msgstr "감히 바룬 가문의 소유물을 훔치시겠다?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F33
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
