#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "022150"
msgid "Need me to lend a hand?"
msgstr "도움이 필요해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Kopai is a Samoan dumpling (sweet)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02214F"
msgid "This might be an excellent spot for an outpost. Just leave me here with a bowl full of Chunks and we're good."
msgstr "전초기지 짓기에 딱인 곳일 것 같아. 그냥 나한테 청크 한가득 주고 버리고 가도 문제없다고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACB
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02214E"
msgid "Readings on your scanner seem to be correct. But I'll do further calibrations later."
msgstr "네 스캐너 신호는 맞는 것 같아. 다만 나중에 내가 좀 더 조정해 줄게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACA
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Crafting_CreateItem
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02214D"
msgid "You are so good with your hands. This kind of work suits you."
msgstr "손재주가 정말 능숙하네. 이런 일이 잘 어울린다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A71
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsDown
msgctxt "02214A"
msgid "Our weapons are cashed, Captain!"
msgstr "무기 맛 갔어, 선장!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A71
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsDown
msgctxt "022149"
msgid "They got one of our weapons!"
msgstr "놈들이 우리 무장 하나를 파괴했다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ABE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_SpaceshipLeaveCombat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipLeaveCombat
msgctxt "022148"
msgid "There might be some useful salvage left out there."
msgstr "쓸모 있는 것들을 인양할 수 있을지 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "022147"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "물론."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_SpaceshipWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsDown
msgctxt "021FB8"
msgid "Weapons are down. Great Serpent, aid us!"
msgstr "무장 파손. 위대한 뱀이시여, 우릴 도와주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE199
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "021FB7"
msgid "The Great Serpent shall avenge them!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 복수하실 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247D
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D249F
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "021EA9"
msgid "We are taking damage."
msgstr "피해를 받고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D2479
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D2493
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "021EA8"
msgid "I have direct sensor contact with a hostile target."
msgstr "적대 목표물과 직접적으로 조우하였습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "021C9F"
msgid "I know we got past the scans but I never feel good until we put our feet on the ground."
msgstr "스캔은 통과 했지만, 행성에 발붙이기 전까지는 절대 안심이 안 된다니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACA
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Crafting_CreateItem
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "021C9D"
msgid "We'll find a good use for this. I am sure of it."
msgstr "이걸 잘 활용할 방법을 찾을 수 있을 거야. 분명히."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A74
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_Smuggler_SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
msgctxt "021C97"
msgid "They repaired their weapon!"
msgstr "놈들이 무장을 고쳤어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Sahima_SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsDown
msgctxt "021C96"
msgid "Our fangs cut deep! The enemy's lost a weapon!"
msgstr "우리의 송곳니가 깊이 박혔구나! 적이 무장을 잃었어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC2
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "021C95"
msgid "You think you can pick on me?"
msgstr "날 건들 수 있을 것 같느냐?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC4
#. INFO GROUP: CREW_Sahima_SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
msgctxt "02181E"
msgid "We can't let them hit us with the shields down!"
msgstr "보호막이 꺼졌을 때 공격받아선 안 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: final cry before your ship explodes
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_Death
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Death
msgctxt "021662"
msgid "System failure! I can't hold it!"
msgstr "시스템 고장! 버틸 수가 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246E
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "021545"
msgid "Searching."
msgstr "탐색 중."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02130E"
msgid "Looks like a bunch of life on this planet. Shame if we flipped that around."
msgstr "이 행성은 삶이 가득해 보이는군. 여길 쓸어버려야 한다면 유감이겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02130D"
msgid "Rocks, minerals, dirt... this is a miner's dream right here."
msgstr "바위, 미네랄, 먼지... 이게 바로 광부들의 꿈 아니겠나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima__BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02130C"
msgid "The more we can carry, the more stuff we have to trade back home."
msgstr "더 물건을 많이 챙길수록 고향에서 더 물건을 많이 교환할 수 있겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACB
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "02130B"
msgid "The hand scanner is such a delightful invention!"
msgstr "핸드 스캐너는 참으로 멋진 발명품이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A6C
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_PowerAttack
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: PowerAttack
msgctxt "021307"
msgid "Aaaayyyaarrrrgghh!"
msgstr "아아아아악!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "021306"
msgid "That's exactly what I would've done!"
msgstr "나도 정확히 그렇게 했을 거야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "021305"
msgid "Don't talk to me."
msgstr "나한테 말 걸지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247D
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D249F
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "021095"
msgid "Taking light damage. Compensating."
msgstr "경미한 피해 확인. 보정 중."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7E
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01004048
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0209BF"
msgid "Back in my day, we used to call that something else. Either way it's old hat."
msgstr "나 때는 말이야, 그거 부르는 이름이 달랐지. 뭐, 구닥다리 같은 얘기지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0209BE"
msgid "The smuggling here is pretty straightforward, but pricey. The number of palms you gotta grease... almost rather be in New Atlantis."
msgstr "이 동네에서 밀수업은 꽤 단순하지만, 돈도 많이 들어가지. 기름칠해야 할 인간도 많고... 차라리 뉴아틀란티스에서 하고 말지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACB
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0209BD"
msgid "So many things to scan! Such a large and interesting galaxy we live in!"
msgstr "스캔할 게 참 많아! 이 은하계는 참 넓고 흥미롭다니까!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Sahima_SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
msgctxt "0209B6"
msgid "Show caution, their weapon's back online!"
msgstr "조심해, 적 무장이 다시 복구됐어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "0209B5"
msgid "Everything's gone quiet."
msgstr "모든 게 조용해졌네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "020555"
msgid "Maybe it's just the red eyes, but Cydonia folks are intense. Hell, even the local priests have a bench press."
msgstr "눈이 시뻘게서 더 그런 것도 있겠지만, 시도니아 사람들은 장난 아니지. 망할, 그냥 동네 신부님도 거기서는 벤치를 든다니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7E
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01004048
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "020554"
msgid "Got a power that'll fix my hip?"
msgstr "혹시 자네 능력으로 내 골반은 못 고치나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD0
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "020553"
msgid "Burdens are best divided among the group."
msgstr "짐은 나눌수록 최고지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_SpaceshipEnterCombat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnterCombat
msgctxt "020552"
msgid "Shields enabled. Weapons primed. May the Serpent bless us in this fight."
msgstr "보호막 전개. 무기 장전. 뱀께서 우리에게 축복하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A69
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "020551"
msgid "Got me!"
msgstr "피격됐어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A60
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "020550"
msgid "We didn't have much of a choice here."
msgstr "선택의 여지가 없었다고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "0203D9"
msgid "We've been hit!"
msgstr "맞았어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "0203D8"
msgid "The structure holds! Keep fighting!"
msgstr "선체가 버티고 있어! 계속 싸워라!"

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247E
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D24CC
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: EnemyKilled
msgctxt "0202E2"
msgid "My sensors indicate an unbeliever has been vanquished."
msgstr "센서에 의하면 불신자가 죽은 것으로 파악됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Venom / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE64
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011000CC
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "020213"
msgid "You will suffer, false Promised."
msgstr "고통받을 것이다, 거짓된 약속받은 자여."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD4
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0200D6"
msgid "Stay prepared. To board another ship is to step in another's home, often uninvited."
msgstr "준비해. 남의 배에 강제로 승선하는 건 남의 집에 침범하는 것이니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0200D5"
msgid "Gangs here are cutthroat. They see a neck, they start twitching like an addict until it's cut."
msgstr "여기 갱단은 살벌하지. 사람 목만 보이면, 약에 맛이 간 것처럼 죽을 때까지 조를 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACA
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Crafting_CreateItem
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0200D4"
msgid "To take small parts and make a whole is truly magic."
msgstr "작은 부품들을 모아 하나로 만드는 건 정말 마법이야."

