#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014AF3"
msgid "Lost, alone, amidst a dream's whispers. A voice, sings, for our trapped world unheard."
msgstr "길 잃어, 홀로, 꿈의 속삭임을 헤매네. 목소리, 노래, 갇혀버린 세상에선 안 들리네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malik hired me to find out what's happening to his groats. &&& Farmer: Well, I am his farmhand, and he never told me that, so how do I know you are telling the truth?
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, damn...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014AE3"
msgid "Stop playing dumb. This slate talks about a man at a seaweed farm who buys groats, no questions asked. Who are they?"
msgstr "시치미 떼지 마. 이 슬레이트에 해조류 양식장에서 아무것도 묻지 않고 그로트를 사는 사람에 대해 적혀 있어. 그게 누구야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malik hired me to find out what's happening to his groats. &&& Farmer: Well, I am his farmhand, and he never told me that, so how do I know you are telling the truth?
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, damn...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014AE2"
msgid "Knock it off. Malik doesn't have farmhands. He says so in this note."
msgstr "집어치워. 말릭 씨에겐 일꾼이 없어. 여기 그렇게 적혀 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247A
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D24D2
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: RangedAttack
msgctxt "014ABC"
msgid "Hostiles in range. Unleashing the Serpent's wrath."
msgstr "사거리 내 적 확인. 뱀의 분노를 표출합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 어떻게 보답하면 되겠습니까?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_Attack12
#. TOPIC: 0103ABB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Attack12_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01499F"
msgid "I could use some extra repair parts."
msgstr "예비 부품을 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 어떻게 보답하면 되겠습니까?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_Attack12
#. TOPIC: 0103ABB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Attack12_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01499E"
msgid "Credits would be appreciated."
msgstr "크레딧으로 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 어떻게 보답하면 되겠습니까?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_Attack12
#. TOPIC: 0103ABB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Attack12_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01499D"
msgid "Salvage rights are enough for me."
msgstr "잔해를 수집할 권리만 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 어떻게 보답하면 되겠습니까?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_Attack12
#. TOPIC: 0103ABB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Attack12_100b_DefenderHailAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01499C"
msgid "No need for payment."
msgstr "보상은 괜찮아요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0148A0"
msgid "I think I'll stay up here where it's safe, thank you."
msgstr "난 안전한 곳에 남고 싶어. 사양하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you end up in a Martian prison?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: A person's got to have a code.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01489F"
msgid "Not my business who they belonged to."
msgstr "그게 누구 것이었는지는 내 알 바 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Show me the way forward! Show me how I may serve!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02
#. TOPIC: 0113E4B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01489D"
msgid "I beg of you, show me anything!"
msgstr "간청드리나이다. 아무거라도 보여 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01489C"
msgid "There was never a time when I was old enough to be allowed to drink alcohol here."
msgstr "술을 마셔도 되는 나이가 되기 전에는 이곳에 들어온 적이 없었는데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01489B"
msgid "Bars are a semingly universal constant across cultures."
msgstr "술집은 어떤 문화권이든 꼭 존재하는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01489A"
msgid "I, uhh, have heard that there is a spiritual component to healing in Va'ruun culture. That would seem to be true."
msgstr "바룬 문화권에서는 치유에 영적인 부분도 있다고 들었는데... 사실인 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014899"
msgid "The Great Serpent is always with us, at work and at home."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께선 언제나 우리와 함께하고 있어, 일터든 집이든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014898"
msgid "Faith is the primary motivator in people's lives here."
msgstr "신의는 이곳 사람들에게 가장 기본이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014897"
msgid "This device is rather imposing looking, no?"
msgstr "꽤 위압적인 장치이지 않아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014896"
msgid "The device looks ready. Let us hope it has not been built too hastily. We need this to work."
msgstr "장치가 준비된 것 같네. 급하게 만들어진 건 아니길 바라자고. 반드시 정상 작동해야 하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014895"
msgid "So many have been displaced... How many more have been lost?"
msgstr "집을 잃은 사람들이 이렇게 많다니... 얼마나 많은 사람들이 죽은 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014894"
msgid "Things here seem dire indeed."
msgstr "확실히 이곳 상황은 위중해 보여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01488C"
msgid "The first Crusade came after a decade of preparation. House Va'ruun is in no condition to attempt it again now."
msgstr "첫 뱀의 성전은 십 년 넘게 준비한 끝에 시작되었어. 지금의 바룬 가문은 다시 그런 일을 벌일 여건이 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal. &&& Mujeen: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.|Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014881"
msgid "This seems a waste of time. The Zealots have made their intentions clear."
msgstr "시간 낭비야. 광신도들이 의사 표현은 확실히 해두고 갔군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0726_CompanionAvoidBattleComment02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014880"
msgid "Focus on our ultimate goal! Keep moving!"
msgstr "최종 목표에 집중해! 계속 움직여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0727_CompanionAvoidBattleComment03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487F"
msgid "Keep moving!"
msgstr "계속 이동해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0725_CompanionStageEntryComment01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487E"
msgid "Our priority is the Pinnacle. We do not need to engage every single one of them."
msgstr "첨탑이 최우선이야. 놈들 하나하나 상대할 필요 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1100_CompanionPalaceDuctsEscape
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487D"
msgid "We have to get out of here while we can!"
msgstr "여기서 빠져나가야 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0910_CompanionVortexGateSeen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487C"
msgid "There... Everything is because of this."
msgstr "저기... 모든 게 저것 때문이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0760_CompanionCrusadersHallEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487B"
msgid "Much will be lost if we cannot save the Citadel."
msgstr "성채를 구하지 못하면 많은 것을 잃게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0430_CompanionResearchLevelEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01487A"
msgid "Be cautious. Security is online, and we do not have authorization."
msgstr "조심해. 보안이 켜져 있고, 우린 출입 권한이 없으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0940_CompanionModulator02Destroyed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014879"
msgid "That did it!"
msgstr "좋았어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0960_CompanionModulator01Destroyed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014878"
msgid "That makes two! Find the next console!"
msgstr "두 개나 부쉈어! 다음 제어 장치를 찾아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0980_CompanionModulator03Destroyed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014877"
msgid "Looks like only one left!"
msgstr "이제 하나만 남은 모양이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014876"
msgid "You attempted to serve. Is that not all that can be asked of you?"
msgstr "섬기려고 한 일이잖아요. 그거면 된 거 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption. &&& VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014875"
msgid "Are you sure? This could take some time."
msgstr "진심이야? 시간이 좀 걸릴 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: Anasko certainly believed so. He was willing to sacrifice a great deal for it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "Next time?" Hopefully there will be no next time. Once was enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014874"
msgid "Maybe next time I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "다음에 내가 한번 시도해 봐야 할지 모르겠어."

msgctxt "014873"
msgid "\"Next time?\" Hopefully there will be no next time. Once was enough."
msgstr "'다음에?' 다음은 없었으면 좋겠군. 한번으로 충분해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Time heals all wounds.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Time heals all wounds.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now only one matter remains to discuss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014872"
msgid "Indeed it does."
msgstr "과연 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: War brings out the worst in everyone.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014871"
msgid "There is no guarantee it will not happen again in the future, but at least you have prevented it for now."
msgstr "먼 미래에 또 그런 일이 벌어지지 않으리란 보장은 없지만, 지금은 네가 막아냈구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A little chaos now and then is good for everyone. &&& Andreja: The victims on both sides would disagree.|This was not something to have entered into lightly.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed it does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014870"
msgid "War brings out the worst in everyone."
msgstr "전쟁은 인간의 가장 악한 모습을 드러내지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It would have happened eventually anyway. &&& Andreja: I am not sure that is true. The first Crusade had such an impact, it caused a split amongst House Va'ruun.|The Zealots keep that lesson fresh in people's minds, for better or worse.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True. There is enough of that to go around.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486F"
msgid "The last thing the Settled Systems need is more conflict."
msgstr "개척 성계에는 더 이상의 갈등이 있어선 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The last thing the Settled Systems need is more conflict.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The last thing the Settled Systems need is more conflict.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486E"
msgid "True. There is enough of that to go around."
msgstr "맞는 말이야. 그런 일은 다들 충분히 겪었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The people need something to fight for. &&& Andreja: Yes, but perhaps not literally.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The first Crusade came after a decade of preparation. House Va'ruun is in no condition to attempt it again now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486D"
msgid "It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea."
msgstr "처음 시도했을 때 잘 되지 못했지. 두 번 시도하는 것은 나쁜 생각인 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486C"
msgid "If you see any settlers best to just keep it moving. Or shoot them. One or the other."
msgstr "이미 정착한 것들이 보이면 그냥 지나가는 게 좋아. 쏴 버리거나. 둘 중에 하나지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486B"
msgid "I would perhaps not say that too loudly in Dazra, but it is hard to disagree."
msgstr "그런 말은 다즈라에서 크게 하지 않는 게 좋겠지만, 틀린 말은 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is a difficult question. It is hard to know whether Anasko was interpreting the Serpent's Will correctly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01486A"
msgid "What do you think about the Crusade?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 관해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014869"
msgid "That is a difficult question. It is hard to know whether Anasko was interpreting the Serpent's Will correctly."
msgstr "어려운 질문이구나. 아나스코 님께서 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 제대로 이해했던 것인지는 불확실해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Maybe next time I'll give it a shot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014868"
msgid "But the decision can always be revisited in the future. For now, I think it best that House Va'ruun focus inward, on recovering and rebuilding."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그 결정은 미래에도 다시 검토할 수 있잖아. 내가 보기에 지금 바룬 가문은 내부를 정비하며 회복하는 것부터 해야 한다 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014867"
msgid "It would cause turmoil in the Settled Systems, and would put the people of Dazra at risk when they have had but a moment to breathe."
msgstr "개척 성계에 파란을 일으킬 것이고, 다즈라 신민들도 이제 한 시름을 덜 수 있게 되었는데 또 큰 위험에 빠지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Maybe next time I'll give it a shot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014866"
msgid "I am glad it is not something to worry about right now."
msgstr "지금 당장은 걱정해야 할 사안이 아니게 되어 기뻐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014865"
msgid "Not that I needed another reason to love you, but I will not forget what you have done for my people."
msgstr "널 사랑할 이유가 더 생길 필요도 없었는데... 네가 우리 신민들을 위해 해 준 일을 잊지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014864"
msgid "It means a great deal to me, what you have done for my people."
msgstr "네가 우리 신민들을 위해 해 준 일을 정말 고맙게 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113B3B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014863"
msgid "I suppose it is time to see what other adventures await us."
msgstr "그럼 이제 다른 모험을 향하여 떠나 보자고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I cannot thank you enough for what you have done for Dazra, for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think that might be a little too much to hope for. Statues tend to be reserved for Jinan himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014862"
msgid "Next time I come back, there'd better be a statue of me."
msgstr "다음에 다시 여기 방문할 땐 날 기리는 조각상 정도는 세워 놔야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014861"
msgid "I cannot thank you enough for what you have done for Dazra, for House Va'ruun."
msgstr "네가 다즈라와 바룬 가문을 위해서 해 준 일들이 정말이지 너무나도 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014860"
msgid "The people of Dazra owe you a great deal for saving them."
msgstr "다즈라 신민들은 네가 모두를 구해 준 것에 큰 빚을 졌어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I cannot thank you enough for what you have done for Dazra, for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132571
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485F"
msgid "I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 진정한 신도라면 기꺼이 했을 일을 한 것뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132570
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485E"
msgid "I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion."
msgstr "나도 그렇기를 바라지만, 모든 이들이 이 일에 너처럼 나서진 않았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132570
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485D"
msgid "Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do."
msgstr "다른 사람이었다면 우리한테 미래는 없었겠지만... 너 덕분에 미래를 구가할 수 있게 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132570
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485C"
msgid "Your dedication to House Va'ruun is admirable. Most from the Settled Systems would have been content to watch them fall."
msgstr "바룬 가문을 진심으로 섬기는 모습이 대단하구나. 개척 성계의 대부분 사람들은 망하는 걸 지켜보려 했을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. PROMPT: Next time I come back, there'd better be a statue of me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Next time I come back, there'd better be a statue of me.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485B"
msgid "I think that might be a little too much to hope for. Statues tend to be reserved for Jinan himself."
msgstr "너무 많은 걸 바라는 것 같네. 조각상은 오직 지난 님을 기리는 것만 존재해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. PROMPT: Next time I come back, there'd better be a statue of me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Next time I come back, there'd better be a statue of me.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01485A"
msgid "You might deserve one, but I think there are other priorities for the city right now."
msgstr "너를 기리는 동상 정도는 있어야겠지만 지금 도시엔 그것 말고도 중요한 일이 많잖아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I cannot thank you enough for what you have done for Dazra, for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If only more in the Settled Systems shared that view... But history is what it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014859"
msgid "Everyone deserves help. Even House Va'ruun."
msgstr "모두가 도움을 받아 마땅하지. 바룬 가문이라 할지라도."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do. &&& Andreja: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.|Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do. &&& Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading. &&& Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is certainly a solid foundation on which to build House Va'ruun's future.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132564
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014858"
msgid "House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now."
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 성실함이야말로 지금 사람들에게 가장 필요한 것이지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I cannot thank you enough for what you have done for Dazra, for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is modesty, and there is nonsense. What you have done is not "nothing."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014857"
msgid "It was nothing."
msgstr "별거 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132565
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014856"
msgid "But now, House Dul'kehf will take control."
msgstr "하지만 지금은, 둘케프 가문이 주도하게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132565
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014855"
msgid "But now, House Ka'dic will lead."
msgstr "하지만 지금은, 카딕 가문이 주도하게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132565
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014854"
msgid "But now House Veth'aal will lead the way."
msgstr "하지만 지금은, 베타알 가문이 주도하게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. PROMPT: Everyone deserves help. Even House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Everyone deserves help. Even House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014853"
msgid "If only more in the Settled Systems shared that view... But history is what it is."
msgstr "개척 성계의 나머지 세력도 그렇게 생각한다면 좋을 텐데... 과거사 때문에 안 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132563
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014852"
msgid "It is certainly a solid foundation on which to build House Va'ruun's future."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 미래를 가꾸는 데 가장 튼튼한 토대인 것은 분명해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do. &&& Andreja: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.|Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do. &&& Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading. &&& Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hopefully, yes. The events here seem to have taken a personal toll on him. With time, and guidance from the Great Serpent, may he serve well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132562
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014851"
msgid "Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader."
msgstr "해즈막은 뛰어난 지도자가 될 잠재력이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. PROMPT: Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132561
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014850"
msgid "Hopefully, yes. The events here seem to have taken a personal toll on him. With time, and guidance from the Great Serpent, may he serve well."
msgstr ""
"부디, 그렇길 바라지. 여기서 일어난 일들이 그분에게 개인적으로 큰 타격을 준 것 같거든. 시간이 지나고 위대한 뱀의 인도를 받으면 잘 "
"섬길 수 있을지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. PROMPT: Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132561
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484F"
msgid "He seems to have been quite personally affected by all that has happened, but we all carry our own experiences in all that we do."
msgstr "그동안 벌어진 모든 일에 개인적으로 상당히 영향을 받은 듯하지만, 원래 저마다 내린 결정으로 각자의 경험을 갖고 살아가지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. PROMPT: It was nothing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was nothing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484E"
msgid "There is modesty, and there is nonsense. What you have done is not \"nothing.\""
msgstr "겸손 챙기는 거랑 헛소리 하는 건 달라. 너가 한 일은 '별거' 그 이상이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: It was nothing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113256A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484D"
msgid "These people have a future thanks largely to you."
msgstr "이 사람들은 거의 네 덕분에 미래를 구가할 수 있게 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484C"
msgid "I think they have a well-earned reputation for being measured and reserved. Whether that is what is best for House Va'ruun right now... That remains to be seen."
msgstr "신중하고 침착하다는 평판은 분명한 것 같아. 그것이 지금 바룬 가문에게 가장 좋은 것인지... 그건 아직 알 수 없지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484B"
msgid "They seem... deliberate. Precise. Hopefully that can restore some stability with enough time."
msgstr "그 가문은... 계획적이고 정확해 보여. 충분한 시간이 지나면 어느 정도 안정을 회복할 수 있기를 바라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Dul'kehf's diligence is just what people need right now. &&& Andreja: It is certainly a solid foundation on which to build House Va'ruun's future.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Having seen more of the universe myself, I think that could indeed benefit us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01484A"
msgid "With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 이끌게 됐으니 나머지 개척 성계 전역의 신뢰를 쌓을 수 있을지 몰라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hasmak has the potential to be an excellent leader. &&& Andreja: Hopefully, yes. The events here seem to have taken a personal toll on him. With time, and guidance from the Great Serpent, may he serve well.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The decision is behind us, so I can do nothing but share that faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132558
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014849"
msgid "I have faith that Razma will be a good leader."
msgstr "라즈마라면 좋은 지도자가 될 수 있으리라 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. PROMPT: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think Viktor is the best choice for Speaker.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132557
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014848"
msgid "The decision is behind us, so I can do nothing but share that faith."
msgstr "이미 결정을 내렸으니 나도 그러길 믿어야 할 수밖에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think Viktor is the best choice for Speaker.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132557
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014847"
msgid "If her many connections both within and outside House Va'ruun are put to positive use, it could usher in a new era."
msgstr "그분이 바룬 가문 안팎에서 맺은 여러 인맥을 긍정적으로 활용한다면, 새로운 시대가 열릴 수도 있을 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I fully expect they'll make a mess of things. &&& Andreja: Do you have so little regard for these people?|I believe that ultimately they will rise to the occasion.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you have so little regard for these people?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014846"
msgid "I fully expect them to make a mess of things."
msgstr "난 그자들이 완전 엉망진창으로 만들 거라 예상해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132559
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014845"
msgid "Having seen more of the universe myself, I think that could indeed benefit us all."
msgstr "우주의 여러 면을 많이 보았기 때문인지, 그게 우리 모두에게 정말 유익할 수 있다고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132559
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014844"
msgid "Perhaps in time. The immediate focus needs to be on rebuilding here."
msgstr "시간이 지난다면 아마도. 당장은 이곳을 재건하는 데 집중해야 해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Dul'kehf? &&& Barrett: I hate to punt the ball here, but I'm just a tourist. I don't know enough about Va'ruun culture or politics to form an educated opinion.|And scientifically speaking, I wouldn't want to make a decision like this without a full set of data.|But gastronomically speaking, I am glad you didn't go with House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hate to punt the ball here, but I'm just a tourist. I don't know enough about Va'ruun culture or politics to form an educated opinion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113230F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014843"
msgid "What do you think about House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Ka'dic?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132551
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014842"
msgid "Certainly I have very strong feelings about individuals within House Ka'dic..."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 여러 인물들에 관해 심한 감정을 갖고 있긴 해..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132551
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014841"
msgid "As a whole, there is discord within the House that needs to be resolved. If that can happen, they have an understanding of the rest of the Settled Systems that could serve us well."
msgstr ""
"전체적으로, 가문 내에는 해결해야 할 불화가 있어. 만약 그렇게 될 수 있다면, 우리에게 도움이 될 수 있는 나머지 개척 성계에 대한 "
"이해를 할 수 있게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Ka'dic?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132551
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014840"
msgid "How they deal with the Zealots, and their agents out in the Settled Systems, will be of great importance going forward."
msgstr "저들이 광신도들과 개척 성계에 있는 요원들을 어떻게 다루느냐에 따라 앞으로 매우 중요한 과제가 될 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: With House Ka'dic running things, maybe trust can be built with the rest of the Settled Systems. &&& Andreja: Having seen more of the universe myself, I think that could indeed benefit us all.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132550
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483F"
msgid "House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 다즈라에 질서를 회복하는 데 가장 적합한 위치에 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. PROMPT: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483E"
msgid "There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power."
msgstr "이에 반대하는 사람들이 많은데, 그저 자신들이 권력을 쥐고 싶어서만은 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. PROMPT: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483D"
msgid "But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain."
msgstr "어쨌든 질서가 세워지겠지. 그건 확실해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483C"
msgid "Indeed, they seem to value order very highly. Hopefully the rest of House Va'ruun will follow."
msgstr "확실히 질서를 매우 중시하는 것 같아. 부디 바룬 가문의 나머지 인원들도 그랬으면 좋겠어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have faith that Razma will be a good leader. &&& Andreja: The decision is behind us, so I can do nothing but share that faith.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He certainly has very strong views about faith and loyalty. We will see how that shapes House Va'ruun in the years to come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483B"
msgid "I think Viktor is the best choice for Speaker."
msgstr "빅토르야말로 대변자 역할을 맡기는 데 최선인 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. PROMPT: I think Viktor is the best choice for Speaker.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think Viktor is the best choice for Speaker.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01483A"
msgid "He certainly has very strong views about faith and loyalty. We will see how that shapes House Va'ruun in the years to come."
msgstr "그 사람은 확실히 신앙과 충성심이 확고한 것 같아. 앞으로 몇 년 동안 바룬 가문에 어떤 영향을 미칠지 지켜보게 되겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I fully expect them to make a mess of things. &&& Andreja: Do you have so little regard for these people?|I believe that ultimately they will rise to the occasion.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you have so little regard for these people?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113254A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014839"
msgid "I expect it to be a disaster."
msgstr "완전 재앙 같은 일이 벌어질 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Ka'dic? &&& Barrett: I hate to punt the ball here, but I'm just a tourist. I don't know enough about Va'ruun culture or politics to form an educated opinion.|And scientifically speaking, I wouldn't want to make a decision like this without a full set of data.|But gastronomically speaking, I am glad you didn't go with House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know them, but I do know history. And historically militant governments are a pain in the you know what.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113232E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014838"
msgid "What do you think about House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Veth'aal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132547
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014837"
msgid "Veth'aal has a reputation, well-earned, for being particularly strict in their adherence to the faith."
msgstr "베타알은 신앙을 고수하는 데 특히 엄격한 것으로 유명해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132547
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014836"
msgid "I imagine this will create friction with the others, as it often has in the past. But with the weight of leadership on their side, there will be little to hold them back."
msgstr ""
"그래서 다른 가문들과 마찰을 일으킬 것이라고 봐. 과거에도 종종 그랬듯이. 하지만 영도력의 영향력 덕분에 거의 억제되는 일은 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.|Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113253B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014835"
msgid "Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading."
msgstr "다만... 아나스코 님이 다스리지 않는 바룬 가문의 미래는 어찌 될지 상상이 되지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: heavy sigh at the top / Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: Your dedication to House Va'ruun is admirable. Most from the Settled Systems would have been content to watch them fall.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113253B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014834"
msgid "After several generations, it will be a massive change to not have a Va'ruun as Speaker."
msgstr "몇 세대가 지나면, 바룬 성씨의 대변자가 없는 것으로 엄청난 변화를 맞이하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: "Next time?" Hopefully there will be no next time. Once was enough.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Not that I needed another reason to love you, but I will not forget what you have done for my people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113253A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014833"
msgid "No matter what, the path ahead will be difficult. But at least there is still a path, thanks to your actions."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있어도 앞으로의 길은 어려울 거야. 하지만 적어도 네 행동 덕분에 길은 여전히 열려 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko certainly believed so. He was willing to sacrifice a great deal for it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014832"
msgid "It is the Serpent's Will."
msgstr "이게 다 위대한 뱀의 뜻이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe next time I'll give it a shot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132538
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014831"
msgid "Anasko certainly believed so. He was willing to sacrifice a great deal for it."
msgstr "아나스코 님은 확실히 그렇게 믿은 것 같아. 많은 걸 희생할 각오까지 하셨으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The victims on both sides would disagree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132537
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014830"
msgid "A little chaos now and then is good for everyone."
msgstr "가끔 혼돈스러운 사태가 벌어지는 게 모두에게 좋잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A little chaos now and then is good for everyone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A little chaos now and then is good for everyone.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132536
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482F"
msgid "The victims on both sides would disagree."
msgstr "양측의 피해자들은 그렇게 생각 안 할걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A little chaos now and then is good for everyone.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: War brings out the worst in everyone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132536
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482E"
msgid "This was not something to have entered into lightly."
msgstr "그냥 쉽게 진행할 사안이 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not sure that is true. The first Crusade had such an impact, it caused a split amongst House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482D"
msgid "It would have happened eventually anyway."
msgstr "어차피 결국 벌어질 일이었잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would have happened eventually anyway.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It would have happened eventually anyway.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482C"
msgid "I am not sure that is true. The first Crusade had such an impact, it caused a split amongst House Va'ruun."
msgstr "그게 사실인지는 잘 모르겠는데. 첫 뱀의 성전이 너무 큰 영향을 끼쳐서, 바룬 가문 사이에 분열이 생겼을 정도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would have happened eventually anyway.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The last thing the Settled Systems need is more conflict.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482B"
msgid "The Zealots keep that lesson fresh in people's minds, for better or worse."
msgstr "광신도들 때문에 그 교훈을 모두가 생생하게 기억하고 있지. 좋든 나쁘든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, but perhaps not literally.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01482A"
msgid "The people need something to fight for."
msgstr "사람들은 싸워 나가야 할 명분이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The people need something to fight for.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The people need something to fight for.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It didn't go very well the first time. A second try seems like a bad idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014829"
msgid "Yes, but perhaps not literally."
msgstr "그래, 하지만 말 그대로일 필요는 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is a difficult question. It is hard to know whether Anasko was interpreting the Serpent's Will correctly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014828"
msgid "What do you think about the Crusade?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014827"
msgid "That is a difficult question. It is hard to know whether Anasko was interpreting the Serpent's Will correctly."
msgstr "어려운 질문이구나. 아나스코 님께서 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 올바르게 해석했는지는 알기 어렵지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014826"
msgid "Attempting to rebuild and wage war will stretch resources thin, and test the resolve of the people."
msgstr "재건하는 와중에 전쟁을 벌이면 자원이 고갈되고 신민들의 결의도 시험받게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014825"
msgid "But the Council has decided, and I will keep my opinions to myself. My loyalty ultimately lies with House Va'ruun."
msgstr "하지만 대의회가 결정했으니, 내 의견은 이만 줄이겠어. 난 바룬 가문에게 철저히 충성하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014824"
msgid "It will cause turmoil in the Settled Systems, and... In the end, it may be more damaging for House Va'ruun than anyone else."
msgstr "개척 성계에 혼란을 일으킬 것이고... 결국에는 다른 누구보다도 바룬 가문이 제일 큰 피해를 입고 말겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014823"
msgid "But the Council has decided, and defying them at this point would accomplish nothing."
msgstr "하지만 대의회는 이미 결정을 내렸고, 지금 와서 그 뜻에 저항한다면 아무것도 이루지 못하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014822"
msgid "And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?"
msgstr "그것만으로도 버거운데, 이제 뱀의 성전까지 걱정해야 되잖아. 그 조치에 찬성표를 던진 것이 옳은 일이라고 확신해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014821"
msgid "Thankfully, this transfer of power comes at a time of peace. You were right to vote against the Crusade."
msgstr "다행히도, 이번 권력 이양으로 평화로운 시기를 구가하게 됐구나. 뱀의 성전에 반대표를 던진 것은 옳은 일이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted. 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Only a descendant of Jinan Va'ruun should lead. None of the other Houses are fit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. INFO GROUP: COM_Andreja_AngerScene_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014820"
msgid "After everything, all the effort to save Dazra, you turn your back on them and refuse to help name a Speaker? Are you mad?"
msgstr "다즈라를 구하기 위해 그 온갖 노력을 했으면서, 결국 가문들에게 등을 돌리고 대변자를 지명하는 것을 거부한 거야? 미쳤어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. PROMPT: They'll figure it out eventually. It's not a big deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They'll figure it out eventually. It's not a big deal.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481F"
msgid "That is hardly the point!"
msgstr "내 말 뜻이 그게 아니잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Only a descendant of Jinan Va'ruun should lead. None of the other Houses are fit.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only a descendant of Jinan Va'ruun should lead. None of the other Houses are fit.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481E"
msgid "There is no living descendant! So... So what, they should just give up?"
msgstr "애초에 살아 있는 바룬의 후예가 없잖아! 그럼... 다 그냥 포기해야 한다는 거야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted.  &&& Andreja: 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Circus? You would insult them, and by extension me, even now?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481D"
msgid "I don't care who runs that circus."
msgstr "이 서커스장을 누가 운영하든 난 관심 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: I don't care who runs that circus.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't care who runs that circus.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481C"
msgid "Circus? You would insult them, and by extension me, even now?"
msgstr "서커스장? 바룬 가문을 모욕하는 건 나까지 모욕하는 걸 몰라? 지금 그 말을 해?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted.  &&& Andreja: 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are a great many things in life far more unpleasant that we all must deal with, whether we want to or not!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132525
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481B"
msgid "I didn't want that kind of responsibility."
msgstr "난 그런 책임을 원하지 않았단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on "after" / Disbelief
#. PROMPT: The less organized they are, the better off everyone else is.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The less organized they are, the better off everyone else is.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132526
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01481A"
msgid "I cannot begin to understand the twist of logic that would cause you to say such a thing, after saving them!"
msgstr "사람들을 구해 놓고 그런 말을 하다니, 대체 뭔 기괴한 생각 때문에 그런 건지 도무지 이해할 수 없어!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted.  &&& Andreja: 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is hardly the point!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132529
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014819"
msgid "They'll figure it out eventually. It's not a big deal."
msgstr "다 저들이 알아서 해결하겠지. 별것도 아닌데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. PROMPT: I didn't want that kind of responsibility.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't want that kind of responsibility.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132524
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014818"
msgid "There are a great many things in life far more unpleasant that we all must deal with, whether we want to or not!"
msgstr "이 세상엔 우리가 원하든 원치 않든 겪어야 하는, 이보다 훨씬 더 불쾌한 일들이 아주 많아!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted.  &&& Andreja: 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I cannot begin to understand the twist of logic that would cause you to say such a thing, after saving them!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132527
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014817"
msgid "The less organized they are, the better off everyone else is."
msgstr "각 가문들이 혼란에 빠져 있는 게 모두에게 훨씬 이로워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: Let's just agree to disagree.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132522
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014816"
msgid "This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily!"
msgstr "아무것도 아닌 것마냥 그렇게 쉽게 무시할 사안이 아니야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: It doesn't matter. The decision has been made.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It doesn't matter. The decision has been made.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132520
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014815"
msgid "It does matter, because this decision has consequences."
msgstr "상관이 있지. 이 결정에 결과가 따를 테니까."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only a descendant of Jinan Va'ruun should lead. None of the other Houses are fit. &&& Andreja: There is no living descendant! So... So what, they should just give up? &&& Andreja: You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward.|And you were explicitly warned about the consequences of your choice.|And you went and made it anyway! And... And now, we cannot go back!
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... What? Why would you ever think such a thing?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014814"
msgid "I figured they were bluffing."
msgstr "난 저들이 허풍을 늘어놓는 줄 알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. PROMPT: I figured they were bluffing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I figured they were bluffing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014813"
msgid "I... What? Why would you ever think such a thing?"
msgstr "뭐...? 대체 왜 그런 생각을 갑자기 하게 된 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014812"
msgid "I need you to do better."
msgstr "내게 더 좋은 모습을 보여 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A warning to the player. / Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: You know that I love you. You mean so much to me. But this... I will try to move past it, but it is difficult.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014811"
msgid "I will try and move past this... But you sincerely need to consider the broader consequences of your actions."
msgstr "이번 일은 잊으려 해 보겠지만... 네가 내린 결정으로 어떤 더 큰 결과가 벌어질지 진심으로 생각해 줬으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014810"
msgid "I hope that you can do better. I need you to."
msgstr "난 네가 더 잘할 수 있다고 믿어. 그 모습을 보여 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I will do my best to forgive you, but you must think about what you have done here.|No matter your intent, you have jeopardized my link to my home. I need you to think your actions through in the future.|I need you to do better.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: The next time we make port, I am leaving.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480F"
msgid "I... I cannot. You have cost me so much. I cannot do this."
msgstr "나... 못하겠다. 너 때문에 나 너무 힘들어. 더 이상은 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily!
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480E"
msgid "You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you."
msgstr ""
"넌 우릴 바룬 가문으로부터 떼어놓았어. 너 때문에 내가 바룬 가문으로부터 쫓겨난 걸지 몰라. 그게 내 마음을 얼마나 아프게 하는지 전혀 "
"모른다면, 난 너와 아무런 관계도 맺고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily!
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480D"
msgid "We are no longer permitted in Dazra. We have lost contact with House Va'ruun, and... And potentially damaged relations across the Settled Systems."
msgstr ""
"우리는 더 이상 다즈라에 들어갈 수 없어. 바룬 가문과 연락이 끊겼고... 개척 성계 전역의 모든 세력과의 관계마저 손상시켰을지 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480C"
msgid "If you cannot understand the gravity of that, I am not sure I wish to be around you."
msgstr "그 정도 일이 얼마나 위중한지 모른다면 더 이상 난 네 옆에 지내지 못할 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: extra frustrated because you can't explain why you're angry / Irritated
#. PROMPT: You're that mad over this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're that mad over this?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480B"
msgid "Yes! Clearly! You just... I... You... You are infuriating, do you know that?"
msgstr "그래! 분명히! 넌 그냥... 넌... 넌.. 날 짜증나게 해, 알고 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: The next time we make port, I am leaving.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01480A"
msgid "I hope that at some point you can understand... How much your actions can affect others."
msgstr "언젠가는 너도 이해하게 됐으면 좋겠어... 자신의 행동이 다른 사람에게 얼마나 큰 영향을 미칠 수 있는지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: There is no living descendant! So... So what, they should just give up?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014809"
msgid "You were granted an incredibly opportunity to help House Va'ruun define itself going forward."
msgstr "네겐 바룬 가문이 앞으로 나아갈 방향을 정하는 데 도움을 줄 수 있는 놀라운 기회가 주어졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014808"
msgid "And you were explicitly warned about the consequences of your choice."
msgstr "그리고 네 선택에 따라 무슨 결과가 따를지 확실히 경고를 받았고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014807"
msgid "And you went and made it anyway! And... And now, we cannot go back!"
msgstr "그럼에도 그런 결정을 내렸고! 이젠... 이제 우리 돌아가지 못해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014806"
msgid "I need you to listen to me right now."
msgstr "지금 내 말을 들어 줘야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014805"
msgid "It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned."
msgstr "다즈라에서 그 많은 일을 했으면서 새 대변자를 세우는 것을 거부하고, 우리가 쫓겨나도록 만들다니 도저히 받아들일 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014804"
msgid "I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted."
msgstr "이 와중에 널 버리지 않겠지만... 정말 정말 그러고 싶다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: I fully expect they'll make a mess of things.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I fully expect them to make a mess of things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014803"
msgid "I believe that ultimately they will rise to the occasion."
msgstr "난 결국 다들 상황에 맞게 대처할 것이라고 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. PROMPT: Considering my resume, I think it's par for the course.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014802"
msgid "Joking aside, It was quite admirable how you were able to go from a virtual stranger to the council's most trusted confidant in such a short time."
msgstr "농담은 제쳐두고, 네가 사실상 외부인이었는데 그렇게 단기간에 대의회의 가장 신뢰받는 심복이 되다니 정말 대단해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FF"
msgid "There used to be several Temples like this. Now... look at this place."
msgstr "예전에는 이런 사원이 많았는데. 이젠... 이곳을 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FE"
msgid "I... have never seen anything like this."
msgstr "난... 이런 건 본 적이 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FD"
msgid "Growing up, I only found myself in the Halls of Healing on rare occasions. Training accidents, mostly. I always found these gardens comforting."
msgstr "어렸을 때 회복의 전당에는 거의 온 적이 없었어. 그나마 주로 훈련 사고 때였지. 난 항상 정원이 마음을 안정시킨다 생각했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I appreciate it all the more for that.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113826C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FC"
msgid "I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you."
msgstr "우리가 해야 할 일이 많다는 건 알지만, 그냥... 말하지 않고 넘기고 싶진 않았어. 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: No, I was not.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113826B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FB"
msgid "After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me."
msgstr ""
"최근에 우리가 겪은 모든 일 이후, 난 이곳을 다시는 볼 수 없게 되는 게 아닐까 걱정됐었어. 그래서, 감사해. 나만 힘들었으면 더욱 "
"나았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: No, I was not.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113826B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147FA"
msgid "I am of course grateful to see my home again after being away for so long, although..."
msgstr "물론, 오랜만에 고향 땅을 다시 볼 수 있어서 감사하긴 하지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F8"
msgid "I am glad we have a moment. I am having trouble maintaining my composure. Finding myself in Dazra has been... overwhelming."
msgstr "잠시 휴식을 갖게 되어서 기뻐. 아직도 진정이 잘 되질 않아. 다즈라에 오게 되다니... 압도적이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F7"
msgid "Thank you for taking a moment. Now that you know my history, I can speak openly about how surreal it has been to see Dazra again."
msgstr ""
"잠시 휴식 시간을 갖게 해 줘서 고마워. 이제 내 과거를 알고 있을 테니, 다즈라를 다시 보는 것이 내게 얼마나 초현실적이었는지 "
"공개적으로 말할 수 있을 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I am glad we have a moment. I am having trouble maintaining my composure. Finding myself in Dazra has been... overwhelming.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, I was not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F6"
msgid "You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again."
msgstr "살면서 다신 다즈라를 볼 수 없을지도 모른다고 느꼈구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm always looking for unique experiences, and they don't get much more unique than this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm always looking for unique experiences, and they don't get much more unique than this.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137493
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F5"
msgid "I... suppose that is true."
msgstr "그게... 맞는 말인 것 같구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm always looking for unique experiences, and they don't get much more unique than this.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137493
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F4"
msgid "All the same, I am glad to count you among us."
msgstr "나도 그래. 너도 나와 같은 교우가 되어 참 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I am glad we have a moment. I am having trouble maintaining my composure. Finding myself in Dazra has been... overwhelming.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I could not have imagined.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F3"
msgid "House Va'ruun has been through a lot."
msgstr "바룬 가문은 참 많은 일을 겪었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think would have happened if I'd turned it down?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think would have happened if I'd turned it down?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113748F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F2"
msgid "I... I am not sure. But what might have been does not matter. You are one of us now."
msgstr "난... 잘 모르겠어. 하지만 무슨 일이 일어날 수 있었는지는 중요하지 않아. 넌 이제 우리 중 하나가 된 거니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've been waiting for this opportunity for a very long time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been waiting for this opportunity for a very long time.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137495
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F1"
msgid "Then I am glad we are here."
msgstr "그럼 우리가 이곳에 있게 되어 기뻐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0610_CompanionResearchLevelBacktrack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147F0"
msgid "Anasko spoke true - Zealots are here! They cannot be allowed to gain a foothold!"
msgstr "아나스코 님 말이 맞았어. 광신도야! 저놈들이 발붙이게 하면 안 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0610_CompanionResearchLevelBacktrack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147EF"
msgid "Anasko was right! The Zealots will only make things worse!"
msgstr "아나스코 말이 맞았어! 광신도 놈들은 상황만 더 악화시킬 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0510_CompanionReactorLevelEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147EE"
msgid "The reactor is ahead, and it does indeed look unstable."
msgstr "반응로는 앞쪽에 있어. 확실히 불안정해 보이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147ED"
msgid "This guy may be weird, but like I always tell Cora, don't judge a book by its cover."
msgstr "이친구는 좀 이상할진 몰라도 내 딸 코라에게도 말했듯이, 겉으로만 판단하지 알아야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147EC"
msgid "This Orahim is the very definition of bad vibes. Something just feels... off."
msgstr "이 오라힘이란 사람은 불길한데. 뭔가 좀... 이상해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm an outsider. The fact they even gave me a vote is ridiculous. &&& Barrett: You've got a point. But when people are vying for a throne, sometimes an outsider's the only person who can be objective. &&& Barrett: Well, either way, I won't waste your brain cells on the what-ifs. The fact is you got rid of the vortex, and saved Dazra.|As for the whole "choosing a leader" thing, time will tell if you made the right choice.|Give it maybe twenty years and you'll start to see the results.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's hard to say for sure. It really depends on whether they can stay out of their own way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01137088
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147EB"
msgid "How long do you think it'll take to rebuild?"
msgstr "재건 되는데 얼마나 걸릴 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: How long do you think it'll take to rebuild?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long do you think it'll take to rebuild?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01137087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147EA"
msgid "It's hard to say for sure. It really depends on whether they can stay out of their own way."
msgstr "언제라고 장담은 못하겠군. 얼마나 과거를 잘 돌아보느냐에 따라 달렸지."

#. PROMPT: How long do you think it'll take to rebuild?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01137087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E9"
msgid "The Mourning Device was a scientific achievement, one that I would love to unpack and study. The people who made it are capable of great things!"
msgstr "모어닝 장치는 내가 정말 파헤쳐 보고 싶은 과학계의 업적이지. 이걸 만든 이들은 정말 위대한 일들을 할 수 있는 사람들이야!"

#. PROMPT: How long do you think it'll take to rebuild?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: I can travel to other dimensions, but not forward in time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01137087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E8"
msgid "But that greatness is also a pandora's box -- filled with as much misfortune as it is hope."
msgstr "하지만 그 위대함은 마치 판도라의 상자와도 같아서, 희망 만큼 불행이 차 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E7"
msgid "It is comforting to see that at least some places can maintain a degree of normalcy."
msgstr "그나마 일부 지역은 어느 정도 정상인 상태를 유지할 수 있게 되어 위안이 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E6"
msgid "There are at least some areas where things have not been thrown into total chaos."
msgstr "일부 혼란 사태가 벌어지지 않을 수 있던 곳들도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ever so slightly annoyed / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E5"
msgid "House Ka'dic seems to have remained largely unscathed. How fortunate for them."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 상당히 무사한 것 같아. 얼마나 다행한 일인지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E4"
msgid "This area is lucky to be unaffected."
msgstr "이곳은 운 좋게도 피해를 입지 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E3"
msgid "I hope the extra defenses provide citizens with some small amount of comfort."
msgstr "추가 방어 조치가 신민들에게 조금이라도 위안을 주었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E2"
msgid "Extra defenses seem necessary, but I hope those turrets are properly calibrated."
msgstr "추가 방어 조치가 필요해 보이긴 하지만 포탑들이 제대로 조정되어 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E1"
msgid "Progress on the device is welcome. It is good to feel that we are making a difference."
msgstr "저 장치가 진전이 있자니 다행이야. 우리가 변화를 만들고 있다는 느낌이 들어서 기분이 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147E0"
msgid "It seems the political deadlock really has subsided. This is good."
msgstr "정치적으로 교착된 상태가 확실히 풀린 것 같아. 좋은 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DF"
msgid "This is... unreal. The view of the Citadel from this plaza was never so clear. So many buildings used to be in the way."
msgstr ""
"이건... 비현실적이야. 이 광장에서 성채의 전망이 이렇게 선명하게 보인 적이 없었는데. 예전에는 많은 건물이 방해가 되었었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374C0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DE"
msgid "The scale of the disaster is... hard to accept."
msgstr "이 정도 재난의 규모는... 받아들이기 힘들 정도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DD"
msgid "Never in his worst nightmares could I imagine Jinan Va'ruun saw a future like this."
msgstr "지난 바룬께서는 이런 미래는 절대 꿈속에서도 예상치 못하셨겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DC"
msgid "Whatever you may think of this place, there is no question of the influence that Jinan Va'ruun had here."
msgstr "네가 이 장소에 대해 어떻게 생각하든, 지난 바룬께서 이곳에 영향을 미쳤다는 점에는 의심의 여지가 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DB"
msgid "It is time to see what effect we have had on the city. A positive one, I hope."
msgstr "우리가 도시에 어떤 영향을 미쳤는지 볼 때야. 긍정적인 영향이었으면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374BA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147DA"
msgid "Let us see what has changed with a new House in charge."
msgstr "새 가문이 집권한 뒤 어떤 변화가 있는지 살펴보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D9"
msgid "Hopefully the soldiers are all out on missions, or patrols, and not... gone."
msgstr "부디 군인들은 모두 임무 수행이나 순찰을 하러 나갔고, 사라진 게 아니었으면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D8"
msgid "I do not envy whomever is sent to clean this up."
msgstr "이것들을 치우게 될 사람은 참 안됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D7"
msgid "So much needless destruction..."
msgstr "이렇게나 무의미한 파괴가 이루어졌다니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D6"
msgid "Spacers have an amazing ability to make everything worse, in their own unique way."
msgstr "스페이서들이 모든 걸 망칠 수 있는 능력은 놀라워서 독특할 정도야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D5"
msgid "Of all the places for a ship to crash..."
msgstr "불착시할 만한 곳에서도 하필이면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D4"
msgid "That savage defiles Makhara's armor by wearing it. I suggest we relieve them of it immediately."
msgstr "저 야만인이 마카라의 갑옷을 입어 명예를 더럽혔어. 즉시 저 옷을 벗기는 것이 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D3"
msgid "Their lack of respect for House Va'ruun appears to know no bounds. It is not enough that they have stolen artifacts, but that fool is wearing one."
msgstr "바룬 가문을 무시하는 것이 한계가 없군. 유물을 훔친 것만으로도 심각한데, 저 바보가 그걸 착용하고 있잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D2"
msgid "I cannot imagine any engineer accounting for a spaceship at full speed impacting their secure facility."
msgstr "어떤 엔지니어도 우주선이 최고 속도로 날아와 보안 시설에 영향을 미칠 것이라고는 상상하지도 못했겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D1"
msgid "That looks like the weapon stolen from the tomb."
msgstr "영묘에서 훔친 무기인 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324ED
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147D0"
msgid "Spacers have a reputation for a reason... No sane individual would do this."
msgstr "스페이서가 악명을 떨치는 데에는 이유가 있어... 제정신이라면 이런 짓을 하지 않을 테니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CF"
msgid "This facility is much larger than the exterior would suggest."
msgstr "이 시설은 겉에서 보이는 것보다 훨씬 더 크네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CE"
msgid "Even with all the secrecy around our home, we must be vigilant. Posts like this are key to maintaining a watchful eye."
msgstr "우리 고향엔 비밀을 지키는 조치들이 많지만 그래도 우린 경계를 늦추지 말아야 해. 이런 장소들이 주의를 다하는 데 중요하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CD"
msgid "Keeping watch over the landscape is clearly a high priority."
msgstr "주변 지역을 감시하는 것은 분명 최우선 순위 중 하나지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CC"
msgid "There - is that not the boost pack we are looking for?"
msgstr "저것 봐. 우리가 찾던 부스터 팩인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CB"
msgid "If Dazra is to recover, everywhere the Zealots have infiltrated must be cleansed."
msgstr "다즈라가 회복되려면, 광신도들이 침투한 모든 곳을 정화해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147CA"
msgid "Bold of the Zealots to take over such a significant location."
msgstr "광신도들이 이토록 중요한 장소를 차지하다니 참 당돌하군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C9"
msgid "If this is not eventually mitigated, it could prove disastrous for the environment."
msgstr "결국 이 문제가 완화되지 않으면 환경에 심각한 결과를 초래할지 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C8"
msgid "It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing."
msgstr "약속받은 자 중 하나가 되다니 참으로 놀라운 헌신을 보여 줬어. 난 꿈에서도 이런 일을 벌어지는 건 상상하지 못했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C7"
msgid "Then tell me, if you do not truly care what happens here, why walk the Serpent's Path? Why become Promised?"
msgstr "그럼, 말해봐. 여기서 무슨 일이 일어나는지 정말 신경 쓰지 않는다면, 왜 뱀의 길을 걸었지? 왜 약속받은자 가 됐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate it all the more for that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C6"
msgid "It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary."
msgstr "나의 신념과 정확히 일치하지는 않았지만, 필요한 것 같았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I suppose that is true.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C5"
msgid "But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"하지만 이제 우리가 여기에 온 이상, 바룬 가문을 돕기 위해 우리가 할 수 있는 모든 것을 해야 한다는 데에는 동의할 거라고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal is best positioned to restore order to things in Dazra. &&& Andreja: There are many who would disagree, and not just because they might wish to see themselves in power.|But yes, order will come. Of that we can be certain. &&& Andreja: And were that not enough, we have the Serpent's Crusade to deal with. Are you sure voting in favor of it was the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko certainly believed so. He was willing to sacrifice a great deal for it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C4"
msgid "It is the Serpent's Will."
msgstr "이게 바로 위대한 뱀의 뜻이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C3"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "괜찮아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: chuckling at  / Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you okay?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you okay?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C2"
msgid "That is... a complicated question."
msgstr "그건... 복잡한 질문이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I am glad we have a moment. I am having trouble maintaining my composure. Finding myself in Dazra has been... overwhelming.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Especially a home that you were unsure you would ever return to. And... a home that has suffered so much while you were gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C1"
msgid "There's no place like home."
msgstr "역시 고향이 최고라니깐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no place like home.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no place like home.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147C0"
msgid "Especially a home that you were unsure you would ever return to. And... a home that has suffered so much while you were gone."
msgstr "특히 당신이 다시 돌아올지 확신하지 못했던 집. 그리고... 당신이 떠난 동안 너무나 많은 피해를 입은 집."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BF"
msgid "But to see what has transpired here... It is hard to believe this is part of any plan. Truly, it is a disaster."
msgstr "하지만 여기서 벌어진 일을 보면... 이게 어떤 계획의 일부라고 믿긴 어려워. 정말, 재난일 뿐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: House Va'ruun has been through a lot.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Va'ruun has been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BE"
msgid "I could not have imagined."
msgstr "난 상상도 못했을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BD"
msgid "I suppose that is true."
msgstr "맞는 말인 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again. &&& ...  &&& Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me. &&& Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun. &&& Andreja: But to see what has transpired here... It is hard to believe this is part of any plan. Truly, it is a disaster.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose that is true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BC"
msgid "If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it."
msgstr "이 일도 계획의 일부라면, 우리가 이곳에 온 것도 그 중 하나겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again. &&& ...  &&& Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me. &&& Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun. &&& Andreja: But to see what has transpired here... It is hard to believe this is part of any plan. Truly, it is a disaster.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is an incredibly heartless view of the situation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BB"
msgid "There are plenty of people who suffer all over the Settled Systems. This is no different."
msgstr "개척 성계에는 고통받는 사람들이 셀 수 없이 많아. 별반 다를 게 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are plenty of people who suffer all over the Settled Systems. This is no different.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are plenty of people who suffer all over the Settled Systems. This is no different.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147BA"
msgid "That is an incredibly heartless view of the situation."
msgstr "진짜 무심한 판단이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again. &&& ...  &&& Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me. &&& Andreja: The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun. &&& Andreja: But to see what has transpired here... It is hard to believe this is part of any plan. Truly, it is a disaster.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is, though had we not arrived when we did, it may never have been put into action.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B9"
msgid "At least there's a plan to fix things."
msgstr "다만 문제들을 해결할 방안이 있어서 망정이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it. &&& Andreja: I suppose that is true. &&& Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If that is supposed to be a joke, it is not funny. This is my home we are talking about!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B8"
msgid "Until something more interesting comes along."
msgstr "뭔가 더 흥미로운 일이 생기기 전까진."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Until something more interesting comes along.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Until something more interesting comes along.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B7"
msgid "If that is supposed to be a joke, it is not funny. This is my home we are talking about!"
msgstr "농담으로 한 말이면 웃기지도 않는 소리야. 지금 우린 내 고향을 이야기하는 거잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it. &&& Andreja: I suppose that is true. &&& Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: In this case I am very personally glad to hear that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B6"
msgid "That's what we do."
msgstr "우리가 하는 일이 바로 그거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's what we do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's what we do.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B5"
msgid "In this case I am very personally glad to hear that."
msgstr "그렇다면 네가 그렇게 말해 줘서 개인적으로 정말 기뻐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it. &&& Andreja: I suppose that is true. &&& Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Payment is what you are thinking about, after all that we have seen in Dazra?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B4"
msgid "Their credits will spend as well as anyone else's."
msgstr "저들이 준 크레딧은 다른 사람들이 준 것과 마찬가지로 잘 쓰일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Their credits will spend as well as anyone else's.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Their credits will spend as well as anyone else's.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B3"
msgid "Payment is what you are thinking about, after all that we have seen in Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에서 그 많은 일을 겪었는데, 겨우 보상에 대해 생각하고 있는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B2"
msgid "I suppose we shall see, in time."
msgstr "머지 않아 우리 모두 알게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: At least there's a plan to fix things.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: At least there's a plan to fix things.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011374A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B1"
msgid "There is, though had we not arrived when we did, it may never have been put into action."
msgstr "그렇긴 해. 다만 우리가 이곳에 오지 않았다면 영영 해결되지 않았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It doesn't exactly align with my beliefs, but it seemed necessary.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147B0"
msgid "I appreciate it all the more for that."
msgstr "그러니까 더더욱 감사한 마음이 드네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it is a plan, then our being here is part of it. &&& Andreja: I suppose that is true. &&& Andreja: But now that we are here, surely you must agree that we should do everything we can to help House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And... I appreciate that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AF"
msgid "[Flirt] I'll gladly help for your sake, Andreja."
msgstr "[유혹] 안드레자, 널 위해서라면 기꺼이 도와줄 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You weren't sure you would ever see Dazra again.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AE"
msgid "No, I was not."
msgstr "그래, 못 볼 거라 생각했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: After everything that we have been through recently, I worried I might never see this place again. For that, I am grateful. If only this were just about me.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: But to see what has transpired here... It is hard to believe this is part of any plan. Truly, it is a disaster.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113749A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AD"
msgid "The Great Serpent has always demanded much of us, as individuals and as the whole of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께선 항상 우리와 바룬 가문 전체에게 많은 것을 바라셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: slightly bashful / Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Flirt] I'll gladly help for your sake, Andreja.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Flirt] I'll gladly help for your sake, Andreja.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137499
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AC"
msgid "And... I appreciate that."
msgstr "그리고... 난 고맙게 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I am glad we are here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137496
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AB"
msgid "I've been waiting for this opportunity for a very long time."
msgstr "아주 오랫동안 이 기회를 기다려 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've never been the religious type, but you know what they say. When in Dazra...
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never been the religious type, but you know what they say. When in Dazra...
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137497
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147AA"
msgid "Well, it means a great deal. To me, and to all of us."
msgstr "음, 정말 의미가 커. 내게도, 우리 모두에게도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... suppose that is true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137494
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A9"
msgid "I'm always looking for unique experiences, and they don't get much more unique than this."
msgstr "난 항상 특별한 경험을 찾고 있지. 그리고 이것보다 더 특별한 경험은 거의 못할 테고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not sure I believe that. But I thank you for doing it, just the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137492
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A8"
msgid "There really was no other way."
msgstr "정말 다른 방법은 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... I am not sure. But what might have been does not matter. You are one of us now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137490
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A7"
msgid "What do you think would have happened if I'd turned it down?"
msgstr "내가 거절했다면 무슨 일이 벌어졌을 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There really was no other way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There really was no other way.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137491
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A6"
msgid "I am not sure I believe that. But I thank you for doing it, just the same."
msgstr "그 말을 믿어지지 않지만, 어쨌든 노력해 줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, it means a great deal. To me, and to all of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01137498
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A5"
msgid "I've never been the religious type, but you know what they say. When in Dazra..."
msgstr "난 항상 종교를 믿는 사람은 아니었지만, 그런 말 있잖아... 다즈라에 가면 다즈라의 법을 따르라..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the Serpent's Will. &&& Andreja: I suppose we shall see, in time. &&& Andreja: It is an incredible commitment you have made, to become one of the Promised. Never in my wildest dreams would I have imagined such a thing.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps it does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113748E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A4"
msgid "This makes us that much closer, doesn't it? Seemed like the right thing to do."
msgstr "그만큼 우리가 가까워진 거지? 그게 올바른 일처럼 느껴지더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This makes us that much closer, doesn't it? Seemed like the right thing to do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This makes us that much closer, doesn't it? Seemed like the right thing to do.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113748D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A3"
msgid "Perhaps it does."
msgstr "그럴지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: embarrassed / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This makes us that much closer, doesn't it? Seemed like the right thing to do.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I know we have much to do, but I just... I did not want to leave it unsaid. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113748D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_DazraArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A2"
msgid "But now is hardly the time!"
msgstr "하지만 지금은 이럴 때가 아니야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A1"
msgid "The ramp here seems almost man-made. I wonder if anyone's left us a souvenir."
msgstr "마치 누군가 일부러 만든 것처럼 생긴 경사로네. 챙길 만한 기념품이라도 남겼으려나."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: *Sigh* I love you, but some things go beyond even love.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0147A0"
msgid "Your actions will cost countless lives, and inflict an emotional toll on people across the Settled Systems."
msgstr "네 행동으로 말미암아 수많은 이들의 목숨이 희생되고, 더 나아가 개척 성계 사람들 모두의 마음에 깊은 상처가 새겨질 꺼야."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: When we next make port, I'll be returning to the Lodge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479F"
msgid "And that, I cannot look past."
msgstr "그리고 그건, 나도 눈감아줄 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479E"
msgid "I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라에서 너가 했던 모든 일들에 감사를 전하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479D"
msgid "As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that."
msgstr ""
"컨스텔레이션의 한 일원으로서 미지를 탐험하는 게 우리의 일이지만, 우리가 그 이상으로 무슨 막중한 책임을 지는지는 때때로 불분명해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479C"
msgid "You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended."
msgstr "곤경에 처한 도시를 보고 , 너는 방관보다는 중재라는 힘든 결정을 내렸어. 그것에 대해서는... 찬사받아 마땅해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing. &&& SarahMorgan: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.|Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked. &&& SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.|For the representatives to entrust you with so much responsibility, from choosing a leader to stopping the Serpent's Crusade, is... well, unprecedented.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Be that as it may, you were still began your journey as an outsider.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479B"
msgid "As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised."
msgstr "그들은 약속받은 자로서의 내 판단에 흔들림이 없다는 걸 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01479A"
msgid "Be that as it may, you were still began your journey as an outsider."
msgstr "그렇다고는 해도, 넌 이방인으로서 여정의 길에 올랐잖아."

#. PROMPT: As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014799"
msgid "To go from a virtual stranger to their most trusted confidant in such a short time was no small feat."
msgstr "그렇게 짧은 시간 만에 생판 모르는 사람에서 가장 믿음직한 이로 거듭나는 건 결코 우습게 볼 일이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing. &&& SarahMorgan: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.|Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked. &&& SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.|For the representatives to entrust you with so much responsibility, from choosing a leader to stopping the Serpent's Crusade, is... well, unprecedented.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But when called into service, you did what was necessary. That's something to be admired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014798"
msgid "You flatter me."
msgstr "과찬이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: You flatter me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You flatter me.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014797"
msgid "But when called into service, you did what was necessary. That's something to be admired."
msgstr "하지만, 부름에 응하면 너는 해야만 하는 일을 했어. 그건 존경받을 만한 행동이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing. &&& SarahMorgan: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.|Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked. &&& SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.|For the representatives to entrust you with so much responsibility, from choosing a leader to stopping the Serpent's Crusade, is... well, unprecedented.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh really? And I suppose your next miracle will be curing the common cold? Will the wonders never cease?! *Laughs*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 011373A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014796"
msgid "Considering my resume, I think it's par for the course."
msgstr "그래도 내가 누군데 그 정도는 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: teasing the Player / Disbelief
#. PROMPT: Considering my resume, I think it's par for the course.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Considering my resume, I think it's par for the course.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014795"
msgid "Oh really? And I suppose your next miracle will be curing the common cold? Will the wonders never cease?! *Laughs*"
msgstr "아 그러셔? 그럼 다음에 행하실 기적은 만병통치약의 개발이겠네? 놀라운 일이 끝이 없구나? *웃음*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing. &&& SarahMorgan: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.|Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked. &&& SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.|For the representatives to entrust you with so much responsibility, from choosing a leader to stopping the Serpent's Crusade, is... well, unprecedented.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And they couldn't have chosen a better person to do so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014794"
msgid "They were simply indecisive and looking for someone to lead them."
msgstr "가문들은 그저 결정하는 것에 어려움을 겪었을 뿐이고, 자신들을 이끌어 줄 누군가를 찾고 있었을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: They were simply indecisive and looking for someone to lead them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They were simply indecisive and looking for someone to lead them.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014793"
msgid "And they couldn't have chosen a better person to do so."
msgstr "그리고 이보다 더 적합한 사람을 구할 수도 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf is clearly the most qualified.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014792"
msgid "Tell me... what influenced your decision to advocate for House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "말해줘... 너가 카딕 가문을 지지하게끔 만든 이유가 뭐야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf is clearly the most qualified.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014791"
msgid "Tell me... what influenced your decision to advocate for House Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "말해줘... 너가 둘케프 가문을 지지하게끔 만든 이유가 뭐야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Dul'kehf is clearly the most qualified.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113739C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014790"
msgid "Tell me... what influenced your decision to advocate for House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "말해줘... 너가 베타알 가문을 지지하게끔 만든 이유가 뭐야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised. &&& SarahMorgan: Be that as it may, you were still began your journey as an outsider.|To go from a virtual stranger to their most trusted confidant in such a short time was no small feat. &&& SarahMorgan: I would like to pick your brain, however, regarding your choice of Speaker. Call it... intellectual curiosity. &&& SarahMorgan: Tell me... what influenced your decision to advocate for House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
