#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. PROMPT: House Veth'aal seemed the best of three lackluster choices.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: That being said, I do question your decision to leave them without a Speaker.
