#. TOPIC: 01137384
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476F"
msgid "As a witness to the dangers of over-militarization myself, I'm concerned that House Veth'aal will choose the most aggressive response to Va'ruun'kai's future issues."
msgstr "과잉 군사력의 위험성을 직접 목격한 사람으로서, 베타알 가문이 바룬카이의 미래 문제에 대해 가장 공격적인 대응을 선택할까 봐 걱정이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Ka'dic abstained from the vote for political reasons. &&& SamCoe: Yeah, maybe. It's always tough to be the deciding vote. The way they did it was sneaky as hell. &&& SamCoe: My guess? They probably KNEW how you were voting, and figured they would make YOU the bad guy.|Had they just voted their conscience, that'd mean House Veth'aal would be pissed at them. As it stands, their hands are clean.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can't abide by that. Law and order is one thing, but martial law is another.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132667
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476E"
msgid "They wouldn't be so foolish. I chose House Veth'aal because the city needs order."
msgstr "그렇게까지 어리석진 않을 걸. 내가 베타알 가문을 고른 건, 도시에 질서가 필요해서야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They shouldn't rely on me to make a decision. I won't always be there to help. &&& SarahMorgan: You have a point. And yet they weren't asking you to run their government, only to nudge it in the right direction. &&& SarahMorgan: Regardless, you did your best to navigate rough seas, both practically and politically.|And with the immediate threat dealt with, one hopes that Dazra will look forward to a brighter future.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. I know I will not make the mistake of doubting House Va'ruun. Even after all this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113737F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476D"
msgid "Agreed. Things may look tough now, but their self-reliance and ingenuity will help them pull through this."
msgstr "동의해. 지금은 힘들어 보일지 몰라도, 그들의 자립심과 독창성이 이 위기를 극복하는 데 도움이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your opinion of House Dul'kehf? &&& SarahMorgan: They're bureaucratic, measured, and exacting. |Whereas Constellation is a much different organization, outside of maybe, say... Walter.|In the short term, I worry they'll struggle to move things along. In the long term, rules and regulations may serve them well.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think if Va'ruun society is to move past Jinan's heirs, having an authoritative figure is helpful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137381
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476C"
msgid "What's your opinion of House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. PROMPT: Agreed. Things may look tough now, but their self-reliance and ingenuity will help them pull through this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. Things may look tough now, but their self-reliance and ingenuity will help them pull through this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I would call this mission a resounding success. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113737E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476B"
msgid "Yes. I know I will not make the mistake of doubting House Va'ruun. Even after all this."
msgstr "그래. 난 바룬 가문을 의심하는 실수는 하지 않을 거야. 이 모든 일을 겪은 후에도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: I did what I could. The rest is up to them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did what I could. The rest is up to them.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I would call this mission a resounding success. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113737C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01476A"
msgid "As it should be."
msgstr "그래야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. PROMPT: What's your opinion of House Veth'aal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your opinion of House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Apologetic
