msgctxt "014756"
msgid "The city is doomed either way. I am not going to be the scapegoat when it does."
msgstr "도시는 어느 쪽이든 파멸할 운명이야. 나는 도시가 파멸할 때 희생양이 되지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014755"
msgid "Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else."
msgstr "동의해. 우리는 우리의 삶의 방식을 다른 누구에게도 강요하고 싶지 않기 때문에 종종 난제에 부딪히지."

#. PROMPT: When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014754"
msgid "Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked."
msgstr "외교관들은 종종 다른 사회에 무엇이 최선인지 안다고 생각하지. 너는 판단하는 대신 그들의 집단에 동화되었고, 오직 요청받은 일만 했어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Interesting. I personally disagree, which means our criteria must be markedly different. |House Veth'aal voted in favor of the Serpent's Crusade. That alone gives me pause.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014753"
msgid "That being said, I do question your decision to leave them without a Speaker."
msgstr "그렇긴 하지만, 그들에게 대변자를 남기지 않은 네 결정에는 의문이 들어."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014752"
msgid "You were given a chance to steer their government in the right direction."
msgstr "그들의 정부를 올바른 방향으로 이끌 기회가 주어졌었잖아."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They shouldn't rely on me to make a decision. I won't always be there to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014751"
msgid "As it stands now, I worry they will suffer from infighting and turmoil."
msgstr "지금 상태로는 그들이 내분과 혼란으로 고통받을까 봐 걱정이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra.|As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that.|You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014750"
msgid "When people are hurting, I can't stand by and do nothing."
msgstr "사람들이 고통받고 있을 때, 나는 가만히 서서 아무것도 하지 않을 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's precisely why I did it. To weaken House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's precisely why I did it. To weaken House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137371
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474F"
msgid "As a strategic move it plays, but we're not at war with House Va'ruun. There was no need to weaken them."
msgstr "전략적 움직임으로는 통하지만, 우리는 바룬 가문과 전쟁 중이 아니야. 그들을 약화시킬 필요는 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's precisely why I did it. To weaken House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: Regardless, you did your best to navigate rough seas, both practically and politically.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137371
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474E"
msgid "Still, given their intentions, I understand why you made that decision. I only hope it doesn't sow even more bitterness toward outsiders."
msgstr "그럼에도 불구하고 그들의 의도를 고려할 때, 네가 왜 그런 결정을 내렸는지 이해해. 그저 이방인에 대한 더 큰 반감을 불러일으키지 않기를 바랄 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra.|As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that.|You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's as may be, but when called into service, you did what was necessary. That's something to be admired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474D"
msgid "I wasn't attempting to be a savior."
msgstr "나는 구원자가 되려고 한 게 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. PROMPT: I wasn't attempting to be a savior.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wasn't attempting to be a savior.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 0113736A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474C"
msgid "That's as may be, but when called into service, you did what was necessary. That's something to be admired."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지만, 부름을 받았을 때 너는 필요한 일을 했어. 그건 존경받을 만한 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra.|As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that.|You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Laugh* Yes. Perhaps you'll be the recipient of the first ever "Savior of Va'ruun" award. Would look lovely on your mantle at home.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137369
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474B"
msgid "I should be commended. Preferably with some kind of ceremony and a award."
msgstr "나는 칭찬받아야 해. 어떤 의식과 상 같은 걸로 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. PROMPT: I should be commended. Preferably with some kind of ceremony and a award.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I should be commended. Preferably with some kind of ceremony and a award.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137368
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01474A"
msgid "*Laugh* Yes. Perhaps you'll be the recipient of the first ever \"Savior of Va'ruun\" award. Would look lovely on your mantle at home."
msgstr "*웃음* 그래. 아마도 네가 최초의 ‘바룬의 구원자’ 상을 받게 될 거야. 집 벽난로 위에 두면 멋지겠네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Agreed. It's often a conundrum, as we don't wish to impose our way of life onto anyone else.|Diplomats often think they know what's best for another society. Instead of judging, you assimilated into their group, and only did what you were asked.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137363
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014749"
msgid "In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard."
msgstr "어쨌든, 대의회가 너를 그렇게 높이 평가해 줘서 고마워."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As one of the Promised, they knew my judgment was uncompromised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137363
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014748"
msgid "For the representatives to entrust you with so much responsibility, from choosing a leader to stopping the Serpent's Crusade, is... well, unprecedented."
msgstr "대표단이 지도자를 선택하는 것부터 뱀의 성전을 막는 것까지 그렇게 많은 책임을 네게 맡기다니... 전례가 없는 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. PROMPT: Thanks, but let's not discuss this now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks, but let's not discuss this now.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137364
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014747"
msgid "Of course. It can wait."
msgstr "물론이야. 기다릴 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra.|As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that.|You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. It can wait.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137365
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014746"
msgid "Thanks, but let's not discuss this now."
msgstr "고맙지만, 이건 지금 얘기하지 말자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: It was all luck, honestly.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was all luck, honestly.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: In any case, I'm thankful the council held you in such high regard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137366
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014745"
msgid "An ancient scholar from Earth once said: \"Luck is what happens when preparation meets opportunity.\" Your training and leadership under fire are hardly happenstance."
msgstr ""
"지구의 한 고대 학자가 말했지. '행운은 준비가 기회를 만날 때 일어난다'고. 네가 훈련받은 것과 위기 상황에서 지휘력을 발휘한 건 결코 "
"우연이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: I want to say thank you for everything you did in Dazra.|As members of Constellation, it's our job to explore distant worlds, but it's sometimes unclear what responsibilities we hold beyond that.|You saw a city in need, and made the difficult decision to intercede, rather than observe. For that... you should be commended.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An ancient scholar from Earth once said: "Luck is what happens when preparation meets opportunity." Your training and leadership under fire are hardly happenstance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01137367
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014744"
msgid "It was all luck, honestly."
msgstr "솔직히 다 운이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: 어이, 얘기 좀 해.|컨스텔레이션의 회원들은 높은 성품을 갖춘 것으로 존중받는데, 계속해서 네가 나쁜 결정을 내려 우리의 평판마저 떨어지고 말았어.|지금 당장은 날 도와주려고 노력하는 걸 알고 있으니 협력하도록 할게. 하지만 네가 저지른 행동은 절대 받아들일 수 없단 걸 명심해.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_AngerScene_GreetDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014743"
msgid "Hey, we need to talk. Now."
msgstr "이봐, 우리 얘기 좀 해. 당장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: VeryAngry
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Serpent's will is not for you to question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_AngerScene_GreetDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014742"
msgid "Have you taken leave of your senses? What possessed you to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Do you not understand what that means?"
msgstr "정신이 나간 거야? 무슨 생각으로 뱀의 성전을 재개한 거지? 그게 무슨 의미인지 이해는 하고 있는 거야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: 어이, 얘기 좀 해.|컨스텔레이션의 회원들은 높은 성품을 갖춘 것으로 존중받는데, 계속해서 네가 나쁜 결정을 내려 우리의 평판마저 떨어지고 말았어.|지금 당장은 날 도와주려고 노력하는 걸 알고 있으니 협력하도록 할게. 하지만 네가 저지른 행동은 절대 받아들일 수 없단 걸 명심해. &&& SarahMorgan: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps not, but the will of a warmongering madman is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014741"
msgid "The Serpent's will is not for you to question."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻은 네가 의문을 품을 것이 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: The Serpent's will is not for you to question.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent's will is not for you to question.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014740"
msgid "Perhaps not, but the will of a warmongering madman is."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 하지만 전쟁광 미치광이의 뜻은 의문을 품어야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: 어이, 얘기 좀 해.|컨스텔레이션의 회원들은 높은 성품을 갖춘 것으로 존중받는데, 계속해서 네가 나쁜 결정을 내려 우리의 평판마저 떨어지고 말았어.|지금 당장은 날 도와주려고 노력하는 걸 알고 있으니 협력하도록 할게. 하지만 네가 저지른 행동은 절대 받아들일 수 없단 걸 명심해. &&& SarahMorgan: 
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, the same Speaker who leveled half the city. What a model of wisdom he is!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473F"
msgid "I understand perfectly. It was the Speaker's choice, and we must abide by it."
msgstr "완전히 이해하고 있어. 그건 대변자의 선택이었고, 우리는 따라야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: I understand perfectly. It was the Speaker's choice, and we must abide by it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand perfectly. It was the Speaker's choice, and we must abide by it.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473E"
msgid "Yes, the same Speaker who leveled half the city. What a model of wisdom he is!"
msgstr "그래, 도시의 절반을 쑥대밭으로 만든 그 대변자 말이지. 그 대변자가 얼마나 지혜로운지 알 만하군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: 어이, 얘기 좀 해.|컨스텔레이션의 회원들은 높은 성품을 갖춘 것으로 존중받는데, 계속해서 네가 나쁜 결정을 내려 우리의 평판마저 떨어지고 말았어.|지금 당장은 날 도와주려고 노력하는 걸 알고 있으니 협력하도록 할게. 하지만 네가 저지른 행동은 절대 받아들일 수 없단 걸 명심해. &&& SarahMorgan: 
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course you didn't. Unbelievable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473D"
msgid "To be honest, I didn't think it through."
msgstr "솔직히, 깊이 생각하지 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I didn't think it through.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To be honest, I didn't think it through.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473C"
msgid "Of course you didn't. Unbelievable."
msgstr "물론 안 했겠지. 믿을 수가 없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: 어이, 얘기 좀 해.|컨스텔레이션의 회원들은 높은 성품을 갖춘 것으로 존중받는데, 계속해서 네가 나쁜 결정을 내려 우리의 평판마저 떨어지고 말았어.|지금 당장은 날 도와주려고 노력하는 걸 알고 있으니 협력하도록 할게. 하지만 네가 저지른 행동은 절대 받아들일 수 없단 걸 명심해. &&& SarahMorgan: 
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hardly. You're stretching their resources thin, to fight a war that is utterly pointless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ECF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473B"
msgid "It's the best thing for Dazra."
msgstr "이게 다즈라를 위한 최선이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: It's the best thing for Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's the best thing for Dazra.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ECE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01473A"
msgid "Hardly. You're stretching their resources thin, to fight a war that is utterly pointless."
msgstr "전혀. 너는 완전히 무의미한 전쟁을 위해 그들의 자원을 낭비하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry that the player would decide this isn't important right now. / Angry
#. PROMPT: Let's talk about this later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's talk about this later.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ECC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014739"
msgid "Fine. But we're having this conversation, sooner or later."
msgstr "좋아. 하지만 우리는 이 대화를 하게 될 거야. 조만간."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent's will is not for you to question. &&& SarahMorgan: Perhaps not, but the will of a warmongering madman is. &&& SarahMorgan: What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war. |And yet it was YOU -- not him, not even the council -- who carried out that wish.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Except that's not how House Va'ruun operates. This decree came from their Speaker, the mouth of their god.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ECB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014738"
msgid "If the council disagrees with the decision, they can stop at anytime."
msgstr "대의회가 그 결정에 동의하지 않으면 언제든지 중단할 수 있어."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sarah. I made a mistake.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014737"
msgid "Either you apologize now or we go our separate ways."
msgstr "지금 당장 사과하지 않으면 우리는 각자의 길을 가는 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Perhaps not, but the will of a warmongering madman is.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014736"
msgid "What Anasko was trying to achieve was a declaration of war."
msgstr "아나스코가 이루려던 것은 선전 포고였어."

#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If the council disagrees with the decision, they can stop at anytime.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014735"
msgid "And yet it was YOU -- not him, not even the council -- who carried out that wish."
msgstr "그런데 소원을 이룬 건 아나스코도, 대의회도 아닌 바로 너였어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014734"
msgid "Seems like the new rulers are wasting no time letting people know who's in charge."
msgstr "새로운 지도자들이 지체 없이 누가 주인인지 확실히 각인시키는 것 같네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E07
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014731"
msgid "The Crimson Fleet's getting smarter. Food is the most valuable commodity in times like these."
msgstr "크림슨 함대가 점점 더 똑똑해지고 있네. 이럴 때일수록 식량이 가장 귀중한 자원이니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E03
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014730"
msgid "Finally, I get to try this Koza I've heard so much about!"
msgstr "드디어 소문으로만 듣던 '코자’를 맛보게 되는군!"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E05
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472F"
msgid "Even as a man of science, I can appreciate a temple as a place to pray and grieve. To see it all taken away, I feel for the people here."
msgstr ""
"과학자지만, 기도하고 슬퍼할 수 있는 사원 같은 공간이 있어 다행이야. 모든 걸 빼앗겼으니, 여기 사람들의 심정이 어떨지 느껴지는군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E04
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472E"
msgid "It's interesting that faith plays such a prominent role in the healing process. I'd be curious to see if there's science behind it, or if it's just a placebo."
msgstr ""
"치유 과정에서 신앙이 이토록 중요한 역할을 한다는 게 흥미롭군. 과학적인 근거가 있는 건지, 아니면 그냥 위약 효과인지 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472D"
msgid "These turrets seem oddly placed. What exactly is coming out of that crater?"
msgstr "이 포탑들은 이상하게 배치되어 있군. 저 구덩이에서 대체 뭐가 나오고 있는 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E06
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472C"
msgid "There's some kind of monastery at the top of that mesa. Might be worth checking out."
msgstr "저 탁상지 위에 수도원 같은 게 있어. 한번 가볼 만한 가치가 있을 것 같군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E00
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472B"
msgid "It's easy to get lost in a city like this. Nice to have these plazas as a waypoint."
msgstr "이런 도시에서는 길을 잃기 쉬워. 이런 광장들이 이정표가 되어주니 좋군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01472A"
msgid "You know what they say, the bigger the statue, the bigger the insecurity."
msgstr "이런 말도 있잖아. 조각상이 클수록, 불안감도 크다."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E02
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014729"
msgid "It seems like there's a shrine in every home. Say what you will about the citizens here, but they practice what they preach."
msgstr "집집마다 성소가 있는 것 같아. 여기 시민들에 대해 뭐라 떠들든 자유겠지만, 말한 대로 실천은 하는군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DF9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014728"
msgid "Seems the accident here displaced a lot of people. I hope the conditions here are humane, but I'm not holding my breath."
msgstr "여기서 일어난 사고로 많은 사람들이 쫓겨난 것 같군. 이곳 상황이 잔혹하지 않았으면 좋겠지만, 기대는 안 되네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speechless at seeing the Scaled Citadel and the crater at its feet
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014727"
msgid "Wow. I'm just... wow."
msgstr "와우. 난 그냥... 와우."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014726"
msgid "I've got a bit of nerves knowing what this device is capable of. Let's hope the science is right this time."
msgstr "이 장치에 어떤 능력이 있는지 알고 나니 약간 긴장되는군. 이번에는 과학이 맞기를 바라자고."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014725"
msgid "Watching the reconstruction of the Mourning Device is fascinating. Theoretically it should work, but you know what they say about theory."
msgstr "모어닝 장치의 재구성을 지켜보는 건 흥미롭군. 이론적으로는 작동해야겠지만, 그 이론에 대해 뭐라고 하는지 알잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DF7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014724"
msgid "As large as this area is, the barracks are pretty empty. I wonder how many soldiers were lost in the calamity."
msgstr "지역이 넓어서 그런가. 막사는 텅 비어 있군. 이 재앙으로 얼마나 많은 군인들이 목숨을 잃었는지 궁금해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136E01
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014723"
msgid "Must be nice to be born into a house like this. It's opulent."
msgstr "이런 가문에서 태어나면 진짜 좋겠네. 엄청 호화로워."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DFB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014722"
msgid "I'm both excited and terrified by what this device can do. But the work presses on."
msgstr "이 장치로 할 수 있는 게 기대되면서도 두려워. 하지만 일은 계속 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: player chose a new house to rule House Va'ruun, and their flags are now all around
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136DF8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014721"
msgid "Look at those flags. It's a new day in Dazra."
msgstr "저 깃발들을 봐. 다즈라의 새날이 밝았군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132379
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014720"
msgid "I'm curious how Spacers got here on their own. I'd love to sit down with them and share experiences, but I doubt they feel the same."
msgstr "어떻게 스페이서들이 여기까지 왔을까? 녀석들과 같이 앉아서 경험담을 나누고 싶지만, 녀석들도 그러고 싶어 할진 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Spaceship cockpit crashed into the front door of a facility creating an entrance.
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132378
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01471F"
msgid "Well, at least the Spacers knocked before they went in."
msgstr "뭐, 스페이서 녀석들, 적어도 들어가기 전에 노크는 했군."

msgctxt "01471E"
msgid "\"We don't need a real throne, we have a throne at home.\""
msgstr "\"우리에겐 왕좌가 필요 없다. 이미 집 안에 왕좌가 있으니.\""

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132376
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01471D"
msgid "That has to be the Fang's Rifle. I'd bet an Artifact on it."
msgstr "저게 분명 '송곳니의 소총’일 거야. 맞다는 데 유물을 걸지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01471C"
msgid "You can definitely tell Spacer's have been here."
msgstr "스페이서 녀석들이 여기 있었다는 건 확실히 알겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132370
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01136E55
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01471B"
msgid "That rock formation looks like a ramp. Be a shame if someone took their ride and launched from it."
msgstr "저 바위 지형은 경사로처럼 생겼네. 누군가 자기 우주선을 타고 저기서 발사한다면 장관이겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132370
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01136E55
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01471A"
msgid "This is an interesting rock formation. It almost looks man-made."
msgstr "바위 지형이 흥미롭군. 꼭 인공적으로 만들어진 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014719"
msgid "Someone turned this crash into an outpost. Classic Va'ruun ingenuity."
msgstr "누군가 이 추락 현장을 전초기지로 바꿨군. 바룬 가문의 기발한 재주인가."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014718"
msgid "Not sure what a camp is doing this far out. It's either scientific, or underhanded."
msgstr "이렇게 외진 곳에 캠프를 만든 이유를 모르겠군. 과학 연구 때문이거나, 아니면 뭔가 꿍꿍이가 있는 거겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014717"
msgid "Look at those blades of rock. Nice to have a roof over your head, I think."
msgstr "저 날선 바위를 봐. 머리 위에 지붕 노릇을 해줄 게 있으니 참 좋군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014716"
msgid "Ooh, a science outpost! It looks like they were doing a soil survey."
msgstr "오, 과학 전초기지다! 토양 조사를 하고 있었던 것 같군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132375
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014715"
msgid "It's the boost pack! Nice of the Spacers to store it here for us."
msgstr "부스터 팩이잖아! 스페이서 녀석들이 친절하게도 우리를 위해 여기에 보관해 뒀군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132373
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014714"
msgid "Didn't expect to find a bunker here. Nice use of the landscape."
msgstr "여기에 벙커가 있을 줄은 몰랐어. 지형을 잘 활용했군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132377
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014713"
msgid "That must be the armor Maaliya wanted. I hope there's a way to wash it."
msgstr "저게 말리야가 원하던 방어구인가 보군. 세탁할 방법이 있으면 좋겠는데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: That's right! They could carry you around on a palanquin, and walk you through the city. And of course there'd be confetti.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014712"
msgid "I also want to thank you for putting a halt to the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 중단시켜 줘서 고맙다는 말을 하고 싶군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014711"
msgid "The last thing the Settled Systems needs is another war."
msgstr "개척 성계에 전쟁이 또 일어나는 건 정말 최악이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: First off, I just want to say, heck of a job saving Dazra. That was a tough situation to navigate, and you did it with aplomb.|A pat on the back isn't nearly enough. I hope they throw you a parade.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fair. Do you think there should be a "Dusty Day?" That'd be pretty sweet if you ask me, and well deserved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014710"
msgid "A parade isn't enough either."
msgstr "퍼레이드만으로는 부족하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A parade isn't enough either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A parade isn't enough either.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: I also want to thank you for putting a halt to the Serpent's Crusade. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470F"
msgid "Fair. Do you think there should be a \"Dusty Day?\" That'd be pretty sweet if you ask me, and well deserved."
msgstr "그래. '두더지의 날' 같은 게 있으면 어떨까? 나라면 정말 멋질 것 같고, 그럴 자격도 충분해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A parade would be fun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A parade would be fun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: I also want to thank you for putting a halt to the Serpent's Crusade. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F1B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470E"
msgid "That's right! They could carry you around on a palanquin, and walk you through the city. And of course there'd be confetti."
msgstr "그렇지! 사람들이 가마에 당신을 태우고 도시를 돌아다니는 거야. 물론 색종이도 뿌리고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm just fine with a pat on the back. Maybe a thumbs up too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just fine with a pat on the back. Maybe a thumbs up too.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: I also want to thank you for putting a halt to the Serpent's Crusade. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470D"
msgid "Two thumbs up even! Don't sell yourself short."
msgstr "엄지손가락 두 개도 치켜세워 주지! 너무 겸손해하지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: First off, I just want to say, heck of a job saving Dazra. That was a tough situation to navigate, and you did it with aplomb.|A pat on the back isn't nearly enough. I hope they throw you a parade.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's right! They could carry you around on a palanquin, and walk you through the city. And of course there'd be confetti.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F1C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470C"
msgid "A parade would be fun."
msgstr "퍼레이드도 재밌을 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: First off, I just want to say, heck of a job saving Dazra. That was a tough situation to navigate, and you did it with aplomb.|A pat on the back isn't nearly enough. I hope they throw you a parade.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Two thumbs up even! Don't sell yourself short.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01136F1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470B"
msgid "I'm just fine with a pat on the back. Maybe a thumbs up too."
msgstr "난 그냥 등을 토닥여주는 걸로도 충분해. 엄지손가락도 치켜세워주면 좋고."

#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can travel to other dimensions, but not forward in time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113231C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01470A"
msgid "Give it maybe twenty years and you'll start to see the results."
msgstr "한 20년쯤 지나면 결과를 볼 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014709"
msgid "This place was never meant offer refuge to Zealots."
msgstr "이곳은 광신도들의 피난처가 될 곳이 절대 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014708"
msgid "These Zealots... So quick to destroy or seize the work of others."
msgstr "광신도 녀석들... 순식간에 남들이 노력한 것을 빼앗고 부수다니."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014707"
msgid "It is quite common for people from Dazra to make regular pilgrimages to the shrines around Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라 신민들이 다즈라 주변을 아우르는 사원들에 순례를 마치는 것은 흔한 풍습이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014706"
msgid "These shrines are clearly important locations."
msgstr "이 사원들은 분명 중요한 장소들이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014705"
msgid "The Zealots have no claim to this place, no right to obstruct the Promised from visiting these shrines."
msgstr "광신도들은 이곳에 아무런 권리도 없어. 약속받은 자들이 이 사원에 방문하지 못하도록 할 권리가 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014704"
msgid "The Zealots would seem to do everything in their power to disrupt daily life for the Va'ruun people."
msgstr "광신도들은 바룬 신민들의 일상 생활을 방해하기 위해 무슨 짓이든 할 작정인 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014703"
msgid "It is amazing the government has allowed this to stand. I suppose they have more pressing matters."
msgstr "정부 측에서 이걸 남겨 두다니 대단한걸. 더 시급한 문제가 있을 법한데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014702"
msgid "This is... I am at a loss. It shows... dedication, I suppose?"
msgstr "난... 뭐라 말해야 할지 모르겠네. 그만큼 헌신적이란 거겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014701"
msgid "Attempting research at an unsecured site like this is always a risk."
msgstr "이런 위험한 장소에서 연구를 시도하는 것은 항상 위험한 법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: an "oops, oh well. Anyway" tone
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014700"
msgid "At least they attempted to use the local geography to their advantage."
msgstr "그나마 저들은 이곳의 지형지물을 이용해 보려고 하긴 했네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FF"
msgid "Remote setups like this are rarely used for official, authorized business. I have seen my fair share."
msgstr "이런 외진 곳의 장소는 공식적으로 승인된 업무엔 거의 쓰이지 않아. 나도 잘 알고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FE"
msgid "Someone saw strategic value in this wreck. I like the way they think."
msgstr "누가 이 잔해에서 전략적 가치를 보았나 본데. 맘에 드는 생각이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FD"
msgid "Mind your surroundings. Even the plants here can be dangerous."
msgstr "주변을 잘 살펴봐. 이곳의 식물마저 위험할 수 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FC"
msgid "Unfamiliar environments should always be approached with caution..."
msgstr "위험한 환경 요소는 항상 조심스럽게 다가가야 하는 법이지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FB"
msgid "Crash landings on Va'ruun'kai are a rare occurrence. I wonder what became of the occupants."
msgstr "바룬카이에 불시착을 하는 건 자주 있는 일이 아닌데. 점거자들은 어떻게 됐는지 궁금하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146FA"
msgid "No immediate sign of the occupants... I cannot imagine they fared well."
msgstr "점거자들의 흔적이 보이질 않아... 무사하지는 않았던 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F9"
msgid "The formation here makes for a relatively defensible location. Only one easy way up."
msgstr "이곳의 위치를 고려하면 방어하기 유리한 것 같네. 올라오는 길 하나뿐이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E17
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F8"
msgid "Nothing wrong with a little bit of prayer, especially here."
msgstr "기도 한번 드리는 것도 나쁘진 않지, 특히 여기서는 말야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E18
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F7"
msgid "Man. When tragedy happens, the first place you go is the house of worship. Damn shame for it to be cut open like this."
msgstr "참. 비극이 벌어지면, 사람들이 처음 찾는 곳이 예배당인데 말이야. 망할, 이렇게 되다니 안타깝군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E16
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F6"
msgid "The bar. Best part of every town. So, what's your poison?"
msgstr "술집, 어디를 들리든 없어서는 안될 곳이지. 자, 뭘로 할래?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E15
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F5"
msgid "Cool shrine. Is it okay if we look at it? I always get worried we're breaking some kind of sacred ritual."
msgstr "멋진 성소네. 좀 살펴봐도 괜찮을까? 뭐 신성한 의식이라도 방해하는 건 아닌지 걱정돼서."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E14
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F4"
msgid "House Ka'dic looked like it survived the calamity. Hope the other houses don't get spiteful."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 재앙 속에서도 살아남은 거 같네. 다른 가문들이 앙심 품지 않길 바라야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E13
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F3"
msgid "This part of the city looks mostly intact. Also, do you smell that? I think we found the food spot."
msgstr "도시 이쪽은 꽤 멀쩡해 보이네. 그리고, 지금 냄새 안 나? 아무래도 식당인가 본데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E10
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F2"
msgid "As someone who's familiar with a family statue or two, I give this two out of five on the self-aggrandizing scale."
msgstr "가문 조각상에 나름 익숙한 사람으로서 평가하자면, 자화자찬 점수로는 5점 만점에 2점 정도 되겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F1"
msgid "I'm no scientist, but that looks like it can do some damage."
msgstr "내가 과학자는 아니지만, 저거 꽤 위력적인 것 같은데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E11
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146F0"
msgid "Damn... half the city got leveled. Even seeing it, I can't believe it."
msgstr "젠장... 도시 절반이 날아가다니. 보고도 믿을 수가 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E09
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146EF"
msgid "Looks like there's a base at the top. That's an intimidating perch."
msgstr "꼭대기에 기지가 있는 거 같네. 무시무시한 곳에 둥지를 틀었군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E08
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146EE"
msgid "That's a lot of food. I can see why the pirates went after it, way more valuable than creds."
msgstr "식량 엄청 많네. 해적들이 왜 노렸는지 알겠군. 크레딧보다도 훨씬 값어치 있겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146ED"
msgid "This place is exactly what I pictured. House Va'ruun takes its military seriously. Maybe too seriously. That being said, don't see too many soldiers."
msgstr ""
"여긴 내가 상상했던 모습 그대로야. 바룬 가문은 군사력에, 어쩌면 지나치게 적극적이네. 근데 그런 것 치고는 병력이 많아 보이지는 않아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146EC"
msgid "Whatever this machine is, it's starting to take shape."
msgstr "이 기계가 뭔지는 몰라도, 뭔가 모양이 잡히고 있는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146EB"
msgid "You really get to know a culture by how they treat those in need. And I'm not liking what I'm seeing."
msgstr "어려운 자들을 어떻게 대하는지 보면 그 문화를 알 수 있지. 그리고 여기 문화는 썩 마음에 안 드네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E0F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146EA"
msgid "So this is the big science project, huh. Neat."
msgstr "이게 그 거창한 과학 프로젝트겠군. 멋진데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_SpaceshipWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsDown
msgctxt "0146E9"
msgid "Weapons offline! Fix them, we mustn't fail!"
msgstr "무장 다운! 당장 고쳐. 실패는 용납할 수 없어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E12
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E8"
msgid "These turrets were set up recently. What are they trying to keep out?"
msgstr "저 포탑들은 최근에 설치됐어. 뭘 막으려는 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E7"
msgid "That must be the armor. Maaliya's description was right on the nose."
msgstr "저게 갑옷인가 보네. 말리야가 말한 거랑 딱 들어맞아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E6"
msgid "That looks like our boost pack. Let's bring it back to Maaliya."
msgstr "저게 우리가 찾는 부스터 팩 같은데. 말리야한테 다시 가져다주자."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132609
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E5"
msgid "A bunker. I doubt any ships flying over head would even notice this thing."
msgstr "벙커네. 저 위에 날아다니는 우주선들은 눈치도 못 챌걸."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132604
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E4"
msgid "A sniper could make a good home here."
msgstr "저격수가 자리잡기 좋은 곳이군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E3"
msgid "Am I hallucinating, or are those Spacers?"
msgstr "내가 헛것을 보는 거야, 아니면 저거 스페이서들이야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E2"
msgid "Weapons room. And that looks like Maaliya's rifle."
msgstr "무기고다. 그리고 저건 말리야의 소총 같은데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E1"
msgid "Nice little sanctuary under the rock formations here."
msgstr "여기 바위 더미 아래에 괜찮은 은신처 찾았어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132605
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146E0"
msgid "Camps like these are where people make deals. Looks like this one went bad."
msgstr "보통 이런 캠프에서 거래가 이루어지지. 여기는 잘 안 풀린 모양이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132607
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01136E50
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DF"
msgid "That rock formation almost looks like a ramp. Got a skateboard?"
msgstr "저 바위 모양은 거의 경사로 같네. 스케이트보드라도 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132607
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01136E50
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DE"
msgid "Wonder what's at the top of that path there."
msgstr "저 길 끝에 뭐가 있을지 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132606
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DD"
msgid "Hell of a way to make an entrance."
msgstr "엄청난 등장인데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325F7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DC"
msgid "I wonder what they're studying the soil for. The last thing this planet needs is more bad news."
msgstr "저 흙을 왜 연구하는 건지 궁금하네. 이 행성에 나쁜 소식은 이미 차고 넘치는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DB"
msgid "Looks like the place is under new management."
msgstr "새로운 주인이 들어선 거 같네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325F9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146DA"
msgid "A throne fit for a king."
msgstr "왕에게 어울리는 왕좌인데."

#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113268F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D9"
msgid "Good call putting an end to the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 끝낸 건 잘한 선택이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah. A lot more people, including innocents, would've died if he succeeded.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113268F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D8"
msgid "I hate to say it, because I know a lot of decent folks were lost, but it's probably for the best Anasko's experiment blew up in his face."
msgstr "괜찮은 사람들도 많이 잃었고, 그렇기에 말하기 싫지만, 아나스코의 실험이 실패한 게 아마 최선일 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Yeah, maybe. It's always tough to be the deciding vote. The way they did it was sneaky as hell.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136DF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D7"
msgid "My guess? They probably KNEW how you were voting, and figured they would make YOU the bad guy."
msgstr "내 추측? 쟤네 아마 네가 어떻게 투표할지 알고, 널 나쁜 놈으로 만들려고 했을 거야."

#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal will respect the decision of the council.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136DF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D6"
msgid "Had they just voted their conscience, that'd mean House Veth'aal would be pissed at them. As it stands, their hands are clean."
msgstr "쟤네가 그냥 양심에 따라 투표했으면, 베타알 가문이 화를 쟤네한테 돌렸을 거야. 지금 상황에서는, 놈들은 책임이 없지."

#. PROMPT: I think House Dul'kehf just wants to fix the city before going to war.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think House Dul'kehf just wants to fix the city before going to war.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Ka'dic doesn't do wars. They're covert operators.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113267A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D5"
msgid "That's my worry too. I wonder if they'd be so hesitant if the city wasn't in shambles."
msgstr "나도 그게 걱정이야. 도시가 이렇게 엉망진창이 아니었어도 놈들이 그렇게 망설였을까 의문이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah. A lot more people, including innocents, would've died if he succeeded. &&& SamCoe: That's the thing. People can say it would've just been soldiers, and they signed up for it -- but war doesn't work like that. &&& SamCoe: But yeah, either way, I don't see House Va'ruun as the kind of people who wage war halfway. |And with Cora getting older, I just don't want her to be caught up in that. &&& SamCoe: So I'm hoping House Ka'dic sticks to their word on this. The fact they abstained from voting does give me pause though. 
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know about thrive, but I appreciate them voting "no" on the Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113267D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D4"
msgid "They will. And the city of Dazra will thrive as a result."
msgstr "그럴 거야. 그리고 다즈라는 결국 번영할 거고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They will. And the city of Dazra will thrive as a result. &&& SamCoe: I don't know about thrive, but I appreciate them voting "no" on the Crusade.|I just hope that was out of wisdom, and not caution.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yet. Doesn't mean they might not flip the script once the city's back up and running.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D3"
msgid "I trust them to do what's best for Dazra. Going to war is not on their agenda."
msgstr "나는 쟤네가 다즈라를 위해 최선을 다할 거라고 믿어. 전쟁하려는 생각은 없을 거야."

#. PROMPT: What are your thoughts on House Dul'kehf's leadership style?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on House Dul'kehf's leadership style?
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132678
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D2"
msgid "I'm not going to say they're the best choice. Being from the Freestar Collective, I've had my fill of bureaucracy."
msgstr "최고라고는 못 하겠어. 자유항성 공동체 출신으로서, 난 관료제는 질리도록 겪었거든."

#. PROMPT: What are your thoughts on House Dul'kehf's leadership style?
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: House Dul'kehf follows orders. They won't deviate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132678
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D1"
msgid "But if they're the only ones who aren't beating the war drum, they're okay in my book."
msgstr "그래도 전쟁을 부르짖지 않는 유일한 가문이라면, 내 기준에서는 괜찮아."

#. PROMPT: I trust them to do what's best for Dazra. Going to war is not on their agenda.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I trust them to do what's best for Dazra. Going to war is not on their agenda.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132672
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146D0"
msgid "Yet. Doesn't mean they might not flip the script once the city's back up and running."
msgstr "아직은 말이야. 도시가 다시 돌아가기 시작하면 쟤네가 태도를 바꾸지 말라는 법도 없잖아."

#. PROMPT: I trust them to do what's best for Dazra. Going to war is not on their agenda.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: My guess? They probably KNEW how you were voting, and figured they would make YOU the bad guy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132672
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CF"
msgid "Hard to know which way they're leaning, but you may have a point about them being anti-Crusade."
msgstr "쟤네가 어느 쪽으로 기우는지는 알기 어렵지만, 쟤네가 성전 반대파라는 네 주장이 일리가 있을지도 몰라."

#. PROMPT: House Ka'dic doesn't do wars. They're covert operators.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Ka'dic doesn't do wars. They're covert operators.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: My guess? They probably KNEW how you were voting, and figured they would make YOU the bad guy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132670
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CE"
msgid "That makes me feel way worse. But at least things won't get bloody that way."
msgstr "그 말 들으니 더 불안해지네. 그래도 적어도 유혈 사태는 안 벌어지겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Ka'dic abstained from the vote for political reasons. &&& SamCoe: Yeah, maybe. It's always tough to be the deciding vote. The way they did it was sneaky as hell. &&& SamCoe: My guess? They probably KNEW how you were voting, and figured they would make YOU the bad guy.|Had they just voted their conscience, that'd mean House Veth'aal would be pissed at them. As it stands, their hands are clean.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you chose them knowing that might happen? I hope you're joking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132669
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CD"
msgid "I expect them to initiate the Crusade as soon as they're ready."
msgstr "놈들이 준비되는 대로 바로 성전을 시작할 거라고 봐."

#. PROMPT: They will. And the city of Dazra will thrive as a result.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They will. And the city of Dazra will thrive as a result.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113267C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CC"
msgid "I don't know about thrive, but I appreciate them voting \"no\" on the Crusade."
msgstr "번영할지는 모르겠어. 그래도 쟤네가 성전에 반대표 던진 건 고맙게 생각해."

#. PROMPT: They will. And the city of Dazra will thrive as a result.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I trust them to do what's best for Dazra. Going to war is not on their agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113267C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CB"
msgid "I just hope that was out of wisdom, and not caution."
msgstr "그게 현명함 덕분이었길 바라야지, 신중함이 아니라."

#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132657
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146CA"
msgid "You gave them a starting point to rebuild and make a new future."
msgstr "네가 그들에게 재건하고 새로운 미래를 만들 시작점을 준 거지."

#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: So I'm hoping House Ka'dic sticks to their word on this. The fact they abstained from voting does give me pause though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132658
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C9"
msgid "And with Cora getting older, I just don't want her to be caught up in that."
msgstr "그리고 코라도 점점 더 커가는데, 그저 코라가 그런 일에 휘말리지 않았으면 하는 바람이야."

#. PROMPT: What are your thoughts on House Ka'dic's leadership style?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on House Ka'dic's leadership style?
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: House Ka'dic abstained from the vote for political reasons.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113266E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C8"
msgid "They're spies, right? Can't trust a word they say. But sometimes you can guess what they're thinking, if you pay attention to the subtext."
msgstr "놈들은 스파이잖아? 쟤네 말은 하나도 믿을 수 없어. 하지만 속내를 잘 살피면, 뭘 생각하는지 때로는 짐작할 수 있지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01136E17
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C7"
msgid "Nothing wrong with a little bit of prayer, especially here."
msgstr "기도 한번 드리는 것도 나쁘진 않지, 특히 여기서는 말야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F11
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C6"
msgid "The armies of House Va'ruun must have been quite the force. To see these emptiness now brings me both sorrow, and relief."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 군대는 꽤나 강력한 세력이었음에 틀림없어. 지금 이렇게 텅 빈 모습을 보니 슬프기도 하고 안도되기도 하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F19
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C5"
msgid "Damn pirates are a plague. And now they've spread even here."
msgstr "망할 해적놈들은 재앙이야. 그리고 이제 그들은 여기에도 퍼졌어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F10
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C4"
msgid "The shrines here are modest, as is their way of living."
msgstr "여기 있는 성소들은 그들의 생활 방식처럼 소박하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F17
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C3"
msgid "While I don't ascribe to their religion, I can empathize with losing a house of worship, especially after a calamity like this."
msgstr "나는 그들의 종교를 믿지는 않지만, 특히 이런 재앙을 겪은 후에 예배당을 잃는 것에 공감할 수 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F15
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C2"
msgid "Those turrets look new. And they're pointing toward the crater."
msgstr "저 포탑들은 새것 같아. 그리고 크레이터를 향하고 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F12
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C1"
msgid "That looks almost like a monastery on top of that mesa. Granted I don't know what House Va'ruun considers monastic."
msgstr "저 고원 위에 있는 건 거의 수도원처럼 보여. 물론 바룬 가문이 무엇을 수도원으로 여기는지는 모르겠지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F18
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146C0"
msgid "Look at those banners. Hopefully they instill confidence in the new leadership."
msgstr "저 깃발들을 봐. 새 지도부를 신뢰하도록 만들어 주기를 바라야겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F16
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BF"
msgid "The Mourning Device. The closer it gets to completion, the more ominously it looms."
msgstr "모어닝 장치. 완성에 가까워질수록, 더욱 불길하게 느껴져."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F14
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BE"
msgid "I wonder if there is an element of survivor's guilt to live in such splendor, or if the residents don't care about the optics."
msgstr "이런 화려한 곳에 사는 것에 생존자의 죄책감 같은 게 있는지, 아니면 주민들이 남들 시선 따위 신경 쓰지 않는지 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BD"
msgid "There must be a switch or control room somewhere to drain this water."
msgstr "이 물을 빼내려면 어딘가에 스위치나 제어실이 있을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F13
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BC"
msgid "The damage to the city is one thing, but it's here that we see the true cost."
msgstr "도시의 피해도 문제지만, 진정한 대가는 바로 여기서 볼 수 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BB"
msgid "Quite the view. But let's not linger too long."
msgstr "경치가 꽤 좋네. 하지만 너무 오래 머물지는 말자."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146BA"
msgid "This restaurant seems like it was a fine place to get a home-cooked meal."
msgstr "이 식당은 집밥을 먹을 수 있는 훌륭한 곳이었던 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B9"
msgid "Gunshots. I'm more concerned with whatever they're shooting at."
msgstr "총소리야. 그들이 쏘고 있는 대상이 더 걱정되는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B8"
msgid "That water looks suspicious. The dam seems to be safeguarding the farm on the other end of the lake."
msgstr "저 물은 수상해 보여. 댐이 호수 반대편에 있는 농장을 보호하고 있는 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F0A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B7"
msgid "I think I see another area on the other side of these crates. If they can be removed..."
msgstr "그 상자 반대편에 또 다른 구역이 있는 것 같아. 상자를 치울 수만 있다면..."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F08
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B6"
msgid "I'm curious what kind of people lived here. And also, where they've gone."
msgstr "여기에 어떤 사람들이 살았는지 궁금하네. 그리고 그들이 어디로 갔는지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: research facility on the edge of a mountain
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F09
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B5"
msgid "Research at the cutting edge. Quite literally in fact."
msgstr "최첨단 연구. 사실 말 그대로 벼랑 끝에 있네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F07
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B4"
msgid "You know, I just had a memory of the first time I ate Chunks. Sheer madness to see one all the way out here."
msgstr "있잖아, 여기서 청크를 보니 처음 먹었던 기억이 떠올랐어. 이런 오지에서 이걸 보다니 정말 말도 안 돼."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F06
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B3"
msgid "Judging by the number of shrines, prayer is an important part of daily life here."
msgstr "성소의 수를 보니, 여기에서 기도는 일상생활의 중요한 부분인 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F05
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B2"
msgid "This place must've been a listening post, before the Zealots took it over."
msgstr "여긴 광신도들이 점령하기 전에는 청음초소였던 게 분명해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B1"
msgid "This camp was only recently evacuated. Be on your guard."
msgstr "이 야영지는 최근에 대피했어. 경계해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F03
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146B0"
msgid "Part of Constellation's charter is the admiring of cute animals."
msgstr "컨스텔레이션 헌장의 일부는 귀여운 동물을 감상하는 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F00
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AF"
msgid "The Zealots ruin everything they touch. But this target feels more strategic."
msgstr "광신도들은 그들이 손대는 모든 것을 망쳐. 하지만 이 목표는 더 전략적으로 느껴져."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AE"
msgid "It's not unusual for stations this large to have ample food supplies, but farming food on one is quite novel."
msgstr "이렇게 큰 기지에 식료품을 가득 보관하는 거야 드문 일은 아니지만, 식량을 재배한다는 건 꽤 참신한데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AD"
msgid "That looks like the armor that was stolen from Maaliya."
msgstr "저건 말리야에게서 도난당한 방어구 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AC"
msgid "A statoin like this must be vital for Dazra's grid. We should remove the Zealots before they can cause harm."
msgstr "이런 시설은 다즈라의 전력망에 필수적일 거야. 광신도들이 해를 입히기 전에 제거해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AB"
msgid "Creatures, gases, this is quite the hazardous situation we've walked into."
msgstr "생물, 가스, 우리가 걸어 들어온 이곳은 꽤나 위험한 상황이네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F02
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146AA"
msgid "A geothermal plant. There may be a source of hot water underneath here."
msgstr "지열 발전소야. 여기 어딘가 아래에 온수원이 있을지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F04
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A9"
msgid "A venom tree. An inauspicious sign, at least for these treasure hunters."
msgstr "맹독 나무야. 불길한 징조지. 적어도 이 보물 사냥꾼들에게는."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A8"
msgid "I'd use caution when approaching that viscous material. It looks toxic to the touch."
msgstr "저 점성 물질에 접근할 때는 조심하는 게 좋겠어. 만지면 독성이 있을 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF3
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A7"
msgid "This bunker is well concealed. They utilized the natural landscape perfectly."
msgstr "이 벙커는 잘 숨겨져 있어. 자연 경관을 완벽하게 활용했네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A6"
msgid "The Zealots have no reservations of killing their own cousins, do they."
msgstr "광신도들은 자기 사촌들을 죽이는 데 거리낌이 없나 보군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A5"
msgid "Some kind of business deal was transacted here. Or at least, it was attempted."
msgstr "여기서 일종의 사업 거래가 이루어졌던 것 같아. 아니면 적어도 시도는 했던가."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A4"
msgid "That vessel has been stripped bare, but it looks sturdy enough."
msgstr "저 우주선은 깡그리 털렸지만, 꽤나 튼튼해 보여."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EEE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A3"
msgid "Seeing these beds makes me miss the comforts of the Lodge."
msgstr "이 침대들을 보니 롯지의 안락함이 그리워지네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A2"
msgid "Spacers. They're absolute vultures, wherever they reside."
msgstr "스페이서 놈들이야. 그들은 어디에 있든 그야말로 벌처들이지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EED
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A1"
msgid "Crashes like this can be perilous, even if you survive. I'm glad whoever was here seemed to have made it out."
msgstr "이런 추락은 살아남더라도 위험할 수 있어. 여기 있던 사람이 무사히 빠져나간 것 같아서 다행이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0146A0"
msgid "Is that our weapon? It matches the description."
msgstr "저게 우리 무기인가? 설명과 일치해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136F01
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469F"
msgid "Bravo. That should restore the power."
msgstr "잘했어. 이걸로 동력이 복구될 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EEB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469E"
msgid "Careful. Those plants bare all the trademark signs of toxicity."
msgstr "조심해. 저 식물들은 독성의 모든 전형적인 징후를 가지고 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469D"
msgid "We'll need to connect the battery here to get this working again, but I'm not sure how."
msgstr "이걸 다시 작동시키려면 여기 있는 배터리를 연결해야 하는데, 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EEF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469C"
msgid "This almost looks like a museum. The sculptures are beautiful, in their own way."
msgstr "여긴 거의 박물관 같아. 조각품들이 나름대로 아름답네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469B"
msgid "Whoever was here, seemed to be doing a soil survey. I wonder if they posted their findings."
msgstr "여기 있던 사람은 토양 조사를 하고 있었던 것 같아. 그들이 조사 결과를 게시했는지 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EEA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01469A"
msgid "The rock formations here might provide shelter from inclement weather."
msgstr "여기에 있는 바위 지형은 악천후로부터 피난처를 제공할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lights went out, likely a trap
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014699"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "안 돼..."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014696"
msgid "The situation in Dazra is so dire they're taking extreme measures for housing."
msgstr "다즈라의 상황이 너무 심각해서 주택 문제에 극단적인 조치를 취하고 있네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE2
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014695"
msgid "Spacers, out here. It's like we can't escape them."
msgstr "여기까지 스페이서라니. 그들을 피할 수 없는 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE1
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014694"
msgid "This village looks almost... wholesome."
msgstr "이 마을은 거의... 평화로워 보여."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EFA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014693"
msgid "A beautiful shrine with a majestic view."
msgstr "장엄한 경치를 가진 아름다운 성소야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE0
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014692"
msgid "This is certainly one way to kick down a door."
msgstr "이건 확실히 문을 박차고 들어가는 한 가지 방법이네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014691"
msgid "You can admire someone building a homestead out here."
msgstr "여기서 정착지를 건설한 사람을 존경할 만해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014690"
msgid "If this \"Mourning Device\" is what they say, I worry a second calamity might befall the city."
msgstr "이 '모어닝 장치'가 저들이 말한 대로라면, 도시에 두 번째 재난이 닥칠지도 모른다는 걱정이 들어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468F"
msgid "This must be the waste disposal area. Hopefully the sensors don't consider us rubbish."
msgstr "여기가 쓰레기 처리 구역인가 봐. 센서가 우리를 쓰레기로 여기지 않기를 바라야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468E"
msgid "So this is Jinan Va'ruun. Interesting that he looks upward to the sky, as if appealing to a higher power."
msgstr "이것이 지난 바룬이군. 더 높은 힘에 호소하듯 하늘을 올려다보는 게 흥미롭네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: the scale of the building and the crater in front of you
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468D"
msgid "By the stars... I wasn't prepared for the sheer scale of it all."
msgstr "세상에... 이 모든 것의 엄청난 규모에 대비하지 못했어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468C"
msgid "The path here may lead to something."
msgstr "여기에 있는 길이 어딘가로 이어질지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468B"
msgid "Is that a throne? Well, heavy is the head that wears the crown..."
msgstr "저게 왕좌인가? 그래, 왕관을 쓴 자는 그 무게를 견뎌야지..."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01468A"
msgid "The shrines here have a unique archictecture. I wonder what the meaning is behind the shapes."
msgstr "여기 있는 성소들은 독특한 건축 양식을 가지고 있어. 그 모양 뒤에 어떤 의미가 있는지 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014689"
msgid "This must've been a vibrant area before the calamity. Now, walking through, you can feel the tension and sorrow in the air."
msgstr "여긴 재앙 전에는 활기찬 지역이었을 거야. 지금 걸어가면서 긴장과 슬픔이 느껴지네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EF5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014688"
msgid "I have eyes on the prize. That's definitely the boost pack Maaliya was searching for."
msgstr "목표물이 보여. 저건 분명히 말리야가 찾고 있던 부스터 팩이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EE4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014687"
msgid "A communal sleeping area. Not much in terms of privacy now, is it."
msgstr "공동 수면실이야. 이제 사생활 면에서는 별 문제 없겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014686"
msgid "The groats in the crater look sweet enough to pet."
msgstr "크레이터에 있는 그로트들은 쓰다듬어도 될 만큼 귀여워 보이네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EDA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014685"
msgid "It seems the Mourning Device is complete. Let's hope the results match the time put into the process."
msgstr "모어닝 장치가 완성된 것 같네. 그 과정에 들인 시간만큼 결과가 좋았으면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ED7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorganNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014684"
msgid "Oh, if there's one thing shared by all cultures, it's a place to vent and drink."
msgstr "아, 모든 문화에 공통점이 하나 있다면 그건 바로 술 마시며 스트레스를 푸는 장소지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: If the council disagrees with the decision, they can stop at anytime.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If the council disagrees with the decision, they can stop at anytime.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: But enough. There is no justification for what you did.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136ECA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014683"
msgid "Except that's not how House Va'ruun operates. This decree came from their Speaker, the mouth of their god."
msgstr "하지만 그건 바룬 가문의 운영 방식이 아니야. 이 포고는 그들의 신의 입, 그들의 대변자로부터 나온 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did it to gain the Great Serpent's favor. &&& SamCoe: Man, of all the stupid... &&& SamCoe: I like to think I have thick skin, but this is different. Fact is, you messed up. Big time.
