msgid "I didn't mess up. You messed up."
msgstr "내가 망친 게 아니야. 네가 망친 거지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion. &&& SamCoe: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit. &&& SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
