#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014678"
msgid "Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?"
msgstr "왜 뱀의 성전을 반대하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, works for me.
