#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: *Sigh* Keep in mind this isn't easy for me either. I love you, but I also can't support decisions like this.
