msgid "*Sigh* I love you, but some things go beyond even love."
msgstr "*한숨* 널 사랑하지만, 어떤 것들은 사랑조차 초월해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: *Sigh* Keep in mind this isn't easy for me either. I love you, but I also can't support decisions like this.|I'll try to move past it this time, but please, be more prudent in the future.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: Your actions will cost countless lives, and inflict an emotional toll on people across the Settled Systems.
