msgid "I'm sorry, but as Chair of Constellation, I can't support this."
msgstr "미안하지만, 컨스텔레이션의 의장으로서 나는 이것을 지지할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: When we next make port, I'll be returning to the Lodge.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
