#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014671"
msgid "Very well. I'm skeptical, but listening."
msgstr "좋아. 회의적이지만, 들어볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: Sarah, are you threatening to leave?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sarah, are you threatening to leave?
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sarah. I made a mistake.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014670"
msgid "Yes, if it comes to that. I most certainly will."
msgstr "그래, 그렇게 된다면. 나는 반드시 그럴 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sarah. I made a mistake.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01466F"
msgid "Because it's going to cost countless lives. All in the name of religious fanaticism."
msgstr "왜냐하면 이건 종교적 광신주의의 이름으로 수많은 생명을 희생시킬 것이기 때문이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If the council disagrees with the decision, they can stop at anytime. &&& SarahMorgan: Except that's not how House Va'ruun operates. This decree came from their Speaker, the mouth of their god. &&& SarahMorgan: But enough. There is no justification for what you did.|Either you apologize now or we go our separate ways.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, if it comes to that. I most certainly will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01466E"
msgid "Sarah, are you threatening to leave?"
msgstr "사라, 떠나겠다고 협박하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Your actions will cost countless lives, and inflict an emotional toll on people across the Settled Systems.|And that, I cannot look past.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: I'm sorry it had to come to this, but you left me no choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01466D"
msgid "When we next make port, I'll be returning to the Lodge."
msgstr "다음에 정박하면, 나는 롯지로 돌아갈 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Clearly. But I need to know you're actually contrite, and this isn't more lip service.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01466C"
msgid "*Sigh* Keep in mind this isn't easy for me either. I love you, but I also can't support decisions like this."
msgstr "*한숨* 이것도 나에게 쉽지 않다는 걸 명심해 줘. 나는 너를 사랑하지만, 이런 결정을 지지할 수도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: *Sigh* I love you, but some things go beyond even love.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01466B"
msgid "I'll try to move past it this time, but please, be more prudent in the future."
msgstr "이번에는 넘어가도록 노력하겠지만, 제발, 앞으로는 더 신중해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SarahMorgan: Clearly. But I need to know you're actually contrite, and this isn't more lip service.
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014669"
msgid "I'm willing to give you a second chance, on the condition you make an effort to change."
msgstr "네가 변하려고 노력한다면, 너에게 두 번째 기회를 줄 용의가 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: SarahMorgan
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SarahMorgan: *Sigh* I love you, but some things go beyond even love.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SarahMorgan
#. TOPIC: 01136EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SarahMorgan_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014668"
msgid "And as Chair of Constellation, I will do my best to guide you toward that."
msgstr "컨스텔레이션의 리더로서, 네가 그렇게 나아갈 수 있도록 최선을 다할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132503
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014661"
msgid "It would seem the farm has fallen on hard times. It is so empty."
msgstr "농장이 힘든 시기에 빠진 것 같아. 텅 비었어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014660"
msgid "There seems to be a path up. We should follow it."
msgstr "저 위로 길이 나 있는 것 같아. 따라가 보자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: You got a lot more faith in them than I do. Now that Viktor is Speaker, the man has no reason to.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113264C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01465F"
msgid "I will say that I don't mind you left them without a leader."
msgstr "네가 쟤네를 지도자 없이 내버려둔 건 딱히 개의치 않는다고 말해둘게."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113239D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01465A"
msgid "See those batteries? One is dislodged. We need to lower it somehow and reconnect it."
msgstr "저 배터리들 보이지? 하나가 빠져 있어. 어떻게든 내려서 다시 연결해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113239C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014659"
msgid "Careful, this looks like some sort of trash compactor. Let's not press our luck."
msgstr "조심해. 폐기물 압축기 같아. 괜히 운을 시험하지 말자고."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113239B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014658"
msgid "I can see another part of the station behind these numbered food crates. There might be a way to get through."
msgstr "번호가 매겨진 음식 상자들 뒤에 기지의 다른 편이 보여. 저걸 통과할 방법이 있을지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132394
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014657"
msgid "There's a path here. Might be worth climbing up to see what we find."
msgstr "여기 길이 있군. 뭐가 있나 올라가 볼 만한 가치가 있을 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113239A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014656"
msgid "You have to admire the technology that goes into something like this. Self-sustaining agriculture on a station this large is pretty impressive."
msgstr "이런 걸 만드는 기술이 정말 대단하네. 이렇게 큰 기지에서 자급자족 농업이라니, 꽤 인상적이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132398
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014655"
msgid "The dam must've been built to protect the farm at the edge of the lake. Just science taking the \"in\" out of inhospitable."
msgstr "저 댐은 호수 가장자리에 있는 농장을 보호하기 위해 지어진 게 분명해. 과학이 거주불가능 환경에서 '불가능'을 없애는 거지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132396
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014654"
msgid "It's hard to reconcile the beauty of this view with the destruction below it, but damn, what a sight."
msgstr "이 아름다운 절경과 그 아래 펼쳐진 파괴의 현장을 동시에 받아들이기는 어렵네. 하지만, 젠장, 정말 장관이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sleeping bags put on shelves like a bunk bed.
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132391
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014653"
msgid "Pretty rough sleeping arrangements. Still, I call dibs on the top shelf!"
msgstr "잠자리가 꽤 열악하네. 그럼, 난 맨 위 칸에서 잘래!"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132397
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014652"
msgid "There must be a control room to drain the water. It's blocking the door and also, I didn't bring my swimsuit."
msgstr "물을 뺄 수 있는 제어실이 있을 거야. 문은 막혀 있고, 나 수영복도 안 가져왔다고."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132395
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014651"
msgid "This would be a nice place for a picnic if it weren't crawling with baddies."
msgstr "소풍 장소로 딱 좋겠네. 나쁜 놈들이 득실거리지만 않는다면."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132399
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014650"
msgid "These must be sleeping pods. I would feel too boxed in to sleep."
msgstr "이것들은 수면 포드인가 보군. 너무 갇혀 있는 느낌이 들어서 잠을 못 잘 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132393
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464F"
msgid "I don't like this. The camp's empty, but all their things are still here."
msgstr "이거 느낌이 쎄한데. 캠프는 비어 있는데, 물건들은 다 그대로 있잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113238E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464E"
msgid "That got the power running at least. But we might be too late."
msgstr "적어도 전력은 다시 들어오는군. 하지만 너무 늦었을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132390
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464D"
msgid "Looks like one of the maintenance workers. Didn't stand a chance against the Zealots."
msgstr "정비인력 중 한 명인가 보군. 광신도들에게는 상대가 안 됐겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132392
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464C"
msgid "Neat place for a shrine. I'd argue it humanizes them if they weren't always shooting at us."
msgstr ""
"성소 위치 한번 기가 막히군. 허구한 날 우리한테 총질만 해대지 않는다면, 저 녀석들에게도 인간적인 구석이 있다고 해줬을 텐데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113238D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464B"
msgid "A floating village! It looks charming. I wonder if anyone's around."
msgstr "떠있는 마을이라니! 매력적이군. 사람이 있을지 궁금한데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113238C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01464A"
msgid "I'm trying to imagine this place in its heydey. Bustling homes and smiling faces. Makes it seem warmer, but sadder too."
msgstr "한창때의 이 장소가 어땠을지 상상해 보고 싶네. 북적이는 집들과 웃는 얼굴들. 더 따뜻해 보이면서도, 더 슬퍼 보이기도 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113238B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014649"
msgid "Cozy. This must've been a great spot for a meal, once upon a time."
msgstr "아늑하군. 예전에는 식사하기에 정말 좋은 곳이었을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132387
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014648"
msgid "Ooh, you can see Dazra from here! Fun."
msgstr "오, 여기서 다즈라가 보여! 재밌는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132389
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014647"
msgid "Pretty nifty engineering to use the crater to keep the groats sheltered. I respect it."
msgstr "구덩이를 이용해서 그로트를 보호하다니 꽤나 실용적인 공학 기술이네. 인정할 만해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132384
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014646"
msgid "Will you look at that. All the way out here, in the far reaches of space... Chunks finds a way."
msgstr "저것 좀 봐. 이 머나먼 우주까지... 청크가 어떻게든 찾아왔군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132388
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014645"
msgid "You ever just want to pick up one of those groats and take them home?"
msgstr "저 그로트 중 한 마리 들어서 집에 데려가고 싶다는 생각 안 들어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Talking about it like it's a nature documentary
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132386
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014644"
msgid "Va'ruun'kai is home to many natural predators. You can recognize them by the sound of their distinct gunfire."
msgstr "바룬카이의 자연에는 수많은 포식자들이 살고 있어. 녀석들의 독특한 총소리로 알아볼 수 있지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132382
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014643"
msgid "Huh, I think I had a dream about this place once. Didn't make any sense until... well, still doesn't make sense, honestly."
msgstr "어, 나 여기 꿈에서 본 적 있는 것 같아. 그때는 전혀 이해가 안 됐는데... 뭐, 솔직히 지금도 이해는 안 돼."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014642"
msgid "Ah, electrical transformers. The science behind electromagnetic induction is fascinating if you ever have a chance to study it."
msgstr "아, 전기 변압기로군. 전자기 유도 과학 이론은 정말 흥미로우니 기회가 되면 한번 공부해 봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132381
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014641"
msgid "The shrine has an interesting shape to it. Almost like a morel mushroom."
msgstr "성소의 모양이 흥미롭군. 꼭 곰보버섯 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132383
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014640"
msgid "Va'ruun shrines have a serenity about that, even amidst all the violence."
msgstr "바룬 성소는 폭력 속에서도 평온함이 느껴져."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132380
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463F"
msgid "Posts like this make for great watchtowers. The only question is, from what threat?"
msgstr "이런 기둥은 훌륭한 망루가 되지. 문제는, 어떤 위협을 감시하느냐는 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463E"
msgid "Careful. Those fumes look noxious, and those creatures look angry."
msgstr "조심해. 저 연기는 유해한 거 같고, 저 생물들은 화난 것처럼 보여."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132385
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463D"
msgid "Dazra's in such bad shape people are taking shelter wherever they can find it."
msgstr "다즈라의 상황이 너무 안 좋아서, 사람들이 어디든 찾아낸 곳이면 피난처로 삼고 있군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463C"
msgid "Something's made its nest here. I'd take samples of this goo, but it might be wiser to reach for my gun."
msgstr "뭔가가 여기에 둥지를 틀었군. 이 끈적이는 물질의 샘플을 채집하고 싶지만, 총을 드는 게 더 현명할지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463B"
msgid "A geothermal plant. If it's anything like ours back home, it combines energy from the formation of the planet and from radioactive decay."
msgstr ""
"지열 발전소로군. 우리 고향에 있는 것과 비슷하다면, 행성이 형성될 때 생긴 에너지와 방사성 붕괴에서 나오는 에너지를 결합해서 가동하는 "
"방식일 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113237B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01463A"
msgid "Now this is wasteland living."
msgstr "이게 바로 황무지 생활이지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132372
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014639"
msgid "Ervin would've loved to examine these plants. Beautiful, dangerous... like a moth to a flame."
msgstr "어빈이 이 식물들을 조사했으면 정말 좋아했을 거야. 아름답고, 위험하고... 불나방 같지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132371
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014638"
msgid "Even experienced pilots have to make the occasional crash landing. Looks like whoever was inside made camp and left."
msgstr "아무리 경험 많은 조종사라도 가끔은 불시착을 해야 할 때가 있지. 안에 있던 사람은 캠프를 만들고 떠난 것 같군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AffinityEvents
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014637"
msgid "A lot of interesting sculptures and goodies here. Anthropologically speaking, I'm intrigued."
msgstr "흥미로운 조각상과 물건들이 많군. 인류학적으로 흥미로워."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132508
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014636"
msgid "There must be some mechanism for draining the flood waters."
msgstr "물을 뺄 수 있는 어떤 장치가 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014635"
msgid "This one almost made it... May the Serpent care for you now, brethren."
msgstr "이자는 거의 다다랐는데... 뱀께서 그대를 보살피시길, 형제여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014634"
msgid "This one at least tried to get away. Unfortunate."
msgstr "이 사람은 도망가려고는 했네. 안타까워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132506
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014633"
msgid "A temporary encampment, but not an uneventful stay for the occupant."
msgstr "임시 야영지지만, 점거자에겐 평범히 머무를 곳은 아니었을 테지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132507
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014632"
msgid "They are one step away from living like animals in cages..."
msgstr "우리에 갇힌 동물보다 한 발짝 나은 수준이네..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132507
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014631"
msgid "The Zealots appear to have little self-respect, to live like this."
msgstr "광신도들은 자신들을 아끼지도 않나 봐, 이런 식으로 살다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132504
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014630"
msgid "The farm looks... different from what I remember as a child."
msgstr "이 농장은... 내 어린 시절 기억과 다르게 느껴져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132504
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462F"
msgid "This place appears to have been through quite a lot."
msgstr "이곳은 상당히 많은 일을 겪은 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132505
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462E"
msgid "The mission appears to have outweighed any considerations for privacy."
msgstr "사생활 따위보다 임무가 훨씬 중요했나 보네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132502
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462D"
msgid "I remember this place. The seaweed dumplings were excellent. A shame to see it shuttered."
msgstr "이곳이 기억나. 해조류 만두가 아주 좋았는데. 예전 같지 못하다니 안타까워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132502
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462C"
msgid "Not enough business to justify keeping it open, perhaps."
msgstr "계속 운영할 만큼의 수익성이 없었던 걸지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132509
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462B"
msgid "Ambush. How typical."
msgstr "기습이라. 뻔하기도 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132501
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01462A"
msgid "Considerable effort went into making at least some portion of this water sanitary."
msgstr "물의 일부만이라도 위생적일 수 있도록 상당한 노력이 기울여졌어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F40
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: EnemyKilled
msgctxt "014629"
msgid "They are lifeless as groat meat."
msgstr "그로트 고기마냥 생기가 사라졌군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132503
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014628"
msgid "It seems that more people used to call this place home."
msgstr "예전에는 더 많은 사람들이 이곳을 집이라고 불렀겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014627"
msgid "This almost seems better suited to a surveillance post than a research lab."
msgstr "이건 연구소라기보다는 감시 초소가 더 맞는 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014626"
msgid "Groats in a pen, as one would expect from a groat farm."
msgstr "우리 안의 그로트들. 그로트 농장에 흔히 보이는 광경이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014625"
msgid "It is heartbreaking to see my people reduced to this."
msgstr "같은 신민들이 이렇게 지내는 걸 보니 가슴이 아파."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014624"
msgid "Shelter must be in short supply indeed for this, of all places, to become a refuge."
msgstr "하필 이런 곳이 난민촌이 되다니, 피난할 곳이 그 정도로 없었단 것이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014623"
msgid "It still seems surprising that Chunks was ever allowed to build here. The end result, however, is hardly a surprise."
msgstr "청크 사가 이곳에 건축을 허가받았다는 것은 여전히 놀라운 일이야. 사업 결과도 전혀 놀라운 일이 아니지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324FB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014622"
msgid "This is perhaps the most out of place Chunks in the galaxy."
msgstr "이곳이 아마 은하계에서도 가장 황당한 청크 지점일 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014621"
msgid "Quite a view from here. This place is... unique, is it not?"
msgstr "경치가 참 대단하네. 이곳은... 특이하지. 안 그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324F6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014620"
msgid "Look at this view... Despite everything, I cannot help but be moved by how beautiful my home can be."
msgstr "이 풍경을 봐... 이제껏 벌어진 일에도 불구하고, 우리 고향의 아름다운 모습에 감동하지 않을 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: dying and trailing off at the end / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247B
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D24A9
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Death
msgctxt "01461F"
msgid "Repair impossible... system malfunction... All Must Serve..."
msgstr "수리 불가능... 시스템 고장... 모두가 섬겨야 한다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01461E"
msgid "Any opportunity to prove to each other how devoted they are... How pathetic."
msgstr "서로가 얼마나 헌신적인지 증명하고 싶어서 결국... 참 형편없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01461D"
msgid "The Zealots cannot seem to pass up a chance to flaunt their devotion."
msgstr "광신도들은 자신들의 헌신을 과시할 기회를 절대 놓치지 않나 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324EA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01461C"
msgid "That removes any advantage they hoped to gain by keeping us in the dark."
msgstr "이걸로 저들이 우리를 감쪽 같이 속여 얻으려던 모든 이점이 사라지게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01461B"
msgid "House Va'ruun has always done its best to make use of the geography."
msgstr "바룬 가문은 항상 지형지물을 이점으로 쓰려고 노력해 왔지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E7
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01461A"
msgid "Ah, a farm. That explains the smell."
msgstr "아, 농장이군. 냄새가 왜 나나 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DD
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014619"
msgid "Only one battery appears operational. Perhaps if we connect the other?"
msgstr "배터리가 하나만 작동하나 봐. 서로 연결시키면 어떨까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014618"
msgid "The Zealots seem to have made quite a home for themselves."
msgstr "광신도들이 자기들을 위한 거주 공간을 상당히 꾸렸나 본데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324E4
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014617"
msgid "Ugh. It is a disgrace that the Zealots flourish here, right under our noses."
msgstr "어휴. 광신도들이 이곳에서 크게 활동했다니 수치스러워. 바로 우리 옆에서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324D9
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014616"
msgid "Commotion up ahead. Exercise caution."
msgstr "앞에 소란이 벌어졌네. 조심해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014615"
msgid "This seems ill-advised, but I see no other way through."
msgstr "별로 추천하고 싶지 않지만, 달리 길이 없는 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DB
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014614"
msgid "We need to get past these crates somehow."
msgstr "어떻게든 저 상자들을 통과해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324DA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014613"
msgid "If we want what is here, we will have to fight for it."
msgstr "이곳에 있는 것을 얻으려면 싸워서 쟁취해야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324D8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014612"
msgid "Va'ruun operations are always as self-sustaining as possible. We have only ever been able to rely on ourselves."
msgstr "바룬 가문은 최대한 자립적인 방식을 추구해 왔어. 우리 외엔 의지할 자들이 없었기 때문이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 011324D8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_AndrejaNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014611"
msgid "An effort was made to keep this place sustained, without a need for frequent resupply."
msgstr "잦은 재공급 없이 이곳을 지속 가능하게 유지하려는 노력이 이루어졌구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: I don't want to talk about it right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't want to talk about it right now.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132566
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014601"
msgid "Very well. Some other time."
msgstr "잘 알았어. 나중에 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A parade would be fun. &&& Barrett: That's right! They could carry you around on a palanquin, and walk you through the city. And of course there'd be confetti. &&& Barrett: I also want to thank you for putting a halt to the Serpent's Crusade. |The last thing the Settled Systems needs is another war.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's fine. We'll talk later.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132328
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014600"
msgid "I don't want to talk about it right now."
msgstr "지금은 그 일에 대해 이야기하고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do. &&& Andreja: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.|Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do. &&& Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading. &&& Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you have so little regard for these people?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145F3"
msgid "I fully expect they'll make a mess of things."
msgstr "그 사람들이 완전히 망쳐 버릴 거라고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will. &&& Barrett: That's the problem with omnipotent beings. Poor communication skills.|Would make things a whole lot clearer if they just stopped by and talked to you. &&& Barrett: Either way, I hope the new leadership in Dazra is just as level headed. &&& Barrett: The whims of a cosmic snake aside, House Ka'dic seems like they'd be more open to peace.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hate to punt the ball here, but I'm just a tourist. I don't know enough about Va'ruun culture or politics to form an educated opinion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132312
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145F2"
msgid "What do you think about House Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Barrett: Yeah, yeah, so I hear. The big snake in the sky, rubber stamping tens of thousands of deaths.|Well, this isn't the first time people have committed heinous acts in the name of some divine edict.|And it always turns out be some megalomaniac, doing megalomaniac things. Guess what that makes you. &&& Barrett: And the fact you did all this without considering how the rest of us would feel...|Constellation is about exploring the unknown, and keeping your mind and heart open to new discoveries.|Acts of aggression like this goes against who we are as a people.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But it DOES matter. You made these decisions. You have to own them, justify them! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132353
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145B4"
msgid "It doesn't matter. The decision has been made."
msgstr "상관없어. 결정은 이미 내려졌으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Barrett: Yeah, yeah, so I hear. The big snake in the sky, rubber stamping tens of thousands of deaths.|Well, this isn't the first time people have committed heinous acts in the name of some divine edict.|And it always turns out be some megalomaniac, doing megalomaniac things. Guess what that makes you. &&& Barrett: And the fact you did all this without considering how the rest of us would feel...|Constellation is about exploring the unknown, and keeping your mind and heart open to new discoveries.|Acts of aggression like this goes against who we are as a people.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132363
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145AF"
msgid "Let's just agree to disagree."
msgstr "그냥 서로 동의하지 않는 걸로 하자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I need you to listen to me right now.|It is unthinkable to me that after all that was done in Dazra, you would refuse to help establish a new Speaker and get us banned.|I will not abandon you in the middle of all that is going on, but I am very, very tempted.  &&& Andreja: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is no living descendant! So... So what, they should just give up?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113252D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145AD"
msgid "Only a descendant of Jinan Va'ruun should lead. None of the other Houses are fit."
msgstr "지난 바룬의 피가 흐르는 자손만이 이끌어야 해. 나머지 가문들은 합당치 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated but also willing to believe. / Irritated
#. PROMPT: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You know that I love you. You mean so much to me. But this... I will try to move past it, but it is difficult.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113251A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A8"
msgid "I would really like to believe that..."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 믿고 싶어..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Andreja: This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily! &&& Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will hear you out, if you have something worthwhile to say.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132519
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A7"
msgid "Listen, Andreja. I can explain."
msgstr "안드레자, 잘 들어. 내가 설명할 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Frustrated. Reluctantly willing to listen to the player. / Irritated
#. PROMPT: Listen, Andreja. I can explain.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Listen, Andreja. I can explain.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132518
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A6"
msgid "I will hear you out, if you have something worthwhile to say."
msgstr "들어 줄게. 충분한 얘길 해 줄 수 있다면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132516
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A5"
msgid "Very well. I will."
msgstr "좋아. 그렇게 할게."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Andreja: This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily! &&& Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: After everything you and I have been through, all that I have shared with you... You would even ask such a question?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132513
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A2"
msgid "You're that mad over this?"
msgstr "이 일에 그 정도로 화가 났단 말이야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Barrett: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. |This isn't some political argument with no answer. This is the difference between right and wrong, life and death. &&& Barrett: At the end of the day, you made a choice to start this "Serpent's Crusade." &&& Barrett: I want you to open your eyes and see the consequences of that choice. And if you can't, then I can't be a part of it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'd really like to believe that...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132305
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0145A0"
msgid "[Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on."
msgstr "[두 번째 기회] 그 선택의 결과를 몰랐어. 앞으로는 더 나은 결정을 내리도록 노력할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: You're that mad over this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're that mad over this?
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01459F"
msgid "After everything you and I have been through, all that I have shared with you... You would even ask such a question?"
msgstr "너와 내가 그 모든 일을 겪고, 네게 그 많은 것들을 공유했는데... 정녕 그런 질문을 할 거야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Andreja: This is not a matter that can be brushed aside so easily! &&& Andreja: You have cut us off from House Va'ruun. You have potentially cut me off from House Va'ruun. If you cannot even begin to see how that might hurt me, I want nothing to do with you.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well. I will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132517
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01459D"
msgid "If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave."
msgstr "내가 한 일이 발아들일 수 없다면 떠나도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I would really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You mean so much to me, but what you have done... I had only just once again found my home, and now I may never be able to return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01459A"
msgid "You know that I love you. You mean so much to me. But this... I will try to move past it, but it is difficult."
msgstr "난 널 사랑하는 것 알지. 넌 내게 참 소중해. 하지만 이건... 눈 감아 주려 하겠지만, 너무 힘들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I would really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You mean so much to me, but what you have done... I had only just once again found my home, and now I may never be able to return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014599"
msgid "I will do my best to move past this."
msgstr "최대한 이 일을 눈 감아 주도록 할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I would really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: You mean so much to me, but what you have done... I had only just once again found my home, and now I may never be able to return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014598"
msgid "I... It is difficult for me, but I will attempt to move past this."
msgstr "내겐... 힘든 일이지만 이번 일을 잊어 보려 해 볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: You know that I love you. You mean so much to me. But this... I will try to move past it, but it is difficult.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014597"
msgid "You mean so much to me, but what you have done... I had only just once again found my home, and now I may never be able to return."
msgstr "넌 내게 너무나 소중하지만, 네가 한 일은 결코... 드디어 겨우 고향을 찾았는데, 이제는 다시는 돌아갈 수 없을지도 모라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014596"
msgid "I can only hope that some day, on my own, I can convince the Council to allow me back."
msgstr "언젠가는 나 혼자서 대의회를 설득해 다시 돌아올 수 있기를 바라는 수밖에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014595"
msgid "I will stay with you until that time, in honor of all that has passed between us, but... You must do better. You must be better."
msgstr ""
"그때까지 너와 함께 있을게, 우리 사이에 지나간 모든 일을 기릴 수 있도록. 하지만... 더 좋은 모습을 보여 줘. 더 나아져야만 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A warning to the player. / Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: You know that I love you. You mean so much to me. But this... I will try to move past it, but it is difficult.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014594"
msgid "I will do my best to forgive you, but you must think about what you have done here."
msgstr "난 널 용서하기 위해 최선을 다하겠지만 넌 여기서 한 일을 잘 생각해 보도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014593"
msgid "No matter your intent, you have jeopardized my link to my home. I need you to think your actions through in the future."
msgstr ""
"네 의도가 무엇이든, 넌 내 고향과 나 사이의 연결 고리를 위험에 빠뜨렸어. 앞으로 네 자신의 행동을 신중하게 생각해야 줘야만 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I will do my best to forgive you, but you must think about what you have done here.|No matter your intent, you have jeopardized my link to my home. I need you to think your actions through in the future.|I need you to do better.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: The next time we make port, I am leaving.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014591"
msgid "I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly."
msgstr "널 사랑하지만 이건... 너무해. 너 때문에 난 큰 피해를 본 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: You mean so much to me, but what you have done... I had only just once again found my home, and now I may never be able to return.|I can only hope that some day, on my own, I can convince the Council to allow me back.|I will stay with you until that time, in honor of all that has passed between us, but... You must do better. You must be better.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: The next time we make port, I am leaving.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014590"
msgid "This is... it is too much. I cannot be around you."
msgstr "이건... 너무할 정도야. 더 이상 네 옆에 못 있겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: The next time we make port, I am leaving.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01458F"
msgid "I hope that at some point you can understand the consequences of what you have done. What you have cost me."
msgstr "언젠가 자신이 저지른 일의 결과를 이해할 수 있기를 바라. 너 때문에 내가 무슨 대가를 것인지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: upset and angry, leaving to get some distance / Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: I love you, but this... This is too much. You have cost me so dearly.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Andreja: I hope that at some point you can understand the consequences of what you have done. What you have cost me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113250C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_System_AngerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01458E"
msgid "The next time we make port, I am leaving."
msgstr "다음에 우주항에 도착하면 그 즉시 떠나겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They seem like as good a choice as any.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They seem like as good a choice as any.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01458A"
msgid "That is... Disappointing, if I am being honest. The lives of many people are dependent on the outcome of that choice. It was not one to be made casually."
msgstr ""
"솔직히 말해서 그건... 실망스럽네. 수많은 사람들의 삶이 그 선택의 결과에 달려 있었어. 그렇게 가볍게 내릴 선택이 아니었다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have only done what any true servant of the Serpent would do. &&& Andreja: I would like to believe that is true, but I suspect not all would have risen to the occasion.|Left to another, we might not have a future. But thanks to you, we do. &&& Andreja: Though... It is hard to imagine a future for House Va'ruun where Anasko is not leading. &&& Andreja: But now, House Dul'kehf will take control.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is... Disappointing, if I am being honest. The lives of many people are dependent on the outcome of that choice. It was not one to be made casually.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 01132560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014588"
msgid "They seem like as good a choice as any."
msgstr "여타 다른 선택지와 별반 나쁘지 않은 것처럼 느껴졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: I fully expect they'll make a mess of things.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I fully expect they'll make a mess of things.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0113255D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Andreja_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014587"
msgid "Do you have so little regard for these people?"
msgstr "이 사람들한테 그렇게나 관심이 없는 거야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132626
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014582"
msgid "We'll need to drain all this to get further down. The water looks bad enough to melt your foot."
msgstr "더 내려가려면 물부터 다 빼야겠어. 저 물에 들어가면 발이 다 녹아버릴 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132623
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014581"
msgid "It's some kind of food storage area. Maybe there's a switch or something to unlatch these crates."
msgstr "여기 식량 창고 같은데. 어쩌면 상자를 풀 수 있는 스위치 같은 게 있을 수도."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132627
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014580"
msgid "That water looks like it's a hazard. The dam's doing a good job of keeping hell at bay though."
msgstr "저 물은 환경 재해나 다름없는데. 그래도 댐이 저 망할 걸 잘 틀어막고 있군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132624
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457F"
msgid "If a picture told a thousand words... this would need at least three. Wish Cora were here to see it."
msgstr "백문이 불여일견이라고... 말로 이걸 설명할 순 없을 거야. 코라가 이걸 볼 수 있었다면 좋겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132621
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457E"
msgid "Guess no one's home. A shame. I would've liked to know more about this place."
msgstr "아무도 없는 거 같아. 여기 대해 더 알고 싶었는데 아쉽게 됐네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132622
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457D"
msgid "I would've liked to try the food here. The place has that homecooked feel."
msgstr "여기 음식 한번 먹어보고 싶었는데. 뭔가 집밥 같은 느낌이 나."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132619
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457C"
msgid "Nice shrine. Has a bit of snake-like design to it, not sure if that's on purpose."
msgstr "멋진 성소네. 뱀 같은 모양이 좀 있는데, 의도적인 건지는 잘 모르겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457B"
msgid "Lights are back on. Everything's up and running."
msgstr "불 다시 켜졌다. 다 정상 작동하고 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01457A"
msgid "It's a damn free for all in here. Well, to the victor go the spoils."
msgstr "여기 완전 난장판이네. 뭐, 전리품은 승자의 것이지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132615
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014579"
msgid "Not sure where this plant supplies energy to, but I can see why the Zealots would target it."
msgstr "저 식물이 어디에 에너지를 공급하는 건지는 모르겠지만, 광신도들이 노릴 만도 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014578"
msgid "Cute animals. Maybe I'll bring the kid here to pet them."
msgstr "귀여운 동물들이네. 나중에 코라 데려와서 만지게 해 줘야겠다."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132614
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014577"
msgid "That's a big fence. Not sure it did its job if the Zealots got in."
msgstr "저거 울타리 엄청 크네. 광신도들이 들어온 거 보면 제 역할은 못한 거 같지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014576"
msgid "Is that... is that a Chunks? You've got to be kidding me."
msgstr "저거... 청크 맞아? 농담이지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261B
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014575"
msgid "Hell of a view. You see all the good and the bad."
msgstr "경치 끝내주네. 좋은 거랑 나쁜 거 다 보이고."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132610
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014574"
msgid "These poor workers didn't know what hit 'em."
msgstr "이 불쌍한 노동자들은 뭐에 당했는지도 몰랐군."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132625
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014573"
msgid "I see blood stains. Whoever was camped here didn't leave on their own terms."
msgstr "핏자국이 보여. 누가 여기 머물렀는지는 모르겠지만, 제 발로 나간 게 아닌 건 확실해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014572"
msgid "It's pretty on brand for House Va'ruun to grow their own food and be self-sustainable. No help from outsiders or Chunks To Go."
msgstr "바룬 가문은 식량까지도 직접 재배해서 자급자족하네. 외부 조달이나 청크 투 고 같은 거 없이."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132618
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014571"
msgid "Imagine seeing something like this outside the Hitching Post. Still, better than having to look at the old Solomon."
msgstr "히칭 포스트 밖에 이런 게 있다고 생각해 봐. 뭐, 그래도 늙은이 솔로몬 동상보다야 낫네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113260A
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014570"
msgid "Same rules apply to mushrooms and alien plants. Don't touch them unless they're pre-packaged."
msgstr "버섯이랑 외계 식물도 마찬가지야. 포장된 거 아니면 건드리지 마."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132612
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456F"
msgid "Ugh, this stuff is disgusting. And I bet whatever made it is is even uglier."
msgstr "으, 이거 진짜 역겹네. 이걸 만든 놈은 아마 더 못생겼을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132611
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456E"
msgid "Gotta get your prayers in, even when you're moving boxes. Otherwise the Great Serpent will land one on your face."
msgstr "상자나 나를 때에도 기도는 빠짐없이 드려야지. 안 그러면 위대한 뱀께서 네 얼굴에 한 방 먹일 테니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132617
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456D"
msgid "Zealots must've run everyone out of here. Without someone radioing in threats, Dazra's exposed."
msgstr "광신도들이 여기 있는 모두를 내쫓았을 거야. 누가 경고라도 하지 않으면, 다즈라가 위험해."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132602
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456C"
msgid "Those are some hard beds. I imagine a lot of sleepless nights here."
msgstr "엄청 딱딱한 침대로군. 많이들 여기서 뒤척였겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132600
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456B"
msgid "Fancy sculpture. That thing in the middle looks sharp enough to cut you open."
msgstr "멋진 조각품이네. 저 가운데 있는 건 날카로워서 사람이라도 찢을 수 있겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132608
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01456A"
msgid "Looks like a recent crash. Hopefully whoever was flying it made it out alive."
msgstr "최근에 추락한 거 같아. 조종한 사람이 무사히 빠져나왔으면 좋겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FA
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014569"
msgid "Pretty surprising to see a building way out here."
msgstr "이렇게 멀리 건물이 있는 거 보니까 좀 놀랍네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132613
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014568"
msgid "That stuff spewing from the plnat can't be good to breathe. Smells worse than my old man's cigars."
msgstr "저 식물에서 뿜어져 나오는 거 마셔서 좋을 리가 없겠어. 우리 아버지 시가보다도 냄새가 독한데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325F8
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014567"
msgid "Now that's something you don't see every day. A floating village."
msgstr "날마다 볼 수 있는 광경은 아니지. 떠다니는 마을이라니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lights went out, likely a trap
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FF
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014566"
msgid "Shit."
msgstr "젠장."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325F5
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014565"
msgid "Looks like these are the living quarters. It's more cramped than a gym locker. But hey, beds, billiards, what more do you need, right?"
msgstr "여기 숙소 같은데. 헬스장 사물함보다 더 비좁네. 그래도 뭐, 침대랑 당구대까지, 이 정도면 충분하잖아, 그렇지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325F6
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014564"
msgid "This thing looks dangerous. Might even be designed to crush heavy machinery."
msgstr "저거 위험해 보이는데. 중장비도 부술 수 있게 만든 거 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132616
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014563"
msgid "Listening posts remind me of wartime. Battles are won and lost with information."
msgstr "청음초소 보니까 전쟁 때 생각나네. 전투의 승패는 정보에 달렸지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132601
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014562"
msgid "One of the batteries here seems dislodged. If we can get it connected again, we might be able to get this thing running."
msgstr "여기 배터리 하나가 빠진 것 같아. 다시 연결하면 이거 작동시킬 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132603
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014561"
msgid "Humble abode like this almost reminds me of home."
msgstr "이런 소박한 곳 보니까 거의 집에 온 기분인데."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113261C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014560"
msgid "Sounds like a lot of hooting and hollering. Just your standard old fashioned treasure hunt."
msgstr "아주 야단법석이로군. 전형적인 보물찾기 클래식이지."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FE
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01455F"
msgid "You think they built this farm around the crater on purpose? Smart."
msgstr "일부러 농장을 크레이터 주변에다 지은걸까? 똑똑하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 011325FC
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoeNewBranch0
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01455E"
msgid "There's a path here leading up. Might be worth taking a look."
msgstr "여기 위로 이어지는 길이 있네. 한번 살펴볼 만하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: A lot of innocents died in Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A lot of innocents died in Dazra.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: But yeah, either way, I don't see House Va'ruun as the kind of people who wage war halfway. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113268B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01455D"
msgid "I know, and I'm not celebrating that. It's just a lot more would've died if Anasko got his way. But no matter what, the blood's on his hands."
msgstr "나도 알아. 기쁘다는 게 아니야. 아나스코가 자기 뜻대로 했다면 훨씬 더 많은 사람이 죽었을 거야. 어쨋든, 다 자기 책임이지."

#. PROMPT: I didn't know you felt this strongly.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't know you felt this strongly.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113457D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01455B"
msgid "Well, then you haven't been paying attention."
msgstr "몰랐다면 네가 신경을 안 쓴 거겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did it to gain the Great Serpent's favor. &&& SamCoe: Man, of all the stupid... &&& SamCoe: I like to think I have thick skin, but this is different. Fact is, you messed up. Big time.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, then you haven't been paying attention.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113457E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01455A"
msgid "I didn't know you felt this strongly."
msgstr "네가 이렇게까지 진지하게 생각하는 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Good call putting an end to the Serpent's Crusade.|I hate to say it, because I know a lot of decent folks were lost, but it's probably for the best Anasko's experiment blew up in his face.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's the thing. People can say it would've just been soldiers, and they signed up for it -- but war doesn't work like that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113268E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014559"
msgid "Yeah. A lot more people, including innocents, would've died if he succeeded."
msgstr "그래. 그자가 성공했다면 무고한 사람들을 포함해서 훨씬 더 많은 사람이 죽었을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Good call putting an end to the Serpent's Crusade.|I hate to say it, because I know a lot of decent folks were lost, but it's probably for the best Anasko's experiment blew up in his face.
