#. TOPIC: 0113265D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014526"
msgid "Same. Stopping the Crusade was the main thing. The political stuff will work itself out in time."
msgstr "나도. 뱀의 성전을 막는 게 가장 중요했어. 정치적인 문제는 시간이 지나면 해결될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. They should've decided themselves. &&& SamCoe: Agree, one hundred percent. If they can't decide this now, what happens when you leave? Might as well make YOU the Speaker. &&& SamCoe: But at the end of the day, what's done is done. I know I'm burying the lede here, because you did save a whole city from ruin.|You gave them a starting point to rebuild and make a new future. |And thanks to you, the only "Crusade" Cora's gonna read about is in the history books.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, you need to. Close it, lock it, throw away the key. Or else we'll have problems.
