#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014525"
msgid "I'm not closing the door on the Crusade happening."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 일어날 가능성을 닫아두고 있진 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: For the sake of Dazra, I hope to see improvement sooner than that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: For the sake of Dazra, I hope to see improvement sooner than that.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113231B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014524"
msgid "You and me both. But something like this doesn't go away in a year."
msgstr "너나 나나 마찬가지야. 하지만 이런 일은 1년 만에 사라지지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. PROMPT: For the sake of Dazra, I hope to see improvement sooner than that.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: Regardless, I won't sit here and sugarcoat it. The people of Dazra have a long road ahead of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113231B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014523"
msgid "And even if the city is restored, the scars will last generations."
msgstr "그리고 도시가 복구된다고 해도, 상처는 몇 세대 동안 지속될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: Cora can read? That's news to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cora can read? That's news to me.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Either way, I'm not gonna worry about it too much.
