#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01451D"
msgid "Agreed. They should've decided themselves."
msgstr "동의해. 그자들이 스스로 결정했어야 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Agreed. They should've decided themselves.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. They should've decided themselves.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: But at the end of the day, what's done is done. I know I'm burying the lede here, because you did save a whole city from ruin.
