#. TOPIC: 01132655
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01451C"
msgid "Agree, one hundred percent. If they can't decide this now, what happens when you leave? Might as well make YOU the Speaker."
msgstr "100% 동의해. 이걸 지금 결정하지 못하면, 네가 떠나고 나면 어떻게 되겠어? 차라리 널 대변자로 앉히는 게 낫겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Djimal might've suggested it thinking I'd choose House Ka'dic.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Djimal might've suggested it thinking I'd choose House Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: But at the end of the day, what's done is done. I know I'm burying the lede here, because you did save a whole city from ruin.
