#. TOPIC: 01132653
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01451B"
msgid "If they were thinking that, joke's on them."
msgstr "만약 그렇게 생각했다면, 그자들만 손해지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. They should've decided themselves. &&& SamCoe: Agree, one hundred percent. If they can't decide this now, what happens when you leave? Might as well make YOU the Speaker. &&& SamCoe: But at the end of the day, what's done is done. I know I'm burying the lede here, because you did save a whole city from ruin.|You gave them a starting point to rebuild and make a new future. |And thanks to you, the only "Crusade" Cora's gonna read about is in the history books.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You would know better than I, professor. Glad the kid's got you to teach her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132663
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01451A"
msgid "History is full of crusades, not just the Serpent's one."
msgstr "역사에는 뱀의 성전 말고도 성전이 많으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal will respect the decision of the council. &&& SamCoe: You got a lot more faith in them than I do. Now that Viktor is Speaker, the man has no reason to. &&& SamCoe: I will say that I don't mind you left them without a leader.|It's up to them to make a decision. Hell, do it the old fashioned way, have the people vote.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, me too. Sure, you insulted them on the way out, but come on. You saved their damn city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132652
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014519"
msgid "I'm surprised they banished us from the city for that."
msgstr "그것 때문에 그자들이 우릴 도시에서 추방했다니 놀랍군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They would never have a democratic vote given their beliefs.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They would never have a democratic vote given their beliefs.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113264F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014518"
msgid "Sure. The only vote that counts is the Great Serpent's."
msgstr "물론. 가장 중요한 투표는 위대한 뱀의 것이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They would never have a democratic vote given their beliefs.
