msgid "Djimal might've suggested it thinking I'd choose House Ka'dic."
msgstr "지말이 내가 카딕 가문을 선택할 거라고 생각해서 제안했을지도 몰라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: That's the thing. People can say it would've just been soldiers, and they signed up for it -- but war doesn't work like that.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132658
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014514"
msgid "But yeah, either way, I don't see House Va'ruun as the kind of people who wage war halfway."
msgstr "하지만 그래, 어느 쪽이든, 바룬 가문이 전쟁을 어중간하게 할 사람들은 아니라고 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm surprised they banished us from the city for that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm surprised they banished us from the city for that.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132651
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014513"
msgid "Yeah, me too. Sure, you insulted them on the way out, but come on. You saved their damn city."
msgstr "그래, 나도. 그래, 네가 나가는 길에 그자들을 모욕하긴 했지만, 그래도 말이야. 네가 그 빌어먹을 도시를 구했잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm surprised they banished us from the city for that.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: But at the end of the day, what's done is done. I know I'm burying the lede here, because you did save a whole city from ruin.
