#. PROMPT: Cora's probably read all that already.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cora's probably read all that already.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Either way, I'm not gonna worry about it too much.
