msgctxt "0144F6"
msgid "[Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sam. I didn't realize what I was doing."
msgstr "[두 번째 기회] 미안해, 샘. 내가 무슨 짓을 하고 있는지 몰랐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did it to gain the Great Serpent's favor. &&& SamCoe: Man, of all the stupid... &&& SamCoe: I like to think I have thick skin, but this is different. Fact is, you messed up. Big time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132640
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F5"
msgid "The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻은 네 하찮은 의견 따위 초월해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated but also willing to believe. / Irritated
#. PROMPT: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sam. I didn't realize what I was doing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sam. I didn't realize what I was doing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Look, I love you, and maybe that makes me a fool, but I think you can change.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F4"
msgid "Man, I really must be a sucker..."
msgstr "이런, 나 진짜 호구 짓을 단단히 했나 보군..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion. &&& SamCoe: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit. &&& SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. I owe you that much. Make your case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132636
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F3"
msgid "Sam, please, I can explain."
msgstr "샘, 제발, 설명할 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: Sam, are you threatening to leave?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sam, are you threatening to leave?
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sam. I didn't realize what I was doing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F2"
msgid "I think I made my intentions clear."
msgstr "내 의도는 분명히 밝혔다고 생각하는데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion. &&& SamCoe: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit. &&& SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think I made my intentions clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132630
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F1"
msgid "Sam, are you threatening to leave?"
msgstr "샘, 지금 떠나겠다고 협박하는 거야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion. &&& SamCoe: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit. &&& SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're starting a war with the Settled Systems. That includes Rangers and civilians minding their own.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132632
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144F0"
msgid "Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?"
msgstr "왜 뱀의 성전을 반대하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you against the Serpent's Crusade?
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: [Second Chance] I'm sorry, Sam. I didn't realize what I was doing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132631
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144EF"
msgid "You're starting a war with the Settled Systems. That includes Rangers and civilians minding their own."
msgstr "개척 성계와 전쟁을 시작하겠다는 거야. 거기엔 자기 일만 신경 쓰는 레인저와 시민들도 포함되어 있어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion. &&& SamCoe: You're losing me with this Great Serpent bullshit. &&& SamCoe: You were given a simple choice. War or peace. Never thought anyone could get that choice wrong. But then you did.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You read my mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132634
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144EE"
msgid "If you don't like my decisions, then leave."
msgstr "내 결정이 마음에 안 들면, 떠나."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Man, of all the stupid...
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The will of the Great Serpent transcends your feeble opinion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132628
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144ED"
msgid "I like to think I have thick skin, but this is different. Fact is, you messed up. Big time."
msgstr "나도 웬만해선 상처 안 받는데, 이건 경우가 달라. 네가 망쳤다는 게 사실이야. 아주 크게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Man, I really must be a sucker...
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144EC"
msgid "Look, I love you, and maybe that makes me a fool, but I think you can change."
msgstr "봐, 난 널 사랑해. 그래서 내가 바보 같아 보일 수도 있겠지만, 난 네가 변할 수 있다고 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144EB"
msgid "Still, you have to prove it with actions. Not just to me, but to Cora too."
msgstr "그래도, 행동으로 증명해야 해. 나뿐만 아니라, 코라에게도."

#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: I know we've got some history, but at the end of the day, I need to set an example for Cora.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144EA"
msgid "I'm guess what I'm saying is, we're going to stick it out for now. But if you do this again, there won't be a next time."
msgstr "그러니까, 내 말은, 일단은 지켜보겠다는 거야. 하지만 이런 짓을 또 한다면, 다음은 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Man, I really must be a sucker...
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E9"
msgid "Look, you're part of Constellation, so maybe that makes me biased. But I think you can change."
msgstr "봐, 넌 컨스텔레이션의 일원이니까, 내가 편향된 걸 수도 있어. 하지만 난 네가 변할 수 있다고 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: I know we've got some history, but at the end of the day, I need to set an example for Cora.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E8"
msgid "So I'm giving you another set of cards. Let's hope you play 'em right."
msgstr "그러니까 한 번 더 기회를 주겠다는 거야. 이번엔 제대로 했으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Frustrated. Reluctantly willing to listen to the player. / Irritated
#. PROMPT: Sam, please, I can explain.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sam, please, I can explain.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132635
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E7"
msgid "Fine. I owe you that much. Make your case."
msgstr "좋아. 그 정도는 해 줘야지. 어디 한번 변명해 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Look, I love you, and maybe that makes me a fool, but I think you can change.|Still, you have to prove it with actions. Not just to me, but to Cora too.|I'm guess what I'm saying is, we're going to stick it out for now. But if you do this again, there won't be a next time.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Which means at the next port we're leaving.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E6"
msgid "I know we've got some history, but at the end of the day, I need to set an example for Cora."
msgstr "우리 사이에 이런저런 일이 있었다는 건 알지만, 결국, 난 코라에게 모범을 보여야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Look, I love you, and maybe that makes me a fool, but I think you can change.|Still, you have to prove it with actions. Not just to me, but to Cora too.|I'm guess what I'm saying is, we're going to stick it out for now. But if you do this again, there won't be a next time.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Which means at the next port we're leaving.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E5"
msgid "Listen, it's not just me. In another life, maybe I look the other way. But I have to set a good example for Cora."
msgstr "들어 봐, 나 때문만이 아니야. 다른 상황이었다면, 나도 그냥 넘어갔을지도 몰라. 하지만 난 코라에게 좋은 본보기가 되어야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: If you don't like my decisions, then leave.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you don't like my decisions, then leave.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: I know we've got some history, but at the end of the day, I need to set an example for Cora.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132633
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E4"
msgid "You read my mind."
msgstr "내 마음을 읽었군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: Which means at the next port we're leaving.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 0113262B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E3"
msgid "Don't want to make a big speech about it. Let's just go our separate ways."
msgstr "거창하게 연설하고 싶진 않아. 그냥 각자 갈 길 가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SamCoe: I know we've got some history, but at the end of the day, I need to set an example for Cora.
#. ALIAS: SamCoe
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SamCoe: Don't want to make a big speech about it. Let's just go our separate ways.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_SamCoe
#. TOPIC: 01132629
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_SamCoe_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144E2"
msgid "Which means at the next port we're leaving."
msgstr "그 말은 즉, 다음 착륙 때 우린 널 떠날 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0726_CompanionAvoidBattleComment02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144D1"
msgid "This is getting out of hand, dusty! We gotta move!"
msgstr "이건 감당 못 해, 두더지! 움직여야 된다고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0726_CompanionAvoidBattleComment02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144D0"
msgid "There's too many of them! We need to get our butts in gear, now!"
msgstr "머릿수가 너무 많아! 지금 당장 튀어야 한다고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0727_CompanionAvoidBattleComment03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CF"
msgid "Go, go!"
msgstr "어서, 어서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111869C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0727_CompanionAvoidBattleComment03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CE"
msgid "We gotta run!"
msgstr "뛰어야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0725_CompanionStageEntryComment01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CD"
msgid "Wow, this is getting to be some party. Don't mind us, just passing through."
msgstr "와. 이거 파티 제대로 하겠는데. 우린 신경 쓰지 마. 그냥 좀 지나갈게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0725_CompanionStageEntryComment01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CC"
msgid "Crowd's gathering. Let's keep our heads down and maybe no one will notice."
msgstr "무지하게 몰려오는데. 머리 숙이고 있으면 우릴 못 볼지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerM01: Strike, O Promised! This is our hour! &&& LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerF01: The Restoration is at hand! The Citadel will be ours!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0720_ZealotsAttackSpeakersHall
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CB"
msgid "Stay light as hydrogen, and we might be able to sneak by."
msgstr "수소처럼 가볍게 다니면 몰래 지나갈 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerM01: Strike, O Promised! This is our hour! &&& LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerF01: The Restoration is at hand! The Citadel will be ours!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0720_ZealotsAttackSpeakersHall
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144CA"
msgid "Let's go. We'll slide right past them while they're dancing with the phantoms."
msgstr "가자. 저놈들이 유령이랑 춤 추는 동안에 슬쩍 빠져나가자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0760_CompanionCrusadersHallEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144C9"
msgid "When you think about all the lives that were lost because of this Crusade... there's no honor and glory in any of this."
msgstr "이 성전 때문에 사라져 버린 그 많은 목숨을 생각하면... 거기엔 그 어떤 명예도, 영광도 있을 수가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0760_CompanionCrusadersHallEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144C8"
msgid "A memorial for the Serpent's Crusade. Huh. It's always wild to see how the other side sees things. Snake eyes and all."
msgstr "뱀의 성전 기념비라. 허. 다른 쪽에서 생각하는 관점을 보는 건 항상 재밌더라고. 뱀의 눈도 그렇고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0910_CompanionVortexGateSeen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144C7"
msgid "Wow. Part of me is awed by the science and spectacle of it... but the rest of me terrified, knowing what it's capable of."
msgstr "와. 한편으로는 과학과 웅장함에 경외감이 들기는 한데... 다른 한편으로는 무섭네. 저게 뭘 할 수 있는지 아니까 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0910_CompanionVortexGateSeen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144C6"
msgid "That's the gate. I don't know what's on the other side of it, but I'd bet my hat it's gonna be weird."
msgstr "저게 그 차원문이구나. 반대쪽에 뭐가 있는진 모르겠지만, 분명 괴상할 거라는 데 내 모자를 걸겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1100_CompanionPalaceDuctsEscape
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144C5"
msgid "My scanner says we need to skedaddle. Now."
msgstr "스캐너가 빨리 도망쳐야 된대. 당장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F9
