msgstr "누가 불 껐어?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Barrett: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. |This isn't some political argument with no answer. This is the difference between right and wrong, life and death. &&& Barrett: At the end of the day, you made a choice to start this "Serpent's Crusade." &&& Barrett: I want you to open your eyes and see the consequences of that choice. And if you can't, then I can't be a part of it.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What you did was monstrous. But I'm trying to balance that with everything else you've done, good and bad.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132369
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B5"
msgid "Do you think I'm a monster?"
msgstr "내가 괴물이라고 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: Barrett, are you saying you're mad enough to leave?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Barrett, are you saying you're mad enough to leave?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132368
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B4"
msgid "I don't know. I'd like to think anyone can change, but only if they acknowledge there's a problem worth fixing."
msgstr "모르겠어. 누구나 변할 수 있다고 생각하고 싶지만, 고쳐야 할 문제가 있다는 걸 인정해야만 가능하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Barrett is leaving the player because of something the player did. Likely murder. / Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: But while I love you, that love is not unconditional. |The cavalier way you put lives in danger... it's murder. And that is a line that can't be crossed.|I'm going to stick with you for now, but please -- learn from this.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: At the next port we'll go our separate ways.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132367
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B3"
msgid "*sigh*  I love you, but there are some things I can't forgive."
msgstr "*한숨* 널 사랑하지만, 용서할 수 없는 일도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Deep breath. Barrett is leaving the player because of something the player did. Likely murder. / Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: But while I love you, that love is not unconditional. |The cavalier way you put lives in danger... it's murder. And that is a line that can't be crossed.|I'm going to stick with you for now, but please -- learn from this.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: At the next port we'll go our separate ways.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132367
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B2"
msgid "*sigh* So... just like that then. It's goodbye."
msgstr "*한숨* 그럼... 이렇게 끝이네. 잘 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Barrett is leaving the player. / Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: *sigh*  I love you, but there are some things I can't forgive.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: I hope in time you realize the scale of what you've done. The lives that you put in harm's way. But either way, I can't be a part of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132365
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B1"
msgid "At the next port we'll go our separate ways."
msgstr "다음 항구에서 우린 각자의 길을 가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Barrett: Yeah, yeah, so I hear. The big snake in the sky, rubber stamping tens of thousands of deaths.|Well, this isn't the first time people have committed heinous acts in the name of some divine edict.|And it always turns out be some megalomaniac, doing megalomaniac things. Guess what that makes you. &&& Barrett: And the fact you did all this without considering how the rest of us would feel...|Constellation is about exploring the unknown, and keeping your mind and heart open to new discoveries.|Acts of aggression like this goes against who we are as a people.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132363
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144B0"
msgid "Let's just agree to disagree."
msgstr "그냥 서로 동의하지 않는 걸로 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player told Barrett to leave. / Confident
#. PROMPT: If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave, Barrett.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave, Barrett.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: *sigh*  I love you, but there are some things I can't forgive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132362
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AF"
msgid "All right. I will."
msgstr "알았어. 그렇게 할게."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Barrett: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. |This isn't some political argument with no answer. This is the difference between right and wrong, life and death. &&& Barrett: At the end of the day, you made a choice to start this "Serpent's Crusade." &&& Barrett: I want you to open your eyes and see the consequences of that choice. And if you can't, then I can't be a part of it.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. I will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132361
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AE"
msgid "If you think what I did isn't acceptable then you should leave, Barrett."
msgstr "내가 한 일이 용납할 수 없다고 생각한다면, 넌 떠나야 해, 배럿."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AD"
msgid "That's the problem with omnipotent beings. Poor communication skills."
msgstr "전능한 존재들의 문제는 바로 이거야. 형편없는 소통 능력."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: Either way, I hope the new leadership in Dazra is just as level headed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AC"
msgid "Would make things a whole lot clearer if they just stopped by and talked to you."
msgstr "그냥 들러서 너랑 얘기만 해도 일이 훨씬 명확해질 텐데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: I'd really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: But while I love you, that love is not unconditional. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132360
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AB"
msgid "We've been through so much, and are on this journey together."
msgstr "우린 많은 일을 겪었고, 이 여정을 함께 하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Barrett forgives the player for what they did. / Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: I'd really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: But while I love you, that love is not unconditional. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132360
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144AA"
msgid "*sigh* I guess I can believe that we can move beyond this."
msgstr "*한숨* 이 일을 극복할 수 있다고 믿을 수 있을 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Barrett forgives the player for what they did. / Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: I'd really like to believe that...
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: But while I love you, that love is not unconditional. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132360
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A9"
msgid "Look. I think we can move past this. I believe that what you and I share is important and worth working on."
msgstr "봐. 난 우리가 이 일을 극복할 수 있다고 생각해. 너와 내가 나누는 것이 중요하고, 노력할 가치가 있다고 믿어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree. &&& Barrett: Are you kidding me? That's a cop out. |This isn't some political argument with no answer. This is the difference between right and wrong, life and death. &&& Barrett: At the end of the day, you made a choice to start this "Serpent's Crusade." &&& Barrett: I want you to open your eyes and see the consequences of that choice. And if you can't, then I can't be a part of it.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know. I'd like to think anyone can change, but only if they acknowledge there's a problem worth fixing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A8"
msgid "Barrett, are you saying you're mad enough to leave?"
msgstr "배럿, 떠날 만큼 화가 났다는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Frustrated. Reluctantly willing to listen to the player. / Irritated
#. PROMPT: Please hear me out, Barrett. I can explain.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please hear me out, Barrett. I can explain.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A7"
msgid "Okay. I'll listen to what you have to say... but I'm not going to accept excuses."
msgstr "좋아. 네 말을 들어줄게... 하지만 변명은 받아들이지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Barrett: Yeah, yeah, so I hear. The big snake in the sky, rubber stamping tens of thousands of deaths.|Well, this isn't the first time people have committed heinous acts in the name of some divine edict.|And it always turns out be some megalomaniac, doing megalomaniac things. Guess what that makes you.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A6"
msgid "And the fact you did all this without considering how the rest of us would feel..."
msgstr "그리고 네가 우리 기분을 생각하지도 않고 이 모든 일을 저질렀다는 게..."

#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A5"
msgid "Constellation is about exploring the unknown, and keeping your mind and heart open to new discoveries."
msgstr "컨스텔레이션은 미지의 세계를 탐험하고, 새로운 발견에 마음을 여는 곳이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's just agree to disagree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A4"
msgid "Acts of aggression like this goes against who we are as a people."
msgstr "이런 공격적인 행동은 우리 민족성에 어긋나는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Do you think I'm a monster?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think I'm a monster?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: [Second Chance] I didn't realize the consequences of that choice. I'll try to make better decisions from now on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113235B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A3"
msgid "What you did was monstrous. But I'm trying to balance that with everything else you've done, good and bad."
msgstr "네가 한 짓은 끔찍해. 하지만 난 네가 한 모든 일, 좋은 일과 나쁜 일을 균형 있게 보려고 노력 중이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry that the player would decide this isn't important right now. / Angry
#. PROMPT: Let's talk about this later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's talk about this later.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132357
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A2"
msgid "What? You're serious? Fine. You do you."
msgstr "뭐? 진심이야? 그래. 너 하고 싶은 대로 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Let's talk about this later.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: And the fact you did all this without considering how the rest of us would feel...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132357
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_System_AngerSceneSerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0144A1"
msgid "But we're talking this over eventually. You can't just start a war and expect me to let this go."
msgstr "하지만 언젠가 이 일에 대해 이야기해야 해. 전쟁을 일으켜 놓고 내가 이걸 그냥 넘어가길 바랄 수는 없지."

