#. TOPIC: 011322FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014425"
msgid "The real House Va'ruun was descended from Jinan Va'ruun himself. The line has been severed."
msgstr "진정한 바룬 가문은 지난 바룬 자신의 후손이었어. 그 계보는 끊겼지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal will bring much needed order and structure to Dazra. &&& Barrett: Does the structure you're talking about include a barred door and no key?|Because that's what House Veth'aal likes to do. &&& Barrett: But it did surprise me when you told them no one was fit to lead.|I know you're not afraid of making hard decisions, so maybe there was another reason you abstained from making a choice.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Valid. Part of me wants to say, "You did it to yourselves." 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 011322F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014424"
msgid "Honestly, I was just sick of their nonsense."
msgstr "솔직히, 난 그냥 그들의 헛소리가 지겨웠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The real House Va'ruun was descended from Jinan Va'ruun himself. The line has been severed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The real House Va'ruun was descended from Jinan Va'ruun himself. The line has been severed.
