#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 011322F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014423"
msgid "Only if you believe in bloodlines and god-kings. In my opinion, anyone can be a leader."
msgstr "혈통과 신의 왕을 믿는다면 말이지. 내 생각에, 누구나 지도자가 될 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The real House Va'ruun was descended from Jinan Va'ruun himself. The line has been severed.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: Well, either way, I won't waste your brain cells on the what-ifs. The fact is you got rid of the vortex, and saved Dazra.
