#. TOPIC: 011322F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01441F"
msgid "I am afraid of making hard decisions. It's like you don't know me at all."
msgstr "난 어려운 결정을 내리는 게 두려워. 넌 날 전혀 모르는 것 같아."

