#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 011322F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01441E"
msgid "Yeah, and it was unfair how they put the onus on you. Never easy being a tiebreaker."
msgstr "그래, 그리고 그들이 너에게 책임을 떠넘긴 건 불공평했어. 동점 상황을 깨는 건 결코 쉬운 일이 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't put much thought into the choice, to be honest.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01441D"
msgid "Hey, it's on them for not doing their homework on you."
msgstr "이봐, 너에 대해 알아보지 않은 건 그들 잘못이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I didn't put much thought into the choice, to be honest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113236A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01441C"
msgid "They might as well have decided their leadership with a rock-paper-scissors contest."
msgstr "차라리 가위바위보로 지도자를 결정하는 게 나았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Crusade was Anasko's ambition. It was never the Serpent's will. &&& Barrett: That's the problem with omnipotent beings. Poor communication skills.|Would make things a whole lot clearer if they just stopped by and talked to you. &&& Barrett: Either way, I hope the new leadership in Dazra is just as level headed. &&& Barrett: The whims of a cosmic snake aside, House Ka'dic seems like they'd be more open to peace.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Player
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey, it's on them for not doing their homework on you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 0113233F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01441B"
msgid "I didn't put much thought into the choice, to be honest."
msgstr "솔직히 그 선택에 대해 별로 생각하지 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Said like "Thaaat's pretty messed up / Neutral
#. PROMPT: I actually chose House Dul'kehf knowing it was the worst thing for Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually chose House Dul'kehf knowing it was the worst thing for Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132318
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01441A"
msgid "That's pretty messed up, but hey, it's on them for having you make that choice."
msgstr "그건 좀 엉망진창이지만, 뭐, 네가 그 선택을 하게 한 건 그들 잘못이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: I actually chose House Dul'kehf knowing it was the worst thing for Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I actually chose House Ka'dic knowing it was the worst thing for Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132318
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014419"
msgid "But I do know you make a damn persuasive argument."
msgstr "하지만 네가 설득력 있는 주장을 한다는 건 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132303
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014418"
msgid "I hate to punt the ball here, but I'm just a tourist. I don't know enough about Va'ruun culture or politics to form an educated opinion."
msgstr ""
"여기서 공을 넘기기는 싫지만, 난 그저 여행객일 뿐이야. 바룬 문화나 정치에 대해 충분히 알지 못해서 제대로 된 의견을 낼 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132303
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014417"
msgid "And scientifically speaking, I wouldn't want to make a decision like this without a full set of data."
msgstr "그리고 과학적으로 말하자면, 완전한 데이터가 없는 상태에서 이런 결정을 내리고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Gastronomically - as in his gut reaction / Confident
#. PROMPT: What do you think about House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Barrett
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Barrett: House Dul'kehf's attention to detail will serve Dazra well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_COM_Companion_Barrett
#. TOPIC: 01132303
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_COM_Barrett_QuestEvent_MQ06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014416"
msgid "But gastronomically speaking, I am glad you didn't go with House Veth'aal."
msgstr "식도락 측면에서 보자면, 베타알 가문과 함께하지 않은 건 잘한 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A79
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014405"
msgid "Staying here probably isn't the best idea."
msgstr "이곳에 계속 있는 건 좋지 않을 것 같네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014401"
msgid "I'm only going to say this once - leave me alone."
msgstr "딱 이 말만 하지. 날 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo. &&& Tane: Heh, that's what I said when I first met him. But I came around.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FF"
msgid "Silver spoon or not, I can't argue with the right to choose."
msgstr "은수저든 아니든, 자기 삶을 선택할 권리에 대해 왈가왈부할 순 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo. &&& Tane: Heh, that's what I said when I first met him. But I came around.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FE"
msgid "And look at me. I could've rode into the sunset on the Coe legacy and I left it all behind."
msgstr "날 봐. 나는 코의 유산을 얻어 행복한 결말을 맺을 수도 있었지만, 모든 것을 뒤로하고 떠났어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo. &&& Tane: Heh, that's what I said when I first met him. But I came around.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FD"
msgid "It's different when you're born into responsibility. Growing up with expectations, not allowed aspirations of your own..."
msgstr "소임을 다해야 한다는 기대를 받으며 태어나면 다르거든. 기대만 받으며 자라고, 기대감을 품는 건 허용되지 않는다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FC"
msgid "I can easily see how stifling it could be, privilege or not."
msgstr "얼마나 답답할지 쉽게 알 거 같아. 특권이든 아니든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not the life I'd want either. &&& Tane: That's not the life anyone wants.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FB"
msgid "But it is the unfortunate way of House Va'ruun. The collective comes first. The individual second."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 비참한 방식이지. 집단이 우선이거든. 개인은 뒷선이고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Referring to "Nature finds a way. / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not the life I'd want either. &&& Tane: That's not the life anyone wants.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143FA"
msgid "As a part of Nature, people generally don't like to be contained, and we all know how that saying goes."
msgstr "천성상 보통 인간은 참는 걸 좋아하지 않지. 우리 모두 그 속담이 어떻게 적용되는지 잘 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not the life I'd want either. &&& Tane: That's not the life anyone wants.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F9"
msgid "Yeah, count me out. Pretty sure I'd be a broken man had I did what I was told."
msgstr "그래, 난 빼줘. 내가 시키는 대로 했다면 아마 엉망이 됐을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not the life I'd want either. &&& Tane: That's not the life anyone wants.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F8"
msgid "Sure there are responsibilities I'd rather not have, but at least I chose to be in this position."
msgstr "물론 맡고 싶지 않았던 소임도 있지만, 적어도 나는 이 자리를 선택했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E674
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1010_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F6"
msgid "House Ma'leen are many things, but rarely liars. I hope we have not made the situation worse."
msgstr "마린 가문은 다채로운 면이 있지만, 거짓말은 거의 안 해. 상황을 악화시킨 게 아니어야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E674
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1010_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F5"
msgid "I am not sure that was the right move."
msgstr "그게 옳은 선택인지 잘 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E674
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1010_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F4"
msgid "I hope that Phantom really was bluffing."
msgstr "그 유령이 진짜로 허세 부린 거면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E674
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1010_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F3"
msgid "You sure that was necessary?"
msgstr "정말 필요한 일이었을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E674
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1010_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F2"
msgid "I hope pulling that extra interlock was the right thing to do."
msgstr "제어장치를 더 뽑아낸 게 옳은 선택이었으면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1500_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F1"
msgid "So the Phantoms spoke true. We have done enough here. We should go."
msgstr "그 유령 말이 사실이었네. 여기선 할 만큼 했어. 이만 가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1500_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143F0"
msgid "You made a decision. We will all have to live with the consequences"
msgstr "넌 결정을 내렸어. 우리 모두는 그 결과를 감당하며 살아야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1500_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143EF"
msgid "I guess they really were telling the truth. Tough way to find out."
msgstr "그놈들 말이 사실이었던 모양이야. 아주 어렵게도 확인했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1500_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143EE"
msgid "Sometimes you make the right call, and sometimes... Well, we'd better get back."
msgstr "가끔은 옳은 결정을 내릴 때도 있고, 가끔은... 음, 이제 돌아가는 게 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0112E673
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1500_CompanionReaction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143ED"
msgid "I don't think there's anything else we can do here. We'd better get back to Dazra."
msgstr "여기서 우리가 더 할 일은 없을 것 같아. 다즈라로 돌아가는 게 좋겠어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life. &&& Inaza: Hmm. An unusual, but welcome, response.|Then let us enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path. &&& Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BCB11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143B3"
msgid "Of course. We shall see each other afterwards."
msgstr "당연한 거야. 나중에 다시 만나자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here! &&& Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need! &&& Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143B2"
msgid "What horror is this?"
msgstr "이 호러스런 광경은 대체 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: hesitant, concerned that the player is trying to pull a fast one / Confused / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve." &&& Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is no joke.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143B1"
msgid "I heard nothing... He said that?"
msgstr "난 못 들었는데... 그렇게 말했다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC193
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143B0"
msgid "Please, we are not a threat. We are trying to help."
msgstr "제발요. 우린 위험 인물이 아니에요. 도와주려는 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143AE"
msgid "I have some choice words for anyone supporting a connection between House Va'ruun and the Zealots."
msgstr "바룬 가문과 광신도 사이의 연결고리를 지원하는 사람에게는 특별히 해 주고 싶은 말이 있는데 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: through gritted teeth - you would love to say more but can't because it might blow your cover / Stern / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143AD"
msgid "That sounds like an incredibly foolish plan."
msgstr "엄청나게 바보 같은 계획처럼 들리는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143AC"
msgid "An extreme sacrifice for the sake of your House."
msgstr "가문을 위한 희생 치고는 너무 극단적이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143AB"
msgid "I suggest we tread carefully. The Zealots are shunned for a reason."
msgstr "조심스럽게 나아가는 게 좋아. 다들 그만한 이유가 있어서 광신도들을 멀리하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stone-faced - you're annoyed by all this but can't show it / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& FarudHajtal: And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient.|If not for your help, our precious heirlooms could have been taken off-world and never seen again.|But that shame is not your burden to bear, so I'll speak no more of it. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I... &&& FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E8F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0143AA"
msgid "Honor and service would seem to matter a great deal here."
msgstr "여기 사람들에겐 명예와 봉사가 엄청 중요한가 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0112676D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014397"
msgid "The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on."
msgstr "뱀의 성전은 위험을 감수하기엔 너무나 중요하지. 과업은 수행되어야 하느니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: After everything I've done, you're just to cast me aside and let me die?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: After everything I've done, you're just to cast me aside and let me die?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01124C21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014396"
msgid "My child, you are not being cast aside. I could not have made it this far without you. Your time has just come to its inevitable end."
msgstr ""
"내 아이야. 널 내팽개치는 게 아니다. 네가 없었다면 여기까지 오지도 못했을 것이야. 네가 피할 수 없는 종말을 맞게 되었을 뿐이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: After everything I've done, you're just to cast me aside and let me die?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01124C21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014395"
msgid "From the moment I commissioned this project, I knew we might suffer losses. I will carry that burden with me, I assure you."
msgstr "이 계획에 착수했던 순간부터 손해를 입게 될 것은 알고 있었느니라. 그 짐은 온전히 내가 짊어질 것이야. 내 장담하마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can't you just shut down the gate?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014394"
msgid "When the Zealots have been purged, we will learn from this experience and we will try again. Eventually I will be granted an audience with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "광신도가 제거되고 나면, 우리는 이 경험으로부터 배워 다시금 시도할 것이야. 결국에는 위대한 뱀과의 알현을 허락받게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112676C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014393"
msgid "It would be unwise to ignore the Herald's counsel."
msgstr "전령님의 충고를 무시하는 건 현명하지 않은 짓이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112676C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014392"
msgid "This sounds like it is worth at least investigating."
msgstr "적어도 조사해볼 가치는 있을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112676C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014391"
msgid "I've followed a few visions in my time. Mixed results, if I'm being honest. But this one could be legit."
msgstr "나도 환영을 몇 번 따라 해 봤어. 솔직히 말하자면, 결과는 엇갈렸지. 그래도 이건 진짜일지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112676C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014390"
msgid "Are we sure about this? Sounds like a bit of a gamble"
msgstr "이거 확실한 거 맞아? 나한텐 좀 도박처럼 들리는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112676C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01438F"
msgid "I'm not quite sure this is where we should be focusing our energy, given everything else that's going on. But I'm hardly the expert."
msgstr "지금 상황을 봤을 때 우리 에너지를 이런 데다 집중하는 게 맞는지 잘 모르겠어. 그래도 내가 전문가는 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I wish only to serve!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Show me the way forward! Show me how I may serve!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02
#. TOPIC: 01127760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01438D"
msgid "I have devoted my life to your service, Great Serpent! I beg you, hear me!"
msgstr "제 평생을 바쳐 섬겼나이다, 위대한 뱀이시여! 간청드리오니 들어 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I have devoted my life to your service, Great Serpent! I beg you, hear me!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02
#. TOPIC: 01127761
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01438C"
msgid "I wish only to serve!"
msgstr "섬기길 원할 뿐이나이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I have devoted my life to your service, Great Serpent! I beg you, hear me!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I beg of you, show me anything!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02
#. TOPIC: 0112775F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko02_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01438B"
msgid "Show me the way forward! Show me how I may serve!"
msgstr "나아갈 길을 보여 주소서! 섬길 방법을 보여 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Great Serpent, why cannot I not leave this place?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01
#. TOPIC: 0112775E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014389"
msgid "No, not again!"
msgstr "안 돼! 또 이렇다니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: No, not again!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: More than a few steps, and I am lost in darkness! Please, release me from this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01
#. TOPIC: 0112775D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014388"
msgid "Great Serpent, why cannot I not leave this place?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 제가 어찌 이곳을 떠날 수 없나이까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, why cannot I not leave this place?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01
#. TOPIC: 0112775C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014387"
msgid "More than a few steps, and I am lost in darkness! Please, release me from this!"
msgstr "몇 걸음만 걸으면 어둠 속에서 길을 잃나이다! 부디 저를 풀어 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: There must be some end to this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko03
#. TOPIC: 0112775B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko03_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014385"
msgid "How long must I wander..."
msgstr "얼마나 더 헤매야 하는가..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: anguished / Pleading
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: How long must I wander...
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko03
#. TOPIC: 0112775A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Anasko03_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014384"
msgid "There must be some end to this!"
msgstr "분명 이곳에도 끝이 있을 터!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us! &&& Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My child, you are not being cast aside. I could not have made it this far without you. Your time has just come to its inevitable end.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01124C22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01437B"
msgid "After everything I've done, you're just to cast me aside and let me die?"
msgstr "지금까지 그렇게 많은 일을 해 줬는데, 날 그냥 내팽개치고 죽게 내버려둔단 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us! &&& Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01124C20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01437A"
msgid "[Submit] I understand. All Must Serve."
msgstr "[복종] 알겠습니다. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014379"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko is waiting for us in the Scaled Citadel. I was able to speak with him. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Well, it would seem I owe you an apology, sister.  &&& Inaza: There is no need, brother. Your skepticism only strengthens us. &&& Ekris: As you say. But to the matter at hand. Did Anasko mention anything that could aid us in his extraction?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, the pinnacle of the Citadel was modified to house the equipment to create a gate to the Vortex.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112417B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014378"
msgid "He said the gate is still open."
msgstr "차원문이 아직 열려 있다고 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He said the gate is still open.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He said the gate is still open.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112417A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014377"
msgid "Yes, the pinnacle of the Citadel was modified to house the equipment to create a gate to the Vortex."
msgstr "그래. 성채 첨탑을 개조해서 장비를 설치하고 볼텍스로 통하는 차원문을 만들어냈었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He said the gate is still open.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0112417A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014376"
msgid "If it still runs, that would explain everything we have experienced since the initial incident."
msgstr "그게 아직도 작동 중이라면, 사고 발생 이후로 우리가 겪었던 모든 일들이 설명돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on will, you're convincing yourself more than anything / Concentrating
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: But time is short, and the bridge collapses. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014375"
msgid "There is still reason to hope. The Great Serpent will see us through."
msgstr "아직 희망이 남아있구나. 위대한 뱀께서 우리를 굽어살피실 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014374"
msgid "The Gate is still open, the experiment still runs."
msgstr "차원문이 여전히 열려 있고, 실험도 여전히 진행 중이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I do not serve the Great Serpent. I am the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014373"
msgid "But to see you here, perhaps the Great Serpent works through you. That, in this dark moment, would be enough."
msgstr "하지만 네가 여기 있는 걸 보니, 위대한 뱀께서 널 통해 행하시는 모양이구나. 이 암울한 순간에는 그걸로 족하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: We risk losing everything to the Zealots. So the Gate must cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex and back one last time, to purge them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01123989
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014371"
msgid "I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time."
msgstr "지금 이 순간에 너와 만나 기쁘구나. 허나 시간이 얼마 남지 않았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Despite your attempts to meddle, you have nonetheless served your part in the Serpent's Plan.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You, and those bothersome Zealots trapped inside, will be cast into the void forever, and I will carry on the Crusade myself!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01123988
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014370"
msgid "Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex."
msgstr ""
"네놈이건 광신도건, 이제 우리의 업적을 방해하지 못할 거다. 차원문이 다시 한번 순환하면 이 성채를 볼텍스 내부로 이동시킬 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But since all that, we've shared a lot, haven't we? More than anything, I've shared that I care about all of you. Want the best for you.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So, let's get to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C595
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01436C"
msgid "I suppose I should stop pretending you're not all here for a specific reason. You've heard something that's been going around. Want to know if I really said it."
msgstr ""
"당신이 여기 괜히 온게 아니라는 건 나도 알고 있어. 뭔가 소문이 도는 건 알았겠지. 내가 정말 그런 말을 했는지 알고 싶을 테고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: laughing self-consciously at your behavior during a medical episode. / Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You've been so good to me. Doctor Phillips said it was just disorientation after a grav jump, but I've heard some of the other patients here talking.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Thank you for taking care of me through this. It was all just so much, so fast. It's nice to be able to talk like this, though, isn't it?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01436B"
msgid "And, well... I think we can agree it was a bit more than that! I just need some rest."
msgstr "아, 물론... 단순한 어지럼증은 아니었다는 건 인정할게! 그래도 좀 쉬면 나아질거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: loud whisper, talking to someone on the side / Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We made a jump, and one of the passengers is... I don't even know. This guy has been like this for hours.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJVPassenger
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Which guy is it? No, what's his name?... Jinan? The one from Astrogation Club?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C583
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01436A"
msgid "I don't even know... After the grav jump... sounds like he's losing his fucking mind."
msgstr "나도 몰라... 중력 도약 이후부터는... 머리라도 돈 것처럼 지껄이더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: loud whisper, talking to someone on the side / Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I don't even know... After the grav jump... sounds like he's losing his fucking mind.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJVPassenger
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ahhhhhhh! Ah ha ha ha ha!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C582
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "014369"
msgid "Which guy is it? No, what's his name?... Jinan? The one from Astrogation Club?"
msgstr "누군데 그래? 이름이 뭐라 그랬지?... 지난? 그 우주 탐사 클럽에 있던?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: maniacal, out of breath / Awed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha! Ahhh ha ha ha ha! Yes! Yes! I see! My eyes are open! 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We made a jump, and one of the passengers is... I don't even know. This guy has been like this for hours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C585
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014368"
msgid "All of it! Eternity, everything, all of everything! I see! I see... Ahhhhh!"
msgstr "전부 다! 영원, 전부, 모든 것들이! 보인다! 보여! 으아아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: loud whisper / Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All of it! Eternity, everything, all of everything! I see! I see... Ahhhhh!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJVPassenger
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I don't even know... After the grav jump... sounds like he's losing his fucking mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C584
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014367"
msgid "We made a jump, and one of the passengers is... I don't even know. This guy has been like this for hours."
msgstr "도약을 한 이후부터 승객 하나가... 뭔지도 모르겠다. 몇 시간째 저러고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: maniacal, out of breath / Awed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): ...I got it, I got it! Shhh! Yes, it's recording... keep it hidden!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All of it! Eternity, everything, all of everything! I see! I see... Ahhhhh!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C586
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014366"
msgid "Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha! Ahhh ha ha ha ha! Yes! Yes! I see! My eyes are open!"
msgstr "하하하하하하하! 아하하하하! 그래! 그래! 보인다! 보여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: loud whisper / Irritated
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJVPassenger
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha! Ahhh ha ha ha ha! Yes! Yes! I see! My eyes are open! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C587
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014365"
msgid "...I got it, I got it! Shhh! Yes, it's recording... keep it hidden!"
msgstr "...알았어, 알았다고! 쉿! 그래, 녹음 되고 있어... 잘 숨겨!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F248
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_MinerIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014364"
msgid "Sometimes its pretty peaceful out here... at night."
msgstr "가끔은 평화로울 때도 있지... 밤에 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Inaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014360"
msgid "Well, the Great Serpent is full of surprises. He has sent you, of all people."
msgstr "음, 위대한 뱀께서는 놀라움으로 충만하시구나. 그 많은 이들 중에서 그대를 보내시다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Inaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01435F"
msgid "How remarkable."
msgstr "정말 놀랍구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Inaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01435E"
msgid "Welcome to Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라에 온 것을 환영한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that. &&& ...  &&& Inaza: To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course. &&& Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak. &&& Djimal: I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01435D"
msgid "Explain the meaning of this at once."
msgstr "빨리 무슨 뜻인지 설명해 보시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: All Must Serve. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I do not understand. To what do you refer? &&& Inaza: To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course. &&& Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Explain the meaning of this at once.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01435C"
msgid "I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this?"
msgstr "이해가 안 되는데요. 성전은 오래 전 일이에요. 그게 이번 일과 무슨 관련이 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that. &&& ...  &&& Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak. &&& Djimal: I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this? &&& Lovek: Explain the meaning of this at once.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Truly, that was the Speaker's wish? Well then our path is clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01435B"
msgid "Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "아나스코는 위대한 뱀에게서 뱀의 성전을 다시 시작하라는 지시를 받았다고 믿었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that. &&& ...  &&& Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak. &&& Djimal: I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this? &&& Lovek: Explain the meaning of this at once.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: After all this time... And we knew nothing of this? The Council was never consulted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01435A"
msgid "Part of the experiment was to send Phantoms out into the Settled Systems. An opening salvo in the Crusade."
msgstr "실험 중에 일부는 유령들을 개척 성계로 내보내는 내용이었어요. 성전의 시작을 알리는 신호탄인 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that. &&& ...  &&& Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak. &&& Djimal: I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this? &&& Lovek: Explain the meaning of this at once.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Perhaps he was not, but... he did say it? The Speaker of House Va'ruun said the Crusade should begin again?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014359"
msgid "It was delusional. Anasko wasn't in his right mind."
msgstr "그냥 망상이에요. 아나스코는 제정신이 아니었다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was delusional. Anasko wasn't in his right mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was delusional. Anasko wasn't in his right mind.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: The Speaker's word is final. It always has been.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014358"
msgid "Perhaps he was not, but... he did say it? The Speaker of House Va'ruun said the Crusade should begin again?"
msgstr "그랬을지도 모르지만... 그렇게 말씀하셨다고요? 바룬 가문의 대변자가 성전을 다시 시작해야 한다고 했단 말이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Part of the experiment was to send Phantoms out into the Settled Systems. An opening salvo in the Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Part of the experiment was to send Phantoms out into the Settled Systems. An opening salvo in the Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: To be fair, it has never been necessary for the Speaker to consult the Council. It is his decision to make.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014357"
msgid "After all this time... And we knew nothing of this? The Council was never consulted."
msgstr "지금까지... 저희가 전혀 몰랐다는 겁니까? 대의회에서는 한 번도 상의한 적이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014356"
msgid "Truly, that was the Speaker's wish? Well then our path is clear."
msgstr "진정 그게 대변자님의 뜻이었단 말이오? 그럼 우리 길은 분명하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. PROMPT: It was delusional. Anasko wasn't in his right mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was delusional. Anasko wasn't in his right mind. &&& Djimal: Perhaps he was not, but... he did say it? The Speaker of House Va'ruun said the Crusade should begin again?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014355"
msgid "The Speaker's word is final. It always has been."
msgstr "대변자님의 말은 절대적이오. 언제나 그래왔지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Lovek
#. PROMPT: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Lovek: Truly, that was the Speaker's wish? Well then our path is clear.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014354"
msgid "Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover..."
msgstr "정중히 말씀드리지만, 전 반대입니다. 지금 당장은 그런 일을 할 만한 상황이 아니에요. 재건하고 회복할 시간이 필요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Ugh. I should have expected as much.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Both of my colleagues have made valid points. The matter is complicated.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014353"
msgid "And what does House Ka'dic say?"
msgstr "카딕 가문은 뭐라고 할 거요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Truly, that was the Speaker's wish? Well then our path is clear. &&& Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover...
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I can assure you all that he did indeed believe in it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014352"
msgid "There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer."
msgstr "더 논의할 것 없소. 대변자님께서 성전을 부르시면, 우리는 응답하는 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Lovek: Truly, that was the Speaker's wish? Well then our path is clear. &&& Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Then House Veth'aal agrees. The Crusade begins.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014351"
msgid "I can assure you all that he did indeed believe in it."
msgstr "제가 장담할 수 있는 건, 그분은 그렇게 믿었다는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& Inaza: I can assure you all that he did indeed believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: What does House Dul'kehf say?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014350"
msgid "Then House Veth'aal agrees. The Crusade begins."
msgstr "그렇다면 베타알 가문은 찬성이오. 성전의 시작이로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Then House Veth'aal agrees. The Crusade begins.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I... I have no wish to defy the Speaker, but he is no longer here. The Va'ruun people need time. House Dul'kehf declines.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434F"
msgid "What does House Dul'kehf say?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 어찌 하시겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& ...  &&& Inaza: I can assure you all that he did indeed believe in it. &&& Lovek: Then House Veth'aal agrees. The Crusade begins. &&& Lovek: What does House Dul'kehf say?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Ugh. I should have expected as much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434E"
msgid "I... I have no wish to defy the Speaker, but he is no longer here. The Va'ruun people need time. House Dul'kehf declines."
msgstr "전... 대변자님을 거역하고 싶지는 않지만, 그분은 이제 없으십니다. 바룬 신민들은 시간이 필요해요. 둘케프 가문은 반대입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: What does House Dul'kehf say? &&& Malibor: I... I have no wish to defy the Speaker, but he is no longer here. The Va'ruun people need time. House Dul'kehf declines.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: And what does House Ka'dic say?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434D"
msgid "Ugh. I should have expected as much."
msgstr "으. 당연히 그리 말할 줄 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: Part of the experiment was to send Phantoms out into the Settled Systems. An opening salvo in the Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Part of the experiment was to send Phantoms out into the Settled Systems. An opening salvo in the Crusade. &&& Malibor: After all this time... And we knew nothing of this? The Council was never consulted.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434C"
msgid "To be fair, it has never been necessary for the Speaker to consult the Council. It is his decision to make."
msgstr "공정하게 말하자면, 대변자님이 대의회와 상의할 필요는 없었어요. 그분이 결정하실 일이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko believed the Great Serpent was instructing him to restart the Serpent's Crusade. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I... I have no wish to defy the Speaker, but he is no longer here. The Va'ruun people need time. House Dul'kehf declines. &&& Lovek: Ugh. I should have expected as much. &&& Lovek: And what does House Ka'dic say?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434B"
msgid "Both of my colleagues have made valid points. The matter is complicated."
msgstr "두 의원님들 모두 타당한 지적을 하셨네요. 복잡한 문제예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01434A"
msgid "Then we have a decision."
msgstr "그럼 정해진 거군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Both of my colleagues have made valid points. The matter is complicated.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: So, one vote for, one against.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014349"
msgid "I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains."
msgstr "아무래도 일단 카딕 가문은... 기권해야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: So, one vote for, one against.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014348"
msgid "And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?"
msgstr ""
"당신 생각은 어떻소? 우리가 바룬 가문을 위해 칼을 들고 싸워야겠소? 아니면 여기 계속 쭈그리고 앉아서 우리 처지나 비관해야겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& ...  &&& Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains. &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014347"
msgid "Consider what you are about to say very carefully."
msgstr "지금 네 대답 굉장히 신중히 해야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& ...  &&& Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains. &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014346"
msgid "As a participant in the overall human experiment, I'm just going to interject for a moment to say that I'm not really a fan of where this is going."
msgstr "나름 별에 별 일 다 겪어본 사람으로서 슬쩍 끼어들자면, 지금 이거 돌아가는 꼴 별로 내키지 않는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& ...  &&& Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains. &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014345"
msgid "I hate to butt in, but... This isn't even a question, right? You can't possibly seriously consider this."
msgstr "끼어들기는 싫은데... 이걸 지금 질문이라고 하는 거야? 진지하게 생각할 필요도 없는 거잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Respectfully, I disagree. We are in no position to undertake something like that right now. We need time to rebuild, recover... &&& ...  &&& Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains. &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014344"
msgid "Oh you cannot be seriously considering this. After everything the Settled Systems have been through?"
msgstr "세상에, 이걸 진지하게 생각하는 건 아니지? 개척 성계가 그동안 어떤 일을 겪어 왔는지 알잖아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then we have a decision.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014343"
msgid "Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "그렇게 해요. 뱀의 성전을 시작하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: And what does House Ka'dic say? &&& Djimal: Both of my colleagues have made valid points. The matter is complicated. &&& Djimal: I believe that for the moment, House Ka'dic... abstains.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014342"
msgid "So, one vote for, one against."
msgstr "그럼, 찬성 하나에 반대 하나로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014341"
msgid "Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade."
msgstr "지금 세상은 평화롭고, 앞으로도 평화로워야 해요. 난 성전을 반대하겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do we have to make this decision right now?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014340"
msgid "So be it."
msgstr "그럼 좋소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, of course. Such an immense decision can only benefit from discussion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433F"
msgid "Can we discuss this more first?"
msgstr "일단 좀 더 의논해볼 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can we discuss this more first?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we discuss this more first?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What does starting the Crusade even mean?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433E"
msgid "Yes, of course. Such an immense decision can only benefit from discussion."
msgstr "그럼, 물론이오. 이렇게 중대한 사항일수록 논의를 거치는 것이 좋지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does starting the Crusade even mean?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What does starting the Crusade even mean?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433D"
msgid "There is no question that we will have to start with limited engagements."
msgstr "물론 처음에는 제한된 방식만 가지고 교전할 수밖에 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does starting the Crusade even mean?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433C"
msgid "For now, we strike where we can. Make it deadly to travel among the stars."
msgstr "당장은 가능한 곳부터 타격하고, 행성 간 이동을 극도로 위험하게 만들 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does starting the Crusade even mean?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433B"
msgid "We put fear back into the Settled Systems, where it belongs."
msgstr "우리는 개척 성계를 다시 공포로 몰아넣을 것이오. 응당 그래야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Okay, that's enough.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Okay, that's enough.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01433A"
msgid "Then do we begin the Crusade?"
msgstr "그러면 성전을 시작하는 거요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do we have to make this decision right now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do we have to make this decision right now?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014339"
msgid "You know how these things go. If we do not decide now, word will get out. It always does. Then we will have to deal with even more disarray."
msgstr "어떻게 될지 알잖소. 지금 결정하지 않으면 소문이 퍼질 거요. 항상 그러니까. 그렇게 되면 우리는 더 큰 혼란을 겪어야 하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do we have to make this decision right now?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014338"
msgid "It is best that we control the narrative immediately."
msgstr "앞으로 퍼질 소문을 지금 통제하는 게 최선이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014337"
msgid "Malibor, why are you against the idea?"
msgstr "말리보어. 반대하는 이유가 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do it. Start the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Lovek: Then we have a decision.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then do we begin the Crusade?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014336"
msgid "Okay, that's enough."
msgstr "좋아요. 그거면 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014335"
msgid "Djimal, why are you abstaining?"
msgstr "지말. 왜 기권한 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade. &&& Lovek: So be it.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You know how these things go. If we do not decide now, word will get out. It always does. Then we will have to deal with even more disarray.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014334"
msgid "Do we have to make this decision right now?"
msgstr "지금 당장 결정을 내려야 하나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Malibor, why are you against the idea?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor, why are you against the idea? &&& Lovek: 
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F69D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014333"
msgid "We have only just survived the most terrible period in the last few decades. We need at least a moment to breathe, to feel some sense of relief."
msgstr "저희는 지난 몇십 년 동안 가장 끔찍했던 시기를 이제서야 겨우 벗어났습니다. 안정을 느끼고 숨을 돌릴 시간이 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Malibor, why are you against the idea?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F69D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014332"
msgid "And we are hardly in a position to begin any sort of major military operation, both in terms of provisions and strategic positioning."
msgstr "그리고 저희 공급 사정이나 전략적인 상황을 보면, 대규모 군사 작전을 수행하기에는 역부족입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Malibor, why are you against the idea?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F69D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014331"
msgid "But, if it is the will of the Council, of course House Dul'kehf will commit fully."
msgstr "하지만 이것이 대의회의 뜻이라면, 둘케프 가문은 기꺼이 따를 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Lovek, you're sure this is the right thing to do?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Lovek, you're sure this is the right thing to do?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014330"
msgid "I am. Jinan Va'ruun himself began the original Serpent's Crusade, and it is long past time that we return to it. We cannot share this universe with heretics."
msgstr ""
"확신하오. 지난 바룬께서 뱀의 성전을 시작하셨으니, 오랜 세월이 흘러 우리가 성전을 되살리는 거요. 이 우주에서 이단자와 공존할 순 없소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are no innocent people. If you are not Promised, then you will be cast into shadow. Jinan Va'ruun was very clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432F"
msgid "Won't innocent people be hurt or killed?"
msgstr "무고한 사람들이 다치거나 희생되지 않을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Won't innocent people be hurt or killed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Won't innocent people be hurt or killed?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432E"
msgid "There are no innocent people. If you are not Promised, then you will be cast into shadow. Jinan Va'ruun was very clear."
msgstr "무고한 사람이란 없소. 약속받은 자가 아니라면 그림자에 내던져질 운명이지. 지난 바룬께서는 그 점을 분명히 하셨소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we discuss this more first? &&& Lovek: Yes, of course. Such an immense decision can only benefit from discussion.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is no question that we will have to start with limited engagements.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432D"
msgid "What does starting the Crusade even mean?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 시작하는 게 무슨 의미가 있다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: There is nothing more to discuss. If the Speaker calls for Crusade, then we answer. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: So, one vote for, one against. &&& Lovek: And what about you? Should we take up the sword and fight for House Va'ruun, or continue to cower here and pity ourselves? &&& companion: Consider what you are about to say very carefully.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am. Jinan Va'ruun himself began the original Serpent's Crusade, and it is long past time that we return to it. We cannot share this universe with heretics.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432C"
msgid "Lovek, you're sure this is the right thing to do?"
msgstr "로벡. 정말 이게 올바른 결정이라고 확신하나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Okay, that's enough. &&& Lovek: Then do we begin the Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: And with all of this out of the way, we will take our leave. You have been through a great deal, and deserve a chance to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F693
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432B"
msgid "Very well. We will notify the Elders of the Houses as well as our new Speaker, and begin preparations as soon as possible."
msgstr "좋습니다. 가문 장로님들과 저희 새 대변자님께 알리겠습니다. 최대한 빨리 준비에 착수하도록 하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Then so it shall be. &&& Malibor: House Va'ruun moves forward from this crisis, and continues to serve the Great Serpent. &&& Djimal: All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I do not understand. To what do you refer?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F235
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01432A"
msgid "Before you adjourn... Is there not one matter more to address?"
msgstr "회의 끝내기 전에... 논의할 문제가 하나 더 있지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Veth'aal should lead.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F231
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014329"
msgid "You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that."
msgstr "그러게요. 머리를 부딪혔나 봐요. 아까 한 말은 잊어버려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: And with all of this out of the way, we will take our leave. You have been through a great deal, and deserve a chance to rest.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Know that House Va'ruun is eternally grateful for all that you have done, and that the Great Serpent will one day grant you a place by His side.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F691
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014328"
msgid "The home, of course, is yours. You deserve a place among us after everything."
msgstr "이 집도 당연히 그대의 것입니다. 모든 일을 겪으셨으니 저희와 함께 하실 자격이 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Very well. We will notify the Elders of the Houses as well as our new Speaker, and begin preparations as soon as possible.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: The home, of course, is yours. You deserve a place among us after everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F692
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014327"
msgid "And with all of this out of the way, we will take our leave. You have been through a great deal, and deserve a chance to rest."
msgstr "그리고 모든 일이 해결된다면, 저희는 휴식을 가질 겁니다. 그대는 정말 많은 수고를 거쳐주셨습니다. 이제 쉴 때도 됐죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: The home, of course, is yours. You deserve a place among us after everything.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F690
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014326"
msgid "Know that House Va'ruun is eternally grateful for all that you have done, and that the Great Serpent will one day grant you a place by His side."
msgstr ""
"바룬 가문이 그대의 업적에 영원히 감사할 것이라는 것을, 그리고 위대한 뱀께서 곁에 그대를 위한 자리를 마련해 둘 것을 잊지 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Djimal, why are you abstaining?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Djimal, why are you abstaining? &&& Lovek: 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F697
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014325"
msgid "It seems the prudent choice at the moment."
msgstr "지금 당장은 그게 신중한 선택 같으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Djimal, why are you abstaining?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F697
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014324"
msgid "House Ka'dic will, of course, accept the judgement of the Council no matter the decision."
msgstr "물론 카딕 가문은 대의회에서 어떤 결정을 내리더라도 그 판단에 따를 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Djimal, why are you abstaining?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Okay, that's enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F697
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014323"
msgid "But to be candid, I do not wish to be the deciding vote in such a monumental decision."
msgstr "솔직히 말하자면, 이런 중대한 결정을 내리는 자리에서 결정적인 표를 던지고 싶지는 않거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: House Va'ruun moves forward from this crisis, and continues to serve the Great Serpent. &&& Djimal: All Must Serve. &&& Inaza: Before you adjourn... Is there not one matter more to address?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F234
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014322"
msgid "I do not understand. To what do you refer?"
msgstr "잘 모르겠군요. 무엇에 관한 말씀이신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's got a point. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: And what assurance do I have that the two of you are not just looking to usurp power for yourselves? &&& Djimal: Then we let the Vindicator decide. &&& Djimal: And we have a Herald here as witness.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Surely you cannot mean this. House Va'ruun's survival is paramount.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F233
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014321"
msgid "I don't think any of you are fit to lead. I think House Va'ruun is dead, and should remain so."
msgstr "지도자를 맡을 가문은 없는 것 같네요. 바룬 가문은 이제 죽었고, 앞으로도 그렇게 남아야 한다고 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think any of you are fit to lead. I think House Va'ruun is dead, and should remain so.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think any of you are fit to lead. I think House Va'ruun is dead, and should remain so.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014320"
msgid "Surely you cannot mean this. House Va'ruun's survival is paramount."
msgstr "진심은 아니시겠지요. 바룬 가문의 생존이 최우선이란 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think any of you are fit to lead. I think House Va'ruun is dead, and should remain so.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431F"
msgid "To say such a thing is heresy. You would brand yourself a traitor."
msgstr "이단자나 할 법한 말이군요. 스스로를 반역자로 규정하는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think any of you are fit to lead. I think House Va'ruun is dead, and should remain so.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Then so it shall be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431E"
msgid "This is a result of your escape, yes? You... hit your head. You do not mean what you just said."
msgstr "탈출하다가 이렇게 된 거겠지요? 그... 머리를 다치셨군요. 그 말이 진심일 리가 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431D"
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr "네, 물론입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: House Veth'aal should lead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431C"
msgid "So, what is your actual reply?"
msgstr "자, 진정한 대답은 무엇입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I choose House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then... Then decisions about our future no longer concern you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431B"
msgid "I'm serious. I've had it with all of you."
msgstr "진심입니다. 당신네랑은 할 만큼 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm serious. I've had it with all of you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm serious. I've had it with all of you.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01431A"
msgid "Then... Then decisions about our future no longer concern you."
msgstr "그렇다면... 우리의 미래는 이제 그대의 관심사 밖이로군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm serious. I've had it with all of you.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014319"
msgid "Out of respect for all you have done for us, you will be allowed to leave the city."
msgstr "우리에게 해준 모든 것에 대한 존중의 의미에서, 그대에게 도시를 떠날 기회를 주겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm serious. I've had it with all of you.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014318"
msgid "But after that... You are an enemy of House Va'ruun, and will be killed on sight."
msgstr "하지만 그 후엔... 당신은 바룬 가문의 적이고, 발견 시 즉시 사살될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm serious. I've had it with all of you.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Then so it shall be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014317"
msgid "Go, then. Go back to the worthless Settled Systems and share their fate when the Shrouding comes. For it will come."
msgstr "그렇다면 가시오. 그 보잘것없는 계척 성계로 돌아가 장막의 날에 닥칠 놈들의 운명을 전파하시오. 그리고 그날이 멀지 않았음을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Before you adjourn... Is there not one matter more to address? &&& Malibor: I do not understand. To what do you refer?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: The Harbinger knows of what I speak.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014316"
msgid "To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course."
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 대한 문제 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I don't understand. The Crusade was ages ago. What does that have to do with any of this?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F22C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014315"
msgid "The Harbinger knows of what I speak."
msgstr "선구자는 무슨 말인지 알 거예요."

