msgid "The Reverent knows of what I speak."
msgstr "숭배자는 무슨 말인지 알 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: To the matter of the Serpent's Crusade, of course.
