msgid "The Adherent knows of what I speak."
msgstr "지지자는 무슨 말인지 알 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Well, the Ministry at large is responsible for making sure everyone has what they need.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430F"
msgid "What is it that you do here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is it that you do here?
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: That means both internal and external trade, here on Va'ruun'kai and also out among the stars, with... select parties.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430E"
msgid "Well, the Ministry at large is responsible for making sure everyone has what they need."
msgstr "우리 부처의 역할은 사람들 모두에게 필요한 것을 공급하는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Well, the Ministry at large is responsible for making sure everyone has what they need.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Personally, I'm coordinating trade and delivery with locations outside the city. What's left of the city, I mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430D"
msgid "That means both internal and external trade, here on Va'ruun'kai and also out among the stars, with... select parties."
msgstr "도시 내의 교역과 도시 외의 교역 둘 다 말이야. 여기 바룬카이랑 그리고... 소수의 특정 행성을 대상으로 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: That means both internal and external trade, here on Va'ruun'kai and also out among the stars, with... select parties.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430C"
msgid "Personally, I'm coordinating trade and delivery with locations outside the city. What's left of the city, I mean."
msgstr "그 부처 소속으로, 나는 도시 바깥으로의 교역과 유통을 조정하고 있지. 뭐, 이젠 도시라 할 것도 없지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Just look around!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_EkrisKaisir_TL_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430B"
msgid "How have things been affected by the disaster?"
msgstr "재난이 어떤 영향을 미쳤죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I am sure you have at least some idea of how much we have physically lost. A huge portion of the city is just... gone.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I hope that eventually we can return things to the way they were, but we must be realistic. That will take time, and I suspect a great deal of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_EkrisKaisir_TL_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01430A"
msgid "And those left behind are struggling. Supplies are limited, there is so much work to be done, and we are all just so tired."
msgstr "생존자들은 힘에 겨워하지. 물자는 부족하고, 해야 할 일은 많고, 게다가 우린 모두 지쳤어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Just look around!
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: And those left behind are struggling. Supplies are limited, there is so much work to be done, and we are all just so tired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_EkrisKaisir_TL_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014309"
msgid "I am sure you have at least some idea of how much we have physically lost. A huge portion of the city is just... gone."
msgstr "둘러보면 적어도 물리적인 손실이 얼마나 큰지 감이 잡히겠지. 도시의 대부분이 그냥... 사라졌으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How have things been affected by the disaster?
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I am sure you have at least some idea of how much we have physically lost. A huge portion of the city is just... gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_EkrisKaisir_TL_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014308"
msgid "Just look around!"
msgstr "그냥 주변을 봐봐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: And those left behind are struggling. Supplies are limited, there is so much work to be done, and we are all just so tired.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111E9AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_EkrisKaisir_TL_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014307"
msgid "I hope that eventually we can return things to the way they were, but we must be realistic. That will take time, and I suspect a great deal of it."
msgstr "언젠가 모든 것을 원래대로 돌이켜 놓을 수 있길 바라지만, 현실적으로 생각해야지. 오랜 시간이 걸릴 거야. 정말 오랜 시간이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_MaliborBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014306"
msgid "After everything, you betray us like this?"
msgstr "그 모든 걸 겪고도, 우릴 헌신짝 버리듯 배신합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_MaliborBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014305"
msgid "You have been given an opportunity to leave. I suggest you take it."
msgstr "떠날 기회를 드렸습니다. 그 기회를 잡는 걸 추천드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_MaliborBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014304"
msgid "You have made your position clear. Just go."
msgstr "당신 입장은 충분히 들었습니다. 떠나세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_MaliborBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014303"
msgid "I genuinely believed in you."
msgstr "진심으로 그대를 믿었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_LovekBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014302"
msgid "I knew you would be a disappointment."
msgstr "네놈에게 실망하게 될 줄 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_LovekBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014301"
msgid "Leave. And never come back."
msgstr "가라. 다시는 돌아오지 마라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_LovekBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014300"
msgid "I hope the Serpent has a special kind of hell set aside for you."
msgstr "지옥에 뱀께서 너를 위해 마련한 특별 구역이 있길 바라지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_LovekBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FF"
msgid "Of course you betrayed us. Why did we expect anything different?"
msgstr "네놈의 배신은 불 보듯 뻔하지! 왜 아닐 거라고 부정했을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_DjimalBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FE"
msgid "You should just leave."
msgstr "그냥 여기서 나가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_DjimalBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FD"
msgid "I thought we could trust you."
msgstr "당신을 신뢰할 수 있을 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_DjimalBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FC"
msgid "I no longer have anything to say to you."
msgstr "이제 너랑 할 얘기 따윈 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_DjimalBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FB"
msgid "Go, before someone changes their mind and the shooting starts."
msgstr "가시지. 누가 마음 접고 널 쏴버리기 전에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_InazaBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142FA"
msgid "Only the Serpent can judge you."
msgstr "오직 위대한 뱀께서만 널 심판할 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_InazaBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142F9"
msgid "You can turn your back on the Great Serpent, but it will not spare you in the Shrouding."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 등을 돌리는 건 네 자유지만, 장막의 날에 그분께서 널 살려두지 않을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_InazaBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142F8"
msgid "You have saved, so I will pray for you. But I fear for your soul."
msgstr "우릴 구해 줬으니 널 위해 기도하겠지만, 네 영혼이 걱정이구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_InazaBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0142F7"
msgid "Take advantage of the mercy shown, and leave while you can."
msgstr "자비를 보여준 것을 감사히 여기고, 떠날 수 있을 때 떠나거라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LijanaDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0142F6"
msgid "Uhh, hello?"
msgstr "음, 저기요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LijanaDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0142F5"
msgid "Should we continue this some other time?"
msgstr "이건 나중에 해결할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LijanaDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0142F4"
msgid "I know we have all been through a lot, but..."
msgstr "우리 모두 많은 일을 겪었지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142F3"
msgid "The requests for aid and supplies never cease."
msgstr "지원 요청과 물자 요청이 참 끝도 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142F2"
msgid "It has been quite a challenge to keep all of the records in order."
msgstr "모든 기록을 제대로 정리해 두긴 했는데 정말 쉽지 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142F1"
msgid "Great Serpent guide you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142F0"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142EF"
msgid "It is still hard to believe we will never see the Citadel again."
msgstr "성채를 다시 보지 못할 거라니, 믿기 힘드네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142EE"
msgid "The disaster may be behind us now, but we face a whole new type of change."
msgstr "한 차례 재난이 지나갔지만, 이제 새로운 변화가 닥쳐올 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142ED"
msgid "I understand House Dul'kehf was able to contribute to the project here in Dazra. I am glad."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 우리 다즈라의 프로젝트를 계속 지원하게 되었단 걸 확인했어요. 다행이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142EC"
msgid "We have done our best to allocate the necessary supplies for the device being built."
msgstr "현재 건설 중인 장치에 필요한 물자 투입을 위해 최선을 다했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142EB"
msgid "I do hope this thing being built will not have any harmful side effects."
msgstr "지금 짓고 있는 이 장치가 혹시 위험한 부작용은 있지 않았으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142EA"
msgid "Life under House Ka'dic will be... interesting."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 통치하의 삶이라... 흥미롭네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142E9"
msgid "Hopefully House Ka'dic will not change too many policies. At least, not the ones that impact our work here."
msgstr "부다 카딕 가문이 기존 정책을 너무 바꾸지 않았으면 좋겠어요. 특히 저희 일과 관련된 쪽은 더더욱."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142E8"
msgid "As long as House Veth'aal understands the importance of our work here, I am fine with them taking over."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 우리 임무의 중요성을 안다면, 베타알이 여길 담당하는 것도 나쁘지 않겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142E7"
msgid "The needs of the Crusade will put an all-new pressure on our work here."
msgstr "성전에 필요한 준비를 하려면 여기 업무가 크게 부담을 받을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Hello_LijanaDulkehf
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142E6"
msgid "The Crusade requires that we re-prioritize a great many things. But we will do what we must."
msgstr "뱀의 성전은 기존의 관념을 바꿔야 이룩할 수 있죠. 그치만 필요한 것이라면 뭐든지 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111DB6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E5"
msgid "Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have."
msgstr "생각해 봐야겠다면 그렇게 하세요. 하지만 당신도 사람들을 아낀다면, 저와 같은 결론을 내리게 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111DB6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E4"
msgid "And when you do, just know that we can't afford any loose ends. No witnesses."
msgstr "그리고 실행할 땐 우리가 더 이상의 손실을 감당 못 한다는 걸 알아둬요. 목격자는 없어야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111DB6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E3"
msgid "As far as everyone else is concerned, the hostages were dead when you arrived and you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name."
msgstr "다들 걱정했던 대로 당신이 도착했을 땐 이미 인질들이 죽어 있었고, 당신은 카딕 가문의 이름으로 복수를 했다고 하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't do this anymore. Let's cut straight to business. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I've worked hard to obtain my position with the Zealots. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB62D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E2"
msgid "Oh, I see. Trying to get on my good side."
msgstr "아, 알겠다. 나한테 잘 보이려고 했던 거구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I should purge you where you stand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103749A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E1"
msgid "Last chance to walk away, Mihael."
msgstr "곱게 떠날 마지막 기회야. 미해일."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142E0"
msgid "As I already made clear..."
msgstr "내가 분명히 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player re-entering scene. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DF"
msgid "I believe Sahima was speaking."
msgstr "사히마가 말하던 중이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Of course. I'm fascinated to learn how you reconcile your religion and science.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DE"
msgid "She would like to see you when we're done here."
msgstr "일이 마무리되면 그대를 만나고 싶어하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035922
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DD"
msgid "Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe."
msgstr "제발, 사히마가 무사한지만 말해 줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DC"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "누구신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is reentering the scene. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The other hostages are being kept just beyond this room.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DB"
msgid "Where were we? Right."
msgstr "어디까지 했었죠? 아, 맞다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142DA"
msgid "To reiterate..."
msgstr "다시 말하지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D9"
msgid "So, Mihael, will you turn a blind eye to the Great Serpent's plan?"
msgstr "그래, 미해일. 위대한 뱀의 계획에 눈을 감을 셈이야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D8"
msgid "So, what will it be, Mihael?"
msgstr "자, 어떻게 할 거지, 미해일?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Perhaps you'd trust the word of a House Va'ruun soldier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D7"
msgid "Will you throw away your life and the lives of everyone at Epsilon over your pride?"
msgstr "자존심 때문에 네 목숨과 엡실론에 있는 사람들 목숨 전부를 내다 버릴 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D6"
msgid "Go head. Introduce yourself."
msgstr "어서. 자기 소개라도 해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: The location you're looking for is Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033766
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D5"
msgid "Once again..."
msgstr "다시 말하지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033746
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D4"
msgid "Like I said..."
msgstr "전에도 말했지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the scene. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D3"
msgid "Like I was saying..."
msgstr "제가 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the scene. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D2"
msgid "Remember..."
msgstr "명심하세요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D1"
msgid "So, do I have your cooperation?"
msgstr "자, 협조해줄 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142D0"
msgid "Will you make the sacrifice so House Ka'dic cuts ties with the Zealots for good?"
msgstr "희생을 해서라도 카딕 가문이 광신도와 관계를 완전히 끊도록 해 줄 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033746
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142CF"
msgid "Like I said..."
msgstr "전에도 말했지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142CE"
msgid "As I was saying..."
msgstr "전에도 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142CD"
msgid "To reiterate..."
msgstr "다시 말하지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142CC"
msgid "As I was saying..."
msgstr "전에도 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142CB"
msgid "As I was saying..."
msgstr "전에도 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_Mila_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0142CA"
msgid "Thank you for not letting my journal be the end of us all."
msgstr "제 일기 때문에 우리 모두 끝장나지 않게 해주셔서 감사해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: You are not welcome here. You will leave immediately. &&& Karija: This is your only warning.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How confident you are. So much more so than any who came before.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111D836
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C9"
msgid "You can skip the bravado. I'm here for a Vortex Interlock, and I'm going to get it. You won't stop me."
msgstr "허세 부릴 필요 없어. 난 볼텍스 제어장치 때문에 온 거고, 반드시 가져갈 거야. 넌 날 막지 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can skip the bravado. I'm here for a Vortex Interlock, and I'm going to get it. You won't stop me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can skip the bravado. I'm here for a Vortex Interlock, and I'm going to get it. You won't stop me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: Jinan Va'ruun himself charged us with the protection of this facility. It was his last order, and it will be carried out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111D835
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C8"
msgid "How confident you are. So much more so than any who came before."
msgstr "자신감이 넘치는구나. 전에 왔던 누구보다도 훨씬 더 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just stay away from me from now on. &&& Orahim: Hmmph, if that is how you wish things to be. |Now, you can go. I will stay here and medidate for a time. Thank you for your help. |I hope that, perhaps one day, we can be friends. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will not hold this against you. You made a wise decision in the end.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F76A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C7"
msgid "Forget it. Just get away from me."
msgstr "됐어. 나한테서 물러나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Forget it. Just get away from me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forget it. Just get away from me.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F769
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C6"
msgid "I will not hold this against you. You made a wise decision in the end."
msgstr "원망하지 않겠다. 결국 올바른 선택을 내린 것이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Forget it. Just get away from me.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F769
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C5"
msgid "I am not asking you to be my friend. If you never want to speak with me in Dazra, so be it. I am still thankful for your help."
msgstr ""
"난 네게 내 친구가 되어 달라고 부탁하는 게 아니다. 다즈라에서 나와 이야기하고 싶지 않다면, 그렇게 하도록. 난 여전히 네가 도와준 "
"것에 감사하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good luck, Orahim. &&& Orahim: Thank you. Really, thank you for everything. |Go on now. I will stay here for a time to think and meditate. |Hopefully I will see you in Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. I will not hold this against you. I am glad you made a wise decision. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C4"
msgid "I changed my mind."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I changed my mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I changed my mind.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C3"
msgid "Good. I will not hold this against you. I am glad you made a wise decision."
msgstr "좋아. 널 원망하지 않겠다. 결국 올바른 선택을 내린 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I changed my mind.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C2"
msgid "Now go. I will stay here and meditate for a while. I thank you for your help."
msgstr "이제 가도록 하라. 난 여기 남아 명상을 해야겠으니. 도와줘서 고맙다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C1"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask some questions about Khaslav. &&& Orahim: All right.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Many Zealots, all willing to die in order to protect Khaslav. We must both be prepared for a great amount of bloodshed. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F765
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142C0"
msgid "What should I be expecting in Khaslav's hideout?"
msgstr "카슬라프의 은신처에는 어떤 위험이 도사리고 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: cold, annoyed / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0142BF"
msgid "Hmmph."
msgstr "흠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask some questions about Khaslav. &&& Orahim: All right.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He never did. When I approached him about my... newfound crisis of conscience, he kept me under constant surveillance. One night, when the others were asleep, I fought my guards and barely escaped. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F75D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142BE"
msgid "Why did he let you leave?"
msgstr "카슬라프는 왜 네가 떠나게 놔뒀지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask some questions about Khaslav. &&& Orahim: All right.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Undoubtedly. Khaslav is prideful, and leaving the crew is the greatest dishonor anyone has ever dared to commit against him. He killed many of our crew for much lower offenses. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F761
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142BD"
msgid "Do you really think Khaslav will hunt you down if we don't strike first?"
msgstr "정말 먼저 선제공격을 하지 않으면 카슬라프가 널 잡으러 올 거라고 생각하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you really think Khaslav will hunt you down if we don't strike first?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you really think Khaslav will hunt you down if we don't strike first?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142BC"
msgid "Undoubtedly. Khaslav is prideful, and leaving the crew is the greatest dishonor anyone has ever dared to commit against him. He killed many of our crew for much lower offenses."
msgstr ""
"분명 그럴걸. 카슬라브는 자존심이 강하고, 깡패짓 그만두고 떠나는 걸 자기에게 망신 주려는 거라고 여기지. 녀석은 훨씬 하찮은 죄목으로도 "
"부하들을 수없이 죽였다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you really think Khaslav will hunt you down if we don't strike first?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142BB"
msgid "As much as his Zealots respect him, they also fear him -- but what would they have to fear if it was acceptable to leave him?"
msgstr ""
"광신도들은 카슬라프를 존경하지만, 그만큼 두려워하기도 하지. 깡패짓을 그만두고 떠나는 걸 순순히 놔둔다면, 부하들이 카슬라프를 "
"두려워하겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you really think Khaslav will hunt you down if we don't strike first?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Let's talk about something else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142BA"
msgid "It is only a matter of time until Khaslav comes and makes an example out of me."
msgstr "카슬라프가 본보기로 나를 처치하려고 오는 건 이제 시간문제일 뿐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay. Let's!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142B9"
msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "다른 얘기를 하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask some questions about Khaslav. &&& Orahim: All right.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is a small but important distinction between Khaslav and other Zealots. A Zealot, brutal as he may be, kills in the name of the Serpent's Crusade. They kill those they deem not worthy of the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F763
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142B8"
msgid "What makes Khaslav different from other Zealots?"
msgstr "카슬라프는 다른 광신도와 뭐가 다르지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why did he let you leave?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why did he let you leave?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Let's talk about something else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F75C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142B7"
msgid "He never did. When I approached him about my... newfound crisis of conscience, he kept me under constant surveillance. One night, when the others were asleep, I fought my guards and barely escaped."
msgstr ""
"놔두지 않았어. 카슬라프에게 양심이 찔려서 괴롭다고 했더니... 부하들에게 계속 나를 감시하라고 시키더군. 어느 날 밤, 다른 부하들이 "
"잠들어 있을 때, 감시병들과 싸우고 간신히 탈출했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142B6"
msgid "You have not changed at all. Death is all you know, only now it seems everyone is a target. When did you become so pathetic? We used to idolize you, now you are just so... boring!"
msgstr ""
"전혀 변하지 않았군. 네가 아는 거라곤 살육뿐이지. 이젠 아예 인간이면 모두 표적으로 보이나 보군. 언제부터 그렇게 비참해졌냐? 우리는 "
"너를 추앙했는데, 이젠 아주... 지루해 빠졌군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0142B5"
msgid "In this way, we are redeemed."
msgstr "이 방식으로 우리는 구원받는 것이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Carry out our charge to Prepare the Way! Bring to the unworthy our Serpent's Crusade!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C56C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142B4"
msgid "Bring to them... their woe!"
msgstr "저들에게... 고통을 입힐 것이니라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Go forth, those whose blood is venom! Whose voice, the hiss of reason!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Bring to them... their woe!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C56D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142B3"
msgid "Carry out our charge to Prepare the Way! Bring to the unworthy our Serpent's Crusade!"
msgstr "길을 닦기 위한 우리의 과업을 수행하라! 우리의 뱀의 성전군은 합당치 못한 자들을 몰아낼지니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And if the United Colonies, the Freestar Collective, the "free peoples" of the galaxy will not accept His love...  let them be crushed in His embrace!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Carry out our charge to Prepare the Way! Bring to the unworthy our Serpent's Crusade!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C56E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142B2"
msgid "Go forth, those whose blood is venom! Whose voice, the hiss of reason!"
msgstr "돌격하라, 피가 독인 자들이여! 목소리가 이성의 뱀의 음성인 자들이여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We spread His Word that the Settled Systems may know its place when comes the Shrouding!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Go forth, those whose blood is venom! Whose voice, the hiss of reason!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C56F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142B1"
msgid "And if the United Colonies, the Freestar Collective, the \"free peoples\" of the galaxy will not accept His love...  let them be crushed in His embrace!"
msgstr ""
"그리고 만약 식민지 연합, 자유항성 공동체라는 소위 은하계의 '자유민'들이 뱀의 사랑을 받아들이지 않는다면... 그분의 포옹으로 "
"산산조각이 날 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We are House Va'ruun, the Promised, the holy anointed of the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And if the United Colonies, the Freestar Collective, the "free peoples" of the galaxy will not accept His love...  let them be crushed in His embrace!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C570
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142B0"
msgid "We spread His Word that the Settled Systems may know its place when comes the Shrouding!"
msgstr "장막의 날이 올 때 자신들의 위치를 깨닫도록 그분의 말씀을 개척 성계 전역으로 전파할지니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Never!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We spread His Word that the Settled Systems may know its place when comes the Shrouding!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C571
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AF"
msgid "We are House Va'ruun, the Promised, the holy anointed of the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "우리는 바룬 가문, 약속받은 자들, 위대한 뱀의 성유를 부음 받은 자들이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Is that our fate? To suffer the insults and disdain of unbelievers?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We are House Va'ruun, the Promised, the holy anointed of the Great Serpent!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AE"
msgid "Never!"
msgstr "절대 아니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Too long have we preached His understanding, and received nothing but derision in return!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Never!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C573
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AD"
msgid "Is that our fate? To suffer the insults and disdain of unbelievers?"
msgstr "그게 우리의 운명인가? 불신자들의 모욕과 멸시를 받는 것이?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Too long have we spread His truth, only to have it fall on deaf ears.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Is that our fate? To suffer the insults and disdain of unbelievers?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C574
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AC"
msgid "Too long have we preached His understanding, and received nothing but derision in return!"
msgstr "참으로 오랫동안 우린 그분의 이해를 전파해 왔으나, 우린 그 대가로 조롱만 받아 왔다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The time has come!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Too long have we preached His understanding, and received nothing but derision in return!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C575
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AB"
msgid "Too long have we spread His truth, only to have it fall on deaf ears."
msgstr "너무나 오랫동안 그분의 진리를 전파해 왔지만, 그저 소 귀에 경 읽기였을 뿐이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My children! House Va'ruun!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Too long have we spread His truth, only to have it fall on deaf ears.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C576
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142AA"
msgid "The time has come!"
msgstr "드디어 때가 되었노라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a massive crowd / Confident
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The time has come!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C577
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_08
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A9"
msgid "My children! House Va'ruun!"
msgstr "나의 아이들이여! 바룬 가문이여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You have been given your place, and will there remain for all eternity, through the Shrouding and beyond.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C578
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A8"
msgid "So I have spoken, and so it will be."
msgstr "내가 말하였으니, 그대로 이루어지리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): May your light and power grow, in service to the one Great House, House Va'ruun, and in turn the Great Serpent Himself!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So I have spoken, and so it will be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C579
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A7"
msgid "You have been given your place, and will there remain for all eternity, through the Shrouding and beyond."
msgstr "그대들은 각자의 위치를 부여받았으며, 그 자리를 끝까지 지킬 것이니라. 장막의 날과 그 이후에도 앞으로 영원히."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But families you shall be no longer! For today I formally recognize the formation of the four Noble Houses! HOUSE Veth'aal! HOUSE Dul'kehf! HOUSE Ka'dic! HOUSE Ma'leen!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You have been given your place, and will there remain for all eternity, through the Shrouding and beyond.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A6"
msgid "May your light and power grow, in service to the one Great House, House Va'ruun, and in turn the Great Serpent Himself!"
msgstr ""
"그대들의 빛과 힘이 나날이 커져가기를 바란다. 유일하며 위대한 가문인 바룬 가문을 위하여, 나아가서 위대한 뱀이신... 그분을 위하여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And so today, I recognize the families that have supported me, championed me... challenged me. Veth'aal. Dul'kehf. Ka'dic. Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): May your light and power grow, in service to the one Great House, House Va'ruun, and in turn the Great Serpent Himself!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A5"
msgid "But families you shall be no longer! For today I formally recognize the formation of the four Noble Houses! HOUSE Veth'aal! HOUSE Dul'kehf! HOUSE Ka'dic! HOUSE Ma'leen!"
msgstr ""
"하지만 이제부터 그대들은 단순한 가족이 아니다! 오늘 나는 공식적으로 네 개의 명문 가문이 형성되었음을 선포하겠다! 베타알 가문! 둘케프 "
"가문! 카딕 가문! 마린 가문!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You have distinguished yourselves. Risen in power. In prominence. In... faith.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But families you shall be no longer! For today I formally recognize the formation of the four Noble Houses! HOUSE Veth'aal! HOUSE Dul'kehf! HOUSE Ka'dic! HOUSE Ma'leen!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A4"
msgid "And so today, I recognize the families that have supported me, championed me... challenged me. Veth'aal. Dul'kehf. Ka'dic. Ma'leen."
msgstr "그래서 오늘, 나는 나를 지지하고, 옹호하고... 도전했던 가문들을 인정한다. 베타알. 둘케프. 카딕. 마린."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And yet, there are some amongst us - some amongst YOU - who have proven to be... if not more worthy, then certainly more willing to assess their own worth. Their own value to the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And so today, I recognize the families that have supported me, championed me... challenged me. Veth'aal. Dul'kehf. Ka'dic. Ma'leen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A3"
msgid "You have distinguished yourselves. Risen in power. In prominence. In... faith."
msgstr "그대들은 스스로를 증명했다. 힘을 키워 일어났으며, 명성을 드높였다. 신앙심으로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Sit with me, all, and be one. For are we not all His chosen? Are we not all House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You have distinguished yourselves. Risen in power. In prominence. In... faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A2"
msgid "And yet, there are some amongst us - some amongst YOU - who have proven to be... if not more worthy, then certainly more willing to assess their own worth. Their own value to the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"하지만 우리 중에는, 그대들 중에는... 더 가치가 있진 않더라도, 남들보다 자신들을 더 드높이려는 자들이 있다. 위대한 뱀에 대한 "
"자신의 가치를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a large, formal gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And yet, there are some amongst us - some amongst YOU - who have proven to be... if not more worthy, then certainly more willing to assess their own worth. Their own value to the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C57F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A1"
msgid "Sit with me, all, and be one. For are we not all His chosen? Are we not all House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "모두 나와 함께 앉아 하나가 되자. 우리 모두 그분의 선택받은 자들이 아닌가? 우리 모두 바룬 가문이 아닌가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Now you all know me. You know I wouldn't lie to you. Not about anything, and certainly not about this.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0142A0"
msgid "So if you've listened this long, I hope you'll listen a bit longer. Because just like me, the Great Serpent cares about each and every one of you."
msgstr "여기까지 들었다면 조금 더 내 말을 들어주길 바란다. 나와 마찬가지로 위대한 뱀께서도 그대들 한 명 한 명을 아끼시기 때문이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak.  / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): He is a celestial entity... a being... as old as the cosmos itself. He is everywhere and everyone. The Great Serpent is inside each and every one of us right now.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So if you've listened this long, I hope you'll listen a bit longer. Because just like me, the Great Serpent cares about each and every one of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C590
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429F"
msgid "Now you all know me. You know I wouldn't lie to you. Not about anything, and certainly not about this."
msgstr ""
"이제 그대들 모두가 나를 잘 알 것이다. 내가 그대들에게 거짓말을 하지 않는다는 것을 알 것이다. 어떤 것이든, 특히 이것에 관해서는."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. gearing up for your big reveal / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Great Serpent is as real, as tangible, as any of us in this room right now. I know. I saw Him. Spoke with Him.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Now you all know me. You know I wouldn't lie to you. Not about anything, and certainly not about this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C591
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429E"
msgid "He is a celestial entity... a being... as old as the cosmos itself. He is everywhere and everyone. The Great Serpent is inside each and every one of us right now."
msgstr ""
"그분은 천상의 존재이시다... 우주 자체만큼 오래된 존재이시다. 그분은 어디에나 계시고 모든 이에게 계신다. 위대한 뱀은 지금 우리 각자 "
"안에 계신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. gearing up for your big reveal / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Great Serpent is real. He is not a figment of my imagination. He is not a paranoid delusion. He is not a lie or some kind of con job.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): He is a celestial entity... a being... as old as the cosmos itself. He is everywhere and everyone. The Great Serpent is inside each and every one of us right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C592
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429D"
msgid "The Great Serpent is as real, as tangible, as any of us in this room right now. I know. I saw Him. Spoke with Him."
msgstr "위대한 뱀은 지금 이 방에 있는 우리 중 누구만큼이나 실재하고, 만질 수 있다. 나는 안다. 그분을 보았으며, 그분과 대화했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. gearing up for your big reveal / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So, let's get to it.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Great Serpent is as real, as tangible, as any of us in this room right now. I know. I saw Him. Spoke with Him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C593
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429C"
msgid "The Great Serpent is real. He is not a figment of my imagination. He is not a paranoid delusion. He is not a lie or some kind of con job."
msgstr "위대한 뱀은 실재하신다. 그분은 내 상상의 산물이 아니다. 그분은 편집증적 망상이 아니다. 그분은 거짓말이나 사기 같은 것이 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. gearing up for your big reveal / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I suppose I should stop pretending you're not all here for a specific reason. You've heard something that's been going around. Want to know if I really said it.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Great Serpent is real. He is not a figment of my imagination. He is not a paranoid delusion. He is not a lie or some kind of con job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C594
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429B"
msgid "So, let's get to it."
msgstr "자, 이제 본론으로 들어가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We've come to know each other well over these last weeks. Before... Well, you all know what happened. Before that, I was quiet on the ship, I know. Kept to myself. Didn't get to know any of you like I should have.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I suppose I should stop pretending you're not all here for a specific reason. You've heard something that's been going around. Want to know if I really said it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C596
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01429A"
msgid "But since all that, we've shared a lot, haven't we? More than anything, I've shared that I care about all of you. Want the best for you."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그 모든 일이 있은 후, 우리는 많은 것을 공유했지, 그렇지 않나? 무엇보다도, 나는 그대들을 전부 아끼고 있다는 것을 공유했다. "
"최선을 바란다는 것을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll tell you, it still surprises me that there are so many interested in what I have to say. But I do appreciate it. I appreciate all of you.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But since all that, we've shared a lot, haven't we? More than anything, I've shared that I care about all of you. Want the best for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C597
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014299"
msgid "We've come to know each other well over these last weeks. Before... Well, you all know what happened. Before that, I was quiet on the ship, I know. Kept to myself. Didn't get to know any of you like I should have."
msgstr ""
"우리는 지난 몇 주 동안 서로를 잘 알게 되었다. 그 전에는... 음, 무슨 일이 있었는지 모두 알고 있을 것이다. 그 전에는 내가 "
"배에서 조용히 지냈다는 것을 안다. 혼자 지냈다. 그대들을 제대로 알지 못했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, look at you all here, crammed into this cave. I know, it's hardly what any of us imagined when we first set out those months ago, but here we are.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We've come to know each other well over these last weeks. Before... Well, you all know what happened. Before that, I was quiet on the ship, I know. Kept to myself. Didn't get to know any of you like I should have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C598
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014298"
msgid "I'll tell you, it still surprises me that there are so many interested in what I have to say. But I do appreciate it. I appreciate all of you."
msgstr ""
"그래, 내가 할 말에 이렇게 많은 이들이 관심을 가져 준다는 게 여전히 놀랍다. 하지만 정말 고맙다. 그대들 모두에게 감사한 마음이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: addressing a gathering of people who've come to hear you speak. / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Is it recording? All right, thank you.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll tell you, it still surprises me that there are so many interested in what I have to say. But I do appreciate it. I appreciate all of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C599
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014297"
msgid "Well, look at you all here, crammed into this cave. I know, it's hardly what any of us imagined when we first set out those months ago, but here we are."
msgstr ""
"자, 여기 이 동굴에 빽빽이 모여 있는 여러분을 보라. 몇 달 전 처음 출발했을 때 우리 중 누구도 상상하지 못했던 모습이지만, 결국 "
"이렇게 되었군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: aside / Friendly
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, look at you all here, crammed into this cave. I know, it's hardly what any of us imagined when we first set out those months ago, but here we are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C59A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_06
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014296"
msgid "Is it recording? All right, thank you."
msgstr "녹음 중인가? 좋아, 고맙다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's Sylvie, yes? I thought I overheard that earlier. Well Sylvie, I sincerely appreciate all you've done for me.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C588
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014295"
msgid "I can see how hard you all work here in the med bay, and I know you must be tired. Why don't you tell me something about your day, get my mind off all this?"
msgstr ""
"나는 당신들이 여기 메디베이에서 얼마나 열심히 일하는지 알고 있고, 분명히 피곤할 것이다. 오늘 하루 어땠는지 말해 주겠나? 이 모든 "
"것에서 잠시 마음을 돌릴 수 있도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Thank you for taking care of me through this. It was all just so much, so fast. It's nice to be able to talk like this, though, isn't it?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I can see how hard you all work here in the med bay, and I know you must be tired. Why don't you tell me something about your day, get my mind off all this?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C589
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014294"
msgid "It's Sylvie, yes? I thought I overheard that earlier. Well Sylvie, I sincerely appreciate all you've done for me."
msgstr "실비, 맞나? 아까 내가 그렇게 들은 것 같군. 실비, 나를 위해 해 준 모든 일에 진심으로 고맙다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: laughing self-consciously at your behavior during a medical episode. / Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And, well... I think we can agree it was a bit more than that! I just need some rest.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's Sylvie, yes? I thought I overheard that earlier. Well Sylvie, I sincerely appreciate all you've done for me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014293"
msgid "Thank you for taking care of me through this. It was all just so much, so fast. It's nice to be able to talk like this, though, isn't it?"
msgstr "이 일을 겪는 동안 나를 돌봐줘서 고맙다. 모든 게 너무 많았고, 너무 빨랐다. 하지만 이렇게 이야기할 수 있어서 좋다, 그렇지 않나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Or rather, that's what you all have told me. I confess I don't remember much. My sense of time is... off.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And, well... I think we can agree it was a bit more than that! I just need some rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014292"
msgid "You've been so good to me. Doctor Phillips said it was just disorientation after a grav jump, but I've heard some of the other patients here talking."
msgstr ""
"그대들은 나를 참 잘 대해 줬다. 필립스 박사는 중력 도약 후 방향 감각이 상실한 것뿐이라고 하셨지만, 여기 있는 다른 환자들이 "
"이야기하는 것을 들었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Again, I am just so sorry about all of that. It's... It's been quite a couple of days.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You've been so good to me. Doctor Phillips said it was just disorientation after a grav jump, but I've heard some of the other patients here talking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014291"
msgid "Or rather, that's what you all have told me. I confess I don't remember much. My sense of time is... off."
msgstr "아니, 그건 그대들이 내게 말해 준 것들이다. 고백하건대 나는 잘 기억나지 않는다. 내 시간 감각이... 이상하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Or rather, that's what you all have told me. I confess I don't remember much. My sense of time is... off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C58E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014290"
msgid "Again, I am just so sorry about all of that. It's... It's been quite a couple of days."
msgstr "다시 한번, 그 모든 일에 대해 정말 죄송하다. 그게... 정말 며칠 동안 엄청난 일이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: talking to someone on the side / Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ahhhhhhh! Ah ha ha ha ha!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJVPassenger
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C580
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01428F"
msgid "What? No, no, I'm not... I'm not recording! It's not on! See?! Okay fine!"
msgstr "뭐? 아니, 아니, 나는... 나는 녹음하고 있지 않아! 켜져 있지 않아! 보이지?! 알았어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: maniacal, out of breath / Awed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Which guy is it? No, what's his name?... Jinan? The one from Astrogation Club?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What? No, no, I'm not... I'm not recording! It's not on! See?! Okay fine!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C581
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01428E"
msgid "Ahhhhhhh! Ah ha ha ha ha!"
msgstr "아! 아 하 하 하 하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speaking to the groats. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 0111F71F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC13_MilaIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "01428D"
msgid "You're looking mighty fine today, groats."
msgstr "오늘 정말 좋아 보이네, 그로트들아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speaking to the groats. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 0111F71F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC13_MilaIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "01428C"
msgid "I hope everyone's eating well."
msgstr "다들 잘 먹어야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 0111F71F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC13_MilaIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "01428B"
msgid "How are we doing today, everyone?"
msgstr "다들 오늘 하루는 어떻게 보내니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speaking to the groats. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 0111F71F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC13_MilaIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "01428A"
msgid "Anyone need anything? No? That's what I like to hear."
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거 있니? 없다고? 그 소릴 듣고 싶었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speaking to the groats. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 0111F71F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC13_MilaIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "014289"
msgid "I wish all I had to do was eat and sleep."
msgstr "나도 먹고 자기만 하면 좋을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZenPostMQ04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014288"
msgid "Not here for any trouble I hope."
msgstr "문제는 일으키지 말아 줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaPostMQ04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014287"
msgid "I thought I had ruined our lives. Thank you"
msgstr "제가 우리 인생을 망친 줄 알았어요. 고마워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just saw the player kill his groat, Boris. / Shocked / to Boris
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111EA54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_BorisDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014286"
msgid "Boris!"
msgstr "보리스!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just witnessed the player kill his groat, Bella. / Shocked / to Bella
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111EA53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_BellaDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014285"
msgid "Bella, no!"
msgstr "벨라! 안돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed one or both of his groats. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_GroatsDead_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014284"
msgid "What type of cruel person are you?"
msgstr "뭐 이런 잔인한 놈이 다 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed one or both of his groats. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_GroatsDead_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014283"
msgid "You're not welcome here."
msgstr "여긴 네가 올 곳이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society. / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Mirek_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014282"
msgid "Leave this place."
msgstr "여기서 나가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed one or both of his groats. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_GroatsDead_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014281"
msgid "Groats are innocent creatures."
msgstr "그로트는 무고한 동물이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed one or both of his groats. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_GroatsDead_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014280"
msgid "Your actions will not be forgotten."
msgstr "네가 한 짓은 절대 잊지 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01427F"
msgid "I've already lost Boris... I hope Bella remains safe"
msgstr "이미 보리스를 잃었어... 벨라는 무사해야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01427E"
msgid "I've already lost Bella... I hope Boris remains safe"
msgstr "이미 벨라를 잃었어... 보리스는 무사해야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01427D"
msgid "I recently lost both my groats. Perhaps I'm not cut out for farming after all."
msgstr "최근에 그로트 둘을 다 잃었어. 난 농부 일에는 소질이 없었나 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Indeed. But there is another path.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: At its terminus was a gate; a path into the realm where our Speaker resides.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111D803
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01427C"
msgid "In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall."
msgstr "두 번째 미래에서는, 그대가 형체 없는 벽을 넘어 동굴에 들어가 아나스코 님과 접촉하는 모습을 보았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you point me to the cave, I can find him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you point me to the cave, I can find him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Step through it, find Anasko, and complete the vision. Only then will his voice be heard. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D6FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01427B"
msgid "Then you must embark to the Seer's Rift, at the northern edge of the crater. You will find an entrance there, one that has no form."
msgstr "그렇다면 구덩이 북쪽 가장자리에 있는 선견자의 균열로 향해야 한다. 그곳에서 형체가 없는 입구를 찾을 수 있을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, stoic. A penitent citizen making a pilgrimage for redemption. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014279"
msgid "I hope the Great Serpent finds me worthy of redemption."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 내게 구원을 내려주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, stoic. A penitent citizen making a pilgrimage for redemption. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014278"
msgid "This journey has renewed my faith."
msgstr "이 여정으로 내 신앙심이 다시 새로워졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, stoic. A penitent citizen making a pilgrimage for redemption. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014277"
msgid "I needed this walk to clear my mind."
msgstr "머리를 식히려면 이 산책이 필요했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Whispering a prayer to yourself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014276"
msgid "Great Serpent, grant your mercy to this lost soul."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 이 길 잃은 영혼에게 자비를 베푸소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Whispering a prayer to yourself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014275"
msgid "As I walk the Serpent's Path, my heart is filled with humility."
msgstr "뱀의 길을 걸으니, 내 마음이 겸허함으로 가득 차는구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Whispering a prayer to yourself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014274"
msgid "The unrepentant will be punished. Only those who seek salvation will be worthy."
msgstr "회개하지 않는 자들은 벌을 받으리라. 오직 구원을 갈구하는 자만이 가치 있으리."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A penitent citizen making a religious pilgrimage
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014273"
msgid "Forgive me, but I prefer silence."
msgstr "미안하지만, 난 조용한 게 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A penitent citizen making a religious pilgrimage
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014272"
msgid "Great Serpent protect you, friend."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 자네를 지켜주시길, 친구."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014271"
msgid "Be careful out here."
msgstr "여기선 조심하는 게 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014270"
msgid "You'll be safer in the city."
msgstr "도시에 있는 게 더 안전할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426F"
msgid "Please do not interfere."
msgstr "방해하지 말아 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426E"
msgid "Be careful. These lands are not safe."
msgstr "조심해. 여기는 안전하지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426D"
msgid "May the Great Serpent watch over you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426C"
msgid "It is best not to travel alone."
msgstr "혼자 다니지 않는 게 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Whispering a prayer to yourself / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426B"
msgid "Great Serpent, protect us in our duty."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 우리의 임무를 지켜주소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01426A"
msgid "The zealots are always watching."
msgstr "광신도들은 항상 지켜보고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014269"
msgid "Now more than ever, we must be vigilant."
msgstr "지금은 그 어느 때보다도 경계해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F248
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_MinerIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014267"
msgid "Ugh, when is my shift over!"
msgstr "아, 대체 언제 교대 시간이 되는 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F248
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_MinerIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014266"
msgid "Now we have to deal with aggressive animals too?"
msgstr "이제는 난폭한 동물까지 상대해야 하는 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_GravDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipGravJumpDown
msgctxt "014265"
msgid "Direct hit to the Grav Drive!"
msgstr "중력 구동기에 직격!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F248
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_MinerIdles
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014264"
msgid "I'm getting too old for this."
msgstr "이 짓도 이제 나이 들어서 못 해먹겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_CivilianVendorsBCK_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014263"
msgid "Welcome. What items are you seeking today?"
msgstr "어서 오세요. 오늘은 어떤 물건을 찾으시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Show me what you got.
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_WeaponsVendor
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01035B1B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014262"
msgid "You look like you could use some supplies."
msgstr "무기가 필요해 보이는군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_CivilianVendorsBCK_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014261"
msgid "I have some surplus supplies I can offer, if you are in need."
msgstr "필요하시다면 제공해 드릴 수 있는 잉여 물품이 좀 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_CivilianVendorsBCK_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014260"
msgid "Ah, a fellow explorer! I might have what you need."
msgstr "아, 탐험가 동지시군요! 필요한 게 있으실지도 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Show me what you got.
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_WeaponsVendor
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01035B1B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425F"
msgid "Supplies are hard to come by out here. But I can help you."
msgstr "여기선 물품을 구하기 어렵지만, 제가 도와드릴 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Show me what you got.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Trade
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01035AF7
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425E"
msgid "Thanks for your business."
msgstr "이용해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_CivilianVendorsBCK_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425D"
msgid "Good luck out there."
msgstr "행운을 빕니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Show me what you got.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Trade
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01035AF7
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425C"
msgid "What can I get for you?"
msgstr "뭘 드릴까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425B"
msgid "Are you supposed to be here?"
msgstr "여기에 계셔도 되는 분인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01425A"
msgid "Don't bother me."
msgstr "귀찮게 하지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014259"
msgid "Make yourself at home, stranger."
msgstr "편하게 계세요, 낯선 분."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014258"
msgid "I miss my home."
msgstr "고향이 그립네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014257"
msgid "Mind your business, off-worlder."
msgstr "상관하지 마, 외부 세계인."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014256"
msgid "The animals here terrify me."
msgstr "여기 동물들은 너무 무서워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Civilians_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014255"
msgid "Nice to see a new face."
msgstr "새로운 얼굴을 보니 반갑네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014254"
msgid "The Kavnyk system is harsh, but there is much to learn here."
msgstr "카브닉 항성계는 가혹하지만, 여기에서 배울 점이 많아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014253"
msgid "Zealots are a constant worry. But we are just scientists, we are no threat to them."
msgstr "광신도들은 언제나 골칫거리지. 하지만 우린 그저 과학자일 뿐이고, 그들에게 위협이 되지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014252"
msgid "Fascinating specimens out here. I'm always finding something new."
msgstr "여기 정말 매혹적인 표본들이 있어. 항상 새로운 걸 발견한다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014251"
msgid "The anomalies have spread through the entire Kavnyk system. Have you seen them?"
msgstr "이상 역장이 카브닉 항성계 전역으로 퍼졌어. 보셨나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014250"
msgid "If you see an anomaly, it's best to keep your distance. Too many unknowns."
msgstr "이상 역장이 보이면 거리를 두는 것이 가장 좋습니다. 알 수 없는 것이 너무 많습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424F"
msgid "Have you seen the anomalies? Amazing phenomena, aren't they?"
msgstr "이상 역장을 보셨나요? 정말 놀라운 현상이지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424E"
msgid "Sorry, we're all pretty busy around here."
msgstr "죄송합니다만, 여기는 다들 꽤 바빠서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Scientists_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424D"
msgid "I can't wait to get back to my lab in Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라에 있는 내 연구실로 빨리 돌아가고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424C"
msgid "Rare to see anyone out here."
msgstr "여기서 사람을 보는 건 드문 일이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424B"
msgid "Sorry, we're all pretty busy around here."
msgstr "죄송합니다만, 여기는 다들 꽤 바빠서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01424A"
msgid "It's not very safe around here. Keep clear."
msgstr "여기는 그다지 안전하지 않습니다. 조심하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014249"
msgid "Good timing. We just finished with the explosives."
msgstr "때마침 잘 오셨네요. 방금 폭발물 설치를 끝냈거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014248"
msgid "The city life isn't for me. Hand me a Cutter and give me some space."
msgstr "도시 생활은 나랑 안 맞아. 나한테는 절단기랑 공간만 있으면 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_Dialogue
#. TOPIC: 0111F249
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OE_Miner_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014247"
msgid "This shift has been brutal."
msgstr "이번 교대 근무는 정말 힘들었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F755
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014245"
msgid "All right, but they're just going to lecture me."
msgstr "알겠는데, 그냥 잔소리만 하실 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F755
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014244"
msgid "Fine, but they're not going to be happy about it."
msgstr "알았어요. 근데 좋아하진 않으실 걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F755
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014243"
msgid "I'll let Zeni know, but if I lose a finger, it's your fault."
msgstr "제니 엄마한테 말은 할 건데, 혹시 제 손가락 떨어지면 엄마 탓이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Mila
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F728
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014242"
msgid "Mila, did you run the update on the bots yet?"
msgstr "밀라. 아직 로봇 업데이트 안 했니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Mila
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F728
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014241"
msgid "Mila, did you fill the feed distributors yet?"
msgstr "밀라. 사료 공급기 아직 안 채웠니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Mila
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F728
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014240"
msgid "Mila, did you get that maintenance done yet?"
msgstr "밀라. 그 수리한다는 거 아직 안 끝났니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F734
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01423F"
msgid "Practice makes perfect. Just talk to Zen first. They'll walk you through it."
msgstr "연습을 해야 완벽해지지. 먼저 젠한테 말하렴. 자세히 알려줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F734
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01423E"
msgid "That's exactly why you need to do it. Just let Zen know before you start."
msgstr "바로 그래서 네가 해야 하는 거야. 시작하기 전에 젠한테 말하고 하렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F734
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01423D"
msgid "You're doing it, like it or not. Now go let Zen know."
msgstr "좋든 싫든 네가 해야 해. 가서 젠한테도 말해주렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F749
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01423C"
msgid "Can't Zeni do it? I'm not sure I know what I'm doing."
msgstr "제니 엄마가 하면 안 돼요? 제대로 하는 건지 모르겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F71C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F749
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01423B"
msgid "Not yet, but what if I screw it up?"
msgstr "아직인데, 제가 망치면 어떡해요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
