msgstr "왔던 길을 다시 돌아가 보면 될 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Poking fun at her wife. "Grub grazer" is a little critter creature on the planet. / Amused / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: 
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
