msgid "Oh. Helpful. Thank you."
msgstr "아. 참 도움 되네. 고마워라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastically playful. / Sarcastic / to Zen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina:  &&& Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Sarcastic
