#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F74D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014231"
msgid "Well, aren't you just the best?"
msgstr "와, 역시 당신이 최고라니깐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastically playful. / Sarcastic / to Zen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina:  &&& Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen
