#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F74D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014230"
msgid "You're reliable as ever."
msgstr "역시나 믿을만하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen
#. TOPIC: 0111F71E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F73E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01422F"
msgid "Zen, have you seen my grinder? The groats are due for a trim."
msgstr "젠. 내 그라인더 못 봤어? 그로트 손질해줘야 하는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen
#. TOPIC: 0111F71E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F73E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01422E"
msgid "Have you seen my left work glove? Why is it always just one that's missing?"
msgstr "내 작업용 장갑 왼쪽 꺼 못 봤어? 왜 맨날 한쪽만 사라지는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen
#. TOPIC: 0111F71E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_IrinaAndZen_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F73E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01422D"
msgid "Do you know what I did with my scheduling slate? I can't find it anywhere."
msgstr "내가 일정표 슬레이트를 어떻게 했더라? 아무 데도 안 보이는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She knows what her mother is up to no good in a playful way. / Amused / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F715
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F724
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01422B"
msgid "I think you should do that. You know Rina hates it when you send me."
msgstr "직접 하셔야 될 것 같은데요. 리나 엄마가 저 보내는 거 싫어하잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She knows what her mother is up to no good in a playful way. / Amused / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F715
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F724
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01422A"
msgid "Uh, I think that's your job. Especially after last time!"
msgstr "으. 직접 하셔야 될 걸요. 특히 지난번 이후로는요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She knows what her mother is up to no good in a playful way. / Amused / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F715
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F724
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014229"
msgid "No way, I know exactly what you're trying to do."
msgstr "싫어요. 뭐 하시려는 건지 딱 알거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slight irritation at her parents flirting / Tired / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F730
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014228"
msgid "By the Serpent you two..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 대고, 두 분도 참..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly irritated at her parents flirting. / Irritated / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F730
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014227"
msgid "Ugh, come back when you really need something."
msgstr "으. 진짜로 필요한 일 있을 때 다시 오세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly irritated at her parents flirting. / Irritated / to Mila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila:  &&& Zen: 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaMazur
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F730
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014226"
msgid "Serpent spare me."
msgstr "뱀이시여, 저 좀 구해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She's wants to intentionally antagonize her wife . / Amused / to Zen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F714
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F751
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014225"
msgid "That's why I'm doing it."
msgstr "그래서 부탁하잖니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She's wants to intentionally antagonize her wife . / Amused / to Zen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F714
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F751
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014224"
msgid "Oh come on. I love getting a rise out of her and you know it."
msgstr "아, 왜 그래. 내가 이리나 약 올리는 거 얼마나 좋아하는지 알면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She's wants to intentionally antagonize her wife . / Amused / to Zen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen:  &&& Mila: 
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F714
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F751
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014223"
msgid "I'm just trying to keep her on her toes is all."
msgstr "그냥 정신 바짝 차리게 하려고 그러는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F716
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F745
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014222"
msgid "Mila, dear. Go tell your mother to stop rearranging my tools."
msgstr "우리 밀라. 엄마한테 가서 내 도구 정리 좀 그만 하라고 전해 주렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F716
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F745
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014221"
msgid "Mila, find Irina and ask her what's for dinner."
msgstr "밀라. 이리나 찾아서 저녁 뭐 먹을지 물어보렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Zen
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila
#. TOPIC: 0111F716
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_LC13_ZenAndMila_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111F745
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014220"
msgid "Oh Mila, please go find Irina and ask her to come here."
msgstr "아, 밀라. 이리나 찾아서 여기 좀 오라고 전해 줄래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A little surprised and suspicious. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: My son, Vaeric, has left.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111CBE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01421F"
msgid "Hm. It is a rare moment when prayers are so specifically answered, but it is not for me to question His will."
msgstr "흠. 기도가 이렇게 구체적으로 응답되는 순간은 드물지만, 내가 그분의 뜻에 의문을 제기할 수는 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious, prepared. It's time to fire the Mourning Device. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
