#. INFO GROUP: Ekris_BlockingHello_DuringFiringSequence
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01421E"
msgid "We stand ready."
msgstr "우리는 준비됐어."

