msgid "Jinan Va'ruun found that higher power on a grav jump. In the end, it is the Great Serpent you truly seek. You just may not realize it yet."
msgstr ""
"지난 바룬님께선 중력 도약에서 더 큰 힘을 찾아내셨다. 결국 네가 진정으로 찾는 건 위대한 뱀일 뿐이야. 아직 깨닫지 못했을 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This doesn't align with my beliefs, or with the teachings of Keeper Aquilus.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FF"
msgid "I cannot force you to enter. But I will wait for you to return."
msgstr "강제로 들여보낼 순 없지. 그래도 네가 돌아오길 기다리겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me. &&& Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you...  &&& Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed. &&& Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not offer religion. I offer truth. If you choose not to seek the truth, so be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FE"
msgid "I have no interest or need in your religion."
msgstr "그쪽 종교에는 관심도 없고, 필요하지도 않거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have no interest or need in your religion.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have no interest or need in your religion.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FD"
msgid "I do not offer religion. I offer truth. If you choose not to seek the truth, so be it."
msgstr "종교를 권하는 게 아니다. 진리를 권하지. 진리를 찾지 않겠다면, 그렇게 해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have no interest or need in your religion.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FC"
msgid "Neither the Great Serpent nor I will be going anywhere. We shall both await your return."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서도 그렇고, 나도 아무 데도 가지 않을 거다. 우리 모두 네가 돌아오길 기다리겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FB"
msgid "You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed."
msgstr "물론 여기 있는 그대의... 동포 역시 해를 입지 않으리라고 보장하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach. &&& Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel. &&& Malibor: We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We must try to maintain some sense of hope. None can know what will happen, save the Great Serpent himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141FA"
msgid "I'll help, but the outcome isn't going to be what you're hoping for."
msgstr "도와주긴 하겠지만, 결과가 원하는 대로 나오진 않을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help, but the outcome isn't going to be what you're hoping for.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll help, but the outcome isn't going to be what you're hoping for.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Your arrival, and your interaction with Anasko, shows that he can still be saved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141F9"
msgid "We must try to maintain some sense of hope. None can know what will happen, save the Great Serpent himself."
msgstr "희망을 잃지 않도록 해 봐야지요. 앞으로 무슨 일이 있을지는 위대한 뱀을 제외하면 아무도 모르는 법입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Makola
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141F8"
msgid "You have no place in our city."
msgstr "우리 도시에 네 녀석이 있을 자리는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Makola
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141F7"
msgid "Were it not for the Council, you would be cut down. As you should."
msgstr "대의회가 아니었다면, 너는 처분당했을 거다. 당연히 그리됐겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Makola
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141F6"
msgid "Get away from me, husk."
msgstr "저리 비켜. 허물 녀석아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: This is Sirak *static* on the st-- *static* Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111D60B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5005_Companion_TheOracleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141F5"
msgid "There is no record of a starstation in this orbit. Something is not right."
msgstr "이 궤도에는 우주정거장 기록이 없어. 뭔가 잘못된 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: This is Sirak *static* on the st-- *static* Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111D60B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5005_Companion_TheOracleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141F4"
msgid "I've never seen a starstation like that before."
msgstr "저런 우주정거장은 본 적이 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: This is Sirak *static* on the st-- *static* Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111D60B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5005_Companion_TheOracleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141F3"
msgid "Never seen a station like that before. Certainly isn't Freestar."
msgstr "저런 정거장은 본 적이 없어. 자유항성 소속은 확실히 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: This is Sirak *static* on the st-- *static* Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111D60B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5005_Companion_TheOracleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141F2"
msgid "An undocumented starstation? It's like nothing I've ever seen before."
msgstr "자료에는 없는 우주정거장인가? 저런 건 본 적이 없는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Ekris
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Then we let the Vindicator decide.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal should lead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111CBEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141EC"
msgid "And we have a Herald here as witness."
msgstr "그리고 전령님이 증인을 서 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraOrahim
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: Unlikely, although I suppose it is not impossible. But, it would mean an early grave for them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111D7E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141EB"
msgid "Do you think any other Zealots will try to retaliate against you, after what we did to Khaslav?"
msgstr "다른 광신도들이 네게 보복할까? 카슬라프에게 한 짓을 되갚아주겠다고 하면 어쩌지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think any other Zealots will try to retaliate against you, after what we did to Khaslav?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111D7E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141EA"
msgid "Unlikely, although I suppose it is not impossible. But, it would mean an early grave for them."
msgstr "가능성은 작지만, 없다고는 못 하지. 하지만 그랬다간 일찍 무덤에 가는 지름길이 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111D7E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E9"
msgid "Any Zealot stupid enough to try and draw their weapon against me will be dead before their gun leaves its holster."
msgstr "감히 내게 무장을 겨누려는 광신도는 총을 뽑기도 전에 죽을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Enraged, launching into an attack / Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: She trusted you, and this is how you repay that trust?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E8"
msgid "Villain! You will die for this!"
msgstr "악당 놈! 네놈은 오늘 죽었다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E7"
msgid "What? The Fang's heirloom? But how could you have that? Unless..."
msgstr "뭐? 송곳니의 가보? 네가 어떻게 그걸? 설마..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious accusation / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maaliya was unworthy. I will carry on the Fang's legacy myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E6"
msgid "Betrayer! You killed my daughter!"
msgstr "배신자! 네가 내 딸을 죽였구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: What? The Fang's heirloom? But how could you have that? Unless... |Betrayer! You killed my daughter!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: She trusted you, and this is how you repay that trust?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E5"
msgid "Maaliya was unworthy. I will carry on the Fang's legacy myself."
msgstr "말리야는 자격이 없었어. 송곳니의 유산은 내가 이어가겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rising rage / Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maaliya was unworthy. I will carry on the Fang's legacy myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maaliya was unworthy. I will carry on the Fang's legacy myself.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Villain! You will die for this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E4"
msgid "She trusted you, and this is how you repay that trust?"
msgstr "그 애는 널 믿었는데, 이런 식으로 신뢰를 갚는 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: What? The Fang's heirloom? But how could you have that? Unless... |Betrayer! You killed my daughter!
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yours by right?! You had no right to do what you did!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E3"
msgid "I'm the one who reclaimed the heirlooms. They're mine by right."
msgstr "가보를 되찾은 건 나야. 그러니 내 것이 되는 게 당연하지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAndrahDubib: I believe they will be fine. Since Malik is paying me, I have a more stable means of income, which I have been giving to them whenever I can. Now they can afford supplies from Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AndrahDubib_HelpingUnfortunate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E2"
msgid "What will happen to the people that relied on the groats you gave them?"
msgstr "네가 주던 그로트에 의지하던 사람들은 어떻게 되는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: What? The Fang's heirloom? But how could you have that? Unless... |Betrayer! You killed my daughter!
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maaliya... my little flower... no...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E1"
msgid "[Lie] I found her body in the wilderness."
msgstr "[거짓말] 황무지에서 시신을 발견했소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just learned your daughter died. Devastated. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I found her body in the wilderness.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] I found her body in the wilderness.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141E0"
msgid "Maaliya... my little flower... no..."
msgstr "말리야... 나의 작은 꽃이여... 안 돼..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just learned your daughter died. Devastated. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I found her body in the wilderness.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141DF"
msgid "It's my fault. I'm the one who let her go. I should have protected her."
msgstr "내 잘못이야. 내가 보내는 게 아니었는데. 내가 그 애를 지켰어야 했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just learned your daughter died. Devastated. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I found her body in the wilderness.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Villain! You will die for this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141DE"
msgid "Leave me."
msgstr "저리 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will happen to the people that relied on the groats you gave them?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AndrahDubib_HelpingUnfortunate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141DD"
msgid "I believe they will be fine. Since Malik is paying me, I have a more stable means of income, which I have been giving to them whenever I can. Now they can afford supplies from Dazra."
msgstr "잘 지낼 겁니다. 말릭이 제게 돈을 주고 있으니까요. 덕분에 수입이 안정적이고, 그 돈을 최대한 사람들에게 나눠 주고 있습니다. 이제 다즈라에게서 용품을 살 수 있게 됐죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you like having Andrah as a farmhand? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Andrah
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141DC"
msgid "I suppose I will grow accustomed to it. Admittedly, it is good to have the chance to rest my bones and let him deal with the hard labor."
msgstr "익숙해져야겠지. 솔직히 나도 좀 쉬면서 힘든 일은 저 친구에게 맡길 기회가 생겨서 좋긴 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Andrah
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141DB"
msgid "Not that I needed any help to begin with."
msgstr "그렇다고 내가 도움이 필요했다는 건 아니고."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAndrahDubib: He is not the friendliest man on this planet, but I suppose I should not complain. It was either this or jail, right?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AndrahDubib_Farmhand
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D8"
msgid "How is it being Malik's farmhand?"
msgstr "말릭 밑에서 일하는 건 어때?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I cannot remember much of it. It's a blur, but I remember... screams, confusion, terror. Borhal was carrying me, but I forget where we were.|*Sigh* Borhal was always there, and I took him for granted...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I cannot remember much of it. It's a blur, but I remember... screams, confusion, terror. Borhal was carrying me, but I forget where we were. It is all a haze for me, but Borhal surely remembers it better.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC0F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D7"
msgid "What does it matter to you? Just leave me alone, will you? I already have Borhal to contend with, I do not need you to bother me any further."
msgstr "당신이 뭔 상관인데? 나를 그냥 내버려 둬, 알겠어? 이미 보할 형이랑 싸우고 있는데, 당신까지 날 괴롭힐 필요는 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D6"
msgid "Hmmph, peeling Amila off the floor of Herald's Rest. We were stumbling towards the stairs when it happened."
msgstr "흠, 전령의 안식처의 바닥에서 아밀라를 일으켜 세우던 중이었지. 우린 계단을 향해 비틀거리며 걸어가고 있었는데 그 일이 터졌네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Why must you disgrace me with your presence? I have no interest in being friends with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D5"
msgid "It was... blinding, and the screams deafening. I thought the Great Serpent was there to eat us all. I have never been so terrified in my life..."
msgstr ""
"눈이... 부셨지. 비명 소리로 귀가 멀 정도였어. 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 먹어 치우려 오신 줄 알았네. 살면서 그때만큼 겁먹은 적이 "
"없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
