msgctxt "0141D3"
msgid "It was... blinding, and the screams deafening. I thought the Great Serpent was there to eat us all. I have never been so terrified in my life..."
msgstr ""
"눈이... 부셨지. 비명 소리로 귀가 멀 정도였어. 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 먹어 치우려 오신 줄 알았네. 살면서 그때만큼 겁먹은 적이 "
"없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D2"
msgid "Amila cannot remember much of the event, and should count himself lucky that he does not have to bear the memory of that terrible day."
msgstr "아밀라는 그때 일이 잘 기억나지 않을 거야. 그 끔찍한 날을 기억하지 않아서 운이 좋은 줄 알아야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D1"
msgid "I cannot remember much of it. It's a blur, but I remember... screams, confusion, terror. Borhal was carrying me, but I forget where we were."
msgstr ""
"기억이 잘 나진 않아. 흐릿하지만... 비명, 혼란... 무서웠던 게 기억이 나. 형이 나를 옮겨 주고 있었는데, 우리가 어디에 있었는지 "
"잊어 버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: What does it matter to you? Just leave me alone, will you? I already have Borhal to contend with, I do not need you to bother me any further.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141D0"
msgid "*Sigh* Borhal was always there, and I took him for granted..."
msgstr "*한숨* 형이 항상 내 곁에 있었는데, 난 그걸 당연스레 여겼지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraMalikVosh
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMalikVosh: I suppose I will grow accustomed to it. Admittedly, it is good to have the chance to rest my bones and let him deal with the hard labor. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Andrah
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CF"
msgid "How do you like having Andrah as a farmhand?"
msgstr "앤드라를 일꾼으로 둔 건 어때?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know Sirak Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CE"
msgid "Indeed. Sirak was my cousin."
msgstr "알다마다. 시락은 내 사촌이었다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CD"
msgid "I know they were assigned to the Oracle, and Malibor relayed their final report sent by the station."
msgstr "오라클에 배정된 것도 알고 있었고, 우주정거장에서 보낸 마지막 보고도 말리보어를 통해 전달받았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CC"
msgid "They walk with the Great Serpent now."
msgstr "지금은 위대한 뱀과 함께 걷고 있겠구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is it being Malik's farmhand?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AndrahDubib_Farmhand
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CB"
msgid "He is not the friendliest man on this planet, but I suppose I should not complain. It was either this or jail, right?"
msgstr "친절한 사람은 아니지만, 불평할 입장은 아니지. 감옥에 가는 것보단 낫잖아, 안 그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AndrahDubib_Farmhand
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141CA"
msgid "I am glad he chose to forgive me, and he is even paying me for my work, so he seems to be a fair man. Unfriendly, but fair."
msgstr "날 용서해 줘서 기쁘고, 일삯도 주고 있으니 공평한 사람 같아. 불친절하지만, 공평해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rising rage / Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm the one who reclaimed the heirlooms. They're mine by right.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one who reclaimed the heirlooms. They're mine by right.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Villain! You will die for this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141C9"
msgid "Yours by right?! You had no right to do what you did!"
msgstr "네 권리라고?! 네깟 놈이 그럴 권리는 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know Sirak Veth'aal? &&& MQ_LovekVethaal: Indeed. Sirak was my cousin.|I know they were assigned to the Oracle, and Malibor relayed their final report sent by the station.|They walk with the Great Serpent now.
