#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141C0"
msgid "Sirak was a respected scientist, dedicated to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "시락은 위대한 뱀께 헌신했던 존경받는 과학자였소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141BF"
msgid "They spent every moment engrossed in their work. A true testament of faith."
msgstr "언제나 일에 몰두하던 사람이었지. 진정한 신앙의 증거를 보여준 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141BE"
msgid "It was their greatest honor to be selected for the Oracle."
msgstr "본인이 오라클에 배정된 걸 가장 큰 영광으로 여겼다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What will become of the Oracle now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will become of the Oracle now?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141BD"
msgid "The Oracle's fate will be tabled for a future discussion."
msgstr "오라클의 운명에 대해서는 나중에 논의할 예정이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What will become of the Oracle now?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141BC"
msgid "We have more important issues at hand."
msgstr "당장은 더 중요한 문제들이 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Hmmph, peeling Amila off the floor of Herald's Rest. We were stumbling towards the stairs when it happened. |It was... blinding, and the screams deafening. I thought the Great Serpent was there to eat us all. I have never been so terrified in my life...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CC0B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141BB"
msgid "Why must you disgrace me with your presence? I have no interest in being friends with you."
msgstr "왜 계속 내 앞에 머무르며 날 모욕하는 것이냐? 너와 친구가 될 생각은 전혀 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Hmmph, peeling Amila off the floor of Herald's Rest. We were stumbling towards the stairs when it happened. 
