#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141B9"
msgid "I have some other questions."
msgstr "다른 질문이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: What does it matter to you? Just leave me alone, will you? I already have Borhal to contend with, I do not need you to bother me any further.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
