#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Oracle's fate will be tabled for a future discussion. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141B7"
msgid "What will become of the Oracle now?"
msgstr "이제 오라클은 어떻게 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many people were stationed on the Oracle?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How many people were stationed on the Oracle?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141B6"
msgid "Eighty-seven souls reside with the Great Serpent now. Many were some of the finest scientific minds House Va'ruun had to offer."
msgstr "지금쯤 87명의 영혼이 위대한 뱀의 곁에 서 있겠구려. 그 중 많은 이들이 바룬 가문에서 배출해낸 최고의 과학자였지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many people were stationed on the Oracle?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: Can you tell me more about Sirak?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141B5"
msgid "They will be remembered alongside those we lost here in Dazra."
msgstr "여기 다즈라에서 잃은 사람들과 함께 기억될 것이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed, grieving for your recently-deceased daughter / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudDepressedBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141B4"
msgid "Maaliya, I have failed you."
msgstr "말리야, 내가 널 실망시켰구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141B3"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr "날 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed, grieving for your recently-deceased daughter / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudDepressedBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141B2"
msgid "My daughter is dead. Our legacy is over."
msgstr "내 딸이 죽었다. 우리의 유산은 끝났어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed, grieving for your recently-deceased daughter / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudDepressedBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141B1"
msgid "My fault... All my fault..."
msgstr "내 잘못이야... 다 내 잘못이야..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed, grieving for your recently-deceased daughter / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudDepressedBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0141B0"
msgid "I'm so sorry, little flower."
msgstr "정말 미안하구나. 나의 작은 꽃아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141AF"
msgid "Why is staying positive so hard?"
msgstr "긍정적으로 생각하는 게 왜 이렇게 힘들지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141AE"
msgid "I don't even know why I'm still here."
msgstr "내가 왜 아직 여기 있는지조차 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141AD"
msgid "Over thinking never helps, yet I do it every time."
msgstr "너무 심각해 봤자 도움도 안 되는데, 매번 그렇게 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0141AC"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141AB"
msgid "The Ministry of State makes no exceptions."
msgstr "국무성은 절대 예외를 두지 않는구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141AA"
msgid "We are all equal under Va'ruun law."
msgstr "바룬의 법 아래에선 우리 모두 평등하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A9"
msgid "How could Viktor have given such an order?"
msgstr "빅토르가 어떻게 그런 명령을 내릴 수 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A8"
msgid "I'm glad Eggie and I have reconciled."
msgstr "에기랑 화해하게 돼서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A7"
msgid "I can't believe Vaeric's gone."
msgstr "배릭이 떠났다니 믿기질 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A6"
msgid "Eggie will get through this."
msgstr "에기는 잘 이겨낼 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A5"
msgid "It's good to have at least one friend back."
msgstr "적어도 친구 하나라도 돌아와서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A4"
msgid "It's good to have Vaeric back."
msgstr "배릭이 돌아와서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A3"
msgid "Eggie has curbed his drinking since Vaeric returned."
msgstr "배릭이 돌아온 뒤로 에기가 술을 자제하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A2"
msgid "I like having things back to normal."
msgstr "다시 예전처럼 돌아가서 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A1"
msgid "Nice to see you again."
msgstr "다시 보니 반갑네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0141A0"
msgid "Vaeric sure had us worried."
msgstr "배릭 때문에 걱정 많이 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419F"
msgid "Work is just exhausting these days."
msgstr "요즘은 일이 너무 힘들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419E"
msgid "It always feels like we're being watched since House Veth'aal took over."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡은 뒤로는 항상 감시당하는 기분이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419D"
msgid "We've so little free time with Dul'kehf in charge."
msgstr "둘케프가 통치하면서부터 우리에겐 자유 시간이 거의 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419C"
msgid "I wonder if House Ka'dic will really open our walls."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 정말로 장벽을 개방할까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BiancaLatif_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419B"
msgid "With Razma as the acting Speaker, maybe we'll have a chance to see beyond Dazra."
msgstr "라즈마가 대변자 대행을 맡고 있으니, 어쩌면 다즈라 너머를 볼 기회가 생길지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01419A"
msgid "I'm done after this one. I promise."
msgstr "이것만 마시고 끝낼게. 진짜야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014199"
msgid "Why have friends if they just leave in the end?"
msgstr "결국 그냥 떠날 거면 친구는 왜 있는 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014198"
msgid "Great Serpent give me strength to get past this."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 이 상황을 극복할 힘을 주소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014197"
msgid "Bee is going to help me get through this."
msgstr "내가 이겨낼 수 있게 비가 도와줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014196"
msgid "Thanks for the advice. You've changed everything."
msgstr "조언해줘서 고마워. 덕분에 모든 게 바뀌었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014195"
msgid "I still can't believe what happened to Vaeric."
msgstr "아직도 배릭에게 일어난 일을 믿을 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014194"
msgid "I can't bring myself to accept that Vaeric isn't coming back."
msgstr "배릭이 돌아오지 않을 거란 사실을 받아들이기 힘드네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014193"
msgid "I'm glad Bee gave me another chance."
msgstr "비가 다시 기회를 줘서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014192"
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr "잘 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014191"
msgid "I knew Vaeric would be all right."
msgstr "역시 배릭이 무사할 줄 알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014190"
msgid "It's great to have everyone back together."
msgstr "다들 다시 모이니까 너무 좋은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418F"
msgid "Thank the Serpent. Vaeric's back and Bee is speaking to me again."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 감사를. 배릭도 돌아왔고, 비도 다시 말을 걸어주고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418E"
msgid "Plenty more to drink to now that Vaeric's back."
msgstr "이제 배릭이 돌아왔으니 더 많이 마실 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418D"
msgid "I'm so tired of these long hours."
msgstr "너무 오래 일하느라 지쳐버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418C"
msgid "Monitored breaks are ridiculous."
msgstr "휴식 시간을 감시하다니 말도 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418B"
msgid "The Dul'kehf time keeping methods are so excessive."
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 시간 엄수 방식은 너무 과해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01418A"
msgid "I've heard House Ka'dic may resume official contact with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 개척 성계와 공식 접촉을 재개할 수도 있다고 들었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EgboKazmi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014189"
msgid "If House Ka'dic is increasing outside tolerance, I hope it doesn't include the Zealots."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 외부에 관용을 더 베풀 거라면, 광신도는 제외했으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014188"
msgid "It's nice to see my friends again."
msgstr "친구들을 다시 만나니 반갑네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014187"
msgid "You were right when you convinced me to return."
msgstr "내가 돌아오도록 설득한 건 옳은 결정이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014186"
msgid "Even if I have little joy in my duties, being with friends again is worth it."
msgstr "할 일이 별로 즐겁지 않더라도, 친구들과 함께하니 훨씬 낫네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014185"
msgid "It's nice to get away from the keep."
msgstr "요새 바깥으로 나오니 꽤 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014184"
msgid "The armor of the Fang? But how?"
msgstr "송곳니의 방어구잖아? 하지만 어떻게?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014183"
msgid "Is that... Mahkara the Fang's spacesuit?"
msgstr "저게... 송곳니의 마카라가 입던 우주복인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014182"
msgid "The Fang's spacesuit! Stolen? Or perhaps a gift?"
msgstr "송곳니의 우주복! 훔친 건가요? 아니면 설마 선물 받은 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014181"
msgid "Mahkara the Fang's armor! But shouldn't it be in her tomb?"
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라의 방어구! 근데 무덤에 있어야 하는 거 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, confused / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014180"
msgid "By the serpent, Mahkara the Fang wore that!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 송곳니의 마카라가 입었던 거라니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hm. It is a rare moment when prayers are so specifically answered, but it is not for me to question His will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111CBE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01417F"
msgid "I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for."
msgstr "저는 장로님 생각보다 더 많은 걸 이해해요. 제가 바로 그토록 찾으시던 제3자입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D247D
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D249F
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "01417E"
msgid "Internal systems at critical levels. Making final stand."
msgstr "내부 시스템에 심한 피해 확인. 마지막 저항 개시."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D2479
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D2493
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "01417D"
msgid "Alert. I have located the heretic."
msgstr "경보. 이단자를 발견했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious, prepared. It's time to fire the Mourning Device. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Ekris_BlockingHello_DuringFiringSequence
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01417C"
msgid "On your mark."
msgstr "준비해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious, prepared. It's time to fire the Mourning Device. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Ekris_BlockingHello_DuringFiringSequence
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01417B"
msgid "It's time."
msgstr "때가 됐다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious, prepared. It's time to fire the Mourning Device. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Ekris_BlockingHello_DuringFiringSequence
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01417A"
msgid "At your order."
msgstr "지시 사항대로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MalikVosh
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Hmmph, you know nothing about keeping livestock. We need to stop my groats from disappearing so that we can properly feed Dazra. An interruption of the food supply would be catastrophic at a time like this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0111CF93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_GroatTL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014179"
msgid "Why are these groats so important? Can't you replace them?"
msgstr "그로트가 뭐가 그렇게 중요한데요? 그냥 다른 걸로 대신하면 안 되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are these groats so important? Can't you replace them?
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0111CF92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_GroatTL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014178"
msgid "Hmmph, you know nothing about keeping livestock. We need to stop my groats from disappearing so that we can properly feed Dazra. An interruption of the food supply would be catastrophic at a time like this."
msgstr "쯧, 가축 키우는 것에 대해 아무것도 모르는군. 다즈라를 제대로 먹이려면 그로트가 사라지지 않게 해야 해. 이럴 때 먹이 공급이 중단되면 끔찍한 일이 벌어질 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0111CF92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_GroatTL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014177"
msgid "And, if I keep losing groats, how will I breed new ones? I can work with the other groat farms, but their supply is already strained."
msgstr ""
"그리고, 내가 계속 그로트를 잃으면, 어떻게 새끼를 치겠나? 다른 그로트 목장과 협력할 수 있지만, 그쪽 물자도 이미 바닥을 보이고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014176"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "014175"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "뭘 원하느냐?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014174"
msgid "I do not want any trouble."
msgstr "문제를 일으킬 생각은 없다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014173"
msgid "Save your words for when we meet at my home."
msgstr "나의 집에서 서로 만나 그때 얘기하도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud, enthralled by the old tales, enthusiastic to tell the story / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014172"
msgid "Mahkara's weapon was crafted by the renowned gun-maker Kiva Shan, who was blind."
msgstr "마카라 님의 무기는 유명한 총기 제작자인 키바 샨이 만들었죠. 키바 샨은 시각 장애인이었데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud, enthralled by the old tales, enthusiastic to tell the story / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014171"
msgid "It was said Kiva could judge the quality of metals by touch, smell and taste."
msgstr "키바 샨은 촉감, 냄새, 그리고 맛으로도 금속의 품질을 판단할 수 있었다고 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud, enthralled by the old tales, enthusiastic to tell the story / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014170"
msgid "Her boost pack was forged by Anjari the Elder, whose son Anjari the Younger earned great renown as a sculptor."
msgstr "마카라 님의 부스터팩은 안자리 장로께서 만드셨는데, 그분의 아들인 어린 안자리는 조각가로 명성을 떨쳤죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud, enthralled by the old tales, enthusiastic to tell the story / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01416F"
msgid "Mahkara's spacesuit was made by the weaver Krisa Vaszla, a woman of surpassing beauty and skill."
msgstr "마카라 님의 우주복은 빼어난 미모와 훌륭한 솜씨를 겸비한 직공인 크리사 바즐라가 만들었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01416E"
msgid "Krisa was a mother to thirteen children, many of whom aided in her work."
msgstr "크리사에게는 자녀가 13명이 있었는데, 그 아이들 중 다수가 크리사의 일을 도왔죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud, enthralled by the old tales, enthusiastic to tell the story / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01416D"
msgid "How she found the time to raise so many children while mastering her craft is a mystery to me."
msgstr "그렇게 많은 아이를 키우면서 어떻게 그 기술을 연마할 시간을 찾았는지, 저에게는 정말 수수께끼예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Barking orders to his engineers. Concerned. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MourningDevice_Control
#. TOPIC: 0111CA1B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_Ekris
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01416C"
msgid "Steady!"
msgstr "그대로 유지!"

