#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Hold! Hold! We cannot fail the Speaker now! &&& Scientist_F04: Rerouting power. &&& Scientist_M07: It's burning out!
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scientist_F04: Cutting power!
