#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_03_Fire
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01416B"
msgid "Enough! Shut it down!"
msgstr "이 정도면 충분해! 종료시켜!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Barking orders to his engineers. We're done! We did it! / Relieved / to Ekris
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Enough! Shut it down! &&& ...  &&& Scientist_F02: Returning to zero point. &&& Scientist_M07: Retracting stabilizers. &&& Scientist_F04: Shutdown complete!
