#. TOPIC: 0111CF9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_03_Fire
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01416A"
msgid "Clear!"
msgstr "성공이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: To the control room. Relieved, grateful. We did it! / Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Clear! &&& Scientist_M07: *sigh*
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: We have done all we can. I'm sure the Council is waiting to speak with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MourningDevice_Control
#. TOPIC: 0111CF9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_03_Fire
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014169"
msgid "Well done, all. Well done."
msgstr "잘 했어. 모두 수고했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: To the player, after firing the Mourning Device. Relieved, grateful, confident. / Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MourningDevice_Control
#. TOPIC: 0111CA1B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_Ekris
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014168"
msgid "This would never have been possible without you. Now, we have a chance."
msgstr "자네 없이는 불가능했을 거야. 이제 우리에게 기회가 생겼군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: To the player. Relieved, grateful, confident. / Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well done, all. Well done.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MourningDevice_Control
#. TOPIC: 0111D7EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MourningDeviceControl_03_Fire
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014167"
msgid "We have done all we can. I'm sure the Council is waiting to speak with you."
msgstr "우리가 할 수 있는 건 다했어. 대의회에서 자네와 이야기를 나누기 위해 기다리고 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Control room chatter, reporting status as the Mourning Device fires. Relieved. We did it! / Relieved / to Scientist_F04_HTT
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist_F04: Cutting power! &&& Scientist_M03: Grav Drive cycling down. &&& Scientist_F02: Returning to zero point. &&& Scientist_M07: Retracting stabilizers.
