msgid "Shutdown complete!"
msgstr "종료 완료!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Control room chatter, reporting status as the Mourning Device prepares to fire. / Concentrating / to Scientist_M07_HTT
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Fire! &&& ...  &&& Scientist_F04: His fangs shall pierce the shell of the world.... &&& Ekris: Focus! &&& Scientist_F02: Beam is on target.
#. ALIAS: Scientist_M07
