msgid "Compensating for recoil."
msgstr "반동 보정."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Control room chatter, reporting status as the Mourning Device fires. It's overloading! / Worried / to Scientist_M07_HTT
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist_M07: Compensating for recoil. &&& ...  &&& Scientist_M03: Fluctuations in the grav field. &&& Ekris: Hold! Hold! We cannot fail the Speaker now! &&& Scientist_F04: Rerouting power.
