msgstr "에너지가 소진됐습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Ilana
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila: Yeah, because you wouldn't stop complaining...  &&& Ivali: So... are we going to play again, or what? &&& Ilana: No, it's no fun when it's just us three.
