#. SCRIPT NOTES: Briskly. Engineer calls out system status during the Mourning Device firing sequence. Worried. / Worried / to Scientist_F02_HTT
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist_F02: Beam is on target. &&& ...  &&& Scientist_F04: Power draw exceeding capacity. &&& Ekris: It's working! Steady! &&& Scientist_F04: Attempting to stabilize voltage.
