#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Ilana
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila: Yeah, because you wouldn't stop complaining...  &&& Ivali: So... are we going to play again, or what? &&& Ilana: No, it's no fun when it's just us three.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ivali: Hey! I know what we could do!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 010B12FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_LoopingScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
