msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*한숨*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerFemale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, you didn't know? They might've found something. Could be it!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01415C"
msgid "Three months. Three months we've been digging, and still nothing."
msgstr "세 달. 세 달 동안 파헤쳤지만, 여전히 아무것도 못 찾았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Three months. Three months we've been digging, and still nothing.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well then what the hell are we still doing here?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01415B"
msgid "Oh, you didn't know? They might've found something. Could be it!"
msgstr "오, 몰랐어? 걔네가 뭔가 찾아낸 모양이던데. 그게 찾던 걸지도 모르지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, you didn't know? They might've found something. Could be it!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerFemale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Boss wants us on patrol. Besides, from what I hear, you don't want to go down there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01415A"
msgid "Well then what the hell are we still doing here?"
msgstr "그럼 대체 여기서 씨발 계속 뭘 하고 있는 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well then what the hell are we still doing here?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Why? What'd you hear?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014159"
msgid "Boss wants us on patrol. Besides, from what I hear, you don't want to go down there."
msgstr "대장이 우리 보고 계속 순찰하라 하잖아. 게다가, 나는 들었다고. 너도 들었으면 저 아래로 가고 싶지 않을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Boss wants us on patrol. Besides, from what I hear, you don't want to go down there.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerFemale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Screaming.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014158"
msgid "Why? What'd you hear?"
msgstr "왜? 뭘 들었는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Why? What'd you hear?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC08_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111CBE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_LC08_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014157"
msgid "Screaming."
msgstr "비명 소리."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Give me your best bottle of koza, Genna. &&& Genna: What's the occasion?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: That's as good a reason as any.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014156"
msgid "I'm just happy things are improving around here."
msgstr "그냥 상황이 나아지고 있으니까 기뻐서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should discuss the displacement of the noble Houses. |I motion to make House Dul'kehf a priority. Sharing occupancy with the Halls of Healing is not ideal for us or the Heralds. &&& Kadic_Djimal: I'd remind the Mediary that your House chose that location. This is a problem of your own making. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Be that as it may, House Veth'aal would like to offer House Dul'kehf priority here. We empathize with your loss of home and will patiently wait for our turn.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Regardless, the act is suspicious. Whereas our house has demonstrated its commitment to service by staying at the Keep.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0111CA17
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_030_CouncilMeetings_Scene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014155"
msgid "Your accusation is baseless, Mediary. There is no evidence of any such theft."
msgstr "근거 없는 비난입니다, 중개자. 그런 도둑질을 했다는 증거는 없어요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vethaal_Lovek: Be that as it may, House Veth'aal would like to offer House Dul'kehf priority here. We empathize with your loss of home and will patiently wait for our turn. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Your accusation is baseless, Mediary. There is no evidence of any such theft.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Agreed. Construction will begin with House Veth'aal, followed by the Ministry of State.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0111CA16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_030_CouncilMeetings_Scene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014154"
msgid "Regardless, the act is suspicious. Whereas our house has demonstrated its commitment to service by staying at the Keep."
msgstr "그래도 의심스러운 행동이기는 합니다. 우리 가문은 본성에 머무르면서 헌신적인 섬김을 보여줬으니 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. Let us proceed to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B158
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_060_CouncilMeetings_Scene06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014153"
msgid "To question my authority as acting Speaker is to question His will, and those who doubt will be dealt with in full display of the populace."
msgstr ""
"대변자 직무 대행을 맡은 내 권위를 의심하는 것은 곧 그분의 뜻을 의심하는 것이며, 의심하는 자들은 대중들이 보는 앞에서 처리될 것이다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Captain here, noting the latest acquisition from the Va'ruun tomb: the boost pack, stashed away in maintenance.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): As always, Va'ruun tech is a gamble. It might work or not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01414D"
msgid "Secured in the \"vault\"... Or at least, what passes for a vault in this ragtag operation."
msgstr "'금고'에 보관되어 있지... 아니, 적어도 이 허접한 작전에서 금고라고 부를 만한 곳에."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What are you... ugh. I've had it up to here! Do you hear me, King?! I'm done! I can't bear your idiocies any longer!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I was promised a glorious future in the military, and I threw it all away because I thought you were worth it. But now, now I see you for what you truly are: a colossal disappointment!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog05_Conclusion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01414C"
msgid "I deserve better than this! I sacrificed everything, my dreams, my ambitions. All for what?! To serve a fool like you?!"
msgstr "난 이것보다 더 나은 대접을 받을 자격이 있어! 난 모든 걸 희생했어, 내 꿈, 야망. 다 무엇을 위해서?! 너 같은 바보를 섬기기 위해?!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I was promised a glorious future in the military, and I threw it all away because I thought you were worth it. But now, now I see you for what you truly are: a colossal disappointment!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Consider this my final farewell! Captain out! And you, King, you can go rot in the vacuum of space for all I care!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog05_Conclusion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01414B"
msgid "So here I am, stuck on this backwater planet surrounded by locals who aren't exactly friendly to former Spacers and relic stealers like us."
msgstr "그래서 난 여기, 이 벽지 행성에 갇혀, 우리 같은 전직 스페이서와 유물 도둑을 달가워하지 않는 현지인들에게 둘러싸여 있지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So here I am, stuck on this backwater planet surrounded by locals who aren't exactly friendly to former Spacers and relic stealers like us.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog05_Conclusion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01414A"
msgid "Consider this my final farewell! Captain out! And you, King, you can go rot in the vacuum of space for all I care!"
msgstr "이걸 내 마지막 작별 인사로 여겨! 선장, 끝낸다! 그리고 킹, 네놈은 내가 알 바 아니고 우주 저편에서 썩어 문드러져 버려라!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, prepare yourselves for a dose of pure lunacy.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And where did fate drop us? Right smack dab in front of the entrance to this bunker. Abandoned, desolate, not a soul in sight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014149"
msgid "It all began with the king's insatiable curiosity, or so he claims. One fine day, he decided to tinker with the ship's engine controls, leading to a catastrophic failure that forced us into a crash landing on this godforsaken planet."
msgstr ""
"모든 건 킹의 만족할 줄 모르는 호기심이나, 녀석이 박박 우기던 것 때문에 시작됐지. 어느 좋은 날, 녀석은 우주선의 엔진 제어 장치를 "
"만지작거리려 했고, 그 결과 돌발고장이 발생해서 이 망할 놈의 행성에 불시착하게 됐지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So what did we do? We claimed it as our own, naturally. A temporary refuge until we could plot our escape from this miserable rock.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Captain, signing off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014148"
msgid "Oh, the absurdity of it all. One reckless move by the king, who, incidentally, insists it was all part of his master plan. And here we are, lords of an empty bunker in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr ""
"아, 정말 어처구니가 없네. 킹, 그 멍청이는 모든 게 다 자기가 세운 대단한 계획의 일부라고 우기던데. 그렇게 지금 우린, 안이 텅텅 "
"빈 벙커의 귀족이 됐지."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, prepare yourselves for a dose of pure lunacy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014147"
msgid "Dears listeners, gather 'round for another tale of cosmic absurdity. You want to know how this \"mighty\" team of Spacers stumbled upon this Va'ruun bunker?"
msgstr ""
"친애하는 청중 여러분, 우주의 다른 기막힌 이야기를 들려드릴 테니 이쪽으로 모여보시라. 이 '강력한' 스페이서 팀이 어떻게 우연히 이 "
"바룬 벙커를 발견했는지 알고 싶으신가?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I deserve better than this! I sacrificed everything, my dreams, my ambitions. All for what?! To serve a fool like you?!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So here I am, stuck on this backwater planet surrounded by locals who aren't exactly friendly to former Spacers and relic stealers like us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog05_Conclusion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014146"
msgid "I was promised a glorious future in the military, and I threw it all away because I thought you were worth it. But now, now I see you for what you truly are: a colossal disappointment!"
msgstr "난 군대에서 영광스러운 미래를 약속받았고, 그 모든 걸 내던졌어. 네가 그럴 가치가 있다고 생각했기 때문이지. 하지만 지금, 이제야 네 진짜 모습이 보여. 엄청나게 실망스러운 놈!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It all began with the king's insatiable curiosity, or so he claims. One fine day, he decided to tinker with the ship's engine controls, leading to a catastrophic failure that forced us into a crash landing on this godforsaken planet.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So what did we do? We claimed it as our own, naturally. A temporary refuge until we could plot our escape from this miserable rock.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014145"
msgid "And where did fate drop us? Right smack dab in front of the entrance to this bunker. Abandoned, desolate, not a soul in sight."
msgstr ""
"운명은 우리를 어디에 떨어뜨렸을까? 이 벙커 입구 바로 코앞에 떨궈버렸지. 버려졌고, 황량하고, 주변에 아무도 없는 곳인데 말이지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And where did fate drop us? Right smack dab in front of the entrance to this bunker. Abandoned, desolate, not a soul in sight.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, the absurdity of it all. One reckless move by the king, who, incidentally, insists it was all part of his master plan. And here we are, lords of an empty bunker in the middle of nowhere.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014144"
msgid "So what did we do? We claimed it as our own, naturally. A temporary refuge until we could plot our escape from this miserable rock."
msgstr ""
"그래서 우리가 어떻게 했냐고? 당연히 우리 걸로 삼았지. 이 비참한 암석 행성에서 탈출할 계획을 완성할 때까지 쓸 임시 피난처로 말이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Dears listeners, gather 'round for another tale of cosmic absurdity. You want to know how this "mighty" team of Spacers stumbled upon this Va'ruun bunker?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It all began with the king's insatiable curiosity, or so he claims. One fine day, he decided to tinker with the ship's engine controls, leading to a catastrophic failure that forced us into a crash landing on this godforsaken planet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014143"
msgid "Well, prepare yourselves for a dose of pure lunacy."
msgstr "자, 진짜 멍청한 짓이 뭔지 맛볼 준비를 하시라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, the absurdity of it all. One reckless move by the king, who, incidentally, insists it was all part of his master plan. And here we are, lords of an empty bunker in the middle of nowhere.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111CBCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog00_TheBunker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014142"
