#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: I suppose we are. &&& Malibor: Then this Council has determined the matter resolved. No further action will be taken. &&& Djimal: Andreja will continue to serve in her current capacity, relaying information back to House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you for your understanding.
