#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_Main
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014123"
msgid "And rest assured that we will be keeping a close eye."
msgstr "앞으로도 엄중히 지켜볼 터이니 안심하시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We would not be where we are without you.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: It is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
