#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_Main
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014122"
msgid "Is that not so, Lovek?"
msgstr "안 그렇습니까, 로벡?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
