msgid "None of this is ideal. We would prefer it had never happened."
msgstr "이상적이지는 않지요. 앞으로는 이런 일이 절대 없었으면 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm glad things turned out this way.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
