#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So, we can get away with murder. Good to know.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: This is the last time we will speak of any of this.
