#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, stoic. A penitent citizen making a pilgrimage for redemption.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01410E"
