msgstr "한 걸음씩 차근차근, 알겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, stoic. A penitent citizen making a pilgrimage for redemption. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Pilgrims
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01410D"
msgid "Out here, far from the city, the voice of the Great Serpent is clearer to me."
msgstr "여기, 도시에서 멀리 떨어져 있으니, 위대한 뱀의 목소리가 더 또렷하게 들려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01410C"
msgid "Move along. I'm on duty."
msgstr "비켜. 나 근무 중이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01410B"
msgid "Sorry, I can't talk. I have to keep an eye on these animals."
msgstr "미안, 지금은 말할 수 없어. 이 동물들을 지켜봐야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01410A"
msgid "The roads aren't as safe as they once were."
msgstr "길이 예전만큼 안전하지 않아서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow. (Koza is an alcoholic beverage made from fermented groat's milk) / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014109"
msgid "There's a cup of koza waiting for me at the end of this journey."
msgstr "이 여정의 끝에 코자 한 잔이 기다리고 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014108"
msgid "I'll be grateful to get off my feet for a while."
msgstr "잠시라도 쉴 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014107"
msgid "Groats are really quite gentle."
msgstr "그로트는 정말 꽤 온순해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014106"
msgid "May the Serpent watch over us both."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 저희를 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014105"
msgid "Not much further to go now."
msgstr "이제 거의 다 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014104"
msgid "Good day to you."
msgstr "좋은 하루 보내."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A groat (goat) farmer walking along a road with animals in tow.  / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Farmers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "014103"
msgid "Not a bad evening for a walk."
msgstr "산책하기에 나쁘지 않은 저녁이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: being diplomatic - you're not thrilled with the idea but you're not going to say it out loud / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014100"
msgid "We will all do our best to support House Ka'dic as we move into... a new era."
msgstr "저희는 최선을 다해 카딕 가문을 도울 것입니다. 새로운 시대로 나아가야지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C754
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140E9"
msgid "Hey, look who's back! Did you find Vaeric?"
msgstr "이야, 이게 누구야! 배릭은 찾았어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Heretics must be made Penitent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C754
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140E8"
msgid "Oh, of course you didn't. Because his family executed him as a traitor. A heretic of the highest order."
msgstr "아, 당연히 못 찾았겠지. 자기 가족들한테 반역자 혐의로 처형당했으니까. 최고 명문가의 이단자라니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: My friend the traitor trying out the phrase, but also being puzzled by it. it doesn't make sense to him. / Sad
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry for your loss. I know he was a friend.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry for your loss. I know he was a friend.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C750
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140E7"
msgid "Yes, Vaeric. My friend the traitor. It doesn't seem right, does it?"
msgstr "그래. 배릭... 내 반역자 친구. 이게 도대체가 맞는 말이야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry for your loss. I know he was a friend.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Thinking
