#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140E4"
msgid "Heretics must be made Penitent."
msgstr "이단자는 반드시 회개시켜야 하는 법이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey, look who's back! Did you find Vaeric?|Oh, of course you didn't. Because his family executed him as a traitor. A heretic of the highest order.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, Vaeric. My friend the traitor. It doesn't seem right, does it? 
