#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140E3"
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss. I know he was a friend."
msgstr "고인의 명복을 빌어. 배릭의 친구였다는 거 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think we need to talk about the drinking.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
