msgid "Oh no. Did Bee put you up to this?"
msgstr "아, 진짜. 비가 시켜서 온 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: It's ruining your friendship with Bianca.
