msgid "As much as I appreciate the sentiment, something has to get me through this."
msgstr "생각해주는 마음은 고마운데, 이 상황을 극복할 만한 게 있어야 한다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. PROMPT: Heretics must be made Penitent. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Heretics must be made Penitent. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
