msgstr "예예. 모두가 섬겨야 한다지. 국무성이 지켜볼 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. PROMPT: Heretics must be made Penitent. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think we need to talk about the drinking.
