#. TOPIC: 0111C752
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DF"
msgid "And now if you'll excuse me, I will honor his return to the Great Serpent with a drink."
msgstr "이만 실례하겠어. 술 한 잔으로 위대한 뱀의 품에 돌아간 배릭을 기념해야겠으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. PROMPT: Don't you think you've had enough?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't you think you've had enough?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C748
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DE"
msgid "If I wasn't half way in already, I'd say I'm just getting started."
msgstr "아직 절반도 못 왔는데, 이제 시작이라고 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. PROMPT: Don't you think you've had enough?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: I think we need to talk about the drinking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C748
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DD"
msgid "It's practically an open bar thanks to Vaeric, and I'm inclined to think he knew I was going to need it."
msgstr "배릭 덕분에 사실상 공짜 술이 나오는 셈인데, 이게 필요할 거란 걸 배릭도 알고 있었을 거란 말이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think we need to talk about the drinking. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Oh no. Did Bee put you up to this? |As much as I appreciate the sentiment, something has to get me through this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't you think I know that? She made it quite clear on numerous occasions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C747
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DC"
msgid "It's ruining your friendship with Bianca."
msgstr "비앙카와 쌓은 우정을 망치고 있잖아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey, look who's back! Did you find Vaeric?|Oh, of course you didn't. Because his family executed him as a traitor. A heretic of the highest order.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, that's because I am. Nothing a bottle of koza won't fix.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C74F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DB"
msgid "You look like you're handling it well."
msgstr "참 잘도 추스르고 있는 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: It's ruining your friendship with Bianca.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's ruining your friendship with Bianca.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C746
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140DA"
msgid "Don't you think I know that? She made it quite clear on numerous occasions."
msgstr "그걸 내가 모르겠어? 비앙카도 여러 번 분명하게 말했었단 말이야."

