#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What, like talking to a friend? Well, as you know, one of them was recently executed, and the other isn't speaking to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C743
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D9"
msgid "I understand, but there are better forms of help."
msgstr "이해는 가지만, 더 도움이 될 방식도 있을 텐데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You look like you're handling it well. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Well, that's because I am. Nothing a bottle of koza won't fix.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If I wasn't half way in already, I'd say I'm just getting started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C749
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D8"
msgid "Don't you think you've had enough?"
msgstr "그 정도면 됐다고 생각하지 않아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. PROMPT: I understand, but there are better forms of help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand, but there are better forms of help.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C742
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D7"
msgid "What, like talking to a friend? Well, as you know, one of them was recently executed, and the other isn't speaking to me."
msgstr "뭐, 친구랑 대화하기 같은 거? 댁도 알겠지만, 한 명은 최근에 처형당했고, 다른 한 명은 나한테 말도 안 건단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: Consider using your friendship with Bianca for support instead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Consider using your friendship with Bianca for support instead.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. 
