#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D6"
msgid "You act like we're even on speaking terms."
msgstr "나랑 뭐라도 되는 사이인 것처럼 굴지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. PROMPT: Enjoy the drink. I'll see you around.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Enjoy the drink. I'll see you around.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm worried about your health.
