#. TOPIC: 0111C74A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D5"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr "나중에 보자고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's ruining your friendship with Bianca. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Don't you think I know that? She made it quite clear on numerous occasions. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. |I blew her off when she probably needed someone the most, and for what? |I just... I can't stop, and I can't even bring myself to talk to her anymore.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Have faith, right? Serpent give me strength... All you can spare.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D4"
msgid "The Great Serpent will guide you through this."
msgstr "네가 이겨낼 수 있도록 위대한 뱀께서 인도해주실 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Don't you think I know that? She made it quite clear on numerous occasions.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D3"
msgid "Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her."
msgstr "비앙카는 날 포기했어. 나도 탓하지는 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D2"
msgid "I blew her off when she probably needed someone the most, and for what?"
msgstr "가장 옆에 있어줘야 할 순간에 혼자 내버려 뒀으니, 뭐 어쩌겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent will guide you through this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D1"
msgid "I just... I can't stop, and I can't even bring myself to talk to her anymore."
msgstr "난 그냥... 멈추지도 못하겠고, 더 이상 비랑 대화할 엄두도 못 내겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. PROMPT: I'm worried about your health.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm worried about your health.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C744
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140D0"
msgid "At least somebody is, and you don't even know me. Now, my remaining best friend on the other hand..."
msgstr "누가 걱정해주기는 하네. 그것도 날 알지도 못하는 사람이. 반면에 내 하나 남은 절친은..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's ruining your friendship with Bianca. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Don't you think I know that? She made it quite clear on numerous occasions. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Bianca gave up on me, and I don't blame her. |I blew her off when she probably needed someone the most, and for what? |I just... I can't stop, and I can't even bring myself to talk to her anymore.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You... you're right. She lost Vaeric, too. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CF"
msgid "She needs your support just as much as you need hers."
msgstr "너한테 비의 도움이 필요한 것처럼, 비한테도 네 도움이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. PROMPT: She needs your support just as much as you need hers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She needs your support just as much as you need hers.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C739
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CE"
msgid "You... you're right. She lost Vaeric, too."
msgstr "그... 네 말이 맞아. 비도 배릭을 잃었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. PROMPT: She needs your support just as much as you need hers.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey... Bee...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C739
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CD"
msgid "Great Serpent I've been so selfish. I hope she'll forgive me."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 내가 너무 이기적이었어. 날 용서해주면 좋겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. PROMPT: Just start with a simple hello. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just start with a simple hello. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey... Bee...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C73B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CC"
msgid "You make it sound so easy... but you're right. I have to do something."
msgstr "말은 참 쉽게 하네... 그래도 그 말이 맞아. 뭐라도 해 봐야지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey, look who's back! Did you find Vaeric?|Oh, of course you didn't. Because his family executed him as a traitor. A heretic of the highest order.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You act like we're even on speaking terms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C741
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CB"
msgid "Consider using your friendship with Bianca for support instead."
msgstr "그러는 대신에 비앙카와 쌓은 우정을 활용해서 도움을 부탁해 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Hey... Bee...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Look, I... I'm sorry for how I've been lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C738
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_BiancaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140CA"
msgid "Eggie."
msgstr "에기."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Enjoy the drink. I'll see you around. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: Until we meet again.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At least somebody is, and you don't even know me. Now, my remaining best friend on the other hand...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C745
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140C9"
msgid "I'm worried about your health."
msgstr "네 건강이 걱정돼서 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBiancaLatif: He's dead, Eggie... And I miss him. I miss what we all used to be. &&& HVDazraEgboKazmi: I do, too. Can we start over? Will you give me another chance to clean myself up? I can't do it alone. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraEgboKazmi: There's a first. Let's go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C734
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_BiancaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140C8"
msgid "You know I will, Eggie. Now let's start by getting out of here for once."
msgstr "그럴 거 알잖아. 에기. 일단 여기서 나가는 것부터 시작하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraEgboKazmi: Look, I... I'm sorry for how I've been lately.|I want to do better... and I heard about Vaeric. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: He's dead, Eggie... And I miss him. I miss what we all used to be.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBiancaLatif: You know I will, Eggie. Now let's start by getting out of here for once.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C735
