msgctxt "0140A7"
msgid "No, I actually... I just wanted to know how you're doing."
msgstr "아니, 실은... 그냥 네가 어떻게 지내는지 궁금해서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. PROMPT: All I can say is that you need to move on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All I can say is that you need to move on.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
