#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140A6"
msgid "So the news is true. Vaeric was executed as a traitor."
msgstr "그럼 그 소식이 사실이구나. 배릭이 반역자로 처형당했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to HVDazraEgboKazmi
