#. TOPIC: 0111C722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140A4"
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr "그렇게 된 건 유감이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBiancaLatif: Oh, you're back... Is this about Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So the news is true. Vaeric was executed as a traitor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C72A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0140A3"
msgid "All I can say is that you need to move on."
msgstr "이제 그만 잊고 나아가야 한다는 말밖에 못 해주겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. PROMPT: I simply thought you should know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I simply thought you should know.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBiancaLatif: Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to be alone. I have a lot to... process.
