msgid "Thank you for telling me. I didn't think you would."
msgstr "알려줘서 고마워. 안 그럴 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: He's left Va'ruun'kai. Likely forever.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Grateful
