#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01409F"
msgid "I think we need to talk about the drinking."
msgstr "네 술 문제에 대해 얘기 좀 해야 할 것 같아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I promised I would let you know what I found. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you for telling me, even if it wasn't what I wanted to hear. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to be alone. I have a lot to... process.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right. Here I am thinking only of myself when Eggie...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01409E"
msgid "I know you want to handle this on your own, but you don't have to."
msgstr "혼자 감당하고 싶어하는 건 알지만, 꼭 그럴 필요는 없어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I promised I would let you know what I found. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you for telling me, even if it wasn't what I wanted to hear. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to be alone. I have a lot to... process.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right. Here I am thinking only of myself when Eggie...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01409D"
msgid "Please, I know what you're going through, but don't go through this alone."
msgstr "그러지 마. 네가 얼마나 힘든지는 알지만, 혼자서 감당하면 안 돼."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like you to follow me for awhile.
