#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBiancaLatif: I could really use his friendship right now.
