#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01408A"
msgid "Why did you ever stop hanging out?"
msgstr "왜 어울리지 않게 된 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
