#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C701
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014087"
msgid "Once he was gone, the drinking spiraled, and of course he didn't want to listen to me."
msgstr "배릭이 없으니 술은 더 마셔대고, 당연히 내 말은 들으려 하지도 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. PROMPT: Why did you ever stop hanging out?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBiancaLatif: Yes, you both probably need each other.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C701
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014086"
msgid "I just couldn't deal with it anymore."
msgstr "난 더 이상 견딜 수 없었어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, you both probably need each other. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you. I hope he'll forgive me. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: I could really use his friendship right now.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't think I tried? Eggie's his own problem now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C700
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014085"
msgid "Eggie's the one that needs your help if he has a problem."
msgstr "에기한테 문제가 있다면, 네 도움이 필요할 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, you both probably need each other. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you. I hope he'll forgive me. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: I could really use his friendship right now.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wouldn't be so sure about that. If he did, maybe he would've listened to me by now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014084"
msgid "Eggie could probably use your friendship as well."
msgstr "에기한테도 네 우정이 필요한 걸지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. PROMPT: Eggie could probably use your friendship as well.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Eggie could probably use your friendship as well.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014083"
msgid "I wouldn't be so sure about that. If he did, maybe he would've listened to me by now."
msgstr "난 잘 모르겠는데. 정말로 그랬으면 지금쯤 내 말을 들었겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're welcome. &&& Ukaru: Very much so! But decorum aside, we should brass the tacks, no? &&& Ukaru: So you are here, picking up where I left off, yes? Here. This log should come in handy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are most welcome.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01045E5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014082"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "고맙습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know you want to handle this on your own, but you don't have to. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: You're right. Here I am thinking only of myself when Eggie...|It was always the three of us, you know? |I should talk to him. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's just hope he still sees me as a friend.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014081"
msgid "I'm sure he could use a friendly face right now."
msgstr "지금 그 사람한테는 친구가 필요할 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All I can say is that you need to move on. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: So the news is true. Vaeric was executed as a traitor.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you for telling me. I didn't think you would.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C71F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014080"
msgid "I simply thought you should know."
msgstr "그냥 네가 알아야 할 것 같아서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you handling things after the duel?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407F"
msgid "I wish you put the tranquilizer in my cup. Really, I wish you had."
msgstr "당신이 진정제를 내 컵에 넣었으면 좋았을 텐데. 정말로 그랬더라면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407E"
msgid "I want to be mad at you so badly. I want to blame you for my brother's death, use you as a scapegoat while I drown in koza. But I know that it is no use."
msgstr ""
"당신한테 미친 듯이 화를 내고 싶어. 형을 죽이게 돼서 당신을 비난하고 싶어. 코자를 퍼마시면서 당신을 탓을 하고 싶어. 하지만 이젠 "
"쓸모 없는 일이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: Pfft, what duel? You robbed us of the chance and now I will never hear the end of it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407D"
msgid "I had a decade's worth of chances to stop this from happening, and... forget it. I do not want to talk about this anymore."
msgstr "이런 일이 일어나지 않도록 막을 기회가 무려 10년은 됐을 텐데... 관두자. 더 이상 이 얘기를 하고 싶지 않아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I promised I would let you know what I found. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you for telling me, even if it wasn't what I wanted to hear. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to be alone. I have a lot to... process.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I only have one friend left, and he's a lousy drunk, so thanks for the reminder.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C70E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407C"
msgid "You should be with friends or family."
msgstr "친구들이나 가족과 함께 있는 게 좋을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: Eggie's the one that needs your help if he has a problem.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Eggie's the one that needs your help if he has a problem.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407B"
msgid "You don't think I tried? Eggie's his own problem now."
msgstr "내가 안 해봤겠어? 지금은 에기 본인 문제란 말이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I wish you put the tranquilizer in my cup. Really, I wish you had.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01407A"
msgid "How are you handling things after the duel?"
msgstr "결투 이후로 어떻게 지내고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: Pfft, what duel? You robbed us of the chance and now I will never hear the end of it. |I was ready to die, ready to kill. I was ready! You had no right to interfere like you did. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014079"
msgid "I feel... hopeful. And I also feel that I owe you an apology."
msgstr "나는... 희망이 느껴져. 그리고 당신에게 사과해야 할 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014078"
msgid "Danika was right - the duel was asinine, and we would have regretted it. My pride was hurt, but if I lost Borhal... ah, enough of this sentimental groat shit, just... thank you."
msgstr ""
"다니카의 말이 맞았어. 결투는 어리석었고, 우린 후회했을 거야. 내 자존심은 상했지만, 형을 잃었다면... 아, 이 감정적인 쓸데없는 "
"소리는 그만두고, 그냥... 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "thought" / Depressed
#. PROMPT: Who is Eggie?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who is Eggie?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014077"
msgid "I thought Eggie was one of my best friends. Right alongside Vaeric."
msgstr "에기를 제일 친한 친구라고 생각했어. 배릭이랑 같이 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. PROMPT: Who is Eggie?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014076"
msgid "But he'd rather down a bottle of koza than have one coherent conversation with me."
msgstr "그런데 나랑 제대로 된 대화 하는 것보다 코자 한 병 더 마시는 쪽을 골랐다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. PROMPT: Who is Eggie?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBiancaLatif: Eggie's the one that needs your help if he has a problem.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014075"
msgid "Vaeric was always able to talk him out of \"one more bottle.\" Me? I think he just tuned me out."
msgstr "배릭은 항상 걔가 '한 병 더’라는 말 못하게 말릴 수 있었는데. 난? 그냥 무시하는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Life... goes on, I suppose. |It needed to happen. It needed to happen, right? He was out of control, and the episode with mother's urn... the duel needed to happen.|I feel no joy over it, though. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014074"
msgid "Are you trying to mock me? You were supposed to facilitate the duel, not scuttle it."
msgstr "나를 놀리려는 것이냐? 결투를 도와주기로 해 놓고선, 오히려 방해하려고 하다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: I was a fool, and I thank the Great Serpent that you and Danika took action to stop me. I am ashamed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014073"
msgid "You and Danika only served to fan the flames. There will be another duel soon enough."
msgstr "자네와 다니카는 불길에 부채질하는 짓만 했을 뿐이네. 곧 또 다시 결투가 일어나겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you handling things after the duel?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014072"
msgid "Life... goes on, I suppose."
msgstr "인생은 계속되는 법이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014071"
msgid "It needed to happen. It needed to happen, right? He was out of control, and the episode with mother's urn... the duel needed to happen."
msgstr ""
"벌어져야 했던 일이야. 그래야만 했지, 그렇지? 녀석은 통제 불능이었고, 어머니의 유골함에 손을 대고... 결투는 벌어져야 했던 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Are you trying to mock me? You were supposed to facilitate the duel, not scuttle it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014070"
msgid "I feel no joy over it, though."
msgstr "물론 즐거움은 전혀 느껴지지 않는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I wish you put the tranquilizer in my cup. Really, I wish you had.|I want to be mad at you so badly. I want to blame you for my brother's death, use you as a scapegoat while I drown in koza. But I know that it is no use.|I had a decade's worth of chances to stop this from happening, and... forget it. I do not want to talk about this anymore.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406F"
msgid "Pfft, what duel? You robbed us of the chance and now I will never hear the end of it."
msgstr "*피식하는 소리* 무슨 결투? 당신은 우리한테서 그 기회를 빼앗았고, 이제 영영 그 소리만 듣겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAmilaAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I feel... hopeful. And I also feel that I owe you an apology. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406E"
msgid "I was ready to die, ready to kill. I was ready! You had no right to interfere like you did."
msgstr "난 죽을 준비가 되어 있었어, 죽일 준비가 되어 있었어. 준비됐었다고! 당신이 그렇게 끼어들 일이 아니었단 말이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAmilaAdlam: I wish you put the tranquilizer in my cup. Really, I wish you had.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AmilaAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406D"
msgid "How are you handling things after the duel?"
msgstr "결투 이후로 어떻게 지내고 있나요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, you both probably need each other. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you. I hope he'll forgive me. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: I could really use his friendship right now.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I thought Eggie was one of my best friends. Right alongside Vaeric.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406C"
msgid "Who is Eggie?"
msgstr "에기가 누구지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. PROMPT: I'm sure he could use a friendly face right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure he could use a friendly face right now.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C703
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406B"
msgid "Let's just hope he still sees me as a friend."
msgstr "걔가 아직 날 친구로 여겨주면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B28
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01406A"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고맙습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBorhalAdlam: Are you trying to mock me? You were supposed to facilitate the duel, not scuttle it. |You and Danika only served to fan the flames. There will be another duel soon enough. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014069"
msgid "I was a fool, and I thank the Great Serpent that you and Danika took action to stop me. I am ashamed."
msgstr "내가 바보였어. 자네와 다니카가 나를 막기 위해 나서 주셨다니 위대한 뱀에게 감사를 드려야겠네. 수치스럽구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014068"
msgid "Yet, somehow, there was one blessing that came out of this travesty -- I apologized to Amila for challenging him, and he apologized to me, and I... well, I believed him."
msgstr ""
"그러나 어찌 된 일인지, 그 비극 속에서도 축복이 찾아온 것 같군. 아밀라에게 결투를 신청한 것에 대해 사과했고, 동생 녀석도 내게 "
"사과했네. 그리고 난... 글쎄, 걔를 믿었고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBorhalAdlam
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C5F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_BorhalAdlam_PostMS03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014067"
msgid "I feel hopeful for his future for the first time in so many years."
msgstr "지난 몇 년 이후 처음으로 내 동생의 미래에 희망이 느껴지기 시작했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraBiancaLatif: Thank you. I hope he'll forgive me.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Eggie's the one that needs your help if he has a problem.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C6FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014066"
msgid "I could really use his friendship right now."
msgstr "지금 당장 그 우정이 필요할 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014065"
msgid "I heard about Vaeric. The State certainly makes no exceptions."
msgstr "배릭 씨에 대해 들었어요. 국무성은 예외를 둘 수 없었겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014064"
msgid "The Ministry of State knows no bounds when Viktor sees to his own son's execution."
msgstr "빅토르가 자기 아들 처형을 준비한 걸 보니 국무성은 한계를 모르나 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014063"
msgid "It's good to see Vaeric back."
msgstr "배릭 씨가 돌아와서 반갑네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014062"
msgid "With Vaeric back, I hope he plans on settling his tab."
msgstr "이제 배릭 씨가 돌아왔으니, 외상을 갚을 계획을 세워주시면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014061"
msgid "You realize you convinced two of my best customers to leave... but I can't blame them."
msgstr "제 최고의 고객 두 분을 떠나게 만든 거 아시겠지요... 그분들을 탓할 수는 없겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014060"
msgid "Sure seems quiet around here since I lost some of my regulars."
msgstr "단골 손님이 없어진 뒤 가게가 조용해졌네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405F"
msgid "I hope you wouldn't have anything to with the extra pair of eyes on me these days."
msgstr "요즘 저를 감시하는 시선이 많아져서 불편을 느끼지 않으셨으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405E"
msgid "Things are much quieter here since House Veth'aal took over."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 장악한 뒤로 가게가 훨씬 조용해졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405D"
msgid "Things are much quieter here since House Dul'kehf took over."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 장악한 뒤로 가게가 훨씬 조용해졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405C"
msgid "Things have picked up a bit since House Ka'dic took over."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 장악한 뒤로 상황이 조금 나아진 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405B"
msgid "Hard to tell how the Crusade will affect business."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 사업에 어떤 영향을 미칠지 장담하기 어렵네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GennaDubari_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01405A"
msgid "I'm expecting an uptick in business with the Serpent's Crusade... I only hope once it's started, I still have customers left to serve."
msgstr "뱀의 성전으로 사업이 활기를 띨 거라 기대했는데... 일단 시작되고 나서도 손님이 남아 있기나 했으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014059"
msgid "We have survived, but at such a great cost."
msgstr "저희는 살아남았지만, 대가가 너무나 크군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014058"
msgid "Perhaps some day I will not be surprised to see the Citadel missing from the skyline."
msgstr "언젠가는 지평선에 성채가 보이지 않는다는 사실이 놀랍지 않게 될 지도 모르지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014057"
msgid "The disaster of the Citadel is behind us, but the Crusade now looms ahead."
msgstr "성채의 재앙은 지나갔지만, 이제 성전이 다가오고 있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014056"
msgid "I personally do not relish the thought of war with the Settled Systems, but if the Serpent demands it of us..."
msgstr "제 개인적으로는 개척 성계와 전쟁을 한다는 생각이 마음에 들지 않지만, 위대한 뱀께서 요구하신다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: being diplomatic - you're not thrilled with the idea but you're not going to say it out loud / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014054"
msgid "Being appointed Speaker will no doubt put all of Razma's skills to the test."
msgstr "대변자로 임명된다면 분명 라즈마의 모든 능력이 시험대에 오를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: being diplomatic - you're not thrilled with the idea but you're not going to say it out loud / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014053"
msgid "House Veth'aal will bring all of its considerable fervor to bear now that Viktor is Speaker. I hope it will benefit us."
msgstr "빅토르가 대변자가 되었으니 베타알 가문이 그 열정을 최대한 발휘하겠지요. 그 열정이 저희에게 도움이 되길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: being diplomatic - you're not thrilled with the idea but you're not going to say it out loud / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014052"
msgid "We stand ready to support House Veth'aal in whatever efforts they pursue."
msgstr "저희는 베타알 가문이 수행하는 모든 활동을 지원할 준비가 되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014051"
msgid "With the Serpent's Crusade in front of us, none are perhaps best suited to lead than House Veth'aal."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 눈 앞에 있으니, 지도자를 맡기에 베타알 가문보다 더 나은 가문은 없을지도 모르지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014050"
msgid "House Dul'kehf is truly honored to lead."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 지도자를 맡게 되어 진정 영광입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01404F"
msgid "Greetings, Harbinger."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01404E"
msgid "Brethren."
msgstr "교우님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01404D"
msgid "Hello, Sister."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 자매님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01404C"
msgid "Hello, Brother."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 형제님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
