#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014045"
msgid "Promised."
msgstr "약속받은 자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014044"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014043"
msgid "May the Great Serpent protect you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 보호하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014042"
msgid "Serpent bless you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014041"
msgid "Hopefully more follow in your stead, and come to accept the Great Serpent."
msgstr "당신을 따라 위대한 뱀을 받아들이는 이들이 더 많아지기를 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014040"
msgid "There is no end to the work ahead of us. But we are steeled for it."
msgstr "앞으로 할 일은 끝이 없습니다. 하지만 우린 단단히 준비되어 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403F"
msgid "All that we need is here before us. We should not reach too far, too quickly."
msgstr "필요한 모든 것이 우리 앞에 있습니다. 너무 멀리, 너무 빨리 뻗으려 해선 안 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403E"
msgid "Perhaps you've encountered some of our... external partners, without even realizing it."
msgstr "어쩌면 당신은 우리... 외부 협력자 중 일부를 만났을지도 모릅니다. 자신도 모르는 사이에 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403D"
msgid "The Ministry of Commerce exists to serve, as do we all."
msgstr "상무성은 섬기기 위해 존재하며, 우리 모두가 그렇습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403C"
msgid "In time, I hope we can find new lodging. The Halls of Healing can be quite distracting."
msgstr "때가 되면 새 숙소를 찾을 수 있기를 바랍니다. 회복의 전당은 꽤나 정신이 없어서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403B"
msgid "So many records have been lost. We may never be able to fully recover them."
msgstr "너무 많은 기록이 유실되었습니다. 우리가 완전히 복구하지 못할 수도 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01403A"
msgid "There has never been a greater need for the steady flow of supplies."
msgstr "그 어느 때보다도 안정적인 물자 조달이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014039"
msgid "You are comfortable coming and going? I have never left Va'ruun'kai, and have no wish to."
msgstr "오가는 게 편하신가 보군요? 전 바룬카이를 떠난 적이 없고, 그럴 생각도 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014038"
msgid "It is inspiring to see that you have walked the Serpent's Path."
msgstr "당신이 뱀의 길을 걸었다는 것은 고무적이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014037"
msgid "Despite all that we have gone through, we cannot appear weak to those outside House Va'ruun."
msgstr "우리가 겪은 모든 일에도 불구하고, 바룬 가문 밖의 사람들에게 약한 모습을 보여선 안 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014036"
msgid "House Dul'kehf works to benefit all of the Promised equally."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 모든 약속받은 자에게 공평하게 이익이 되도록 일합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014035"
msgid "Hasmak should be around someplace, if you need him."
msgstr "필요하다면 해즈막이 근처에 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014034"
msgid "So many projects over the years, all needing supplies and resources. It never ends."
msgstr "수년에 걸쳐 너무 많은 프로젝트가 있었고, 모두 물품과 자원을 필요로 합니다. 끝이 없지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014033"
msgid "It is reassuring to know that you are working to resolve our situation."
msgstr "우리가 처한 상황을 해결하기 위해 당신이 애쓰고 있다는 사실이 든든하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014032"
msgid "We do what we can to support Hasmak as the new Elder."
msgstr "우리는 새 장로인 해즈막을 지원하기 위해 최선을 다하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014031"
msgid "I am glad the information about Ma'leen Dam was useful."
msgstr "마린 댐에 대한 정보가 유용했다니 기쁩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014030"
msgid "We must be sure to properly archive information about these Vortex Interlocks."
msgstr "이 볼텍스 제어장치에 대한 정보를 적절히 기록해 두어야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402F"
msgid "The loss of the Abbas farm is unfortunate."
msgstr "아바스 농장을 잃은 건 유감입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402E"
msgid "Food sources were a priority even before the incident at the dam. Now there is even more to be done."
msgstr "댐 사고 이전에도 식량 확보가 최우선 과제였는데, 이제 할 일이 더 많아졌습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402D"
msgid "While I have no issue with it, there are some who question House Ka'dic's priorities."
msgstr "저는 문제가 없지만, 카딕 가문의 우선순위에 의문을 제기하는 사람들이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402C"
msgid "We can only hope that things will not change too greatly under Razma's guidance."
msgstr "라즈마의 지휘 아래 상황이 크게 변하지 않기만을 바랄 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402B"
msgid "House Dul'kehf is the most logical choice to govern, in light of all that has happened."
msgstr "일어난 모든 일을 고려할 때 둘케프 가문이 통치하는 것이 가장 논리적인 선택입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01402A"
msgid "Hasmak will prove himself a most capable, reasoned Speaker."
msgstr "해즈막은 매우 유능하고 합리적인 대변자임을 입증할 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014029"
msgid "Adjustments must be made to supply lines to accommodate the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "뱀의 성전군을 수용하기 위해 보급선을 조정해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly.  Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014028"
msgid "We must drastically improve our armament stockpiles for the coming Crusade."
msgstr "다가올 성전을 위해 무기 비축량을 대폭 개선해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Dul'kehf greeting. Polite, business friendly. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericExecutors_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014027"
msgid "Contingencies are already being put in place. It is likely that we will lose some of our suppliers once the Crusade becomes apparent."
msgstr "이미 비상 대책을 마련하고 있습니다. 성전이 가시화되면 일부 보급선을 잃을 가능성이 큽니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014026"
msgid "Maybe Amila Adlam can finally find peace next to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "아밀라 애들럼이 마침내 위대한 뱀 곁에서 안식을 찾을 수 있기를."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014025"
msgid "Hard to believe Borhal is gone."
msgstr "보할이 떠났다니 믿기 어렵군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014024"
msgid "We have served faithfully since the beginning of House Va'ruun, and will continue to do so."
msgstr "저희는 바룬 가문이 설립되었을 때부터 충실히 섬겨 왔고, 앞으로도 계속 그럴 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014023"
msgid "Hasmak will bring a unique composure and poise to the role of Speaker. I believe we have chosen very well."
msgstr "해즈막 님은 특유의 평정심과 침착함을 가지고 대변자 역할을 맡으실 겁니다. 아주 잘 선택했다고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014022"
msgid "Nice ship you got here, but I'm not leaving Va'ruun'kai until we find Vaeric."
msgstr "좋은 배인데, 배릭을 찾기 전에는 바룬카이를 떠나지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014021"
msgid "If you're leaving, I'll head back to the Herald's Rest."
msgstr "떠날 참인가? 나는 전령의 안식처로 돌아가겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014020"
msgid "If you're leaving, I'll hang back here."
msgstr "떠날 참인가, 나는 여기 남겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401F"
msgid "If you have some off world business to take care of, I can wait at the Herald's Rest till you're back."
msgstr "외부 세계에서 할 일이 있다면 자네가 돌아올 때까지 전령의 안식처에서 기다릴 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401E"
msgid "If you have some off world business to take care of, I can wait here till you're back."
msgstr "외부 세계에서 할 일이 있다면 자네가 돌아올 때까지 여기서 기다릴 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401D"
msgid "I'm going to stick around here until we find Vaeric. You go do what you gotta do."
msgstr "우리가 배릭을 찾을 때까지 난 여기서 지낼 거네. 자넨 할 일을 하러 가도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111C824
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401C"
msgid "I won't leave this rock till we can locate Vaeric."
msgstr "배릭이 어디 있는지 알기 전까진 행성을 떠나지 않을 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401B"
msgid "Hey, let's chat."
msgstr "이봐, 이야기나 나누자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01401A"
msgid "You looking for me?"
msgstr "날 찾으셨나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014019"
msgid "Come on, don't be shy."
msgstr "어이, 부끄러워하지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014018"
msgid "Another day in Dazra."
msgstr "또 다즈라의 하루가 시작됐군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014017"
msgid "A drink or two oughta lighten this mood."
msgstr "한두 잔 마시면 기분이 한결 가벼워질 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "014016"
msgid "Hope things start looking up soon around here."
msgstr "여기도 곧 상황이 좋아졌으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious, a bit suspicious / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry, I know exactly where to find your stolen heirlooms.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry, I know exactly where to find your stolen heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll stay a while and pray while my wounds heal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111BB7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014015"
msgid "Oh? I won't ask how you know this. If you were secretly a Spacer, I doubt you'd be helping me."
msgstr "오? 그걸 어떻게 아는지는 묻지 않을게요. 당신이 몰래 스페이서 활동을 했다면, 절 도와주진 않았겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh? I won't ask how you know this. If you were secretly a Spacer, I doubt you'd be helping me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111BB80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014014"
msgid "Don't worry, I know exactly where to find your stolen heirlooms."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 도둑맞은 가보가 어디 있는지 정확히 알고 있으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't worry, I know exactly where to find your stolen heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014013"
msgid "It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching."
msgstr "녀석들 본거지인 시설은 꽤 크니, 샅샅이 뒤져봐야 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: None at all. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Sherine, dear, would you tell our dauntless research assistant about the latest news? &&& SherineDubas: With pleasure. &&& SherineDubas: I hope you enjoyed your little jaunt into the field, because I'll be sending you right back out there.|Some of the local farmers and groat-herders have reported seeing unusual plant growth in the area.|What's more, none of this unusual growth was seen before the Dazra incident.|It's increasingly clear the event affected the ecosystem in some way, but the details elude us.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's an interesting theory, but let's not jump to any conclusions just yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0111BB84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014012"
msgid "It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them."
msgstr "간단합니다. 식물이 독성을 띠고 있어서 그걸 먹은 동물들이 중독된 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Skeptical but polite / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Based on our information, these unusual new strains aren't limited to a specific area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0111BB83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014011"
msgid "That's an interesting theory, but let's not jump to any conclusions just yet."
msgstr "흥미로운 가설이지만, 성급하게 결론을 내리지는 말자고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected. &&& AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit. &&& AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised. &&& AzadDubas: Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Have you, now?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0111BB82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014010"
msgid "Oh, I have a pretty good idea."
msgstr "아, 짐작 가는 게 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Oh, I have a pretty good idea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0111BB81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400F"
msgid "Have you, now?"
msgstr "정말이세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Enthusiastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Oh, I have a pretty good idea.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: It seems that certain local species of flora have suddenly become extremely toxic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0111BB81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400E"
msgid "Well, I'll share my conclusions and we'll see if they align with your hypothesis."
msgstr "제 결론을 말씀드리면, 그게 당신 가설과 일치하는지 알 수 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well, look who it is. &&& Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment. &&& Ekris: To what do I owe the honor, Harbinger?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At the moment? Obviously a great deal of nothing. Have the High Council to thank for that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400D"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. PROMPT: What's going on here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400C"
msgid "This does not concern you."
msgstr "당신이 상관할 바 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't it against the rules for you not to accept an apology from Amila?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Isn't it against the rules for you not to accept an apology from Amila?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400B"
msgid "It would be, if Amila weren't a habitual liar, deceiver, and cheater. As I said before, an apology from him is less than worthless -- he has apologized countless times for a decade, only to continue stabbing me in the back."
msgstr ""
"아밀라가 상습적인 거짓말쟁이, 협잡꾼, 사기꾼만 아니었다면 사과를 받아들였을 거네. 앞서 말했듯이, 놈의 사과를 받아 봐야 전혀 의미가 "
"없어. 동생은 10년 동안 수없이 사과했지만, 그 뒤에 계속 내 뒤통수를 때렸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Enough of your sanctimony. He knew the risks and accepted a fair duel. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01400A"
msgid "You should be ashamed. This was barbaric."
msgstr "부끄러운 줄 아십쇼. 야만스러운 짓이잖습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can hardly believe it myself, but Amila was out of control. What happened today was inevitable. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014009"
msgid "I can't believe you actually did that."
msgstr "정말로 그러실 줄은 몰랐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It would be, if Amila weren't a habitual liar, deceiver, and cheater. As I said before, an apology from him is less than worthless -- he has apologized countless times for a decade, only to continue stabbing me in the back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014008"
msgid "Isn't it against the rules for you not to accept an apology from Amila?"
msgstr "아밀라의 사과를 받아들이지 않으면 결투 규칙 위반인 거 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't believe you actually did that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't believe you actually did that.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014007"
msgid "I can hardly believe it myself, but Amila was out of control. What happened today was inevitable."
msgstr "나도 거의 믿을 수 없지만, 아밀라는 자제심을 잃은 지 오래였어. 오늘 벌어진 일은 불가피했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should be ashamed. This was barbaric.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should be ashamed. This was barbaric.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111BFA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014006"
msgid "Enough of your sanctimony. He knew the risks and accepted a fair duel."
msgstr "위선적인 말은 그만하시지. 놈은 위험을 알고 있었고 공정한 결투를 받아들였다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014005"
msgid "The duel is fast approaching, and you've witness the brothers' stubbornness. Their minds are made up, and they are ready to die."
msgstr "결투가 금방 시작되려고 해요. 두 형제가 고집불통인 건 보셨겠죠. 다들 마음 먹은 것 같아요. 서로 죽을 각오가 된 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014004"
msgid "I know that it will not. You have to trust me, I know that this way is the only way."
msgstr "불공평한 건 알지만 제 말을 믿어 주셔야 해요. 이 방법 밖에는 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& Danika: Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats.  &&& Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. |Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel. |As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this.  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014003"
msgid "Are you sure this is the only way? This seems risky."
msgstr "이게 유일한 방법인 게 확실한가요? 위험해 보이는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& Danika: Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats.  &&& Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. |Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel. |As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this.  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014002"
msgid "How are you so sure that this won't backfire?"
msgstr "이게 역효과가 없을 거라고 어떻게 확신하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014001"
msgid "It seems that after years of suffering Amila's embarrassments, Borhal has reached a boiling point. But still, to challenge your brother to a duel..."
msgstr ""
"아밀라가 몇 년 동안이나 계속 창피한 모습을 보인 끝에, 보할도 더 이상 참지 못했던 것 같아요. 그래도 같은 형제한테 결투를 "
"신청하다뇨..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: This is it. Shall we begin our duties? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "014000"
msgid "I pray that we will be able to work towards a peaceful resolution before it is too late."
msgstr "부디 더 늦기 전에 우리가 최대한 평화적인 결말을 이룩하기를 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFF"
msgid "Amila Adlam's death was predictable. He never stood a chance against his brother."
msgstr "애들럼가의 아밀라는 예상대로 죽었군. 자기 형을 이길 가망은 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFE"
msgid "If Amila did not die in the duel with his brother, he would have died drunk on the street."
msgstr "아밀라가 자기 형과의 결투에서 죽지 않았더라도, 길거리에서 술에 쩔어 죽었을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFD"
msgid "Amila was a troublemaker, but no one deserves to die the way he did."
msgstr "아밀라는 골칫거리였지만, 그래도 그런 식으로 죽을 사람은 아니었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFC"
msgid "I cannot believe Borhal is gone. I never would have expected him to lose to Amila."
msgstr "보할이 죽다니 믿을 수 없어. 아밀라에게 질 줄은 상상도 못 했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFB"
msgid "Borhal was a friend to the city, and he will be missed."
msgstr "보할은 이 도시에 살던 친구였는데, 그 친구가 그리울 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FFA"
msgid "Amila is always so drunk he can scarcely hold himself together, let alone a knife. How did Borhal lose?"
msgstr "아밀라는 항상 술에 취해 자기 몸도 제대로 가누지 못하는데, 어떻게 칼을 들고 보할을 이겼지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FF9"
msgid "Looks like the Adlam duel fell through. Amila does not realize how lucky he is."
msgstr "애들럼가의 결투는 무산된 것 같군. 아밀라는 자기가 얼마나 운이 좋은지 모를 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FF8"
msgid "Glad to see that the Adlam duel ended peacefully. Well, at least for now."
msgstr "애들럼가의 결투가 평화롭게 끝나서 다행이야. 뭐, 적어도 지금은 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PostMS03_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013FF7"
msgid "Borhal seemed dead-set on dueling his brother. I wonder what happened..."
msgstr "보할은 자기 형과 결투를 할 생각에 사로잡혀 있는 것 같았는데. 무슨 일이 있었던 거지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FF3"
msgid "We just got another report from one of the groat farms."
msgstr "그로트 목장에서 방금 또 보고가 들어왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Merciful Serpent. Whatever this is, it seems to be spreading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FF2"
msgid "More dead animals. Bladed backs this time. No signs of injury."
msgstr "또 동물이 죽었어. 이번에는 칼날등줄기야. 외상은 보이지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried, open with a sigh / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: We just got another report from one of the groat farms.|More dead animals. Bladed backs this time. No signs of injury.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FF1"
msgid "Merciful Serpent. Whatever this is, it seems to be spreading."
msgstr "자비로운 뱀이시여. 뭔진 모르겠지만, 이 현상이 점점 퍼지고 있는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / Concerned / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Nothing. And I'm not really surprised, in light of recent events.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FF0"
msgid "Still no word from the city about a research assistant?"
msgstr "아직 도시에서 연구 보조원을 보냈다고 연락이 안 왔나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Consoling / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Merciful Serpent. Whatever this is, it seems to be spreading.|Still no word from the city about a research assistant? &&& AzadDubas: Nothing. And I'm not really surprised, in light of recent events.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FEF"
msgid "Be patient, dear. The Serpent provides."
msgstr "기다려 봐요. 여보. 위대한 뱀께서 보살펴 주실 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Exasperated / Worried / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: We just got another report from one of the groat farms.|More dead animals. Bladed backs this time. No signs of injury. &&& SherineDubas: Merciful Serpent. Whatever this is, it seems to be spreading.|Still no word from the city about a research assistant?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Be patient, dear. The Serpent provides.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 0111BB86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStationIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FEE"
msgid "Nothing. And I'm not really surprised, in light of recent events."
msgstr "연락이 없었어. 최근에 일어난 사건들을 감안하면 놀랍지도 않지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Consoling / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra? &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FED"
msgid "In all likelihood, yes."
msgstr "틀림없이, 그럴 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FEC"
msgid "Even those we see as heroes are still just people."
msgstr "영웅으로 추앙받는 이들도 결국 똑같은 사람일 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / Somber / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra? &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FEB"
msgid "I'm not saying it gets any easier, but eventually you just learn to live with it."
msgstr "쉽다고 말할 순 없지만, 결국엔 그냥 그렇게 사는 법을 배우게 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fatherly, consoling / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra? &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FEA"
msgid "It's hard at first, but then you think about all the lives your saving, and it kind of evens out."
msgstr "처음엔 힘들지만, 당신이 구할 수많은 생명을 생각하면, 결국 가치 있는 일이 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra? &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE9"
msgid "You're a light for your people in a dark time."
msgstr "당신은 어두운 시대를 살아가는 이곳 사람들에게 한 줄기 빛이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE8"
msgid "Perhaps your example will inspire others to take up the fight."
msgstr "당신이 모범을 보여주셨으니 다른 사람들에게도 분투를 계속할 용기가 생겼을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Recalling her name / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do. &&& companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE7"
msgid "Andreja, was it? That is well said."
msgstr "안드레자, 맞죠? 정말 말 잘하셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE6"
msgid "I've spent nearly my while idolizing Mahkara."
msgstr "저는 거의 평생 마카라 님을 우상으로 여기며 살아왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE5"
msgid "It's easy to forget she was once not so different from me."
msgstr "마카라 님도 한때는 저와 별반 다르지 않았다는 걸 잊기 쉽죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Warm, friendly / Friendly / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE4"
msgid "But what of yourself? I'm glad you two are still traveling together."
msgstr "그런데 여러분은 어때요? 두 분이 아직도 함께 여행하고 있다니 기쁘네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do. &&& companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE3"
msgid "You're Barrett, right?"
msgstr "배럿, 맞죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned, somber / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE2"
msgid "I suppose that's as much as I can hope for."
msgstr "제가 바랄 수 있는 건 그 정도겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE1"
msgid "Perhaps I should find a companion and be a team like the two of you."
msgstr "저도 두 분처럼 팀을 이룰 동료를 찾아봐야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FE0"
msgid "Does that add some humor and levity to your travels? To have someone to talk to?"
msgstr "그런 식으로 유머와 재치를 더하며 여행하시는 건가요? 누군가와 함께 대화하면서요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do. &&& companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDF"
msgid "It's Sam, right?"
msgstr "샘, 맞죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDE"
msgid "What you say makes good sense."
msgstr "당신 말, 정말 일리가 있네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Determined / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDD"
msgid "From now on, I will focus on the help I can provide and I will not give in to doubt."
msgstr "이제부터는 제가 도움을 베풀 수 있는 것에 집중하고, 의심에 빠지지 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDC"
msgid "I admit, I'm a little envious."
msgstr "솔직히, 조금 부럽네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDB"
msgid "I'd like to have a traveling companion who offers encouragement in he way that you do."
msgstr "저도 당신처럼 격려를 아끼지 않는 동료와 함께 여행하고 싶어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.|I thought there would be more glory and less blood.|I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path. |I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do. &&& companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FDA"
msgid "You are Sarah, yes? I had not meant to be an example to anyone."
msgstr "사라, 맞죠? 누군가의 모범이 되려고 했던 건 아니었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD9"
msgid "And yet, was not Mahkara the Fang an example to me?"
msgstr "하지만, 아직 송곳니의 마카라 님은 제게 모범이잖아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A dawning realization, feeling encouraged / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD8"
msgid "Perhaps you're right. Maybe I really can inspire others to have hope."
msgstr "어쩌면 당신 말이 맞을지도 몰라요. 제가 정말 다른 사람들에게 희망을 줄 수 있을지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD7"
msgid "Maybe I should seek a companion who can offer my new perspectives as you do."
msgstr "당신처럼 제게 새로운 관점을 제시해 줄 수 있는 동료를 찾아봐야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a chuckle or soft laugh. Friendly. Maaliya = mah-LEE-yuh. / Friendly / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.|And yes, we are still working together. There is safety in numbers. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD6"
msgid "Thank you for the compliment, Maaliya. Perhaps when I am older."
msgstr "칭찬 고마워요. 말리야. 아마 제가 나이가 더 들면 그렇게 될지도 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a chuckle, she said something funny. Maaliya = mah-LEE-yuh. / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: Yeah, sure. My sidekick here is pretty good company, I guess. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Then it's settled. I will follow your example and find a sidekick of my own.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD5"
msgid "I'd apply for that job in a second, Maaliya, but I'm already booked."
msgstr "말리야, 저도 당장 그 자리에 지원하고 싶지만, 이미 꽉 찼어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Warm. Maaliya = mah-LEE-yuh. / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: Well, you know, I have my uses. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD4"
msgid "Your Sam is out there somewhere, Maaliya, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "말리야, 당신의 조력자 샘은 어딘가에 있을 겁니다. 분명히요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly. Maaliya = mah-LEE-yuh / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I recommend it. Traveling with others can be illuminating. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD3"
msgid "Good luck, Maaliya."
msgstr "행운을 빌어요. 말리야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, playful / Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.|I've spent nearly my while idolizing Mahkara.|It's easy to forget she was once not so different from me.|But what of yourself? I'm glad you two are still traveling together. &&& companion: I'm well, thank you for asking.|And yes, we are still working together. There is safety in numbers.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Thank you for the compliment, Maaliya. Perhaps when I am older.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD2"
msgid "Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know."
msgstr "또 현명한 말씀을 해주시는군요. 당신, 철학자가 될 수도 있겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly. / Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: You're Barrett, right?|I suppose that's as much as I can hope for.|Perhaps I should find a companion and be a team like the two of you. |Does that add some humor and levity to your travels? To have someone to talk to? &&& companion: Yeah, sure. My sidekick here is pretty good company, I guess.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Thank you for the compliment, Maaliya. Perhaps when I am older.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD1"
msgid "Then it's settled. I will follow your example and find a sidekick of my own."
msgstr "그럼 결정됐네요. 저도 당신 본보기를 따라 제 조력자를 찾아야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Encouraged, eager / Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It's Sam, right?|What you say makes good sense.|From now on, I will focus on the help I can provide and I will not give in to doubt.|I admit, I'm a little envious.|I'd like to have a traveling companion who offers encouragement in he way that you do. &&& companion: Well, you know, I have my uses.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Thank you for the compliment, Maaliya. Perhaps when I am older.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FD0"
msgid "Now I have a new purpose. I must find my own Sam."
msgstr "이제 제게 새로운 목표가 생겼어요. 저만의 조력자 샘을 찾을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Warm, friendly, a soft chuckle to open / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: You are Sarah, yes? I had not meant to be an example to anyone.|And yet, was not Mahkara the Fang an example to me?|Perhaps you're right. Maybe I really can inspire others to have hope.|Maybe I should seek a companion who can offer my new perspectives as you do. &&& companion: I recommend it. Traveling with others can be illuminating.
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Thank you for the compliment, Maaliya. Perhaps when I am older.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCF"
msgid "I can always use a little more of that in my life."
msgstr "제 삶에 그런 게 조금 더 있다면 언제든 환영이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Andreja, was it? That is well said.|I've spent nearly my while idolizing Mahkara.|It's easy to forget she was once not so different from me.|But what of yourself? I'm glad you two are still traveling together.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCE"
msgid "I'm well, thank you for asking."
msgstr "잘 지내고 있어요. 물어봐 줘서 고마워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite, friendly.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCD"
msgid "And yes, we are still working together. There is safety in numbers."
msgstr "그리고 예, 우린 여전히 함께하고 있어요. 여럿이 모이면 더 안전하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a chuckle, this is a joke
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: You're Barrett, right?|I suppose that's as much as I can hope for.|Perhaps I should find a companion and be a team like the two of you. |Does that add some humor and levity to your travels? To have someone to talk to?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCC"
msgid "Yeah, sure. My sidekick here is pretty good company, I guess."
msgstr "예, 맞습니다. 제 조력자가 꽤 좋은 친구거든요. 아마도요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Blushing a little at an unexpected compliment, but also smirking and cocky
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It's Sam, right?|What you say makes good sense.|From now on, I will focus on the help I can provide and I will not give in to doubt.|I admit, I'm a little envious.|I'd like to have a traveling companion who offers encouragement in he way that you do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCB"
msgid "Well, you know, I have my uses."
msgstr "뭐, 알다시피, 전 꽤 유능합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: In all likelihood, yes.|Even those we see as heroes are still just people. &&& NPC_MaalyaHajtal: You are Sarah, yes? I had not meant to be an example to anyone.|And yet, was not Mahkara the Fang an example to me?|Perhaps you're right. Maybe I really can inspire others to have hope.|Maybe I should seek a companion who can offer my new perspectives as you do.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Wise words yet again. You could be a philosopher, you know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C4EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FCA"
msgid "I recommend it. Traveling with others can be illuminating."
msgstr "저도 추천해요. 다른 사람들과 함께 여행하면 꽤 많은 걸 깨닫게 되거든요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is the Captain, tasked with the dubious honor of documenting the supposed greatness of our illustrious Spacer "King". Honestly, I'd rather be swabbing the hull than glorifying his every move in these blasted audio logs.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's not that I don't respect the king's authority, but spending my time recounting his supposed triumphs feels like a waste of valuable plundering hours. I'd much rather be out there, seizing riches and exploring uncharted territories than pandering to the ego of one man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC9"
msgid "But orders are orders, and the king demands to be immortalized for posterity."
msgstr "하지만 명령은 명령이니까. 킹께서는 자기 이름을 후대에 길이길이 남기라 요구하시었다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's not that I don't respect the king's authority, but spending my time recounting his supposed triumphs feels like a waste of valuable plundering hours. I'd much rather be out there, seizing riches and exploring uncharted territories than pandering to the ego of one man.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC8"
msgid "Nevertheless, duty calls, and so I shall comply. But mark my words, these audio logs will be a testament not only to the king's supposed greatness but also to my unyielding patience in carrying out this tiresome task. The Captain, signing off."
msgstr ""
"그럼에도 의무가 부여됐으니, 나는 따르리라. 하지만 내 말을 명심해라. 이 음성 기록은 킹의 그 잘난 위업뿐만 아니라 이 지루한 임무를 "
"수행하는 나의 불굴의 인내심을 증명하는 증서가 될 거다. 선장, 통신 종료."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But orders are orders, and the king demands to be immortalized for posterity.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Nevertheless, duty calls, and so I shall comply. But mark my words, these audio logs will be a testament not only to the king's supposed greatness but also to my unyielding patience in carrying out this tiresome task. The Captain, signing off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD15
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC7"
msgid "It's not that I don't respect the king's authority, but spending my time recounting his supposed triumphs feels like a waste of valuable plundering hours. I'd much rather be out there, seizing riches and exploring uncharted territories than pandering to the ego of one man."
msgstr ""
"킹의 권위를 안 존중하려는 건 아니지만, 그 잘난 업적이라는 걸 하나하나 기록하며 시간을 보내자니 귀중한 약탈 시간을 버리는 기분이 "
"들더라고. 한가하게 킹의 비위나 맞추고 있기보다는, 차라리 밖으로 나가서 보물을 움켜쥐고 미개척지를 탐험하는 게 훨씬 성미에 맞거든."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Three relics, they say, but one's nothing more than a busted rifle. As per the King's orders, they've dragged it off to the armory for inspection.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog02_Rifle
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC6"
msgid "The Captain here, once again plagued by the mundane task of documenting the meager spoils brought back by Sidari's crew."
msgstr "선장이다. 시다리의 선원들이 가져온 보잘것없는 전리품을 기록하는 세속적인 임무에 다시 한번 시달리고 있지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Captain here, once again plagued by the mundane task of documenting the meager spoils brought back by Sidari's crew. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Could it be salvageable? Who knows. But even if it won't fire, they claim this "weird Va'ruun stuff" would still be worth something to the right buyer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog02_Rifle
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC5"
msgid "Three relics, they say, but one's nothing more than a busted rifle. As per the King's orders, they've dragged it off to the armory for inspection."
msgstr "유물 세 개라는데, 하나는 고장 난 소총에 불과해. 킹의 명령에 따라, 그들은 그걸 검사를 위해 무기고로 끌고 갔지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Could it be salvageable? Who knows. But even if it won't fire, they claim this "weird Va'ruun stuff" would still be worth something to the right buyer.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Nevertheless, duty calls, and so I shall continue this tedious exercise in cataloging our misadventures. The Captain, reluctantly signing off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog02_Rifle
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC4"
msgid "Bah! Why does the king bother with that stuff? I'd rather be scouring the cosmos for genuine treasures than wrangling over broken artifacts."
msgstr ""
"쳇! 킹은 왜 그런 거에 신경 쓰는 거지? 망가진 유물에 대해 왈가왈부하는 것보다 차라리 우주를 샅샅이 뒤져 진짜 보물을 찾는 게 낫겠어."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Secured in the "vault"... Or at least, what passes for a vault in this ragtag operation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC3"
msgid "The Captain here, noting the latest acquisition from the Va'ruun tomb: the boost pack, stashed away in maintenance."
msgstr "선장이다. 바룬 무덤에서 최근에 얻은 전리품을 기록해두겠다. 부스터 팩은 정비실에 보관해 뒀다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): As always, Va'ruun tech is a gamble. It might work or not.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll wager fifty credits that somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC2"
msgid "Am I disappointed that I can't take it for a test flight? Not in the slightest. I'm not that reckless. Let someone else play the guinea pig."
msgstr "입고서 시험 비행을 할 수 없어서 실망했냐고? 전혀. 난 그렇게 무모하지 않아. 실험용 쥐는 다른 녀석을 쓰라고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Secured in the "vault"... Or at least, what passes for a vault in this ragtag operation.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Am I disappointed that I can't take it for a test flight? Not in the slightest. I'm not that reckless. Let someone else play the guinea pig.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC1"
msgid "As always, Va'ruun tech is a gamble. It might work or not."
msgstr "늘 그렇듯이, 바룬 기술은 도박이야. 작동할 수도 있고 안 할 수도 있지."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But orders are orders, and the king demands to be immortalized for posterity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FC0"
msgid "This is the Captain, tasked with the dubious honor of documenting the supposed greatness of our illustrious Spacer \"King\". Honestly, I'd rather be swabbing the hull than glorifying his every move in these blasted audio logs."
msgstr ""
"선장이다. 우리 걸출한 스페이서 '킹'의 그 잘난 위업을 기록하는, 참으로 영광스럽기 짝이 없는 임무를 맡으셨다 이 말이다. 솔직히, 이 "
"망할 음성 기록에 녀석의 모든 행동을 찬양하는 걸 녹음하느니 차라리 선체 바닥을 닦는 게 낫겠어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But alas, we're stuck here, pandering to his ego and pretending to be impressed by his ostentatious displays.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog04_Armor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FBF"
msgid "Ah well, such is the life of a Spacer I guess. Captain signing off."
msgstr "뭐, 스페이서의 인생이란 게 원래 다 그런 거지. 선장, 통신 종료."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Am I disappointed that I can't take it for a test flight? Not in the slightest. I'm not that reckless. Let someone else play the guinea pig.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ah, the joys of pirate life. Captain, begrudgingly acknowledging and signing off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FBE"
msgid "I'll wager fifty credits that somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over."
msgstr "이번 주가 가기 전에 누군가 부스터 팩을 시험하다 자폭할 거라는 데 50크레딧을 걸지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Three relics, they say, but one's nothing more than a busted rifle. As per the King's orders, they've dragged it off to the armory for inspection.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Bah! Why does the king bother with that stuff? I'd rather be scouring the cosmos for genuine treasures than wrangling over broken artifacts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog02_Rifle
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FBD"
msgid "Could it be salvageable? Who knows. But even if it won't fire, they claim this \"weird Va'ruun stuff\" would still be worth something to the right buyer."
msgstr ""
"수리할 수 있을까? 누가 알겠어. 하지만 발사되지 않더라도, 그들은 이 '이상한 바룬 물건'이 적절한 구매자에게는 여전히 가치가 있을 "
"거라고 주장하지."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Typical, really. The man always hoards the choicest loot for his own glorification. Now, he's scurried back to his so called command center.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog04_Armor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FBC"
msgid "The Captain here, once again chronicling the insufferable antics of our esteemed boss. Seems he couldn't resist snagging that Va'ruun armor for himself... as per the usual."
msgstr ""
"선장이다. 우리 존경하는 대장님의 참을 수 없는 행동을 다시 한번 기록한다. 바룬 방어구를 챙겨 자기 걸로 삼는 걸 도저히 참을 수 "
"없었던 것 같군... 녀석이야 늘 그랬지만."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I deserve better than this! I sacrificed everything, my dreams, my ambitions. All for what?! To serve a fool like you?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog05_Conclusion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FBB"
msgid "What are you... ugh. I've had it up to here! Do you hear me, King?! I'm done! I can't bear your idiocies any longer!"
msgstr "뭐 하는... 으. 더는 못 참겠어! 듣고 있어? 킹?! 난 끝났어! 더 이상 네놈의 바보짓을 견딜 수 없어!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Hmph, he wants us to call it his Throne Room... He's prancing around in that armor like he's some sort of space king. It's enough to make a spacer want to walk the plank.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ah well, such is the life of a Spacer I guess. Captain signing off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog04_Armor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB9"
msgid "But alas, we're stuck here, pandering to his ego and pretending to be impressed by his ostentatious displays."
msgstr "하지만 슬프게도, 우린 여기 갇힌 채 녀석의 자존심을 채워주고 녀석의 허세에 감명받은 척해야 해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Typical, really. The man always hoards the choicest loot for his own glorification. Now, he's scurried back to his so called command center.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But alas, we're stuck here, pandering to his ego and pretending to be impressed by his ostentatious displays.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog04_Armor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB8"
msgid "Hmph, he wants us to call it his Throne Room... He's prancing around in that armor like he's some sort of space king. It's enough to make a spacer want to walk the plank."
msgstr ""
"흥, 킹 녀석은 우리가 그걸 알현실이라고 불러주길 원하지... 녀석은 그 방어구를 입고 마치 스페이스 킹이라도 된 것처럼 으스대고 있지. "
"스페이서인데 뱃사람처럼 널빤지 형을 받고 싶어질 정도라고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Captain here, once again chronicling the insufferable antics of our esteemed boss. Seems he couldn't resist snagging that Va'ruun armor for himself... as per the usual.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But alas, we're stuck here, pandering to his ego and pretending to be impressed by his ostentatious displays.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog04_Armor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB7"
msgid "Typical, really. The man always hoards the choicest loot for his own glorification. Now, he's scurried back to his so called command center."
msgstr ""
"참 뻔하지. 녀석은 항상 자기 자신을 위해 가장 좋은 전리품을 챙기니까. 이제 녀석은 지가 지휘 센터라고 부르는 곳으로 돌아갔어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll wager fifty credits that somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog03_BoostPack
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB6"
msgid "Ah, the joys of pirate life. Captain, begrudgingly acknowledging and signing off."
msgstr "아, 그게 해적 생활의 즐거움이지. 선장, 마지못해 인정하고 통신 종료."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Bah! Why does the king bother with that stuff? I'd rather be scouring the cosmos for genuine treasures than wrangling over broken artifacts.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_LC48_Audiolog_SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC48_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0111BD0F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_AudioLog02_Rifle
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB5"
msgid "Nevertheless, duty calls, and so I shall continue this tedious exercise in cataloging our misadventures. The Captain, reluctantly signing off."
msgstr "그럼에도 불구하고 의무가 부르니, 우리의 불행을 기록하는 이 지루한 작업을 계속해야겠지. 선장, 마지못해 통신 종료."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Tevina Veth'aal is the one responsible for the crimes of murder, aiding the Zealots, and supply theft.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Let the record show this slate is a recording of Tevina Veth'aal, and my ward, Ochim Ka'dic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C5D16
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013FB4"
msgid "I'll make the deposit into your accounts. Your family will be taken care of for generations to come."
msgstr "계좌에 입금하도록 하겠다. 너의 가족은 앞으로 몇 세대에 걸쳐 보살핌을 받게 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I am aware of the situation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_TooEarly_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB2"
msgid "I need to speak to you about Andreja."
msgstr "안드레자 얘기를 하고 싶은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: heavy sigh at the top, you're frustrated at the timing / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak to you about Andreja.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Now is hardly the time. We need to focus on what may yet happen, not things that have already transpired and cannot be changed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_TooEarly_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB1"
msgid "I am aware of the situation."
msgstr "무슨 상황인지는 압니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I am aware of the situation.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Should we manage to resolve the current situation, the Council will address your concern.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_TooEarly_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FB0"
msgid "Now is hardly the time. We need to focus on what may yet happen, not things that have already transpired and cannot be changed."
msgstr "다만, 지금은 때가 아닙니다. 이미 일어나서 바꿀 수 없는 일이 아니라, 앞으로 일어날지도 모르는 일에 집중해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I am aware of the situation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_TooEarly_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FAF"
msgid "I need to speak to you about Andreja."
msgstr "안드레자 얘기를 하고 싶은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Now is hardly the time. We need to focus on what may yet happen, not things that have already transpired and cannot be changed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_TooEarly_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FAE"
msgid "Should we manage to resolve the current situation, the Council will address your concern."
msgstr "지금 상황을 해결하고 나면 대의회에서 그대의 걱정을 해결해줄 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak to you about Andreja.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Oh, are we finally willing to acknowledge this... disaster?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja
#. TOPIC: 0111C6E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Council_Andreja_LeadIn_TL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FAD"
msgid "Yes, I suppose it is time we discuss the matter."
msgstr "네. 그 문제를 논의할 때인 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: You had us so worried, Vaeric. What a time to go soul searching.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Hey, they almost did. And don't worry. I don't plan on making any unexpected pilgrimages anytime soon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C789
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FAB"
msgid "I kept thinking one of those Horrors we heard about got you."
msgstr "난 네가 소문으로 들었던 그 호러한테 잡힌 줄 알았다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I kept thinking one of those Horrors we heard about got you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C787
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FAA"
msgid "You had us so worried, Vaeric. What a time to go soul searching."
msgstr "엄청 걱정했어, 배릭. 하필 이런 시기에 자아 성찰하러 가기야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: How're you doing, Vaeric? You look a little distracted. &&& Vaeric: I was just thinking about my sister and those we lost. |The loss feels different. They were just here one moment and gone the next.|Not like when we lost my grandad to a heart attack. It was sudden, but there's a body to mourn over, to say goodbye.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA9"
msgid "I know what you mean. For many of us, the incident took more than just the people. It took keepsakes, memories, reminders."
msgstr ""
"무슨 말인지 알겠어. 우리에게 이 사고는 단순한 인명 사고 이상의 것이니까. 유품이든, 추모할 것이든, 상기시킬 것까지 다 앗아갔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I'd never experienced loss until that day, and then I lost almost everyone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA8"
msgid "Not only did I lose my parents, I have nothing physical to hold on to, nothing to cherish."
msgstr "난 부모님만 잃은 게 아니라, 가지고 있을 물건조차 전혀 없어. 간직할 게 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: I was just thinking about my sister and those we lost. |The loss feels different. They were just here one moment and gone the next.|Not like when we lost my grandad to a heart attack. It was sudden, but there's a body to mourn over, to say goodbye. &&& Bianca: I know what you mean. For many of us, the incident took more than just the people. It took keepsakes, memories, reminders.|Not only did I lose my parents, I have nothing physical to hold on to, nothing to cherish. &&& Egbo: I'd never experienced loss until that day, and then I lost almost everyone.|But wouldn't it be harder to have those reminders? &&& Bianca: Maybe for some. But at least then you have the choice.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA7"
msgid "Bianca is right. All I have of Vashti is the ring she gave me, but I've nothing of anyone else."
msgstr "비앙카 말이 맞아. 나에게 남은 건 바슈티가 준 반지 하나뿐이고, 다른 사람의 물건은 아무것도 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA6"
msgid "I would've much preferred having the choice."
msgstr "난 선택권이 있는 쪽이 훨씬 더 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Hey, they almost did. And don't worry. I don't plan on making any unexpected pilgrimages anytime soon. &&& Bianca: You better not. I'm not sure Eggie's liver could handle it. &&& Egbo: Yeah, you may not want to check the balance on your tab anytime soon...|But, it's still open, right?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Something tells me Viktor Veth'aal won't be too keen on funding your drinking habit, Eggie.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C784
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA5"
msgid "Hmm, that will depend on what my father says when he sees the bill."
msgstr "흐음, 그건 아버지가 계산서 보고 뭐라고 하실지에 달렸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: You had us so worried, Vaeric. What a time to go soul searching. &&& Egbo: I kept thinking one of those Horrors we heard about got you. &&& Vaeric: Hey, they almost did. And don't worry. I don't plan on making any unexpected pilgrimages anytime soon.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Yeah, you may not want to check the balance on your tab anytime soon...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C786
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA4"
msgid "You better not. I'm not sure Eggie's liver could handle it."
msgstr "그러는 게 좋을걸. 에기의 간이 더는 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: I kept thinking one of those Horrors we heard about got you. &&& Vaeric: Hey, they almost did. And don't worry. I don't plan on making any unexpected pilgrimages anytime soon. &&& Bianca: You better not. I'm not sure Eggie's liver could handle it.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C785
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA3"
msgid "Yeah, you may not want to check the balance on your tab anytime soon..."
msgstr "맞아. 당분간은 외상값 얼마 남았는지 확인 안 하는 게 좋을걸..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Hmm, that will depend on what my father says when he sees the bill.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C785
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA2"
msgid "But, it's still open, right?"
msgstr "그래도, 아직 써도 되지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Bianca, Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: You had us so worried, Vaeric. What a time to go soul searching. &&& Egbo: I kept thinking one of those Horrors we heard about got you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: You better not. I'm not sure Eggie's liver could handle it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C788
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA1"
msgid "Hey, they almost did. And don't worry. I don't plan on making any unexpected pilgrimages anytime soon."
msgstr "야, 진짜 잡힐 뻔했단 말이야. 그리고 걱정 마셔. 당분간은 예정에도 없이 순례 떠날 계획 없으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: You better not. I'm not sure Eggie's liver could handle it. &&& Egbo: Yeah, you may not want to check the balance on your tab anytime soon...|But, it's still open, right? &&& Vaeric: Hmm, that will depend on what my father says when he sees the bill.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C783
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VaericReturnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013FA0"
msgid "Something tells me Viktor Veth'aal won't be too keen on funding your drinking habit, Eggie."
msgstr "빅토르 베타알이 네 술버릇에 그렇게 크게 투자하고 싶어 하진 않을 것 같아, 에기."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I know what you mean. For many of us, the incident took more than just the people. It took keepsakes, memories, reminders.|Not only did I lose my parents, I have nothing physical to hold on to, nothing to cherish. &&& Egbo: I'd never experienced loss until that day, and then I lost almost everyone.|But wouldn't it be harder to have those reminders?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Bianca is right. All I have of Vashti is the ring she gave me, but I've nothing of anyone else. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9F"
msgid "Maybe for some. But at least then you have the choice."
msgstr "그런 사람도 있겠지. 그래도 선택권이 있는 게 좋잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I was just thinking about my sister and those we lost. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9E"
msgid "How're you doing, Vaeric? You look a little distracted."
msgstr "어떻게 지내, 배릭? 좀 심란해 보이는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: How're you doing, Vaeric? You look a little distracted.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9D"
msgid "I was just thinking about my sister and those we lost."
msgstr "그냥 동생이랑 떠나버린 사람들 생각이 나서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9C"
msgid "The loss feels different. They were just here one moment and gone the next."
msgstr "뭔가 다르게 느껴지는 상실감이야. 여기 있던 사람들이 한순간에 사라졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I know what you mean. For many of us, the incident took more than just the people. It took keepsakes, memories, reminders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9B"
msgid "Not like when we lost my grandad to a heart attack. It was sudden, but there's a body to mourn over, to say goodbye."
msgstr "할아버지를 심장마비로 잃었을 때와는 달라. 갑작스러운 일이었지만, 슬퍼하고 작별 인사를 할 수 있는 시신이라도 있었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's an enormous undertaking. Over half the city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C782
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F9A"
msgid "I wonder when reconstruction will begin in earnest."
msgstr "언제부터 본격적으로 재건이 시작될지 궁금하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: How're you doing, Vaeric? You look a little distracted. &&& Vaeric: I was just thinking about my sister and those we lost. |The loss feels different. They were just here one moment and gone the next.|Not like when we lost my grandad to a heart attack. It was sudden, but there's a body to mourn over, to say goodbye. &&& Bianca: I know what you mean. For many of us, the incident took more than just the people. It took keepsakes, memories, reminders.|Not only did I lose my parents, I have nothing physical to hold on to, nothing to cherish.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F99"
msgid "I'd never experienced loss until that day, and then I lost almost everyone."
msgstr "그 사고 전까지 상실을 경험해 본 적이 없었는데, 거의 모두를 잃고 말았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Maybe for some. But at least then you have the choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C78D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F98"
msgid "But wouldn't it be harder to have those reminders?"
msgstr "그래도 떠올릴 물건이 있는 게 더 힘들지 않을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I wonder when reconstruction will begin in earnest. &&& Vaeric: It's an enormous undertaking. Over half the city. &&& Egbo: And with my luck, I'm going to be stuck with salvage work or something equally demanding.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Yeah, you two will sit back and be the great directors while the rest of us toil away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F97"
msgid "I'm hoping for architectural work."
msgstr "건축 관련 일을 하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Please, Eggie, you're an artist, and you know how much we love our statues. &&& Bianca: Vaeric will have House Veth'aal commission a new statue of Jinan Va'ruun that will put the old one to shame.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Oh great, no pressure. I'm not sure whether I'd be thankful or not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F96"
msgid "Consider it done!"
msgstr "맡겨만 줘!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I was just dropping off supplies. Those poor people with no home to call their own.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C778
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F95"
msgid "Bianca, I saw you earlier at the refugee camp. Were you sent to aid them?"
msgstr "비앙카, 아까 난민촌에서 널 봤어. 난민들을 도우러 갔었어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: And with my luck, I'm going to be stuck with salvage work or something equally demanding. &&& Bianca: I'm hoping for architectural work.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Please, Eggie, you're an artist, and you know how much we love our statues.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F94"
msgid "Yeah, you two will sit back and be the great directors while the rest of us toil away."
msgstr "예예, 나머지 사람들이 고생하는 동안 두 사람은 편안히 앉아서 훌륭하게 감독만 하면 되겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Bianca, I saw you earlier at the refugee camp. Were you sent to aid them? &&& Bianca: I was just dropping off supplies. Those poor people with no home to call their own. &&& Egbo: I'm surprised your father hasn't put them to work yet.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C774
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F93"
msgid "Oh, don't get me started on that. If it were up to him, you know they'd be toiling away in that crater."
msgstr "오, 그 얘기는 꺼내지도 마. 아버지 마음대로 했다면, 난민들은 저 구덩이에서 고생하고 있었을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: And those people aren't physically capable of that work to begin with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C774
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F92"
msgid "I think the only reason he hasn't pushed for it is because the area is still too dangerous and unpredictable for civilians."
msgstr "아버지가 일을 시키지 않은 유일한 이유는 이 지역이 여전히 민간인에게는 너무 위험하고 예측할 수 없기 때문일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: It's an enormous undertaking. Over half the city. &&& Egbo: And with my luck, I'm going to be stuck with salvage work or something equally demanding. &&& Bianca: I'm hoping for architectural work. &&& Egbo: Yeah, you two will sit back and be the great directors while the rest of us toil away.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric will have House Veth'aal commission a new statue of Jinan Va'ruun that will put the old one to shame.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F91"
msgid "Please, Eggie, you're an artist, and you know how much we love our statues."
msgstr "제발, 에기, 넌 예술가잖아. 우리가 조각상을 얼마나 사랑하는지 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I wonder when reconstruction will begin in earnest.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: And with my luck, I'm going to be stuck with salvage work or something equally demanding.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C781
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F90"
msgid "It's an enormous undertaking. Over half the city."
msgstr "엄청난 규모의 사업이야. 도시의 절반 이상을 다루는 거니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Oh, don't get me started on that. If it were up to him, you know they'd be toiling away in that crater. |I think the only reason he hasn't pushed for it is because the area is still too dangerous and unpredictable for civilians. &&& Bianca: And those people aren't physically capable of that work to begin with. &&& Egbo: All I can say is that I'm glad I'm not in a position of power at a time like this.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C773
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8F"
msgid "Heh, thank the Serpent for that."
msgstr "헤, 위대한 뱀께 감사해야겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I'm hoping for architectural work. &&& Egbo: Yeah, you two will sit back and be the great directors while the rest of us toil away. &&& Vaeric: Please, Eggie, you're an artist, and you know how much we love our statues.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Consider it done!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8E"
msgid "Vaeric will have House Veth'aal commission a new statue of Jinan Va'ruun that will put the old one to shame."
msgstr "배릭은 베타알 가문이 지난 바룬의 새 조각상을 제작 의뢰하도록 할 거고, 새 조각상은 낡은 조각상을 부끄러워 보이게 만들 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Bianca, I saw you earlier at the refugee camp. Were you sent to aid them? &&& Bianca: I was just dropping off supplies. Those poor people with no home to call their own.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Oh, don't get me started on that. If it were up to him, you know they'd be toiling away in that crater. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C777
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8D"
msgid "I'm surprised your father hasn't put them to work yet."
msgstr "네 아버지가 아직 그 사람들에게 일하라고 말하지 않았다니 놀랍네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I was just dropping off supplies. Those poor people with no home to call their own. &&& Egbo: I'm surprised your father hasn't put them to work yet. &&& Vaeric: Oh, don't get me started on that. If it were up to him, you know they'd be toiling away in that crater. |I think the only reason he hasn't pushed for it is because the area is still too dangerous and unpredictable for civilians.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: All I can say is that I'm glad I'm not in a position of power at a time like this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C776
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8C"
msgid "And those people aren't physically capable of that work to begin with."
msgstr "그리고 그 사람들은 애초에 신체적으로 그런 일을 할 수도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca, Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8B"
msgid "You two look tired."
msgstr "둘 다 피곤해 보이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Bianca, I saw you earlier at the refugee camp. Were you sent to aid them?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I'm surprised your father hasn't put them to work yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C779
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F8A"
msgid "I was just dropping off supplies. Those poor people with no home to call their own."
msgstr "그냥 물품을 좀 전달했어. 집이라고 부를 곳도 없는 불쌍한 사람들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: I'm surprised your father hasn't put them to work yet. &&& Vaeric: Oh, don't get me started on that. If it were up to him, you know they'd be toiling away in that crater. |I think the only reason he hasn't pushed for it is because the area is still too dangerous and unpredictable for civilians. &&& Bianca: And those people aren't physically capable of that work to begin with.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Heh, thank the Serpent for that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C775
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F89"
msgid "All I can say is that I'm glad I'm not in a position of power at a time like this."
msgstr "이런 시기에 내가 권력자의 자리에 있지 않아서 다행이라고밖에 할 말이 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Don't start. House Dul'kehf is to blame for this.|Additional workdays, and they watch your time like a hawk. &&& Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable. &&& Vaeric: I'm sorry to hear it.|If it makes you feel any better, I spent the day with Vitoria being drilled on the Ministry of State's history during the time of Jarek Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F88"
msgid "Okay, Serpent forgive me, that's boring, but I bet Vitoria didn't tap her watch if you were seconds over your break time. Seconds!"
msgstr ""
"좋아. 위대한 뱀이시여. 저를 용서하소서. 지루해서 그랬사옵니다. 근데 비토리아는 휴식 시간을 몇 초 넘겼다고 해서 재촉을 하진 않았을 "
"걸. 고작 몇 초라고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca, Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired. &&& Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.|We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches... &&& Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F87"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear it."
msgstr "유감스럽게 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Bianca, Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Okay, Serpent forgive me, that's boring, but did you have monitored breaks? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F86"
msgid "If it makes you feel any better, I spent the day with Vitoria being drilled on the Ministry of State's history during the time of Jarek Va'ruun."
msgstr "기분이 나아질지 모르겠지만, 나는 비토리아와 함께 자렉 바룬 님 시절의 국무성 역사에 대해 하루 종일 공부했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca, Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F85"
msgid "You two look tired."
msgstr "둘 다 피곤해 보이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I wonder when reconstruction will begin in earnest. &&& Vaeric: It's an enormous undertaking. Over half the city.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I'm hoping for architectural work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C780
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F84"
msgid "And with my luck, I'm going to be stuck with salvage work or something equally demanding."
msgstr "운이 좋으면, 인양 작업이나 그 일에 못지 않게 힘든 일을 하게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C771
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F83"
msgid "Don't start. You have your father to blame for this."
msgstr "또 시작이네. 네 아버지 탓할 거잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C771
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F82"
msgid "We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches..."
msgstr "우리는 이제 거의 매일 일하고, 휴식 시간에 감시당하고, 무작위 검사도 당하고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Is it heresy for a me to say I rather enjoy having House Ka'dic in charge? &&& Bianca: Only if you said that to your father. |I had a feeling you'd be in favor of their changes.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F81"
msgid "Think this means they'll open up travel to the Settled Systems?"
msgstr "개척 성계로 여행할 수 있게 개방한다는 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: If they do, we'll all go there together.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F80"
msgid "I've always wondered what Neon looks like."
msgstr "네온이 어떻게 생겼을지 항상 궁금했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca, Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired. &&& Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.|We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches... &&& Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7F"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear it."
msgstr "유감스럽게 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Bianca, Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Okay, Serpent forgive me, that's boring, but did you have monitored breaks? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7E"
msgid "If it makes you feel any better, I spent the day with Vitoria being drilled on the Ministry of State's history during the time of Jarek Va'ruun."
msgstr "기분이 나아질지 모르겠지만, 나는 비토리아와 함께 자렉 바룬 님 시절의 국무성 역사에 대해 하루 종일 공부했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Is it heresy for a me to say I rather enjoy having House Ka'dic in charge?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C766
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7D"
msgid "Only if you said that to your father."
msgstr "그 말을 네 아버지 앞에서도 하지 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Think this means they'll open up travel to the Settled Systems?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C766
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7C"
msgid "I had a feeling you'd be in favor of their changes."
msgstr "너라면 이 변화를 좋게 받아들일 거라 생각했었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Only if you said that to your father. |I had a feeling you'd be in favor of their changes. &&& Egbo: Think this means they'll open up travel to the Settled Systems?|I've always wondered what Neon looks like. &&& Vaeric: If they do, we'll all go there together.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: We'll make it a galactic tour of the all the bars the Settled Systems has to offer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C765
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7B"
msgid "Well, now I'm on board with House Ka'dic as well."
msgstr "나도 이제 카딕 가문이 이끄는 것을 좋게 생각하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired. &&& Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.|We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches...
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'm sorry to hear it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F7A"
msgid "Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable."
msgstr "사실 난 거의 안 올 뻔했어. 그동안 너무 지쳤었고, 침대도 너무 편해 보이더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Bianca, Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Is it heresy for a me to say I rather enjoy having House Ka'dic in charge? &&& Bianca: Only if you said that to your father. |I had a feeling you'd be in favor of their changes. &&& Egbo: Think this means they'll open up travel to the Settled Systems?|I've always wondered what Neon looks like.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Well, now I'm on board with House Ka'dic as well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C764
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F79"
msgid "If they do, we'll all go there together."
msgstr "그렇게 된다면, 우리 모두 함께 가자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fake concern / Concerned / to Bianca, Egbo
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Only if you said that to your father. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F78"
msgid "Is it heresy for a me to say I rather enjoy having House Ka'dic in charge?"
msgstr "혹시 내가 카딕 가문이 주도하게 돼서 기분이 좋다고 하면 나도 이단자인 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: How are you feeling, Eggie?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Well, it cures your physical addiction, it's that mental habit that kept you going back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C761
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F77"
msgid "Much better after that Junk Flush. The power of modern medicine."
msgstr "정크 플러시를 맞으니까 훨씬 나아졌어. 현대 의학의 힘이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F76"
msgid "Don't start. House Dul'kehf is to blame for this."
msgstr "또 시작이네. 둘케프 가문 탓할 거잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F75"
msgid "Additional workdays, and they watch your time like a hawk."
msgstr "초과 근무에, 일할 때 매의 눈으로 감시하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Much better after that Junk Flush. The power of modern medicine. &&& Bianca: Well, it cures your physical addiction, it's that mental habit that kept you going back.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F74"
msgid "Yeah, but that's what you're helping me work on now."
msgstr "예예, 하지만 그 중독이 바로 지금 내 일을 도와주고 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F73"
msgid "And not being in the Herald has made a world of difference."
msgstr "그리고 전령 안에 있지 않은 것이 큰 변화를 일으켰지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Yeah, Eggie?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F72"
msgid "Bee?"
msgstr "비?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Bee?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Is it heresy that we miss Vaeric and wish he was still with us?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F71"
msgid "Yeah, Eggie?"
msgstr "왜, 에기?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Think this means they'll open up travel to the Settled Systems?|I've always wondered what Neon looks like. &&& Vaeric: If they do, we'll all go there together. &&& Bianca: Well, now I'm on board with House Ka'dic as well.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C763
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F70"
msgid "We'll make it a galactic tour of the all the bars the Settled Systems has to offer."
msgstr "개척 성계에 있는 모든 술집을 둘러보는 은하계 여행을 하게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.|We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches... &&& Bianca: Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable. &&& Vaeric: I'm sorry to hear it.|If it makes you feel any better, I spent the day with Vitoria being drilled on the Ministry of State's history during the time of Jarek Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F6F"
msgid "Okay, Serpent forgive me, that's boring, but did you have monitored breaks?"
msgstr "좋아. 위대한 뱀이시여. 저를 용서하소서. 지루해서 그랬사옵니다. 휴식 시간에 나를 감시했어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C76F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013F6E"
msgid "You haven't lived until some overzealous security guard escorts you to the bathroom."
msgstr "지나치게 광신적인 경비대원이 화장실까지 따라붙는 걸 경험하기 전까지는 살아봤다고 할 수 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Bianca, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Yeah, you two will sit back and be the great directors while the rest of us toil away. &&& Vaeric: Please, Eggie, you're an artist, and you know how much we love our statues. &&& Bianca: Vaeric will have House Veth'aal commission a new statue of Jinan Va'ruun that will put the old one to shame. &&& Vaeric: Consider it done!
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C77A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Bar02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F6D"
msgid "Oh great, no pressure. I'm not sure whether I'd be thankful or not."
msgstr "와 대단하네. 참 부담스럽지 않아. 고마워해야 할지 말아야 할지 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: That's an easy one. Drinking koza at the Herald's Rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C758
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F6C"
msgid "What do you think we'd be doing right now if Vaeric were still alive?"
msgstr "배릭이 아직 살아 있었다면 우린 지금쯤 뭘 하고 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Much better after that Junk Flush. The power of modern medicine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C762
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F6B"
msgid "How are you feeling, Eggie?"
msgstr "기분 어때? 에기?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: How are you feeling, Eggie? &&& Egbo: Much better after that Junk Flush. The power of modern medicine.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Yeah, but that's what you're helping me work on now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F6A"
msgid "Well, it cures your physical addiction, it's that mental habit that kept you going back."
msgstr "신체 중독을 치료하는 것도 중요하지만, 그 중독을 계속 반복하게 만드는 건 정신 습관 때문이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Yeah, Eggie? &&& Egbo: Is it heresy that we miss Vaeric and wish he was still with us?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F69"
msgid "Well, I'm no Herald or State Warden, but I don't think so."
msgstr "내가 전령이거나 국무성 교정관은 아니지만, 그렇진 않은 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Good, because I'm in no condition to be handling that level of stress right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F68"
msgid "We miss the Vaeric we knew, not this heretic or traitor they speak of."
msgstr "우린 우리가 알던 배릭이 그리운 거지, 남들이 말하는 이단자, 반역자가 그리운 게 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Bee? &&& Bianca: Yeah, Eggie?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Well, I'm no Herald or State Warden, but I don't think so. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F67"
msgid "Is it heresy that we miss Vaeric and wish he was still with us?"
msgstr "배릭이 그립고 여전히 우리와 함께 있기를 바라는 것조차도 이단 행위일까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Is it heresy that we miss Vaeric and wish he was still with us? &&& Bianca: Well, I'm no Herald or State Warden, but I don't think so. |We miss the Vaeric we knew, not this heretic or traitor they speak of.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C75A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F66"
msgid "Good, because I'm in no condition to be handling that level of stress right now."
msgstr "다행이네. 지금은 그 정도의 스트레스를 감당할 수 있는 상태가 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: What do you think we'd be doing right now if Vaeric were still alive?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: We sure did spend a lot of time there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C757
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F65"
msgid "That's an easy one. Drinking koza at the Herald's Rest."
msgstr "쉬운 일이네. 전령의 안식처에서 코자 마시기."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Egbo, Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You two look tired. &&& Egbo: Don't start. You have your father to blame for this.|We work almost every day now, monitored breaks, random searches...
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'm sorry to hear it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F64"
msgid "Honestly, I almost didn't show up. I was so tired and my bed looked so comfortable."
msgstr "사실 난 거의 안 올 뻔했어. 그동안 너무 지쳤었고, 침대도 너무 편해 보이더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: What do you think we'd be doing right now if Vaeric were still alive? &&& Egbo: That's an easy one. Drinking koza at the Herald's Rest.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: And credits. I bet Genna misses us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C756
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F63"
msgid "We sure did spend a lot of time there."
msgstr "정말 같이 오랜 시간을 보냈었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Bianca
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: That's an easy one. Drinking koza at the Herald's Rest. &&& Bianca: We sure did spend a lot of time there.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111C755
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_PostQuest_Plaza03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F62"
msgid "And credits. I bet Genna misses us."
msgstr "그리고 크레딧. 제나는 우리를 보고 싶어 할걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dazra was consumed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Dazra was consumed?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: That sounds ominous if true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA15
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F55"
msgid "The anomaly spread, absorbing all in its path. The crater you see now is nothing compared to the destruction looming ahead."
msgstr "이상 역장이 퍼지면서 경로에 있는 모든 것을 흡수했지. 지금 보이는 구덩이는 앞으로 다가올 파괴에 비하면 아무것도 아니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD0
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
