msgid "I look forward to trading with you."
msgstr "같이 기꺼이 거래하고 싶어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACA
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Crafting_CreateItem
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F4C"
msgid "Very well done. You are quite the crafter."
msgstr "아주 잘했어. 손재주가 뛰어나네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC9
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F4B"
msgid "Please! There are people around."
msgstr "그만해! 주변에 사람들도 있잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A70
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
msgctxt "013F48"
msgid "Shields just went offline!"
msgstr "보호막이 오프라인 됐어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC4
#. INFO GROUP: CREW_Sahima_SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
msgctxt "013F47"
msgid "We're too vulnerable without our shields!"
msgstr "보호막이 없으면 무방비 상태야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013F46"
msgid "That seems unwise."
msgstr "그건 현명하지 못한 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: I do not always see eye-to-eye with Viktor, but his loyalty to House Va'ruun cannot be questioned.
