#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_VethaalChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F3E"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal running things?"
msgstr "베타알 가문을 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Veth'aal running things?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_VethaalChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F3D"
msgid "I do not always see eye-to-eye with Viktor, but his loyalty to House Va'ruun cannot be questioned."
msgstr "빅토르와 항상 의견이 맞는 건 아니지만, 바룬 가문에 대한 충성심은 의심의 여지가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
