#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_VethaalChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F3C"
msgid "We stand ready to support them in the coming days, and to carry out our jobs as effectively as ever."
msgstr "우리는 앞으로도 베타알 가문을 도와줄 준비가 되어 있고, 그 어느 때보다도 효율적으로 맡은 일을 해낼 거라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_VethaalChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F3B"
msgid "And perhaps, if the occasion calls for it, to offer a more balanced viewpoint to counter their zeal."
msgstr "그리고 혹시나 그럴 일이 생긴다면, 그 열정에 대응하면서 더 균형 잡힌 시각을 제시해 줘야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: I confess there are... Concerns about loyalty. Elements within House Ka'dic have courted favor with the Zealots one too many times for my liking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_KadicChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F3A"
msgid "How do you feel about House Ka'dic running things?"
msgstr "카딕 가문을 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic running things?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_KadicChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F39"
msgid "I confess there are... Concerns about loyalty. Elements within House Ka'dic have courted favor with the Zealots one too many times for my liking."
msgstr ""
"솔직히 말하자면... 카딕 가문의 충성심이 걱정이라네. 내가 보기에는 카딕 가문 내부에 광신도에게 호의적인 부류가 지나치게 많거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_KadicChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F38"
msgid "But, I am sure Razma will see reason and navigate her new role with all the prudence and discretion it requires."
msgstr "하지만 나는 라즈마가 이성을 되찾고 새로운 역할에 필요한 모든 신중함과 신중함을 발휘할 것이라고 확신하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B6A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_KadicChosen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F37"
msgid "And House Dul'kehf will carry on as it has, always here to provide for the Promised."
msgstr "그리고 둘케프 가문은 언제나 약속받은 자들을 위해 이 자리에서 역할을 다할 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: If the Speaker willed it, if the Council approved... We will carry out the Great Serpent's mission.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B67A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Crusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F36"
msgid "The Serpent's Crusade calls. Are you prepared to answer?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 선언할 겁니다. 대답할 준비가 되셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How will you govern as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B677
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Speaker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F35"
msgid "Our first priority - not just now, but always - must be to the people of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "우리 최우선 목표는, 지금뿐만 아니라 항상 그렇지만 바룬 가문 신민들이어야 하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B677
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Speaker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F34"
msgid "We owe them stability. We need to rebuild, secure new supply lines. After that, we can take a longer view of the future."
msgstr "안정을 제공해 줘야지. 도시를 재건하고 새 공급망을 확보해야 하네. 그렇게 하고 나면 미래를 더 장기적으로 볼 수 있을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B677
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Speaker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F33"
msgid "We must maintain the balance that Jinan Va'ruun created. All Must Serve."
msgstr "지난 바룬께서 만드신 균형을 지켜나가야 해. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: Our first priority - not just now, but always - must be to the people of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B678
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Speaker
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F32"
msgid "How will you govern as Speaker?"
msgstr "대변자로서 어떻게 통치할 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent's Crusade calls. Are you prepared to answer?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B679
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Crusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F31"
msgid "If the Speaker willed it, if the Council approved... We will carry out the Great Serpent's mission."
msgstr "대변자님의 뜻이었다면, 또 대의회가 승인했다면... 위대한 뱀께서 내리신 임무를 수행해야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B679
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Crusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F30"
msgid "We will undoubtedly have to rely on House Veth'aal for guidance. Viktor has long wished for this opportunity, and is the most prepared."
msgstr ""
"베타알 가문의 인도에 의지해야 한다는 건 명백하네. 빅토르는 오랫동안 이런 기회를 원해왔고, 가장 준비도 잘 되어 있으니 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111B679
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Crusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F2F"
msgid "But we will move forward, and we will prevail."
msgstr "하지만 우린 앞으로 나아갈 것이고, 승리할 거라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: As of very recently, I am the Elder. I am ultimately responsible for all of House Dul'kehf, and by association, the Ministry of Commerce.
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F2E"
msgid "That would have been enough of a change, but to be named Speaker... It is a great deal to adjust to."
msgstr "그것만 해도 많은 변화가 있었는데, 이젠 대변자로 지명되다니... 적응해야 할 일이 너무 많구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F2D"
msgid "Viktor Veth'aal executed his own son for heresy. So much loss, and yet the Ministry of State prevails."
msgstr "빅토르 베타알은 이단 행위를 했다는 이유로 자기 아들을 처형했어요. 그렇게 많은 이들을 잃고도, 아직 국무성은 건재하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F2C"
msgid "The Ministry of State executed Vaeric Veth'aal as a traitor. We must all remember our duty to root out heresy. Even now."
msgstr ""
"국무성은 배릭 베타알을 반역자로 규정하고 처형했어. 우리는 이단자들을 뿌리 뽑아야 하는 우리의 의무를 기억해야 해. 지금 이 순간에도 "
"말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F2B"
msgid "Vaeric Veth'aal was executed for heresy. Let that be a reminder of the State's resolve."
msgstr "배릭 베타알은 이단죄로 처형당했어. 국무성의 결의를 상기시키는 계기가 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F2A"
msgid "We are all equal under the Ministry of State. Not even Viktor's son was safe from the law."
msgstr "우리는 모두 국무성 아래 평등합니다. 빅토르의 아들조차 법의 심판을 피할 수 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F29"
msgid "Do not waste breath and time talking to us. Find Anasko."
msgstr "말할 시간도 낭비하지 마시오. 아나스코 님을 찾으시구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F28"
msgid "The Citadel awaits."
msgstr "성채가 기다리고 있소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F27"
msgid "You have served House Va'ruun well."
msgstr "바룬 가문을 잘 섬겨 주셨구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F26"
msgid "This will work. This must work."
msgstr "잘 될 거요. 반드시 될 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F25"
msgid "All that we have done has led to this moment."
msgstr "우리가 해 온 모든 일이 이 순간으로 이어졌군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F24"
msgid "I understand that you have made progress with the Mourning Device. This is good."
msgstr "당신이 모어닝 장치 작업을 도와줬다는 걸 알고 있소. 좋은 일이구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F23"
msgid "The Ministry of State is ever watchful. Remain true or suffer Vaeric's fate."
msgstr "국무성은 항상 주시하고 있습니다. 진실되게 남든지, 아니면 배릭의 운명을 따르십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F22"
msgid "Viktor didn't even spare his own son. There will be no leniency from the State."
msgstr "빅토르는 제 아들조차도 살려주지 않았어. 국무성은 관용을 베풀지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F21"
msgid "I'm afraid there is nothing more I can do to help."
msgstr "더는 도와줄 방법이 없어서 안타깝네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F20"
msgid "We could not have gotten this far without you."
msgstr "당신 없이는 여기까지 오지 못했겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1F"
msgid "The Device has done its work. Now it is your turn."
msgstr "장치는 제 역할을 했어요. 이제 당신 차례군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1E"
msgid "Perhaps we retain the Great Serpent's favor after all."
msgstr "우리에게 위대한 뱀의 총애가 남아 있었는지도 모르겠군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1D"
msgid "Now, we will see if our faith pays off."
msgstr "이제 우리 믿음이 결실을 맺는지 지켜보죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1C"
msgid "It seemed fitting, necessary even, that we should be present."
msgstr "우리가 참석하는 게 적절할 것 같았어요. 필요하기도 하고요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1B"
msgid "It's reassuring to see what we can accomplish when we collaborate."
msgstr "함께 협력했을 때 이루어낼 수 있는 일을 보면 안심이 돼요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F1A"
msgid "I am glad my information was of use to you."
msgstr "내 정보가 도움이 되었다니 다행이로군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F19"
msgid "House Dul'kehf is at your service."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 도울 준비가 됐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F18"
msgid "It is a challenge, but an even greater honor, to be called to serve in this new role."
msgstr "힘든 일이지만, 새 역할을 맡게 되어 더 큰 영광이라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F17"
msgid "House Ka'dic has always had ambition. Hopefully that will serve them - and us all - well going forward."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 항상 야심이 넘쳤지. 이번 일로 그 가문은 물론 우리 모두가 나아갈 수 있으면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
