#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F14"
msgid "So much has changed in so little time."
msgstr "이렇게 짧은 시간에 많은 것이 바뀌다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F13"
msgid "In time, all will see that House Dul'kehf is the best possible choice to lead us into the future."
msgstr "머지 않아 둘케프 가문이 우리 모두를 미래로 이끄는 데 가장 최적인 선택지임을 알게 될 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F12"
msgid "I pray to the Great Serpent to guide Razma in her new role."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 라즈마가 새 역할을 잘 이행하도록 기도하고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F11"
msgid "Viktor will do great things, with our counsel and assistance."
msgstr "빅토르는 여러 위업을 달성할 거네. 우리의 도움과 조언과 함께."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F10"
msgid "Time will tell if House Veth'aal's devotion is enough to guide us all."
msgstr "베타알 가문의 헌신이 우리 전체를 이끄는 데 충분한지는 시간이 지나면 알 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013F0F"
msgid "The Great Serpent demands much of us. But we will show all that His is the only way."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 우리에게 많은 걸 바라시지만 오직 그분의 길만이 유일하단 것을 보여 줄 거네."

