#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for. &&& ...  &&& Luther: And if they've become Promised, truly their arrival is more than coincidence. &&& Viktor: *sigh* Serpent give me strength. You both speak true.|Perhaps I have reacted in haste.  &&& Viktor: Tell me, Harbinger, are you well practiced in discretion? 
