msgid "Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things."
msgstr "물론이죠. 많은 것들을 잘 알고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things.
