msgstr "그럼 처음 생각했던 것보다는 기대해 볼만하겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're not Promised and they speak to you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not Promised and they speak to you?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B740
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F0A"
msgid "I guess when you're part of their supply chain, they make a few exceptions."
msgstr "바룬 가문 공급망을 담당하게 되면 몇 가지 예외를 인정해주는 모양이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're not Promised and they speak to you?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B740
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F09"
msgid "There's not a lot of people in the import/export business when it comes to Dazra, and they aim to keep it that way."
msgstr "다즈라에는 수출입 업종에 종사하는 사람이 많지가 않은데, 앞으로도 쭉 그렇게 유지하려 하더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're not Promised and they speak to you?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: A heretic then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B740
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F08"
msgid "But believe me, it wasn't any short amount of time before they let me roam these streets."
msgstr "하지만 내가 이 거리를 돌아다녀도 된다고 허락을 받기까지 걸린 시간은 절대 짧지 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is his dad actually to blame? &&& Tane: Well, it's Viktor we're talking about, so it wouldn't surprise me...|But Vaeric can't see how much effort Viktor puts into making sure his son has all the tools he needs to take over.|He'll go on these rants of Viktor drilling him on scenarios. Stuff makes my brain hurt, but Vaeric talks about it like child's play.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ugh, the State's my least favorite of the three. Commerce and Conjunction keep to themselves, but State reaches everywhere.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F07"
msgid "What do you know about the Ministry of State?"
msgstr "국무성에 대해 알고 있는 게 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is he self-absorbed? &&& Tane: He's just used to getting his way and the world revolving around him.|When you're raised to be Elder, that's bound to bring you all sorts of extra attention.|So sometimes when hanging around with us peons, he forgets we have our own thoughts and opinions.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal. When it comes to House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent, you won't find a more dedicated House.
