msgid "Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에 대해 자세히 알려줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
