#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F04"
msgid "Some are borderline fanatics if you ask me. One step away from Zealots."
msgstr "어떤 녀석들이냐고 물어보면 일부는 까딱하면 광인이 될 거 같다고 해야 하나. 한 발짝만 나가면 광신도가 될 녀석들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
