#. TOPIC: 0111B73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013F03"
msgid "Viktor isn't even the worst of 'em."
msgstr "그 녀석들에 비하면 빅토르는 최악도 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path. &&& Tane: Oh wow, you really bought in, huh?  &&& Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I guess when you're part of their supply chain, they make a few exceptions.
