msgid "You're not Promised and they speak to you?"
msgstr "약속받은 자도 아닌데 사람들이 말을 받아 주나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me anything about Viktor? &&& Tane: I've only had a few run ins with Viktor for security purposes, and he's all in.|The man embodies House Veth'aal. He could probably recite Jinan's teachings word for word.|And he runs the Ministry of State without missing a beat. Strict, demanding, and always watching.|The guy's good at his job, but when it comes to personality, I couldn't tell you. Whoever he is, he keeps it close to the chest.
