#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Guess we both felt the Herald's Rest was one of the few places that made us feel like real people.
