msgid "Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances."
msgstr "어, 친구라기엔 좀 과한데. 친한 지인에 가깝지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's all I wanted to know. &&& Tane: Always up for a chat.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey, whatever you want.
