#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF5"
msgid "He'll go on these rants of Viktor drilling him on scenarios. Stuff makes my brain hurt, but Vaeric talks about it like child's play."
msgstr ""
"배릭은 빅토르가 예상 상황을 반복훈련시키는 것에 대해 불평하곤 했지. 골치아픈 일이지만, 배릭은 마치 어린애 놀이처럼 이야기했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Tane
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B737
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF4"
msgid "So are you and Vaeric friends?"
msgstr "그래서 당신 배릭의 친구인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about the Ministry of State?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the Ministry of State?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF3"
msgid "Ugh, the State's my least favorite of the three. Commerce and Conjunction keep to themselves, but State reaches everywhere."
msgstr "으, 국무성은 세 부처 중 가장 마음에 안들어. 상무성과 결합성은 지들끼리만 놀지만, 국무성은 모든 곳에 영향을 미친다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about the Ministry of State?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF2"
msgid "They're security, but more importantly they're loyalty, so they'll get deep in your business. They want your motives, your next of kin, your first born."
msgstr ""
"녀석들은 보안을 담당하지. 더 중요한 건 녀석들은 충성심이 크기 때문에, 자네 일에 깊이 관여할 거야. 녀석들은 자네의 동기나, 가까운 "
"친척, 친자식 관련 정보를 원할 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about the Ministry of State?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF1"
msgid "I joke, but the moment they get a whiff of something anti-snake, that's heresy. And heresy is a one way ticket to meet the Great Serpent Himself."
msgstr ""
"농담으로 하는 얘기지만, 녀석들이 위대한 뱀에 반기를 드는 냄새를 맡는 순간, 그대로 이단으로 낙인찍혀. 그리고 위대한 뱀을 직접 만날 "
"수 있게 이단자들에게 편도 승차권을 끊어주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EF0"
msgid "He's a good enough guy I suppose. A little self-absorbed, spoiled. Growing up in a noble House probably does that to you."
msgstr "배릭은 충분히 좋은 사내라고 생각해. 약간 자기중심적이고 버릇이 없지만. 명문 가문에서 자랐으니 그럴 수도 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EEF"
msgid "A little naive, too. He's got this friend, Bianca. She's crazy about him, but the guy's oblivious."
msgstr "약간 천진난만하기도 하고. 비앙카라는 친구가 있어. 비앙카는 배릭에게 미쳐있지만, 배릭은 눈치 못 챈 모양이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: That's going to work out well is sarcastic. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EEE"
msgid "And his friend Eggie? Guy needs to lay off the koza, but I heard Vaeric let him in on his tab. That's gonna work out well."
msgstr ""
"또 배릭에게 에기란 친구가 있거든? 그 친구 코자를 좀 끊어야 하는데, 배릭이 그 친구 외상값을 대신 내준다고 들었어. 뭐 다 잘 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How is he self-absorbed?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EED"
msgid "Blames his dad for everything, though, and I get it. Viktor Veth'aal is not an easy man."
msgstr "배릭이 모든 걸 아버지 탓으로 돌리는 건 이해가 가. 빅토르 베타알은 쉬운 사람이 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of person is Vaeric? &&& Tane: He's a good enough guy I suppose. A little self-absorbed, spoiled. Growing up in a noble House probably does that to you.|A little naive, too. He's got this friend, Bianca. She's crazy about him, but the guy's oblivious.|And his friend Eggie? Guy needs to lay off the koza, but I heard Vaeric let him in on his tab. That's gonna work out well.|Blames his dad for everything, though, and I get it. Viktor Veth'aal is not an easy man.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He's just used to getting his way and the world revolving around him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B73A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013EEC"
msgid "How is he self-absorbed?"
msgstr "배릭은 얼마나 자기중심적인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me anything about Viktor?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me anything about Viktor?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B730
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EEB"
msgid "I've only had a few run ins with Viktor for security purposes, and he's all in."
msgstr "보안 일 때문에 빅토르와 몇 번 만난 적이 있는데, 아주 지쳐 보였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me anything about Viktor?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B730
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EEA"
msgid "The man embodies House Veth'aal. He could probably recite Jinan's teachings word for word."
msgstr "그 남자는 베타알 가문의 상징 그 자체야. 아마 지난의 가르침을 한 마디 한 마디 다 읊을 수도 있을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me anything about Viktor?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B730
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE9"
msgid "And he runs the Ministry of State without missing a beat. Strict, demanding, and always watching."
msgstr "그리고 빅토르는 한 치의 오차도 없이 국무성을 운영해. 엄격하고, 까다롭고, 항상 주시하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can you tell me anything about Viktor?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B730
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013EE8"
msgid "The guy's good at his job, but when it comes to personality, I couldn't tell you. Whoever he is, he keeps it close to the chest."
msgstr "일에는 능숙했지만, 성격에 관해 평가하라 하면, 뭐라 말을 못 하겠군. 실제로 어떻든 간에, 흉금을 털어놓지 않는 부류일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So are you and Vaeric friends? &&& Tane: Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances.  &&& Tane: Guess we both felt the Herald's Rest was one of the few places that made us feel like real people.|Couple of drinks and everyone's your friend in that moment.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've only had a few run ins with Viktor for security purposes, and he's all in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B731
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE7"
msgid "Can you tell me anything about Viktor?"
msgstr "빅토르에 대해 말해 주겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The ring is a small price to pay for your life.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The ring is a small price to pay for your life.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Take it. I'll find solace in the fact that the ring will remain with my family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE6"
msgid "You're right, and I know Vashti would want it this way."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 바슈티도 이렇게 하길 바랐겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's all I wanted to know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's all I wanted to know.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's backtrack.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE5"
msgid "Always up for a chat."
msgstr "언제든 대화하러 와."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do. &&& Vaeric: The credits are easy, and I'll gladly pay a price for freedom.|As for the ring... &&& Vaeric: Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm.|That disaster took every physical reminder of her except for this ring. Just wiped her from existence. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If it were just a ring, my mind wouldn't flood with memories every time I looked at it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B728
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE4"
msgid "It's just a ring. Hand it over."
msgstr "그냥 반지일 뿐이잖아. 넘겨줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do. &&& Vaeric: The credits are easy, and I'll gladly pay a price for freedom.|As for the ring... &&& Vaeric: Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm.|That disaster took every physical reminder of her except for this ring. Just wiped her from existence. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right, and I know Vashti would want it this way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE3"
msgid "The ring is a small price to pay for your life."
msgstr "반지는 네 목숨을 위해 지불하는 작은 대가라 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you think Viktor is so closed off?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you think Viktor is so closed off?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B725
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE2"
msgid "When you're in the kind of position that he is, I think you have to be."
msgstr "그런 지위에 있다면, 자네도 그렇게 해야 할걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you think Viktor is so closed off?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B725
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE1"
msgid "You can't be in charge of security and purging heretics, and then turn around and cry over spilled milk."
msgstr "보안을 책임지고 이단자를 숙청하는 일을 하면서, 이미 엎질러진 물을 두고 뒤에서 울 수는 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you think Viktor is so closed off?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B725
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EE0"
msgid "This is Dazra where noble Houses like to duke it out for bragging rights. They see weakness, they take advantage."
msgstr "이곳은 명문 가문들이 서로 뽐내기 위해 다투는 다즈라라고. 그 가문들은 약점을 찾아내고, 이득을 취하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So are you and Vaeric friends? &&& Tane: Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances.  &&& Tane: Guess we both felt the Herald's Rest was one of the few places that made us feel like real people.|Couple of drinks and everyone's your friend in that moment.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013EDF"
msgid "Let's go back a bit."
msgstr "되짚어 가보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do. &&& Vaeric: The credits are easy, and I'll gladly pay a price for freedom.|As for the ring... &&& Vaeric: Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm.|That disaster took every physical reminder of her except for this ring. Just wiped her from existence. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True. It's as if she's looking out for me one last time. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EDE"
msgid "Your sister would want you to live."
msgstr "여동생은 네가 살기를 바랄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's go back a bit.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's go back a bit.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B721
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EDD"
msgid "Sure thing."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's backtrack.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's backtrack.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: What kind of person is Vaeric?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EDC"
msgid "Hey, whatever you want."
msgstr "원하는 대로 하셔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give ring] It's done. Your son is dead. &&& Luther: What have you done? Vaeric... &&& Vitoria: This blood is on your hands, Viktor. I hope you remember this.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I clearly said exceptions should be made.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B66B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EDB"
msgid "You act like this was a crime. Your own laws demanded death."
msgstr "제가 범죄라도 저지른 것처럼 말하시네요. 배릭은 당신들의 법 때문에 죽었는데 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You're right, and I know Vashti would want it this way.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B726
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EDA"
msgid "Take it. I'll find solace in the fact that the ring will remain with my family."
msgstr "가져가. 그 반지가 가족의 품에 남는다는 걸 위안으로 삼을게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B726
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED9"
msgid "And now, I hope we are done here."
msgstr "이제, 볼일이 끝난 거면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Now that's over with, I'm going to hang back here, talk to Vaeric a bit. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B726
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED8"
msgid "Thank you for seeing reason. I owe you both my life and freedom."
msgstr "이성을 되찾아줘서 고맙군. 내 삶과 자유를 빚졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You act like this was a crime. Your own laws demanded death.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You act like this was a crime. Your own laws demanded death.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: No, it was Vaeric's choice. He knew the consequences.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B66A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED7"
msgid "And I clearly said exceptions should be made."
msgstr "제가 분명히 예외도 있을 수 있다고 했잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So are you and Vaeric friends? &&& Tane: Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances.  &&& Tane: Guess we both felt the Herald's Rest was one of the few places that made us feel like real people.|Couple of drinks and everyone's your friend in that moment.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Always up for a chat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B72F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED6"
msgid "That's all I wanted to know."
msgstr "알고 싶던 건 그게 다예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED5"
msgid "Not from the man himself... The only time I get glimpses of who Viktor might be is through Vaeric."
msgstr "빅토르 자체를 통해서는 힘들지... 빅토르가 어떤 사람인지 엿볼 수 있는 건 배릭을 통해서뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED4"
msgid "It's clear he cares about his son."
msgstr "빅토르가 아들을 아끼는 건 분명해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED3"
msgid "Putting in all that work to prepare Vaeric for the vultures and wolves when he becomes Elder."
msgstr "배릭이 장로가 되었을 때 독수리와 늑대를 상대할 수 있게 준비시키려 모든 노력을 기울이고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Can you tell me more about House Veth'aal?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericFriendScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013ED2"
msgid "And get this, he even tells Vaeric he's proud of him."
msgstr "그리고 듣기론, 빅토르가 배릭에게 '배릭 너는 내 자랑이다'라고 말했다더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure what I would think.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what I would think.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I hope you can see why I want to walk away from all this... to start my own life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B668
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED1"
msgid "Perhaps you are lucky then. It's not easy to watch people you love blindly follow a path that leads to their destruction."
msgstr "운이 좋은가 보군. 사랑하는 사람이 파멸로 이어지는 길을 맹목적으로 따라가는 걸 지켜보긴 쉽지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Tracker says this is it, so switching her off before those pings drive me crazy.|Damn... it doesn't look pretty.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B66C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2090_Tane_FoundCampScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ED0"
msgid "Let's take a look around, but be careful."
msgstr "주변을 둘러보자고. 조심해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So are you and Vaeric friends? &&& Tane: Eh, friend's a strong word. More like friendly acquaintances.  &&& Tane: Guess we both felt the Herald's Rest was one of the few places that made us feel like real people.|Couple of drinks and everyone's your friend in that moment.
