msgid "You can't think of anything about Viktor's personality outside of work?"
msgstr "일 외에 빅토르의 성격에 대해 생각나는 게 아무것도 없나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Nothing going on out here. How about you? Find anything?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Never thought of Vaeric as the Dear Diary type.
