#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013ECD"
msgid "I'm not sure what I would think."
msgstr "어떻게 생각하게 될지 잘 모르겠는걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's just a ring. Hand it over.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's just a ring. Hand it over.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B727
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ECC"
msgid "If it were just a ring, my mind wouldn't flood with memories every time I looked at it."
msgstr "그냥 반지였다면, 반지를 볼 때마다 추억이 떠오르지는 않았을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's just a ring. Hand it over.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B727
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ECB"
msgid "I wouldn't be filled with grief at the very thought of removing it from my finger..."
msgstr "손가락에서 떼어낸다는 생각만으로도 슬픔이 밀려오는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's just a ring. Hand it over.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Take it. I'll find solace in the fact that the ring will remain with my family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111B727
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ECA"
msgid "But I know Vashti would gladly have me give it up, if it meant my freedom."
msgstr "하지만 바슈티라면 기꺼이 포기하겠지. 내 자유를 위해서라면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: All my years and all the planets I've been on... Never going to get used to those things.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You got that right.
