#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EC1"
msgid "True. It's as if she's looking out for me one last time."
msgstr "맞아. 마치 마지막으로 날 챙겨주는 듯한 느낌이네."

