#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Only some logs, but Vaeric is living here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only some logs, but Vaeric is living here.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Sounds like it's a waiting game then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111AA84
