#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB9"
msgid "Never thought of Vaeric as the Dear Diary type."
msgstr "배릭이 일기 쓰는 타입일 줄은 몰랐는걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does your leaving mean for House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB8"
msgid "If he would have listened just once, maybe I could have left on good terms with my father's blessing..."
msgstr "그냥 아버지의 말을 따랐다면, 아버지의 축복을 받고 사이좋은 관계로 남을 수 있었겠지..."

msgctxt "013EB7"
msgid "\"Control the narrative\" as they like to say."
msgstr "'소문이 퍼지는 걸 통제한다'라고들 하듯이 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your tracker?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104138
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB6"
msgid "Oh this old thing? Well, truth is, I made a deal with Vaeric a while back."
msgstr "아, 그 오래된 거? 사실 얼마 전에 배릭과 거래를 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
