#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB5"
msgid "The guy isn't exactly keen on being cooped up in Dazra. Wants to see what the galaxy has to offer."
msgstr "배릭은 다즈라에 갇혀 있는 걸 별로 좋아하지 않아. 은하계가 선사하는 것들을 보고 싶어 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why outside of Dazra?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104138
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB4"
msgid "So I told him when he's ready, pick a safe spot somewhere outside of Dazra, and I'll go get him."
msgstr "그래서 준비되면, 다즈라 외곽의 안전한 장소를 골라, 내가 데리러 가겠다고 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: The credits are easy, and I'll gladly pay a price for freedom.|As for the ring...
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB3"
msgid "Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm."
msgstr "바슈티가 줬던 거야. 대재난 이후로 유일하게 남은 유품이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is your work coming along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB2"
msgid "Slowly, but it will be much faster if you have the power grid access code."
msgstr "느리긴 하지만, 자네가 전력망 접속 코드를 가져오면 훨씬 더 빨라지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: [Give Access Code] Yes, this slate has the code on it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB1"
msgid "Testing without full power is extremely limiting."
msgstr "최대 전력 없이 시험하는 건 너무 제한적이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is your work coming along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013EB0"
msgid "We're almost there, so I'm hoping you have the final key to unlocking the Mourning Device's true potential."
msgstr "거의 다 됐으니까, 자네가 모어닝 장치의 진짜 잠재력을 발휘할 수 있는 마지막 열쇠를 찾아준다면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
