msgstr "이제 큰 일은 당신에게 달려 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device, reacting after seeing it work. Awed, somber. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
