#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_AfterFiring
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E80"
msgid "Our work here is finished. May the Serpent guide you on your path."
msgstr "여기서 우리의 일은 끝났습니다. 위대한 뱀께서 당신의 길을 인도하길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device, reacting after seeing it work. Awed, somber. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_AfterFiring
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E7F"
msgid "We place our faith in the Serpent, and in you."
msgstr "우리는 위대한 뱀을 믿습니다. 그리고 당신도요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This isn't a safe place for a child.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AECA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E7E"
msgid "You can't get in there. Not unless you have a card."
msgstr "저긴 못 들어가요. 카드라도 있으면 몰라도요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: You can't get in there. Not unless you have a card.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's fine. It was built extra strong, and the railings are all sturdy. There aren't any sharp edges.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E7D"
msgid "This isn't a safe place for a child."
msgstr "여긴 애들한텐 위험한 곳이란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: You can't get in there. Not unless you have a card.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're funny.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E7C"
msgid "You're a little young, or a little short, to be a maintenance worker."
msgstr "넌 정비 작업자라고 보기엔 좀 어린데. 아님 좀 작다고 해야 하나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This isn't a safe place for a child.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This isn't a safe place for a child.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: So you are trying to get in there?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E7B"
msgid "It's fine. It was built extra strong, and the railings are all sturdy. There aren't any sharp edges."
msgstr "괜찮아요. 저긴 엄청 강하게 지어졌고, 난간도 전부 튼튼하거든요. 날카로운 부분도 없고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: You can't get in there. Not unless you have a card.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: So you are trying to get in there?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E7A"
msgid "Happen to have a card? I seem to have misplaced mine."
msgstr "혹시 카드 갖고 있니? 내건 두고 온 것 같아서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're a little young, or a little short, to be a maintenance worker.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're a little young, or a little short, to be a maintenance worker.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: So you are trying to get in there?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E79"
msgid "You're funny."
msgstr "재밌는 분이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang.|Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning.|It was a most prestigious honor.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111AABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E78"
msgid "When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place."
msgstr "재난이 닥쳤을 때, 저는 이곳을 지키기 위해 왔었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111AABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E77"
msgid "Those accursed Spacers snuck in and tried to kill me, the cowards!"
msgstr "그 망할 놈의 스페이서 녀석들이 몰래 들어와 절 죽이려고 했어요! 비겁한 놈들!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111AABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E76"
msgid "No doubt they're already on their way back to their lair with my family's precious heirlooms."
msgstr "보나 마나 그 스페이서 놈들은 이미 우리 가문의 소중한 가보를 챙겨서 소굴로 돌아가고 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Crestfallen, depressed / Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0111AABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E75"
msgid "Now I must bear the shame of allowing her legacy to be forever tarnished."
msgstr "이제 저는 마카라 님의 유산이 영원히 더럽혀지도록 내버려뒀다는 수치심을 짊어지고 살아야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E74"
msgid "Some of them stayed behind to ambush me. I could hear them."
msgstr "몇 명은 저를 덮치려고 뒤에 숨어 기다리고 있더군요. 소리가 다 들렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This place seems very important to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E73"
msgid "Serpent curse them for all time!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그 새끼들을 영원히 저주하시길!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E72"
msgid "Armiger, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "복종자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E71"
msgid "Reverent, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "숭배자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
