#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E70"
msgid "Diviner, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "예측자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E6F"
msgid "Vindicator, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "옹호자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E6E"
msgid "Harbinger, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "선구자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dejected / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you think you're being a little hard on yourself?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E6D"
msgid "I accepted a sacred duty, and I failed to uphold it."
msgstr "저는 신성한 의무를 다하기로 맹세했지만, 의무를 다하지 못했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dejected / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you think you're being a little hard on yourself?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: You honor your ancestor with your courage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E6C"
msgid "What's done is done. The circumstances do not matter."
msgstr "이미 벌어진 일이에요. 자초지종이 어쨌든 중요하지 않죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
