msgstr "농장에서 사는 건 마음에 드니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you like living on a farm?
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: Father says we have to make do with what the Great Serpent provides. So we do.
