#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E56"
msgid "I guess. It's the only place I've ever lived."
msgstr "글쎄요. 여기서밖에 안 살아봐서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: I guess. It's the only place I've ever lived.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111AECB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Comrak_Farm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E55"
msgid "Father says we have to make do with what the Great Serpent provides. So we do."
msgstr "아버지는 위대한 뱀께서 내려주신 것으로만 살아야 한대요. 그래서 그렇게 살아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E54"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하고 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Comrak
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: Not much. Just looking around, mostly. I used to try and find scrap to sell, but I don't think there's any left at this point.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Comrak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E53"
msgid "What were you doing at the dam?"
msgstr "댐에서 뭐 하고 있는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you doing here?
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: I like the view, too. And it's nice to just get away from the farm sometimes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Comrak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E52"
msgid "Not much. Just looking around, mostly. I used to try and find scrap to sell, but I don't think there's any left at this point."
msgstr "별 거 안 해요. 그냥 둘러보거나 하죠. 예전에는 팔 수 있는 고물이라도 찾아봤는데, 지금은 남은 게 거의 없는 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: Not much. Just looking around, mostly. I used to try and find scrap to sell, but I don't think there's any left at this point.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111AEC1
