#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E51"
msgid "I like the view, too. And it's nice to just get away from the farm sometimes."
msgstr "경치도 맘에 들고요. 가끔은 그냥 농장에서 벗어나는 것도 좋잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E50"
msgid "We'll have to move. We can't stay here after this."
msgstr "이사해야겠네요. 이렇게 됐으니까 여기 못 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4F"
msgid "What are we going to do?"
msgstr "앞으로 어떡해야 할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4E"
msgid "You killed Kaviil. You're a monster."
msgstr "캐빌 아저씨를 죽이다니. 이 괴물."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4D"
msgid "The Great Serpent has forsaken us."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 버리셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4C"
msgid "Everything we ever had... ruined..."
msgstr "우리가 가졌던 모든 것이... 망가졌어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4B"
msgid "How dare you show your face after what you did."
msgstr "네가 한 짓을 생각하면 뻔뻔하게 낯짝도 잘 들이미는구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E4A"
msgid "My whole life, drowned."
msgstr "내 평생이 가라앉다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E49"
msgid "This farm is the only place I have ever known. Now I have nothing."
msgstr "이 농장은 내가 아는 유일한 곳이었어요. 이제 아무것도 안 남았네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E48"
msgid "Why would I ever speak to you, after what you did?"
msgstr "그런 짓을 해 놓고, 나한테 말 거는 이유는 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E47"
msgid "I liked this place. Finally felt as though I fit in somewhere."
msgstr "좋은 곳이었는데. 드디어 자리를 잡았다는 느낌이 들었다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E46"
msgid "I suppose we will have to find some other way to live."
msgstr "먹고 살려면 다른 방법을 찾아봐야 할 것 같네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013E45"
msgid "You would do well to leave. The moon, not just this farm."
msgstr "떠나는 게 좋을 겁니다. 이 농장 말고, 이 위성에서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But I would ask you to remember, remember above all else: The Great Serpent has given us His greatest gift. A Promise.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E44"
msgid "A Promise that one day, when eternity arrives, our struggle will be rewarded. That we will sit by His side at the Shrouding. That we will reap the rewards while those would deny Him are cast into shadow forevermore."
msgstr "영원에 도달하는 어느 날, 우리의 투쟁이 보상받을 것이라는 약속. 장막의 날에 우리가 그분의 곁에 앉을 것이라는 약속. 그분을 부정하는 자들은 영원히 그림자 속으로 던져지는 동안 우리는 보상을 거둘 것이라는 약속."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I would never ask you to not feel that struggle. I know it too! I feel it every day as you do. All of us, as one, know that life here can challenge our will, even on the best of days.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): A Promise that one day, when eternity arrives, our struggle will be rewarded. That we will sit by His side at the Shrouding. That we will reap the rewards while those would deny Him are cast into shadow forevermore.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E43"
msgid "But I would ask you to remember, remember above all else: The Great Serpent has given us His greatest gift. A Promise."
msgstr "하지만 무엇보다도 이것을 기억해 주시길 바란다. 위대한 뱀께서는 우리에게 그분의 가장 큰 선물인 약속을 주셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): To look beyond the struggles of the moment, and see the brighter future ahead. To know that to struggle IS to serve.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But I would ask you to remember, remember above all else: The Great Serpent has given us His greatest gift. A Promise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E42"
msgid "I would never ask you to not feel that struggle. I know it too! I feel it every day as you do. All of us, as one, know that life here can challenge our will, even on the best of days."
msgstr "나는 결코 여러분에게 그 투쟁을 느끼지 말라고 요구하지 않을 것이다. 나도 그것을 안다! 나도 여러분처럼 매일 그것을 느낀다. 우리 모두는 하나가 되어, 이곳에서의 삶이 우리의 의지에 도전할 수 있다는 것을 알고 있다. 심지어 가장 좋은 날에도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All Must Serve House Va'ruun. We are charged, each in our own way, to better our society. To better ourselves.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I would never ask you to not feel that struggle. I know it too! I feel it every day as you do. All of us, as one, know that life here can challenge our will, even on the best of days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E41"
msgid "To look beyond the struggles of the moment, and see the brighter future ahead. To know that to struggle IS to serve."
msgstr "순간의 투쟁을 넘어, 더 밝은 미래를 바라보는 것. 투쟁하는 것이 곧 섬기는 것임을 아는 것."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You all know the words. All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): To look beyond the struggles of the moment, and see the brighter future ahead. To know that to struggle IS to serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E40"
msgid "All Must Serve House Va'ruun. We are charged, each in our own way, to better our society. To better ourselves."
msgstr "모두가 바룬 가문을 섬겨야 한다. 우리는 각자의 방식으로 우리 사회를 더 낫게 만들도록 임무를 받았다. 우리 자신을 더 낫게 만들도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All Must Serve House Va'ruun. We are charged, each in our own way, to better our society. To better ourselves.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111F7B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3F"
msgid "You all know the words. All Must Serve."
msgstr "여러분 모두 그 말을 알고 있다. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We must all, every one, put our faith not only in the Great Serpent, but in each other.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111B63C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3E"
msgid "Only together, as House Va'ruun united, will we face His Return and the Shrouding, and emerge at His side."
msgstr "오직 함께, 바룬 가문이 하나로 뭉칠 때만, 우리는 그분의 귀환과 장막의 날을 마주하고 그분의 곁에 서게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I see you, and I know you. I know you for what you are, for what you can be. For what House Va'ruun needs you to be.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Only together, as House Va'ruun united, will we face His Return and the Shrouding, and emerge at His side.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111B63D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3D"
msgid "We must all, every one, put our faith not only in the Great Serpent, but in each other."
msgstr "우리 모두, 한 명 한 명, 위대한 뱀뿐만 아니라 서로에게도 신뢰를 두어야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on needs / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I see you in your days, bold and mighty. And I see you in your nights, shivering and weak.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We must all, every one, put our faith not only in the Great Serpent, but in each other.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111B63E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3C"
msgid "I see you, and I know you. I know you for what you are, for what you can be. For what House Va'ruun needs you to be."
msgstr "나는 당신을 보고, 당신을 안다. 나는 당신이 어떤 사람인지, 어떤 사람이 될 수 있는지 안다. 바룬 가문에 당신이 어떤 사람이 되어야 하는지 안다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I see you, Promised of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I see you, and I know you. I know you for what you are, for what you can be. For what House Va'ruun needs you to be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111B63F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3B"
msgid "I see you in your days, bold and mighty. And I see you in your nights, shivering and weak."
msgstr "나는 낮에 당신이 대담하고 강한 것을 본다. 그리고 밤에 당신이 떨고 약한 것을 본다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I see you in your days, bold and mighty. And I see you in your nights, shivering and weak.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0111B640
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E3A"
msgid "I see you, Promised of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 약속받은 자여, 나는 당신을 본다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And there, outside of space and time, I was shown that we, all of us, are His creation.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C59B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E39"
msgid "For now, He slumbers in the beyond. But soon, He returns. We the Promised are called upon to Prepare The Way."
msgstr "지금 그분은 저 너머에서 잠들어 계시다. 하지만 곧 그분은 돌아오신다. 우리 약속받은 자들은 길을 예비하라는 부름을 받았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): His form was beyond grasp. Behind His eyes burned the fire of a billion suns. And His voice thundered through the cosmos: "You are of me."
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): For now, He slumbers in the beyond. But soon, He returns. We the Promised are called upon to Prepare The Way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C59C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E38"
msgid "And there, outside of space and time, I was shown that we, all of us, are His creation."
msgstr "그리고 그곳, 시공간 밖에서, 나는 우리 모두가 그분의 창조물임을 보았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): ...and I beheld a Great Serpent, coiled at the heart of all creation.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And there, outside of space and time, I was shown that we, all of us, are His creation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C59D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E37"
msgid "His form was beyond grasp. Behind His eyes burned the fire of a billion suns. And His voice thundered through the cosmos: \"You are of me.\""
msgstr ""
"그분의 형체는 파악할 수 없었다. 그분의 눈 뒤에는 수십억 개의 태양의 불이 타오르고 있었다. 그리고 그분의 목소리가 우주를 통해 울려 "
"퍼졌다. '너는 나의 일부다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMJinanVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): His form was beyond grasp. Behind His eyes burned the fire of a billion suns. And His voice thundered through the cosmos: "You are of me."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 0116C59E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_JinanVaruun_01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013E36"
msgid "...and I beheld a Great Serpent, coiled at the heart of all creation."
msgstr "...그리고 나는 모든 창조의 심장에 똬리를 튼 위대한 뱀을 보았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: PredatorsKilled
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E35"
msgid "Thank you for helping us."
msgstr "도와주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: PredatorsKilled
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
