msgid "The creatures' behavior is very bizarre."
msgstr "생물들의 행동이 매우 기이하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: PredatorsKilled
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E33"
msgid "What do we do now?"
msgstr "이제 우린 어쩌죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: PredatorsKilled
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E32"
msgid "We underestimated the wildlife out here."
msgstr "여기 야생 동물들을 과소평가했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: AttackedMiners
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
