msgid "What are we going to do?"
msgstr "우린 이제 어쩌지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: AttackedMiners
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E2F"
msgid "They came out of nowhere."
msgstr "갑자기 튀어나왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 0111AC8C
#. INFO GROUP: AttackedMiners
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E2E"
msgid "No one told me it would get this bad."
msgstr "이렇게 심각해질 줄은 아무도 말해주지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MQ03_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111B6BC
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111B6C4
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013E2D"
msgid "Serpent's vengeance is upon you!"
msgstr "뱀의 복수가 네놈에게 내리리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MQ03_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111B6BC
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111B6C4
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013E2C"
msgid "Death to the false Promised!"
msgstr "거짓된 약속받은 자에게 죽음을!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MQ03_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111B6BC
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111B6C4
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013E2B"
msgid "You interfered for the last time!"
msgstr "네놈이 방해하는 것도 이번이 마지막이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
