msgstr "미해일을 위하여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MQ03_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111B6BD
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111B6CA
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "013E27"
msgid "Justice for our brethren!"
msgstr "우리 교우들을 위하여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MQ03_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 0111B6BD
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111B6CA
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "013E26"
msgid "For Epsilon!"
msgstr "엡실론을 위하여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ModelAHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E25"
msgid "Please do not frighten the groats."
msgstr "그로트를 겁주지 말아 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ModelAHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E24"
msgid "This unit is programmed to protect these groats by any means necessary."
msgstr "이 개체는 모든 수를 다하여 그로트를 지키도록 프로그래밍되어 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ModelAHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E23"
msgid "Groat caregiver protocol is active."
msgstr "그로트 돌보미 프로토콜이 개시 중입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ModelAHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E22"
msgid "Warning. A stress free environment for groats is essential and will be enforced."
msgstr "경고. 그로트들을 위한 안락한 환경 조성은 필수적이며 강제화될 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040D7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ModelAHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E21"
msgid "Interference with caregiving tasks will not be tolerated."
msgstr "돌봄 작업을 방해하는 것은 허용되지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_Attackover
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E20"
msgid "Feel free to take some supplies or use the facility."
msgstr "용품을 가져가거나 시설을 사용해도 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1F"
msgid "The fauna in this region has become aggressive."
msgstr "이 지역 동물들이 공격적으로 변했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1E"
msgid "I don't understand. Something has changed the predators' behavior."
msgstr "이해가 안 되네요. 무언가 포식자들의 행동을 바꿔 놓았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1D"
msgid "Predators are incoming. Can you defend us?"
msgstr "포식자들이 몰려오고 있습니다. 저희를 지켜 주실 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: AfterAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1C"
msgid "I need a vacation."
msgstr "휴가가 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: AfterAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1B"
msgid "I hope that's the last of them."
msgstr "저게 마지막이었으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: AfterAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E1A"
msgid "Thanks. Feel free to grab some supplies."
msgstr "감사합니다. 용품 좀 챙겨 가셔도 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: AfterAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E19"
msgid "Go ahead and use our facilities if you'd like."
msgstr "괜찮으시면 저희 시설을 이용하셔도 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E18"
msgid "Did you see any predators on the way here?"
msgstr "여기 오는 길에 포식자들을 보셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E17"
msgid "Be ready. Predators could attack any moment."
msgstr "조심하세요. 언제 포식자들이 공격해올지 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunMiners
#. TOPIC: 011072B3
#. INFO GROUP: BeforeAttack
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013E16"
msgid "You picked a bad time to show up here."
msgstr "하필 이런 때 오셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Well, if you had to tell anyone, Vitoria would be the most trustworthy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VitoriaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E15"
msgid "I told Vitoria that you were safe."
msgstr "비토리아에게 네가 안전하다고 말했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I told Vitoria that you were safe.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VitoriaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013E14"
msgid "Well, if you had to tell anyone, Vitoria would be the most trustworthy."
msgstr "음, 누군가에게 말해야 한다면, 비토리아 고모가 가장 신뢰할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VitoriaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E13"
msgid "She will keep my secret, especially knowing the consequences we'd all face."
msgstr "특히 우리 모두가 직면하게 될 결과를 아시니, 고모는 내 비밀을 지켜줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VitoriaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E12"
msgid "In fact, a part of me is relieved. She has enough grief to deal with."
msgstr "사실 마음 한구석에서는 안도감이 들기도 해. 고모는 감당할 만큼 슬픔을 겪었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you hear that your father was named Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E11"
msgid "I had not, but I'm certain he considers it a great honor."
msgstr "나는 그렇게 생각한 적이 없지만, 아버지는 큰 영광으로 생각하고 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E10"
msgid "I suppose this does make my future a little more uncertain, though."
msgstr "하지만 이 때문에 내 미래가 좀 더 불확실해질 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0F"
msgid "With House Veth'aal running things, it's only a matter of time before their eyes and ears are everywhere."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 지도자를 맡게 됐으니, 가문의 눈과 귀가 온 사방에 깔리는 것도 시간 문제야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: Vashti knew my heart and mind well. She may be disappointed I returned, but she'd also be happy I remained with the family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0E"
msgid "What do you think your sister, Vashti, would've thought of all this?"
msgstr "네 여동생 바슈티라면 이 모든 일을 어떻게 생각했을까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I had not, but I'm certain he considers it a great honor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0D"
msgid "Did you hear that your father was named Speaker?"
msgstr "네 아버지가 대변자로 임명됐다는 소식은 들었어?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: Yes, and it is as I feared. This war is folly, and will only bring about the death of our people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111324
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0C"
msgid "Did you hear the Serpent's Crusade is restarting?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 다시 시작된다는 소식은 들었어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you hear the Serpent's Crusade is restarting?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0B"
msgid "You can't be serious. This is exactly what I feared."
msgstr "그거 진심이야? 내가 걱정했던 게 딱 이런 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E0A"
msgid "The Serpent's Crusade is a suicide mission. My people would move to wage a war they cannot win for a god that doesn't exist."
msgstr "뱀의 성전은 자살 임무야. 우리 신민들이 있지도 않은 신을 위한답시고 이길 수 없는 전쟁을 벌이려 하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E09"
msgid "I can only hope the Settled Systems will show mercy when the time comes."
msgstr "때가 되면 개척 성계에서 자비를 보여주길 바랄 수밖에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think your sister, Vashti, would've thought of all this?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E08"
msgid "Vashti knew my heart and mind well. She would understand, I have no doubt."
msgstr "바슈티는 내 생각과 마음을 잘 알았어. 분명히 날 이해해 줬을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E07"
msgid "Our father is what would bother her the most."
msgstr "가장 성가신 문제는 우리 아버지였겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E06"
msgid "She would've made a far better Elder than I if only he would've listened..."
msgstr "아버지가 내 말을 들어줬다면 여동생이 나보다 훨씬 더 훌륭한 장로가 되었을 텐데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E05"
msgid "But the man refuses to see anyone's truth but his own."
msgstr "하지만 그분은 자기 자신의 진실만 보시지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: For now. My father won't risk additional resources to confirm my death. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_SafetyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E04"
msgid "Do you really think you'll be safe here?"
msgstr "정말 여기 있는 게 안전하겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you really think you'll be safe here?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_SafetyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E03"
msgid "For now. My father won't risk additional resources to confirm my death."
msgstr "일단은. 아버지가 내 죽음을 확인하려고 자원을 더 쓰진 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_SafetyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E02"
msgid "That would only reflect poorly on him."
msgstr "본인한테 나쁜 영향만 줄 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_SafetyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E01"
msgid "Besides, this is just a stepping stone. My ultimate goal is to leave Va'ruun'kai behind."
msgstr "그리고, 여긴 그냥 잠깐 들르는 거야. 내 마지막 목표는 바룬카이를 떠나는 거니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 0111AA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_TL_SafetyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013E00"
msgid "This farm will allow me to prove to myself that I can make it out there."
msgstr "이 농장에서라면 내가 바깥에서도 성공할 수 있다는 걸 스스로 증명할 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFF"
msgid "Vitoria deserved the truth. Thank you for sparing her additional grief."
msgstr "비토리아 고모는 진실을 알 자격이 있어. 고모의 슬픔을 덜어 줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFE"
msgid "I wonder how often my father thinks of me... I think of him often."
msgstr "아버지는 내 생각을 얼마나 자주 하실까... 난 많이 생각하는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFD"
msgid "The Serpent's Crusade will be the end of my people."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 우리 신민들을 끝장낼 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFC"
msgid "The High Council is foolish if they think they can win this war."
msgstr "대의회가 이 전쟁에서 이길 수 있다고 생각한다면 진짜 멍청한 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFB"
msgid "I fear the fate of my friends and family."
msgstr "내 친구와 가족들이 어떤 운명을 맞을지 두려워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DFA"
msgid "We are now no better than the Zealots."
msgstr "이제 우린 광신도보다 나을 게 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DF9"
msgid "May the Settled Systems show mercy when all is said and done."
msgstr "모든 일이 끝날 때 개척 성계가 자비를 보여주면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DF8"
msgid "I can't believe my father would condone this war."
msgstr "아버지가 이 전쟁을 용납하셨다니 믿기지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC04ApostatesRefuge
#. TOPIC: 01109B93
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LC04_Vaeric_SerpentsCrusade_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013DF7"
msgid "My father would risk everything for his foolish beliefs."
msgstr "아버지는 그 멍청한 믿음에 모든 걸 걸고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I would be able to speak to Anasko?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would be able to speak to Anasko?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B773
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF6"
msgid "Not in the way you and I speak, but in crude terms, yes. Provided you managed to maintain your own sanity through the process."
msgstr "자네랑 내가 대화하는 방식은 아닌데, 대충 말하자면 그래. 그 과정에서 자네가 제정신을 유지할 수 있다면 말이지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I would be able to speak to Anasko?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: You just need to have a little faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B773
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF5"
msgid "But this is all purely theoretical. No one has ever entered the vortex and come back."
msgstr "어쨌든 다 이론적인 이야기야. 볼텍스에 들어갔다 나온 사람은 아무도 없었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That sounds ominous if true. &&& ...  &&& Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall. &&& Inaza: At its terminus was a gate; a path into the realm where our Speaker resides.|You stepped into this void, and in that moment something changed. The false future, rewritten. &&& Ekris: Hm... roughly speaking, it could be that entering the vortex directly would allow you to speak with him.|And while my readings do not show any anomalous activity, I admit there's a lot of interference.|Still, that only emphasizes the potential danger involved here. I cannot approve of such an excursion on the MINUTE chance Anasko is present.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not in the way you and I speak, but in crude terms, yes. Provided you managed to maintain your own sanity through the process.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B774
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF4"
msgid "I would be able to speak to Anasko?"
msgstr "아나스코와 대화할 수 있을 거라고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Ekris
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He said the gate is still open. &&& Ekris: Yes, the pinnacle of the Citadel was modified to house the equipment to create a gate to the Vortex.|If it still runs, that would explain everything we have experienced since the initial incident.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF3"
msgid "It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading."
msgstr "그것보다 훨씬 더하지. 내가 아나스코 님의 귀환을 기도할 때, 보통은 그분의 부재와 상실을 느꼈어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Ekris
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF2"
msgid "But when I last prayed to the Great Serpent, I felt Anasko's presence, clear and distinct."
msgstr "그런데 최근에 위대한 뱀께 기도드렸을 때, 아나스코 님의 존재가 분명하고 뚜렷하게 느껴지더구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Ekris
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DF1"
msgid "Even as it receded, I felt him anchored to this world."
msgstr "서서히 약해지고 있었지만, 그분은 이 세상에 고정되어 있었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Yes, the pinnacle of the Citadel was modified to house the equipment to create a gate to the Vortex.|If it still runs, that would explain everything we have experienced since the initial incident. &&& Inaza: It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading.|But when I last prayed to the Great Serpent, I felt Anasko's presence, clear and distinct.|Even as it receded, I felt him anchored to this world. 
