#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is fine to question. The truth will be revealed in time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DEA"
msgid "I don't know if either of you are right."
msgstr "둘 중에 누가 맞는지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Providence?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Providence?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B76F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE9"
msgid "The Great Serpent has guided you here. From the moment you found the Oracle, to the words I speak to you now."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 여기로 인도하셨으니까. 그대가 오라클을 발견했을 때부터 내가 지금 말하는 이 순간까지 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: It sounds like you agree with me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE8"
msgid "You're both right. We must have faith that our efforts will succeed, but that means nothing without the science."
msgstr "두 분 다 맞아요. 우리 노력이 성공하려면 신앙심을 가져야 하겠지만, 그렇다고 해서 과학을 빼놓고 할 필요는 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're both right. We must have faith that our efforts will succeed, but that means nothing without the science.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're both right. We must have faith that our efforts will succeed, but that means nothing without the science.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: And yet only one is the foundation for the other.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE7"
msgid "It sounds like you agree with me."
msgstr "내 말에 동의해주는 느낌이구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know if either of you are right.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know if either of you are right.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But the proof is not in our words. It is in the vision. Anasko's presence still persists in this world, and he seeks our aid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE5"
msgid "It is fine to question. The truth will be revealed in time."
msgstr "의문을 가져도 괜찮다. 시간이 지나면 진실이 밝혀질 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun. &&& companion: It would be unwise to ignore the Herald's counsel.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is as the Great Serpent foretold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE4"
msgid "You sound certain I'll find him there."
msgstr "찾게 될 거라고 확신하시는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE3"
msgid "It is as the Great Serpent foretold."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 예언하셨으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: It is as the Great Serpent foretold.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE2"
msgid "In my visions, I witnessed two futures."
msgstr "환영 속에서 두 가지 미래가 보였다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE1"
msgid "In the first, you breached the Scaled Citadel, but found Anasko had sunk too far into the void."
msgstr "첫 번째 미래에서는 그대가 비늘 성채에 들어갔지만, 아나스코 님께서 공허에 너무 깊이 파묻혀 버리셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That sounds ominous if true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DE0"
msgid "And in time, all of Dazra was consumed along with him."
msgstr "이윽고는, 다즈라 전체가 그분과 함께 삼켜지고 말았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And nothing of value was lost.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And nothing of value was lost.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DDF"
msgid "Despite what you may feel about our city, we still have time to change its fate."
msgstr "그대가 우리 도시를 어떻게 생각하든, 아직 그 운명을 바꿀 시간은 남아있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DDD"
msgid "At its terminus was a gate; a path into the realm where our Speaker resides."
msgstr "그 끝에는 차원문이 있었지. 우리 대변자님이 계신 영역으로 통하는 통로 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Hm... roughly speaking, it could be that entering the vortex directly would allow you to speak with him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DDC"
msgid "You stepped into this void, and in that moment something changed. The false future, rewritten."
msgstr "그대가 공허 속으로 발을 들이자, 그 순간 뭔가가 변했다. 거짓 미래가 다시 쓰여진 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That sounds ominous if true.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That sounds ominous if true.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA19
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DDB"
msgid "Indeed. But there is another path."
msgstr "그렇지. 허나 다른 길도 있단다."

#. PROMPT: You're both right. We must have faith that our efforts will succeed, but that means nothing without the science.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're both right. We must have faith that our efforts will succeed, but that means nothing without the science. &&& Ekris: It sounds like you agree with me.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But the proof is not in our words. It is in the vision. Anasko's presence still persists in this world, and he seeks our aid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DDA"
msgid "And yet only one is the foundation for the other."
msgstr "둘 중 하나만이 다른 하나를 위한 토대가 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there. &&& Inaza: It is as the Great Serpent foretold. &&& Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. |In the first, you breached the Scaled Citadel, but found Anasko had sunk too far into the void.|And in time, all of Dazra was consumed along with him.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It was not His will, but a warning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA18
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD9"
msgid "Maybe that future is simply the Serpent's will."
msgstr "그냥 그 미래가 위대한 뱀의 뜻인 걸지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there. &&& Inaza: It is as the Great Serpent foretold. &&& Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. |In the first, you breached the Scaled Citadel, but found Anasko had sunk too far into the void.|And in time, all of Dazra was consumed along with him.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Despite what you may feel about our city, we still have time to change its fate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD8"
msgid "And nothing of value was lost."
msgstr "그렇게 대단한 게 사라지지는 않았단 거네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE197
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "013DD7"
msgid "Great Serpent, accept these offerings."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 이 제물을 받으소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun. &&& companion: It would be unwise to ignore the Herald's counsel.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent has blessed me with the sight. And I have seen events there that are only now beginning to take shape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD6"
msgid "How do you know such a cave exists?"
msgstr "그런 동굴이 있다는 건 어떻게 아시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there. &&& Inaza: It is as the Great Serpent foretold. &&& Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. |In the first, you breached the Scaled Citadel, but found Anasko had sunk too far into the void.|And in time, all of Dazra was consumed along with him.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The anomaly spread, absorbing all in its path. The crater you see now is nothing compared to the destruction looming ahead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD5"
msgid "Dazra was consumed?"
msgstr "다즈라가 삼켜졌다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe that future is simply the Serpent's will.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe that future is simply the Serpent's will.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA17
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD4"
msgid "It was not His will, but a warning."
msgstr "그분의 뜻이 아니라, 경고였단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound certain I'll find him there. &&& Inaza: It is as the Great Serpent foretold. &&& Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. |In the first, you breached the Scaled Citadel, but found Anasko had sunk too far into the void.|And in time, all of Dazra was consumed along with him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed. But there is another path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD3"
msgid "That sounds ominous if true."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면 좀 불길한데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know such a cave exists?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you know such a cave exists?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: You sound certain I'll find him there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD2"
msgid "The Great Serpent has blessed me with the sight. And I have seen events there that are only now beginning to take shape."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 내게 계시의 축복을 내려 주셨단다. 나는 이제서야 막 구체화되기 시작한 사건들을 본 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza:  &&& Inaza: Have you reconsidered my request? &&& Inaza: I have seen visions of Anasko, searching for one bold enough to enter the heart of the vortex.|And now that you are here, I know your arrival was no accident. But rather, providence.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent has guided you here. From the moment you found the Oracle, to the words I speak to you now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111B770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD1"
msgid "Providence?"
msgstr "섭리라고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened. &&& Inaza: You cast doubt on my words. It's to be expected. &&& Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. |At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun. &&& companion: It would be unwise to ignore the Herald's counsel.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you must make time, or we are truly lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DD0"
msgid "I'm not sure we have time for that."
msgstr "그럴 시간 여유가 있을지 잘 모르겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He said that we need to enter the Scaled Citadel.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110FC79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCF"
msgid "And if you've spoken to him once, it's not out of the realm of possibility you could do it again."
msgstr "그리고 자네가 그분과 대화했다면, 그런 일이 또 생길 가능성도 무시할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure we have time for that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure we have time for that.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: In my visions, I witnessed two futures. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111AA1B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCE"
msgid "Then you must make time, or we are truly lost."
msgstr "그럼 여유를 내야만 한다. 안 그러면 진정으로 길을 잃을 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That sounds ominous if true. &&& Inaza: Indeed. But there is another path. &&& Inaza: In the second future, I saw you make contact with Anasko, entering a cave through a formless wall. &&& Inaza: At its terminus was a gate; a path into the realm where our Speaker resides.|You stepped into this void, and in that moment something changed. The false future, rewritten.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCD"
msgid "Hm... roughly speaking, it could be that entering the vortex directly would allow you to speak with him."
msgstr "흠... 대충 말해보는 건데, 볼텍스에 직접 들어가면 그분하고 대화할 수 있을지도 모르기는 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: my-newt, not the word for 60 seconds / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You just need to have a little faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCC"
msgid "Still, that only emphasizes the potential danger involved here. I cannot approve of such an excursion on the MINUTE chance Anasko is present."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그 사실은 잠재적인 위험성을 강조할 뿐이야. 아나스코 님이 계실지도 모른다는 눈곱만한 가능성 때문에 자네를 보낼 순 없어."

#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anything can seem like providence to the unenlightened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D70E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCB"
msgid "And now that you are here, I know your arrival was no accident. But rather, providence."
msgstr "그리고 그대가 여기 왔으니, 그대의 도착은 우연이 아니었던 것이야. 차라리 섭리라고 봐야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your city was in trouble and I came here to help. There's nothing else to it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But rest assured, all will be revealed when you journey north. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D706
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DCA"
msgid "The Great Serpent drew a path for you. Trickles of the greater plan, drawing you here."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대의 길을 만드신 것이다. 더 큰 계획의 흐름이 그대를 이끈 것이야."

#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: It would be unwise to ignore the Herald's counsel.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110D705
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DC9"
msgid "At the edge of the crater you will find a cave carved by the anomaly. There, you will make contact with Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "구덩이 가장자리에 이상 역장에 의해 생성된 동굴이 있다. 그곳에서 아나스코 바룬 님과 접촉할 수 있을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vitoria
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA8"
msgid "Can you tell me more about Vaeric?"
msgstr "배릭에 대해 더 자세히 말해줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA7"
msgid "Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father."
msgstr "배릭은 순종적인 아이였어요. 과묵하고요. 아버지를 기쁘게 해 주려고 항상 공부에 몰두했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA6"
msgid "But the two have clashed ever since Vaeric sacrificed his groat."
msgstr "하지만 배릭이 그로트를 제물로 바친 이후로 둘은 계속 부딪쳤어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA5"
msgid "He found his voice that day, and to Viktor's dismay, he wanted no part of being Elder."
msgstr "그날 배릭은 자기 의견을 밝혔고, 빅토르는 실망했죠. 배릭은 장로가 되고 싶어 하지 않았거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA4"
msgid "Vaeric is a dreamer who let his fascination with the Settled Systems get the best of him."
msgstr "배릭은 개척 성계가 대단할 거라 상상하면서 거기에 매료된 몽상가예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA3"
msgid "You could always tell his heart wasn't into learning about Va'ruun society."
msgstr "배릭이 바룬 사회에 정진하려는 열정이 없다는 건 언제나 알 수 있었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA2"
msgid "Noble Houses, Ministries, Dazra... He was a devout student, but none of it interested him."
msgstr "명문 가문, 정부 부처, 다즈라... 배릭은 독실한 학생이었지만, 어느 것에도 흥미를 느끼지 못했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA1"
msgid "The only lessons that truly fascinated him were about space and exploration."
msgstr "배릭이 진정으로 매료된 건 우주와 탐험에 관한 것들뿐이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Luther
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Vaeric is a dreamer who let his fascination with the Settled Systems get the best of him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A91B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013DA0"
msgid "What can you tell me about Vaeric?"
msgstr "배릭에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Are you here to help or question my every decision?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A919
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_RingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9F"
msgid "Why ask for a simple ring as proof of death?"
msgstr "죽였다는 증거로 반지를 가져오라고 한 이유는 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why ask for a simple ring as proof of death?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_RingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9E"
msgid "Are you here to help or question my every decision?"
msgstr "도와주러 온 거냐? 아니면 내 결정에 일일이 질문하러 온 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_RingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9D"
msgid "You think I would prefer to see my own son's severed head?"
msgstr "내가 내 아들의 잘린 머리를 보고 싶을 것 같나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_RingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9C"
msgid "The ring is unique. A gift from his sister and all he has left of her. It will be enough."
msgstr "특별한 반지다. 배릭의 여동생이 배릭에게 준 선물이자, 유일하게 남긴 물건이니까. 이 정도만 설명하면 알아듣겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: He does, Luther. He is allowing his fervent pride and anger to cloud his judgement. &&& Vitoria: What my brother is trying to say is that he wishes his own son dead. &&& Vitoria: First, we lose Vashti to that malignance tearing through Dazra, and now you so willingly offer up Vaeric?|As if our House has not suffered enough loss already. 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My son denounced the very faith that defines Va'ruun society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A917
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9B"
msgid "What did Vaeric do to turn his back on the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "배릭이 무슨 짓을 했길래 위대한 뱀에게 등을 돌렸다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What did Vaeric do to turn his back on the Great Serpent?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What did Vaeric do to turn his back on the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A916
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D9A"
msgid "My son denounced the very faith that defines Va'ruun society."
msgstr "내 아들은 바룬 사회를 정의하는 믿음 그 자체를 비난했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What did Vaeric do to turn his back on the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A916
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D99"
msgid "He dared to blame Anasko for the state of Dazra. Dared to call our faith in the Great Serpent \"blind.\""
msgstr "감히 다즈라의 상황을 아나스코 님 탓으로 돌렸단 말이다. 감히 위대한 뱀을 향한 우리의 믿음을 '맹목적'이라 부르다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What did Vaeric do to turn his back on the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A916
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D98"
msgid "It is heresy and punishable by death."
msgstr "이는 이단 행위고 사형으로 처벌해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: This is foolish, Viktor. The High Council needs access to the power grid if we hope to restore the city. 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Vitoria is right. I know you're angry, but you can't let personal matters interfere with what may be best for everyone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A915
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D97"
msgid "Your inability to provide a legitimate excuse for denying them will only last so long."
msgstr "계속 거부하는 이유를 합리적으로 못 대면 우리도 오래 못 버틸 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: He does, Luther. He is allowing his fervent pride and anger to cloud his judgement. &&& Vitoria: What my brother is trying to say is that he wishes his own son dead. &&& Vitoria: First, we lose Vashti to that malignance tearing through Dazra, and now you so willingly offer up Vaeric?|As if our House has not suffered enough loss already. 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because he let his weakness get the better of him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A914
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D96"
msgid "Why would Vaeric leave at a time like this?"
msgstr "배릭은 왜 이런 시기에 집을 나갔을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Vaeric leave at a time like this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would Vaeric leave at a time like this?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D95"
msgid "Because he let his weakness get the better of him."
msgstr "자신을 이기지 못하고 나약함을 드러냈기 때문이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Vaeric leave at a time like this?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D94"
msgid "He sees himself as a prisoner in this life. He runs from a duty that others would spend their lives coveting."
msgstr "그 아이는 자기가 감옥에 갇힌 삶을 살고 있다고 여겼다. 다른 사람들이라면 인생을 바치려 할 의무에서 도망치고 말았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Vaeric leave at a time like this?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D93"
msgid "He is my son. He does not get to choose. He was born to inherit my title and he knows the punishment for refusing to honor it."
msgstr ""
"녀석은 내 아들이야. 선택권이 없다고. 녀석은 내 칭호를 물려받기 위해 태어났고, 그 영광을 거절하면 어떤 처벌을 받을지도 알고 있을 "
"거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Grief can often cloud our judgement.  &&& Viktor: This is not grief. This is betrayal. Not only to me, but to our society and the Great Serpent Himself. &&& Viktor: I do not wish Vaeric dead, but as head of the Ministry of State, he left me no choice. |All Must Serve. Those who refuse will be met with death.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The shame Vaeric has brought upon this House is immeasurable. It stains the very foundation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D92"
msgid "How does Vaeric's death relate to power grid access?"
msgstr "배릭을 죽이는 것과 전력망 접속 권한이 무슨 관련이 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How does Vaeric's death relate to power grid access?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How does Vaeric's death relate to power grid access?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
