#. TOPIC: 0111A911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D91"
msgid "The shame Vaeric has brought upon this House is immeasurable. It stains the very foundation."
msgstr "배릭이 이 가문에 끼친 치욕은 이루 말할 수 없을 정도다. 가문의 근간 자체를 더럽혔단 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How does Vaeric's death relate to power grid access?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D90"
msgid "I will not act until this House is in order and its members are properly aligned with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "우리 가문에 질서가 잡히고, 구성원들이 위대한 뱀을 위해 제대로 단결하기 전까지는 도와줄 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric? &&& Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric was devout, although he lacked an enthusiasm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8F"
msgid "What was Vaeric like before the catastrophe?"
msgstr "재난이 일어나기 전에 배릭은 어떤 사람이었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was Vaeric like before the catastrophe?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was Vaeric like before the catastrophe?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8E"
msgid "Vaeric was devout, although he lacked an enthusiasm."
msgstr "배릭은 독실한 신자였다. 열정은 부족했지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Vaeric? &&& Vitoria: Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father.|But the two have clashed ever since Vaeric sacrificed his groat.|He found his voice that day, and to Viktor's dismay, he wanted no part of being Elder.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric is conflict averse. Pressure, responsibility, stress. He avoids them like the plague.
