#. TOPIC: 0111A90D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8D"
msgid "Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?"
msgstr "왜 배릭은 장로가 되기 싫어했던 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8C"
msgid "Vaeric is conflict averse. Pressure, responsibility, stress. He avoids them like the plague."
msgstr "배릭은 갈등을 싫어해요. 압박감, 책임감, 스트레스. 그런 것들을 역병 보듯 피하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8B"
msgid "He wants everyone's approval, and as Elder, that is an impossible task."
msgstr "배릭은 모두를 만족시키는 장로가 되길 원하지만, 그건 불가능하잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D8A"
msgid "I believe it is why he has fled. He made his final stand against his father and rather than face the disapproval, he disappears."
msgstr "그래서 도망쳤을 거예요. 아버지에게 마지막으로 대들고 나서 못마땅해하는 아버지의 모습을 보느니, 사라져 버리기로 한 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Vaeric? &&& Vitoria: Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father.|But the two have clashed ever since Vaeric sacrificed his groat.|He found his voice that day, and to Viktor's dismay, he wanted no part of being Elder.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Viktor's pride and belief in tradition will not allow it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D89"
msgid "Why won't Viktor let Vaeric do what he wants?"
msgstr "빅토르는 왜 배릭이 원하는 대로 하게 내버려두지 않은 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why won't Viktor let Vaeric do what he wants?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why won't Viktor let Vaeric do what he wants?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D88"
msgid "Viktor's pride and belief in tradition will not allow it."
msgstr "빅토르의 자부심과 전통에 대한 신념 때문이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why won't Viktor let Vaeric do what he wants?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A90A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D87"
msgid "He sees Vaeric's refusal to inherit the role of Elder as an insult, and many would share that view."
msgstr "빅토르는 배릭이 장로직을 물려받기를 거부한 걸 모욕으로 여기고 있어요. 많은 사람들이 그렇게 생각할 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Vaeric? &&& Vitoria: Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father.|But the two have clashed ever since Vaeric sacrificed his groat.|He found his voice that day, and to Viktor's dismay, he wanted no part of being Elder.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Viktor was too lenient with him when it came to Vaeric's free time.
