#. TOPIC: 0111A909
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D86"
msgid "What do you think changed Vaeric?"
msgstr "뭣 때문에 배릭이 변했을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think changed Vaeric?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think changed Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D85"
msgid "Viktor was too lenient with him when it came to Vaeric's free time."
msgstr "빅토르는 배릭이 자유롭게 시간을 보내는 걸 너무 관대하게 허용해 줬어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think changed Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D84"
msgid "As strict as he was, he allowed him the freedom to associate with whomever he wanted."
msgstr "엄격했던 만큼, 원하는 사람과 자유롭게 어울릴 수 있도록 허용해줬죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think changed Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013D83"
msgid "I think too much time at the Herald's Rest showed Vaeric a different life is possible, when it's not. Not for him."
msgstr "배릭은 전령의 안식처에서 너무 시간을 많이 보내다 보니 다른 삶도 살 수 있다는 걸 알게 됐나 봐요. 배릭에게는 아니었지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Vaeric? &&& Vitoria: Vaeric was an obedient child. Quiet. Always absorbed in his studies to please his father.|But the two have clashed ever since Vaeric sacrificed his groat.|He found his voice that day, and to Viktor's dismay, he wanted no part of being Elder.
