msgid "Vaeric sacrificed a groat?"
msgstr "배릭이 그로트를 제물로 바쳤다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric sacrificed a groat?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric sacrificed a groat?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7F"
msgid "All Va'ruun children raise a groat, and when they come of age, they sacrifice it."
msgstr "모든 바룬 아이들은 그로트를 키우다, 성인이 되면 제물로 바쳐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric sacrificed a groat?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7E"
msgid "It is our way of solidifying our connection with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이는 위대한 뱀과의 관계를 공고히 하는 우리만의 방법이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric sacrificed a groat?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why doesn't Vaeric want to be Elder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7D"
msgid "All Must Serve, and our dedication to Him comes above all else."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 하고, 그분을 향한 헌신이 무엇보다도 우선이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Luther
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
