#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A903
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7C"
msgid "Who is Vashti?"
msgstr "바슈티는 누군가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who is Vashti?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7B"
msgid "Vashti was Viktor's daughter. We lost her in the accident."
msgstr "바슈티는 빅토르의 딸이었어요. 그 사고 때 잃고 말았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D7A"
msgid "She and Vaeric were very close. She was his anchor and voice of reason."
msgstr "바슈티와 배릭은 매우 친했어요. 바슈티는 배릭의 정신적 지주이자 이성의 목소리였죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D79"
msgid "I truly believe if she was still with us, Vaeric would be, too."
msgstr "바슈티가 아직 우리 곁에 있었다면, 배릭도 같이 남아 있었을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is Viktor being so unreasonable? &&& Vitoria: Viktor is letting his emotions get the better of him. |He was barely processing the shock and grief from losing Vashti. Then came the anger and betrayal from Vaeric.|My brother is a man of pride and great faith. For the first time, I think he does not know what to do.|But I am certain Viktor does not wish Vaeric dead.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As head of the Ministry of State, Viktor feels he has no choice. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D78"
msgid "Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?"
msgstr "빅토르가 배릭을 죽이길 원하지 않는다면, 처형할 사람은 왜 보내겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D77"
msgid "As head of the Ministry of State, Viktor feels he has no choice."
msgstr "국무성의 장관으로서, 빅토르는 선택의 여지가 없다고 느꼈을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D76"
msgid "He believes he is trapped by his own faith and duty."
msgstr "빅토르는 자기가 믿음과 의무에 사로잡혀 있다고 믿고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D75"
msgid "If he makes an exception for his son and the truth comes out, people will see it as weakness."
msgstr "자신의 아들을 예외로 살려 뒀다가 진실이 드러나면, 신민들은 그걸 약점으로 여기겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "him" / Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D74"
msgid "They will question the Ministry of State's authority, which means they are questioning him... Something his pride would never risk."
msgstr ""
"신민들은 국무성의 권위에 의문을 제기할 것이고, 이는 오라버니에게 의문을 제기하는 것을 의미하죠... 오라버니는 자존심 때문에 결코 "
"위험을 무릅쓰지 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D73"
msgid "On the other hand, going through with it, announcing it to the public? That solidifies the Ministry of State as a force to be both feared and revered."
msgstr ""
"반면에, 처형을 실행에 옮기고 대중에게 발표한다면요? 이로써 국무성은 두려움과 존경을 동시에 받는 세력으로 확고히 자리매김하게 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is Viktor being so unreasonable? &&& Vitoria: Viktor is letting his emotions get the better of him. |He was barely processing the shock and grief from losing Vashti. Then came the anger and betrayal from Vaeric.|My brother is a man of pride and great faith. For the first time, I think he does not know what to do.|But I am certain Viktor does not wish Vaeric dead.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is it not obvious? He has given you the perfect out. The ring.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D72"
msgid "How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?"
msgstr "빅토르가 배릭이 죽길 원하지 않는다는 건 어떻게 알죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D71"
msgid "Is it not obvious? He has given you the perfect out. The ring."
msgstr "뻔하지 않아요? 오라버니가 완벽한 구실을 줬잖아요. 반지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D70"
msgid "Yes, Vaeric would be loathe to part with it. It belonged to his sister and is all he has left, but to save his life?"
msgstr "물론 배릭은 반지를 내주기 싫어하겠죠. 동생이 남긴 유일한 물건이니. 하지만 목숨은 지켜야 하지 않겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6F"
msgid "To save her brother, Vashti would give him her blessing to hand it over if you asked."
msgstr "바슈티도 자기 오빠를 구하기 위해서라면 얼마든지 넘겨줘도 좋다고 했을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know Viktor doesn't want Vaeric dead?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6E"
msgid "This is why I ask you to spare him."
msgstr "그래서 저도 배릭을 살려달라고 부탁하는 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is Viktor being so unreasonable? &&& Vitoria: Viktor is letting his emotions get the better of him. |He was barely processing the shock and grief from losing Vashti. Then came the anger and betrayal from Vaeric.|My brother is a man of pride and great faith. For the first time, I think he does not know what to do.|But I am certain Viktor does not wish Vaeric dead.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I pray I have answers for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6D"
msgid "I still have more questions."
msgstr "아직 질문이 더 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I still have more questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I still have more questions.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0111A8FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6C"
msgid "And I pray I have answers for you."
msgstr "답해줄 수 있기를 기도할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6B"
msgid "But I also recognize these circumstances are not normal."
msgstr "하지만 이 상황이 정상이 아니라는 것도 잘 알고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_TheKeepScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D6A"
msgid "The Ministry of State oversees military and security, so we already have established offices here."
msgstr "국무성은 군사 및 보안을 감독하기 때문에, 진즉에 이곳에 청사를 차렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why haven't you dealt with this yourself?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D69"
msgid "This knowledge weakens the Ministry of State's authority, something we cannot risk at this time."
msgstr "그런 사실이 알려지면 국무성의 권위가 약해진다. 현재로서는 그런 위험을 감수할 순 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why haven't you dealt with this yourself?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D68"
msgid "This is why my interests turned to a third party, someone outside of the noble Houses, but we have yet to determine someone trustworthy enough. Until now."
msgstr "그래서 명문 가문 소속이 아닌 제3자를 찾으려고 했지만, 아직 충분히 믿을 만한 사람을 찾아내지 못했다. 지금까지는 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would Viktor send someone to execute Vaeric if he doesn't want him dead?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D67"
msgid "But I am certain Viktor does not wish Vaeric dead."
msgstr "하지만 빅토르는 배릭이 죽기를 바라지 않을 거라 장담해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D66"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Vindicator <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 옹호자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D65"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Diviner <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 예측자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D64"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Reverent <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 숭배자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D63"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Armiger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 복종자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D62"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Adherent <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 지지자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't even know what discretion is...
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't even know what discretion is...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104106B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D61"
msgid "So the Council would send an untrustworthy fool to secure my cooperation?"
msgstr "대의회가 내 협조를 구한답시고 믿지도 못할 멍청이를 보냈단 말이냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't even know what discretion is...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Do not be foolish, Viktor. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104106B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D60"
msgid "The sheer audacity... Without discretion, there is nothing left to say."
msgstr "뻔뻔한 것도 정도가 있지... 신중하지 못하다면 더 할 말 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D5F"
msgid "I just want to save lives. I don't care about a reputation or legacy, or being compared to heroes."
msgstr "저는 그저 생명을 구하고 싶을 뿐이에요. 명성, 유산, 영웅과의 비교 이딴 건 아무래도 상관없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D54"
msgid "You are nothing!"
msgstr "네놈은 아무것도 아니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D53"
msgid "You cannot stop this!"
msgstr "멈추지 못할 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D52"
msgid "Just give it up!"
msgstr "그냥 포기해라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D51"
msgid "I have the Great Serpent on my side!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 내 편을 들어주신다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D50"
msgid "You cannot defy the Serpent's Will!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻을 거스를 수는 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D4F"
msgid "Be made dust!"
msgstr "흙먼지로 만들어주마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D4E"
msgid "Accept your end!"
msgstr "종말을 받아들여라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D4D"
msgid "I will not be defied!"
msgstr "나는 거역하지 않을 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D4C"
msgid "There will be no mercy for you!"
msgstr "자비는 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111930C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_Taunt_Anasko
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "013D4B"
msgid "Your last moments will be nothing but suffering!"
msgstr "마지막 순간을 고통스럽게 해주마!"

