#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D45"
msgid "So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun?"
msgstr "그럼 대의회가 바룬 가문 아래에 있는 가문들을 운영하는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D44"
msgid "No, it's... complicated."
msgstr "아뇨. 그... 복잡하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D43"
msgid "The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House."
msgstr ""
"대변자님이 가장 큰 권위를 가져요. 그분은 위대한 뱀의 목소리나 다름없죠. 각 가문들은 일상에 필요한 직무를 처리하는데, 가문 장로가 "
"개별적으로 운영해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ...and prestige is a little rueful / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Got it. Makes sense.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D42"
msgid "Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige."
msgstr ""
"그리고 각 가문들은 대의회에 중개자를 임명해서 대변자님께 정보를 제공하고 조언을 드리죠. 중개자는 장로와는 별개의 직책인데, 권위는 더 "
"낮아요... 명성도 그렇고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun? &&& ...  &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you must have a head for politics, or you're good at pretending. Either way, you will fit right in here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D41"
msgid "Got it. Makes sense."
msgstr "알았어요. 이해가 되네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Have you ever thought about changing the system?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Have you ever thought about changing the system?
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: Got it. Makes sense.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D40"
msgid "Now is hardly the time to be entertaining such thoughts."
msgstr "지금은 그런 생각을 할 때가 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun? &&& ...  &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just so you know, it isn't wise to openly question Jinan Va'ruun's decisions. You don't want to be accused of heresy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3F"
msgid "There's no way that's all necessary."
msgstr "그런 직책들이 다 필요한 건 아니잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun? &&& ...  &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps. It keeps the Speaker free to concentrate on the larger issues, while allowing us some amount of control over our lives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3E"
msgid "That all seems overly complicated."
msgstr "너무 복잡해 보이는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no way that's all necessary.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no way that's all necessary.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3D"
msgid "Just so you know, it isn't wise to openly question Jinan Va'ruun's decisions. You don't want to be accused of heresy."
msgstr "참고로 말하자면, 지난 바룬 님의 결정을 대놓고 의심하는 건 좋지 않아요. 이단자라는 비난은 피해야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That all seems overly complicated.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That all seems overly complicated.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3C"
msgid "Perhaps. It keeps the Speaker free to concentrate on the larger issues, while allowing us some amount of control over our lives."
msgstr "그럴지도요. 덕분에 대변자님은 더 큰 문제에 집중하실 수 있고, 우리는 우리 인생을 어느 정도 통제할 수 있답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: No, it's... complicated.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3B"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you."
msgstr "지난 바룬께서 직접 만드신 규칙이 있거든요. 최대한 쉽게 설명해 볼게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Got it. Makes sense.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Got it. Makes sense.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D3A"
msgid "So you must have a head for politics, or you're good at pretending. Either way, you will fit right in here."
msgstr "정치를 아주 잘 아는 모양이네요. 아니면 그런 척을 잘하거나요. 어느 쪽이든 여기에 잘 어울리겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So the High Council runs the Houses under Va'ruun? &&& ...  &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the rules. Let me see if I can make it easy for you. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: The Speaker has supreme authority. He is the voice of the Great Serpent. The Houses each handle some function of daily life, and are individually run by the Elder of the House. &&& MQ_DjimalKadic: Each of the Houses also appoints a Mediary to the High Council, to inform and advise the Speaker. It's a separate position from the Elder, with a lesser degree of authority... and prestige.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Now is hardly the time to be entertaining such thoughts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011191C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_CouncilElders
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D39"
msgid "Have you ever thought about changing the system?"
msgstr "제도를 바꿀 생각을 해 본 적은 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Not long, though it feels like an eternity.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: It has been quite a challenge to accept this new level of responsibility.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119137
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Council
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D38"
msgid "Djimal and I had only been a part of the Council for maybe a year before all this? And we were only ever in subordinate roles."
msgstr "지말과 제가 이 사건 터지기 전에 대의회에서 활동한 지가 겨우 1년쯤 됐을까요? 게다가 하급자 역할만 맡아봤지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What exactly does your High Council do?
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: We offer perspectives and opinions that can often contradict one another, which can ultimately help the Speaker to guide our people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D37"
msgid "Any decision about House Va'ruun is the Speaker's to make, but Jinan Va'ruun in his wisdom saw fit to create the High Council to help advise those decisions."
msgstr ""
"바룬 가문에 관련된 결정은 모두 대변자님이 내리시지만, 지난 바룬께선 지혜롭게도 그런 결정에 조언을 제공해 줄 대의회를 만들기로 "
"하셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013D36"
msgid "Hmm? Something I can do for you?"
msgstr "흠? 도와줄 일이라도 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can skip the bravado. I'm here for a Vortex Interlock, and I'm going to get it. You won't stop me. &&& Karija: How confident you are. So much more so than any who came before. &&& Karija: Jinan Va'ruun himself charged us with the protection of this facility. It was his last order, and it will be carried out.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But it seems you are not hearing me. You have no right to be here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A4D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D35"
msgid "So you can hear me? Fascinating, other phantoms couldn't."
msgstr "내 말이 들린다는 거네? 재밌는데. 다른 유령들은 못 듣던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So you can hear me? Fascinating, other phantoms couldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you can hear me? Fascinating, other phantoms couldn't.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: The work done here must be safeguarded. Protected. Never permitted to leave. None but the Speaker may decide otherwise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A4D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D34"
msgid "But it seems you are not hearing me. You have no right to be here."
msgstr "넌 내 말을 못 듣는 모양이군. 넌 여기 있을 자격이 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will take you down as many times as I need to. You're not stopping me. &&& Karija: Your conviction is impressive. The outcome will not change, but we will show you... mercy.
#. ALIAS: Vedrasa
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVedrasaMaleen
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A4D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D33"
msgid "So be it. I will simply watch."
msgstr "그래요. 난 그냥 지켜보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I see.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Do you know where I was when it happened? The "incident", they call it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A423
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D32"
msgid "I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help."
msgstr "대의회가 다시 한번 해결책을 찾고 있다니 다행이구먼. 돕지 않는 건... 잘못된 일 같았거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you. &&& Karija: I have already made it clear you cannot. &&& Vedrasa: This is turning into a most exhilarating exercise.
#. ALIAS: Draqir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDraqirMaleen
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A4D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D31"
msgid "All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already!"
msgstr "웬 소란이야! 겨우 침입자 하나 가지고? 빨리 끝내 버리자고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you. &&& Karija: I have already made it clear you cannot.
#. ALIAS: Vedrasa
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVedrasaMaleen
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Draqir: All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A4D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D30"
msgid "This is turning into a most exhilarating exercise."
msgstr "이거 아주 짜릿한 운동이 되겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not going to stop until I get answers. &&& Karija: I respect your dedication. But I also cannot stop. I swore an oath to House Va'ruun, and I will uphold it. &&& Karija: Do you even understand why you are here, what it is you are looking for? This seems a fool's errand.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So, you do know something about this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A422
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2F"
msgid "I'm looking for something called a Vortex Interlock."
msgstr "볼텍스 제어장치라는 물건을 찾고 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm looking for something called a Vortex Interlock.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for something called a Vortex Interlock.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2E"
msgid "So, you do know something about this place."
msgstr "그래. 여길 아주 모르는 건 아니로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm looking for something called a Vortex Interlock.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: You should have left when you had the chance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2D"
msgid "It does not matter. The Interlocks are not yours. They belong here, with us. And they will stay here."
msgstr "상관없다. 제어장치는 네 것이 아니다. 우리와 함께 이곳에 속한 것이지. 여기 남아있어야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vedrasa: Sister, have you not finished this game?
#. ALIAS: Vedrasa
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVedrasaMaleen
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: It would also seem that I spoke too soon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A41F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2C"
msgid "You should have heeded Karija's words in the beginning, little one. This is no place for you."
msgstr "카리자가 한 말을 잘 들었어야지, 꼬마야. 여긴 네가 있을 곳이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Vedrasa
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: The work done here has tied us to this place for all time. That is why we have agreed to guard it. &&& Vedrasa: Sister, have you not finished this game? &&& Vedrasa: You should have heeded Karija's words in the beginning, little one. This is no place for you. &&& companion: It would also seem that I spoke too soon.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not going to stop until I get answers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A41D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2B"
msgid "The outcome has not changed, Vedrasa. We are still in control here."
msgstr "결과는 변하지 않았어요. 베드라사. 여긴 여전히 우리가 통제합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Karija
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: You think you would be rid of me so easily? The arrogance... &&& companion: It would seem this will be more challenging than we anticipated. &&& Karija: The work done here has tied us to this place for all time. That is why we have agreed to guard it.
#. ALIAS: Vedrasa
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVedrasaMaleen
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: You should have heeded Karija's words in the beginning, little one. This is no place for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0111A420
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage550_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D2A"
msgid "Sister, have you not finished this game?"
msgstr "자매님. 그 장난, 아직도 안 끝났나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: tone of "oh boy, here we go again" / Serious
