#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A Zealot wouldn't feel guilty about the Serpent's Crusade. Weren't you doing the Great Serpent's bidding? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A Zealot wouldn't feel guilty about the Serpent's Crusade. Weren't you doing the Great Serpent's bidding? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A442
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D21"
msgid "I thought I was, but the Great Serpent has stopped answering my prayers long ago. He has forsaken me, but I do not know why."
msgstr "난 그렇다고 생각했지만, 위대한 뱀께선 오래 전부터 내 기도에 답하지 않았다. 그분이 날 버리셨으나, 그 이유를 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A Zealot wouldn't feel guilty about the Serpent's Crusade. Weren't you doing the Great Serpent's bidding? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
