msgstr "이제 그분의 인도로 말미암아 난 양심이 생겼다. 이보다 더 심한 고문이 없어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Well, that was certainly an exciting show. And what a twist ending! |You know, hard as it is to believe, I will miss him. Orahim was fun to have around, back when he was not a self-righteous bore. |And as much as I am sure he tried to convince you otherwise, I am a man of my word. Your credits. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ha ha! You really are a brigand aren't you? Great Serpent, in another life, you and I would have made the Settled Systems ours. 
