#. TOPIC: 0111A441
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1F"
msgid "Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?"
msgstr "에이, 그것보다 돈 더 줄 수 있잖아. 당신 시체에서 그 크레딧을 챙겨 줘야겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on. &&& Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy. &&& Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done. &&& Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I thought I was, but the Great Serpent has stopped answering my prayers long ago. He has forsaken me, but I do not know why. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A443
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1E"
msgid "A Zealot wouldn't feel guilty about the Serpent's Crusade. Weren't you doing the Great Serpent's bidding?"
msgstr "광신도라면 뱀의 성전을 수행하면서 죄책감을 느끼지 않을 텐데. 당신은 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 따르고 있던 게 아니었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A440
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1D"
msgid "Ha ha! You really are a brigand aren't you? Great Serpent, in another life, you and I would have made the Settled Systems ours."
msgstr "하하! 아주 그냥 도적이 납셨군? 위대한 뱀이시여, 전생에 우리가 서로 만났으면 개척 성계를 우리 것으로 만들었을 텐데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A440
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1C"
msgid "Here, take this, take it all. This was the most fun I have had in months. Oh, but one more thing..."
msgstr "자, 받아라. 전부 가져가. 근래 몇 달 동안 제일 재밌는 순간이었다. 아, 다만 한 가지 더..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A440
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1B"
msgid "You had better pray to the Great Serpent, or any other Settled Systems false-god that you worship, that you never see my face again. Nobody speaks to me the way you just did. Consider this warning a token of our friendship."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀께, 아니면 네놈이 숭배하는 다른 개척 성계의 거짓된 신에게 기도를 올려라. 다신 내 얼굴을 보는 일이 없게 해 달라고. 세상 "
"그 누구라 해도 방금 그딴 식으로 나한테 말하면 가만 두지 않으니까. 서로 친해졌으니 특별히 경고해 주는 걸로 알아라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: clear throat at beginning, whiplash back to being friendly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Come on, you can spare more credits than that. Or should I just take the rest off your corpse?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111A440
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D1A"
msgid "*Coughs* But, enough of that. Ta-ta, friend! Time to move along."
msgstr "*기침* 어쨌든, 그쯤 하면 됐어. 안녕이다, 친구! 이제 갈 시간이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, I found you, so I'm leaving now.  &&& Ilana: Fine. Bye.  &&& Ilana: I'm just... annoyed.|I know that some people have lost a lot. Their homes, or their parents, or other things. Ivali and I are lucky, or so my parents say. You know, when I actually see them.|My parents have been so busy helping other people that I feel like they've forgotten about me. |I'm sick of feeling sad. Like, sometimes my mother will tell me and Ivali that she'll try and be home early so that she can be with us. But it just... never happens. I wish she'd just not say anything at all. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's okay, and thanks, I guess. That was kind of embarrassing... I'm not sure why I told you all of that.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0111A44B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D19"
msgid "I know how hard everything has been for you, and I'm sorry you're going through this."
msgstr "요즘 힘들었지? 그런 일들을 겪었으니… 정말 안됐구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know how hard everything has been for you, and I'm sorry you're going through this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know how hard everything has been for you, and I'm sorry you're going through this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0111A44A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D18"
msgid "It's okay, and thanks, I guess. That was kind of embarrassing... I'm not sure why I told you all of that."
msgstr "괜찮아요. 그리고, 감사해요. 좀 창피한 느낌이 드네요... 왜 그런 말을 했는지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know how hard everything has been for you, and I'm sorry you're going through this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0111A44A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D17"
msgid "I don't really want to talk anymore, so... bye."
msgstr "더 이상 얘기하고 싶지 않아요. 그럼... 안녕."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ilana: What took you so long? Ugh... I've been waiting forever. I'm so bored.
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Uh, no, I don't feel lucky. It's just a stupid game.
