#. PROMPT: Cheer up! Don't you feel lucky that you're still able to play these games?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cheer up! Don't you feel lucky that you're still able to play these games?
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ilana: I'm just... annoyed.
