#. TOPIC: 0111A448
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D15"
msgid "Uh, no, I don't feel lucky. It's just a stupid game."
msgstr "어, 아뇨. 운이 좋다 안 느껴요. 바보 같은 놀이일 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Ilana may not show it now, but one day he'll look back and be thankful for everything you did for him. You're doing great.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ilana may not show it now, but one day he'll look back and be thankful for everything you did for him. You're doing great.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mila: I should be going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0111A446
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D14"
msgid "Thanks, I'm glad you think so."
msgstr "고마워요, 그렇게 생각하니 기뻐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I should be going.  &&& Mila: Okay, thanks for the game.  
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thanks, I'm glad you think so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0111A447
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D13"
msgid "Ilana may not show it now, but one day he'll look back and be thankful for everything you did for him. You're doing great."
msgstr "아일라나가 지금 모습을 보이진 않지만 언젠가 네가 해 준 모든 일에 감사를 표할 거야. 넌 잘하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then where do we draw the line? If selling the remains of your deceased mother does not warrant a penalty of death, then we are living in an contemptible world. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111A43F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D12"
msgid "What kind of soldier would duel their inebriated civilian brother? There's no honor to be gained by this."
msgstr "대체 어떤 군인이 술에 취한 민간인과, 그것도 형제와 결투를 벌입니까? 해봤자 명예롭지 않은 짓이라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of soldier would duel their inebriated civilian brother? There's no honor to be gained by this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of soldier would duel their inebriated civilian brother? There's no honor to be gained by this.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111A43E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D11"
msgid "Then where do we draw the line? If selling the remains of your deceased mother does not warrant a penalty of death, then we are living in an contemptible world."
msgstr ""
"그럼 우리는 어디에서 선을 그어야 했나? 죽은 어머니의 유골을 파는 것이 사형을 받을 만한 것이 아니라면, 그거야말로 경멸스러운 세상에 "
"살고 있는 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a little shocked / Irritated
#. PROMPT: Talk to me while I can still help you, otherwise you'll just die alone, remembered as a drunk and a loser that pushed Borhal too far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Talk to me while I can still help you, otherwise you'll just die alone, remembered as a drunk and a loser that pushed Borhal too far.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Go on, ask your questions again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111A438
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D10"
msgid "You do not mince words, do you? I can respect that, but it also makes me want to beat your head in."
msgstr "말을 가려 할 줄 모르나? 이 새끼가? 싸가지 없는 건 그렇다 쳐도, 그딴 말을 들으니 대가리 부숴버리고 싶네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you refuse to apologize?  &&& Amila: Do I have something to apologize for?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You do not mince words, do you? I can respect that, but it also makes me want to beat your head in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0111A439
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D0F"
msgid "Talk to me while I can still help you, otherwise you'll just die alone, remembered as a drunk and a loser that pushed Borhal too far."
msgstr ""
"도울 수 있을 때 말하는 게 좋을 겁니다. 아니면 그냥 혼자 뒈지시던가. 보할을 계속 자극하다 뒈져버린 주정뱅이, 실패자로 기억되고 "
"싶다면야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
