msgstr "뭘 해야 할지 다 압니다. 전에도 이미 해 봤죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Oh. Oh no.|I'm so sorry. With the state of Dazra being what it appears, we assumed there were other priorities, and were not expecting you.|I am sorry, but we do not have the allotted produce ready for delivery. Things have been slow, but we are trying our best.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111A427
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D0B"
msgid "If you will be here for a while, mind your step. Things are in a sorry state here, though we do the best we can."
msgstr "잠시 머무르실 거라면 발밑 조심하세요. 최선을 다하고 있는데도 여기 상황이 영 좋질 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Comrak
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: Father says the Great Serpent watches over us all the time. I'm not worried.
