#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D0A"
msgid "Are you sure it's safe to be wandering around alone?"
msgstr "정말 여기서 혼자 돌아다녀도 괜찮겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure it's safe to be wandering around alone?
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: Besides, no one ever comes around here anymore anyways.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 0111A425
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Comrak_Alone
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D09"
msgid "Father says the Great Serpent watches over us all the time. I'm not worried."
msgstr "아버지가 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 지켜주신댔거든요. 걱정 안 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: Father says the Great Serpent watches over us all the time. I'm not worried.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
