#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC05_Quest_WarningScene01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013D07"
msgid "Warning: Power fluctuations detected. Re-routing to compensate; drainage pump control bypassed."
msgstr "경고. 전력 변동 감지. 보정을 위해 경로를 재지정합니다. 배수 펌프 제어 절차가 우회됩니다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_AnnouncerFTheOracle
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC05_Quest
#. TOPIC: 01050B39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC05_Quest_WarningScene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013D06"
msgid "Warning: Power grid destabilized. Containment fields failing. Backup systems risk overload; consider manual shutdown at the earliest convenience."
msgstr ""
"경고. 전력망 불안정 감지. 억제장이 비활성화되었습니다. 백업 시스템이 과부하 될 위험이 있습니다. 최대한 빨리 수동 정지를 검토해 "
"주십시오."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_AnnouncerFTheOracle
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_LC05_Quest
#. TOPIC: 01050B38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_LC05_Quest_WarningScene03
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013D05"
msgid "Warning: Critical power failure. Dam function compromised. Emergency evacuation protocols enacted. Please exit the facility."
msgstr "경고. 심각한 전력 부족 감지. 댐 기능이 손상되었습니다. 비상 대피 프로토콜이 실행됩니다. 시설 밖으로 대피해 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking aloud, hesitant, a bit uncertain / Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D04"
msgid "It is... not what I was expecting."
msgstr "이건... 제가 예상했던 게 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grappling with a challenging issue, soul-searching / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D03"
msgid "I thought there would be more glory and less blood."
msgstr "핏자국보다 영광이 더 많을 줄 알았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D02"
msgid "I know that what I do is necessary to protect innocent people, but every life I take makes me question my path."
msgstr "무고한 사람들을 지키려면 제가 하는 일이 꼭 필요하다는 걸 알지만, 생명을 앗아갈 때마다 제 길이 맞는지 의심하게 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: In all likelihood, yes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D01"
msgid "I wonder now if Mahkara also felt the sting of guilt as I do."
msgstr "마카라 님도 저처럼 죄책감을 느꼈을지 궁금하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: It is... not what I was expecting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013D00"
msgid "How goes the battle to protect the people of Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라의 신민을 지키기 위한 전투는 잘 되고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: Oh yes, they have been all that I hoped.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFF"
msgid "Are the heirlooms working okay?"
msgstr "그 유산은 잘 작동하나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Enthusiastic. / Happy / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are the heirlooms working okay?
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFE"
msgid "Oh yes, they have been all that I hoped."
msgstr "아, 그럼, 제가 바라던 그대로예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFD"
msgid "Better yet, everything fits comfortably and is easy to use."
msgstr "게다가, 모든 게 편안하게 잘 맞고 사용하기도 쉬워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFC"
msgid "Truly, it's a testament to the skill of those who created them so long ago."
msgstr "정말, 오래전에 가보를 만든 장인들의 솜씨가 대단하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: NPC_MaalyaHajtal: I ask myself that question often.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFB"
msgid "Do you think you've honored Mahkara the Fang's legacy?"
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라의 유산을 잘 기리고 있다고 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think you've honored Mahkara the Fang's legacy?
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CFA"
msgid "I ask myself that question often."
msgstr "저도 자주 스스로에게 그 질문을 던지곤 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ruminating / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CF9"
msgid "For so many years, I was obsessed with the legacy of the mighty Fang."
msgstr "아주 오랜 세월 동안, 저는 강대한 송곳니의 유산에 집착했었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: An epiphany / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CF8"
msgid "It is strange to say this, but I don't really care so much anymore."
msgstr "이런 말 하긴 낯설지만, 이젠 정말 아무래도 상관없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_MaalyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_TL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CF7"
msgid "What I do, I do to protect the people of Dazra, and for no other reason."
msgstr "제가 하는 일은, 다즈라의 신민을 지키기 위한 일일 뿐이에요."

