#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013CE8"
msgid "Serpent protect you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 보호해주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013CE7"
msgid "Until our next meeting."
msgstr "다음에 또 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196EA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013CE6"
msgid "I hope to see you again."
msgstr "또 만나요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CE5"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious, the player has stopped talking mid-conversation.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_WFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013CE4"
msgid "Something on your mind?"
msgstr "무슨 생각 하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious, the player has stopped talking mid-conversation.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_WFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013CE3"
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "괜찮아요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: 
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110950D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_000_CouncilMeetings_Scene_OpeningIntro
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01119273
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CE2"
msgid "State your proposals."
msgstr "제안을 말해보도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119292
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CE1"
msgid "Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?"
msgstr "청크에서 살고 있는 버림받은 자들에 대해 들어본 적이 없는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119292
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CE0"
msgid "I'm not surprised. Our existence is a shameful topic for many."
msgstr "놀랍지도 않군. 우리의 존재는 많은 이들에게 수치스러운 주제니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not here to scoff at anyone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not here to scoff at anyone.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDF"
msgid "Truly? Then I welcome you."
msgstr "정말인가? 그렇다면 자네를 환영하겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not here to scoff at anyone.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDE"
msgid "Just know that spending time with us might cause you to be looked upon unfavorably."
msgstr "다만 우리와 어울리면 다른 이들에게 안 좋게 보일 수도 있다는 걸 알아두게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LucjanVolkar: Have you come to scoff at the fools? Or are you here to join us, perhaps?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119293
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDD"
msgid "I'm not sure what you mean."
msgstr "무슨 말씀이신지 잘 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LucjanVolkar: Have you come to scoff at the fools? Or are you here to join us, perhaps?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Truly? Then I welcome you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119291
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDC"
msgid "I'm not here to scoff at anyone."
msgstr "난 그 누구도 비웃고 싶지 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious, a little bitter / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119294
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDB"
msgid "Have you come to scoff at the fools? Or are you here to join us, perhaps?"
msgstr "어리석은 자들을 비웃으러 왔나? 아니면, 우리와 함께하러 왔나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CDA"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "누구신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who are you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD9"
msgid "We are outcasts living in self-imposed exile."
msgstr "우리는 스스로를 추방한 버림받은 자들일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who are you?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD8"
msgid "We are not welcome in the city, so we have come here to make a new home."
msgstr "우리는 도시에서 환영받지 못하기에 이곳에 새 터전을 마련했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LucjanVolkar: Have you come to scoff at the fools? Or are you here to join us, perhaps?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It closed because it was not profitable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD7"
msgid "What happened to this place?"
msgstr "이곳에 무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happened to this place?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happened to this place?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD6"
msgid "It closed because it was not profitable."
msgstr "수익성이 없어서 문을 닫았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happened to this place?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: I'm not sure what you mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD5"
msgid "Being open to new ideas and experiences is not our way."
msgstr "새로운 사상과 경험을 받아들이는 건 우리 방식이 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happened to this place?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD4"
msgid "Little wonder. We are a deeply traditional people, and distrustful of unfamiliar things."
msgstr "당연한 일이지. 우리는 전통을 중시하고 익숙하지 않은 것들을 불신하는 민족이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wistful, a sad tale / Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LucjanVolkar: Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?|I'm not surprised. Our existence is a shameful topic for many.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD3"
msgid "All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds."
msgstr "평생 위를 올려다보며 머나먼 세계를 탐험하기를 열망했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD2"
msgid "Such thinking is frowned upon, so I kept these feelings in my heart and did not speak of them."
msgstr "그런 생각은 눈살을 찌푸리게 하는 것이라, 이 감정을 가슴속에 묻고 입 밖에 내지 않았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD1"
msgid "When the calamity struck, things changed."
msgstr "재난이 닥치자, 상황이 바뀌었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CD0"
msgid "Some of us openly questioned whether it was safe to remain here."
msgstr "우리 중 일부는 이곳에 남아 있는 것이 안전한지 공개적으로 의문을 제기했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCF"
msgid "The condemnation was swift and merciless."
msgstr "비난은 빠르고 가차 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCE"
msgid "We were shunned and cursed. People would not look at us. Merchants would not serve us."
msgstr "우리는 따돌림당하고 저주받았네. 사람들은 우리를 쳐다보지 않았고, 상인들은 우리에게 물건을 팔지 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm truly sorry.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCD"
msgid "We left the city behind, knowing we would never again be forgiven or accepted."
msgstr "우리는 다시는 용서받거나 받아들여지지 않을 것임을 알면서 도시를 떠났네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what you mean. &&& LucjanVolkar: Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?|I'm not surprised. Our existence is a shameful topic for many. &&& LucjanVolkar: All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds.|Such thinking is frowned upon, so I kept these feelings in my heart and did not speak of them.|When the calamity struck, things changed.|Some of us openly questioned whether it was safe to remain here.|The condemnation was swift and merciless.|We were shunned and cursed. People would not look at us. Merchants would not serve us.|We left the city behind, knowing we would never again be forgiven or accepted.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. Sympathy from a stranger is a rare gift among the people of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111928A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCC"
msgid "I'm truly sorry."
msgstr "정말 안타깝군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm truly sorry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm truly sorry.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCB"
msgid "Thank you. Sympathy from a stranger is a rare gift among the people of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "고맙네. 바룬 가문의 신민들 사이에서 이방인의 동정을 받는 건 흔치 않은 선물이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm truly sorry.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CCA"
msgid "Unfortunately, our collective closed-mindedness could lead to our downfall."
msgstr "불행히도, 우리의 집단적 편협함은 우리의 몰락으로 이어질 수 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm truly sorry.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: If you need a place to stay, you may remain here as long as you like.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC9"
msgid "If more of these unforeseen calamities should happen, we risk losing everything."
msgstr "만약 이런 예측할 수 없는 재난이 더 많이 일어난다면, 우리는 모든 것을 잃을 위험에 처하게 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what you mean. &&& LucjanVolkar: Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?|I'm not surprised. Our existence is a shameful topic for many. &&& LucjanVolkar: All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds.|Such thinking is frowned upon, so I kept these feelings in my heart and did not speak of them.|When the calamity struck, things changed.|Some of us openly questioned whether it was safe to remain here.|The condemnation was swift and merciless.|We were shunned and cursed. People would not look at us. Merchants would not serve us.|We left the city behind, knowing we would never again be forgiven or accepted.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True, and yet I could not remain silent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119288
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC8"
msgid "Not surprising, really."
msgstr "사실 놀랍지도 않군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not surprising, really.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not surprising, really.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC7"
msgid "True, and yet I could not remain silent."
msgstr "맞는 말이네, 하지만 난 침묵할 수 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not surprising, really.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC6"
msgid "I know it was selfish, at least in part."
msgstr "적어도 어느 정도는 이기적이었다는 걸 알고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not surprising, really.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC5"
msgid "All my life, I've sought the chance to leave, and there it was."
msgstr "평생 떠날 기회를 찾았는데, 그 기회가 온 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on the first "are". What if we really ARE in danger, though? / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not surprising, really.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC4"
msgid "But what if we are in danger? What if there are more of these catastrophes?"
msgstr "하지만 만약 우리가 위험에 처해 있다면? 만약 이런 재난이 더 많이 발생한다면?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not surprising, really.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: If you need a place to stay, you may remain here as long as you like.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC3"
msgid "If we lose this world, we lose everything."
msgstr "우리가 이 세계를 잃으면, 모든 것을 잃는 것이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what you mean. &&& LucjanVolkar: Then you have not heard of the outcasts living at Chunks?|I'm not surprised. Our existence is a shameful topic for many. &&& LucjanVolkar: All my life I've looked upward, yearning to explore distant worlds.|Such thinking is frowned upon, so I kept these feelings in my heart and did not speak of them.|When the calamity struck, things changed.|Some of us openly questioned whether it was safe to remain here.|The condemnation was swift and merciless.|We were shunned and cursed. People would not look at us. Merchants would not serve us.|We left the city behind, knowing we would never again be forgiven or accepted.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I couldn't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC2"
msgid "You should have kept your mouth shut."
msgstr "입을 다물고 있는 게 좋았을 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to LucjanVolkar
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: Is it possible that some day, some of us could return? Perhaps.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC1"
msgid "Will you ever try to return to the city?"
msgstr "도시로 돌아가려고 시도해 본 적이 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LucjanVolkar: Thank you. Sympathy from a stranger is a rare gift among the people of House Va'ruun.|Unfortunately, our collective closed-mindedness could lead to our downfall.|If more of these unforeseen calamities should happen, we risk losing everything.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CC0"
msgid "If you need a place to stay, you may remain here as long as you like."
msgstr "머물 곳이 필요하다면, 원하는 만큼 이곳에 머물러도 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Bitter / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBF"
msgid "Unlike those in the city, we do not make others feel unwelcome."
msgstr "도시 사람들과는 달리, 우리는 다른 사람들을 불편하게 하지 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBE"
msgid "Or was there something else?"
msgstr "아니면 다른 용건이 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBD"
msgid "I couldn't."
msgstr "그럴 수 없었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBC"
msgid "For too long, I remained silent and denied who I truly am."
msgstr "너무 오랫동안 침묵하며 진정한 내 모습을 부정했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBB"
msgid "The tragedy in the city showed that we are vulnerable."
msgstr "도시의 비극은 우리가 취약하다는 것을 보여주었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CBA"
msgid "I can't believe the Great Serpent intended us to stay trapped on this world forever."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리가 이 세계에 영원히 갇혀 있기를 바라셨다고는 믿을 수 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have kept your mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: If you need a place to stay, you may remain here as long as you like.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB9"
msgid "Not when our entire civilization could be lost if the planet were threatened."
msgstr "행성이 위협받으면 우리 문명 전체가 사라질 수도 있는데 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will you ever try to return to the city?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB8"
msgid "Is it possible that some day, some of us could return? Perhaps."
msgstr "언젠가 우리 중 일부가 돌아갈 수 있을지도 모르지. 아마도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Exposition / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB7"
msgid "But that future is difficult to see, at least today."
msgstr "하지만 적어도 지금으로서는 그 미래를 보기가 어렵군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB6"
msgid "It could be a long time, perhaps years or even decades, before we are accepted in Dazra City again."
msgstr "다즈라 시티에서 다시 받아들여지려면 오랜 시간, 아마도 수년 또는 수십 년이 걸릴 수도 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber, sad / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB5"
msgid "It is just as likely that we will all die here, forgotten by our brothers and sisters."
msgstr "형제자매들에게 잊힌 채 이곳에서 우리 모두 죽을 가능성도 마찬가지로 크지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to LucjanVolkar
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: Several reasons. For one, it's large enough to accommodate us comfortably.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB4"
msgid "Why choose this place for a new home?"
msgstr "왜 이곳을 새 터전으로 선택한 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Exposition / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why choose this place for a new home?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB3"
msgid "Several reasons. For one, it's large enough to accommodate us comfortably."
msgstr "몇 가지 이유가 있네. 하나는, 우리를 편안하게 수용할 수 있을 만큼 충분히 크다는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB2"
msgid "It's also far enough from the city to afford us some solitude."
msgstr "또한 도시에서 멀리 떨어져 있어 고독을 누릴 수 있다는 점도 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB1"
msgid "And lastly, it is unclaimed and so there is nobody to object to our presence."
msgstr "그리고 마지막으로, 소유권이 주장되지 않은 곳이라 우리의 존재를 반대할 사람이 아무도 없다는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CB0"
msgid "In truth, people from the city don't like to come here."
msgstr "사실, 도시 사람들은 이곳에 오는 것을 좋아하지 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAF"
msgid "To many, it's a symbol of the greed and corruption that plague the other factions of humanity."
msgstr "많은 이들에게 이곳은 인류의 다른 세력을 괴롭히는 탐욕과 부패의 상징이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to LucjanVolkar
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LucjanVolkar: Once something is accepted as tradition, it is difficult to change peoples' minds.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAE"
msgid "Why do people oppose the idea of leaving the planet?"
msgstr "왜 사람들은 행성을 떠나는 것에 반대하는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do people oppose the idea of leaving the planet?
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAD"
msgid "Once something is accepted as tradition, it is difficult to change peoples' minds."
msgstr "일단 전통으로 받아들여지면 사람들의 마음을 바꾸기가 어렵지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAC"
msgid "The Great Serpent guided Jinan Va'ruun to this world. It is where we are meant to be."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 지난 바룬을 이 세계로 인도하셨네. 이곳이 우리가 있어야 할 곳이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAB"
msgid "To desire to travel to other worlds is to be in defiance of the Serpent's will."
msgstr "다른 세계로 여행하기를 바라는 것은 뱀의 의지에 반하는 것이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CAA"
msgid "Only a select few are sent forth as spies to protect us from the other factions."
msgstr "오직 소수의 선택된 자들만이 다른 세력으로부터 우리를 보호하기 위해 간첩으로 보내지지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CA9"
msgid "But in truth, I see a means of control."
msgstr "하지만 사실, 나는 통제의 수단을 보고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LucjanVolkar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanTL3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CA8"
msgid "If people left, they might return with new ideas and challenging questions that threaten the fabric of society."
msgstr "만약 사람들이 떠난다면, 그들은 사회 구조를 위협하는 새로운 사상과 도발적인 질문을 가지고 돌아올 수도 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised to see an outsider / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117636
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaDalca
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013CA7"
msgid "An outsider? Here?"
msgstr "이방인이? 여기에?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised to see an outsider. A little taken aback.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 01119295
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011192D1
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013CA6"
msgid "I don't believe it!"
msgstr "믿을 수 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013CA5"
msgid "What can this mean?"
msgstr "이게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I listened, I just didn't care.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I listened, I just didn't care.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: The Speaker's orders will be carried out! You must die!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F4F1C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage530_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CA4"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "알겠다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS00B_MS01_OchimGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013CA3"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013CA2"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "잘 가거라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013CA1"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "흠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013CA0"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Uncertain, curious - the player has stopped talking in mid-conversation.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927C
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011192B0
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C9F"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr "뭐가 잘못됐나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite greeting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C9E"
msgid "Sit anywhere you like."
msgstr "원하는 곳에 앉으시게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite greeting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C9D"
msgid "You can rest safely here."
msgstr "여기서 안전하게 쉴 수 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking out loud / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C9C"
msgid "We have made our choice, for better or worse."
msgstr "좋든 싫든 우리는 선택을 했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber, resigned / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C9B"
msgid "There's no going back."
msgstr "돌이킬 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLucjanVolkar
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_LucjanHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C9A"
msgid "We will face the future together."
msgstr "우리는 함께 미래를 마주할 것이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Trying to chin up and be optimistic, but life is hard / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female02Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C99"
msgid "It's not so bad here, really."
msgstr "여기도 그렇게 나쁘진 않아, 정말로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Trying to chin up and be optimistic, but life is hard / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female02Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C98"
msgid "With some work, we can make this place a true home."
msgstr "조금만 노력하면 이곳을 진정한 보금자리로 만들 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking aloud / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female02Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C97"
msgid "We'll need to find more supplies soon."
msgstr "곧 물품을 더 많이 찾아야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking aloud / Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female02Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C96"
msgid "Hm, perhaps a fence to keep out the beasts."
msgstr "흠, 아마도 짐승들을 막을 울타리가 필요할지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Despairing, muttering to yourself / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C95"
msgid "All is lost. All is lost."
msgstr "모든 걸 잃었어. 모든 걸 잃었다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Despairing, muttering to yourself / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C94"
msgid "Why? Why would the Great Serpent forsake us?"
msgstr "왜? 위대한 뱀께서는 왜 우리를 버리시는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Despairing, muttering to yourself / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C93"
msgid "I'll never see my children again."
msgstr "다시는 내 아이들을 볼 수 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Despairing, muttering to yourself / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C92"
msgid "Why go on? What's the point?"
msgstr "왜 계속 살아야 하지? 무슨 의미가 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Despairing, muttering to yourself / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Female04Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C91"
msgid "Great Serpent, take pity on this wayward soul."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 이 길 잃은 영혼을 불쌍히 여기소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relaxed, unworried / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male03Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C90"
msgid "I'm not worried. This is a part of the Great Serpent's design."
msgstr "난 걱정하지 않아. 이것은 위대한 뱀의 계획의 일부일 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relaxed, unworried / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male03Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C8F"
msgid "Everything will unfold as it should."
msgstr "모든 것은 예정대로 진행될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relaxed, unworried / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male03Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C8E"
msgid "We must be patient and trust in the Great Serpent's will."
msgstr "우리는 인내심을 갖고 위대한 뱀의 의지를 믿어야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relaxed, unworried / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male03Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C8D"
msgid "It's not our place to question why the Great Serpent has brought us here."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 왜 우리를 이곳으로 인도하셨는지 의문을 품는 것은 우리가 할 일이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Bitter, angry / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C8A"
msgid "The people in the city are fools!"
msgstr "도시에 있는 사람들은 바보들이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Bitter, angry / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C89"
msgid "How do the others know it's not the Great Serpent's will that we spread to other worlds?"
msgstr "다른 이들이 우리가 다른 세계로 퍼져나가는 것이 위대한 뱀의 뜻이 아니라는 것을 어떻게 알겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Certain / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C88"
msgid "When the next catastrophe comes, we will be safe here."
msgstr "다음 재난이 닥치면, 우리는 이곳에서 안전할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Bitter / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks
#. TOPIC: 0111927B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueDazraChunks_Male05
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C87"
msgid "They'll regret casting us out."
msgstr "우릴 내쫓은 걸 후회하게 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_LovekVethaal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: It was breathtaking. A true testament to the will of Jinan Va'ruun, and our faith in the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119141
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C7C"
msgid "What was Dazra like before the experiment?"
msgstr "다즈라는 실험 전에 어떤 모습이었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was Dazra like before the experiment?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: To have started from nothing, and to have accomplished so much... I pray to the Serpent that we can someday reclaim all that we have lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119140
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C7B"
msgid "It was breathtaking. A true testament to the will of Jinan Va'ruun, and our faith in the Great Serpent."
msgstr "숨 막히는 장관이었지. 지난 바룬 님의 뜻과 위대한 뱀을 향한 우리의 신앙을 보여주는 진정한 증거였다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_LovekVethaal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: We are well aware of how we are perceived by people outside House Va'ruun. What they might inflict upon us, given the chance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C7A"
msgid "Why have I never seen this star system on any of my maps? How have you managed to stay hidden?"
msgstr "왜 제가 쓰는 은하계 지도에는 이 항성계가 전혀 안 보이죠? 지금까지 어떻게 숨겨온 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: settled systems in a derisive, almost mocking tone / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: So our survival has required a great deal of effort and planning. Grav jump coordinates are a closely guarded secret, known only to a few.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: Those who manage to find their way here rarely leave. Were the circumstances different, you would have learned for yourself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C79"
msgid "And our agents have infiltrated every government of the Settled Systems. Data is carefully and quietly scrubbed from their maps."
msgstr "우리 요원들이 개척 성계에 있는 모든 정부 조직에 침투해있기도 하고. 그쪽 지도에서 데이터를 조용히 지워버리는 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: We are well aware of how we are perceived by people outside House Va'ruun. What they might inflict upon us, given the chance.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: And our agents have infiltrated every government of the Settled Systems. Data is carefully and quietly scrubbed from their maps.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C78"
msgid "So our survival has required a great deal of effort and planning. Grav jump coordinates are a closely guarded secret, known only to a few."
msgstr "그러니 우리가 생존하려면 계획과 노력이 많이 필요하지. 중력 도약 좌표는 아는 사람이 거의 없는 극비 사항이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why have I never seen this star system on any of my maps? How have you managed to stay hidden?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: So our survival has required a great deal of effort and planning. Grav jump coordinates are a closely guarded secret, known only to a few.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C77"
msgid "We are well aware of how we are perceived by people outside House Va'ruun. What they might inflict upon us, given the chance."
msgstr "우린 바룬 가문 바깥에 있는 사람들이 우릴 어떻게 보는지 잘 알고 있소. 기회가 생기면 우리한테 어떤 짓을 할 건지도 잘 아오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: And our agents have infiltrated every government of the Settled Systems. Data is carefully and quietly scrubbed from their maps.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C76"
msgid "Those who manage to find their way here rarely leave. Were the circumstances different, you would have learned for yourself."
msgstr "이곳을 찾아낸 이들은 떠나는 법이 거의 없소이다. 상황이 달랐다면 당신도 직접 알게 됐을 텐데 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: It was breathtaking. A true testament to the will of Jinan Va'ruun, and our faith in the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111913A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C75"
msgid "To have started from nothing, and to have accomplished so much... I pray to the Serpent that we can someday reclaim all that we have lost."
msgstr ""
"빈손으로 시작해서 정말 많은 것을 성취해 냈는데... 언젠간 잃어버린 모든 것을 되찾을 수 있기를 위대한 뱀께 기도드릴 뿐이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Not long, though it feels like an eternity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119139
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Council
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C74"
msgid "How long have you been on the High Council?"
msgstr "대의회에서 활동한 지는 얼마나 됐나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_LovekVethaal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: I was outside the city, visiting a friend at his farm. We saw the flash of light from inside, and by the time we made it outside...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119136
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C73"
msgid "Where were you when the experiment went wrong?"
msgstr "실험이 잘못됐을 때 어디 있었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long have you been on the High Council?
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Djimal and I had only been a part of the Council for maybe a year before all this? And we were only ever in subordinate roles.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119138
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Council
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C72"
msgid "Not long, though it feels like an eternity."
msgstr "길지는 않지만, 영원처럼 느껴지는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the experiment went wrong?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: You know, in that moment I worried it was my fault. That I had somehow not been faithful enough, that I had not believed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119135
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C71"
msgid "I was outside the city, visiting a friend at his farm. We saw the flash of light from inside, and by the time we made it outside..."
msgstr "도시 바깥에 있는 친구의 농장을 방문 중이었소. 안에서 번쩍이는 섬광을 봤는데, 밖으로 나왔을 때는 이미..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: I was outside the city, visiting a friend at his farm. We saw the flash of light from inside, and by the time we made it outside...
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LovekVethaal: I still find myself worrying that we are being punished. That we have affronted the Great Serpent in some way, and that this is our penance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119134
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C70"
msgid "You know, in that moment I worried it was my fault. That I had somehow not been faithful enough, that I had not believed."
msgstr ""
"실은, 그 순간엔 내 잘못 때문이 아닌가 걱정했었다오. 왠진 몰라도 믿음이 부족했던 건 아닐까 하고 말이오. 평소엔 상상도 못 할 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_LovekVethaal: You know, in that moment I worried it was my fault. That I had somehow not been faithful enough, that I had not believed.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119133
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6F"
msgid "I still find myself worrying that we are being punished. That we have affronted the Great Serpent in some way, and that this is our penance."
msgstr ""
"지금도 우리가 벌을 받고 있는 건 아닐지 걱정이구려. 우리가 어떤 식으로든 위대한 뱀을 모욕했고, 이번 일은 우리의 속죄가 아닐런지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Djimal and I had only been a part of the Council for maybe a year before all this? And we were only ever in subordinate roles.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Lovek, on the other hand, has served on the Council for quite a long time. He rarely lets us forget it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119132
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Council
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6E"
msgid "It has been quite a challenge to accept this new level of responsibility."
msgstr "이렇게 새로운 수준의 책임을 도맡는 건 꽤 어려웠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: It has been quite a challenge to accept this new level of responsibility.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119130
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Council
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6D"
msgid "Lovek, on the other hand, has served on the Council for quite a long time. He rarely lets us forget it."
msgstr "반면에 로벡은 꽤나 오랫동안 대의회에서 활동해 왔지요. 그 사실을 우리에게 계속 상기시키더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Any decision about House Va'ruun is the Speaker's to make, but Jinan Va'ruun in his wisdom saw fit to create the High Council to help advise those decisions.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Or, at least, that is how it was before all this. Now, with the Speaker gone, we have temporarily taken over making decisions in his stead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6C"
msgid "We offer perspectives and opinions that can often contradict one another, which can ultimately help the Speaker to guide our people."
msgstr ""
"저희는 종종 서로 모순될 수 있는 관점과 의견을 제시해 드리고, 이는 궁극적으로 대변자님께서 우리 신민을 이끄시는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: We offer perspectives and opinions that can often contradict one another, which can ultimately help the Speaker to guide our people.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6B"
msgid "Or, at least, that is how it was before all this. Now, with the Speaker gone, we have temporarily taken over making decisions in his stead."
msgstr "적어도 그 사고 전에는 그랬다고 해야 할까요. 지금은 대변자님이 없으시니, 저희가 임시로 그분을 대신해서 결정을 내리고 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C6A"
msgid "Once this is all behind us, we can restore the intended order of things."
msgstr "이번 일이 지나고 나면 예전의 질서를 회복할 수 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: We offer perspectives and opinions that can often contradict one another, which can ultimately help the Speaker to guide our people.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C69"
msgid "Now that we have a new Speaker, we can attempt to restore the normal order of things."
msgstr "이제 새 대변자님이 정해졌으니, 정상적인 질서를 회복해 나갈 수 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: almost to yourself, like you're afraid to think about it / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111912D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C68"
msgid "Though if that Speaker is not of Jinan Va'ruun's line, do they still carry the same authority?"
msgstr "하지만 그 대변자가 지난 바룬 님의 혈통이 아니라면, 여전히 같은 권위를 가질 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Any decision about House Va'ruun is the Speaker's to make, but Jinan Va'ruun in his wisdom saw fit to create the High Council to help advise those decisions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01119131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Govt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C67"
msgid "What exactly does your High Council do?"
msgstr "대의회는 정확히 어떤 일을 하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaliborDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C66"
msgid "There are other matters that require my attention..."
msgstr "제가 신경 써야 할 문제들이 많습니다만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaliborDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C65"
msgid "Should we perhaps continue at another time?"
msgstr "대화는 나중에 계속하도록 할까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C64"
msgid "I confess I am still not used to seeing such a new face. Especially not here, with the Council."
msgstr "솔직히, 아직도 새로운 사람 만나는 게 익숙하지가 않소. 여기 말고 대의회에서는 특히 더 그렇고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C63"
msgid "May the Great Serpent bless you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_FollowerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C62"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "응?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C61"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "반가워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We haven't been able to observe much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111917E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C60"
msgid "What do you know about these \"Redeemed\" Zealots?"
msgstr "그 '대속자' 광신도에 대해서 뭘 알고 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about these "Redeemed" Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about these "Redeemed" Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111917D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C5F"
msgid "We haven't been able to observe much."
msgstr "그렇게 자세히 볼 수는 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about these "Redeemed" Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111917D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C5E"
msgid "They are physically superior: stronger, faster. They ignore pain and are resistant to things that would take any normal person down in an instant."
msgstr "신체적으로 우월한 놈들이죠. 더 강하고 빨라요. 고통도 무시할 뿐더러 보통 사람이라면 바로 쓰러질 공격에도 버틸 수 있더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you know about these "Redeemed" Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111917D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C5D"
msgid "I'm not sure what the Zealots have done to \"create\" them, but I would surmise the process was less than pleasant."
msgstr "광신도가 놈들을 '창조'하려고 무슨 짓을 했는진 모르겠지만, 그 과정이 즐겁진 않았을 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma? &&& Djimal: Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young.|It's the reason we were groomed for the positions we currently hold.|The Zealots are what divide us, much like they divide our House as a whole.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We use similar tactics to navigate the complex waters of Va'ruun society. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119176
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C5A"
msgid "How are you and Razma like-minded?"
msgstr "라즈마와 생각이 어떻게 잘 통한다는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How are you and Razma like-minded?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you and Razma like-minded?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119175
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C59"
msgid "We use similar tactics to navigate the complex waters of Va'ruun society."
msgstr "우리 둘 다 바룬 사회의 복잡한 물살을 헤쳐나갈 때 비슷한 전술을 써요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How are you and Razma like-minded?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119175
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C58"
msgid "But most importantly, we share the same ideologies when it comes to House Ka'dic and the people of Dazra."
msgstr "하지만 가장 중요한 건, 우리가 카딕 가문과 다즈라 신민들에 대해서 같은 신념을 공유한다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How are you and Razma like-minded?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119175
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C57"
msgid "There is no progress without change, and Dazra stagnates in old tradition."
msgstr "변화 없이는 발전도 없는데, 다즈라는 옛 전통에 얽매여 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How are you and Razma like-minded?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119175
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C56"
msgid "Perhaps your arrival and the Scaled Citadel incident, awful as it was, will serve as a catalyst to finally advance our society."
msgstr "어쩌면 당신의 등장과 비늘 성채 사고가... 물론 끔찍한 사고였지만, 드디어 우리 사회를 발전시킬 기폭제가 되어줄지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119173
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C55"
msgid "Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young."
msgstr "평소에는 라즈마 형님과 꽤 잘 맞아요. 어렸을 적부터 항상 서로 생각이 통하곤 했었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119173
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C54"
msgid "It's the reason we were groomed for the positions we currently hold."
msgstr "그래서 우리가 지금 이 직책을 맡고 있는 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119173
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C53"
msgid "The Zealots are what divide us, much like they divide our House as a whole."
msgstr "우리 사이를 갈라놓은 건 광신도랍니다. 우리 가문 전체도 갈라졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119174
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C52"
msgid "Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma?"
msgstr "당신과 라즈마의 관계를 더 자세히 말해줄 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma? &&& Djimal: Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young.|It's the reason we were groomed for the positions we currently hold.|The Zealots are what divide us, much like they divide our House as a whole.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Many within the Ministry of Conjunction are aware of the division. They wouldn't be good Envoys otherwise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119172
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C51"
msgid "Do your differences affect your House members much?"
msgstr "두 사람의 입장 차이가 가문 사람들에게 영향을 많이 끼치나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do your differences affect your House members much?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do your differences affect your House members much?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119171
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C50"
msgid "Many within the Ministry of Conjunction are aware of the division. They wouldn't be good Envoys otherwise."
msgstr "결합성 내부에서도 이런 분열을 알고 있는 사람들이 많죠. 안 그랬다면 좋은 대표가 되지도 못했을 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do your differences affect your House members much?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119171
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4F"
msgid "And yes, it does affect them. When you aren't united, the cracks begin to show."
msgstr "그리고 물론 영향을 끼쳐요. 단결하지 못하면 균열이 보이기 시작하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do your differences affect your House members much?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119171
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4E"
msgid "The dissidence grows, rumors begin to circulate, and trust is called into question."
msgstr "입장 차이가 커지고, 소문이 돌기 시작하고, 신뢰는 곧 의심이 되죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do your differences affect your House members much?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119171
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4D"
msgid "Our Envoys should know better, but that's how we ended up with the current narrative that House Ka'dic is sympathetic toward the Zealots."
msgstr "우리 사절들이 더 잘 알겠지만, 그래서 지금 카딕 가문이 광신도에게 호의적이라는 이야기가 나오게 된 거랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player should have no knowledge of the Shadow Stations. Concerned shock. / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119169
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4C"
msgid "How would you --?"
msgstr "그걸 어떻게...?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Recomposing herself here. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119169
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4B"
msgid "I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 선택하신 이유를 이제 알 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How would you --? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C4A"
msgid "I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations."
msgstr "분명 그 오래된 비밀 기지 중 한 곳에 잡혀 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma? &&& Djimal: Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young.|It's the reason we were groomed for the positions we currently hold.|The Zealots are what divide us, much like they divide our House as a whole.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I remember it well. Zealots attacked a highlands groat farm. 
