#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C49"
msgid "What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?"
msgstr "왜 광신도를 보는 두 사람의 관점이 다른 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What did you want to speak to me about before leaving for Shadow Station Epsilon?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_SkippedDjimalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C48"
msgid "We're well passed the time for that conversation. What's done is done."
msgstr "그 얘기를 할 시간은 이미 지났어요. 다 끝난 일이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_SkippedDjimalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C47"
msgid "I am grateful to have our family members safely returned, as I am sure Ekris will be grateful to have Sahima's research safely in hand."
msgstr "우리 가족들이 무사히 돌아와서 다행이네요. 분명 에크리스도 사히마의 연구 자료를 무사히 얻게 돼서 감사해 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Deep curious, and suspicious. Player knows information they shouldn't have. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119165
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C46"
msgid "Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time."
msgstr "대단한데. 비밀 기지를 어떻게 알고 있는지 궁금하긴 하지만, 그 이야기는 나중에 하도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I had some other questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I had some other questions.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
