#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C45"
msgid "What do you want to know?"
msgstr "뭘 알고 싶은 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your relationship with Razma? &&& Djimal: Razma and I are normally quite agreeable. We've always been like-minded, ever since we were young.|It's the reason we were groomed for the positions we currently hold.|The Zealots are what divide us, much like they divide our House as a whole.
