msgid "I had some other questions."
msgstr "다른 질문이 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C43"
msgid "I remember it well. Zealots attacked a highlands groat farm."
msgstr "똑똑히 기억나요. 광신도가 하이랜드에 있는 그로트 농장을 공격했었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C42"
msgid "A weapon left behind was one used in payment for a recent operation."
msgstr "현장에 남겨진 무기가 바로 얼마 전 작전에 대한 보상으로 넘겨준 무기더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C41"
msgid "Razma could accept it as collateral damage. I could not."
msgstr "라즈마 형님은 그 일을 부수적인 피해로 치부했어요. 전 그럴 수 없었고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: What created the different view points on the Zealots between you two?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_RazmaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C40"
msgid "An innocent family died that day, and it opened my eyes to the greater consequences of working with Zealots."
msgstr "그 날 무고한 가족이 죽었고, 광신도와 협력하면 더 큰 결과로 이어질 수 있다는 걸 깨닫게 됐으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Like I said...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119166
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3F"
msgid "It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon."
msgstr "예상했던 그대로더군요. 비밀 기지 엡실론이에요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: We're well passed the time for that conversation. What's done is done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0111916C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_SkippedDjimalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3E"
msgid "What did you want to speak to me about before leaving for Shadow Station Epsilon?"
msgstr "내가 비밀 기지 엡실론으로 가기 전에 무슨 말을 하려고 했던 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon. &&& Razma: Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time. &&& Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Shadow Stations were established during the Serpent's Crusade. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119164
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3D"
msgid "What are these Shadow Stations?"
msgstr "그 비밀 기지들은 다 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What are these Shadow Stations?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these Shadow Stations?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119163
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3C"
msgid "The Shadow Stations were established during the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "비밀 기지는 뱀의 성전이 진행되던 도중에 세워진 것들이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What are these Shadow Stations?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119163
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3B"
msgid "A series of secret military installations that few knew about and even fewer may remember."
msgstr "아는 사람도 별로 없고, 기억하는 사람은 더더욱 없는 비밀 군사 시설이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What are these Shadow Stations?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119163
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C3A"
msgid "The idea was to have isolated centers focused on different aspects of furthering the Crusade."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 성공시키기 위해 다양한 측면에서 연구할 수 있는 독립 센터를 세우자는 취지였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What are these Shadow Stations?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll head there right away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01119163
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C39"
msgid "This way if one fell, it wouldn't endanger the others."
msgstr "그렇게 하면 하나가 잘못돼도 다른 기지들은 무사하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Your actions today were very telling, Harbinger. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C38"
msgid "I misjudged your compassion for the people of the Settled Systems."
msgstr "당신이 개척 성계 사람들을 동정할 거란 생각은 내 착각이었지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C37"
msgid "It's unlike any we've seen. They're... augmented somehow. They're minds lack any inhibition."
msgstr "지금까지 봤던 놈들이랑은 달라요. 뭔진 몰라도... 강화됐거든요. 자제심이라곤 전혀 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C36"
msgid "Another Redeemed is stationed down there, along with a few other Zealots, and a Model S."
msgstr "저 아래쪽에 대속자가 또 한 놈 있어요. 다른 광신도 몇 명이랑 모델 S도 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C35"
msgid "Be careful."
msgstr "조심하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C34"
msgid "You've served House Ka'dic well today."
msgstr "오늘 카딕 가문에 큰 도움을 준 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Not enough to have prevented it from happening. If I had any idea it was going to turn out like this...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C33"
msgid "What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel?"
msgstr "성채에서 했던 실험에 대해 뭐 알고 있는 게 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel?
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C32"
msgid "Not enough to have prevented it from happening. If I had any idea it was going to turn out like this..."
msgstr "이런 사태를 막을 정도로 잘 알진 못했어. 일이 이렇게 될 줄 알았더라면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Not enough to have prevented it from happening. If I had any idea it was going to turn out like this...
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C31"
msgid "It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "꽤 오랫동안 아나스코 님의 주요 목표였지. 지난 바룬 님께서 경험하셨던 위대한 뱀과의 접촉을 재현하려고 했다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C30"
msgid "Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it."
msgstr "중력 구동기 기술에 대한 모든 지식과, 우리가 지난 100년 동안 이루어낸 모든 과학적 진보를 그 실험에 전부 쏟아부었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is the will of the Serpent that you be here now to protect the Promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2F"
msgid "Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team."
msgstr ""
"실험 끝날 때쯤 되니까 진이 다 빠지더라고. 잠깐 쉬고 싶다고 했어. 안 그랬으면 나도 나머지 과학팀이랑 같이 저 안에 갇혀버렸을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel? &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have never considered luck a real factor in anything. Given the state Dazra is in now, I would hardly call this "lucky."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2E"
msgid "Sounds like you got lucky."
msgstr "운이 좋은 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel? &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, I am sure that is how some would see it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2D"
msgid "Perhaps the Great Serpent had other plans for you."
msgstr "아마도 위대한 뱀은 너를 위해 다른 계획을 세웠을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel? &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course not!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2C"
msgid "You had no way of knowing this was going to happen."
msgstr "이런 일이 일어날지 전혀 예상할 수 없었을 걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It is the will of the Serpent that you be here now to protect the Promised.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It is the will of the Serpent that you be here now to protect the Promised.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2B"
msgid "I don't know about that."
msgstr "그건 잘 모르겠구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It is the will of the Serpent that you be here now to protect the Promised.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C2A"
msgid "Seems that it would have been easier to just not have it happen in the first place, wouldn't you think?"
msgstr "그냥 애초에 그런 일이 일어나지 않도록 하는 게 더 쉬웠을 거라고 생각하지 않나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like you got lucky.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like you got lucky.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C29"
msgid "I have never considered luck a real factor in anything. Given the state Dazra is in now, I would hardly call this \"lucky.\""
msgstr "난 운이 중요한 요소라고 생각해본 적이 없다네. 지금 다즈라만 놓고 봐도, '운'이랑은 거리가 멀지 않나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like you got lucky.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C28"
msgid "But, I suppose it is better than the alternative."
msgstr "그래도, 이게 그나마 나은 경우겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You had no way of knowing this was going to happen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You had no way of knowing this was going to happen.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C27"
msgid "Of course not!"
msgstr "그야 당연하지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the experiment in the Citadel? &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: It had been Anasko's primary goal for some time. A way to recreate Jinan Va'ruun's encounter with the Great Serpent. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Everything we knew about Grav Drive technology, every scientific advancement we'd made in the last hundred years was poured into it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Towards the end, I was just so exhausted. I asked for a brief time off; had I not, I would be trapped in there with the rest of the science team.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know about that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C26"
msgid "It is the will of the Serpent that you be here now to protect the Promised."
msgstr "약속받은 자를 지키기 위해 지금 이곳에 있는 것 또한 위대한 뱀의 뜻이겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I don't know about that.|Seems that it would have been easier to just not have it happen in the first place, wouldn't you think?
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Some breakthroughs were made shortly thereafter, and they ran the experiment... And here we are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C25"
msgid "I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready."
msgstr "난 재난이 터지기 몇 주 전에 프로젝트를 떠났고, 우린 그때 거의 준비가 안 돼 있었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps the Great Serpent had other plans for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps the Great Serpent had other plans for you.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C24"
msgid "Yes, I am sure that is how some would see it."
msgstr "그래, 분명 그렇게 보는 사람들도 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Yes, depending on how much trouble you're getting into.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Phantoms, the Vortex... Fascinating subject, really. If only there were some less disastrous way we could have discovered all this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C23"
msgid "We have been nearly overwhelmed with all that has happened over the last few weeks. But I have still spent some time doing my own research, when I can."
msgstr ""
"우린 지난 몇 주 동안 일어난 일들 때문에 거의 넋이 나갈 지경이었어. 그래도 내가 짬이 날 때마다 나름대로 연구를 좀 해 왔다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Yes! Exactly! I am glad I am not the only one who can see that.|Does nothing to make the loss any easier, but still.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Second, we have learned that killing the Phantoms sometimes causes an even greater disturbance. "Horrors," as they have been colloquially termed, can appear from... somewhere. We are unsure of their origin, but it is not within our universe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C22"
msgid "We have encountered several interesting phenomena. First, while the Phantoms shift to a fully human form when killed, they often retain small shards that appear to be an almost crystallized version of Vortex Energy."
msgstr ""
"우리가 몇 가지 흥미로운 이상 현상을 발견했다네. 우선 유령을 죽이면 완전히 인간 모습으로 돌아오는데, 그때 볼텍스 에너지가 결정화된 "
"것처럼 보이는 작은 조각을 종종 남기더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You had me at "explosive mixture."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C21"
msgid "While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications."
msgstr ""
"그게 모어닝 장치 개발에 필요한 물건은 아니지만, 자네가 현장에 나가게 되면 좀 더... 실용적으로 응용할 수 있는 방법이 있을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: I left the project weeks before the disaster, and at that point we were nowhere near ready.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011190DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Experiment
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C20"
msgid "Some breakthroughs were made shortly thereafter, and they ran the experiment... And here we are."
msgstr "그 후에 얼마 안 돼서 몇 가지 돌파구가 나왔고, 실험을 진행했지... 그리고 이렇게 된 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: The process is simple enough that any industrial workstation should suffice, if you have the materials.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013C1F"
msgid "And, depending on how you combine said materials, you may find the results to be somewhat variable. I hope you can use that to your advantage."
msgstr "그리고 그 재료를 어떻게 조합하느냐에 따라서 결과물이 약간 달라질 수도 있을 거야. 그 점을 잘 활용하길 바라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LovekVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C1E"
msgid "Are you sure you are listening?"
msgstr "지금 듣고 있는 거 맞소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LovekVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C1D"
msgid "I am rather busy, so if there is nothing else..."
msgstr "난 꽤 바쁜 몸이니까, 할 말이 더 없으면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LovekVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C1C"
msgid "If you were wondering: yes, I am still waiting."
msgstr "궁금해할까봐 하는 말인데, 맞소. 기다리는 중이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaliborDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013C1B"
msgid "Was there... something else?"
msgstr "무슨 일이라도... 있었습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C1A"
msgid "Anasko would, I hope, be proud of our resilience."
msgstr "아나스코 님께서도 저희의 회복력을 자랑스러워하시면 좋겠군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C19"
msgid "Hello, Vindicator."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 옹호자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C18"
msgid "Hello, Diviner."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 예측자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C17"
msgid "Greetings, Reverent."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 숭배자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C16"
msgid "Hello, Armiger."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 복종자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C15"
msgid "Greetings, Adherent."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 지지자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C14"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "반가워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C13"
msgid "How may I assist you?"
msgstr "어떻게 도와드릴까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MaliborHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C12"
msgid "Did you need something?"
msgstr "필요하신 게 있으십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C11"
msgid "The hour is at hand. Dazra is nearly saved."
msgstr "때가 가깝구려. 다즈라를 거의 구해냈소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C10"
msgid "I trust you are finding your footing in Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라에 잘 자리 잡고 있을 거라 믿겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0F"
msgid "You would speak with me?"
msgstr "나와 할 말이 있으시오?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0E"
msgid "Yes? Did you require something?"
msgstr "응? 뭔가 필요한 거라도 있소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0D"
msgid "What may I do for you?"
msgstr "뭘 도와주면 되겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: formal, but neutral / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LovekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0C"
msgid "The Council is here, should you require us."
msgstr "대의회의 힘이 필요하면 언제든지 말해 주시오."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0B"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "반가워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C0A"
msgid "One more trial behind us, eh?"
msgstr "우리에게 아직 시험이 하나 남았구만?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C09"
msgid "If it isn't the savior of Dazra. Well, one of them."
msgstr "다즈라의 구원자 아니신가. 뭐, 자네뿐만은 아니었지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C08"
msgid "We'll review the data, see whether we can make improvements. Not that I expect to ever fire that again..."
msgstr "데이터를 분석하고 개선할 수 있는지 볼 걸세. 다시는 작동시킬 일 없겠지만..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C07"
msgid "My part in this is finished for now. Seems like you still have work to do."
msgstr "내가 당분간 할 일은 끝났네. 아직 자네는 해야 할 일이 있는 것 같네만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C06"
msgid "That went better than expected!"
msgstr "생각보다 일이 훨씬 잘 진행됐군!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C05"
msgid "Let's hope the calculations are right, and it doesn't vaporize us all."
msgstr "부디 계산이 맞아서 우리 모두 증발하는 일이 없길 바라세."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C04"
msgid "Don't just stand there. Activate it!"
msgstr "가만히 있지 말게. 작동시키게나!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C03"
msgid "Now, the moment of truth."
msgstr "이제 진실의 순간이로군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C02"
msgid "I would say it's just about time."
msgstr "드디어 때가 됐다고 생각하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C01"
msgid "Construction is nearing completion. Then we'll find out if it works."
msgstr "건설이 거의 다 끝났네. 그럼 잘 작동하는지 알 수 있겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013C00"
msgid "The Device is coming together nicely. Very few adjustments to the original design."
msgstr "장치가 순조롭게 완성되고 있네. 본래 디자인에서 아주 약간만 수정했지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFF"
msgid "We're finally getting close."
msgstr "드디어 거의 다 끝났네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFE"
msgid "I am starting to feel just a little optimistic about all this."
msgstr "그동안의 이 모든 일에 점점 긍정적인 생각이 든다네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFD"
msgid "It's good to see that the Houses can actually cooperate."
msgstr "가문들이 서로 협력하는 걸 보게 되다니 기분이 괜찮네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFC"
msgid "One House down, two to go. Progress!"
msgstr "가문 하나 끝냈고 두 개 남았군. 발전이 있구먼!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFB"
msgid "This is hardly the project I thought I would stake my reputation on."
msgstr "내 명성을 이런 프로젝트에 걸 줄은 몰랐네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BFA"
msgid "There won't be time to sufficiently test the Device, but... how much worse could it make things?"
msgstr "장치를 제대로 시험할 시간은 없을 거네만... 사태를 지금보다 악화시킬 리는 없겠지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BF9"
msgid "The work continues, as always."
msgstr "언제나 그렇듯이 일은 계속 되고 있네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BF8"
msgid "Hmm? Yes?"
msgstr "흐음? 뭐지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BF7"
msgid "Ah, yes. Hello there."
msgstr "아, 그래. 반갑네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BF6"
msgid "The things they expect me to accomplish..."
msgstr "다들 내가 해결해 주길 기대하고 있어..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013BF5"
msgid "We'll all be lucky to see the end of the year."
msgstr "올해가 가는 걸 볼 수 있다면 운 좋은 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: I pray they are cooperative. There's no telling how much time we have.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011190EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013BF4"
msgid "And before I forget, I've been told to inform you that the Council has now granted you access to the armory in the Keep. Seems they're pleased with your work."
msgstr ""
"그리고 잊기 전에 말해두는데, 대의회에서 자네한테 본성 무기고 접속 권한을 부여한다고 전해 달라더군. 자네 일 처리가 마음에 든 모양이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I can imagine that without the Speaker to issue clear directions, things have been difficult.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BF3"
msgid "We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way."
msgstr ""
"장벽을 뚫을 수 있는지 알아보기 위해 중력 구동기 에너지를 활용한 임시 장치를 만들 계획을 세웠지만, 프로젝트가 중단돼 버렸어. 정치가 "
"방해가 됐지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Help me get what we need, and we will see what we can do for the Speaker, and for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you've got something that can help me, I'd appreciate it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BDE"
msgid "And, I may have something that can help you on whatever trials the Serpent puts before you as we navigate this."
msgstr "그리고, 위대한 뱀께서 자네 앞에 무슨 시련을 준비해 놓으셨든 길을 찾는 데 도움이 될 만한 물건을 주도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A0D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BDD"
msgid "Well, look who it is."
msgstr "이런, 이게 누구야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The High Council told me to help your project.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The High Council told me to help your project.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BDC"
msgid "Well, well. Progress at last. Then your arrival is even more momentous than I'd believed."
msgstr "아이고야. 드디어 진전이 있구만. 자네가 도착한 게 생각보다 더 중요한 순간이었군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well, look who it is. &&& Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment. &&& Ekris: To what do I owe the honor, Harbinger?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Did he now? How magnanimous.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BDB"
msgid "Malibor says work on the \"Mourning Device\" must proceed."
msgstr "말리보어가 '모어닝 장치' 작업을 계속해야 한다고 하던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BDA"
msgid "Did he now? How magnanimous."
msgstr "인제사? 아주 관대하기도 하셔라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD9"
msgid "But approval is approval, and I will gladly take it."
msgstr "그래도 승인이 나왔다니까, 기쁘게 받아들여야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well, look who it is.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: To what do I owe the honor, Harbinger?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD8"
msgid "You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment."
msgstr "자네, 꽤 큰 파장을 몰고 왔더군. 지금 상황을 생각해 보면 대단한 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Did he now? How magnanimous.|But approval is approval, and I will gladly take it.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD7"
msgid "I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself."
msgstr "기술적으로 자세한 내용은 그냥 생략하겠네. 솔직히 말하면 나도 거의 아는 게 없으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well, look who it is. &&& Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment. &&& Ekris: To what do I owe the honor, Harbinger?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At the moment? Obviously a great deal of nothing. Have the High Council to thank for that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD6"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Well, look who it is. &&& Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment. &&& Ekris: To what do I owe the honor, Harbinger?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, well. Progress at last. Then your arrival is even more momentous than I'd believed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD5"
msgid "The High Council told me to help your project."
msgstr "대의회에서 프로젝트를 도와달라고 하더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way. &&& companion: I can imagine that without the Speaker to issue clear directions, things have been difficult.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD4"
msgid "Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage."
msgstr "모든 가문이 함께 공헌해야 하는데, 모든 가문이 그 점을 지렛대로 써먹을 수 있다는 걸 알아채 버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD3"
msgid "What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations."
msgstr "힘을 합쳐 노력해야 했을 일이 논쟁이 돼 버렸지. 쉬운 결정이 협상 과정이 돼 버렸다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage. &&& Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations. &&& Ekris: And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD2"
msgid "No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward."
msgstr "지나간 일 불평해 봐야 소용없어요. 이제 앞으로 나아가야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a little sardonic - it's true, but it's also annoying / Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD1"
msgid "Indeed. All Must Serve."
msgstr "그렇지. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BD0"
msgid "And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 해서 작업은 시작도 못 한 거라네. 물자가 쌓여가는 동안 여기 죽치고 앉아서 재난을 쳐다보는 짓거리도 일주일째야. 뱀이시여, "
"보우하소서. 미칠 노릇이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage. &&& Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations. &&& Ekris: And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't disagree, but... Allow me to impart some advice. Most would consider that disloyal, possibly even heresy. Keep that kind of talk to yourself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BCF"
msgid "I've been here ten minutes, and the Council is already annoying."
msgstr "여기 온 지 10분밖에 안 됐는데 벌써 대의회에 짜증이 나네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage. &&& Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations. &&& Ekris: And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose I should.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BCE"
msgid "You should be grateful that I'm here, and that you can continue your work."
msgstr "제가 온 걸 감사하게 생각하시죠. 덕분에 작업을 계속할 수 있는 거니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: You have made quite a stir, and given the state of things, that is a singular accomplishment.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A0B
