#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should be grateful that I'm here, and that you can continue your work.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should be grateful that I'm here, and that you can continue your work.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC7"
msgid "I suppose I should."
msgstr "그래야 할 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've been here ten minutes, and the Council is already annoying.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been here ten minutes, and the Council is already annoying.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC5"
msgid "I don't disagree, but... Allow me to impart some advice. Most would consider that disloyal, possibly even heresy. Keep that kind of talk to yourself."
msgstr ""
"동감이긴 하지만... 몇 가지 조언을 해주지. 대부분의 사람들은 그런 말을 불충으로, 심지어 이단으로 받아들일 수 있어. 그런 소리는 "
"혼자 있을 때만 하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC4"
msgid "One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through."
msgstr ""
"그냥 대충 봐도 알겠지만, 비늘 성채가 역장에 둘러싸여 있다네. 그걸 뚫고 가지 못하면 안에서 진행 중인 실험을 멈출 수가 없지. 뚫고 "
"가는 건 절대 불가능한 걸로 판명됐고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: If you're here, the Council has likely sent word to the Houses that it's time to stop the infighting. I doubt it will be enough.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I doubt they'll listen to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC3"
msgid "I need to oversee construction here, make sure things are built to specifications. If you could follow up with the Houses, that may speed up the process."
msgstr ""
"난 여기서 작업을 감독해야 하네. 설계대로 만들어지는지 확인해야 하거든. 자네가 가문들 일을 알아봐 줄 수 있다면, 진행 속도도 "
"빨라지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself. &&& Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through. &&& Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC2"
msgid "I can imagine that without the Speaker to issue clear directions, things have been difficult."
msgstr "대변자님이 사안을 명확히 정리해 주질 못하시니, 문제가 어려워졌겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself. &&& Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through. &&& Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC1"
msgid "This seems like the one time to set politics aside."
msgstr "지금은 정치를 치워둬야 할 때인 것 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself. &&& Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through. &&& Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BC0"
msgid "Sounds like maybe some things aren't so different out here after all."
msgstr "여기서도 별반 다르지 않은 것들이 좀 있는 모양이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself. &&& Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through. &&& Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBF"
msgid "Hell, I've never met a situation that politics couldn't make worse."
msgstr "망할. 정치가 이렇게 나쁜 상황은 처음 봅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I will spare you much of the technical detail, as I confess that pieces of it I barely understand myself. &&& Ekris: One cannot help but notice the energy field around the Scaled Citadel. Until we can get through it, we cannot shut down the experiment inside. And it has proved quite impossible to get through. &&& Ekris: We had the beginnings of a plan to build a makeshift contraption to redirect Grav Drive energy to see if we could penetrate the barrier, but the project came to a halt. Politics got in the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBE"
msgid "This hardly seems like the time for politics to matter."
msgstr "지금은 정치가 중요한 때가 아닌 것 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's going on here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's going on here?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBD"
msgid "At the moment? Obviously a great deal of nothing. Have the High Council to thank for that."
msgstr "지금 말인가? 당연히 아무것도 진행된 게 없지. 대의회 나리님들 덕분에 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's going on here?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01118A05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBC"
msgid "Politics and expedience rarely pair well."
msgstr "정치와 편의라는 게 잘 어울리기는 힘들지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Indeed. All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: If you're here, the Council has likely sent word to the Houses that it's time to stop the infighting. I doubt it will be enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBB"
msgid "I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work."
msgstr "이제 불평할 만큼 한 것 같아. 일하러 갈 시간이구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I need to oversee construction here, make sure things are built to specifications. If you could follow up with the Houses, that may speed up the process.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BBA"
msgid "If you're here, the Council has likely sent word to the Houses that it's time to stop the infighting. I doubt it will be enough."
msgstr "자네가 여기 왔다면, 대의회에서도 가문들한테 집안싸움을 멈출 때가 됐다고 전했을 거야. 그걸로 충분할진 모르겠다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you need the Council's approval?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you need the Council's approval?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB9"
msgid "The Council just so happens to represent the three Houses under Va'ruun's banner, who are also entrusted with various aspects of running... well, everything."
msgstr ""
"바룬의 깃발 아래 모인 세 가문을 대표하고 있는 대의회는 마침 여러가지 운영 쪽도 담당하고 있거든. 무슨 운영이나면... 뭐, 전부 다야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you need the Council's approval?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB8"
msgid "Each of those Houses needs to contribute something to the project, so the Council is the final stopgap."
msgstr "프로젝트를 할 때마다 각 가문이 뭔가 공헌을 해야 하니, 대의회가 마지막 임시변통인 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you need the Council's approval?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB7"
msgid "Were the Speaker here, he could bypass all of it with a wave of his hand, but... Well, you have already seen the state he's in."
msgstr "대변자님이 여기 계셨으면 손짓 한 번에 넘어갈 수 있었을 텐데... 뭐, 그분 상태가 어떤진 자네도 봤겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I doubt they'll listen to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I doubt they'll listen to me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: House Veth'aal owes us access codes for the city power grid. It's the only way to guarantee enough power to activate the device.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB6"
msgid "The first convert in generations? The only one to have heard from the Speaker since the disaster? Oh, I think they will listen."
msgstr "몇 세대 만에 처음 나타난 개종자인데? 재난 이후로 대변자님의 말을 들은 유일한 사람인데? 아마 들어줄 걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: House Veth'aal owes us access codes for the city power grid. It's the only way to guarantee enough power to activate the device.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: And Hasmak, the new Elder of House Dul'kehf... He has been distant, guarded. He claims to have vital information about an important component of the experiment, but has withheld it until now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB5"
msgid "House Ka'dic was supposed to provide a young scientist named Sahima to help me. She had at least some experience with the original Citadel experiment. No idea why they refuse to send her."
msgstr ""
"카딕 가문은 사히마라는 젊은 과학자를 보내서 우릴 도와주기로 했었어. 성채에서 진행하던 원래 실험에 참여한 적이 있었거든. 왜 보내주질 "
"않는 건지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Malibor says work on the "Mourning Device" must proceed. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Every one of the Houses needs to contribute, and every one realized they could potentially use it for leverage. &&& Ekris: What should have been a cooperative effort turned contentious. Easy decisions became negotiations. &&& Ekris: And so construction never began. We have sat here, staring at this disaster as supplies pile up, for well over a week now. Serpent help us, it is infuriating.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Council just so happens to represent the three Houses under Va'ruun's banner, who are also entrusted with various aspects of running... well, everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB4"
msgid "Why do you need the Council's approval?"
msgstr "대의회의 승인이 필요한 이유는 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No use complaining about the past. Time to move forward. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: I believe I've done enough complaining for now. Time to get to work. &&& Ekris: If you're here, the Council has likely sent word to the Houses that it's time to stop the infighting. I doubt it will be enough. &&& Ekris: I need to oversee construction here, make sure things are built to specifications. If you could follow up with the Houses, that may speed up the process.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate that someone around here is eager to get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011189F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage1000_EkrisScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BB3"
msgid "I'll get right on it."
msgstr "바로 처리할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll get right on it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll get right on it.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: House Veth'aal owes us access codes for the city power grid. It's the only way to guarantee enough power to activate the device.
