#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA8"
msgid "Using the tragedy as cover seems especially low."
msgstr "비극을 위장 수단으로 이용하다니 참 비열해 보이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Which enemies?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Which enemies?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Doing so would be treason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111812E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA7"
msgid "I'm not sure. The message was vague, and there are many who would want to do us harm."
msgstr "잘 모르겠어요. 메시지는 모호했고, 저희를 해치고 싶어 하는 사람들은 많거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Smart move. I'd do the same given the opportunity.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Smart move. I'd do the same given the opportunity.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
