#. TOPIC: 01118130
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA6"
msgid "Smart, cowardly and treacherous. But to make such accusations, more proof is required."
msgstr "영리하고, 비겁하고, 기만적이지요. 하지만 그런 혐의를 제기하려면 증거가 더 많이 필요해요."

