#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA5"
msgid "Smart move. I'd do the same given the opportunity."
msgstr "현명한 처사네요. 저라도 기회가 있었다면 똑같이 했을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Yes. But given the seriousness of the accusation, the proof must be irrefutable.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111812D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA4"
msgid "So I told my cousin to return with more evidence, and when I didn't hear back, I assumed that was the end of it."
msgstr "그래서 사촌에게 증거를 더 많이 모아서 돌아오라고 했는데, 소식이 없어서 끝장난 줄 알았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Explain.
