#. TOPIC: 0111812D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA3"
msgid "But this morning I received a slate from a courier. It's from Ukaru. It was worrying to say the least."
msgstr "하지만 오늘 아침에 택배로 슬레이트를 받았어요. 우카루가 보낸 거였죠. 정말 걱정스럽더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
