#. TOPIC: 01011C1C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013BA0"
msgid "Very well. What would you like to know?"
msgstr "알겠어요. 뭘 알고 싶으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
