msgstr "그로트를 별로 좋아하지 않는 것 같은데, 왜 그로트 농부가 된 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraMalikVosh
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMalikVosh: There is a lot of pressure on me and the other groat farmers to provide a steady supply of groats for rations. 
