msgctxt "013B8E"
msgid "What fool would live amongst groats if he did not like them? I like them just fine, and being a groat farmer is noble, responsible work."
msgstr "그로트를 좋아하지 않는 바보가 어디 있겠나? 난 그로트를 아주 좋아하고, 그로트 농부는 고귀하고 책임감 있는 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118E29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Groats
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B8D"
msgid "That being said, groats are stubborn, idiotic animals, that I am growing much too old to deal with."
msgstr "하지만 그로트는 고집 세고 멍청한 동물이라, 나이 든 내가 다루기엔 너무 벅차."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you handling the emergency in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118E27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B8C"
msgid "There is a lot of pressure on me and the other groat farmers to provide a steady supply of groats for rations."
msgstr "배급용 그로트를 안정적으로 공급해야 한다는 압박이 나와 다른 그로트 농부들에게 크지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118E27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B8B"
msgid "We are holding out, but if something goes wrong, we could be responsible for the starvation of hundreds."
msgstr "우린 버티고 있지만, 일이 잘못되면 수백 명이 굶주리게 되는데 그 책임을 져야 할 수도 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMalikVosh: And with my groats missing, things are growing worse by the day.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118E27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B8A"
msgid "All this pressure... it is not good for an old body like mine."
msgstr "이 모든 압박감... 나 같은 늙은이에겐 좋지 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Yes, depending on how much trouble you're getting into.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B89"
msgid "If you've got something that can help me, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr "도움이 될 만한 게 있다면, 알려주면 고맙겠어."

msgctxt "013B88"
msgid "\"Fascinating\" isn't the word I would use to describe it."
msgstr "그걸 '매혹적'이라는 말로 설명하면 안 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Fascinating isn't the word I would use to describe it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Fascinating" isn't the word I would use to describe it.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have encountered several interesting phenomena. First, while the Phantoms shift to a fully human form when killed, they often retain small shards that appear to be an almost crystallized version of Vortex Energy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B87"
msgid "I know, I know. I have lost friends and colleagues myself."
msgstr "알지, 알아. 나도 친구와 동료들을 잃었다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have been nearly overwhelmed with all that has happened over the last few weeks. But I have still spent some time doing my own research, when I can.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B86"
msgid "These Phantoms, the Vortex... Fascinating subject, really. If only there were some less disastrous way we could have discovered all this."
msgstr "그 유령들, 볼텍스 같은 거 말이야... 정말 매혹적인 주제거든. 좀 덜 불행한 방법으로 발견했으면 좋았을 텐데 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've got something that can help me, I'd appreciate it.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have been nearly overwhelmed with all that has happened over the last few weeks. But I have still spent some time doing my own research, when I can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B85"
msgid "Yes, depending on how much trouble you're getting into."
msgstr "그러지. 자네가 휘말릴 문제가 얼마나 많을진 모르겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have encountered several interesting phenomena. First, while the Phantoms shift to a fully human form when killed, they often retain small shards that appear to be an almost crystallized version of Vortex Energy.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B84"
msgid "Second, we have learned that killing the Phantoms sometimes causes an even greater disturbance. \"Horrors,\" as they have been colloquially termed, can appear from... somewhere. We are unsure of their origin, but it is not within our universe."
msgstr ""
"그리고, 유령을 죽이면 가끔 더 심각한 방해꾼이 나타난다는 사실을 알아냈지. 유령들이 하는 말을 들어보면 '호러'라고 하던데... "
"어디서든 튀어나올 수 있어. 기원이 어딘진 모르겠지만, 우리 우주가 아니란 건 확실하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Second, we have learned that killing the Phantoms sometimes causes an even greater disturbance. "Horrors," as they have been colloquially termed, can appear from... somewhere. We are unsure of their origin, but it is not within our universe.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B83"
msgid "These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy."
msgstr "호러와 스폰들은 포낭으로 뒤덮여 있는데, 그 포낭은 볼텍스 에너지가 신체 기관으로 발현된 것 같더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B82"
msgid "Yes! Exactly! I am glad I am not the only one who can see that."
msgstr "맞아! 정확해! 나만 그런 생각 하는 게 아니라서 다행이구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have encountered several interesting phenomena. First, while the Phantoms shift to a fully human form when killed, they often retain small shards that appear to be an almost crystallized version of Vortex Energy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B81"
msgid "Does nothing to make the loss any easier, but still."
msgstr "물론 그렇다고 잃은 것들을 돌려받진 못하겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've got something that can help me, I'd appreciate it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Yes, depending on how much trouble you're getting into. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have been nearly overwhelmed with all that has happened over the last few weeks. But I have still spent some time doing my own research, when I can. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Phantoms, the Vortex... Fascinating subject, really. If only there were some less disastrous way we could have discovered all this.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, then you are in luck.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B80"
msgid "If it's not something that will help me get rid of the Phantoms, I don't care about it."
msgstr "유령을 없애는 데 도움이 안 된다면, 신경 쓰고 싶지 않은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe. &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, then allow me to provide you with a few starting samples.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7F"
msgid "You had me at \"explosive mixture.\""
msgstr "'폭발성 혼합물'에 대해 알고 싶은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's not something that will help me get rid of the Phantoms, I don't care about it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's not something that will help me get rid of the Phantoms, I don't care about it.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have encountered several interesting phenomena. First, while the Phantoms shift to a fully human form when killed, they often retain small shards that appear to be an almost crystallized version of Vortex Energy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7E"
msgid "Well, then you are in luck."
msgstr "음, 그럼 운이 좋구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You had me at "explosive mixture."
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You had me at "explosive mixture."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: The process is simple enough that any industrial workstation should suffice, if you have the materials.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7D"
msgid "Well, then allow me to provide you with a few starting samples."
msgstr "음, 그럼 시작용 샘플을 좀 주도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe. &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: The process is simple enough that any industrial workstation should suffice, if you have the materials.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7C"
msgid "I'll take anything that can give me an edge."
msgstr "나에게 이점이 있다면 무엇이든 받아들이겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7B"
msgid "We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties."
msgstr "우리가 실험을 하기에 충분한 양을 모아서 다양한 성질을 가진 폭발성 혼합물을 만들어내는 방법을 고안해 냈다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've got something that can help me, I'd appreciate it. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: Yes, depending on how much trouble you're getting into. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have been nearly overwhelmed with all that has happened over the last few weeks. But I have still spent some time doing my own research, when I can. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Phantoms, the Vortex... Fascinating subject, really. If only there were some less disastrous way we could have discovered all this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes! Exactly! I am glad I am not the only one who can see that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B7A"
msgid "It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe."
msgstr "확실히 우리가 우주에 대해 알고 있는 것을 재정의할 수 있는 잠재력을 가지고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not interested. I can handle myself just fine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not interested. I can handle myself just fine.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: The process is simple enough that any industrial workstation should suffice, if you have the materials.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B79"
msgid "This is hardly the time to be turning down additional options. I am simply providing you with the information. If you choose to ignore it, so be it."
msgstr "지금은 추가적인 선택지를 무시할 때가 아닌데. 난 그냥 정보만 제공하는 거라네. 자네가 무시하고 싶으면 그렇게 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe. &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do hope you are not questioning the thoroughness of my research. I assure you, they will work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B78"
msgid "Unproven technology against enemies from outside our universe? Sounds like a great plan."
msgstr "우리 우주 밖에서 온 적을 상대로 검증되지 않은 기술을 사용하겠다고? 참 멋진 계획 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMalikVosh: There is a lot of pressure on me and the other groat farmers to provide a steady supply of groats for rations. |We are holding out, but if something goes wrong, we could be responsible for the starvation of hundreds.|All this pressure... it is not good for an old body like mine. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118E26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MalikVosh_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B77"
msgid "And with my groats missing, things are growing worse by the day."
msgstr "게다가 그로트들이 사라지면서 상황은 날이 갈수록 나빠지고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Unproven technology against enemies from outside our universe? Sounds like a great plan.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Unproven technology against enemies from outside our universe? Sounds like a great plan.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
