#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B76"
msgid "I do hope you are not questioning the thoroughness of my research. I assure you, they will work."
msgstr "내 연구의 철저함에 의문을 제기하지 말아줬으면 좋겠군. 장담하는데 쓸모 있을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It certainly has the potential to redefine what we know about the universe. &&& ...  &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: These Horrors and their spawn are infested with cysts, a seemingly organic manifestation of Vortex Energy. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: We have managed to collect enough to run experiments, and have devised a method of combining them into an explosive mixture with varying properties. &&& MQ_EkrisKaisir: While they have no use in the development of the Mourning Device, if you find yourself out in the field I believe they could have more... practical applications.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This is hardly the time to be turning down additional options. I am simply providing you with the information. If you choose to ignore it, so be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01118A40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B75"
msgid "I'm not interested. I can handle myself just fine."
msgstr "관심 없어. 혼자서도 잘 처리할 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_EkrisKaisir: Well, then allow me to provide you with a few starting samples.
#. ALIAS: MQ_EkrisKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_EkrisKaisir: And, depending on how you combine said materials, you may find the results to be somewhat variable. I hope you can use that to your advantage.
