#. TOPIC: 01118A3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Ekris_TL_Grenades01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B74"
msgid "The process is simple enough that any industrial workstation should suffice, if you have the materials."
msgstr "제작법도 아무 공업용 작업대만 있으면 충분할 정도로 간단하지. 재료만 있다면 말이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B73"
msgid "Been some time since I have had anyone to help around the farm."
msgstr "한동안 농장 일을 도울 사람이 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahDubib_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B72"
msgid "Hard to get the smell of groat out of your nose..."
msgstr "코에서 그로트 냄새를 빼기란 쉽지 않아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait a second, maybe I can help you.  &&& MalikVosh: Eh, perhaps. |I'm old. And very tired. I suppose I could use the assistance.  &&& MalikVosh: For weeks now, my groats have been going missing. The first time I did not think much of it. Groats are crafty, and sometimes they escape. |But I am down too many groats now for this to be mere coincidence. They are being stolen. |This cannot continue. I cannot keep purchasing new groats only for them to go missing a few days later.  And without my groats, I cannot supply milk or meat to the city. |I understand that this may seem a minor problem compared to others in Dazra, but I would appreciate your assistance.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do I look like a miser? Yes, yes, I will pay you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B71"
msgid "Will you pay me?"
msgstr "돈은 주는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will you pay me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will you pay me?
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: I'll help you out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B70"
msgid "Do I look like a miser? Yes, yes, I will pay you."
msgstr "내가 구두쇠로 보이나? 그래, 그래, 돈은 주겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait a second, maybe I can help you.  &&& MalikVosh: Eh, perhaps. |I'm old. And very tired. I suppose I could use the assistance.  &&& MalikVosh: For weeks now, my groats have been going missing. The first time I did not think much of it. Groats are crafty, and sometimes they escape. |But I am down too many groats now for this to be mere coincidence. They are being stolen. |This cannot continue. I cannot keep purchasing new groats only for them to go missing a few days later.  And without my groats, I cannot supply milk or meat to the city. |I understand that this may seem a minor problem compared to others in Dazra, but I would appreciate your assistance.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then please, do not waste my time any further. I must continue my inquiries. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6F"
msgid "I don't have time right now."
msgstr "지금은 시간이 없어서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help you find your groats.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll help you find your groats.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6E"
msgid "I appreciate the help."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help you find your groats.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6D"
msgid "Go to my farm and see if you can find anything I may have missed. I will continue to inquire around the city."
msgstr "내 목장에 가서 내가 놓친 게 있는지 찾아봐. 나는 도시를 계속 수색할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: What is it now? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate the help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6C"
msgid "I'll help you find your groats."
msgstr "그로트 찾는 일을 도와드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing, never mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nothing, never mind.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6B"
msgid "Then leave me be, will you? This is a pressing matter."
msgstr "그럼 날 좀 내버려 둬, 알겠어? 지금 이게 급한 문제라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the problem? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B6A"
msgid "Look, I really must be going. This is a pressing matter."
msgstr "이봐, 나 진짜 가봐야 해. 급한 일이라서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have time right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have time right now.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B69"
msgid "Then please, do not waste my time any further. I must continue my inquiries."
msgstr "그러면 더 이상 내 시간을 낭비하지 말아 주게나. 계속 찾아봐야 하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [10000 Credits] I have another idea. I'll pay you to take the groat back to Malik, and work on his farm as a farmhand.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [10000 Credits] I have another idea. I'll pay you to take the groat back to Malik, and work on his farm as a farmhand.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B68"
msgid "Are you... are you serious? That is a considerable amount of credits. That could help a lot of people..."
msgstr "저... 정말이야? 그건 상당한 양의 크레딧인데... 그거면 많은 사람들을 도울 수 있는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [10000 Credits] I have another idea. I'll pay you to take the groat back to Malik, and work on his farm as a farmhand.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B67"
msgid "Well, I will take you up on your offer, if Malik will have me. I will bring back his groat and apologize to him as soon as possible."
msgstr "글쎄, 말릭이 허락한다면 당신 제안을 받아들이겠어. 가능한 한 빨리 그로트를 돌려주고 사과할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: What is it now? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then leave me be, will you? This is a pressing matter.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B66"
msgid "Nothing, never mind."
msgstr "아뇨, 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B65"
msgid "Great Serpent, all of this over a groat?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 고작 그로트 때문에 이 모든 일을?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B64"
msgid "You really are not as scary as you think you are."
msgstr "넌 네가 생각하는 것만큼 무섭지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B63"
msgid "The person at Malik's farm mentioned you by name. I know something's up."
msgstr "말릭 씨 농장에 있는 사람이 네 이름을 말했어. 뭔가 있는 거 다 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B62"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "흠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B61"
msgid "I do not believe you."
msgstr "네 말을 믿을 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing.  &&& AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!   &&& AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone. &&& AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.|I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving. |I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies. |Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Are you... are you serious? That is a considerable amount of credits. That could help a lot of people... 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B60"
msgid "[10000 Credits] I have another idea. I'll pay you to take the groat back to Malik, and work on his farm as a farmhand."
msgstr ""
"[10000 크레딧] 다른 생각이 있어. 네가 그로트를 말릭 씨에게 돌려주고 말릭 씨의 농장에서 일꾼으로 일한다면 크레딧을 줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge09
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5F"
msgid "Well, I..."
msgstr "음, 저..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge09
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5E"
msgid "Huh? He seems fine to me."
msgstr "응? 내 눈엔 괜찮아 보이는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge10
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5D"
msgid "Wait, wait, calm down."
msgstr "잠깐, 잠깐, 진정해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge10
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5C"
msgid "What's the matter with you? You need to calm down."
msgstr "대체 뭐가 문제야? 진정하라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: embarrassed / Disgust / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5B"
msgid "Ugh... to stop this embarassment, maybe..."
msgstr "윽... 이 창피한 상황을 멈추려면, 그럴지도..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B5A"
msgid "I... did you... huh? Did you really think that would work?"
msgstr "저... 네가... 응? 정말 그게 통할 거라고 생각했어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B59"
msgid "I... I do not know what to say to that."
msgstr "저... 무슨 말을 해야 할지 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B58"
msgid "Why are you so dead set on believing a random person at a farm? They could be lying."
msgstr "왜 농장에 있는 낯선 사람 말을 그렇게 철썩같이 믿는 건데? 거짓말일 수도 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B57"
msgid "Let's not be too hasty, now."
msgstr "너무 서두르지는 말자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B56"
msgid "With what proof?"
msgstr "무슨 증거로?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B55"
msgid "Tell me the truth or I'll stop being nice. You really don't want that to happen."
msgstr "사실대로 말하지 않으면 더 이상 착하게 굴지 않을 거야. 정말 그런 상황은 원치 않을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B54"
msgid "Please, please? Pretty please?"
msgstr "제발, 제발? 응?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B53"
msgid "What is it now?"
msgstr "이번엔 무슨 일인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B52"
msgid "It does not paint a very good picture..."
msgstr "좋은 상황은 아니지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B51"
msgid "What's suspicious about it? He's my pet."
msgstr "그게 뭐가 수상한데? 내 애완동물이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B50"
msgid "Don't you want to get things off your chest and clear your conscience?"
msgstr "가슴에 맺힌 거 털어내고 양심을 깨끗이 하고 싶지 않아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4F"
msgid "I could get the guards involved. Do you want that to happen?"
msgstr "경비대원을 부를 수도 있어. 그렇게 되길 바라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4E"
msgid "You have a groat with you right there. You have to admit that's suspicious."
msgstr "네가 그로트를 가지고 있잖아. 수상하긴 하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4D"
msgid "All I want is to give Malik his groat back. I don't care what happens to you."
msgstr "난 그저 말릭 씨에게 그로트를 돌려주고 싶을 뿐이야. 네가 어떻게 되든 상관없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing.  &&& AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!   &&& AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone. &&& AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.|I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving. |I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies. |Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmm, maybe you are right. I did take a lot from him, and put him in a hard position. It would be the right thing to do...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4C"
msgid "I think you should work on Malik's farm as a farmhand to make up for the groats you've taken."
msgstr "네가 훔친 그로트를 보상하려면 말릭 씨의 농장에서 일꾼으로 일해야 할 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge09
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4B"
msgid "The groat seems uncomfortable. It's obvious it isn't yours."
msgstr "그로트가 불편해 보여. 네 것이 아닌 게 분명해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge10
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B4A"
msgid "Do I really have to rough you up over a groat?"
msgstr "고작 그로트 때문에 내가 널 손봐줘야겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B49"
msgid "Just tell me what I need to know, and I'll leave you alone."
msgstr "내가 알아야 할 것만 말해, 그럼 널 그냥 놔줄 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know how you are feeling inside. If you admit what you've done, I can help you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know how you are feeling inside. If you admit what you've done, I can help you.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B48"
msgid "Am I really that obvious?"
msgstr "내가 그렇게 티가 나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You aren't convincing me. From one thief to another, you need to come up with a cover story.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You aren't convincing me. From one thief to another, you need to come up with a cover story.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B47"
msgid "Damn it. Just my luck."
msgstr "젠장. 재수도 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got bad news, Andrah. I'm taking back that groat, whether you like it or not. &&& AndrahDubib: Huh? What's gotten into you? I do not even know you.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Am I really that obvious?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B46"
msgid "I know how you are feeling inside. If you admit what you've done, I can help you."
msgstr "네 속마음을 다 알고 있어. 네가 한 짓을 인정하면, 도와줄 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think you should work on Malik's farm as a farmhand to make up for the groats you've taken.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think you should work on Malik's farm as a farmhand to make up for the groats you've taken.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B45"
msgid "Hmmm, maybe you are right. I did take a lot from him, and put him in a hard position. It would be the right thing to do..."
msgstr "흠, 어쩌면 네 말이 맞을지도. 말릭에게서 많이 훔쳤고, 곤경에 빠뜨렸지. 그렇게 하는 게 맞는 것 같아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think you should work on Malik's farm as a farmhand to make up for the groats you've taken.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B44"
msgid "Well, if Malik will have me, I will do it. I will return the groat and apologize to him soon."
msgstr "글쎄, 말릭이 허락한다면 그렇게 할 거야. 그로트를 돌려주고 곧 사과할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: shocked, was not expecting this turn of events / Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found the person responsible for your missing groats. He'd like to apologize and work as your farmhand.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B43"
msgid "He'd like to what and do what?"
msgstr "뭐라고? 뭘 한다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't mean that. You're getting old and could use the help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B42"
msgid "I do not need any help, much less from a no-good groat thief. I would have rathered you shot him."
msgstr "난 도움이 필요 없네. 더군다나 그로트 도둑놈의 도움 따위. 차라리 자네가 그 녀석을 쐈으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B41"
msgid "Well... maybe."
msgstr "음... 그럴지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B40"
msgid "Uh... not really."
msgstr "어... 아니, 별로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found the person responsible for your missing groats. He'd like to apologize and work as your farmhand. &&& MalikVosh: He'd like to what and do what?|I do not need any help, much less from a no-good groat thief. I would have rathered you shot him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I mean... I... maybe so, but from the very same person who stole livestock from me? I just was not expecting this outcome.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3F"
msgid "You don't mean that. You're getting old and could use the help."
msgstr "그런 뜻으로 한 말이 아닌 거 아시잖습니까. 말릭 씨도 이제 늙었고, 도움이 필요할 수도 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He had good intentions but he went about things the wrong way. Give him a chance.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He had good intentions but he went about things the wrong way. Give him a chance.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You could always call the guards if you don't want him working for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3E"
msgid "That may be true, but still, can I trust him?"
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 하지만, 그래도, 그 녀석을 믿을 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MalikVosh
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: He'd like to what and do what?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3D"
msgid "I found the person responsible for your missing groats. He'd like to apologize and work as your farmhand."
msgstr "말릭 씨 그로트를 훔쳐 간 사람을 찾았습니다. 사과하고 농장에서 일꾼으로 일하고 싶다고 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I could run back over and kill him if you'd like. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I could run back over and kill him if you'd like. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3C"
msgid "No, no, no, what's done is done."
msgstr "아니, 아니, 아니, 이미 끝난 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I could run back over and kill him if you'd like. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Hmmph, I will show the virtue of mercy and hear him out, but I make no guarantees that I will accept him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3B"
msgid "I just was not expecting something like this to happen."
msgstr "그냥 이런 일이 벌어질 줄은 몰랐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't mean that. You're getting old and could use the help. &&& MalikVosh: I mean... I... maybe so, but from the very same person who stole livestock from me? I just was not expecting this outcome.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B3A"
msgid "You can always turn him away when he comes to apologize."
msgstr "사과하러 오면 거절해도 되잖습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't mean that. You're getting old and could use the help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't mean that. You're getting old and could use the help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can always turn him away when he comes to apologize.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B39"
msgid "I mean... I... maybe so, but from the very same person who stole livestock from me? I just was not expecting this outcome."
msgstr ""
"내 말은... 그러니까... 그럴지도 모르지만, 가축을 훔쳐 간 바로 그 인간한테 도움을 받으라고? 이런 결말은 전혀 예상치 못했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] I'm sorry. I couldn't find any sign of a thief, or your missing groats.  &&& MalikVosh: That is very, very disappointing. I suppose at this point I can only continue to pray to the Great Serpent, and hope for the best.|I appreciate your help, though I worry that my troubles are not over.  |Although you found nothing, I understand that you took time to try and help me. Here are a few credits for your trouble.|Now I suppose it's best for me to return to what is left of my farm. Excuse me. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And you believed him? Ridiculous... ridiculous! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B38"
msgid "The thief had good intentions."
msgstr "그 도둑은 좋은 의도로 그런 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B37"
msgid "Hmmph, I will show the virtue of mercy and hear him out, but I make no guarantees that I will accept him."
msgstr "흠, 자비의 미덕을 발휘해 그 도둑놈의 말을 들어주겠지만, 받아들일 거라 보장은 못 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B36"
msgid "It has been a strange day, and I would very much like to rest now. I appreciate you looking into this matter."
msgstr "참 이상한 하루였네. 이제 푹 쉬고 싶군. 이 일을 살펴봐 줘서 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found the person responsible for your missing groats. He'd like to apologize and work as your farmhand. &&& MalikVosh: He'd like to what and do what?|I do not need any help, much less from a no-good groat thief. I would have rathered you shot him.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That may be true, but still, can I trust him?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B35"
msgid "He had good intentions but he went about things the wrong way. Give him a chance."
msgstr "앤드라가 좋은 의도로 한 짓입니다. 방법이 잘못됐을 뿐입니다. 앤드라에게 기회를 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The thief had good intentions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The thief had good intentions.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B34"
msgid "And you believed him? Ridiculous... ridiculous!"
msgstr "그런데 자넨 그 말을 믿었나? 말도 안 돼... 말도 안 된다고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The thief had good intentions.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B33"
msgid "Get out of here. I am not giving you a single credit. Go!"
msgstr "여기서 나가. 단 한 푼도 주지 않을 거야. 어서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B32"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "흠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B31"
msgid "That does not sound very convincing."
msgstr "별로 설득력이 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to MalikVosh
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: So, you are the culprit that has been taking my groats from me.|Well, boy, what do you have to say for yourself?
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Hmmm... nonsense, honest work means honest pay, which I will be giving you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B30"
msgid "I have come to apologize, Malik. I want to make it up to you by working as your farmhand. You do not have to pay me -- I know I have made things difficult for you."
msgstr "말릭, 사과하러 왔어. 네 농장 일꾼으로 일해서 보상하고 싶어. 월급은 주지 않아도 돼. 내가 너를 힘들게 했다는 거 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to AndrahDubib
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: So, you are the culprit that has been taking my groats from me.|Well, boy, what do you have to say for yourself? &&& AndrahDubib: I have come to apologize, Malik. I want to make it up to you by working as your farmhand. You do not have to pay me -- I know I have made things difficult for you.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: I... but sir, I --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2F"
msgid "Hmmm... nonsense, honest work means honest pay, which I will be giving you."
msgstr "흠... 말도 안 되는 소리. 정직하게 일하면 정직하게 보수를 줘야지. 그게 자네에게 줄 보수일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to AndrahDubib
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Hmmm... nonsense, honest work means honest pay, which I will be giving you. &&& AndrahDubib: I... but sir, I --
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: Yes, sir. Thank you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2E"
msgid "Do not throw my generosity back in my face, boy. I expect you to work hard, and I will make sure you do so."
msgstr "내 관대함을 그런 식으로 걷어차지 마라, 얘야. 열심히 일할 거라고 기대하겠고, 그렇게 되도록 내가 지켜볼 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any workers that might have seen anything suspicious?
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_WorkerTL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2D"
msgid "It is just me at the farm, I do not have any workers. If that were the case I would not have bothered asking you for help."
msgstr "농장엔 나 혼자네. 일꾼은 없네. 만약 일꾼이 있었다면 애초에 자네에게 도움을 요청하지도 않았을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MalikVosh
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: It is just me at the farm, I do not have any workers. If that were the case I would not have bothered asking you for help. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_WorkerTL
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2C"
msgid "Do you have any workers that might have seen anything suspicious?"
msgstr "뭐 의심스러운 걸 본 일꾼은 없습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found the person responsible for your missing groats. He'd like to apologize and work as your farmhand. &&& MalikVosh: He'd like to what and do what?|I do not need any help, much less from a no-good groat thief. I would have rathered you shot him.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, no, no, what's done is done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2B"
msgid "I could run back over and kill him if you'd like."
msgstr "원한다면 지금 당장 달려가서 그 녀석을 죽여줄 수도 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B2A"
msgid "So, you are the culprit that has been taking my groats from me."
msgstr "그러니까, 그쪽이 내 그로트를 훔쳐 간 범인이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to AndrahDubib
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: I have come to apologize, Malik. I want to make it up to you by working as your farmhand. You do not have to pay me -- I know I have made things difficult for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B29"
msgid "Well, boy, what do you have to say for yourself?"
msgstr "그래, 얘야, 할 말 있으면 어디 해 봐라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to AndrahDubib
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Do not throw my generosity back in my face, boy. I expect you to work hard, and I will make sure you do so. &&& AndrahDubib: Yes, sir. Thank you!
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B28"
msgid "Ugh, enough of this. Get to work."
msgstr "윽, 이쯤하면 됐네. 가서 일이나 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: Do you need something?
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Damn it. Just my luck.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B27"
msgid "You aren't convincing me. From one thief to another, you need to come up with a cover story."
msgstr "날 설득하지 못하겠는걸? 도둑 대 도둑으로서 말하는데, 지어낸 이야기를 그럴싸하게 할 필요가 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to MalikVosh
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: I... but sir, I -- &&& MalikVosh: Do not throw my generosity back in my face, boy. I expect you to work hard, and I will make sure you do so.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Ugh, enough of this. Get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B26"
msgid "Yes, sir. Thank you!"
msgstr "알겠습니다. 감사합니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He had good intentions but he went about things the wrong way. Give him a chance. &&& MalikVosh: That may be true, but still, can I trust him?
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B25"
msgid "You could always call the guards if you don't want him working for you."
msgstr "그 녀석이 말릭 씨 밑에서 일하기 싫다고 하면 언제든 경비대원을 부르면 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to MalikVosh
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: I have come to apologize, Malik. I want to make it up to you by working as your farmhand. You do not have to pay me -- I know I have made things difficult for you. &&& MalikVosh: Hmmm... nonsense, honest work means honest pay, which I will be giving you.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Do not throw my generosity back in my face, boy. I expect you to work hard, and I will make sure you do so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_05_WrapUpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B24"
msgid "I... but sir, I --"
msgstr "저... 하지만, 저는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B23"
msgid "Unless you have reconsidered, please leave me be."
msgstr "다시 생각해 본 게 아니라면, 날 좀 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
