#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013B22"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B21"
msgid "*Grumble* Groats... one problem after another."
msgstr "*투덜거림* 그로트... 문제에 또 문제가 꼬리를 무는군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B20"
msgid "I pray that you can get to the bottom of this."
msgstr "이 일의 진상을 밝힐 수 있기를 기도하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1F"
msgid "What are you waiting for? Go to my farm and see what you can find."
msgstr "뭘 꾸물대는 거야? 내 농장에 가서 뭐라도 찾아봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1E"
msgid "What are you still doing here? Please, we mustn't waste time."
msgstr "여기서 아직도 뭘 꾸물대는 겐가? 지체할 시간이 없네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_FollowerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1D"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "응?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1C"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "여어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1B"
msgid "Are you here for business?"
msgstr "무슨 일로 왔나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B1A"
msgid "I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out."
msgstr "이제부터 말릭의 그로트는 건드리지 않겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B19"
msgid "Malik does not have to worry about his groats anymore, I promise you."
msgstr "말릭은 이제 그로트 걱정 안 해도 돼. 약속하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B18"
msgid "I will apologize to Malik soon, and see if he will accept me as a farmhand."
msgstr "곧 말릭에게 사과하고, 날 일꾼으로 받아줄지 알아볼 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AndrahHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013B17"
msgid "This is going to be an awkward conversation..."
msgstr "어색한 대화가 되겠는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: He hurried back to his "command center". &&& Actor02: Oh, you mean his throne room?
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
