msgid "Knock it off. Malik told me he doesn't have farmhands, so just tell me what's going on."
msgstr "집어치워. 말릭 씨한테 일꾼이 없다고 들었으니까, 무슨 일인지 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
