#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How does Dazra operate? &&& Qisrani: Before the cataclysm, city operations were comprised of three branches, run by each of the noble Houses. House Ka'dic, Veth'aal, and Dul'kehf.|And while the buildings themselves are gone, the staff remains. Collectively we are still trying to serve the needs of Dazra and its citizens.|That has become exceedingly difficult in the wake of all that's happened, but we are still duty bound.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
