msgid "What can you tell me about House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Has anyone else been allowed entry here? &&& CommerceOfficial: Several. The Halls of Healing are extremely busy. We can't keep track every individual that passes through.|In particular, the patients. We had to usher one out of here just now who claimed to have a crippling headache.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Admin privileges would allow you to view the access logs, however, that track the last three users to sign in.
