#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Zealots. Lots and lots of Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
