msgid "And if you're lucky, the traitor sending them our supplies."
msgstr "그리고 운이 좋다면, 우리한테 물자를 보내는 배신자도 찾을 수 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: an optional line that's more obvious per feedback
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ZealotBoss: 
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We can make a deal. I'll let you go, if you give me the name of the supply thief.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AE4"
msgid "The contact from House Ka'dic has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 연락책은 이미 다즈라로 돌아갔다. 그리고 네가 담당하던 키스라니는 연락책의 손에 죽을 것이다."

#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: Given the patient himself was a headache, it's likely genetic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AE3"
msgid "In particular, the patients. We had to usher one out of here just now who claimed to have a crippling headache."
msgstr "특히 환자들이 문제입니다. 저희는 방금 전에 극심한 두통을 호소하는 환자를 여기서 내보내야 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers_Shared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013AE2"
msgid "You're still here? Fish and guests, as they say."
msgstr "아직도 여기 있었나요? 생선과 손님은, 무슨 말인지 알겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
