#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers_Shared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013AE1"
msgid "Good luck at Jandar's Rest."
msgstr "잔다르의 안식처에서 행운을 빌죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers_Shared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013AE0"
msgid "Happy hunting."
msgstr "즐거운 사냥하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers_Shared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013ADF"
msgid "There are multiple ways for you to infiltrate that cave. Use whatever suits you best."
msgstr "그 동굴에 잠입하는 방법은 여러 가지가 있어요. 가장 잘 맞는 방법으로 잠입하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really should rethink your position on the hostages. &&& ...  &&& Mirek: All right. I'll let you in on their location, but remember. You're the only one that knows.|If word spreads, I'll know exactly who's to blame. &&& Mirek: Now leave me alone before I call security and have you escorted out. Or worse. &&& Mirek: The location you're looking for is Shadow Station Epsilon.|It's an old Va'ruun base that they've taken over for themselves. |Razma will know it. Let her tell you the details, seeing as how I'm about to be reassigned.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Isn't the answer obvious? The Zealots will know the location came from me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ADE"
msgid "Why would giving me this information get you reassigned?"
msgstr "정보를 넘겨줬는데 왜 재배치된다는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would giving me this information get you reassigned?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would giving me this information get you reassigned?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ADD"
msgid "Isn't the answer obvious? The Zealots will know the location came from me."
msgstr "뻔한 거 아니야? 정보가 나한테서 나왔다는 걸 광신도들이 알게 될 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Someone is Razma  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would giving me this information get you reassigned?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: That wasn't so hard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ADC"
msgid "All that hard work, thrown out the window because someone refuses to undergo negotiations."
msgstr "그렇게 힘들게 일해왔는데, 누군가께서 협상을 파토내시는 바람에 물거품이 돼 버렸군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm reporting this to Razma. &&& Djimal: Reporting this to Razma changes nothing, except to increase the conflict between us.|She'll merely keep using the Zealots as needs arise, and paying them with the means to terrorize your Settled Systems.|If you want that to stop, you'll see this through. All you need to do is get Sahima's research and bring it back.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ADB"
msgid "I'm not committing to anything."
msgstr "쉽게 결정하지 못할 문제인데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties. &&& companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Reporting this to Razma changes nothing, except to increase the conflict between us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD7"
msgid "I'm reporting this to Razma."
msgstr "이 일은 라즈마에게 보고할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm reporting this to Razma.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm reporting this to Razma.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD6"
msgid "Reporting this to Razma changes nothing, except to increase the conflict between us."
msgstr "라즈마 형님에게 보고해도 달라질 건 없어요. 우리 둘 사이에 갈등만 커질 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm reporting this to Razma.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD5"
msgid "She'll merely keep using the Zealots as needs arise, and paying them with the means to terrorize your Settled Systems."
msgstr "라즈마 형님은 필요할 때마다 광신도를 이용할 거고, 당신네 개척 성계를 위협할 수단을 넘겨줄 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm reporting this to Razma.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not committing to anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD4"
msgid "If you want that to stop, you'll see this through. All you need to do is get Sahima's research and bring it back."
msgstr "그걸 막고 싶다면 일을 끝까지 해내야겠죠. 사히마의 연구 자료를 확보해서 가져오기만 하면 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal. &&& Djimal: I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger. &&& Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.|And when you do, just know that we can't afford any loose ends. No witnesses.|As far as everyone else is concerned, the hostages were dead when you arrived and you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD3"
msgid "Like I said, I'm not committing to anything."
msgstr "아까도 말했지만, 쉽게 결정하지 못하겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD2"
msgid "I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations."
msgstr "옳은 결정을 내릴 거라 믿겠어요. 그럼, 협상 장소에서 만나도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal. &&& Djimal: I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger. &&& Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.|And when you do, just know that we can't afford any loose ends. No witnesses.|As far as everyone else is concerned, the hostages were dead when you arrived and you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Settled Systems, of course. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD1"
msgid "If I care about my people? What people?"
msgstr "사람들을 아낀다면? 무슨 사람 말이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I care about my people? What people?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If I care about my people? What people?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AD0"
msgid "The Settled Systems, of course."
msgstr "개척 성계 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I care about my people? What people?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACF"
msgid "They're the Zealots number one target with more victims every day."
msgstr "광신도들이 1순위 표적으로 삼는 곳이고, 매일 더 많은 희생자가 나오죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is "murder everyone" your solution to everything?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is "murder everyone" your solution to everything?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACE"
msgid "Of course not, but in this situation, it is the most effective means to an end."
msgstr "물론 아니죠. 하지만 지금 상황에선 가장 효과적인 방법이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is "murder everyone" your solution to everything?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACD"
msgid "As a Mediary, I am constantly weighing decisions based on both immediate and long term consequences."
msgstr "난 중개자로서 즉각적인 영향과 장기적인 영향 모두를 놓고 결정을 저울질하며 끊임없이 고민하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is "murder everyone" your solution to everything?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACC"
msgid "This decision is awful, I know that, but the far reaching consequences are worth the sacrifice."
msgstr "끔찍한 결정이라는 건 나도 알지만, 광범위한 영향을 고려해 보면 희생할 가치가 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal. &&& Djimal: I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger. &&& Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.|And when you do, just know that we can't afford any loose ends. No witnesses.|As far as everyone else is concerned, the hostages were dead when you arrived and you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course not, but in this situation, it is the most effective means to an end.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACB"
msgid "Is \"murder everyone\" your solution to everything?"
msgstr "모든 문젯거리를 '전부 죽여버리기'로 해결하는 모양이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal. &&& Djimal: I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger. &&& Djimal: Think about it if you must, but if you care about your people, you'll come to the same conclusion as I have.|And when you do, just know that we can't afford any loose ends. No witnesses.|As far as everyone else is concerned, the hostages were dead when you arrived and you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Zealots are unpredictable, and their passion to their cause often makes them prone to violence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013ACA"
msgid "And you think \"Zealots killed the hostages\" is a believable story?"
msgstr "'광신도가 인질을 죽였다'는 이야기를 믿을 거라고 생각해요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And you think "Zealots killed the hostages" is a believable story?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you think "Zealots killed the hostages" is a believable story?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC9"
msgid "Zealots are unpredictable, and their passion to their cause often makes them prone to violence."
msgstr "광신도들은 예측 불가인 데다가, 자기네 대의에 대한 열정 때문에 종종 폭력을 쓰곤 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And you think "Zealots killed the hostages" is a believable story?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC8"
msgid "Whether the Zealots believe it or not matters little, but Razma certainly will."
msgstr "광신도들이 믿든 말든 중요한 건 아니지만, 라즈마 형님은 분명 믿을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calm and quieter, the player isn't in combat and is either sneaking or hasn't been seen yet, so she doesn't want to give them away. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC7"
msgid "If you're here to help, that Zealot has a key. You have to get me out of here."
msgstr "도와주러 오신 거라면, 열쇠는 광신도한테 있어요. 저 좀 여기서 꺼내 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed the Zealot, so she's calling out in a normal voice, not yelling. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC6"
msgid "If you're here to help, that Zealot had a key. You have to get me out of here."
msgstr "도와주러 오신 거라면, 열쇠는 광신도한테 있어요. 저 좀 여기서 꺼내 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is dressed like a Zealot attacking other Zealots. / Confused / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Hostage01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Hostage_CommentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC5"
msgid "By the Serpent! Are they... fighting each other?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 저놈들... 서로 싸우는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Hostage01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011180A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Hostage_CommentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC4"
msgid "Serpent be merciful. Has help finally arrived?"
msgstr "뱀이시여, 자비를 베푸소서. 드디어 구조대가 온 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3EB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013AC3"
msgid "And if you're here making demands, she obviously has decided to make use of you rather than undergo sincere negotiations."
msgstr "그리고 네가 와서 이런 요구를 하는 걸 보면, 분명 이모님이 진심으로 협상하는 대신에 널 이용하기로 결정하셨을 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't risking the lives of a few agents worth it to save the many?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
