#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A9D"
msgid "I'll pay him a visit."
msgstr "그 친구한테 한번 가보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll pay him a visit.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll pay him a visit.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A9C"
msgid "All right. I should... I should be going."
msgstr "그래. 그럼... 이만 가봐야 할 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something fishy is going on, here. You seem nervous. &&& Farmer: Because you are making me nervous. |I am done talking to you. You better leave this place before there's trouble.  &&& Farmer: I -- all right, all right, just hear me out!  &&& Farmer: *Sigh* Look, I am not the mastermind of all this. I was paid by a man named Andrah to bring him a groat. I need the credits to pay for my uncle's medicine... |I am not sure why Andrah needs the groats, but you can ask him yourself. I was told to bring the groat to the seaweed farms in Dazra. |As for me, I promise that I will leave this farm and never come back.
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will. I won't ever come back here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A9B"
msgid "I'll find him. Now get out of here."
msgstr "찾아볼게. 그럼 여기서 나가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll find him. Now get out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll find him. Now get out of here.
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A9A"
msgid "I will. I won't ever come back here."
msgstr "그래. 다시는 여기 안 올게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Give me the credits Andrah paid you before you go. They belong to Malik.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Give me the credits Andrah paid you before you go. They belong to Malik.
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A99"
msgid "Damn it, fine."
msgstr "젠장, 알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something fishy is going on, here. You seem nervous. &&& Farmer: Because you are making me nervous. |I am done talking to you. You better leave this place before there's trouble.  &&& Farmer: I -- all right, all right, just hear me out!  &&& Farmer: *Sigh* Look, I am not the mastermind of all this. I was paid by a man named Andrah to bring him a groat. I need the credits to pay for my uncle's medicine... |I am not sure why Andrah needs the groats, but you can ask him yourself. I was told to bring the groat to the seaweed farms in Dazra. |As for me, I promise that I will leave this farm and never come back.
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Damn it, fine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A98"
msgid "Give me the credits Andrah paid you before you go. They belong to Malik."
msgstr "가기 전에 앤드라가 준 돈 이리 내. 그건 말릭 씨 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Farmer: What? What are you doing here? 
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not know. Malik hired me recently to guard the groats while he is away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A97"
msgid "If you're the farmhand, do you know what is causing the groats to go missing?"
msgstr "네가 일꾼이라면, 그로트가 왜 자꾸 사라지는지 알고 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you're the farmhand, do you know what is causing the groats to go missing?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you're the farmhand, do you know what is causing the groats to go missing?
#. ALIAS: Farmer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Farmer: Something fishy is going on, here. You seem nervous.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_02_FarmerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A96"
msgid "I do not know. Malik hired me recently to guard the groats while he is away."
msgstr "몰라. 말릭은 자기가 없는 동안 그로트를 지키라고 최근에 날 고용했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013A95"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하는 거죠?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarmerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A94"
msgid "You are not supposed to be here."
msgstr "여긴 네가 있을 곳이 아니야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013A93"
msgid "Get out of here."
msgstr "여기서 꺼져."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarmerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A92"
msgid "Andrah is at one of the seaweed farms near Dazra. He is the one behind the missing groats."
msgstr "앤드라는 다즈라 근처 해조류 양식장 중 한 곳에 있어. 그 녀석이 그로트가 사라진 일의 배후야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarmerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A91"
msgid "I won't ever come back to this farm, I promise."
msgstr "다시는 이 농장에 오지 않을게. 약속해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 011175D8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarmerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A90"
msgid "I will leave the groat alone. I am not the best with animals, anyway."
msgstr "그로트는 이제 안 건드릴 거야. 난 원래 동물을 잘 다루지도 못하고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AlicjaDalca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8F"
msgid "What's something people might not know about groats?"
msgstr "사람들이 그로트에 대해 잘 모르는 사실이 있다면 뭐가 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AlicjaDalca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8E"
msgid "Any other interesting facts about groats?"
msgstr "그로트에 대한 또 다른 흥미로운 사실이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's something people might not know about groats?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8D"
msgid "You might not know it to look at them, but groats are excellent climbers."
msgstr "겉보기엔 잘 모르실 수도 있지만, 그로트는 아주 잘 기어오른답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8C"
msgid "They try to get up to high places so they can see their surroundings."
msgstr "그로트는 주변 환경을 잘 보려고 높은 곳으로 올라가려고 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8B"
msgid "That includes the tops of crates and buildings, by the way."
msgstr "그건 상자집이나 건물 꼭대기도 마찬가지고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's something people might not know about groats?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A8A"
msgid "Groats have a much wider field of view than we do."
msgstr "그로트는 우리보다 시야가 훨씬 넓어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A89"
msgid "They're not easy to sneak up on, as I learned when I was a child."
msgstr "어릴 때 알게 된 사실인데, 그로트에게 몰래 다가가기는 쉽지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sheepish admission, open with a brief chuckle / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A88"
msgid "That was the same day that I also learned they have a powerful hind kick."
msgstr "그날 뒷발차기가 세다는 것도 알게 됐죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's something people might not know about groats?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A87"
msgid "Newborn groats are very steady and sure-footed compared to other animals."
msgstr "갓 태어난 그로트는 다른 동물에 비해 매우 안정적이고 발놀림이 민첩해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A86"
msgid "They can walk and run with perfect balance only hours after being born."
msgstr "태어난 지 몇 시간 만에 완벽한 균형으로 걷고 달릴 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's something people might not know about groats?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A85"
msgid "Groats don't do well on their own."
msgstr "그로트는 혼자서는 잘 지내지 못해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117644
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A84"
msgid "Without other groats around, they become depressed and stop eating, even to the point of starvation."
msgstr "주변에 다른 그로트가 없으면 우울해져서 굶어 죽을 때까지 먹지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AlicjaDalca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I was raised in the city, and when I was still young, my parents took me to visit a groat farm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A83"
msgid "How did you get into groat farming?"
msgstr "어떻게 그로트 목장을 시작하게 되셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into groat farming?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A82"
msgid "I was raised in the city, and when I was still young, my parents took me to visit a groat farm."
msgstr "저는 도시에서 자랐고, 어렸을 때 부모님과 함께 그로트 목장을 방문했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A81"
msgid "My father wanted me to see how others lived, to open my eyes to new possibilities."
msgstr "아버지께서는 제가 다른 사람들이 어떻게 사는지 보고, 새로운 가능성에 눈을 뜨길 바라셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A80"
msgid "That day changed my life. I knew from the moment I set foot on this farm how I would serve."
msgstr "그날 제 인생이 바뀌었어요. 이 목장에 발을 들이는 순간 제가 어떻게 봉사해야 할지 알게 되었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7F"
msgid "The Great Serpent had revealed my life's purpose, and I came to work here as soon as I was of age."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 제 인생의 목적을 밝혀 주셨고, 저는 성인이 되자마자 이곳에서 일하게 되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7E"
msgid "It has been a fulfilling life."
msgstr "만족스러운 삶이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AlicjaDalca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: By the Serpent's mercy, we were safe from the worst of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117638
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7D"
msgid "How has the catastrophe in Dazra affected the groat farms?"
msgstr "다즈라의 재난이 그로트 목장에 어떤 영향을 미쳤나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, talking about a terrible calamity / Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How has the catastrophe in Dazra affected the groat farms?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7C"
msgid "By the Serpent's mercy, we were safe from the worst of it."
msgstr "뱀의 자비로, 저희는 최악의 상황은 피했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, talking about a terrible calamity / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7B"
msgid "But in truth, nobody was really spared."
msgstr "하지만 사실, 아무도 화를 면하진 못했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, talking about a terrible calamity / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A7A"
msgid "Everyone either lost someone close, or knows someone who did."
msgstr "모두가 가까운 사람을 잃었거나, 가까운 이를 잃은 사람을 알고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, talking about a terrible calamity / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A79"
msgid "And of course there's the disruption to goods and services, the delivery of supplies and so on."
msgstr "그리고 물론 물품과 서비스, 물자 전달 등에도 차질이 생겼고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A78"
msgid "The disaster touches every part of our society."
msgstr "재난은 우리 사회의 모든 부분에 영향을 미치고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber, confused / Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 01117637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaTL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A77"
msgid "I just wish I could know the Great Serpent's reason. Why visit this calamity upon our people?"
msgstr "저는 그저 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 알고 싶을 뿐입니다. 왜 우리 신민에게 이런 재난을 내리셨을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A76"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious, the player has stopped talking mid-conversation.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest
#. TOPIC: 011196E9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_RE_MS05_PostQuest_Maaliya_WFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013A75"
msgid "Something on your mind?"
msgstr "무슨 생각 하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious. The player just stopped talking in mid-conversation. / Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763E
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01117650
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013A74"
msgid "You seem distracted."
msgstr "산만해 보이시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, grieving
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A73"
msgid "I can't stop thinking about the catastrophe."
msgstr "그 재난에 대한 생각을 멈출 수가 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, grieving / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A72"
msgid "My sister was among those lost."
msgstr "제 여동생도 실종자 중에 있었어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A71"
msgid "When I heard the news, it was as if my heart was torn from my chest."
msgstr "그 소식을 들었을 때, 심장이 찢어지는 것 같았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, grieving / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A70"
msgid "I pray that the victims of the calamity did not suffer too much."
msgstr "재난의 희생자들이 너무 고통받지 않았기를 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, grieving / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6F"
msgid "My poor little sister, gone just like that. The pain is almost more than I can bear."
msgstr "제 불쌍한 여동생이 그렇게 허무하게 가 버렸어요. 그 고통은 제가 감당하기 힘들 정도입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6E"
msgid "She used to write letters to me. Such beautiful prose."
msgstr "제게 편지를 쓰곤 했었는데, 정말 아름다운 문체였죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, afraid / Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Female07
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6D"
msgid "Each day I wonder, will there be another catastrophe? Is it truly over?"
msgstr "매일 또 다른 재난이 닥칠지, 정말로 끝난 건지 궁금합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6C"
msgid "Where some see tragedy in the Dazra event, I see salvation."
msgstr "어떤 이들은 다즈라 사건에서 비극을 보지만, 저는 구원을 봅니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6B"
msgid "Those who see the warning for what it is will be spared the Serpent's wrath."
msgstr "그 경고를 제대로 이해하는 사람들은 뱀의 분노를 피할 수 있을 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A6A"
msgid "So many cry out in anguish because they cannot understand why the calamity happened."
msgstr "너무나 많은 이들이 재난이 왜 일어났는지 이해할 수 없어서 고통 속에 울부짖고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A69"
msgid "The truth is plain. We've become lax in our devotion and now we have been punished."
msgstr "진실은 명백합니다. 우리는 헌신에 느슨해졌고 이제 벌을 받은 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A68"
msgid "The Great Serpent strikes down those who falter in their faith."
msgstr "위대한 뱀은 신앙이 흔들리는 자들을 쓰러뜨립니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A67"
msgid "There will be more calamities, I can promise you."
msgstr "더 많은 재난이 있을 것입니다. 장담하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A66"
msgid "The end of times is coming. The calamity was but the first note in the last chorus."
msgstr "종말의 때가 오고 있습니다. 그 재난은 마지막 합창의 첫 음표에 불과했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dire, a prophet of doom / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_Male04
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A65"
msgid "I hope you have made your peace with the Great Serpent, for the great reckoning has begun."
msgstr "위대한 뱀과의 평화를 이루셨기를 바랍니다. 거대한 심판이 시작되었으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A64"
msgid "I can't wait to get those spices you brought me into a stew!"
msgstr "가져다주신 향신료를 스튜에 넣을 생각에 벌써부터 기대가 되네요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A63"
msgid "I hope your other delivers are going well."
msgstr "다른 배달도 잘 되길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A62"
msgid "Hello again, courier."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 택배 기사님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A61"
msgid "Welcome! It's always good to have a visitor."
msgstr "어서 오세요! 손님이 오시는 건 언제나 반가운 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A60"
msgid "The days can be long for a farmer, but there's nothing I'd rather do."
msgstr "농부에게 하루는 길지만, 이 일 말고는 하고 싶은 게 없답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5F"
msgid "These groats are like family to me."
msgstr "이 그로트들은 저에게 가족과 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5E"
msgid "Groats really are wise creatures. You can see it in their eyes."
msgstr "그로트는 정말 현명한 생물이에요. 눈을 보면 알 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_AlicjaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5D"
msgid "I didn't really discover my life's purpose until I began taking care of these creatures."
msgstr "내 인생의 진짜 의미를 찾은 건, 이 아이들을 돌보기 시작하면서부터였어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5C"
msgid "I like the quiet out here."
msgstr "저는 이곳의 고요함이 좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5B"
msgid "The groat is a majestic creature, don't you think?"
msgstr "그로트는 위엄 있는 생물이죠. 그렇지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A5A"
msgid "You get used to the smell of groats after a while."
msgstr "시간이 지나면 그로트 냄새에도 익숙해진답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A59"
msgid "I wouldn't mind a sip of Koza."
msgstr "코자 한 모금 마시고 싶네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A58"
msgid "It might look fierce, but the groat is a gentle beast."
msgstr "사나워 보일지 모르지만, 그로트는 온순한 동물이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A57"
msgid "The Great Serpent favors those who labor for the greater good."
msgstr "위대한 뱀은 대의를 위해 일하는 자를 총애하십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A56"
msgid "Truly, the groat is a gift from the Great Serpent. It provides much for us."
msgstr "진실로, 그로트는 위대한 뱀이 주신 선물입니다. 우리에게 많은 것을 제공하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk. / Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A55"
msgid "Thank the Serpent I was out here when the calamity happened."
msgstr "재난이 닥쳤을 때 이곳에 있었던 것에 대해 뱀께 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly. A hard-working farmer making small talk. / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A54"
msgid "So many were lost to the calamity. It weighs heavy on my heart."
msgstr "너무나 많은 이들이 재난으로 목숨을 잃었어요. 마음이 무겁습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A53"
msgid "You're welcome to look around if you like."
msgstr "괜찮으시다면, 주변을 둘러보셔도 좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A52"
msgid "Why did the Serpent inflict the great calamity on us? Was it a test?"
msgstr "왜 뱀께서는 우리에게 이 거대한 재난을 내리셨을까요? 이것은 시험이었을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A51"
msgid "We don't need any more hands right now."
msgstr "지금은 일손이 더 필요하지는 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A50"
msgid "If it's work you're looking for, there is great need in the city."
msgstr "일자리를 찾고 계시면, 도시 쪽에 가보세요. 일손이 많이 필요하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A4F"
msgid "Out for some fresh air?"
msgstr "신선한 공기 좀 쐬러 나오셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A4E"
msgid "On behalf of the groats, I welcome you to our humble farm."
msgstr "그로트를 대표해서, 저희의 소박한 농장에 오신 것을 환영합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A4D"
msgid "For a beast, the groat is quite intelligent."
msgstr "짐승치고는 그로트는 꽤 지능이 높습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A4C"
msgid "There is something of the Great Serpent in every plant and beast."
msgstr "모든 식물과 짐승에게는 위대한 뱀의 무언가가 깃들어 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Casual, friendly, a farmer making small talk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms
#. TOPIC: 0111763F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGroatFarms_BaseHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013A4B"
msgid "Out here, away from the city, I feel closer to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "도시에서 멀리 떨어진 이곳에서 저는 위대한 뱀과 더 가까워진 느낌을 받습니다."

