#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nodding with sympathy, friendly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are days I feel lost, yes, but today I'm here with a package for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are days I feel lost, yes, but today I'm here with a package for you.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A32"
msgid "I think we all have those kinds of days from time to time."
msgstr "모두 가끔은 길을 잃은 것 같은 나날이 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are days I feel lost, yes, but today I'm here with a package for you.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A31"
msgid "But if you're here with a package, that must mean Lijana was finally able to find a new courier."
msgstr "그런데 당신이 여기 소포를 전해주러 오신 걸 보니, 드디어 리야나가 새 배달원을 찾았나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure he's in a better place now. &&& AlicjaDalca: He deserves nothing less than that.|He was loyal, devoted and steadfast in his faith.|I know the Great Serpent judged him to be worthy, and that brings me some solace.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's a strong aroma, I know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A30"
msgid "[Give package] Get this away from me before that smell gets into my clothes."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 옷에 냄새 배기 전에 빨리 가져가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department. &&& Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Working the spaceport would allow for both the smuggling of supplies and people amidst the chaos.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01114EE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013A2D"
msgid "[Tevina's Records] There were employment records showing your ward Ochim was assigned to work the spaceport."
msgstr "[테비나의 기록] 당신의 피후견자, 오킴이 우주항에서 일하도록 배정받았다는 기록이 있던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Tevina's Records] There were employment records showing your ward Ochim was assigned to work the spaceport.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Tevina's Records] There were employment records showing your ward Ochim was assigned to work the spaceport.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Correlation does not imply causation. Even you should be aware it's not enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01114EE4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "013A2C"
msgid "Working the spaceport would allow for both the smuggling of supplies and people amidst the chaos."
msgstr "우주항에서 일하면 물자는 물론 사람들까지 혼란을 틈타 밀반입할 수 있겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department. &&& Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: On its own, not necessarily damning, but combined with all the other evidence, it signifies a pattern.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C7851
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A2B"
msgid "[Spaceport Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen."
msgstr "[우주항 컴퓨터] 코테지의 비행 단말기 기록이 물자 도난 날짜와 일치합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar. &&& Qisrani: I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself. &&& Qisrani: In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, it's safer in your hands. And when it comes time for the trial, I want you to deliver it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F68
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A2A"
msgid "What about this slate I found at Jandar's Rest? Should I give it to you?"
msgstr "잔다르의 안식처에서 찾은 이 슬레이트는 어떡할까요? 당신께 드려야 하나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about this slate I found at Jandar's Rest? Should I give it to you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about this slate I found at Jandar's Rest? Should I give it to you?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F67
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A29"
msgid "No, it's safer in your hands. And when it comes time for the trial, I want you to deliver it."
msgstr "아뇨. 당신의 손에 있는 게 더 안전해요. 그리고 재판이 벌어질 때가 되면 당신이 전해 주면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about this slate I found at Jandar's Rest? Should I give it to you?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F67
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A28"
msgid "You're the only impartial person involved in this case."
msgstr "이 사건에 연루된 사람들 중엔 당신만이 중립적이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about this slate I found at Jandar's Rest? Should I give it to you?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Let's do it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F67
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A27"
msgid "And besides, you did the leg work. You deserve the honor of submitting it."
msgstr "게다가 힘든 일은 당신이 다 하셨잖아요. 슬레이트를 제출하는 영예를 누려야 마땅하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013A26"
msgid "From what I here, we got our man."
msgstr "제가 듣기로는, 우리가 해냈나 보더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
