msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A22"
msgid "We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation."
msgstr "더 이상 이방인들이 우리 도시에 몰려드는 건 필요 없으니, 고립이 끝난다는 건 생각만 해도 몸서리쳐지는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: Business has never been better, and that is good enough for me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A21"
msgid "However, the Great Serpent has favored House Ka'dic, so I will hold my tongue and support them, as any citizen should."
msgstr "하지만 위대한 뱀께서 카딕 가문을 총애하셨으니, 난 입을 다물고 그들을 지지할 거다. 모든 시민이 그래야 하듯이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
