msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A1D"
msgid "I hope ending our isolation will lead to trade relationships with the Settled Systems. I could finally get official parts for my machine."
msgstr "고립이 끝나면 개척 성계와의 무역 관계로 이어지기를 바랍니다. 그러면 제 기계에 쓸 공식 부품을 구할 수 있을 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: It has been great. They gave me more funding for my shop, so that I can access better parts for the machine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A1C"
msgid "I am nervous about reunification, though. Will we be safe if the Zealots come back?"
msgstr "하지만 재통합은 걱정스럽습니다. 광신도들이 돌아오면 우리가 안전할 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraSaharRaztan: It has been great. They gave me more funding for my shop, so that I can access better parts for the machine. |Business has been good for the first time since I have opened. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A1B"
msgid "I can appreciate the commitment to the Great Serpent, but I must say that the forced pilgrimages are taking a lot out of me."
msgstr "위대한 뱀에 대한 헌신은 이해하지만, 강제 순례는 나를 너무 지치게 하는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMakolaJubav: Business has never been better, and that is good enough for me. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A1A"
msgid "They are strong rulers that understand that the words of Jinan Va'ruun and obedience to the Great Serpent is paramount."
msgstr "그 가문 사람들은 지난 바룬의 말씀과 위대한 뱀에 대한 복종이 가장 중요하다는 것을 이해하는 강력한 통치자들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A19"
msgid "We will all be made stronger from their rule."
msgstr "우리 모두는 가문의 통치 아래 더 강해질 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraSaharRaztan: I hope ending our isolation will lead to trade relationships with the Settled Systems. I could finally get official parts for my machine.|I am nervous about reunification, though. Will we be safe if the Zealots come back?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A18"
msgid "It has been great. They gave me more funding for my shop, so that I can access better parts for the machine."
msgstr "아주 좋았어요. 가게에 더 많은 자금을 지원해 줘서 기계에 더 좋은 부품을 쓸 수 있게 됐거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: I can appreciate the commitment to the Great Serpent, but I must say that the forced pilgrimages are taking a lot out of me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A17"
msgid "Business has been good for the first time since I have opened."
msgstr "가게를 연 이래 처음으로 장사가 잘되고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.|However, the Great Serpent has favored House Ka'dic, so I will hold my tongue and support them, as any citizen should.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: They are strong rulers that understand that the words of Jinan Va'ruun and obedience to the Great Serpent is paramount. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A16"
msgid "Business has never been better, and that is good enough for me."
msgstr "장사가 이보다 더 잘 된 적이 없었어. 그것만으로도 만족스러워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A15"
msgid "How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A14"
msgid "How do you feel about House Dul'khef taking power?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A13"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraHantonIrara: I welcome it, if ending our isolation could lead to opening trade routes with the Settled Systems. Maybe we will not ever have to worry about our supplies ever again.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A12"
msgid "Our stock of supplies have somewhat improved, but my healers are more overworked than ever."
msgstr "물자 재고는 다소 개선되었지만, 치료사들은 그 어느 때보다 과로하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: I just... when are we supposed to find the time for these pilgrimages? My healers have enough on their hands as is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A11"
msgid "Hard work and long hours means that more people are injuring themselves, not just the displaced."
msgstr "힘든 일과 긴 근무 시간으로 인해, 이주민뿐만 아니라 더 많은 사람들이 다치고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
