msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Business is good, and our groat supply has improved. Although, the hours are long. |I pray that no one overworks themselves.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A0D"
msgid "House Veth'aal? Ah, I think it is good that we are committing to our faith in the Great Serpent."
msgstr "베타알 가문? 아, 위대한 뱀에 대한 우리의 신앙을 다지는 건 좋은 일이라고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A0C"
msgid "I used to go on pilgrimages all the time as a young one. It is disappointing to hear so many grumble about them returning."
msgstr "어렸을 때 항상 순례를 다니곤 했어요. 순례가 돌아온다는 소식에 불평하는 사람들이 많다니 실망스럽군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A0B"
msgid "The Great Serpent has given us everything, so it is important that we all form a relationship with Him. House Veth'aal understands that."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리에게 모든 것을 주셨으니, 우리 모두 그분과 관계를 맺는 것이 중요합니다. 베타알 가문은 그것을 이해하고 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Our stock of supplies have somewhat improved, but my healers are more overworked than ever.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A0A"
msgid "I welcome it, if ending our isolation could lead to opening trade routes with the Settled Systems. Maybe we will not ever have to worry about our supplies ever again."
msgstr "고립이 끝나면 개척 성계와의 교역로가 열릴 수 있다면 환영입니다. 어쩌면 다시는 물자 걱정을 하지 않아도 될지도 모르지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
