msgid "How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A08"
msgid "How do you feel about House Dul'khef taking power?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A07"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraOrahim: Hmm, you do not know Zealots like I do, then. You never were one, after all.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: They are a passionate bunch, for certain. I pray that that passion does not lead to zealotry.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A06"
msgid "I am not well-versed in House politics, but House Dul'khef always seemed the most level-headed of the bunch. Seems a good choice, to me."
msgstr "가문 정치에 정통한 것은 아니지만, 둘케프 가문은 항상 가장 분별 있는 가문 같았습니다. 제겐 좋은 선택으로 보입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: foreboding / Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraOrahim: I am not well-versed in House politics, but House Dul'khef always seemed the most level-headed of the bunch. Seems a good choice, to me.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A05"
msgid "They are a passionate bunch, for certain. I pray that that passion does not lead to zealotry."
msgstr "그들은 확실히 열정적인 무리입니다. 그 열정이 광신으로 이어지지 않기를 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power? &&& HVDazraOrahim: The idea of Zealots being welcomed back into the city, after I have just fought so hard to escape them, leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth. |It will be nothing but trouble.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You know I am no Zealot, and I will kill as many as I need to prove it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A04"
msgid "Don't you think that's a little... hypocritical?"
msgstr "그건 좀... 위선적이지 않나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: Eh, times like this that I wish I were an independent vendor. All the other shops are booming, but I still cannot sell to anyone that is not approved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A03"
msgid "It was an interesting choice that could change Dazra forever. I am cautiously optimistic."
msgstr "다즈라를 영원히 바꿀 흥미로운 선택이었습니다. 조심스럽게 낙관하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you think that's a little... hypocritical? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't you think that's a little... hypocritical? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: I am not well-versed in House politics, but House Dul'khef always seemed the most level-headed of the bunch. Seems a good choice, to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A02"
msgid "You know I am no Zealot, and I will kill as many as I need to prove it."
msgstr "내가 광신도가 아니라는 건 알잖아. 그걸 증명하기 위해 필요한 만큼 녀석들을 죽일 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure it'll be fine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure it'll be fine.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: I am not well-versed in House politics, but House Dul'khef always seemed the most level-headed of the bunch. Seems a good choice, to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A01"
msgid "Hmm, you do not know Zealots like I do, then. You never were one, after all."
msgstr "흠, 그럼 당신은 광신도를 잘 모르는군. 결국 당신은 광신도가 아니었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power? &&& HVDazraOrahim: The idea of Zealots being welcomed back into the city, after I have just fought so hard to escape them, leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth. |It will be nothing but trouble.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It will happen, and there will be a reckoning, I am sure of it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013A00"
msgid "There's no guarantee that will happen."
msgstr "그럴 거란 보장은 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FF"
msgid "The idea of Zealots being welcomed back into the city, after I have just fought so hard to escape them, leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth."
msgstr "광신도들로부터 이제 막 벗어났는데, 그들이 다시 도시로 돌아온다는 건 생각만 해도 끔찍해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sure it'll be fine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FE"
msgid "It will be nothing but trouble."
msgstr "그건 골칫거리일 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: he doesn't like House Ka'dic's takeover, but doesn't want to badmouth / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FD"
msgid "Well, perhaps it is better if I do not say anything at all."
msgstr "음, 어쩌면 아무 말도 하지 않는 게 낫겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Business is good, and our groat supply has improved. Although, the hours are long. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FC"
msgid "The Great Serpent wished for it to be this way, and... so be it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 이렇게 되기를 바라셨으니... 그렇게 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraHantonIrara: Our stock of supplies have somewhat improved, but my healers are more overworked than ever.|Hard work and long hours means that more people are injuring themselves, not just the displaced.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FB"
msgid "I just... when are we supposed to find the time for these pilgrimages? My healers have enough on their hands as is."
msgstr "그냥... 언제 우리가 이 순례를 할 시간이 있을까요? 제 치료사들은 지금도 할 일이 너무 많습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Well, perhaps it is better if I do not say anything at all. |The Great Serpent wished for it to be this way, and... so be it.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139FA"
msgid "Business is good, and our groat supply has improved. Although, the hours are long."
msgstr "장사는 잘되고 있고, 그로트 공급도 개선되었어. 근무 시간이 길긴 하지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: House Veth'aal? Ah, I think it is good that we are committing to our faith in the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F9"
msgid "I pray that no one overworks themselves."
msgstr "누구도 과로하지 않기를 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How could you not care? This could change House Va'ruun forever. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How could you not care? This could change House Va'ruun forever. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F8"
msgid "Everything had already changed forever weeks before your arrival."
msgstr "당신이 도착하기 몇 주 전에 이미 모든 것이 영원히 바뀌었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How could you not care? This could change House Va'ruun forever. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F7"
msgid "I have had my fill of change."
msgstr "변화라면 이제 지긋지긋해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power? &&& HVDazraOrahim: The idea of Zealots being welcomed back into the city, after I have just fought so hard to escape them, leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth. |It will be nothing but trouble.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm, you do not know Zealots like I do, then. You never were one, after all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F6"
msgid "I'm sure it'll be fine."
msgstr "괜찮을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: Eh, times like this that I wish I were an independent vendor. All the other shops are booming, but I still cannot sell to anyone that is not approved.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F5"
msgid "It does not affect me much, but the soldiers outside have been fired up. Hard not to feel a boost in morale."
msgstr "나한테는 별 영향이 없지만, 밖에 있는 군인들이 들떠 있어. 사기가 오르는 걸 느끼지 않기란 어렵지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on the results of the trial?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Tevina: I believe there are others. But unfortunately, the new Speaker being from House Ka'dic will pose a detriment to rooting out more traitors.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01114EE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F4"
msgid "What are my thoughts? My thoughts are that Mujeen Ka'dic got away with murder, and somebody helped him hide the weapon."
msgstr "제 생각이 뭐냐고요? 제 생각엔 무진 카딕이 살인을 저지르고 도망쳤고, 무진이 무기를 숨기는 걸 누군가가 도왔다는 거에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on the results of the trial?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Tevina: I believe there are others. But unfortunately, the new Speaker being from House Ka'dic will pose a detriment to rooting out more traitors.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01114EE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F3"
msgid "My thoughts are that we got our man, but that the work isn't over."
msgstr "제 생각에 우리는 범인을 잡은 거 같지만, 아직 일은 끝나지 않은 거 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Tevina: What are my thoughts? My thoughts are that Mujeen Ka'dic got away with murder, and somebody helped him hide the weapon.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01114EE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F2"
msgid "I believe there are others. But unfortunately, the new Speaker being from House Ka'dic will pose a detriment to rooting out more traitors."
msgstr "다른 자들이 있다고 봅니다. 하지만 불행히도 새 대변자가 카딕 가문 출신이라 더 많은 반역자를 찾는 데 걸림돌이 될 겁니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Tevina: What are my thoughts? My thoughts are that Mujeen Ka'dic got away with murder, and somebody helped him hide the weapon.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01114EE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F1"
msgid "We will need to take a close examination of House Ka'dic's personnel, until we have rooted out every last traitor in our city."
msgstr "우리 도시에 있는 반역자를 모조리 뿌리 뽑을 때까지 카딕 가문의 인물들을 면밀히 조사해야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139F0"
msgid "How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139EF"
msgid "How do you feel about House Dul'khef taking power?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139EE"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power? &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: I really do not care one way or another. Nothing will change what happened to us, what was taken from us. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: For a lot of people, there is nothing in our future.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139ED"
msgid "That's why its time to look towards the future."
msgstr "그래서 미래를 향해 나아가야 할 때인 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's why its time to look towards the future.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's why its time to look towards the future.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "0139EC"
msgid "For a lot of people, there is nothing in our future."
msgstr "많은 사람들에게, 우리의 미래는 아무 의미가 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's why its time to look towards the future.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139EB"
msgid "We were supposed to start families, our careers, our lives. Then the calamity stopped it all, and our lives stopped too."
msgstr ""
"저희는 가정을 꾸리고, 경력을 쌓고, 우리만의 삶을 살기로 마음먹었죠. 그러다 재난이 모든 것을 멈춰버렸고, 저희의 인생도 멈추었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's why its time to look towards the future.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139EA"
msgid "My past is all I have -- the new Speaker can never give me a future."
msgstr "제 과거가 제가 가진 전부예요. 새 대변자는 결코 제게 미래를 줄 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E9"
msgid "How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E8"
msgid "How do you feel about House Dul'khef taking power?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: We do not need any more outsiders flooding our city, so I shudder to think of an end to our isolation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E7"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal taking power?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 권력을 잡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power? &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: I really do not care one way or another. Nothing will change what happened to us, what was taken from us. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Everything had already changed forever weeks before your arrival. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E6"
msgid "How could you not care? This could change House Va'ruun forever."
msgstr "어떻게 신경을 안 쓸 수 있어? 바룬 가문이 영원히 바뀔 수도 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no guarantee that will happen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no guarantee that will happen.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: I am not well-versed in House politics, but House Dul'khef always seemed the most level-headed of the bunch. Seems a good choice, to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E5"
msgid "It will happen, and there will be a reckoning, I am sure of it."
msgstr "반드시 일어날 거고, 심판이 있을 거야. 난 그렇게 확신해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Ka'dic taking power?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's why its time to look towards the future.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E4"
msgid "I really do not care one way or another. Nothing will change what happened to us, what was taken from us."
msgstr "저는 정말 어느 쪽이든 상관없어요. 무슨 일이 일어나든 저희에게 일어난 일, 저희가 빼앗긴 것은 변하지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: It was an interesting choice that could change Dazra forever. I am cautiously optimistic. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: It does not affect me much, but the soldiers outside have been fired up. Hard not to feel a boost in morale. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011160BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_PostMQ06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E3"
msgid "Eh, times like this that I wish I were an independent vendor. All the other shops are booming, but I still cannot sell to anyone that is not approved."
msgstr "에휴, 이럴 땐 내가 독립 상인이었으면 좋겠어. 다른 가게들은 다 호황인데, 난 여전히 허가받지 않은 사람에겐 팔 수 없거든."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Tevina: What are my thoughts? My thoughts are that Mujeen Ka'dic got away with murder, and somebody helped him hide the weapon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01114EE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139E2"
msgid "What are your thoughts on the results of the trial?"
msgstr "재판 결과에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: filled with militaristic zeal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139E1"
msgid "All Must Serve! All Must Serve!"
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다! 모두가 섬겨야 한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: filled with militaristic zeal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139E0"
msgid "We will walk in Jinan's footsteps!"
msgstr "우리는 지난의 발자취를 따를 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: filled with militaristic zeal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139DF"
msgid "House Veth'aal will renew our strength!"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 우리의 힘을 되살릴 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: filled with militaristic zeal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139DE"
msgid "Obey the words of Jinan Va'ruun!"
msgstr "지난 바룬의 말씀에 복종하라!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139DD"
msgid "How am I supposed to finish all of this? They keep giving me more work..."
msgstr "이걸 다 어떻게 끝내라는 걸까요? 계속 일을 더 주는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139DC"
msgid "I guess we may start seeing more and more Settled Systems ships, if we stop our, uh, isolation. Dumar should be happy."
msgstr "우리가, 어, 고립을 멈추면 개척 성계 우주선이 더 많이 보이기 시작하겠죠. 두마르가 좋아하겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139DB"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139DA"
msgid "I hope I get to see a lot more Settled Systems ships flying in, now that Razma is Speaker."
msgstr "라즈마가 대변자가 되었으니 개척 성계 우주선이 더 많이 들어오는 걸 보면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D9"
msgid "Maybe Hasmak will start trading ships with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "어쩌면 해즈막이 개척 성계와 우주선 교역을 시작할지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D8"
msgid "I hope I get to see a lot more Settled Systems ships flying in, now that Razma is Speaker."
msgstr "라즈마가 대변자가 되었으니 개척 성계 우주선이 더 많이 들어오는 걸 보면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D7"
msgid "Hopefully House Dul'khef grants us more funding."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 자금을 더 지원해 주면 좋겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D6"
msgid "Ending our isolation could let us buy medical supplies from the Settled Systems."
msgstr "고립이 끝나면 개척 성계로부터 의료 용품을 살 수 있을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D5"
msgid "The forced pilgrimages are stealing the healers away from our patients."
msgstr "강제 순례 때문에 치료사들이 환자들 곁을 떠나고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D4"
msgid "Your arrival set a bad precedent, it seems. Now we will be opening our gates to everyone that wants in."
msgstr "당신이 온 게 나쁜 선례가 된 것 같군. 이제 원하는 사람은 누구나 들어올 수 있게 될 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D3"
msgid "It has been ages since we have had good, strong rulers like House Veth'aal."
msgstr "베타알 가문처럼 훌륭하고 강력한 통치자가 나온 건 오랜만이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D2"
msgid "I had my doubts about House Dul'khef, but business has improved. It is good to see everyone put to work."
msgstr "둘케프 가문에 대해 의구심이 있었지만, 장사가 잘되고 있어. 모두가 일하는 모습을 보니 좋군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D1"
msgid "Hmmph, wish I could take advantage of all this booming business I keep hearing about."
msgstr "흠, 듣기로는 호황이라던데 저도 그 호황 좀 누릴 수 있었으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139D0"
msgid "I am cautiously optimistic about House Ka'dic taking power."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 집권한 상황에 대해 조심스럽게 낙관하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CF"
msgid "The infantry has been fired up since House Veth'aal came to power."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 집권한 이후 보병들이 활기를 띠고 있더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CE"
msgid "All Must Serve!"
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CD"
msgid "With the extra funding I got from House Dul'khef, I was able to freshly repair my machine. Want to take it for a spin?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문에서 추가 자금을 지원받아서 기계를 새로 수리할 수 있었어. 한번 타볼래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CC"
msgid "Dazra is in for some major changes with House Ka'dic in power."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 권력을 잡으면서 다즈라는 큰 변화를 겪게 될 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CB"
msgid "Business has not been this good in ages."
msgstr "이렇게 장사가 잘 된 건 오랜만이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139CA"
msgid "Good to see that everyone is committing their lives to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "모두가 위대한 뱀께 자신의 삶을 바치는 걸 보니 좋군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C9"
msgid "Hmmm... are we really going to allow Zealots back in the city?"
msgstr "흠... 정말로 광신도들을 다시 도시로 들이려고 하는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C8"
msgid "I look forward to seeing how Dazra grows when we end our isolation."
msgstr "고립을 끝내면 다즈라가 어떻게 성장할지 기대되는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C7"
msgid "Hopefully we will be able to rebuild more quickly with House Dul'khefs mandates."
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 명령으로 더 빨리 재건할 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C6"
msgid "I hope the Great Serpent hears everyone's prayers on their pilgrimages."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 순례길에 오른 모든 이들의 기도를 들어주셨으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed / Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C5"
msgid "How am I supposed to keep up with this? There is more to do now than ever."
msgstr "이걸 어떻게 다 따라가라는 거지? 지금 할 일이 그 어느 때보다 많은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed / Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C4"
msgid "I have to take care of my patients, and now I have to go on pilgrimages? When am I supposed to do all this?"
msgstr "환자들을 돌봐야 하는데, 이제 순례까지 가야 한다고? 이걸 다 언제 하라는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed / Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0139C3"
msgid "Maybe Razma can call in aid from the Settled Systems. Great Serpent knows we need it."
msgstr "어쩌면 라즈마가 개척 성계에 도움을 요청할 수 있을 거야. 위대한 뱀께선 우리가 도움이 필요하다는 걸 아실 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire. &&& Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city. &&& Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.|And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help.|What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then it seems the Great Serpent has brought you here for a reason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139C2"
msgid "I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience."
msgstr "저도 제 부모님이 잘 계신지 자주 뵈러 가봐서, 그런 사람들을 살피는 데는 나름 경험이 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139C1"
msgid "Then it seems the Great Serpent has brought you here for a reason."
msgstr "그렇다면 위대한 뱀께서 당신을 이곳에 보낸 이유가 있으신 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139C0"
msgid "I would like you to start with Reigen Ueda."
msgstr "먼저 레이겐 우에다 씨부터 확인해 주시기 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Then it seems the Great Serpent has brought you here for a reason.|I would like you to start with Reigen Ueda.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: I need two things. One, see if he's okay, and two, make sure he's taking his medicine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BF"
msgid "His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience."
msgstr "그분의 집은 여기서 멀지 않은 곳에 있습니다. 복종의 전당 근처죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Oh, hello. Have we met before?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is it? Then I apologize. I thought it was rather simple, but maybe I'm mistaken.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BE"
msgid "That's a difficult question to answer."
msgstr "참 대답하기 난감한 질문이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a difficult question to answer.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a difficult question to answer.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I've been trying to keep everything here sorted, based on a personal system. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 011141B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BD"
msgid "Is it? Then I apologize. I thought it was rather simple, but maybe I'm mistaken."
msgstr "그러느냐? 미안하구나. 그냥 간단한 질문이라 생각했는데, 내 실수였나 보구나."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: I'm afraid I did not get close at all. The ground surrounding the orphanage is collapsing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BC"
msgid "How close did you get to the phantom? Any details on who it might be?"
msgstr "유령을 얼마나 가까이서 봤습니까? 구체적으로 알려 줄 수 있는 세부사항이 또 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How close did you get to the phantom? Any details on who it might be?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BB"
msgid "I'm afraid I did not get close at all. The ground surrounding the orphanage is collapsing."
msgstr "자세히 보진 못했어요. 고아원 주변 땅이 무너지고 있었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139BA"
msgid "There may be other dangers and perhaps even phantoms nearby. But my concern is for anyone who may have been living in the building."
msgstr ""
"주변에 다른 위험 요소가 있을 수도 있고, 심하면 볼텍스 유령들이 나타날지도 몰라요. 그렇지만 혹시라도 그 건물에 누가 살고 있었는지, "
"그 사람들은 괜찮은지 걱정돼요."

#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Hm... that is not the behavior I'd expect given what we know about these things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010FCA90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139B9"
msgid "But I only caught a glimpse of it, from afar."
msgstr "아주 멀리서 얼핏 본 거지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you see the phantom?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139B8"
msgid "From my vantage point, it was standing near the window, looking out."
msgstr "제가 본 위치에서는, 그 유령이 창문 근처에 서서 밖을 보고 있는 것 같았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_Breanne_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0139B7"
msgid "Are you in shock? You seem to have lost the ability to speak."
msgstr "충격에 빠졌나요? 말할 능력을 잃은 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_Breanne_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0139B6"
msgid "Please, we should continue our dialogue. This phantom must be dealt with!"
msgstr "얼른 계속 얘기하자고요. 이 유령은 꼭 처리되야 해요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 011160A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_Breanne_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0139B5"
msgid "Are you all right? Great Serpent, please return this person's tongue!"
msgstr "괜찮으신가요? 위대한 뱀이시여! 이자의 혀를 되찾아 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / Pleading / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139B2"
msgid "Please tell me that you will accept."
msgstr "제발 부디 제 부탁을 들어 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure, I'll take the job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139B1"
msgid "Don't force me to beg on my knees where all can see."
msgstr "제가 사람들 앞에서 무릎 꿇고 빌지 않게 해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Thank you for stopping to talk to me. My name is Lijana Dul'kehf. |Normally I would ask how I can help you, but under the circumstances, I am the one who needs help.|I oversee the delivery of goods to those living outside the city.|Unfortunately, I lost one of my couriers to the recent catastrophe.|I've sought a replacement, but extra hands are in desperately short supply.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate your sympathy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139B0"
msgid "I'm genuinely sorry to hear that."
msgstr "정말 안타깝게 됐네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful, professional / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm genuinely sorry to hear that. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm genuinely sorry to hear that. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: I wouldn't normally seek help from someone I don't know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AF"
msgid "I appreciate your sympathy."
msgstr "위로해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rising anger / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a difficult time for everyone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a difficult time for everyone.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AE"
msgid "Do you think I don't know that? I was there the day it happened!"
msgstr "제가 그걸 모르는 줄 아세요? 참사가 벌어진 날 저도 거기 있었다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, snapping / Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a difficult time for everyone.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AD"
msgid "The last thing I need is to be patronized!"
msgstr "얕잡아 보지 마시죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a sigh. You lost your temper and now you feel bad. / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a difficult time for everyone.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AC"
msgid "No... I shouldn't say that. I'm sorry. I let my temper get the better of me."
msgstr "아... 이렇게 말하면 안 되는데. 죄송해요. 제가 너무 흥분했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Crestfallen, somber / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a difficult time for everyone.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AB"
msgid "If I fail, the reputation of House Dul'kehf will be tarnished."
msgstr "제가 실패하면, 둘케프 가문의 명성에 먹칠을 하게 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm genuinely sorry to hear that.  &&& LijanaValyan: I appreciate your sympathy. &&& LijanaValyan: I wouldn't normally seek help from someone I don't know.|However, I'm not above admitting my situation.|The truth is, this is about more than just a business transaction.|It is very important to me that someone makes these deliveries as soon as possible.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you think I don't know that? I was there the day it happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139AA"
msgid "It's a difficult time for everyone."
msgstr "지금은 모두에게 힘든 시기지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm genuinely sorry to hear that.  &&& LijanaValyan: I appreciate your sympathy. &&& LijanaValyan: I wouldn't normally seek help from someone I don't know.|However, I'm not above admitting my situation.|The truth is, this is about more than just a business transaction.|It is very important to me that someone makes these deliveries as soon as possible.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: With every rising and setting of the great star, yes. And often at midday as well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A9"
msgid "Have you tried praying to the Great Serpent for help?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 기도로 도움을 청한 적이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Increasingly desperate / Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Have you tried praying to the Great Serpent for help?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Have you tried praying to the Great Serpent for help?
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A8"
msgid "With every rising and setting of the great star, yes. And often at midday as well."
msgstr "네. 위대한 별이 뜨고 질 때마다 기도해요. 그리고 정오에도 자주 기도하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hopeful / Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Have you tried praying to the Great Serpent for help?
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A7"
msgid "Perhaps the Great Serpent has guided your path to me in answer to my prayers."
msgstr "아마 위대한 뱀께서 제 기도에 응답하셔서 당신이 제게 다다르도록 인도하신 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to LijanaDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaDulkehf: That's correct. Just make the deliveries and collect payment. There's no need to report back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01172B44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_VKaiZ02_Deliveries
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A6"
msgid "So I'm just delivering stuff and getting paid? No need to return after?"
msgstr "그래서 그냥 물건을 배송하고 대금만 받으면 되는 건가요? 다시 돌아와 보고할 필요는 없고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So I'm just delivering stuff and getting paid? No need to return after?
#. ALIAS: LijanaDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01172B43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_VKaiZ02_Deliveries
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0139A5"
msgid "That's correct. Just make the deliveries and collect payment. There's no need to report back."
msgstr "맞아요. 배송하고 대금을 받으시면 돼요. 다시 보고하러 돌아오실 필요는 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01172B43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_VKaiZ02_Deliveries
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0139A4"
msgid "The money is yours to keep. Saving our reputation is payment enough for me."
msgstr "대금은 그냥 가지세요. 평가가 떨어지지 않게 해주신다면야 그정도 돈은 충분히 드릴 수 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay. &&& ...  &&& companion: I think that we should help her. |Those supplies might be important, perhaps even vital. &&& LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them. &&& LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.|Don't force me to beg on my knees where all can see. 
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well spoken, and very true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A3"
msgid "It would be an honor to serve House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "둘케프 가문을 섬기는 것은 영광스러운 일이 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I believe you actually would beg, but I'll let you off the hook.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I believe you actually would beg, but I'll let you off the hook.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Here are the packages.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A2"
msgid "I am grateful, because I have swallowed as much pride as I can."
msgstr "고마워요. 이젠 더 꺾을 자존심도 없거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would be an honor to serve House Dul'kehf.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It would be an honor to serve House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A1"
msgid "Well spoken, and very true."
msgstr "옳은 말이고, 아주 맞는 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would be an honor to serve House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Here are the packages.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0139A0"
msgid "In so doing, you can take pride in knowing you've made a contribution to a noble lineage."
msgstr "그렇게 함으로써, 고귀한 혈통에 기여했다는 자부심을 가질 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost. &&& companion: I think that we should help her. |Those supplies might be important, perhaps even vital.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399F"
msgid "They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them."
msgstr "정말 중요하죠. 그리고 우리 고객들은 물건을 받기 위해 너무 오래 기다렸고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost. &&& companion: Seems to me like there's an opportunity here. |Cultivating a little good will with one of the noble houses could be useful.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399E"
msgid "That would be wise indeed."
msgstr "현명한 선택이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399D"
msgid "For your help, I'll be sure to speak well of you to the other members of the house."
msgstr "도와주신 것에 대한 보답으로, 제 가문의 다른 사람들에게 당신을 칭찬하는 말을 돌릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost. &&& companion: I'm a sucker for a hard luck case, so you can probably guess what I'm thinking.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399C"
msgid "Your sense of compassion is commendable, especially in such difficult times."
msgstr "이런 어려운 시기에 그런 동정심을 갖다니, 정말 훌륭하시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost. &&& companion: We have a chance to make a real difference here, not only for her, but for the people waiting on their deliveries.|Some of which might be very important.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399B"
msgid "They are important, as is the good name of House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "중요한 일이에요. 둘케프 가문의 명성도 지킬 수 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01399A"
msgid "I assure you, if this were a trivial matter, I would not ask for help."
msgstr "장담하는데, 이게 사소한 문제가 아니었다면 도움을 요청하지 않았을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay. &&& ...  &&& companion: I think that we should help her. |Those supplies might be important, perhaps even vital. &&& LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them. &&& LijanaValyan: Please tell me that you will accept.|Don't force me to beg on my knees where all can see. 
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am grateful, because I have swallowed as much pride as I can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013999"
msgid "I believe you actually would beg, but I'll let you off the hook."
msgstr "당신, 진짜 사람들 앞에서 무릎 꿇고 빌게 될 거 같긴 한데요... 뭐, 까짓것 그렇게 안 되게 해드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: Thought you'd catch me unaware, did you? Thought I'd be easy prey?|Unless you want a hole in the middle of your chest, you'd better turn around and start walking!
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmph. Lucky for you, I take pity on cowards.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013998"
msgid "I surrender! Please don't hurt me!"
msgstr "항복할게요! 제발 해치지 마세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you. &&& LazimValvan: Ah, so Lijana has at last found a new courier. Great Serpent be praised! &&& LazimValvan: This package of dried and salted groat's meat will sustain me in my contemplations.|So captivated am I by the Serpent's mysteries, I sometimes go days without remembering to eat|I know it's customary to pay upon receipt, but let me pose you this question.|If we carry out the will of the Great Serpent, is that not the greatest reward of all?|Compared to such divine favor, the worth of a few credits is a mere pittance.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, I see.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013997"
msgid "[Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 위대한 뱀께서는 제게 대금을 주라고 하시는군요. 분명 그러셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Derision, sneering / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I surrender! Please don't hurt me!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I surrender! Please don't hurt me!
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013996"
msgid "Hmph. Lucky for you, I take pity on cowards."
msgstr "흥. 운 좋게도, 난 겁쟁이에겐 관대한 편이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: Welcome, my friend.|Are not the beauty and majesty of nature truly splendid?|There is serenity here that cannot be found in the city.|It is the ideal place to contemplate the secrets and mysteries of the cosmos.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just now I was wondering why the Great Serpent chose the form that He did. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013995"
msgid "What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 무슨 비밀과 신비를 그렇게 곰곰이 생각하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If Lijana had told me I'd be delivering this package to a paranoid mechanic, I'd have said no.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If Lijana had told me I'd be delivering this package to a paranoid mechanic, I'd have said no.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013994"
msgid "Your predecessor had better manners, and he knew his place."
msgstr "자네 전임자는 더 예의가 발랐고, 자기 분수도 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If Lijana had told me I'd be delivering this package to a paranoid mechanic, I'd have said no.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013993"
msgid "I assume your presence here means that tragedy in this city claimed him as it did so many others."
msgstr "자네가 대신 온 걸 보니 도시에서 비극이 벌어져 다른 사람들을 덮친 것처럼 배달원도 덮쳤나 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, almost mumbling to yourself / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If Lijana had told me I'd be delivering this package to a paranoid mechanic, I'd have said no.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013992"
msgid "Poor lad..."
msgstr "불쌍한 녀석..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: After that greeting, maybe I won't give you this package after all.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: After that greeting, maybe I won't give you this package after all.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: I know the courier well, and you are not him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013991"
msgid "A package? Are you trying to make me believe that you're a courier of House Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "소포? 둘케프 가문의 배달원인 척 속이려는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy. &&& FihranNostal: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough. &&& FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.|We've got pirates and spacers circling like vultures looking for easy pickings.|And that's to say nothing of those fanatics.|Has the Great Serpent abandoned us? I don't know. Perhaps.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't believe you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013990"
msgid "I get it. Just calm down. I'm here to deliver a package."
msgstr "알았어요. 진정하시죠. 그냥 소포 배송하러 온 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I get it. Just calm down. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get it. Just calm down. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: I know the courier well, and you are not him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398F"
msgid "I don't believe you."
msgstr "못 믿겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398E"
msgid "Just now I was wondering why the Great Serpent chose the form that He did."
msgstr "대체 왜 위대한 뱀께서 그런 모습을 택하셨는지 생각하고 있었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398D"
msgid "Why not a bird or a groat or some other creature? Why not a woman or a man or a child?"
msgstr "왜 새나 그로트나 다른 생물의 모습이 아니었던 것일까? 왜 여자, 남자, 아이의 모습이 아니었던 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398C"
msgid "Of course, it's folly to think that I, a lowly mortal, could even begin to grasp the mind of the divine."
msgstr "물론 나 같은 미천한 필멸자 주제에 신의 본심을 이해하려고 시도하는 건 어리석은 생각이겠지만 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What secrets and mysteries are you contemplating, exactly?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: I can see the appeal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398B"
msgid "And yet, a curious mind cannot be stilled. It will seek answers."
msgstr "하지만 마음은 호기심이 많아 가만히 있으려 하지 않는군. 계속 답을 찾으려 하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier. &&& FihranNostal:  &&& FihranNostal: I know the courier well, and you are not him.|Tell me the name of the person who sent you, and prove that you are not a liar.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your predecessor had better manners, and he knew his place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01398A"
msgid "If Lijana had told me I'd be delivering this package to a paranoid mechanic, I'd have said no."
msgstr "리야나가 이 소포를 편집증에 걸린 정비사에게 배송해야 한다고 진작에 말해 줬다면, 단번에 거절했을 텐데 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy. &&& FihranNostal: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough. &&& FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.|We've got pirates and spacers circling like vultures looking for easy pickings.|And that's to say nothing of those fanatics.|Has the Great Serpent abandoned us? I don't know. Perhaps.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A package? Are you trying to make me believe that you're a courier of House Dul'kehf?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013989"
msgid "After that greeting, maybe I won't give you this package after all."
msgstr "인사랍시고 하는 말이 그건가요? 아무래도 소포는 배송 안 하는 게 낫겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: Welcome, my friend.|Are not the beauty and majesty of nature truly splendid?|There is serenity here that cannot be found in the city.|It is the ideal place to contemplate the secrets and mysteries of the cosmos.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Death and life are a part of the great cycle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013988"
msgid "Sure, nature's great until it tries to kill you."
msgstr "예, 그 자연 때문에 목숨을 잃기 전까진 대단하겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AlicjaDalca: Hello there! I don't know your face. Are you lost?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh! So Lijana finally found a replacement courier, then? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013987"
msgid "Not at all. I'm your friendly delivery person!"
msgstr "아뇨. 전 그냥 친절한 배달원일 뿐입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: I needed it many days ago, but that is not your fault.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013986"
msgid "Take your credits and leave me in peace."
msgstr "크레딧 받고 날 좀 내버려두게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013985"
msgid "Talking just makes me more irritable."
msgstr "떠들수록 더 짜증이 나는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013984"
msgid "And before you ask, yes, such a thing is possible."
msgstr "도로 묻기 전에 먼저 대답하지. 그래, 떠들수록 더 짜증 날 수도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, nature's great until it tries to kill you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure, nature's great until it tries to kill you.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013983"
msgid "Death and life are a part of the great cycle."
msgstr "죽음과 삶은 거대한 순환의 일부라 할 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, nature's great until it tries to kill you.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013982"
msgid "Every tree, every rock, every groat, even you and I all have a place in the Serpent's grand design."
msgstr "모든 나무, 모든 돌, 모든 그로트, 심지어 자네와 나까지 모두 뱀께서 행하시는 위대한 설계 속에 자리를 잡고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, nature's great until it tries to kill you.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013981"
msgid "Join me in a moment of meditation, and experience the connection that binds us all."
msgstr "잠시 나와 함께 명상하며 모두를 하나로 이어 주는 연결 고리를 경험하도록 하라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me. &&& FihranNostal: Fine, so you're telling the truth. &&& FihranNostal: I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days.|That, and the constant pain in my back makes me poor company, I know.|I fix machines because they don't try to start a conversation. I prefer the quiet.|But now at last, my medicine has arrived.|The Serpent knows I've gone too long without it.|No doubt He hears my loud swearing when I struggle to get out of my bed every morning.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hah! I wouldn't count on it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013980"
msgid "[Give package] Hopefully this will make you tolerable to be around."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 이거 받으시고 앞으로 좀 얘기가 통하는 사람이 되셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wistful and sad / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397F"
msgid "Yes, yes I was."
msgstr "네, 그랬죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397E"
msgid "After making a delivery, he often stayed for a bowl of stew and tell me the news of the city."
msgstr "배달을 마친 후, 그 배달원은 종종 스튜 한 그릇을 먹으러 머물렀고 도시 소식을 전해 주곤 했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397D"
msgid "He would always have a new joke that he'd share. He had a gift for humor and telling stories."
msgstr "그 배달원은 항상 새 농담을 들려주곤 했어요. 유머와 이야기 솜씨가 뛰어났죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Chuckling to yourself at a fond memory, but tinged with sadness / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397C"
msgid "Sometimes I would laugh so much that my sides would ache for hours."
msgstr "가끔은 몇 시간 동안 배가 아플 정도로 많이 웃었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emotional, nearly a whisper / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397B"
msgid "I will miss him."
msgstr "그 배달원이 그리울 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01397A"
msgid "Ah, I see."
msgstr "아, 알겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013979"
msgid "Far be it from me to deny the will of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻을 거스를 생각은 추호도 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Skeptical / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013978"
msgid "I wonder what else He has told you, and why He has chosen you to hear His divine voice."
msgstr "그분이 또 무슨 말씀을 하셨는지, 그리고 그분의 신성한 목소리를 들을 사람으로 왜 자네를 선택하셨는지 궁금하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] The Great Serpent wants you to pay me, I'm sure of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013977"
msgid "Questions for another day, perhaps. For now, here is your payment."
msgstr "그 질문은 다음 기회에 해야겠네. 지금은, 여기 자네 대금을 받게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can see the appeal. &&& LazimValvan: A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!|Let us share a brief meditation in celebration of this meeting. &&& LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.|Do you feel that? It is the presence of the Great Serpent, omnipotent and all-seeing. |Such divine communion purifies us and makes us strong.|You may think this a chance meeting, but I know the truth.|The Great Serpent has a plan for us all, my friend, and this encounter is a part of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A tantalizing question. For what purpose has the Great Serpent brought you to me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013976"
msgid "And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?"
msgstr "그럼 위대한 뱀께선 이번 만남을 통해 무슨 계획을 세우신 걸까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: Fine, so you're telling the truth.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013975"
msgid "I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days."
msgstr "무례하게 굴었다고 사과하진 않겠어. 이런 암울한 시기에, 신뢰는 쉽게 쌓을 수 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013974"
msgid "That, and the constant pain in my back makes me poor company, I know."
msgstr "그것도 그렇고, 허리 통증이 끊이질 않으니 사람들과 어울리기도 힘들고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013973"
msgid "I fix machines because they don't try to start a conversation. I prefer the quiet."
msgstr "기계를 고치는 게 편해. 기계는 대화를 걸지 않으니까. 조용한 게 좋거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013972"
msgid "But now at last, my medicine has arrived."
msgstr "그래도 드디어 약이 도착했군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013971"
msgid "The Serpent knows I've gone too long without it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서도 내가 너무 오랫동안 약 없이 지냈다는 걸 아셨던 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give package] Here, it sounds like you really need this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013970"
msgid "No doubt He hears my loud swearing when I struggle to get out of my bed every morning."
msgstr "매일 아침 침대에서 일어나려고 애쓸 때마다 욕설을 내지르는 걸 분명 들으셨을 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe he'll come back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he'll come back.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396F"
msgid "I suppose anything is possible if the Great Serpent wills it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻이라면 뭐든 가능하겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber, shaking your head / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe he'll come back.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396E"
msgid "And yet, so much time has passed already."
msgstr "하지만, 벌써 너무 많은 시간이 흘렀네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe he'll come back.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give package] I was tempted to keep this, but here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396D"
msgid "I think we must accept that the lost ones will never return."
msgstr "우리가 상실한 사람들은 절대 돌아오지 않는단 걸 받아들여야 할 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AlicjaDalca: Hello there! I don't know your face. Are you lost?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think we all have those kinds of days from time to time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396C"
msgid "There are days I feel lost, yes, but today I'm here with a package for you."
msgstr "길을 잃은 것 같은 나날이야 있긴 합니다만... 오늘은 그런 건 아니고 당신에게 소포를 전해 드리러 온 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I took a job to help House Dul'kehf. &&& AlicjaDalca: I can think of only one reason the Ministry of Commerce would send someone here.|You must be the new courier.|I know that Lijana has been desperate to find a replacement. &&& AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.|His name was Shameed. He was a radiant soul, full of life and joy and dreams. |All of it stolen away in the blink of an eye, to hear it told.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He deserves nothing less than that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396B"
msgid "I'm sure he's in a better place now."
msgstr "배달원은 분명 더 나은 곳에 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01396A"
msgid "A tantalizing question. For what purpose has the Great Serpent brought you to me?"
msgstr "흥미로운 질문이로군. 과연 위대한 뱀께서 자네를 내 앞으로 이끄신 목적은 무엇일까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013969"
msgid "Do you bring news from the city? Or do you perhaps come in search of wisdom?"
msgstr "도시 소식을 전하러 왔나? 아니면 지혜를 찾아 이곳에 온 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013968"
msgid "Is this meeting a turning point in my life, and you are the agent of that change?"
msgstr "이 만남이 내 인생의 전환점이고, 자네가 그 변화의 전도자로서 나타난 거라면?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And what is the Great Serpent's plan for this encounter?
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013967"
msgid "I have no doubt that a great revelation awaits me."
msgstr "분명히 위대한 계시가 날 기다리고 있을 거라 믿고 의심치 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure he's in a better place now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure he's in a better place now.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013966"
msgid "He deserves nothing less than that."
msgstr "그럴 만한 자격이 충분한 사람이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure he's in a better place now.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013965"
msgid "He was loyal, devoted and steadfast in his faith."
msgstr "그 배달원은 충성스럽고, 헌신적이고, 신앙심이 굳건했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A half-smile, trying to chin up / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure he's in a better place now.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give package] Get this away from me before that smell gets into my clothes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013964"
msgid "I know the Great Serpent judged him to be worthy, and that brings me some solace."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그 배달원을 가치 있게 여기셨다는 걸 알고 있어요. 그게 제겐 위안이 되는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] Hopefully this will make you tolerable to be around.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] Hopefully this will make you tolerable to be around.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013963"
msgid "Hah! I wouldn't count on it."
msgstr "하! 그럴 일은 없을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] Hopefully this will make you tolerable to be around.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: Take your credits and leave me in peace.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013962"
msgid "That miracle, I doubt even the Serpent Himself could perform"
msgstr "그런 기적은, 위대한 뱀께서도 행하실 수 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I took a job to help House Dul'kehf. &&& AlicjaDalca: I can think of only one reason the Ministry of Commerce would send someone here.|You must be the new courier.|I know that Lijana has been desperate to find a replacement. &&& AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.|His name was Shameed. He was a radiant soul, full of life and joy and dreams. |All of it stolen away in the blink of an eye, to hear it told.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose anything is possible if the Great Serpent wills it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013961"
msgid "Maybe he'll come back."
msgstr "배달원이 돌아올지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleasantly surprised / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not at all. I'm your friendly delivery person!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not at all. I'm your friendly delivery person!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013960"
msgid "Oh! So Lijana finally found a replacement courier, then?"
msgstr "오! 그럼 리야나가 드디어 후임 배달원을 찾았나 보군요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not at all. I'm your friendly delivery person!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395F"
msgid "That's good news. She sounded nearly desperate in her last message."
msgstr "좋은 소식이네요. 리야나가 보낸 마지막 메시지엔 거의 절박해진 것처럼 들렸거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Big smile, friendly / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not at all. I'm your friendly delivery person!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395E"
msgid "Well, friendly delivery person, I'll be your friendly package recipient!"
msgstr "좋아요. 친절한 배달원 친구, 제가 소포를 받는 친절한 수취인이 되어 드리죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] Get this away from me before that smell gets into my clothes.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] Get this away from me before that smell gets into my clothes.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395D"
msgid "It's a strong aroma, I know."
msgstr "냄새가 독하긴 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I took a job to help House Dul'kehf. &&& AlicjaDalca: I can think of only one reason the Ministry of Commerce would send someone here.|You must be the new courier.|I know that Lijana has been desperate to find a replacement. &&& AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.|His name was Shameed. He was a radiant soul, full of life and joy and dreams. |All of it stolen away in the blink of an eye, to hear it told.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, yes I was. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395C"
msgid "I can tell that you were fond of him."
msgstr "배달원을 좋아했나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I took a job to help House Dul'kehf. &&& AlicjaDalca: I can think of only one reason the Ministry of Commerce would send someone here.|You must be the new courier.|I know that Lijana has been desperate to find a replacement. &&& AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.|His name was Shameed. He was a radiant soul, full of life and joy and dreams. |All of it stolen away in the blink of an eye, to hear it told.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. I have never questioned it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395B"
msgid "The Great Serpent has a plan, though we may not know it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께는 계획이 있으신 거겠죠. 우리는 감히 짐작도 못하겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has a plan, though we may not know it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan, though we may not know it.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01395A"
msgid "Of course. I have never questioned it."
msgstr "물론이죠. 한 번도 의심한 적 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emotional, lowered voice, kind of rhetorical / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has a plan, though we may not know it.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013959"
msgid "Even so, the pain of loss is still there, like a cold blade through my heart."
msgstr "그렇지만, 상실의 고통은 여전히 남아 있네요. 마치 차가운 칼날이 심장을 관통한 것처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resigned / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has a plan, though we may not know it.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013958"
msgid "That pain will fade in time."
msgstr "고통은, 시간이 지나면 사라지겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he'll come back. &&& AlicjaDalca: I suppose anything is possible if the Great Serpent wills it.|And yet, so much time has passed already. |I think we must accept that the lost ones will never return.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hah! Given what's in there, I don't blame you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013957"
msgid "[Give package] I was tempted to keep this, but here."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 이걸 그냥 가져가 버릴까 생각했지만, 자 받아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A laugh and a friendly remark / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] I was tempted to keep this, but here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] I was tempted to keep this, but here.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013956"
msgid "Hah! Given what's in there, I don't blame you."
msgstr "하! 안에 든 것의 가치를 생각하면, 뭐, 당신을 나무라진 않겠어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_SpaceshipThrustersDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipThrustersDown
msgctxt "013955"
msgid "A lucky shot on our thrusters!"
msgstr "운 좋게 우리 추력기에 맞았군!"

