msgstr " "

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are days I feel lost, yes, but today I'm here with a package for you.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013952"
msgid "That's a relief. I've been waiting a long time for this package."
msgstr "다행이에요. 소포가 언제 오나 오랫동안 기다렸거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AlicjaDalca: Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013951"
msgid "I spent a small fortune on these spices."
msgstr "이 향신료를 구하느라 꽤 돈을 많이 썼죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013950"
msgid "They're some of the rarest we have, as well as the most pungent."
msgstr "굉장히 희귀한 향신료죠. 그만큼 굉장히 자극적이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01394F"
msgid "Cooking is my great joy, and the proper use of seasonings is the most important part."
msgstr "요리는 제 인생의 낙이거든요. 요리할 때는 양념을 적절히 사용하는 게 가장 중요하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll be on my way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01394E"
msgid "Thank you for this!"
msgstr "배송해 줘서 고마워요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, enthusiastic / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Enjoy your cooking!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Enjoy your cooking!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01394D"
msgid "I will! Now here is your payment. Travel safely, courier!"
msgstr "그럴게요! 자, 여기 대금이에요. 안녕히 가세요. 배달원님!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calling out to a passerby. You're urgently in need of help. / to Player Default
