msgid "Excuse me, Vindicator. Can I have a word?"
msgstr "실례합니다. 옹호자. 잠깐 얘기 좀 할 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Frustrated, sad / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm genuinely sorry to hear that. 
