#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013947"
msgid "I've sought a replacement, but extra hands are in desperately short supply."
msgstr "후임을 찾으려 했지만, 일손이 턱없이 부족해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful. &&& AlicjaDalca: Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then. &&& AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.|They're some of the rarest we have, as well as the most pungent.|Cooking is my great joy, and the proper use of seasonings is the most important part.|Thank you for this!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will! Now here is your payment. Travel safely, courier!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013946"
msgid "Enjoy your cooking!"
msgstr "요리 맛있게 해 드세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013945"
msgid "However, I'm not above admitting my situation."
msgstr "하지만, 지금은 체면 차릴 여유가 없네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01172B41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_LijanaDulkehf_TL_VKaiZ02_HowMany
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013944"
msgid "With that being said, it is a dangerous time to travel outside the city, so be vigilant."
msgstr "하지만, 요즘 도시 밖은 위험하니, 여행할 때 조심하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay. &&& LijanaValyan: The delay has been too long already.|If the situation is not resolved soon, the people will begin to lose faith in us.|I cannot allow that. It is my duty to uphold our high standards. &&& LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013943"
msgid "I think that we should help her."
msgstr "리야나를 도와줘야 한다고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013942"
msgid "Those supplies might be important, perhaps even vital."
msgstr "저 물자들이 중요할지도 몰라. 위급한 걸지도 모르고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay. &&& LijanaValyan: The delay has been too long already.|If the situation is not resolved soon, the people will begin to lose faith in us.|I cannot allow that. It is my duty to uphold our high standards. &&& LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013941"
msgid "I'm a sucker for a hard luck case, so you can probably guess what I'm thinking."
msgstr "난 불운한 사람에게 약하니까, 내가 무슨 생각하는지 짐작할 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Under the circumstances, I'm sure your customers understand the delay. &&& LijanaValyan: The delay has been too long already.|If the situation is not resolved soon, the people will begin to lose faith in us.|I cannot allow that. It is my duty to uphold our high standards. &&& LijanaValyan: Time is wasting, so I'll get to the point. I'd like you to be my new courier.|Our deliveries are paid upon arrival. You can keep the payments for yourself.|The Ministry of Commerce has a sterling reputation and it is my duty to uphold it, no matter the cost.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013940"
msgid "We have a chance to make a real difference here, not only for her, but for the people waiting on their deliveries."
msgstr "우리에겐 여기서 진정한 변화를 만들 기회가 있어. 리야나뿐만 아니라, 배송을 기다리는 사람들을 위해서도 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: They are indeed, and our customers have been waiting far too long to receive them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393F"
msgid "Some of which might be very important."
msgstr "그중 일부는 매우 중요할 수도 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes you think that?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I took a job to help House Dul'kehf.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393E"
msgid "A groat farm isn't exactly the kind of place people seek out for a leisurely visit."
msgstr "그로트 목장은 사람들이 한가롭게 방문하고 싶어 할 만한 곳은 아니잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can see the appeal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393D"
msgid "Let us share a brief meditation in celebration of this meeting."
msgstr "이 만남을 축하하며 잠시 명상을 나누도록 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: Ah, so Lijana has at last found a new courier. Great Serpent be praised!
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393C"
msgid "This package of dried and salted groat's meat will sustain me in my contemplations."
msgstr "이 소포 안에 든 그로트 고기 육포는 묵상하는 데 도움이 될 테지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit sheepish, an embarrassing admission / Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393B"
msgid "So captivated am I by the Serpent's mysteries, I sometimes go days without remembering to eat"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 신비에 너무 빠진 나머지, 가끔은 며칠 동안 먹는 것도 잊어버리니 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Semi rhetorical / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01393A"
msgid "Has the Great Serpent abandoned us? I don't know. Perhaps."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 버리신 걸까? 모르겠군. 그럴지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's so dangerous, then why are you out here alone?
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013939"
msgid "Machines and structures don't waste my time with stupid questions."
msgstr "기계나 건물은 쓸데없는 질문을 하지도 않고 시간 낭비하게 만들지도 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: lee-JAHN-ah / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent had nothing to do with it. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: This package of dried and salted groat's meat will sustain me in my contemplations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013938"
msgid "As for the delivery, it's good to know that Lijana has found a replacement courier."
msgstr "한편 이번 배달을 보니, 리야나가 후임 배달원을 찾았다니 다행이로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_FihranHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013937"
msgid "Go on now, get out of here."
msgstr "자, 이제 얼른 가 버려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_FihranHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
