msgid "I'm busy!"
msgstr "난 지금 바빠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_FihranHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013935"
msgid "I have work to do."
msgstr "할 일이 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Looks out across a valley, feeling inspired by nature
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueWayshrines
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimHellosPreStage500
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013934"
msgid "Quite a view."
msgstr "경치 한번 좋군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Looks out across a valley, feeling inspired by nature
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueWayshrines
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimHellosPreStage500
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013933"
msgid "From such a vantage point, You can almost see the Great Serpent's grand design."
msgstr "이런 높은 곳에서 내려다 보면, 위대한 뱀의 거대한 설계를 볼 수 있을 것만 같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Looking out across a valley, feeling inspired by nature
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueWayshrines
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimHellosPreStage500
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013932"
msgid "What better place to contemplate the nature of the Great Serpent and His works?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀과 그분이 행한 업적의 본질을 생각하기에 이보다 더 좋은 장소가 어디 있겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rhetorical
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueWayshrines
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimHellosPostStage500
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013931"
msgid "What fate does the Great Serpent have in store for us next, I wonder?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리에게 또 어떤 운명을 안배해 두셨을지 궁금하군?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueWayshrines
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimHellosPostStage500
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013930"
msgid "May wisdom await you at journey's end."
msgstr "이 여정의 끝에서 지혜가 자네를 기다리길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01392F"
msgid "May the Great Serpent watch over you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 굽어살펴주시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
