msgid "It has been illuminating."
msgstr "많은 걸 깨닫게 해 줬군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E32
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimGoodbyes
