#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013929"
msgid "Go in peace."
msgstr "평안히 가시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritable. The player has stopped talking in mid-conversation. / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Irritated
