msgid "Well?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious. The player has stopped talking in mid-conversation. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E31
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013925"
msgid "Searching for the right words?"
msgstr "적절한 단어를 찾고 있는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious. The player has stopped talking in mid-conversation. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E31
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013924"
msgid "Serpent got your tongue?"
msgstr "말문이 막혔나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curious. The player has stopped talking in mid-conversation. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 01114E31
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ02_LazimWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "013923"
msgid "There is no hurry. We have plenty of time."
msgstr "서두를 필요 없어. 시간은 많으니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013922"
msgid "Insubordination will not be tolerated."
msgstr "불복종은 용납할 수 없다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013921"
msgid "We will have to be vigilant if we are to open Dazra to outsiders."
msgstr "다즈라를 이방인에게 개방하려면 우리 모두 경계해야 할 것이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013920"
msgid "House Ma'leen's return to Dazra would be a welcome one."
msgstr "마린 가문이 다즈라로 돌아온다면 환영할 일이지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391F"
msgid "If House Ma'leen returns to the city, we will be stronger than ever."
msgstr "마린 가문이 도시로 돌아온다면, 우리는 그 어느 때보다 강해질 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391E"
msgid "Razma is an interesting choice for Speaker."
msgstr "라즈마가 대변자가 된 건 흥미로운 선택이군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391D"
msgid "Are we truly ready to end our isolation?"
msgstr "우리가 정말 고립을 끝낼 준비가 된 걸까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391C"
msgid "Zealots walking the streets? I pray it never comes to that."
msgstr "광신도들이 거리를 활보한다고? 그런 일은 없기를 바란다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391B"
msgid "What will the Settled Systems think of our return?"
msgstr "개척 성계 사람들은 우리의 귀환을 어떻게 생각할까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01391A"
msgid "For better or ill, Dazra will forever change with House Ka'dic in charge."
msgstr "좋든 싫든, 카딕 가문이 권력을 잡으면 다즈라는 영원히 변할 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013919"
msgid "Revealing the position of our homeworld would be risky. Are we prepared?"
msgstr "우리 모성의 위치를 드러내는 건 위험할 수 있어. 준비는 되었나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013918"
msgid "Ending our isolation could lead to a stronger House Va'ruun."
msgstr "고립을 끝내는 것이 바룬 가문을 더 강하게 만들 수도 있겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQKadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013917"
msgid "House Ka'dic's rule may prove controversial, but the Great Serpent has favored them."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 통치는 논란이 될 수도 있겠지만, 위대한 뱀께서 그들을 선택하셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013916"
msgid "Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart."
msgstr "네, 물론입니다. 용서하십시오. 당신이 우리의 신념을 마음에 새기셨을 줄은 몰랐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013915"
msgid "Perhaps we should start this conversation again."
msgstr "이 대화를 다시 시작하는 것이 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me. &&& Nalada: That's an understatement. &&& Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.|But not just any off-worlder, one that's able to speak with Anasko Va'ruun himself.|Which in the eyes of the citizens of Dazra, moves you up from the "suspiciously curious" category to the "dangerously unique" one.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013914"
msgid "I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "저는 위험한 인물이 아닙니다. 제가 이 행성에 온 것은 분명 위대한 뱀의 뜻입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start. &&& Nalada: Oh, yes. Of course. &&& Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.|He never came back that evening. I've been worried sick.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You know, now that you mention it, someone in the city said that they felt tremors near that area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013913"
msgid "It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery."
msgstr "대재난으로 인해 제련소에 일종의 지질학적 불안정성이 생겼을 가능성이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Just, please be careful. That old refinery has been abandoned for years, and there's no telling what might be choosing to call the facility its home.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013912"
msgid "You know, now that you mention it, someone in the city said that they felt tremors near that area."
msgstr "그러고 보니, 도시의 누군가가 그 지역 근처에서 진동을 느꼈다고 말한 것이 기억나는군요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: The cataclysm that claimed most of Dazra has severely impaired our ability to survive on Va'ruun'kai.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 0111419C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_04TopLevelWhyGo
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013911"
msgid "Why did Quasim head out to the refinery in the first place?"
msgstr "애초에 콰심은 왜 제련소로 간 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013910"
msgid "Yes, indeed. And after what our city has been through, there are countless others that feel the same way."
msgstr "네, 맞습니다. 우리 도시가 겪은 일을 생각하면, 같은 심정을 가진 이들이 셀 수 없이 많을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: snapping out of it / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: If you want to take a look at what my shop has to offer... well, you let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01390F"
msgid "*Sigh* I'm sorry, you don't need to waste time hearing about my problems, you've clearly come by for a specific reason."
msgstr "*한숨* 죄송합니다. 제 문제로 시간을 허비하실 필요는 없는데, 분명히 특정한 이유로 오신 것이겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Nalada: Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart.|Perhaps we should start this conversation again. &&& Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.|Forgive me for not starting our conversation that way. I've been... a bit distracted of late.|My brother, Quasim has been missing for days. I'm beginning to worry that something terrible has happened to him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, indeed. And after what our city has been through, there are countless others that feel the same way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 011141AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01390E"
msgid "I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening."
msgstr "안타깝군요. 가족을 잃는다는 건 믿을 수 없을 만큼 끔찍한 일일 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why did Quasim head out to the refinery in the first place?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 0111419B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_04TopLevelWhyGo
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01390D"
msgid "The cataclysm that claimed most of Dazra has severely impaired our ability to survive on Va'ruun'kai."
msgstr "다즈라의 대부분을 앗아간 대재난은 바룬카이에서 우리가 생존할 능력을 심각하게 손상시켰습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 0111419B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_04TopLevelWhyGo
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01390C"
msgid "Quasim is simply trying to use his engineering background to help everywhere that he can. In this case, he's trying to assess if the refinery can be reopened."
msgstr "콰심은 그저 자신의 공학 지식을 활용해 할 수 있는 모든 곳을 도우려는 것뿐입니다. 이번 경우에는 제련소를 다시 열 수 있는지 가늠해 보려는 것이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 0111419B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_04TopLevelWhyGo
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01390B"
msgid "He strongly believes that loss of the city's infrastructure means we need to rely on everything we can in order to get back on our feet."
msgstr "콰심은 도시의 기반 시설이 손실되었기 때문에, 우리가 다시 일어서려면 가능한 모든 것에 의존해야 한다고 굳게 믿고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sih-DAH-ree / Neutral / to Actor02
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Three relics, captain. But one of the artifact's a rifle; it's busted. They took it to the armory for inspection.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_A1
#. TOPIC: 011141C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateSceneA1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013909"
msgid "What did Sidari's crew bring back this time?"
msgstr "시다리 선원들이 이번엔 뭘 가져왔지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: What did Sidari's crew bring back this time?
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor01: Could it be salvageable or is it beyond repair?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_A1
#. TOPIC: 011141C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateSceneA1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013908"
msgid "Three relics, captain. But one of the artifact's a rifle; it's busted. They took it to the armory for inspection."
msgstr "유물 세 개를 가져왔습니다, 대장. 그런데 유물 중 하나가 소총인데, 고장 났습니다. 검사를 위해 무기고로 가져갔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: What did Sidari's crew bring back this time? &&& Actor02: Three relics, captain. But one of the artifact's a rifle; it's busted. They took it to the armory for inspection.
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Too soon to tell. But even if it won't fire, weird Va'ruun stuff would still be worth something to the right buyer
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_A1
#. TOPIC: 011141C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateSceneA1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013907"
msgid "Could it be salvageable or is it beyond repair?"
msgstr "수리할 수 있나, 아니면 수리가 불가능한가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor02: Three relics, captain. But one of the artifact's a rifle; it's busted. They took it to the armory for inspection. &&& Actor01: Could it be salvageable or is it beyond repair?
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_A1
#. TOPIC: 011141C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateSceneA1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013906"
msgid "Too soon to tell. But even if it won't fire, weird Va'ruun stuff would still be worth something to the right buyer"
msgstr "아직은 알 수 없습니다. 하지만 발사되지 않더라도, 이상한 바룬 물건은 적절한 구매자에게는 여전히 가치가 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: Boss kept that armor for himself, huh? &&& Actor02: Yeah, typical. He always hoards the best loot.
