#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Va'ruun crap is always temperamental
