msgid "Heard they stashed the boost pack from the Va'ruun tomb in maintenance."
msgstr "바룬 무덤에서 가져온 부스터 팩을 정비실에 숨겨뒀다는 소문이 있던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor02: Va'ruun crap is always temperamental &&& Actor01: Disappointed you can't take it for a test flight?
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor01: Fifty credits somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_03
#. TOPIC: 01114ECE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138FD"
msgid "I'm not that crazy. Someone else can take the risk."
msgstr "난 그렇게 무모하지 않아. 다른 사람 시켜."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor02: I'm not that crazy. Someone else can take the risk. &&& Actor01: Fifty credits somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over.
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_03
#. TOPIC: 01114ECC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138FC"
msgid "Haha, you're on!"
msgstr "하하, 좋아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: Disappointed you can't take it for a test flight? &&& Actor02: I'm not that crazy. Someone else can take the risk.
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Haha, you're on!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_03
#. TOPIC: 01114ECD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138FB"
msgid "Fifty credits somebody blows themselves up with it before the week is over."
msgstr "이번 주가 가기 전에 누군가 그걸로 자폭할 거라는 데 50크레딧을 걸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: Heard they stashed the boost pack from the Va'ruun tomb in maintenance.
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor01: Disappointed you can't take it for a test flight?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdroppingScene_03
#. TOPIC: 01114ED0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138FA"
msgid "Va'ruun crap is always temperamental"
msgstr "바룬 고철은 항상 변덕스럽지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: Heard they stashed the boost pack from the Va'ruun tomb in maintenance. &&& Actor02: Va'ruun crap is always temperamental
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: SpacerFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: I'm not that crazy. Someone else can take the risk.
