#. SCENE: SFBGS001LC48_EavesdropTemplateScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138F9"
msgid "Disappointed you can't take it for a test flight?"
msgstr "시험 비행을 못 해서 실망했나?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01113107
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138F1"
msgid "I've helped House Dul'kehf once already. Surely that counts for something."
msgstr "이미 한번 둘케프 가문을 도와줬잖아요. 이 정도면 뭔가 인정해 줘야 하는 거 아닌가요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01113107
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138F0"
msgid "I've saved all of Dazra. Surely that grants me access to one workstation."
msgstr "저는 다즈라 전역을 구했어요. 그 정도면 작업용 컴퓨터 하나 정도는 접속할 수 있게 해줘도 되는 거 아닌가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01113106
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138EF"
msgid "Yes, while I am loathe to make an exception, one might be made in such a case."
msgstr "네, 예외를 만드는 건 질색이지만, 그런 경우는 예외로 둘 수도 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01113106
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138EE"
msgid "Despite your status and accolades, House Dul'kehf will always maintain that rules are still rules."
msgstr "당신이 처한 상황과 받은 포상을 고려해도, 둘케프 가문은 규칙은 항상 지켜야 하는 규칙이라는 원칙을 고수할 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: So, now that we're alone. Tell me, what have you uncovered?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01113105
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138ED"
msgid "And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do."
msgstr "여기서 대화를 나누는 것 자체가 매우 위험하지만, 시간이 촉박하니 어쩔 수 없겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cutting off Sirak. Pained frustration. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Basira: I'll become one of them. You have to get away from me. &&& Sirak: No, I will not leave you --
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111250A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138EC"
msgid "It's pointless!"
msgstr "소용없다고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calm-like, sad acceptance. Suddenly cut off by a massive headache. / Depressed
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Basira: No, no! It's happening! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0111250A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138EB"
msgid "We share this fate. This is our end. The Great --"
msgstr "이게 우리 운명이야. 이렇게 끝이라고. 위대한..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried, on the brink of insanity and turning into a hostile vortex phantom. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Basira: I'm trying, Sirak! But it's getting worse... I can feel my mind slipping, fragmenting.
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: No, I will not leave you --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 01112509
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138EA"
msgid "I'll become one of them. You have to get away from me."
msgstr "나도 곧 그렇게 될 거야. 나한테서 멀리 떨어져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Desperate. Gets cut off. / Pleading / to Basira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: Basira, hold on. You are strong. Concentrate! &&& Basira: I'm trying, Sirak! But it's getting worse... I can feel my mind slipping, fragmenting. &&& Basira: I'll become one of them. You have to get away from me.
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Basira: It's pointless! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 01112508
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138E9"
msgid "No, I will not leave you --"
msgstr "싫어. 널 두고 떠나진..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried, on the brink of insanity and turning into a hostile vortex phantom. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: Basira, hold on. You are strong. Concentrate!
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Basira: I'll become one of them. You have to get away from me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138E8"
msgid "I'm trying, Sirak! But it's getting worse... I can feel my mind slipping, fragmenting."
msgstr "노력 중이야, 시락! 그런데 계속 나빠져만 가... 정신이 산산이 조각나고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: TheOracleShip: Mem-- *static* crew have been *static* --promised. 
#. ALIAS: TheOracleShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: The Gr-- *static* protects.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0113038D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0100_Sirak_EmergencyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138E7"
msgid "Do not *static*. Repeat. *static* not board."
msgstr "승선하지 *잡음* 반복합니다. *잡음* 마십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: TheOracleShip: Do not *static*. Repeat. *static* not board.
#. ALIAS: TheOracleShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: TheOracleShip: This is Sirak *static* on the st-- *static* Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0113038C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0100_Sirak_EmergencyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138E6"
msgid "The Gr-- *static* protects."
msgstr "위대한 *잡음* 보호하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0138E5"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138E4"
msgid "I have much to do to prepare for my pilgrimage."
msgstr "순례를 준비할 게 많아서요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138E3"
msgid "Now that House Veth'aal is in charge, nothing can stop us."
msgstr "이제 베타알 가문이 지휘하니, 아무도 우릴 막을 수 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138E2"
msgid "The Great Serpent will return our city to glory."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 도시를 영광스럽게 되돌려 주실 것이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138E1"
msgid "I have been trying to know the words of Jinan Va'ruun by heart, but there is just so much..."
msgstr "지난 바룬의 말씀을 외우려고 노력 중인데, 너무 많아서..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138E0"
msgid "One day, songs will be sung of Dazra's triumphant return."
msgstr "언젠가 다즈라의 의기양양한 귀환에 대한 노래가 불릴 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DF"
msgid "The Settled Systems may think us weak, but one day they will fear our newfound strength."
msgstr "개척 성계는 우릴 약하다고 생각할지 모르지만, 언젠가 그들은 우리의 새로운 힘을 두려워하게 될 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DE"
msgid "May the Great Serpent guide you on your path."
msgstr "뱀께서 그대의 길을 인도하시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DD"
msgid "Remember Jinan's words."
msgstr "지난의 말씀을 기억하라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DC"
msgid "The Great Serpent is always watching. Remember that."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 항상 지켜보고 계십니다. 명심하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DB"
msgid "I pray that our new leadership does not steer us into conflict..."
msgstr "새 지도부가 우리를 갈등으로 몰아넣지 않기를 기도합니다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138DA"
msgid "Jinan would be proud to see how we have persevered."
msgstr "우리가 어떻게 인내해 왔는지 보시면 지난께서 자랑스러워하실 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D9"
msgid "His eyes are watching."
msgstr "그분의 눈이 지켜보고 계신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not said in a foreboding or threatening way - they are remarking on the new leadership and warning the player
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D8"
msgid "Be sure to watch what you say."
msgstr "말조심하는 게 좋을 거다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D7"
msgid "Now we can rebuild around the unfailing word of Jinan Va'ruun. As it should be."
msgstr "이제 우리는 지난 바룬의 틀림없는 말씀을 중심으로 재건할 수 있다. 마땅히 그래야 하듯이."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D6"
msgid "My brother was just told that he has been selected for military duty. Only a matter of time for me, I think."
msgstr "내 동생이 방금 군 복무에 선택되었다는 소식을 들었어. 나도 시간문제일 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D5"
msgid "These forced pilgrimages... where am I supposed to find the time?"
msgstr "이 강제 순례... 도대체 시간이 어디서 나라는 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06VethalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D4"
msgid "I hardly have time to think, what with these pilgrimages and prayers."
msgstr "이 순례와 기도 때문에 생각할 시간도 거의 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D3"
msgid "Guess I better start making myself useful."
msgstr "슬슬 내가 쓸모 있는 인간이 되어야 할 텐데."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D2"
msgid "I wonder what our trade routes will look like, now that Hasmak is speaker."
msgstr "해즈막 님이 대변자가 되셨으니, 우리 교역로가 어떻게 될지 궁금하군."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D1"
msgid "Not much time for anything but work, nowadays."
msgstr "요즘은 일 말고는 딴짓할 시간이 별로 없네."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138D0"
msgid "*Sigh* Cannot remember the last time I had a day off..."
msgstr "*한숨* 마지막으로 쉰 날이 언제인지 기억도 안 나네..."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CF"
msgid "Too much work is a good problem to have, right?"
msgstr "일거리가 너무 많은 건 문젯거리긴 해도 좋은 거겠지? 그렇지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CE"
msgid "My partner and I were put on separate job sites, so we haven't seen much of each other lately."
msgstr "반려자와 서로 다른 작업장에 배정돼서, 최근에 서로 거의 보지 못했어."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CD"
msgid "Just need to get through another day."
msgstr "그저 또 하루를 버텨야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CC"
msgid "The work never ends."
msgstr "일이 끝이 없군."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CB"
msgid "I have heard that we may try to establish trade with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "개척 성계와 무역을 시작할 수도 있다는 소식을 들었어."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138CA"
msgid "I've already been put on another job."
msgstr "이미 다른 일에 배정됐어."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C9"
msgid "Business has definitely improved since House Dul'khef rose to leadership."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 영도력을 발휘하게 된 이후로 사업이 확실히 나아졌네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C8"
msgid "I pray that House Kad'ic does not open our gates to outsiders."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 이방인들에게 문을 열지 않기를 기도합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C7"
msgid "Perhaps with House Ka'dic in charge, House Ma'leen will make its return."
msgstr "어쩌면 카딕 가문이 권력을 잡으면, 마린 가문이 돌아올지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C6"
msgid "To question House Ka'dic's policies is to question the Great Serpent."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 정책에 의문을 제기하는 것은 위대한 뱀께 의문을 제기하는 것과 같다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C5"
msgid "Is zealotry to be welcomed in Dazra?"
msgstr "광신을 다즈라에서 환영해야 하는가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C4"
msgid "What will Dazra look like a hundred years from now, if we open our gates to outsiders?"
msgstr "우리가 이방인들에게 문을 연다면, 100년 후 다즈라는 어떤 모습일까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C3"
msgid "House Va'ruun will be a force to be reckoned with if House Ma'leen returns."
msgstr "마린 가문이 돌아온다면 바룬 가문은 만만찮은 세력이 될 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C2"
msgid "I would never question House Ka'dic, but I worry about softening our isolation policy."
msgstr "절대 카딕 가문에 의문을 제기하진 않겠지만, 고립 정책을 완화하는 건 걱정스러워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C1"
msgid "Are we truly prepared to open our gates to everyone?"
msgstr "우리가 정말로 모두에게 문을 열 준비가 된 걸까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138C0"
msgid "I fear what may happen if we welcome the Zealots back to Dazra."
msgstr "광신도들을 다시 다즈라로 맞이하면 무슨 일이 생길지 두려워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BF"
msgid "Razma is an interesting choice for Speaker. She could change Dazra forever."
msgstr "라즈마는 대변자로 흥미로운 선택이야. 라즈마는 다즈라를 영원히 바꿀 수도 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BE"
msgid "Dazra may never be the same with House Ka'dic in charge."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 통치하면 다즈라는 예전과 같지 않을지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BD"
msgid "Softening the outsider policy could revitalize the city."
msgstr "이방인 정책을 완화하면 도시가 활기를 되찾을 수 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BC"
msgid "Perhaps now we will be able to form a close relationship with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "어쩌면 이제 우리는 개척 성계와 긴밀한 관계를 맺을 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BB"
msgid "The Great Serpent must want us to curtail our isolation, since He made House Ka'dic take charge."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께선 우리가 고립을 줄이기를 바라시는 게 분명해. 그분이 카딕 가문을 권좌에 앉히셨으니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138BA"
msgid "It may be time for Dazra to change."
msgstr "이제 다즈라가 변해야 할 때일지도 몰라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generics_PostMQ06KadicHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B9"
msgid "The thought of Zealots openly walking the streets troubles me..."
msgstr "광신도들이 거리를 활보한다는 생각은 날 불편하게 해..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B8"
msgid "There is always another job that needs doing."
msgstr "항상 또 해야 할 일이 있죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B7"
msgid "With House Dul'khef leading us, our economy should recover rapidly."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 이끌면, 경제가 빠르게 회복될 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B6"
msgid "Hard, honest labor is good for folks. Gives us purpose."
msgstr "땀 흘려 정직하게 일하는 게 좋은 거예요. 우리에게 살 목적을 만들어 주니까요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B5"
msgid "We all need to start pulling our own weight."
msgstr "우리 모두 이제 제 몫을 해내야 해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B4"
msgid "If I hear one more layabout grumbling on how hard work has been..."
msgstr "힘들다고 투덜거리는 게으름뱅이 같은 소리를 한 번만 더 들으면..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B3"
msgid "Keeping busy, I hope."
msgstr "일 때문에 바쁘게 지내기라도 했으면 좋겠네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B2"
msgid "You will not ever hear me complain about more work."
msgstr "일이 많아도 불평하지 않을 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B1"
msgid "Put in the work, and the Great Serpent will notice."
msgstr "열심히 일하면, 위대한 뱀께서 알아주시겠죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138B0"
msgid "Hasmak expects everyone in Dazra to work hard. That is something I can respect."
msgstr "해즈막은 다즈라 신민들이 모두 열심히 일하기를 바라더군요. 저도 열심히 일하는 게 중요하다 생각해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AF"
msgid "The Great Serpent will reward us for a job well done."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께선 우리가 일을 잘 해내면 보상을 내려 주실 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorkers_PostMQ06DulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AE"
msgid "Prayer and labor will bring out the best in us all."
msgstr "기도하고 땀 흘리며 일하다 보면, 우리 안의 가장 좋은 모습이 드러날 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AD"
msgid "It is good to see business improving so much."
msgstr "장사가 잘 되는 걸 보니 좋군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AC"
msgid "Our vendors certainly seem happy since Hasmak became Speaker."
msgstr "해즈막이 대변자가 된 후로 상인들이 확실히 행복해하는 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AB"
msgid "The long hours of labor seems to be taking a toll on some of the citizens. Hmmph, they should  find peace in their work."
msgstr "장시간 노동이 시민들에게 피해를 주는 것 같군. 흠, 일에서 안식을 찾아야 할 텐데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138AA"
msgid "The Great Serpent blessed us all with jobs that need doing. We should not complain."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두에게 해야 할 일을 주셨다. 불평해서는 안 돼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A9"
msgid "The structure imposed by House Dul'khef will allow our city to heal more quickly."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 강제하는 구조 덕분에 우리 도시가 더 빨리 치유될 수 있을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A8"
msgid "House Dul'khef was a surprising choice to take power."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡은 건 의외였어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A7"
msgid "Be sure to keep busy like everyone else. Everyone needs to work, for the good of the city."
msgstr "다른 사람들처럼 계속 바쁘게 지내도록 해. 도시를 위해 모두 일해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A6"
msgid "House Dul'khef knows commerce better than any of the other Houses, but how will we fare against an enemy?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 다른 어떤 가문보다 상무성을 잘 알지만, 적을 상대할 때는 어떨까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A5"
msgid "Back to work."
msgstr "일하러 가자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQDulkhefHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A4"
msgid "Anyone refusing to work should be reported."
msgstr "일하기를 거부하는 자는 보고해야 한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A3"
msgid "Remember -- pilgrimages are mandatory. All are expected to participate."
msgstr "기억해... 순례는 의무다. 모두가 참여해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A2"
msgid "Be sure to report anyone who neglects their pilgrimage."
msgstr "순례를 게을리하는 자가 있으면 반드시 보고하도록."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A1"
msgid "House Veth'aal make strong rulers."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 강력한 통치자야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0138A0"
msgid "The will of the Great Serpent will be imposed above all."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 의지가 무엇보다 우선할 것이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389F"
msgid "Dazra has strayed too far from the teachings of Jinan Va'ruun. House Veth'aal will surely fix that."
msgstr "다즈라는 지난 바룬의 가르침에서 너무 멀어졌어. 베타알 가문이 확실히 바로잡을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389E"
msgid "Blasphemy will not be tolerated."
msgstr "신성모독은 용납할 수 없다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389D"
msgid "The Great Serpent will be pleased with House Veth'aal's rule."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 베타알 가문의 통치를 기뻐하실 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389C"
msgid "All Must Serve. Especially now."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다. 특히 지금은."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389B"
msgid "House Veth'aal may seem strict, but they are guiding us back to the Great Serpent's path."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 엄격해 보이지만, 우리를 위대한 뱀의 길로 다시 인도하고 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_PostMQVethaalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01389A"
msgid "Walk in Jinan's steps."
msgstr "지난의 발자취를 따라 걸어라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I've spent countless hours trying to find a way to escape this... unbearable nightmare, but it appears that my fate has been sealed.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The thought of becoming one of the Redeemed... those horrendous, twisted vestiges of humanity... it's... it's too disturbing to contemplate. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013898"
msgid "The Zealot that calls himself \"the Maker\" has decreed we have been chosen for redemption... that we would become one of his... hideous creations..."
msgstr "'조물주'라고 자칭하는 광신도가 우리를 구원의 제물로 선택했답니다... 그자의... 끔찍한 피조물 중 하나로 만들겠다고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Dearest Nalada... I'm using one of these devices to record this message. I pray it somehow finds its way into your hands.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Zealot that calls himself "the Maker" has decreed we have been chosen for redemption... that we would become one of his... hideous creations...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013897"
msgid "I've spent countless hours trying to find a way to escape this... unbearable nightmare, but it appears that my fate has been sealed."
msgstr "이... 견딜 수 없는 악몽에서 벗어나려고 수없이 애썼지만, 제 운명은 이미 정해진 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I've spent countless hours trying to find a way to escape this... unbearable nightmare, but it appears that my fate has been sealed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013896"
msgid "Dearest Nalada... I'm using one of these devices to record this message. I pray it somehow finds its way into your hands."
msgstr "사랑하는 날라다... 이 장치 중 하나로 이 메시지를 녹음하고 있어. 이 메시지가 어떻게든 네 손에 들어가기를 기도할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The Zealot that calls himself "the Maker" has decreed we have been chosen for redemption... that we would become one of his... hideous creations...
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I've heard the screams of the others... their dying breaths, begging... no, praying, for mercy. I can't even fathom the pain they must have endured.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013895"
msgid "The thought of becoming one of the Redeemed... those horrendous, twisted vestiges of humanity... it's... it's too disturbing to contemplate."
msgstr "저 끔찍하고 뒤틀린 인간의 잔재... 대속자 중 하나가 된다는 생각은... 너무나 끔찍해서 차마 생각조차 할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The thought of becoming one of the Redeemed... those horrendous, twisted vestiges of humanity... it's... it's too disturbing to contemplate. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All of the cells near my own are empty. The silence cuts as deep as a painblade. I can only assume I'm the Maker's next... victim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013894"
msgid "I've heard the screams of the others... their dying breaths, begging... no, praying, for mercy. I can't even fathom the pain they must have endured."
msgstr ""
"다른 이들의 비명 소리가 들렸어... 그들의 마지막 숨결, 자비를 구걸하는... 아니, 기도하는 소리가. 그들이 겪었을 고통은 상상조차 "
"할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I've heard the screams of the others... their dying breaths, begging... no, praying, for mercy. I can't even fathom the pain they must have endured.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Soon, my mind will no longer be my own, and I will forget you, and mother and father. Forget everything. Even myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013893"
msgid "All of the cells near my own are empty. The silence cuts as deep as a painblade. I can only assume I'm the Maker's next... victim."
msgstr ""
"내 주변의 감방은 모두 비었어. 이 침묵은 고통의 칼날만큼이나 깊이 베어들어와. 조물주의 다음... 희생자는 나일 수밖에 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What was that? I think? Yes... I... hear them coming. There's so much I want to say, but time isn't on my side. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I love you, Nalada. Farewell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013892"
msgid "Listen to me, dear sister. In your hour of greatest need, trust in the Great Serpent. Despite all that's happened, trust that He will provide for you and protect you."
msgstr ""
"잘 들어. 사랑하는 내 동생. 네가 가장 절박한 순간에, 위대한 뱀을 믿어. 이 모든 일에도 불구하고, 그 분께서 너를 보살피고 보호하실 "
"거라 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All of the cells near my own are empty. The silence cuts as deep as a painblade. I can only assume I'm the Maker's next... victim.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I should never have left you alone, Nalada. In the midst of the calamity that struck Dazra, I should have been there for you. But now...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013891"
msgid "Soon, my mind will no longer be my own, and I will forget you, and mother and father. Forget everything. Even myself."
msgstr "곧, 내 정신은 더 이상 내 것이 아니게 될 거고, 나는 너와 어머니, 아버지를 잊게 되겠지. 모든 것을 잊을 거야. 나 자신조차도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. You get cut off by a loud noise. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Soon, my mind will no longer be my own, and I will forget you, and mother and father. Forget everything. Even myself.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What was that? I think? Yes... I... hear them coming. There's so much I want to say, but time isn't on my side. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013890"
msgid "I should never have left you alone, Nalada. In the midst of the calamity that struck Dazra, I should have been there for you. But now..."
msgstr "널 혼자 두는 게 아니었는데, 날라다. 다즈라를 덮친 그 재앙 속에서, 네 곁에 있었어야 했는데. 하지만 이제..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Listen to me, dear sister. In your hour of greatest need, trust in the Great Serpent. Despite all that's happened, trust that He will provide for you and protect you.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01388F"
msgid "I love you, Nalada. Farewell."
msgstr "사랑한다, 날라다. 잘 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speak in a hushed tone, not too soft. You're in a jail cell recording this. Imagine you hear a door slam. Amp the nervousness. / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I should never have left you alone, Nalada. In the midst of the calamity that struck Dazra, I should have been there for you. But now...
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_NPCQuasim
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Listen to me, dear sister. In your hour of greatest need, trust in the Great Serpent. Despite all that's happened, trust that He will provide for you and protect you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN
#. TOPIC: 01113F33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_AN_QuasimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01388E"
msgid "What was that? I think? Yes... I... hear them coming. There's so much I want to say, but time isn't on my side."
msgstr "뭐지? 온다... 그들이 오는 소리가 들려. 하고 싶은 말은 너무 많지만, 시간이 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Looks like you've won a trip to Jandar's Rest! Lucky you!|Scanning the coordinates, those point further north, hidden in Badlands. Clever, clever.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you shall have precisely that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01111A83
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01387E"
msgid "We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it."
msgstr "이 위치를 점거하고 확보하려면 최소 세 명의 교정관이 더 필요할 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: But that aside, let's get to the guts of the issue, hm? After reading through the evidence, where do you think the supply thief is from?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01111A82
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01387D"
msgid "Then you shall have precisely that."
msgstr "그럼 딱 그만큼 지원해드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar. &&& Qisrani: I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself. &&& Qisrani: In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am of House Dul'kehf, we are meticulous to a fault. Before we move in, I want to make sure we have opened every closet, looked into every crack.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01387C"
msgid "Why wait? Isn't this enough to arrest him?"
msgstr "왜 뜸을 들이는 거죠? 체포하기에 충분하지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why wait? Isn't this enough to arrest him?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why wait? Isn't this enough to arrest him?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Let's do it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01387B"
msgid "I am of House Dul'kehf, we are meticulous to a fault. Before we move in, I want to make sure we have opened every closet, looked into every crack."
msgstr ""
"저는 둘케프 가문의 일원이며, 우리 가문은 정확한 일처리를 중시합니다. 그래서 행동에 옮기기 전에 먼저 최대한 많은 증거물을 찾기를 "
"바라지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure. &&& Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.|The meeting takes place inside the Halls of Obedience. Will you watch my back?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I want to avoid innocents being caught in the crossfire. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01387A"
msgid "Why the Halls of Obedience?"
msgstr "왜 복종의 전당에서 만나는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why the Halls of Obedience?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why the Halls of Obedience?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013879"
msgid "I want to avoid innocents being caught in the crossfire."
msgstr "총격전이 벌어졌을 때 무고한 희생자가 생기는 건 원치 않으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why the Halls of Obedience?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I've got you covered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013878"
msgid "If this is what I think it is, then let's be extra cautious."
msgstr "제 생각이 혹시 맞다면, 더욱더 주의해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This meeting may also be a trap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This meeting may also be a trap.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111189F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013877"
msgid "I'm well aware, and brought a weapon. But I'm still counting on you to be my dagger in the dark."
msgstr "잘 알고 있어요. 이미 무기도 가져왔죠. 하지만 음지에서 당신이 저를 지켜 줄 거라 믿을게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure. &&& Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.|The meeting takes place inside the Halls of Obedience. Will you watch my back?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm well aware, and brought a weapon. But I'm still counting on you to be my dagger in the dark.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011118A0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013876"
msgid "This meeting may also be a trap."
msgstr "이번 회의가 함정일 수도 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to ArguingZealot04
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ArguingZealot03: Did you come prepared? &&& ArguingZealot04: For the sake of our people? Always.
#. ALIAS: ArguingZealot03
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotAssassin: For House Ma'leen!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111189E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_292_AssassinationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013875"
msgid "Then may the Great Serpent watch over us."
msgstr "그리하여 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 굽어살펴 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What concerns do you have with arresting Mujeen?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Let's do it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F65
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013874"
msgid "Some may say we are trying to shift the balance of power, and so to move forward, our evidence must be ironclad."
msgstr "남들이 보기엔 우리가 힘의 균형을 바꾸려 한다고 말할지 몰라요. 그래서 후속 조치를 위해 우리 측 증거가 확실해야 하죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F48
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013873"
msgid "Then we'll need to move swiftly, given his standing with House Ka'dic."
msgstr "그럼 빠르게 움직여야겠네요. 그자와 카딕 가문 사이 관계를 고려하면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've got you covered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F48
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013872"
msgid "But our next move should be to arrest Mujeen."
msgstr "하지만 우리의 다음 목표는 무진을 체포하는 것이 되어야 해요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: I am honored to carry out the Great Serpent's will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111326
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013871"
msgid "Are you prepared to purge the Settled Systems of heresy?"
msgstr "개척 성계에서 이단을 숙청할 준비가 되었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you prepared to purge the Settled Systems of heresy?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111325
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013870"
msgid "I am honored to carry out the Great Serpent's will."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻을 수행하게 되어 영광이구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111325
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386F"
msgid "Soon all of the Settled Systems will either worship Him or be made Penitent."
msgstr "곧 개척 성계 전체가 그분을 숭배하거나 회개자로 변할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111325
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386E"
msgid "We will all stand united under His shadow soon enough."
msgstr "우리 모두는 곧 그분의 그림자 아래서 하나가 될 것이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: Yes, and it is as I feared. This war is folly, and will only bring about the death of our people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111324
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386D"
msgid "Did you hear the Serpent's Crusade is restarting?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전군이 다시 시작된다는 소식 들었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you hear the Serpent's Crusade is restarting?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111323
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386C"
msgid "Yes, and it is as I feared. This war is folly, and will only bring about the death of our people."
msgstr "들었어. 그래서 걱정이야. 이 전쟁은 바보짓이라고. 우리 신민들을 죽일 뿐이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111323
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386B"
msgid "And I know I may be labeled a heretic for saying so, but I don't say that out of some waivering faith..."
msgstr "그런 말 하면 이단자로 낙인찍힐 수 있다는 건 알지만, 내가 믿음을 버려서 이런 말 하는 건 아니고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111323
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01386A"
msgid "I simply can't believe the Great Serpent would want this. Not now. Not when we're already dealing with so much loss."
msgstr "그냥 위대한 뱀이 이런 걸 원한다는 게 믿기지 않아서 그래. 지금은 좀 아니잖아. 이미 그렇게 많은 걸 잃었는데 말이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: I am prepared to give my people the mental preparation needed to endure what is to come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111322
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013869"
msgid "Are you prepared to give your life to the Serpent's Crusade?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 목숨을 바칠 준비가 됐나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you prepared to give your life to the Serpent's Crusade?
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111321
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013868"
msgid "I am prepared to give my people the mental preparation needed to endure what is to come."
msgstr "우리 신민들이 앞으로 생길 일을 참을 때 필요한 마음의 준비를 하게 할 준비는 됐지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: Since we find ourselves once again on the same path, perhaps it's time to initiate official discussions with the Zealots after all. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111321
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013867"
msgid "In the first Crusade, we stood united with House Ma'leen, but they have since abandoned their House and Anasko's actions have weakened us considerably."
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 성전 때 우린 마린 가문과 연합했지만, 그 이후로 놈들은 자기네 가문을 버렸고 아나스코 님의 행동 때문에 우리도 상당히 약해진 "
"상태야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_RazmaKadic: I am prepared to give my people the mental preparation needed to endure what is to come.|In the first Crusade, we stood united with House Ma'leen, but they have since abandoned their House and Anasko's actions have weakened us considerably.
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111320
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013866"
msgid "Since we find ourselves once again on the same path, perhaps it's time to initiate official discussions with the Zealots after all."
msgstr "이제 우리가 다시 한번 같은 길을 걷게 됐으니, 어쩌면 광신도들과 공식적인 논의를 시작할 때가 됐을지도 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111320
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013865"
msgid "We'll need everyone to win this war, and we can no longer afford to have them as enemies."
msgstr "이 전쟁에서 이기려면 모두가 필요하니까, 더는 놈들을 적으로 둘 수 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_RazmaKadic: I am prepared to give my people the mental preparation needed to endure what is to come.|In the first Crusade, we stood united with House Ma'leen, but they have since abandoned their House and Anasko's actions have weakened us considerably.
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111320
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013864"
msgid "As much as I hate to say it, perhaps it's time to initiate official discussions with the Zealots after all."
msgstr "이런 말 하기는 정말 싫지만, 어쩌면 광신도들과 공식적인 논의를 시작할 때가 됐을지도 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01111320
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013863"
msgid "It won't be easy, but we'll need everyone to win this war, and we can no longer afford to have them as enemies."
msgstr "쉽지는 않겠지만, 이 전쟁에서 이기려면 모두가 필요해. 더는 놈들을 적으로 둘 수 없는 형편이지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: My role as Mediary will remain, but I believe the Council will be needed more than ever.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013862"
msgid "Will anything change for you now that Razma is Speaker?"
msgstr "이제 라즈마가 대변자가 됐으니, 당신 역할도 달라지는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will anything change for you now that Razma is Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013861"
msgid "My role as Mediary will remain, but I believe the Council will be needed more than ever."
msgstr "중개자 역할은 계속하겠지만, 난 대의회가 어느 때보다도 더 중요해질 거라고 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013860"
msgid "We've never had a Speaker not of House Va'ruun. Nor has the Speaker also overseen a Ministry."
msgstr "바룬 가문이 아닌 사람이 대변자였던 적은 없었어요. 대변자가 부처를 감독한 적도 없었고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385F"
msgid "I trust my sister to make wise decisions, but adapting these changes will demand a higher level of guidance."
msgstr "우리 형님이 현명한 결정을 하시겠지만, 그런 변화를 받아들이려면 더 높은 수준의 지도력이 필요하겠죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: I accept the will of the Serpent and the words of Anasko Va'ruun, but this decision changes everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385E"
msgid "What do you think of restarting the Serpent's Crusade?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 다시 시작한다는 걸 어떻게 생각하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of restarting the Serpent's Crusade?
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385D"
msgid "I accept the will of the Serpent and the words of Anasko Va'ruun, but this decision changes everything."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻과 아나스코 바룬 님의 말씀을 받들겠지만, 이 결정은 모든 걸 바꿔놓을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385C"
msgid "We have already lost half our population, and those that are left are grief stricken."
msgstr "우린 이미 인구 절반을 잃었어요. 남은 사람들은 슬픔에 빠져 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CrusadeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385B"
msgid "Make no mistake. The people will rise to the cause, but the road to victory is arduous and lined with sacrifice."
msgstr "이건 명심해요. 신민들은 대의를 위해 일어나겠지만, 승리를 향한 길은 험난하고 희생이 뒤따를 겁니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: I was on a walk, nearing Jinan Plaza. My view of the Citadel was clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01385A"
msgid "Do you remember what you were doing when the disaster happened?"
msgstr "재난이 터졌을 때 뭘 하고 있었는지 기억나나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reflective. / Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you remember what you were doing when the disaster happened?
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013859"
msgid "I was on a walk, nearing Jinan Plaza. My view of the Citadel was clear."
msgstr "지난 광장 근처에서 걷고 있었죠. 성채가 잘 보이는 곳이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013858"
msgid "I saw the windows flood with light and then a flash so bright, I was forced to turn away."
msgstr "창문에서 빛이 쏟아지더니 너무 밝은 섬광이 터지는 바람에 돌아서야 했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111131A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Djimal_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013857"
msgid "When I turned back, my eyes saw only a swirl of energy surrounding the Citadel and the crater that surrounded it."
msgstr "다시 몸을 돌렸을 땐 성채를 둘러싼 에너지 소용돌이와 그 주변에 생긴 구덩이만 보이더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013856"
msgid "Brethren."
msgstr "교우님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
