msgid "Chosen."
msgstr "선택받은 자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01384B"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01384A"
msgid "The Great Serpent watch over you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013849"
msgid "Serpent keep you."
msgstr "뱀께서 지켜주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013848"
msgid "His eyes are always watching."
msgstr "그분의 눈은 항상 지켜보고 계십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013847"
msgid "Great Serpent be at your side."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 돌봐주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013846"
msgid "Serpent's favor upon you."
msgstr "뱀께서 총애하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013845"
msgid "The Serpent strikes down those who doubt."
msgstr "뱀께서는 의심하는 자를 치실 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013844"
msgid "Our minds and bodies must be fully devoted to His will."
msgstr "우리의 마음과 몸은 온전히 그분의 뜻에 바쳐져야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013843"
msgid "Idle hands and minds are where heresy is sown."
msgstr "게으른 손과 마음은 이단이 싹트는 곳입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013842"
msgid "Be mindful of your actions. Heresy and treason are one and the same."
msgstr "행동을 조심하시길. 이단과 반역은 하나이고 같은 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013841"
msgid "To not fully dedicate is to risk the path of the apostate."
msgstr "완전히 헌신하지 않는 것은 배교자의 길을 걷는 위험을 감수하는 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013840"
msgid "I pray the Serpent still favors us to have allowed us to live."
msgstr "우리가 살도록 허락하신 뱀께서 여전히 우리를 총애하시길 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383F"
msgid "The incident was a terrifying show of the Serpent's power."
msgstr "그 사고는 위대한 뱀의 권능을 보여주는 끔찍한 사건이었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383E"
msgid "I miss our home, but the Keep shall do."
msgstr "우리의 고향이 그립지만, 본성도 괜찮을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383D"
msgid "We mourn the loss of our fallen, but know they walk with the Serpent."
msgstr "우리는 쓰러진 자들을 애도하지만, 그자들이 뱀과 함께 걷고 있다는 것을 압니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383C"
msgid "Since the incident, full dedication is even more necessary."
msgstr "그 사고 이후로, 완전한 헌신이 더욱 필요해졌습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383B"
msgid "Remain ever vigilant. Heresy must be exposed."
msgstr "항상 경계해야 합니다. 이단은 반드시 척결해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01383A"
msgid "If you seek the House Elder, he is in his office."
msgstr "가문의 장로님을 찾아왔다면, 집무실에 계십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013839"
msgid "Be mindful of our Elder. The incident weighs heavily on his mind."
msgstr "장로님을 잘 보살펴야 합니다. 그 사고가 그분의 마음을 무겁게 짓누르고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013838"
msgid "Something disrupts Viktor's work. I pray his focus returns soon."
msgstr "뭔가가 빅토르 님의 업무를 방해하고 있어. 빅토르 님의 집중력이 어서 돌아오기를 기도할 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013837"
msgid "Something is amiss, but I dare not speculate."
msgstr "뭔가 잘못되었지만, 함부로 추정할 수는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013836"
msgid "I sense a renewed peace within our House."
msgstr "우리 가문에 새로운 평화가 깃든 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013835"
msgid "The accident has brought Viktor and Vaeric closer. Some would credit Grief, but I know it is as the Great Serpent's will."
msgstr "그 사고로 빅토르와 배릭은 더 가까워졌지. 어떤 이들은 슬픔 덕분이라고 하겠지만, 난 위대한 뱀의 뜻임을 안다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013834"
msgid "It seems father and son are more aligned than ever. House Veth'aal prevails."
msgstr "아버지와 아들이 그 어느 때보다 더 굳게 뭉친 것 같군. 베타알 가문은 건재하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013833"
msgid "The penalty for treason is death. Neither blood nor name will save you."
msgstr "반역의 대가는 죽음입니다. 혈통도 가문도 당신을 구해주지 못합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013832"
msgid "Vaeric's fate was unfortunate, but he has been made Penitent."
msgstr "배릭의 운명은 안타깝지만, 결국 회개했을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013831"
msgid "Viktor held even his own son to our laws. His devotion is unmatched."
msgstr "빅토르 님은 자신의 아드님에게조차 우리 법을 엄격히 적용하셨지. 빅토르 님의 헌신은 누구에게도 뒤지지 않는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013830"
msgid "House Veth'aal's devotion is unmatched. It is natural for Viktor to lead."
msgstr "베타알 가문의 헌신은 누구에게도 뒤지지 않지. 빅토르가 이끄는 건 당연하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382F"
msgid "Under Viktor's guidance, Dazra will see a new age of greatness."
msgstr "빅토르 님의 영도 아래, 다즈라는 위대함의 새 시대를 맞이할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382E"
msgid "Viktor's leadership will guarantee salvation for all."
msgstr "빅토르 님의 영도력은 모두에게 구원을 보장할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382D"
msgid "May the Great Serpent steel us all for what is to come."
msgstr "다가올 일을 위해 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 강하게 해 주시기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382C"
msgid "Soon, all of the Settled Systems will stand united under the Great Serpent."
msgstr "머지 않아, 모든 개척 성계는 위대한 뱀 아래 하나가 될 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382B"
msgid "With Viktor at the helm, the Serpent's Crusade will be swift and merciless."
msgstr "빅토르 님이 이끄시는 뱀의 성전군은 신속하고 자비가 없을 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01382A"
msgid "Brethren."
msgstr "교우님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013829"
msgid "Sister."
msgstr "자매님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
