#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01381F"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01381E"
msgid "Great Serpent watch over you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01381D"
msgid "Serpent keep you."
msgstr "뱀께서 지켜주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player has excited a scene. / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQNPCs_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01381C"
msgid "Serpent guide you."
msgstr "뱀께서 그대를 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01381B"
msgid "The outsiders will come to accept His embrace, just as you did."
msgstr "이방인들도 그분의 포옹을 받아들일 겁니다. 당신이 그랬듯이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01381A"
msgid "Our influence in the Settled Systems may be small, but all it takes is a foothold."
msgstr "개척 성계에서 우리의 영향력은 작을지 모르지만, 발판만 마련하면 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013819"
msgid "I envy you. As an envoy, I hope to become an agent of change and see more of our galaxy as well."
msgstr "당신이 부럽군요. 저도 사절로서 변혁의 주역이 되어 우리 은하를 더 많이 보고 싶어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013818"
msgid "Since you've been accepted, I wonder if you'll see our influence on the Settled Systems."
msgstr "당신이 받아들여졌으니, 개척 성계에 우리가 영향력을 미치는 것도 보게 될지 궁금하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013817"
msgid "I wonder what your presence here means for the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "당신의 존재가 결합성에 어떤 의미일지 궁금하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013816"
msgid "Our physical house was spared in the incident. If that doesn't show favor, I don't know what does."
msgstr "우리 가문은 그 사고에서 무사했어요. 그게 총애가 아니라면, 뭐가 총애겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013815"
msgid "The Great Serpent spared so many of us, yet we all still feel the loss."
msgstr "뱀께서 수많은 사람들이 환난을 면케 해주셨으나, 우리는 모두 여전히 상실감을 느끼고 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013814"
msgid "I'll never forget the day of the accident. Such a display of power. It's a wonder heretics exist."
msgstr "그 사고가 일어난 날을 결코 잊을 수 없을 거예요. 그런 힘을 보여주시다니. 이단자들이 존재하는 게 놀라울 따름이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013813"
msgid "I hope when you return to the Settled Systems, you'll aid in showing them the truth path."
msgstr "개척 성계로 돌아가면, 인간들에게 진실된 길을 보여주는 데 힘써주면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013812"
msgid "If you could complete the path, it gives me more hope for the others."
msgstr "당신이 그 길을 완수할 수 있다면, 다른 이들에게도 더 큰 희망을 걸 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013811"
msgid "Perhaps you'll join our numbers embedded in the Settled Systems now that you've been shown the way."
msgstr "당신은 가야할 길을 알게 되었으니, 어쩌면 개척 성계에 잠입한 우리 요원들에게 합류할지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013810"
msgid "Remember, House Ka'dic business is its own. Only Razma and Djimal may decide otherwise."
msgstr "명심하세요. 카딕 가문의 일은 카딕 가문만의 일입니다. 오직 라즈마 님과 지말 님만이 달리 결정할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380F"
msgid "If you're here for Razma, she's in her office."
msgstr "라즈마 씨를 보러 왔다면, 집무실에 계십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380E"
msgid "I pray the Great Serpent delivers our cousins back safely."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 친척들을 무사히 돌려보내 주시길 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380D"
msgid "Zealots interfering in a time like this... It's insulting."
msgstr "이런 시기에 광신도들이 방해하다니... 모욕적이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380C"
msgid "Razma is under tremendous pressure as of late. Serpent guide her."
msgstr "라즈마 님은 최근 엄청난 압박을 받고 있어요. 뱀께서 라즈마 님을 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380B"
msgid "I've heard Sahima is vital in the Mourning Device construction. I pray for her safe delivery back home."
msgstr "사히마가 모어닝 장치 제작에 중요한 역할을 했다고 들었어요. 무사히 집으로 돌아갈 수 있었으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01380A"
msgid "Thank the Serpent for the safe return of our cousins."
msgstr "친척들이 무사히 돌아온 것에 대해 뱀께 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013809"
msgid "It's good to have something to celebrate for once with our cousins back home."
msgstr "친척들이 돌아왔으니, 축하할 일이 생겨서 좋군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013808"
msgid "The Zealots will think twice now before moving against us."
msgstr "광신도들은 이제 우리에게 덤비기 전에 다시 한번 생각해야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013807"
msgid "First the incident, and now this terrible news of our cousins. Will it ever end?"
msgstr "처음엔 그 사고, 그리고 이제 우리 친척들에 대한 이 끔찍한 소식. 이 고난이 언제 끝날까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013806"
msgid "The Zealots will pay for their actions against our House."
msgstr "광신도들은 우리 가문에 저지른 짓에 대한 대가를 치를 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013805"
msgid "So much loss. Sahima, Gavin... We should've known better."
msgstr "너무나 많은 사람을 잃었어요. 사히마, 개빈... 더 잘 알고 지냈어야 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013804"
msgid "House Ka'dic's knowledge of the Settled Systems is unmatched. You were right to choose Razma as Speaker."
msgstr ""
"카딕 가문은 개척 성계에 대해 타의 추종을 불허하는 지식을 가지고 있죠. 당신이 라즈마 님을 대변자로 선택한 건 옳은 판단이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013803"
msgid "Under Razma's guidance, Dazra will see a new age of greatness."
msgstr "라즈마 님의 영도 아래, 다즈라는 위대함의 새 시대를 맞이할 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013802"
msgid "Razma's leadership may see increased representation with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "라즈마 님의 영도력은 개척 성계와 더 증대된 표현을 보게 해 줄지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Veth'aal greeting. Solemn, reverent. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWardens_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013801"
msgid "May the Great Serpent steel us all for what is to come."
msgstr "다가올 일을 위해 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 강하게 해 주시기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013800"
msgid "The Serpent's Crusade will see many of our agents activated. I pray the Serpent protects them."
msgstr "뱀의 성전으로 인해 우리 요원들의 활동이 많아질 겁니다. 뱀께서 요원들을 보호해 주시길 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Generic House Ka'dic greeting. Polite, business friendly. Player has initiated the Serpent's Crusade which means war. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericEnvoys_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FF"
msgid "The Settled Systems will not go gently into His embrace. I hope everyone knows what this Crusade means."
msgstr "개척 성계는 그분의 포옹을 순순히 받아들이지 않을 겁니다. 이 성전이 무엇을 의미하는지 모두가 알았으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FE"
msgid "It's unfortunate Anasko could not be saved. Serpent embrace him."
msgstr "아나스코 님을 구해내지 못한 건 유감이에요. 위대한 뱀께서 그분을 안아 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FD"
msgid "You've neutralized a great threat. Dazra can rest easy now."
msgstr "큰 위협을 막아냈군요. 이제 다즈라도 안심할 수 있겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FC"
msgid "You've neutralized a great threat. If only Dazra could rest easy."
msgstr "큰 위협을 막아냈군요. 다즈라가 안심할 수만 있었으면 좋았을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FB"
msgid "I'm relieved that the Scaled Citadel no longer looms large in our minds."
msgstr "이제 비늘 성채를 크게 걱정할 일이 없어서 안심이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137FA"
msgid "The Scaled Citadel no longer looms large in our minds. It's merely been replaced by the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "이제 비늘 성채를 크게 걱정할 일은 없겠군요. 단지 그 걱정이 뱀의 성전으로 대체되었을 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F9"
msgid "You've done House Ka'dic a great honor."
msgstr "카딕 가문에 큰 영광을 안겨주셨네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F8"
msgid "Razma will make an excellent Speaker. You chose well."
msgstr "라즈마 형님은 훌륭한 대변자가 되실 거예요. 잘 골랐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F7"
msgid "There will be a lot of pressure as the new Speaker, but my sister can handle it."
msgstr "형님이 새로운 대변자가 되시면 부담이 크시겠군요. 그래도 감당하실 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F6"
msgid "We are in your debt. Not just the Council, but all of Dazra."
msgstr "우리가 빚을 졌군요. 대의회뿐만이 아니라, 다즈라 전체가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F5"
msgid "Serpent watch over you, especially for what you've done for us."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 굽어살펴주시길. 특히 우리를 위해 해준 일을 치하해 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F4"
msgid "Regardless of who leads us, all of Dazra is in your debt."
msgstr "누가 우리를 이끌든, 다즈라 전체가 당신에게 빚을 졌군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F3"
msgid "Though I question your judgement, if the Serpent wills House Veth'aal to lead, so be it."
msgstr "당신의 판단이 의문스럽긴 하지만, 위대한 뱀께서 베타알 가문을 원하신다면 그렇게 해야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F2"
msgid "With Viktor in charge, Lovek is sure to play that card every chance he gets."
msgstr "빅토르가 책임을 맡았으니, 로벡은 분명 기회가 될 때마다 이 카드를 써먹겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F1"
msgid "Though I question your judgement, if the Serpent wills House Dul'kehf to lead, so be it."
msgstr "당신의 판단이 의문스럽긴 하지만, 위대한 뱀께서 둘케프 가문을 원하신다면 그렇게 해야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137F0"
msgid "Hasmak only recently became Elder and now assumes the role of Speaker. Let's hope he's ready."
msgstr "해즈막은 최근에서야 장로가 됐는데 이젠 대변자 역할까지 맡게 됐네요. 준비되어 있기를 바라야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137EF"
msgid "I hope you know what restarting the Serpent's Crusade truly means."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 다시 시작한다는 게 어떤 의미인지 알았으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137EE"
msgid "With the Crusade enacted, we move from one trial to the next."
msgstr "성전이 시작되었으니, 시련을 넘어 또 다른 시련이 닥치겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0137ED"
msgid "We had an opportunity to rebuild our city in peace. Instead we'll turn to war. Great Serpent protect us all."
msgstr "우리 도시를 평화롭게 재건할 기회가 있었는데, 그 대신 전쟁으로 돌아섰네요. 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 지켜 주시길."

