#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137E4"
msgid "It's painfully obvious that you want to, so I'll indulge you."
msgstr "엄청 얘기하고 싶어서 입이 근질거리시는 것 같은데, 말하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a warm, sincere laugh / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's painfully obvious that you want to, so I'll indulge you.
