#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137E3"
msgid "*Laughs* Is that so?"
msgstr "*웃음* 그래 보입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Warm, friendly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's painfully obvious that you want to, so I'll indulge you.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
