#. TOPIC: 01111A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137E2"
msgid "I won't deny that it brings me happiness to explain the walking of the Path."
msgstr "구원의 길을 걷는 법에 대해 설명하는 것이 참으로 기쁘단 것은 부정하지 않겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A fond memory, happy / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's painfully obvious that you want to, so I'll indulge you.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01111A01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137E1"
msgid "It reminds me of the joy I felt as a father teaching my infant daughter how to say the word \"dada.\""
msgstr "내 딸이 어린 아가였을 때 '아빠'라고 부르도록 가르쳤을 때의 기쁨이 떠오를 정도라 할 수 있다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful. &&& companion: That makes one of you. &&& VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.|There is no cause for shame. We must each choose the time that is right for us to make the journey.|I would be happy to explain the custom if you like.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I thank you for taking the time to speak to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01111A00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137E0"
msgid "Thanks for the offer, but I'll pass."
msgstr "제안은 고맙지만 사양하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thanks for the offer, but I'll pass.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks for the offer, but I'll pass.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
