#. TOPIC: 011119FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DF"
msgid "Then I thank you for taking the time to speak to me."
msgstr "그렇다면 시간 내서 잠시 얘기해 줘서 고맙구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thanks for the offer, but I'll pass.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DE"
msgid "May you walk in the light of the Serpent's watchful gaze."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 비호를 받으며 나아가시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption. &&& VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DD"
msgid "As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?"
msgstr "정말로 멋진 여정이 될 거라고 생각하지만, 사실 꽤 시간이 걸릴 거야. 괜찮겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption. &&& VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DC"
msgid "Call me cynical, but how do we know this guy isn't setting us up to get mugged, or worse?"
msgstr "냉소적인 말일지 모르지만, 이 사람이 우릴 털어 먹거나 더 끔찍한 짓을 하지 않을 거라 어떻게 알지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Having doubts / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption. &&& VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DB"
msgid "I like a nature walk as much as the next guy, but a pilgrimage? I don't know."
msgstr "자연 경관을 산책하는 건 나도 좋아하지만 순례라니? 잘 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption. &&& VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137DA"
msgid "I'll be honest. I have misgivings about what you're committing yourself to here."
msgstr "솔직히 말할게. 여기서 이런 것에 헌신하려고 하다니, 불안감이 느껴져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please do. &&& VijunAhkmav: Ah, thank you, my friend.|Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path. &&& VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.|To sin against the Great Serpent demands an act of absolution.|We first come here to pray for forgiveness, and then we make a journey.|We travel to each of the Wayshrines, reading their words and contemplating their meaning.|When that is done, we return here to renew our pledge of devotion to the Great Serpent.|In this way, we are redeemed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D9"
msgid "I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption."
msgstr "위대한 뱀에게 저 또한 구원받을 가치가 있음을 입증하도록 하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: For redemption, I will walk the Path.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: For redemption, I will walk the Path.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D8"
msgid "Good. Our sins are a burden that weigh us down."
msgstr "좋소. 우리의 죄악은 우리 스스로를 억누르는 짐이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: For redemption, I will walk the Path.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D7"
msgid "Walk the Path and cast them off. Reclaim your place among the chosen."
msgstr "길을 걷고 그 죄악을 놓으시오. 선택받은 자 중 하나가 되시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please do. &&& VijunAhkmav: Ah, thank you, my friend.|Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path. &&& VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.|To sin against the Great Serpent demands an act of absolution.|We first come here to pray for forgiveness, and then we make a journey.|We travel to each of the Wayshrines, reading their words and contemplating their meaning.|When that is done, we return here to renew our pledge of devotion to the Great Serpent.|In this way, we are redeemed.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. Our sins are a burden that weigh us down. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D6"
msgid "For redemption, I will walk the Path."
msgstr "구원을 받기 위해 그 길을 걷겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D5"
msgid "You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind."
msgstr "결의로 가득 찬 모습으로 말하는 것을 보니 내 마음의 의심조차 바로 사라지는구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to make this journey for educational purposes.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to make this journey for educational purposes.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D4"
msgid "Good! A mind that craves knowledge is a mind that is growing strong."
msgstr "좋소! 지식을 갈구하는 정신이야말로 나날이 강인해지는 정신이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please do. &&& VijunAhkmav: Ah, thank you, my friend.|Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path. &&& VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.|To sin against the Great Serpent demands an act of absolution.|We first come here to pray for forgiveness, and then we make a journey.|We travel to each of the Wayshrines, reading their words and contemplating their meaning.|When that is done, we return here to renew our pledge of devotion to the Great Serpent.|In this way, we are redeemed.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good! A mind that craves knowledge is a mind that is growing strong.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D3"
msgid "I'd like to make this journey for educational purposes."
msgstr "교육적인 목적으로 이 여정을 걸어 보고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VijunAhkmav
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure? &&& VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.|You should join your companion on the journey. Perhaps you, too, will learn something.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D2"
msgid "We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man."
msgstr "두고 보자고요. 기대하진 마시고요, 할아버지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VijunAhkmav
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: Call me cynical, but how do we know this guy isn't setting us up to get mugged, or worse? &&& VijunAhkmav: If that is truly what you believe, then it's all the more reason for you to join your companion on the journey.|You'll provide security, and perhaps you'll also gain some wisdom along the way.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D1"
msgid "I'll try anything once, but you better be on the level here."
msgstr "한번 시도해 볼 수는 있겠는데, 솔직히 말해 주셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Having doubts / to VijunAhkmav
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I like a nature walk as much as the next guy, but a pilgrimage? I don't know. &&& VijunAhkmav: It is not such a long journey. Join your companion on the Path, and you'll see what I mean.|Indeed, the knowledge and wisdom you may gain are well worth the time.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137D0"
msgid "If I do, it's because we watch each other's backs, not because I'm trying to get religion."
msgstr "나도 이 길을 걸어야 한다면... 널 지켜 줘야 하니까 그런 거지 종교적 이유는 절대 없을 줄 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VijunAhkmav
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I'll be honest. I have misgivings about what you're committing yourself to here. &&& VijunAhkmav: Why not join your companion on the Path? |You may find that your doubts are quickly dispelled.|You might also discover truth and wisdom that will open your eyes to new possibilities.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137CF"
msgid "I suppose there's some value in learning more about your culture."
msgstr "당신의 문화에 관해 배우는 것도 어느 정도 가치가 있을지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind. &&& companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137CD"
msgid "Time must be made for that which is important."
msgstr "중요한 의례에는 응당 필요한 시간을 내셔야 하오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137CC"
msgid "You should join your companion on the journey. Perhaps you, too, will learn something."
msgstr "이 여정에는 그대도 함께하도록 하시오. 그렇게 그대 또한 무언가를 깨달을지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind. &&& companion: Call me cynical, but how do we know this guy isn't setting us up to get mugged, or worse?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137CB"
msgid "If that is truly what you believe, then it's all the more reason for you to join your companion on the journey."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 생각한다면, 더더욱 그대의 동료와 함께 이 길을 걸어야 하는 것 아니겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137CA"
msgid "You'll provide security, and perhaps you'll also gain some wisdom along the way."
msgstr "그대는 동료를 지켜 줄 것이고, 더 나아가 새 깨달음을 얻을지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind. &&& companion: I like a nature walk as much as the next guy, but a pilgrimage? I don't know.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C9"
msgid "It is not such a long journey. Join your companion on the Path, and you'll see what I mean."
msgstr "이건 긴 여정이 아니오. 그대 또한 함께 이 길을 걸으면 내 말의 뜻을 깨달을 것이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C8"
msgid "Indeed, the knowledge and wisdom you may gain are well worth the time."
msgstr "그렇지, 지식과 지혜를 얻을 수 있다면 그 시간이 전혀 아깝지 않을 것이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: You speak with such conviction that all doubt is banished from my mind. &&& companion: I'll be honest. I have misgivings about what you're committing yourself to here.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C7"
msgid "Why not join your companion on the Path?"
msgstr "이 길에 그대 또한 함께 걷는 게 어떻겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C6"
msgid "You may find that your doubts are quickly dispelled."
msgstr "금방 그 의구심이 순식간에 사라질 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C5"
msgid "You might also discover truth and wisdom that will open your eyes to new possibilities."
msgstr "그대는 새 가능성을 볼 수 있게 해 줄 진실과 지혜를 깨달을 수도 있을 거라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world. &&& VijunAhkmav: Wise words, my friend. |No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made. &&& VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions. &&& VijunAhkmav: What did you think of the Words of Devotion?|Did you agree with them? Or did you have a different perspective?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It has certainly given my life a purpose. I can't imagine what I would do without it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C4"
msgid "Devotion can give a life purpose, but it must be given carefully."
msgstr "헌신은 삶의 목적을 부여해 줄 수 있으나, 신중히 주여져야 하는 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was tedious. This planet is too gloomy for my taste.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was tedious. This planet is too gloomy for my taste.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C3"
msgid "Interesting. I have never thought of it that way, but then, I've had nothing to compare with."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 이 몸은 그렇게 생각해 본 적이 없으니, 그 의견과 비교할 만한 말이 없구료."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was tedious. This planet is too gloomy for my taste.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C2"
msgid "Few indeed are those of us who journey to the stars. If you are such a one, it's not my business."
msgstr "우리 중에 우주를 여행하는 자들은 적소. 그대가 우주비행사라 해도, 그건 나와 관련 없는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Welcome back, traveler. Tell me, how was your journey?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Interesting. I have never thought of it that way, but then, I've had nothing to compare with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C1"
msgid "It was tedious. This planet is too gloomy for my taste."
msgstr "지루하던데요. 이 행성은 저한테는 너무 우중충해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Welcome back, traveler. Tell me, how was your journey?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wise words, my friend. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137C0"
msgid "It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world."
msgstr "꽤 좋았습니다. 이 행성의 근엄한 아름다움이 멋지게 느껴지더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Approving / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BF"
msgid "Wise words, my friend."
msgstr "현명한 말이로군, 친구여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BE"
msgid "No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made."
msgstr "그 어떤 인공물이라 할지라도 위대한 뱀께서 창조하신 아름다움에 비할 수 없소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite apology / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Time must be made for that which is important.|You should join your companion on the journey. Perhaps you, too, will learn something. &&& companion: We will see, but I would not get your hopes up, old man.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Here, you'll need this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BD"
msgid "No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you."
msgstr "그런 건 아무 상관 없소. 난 그저 그대가 깨달음을 얻는 경험을 느끼길 바라는 것뿐이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm reassurance / Somber / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: If that is truly what you believe, then it's all the more reason for you to join your companion on the journey.|You'll provide security, and perhaps you'll also gain some wisdom along the way. &&& companion: I'll try anything once, but you better be on the level here.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Here, you'll need this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BC"
msgid "I have no ill intent. I swear it in the Great Serpent's name."
msgstr "악의 같은 건 없소. 위대한 뱀의 이름으로 맹세하리다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly apology / Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: It is not such a long journey. Join your companion on the Path, and you'll see what I mean.|Indeed, the knowledge and wisdom you may gain are well worth the time. &&& companion: If I do, it's because we watch each other's backs, not because I'm trying to get religion.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Here, you'll need this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BB"
msgid "I give you my word, I make no such presumption."
msgstr "약속하리다, 그런 식으로 접근할 생각은 전혀 없소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed, approving / Impressed / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Why not join your companion on the Path? |You may find that your doubts are quickly dispelled.|You might also discover truth and wisdom that will open your eyes to new possibilities. &&& companion: I suppose there's some value in learning more about your culture.
