#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137BA"
msgid "That's true! Indeed, that are few better ways to gain such insight."
msgstr "사실이라오! 통찰력을 얻는 데 이보다 좋은 방법은 거의 없소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Devotion can give a life purpose, but it must be given carefully.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Devotion can give a life purpose, but it must be given carefully.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B9"
msgid "It has certainly given my life a purpose. I can't imagine what I would do without it."
msgstr "내겐 삶의 목적을 부여해 주었지... 이 목적이 없으면 무얼 할지 상상도 되지 않는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Devotion can give a life purpose, but it must be given carefully.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B8"
msgid "As for the rest, I agree. Devotion given blindly will fade in time."
msgstr "나머지는 나도 동의한다오. 맹목적인 헌신은 끝을 다하게 된다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
