#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.
