#. TOPIC: 011119EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B7"
msgid "True and lasting devotion must be given with a strength of conviction."
msgstr "진심이며 영속적인 헌신은 확고한 신념으로 주어져야 하는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world. &&& VijunAhkmav: Wise words, my friend. |No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made. &&& VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions. &&& VijunAhkmav: What did you think of the Words of Devotion?|Did you agree with them? Or did you have a different perspective?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think that is true to some extent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B6"
msgid "Anyone who demands devotion is just trying to exploit people."
msgstr "남에게 헌신을 강요하는 자는 그냥 사람들을 착취하려고 그러는 것뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anyone who demands devotion is just trying to exploit people.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anyone who demands devotion is just trying to exploit people.
