#. TOPIC: 011119EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B4"
msgid "Though not all who desire devotion are of ill intent."
msgstr "헌신을 원하는 자 모두가 악의를 가진 건 아니지만 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anyone who demands devotion is just trying to exploit people.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
