#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B3"
msgid "Sometimes, the longing for devotion stems from vanity, or a desire to be loved."
msgstr "때때로 헌신에 대한 갈망은 허영심이나 사랑받고 싶은 욕망에서 비롯되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely. &&& VijunAhkmav: Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion.|I have learned in my many years that a people united in devotion can accomplish great things. &&& VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.|I think I can guess your answer, but I'll ask all the same.|How did you feel about the Words of Obedience?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed! Law and authority provide society with order and structure.
