#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B2"
msgid "Obedience to law and authority is the backbone of society."
msgstr "법과 권력에 대한 복종은 사회의 중추라 할 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Obedience to law and authority is the backbone of society.
