#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137B1"
msgid "Indeed! Law and authority provide society with order and structure."
msgstr "그렇소! 법과 권력은 사회에 질서와 구조를 제공해 준다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
