#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed, just as the Great Serpent has a tail that follows the head, so we lead and we follow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A8"
msgid "It's human nature to organize into leaders and followers."
msgstr "원래 지도자를 세우고 추종자들이 뒤를 따르는 건 인간의 본능입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's human nature to organize into leaders and followers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's human nature to organize into leaders and followers.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A7"
msgid "Indeed, just as the Great Serpent has a tail that follows the head, so we lead and we follow."
msgstr "그렇소. 위대한 뱀께서도 머리를 따라 움직이는 꼬리가 있듯이 우리도 서로를 이끌고 따르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's human nature to organize into leaders and followers.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
