#. TOPIC: 011119E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A6"
msgid "It is the way of things. The natural order."
msgstr "세상만사가 다 그렇소. 순리와 같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability. &&& VijunAhkmav: I find that to be true as well.|I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter.|His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them.|When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice.|You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice. &&& VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.|These Words have the greatest appeal to the young and adventurous. Who does not wish to be strong?|Many of us, however, see them as an uncomfortable reminder of a more violent time.|As a result, there are many who question the value of the Words of Strength when compared to the rest. |After all, is not strength the most likely to diminish with the passage of time?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At my age, I'm inclined to agree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A5"
msgid "Strength isn't important. It's intelligence that matters."
msgstr "위력은 중요한 것이 아닙니다. 그 지적 능력이 중요한 것이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell... &&& companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.|You could not possibly be referring to me. &&& VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.|Did those Words ring true for you?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps that is true. There is another possibility, also.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A4"
msgid "People who give up easily are weak."
msgstr "쉽게 포기하는 사람들은 다 나약한 자들이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: People who give up easily are weak.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: People who give up easily are weak.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A3"
msgid "Perhaps that is true. There is another possibility, also."
msgstr "그게 맞을지 모르겠소. 그러나 다른 가능성도 있다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: People who give up easily are weak.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A2"
msgid "Perhaps such a person is seeking an endeavor that captures their interest and is worthy of their time."
msgstr "포기하는 사람조차 자신이 내어 줄 시간에 걸맞는 관심사의 노력을 기울이고 싶어 할 뿐인지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: People who give up easily are weak.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A1"
msgid "In such a case, perseverance for its own sake seems foolish and wasteful."
msgstr "그렇다면 억지로 인내하는 것이 오히려 바보 같고 헛된 짓이라 할 수 있소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: People who give up easily are weak.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0137A0"
msgid "I believe there are times when giving up is wisdom and not weakness."
msgstr "나는 포기하는 것도 지혜로우며, 나약하지 않은 것일 수 있다고 믿소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379F"
msgid "I find that to be true as well."
msgstr "나도 그 말이 사실이라고 믿소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379E"
msgid "I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter."
msgstr "내 할아버지가 떠오르는군. 그분은 화가셨소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379D"
msgid "His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them."
msgstr "그분의 붓끝에서 참으로 아름다운 경관이 탄생하였지. 어렸을 때 난 그 그림들에 홀딱 빠졌소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379C"
msgid "When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice."
msgstr "그분께 어찌 그게 가능한 것이냐 물었더니 재능이 아니라 꾸준히 연습한 결과라 하셨소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379B"
msgid "You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice."
msgstr "할아버지는 화가로서 뛰어난 재능을 갖추지 못했으나 열심히 연습하셔서 이겨낸 것이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell... &&& companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.|You could not possibly be referring to me. &&& VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.|Did those Words ring true for you?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I find that to be true as well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01379A"
msgid "Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability."
msgstr "인내는 아주 중요한 것입니다. 스스로의 능력이 떨어지더라도 그 노력으로 벌충할 수 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Throw in a brief chuckle at the start / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength isn't important. It's intelligence that matters.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Strength isn't important. It's intelligence that matters.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013799"
msgid "At my age, I'm inclined to agree."
msgstr "이 나이에 듣는 말이니, 맞는 것 같소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength isn't important. It's intelligence that matters.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013798"
msgid "Perhaps we can agree that strength of mind is as valuable and important as any other kind."
msgstr "우리 모두 정신력이 여타 다른 것과 마찬가지로 귀하고 중요한 거라 인정할 수 있겠구료."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability. &&& VijunAhkmav: I find that to be true as well.|I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter.|His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them.|When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice.|You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice. &&& VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.|These Words have the greatest appeal to the young and adventurous. Who does not wish to be strong?|Many of us, however, see them as an uncomfortable reminder of a more violent time.|As a result, there are many who question the value of the Words of Strength when compared to the rest. |After all, is not strength the most likely to diminish with the passage of time?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Interesting. I had not considered that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013797"
msgid "Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun."
msgstr "모두가 총을 꺼내 들 수 있는 세상이니 위력이란 건 아무런 의미도 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking aloud / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013796"
msgid "Interesting. I had not considered that."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 그런 것은 생각해 본 적이 없소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013795"
msgid "It is true that some weapons are as simple to operate as they are lethal."
msgstr "일부 무기는 이제 치명적인 수준 만큼 사용법마저 단순한 게 사실이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013794"
msgid "Does it truly require strength to point such a weapon at someone and end their life?"
msgstr "총구를 사람에게 겨눠 목숨을 앗아가는 데 근력이 필요키나 하겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013793"
msgid "Yet, there are other kinds of strength. Strength of conviction, of will, or belief and so forth."
msgstr "그러나 위력이란 여러 종류가 있지. 스스로의 확신이나 의지, 신념의 힘 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Strength is meaningless when anyone can pick up a gun.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013792"
msgid "Perhaps the way in which we define strength says something about us as individuals."
msgstr "위력이란 무엇인가 정의를 내리는 기준이야말로 서로가 어떤 사람인지 알 수 있는 지평이 될 수 있을지 모르겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VijunAhkmav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Is any place truly safe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013791"
msgid "Are you sure it's safe to be alone out here?"
msgstr "저 바깥이 돌아다니는 데 안전한 게 맞습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: This is said with a heavy heart, given the recent catastrophe in the city. Somber. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure it's safe to be alone out here?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013790"
msgid "Is any place truly safe?"
msgstr "근데, 안전한 장소가 어디 있겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber, sad, trailing off / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378F"
msgid "For so long, the city seemed to be the safest place. But now..."
msgstr "아주 오랫동안 도시는 안전한 곳이라 여겨졌으나, 이제는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378E"
msgid "At my age, I know that my time to join the Great Serpent among the endless stars is not far off."
msgstr "이 나이가 되면 곧 나도 위대한 뱀과 함께 영원한 별 사이를 떠돌게 될 것임을 직감하게 된다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Certain, unafraid / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378D"
msgid "When that time comes, a shrine is as good a place as any to be."
msgstr "그 때가 되면 성소도 여타 다른 곳과 다를 바 없이 충분하다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VijunAhkmav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: My daughter, her husband and their two children were all taken.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378C"
msgid "Did you lose anyone to the calamity in the city?"
msgstr "도시에서 발생한 재난 때문에 혹시 친지를 잃었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, heavy heart. / Sad / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you lose anyone to the calamity in the city?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378B"
msgid "My daughter, her husband and their two children were all taken."
msgstr "내 딸과 사위, 그리고 두 손주까지 전부 잃었다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01378A"
msgid "But lost? I do not think they are truly lost."
msgstr "그렇지만 진심으로 잃었다고 생각하지 않는다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013789"
msgid "It was their time to join the Great Serpent."
msgstr "먼저 때가 되어 위대한 뱀을 맞이하러 간 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Managing a small smile, but still in pain over the loss of loved ones / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 011119D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_VijunTL2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013788"
msgid "I know that I will be with them again, and that will be a joyous day."
msgstr "나도 먼저 간 아이들을 따라갈 것이고, 그땐 참으로 기쁜 날이 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you a priest?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you a priest?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0100776D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013787"
msgid "Nothing of the sort."
msgstr "전혀 그렇지 않소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you a priest?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0100776D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013786"
msgid "I'm just an old man seeking solace in troubled times."
msgstr "나는 그저 이 힘든 시기에 위안을 찾는 늙은이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013785"
msgid "Greetings, my friend!"
msgstr "반갑소, 친구여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Please do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013784"
msgid "Have you changed your mind? Shall I tell you about the Path of Redemption?"
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었소? 구원의 길에 관해 말해 줘도 좋겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Please do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071557
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013783"
msgid "Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path."
msgstr "그대의 친절은 선물과 같군. 길에 대해 설명하는 데 더없이 기쁘게 해 주니 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is that why you're here? For redemption?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Please do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071555
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013782"
msgid "This place has always made me feel closer to the Great Serpent, and that is a comfort."
msgstr "이곳에 오면 항상 위대한 뱀께 더 가까워지는 기분이 들게 되었지. 그래서 위안이 된다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A sly wink and nod / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to take in the sights, so I'll visit these Wayshrines.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071552
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013781"
msgid "And who knows, you might even find more than you seek."
msgstr "혹시 누가 알겠소, 그대가 원한 바 그 이상을 깨닫고 돌아갈 수 있을지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to take in the sights, so I'll visit these Wayshrines.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: As personally gratifying as such a journey could be, it admittedly could take some time. Are you sure?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071552
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013780"
msgid "Wisdom, perhaps, if your mind is open to it."
msgstr "예로, 지혜를 얻을 수 있소. 그대가 마음만 연다면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How safe is this journey? Is the Path guarded?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How safe is this journey? Is the Path guarded?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0100776B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01377F"
msgid "It is not, nor are the shrines themselves."
msgstr "위험하다오, 각 성소들도 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How safe is this journey? Is the Path guarded?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I will prove to the Great Serpent that I am worthy of redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0100776B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01377E"
msgid "The danger of the Path is a part of the test, for redemption is given to the worthy, not the weak."
msgstr "길을 걸으며 만나는 위험 또한 시험의 일부라오. 나약하지 않고, 자격을 갖춘 자에게만 구원이 주어진다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: No, no, of course not. I only wish that it be an enlightening experience for you.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01377D"
msgid "Here, you'll need this."
msgstr "자, 이게 필요할 것이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ran-JEEK DOE-zuh / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01377C"
msgid "It's my copy of the original Path of Redemption, written years ago by the honored Ranjik Dosza."
msgstr "내가 가진 구원의 길 원본을 복사해 주겠소. 예전에 위대하신 란지크 도스자께서 쓰신 책이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01377B"
msgid "It was he who first walked the Path, guided by the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 인도하에 처음으로 길을 걸으신 분이시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01377A"
msgid "Begin reading it here, and follow the steps carefully."
msgstr "여기서 책을 읽고 그 내용을 조심스럽게 따라 걸으시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't really learn anything that surprised me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013779"
msgid "It's probably just as well that they were not a surprise to you."
msgstr "아마 그 내용들도 그대에게 놀랍지 않은 것들이라 그럴지 모르겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Conspiratorial, said quietly in nearly a whisper / Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I chart my own course and I answer to no one.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013778"
msgid "It is best to keep such words and thoughts to yourself."
msgstr "그런 말이나 생각은 입 밖으로 내놓지 않는 게 좋겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I chart my own course and I answer to no one.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013777"
msgid "There are those who might mistake such boldness for betrayal against the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그런 말을 하면 위대한 뱀을 배신하는 소리로 오해받을 수 있으니 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disdain, disapproving / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013776"
msgid "Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor."
msgstr "그건 그냥 형편없는 유머 감각을 뽐낸 것뿐이겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cold / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013775"
msgid "You could not possibly be referring to me."
msgstr "그거 나한테 하는 말은 전혀 아니겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Skeptical, irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013774"
msgid "Complete obedience, huh? Well that's news to me."
msgstr "철저한 복종 말인가? 퍽이나 처음 듣는 얘기네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, taken aback / Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013773"
msgid "I beg your pardon?"
msgstr "뭐라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013772"
msgid "If it's a mindless drone you want at your side, perhaps I should go my own way."
msgstr "네 곁에 아무 생각도 못하는 일벌레가 필요했던 거라면, 그냥 서로 헤어지는 게 낫겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013771"
msgid "Many of us, however, see them as an uncomfortable reminder of a more violent time."
msgstr "하지만 우리 중 많은 사람들은 폭력이 팽배했던 시대를 상기시키는 불쾌한 것으로 여긴다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013770"
msgid "As a result, there are many who question the value of the Words of Strength when compared to the rest."
msgstr "그 결과, 다른 것들과 비교했을 때 위력의 말씀이 갖는 가치에 의문을 품는 사람들이 많다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, grateful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01376F"
msgid "I enjoyed our talk."
msgstr "즐거운 대화였소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, grateful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01376E"
msgid "Thank you again for speaking with me. It was time well spent."
msgstr "나와 대화해 줘서 다시 한번 고맙소. 전혀 아깝지 않은 시간이었소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, grateful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01376D"
msgid "I will think about your answers to my questions."
msgstr "나의 질문에 그대가 답해 준 것들에 생각해 보겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, grateful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01376C"
msgid "I hope that you will remember the Words of the Wayshrines. Let them be a guide."
msgstr "부디 성소의 말씀들을 기억하고 그대의 앞길을 인도하도록 해 주시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "01376B"
msgid "What is happening to me?"
msgstr "나에게 무슨 일이 일어난 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "01376A"
msgid "Where am I? What are you!"
msgstr "여기가 어디지? 넌 누구냐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hit, but you're lost in the void and don't know what's hitting you / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "013769"
msgid "Argh! I'm being attacked!"
msgstr "아악! 공격받고 있어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013768"
msgid "Where am I? What manner of world is this?"
msgstr "여긴 어디지? 도대체 어떤 세상이길래?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013766"
msgid "I have lost the corporeal..."
msgstr "육신을 잃었도다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013765"
msgid "I walk seeking the light, but find no quarter."
msgstr "빛을 찾아 헤매지만, 안식처는 없구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013764"
msgid "The darkness, it's everywhere!"
msgstr "어둠이, 사방에 가득해!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013763"
msgid "Has He forsaken me?"
msgstr "그분께서 날 버리셨나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013762"
msgid "Has death come upon me?"
msgstr "죽음이 나에게 닥친 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013761"
msgid "What has become of me?"
msgstr "나는 어찌 된 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013760"
msgid "I walk, but see no steps!"
msgstr "걷고 있지만, 발자국이 보이지 않아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris:  &&& Ekris: Did Viktor finally relinquish the access code?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Slowly but surely. It's a shame the Houses aren't more forthcoming. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013751"
msgid "How is your work coming along?"
msgstr "작업은 어떻게 진행되고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111464
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013750"
msgid "Is everything going smoothly for you so far?"
msgstr "지금까지 모든 일이 순조롭게 진행되고 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111464
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374F"
msgid "Are you feeling good about your work?"
msgstr "당신의 연구에 만족하고 계시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374E"
msgid "I am certain the Great Serpent guides me, and yet I find myself doubting every other move."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 저를 인도하고 계시다는 건 확신하지만, 다른 모든 행동에 대해선 의심이 듭니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374D"
msgid "While my faith is certain, every theory, every equation, every number gives me pause."
msgstr "제 신앙은 확고하지만, 모든 이론, 모든 방정식, 모든 숫자가 저를 망설이게 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374C"
msgid "It's a constant battle of confidence and self-doubt."
msgstr "자신감과 자기 의심 사이의 끊임없는 싸움입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111137D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374B"
msgid "If we're wrong, we may lose the rest of Dazra. I know. But we also may lose it if we do nothing."
msgstr "우리가 틀리면, 나머지 다즈라를 잃을 수도 있습니다. 알고 있습니다. 하지만 아무것도 하지 않아도 잃을 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111137D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01374A"
msgid "I share both your fears and your experiences. We all do. I don't believe any one of us have worked with so many unknowns."
msgstr "저도 당신의 두려움과 경험을 공유하고 있습니다. 우리 모두가요. 우리 중 누구도 이렇게 많은 미지의 것과 싸워본 적은 없을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111137D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013749"
msgid "I know. We're all under a tremendous amount of pressure, but we must see this through."
msgstr "알고 있습니다. 우리 모두 엄청난 압박감에 시달리고 있지만, 이 일을 끝까지 해내야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111145C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013748"
msgid "Our faith will get us through it. It's the only voice inside pushing me past the fear."
msgstr "우리의 신앙이 우리를 이끌어 줄 겁니다. 제 안에서 두려움을 이겨내도록 밀어주는 유일한 목소리입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111145C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013747"
msgid "When I accepted this challenge, I never realized how great the responsibility would be until we started to assemble to Device."
msgstr "이 도전을 받아들였을 때, 이 장치를 조립하기 전까진 이 책임이 얼마나 막중한지 전혀 몰랐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111145C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013746"
msgid "I see the look on the faces of our Brethren and know that failure is not an option."
msgstr "우리 교우들의 얼굴에 떠오른 표정을 보면서 실패는 있을 수 없다는 걸 깨닫습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111145C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013745"
msgid "All we can do is our best, right? Let's just hope our best is good enough."
msgstr "우리가 할 수 있는 건 최선을 다하는 것뿐이지요, 그렇죠? 그저 우리의 최선이 충분하기를 바랄 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111386
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013744"
msgid "We can't afford even the slightest mistake."
msgstr "우리는 사소한 실수조차도 용납할 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111386
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013743"
msgid "Even the slightest chance for error..."
msgstr "사소한 실수라도 저지른다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02
#. TOPIC: 0111132B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111386
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013742"
msgid "The repercussions if we're wrong..."
msgstr "우리가 틀리면 그 후폭풍은..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111339
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111139D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013740"
msgid "You summoned me?"
msgstr "저를 부르셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111339
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111139D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373F"
msgid "I was told you were looking for me?"
msgstr "저를 찾으셨다고 들었습니다만?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111339
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111139D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373E"
msgid "Is there something you needed, Brethren?"
msgstr "무슨 일이십니까, 교우님?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111338
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373D"
msgid "Yes, the investigation you are running. I was told it needs to stop."
msgstr "네, 당신이 진행 중인 조사를 중단하라는 지시를 받았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111338
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373C"
msgid "Unfortunately, yes. I need to reassign you."
msgstr "유감스럽게도, 그렇습니다. 당신을 다른 곳으로 재배정해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111338
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373B"
msgid "I hate to be the one to tell you, but they are discontinuing the investigation into your current subject."
msgstr "이런 말을 하게 돼 유감이지만, 당신이 현재 조사 중인 대상에 대한 조사를 중단한다고 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111337
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01373A"
msgid "No. Tell me this is not House Ka'dic interfering with Ministry of State affairs."
msgstr "안 됩니다. 설마 카딕 가문이 국무성의 일에 간섭하는 건 아니겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111337
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013739"
msgid "But my work has been nothing but solid from the very beginning. This is Hasmak's handiwork, is it not?"
msgstr "하지만 제 업무는 처음부터 매우 훌륭했습니다. 이건 해즈막의 소행이겠지요, 안 그렇습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111337
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013738"
msgid "I knew this would happen. The moment I knew the subject was part of a noble House, I knew I would be shut down."
msgstr "이럴 줄 알았습니다. 조사 대상이 명문 가문의 일원이라는 걸 안 순간, 조사가 중단될 줄 알았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111337
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013737"
msgid "Why allow me to even waste the time?"
msgstr "그럼 왜 시간을 낭비하게 내버려 둔 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013736"
msgid "Watch yourself. No one shares your view more than I, but I would not dare to say more."
msgstr "조심하십시오. 당신의 견해에 저만큼 공감하는 사람은 없지만, 감히 더는 말하지 않겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013735"
msgid "Accept your duty and channel that energy into your next assignment."
msgstr "당신의 의무를 받아들이고 그 에너지를 다음 임무에 쏟으십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013734"
msgid "Ours is a complex world and you know it, so careful what you say in public."
msgstr "우리가 사는 세상은 복잡합니다. 그러니 공개적으로 말할 때는 조심하십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013733"
msgid "You and I both know those are matters not to be discussed."
msgstr "당신과 나 둘 다 그런 문제는 논의할 사안이 아니라는 걸 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013732"
msgid "Move on and refocus. You know the drill."
msgstr "이제 그만하고 다시 집중하십시오. 어떻게 해야 하는지 알지 않습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111341
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013730"
msgid "Greetings, fellow Promised. Have you had time to look over the report?"
msgstr "안녕하십니까, 약속받은 자여. 보고서를 검토할 시간은 있으셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111341
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372F"
msgid "Serpent's blessings. I have come to inquire about the report I sent you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길. 제가 보낸 보고서에 대해 여쭤보려고 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111341
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372E"
msgid "Have had you had a moment to evaluate the report I sent you?"
msgstr "제가 보낸 보고서를 검토할 시간은 있으셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111340
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372D"
msgid "I have, and I believe your investigation to be true, as sad as it may be."
msgstr "검토해 보았고, 슬프게도 당신의 조사가 사실이라고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111340
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372C"
msgid "Indeed. I will have my official response finished soon, but I believe you are correct."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 곧 공식 답변을 마무리 짓겠지만, 당신이 옳다고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01111340
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372B"
msgid "I was only able to skim it for now, but my initial impulse is that your concerns are justified."
msgstr "지금은 대충 훑어보기만 했지만, 제 직감으로는 당신의 우려가 타당한 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01372A"
msgid "I appreciate your insight. Especially since we do no make these decisions lightly."
msgstr "이런 결정을 가볍게 내리지 않는다는 점을 잘 알고 계시기에, 당신의 통찰력에 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013729"
msgid "Thank you. Additional perspectives help me recognize I am on the right path."
msgstr "감사합니다. 다른 관점은 제가 올바른 길을 가고 있다는 것을 깨닫는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113A3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013728"
msgid "I am relieved you agree, although in truth, I was hoping I was incorrect."
msgstr "제가 틀렸기를 바랐지만, 동의해 주시니 안심이 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111460
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013727"
msgid "It is our duty to root out heresy, and you have done yours well."
msgstr "이단을 뿌리 뽑는 것이 우리의 의무이고, 당신은 그 의무를 잘 수행했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111460
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013726"
msgid "Everyone knows the consequences for heresy. Heresy is treason, and treason is punishable by death."
msgstr "이단의 대가는 누구나 알고 있습니다. 이단은 반역이고, 반역은 사형에 처해집니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111460
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013725"
msgid "Do not carry this weight on your shoulders. The heretics bring it upon themselves."
msgstr "이 짐을 혼자 짊어지지 마십시오. 이단자들이 자초한 일입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01
#. TOPIC: 0111133E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111460
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013724"
msgid "Heresy comes in many forms, but you have come to learn its many guises well. Well done, Warden."
msgstr "이단은 여러 형태로 나타나지만, 당신은 그 많은 가면을 잘 파악했습니다. 잘하셨습니다. 교정관."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111349
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013722"
msgid "Did you get those reports written?"
msgstr "보고서 작성은 다 끝났나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111349
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013721"
msgid "Are you almost done with that paperwork?"
msgstr "서류 작업은 거의 다 끝났나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111349
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013720"
msgid "How's is the documentation going?"
msgstr "문서 작업은 어떻게 되어가고 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111348
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371F"
msgid "Please, I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "제발, 그 얘기는 하고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111348
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371E"
msgid "Stop reminding me. I'm drowning as it is."
msgstr "그만 좀 상기시켜 줘. 지금도 머리가 터질 지경이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111348
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371D"
msgid "Ugh, my mind goes numb at the thought of it."
msgstr "아, 생각만 해도 머리가 멍해지네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111347
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371C"
msgid "Would you rather be out in the field among the heretics?"
msgstr "차라리 이단자들 사이에서 현장 업무를 하는 게 낫지 않겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111347
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371B"
msgid "At least you're not risking your life out there in the Settled Systems."
msgstr "적어도 개척 성계에서 목숨 걸고 일하지는 않잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111347
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111138F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01371A"
msgid "I'd take the burden over reports over the secrecy that our agents have to keep any day."
msgstr "난 차라리 우리 요원들이 지켜야 하는 비밀보다 보고서 작성이 낫겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013719"
msgid "They may risk their lives to stay hidden among the enemy, but conversion and subversion is our Ministry's true work."
msgstr "적들 사이에 숨어 지내기 위해 목숨을 걸어야 할 수도 있지만, 개종과 전복이야말로 우리 부처의 진정한 임무지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013718"
msgid "I will always envy that."
msgstr "그 점은 언제나 부러워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013717"
msgid "I won't argue that. And I heard it's impossible to find decent koza out there."
msgstr "그건 나도 동의해. 그리고 그곳에선 괜찮은 코자를 찾을 수 없다는 말도 들었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013716"
msgid "I can't imagine doing that kind of work and not being able to find a decent drink."
msgstr "그런 일을 하면서 괜찮은 술 한잔도 못 마신다는 건 상상도 할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013715"
msgid "As much I hate to say it, I know you're right. I'd be a terrible agent."
msgstr "이런 말 하긴 싫지만, 네 말이 맞아. 난 끔찍한 요원이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Jovial. / Confident / to Envoy02
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02
#. TOPIC: 01111346
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113EC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013714"
msgid "I may be able to keep a secret with the best of them, but when it comes to improvising on the go, I'd be exposed in a heartbeat."
msgstr "비밀을 지키는 데는 누구보다 자신 있지만, 즉흥적으로 행동해야 한다면 금방 들통날 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013712"
msgid "Any news from your agent?"
msgstr "자네 요원에게서 무슨 소식이라도 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013711"
msgid "Have you heard anything back yet?"
msgstr "뭐 연락 온 거라도 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113BF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013710"
msgid "Did you get an update yet?"
msgstr "새로운 소식이라도 들었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370F"
msgid "None. I fear the worst."
msgstr "아니. 최악의 상황이 걱정되는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370E"
msgid "Nothing yet. I'm beginning to worry."
msgstr "아직 아무것도. 걱정이 되기 시작했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370D"
msgid "Not a thing. It's very... disconcerting."
msgstr "아무것도. 정말... 불안하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113FA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370C"
msgid "Don't worry. If they were exposed in New Atlantis, we'd have heard by now."
msgstr "걱정하지 말게. 뉴아틀란티스에서 발각되었다면, 벌써 소식을 들었을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113FA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370B"
msgid "They'll be fine. Not a lot of questions asked in Neon."
msgstr "괜찮을 거야. 네온에선 별로 질문을 하지 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113FA
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01370A"
msgid "You worry to much. Besides, Akila City is one of the easiest stations there is."
msgstr "너무 걱정하지 말게. 게다가 아킬라 시티는 가장 쉬운 기지 중 하나니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111395
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013709"
msgid "You're right. The Great Serpent protects."
msgstr "자네 말이 맞아. 위대한 뱀께서 보호하실 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Joking a bit. / Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111395
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013708"
msgid "Even so, I'm a worrier at heart. Perhaps this wasn't the best line of work for me."
msgstr "그렇긴 해도, 난 원래 걱정이 많은 성격이야. 아마 이 일은 나에게 가장 적합한 일은 아니었을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01
#. TOPIC: 0111134A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111395
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013707"
msgid "A fair point, but if I don't hear back soon, I'll be looking for an investigation approval."
msgstr "일리가 있군. 하지만 곧 소식이 없다면, 조사 승인을 요청할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111345
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013705"
msgid "How's your day been? Hopefully better than mine."
msgstr "오늘 하루 어땠나? 내 하루보다는 낫기를 바라네만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111345
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013704"
msgid "How are you? Things are... uneventful, I hope?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내나? 별일 없기를 바라네만?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Envoy01
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111345
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013703"
msgid "Taking a break? I sure could use one."
msgstr "잠깐 쉬는 중인가? 나도 좀 쉬고 싶군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111343
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113CC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013702"
msgid "Better here than finding ways to be as invasive as possible like House Veth'aal."
msgstr "베타알 가문처럼 가능한 한 모든 곳에 참견하는 것보다는 여기가 낫지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111343
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113CC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013701"
msgid "I'll take being an Envoy over a Warden any day. Investigating our own... It's just wrong."
msgstr "난 차라리 교정관보다는 대표가 되겠어. 우리 안의 누군가를 조사하다니... 그건 옳지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02:  &&& Envoy01: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111343
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113CC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013700"
msgid "At least you're not working for Viktor. He'd probably work you twice as hard, and tell you your service to the Great Serpent is payment enough."
msgstr "적어도 자넨 빅토르 밑에서 일하진 않잖아. 그 자는 아마 자네에게 두 배로 일을 시키고, 위대한 뱀에 대한 봉사가 충분한 수당이라고 말할 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111344
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111367
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FF"
msgid "*sigh* Just another day in the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "*한숨* 또 결합성의 하루가 시작됐군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111344
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111367
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FE"
msgid "You know how it is. Never a dull moment when it comes to Conjunction."
msgstr "어떤지 잘 알잖아. 결합성에 관해서는 지루할 틈이 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: MoC = M.O.C. stands for the Ministry of Conjunction. Separate letters like DoD for Dept of Defense. / Concerned / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111344
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111367
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FD"
msgid "What I wouldn't give for one uneventful day in the MoC."
msgstr "상무성에서 단 하루라도 별일 없는 날을 보낼 수 있다면 얼마나 좋을까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111342
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113AC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FC"
msgid "Say no more. Or House Dul'kehf with probably twice the paperwork and four times the monotony."
msgstr "더 이상 말하지 말게. 서류 작업은 두 배나 많고 단조로움은 네 배나 되는 둘케프 가문이라면 어떻겠나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111342
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113AC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FB"
msgid "For me, it's being an Executor for Commerce. I'm not sure life gets more dull than that."
msgstr "나는 상무성 실무관 일이 지루해. 이보다 더 지루한 직업은 없을 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Envoy01:  &&& Envoy02: 
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111342
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113AC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136FA"
msgid "Heh, Commerce is the only branch that really irritates me."
msgstr "흥, 상무성은 정말 짜증 나는 곳이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111342
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113AC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F9"
msgid "I may complain about our level of secrecy and paperwork, but at least we deal in subterfuge and security."
msgstr "우리의 비밀 유지와 서류 작업에 대해 불평할 수도 있지만, 적어도 우리는 속임수와 보안을 다루고 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Envoy02
#. ALIAS: Envoy01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03
#. TOPIC: 01111342
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseKadic03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113AC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F8"
msgid "Dul'kehf hoards information for their own self-importance, and they deal with common smugglers."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 자기 잇속만 차리려고 정보를 쌓아두고, 그저 그런 밀수업자나 상대하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111458
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F6"
msgid "Greetings, brethren. Keeping busy, I hope."
msgstr "안녕하십니까, 교우님. 바쁘게 지내시길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111458
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F5"
msgid "Hello. You look preoccupied."
msgstr "안녕하십니까. 골똘히 생각에 잠겨 있는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111458
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F4"
msgid "I have returned. Still busy, I see."
msgstr "돌아왔습니다. 여전히 바쁘신 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111382
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F3"
msgid "Of course. You know what they say about idle hands."
msgstr "물론이지. 손 놓고 있는 것에 대해 뭐라고 하는지 잘 알지 않나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111382
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F2"
msgid "Always. Especially since the incident."
msgstr "항상 그렇습니다. 특히 그 사고 이후로는요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111382
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F1"
msgid "That is the very definition of us Wardens."
msgstr "그것이 바로 우리 교정관의 의미입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113DC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136F0"
msgid "If only all of Dazra shared our values. How different this city would be."
msgstr "다즈라의 모든 이들이 우리의 가치를 공유했더라면 얼마나 좋았을까요. 이 도시는 얼마나 달라졌을까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113DC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136EF"
msgid "I have never understood idleness. Why waste precious time on yourself when it could be used in devotion to the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "저는 한가함을 이해한 적이 없습니다. 위대한 뱀에 대한 헌신에 사용될 수 있는 소중한 시간을 왜 자신을 위해 낭비하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden02:  &&& Warden01: 
#. ALIAS: Warden02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113DC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136EE"
msgid "I often wonder if we forced the bereaved to work in His service, if it would help."
msgstr "저는 종종 상실의 슬픔을 겪는 자들에게 그 분을 위한 일에 강제로 복무하게 한다면, 도움이 될지 궁금합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136ED"
msgid "The Great Serpent expects full devotion of mind and body from us all."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 우리 모두에게 몸과 마음을 다한 헌신을 기대하십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136EC"
msgid "This incident that affected our great city will test everyone. It will either make one stronger, or fall to heresy and doubt."
msgstr "우리 위대한 도시에 영향을 미친 이 사고는 모두를 시험할 것입니다. 이 시험은 사람을 더 강하게 만들거나, 이단과 의심에 빠지게 만들겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136EB"
msgid "We can only observe and remove the detritus as it floats to the top."
msgstr "우리는 그저 관찰하고 위로 떠오르는 찌꺼기를 제거할 수 있을 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136EA"
msgid "I have often wondered myself, and we can only hope the Great Serpent recognizes our devotion when we finally walk at His side."
msgstr "저도 자주 궁금해했고, 우리가 마침내 그 분의 곁을 걷게 될 때 위대한 뱀께서 우리의 헌신을 알아주시길 바랄 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Warden01:  &&& Warden02: 
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E9"
msgid "If the grieved could focus on their devotion to the Great Serpent, Dazra would be well on its way to a restoration plan."
msgstr "만약 슬픔에 잠긴 자들이 위대한 뱀에 대한 헌신에 집중할 수 있다면, 다즈라는 복구 계획을 잘 진행할 수 있을 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E8"
msgid "Instead, they mourn for our lost brethren who have already been elevated to the Great Serpent's side."
msgstr "대신 그들은 이미 위대한 뱀의 곁으로 올라가신, 우리가 잃은 교우들을 위해 애도하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02
#. TOPIC: 0111133A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal02_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C3
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E7"
msgid "They should be celebrating. It makes no sense."
msgstr "그들은 축하해야 합니다. 이해할 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111335
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E5"
msgid "I fear my calculations are off. Can you check them again?"
msgstr "제 계산이 틀린 것 같습니다. 다시 한번 확인해 주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111335
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E4"
msgid "Would you mind confirming my data?"
msgstr "제 데이터를 확인해 주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111335
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E3"
msgid "I need your insight. The numbers I have... Do you have time to check them?"
msgstr "도움이 필요합니다. 제가 가진 숫자들이... 확인해 주실 시간 있으십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scientist01:  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111334
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111399
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E2"
msgid "Of course. We can't afford to be incorrect at a time like this."
msgstr "물론입니다. 지금과 같은 시기에는 틀리면 안 되니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scientist01:  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111334
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111399
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E1"
msgid "Let me see."
msgstr "보여주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scientist01:  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111334
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111399
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136E0"
msgid "Gladly. The more eyes the better."
msgstr "기꺼이. 많이 볼수록 좋지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01:   &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111333
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111363
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DF"
msgid "Serpent grant me strength, thank you. I've been staring at them for way too long now."
msgstr "뱀이시여 제게 힘을 주소서, 감사합니다. 너무 오랫동안 보고 있었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01:   &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111333
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111363
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DE"
msgid "You've no idea the relief you just granted me."
msgstr "얼마나 큰 안도감을 주셨는지 모르실 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01:  &&& Scientist01:   &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111333
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111363
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DD"
msgid "That's what I was hoping, but I find my mental capacity to be severely depleted at this point."
msgstr "저도 그러길 바랐지만, 지금 제 정신 능력이 심각하게 고갈된 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DC"
msgid "We're all tired, but persevering, so you are wise to ask for confirmation."
msgstr "우리 모두 지쳤지만, 인내하고 있습니다. 그러니 확인을 요청하신 건 현명한 선택입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DB"
msgid "Just be ready to return the favor."
msgstr "나중에 은혜를 갚을 준비나 하십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136DA"
msgid "I understand completely. I went through the same thing myself just a few hours ago."
msgstr "완전히 이해합니다. 저도 불과 몇 시간 전에 똑같은 일을 겪었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D9"
msgid "Just get some rest if needed. We can't afford mistakes."
msgstr "필요하면 쉬십시오. 실수는 용납할 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113C8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D8"
msgid "The Great Serpent challenges us all with this one. As long as we're as diligent as you, I pray we're successful."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 시험하시는군요. 당신만큼 부지런하다면, 우리가 성공하기를 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Warden02
#. ALIAS: Warden01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01111336
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HouseVethaal03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111378
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D7"
msgid "Move on and refocus. You know the drill."
msgstr "이제 그만하고 다시 집중하십시오. 어떻게 해야 하는지 알지 않습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111331
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111374
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D6"
msgid "These look good to me."
msgstr "제 눈에는 좋아 보입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111331
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111374
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D5"
msgid "Solid work. I don't see any issues."
msgstr "훌륭합니다. 아무런 문제도 보이지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01
#. TOPIC: 01111331
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice01_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01111374
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D4"
msgid "I couldn't have done it better myself."
msgstr "저라도 이보다 더 잘할 수는 없을 겁니다."

# EDID: [0111138E], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "0136D3"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 0111132A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D1"
msgid "Any new updates or concerns?"
msgstr "새로운 업데이트나 우려 사항이 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 0111132A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136D0"
msgid "Your progress is looking good. How are you feeling about it?"
msgstr "연구 진행 상황이 좋아 보입니다. 어떻게 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Scientist01
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 0111132A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113F6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CF"
msgid "Do you have anything worth noting for Ekris?"
msgstr "에크리스에게 보고할 만한 사항이 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CE"
msgid "Well, I can't do any true testing without power grid access."
msgstr "음, 전력망 접속 없이는 제대로 된 테스트를 할 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CD"
msgid "I simply don't see how any real progress can be made without Sahima's research."
msgstr "사히마의 연구 없이는 실질적인 진전이 있을 수 없다고 봅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CC"
msgid "Well, I'm still hoping House Dul'kehf could provide some background for the basis of this situation, but I'm also not holding my breath."
msgstr "음, 저는 여전히 둘케프 가문이 이 상황의 기반에 대한 배경 지식을 제공해 줄 수 있기를 바라고 있지만, 큰 기대는 하지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being lighthearted over a heavy situation. / Sarcastic / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CB"
msgid "Only about a dozen items that could mean life or death"
msgstr "생사가 걸린 문제가 한 열두 가지 정도?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136CA"
msgid "Please don't ask me that anymore. You know the answer."
msgstr "더 이상 묻지 말아 주십시오. 답은 알고 계시지 않습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being lighthearted over a heavy situation. / Sarcastic / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111329
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113D5
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C9"
msgid "Nothing and everything? Apologies for my vagueness, but you know what I mean."
msgstr "아무것도 없고 모든 것이라고 할까요? 애매모호해서 죄송하지만, 무슨 말인지 아실 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111328
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C8"
msgid "We're all doing what we can in this... impossible situation. I'll let Ekris know the frustrations aren't getting any better."
msgstr ""
"우리는 이... 불가능한 상황에서 우리가 할 수 있는 모든 것을 다하고 있습니다. 에크리스에게 상황이 나아지지 않고 있다는 걸 "
"알리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111328
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C7"
msgid "Understood. I know there's nothing easy about this."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이 일이 쉽지 않다는 건 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist02:  &&& Scientist01: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111328
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011113B0
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C6"
msgid "Fair. I'll pass on your concerns."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 당신의 우려 사항을 전달하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C5"
msgid "No, no. Ekris is already aware of all this."
msgstr "아닙니다, 아닙니다. 에크리스는 이미 이 모든 것을 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C4"
msgid "Apologies. Serpent knows this situation has me on edge, and I know we're all just doing our jobs to the best of our ability."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 뱀께서 아시겠지만 이 상황 때문에 제가 예민해져 있습니다. 우리 모두 각자 최선을 다해 일하고 있다는 걸 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C3"
msgid "Tell him everything is going as well as it could be given the circumstances."
msgstr "상황이 허락하는 한 모든 일이 잘 진행되고 있다고 전해 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C2"
msgid "*sigh* I'm sorry. I've let my frustration dictate my answer."
msgstr "*한숨* 죄송합니다. 제 불만이 제 답변을 지배하게 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Scientist02
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C1"
msgid "Please let Ekris know that our work is on schedule. As long as everything goes as planned, we'll be ready."
msgstr "에크리스에게 우리 연구가 일정대로 진행되고 있다고 전해 주십시오. 모든 것이 계획대로 진행된다면, 우리는 준비될 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Scientist02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scientist01:  &&& Scientist02: 
#. ALIAS: Scientist01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03
#. TOPIC: 01111327
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_MourningDevice03_Scene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0111136F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0136C0"
msgid "Good, as if the pressure isn't bad enough. I'm tired of being checked up on."
msgstr "좋습니다, 압박감이 충분하지 않은 것처럼. 저는 감시받는 것에 지쳤습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
