msgid "Perhaps you have indeed been sent to us."
msgstr "당신이 정말로 부름을 받고 온 걸지도요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0104
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
