#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0104
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
