msgstr "경비대원이 어떻게 처분하는지 지켜보겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0104
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136B3"
msgid "An outsider, here? You must be mad."
msgstr "외부인이 여기 있다고? 미쳤나 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136B2"
msgid "If you have been sent to us, then I hope you can help."
msgstr "만약 당신이 우리에게 보내진 거라면, 도움을 주셨으면 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136B1"
msgid "An outsider here in Dazra. These really are strange days."
msgstr "다즈라에 이방인이 오다니. 요즘 정말 이상한 날만 계속되네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136B0"
msgid "Chosen by the Serpent Himself? You?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 직접 선택하셨다고? 너를?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136AF"
msgid "What makes you think you can talk to me?"
msgstr "나와 대화할 수 있다고 생각하는 이유가 뭐지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136AE"
msgid "You would dare speak to me?"
msgstr "감히 나에게 말을 걸어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136AD"
msgid "You should not be here."
msgstr "여기 와서는 안됐어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0508
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0136AC"
msgid "I have no wish to associate with you."
msgstr "너와 엮이고 싶지 않아."

