#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: I would need time to attempt a scientific explanation for why or how this happened -- but for now let us assume my sister is correct. &&& companion: I would agree. What we saw in that cave goes beyond science. &&& Inaza: This husk's comments aside, that is the essence of faith. Not all things require explanation. &&& Inaza: I do not know what lies ahead, my visions do not go beyond this point. |But I know this link will play a role. In fact, I am certain of it.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111089A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01369F"
msgid "Agreed. And with this settled, we can now continue the work of aligning the noble Houses."
msgstr "동감이야. 그리고 이 문제를 해결했으니 명문 가문들 사이를 조정하는 일도 계속할 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0111089A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01369E"
msgid "Together we will find a way to complete the Mourning Device."
msgstr "함께 모어닝 장치를 완성시킬 방법을 찾아 보자고."

msgctxt "013695"
msgid "\"Just answer the damn questions.\""
msgstr "'그냥 망할 놈의 질문에 답이나 하라고요.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FC52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013694"
msgid "Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me."
msgstr "그렇군... 사과하겠네. 자네 말이 맞아. 내 무지함을 용서해 주게. 내게 하는 모든 질문에 답해 줄 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FC58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013693"
msgid "Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again."
msgstr "어휴... 좋아. 다시 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013692"
msgid "He comes begging for money, so I gave it to him. Then he comes begging for my items to pawn, so I sacrifice them. And then he comes screaming to me that I hate him, that I have done nothing to help him. All of this, for a decade now."
msgstr ""
"동생은 내게 구걸하러 왔고, 그래서 돈을 줬네. 그런 다음 내 물건까지 전당포에 넘기고 싶다며 또 구걸했고, 그래서 물건들을 내주었네. "
"그런데 이젠 내가 녀석을 미워한다고, 아무것도 도와주려고 하지 않는다고 성을 내고 있지. 지난 10년 동안 이런 짓이 계속 반복됐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your people are always trying to kill me. Why would I help you?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F702
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013689"
msgid "And they would certainly never extend an offer to join them, as I do now in this time of desperation. So, will you?"
msgstr "그리고 그자들은 이렇게 어려운 시기에 저처럼 함께 하자는 제안을 결코 하지 않겠지요. 자, 어떻게 하시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013688"
msgid "Oh yes! You came to the city as a husk and now stand as its savior."
msgstr "오, 그래요! 당신은 이 도시에 허물로 와서 이제는 구원자로 우뚝 섰군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013687"
msgid "I'm not against the occasional embellishment on your behalf, but in your case, it's unnecessary,."
msgstr "당신이 공헌한 걸 부풀리는 것에 반대하지는 않지만, 그럴 필요가 없지 않나요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013686"
msgid "Oh yes! You've communed with phantoms, survived the ritual, and returned Vaeric safe and sound."
msgstr "오, 그래요! 당신은 유령과 소통하고, 통과의례에서 살아남았고, 배릭을 무사히 돌려보냈죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013685"
msgid "I'm not against the occasional embellishment on your behalf, believe me."
msgstr "당신이 공헌한 걸 부풀리는 것에 반대하지는 않아요. 정말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013684"
msgid "Oh yes! You've communed with phantoms, survived the ritual, and probably slew two or three horrors on the way."
msgstr "오, 그래요! 당신은 유령과 소통하고, 통과의례에서 살아남았고, 오는 길에 호러 두세 마리는 처치했겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013683"
msgid "I'm not against the occasional embellishment on your behalf, believe me."
msgstr "당신이 공헌한 걸 부풀리는 것에 반대하지는 않아요. 정말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What separates you from the Zealots all over the Settled Systems?
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: As I told you when we first met, we have made a conscious choice to pull back from the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013682"
msgid "That depends a great deal on who you ask."
msgstr "누구에게 묻느냐에 따라 크게 달라지지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: That depends a great deal on who you ask.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Some amongst us saw that as a mistake, an abandonment of House Va'ruun's true calling.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013681"
msgid "As I told you when we first met, we have made a conscious choice to pull back from the Settled Systems."
msgstr "처음 만났을 때 말씀드렸듯이, 저희는 개척 성계에서 확실하게 물러나기로 결정했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: That depends a great deal on who you ask.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Some amongst us saw that as a mistake, an abandonment of House Va'ruun's true calling.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013680"
msgid "Generations ago, we made a decision to pull back from the Settled Systems."
msgstr "몇 세대 전에, 저희는 개척 성계에서 물러나기로 결정했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: That depends a great deal on who you ask.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367F"
msgid "What separates you from the Zealots all over the Settled Systems?"
msgstr "당신들이 개척 성계에 퍼져 있는 광신도와 다른 점은 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367E"
msgid "Perhaps. As Speaker, Viktor may one day relinquish his roles as House Elder and head of the Ministry of State."
msgstr "아마도요. 대변자가 됐으니 빅토르도 언젠가는 가문 장로와 국무성 책임자 자리를 포기할지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367D"
msgid "The title of Elder would fall to Vaeric and Lovek would remain Mediary."
msgstr "장로 직책은 배릭한테 넘어가고, 로벡은 중개자로 남을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367C"
msgid "My only wish would be that Ministry of State duties fall to me. It would be Vaeric's decisions, but I think he would allow it."
msgstr "제가 바라는 건 국무성 직무가 저한테 넘어오는 것 뿐이에요. 배릭이 결정할 일이겠지만, 아마 허락해줄 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: Some amongst us saw that as a mistake, an abandonment of House Va'ruun's true calling.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: They are, of course, factually wrong and incredibly misguided.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367B"
msgid "The schism within our people grew until some took it upon themselves to leave, and declare themselves the true descendants of Jinan Va'ruun."
msgstr "우리 신민 내부의 분열은 커져만 갔고, 결국 그 일부는 자신들이 지난 바룬 님의 진정한 후손이라고 선언하고는 떠나버렸습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: The schism within our people grew until some took it upon themselves to leave, and declare themselves the true descendants of Jinan Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01367A"
msgid "They are, of course, factually wrong and incredibly misguided."
msgstr "물론 그런 주장은 사실과는 다를뿐더러 굉장히 잘못되었지요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Perhaps not now, but as Speaker, Viktor may one day relinquish his current positions as House Elder and head of the Ministry of State.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013679"
msgid "Will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?"
msgstr "빅토르가 대변자가 되면 자네에게도 변화가 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know how unhappy Vaeric was?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013678"
msgid "Yes. Vaeric is in the unfortunate position of having Viktor as a father."
msgstr "네. 배릭이 빅토르를 아버지로 둔 건 불행한 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013677"
msgid "I do what I can for my nephew."
msgstr "전 우리 조카를 위해 최선을 다하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013676"
msgid "My hope is that these recent events will allow them to discuss their differences more openly."
msgstr "이번 일을 계기로 두 사람이 서로의 차이점을 좀 더 터놓고 얘기할 수 있게 되면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know how unhappy Vaeric was?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013675"
msgid "Yes. Vaeric was in the unfortunate position of having Viktor as a father."
msgstr "네. 배릭이 빅토르를 아버지로 둔 건 불행한 일이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013674"
msgid "I did what I could for my nephew, but you see how difficult Viktor can be."
msgstr "전 우리 조카를 위해 최선을 다했지만, 빅토르가 얼마나 까다로운 사람인지 봤잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013673"
msgid "My hope is that these recent events will open my brother's eyes to his own pride and stubbornness."
msgstr "이번 일을 계기로 오라버니가 자기 자존심과 고집을 본인 스스로 알게 된다면 좋겠네요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Perhaps not now, but as Speaker, Viktor may one day relinquish his current positions as House Elder and head of the Ministry of State.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013672"
msgid "Will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?"
msgstr "빅토르가 대변자가 되면 자네에게도 변화가 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reflecting. / Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you remember about the cataclysm?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013671"
msgid "I was with Luther, just outside the Halls of Obedience."
msgstr "루터랑 같이 복종의 전당 밖에 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013670"
msgid "We saw light pulsing in the sky... and then a sound like a percussive scream."
msgstr "하늘에서 빛이 번쩍이더니... 무슨 타악기에서 나는 듯한 소리가 들렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366F"
msgid "We didn't even realize the damage until Viktor came rushing outside and pointed us toward the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "빅토르가 뛰쳐나와서 비늘 성채를 가리키기 전까지는 무슨 피해가 났는지 알지도 못했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366E"
msgid "And it was then that we knew. Knew Vashti and so many others were lost."
msgstr "그때서야 알았죠. 바슈티를 비롯해서 수많은 사람들을 잃었다는 걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: As I told you when we first met, we have made a conscious choice to pull back from the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: MQ_MaliborDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_MaliborDulkehf: The schism within our people grew until some took it upon themselves to leave, and declare themselves the true descendants of Jinan Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110FCB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Malibor_TL_Zealots
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366D"
msgid "Some amongst us saw that as a mistake, an abandonment of House Va'ruun's true calling."
msgstr "저희 중 일부는 그 결정을 실수라고 보았고, 바룬 가문의 진정한 소명을 버린 거라고 생각했지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366C"
msgid "Perhaps not now, but as Speaker, Viktor may one day relinquish his current positions as House Elder and head of the Ministry of State."
msgstr "당장은 아니겠지만, 대변자가 됐으니 빅토르도 언젠가는 가문 장로와 국무성 책임자 자리를 포기하게 될지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366B"
msgid "The title of Elder could fall to Luther, should he accept it, and Lovek would remain Mediary."
msgstr "장로 직책은 루터가 받아들인다면 그쪽에 넘어갈 거고, 로벡은 중개자로 남을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VethaalChosen01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01366A"
msgid "My only wish would be to run the Ministry of State. I believe Luther would allow it, but it all remains to be seen."
msgstr "제가 바라는 건 국무성 운영이 저한테 넘어오는 것 뿐이에요. 루터가 허락해줄 것 같긴 한데, 아직은 지켜봐야죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Yes. Vaeric is in the unfortunate position of having Viktor as a father. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013668"
msgid "Did you know how unhappy Vaeric was?"
msgstr "배릭이 얼마나 불만족스러워했는지 알고 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think your sister, Vashti, would've thought of all this?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013667"
msgid "Vashti knew my heart and mind well. She may be disappointed I returned, but she'd also be happy I remained with the family."
msgstr "바슈티는 내 생각과 마음을 잘 알았어. 내가 집으로 돌아와서 실망했을 수도 있지만, 가족들과 함께 있는 걸 보면 기뻐할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013666"
msgid "Our father is what would bother her the most."
msgstr "가장 성가신 문제는 우리 아버지였겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013665"
msgid "She would've made a far better Elder than I if only he would've listened..."
msgstr "아버지가 내 말을 들어줬다면 여동생이 나보다 훨씬 더 훌륭한 장로가 되었을 텐데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013664"
msgid "For her sake, I hope we can resolve our differences once and for all."
msgstr "바슈티를 위해서라도 우리가 차이점을 완전히 해소할 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Yes. Vaeric is in the unfortunate position of having Viktor as a father. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013663"
msgid "Did you know how unhappy Vaeric was?"
msgstr "배릭이 얼마나 불행했는지 알고 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of your father being named Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013661"
msgid "I'm certain he considers it a great honor."
msgstr "분명 커다란 영광이라 생각하시겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013660"
msgid "My only worry is what duties might fall to me. You helped me accept my future as Elder, but will I inherit Speaker now, too?"
msgstr "유일한 걱정은 그 직무가 나한테 넘어올 거란 거야. 네 덕에 차기 장로 직책을 받아들였는데, 이젠 대변자 자리도 물려받는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365F"
msgid "I feel woefully unprepared for both."
msgstr "양쪽 다 받아들일 준비가 안 된 느낌이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: I was on my way to see my father at the Halls of Obedience when it happened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365E"
msgid "Where were you when half of Dazra was lost?"
msgstr "다즈라의 절반이 사라졌을 때 어디에 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reflecting. / Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when half of Dazra was lost? 
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365D"
msgid "I was on my way to see my father at the Halls of Obedience when it happened."
msgstr "그 일이 터졌을 때는 아버지를 만나러 복종의 전당으로 가던 중이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365C"
msgid "I had just crossed Jinan Plaza when I saw the light pulse from the Citadel and the sound felt like it went right through me."
msgstr "지난 광장을 막 지났을 때 성채에서 뿜어져 나오는 빛을 봤는데, 소리가 마치 내 몸을 관통하는 듯한 느낌이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365B"
msgid "I couldn't help but fixate on the Citadel itself, surrounded by that strange... energy."
msgstr "성채 그 자체에서 눈을 뗄 수가 없었어. 그 이상한... 에너지에 둘러싸인 모습에서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: MQ_VaericVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01365A"
msgid "It didn't even dawn on me until later, just how heavy the losses would be."
msgstr "그때까지는 얼마나 큰 손실을 입었을지 생각도 안 들더라고."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: Vashti knew my heart and mind well. She may be disappointed I returned, but she'd also be happy I remained with the family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_Vashti02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013659"
msgid "What do you think your sister, Vashti, would've thought of all this?"
msgstr "자네의 여동생, 바슈티가 이 모든 일에 대해 어떻게 생각했을 것 같나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Veth'aal being in charge?
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013658"
msgid "Eh. Viktor will seek to reinforce our isolation. It's too early to tell how this will affect the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "으. 빅토르는 우릴 더 고립시키려 하겠지. 그게 결합성에 어떤 영향을 줄지 말하기엔 아직 너무 일러."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013657"
msgid "All I'm certain of is how much more invasive the Ministry of State will no doubt become."
msgstr "내가 확신하는 건 국무성이 얼마나 더 주제넘게 나설지가 불 보듯 뻔하다는 거야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: Better than House Veth'aal. Hasmak and I share a common interest in the Settled Systems which I hope will be reflected in his decisions as Speaker.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013656"
msgid "How do you feel about House Dul'kehf being in charge?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 책무를 맡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about House Dul'kehf being in charge?
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013651"
msgid "Better than House Veth'aal. Hasmak and I share a common interest in the Settled Systems which I hope will be reflected in his decisions as Speaker."
msgstr ""
"베타알 가문보다야 낫지. 해즈막과 나는 개척 성계에 대해 같은 생각을 갖고 있거든. 그 생각이 대변자로서 내리는 결정에도 반영됐으면 "
"좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013650"
msgid "My only concern is how forthright he'll be. House Dul'kehf has always had a way of hoarding information."
msgstr "유일한 걱정은 해즈막이 얼마나 솔직해질까 하는 거야. 둘케프 가문은 항상 자기들만 정보를 가지려 했으니까."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: My first priority will be to increase the number of agents we have outside of Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01364F"
msgid "What will you do now as Speaker?"
msgstr "대변자로서 어떤 일을 해 나갈 건가요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I was with Luther, just outside the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01364B"
msgid "What do you remember about the cataclysm?"
msgstr "대재난에 대해 기억나는 게 뭐 있습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: Eh. Viktor will seek to reinforce our isolation. It's too early to tell how this will affect the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01364A"
msgid "How do you feel about House Veth'aal being in charge?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 책무를 맡게 된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LutherVethaal: As far as duties, I believe very little will change. Viktor likes his control and will do what he can to maintain it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013649"
msgid "How will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?"
msgstr "빅토르가 대변자가 되면 자네에게 어떤 변화가 있을까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_LutherVethaal: I mostly looked after the House members, trying to take a more active role in the lives of our people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_RoleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013648"
msgid "What is your role here with House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에서 맡은 역할이 뭔가요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I was with Luther, just outside the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013647"
msgid "What do you remember about the cataclysm?"
msgstr "대재난에 대해 기억나는 게 뭐 있습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_RazmaKadic: I was in my office, going over reports. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013646"
msgid "What were you doing when the incident occurred?"
msgstr "그 사고가 터졌을 때 무슨 일을 하고 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reflecting. / Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you remember about the cataclysm?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013645"
msgid "I remember the light, and a horrible sound, but most of all, I remember Viktor's face when he rushed outside to find us."
msgstr "빛이랑 끔찍한 소리도 기억나지만, 무엇보다도 우릴 찾으러 달려 나온 빅토르의 얼굴이 떠오르네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013644"
msgid "He kept saying it was gone. Disappeared."
msgstr "계속 없어져 버렸다고 하더라고요. 사라졌다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013643"
msgid "I'll never forget the moment he took us into the Halls of Obedience to see the devastation that surrounded the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "빅토르가 우릴 복종의 전당으로 데려가서 비늘 성채 주변의 참상을 보여줬던 그 순간을 절대로 못 잊을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013642"
msgid "The heartbreak and horror we felt knowing whatever took Dazra, took our House and family with it."
msgstr "다즈라를 날려버린 게 뭔진 몰라도, 그게 우리 가문과 가족까지 없애버렸다는 걸 알게 되니 슬픔과 공포가 몰려왔죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VaericVethaal: I'm certain he considers it a great honor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vaeric_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013641"
msgid "What do you think of your father being named Speaker?"
msgstr "자네의 아버지가 대변자로 임명된 것에 대해 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is your role here with House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_RoleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013640"
msgid "I mostly looked after the House members, trying to take a more active role in the lives of our people."
msgstr "주로 가문 구성원들을 돌보지요. 우리 신민들의 삶에 더 적극적인 역할을 할 수 있도록 지원하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_RoleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363F"
msgid "Viktor's attention is more administrative focused, so he has little time to deal with personal grievances or requests."
msgstr "빅토르는 운영 업무 쪽에 더 관심을 두는지라, 개인적인 불만이나 요청을 처리할 시간이 별로 없거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_RoleScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363E"
msgid "Since the destruction, I did all I could to help ease our family's grief, but once Vaeric left, I turned my focus completely to Viktor."
msgstr "그 사고 이후로는 우리 가족의 슬픔을 덜어주려고 최선을 다했죠. 배릭이 집을 나간 뒤로는 완전히 빅토르에게만 집중하고 있지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will you do now as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363D"
msgid "My first priority will be to increase the number of agents we have outside of Dazra."
msgstr "최우선 과제는 다즈라 외부에 있는 요원 숫자를 늘리는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363C"
msgid "I want a more comprehensive report on the Settled Systems and our old friends, the Zealots."
msgstr "개척 성계 뿐만 아니라 우리 오랜 친구인 광신도들에 대해서도 더 종합적인 보고가 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363B"
msgid "With that knowledge, I can work toward a more long term goal of reintegration."
msgstr "그걸 알게 되면, 재통합이라는 더 장기적인 목표로 나아갈 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01363A"
msgid "We must ensure the Great Serpent's word continues to spread, and will need a true presence in the Settled Systems to do so."
msgstr "우리는 위대한 뱀의 말씀이 계속 퍼지도록 해야 하고, 그러러면 개척 성계에 실제로 존재하는 사람이 필요할 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How will things change for you with Viktor as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013639"
msgid "As far as duties, I believe very little will change. Viktor likes his control and will do what he can to maintain it."
msgstr "직무 쪽에서는 바뀌는 게 거의 없을걸요. 빅토르는 통제권 잡는 걸 좋아하는지라 최대한 오래 붙잡고 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_LutherVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Luther_TL_VethaalChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013638"
msgid "As for me, I'm about to have an even more stressed out husband, so that's what I really have to look forward to."
msgstr "제 입장에서는 남편이 예전보다도 더 스트레스받게 생겼으니, 그쪽이야말로 진짜 기대되는 부분이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reflecting. / Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What were you doing when the incident occurred?
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013637"
msgid "I was in my office, going over reports."
msgstr "사무실에서 보고서를 검토하고 있었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013636"
msgid "I only heard a strange noise outside. Strange enough that I knew it demanded my attention."
msgstr "밖에서 이상한 소리가 들렸을 뿐인데, 특별히 신경 쓰일 만큼 이상한 소리더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_RazmaKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110EFCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Razma_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013635"
msgid "It wasn't until I went to the balcony that overlooks the Scaled Citadel that I saw the horror."
msgstr "비늘 성채가 보이는 발코니에 가서야 어떤 끔찍한 일이 일어났는지 볼 수 있었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013634"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player has excited a scene. / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQNPCs_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013633"
msgid "Serpent guide you."
msgstr "뱀께서 그대를 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013632"
msgid "Until next time."
msgstr "다음에 보자고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player has excited a scene. / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQNPCs_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013631"
msgid "Great Serpent keep you."
msgstr "뱀께서 지키시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013630"
msgid "Harbinger."
msgstr "선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01362F"
msgid "Vindicator."
msgstr "옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01362E"
msgid "Diviner."
msgstr "예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01362D"
msgid "Reverent."
msgstr "숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01362C"
msgid "Armiger."
msgstr "복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01362B"
msgid "Adherent."
msgstr "지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_InazaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01362A"
msgid "I do not know what lies ahead, but I know your link with Anasko will play a role."
msgstr "앞으로 무슨 일이 벌어질지 모르지만, 그대와 아나스코 님 사이의 연결이 큰 역할을 할 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VitoriaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013629"
msgid "We all await your report."
msgstr "당신이 보고하길 모두가 기다리고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VitoriaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013628"
msgid "I pray you return with good news."
msgstr "부디 좋은 소식을 갖고 돌아오길 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VitoriaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013627"
msgid "Viktor is waiting."
msgstr "빅토르가 기다리고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013626"
msgid "Please. Viktor awaits your report."
msgstr "얼른요. 빅토르가 소식을 기다리고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013625"
msgid "It's good to see you again. I hope."
msgstr "반가운 일로 다시 만난 거면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013624"
msgid "If you bring news, Viktor must hear it first."
msgstr "소식을 전하실 거면 빅토르에게 먼저 전하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Waiting for the player's report. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013623"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Waiting for the player's report. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013622"
msgid "Is it done?"
msgstr "끝났나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Waiting for the player's report. / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013621"
msgid "Let us speak."
msgstr "말해 보세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FCAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013620"
msgid "Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this."
msgstr "다만, 그전에... 이 결투는 참 바보 같은 짓이에요. 이 일에 휘말리게 돼서 죄송해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's get going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FCAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01361F"
msgid "I will try and find another peaceful solution to this problem, should you be unsuccessful in convincing them to call it off."
msgstr "이 문제를 평화롭게 해결할 다른 방법이 있나 찾아볼게요. 당신이 결투를 중단하도록 설득하는 데 실패하실 수도 있으니까요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima__BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01361E"
msgid "Picking up all this stuff is good exercise!"
msgstr "이런 짐을 다 옮기는 거야말로 좋은 운동이지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on *make* / Irritated / to Amila
#. PROMPT: Just answer the damn questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FC5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01361D"
msgid "Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer."
msgstr "망할 질문에나 빨리 답하세요. 강제로 그렇게 하도록 만들기 전에."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACA
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Crafting_CreateItem
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01361C"
msgid "That will be useful, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "유용할 것 같아, 분명히."

msgctxt "01361B"
msgid "\"Show some respect and answer the questions.\""
msgstr "예의 좀 갖추고 질문에 답이나 하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Borhal
#. PROMPT: Show some respect and answer the questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110FC55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01361A"
msgid "Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions."
msgstr "최소한의 존중심이라도 보이고, 질문에 답하시죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A74
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_Smuggler_SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsRepaired
msgctxt "013619"
msgid "They brought a weapon back online!"
msgstr "놈들이 무장을 다시 작동시켰어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB2
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "013618"
msgid "Damn! We let them escape!"
msgstr "젠장! 놈들이 탈출하게 놔두다니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013617"
msgid "I would lay by his side every night praying that he would not choke on his own vomit. But in the mornings, when I would throw away his bottles of koza, he would fight me like a monster."
msgstr ""
"매일 밤 나는 동생 옆에 누워 녀석이 토사물에 질식당하지 않기를 기도했네. 그럼에도 아침마다 코자 병을 내다 버리면, 놈은 괴물처럼 "
"변해가지곤 나와 싸워댔지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013616"
msgid "I used to take such pride in giving to the community, and in using my privileged position to help the less fortunate in the city. But I can no longer do that, as Amila has taken nearly every cent from me."
msgstr ""
"나는 지역 사회에 기부하고, 영광스러운 지위를 이용해 도시의 불우한 사람들을 돕는 데 큰 자부심을 느낀다네. 하지만 내 돈을 아밀라가 "
"거의 다 뜯어 갔기 때문에 더 이상 그럴 수도 없게 됐지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013615"
msgid "I have sacrificed my entire purpose for living in the hopes that Amila would get better. And he never does!"
msgstr "아밀라가 더 나아지기만 바라면서 삶의 목표마저 희생했다고. 그런데 놈은 전혀 변하지 않았잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013614"
msgid "But now, everything they have built is gone, and our once great fortune is nearly spent."
msgstr "하지만 이제 부모님이 일군 재산도 전부 사라졌어. 한때 드높았던 가문의 자산도 이젠 거의 바닥났지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013613"
msgid "The money they left us was meant to be used for donations. We were meant to make Dazra a better place. But Amila has sucked the well dry."
msgstr ""
"부모님이 우리에게 남긴 재산은 기부에 쓰여야 할 돈이었네. 우린 다즈라가 더 나은 곳이 되도록 힘써야 했어. 근데 아밀라가 집안 재산을 "
"다 까먹고 말았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013612"
msgid "My parents... maybe they were not good people, but they were good citizens, and Amila trying to sell their remains was just barbaric."
msgstr ""
"내 부모님은... 별로 좋은 분들은 아니셨을지 모르지만 모범 신민이셨네. 아밀라 녀석은 부모의 유골함을 갖다 팔려고, 야만인 같은 짓을 "
"하려고 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reminiscent / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013611"
msgid "Honestly, I respected him a lot. He was unbreakable, even though the world was not always kind to him."
msgstr "사실 예전엔 동생을 꽤 존중해 줬네. 마음이 꺾이거나 그러진 않았거든. 세상은 녀석에게 험하게 굴었지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013610"
msgid "He was funny, kind, and he always was trying to cheer me up, even if I had nothing to be sad about. *Sigh* The Amila you know now is not my brother."
msgstr ""
"재밌고, 친절했고, 항상 내 기운을 북돋아 주려고 애써줬지. 내가 전혀 슬프지 않을 때도 그래줬는데... *한숨* 지금 있는 아밀라는 "
"내가 알던 동생이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01360F"
msgid "My brother may as well have died years ago. The Amila walking around today is nothing like what he used to be."
msgstr ""
"내 동생은 몇 년 전에 이미 죽은 거나 다름없을지도 모르겠네. 지금 저 밖을 돌아다니는 아밀라는 예전의 내 동생과는 전혀 다르단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Would you be happy if Amila died?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01360E"
msgid "I will take no pleasure in his death. However, I may admittedly feel relief."
msgstr "동생이 죽는다고 기쁠 리 없지 않나. 다만 솔직히 안도할 수는 있을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Would you be happy if Amila died?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01360D"
msgid "I will mourn the loss of my brother -- the brother he used to be, at least. And I will pray that his restless soul finds comfort with the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"동생을 잃은 것을 애도하게 되겠지... 과거에 내 동생이었던 녀석이니. 그리고 안식을 취하지 못하던 그 영혼이 위대한 뱀께 나아가 위안을 "
"찾기를 기도하게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01360B"
msgid "As have we all."
msgstr "모두가 그렇다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01360A"
msgid "I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so."
msgstr "멋대로 잘잘못을 따질 생각은 전혀 없다오. 난 그럴 위치가 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013609"
msgid "Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone."
msgstr "시비를 가리는 것은 그대와 위대한 뱀 사이에서 행해질 일이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013608"
msgid "But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful."
msgstr "다만 두려워하지 마시오, 내 친구여. 뱀께서는 자비로우시니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't committed any sins.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I haven't committed any sins.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013607"
msgid "Truly? You're not the first to come here having lived a life utterly free of sin."
msgstr "정말이오? 아무 죄도 저지르지 않고 산 사람이 이곳에 온 것은 처음은 아니라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't committed any sins.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013606"
msgid "But let us pretend for a moment that you had sinned, and simply did not want to admit it."
msgstr "다만 지금은 그대가 이미 죄를 저질렀고, 그걸 인정하지 않는 것으로 가정하도록 하겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't committed any sins.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013605"
msgid "Even then, it would not be my place to judge."
msgstr "그럼에도, 나는 그대의 잘못을 따질 처지가 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't committed any sins.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: That makes one of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013604"
msgid "Sin and redemption are personal matters."
msgstr "죄악과 구원은 개인적인 사안이니 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: I welcome you, fellow traveler.|Have you come seeking redemption for your sins?|Or has your journey brought you here for some other purpose?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Truly? You're not the first to come here having lived a life utterly free of sin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013603"
msgid "I haven't committed any sins."
msgstr "저는 아무런 죄도 저지르지 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013602"
msgid "That makes one of you."
msgstr "내 생각은 전혀 다른데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013601"
msgid "Yeah, sure, and I'm the tooth fairy."
msgstr "흥, 그렇겠지. 그럼 난 이빨 요정이겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013600"
msgid "No sins? Where's the fun in that?"
msgstr "죄를 안 저지른다고? 그게 무슨 재미야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135FF"
msgid "Not that it's any of my business, but I feel a healthy dose of skepticism coming on."
msgstr "내가 신경 쓸 바는 아니지만 꽤 의심스러운 소리인걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: I welcome you, fellow traveler.|Have you come seeking redemption for your sins?|Or has your journey brought you here for some other purpose?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As have we all. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135FE"
msgid "I might have committed a sin or two in my time."
msgstr "살면서 제가 한두 번 죄를 저질렀을지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPreStage100
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135FD"
msgid "Welcome, my friend."
msgstr "만나서 반갑소. 친구여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPreStage100
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135FC"
msgid "Hello! Shall we speak for a moment?"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 잠시 대화를 나눠도 좋겠소?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosPreStage100
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135FB"
msgid "You have the look of one who has traveled far in life."
msgstr "그대는 살면서 많은 곳을 다녀본 듯한 눈빛을 지녔군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sage, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135FA"
msgid "Wisdom awaits you at your journey's end."
msgstr "그대의 여정 끝에는 지혜가 기다리고 있다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sage, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135F9"
msgid "May the Great Serpent guide your steps."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대의 길을 이끌어 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sage, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135F8"
msgid "The Great Serpent offers mercy to the faithful."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 독실한 자에게 자비를 베푸신다오."

