#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135E5"
msgid "As you say. But to the matter at hand. Did Anasko mention anything that could aid us in his extraction?"
msgstr "맞는 말이구먼. 일단 당면한 문제로 돌아가지. 아나스코 님이 구출에 도움 될 만한 말씀은 안 하셨나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, only that we've established some sort of link.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, only that we've established some sort of link.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110FC89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135E4"
msgid "Interesting. Perhaps if two beings were to occupy the same vortex, however briefly, a channel between them is established."
msgstr "재밌는데. 두 존재가 같은 볼텍스 공간에 있게 되면, 잠시뿐이겠지만 둘 사이에 연결망이 생기는 걸지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anasko is waiting for us in the Scaled Citadel. I was able to speak with him. &&& ...  &&& Ekris: Well, it would seem I owe you an apology, sister.  &&& Inaza: There is no need, brother. Your skepticism only strengthens us. &&& Ekris: As you say. But to the matter at hand. Did Anasko mention anything that could aid us in his extraction?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Still, you were able to communicate with him. Should he appear again, perhaps that link remains.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110FC88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135E3"
msgid "I don't think he knows any better than us how to get him out."
msgstr "그 사람이 탈출 방법을 우리보다 더 잘 알고 있을 것 같진 않은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
