msgstr "그래도 자네랑 그분이 서로 대화가 통했잖나. 다시 나타나실 때 그 연결이 남아있을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: It is much more than that. Normally when I pray for Anasko's return, I sense he is lost, fading.|But when I last prayed to the Great Serpent, I felt Anasko's presence, clear and distinct.|Even as it receded, I felt him anchored to this world.  &&& Ekris: 
