#. TOPIC: 0110FC84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135DC"
msgid "And that is the essence of faith."
msgstr "그것이야말로 신앙의 본질이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Ekris
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Then my vision did not betray me. &&& Ekris: Well, it would seem I owe you an apology, sister. 
