msgstr "그럴 필요 없다, 동생아. 네 회의론은 우릴 더 강하게 만들어주니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: This husk's comments aside, that is the essence of faith. Not all things require explanation.
