#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then we must continue our work on the Mourning Device. But it is comforting to have confirmation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110FC7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135CE"
msgid "He said that we need to enter the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "우리가 비늘 성채에 들어가야 한다고 하더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He said that we need to enter the Scaled Citadel.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He said that we need to enter the Scaled Citadel.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110FC79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135CD"
msgid "Then we must continue our work on the Mourning Device. But it is comforting to have confirmation."
msgstr "그렇다면 모어닝 장치 작업을 계속해야겠군. 그래도 확실히 확인받고 나니 안심이 되네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You just need to have a little faith. &&& Ekris: I am no heretic. But to risk so much on a vision... it is a leap of faith I cannot condone.|I will not stand in your way, however, as Inaza has stood in ours. &&& Inaza: You may not realize it now, dear brother, but our goals are one and the same.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. It was born from the incident itself, but I believe it is there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F782
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135CA"
msgid "Did this cave exist prior to the cataclysm?"
msgstr "그 동굴은 대재난 이전에도 있었던 곳인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did this cave exist prior to the cataclysm?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did this cave exist prior to the cataclysm?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F781
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C9"
msgid "No. It was born from the incident itself, but I believe it is there."
msgstr "아니. 사고 때문에 생긴 곳이지. 허나 분명 거기에 있을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did this cave exist prior to the cataclysm?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: If you point me to the cave, I can find him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F781
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C8"
msgid "And what is faith but to give form to the formless? As a Herald, it is my duty to make real what is unseen."
msgstr "그리고 믿음이란 형체 없는 것에 형체를 부여하는 것이 아니겠느냐? 난 전령으로서 보이지 않는 것을 현실로 만들 의무가 있단다."

#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko is waiting for us in the Scaled Citadel. I was able to speak with him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_200_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C7"
msgid "You return. What news do you have of Anasko?"
msgstr "돌아왔구나. 아나스코 님에 대한 소식이 있느냐?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: I think it's foolishness. But not nearly as foolish as trying to convince her of this fact.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_Visions
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C6"
msgid "What do you think of your sister's vision?"
msgstr "누님분의 환영을 어떻게 생각해요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of your sister's vision?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_Visions
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C5"
msgid "I think it's foolishness. But not nearly as foolish as trying to convince her of this fact."
msgstr "바보짓이라고 생각하지. 그래도 그 사실을 누님한테 납득시키는 것보단 덜 바보짓이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Of course. We agree on most things actually, save the one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_SiblingRivalry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C4"
msgid "Do you and your sister get along?"
msgstr "누님분하고는 잘 지내시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you and your sister get along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_SiblingRivalry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C3"
msgid "Of course. We agree on most things actually, save the one."
msgstr "그럼. 사실 딱 한 가지 빼놓고는 생각이 거의 맞아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_SiblingRivalry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C2"
msgid "And before you label me a heretic, it's not the power of the divine, or the breadth of His influence that I question."
msgstr "그리고 날 이단자라고 몰아갈까봐 하는 말인데, 내가 의심하는 건 신성한 힘이나 그분의 커다란 영향력이 아니야."

#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Ekris_TL_SiblingRivalry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135C1"
msgid "It's simply the manner in which He wields it that is a point of contention."
msgstr "그분께서 그걸 행사하시는 방식이 논쟁거리가 될 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: In darkness I wait, for the word He had promised.
#. ALIAS: RipEntry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: RipEntry: *Chanting*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_080_AnaskoChanting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0135C0"
msgid "*Chanting*"
msgstr "*기도하는 소리*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: In darkness I wait, for the word He had promised.
#. ALIAS: RipEntry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: RipEntry: *Chanting*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_080_AnaskoChanting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0135BD"
msgid "*Chanting*"
msgstr "*기도하는 소리*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Headtrack01, Headtrack02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Have you abandoned me, Great Serpent? 
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F23C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135BA"
msgid "Do you not hear my pleas?"
msgstr "제 기도를 듣지 않으시나이까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hear you. &&& Anasko: You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you.  &&& Anasko: I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And now you stand here, a member of the Promised, guided by Him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F23B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B9"
msgid "I do what I do for the good of humankind."
msgstr "전 인류를 위한 일을 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I do what I do for the good of humankind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I do what I do for the good of humankind.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F23A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B8"
msgid "And now you stand here, a member of the Promised, guided by Him."
msgstr "그리고 지금 이 자리에 왔구나. 그분에게 인도받은 약속받은 자의 일원이여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: In darkness I wait, for the word He had promised.
#. ALIAS: RipEntry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: RipEntry: *Chanting*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_080_AnaskoChanting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0135B7"
msgid "*Chanting*"
msgstr "*기도하는 소리*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has guided me to you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has guided me to you.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B4"
msgid "Yes. He works through you, and built the path to guide you to me."
msgstr "그래. 그분께서 너를 통해 행하시고, 내게 오는 길을 만드신 게야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He hears you. &&& Anasko: You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you, even if you are Promised. &&& Anasko: I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can lie to yourself, shield your eyes from the truth, but the fact that you are here shows you are part of His plan.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B3"
msgid "I serve no one but myself."
msgstr "저는 제 자신만 섬기죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I serve no one but myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I serve no one but myself.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B2"
msgid "You can lie to yourself, shield your eyes from the truth, but the fact that you are here shows you are part of His plan."
msgstr "스스로에게 거짓말하고 눈에서 진실을 가릴 수는 있지만, 네가 여기 있다는 사실은 곧 너도 그분이 세우신 계획의 일부라는 뜻이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I do not serve the Great Serpent. I am the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I do not serve the Great Serpent. I am the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B1"
msgid "No. I have heard my grandfather's tale of the moment of contact. You are not what he described."
msgstr "아니. 난 조부님께 접촉의 순간에 대한 이야기를 들었다. 넌 조부님의 설명과는 달라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: I hear you is the revelation / Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: No. I have heard my grandfather's tale of the moment of contact. You are not what he described.|But to see you here, perhaps the Great Serpent works through you. That, in this dark moment, would be enough.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135B0"
msgid "I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you."
msgstr ""
"몇 번이고 손을 뻗어 보았지만... 메아리만 들릴 뿐이었지. 그런데 너, 이방인이 내 말을 들어주다니. 그리고 나도 처음으로 목소리가 "
"들린다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135AF"
msgid "Clearly your arrival here is fated. By stepping into this void, we are now linked."
msgstr "너의 도착이 운명이었던 게야. 이 공허에 발을 들임으로써 우리는 서로 연결되었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence. &&& Anasko: You... you are Promised... a follower of the Great Serpent! &&& Anasko: Or does my mind deceive me once more?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. I have heard my grandfather's tale of the moment of contact. You are not what he described.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135AC"
msgid "I do not serve the Great Serpent. I am the Great Serpent."
msgstr "전 위대한 뱀을 섬기지 않아요. 제가 바로 위대한 뱀이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He hears you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He hears you.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135AB"
msgid "You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you, even if you are Promised."
msgstr "너... 내 말을... 내 목소리를 듣는구나. 허나 난 너를 모른다. 네가 약속받은 자인데도 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Do you not hear my pleas?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0135AA"
msgid "Have you abandoned me, Great Serpent?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저를 버리셨나이까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D4
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110F2D6
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135A9"
msgid "My sister is stubborn, bordering on obstinate. Sadly, we have no choice but to yield to her request."
msgstr "우리 누님은 완전 고집불통인 사람이거든. 안됐지만 누님이 하라는 대로 해줄 수밖에 없다네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110F2D4
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110F2D6
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0135A8"
msgid "Go to the cave in my vision, near the edge of the crater. If my vision is true, you will find him there."
msgstr "내 환영에 나온 동굴로 가거라. 구덩이 가장자리 근처에 있다. 환영이 사실이라면, 거기서 그분을 찾게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I hear them and wish you would just shut up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hear them and wish you would just shut up.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0135A7"
msgid "You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you."
msgstr "너... 내 말을... 내 목소리를 듣는구나. 허나 난 너를 모른다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE4F
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0135A6"
msgid "What? That makes no sense at all. It may be the message was garbled. Still, it seems like you were able to make contact."
msgstr "뭐? 그건 전혀 말이 안 되는데. 메시지를 잘못 들은 걸 수도 있다고. 아무튼, 접촉을 할 수는 있었던 모양이구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, efforts to do... something, anything, about our current dilemma have fallen to political infighting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110E5E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013599"
msgid "What exactly am I signing up for? What do you want from me?"
msgstr "정확히 뭘 위해 가입하라는 거죠? 나한테서 뭘 원하는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly am I signing up for? What do you want from me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What exactly am I signing up for? What do you want from me?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110E5E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013598"
msgid "Well, efforts to do... something, anything, about our current dilemma have fallen to political infighting."
msgstr "글쎄요, 뭐라도... 뭐든지 해 달라는 거지요. 정치적인 내분으로 전락한 저희 딜레마 문제를 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly am I signing up for? What do you want from me?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110E5E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013597"
msgid "I believe your arrival, if nothing else, represents a sign from the Great Serpent Himself that we must finally put aside our differences and work together."
msgstr "난 그대의 도착이 최소한 이제라도 저희가 서로의 차이를 제쳐두고 함께 협력해야 한다는 위대한 뱀의 계시라고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly am I signing up for? What do you want from me?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110E5E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013596"
msgid "It must be ordained that you would appear before us now, able to hear the Speaker when no one else can."
msgstr "아무도 대변자님의 말씀을 듣지 못하는 지금, 그대가 저희 앞에 나타난 것은 정해진 일이었던 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, I have done all that I can! The Scaled Citadel itself has been transformed to petition you!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110D7D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013595"
msgid "I know that All Must Serve, but I need more! I require guidance! Take pity on us, and reveal the way forward!"
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다는 건 알지만, 부족하나이다! 인도가 필요하나이다! 저흴 불쌍히 여기시어, 앞길을 밝혀 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110D7D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013594"
msgid "Something about a gate in a citadel, and seeking the Great Serpent."
msgstr "성채 차원문 얘기도 했고, 위대한 뱀을 찾고 있더군요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: A difficult question. The original converts were accepted in the years after House Va'ruun first made contact with the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013593"
msgid "Why has no one else been converted in so long?"
msgstr "왜 그렇게 오랫동안 개종자가 없었던 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why has no one else been converted in so long?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Once the Serpent's Crusade began, there were fears that anyone from the outside could be spies, infiltrators.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013592"
msgid "A difficult question. The original converts were accepted in the years after House Va'ruun first made contact with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "어려운 질문이구나. 첫 번째 개종자들은 바룬 가문이 개척 성계와 처음 접촉한 뒤 몇 년 사이에 받아들여졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: A difficult question. The original converts were accepted in the years after House Va'ruun first made contact with the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: And after the Crusade... Few were eager to join. When Jinan Va'ruun's son Jarek took power, we pulled back. Rejected contact with non-believers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013591"
msgid "Once the Serpent's Crusade began, there were fears that anyone from the outside could be spies, infiltrators."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 시작되자, 외부에서 온 사람은 첩자나 정보원이 될지도 모른다는 두려움이 퍼졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Once the Serpent's Crusade began, there were fears that anyone from the outside could be spies, infiltrators.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: We removed any avenues for converts to find us. But there were those among us who hoped that one day, we might help others see the light of the Great Serpent's teachings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013590"
msgid "And after the Crusade... Few were eager to join. When Jinan Va'ruun's son Jarek took power, we pulled back. Rejected contact with non-believers."
msgstr ""
"그리고 성전이 끝나자... 합류하려는 이들은 거의 없었다. 지난 바룬 님의 아들이신 자렉 님이 권력을 잡으셨고, 우리는 물러났지. "
"불신자들과의 접촉을 거부했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: And after the Crusade... Few were eager to join. When Jinan Va'ruun's son Jarek took power, we pulled back. Rejected contact with non-believers.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: And if we can survive our current situation, your presence here now might sway opinions on future converts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358F"
msgid "We removed any avenues for converts to find us. But there were those among us who hoped that one day, we might help others see the light of the Great Serpent's teachings."
msgstr ""
"개종자들이 우릴 찾아낼 방법을 없애 버린 것이야. 허나 언젠가는 위대한 뱀의 가르침이 발하는 빛을, 다른 이들이 볼 수 있도록 돕고 "
"싶어한 사람들 또한 있었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: We removed any avenues for converts to find us. But there were those among us who hoped that one day, we might help others see the light of the Great Serpent's teachings.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110ECEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJobCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358E"
msgid "And if we can survive our current situation, your presence here now might sway opinions on future converts."
msgstr "그리고 우리가 지금 상황을 극복해낸다면, 지금 여기 있는 그대가 미래의 개종자에 대한 여론을 결정할지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Tell me brother -- will you be able to live with yourself?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Pray that you lose, brother. If I am to die, my ghost will never let you rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_11_DuelScene_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358D"
msgid "Shut up. You brought this on yourself, Amila."
msgstr "닥쳐라. 다 네 자업자득이다. 아밀라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Tell me brother -- will you be able to live with yourself? &&& Borhal: Shut up. You brought this on yourself, Amila. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: So be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_11_DuelScene_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358C"
msgid "Pray that you lose, brother. If I am to die, my ghost will never let you rest."
msgstr "패배하기만을 기도해라, 형제여. 내가 죽는다면 유령이 되어 죽을 때까지 괴롭힐 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Things are peaceful, and should stay that way. I'm against the Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do we have to make this decision right now?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F6B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_CouncilScene_SerpentsCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358B"
msgid "So be it."
msgstr "어쩔 수 없게 됐군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why are you so sure that I will die? I have been in plenty of scraps on the streets, and I am not some sheltered pushover like my brother.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01358A"
msgid "You seem eager to die."
msgstr "죽고 싶어 환장하는 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Shut up. You brought this on yourself, Amila. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_11_DuelScene_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013589"
msgid "Tell me brother -- will you be able to live with yourself?"
msgstr "말해 봐, 형. 그래 놓고서 평안히 살 수 있을 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You seem eager to die.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem eager to die.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's your funeral. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013588"
msgid "Why are you so sure that I will die? I have been in plenty of scraps on the streets, and I am not some sheltered pushover like my brother."
msgstr "왜 내가 죽을 거라고 확신하는 거지? 나도 길바닥에서 갖은 경험을 해 왔어. 형처럼 온실 속 화초 같은 작자가 아니라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He is trying to kill me! Why should I be the one to apologize?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013587"
msgid "All you have to do is apologize. Why is that so difficult?"
msgstr "그냥 사과를 하면 되는 거예요. 그게 그렇게 어렵습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your apology doesn't have to be earnest. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your apology doesn't have to be earnest. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013586"
msgid "It does not matter. An apology is an apology, and I will not humiliate myself like that."
msgstr "그게 문제냐고. 어쨌든 사과는 사과야. 그렇게 날 비참하게 만드는 짓거리를 하진 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It does not matter. An apology is an apology, and I will not humiliate myself like that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013585"
msgid "Your apology doesn't have to be earnest."
msgstr "사과하는 시늉만 해도 될 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013584"
msgid "I suppose the thought has crossed my mind -- maybe it would be better to be dead."
msgstr "그런 생각을 해 적이 있어. 아마 죽는 게 나을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013583"
msgid "I could be with my wife. Well, if the Great Serpent would let me be with her... we were never the most devout in Dazra."
msgstr ""
"다시 아내와 함께할 수 있겠지. 위대한 뱀께서 그렇게 해 주실지는 모르겠지만... 우리 부부는 다즈라에서 썩 독실한 편은 아니었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013582"
msgid "I am not sure that I want to die, but there really is not much to live for, is there?"
msgstr "죽고 싶은지는 확실히 단언할 수 없지만, 별로 살고 싶지는 않아. 그렇지 않아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013581"
msgid "But I am not just going to let Borhal end me. I cannot give him that satisfaction."
msgstr "그래도 보할이 순순히 나를 죽이도록 놔두지는 않을 거야. 그렇게 만족하는 꼴은 못 보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013580"
msgid "Maybe it would be better to be dead. There is not much to live for, is there? Especially nowadays."
msgstr "죽는 게 차라리 나을지도 몰라. 별로 살고 싶지도 않고. 그렇지 않아? 특히 요즘 시국에는."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357F"
msgid "I am not sure that I want to die, but I am growing tired of living. Sometimes it feels like my life has run its course."
msgstr "죽고 싶은지는 확실히 단언할 수 없지만, 이제 사는 게 싫증이 나. 종종 일생이 끝난 것처럼 느껴져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be honest. Do you want to die?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357E"
msgid "But I am not just going to let Borhal end me. I cannot give him that satisfaction."
msgstr "그래도 보할이 순순히 나를 죽이도록 놔두지는 않을 거야. 그렇게 만족하는 꼴은 못 보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing good will come from this duel. What are you trying to prove?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nothing good will come from this duel. What are you trying to prove?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357D"
msgid "You cannot just turn your back on family like Borhal has done to me."
msgstr "이렇게 가족에게 등을 돌려선 안돼. 보할이 나한테 한 짓거리가 맞냐고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing good will come from this duel. What are you trying to prove?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357C"
msgid "And now he wants to kill me..."
msgstr "날 죽이고 싶어 환장하다니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing good will come from this duel. What are you trying to prove?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357B"
msgid "If he wins, I hope the guilt of what he has done will rot him from the inside out. And if I win? It is justice."
msgstr "형이 이기면, 자기가 저지른 짓에 죄책감이 들어서 속마음부터 썩어버렸으면 좋겠어. 내가 이기면? 정의가 승리하는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose the thought has crossed my mind -- maybe it would be better to be dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01357A"
msgid "Be honest. Do you want to die?"
msgstr "솔직히 말하시죠. 죽고 싶지 않잖아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You cannot just turn your back on family like Borhal has done to me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013579"
msgid "Nothing good will come from this duel. What are you trying to prove?"
msgstr "결투해 봐야 좋을 게 없을 텐데요. 뭘 확인하고 싶은 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All you have to do is apologize. Why is that so difficult?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All you have to do is apologize. Why is that so difficult?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013578"
msgid "He is trying to kill me! Why should I be the one to apologize?"
msgstr "그 새끼가 날 죽이려 들었다고! 왜 내가 사과를 해야 하는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All you have to do is apologize. Why is that so difficult?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013577"
msgid "Borhal likes to paint me as a ne'er-do-well, but what type of psychopath wants to kill their own brother?"
msgstr "보할은 날 쓸모없는 인간으로 몰아가는데, 자기 친형제를 죽이려 드는 인간이야말로 사이코패스 아냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All you have to do is apologize. Why is that so difficult?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013576"
msgid "It is not fair. He should be the one begging for my forgiveness."
msgstr "완전히 잘못됐어. 형이 먼저 나한테 용서를 구해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not know. Ask him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013575"
msgid "Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that?"
msgstr "그런 일들이 있었는데도 왜 보할은 당신의 부모님을 사랑하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Pffft* I am not getting into that with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013574"
msgid "Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?"
msgstr "부모님이 당신을 학대할 때 보할이 막아 주려고 도와준 적이 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: in shock, realizing what has happened. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* I need to be alone with my brother.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013573"
msgid "Stop. Do not say that to me."
msgstr "그만. 그런 말은 나한테 하지 말게나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013572"
msgid "I do not know. Ask him."
msgstr "모르겠어. 형한테 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013571"
msgid "I loved my parents too, you know. And what hurt most, more than any beating, was knowing that they did not love me."
msgstr "나도 내 부모님을 사랑했어, 알아? 그리고 가장 마음 아팠던 건, 예전부터 부모님이 날 사랑하지 않았단 걸 깨달았던 거였지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013570"
msgid "Great Serpent, I wish I got the chance to sell my mother's urn. Serves her right."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 엄마의 유골함을 팔았으면 좋았을 텐데. 그 정도는 당해도 싸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him.  &&& Amila: No, I do not need your comfort. A duel is what he asked for, and he got what he wanted, the fool.|He put me in this position. Damn him, damn him.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356F"
msgid "Ugh! This... this should not have happened!"
msgstr "아아! 이... 이런 일은 일어나지 말았어야 했는데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Scuttle the duel? What is she talking about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356E"
msgid "What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!"
msgstr "무슨 짓을 한 거예요? 둘 다 기절시켰어야죠! 결투를 무산시켰어야 했던 거잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flippant, dismissive / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356D"
msgid "*Pffft* I am not getting into that with you."
msgstr "*피식하는 소리* 그런 말로 날 꼬실 수 없을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flippant, dismissive / Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356C"
msgid "*Sigh* Yes, to a point. He would beg them to stop, and volunteer to take some blows for me."
msgstr "*한숨* 그래, 어느 정도는. 형이 부모님을 말리곤 했지. 나 대신 자기가 잘못했다고 할 때도 있었고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356B"
msgid "But one day I could not take it anymore. I wanted to run to the guards, tell them how my parents would hit me, starve me."
msgstr "하지만 어느 날 난 더 이상 참을 수 없었어. 경비대에게 달려가서 부모님이 날 때리고 굶기고 있다고 말하고 싶었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01356A"
msgid "Borhal talked me out of it. He said that mother and father would find out, and the beatings would only get worse."
msgstr "근데 형이 나보고 하지 말랬어. 엄마, 아빠가 알게 되면, 오히려 구타가 더 심해질 거라면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013569"
msgid "I listened to him, and on and on it went..."
msgstr "그래서 형 말을 들었지만, 계속 지속됐고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. Finally I can begin to repair the damage Amila has done to the family name.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013568"
msgid "How are you feeling now that it's over."
msgstr "일이 끝났는데, 기분이 어떻습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him. &&& ...  &&& Borhal: Enough! I will not be having an argument over the corpse of my brother.|Danika, this is your betrayal. I had trusted you to guide them in how to be a second to Amila, not rope them into a scheme.  &&& Danika: This is insane. You can cremate Amila yourself. I am done.  &&& Borhal: You. Have you anything to say for yourself?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The duel was supposed to be fair and noble, but you and Danika... twisted it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013567"
msgid "This duel was one shameful act after another. I regret taking part in this."
msgstr "이 결투는 수치스러운 선택의 연속이었습니다. 저까지 연루되다니, 후회스럽네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's not your fault. It's nobody's fault. It'd almost make me feel better if it was.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013566"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "유감이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Yes, Amila was out of control. What happened here today was necessary, but I garner no joy from it.  &&& Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel! 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Amila is dead because of you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013565"
msgid "Tranquilize... Amila was not lying about the drink?"
msgstr "진정제라고... 아밀라가 거짓말을 했던 게 아니란 말인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Borhal: Tranquilize... Amila was not lying about the drink?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013564"
msgid "Amila is dead because of you!"
msgstr "당신 때문에 아밀라가 죽었다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't believe you actually went through with that barbarism.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't believe you actually went through with that barbarism.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013563"
msgid "Amila was out of control. He accepted the duel and knew the risks."
msgstr "아밀라는 자제심을 잃었어. 결투를 받아들였고, 위험도 알고 있었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: he's lying and trying to save face - really, he feels bad / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How are you feeling now that it's over.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you feeling now that it's over.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013562"
msgid "Good. Finally I can begin to repair the damage Amila has done to the family name."
msgstr "기분이 낫군. 드디어 아밀라가 우리 가문의 이름에 일으킨 피해를 복구할 수 있게 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him. &&& Danika: You do not get to make a decision like that. You have no right to play with a life!
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013561"
msgid "Enough! I will not be having an argument over the corpse of my brother."
msgstr "그만해라! 내 형제의 시체를 앞에 두고 말다툼하는 것은 용납하지 않겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: This is insane. You can cremate Amila yourself. I am done. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013560"
msgid "Danika, this is your betrayal. I had trusted you to guide them in how to be a second to Amila, not rope them into a scheme."
msgstr "다니카. 날 배신했군. 저자가 아밀라의 입회인 역할을 잘 수행하도록 도와줄 거라 믿었건만, 음모를 꾸미도록 부추기다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Amila was out of control. He accepted the duel and knew the risks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01355F"
msgid "I can't believe you actually went through with that barbarism."
msgstr "그런 야만적인 짓을 정말 끝까지 이행할 줄은 몰랐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amila needed every advantage he could get.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amila needed every advantage he could get.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Shut up! Both of you, shut up!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01355E"
msgid "That was not the point! You had the chance to stop this madness!"
msgstr "그게 중요한 게 아니잖아요! 이 미친 짓이 일어나지 않도록 막을 수 있던 거잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him.  &&& ...  &&& Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Amila: Scuttle the duel? What is she talking about? &&& Danika: Fool... Borhal is dead because of you.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do not put this on me! What you did was... it was murder!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01355D"
msgid "Your anger is completely misguided. You should have done more to end this."
msgstr "엉뚱한 사람한테 화를 내고 계시네요. 이런 일이 일어나지 않도록 당신이 더 최선을 다했어야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him.  &&& Amila: No, I do not need your comfort. A duel is what he asked for, and he got what he wanted, the fool.|He put me in this position. Damn him, damn him.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01355C"
msgid "Ugh! This... this should not have happened!"
msgstr "아아! 이... 이런 일은 일어나지 말았어야 했는데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Scuttle the duel? What is she talking about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
