#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01353C"
msgid "This duel was a mistake; a pointless tragedy. And I cannot even get mad at you for what you did, because... because I know that all of this is my fault."
msgstr ""
"이 결투는 실수였어. 무의미한 비극이지. 그리고 당신이 한 일에 대해 화를 낼 수조차 없어, 왜냐하면... 이게 다 내 잘못이라는 걸 "
"알고 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: I wish to be alone now. Your duties are fulfilled. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01353B"
msgid "It took the death of my brother for me to see what I have become..."
msgstr "형제가 죽고 나서야 내가 무슨 괴물이 됐는지 깨닫게 되다니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him.  &&& ...  &&& Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Amila: Scuttle the duel? What is she talking about? &&& Danika: Fool... Borhal is dead because of you.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We had a plan you stupid --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01353A"
msgid "You pushed the tranquilizer on me! You made things complicated."
msgstr "저한테 진정제를 쥐어 준 사람은 당신이잖아요! 당신 때문에 상황이 더 복잡해졌다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You pushed the tranquilizer on me! You made things complicated.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You pushed the tranquilizer on me! You made things complicated.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Shut up! Both of you, shut up!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013539"
msgid "We had a plan you stupid --"
msgstr "계획을 짰었잖아, 이 멍청이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal.  &&& ...  &&& Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Borhal: Tranquilize... Amila was not lying about the drink? &&& Danika: Amila is dead because of you!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You do not get to make a decision like that. You have no right to play with a life!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013538"
msgid "Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him."
msgstr "아밀라는 결투에서 이기든 지든, 처음부터 가망이 없었던 거죠. 제가 자비를 베풀어 준 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amila was doomed from the start, whether he won the duel or not. I took mercy on him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Enough! I will not be having an argument over the corpse of my brother.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013537"
msgid "You do not get to make a decision like that. You have no right to play with a life!"
msgstr "당신이 멋대로 그런 결정을 내리면 안 되는 거죠. 사람 목숨 갖고 장난칠 권리는 없잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was Amila's time. You know that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was Amila's time. You know that.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* I need to be alone with my brother.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013536"
msgid "I know, but there is no honor to be gained from dueling a weakened man."
msgstr "나도 아네. 하지만 약해진 사람과 결투하는 건 명예로운 일이 아니잖나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: You do not get to make a decision like that. You have no right to play with a life! &&& Borhal: Enough! I will not be having an argument over the corpse of my brother.|Danika, this is your betrayal. I had trusted you to guide them in how to be a second to Amila, not rope them into a scheme. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: You. Have you anything to say for yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013535"
msgid "This is insane. You can cremate Amila yourself. I am done."
msgstr "이건 미친 짓이야. 아밀라는 알아서 화장시키세요. 이젠 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Enough! I will not be having an argument over the corpse of my brother.|Danika, this is your betrayal. I had trusted you to guide them in how to be a second to Amila, not rope them into a scheme.  &&& Danika: This is insane. You can cremate Amila yourself. I am done. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sorry.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013534"
msgid "You. Have you anything to say for yourself?"
msgstr "당신. 당신은 스스로 뭐라 해명할 생각은 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have done everything, and he has left me with nothing!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013533"
msgid "What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?"
msgstr "아밀라가 어려움을 겪는 동안 당신은 어떻게 도와줬나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The family name is all we Adlams have left. My parents were great philanthropists. They built schools, parks, temples, monuments -- they were two prime citizens of House Va'ruun. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013532"
msgid "Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?"
msgstr "당신의 부모님은 아밀라는 물론, 당신까지 학대했더군요. 근데 왜 그렇게 부모에 대한 기억을 중요시하는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013531"
msgid "The family name is all we Adlams have left. My parents were great philanthropists. They built schools, parks, temples, monuments -- they were two prime citizens of House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"우리 애들럼 가족에게 남은 건 이제 가문의 명성이 전부일세. 내 부모님은 위대한 자선가들이셨지. 두 분 다 학교, 공원, 사원, 기념물을 "
"건설했네. 바룬 가문에서 가장 모범적인 신민들이셨던 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Stop. Do not say that to me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your duty as a second has ended. Take your payment and leave me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013530"
msgid "*Sigh* I need to be alone with my brother."
msgstr "*한숨* 동생과 둘만 있도록 날 내버려 두게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What all have you done to support Amila through his hardships?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352F"
msgid "I have done everything, and he has left me with nothing!"
msgstr "모든 걸 다 해 줬네. 그런데도 동생은 내게 티끌 하나 안 남겨줬지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, Great Serpent, no! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352E"
msgid "Would you be happy if Amila died?"
msgstr "아밀라가 죽으면 행복해질 것 같습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Would you be happy if Amila died?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Would you be happy if Amila died?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352D"
msgid "No, Great Serpent, no!"
msgstr "아니. 위대한 뱀이시여! 그건 아니야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reminiscent / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352C"
msgid "We were never the closest of brothers, as our personalities are just so different, but we were close enough. Heh, he was a free spirit, which irked my parents."
msgstr ""
"아주 친한 형제 사이는 아니었지. 우리는 성격이 너무 다르거든. 그래도 적당히 친하긴 했네. 흠, 어릴적 동생은 참 자유로운 영혼이었기 "
"때문에 부모님의 분노를 샀네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We were never the closest of brothers, as our personalities are just so different, but we were close enough. Heh, he was a free spirit, which irked my parents.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352B"
msgid "What was your relationship with Amila like before his addiction?"
msgstr "아밀라가 술에 중독되기 전엔 형제 관계가 어땠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01352A"
msgid "Make it quick, please."
msgstr "빨리 해 줘, 제발."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: surprise and confusion, not asking a question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013529"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Speaker: 
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110ED05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013528"
msgid "I would like to bring up the topic of our \"acting\" Speaker."
msgstr "대변자 '직무 대행' 문제를 논의하고자 하오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Unfortunately the city is in no condition for such a blanket transfer of power.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110ED05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013527"
msgid "When this role was chosen, it was meant to be a temporary position. Now I question whether House Ka'dic knows the meaning of the word."
msgstr ""
"이 직책이 처음 정해졌을 때는 임시직으로 선출된 거였소. 지금은 카딕 가문이 그 단어의 의미를 알기는 하는 건지 의구심이 드오만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kadic_Djimal: I would like to bring up the topic of our "acting" Speaker.|When this role was chosen, it was meant to be a temporary position. But as each day passes, it feels more and more permanent. &&& Speaker: Unfortunately the city is in no condition for such a blanket transfer of power.|I will continue to act as Speaker until things stabilize. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Which means we have no timetable for such talks to even begin. |We also do not have a process for electing a new Speaker when the time comes. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: It's unfortunate Anasko had no children. It would make the succession much more simple.
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Do not question my motives, Mediary. I sit on this seat to serve House Va'ruun and the city of Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110ED03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013526"
msgid "Or difficult, if the current regime continues to grip the seat so tightly."
msgstr "어려울지도 모르죠. 현 정권이 계속 자리를 꽉 잡고 있다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Kadic_Djimal, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: Which means we have no timetable for such talks to even begin. |We also do not have a process for electing a new Speaker when the time comes. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: It's unfortunate Anasko had no children. It would make the succession much more simple.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Do not question my motives, Mediary. I sit on this seat to serve House Va'ruun and the city of Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110ED02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013525"
msgid "Or difficult, if the current regime maintains its stranglehold on the seat."
msgstr "어려울 수도 있지요. 현 정권이 자리에 틀어박혀 있다면 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Unfortunately the city is in no condition for such a blanket transfer of power.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B18B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013524"
msgid "When this role was chosen, it was meant to be a temporary position. But as each day passes, it feels more and more permanent."
msgstr "이 직책이 처음 정해졌을 때는 임시직으로 선출된 거였어요. 그런데 날이 갈수록 점점 더 영구직이 되어가는 느낌이군요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: I would like to bring up the topic of our "acting" Speaker.|When this role was chosen, it was meant to be a temporary position. But as each day passes, it feels more and more permanent. &&& Speaker: Unfortunately the city is in no condition for such a blanket transfer of power.|I will continue to act as Speaker until things stabilize. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Which means we have no timetable for such talks to even begin. |We also do not have a process for electing a new Speaker when the time comes.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Or difficult, if the current regime maintains its stranglehold on the seat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110ED04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013523"
msgid "It's unfortunate Anasko had no children. It would make the succession much more simple."
msgstr "아나스코 님께 자녀가 없었던 게 안타깝구려. 있었다면 승계가 훨씬 간단했을 것을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: It's unfortunate Anasko had no children. It would make the succession much more simple.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B188
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013522"
msgid "We also do not have a process for electing a new Speaker when the time comes."
msgstr "그리고 때가 되면 새 대변자를 선출할 절차도 정해진 게 없고 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Which means we have no timetable for such talks to even begin. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B187
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013521"
msgid "I will continue to act as Speaker until things stabilize."
msgstr "상황이 안정될 때까지는 계속 대변자 대행직을 수행하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. Let us table the matter and proceed to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B185
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013520"
msgid "And I will continue to serve as Speaker until I alone deem it necessary to step down."
msgstr "그리고 난 내가 물러나야 한다고 판단할 때까지 계속 대변자 직무를 수행할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. Let us table the matter and proceed to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B185
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351F"
msgid "I remain committed to having a fair and democratic process in the future. But that time is not now."
msgstr "나는 앞으로도 공정하고 민주적인 절차를 마련하기 위해서 최선을 다하겠어. 하지만 지금은 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. Let us table the matter and proceed to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110B185
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_070_CouncilMeetings_Scene07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351E"
msgid "The issue of Speaker will be revisited. But we have more pressing needs at the moment."
msgstr "대변자 문제는 나중에 다시 얘기하세. 지금 당장은 더 시급한 문제가 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You just need to have a little faith. &&& Ekris: I am no heretic. But to risk so much on a vision... it is a leap of faith I cannot condone.|I will not stand in your way, however, as Inaza has stood in ours. &&& Inaza: You may not realize it now, dear brother, but our goals are one and the same.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will let you go then. But I endeavor you to make time, as the Great Serpent wills.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351D"
msgid "I don't have time for this."
msgstr "이러고 있을 시간이 없는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have time for this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have time for this.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Step through it, find Anasko, and complete the vision. Only then will his voice be heard. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351C"
msgid "I will let you go then. But I endeavor you to make time, as the Great Serpent wills."
msgstr "그럼 그냥 보내주마. 하지만 위대한 뱀의 뜻대로 시간을 내 준다면 좋겠구나."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: My ability has always been limited, but potent. Rarely am I blessed with a vision. When I am, they are decisive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Visions
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351B"
msgid "Are these visions of yours common?"
msgstr "그런 환영을 흔하게 보는 건가요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It is an unnatural thing, a hollow space dug into the backbone of the world.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01351A"
msgid "Can you describe this cave in more detail?"
msgstr "그 동굴을 더 자세히 설명해줄 수 있을까요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: 
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: If you point me to the cave, I can find him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_030_InazaGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013519"
msgid "Have you reconsidered my request?"
msgstr "내 요청을 다시 생각해 보았느냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Visions
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013518"
msgid "But it varies by Herald. Some spend their whole life sorting through visions, others may only get one in a lifetime."
msgstr "전령들마다 다르지. 어떤 이들은 평생 동안 환영과 함께 살아가기도 하고, 다른 이들은 인생에 단 한 번만 보기도 한단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are these visions of yours common?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ED00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Visions
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013517"
msgid "My ability has always been limited, but potent. Rarely am I blessed with a vision. When I am, they are decisive."
msgstr "내 능력은 언제나 제한적이지만 강력했지. 환영으로 축복받는 일은 드물지만, 보일 때마다 항상 중요한 역할을 했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hear them and wish you would just shut up. &&& Anasko: You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you.  &&& Anasko: I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. He works through you, and built the path to guide you to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013516"
msgid "The Great Serpent has guided me to you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 절 인도해 주셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you describe this cave in more detail?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013515"
msgid "It is an unnatural thing, a hollow space dug into the backbone of the world."
msgstr "부자연스러운 존재다. 세상의 근간에 파고든 텅 빈 공간이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013514"
msgid "To enter it is to risk your life."
msgstr "들어가려면 목숨을 걸어야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_040_Inaza_TL_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013513"
msgid "I take no comfort in asking you to make this journey. It is only because I understand its importance that I do."
msgstr "그런 여정을 부탁하는 내 마음도 결코 편하지 않단다. 그 중요성을 알고 있기 때문에 부탁하는 것이야."

#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_090_AnaskoInitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013512"
msgid "I speak into this void, and it answers with silence."
msgstr "공허 속에 질문하면 침묵으로 돌아오는구나."

#. PROMPT: I hear them and wish you would just shut up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you. 
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent has guided me to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013511"
msgid "I hesitate to ask. What manner of being are you? Do you truly serve His will?"
msgstr "묻기 망설여지는구나. 너는 어떤 존재인가? 진정 그분의 뜻을 섬기는가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Have you abandoned me, Great Serpent?  &&& Anasko: Do you not hear my pleas?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You... understand me -- hear my voice. But I do not know you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110DE49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013510"
msgid "I hear them and wish you would just shut up."
msgstr "잘 들었으니까 입 좀 닥쳐주시면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I have reached out so many times... to hear nothing but echoes. Yet you, an outsider, hear me plain. And for the first time, I hear you.|Clearly your arrival here is fated. By stepping into this void, we are now linked.|There is still reason to hope. The Great Serpent will see us through.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01350F"
msgid "But time is short, and the bridge collapses."
msgstr "하지만 시간이 얼마 남지 않았고, 다리는 무너졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110ECF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_100_AnaskoInitial
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01350E"
msgid "Find me in the Scaled Citadel. I will wait for you there."
msgstr "비늘 성채에서 날 찾아라. 거기서 기다리고 있겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. PROMPT: I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You... you are Promised... a follower of the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
