msgid "I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence."
msgstr "들립니다, 대변자님. 그리고 뵙게 되어 영광입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hear you, Speaker, and am honored by your presence.
