#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134EB"
msgid "Can we just for a moment what? Discuss whether or not to allow the first convert to House Va'ruun since before any of us were born? A bit late on that, it seems."
msgstr ""
"잠깐 기다려 주시면 뭐요? 우리가 태어나기 전부터 봐도 한 번도 없었던 바룬 가문 개종자를 받아들일지 말지 논의하나요? 그건 좀 늦은 것 "
"같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Please, can we just for a moment... &&& Djimal: Can we just for a moment what? Discuss whether or not to allow the first convert to House Va'ruun since before any of us were born? A bit late on that, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You're correct, I was not there. Because you elected to travel to the spaceport on your own, and then decide this on your own.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110D758
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134EA"
msgid "You were not there, you did not see Anasko. It felt different. We have already wasted so much time..."
msgstr "거기 있지도 않으셨고, 아나스코 님도 못 보셨잖습니까. 느낌이 달랐어요. 이미 시간을 너무 많이 낭비..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Can we just for a moment what? Discuss whether or not to allow the first convert to House Va'ruun since before any of us were born? A bit late on that, it seems. &&& Malibor: You were not there, you did not see Anasko. It felt different. We have already wasted so much time...
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Do not waste time with more bickering! Anasko, and by extension House Va'ruun, suffers with every passing moment!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110D757
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E9"
msgid "You're correct, I was not there. Because you elected to travel to the spaceport on your own, and then decide this on your own."
msgstr "맞아요, 거기 없었죠. 당신 혼자서 우주항에 가기로 결정했고, 그다음엔 당신 혼자서 이렇게 하기로 결정했으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Of course, Lovek. My apologies.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Anasko Va'ruun, like his father before him, has relied on the teachings of Jinan to guide us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110D756
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E8"
msgid "Please, Malibor. Do go on."
msgstr "자, 말리보어. 계속 해 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B399
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E7"
msgid "What happens now?"
msgstr "이제 어떻게 해야 되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm only one of you because it's necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B398
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E6"
msgid "You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal."
msgstr "그대는 약속받은 자다. 우리의 일원이지. 모두 그대를 동등하게 대해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: That may be so, for now. The Great Serpent has a plan for us all. We will see in time where yours leads.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B397
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E5"
msgid "But for the moment, the Council is awaiting your arrival."
msgstr "그래도 지금 당장은 대의회가 그대를 기다리고 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now? &&& Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That may be so, for now. The Great Serpent has a plan for us all. We will see in time where yours leads.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B396
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E4"
msgid "I'm only one of you because it's necessary."
msgstr "그냥 필요하다고 하니까 그쪽 일원이 된 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm only one of you because it's necessary.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm only one of you because it's necessary.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But for the moment, the Council is awaiting your arrival.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B395
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E3"
msgid "That may be so, for now. The Great Serpent has a plan for us all. We will see in time where yours leads."
msgstr "지금은 그럴지도 모르지. 위대한 뱀께는 우리 모두를 위한 계획이 있으시다. 때가 되면 그대가 어디로 이끌릴지 알 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now? &&& Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As the first convert in a very long time, it is a very particular honor at that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B394
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E2"
msgid "It's an honor to be part of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 일원이 되어 영광입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's an honor to be part of House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's an honor to be part of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But for the moment, the Council is awaiting your arrival.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B393
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E1"
msgid "As the first convert in a very long time, it is a very particular honor at that."
msgstr "아주 오랜 세월만에 나타난 첫 번째 개종자이니, 아주 특별한 영광이로구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now? &&& Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I am sure you will receive them. Hopefully you can find something more along the way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B392
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134E0"
msgid "I'm just in this for the credits."
msgstr "그냥 크레딧 벌려고 온 건데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't really want to be here, you know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't really want to be here, you know.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DF"
msgid "I will tell you a secret: We all feel that at one point or another. The Great Serpent places a heavy burden on the Promised."
msgstr "비밀을 하나 말해주마. 우리 모두가 가끔은 그렇게 느낀단다. 위대한 뱀께서 약속받은 자들에게 무거운 짐을 지우신 게지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't really want to be here, you know.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But for the moment, the Council is awaiting your arrival.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DE"
msgid "We do our best to fulfill it in our own way, but we do not always carry it with grace."
msgstr "우리도 나름대로 최선을 다해 그 짐을 지려 노력하지만, 항상 은혜롭게 지는 건 아니란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now? &&& Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will tell you a secret: We all feel that at one point or another. The Great Serpent places a heavy burden on the Promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B390
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DD"
msgid "I don't really want to be here, you know."
msgstr "딱히 여기 있고 싶진 않네요. 잘 아시겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm just in this for the credits.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just in this for the credits.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But for the moment, the Council is awaiting your arrival.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B391
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DC"
msgid "And I am sure you will receive them. Hopefully you can find something more along the way."
msgstr "분명 받을 수 있을 게다. 부디 길을 걸으며 더 중요한 것을 찾을 수 있길 바라마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Yes, its final resting place is directly above, very near where it first set down on this moon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_UnderMourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DB"
msgid "We're under the Mourning?"
msgstr "여긴 모어닝 호 밑인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, its final resting place is directly above, very near where it first set down on this moon.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: And, after the Serpent's Crusade, when the Mourning was damaged and would fly no more, it was only fitting that it return to this location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_UnderMourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134DA"
msgid "It was Jinan Va'ruun's guidance that led us to this precise spot, where he knew there would be temporary shelter waiting."
msgstr "우리는 지난 바룬 님의 인도에 따라 곧장 이곳에 도착했다. 그분께선 임시 피난처가 있다는 사실을 알았던 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're under the Mourning?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It was Jinan Va'ruun's guidance that led us to this precise spot, where he knew there would be temporary shelter waiting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_UnderMourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D9"
msgid "Yes, its final resting place is directly above, very near where it first set down on this moon."
msgstr "맞다. 바로 위쪽이 우주선의 마지막 안식처이지. 이 위성에 처음 착륙했던 곳과도 아주 가깝고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: It was Jinan Va'ruun's guidance that led us to this precise spot, where he knew there would be temporary shelter waiting.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B38B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_UnderMourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D8"
msgid "And, after the Serpent's Crusade, when the Mourning was damaged and would fly no more, it was only fitting that it return to this location."
msgstr "그리고 뱀의 성전이 끝난 뒤, 모어닝 호가 손상을 입어 더는 비행하지 못하게 됐을 때, 이곳으로 돌아오는 것은 당연한 일이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D7"
msgid "Please, just allow us a moment to explain."
msgstr "부디 설명할 시간을 주시지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default, Mujeen, Tevina
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B68F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104515B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D6"
msgid "You're back. Are you ready to submit your evidence?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요. 증거물을 제출할 준비가 됐나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: Don't take it personally.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D755
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_Arrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D5"
msgid "You seemed unhappy I was allowed to become part of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "내가 바룬 가문의 일원이 된 게 불만인 것 같던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seemed unhappy I was allowed to become part of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: We have been through so much these last few weeks. The Council is attempting to claw back some semblance of order from the chaos, steer things past this somehow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D754
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_Arrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D4"
msgid "Don't take it personally."
msgstr "나쁜 뜻은 아니었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: Don't take it personally.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: And then Malibor goes and throws you into the middle of all this without even consulting us. It's just one more breach of a protocol that barely exists anymore.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D753
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_Arrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D3"
msgid "We have been through so much these last few weeks. The Council is attempting to claw back some semblance of order from the chaos, steer things past this somehow."
msgstr "지난 몇 주간 너무 많은 일이 있었거든요. 대의회는 이 난장판에서 질서를 되찾고 어떻게든 이 상황을 헤쳐나가려 노력하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: exasperated / Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: We have been through so much these last few weeks. The Council is attempting to claw back some semblance of order from the chaos, steer things past this somehow.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_DjimalKadic: I am over it, I assure you. It is good to have you with us, and we are finally moving forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D752
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_Arrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D2"
msgid "And then Malibor goes and throws you into the middle of all this without even consulting us. It's just one more breach of a protocol that barely exists anymore."
msgstr ""
"그런데 말리보어가 우리랑 상의도 없이 당신을 이 난장판 한가운데 던져 놓은 거죠. 이젠 거의 의미도 없는 규약을 한번 더 어긴 셈이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_DjimalKadic: And then Malibor goes and throws you into the middle of all this without even consulting us. It's just one more breach of a protocol that barely exists anymore.
#. ALIAS: MQ_DjimalKadic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D751
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Djimal_TL_Arrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D1"
msgid "I am over it, I assure you. It is good to have you with us, and we are finally moving forward."
msgstr "이제는 괜찮아요. 장담할게요. 우리와 함께 해 줘서 좋네요. 드디어 진전이 있으니까요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: Who is to say? Hasmak has always been hard to read, and his role as House Elder is new. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D6EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134D0"
msgid "What are your thoughts on House Dul'kehf running things?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 책임을 맡게 된 걸 어떻게 생각하시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on House Dul'kehf running things?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D6EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CF"
msgid "Who is to say? Hasmak has always been hard to read, and his role as House Elder is new."
msgstr "누가 알겠나? 해즈막은 항상 속을 읽기 힘들었는데, 이젠 가문 장로까지 됐으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D6EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CE"
msgid "I expect he will maintain a level of secrecy that House Dul'kehf has always kept..."
msgstr "아마 둘케프 가문이 지금껏 지켜온 비밀주의를 계속 유지해 나가겠지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110D6EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_DulkehfChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CD"
msgid "An unwise move for one as inexperienced as he."
msgstr "그렇게 미숙한 자에겐 현명하지 못한 일이지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What exactly does a Herald do?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Together with the Speaker, we work to divine the intent of the Great Serpent, and to spread his message to the people of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJob
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CC"
msgid "The High Council supports the Speaker on matters practical and political. Heralds, like myself, provide spiritual and philosophical guidance."
msgstr "대의회는 현실적이고 정치적인 문제에서 대변자님을 지원하지. 나 같은 전령들은 영적이고 철학적인 인도를 제공해 드린단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: The High Council supports the Speaker on matters practical and political. Heralds, like myself, provide spiritual and philosophical guidance.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: And, as time permits, I make myself available to the people of Dazra for that same guidance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJob
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CB"
msgid "Together with the Speaker, we work to divine the intent of the Great Serpent, and to spread his message to the people of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "대변자님과 함께 위대한 뱀의 신성한 의도를 이해하고, 그분의 전언을 바룬 가문 신민들에게 전하려 노력하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Together with the Speaker, we work to divine the intent of the Great Serpent, and to spread his message to the people of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: I exist to serve. As do we all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJob
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134CA"
msgid "And, as time permits, I make myself available to the people of Dazra for that same guidance."
msgstr "그리고 나도 직접 시간 되는 대로 다즈라 신민들에게 그런 인도를 전해주려 하고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: And, as time permits, I make myself available to the people of Dazra for that same guidance.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJob
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C9"
msgid "I exist to serve. As do we all."
msgstr "난 섬기기 위해 존재한단다. 우리 모두 그렇지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: The Ministry of State maintains the very society of Dazra. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C8"
msgid "Can you tell me more about the Ministry of State?"
msgstr "국무성에 대해 더 말해줄 수 있습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: I was at the Halls of Obedience discussing matters that do not concern you when I first saw it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C7"
msgid "What were you doing when the cataclysm struck?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 뭘 하고 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about the Ministry of State? 
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C6"
msgid "The Ministry of State maintains the very society of Dazra."
msgstr "국무성은 다즈라의 사회를 유지하는 역할을 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C5"
msgid "We enforce the common goals, that our lives are dedicated to House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent."
msgstr "우리의 인생을 바룬 가문과 위대한 뱀께 바친다는 공동의 목표를 집행하는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C4"
msgid "In order for everyone to contribute, we do not allow for the distractions of disillusion and heresy."
msgstr "모두가 공헌해야만 하기 때문에, 의심이나 이단 행위 같은 방해 요소는 용납하지 않는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What were you doing when the cataclysm struck?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C3"
msgid "I was at the Halls of Obedience discussing matters that do not concern you when I first saw it."
msgstr "복종의 전당에서 네가 신경 쓸 필요 없는 문제를 논의하던 중에 대재난을 처음 목격했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C2"
msgid "A strange light emanating from the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "비늘 성채에서 이상한 빛이 뿜어져 나오더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_CataclysmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C1"
msgid "It was but a moment later, and light filled the entire room, followed by an indescribable sound... and then silence."
msgstr "잠시 후에 빛이 방 전체를 가득 채우더니, 도저히 말로는 표현 못 할 소리가 들렸고... 침묵이 찾아왔다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: House Veth'aal will thrive for centuries to come. I will see to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_NoHeirScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134C0"
msgid "What will become of House Veth'aal with no heir?"
msgstr "베타알 가문에 후계자가 없으면 어떻게 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will become of House Veth'aal with no heir?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_NoHeirScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BF"
msgid "House Veth'aal will thrive for centuries to come. I will see to it."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 앞으로 수 세기 동안 번창할 것이다. 내 눈으로 지켜볼 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_NoHeirScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BE"
msgid "There are many of noble blood far more worthy than my own son who would gladly take on the mantle."
msgstr "내 아들보다 훨씬 더 자격 있는 명문가 혈통은 얼마든지 있으니 말이다. 기꺼이 그 역할을 맡으려 하겠지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: My main focus is to return true order and bring a renewed sense of devotion to Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_SpeakerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BD"
msgid "What are your priorities now as Speaker?"
msgstr "지금 대변자로서 생각하고 있는 우선순위는 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your priorities now as Speaker?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_SpeakerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BC"
msgid "My main focus is to return true order and bring a renewed sense of devotion to Dazra."
msgstr "가장 중요한 건 진정한 질서를 되찻고, 다즈라에 새로운 헌신의 자세를 불어넣는 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_SpeakerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BB"
msgid "The current level of idleness among the people is unacceptable."
msgstr "지금 신민들 사이에 퍼진 게으름은 용납할 수 없는 수준이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_SpeakerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134BA"
msgid "I will institute true dedication of the body to Dazra and the mind to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "몸은 다즈라에 바치고, 정신은 위대한 뱀께 바치는 진정한 헌신을 명할 것이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_ViktorVethaal: With Razma as Speaker, there is no chance of Dazra regaining its former glory.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B9"
msgid "What are your thoughts on House Ka'dic running things?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 책임을 맡게 된 걸 어떻게 생각하시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are your thoughts on House Ka'dic running things?
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B8"
msgid "With Razma as Speaker, there is no chance of Dazra regaining its former glory."
msgstr "라즈마가 대변자가 됐으니, 다즈라가 옛 영광을 되찾을 기회는 사라졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MQ_ViktorVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B3B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Viktor_TL_KadicChosenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B7"
msgid "I believe she will reopen our walls to the Settled Systems, exposing our populace to a level of heresy unheard of since before the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "분명 라즈마는 개척 성계를 막아주던 벽을 허물고, 우리 대중들을 뱀의 성전 이후로 전례 없던 수준의 이단에 노출시킬 것이다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: The High Council supports the Speaker on matters practical and political. Heralds, like myself, provide spiritual and philosophical guidance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B38A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_HeraldJob
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B6"
msgid "What exactly does a Herald do?"
msgstr "전령이 하는 일은 정확히 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Vaeric is on a groat farm in the highlands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B5"
msgid "You were saying? About Vaeric?"
msgstr "말하던 중이었죠? 배릭 얘기요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Vaeric is on a groat farm in the highlands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B4"
msgid "You were saying?"
msgstr "말하던 중이었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Believes the player has killed Vaeric. Controlled anger. / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Vaeric is on a groat farm in the highlands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B3"
msgid "The very sight of you offends me. I wish only to be rid of you."
msgstr "당신을 보는 것만으로도 기분 나쁘네요. 좀 사라져 줬으면 좋겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: You were saying? About Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great Serpent steel me...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B2"
msgid "I have news that requires utmost secrecy."
msgstr "절대 비밀로 해야 하는 소식이 있는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hoping the player is going to tell her that her nephew lives. / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have news that requires utmost secrecy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B1"
msgid "Great Serpent steel me..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저를 굳세게 하소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: You were saying? About Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What could you...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134B0"
msgid "I bring information for you alone."
msgstr "당신만 알아야 할 정보를 가져왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Quickly cuts herself off when she realizes something / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I bring information for you alone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bring information for you alone.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AF"
msgid "What could you..."
msgstr "그게 무슨..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hoping the player is going to tell her that her nephew lives. / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I bring information for you alone.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AE"
msgid "*gasp* Serpent give me strength..."
msgstr "*숨막힘* 뱀이시여. 저에게 힘을 주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: You were saying? About Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AD"
msgid "Fine. I'll be going."
msgstr "알았어요. 가 보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Fine. I'll be going.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Fine. I'll be going.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AC"
msgid "Go."
msgstr "가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: You were saying? About Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A fine question after I trusted you with vital information about our family and asked you to spare my nephew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
