#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AB"
msgid "Can I trust you to keep a secret?"
msgstr "비밀을 지켜줄 거라고 믿어도 되겠죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "I" and "you" / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can I trust you to keep a secret?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I trust you to keep a secret?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134AA"
msgid "A fine question after I trusted you with vital information about our family and asked you to spare my nephew."
msgstr "참 좋은 질문 하시네요. 당신을 믿고 우리 가족에 대한 중요 정보까지 말해주면서 조카를 살려달라고 했잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can I trust you to keep a secret?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I have news that requires utmost secrecy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A9"
msgid "I should have put the same question to you myself."
msgstr "저도 똑같은 질문을 할 걸 그랬네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me... &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent is truly merciful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A8"
msgid "Your nephew is still alive."
msgstr "당신 조카는 아직 살아있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me...
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A7"
msgid "My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask."
msgstr "심장 뛸 정도로 기대되는데, 그래도 물어보기 겁나네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your nephew is still alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your nephew is still alive.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A6"
msgid "The Great Serpent is truly merciful."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 진정 자비로우시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I refuse to take a life over a family squabble. Vaeric lives.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I refuse to take a life over a family squabble. Vaeric lives.
