#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A5"
msgid "You speak the truth..."
msgstr "진실을 말하는군요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me... &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
