#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A4"
msgid "I refuse to take a life over a family squabble. Vaeric lives."
msgstr "집안 싸움 때문에 누굴 죽이지는 않기로 했어요. 배릭은 살아 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me... &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you speak true?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A3"
msgid "The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy."
msgstr "그 이단자는 살아 있어요. 위대한 뱀께서 자비를 보여 주셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0134A2"
msgid "Do you speak true?"
msgstr "그게 정말인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me... &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You would conjure false hope in a grieving woman and then turn your back?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
