msgid "Actually, never mind."
msgstr "사실, 아무것도 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric's alive. I told Viktor what he wanted to hear to get the access code.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric's alive. I told Viktor what he wanted to hear to get the access code.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
