msgid "Great Serpent..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have news that requires utmost secrecy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Great Serpent steel me... &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My heart beats with anticipation, and yet I fear to ask.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01349F"
msgid "Vaeric's alive. I told Viktor what he wanted to hear to get the access code."
msgstr "배릭은 살아있어요. 접속 코드를 받으려고 빅토르가 듣고 싶어하던 말을 해준 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Actually, never mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Actually, never mind.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01349E"
msgid "You would conjure false hope in a grieving woman and then turn your back?"
msgstr "슬퍼하는 여자한테 가짜 희망을 줘 놓고서는 그냥 가 버린다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Actually, never mind.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01349D"
msgid "If you were not \"chosen\" I would see you executed out of spite."
msgstr "당신이 '선택받은 자'만 아니었어도 잔인하게 죽여버렸을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "Never." / Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Actually, never mind.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01349C"
msgid "Never speak to me again."
msgstr "다시는 말 걸지 말아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Do you speak true?
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric is on a groat farm in the highlands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01349B"
msgid "Where is he? I must see him."
msgstr "어디 있죠? 만나봐야겠어요."

# EDID: [010CE241], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "01349A"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

