#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013497"
msgid "I... I understand."
msgstr "아... 알겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My nephew... a groat farmer.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013496"
msgid "I always knew that Viktor would drive him away."
msgstr "빅토르가 그 애를 쫓아낼 줄 알고 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013495"
msgid "Vaeric often spoke to me of his own dreams and aspirations, and they never did include House politics."
msgstr "배릭은 종종 자기 꿈이랑 포부를 말해주곤 했는데, 가문 정치에 대한 얘기는 하나도 없었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric is better off away from here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013494"
msgid "I think even Viktor knew he was unhappy, but his pride only allowed him to see a boy that would follow in his footsteps."
msgstr "빅토르도 그 애가 불행하다는 건 알았겠지만, 자존심 때문에 아들이 자기 발자취를 따라야 한다고만 생각한 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Do you speak true? &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Serpent bless you. To know he's safe is enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013493"
msgid "He is safe, and that's all you need to know."
msgstr "지금은 안전해요. 그것만 아시면 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He is safe, and that's all you need to know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He is safe, and that's all you need to know.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I always knew that Viktor would drive him away. 
