#. TOPIC: 0110B0AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013492"
msgid "Serpent bless you. To know he's safe is enough."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길. 무사하단 걸 알면 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Do you speak true? &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is as I feared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013491"
msgid "He's living a better life away from Dazra and the Great Serpent."
msgstr "지금은 다즈라와 위대한 뱀에게서 벗어나서 더 나은 삶을 살고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's living a better life away from Dazra and the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's living a better life away from Dazra and the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I always knew that Viktor would drive him away. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013490"
msgid "It is as I feared."
msgstr "걱정했던 그대로네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic lives. The Great Serpent has shown mercy. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Do you speak true? &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: Where is he? I must see him.
