#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Understood.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01348F"
msgid "All I can tell you is Vaeric is alive. Nothing more."
msgstr "말해줄 수 있는 건 배릭이 살아있다는 것뿐입니다. 그 외에는 말 못 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All I can tell you is Vaeric is alive. Nothing more.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All I can tell you is Vaeric is alive. Nothing more.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I always knew that Viktor would drive him away. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
