msgid "Understood."
msgstr "알겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric is on a groat farm in the highlands. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: My nephew... a groat farmer. &&& MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I always knew that Viktor would drive him away. |Vaeric often spoke to me of his own dreams and aspirations, and they never did include House politics.|I think even Viktor knew he was unhappy, but his pride only allowed him to see a boy that would follow in his footsteps.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My heart tells me that you are right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01348D"
msgid "Vaeric is better off away from here."
msgstr "이곳에서 떨어져 사는 게 배릭한테도 좋을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric is better off away from here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric is better off away from here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: As much as I want to see his face, it is enough to know that Vaeric is alive and safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
