msgid "My heart tells me that you are right."
msgstr "진실을 말한다는 게 가슴으로 느껴지네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I only wanted you to know the truth.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I only wanted you to know the truth.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: As much as I want to see his face, it is enough to know that Vaeric is alive and safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A2
