#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01347F"
msgid "With all that we have seen, it is hard to be sure."
msgstr "지금까지 본 것만으로는 확신하기 어렵구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01347E"
msgid "The disaster that swept through Dazra was one kind of crisis. But to have lost the Speaker... That is something else. Something deeper."
msgstr "다즈라를 휩쓸어버린 재난은 하나의 위기였을 뿐이다. 허나 대변자님을 잃은 것은... 다른 이야기지. 더 난해한 문제다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01347D"
msgid "Anasko was, if nothing else, a symbol for the people of our link to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "아나스코 님은 어쨌든 위대한 뱀과 우리 신민들을 연결해 주는 상징과도 같은 존재였다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01347C"
msgid "Without him to guide us, it is hard to know what will come. But perhaps now more than ever, we need to look to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그분의 인도가 없다면 어떻게 될지 알기 어렵지. 허나 지금이야말로 그 어느 때보다 위대한 뱀을 바라봐야 할 때인지도 모르겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01347B"
msgid "We are, after all, still His Promised. We must believe that He will see us through."
msgstr "우린 결국 그분의 약속받은 자들이니 말이다. 그분도 우릴 계속 지켜보시리라 믿어야 한다."

