#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Your arrival is well-timed. Some interesting new information has come to light.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B3CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013467"
msgid "What can I say? Sometimes field work requires a hearty constitution."
msgstr "뭐라 말씀드려야 할까요? 현장 업무에는 때로 강인한 체력이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: None at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B3CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013466"
msgid "Welcome back! Did you have any difficulty obtaining those tissue samples?"
msgstr "돌아오셨군요! 조직 샘플을 채취하는 데 어려움은 없으셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: None at all. &&& AzadDubas: I'm glad to hear it, because there's more work to do. &&& AzadDubas: Your arrival is well-timed. Some interesting new information has come to light.|I'll take those tissue samples, and here's your payment. &&& AzadDubas: Sherine, dear, would you tell our dauntless research assistant about the latest news?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I hope you enjoyed your little jaunt into the field, because I'll be sending you right back out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B3C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013465"
msgid "With pleasure."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Ecological studies, mainly. Sherine's field of expertise is botany, and mine is biology.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B233
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013464"
msgid "What kind of research do you conduct here?"
msgstr "이곳에서 어떤 연구를 하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of research do you conduct here?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013463"
msgid "Ecological studies, mainly. Sherine's field of expertise is botany, and mine is biology."
msgstr "주로 생태학 연구를 합니다. 셰린은 식물학 전공자고, 저는 생물학 전공자입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013462"
msgid "We keep an eye on the flora and fauna, the health of which are vital to the local settlements."
msgstr "저희는 현지 주민들에게 생명줄이나 다름없는 동식물들의 상태를 놓치지 않고 관찰하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B232
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013461"
msgid "The people, the creatures, and the land exist in symbiosis, as the Great Serpent intended."
msgstr "위대한 뱀 님께서 의도하신 대로, 신민, 생물, 대지는 공생 관계에 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy, in the mood of an enthusiastic school teacher. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How will I know which plants to get samples from?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLPlants
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013460"
msgid "Employ your powers of observation!"
msgstr "관찰력을 발휘해 보세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLPlants
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345F"
msgid "As you travel throughout the area, compare the appearances of the plants that you see."
msgstr "이 지역을 여행하면서, 여러분이 보는 식물의 외관을 비교해 보세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLPlants
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345E"
msgid "What you're looking for is a specimen with obvious abnormalities."
msgstr "당신이 찾아야 할 건 명백하게 이상이 있는 표본이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLPlants
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345D"
msgid "Also, these new plant strains grow in clusters, so there will likely be more than one in the same area."
msgstr "또한, 새 식물 변종은 군집을 이루어 자라기 때문에, 같은 지역에 하나 이상 있을 가능성이 높아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Employ your powers of observation!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B231
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLPlants
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345C"
msgid "How will I know which plants to get samples from?"
msgstr "어떤 식물에서 샘플을 채취해야 할지 어떻게 알 수 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Perhaps, but a review of the facts can often be beneficial.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345B"
msgid "What have we learned so far? Is the picture starting to become clear?"
msgstr "지금까지 알아낸 게 뭐 있나요? 그림 전체 윤곽이 좀 보이시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What have we learned so far? Is the picture starting to become clear?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01345A"
msgid "Perhaps, but a review of the facts can often be beneficial."
msgstr "아마도요. 그래도 사실 관계를 다시 정리해 보는 게 좋을 거 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013459"
msgid "We surmise that the recent incident in Dazra has caused changes in the local ecosystem."
msgstr "저희는 최근 다즈라에서 발생한 그 사고가 지역 생태계에 변화를 일으켰다고 추정했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013458"
msgid "We began to hear about corpses of otherwise healthy animals that show no obvious cause of death."
msgstr "아무런 문제 없이 멀쩡해 보이던 동물들이 갑자기 죽은 채 발견됐다는 소식을 들었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013457"
msgid "Around the same time, strange new specimens of a local plant began to appear."
msgstr "같은 시기에, 지역 서식 식물 중 이상한 표본이 새로 나타나기 시작했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013456"
msgid "These phenomena don't yet pose any danger to people, but they do impact our sources of sustenance."
msgstr "특이 현상이 사람에게 위험을 초래하는 건 아직 아니지만, 우리의 영양분 공급원에는 이미 영향을 미치고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadTLRecap
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013455"
msgid "For that reason, we need to get to the bottom of this mystery and devise a solution."
msgstr "그러니, 우리는 이 수수께끼의 진실을 밝히고 해결책을 모색해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Well, it's just a theory, really.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLChemical
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013454"
msgid "How will this experimental compound make the plants less toxic?"
msgstr "이 화합물 시제품이 어떻게 식물의 독성을 줄일 수 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How will this experimental compound make the plants less toxic?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLChemical
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013453"
msgid "Well, it's just a theory, really."
msgstr "음, 독성을 줄일 수 있다는 건 그냥 가설일 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLChemical
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013452"
msgid "The compound was developed with the intent to expand our range of edible local flora."
msgstr "이 화합물은 더 많은 지역 식물들을 우리가 섭취할 수 있게 만들려는 의도로 개발됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLChemical
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013451"
msgid "With some creative genetic editing, I was hoping to boost the nutritional content of plants we don't normally eat."
msgstr "독창적인 유전자 편집 방식을 써서, 우리가 평소에 먹지 않는 식물의 영양분 함량을 높이고 싶었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110B22C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineTLChemical
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013450"
msgid "With time and study, that same process could be adapted to remove toxins from poisonous plants."
msgstr "시간이 지나고 연구가 진척되면, 동일한 방식으로 독성 식물에서 독소를 제거할 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Great surprised, disbelief / Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wait, did you say experimental compound? Because I did find this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01344F"
msgid "Pirates! Here on Va'ruun'kai! I could scarcely believe it."
msgstr "해적이라니요! 이 바룬카이에! 믿을 수가 없었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sort of with a groan, like you just a bad joke / Tired / to Player Default
