#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01344C"
msgid "Not exactly the sort of place I was expecting to see a comedy routine."
msgstr "코미디 공연을 보게 될 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Further study of these unusual plants is clearly in order.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Based on our information, these unusual new strains aren't limited to a specific area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01344B"
msgid "You really are cut out for this kind of work."
msgstr "정말 이런 일에 적합한 분이시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01344A"
msgid "It's increasingly clear the event affected the ecosystem in some way, but the details elude us."
msgstr "그 사고가 어떤 식으로든 생태계에 영향을 미쳤다는 것이 점점 분명해지고 있지만, 자세한 방식은 알 수 없네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013449"
msgid "Even gravity itself seems to have been briefly altered. Remarkable!"
msgstr "심지어 중력 자체도 일시적으로 변경된 것 같습니다. 놀랍군요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D743
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013448"
msgid "*Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around."
msgstr "*한숨* 동생한테 기회는 최대한 줬네. 돈도 최대한 줬고... 제발 정신을 다잡으라고 몇 번이고 애원도 했단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D743
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013447"
msgid "But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain."
msgstr "하지만 몇 년 동안 계속 고통과 수치스러움만 느꼈지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D743
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013446"
msgid "Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end."
msgstr "빌어먹을 놈... 진작에 결국 이렇게 끝장을 봐야 한단 걸 알았어야 했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you think I wanted this to happen? I tried to stop this downward spiral countless times. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D742
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013445"
msgid "If you knew it would end like this, why didn't you intervene?"
msgstr "사태가 이렇게 치달을 줄 알았으면서 왜 막을려고 하지 않았죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you knew it would end like this, why didn't you intervene?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you knew it would end like this, why didn't you intervene?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D741
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013444"
msgid "Do you think I wanted this to happen? I tried to stop this downward spiral countless times."
msgstr "나라고 일이 이러게 되길 바랐을 것 같나? 이 악순환을 멈추려고 수도 없이 노력했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you knew it would end like this, why didn't you intervene?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D741
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013443"
msgid "It was like saving someone from drowning, only for them to leap back into the ocean."
msgstr "마치 물에 빠져 죽기 직전인 사람을 계속 구해 줘도, 자꾸만 그 사람이 바다에 뛰어드는 느낌이었단 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you knew it would end like this, why didn't you intervene?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D741
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013442"
msgid "Amila refuses to be helped, and he is determined to take me and the family name down with him."
msgstr "아밀라는 도움받기를 거부했네. 죽는 날까지 나와 우리 가문의 명성을 무너뜨릴 생각뿐이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not at all. I have served my time in the military. Amila's... condition, made him unfit for service. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D740
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013441"
msgid "Do you think Amila has a chance of beating you?"
msgstr "아밀라가 당신과 싸워 이길 가능성이 있을 것 같습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you think Amila has a chance of beating you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think Amila has a chance of beating you?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013440"
msgid "Not at all. I have served my time in the military. Amila's... condition, made him unfit for service."
msgstr "전혀 없지. 난 군 복무를 마쳤다네. 아밀라는... 병역판정검사를 통과하지 못했지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you think Amila has a chance of beating you?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343F"
msgid "He may put up a good fight, but I will surely be the victor."
msgstr "녀석이 실력을 뽐낼지 모르지만, 결국 승리하는 건 나일 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Right. I take no pleasure in this, but after today, what he did... he needs to be dealt with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343E"
msgid "One way or another, you won't have to worry about him soon."
msgstr "어떤 식으로든, 이제 동생에 관해 걱정할 필요는 없게 되겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: One way or another, you won't have to worry about him soon.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: One way or another, you won't have to worry about him soon.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: If that is all, you may take your leave. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343D"
msgid "Right. I take no pleasure in this, but after today, what he did... he needs to be dealt with."
msgstr "그렇네. 나도 즐겁자고 이러는 건 아니네. 오늘, 녀석이 한 짓을 보면... 내가 처리해 줘야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not angry or irritated, being truthful / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe your answers to my questions will help me with my job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343C"
msgid "No, you are not my second. I do not see how this is pertinent to your duties."
msgstr "싫네. 내 입회인도 아니지 않는가. 이게 자네가 할 일과 무슨 관계가 있는지 모르겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343B"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* Fine, but do try to be brief. I would prefer to be alone so that I may enjoy what could very well be my final moments alive. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01343A"
msgid "I want to ask you some more personal questions."
msgstr "좀 더 사적인 질문을 하고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: If that is all, you may take your leave. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D73A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013439"
msgid "It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it."
msgstr "마음을 정하신 것 같으니 저는 이만 가 보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't. &&& Borhal: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors. &&& Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.|But instead, it has been endless years of dishonor and pain.|Damn him... I should have known years ago that this would be the only way things would end.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is nothing that could lead to me calling it off. An apology from Amila is worthless. He always, always falls right back into his old ways. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D738
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013438"
msgid "What would it take for you to call off the duel?"
msgstr "어떻게 하면 결투를 취소하실 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No concerns here. &&& Danika: Very good.  &&& Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties.  &&& Danika: Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this.|I will try and find another peaceful solution to this problem, should you be unsuccessful in convincing them to call it off.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Duels were quite common a hundred years ago, but have become more rare with each passing generation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013437"
msgid "Are duels commonplace in Va'ruun culture?"
msgstr "바룬 가문 사회에서는 원래 흔하게 결투를 벌이나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would it take for you to call off the duel?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What would it take for you to call off the duel?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D737
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013436"
msgid "There is nothing that could lead to me calling it off. An apology from Amila is worthless. He always, always falls right back into his old ways."
msgstr ""
"결투를 취소하게 만들 수 있는 건 아무것도 없네. 아밀라의 사과는 아무 소용 없어. 놈은 항상, 항상 옛 모습처럼 엉망이 될 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would it take for you to call off the duel?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D737
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013435"
msgid "There is no apology grand enough to make up for nearly trading your late mother's remains to fund an addiction. That is... inconceivable."
msgstr "어머니의 유골함을 팔아 술을 퍼마시려 한 걸 사과 몇마디로 넘어갈 수 있을까. 참... 상상할 수가 없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are duels commonplace in Va'ruun culture?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are duels commonplace in Va'ruun culture?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013434"
msgid "Duels were quite common a hundred years ago, but have become more rare with each passing generation."
msgstr "백 년 전까진 꽤 자주 결투가 있었다더군요. 하지만 여러 세대가 지나면서 점점 흔하지 않은 일이 되었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are duels commonplace in Va'ruun culture?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Let's get going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013433"
msgid "At this point, the Adlam family is the only one that still takes part in this custom."
msgstr "오늘날에는, 사실상 애들럼 가문 말고는 이런 풍습을 지키는 사람들은 없다고 할 수 있겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You mentioned koza. What is that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned koza. What is that?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013432"
msgid "An alcohol made from groat milk. Amila is absolutely dependent on it, and his wife was too."
msgstr "그로트 젖으로 만든 술일세. 아밀라는 코자에 완전히 중독되어 있지. 제수씨도 그랬었다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You mentioned koza. What is that?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013431"
msgid "The damned stuff rots your brain, I swear. He has always been a troublemaker, but once the koza took over, he went from bad to worse."
msgstr ""
"그 빌어먹을 술이 뇌를 썩게 만드는 게 틀림없어. 확실해. 동생은 전에도 문제아였지만, 코자에 빠진 이후로는 걷잡을 수 없이 더 나빠졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You mentioned koza. What is that?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013430"
msgid "Now he is just an addict and a thief. I will be putting him out of his misery."
msgstr "이제 놈은 중독자에 도둑놈일 뿐이야. 내가 그 비참한 삶을 끝마칠 수 있도록 해 줄 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An alcohol made from groat milk. Amila is absolutely dependent on it, and his wife was too. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01342F"
msgid "You mentioned koza. What is that?"
msgstr "코자 때문에 문제라고 하셨죠? 코자라는 게 뭡니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you hate your brother?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you hate your brother?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01342E"
msgid "I do not hate him. I do not love him, either, and I can no longer tolerate him."
msgstr "동생을 미워하진 않아. 사랑하지도 않지만. 이제 더 이상 참을 수 없는 것일 뿐이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you hate your brother?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01342D"
msgid "But when father moved to strike him, who dove in front of the blows? When mother would not feed him, who sacrificed their food? It was me, it was always me!"
msgstr ""
"아버지가 녀석을 때리려고 할 때마다, 누가 아버지 주먹 앞에 뛰어들었지? 어머니가 녀석한테 밥도 주지 않았을 때, 누가 자기 식사를 "
"포기하며 몰래 나눠 줬지? 바로 나였어! 항상 나였단 말이네!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you hate your brother?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01342C"
msgid "How does he repay me? He steals my valuables, slanders my name, and brings dishonor on the family. Any affection I had for my brother is long dead."
msgstr ""
"그런데 동생이 어떻게 보답했는지 보게. 내 귀중품을 훔치고, 내 명성을 먹칠하고, 가문의 명예를 실추시켰어. 동생에 대한 애정은 이미 "
"오래전에 다 떨어졌네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not hate him. I do not love him, either, and I can no longer tolerate him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D72A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01342B"
msgid "Do you hate your brother?"
msgstr "동생을 싫어합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Plugging in the necessary variables...
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Harbinger, will you do us the honor?
