#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013429"
msgid "May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death."
msgstr "아밀라의 고통받던 영혼이 마침내 죽음으로 안식을 찾아내기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, Amila was out of control. What happened here today was necessary, but I garner no joy from it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013428"
msgid "It had to be done, Borhal."
msgstr "해야만 하는 일이었습니다, 보할 씨."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
