#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013427"
msgid "Yes, Amila was out of control. What happened here today was necessary, but I garner no joy from it."
msgstr "그래, 아밀라는 도저히 말을 듣지 않았어. 오늘 여기서 일어난 일은 이루어져만 했지만, 전혀 기쁜 일은 아니었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
