#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013426"
msgid "What happens now?"
msgstr "이제 어떻게 해야 되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013425"
msgid "You have fulfilled your duties as second, and will receive your payment in full."
msgstr "입회인으로서 그 의무를 마쳤으니 보상을 전액 지급하겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens now?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110B814
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013424"
msgid "As for Danika in I... we must prepare Amila's body for cremation."
msgstr "반면에 다니카는... 우선 우린 아밀라의 사체를 화장시킬 준비를 해야 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Do not let Danika shame you. What you did was honorable. Amila accepted the duel, and you let it play out fairly. You did nothing wrong.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110B813
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013423"
msgid "Your duty as a second has ended. You served Amila honorably, and I thank you for that. Now, I am sure you are eager for your promised payment."
msgstr "자네의 입회인으로서의 의무가 끝이 났군. 아밀라를 잘 도와줘서 내가 고맙다네. 얼른 내가 약속한 보상을 받고 싶겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110B813
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013422"
msgid "It was well earned. But now I am afraid I must ask you to leave. It is time for me to tend to my brother's body. Farewell."
msgstr "이 정도는 충분히 받아야지. 하지만 이젠 떠나 달라고 말해야겠네. 동생의 사체를 처리해야 하니. 그럼, 잘 가게나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him.  &&& Amila: No, I do not need your comfort. A duel is what he asked for, and he got what he wanted, the fool.|He put me in this position. Damn him, damn him.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013421"
msgid "Ugh! This... this should not have happened!"
msgstr "아아! 이... 이런 일은 일어나지 말았어야 했는데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Scuttle the duel? What is she talking about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110ED52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013420"
msgid "What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!"
msgstr "무슨 짓을 한 거예요? 둘 다 기절시켰어야죠! 결투를 무산시켰어야 했던 거잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: surprise and confusion, not asking a question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
