#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01341F"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Borhal: What? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Amila is dead because Borhal killed him. I had nothing to do with this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110B810
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_13_PoisonedNoOne
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01341E"
msgid "Fool... Amila is dead because of you."
msgstr "멍청이... 당신 때문에 아밀라가 죽었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal.  &&& ...  &&& Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!|What have you done? You were supposed to tranquilize them both! You were supposed to scuttle the duel!  &&& Borhal: What?  &&& Danika: Fool... Amila is dead because of you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
