msgstr "너희 족속은 여기 소속이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society. / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
