#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society.  / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Viktor_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
