msgid "How dare you show your face here."
msgstr "감히 이곳에 얼굴을 들이미느냐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society. / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Vitoria_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013384"
msgid "Away with you, husk."
msgstr "꺼져라. 허물."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society. / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
