msgid "You have no business here."
msgstr "여긴 네가 있을 곳이 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society.  / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Vitoria_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "013382"
msgid "Take your heresy elsewhere, outsider."
msgstr "네 이단은 다른 곳에나 갖다 놔라, 이방인."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
