#. SCRIPT NOTES: Just learned your daughter died. Devastated. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I found her body in the wilderness.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Villain! You will die for this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
