#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_PlayerTookHeirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01337D"
msgid "Leave me."
msgstr "날 내버려 둬."

