#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013366"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that the sympathized with. / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013365"
msgid "Thanks to you, I have nothing but time until I'm reassigned."
msgstr "네 덕분에 재배치될 때까지 시간만 죽이는 신세라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that the sympathized with. / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013364"
msgid "You may not want to believe it, but not everyone in Jandar's Rest deserved death."
msgstr "믿고 싶진 않겠지만, 잔다르의 안식처에 있던 사람들 모두가 죽어 마땅한 건 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that the sympathized with. / Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013363"
msgid "I find it hard to believe Mihael would've executed my cousins."
msgstr "미해일이 내 친척들을 처형했단 얘기는 믿기 힘든데 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that the sympathized with. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013362"
msgid "I mourn the loss of my cousins and those you may have killed needlessly at Jandar's Rest."
msgstr "우리 친척들의 죽음은 슬픈 일이야. 네가 잔다르의 안식처에서 이유 없이 죽인 사람들 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that the sympathized with. / Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013361"
msgid "I believed my cousins to be safe with the Zealots. Could I have been so wrong?"
msgstr "친척들이 광신도랑 같이 있으면 안전할 줄 알았어. 내가 틀렸을 리 없는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed a base full of Zealots that they sympathized with.  / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013360"
msgid "So much blood on your hands."
msgstr "네 손에 참 피가 많이도 묻었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335F"
msgid "The Great Serpent protect you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 지켜 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335E"
msgid "It's good to see my cousins have safely returned."
msgstr "우리 친척들이 안전하게 돌아와서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335D"
msgid "I told you the Zealots wouldn't harm my dear cousins."
msgstr "광신도가 우리 친척들을 해치진 않을 거라고 했잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335C"
msgid "It still remains to be seen if I have any work left to return to."
msgstr "앞으로 내가 할 일이 있을지는 아직 두고 봐야 할 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335B"
msgid "Auntie Razma must be quite impressed with you now."
msgstr "라즈마 이모님이 네 활약에 엄청 감명받으셨겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01335A"
msgid "With Auntie Razma as Speaker, I expect I'll have my work cut out for me."
msgstr "라즈마 이모님이 대변자가 됐으니 곧 내게도 많은 일이 주어지겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013359"
msgid "House Ka'dic will bring about a new age for Dazra. One that doesn't fear acceptance of what lies beyond our city."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 다즈라의 새시대를 이끌 거야. 우리 도시 너머에 있는 것들을 두려움 없이 받아들일 수 있도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013358"
msgid "These hours are ridiculous. How can the Speaker expect us to be efficient with no down time?"
msgstr "시간표가 터무니없군. 대변자께서 어떻게 우리가 휴식도 없이 효율적일 것을 기대하는 것이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013357"
msgid "Hasmak is keeping the Ministry of Conjunction quite busy. I could use a break."
msgstr "해즈막 덕분에 결합성이 계속 바쁜 실정이야. 좀 쉬면 좋겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013356"
msgid "I owe you my life."
msgstr "제 목숨을 빚졌네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Professional, direct, a guard on patrol / Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPC_Manager
#. TOPIC: 0114F7EF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SQ_WanderingNPCs_Hello_SharedInfoGroup_Military
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013355"
msgid "May the Great Serpent watch over you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신을 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013354"
msgid "Thank you again for saving us."
msgstr "우릴 구해 주셔서 다시 한번 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013353"
msgid "It's good to be home again."
msgstr "집에 돌아오니 참 좋네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013352"
msgid "After everything we've been through, I find myself hopeful again."
msgstr "그동안 겪은 일 덕분에 다시 희망을 느낄 수 있게 됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013351"
msgid "It's unfortunate Mirek wasn't more forthcoming, but I understand his position."
msgstr "미어렉이 더 적극적으로 나서지 않은 건 안타까운 일이지만, 전 그 입장을 이해해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013350"
msgid "The Mourning Device is quite fascinating. I should have Sahima explain it to me sometime."
msgstr "모어닝 장치는 꽤나 대단하더군요. 사히마에게 설명해 달라고 말해야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334F"
msgid "I've always admired Ekris. If anyone can gain access to the Scaled Citadel, it's him."
msgstr "항상 에크리스를 존경했죠. 비늘 성채를 진입할 수 있게 해 줄 사람은 그분뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334E"
msgid "To think Razma is now Speaker. I hope she makes room for further research."
msgstr "라즈마께서 대변자가 되시다니. 부디 추가 연구를 할 환경을 제공해 주면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334D"
msgid "With House Ka'dic leading Dazra, I wonder what this means for ties with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 다즈라를 이끌게 됐으니 개척 성계의 타 세력과 어떤 관계를 맺는 건지 궁금하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334C"
msgid "Ever since House Veth'aal took over, I've had no spare time."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 이끌게 된 이후로 휴식 시간을 갖지 못하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334B"
msgid "With House Veth'aal in charge, it's a wonder I have time for anything."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 이끌게 됐으니 이젠 남는 시간이 도저히 없게 되었네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01334A"
msgid "With Hasmak named Speaker, Razma's been on edge lately."
msgstr "해즈막께서 대변자가 된 이후 최근부터 많이 예민해지셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013349"
msgid "I'm curious if House Dul'kehf will open more trade routes with the Settled Systems now that they're in charge."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 이끌게 됐으니 개척 성계와 더 많은 교역로를 개방할지 궁금하네요."

