msgctxt "013320"
msgid "Viktor may not realize it now, but he will regret losing his son."
msgstr "빅토르가 지금은 깨닫지 못했을지도 모르지만, 아들을 잃은 걸 후회하게 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331F"
msgid "First Vashti, now Vaeric. I can't imagine this is what Viktor truly wanted."
msgstr "처음엔 비슈티, 이제는 배릭이라니. 빅토르가 정말로 이런 걸 원했을 리 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331E"
msgid "If only you had allowed Vaeric to live."
msgstr "당신이 배릭을 살려주기만 했다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331D"
msgid "I don't blame you for what happened, I only wish you would've prevented it."
msgstr "당신 탓을 하는 건 아니에요. 당신이 막아줬으면 하는 아쉬움이 있을 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331C"
msgid "Thank the Great Serpent, you brought Vaeric home."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 감사합니다. 배릭을 집으로 인도해 주셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331B"
msgid "I feared we'd never see Vaeric again."
msgstr "다시는 배릭을 볼 수 없을까 두려웠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01331A"
msgid "Serpent be at your side."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 돌봐주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013319"
msgid "I truly believe if we had lost Vaeric, it would've broken Viktor."
msgstr "만약 배릭을 잃었다면, 빅토르는 분명 크게 상심했을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013318"
msgid "With Vaeric back, this House can finally begin to heal."
msgstr "배릭이 돌아왔으니, 가문이 마침내 복원될 수 있겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player chose House Veth'aal to lead. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013317"
msgid "You honor us."
msgstr "우리에게 영광을 베푸셨네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player chose House Veth'aal to lead. / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013316"
msgid "Viktor's position as Elder consumed him. I pray he fairs better as Speaker."
msgstr "빅토르는 장로라는 직책에 파묻혀 버렸죠. 대변자로서는 다 잘 해내길 기도하겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player chose House Veth'aal to lead. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013315"
msgid "Viktor sees your choice as divine providence. It is the will of the Serpent."
msgstr "빅토르는 당신의 선택이 신의 섭리라고 봐요. 그것이 위대한 뱀의 뜻이겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player chose House Veth'aal to lead. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013314"
msgid "I am grateful House Veth'aal was chosen to lead, but I worry for Viktor."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 선택받게 돼서 감사하지만, 빅토르가 걱정되네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player chose House Veth'aal to lead. / Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_LutherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013313"
msgid "My husband will make a fine leader. I only hope he leaves room for us in his days."
msgstr "제 남편은 훌륭한 지도자가 될 거예요. 다만 우리한테 여유를 좀 준다면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013312"
msgid "I hope my father and I can finally reconcile our differences."
msgstr "아버지와 내가 마침내 서로의 차이를 받아들일 수 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013311"
msgid "Let's hope I made the right decision."
msgstr "내가 올바른 결정을 내린 거였으면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013310"
msgid "At least one good thing has come of my return. I wish both you and Ekris luck with the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "내가 돌아와서 좋은 일이 하나는 생겼네. 너와 에크리스 모두 비늘 성채에서 행운이 함께하길 빌겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330F"
msgid "It's good to see you."
msgstr "만나서 반가워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330E"
msgid "You were right to convince me to return. It would've crushed my Aunt Vitoria."
msgstr "돌아오라고 설득한 게 옳았어. 안 그랬으면 비토리아 고모에게 큰 상처를 줬을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330D"
msgid "I was hoping being in the Keep might help, but I still see the faces of those we lost."
msgstr "본성에 있으면 도움이 될 거라 생각했는데, 우리가 잃은 사람들의 얼굴이 아직도 눈에 선해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330C"
msgid "I miss my sister. I hope she's pleased that I came home."
msgstr "여동생이 보고 싶어. 내가 집에 돌아가면 여동생이 기뻐했으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330B"
msgid "My father has been struggling with your decision. I hope he sees reason soon."
msgstr "아버지가 너의 결정에 대해 고민하고 계셔. 아버지가 곧 이성을 찾으셨으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hopeful. / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01330A"
msgid "Razma will make a good Speaker. Perhaps I'll have my chance to see the Settled Systems sooner than I thought."
msgstr "라즈마는 좋은 대변자가 될 거야. 생각보다 빨리 개척 성계를 볼 기회가 올지도 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hopeful. / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013309"
msgid "With Hasmak as the new Speaker, perhaps we'll open more trade with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "해즈막이 새로운 대변자가 되면, 개척 성계와 교역 통로가 더 많이 열릴 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: He didn't want to be Elder, and he definitely doesn't want to be Speaker. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013308"
msgid "Now that my father is Speaker, I fear what this means for me as House Veth'aal's heir."
msgstr "이제 아버지가 대변자가 되셨으니, 베타알 가문의 후계자인 나에게 어떤 영향이 있을지 두려워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013307"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Harbinger."
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013306"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Vindicator."
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013305"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Diviner."
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013304"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Reverent."
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013303"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Armiger"
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013302"
msgid "Ekris awaits, Adherent."
msgstr "에크리스가 기다린다. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013301"
msgid "Go. We have kept Ekris waiting long enough."
msgstr "가라. 에크리스를 충분히 오래 기다리게 했잖나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013300"
msgid "No one's smuggling anything here, that's for sure."
msgstr "여기선 밀수꾼 같은 게 확실히 없을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima__NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "0132FF"
msgid "An offering reveals itself!"
msgstr "산 제물이 모습을 드러냈다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The ceremonial drinks have been prepared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132FA"
msgid "Is everything ready?"
msgstr "준비가 끝났나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Is everything ready?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then it is time to begin the duel.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F8"
msgid "The ceremonial drinks have been prepared."
msgstr "의식용 음료 준비가 끝났습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The ceremonial drinks have been prepared.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The ceremonial drinks have been prepared.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Yes, finally. I am ready to do what must be done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F7"
msgid "Then it is time to begin the duel."
msgstr "그럼 결투를 시작할 때네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Everything's ready, but are you sure about this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Everything's ready, but are you sure about this?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *I* am sure. If everything is ready, then it is time to move forward. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F6"
msgid "I-"
msgstr "저..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Is everything ready?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I-
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F5"
msgid "Everything's ready, but are you sure about this?"
msgstr "준비는 끝났는데, 정말 괜찮겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: The ceremonial drinks have been prepared.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The ceremonial drinks have been prepared. &&& Danika: Then it is time to begin the duel.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: The time has come. Amila, are you sufficiently prepared?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F4"
msgid "Yes, finally. I am ready to do what must be done."
msgstr "그래. 드디어 때가 됐군. 반드시 끝마쳐야 할 일을 마칠 준비가 됐다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on I / Neutral
#. PROMPT: Everything's ready, but are you sure about this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Everything's ready, but are you sure about this? &&& Danika: I-
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: The time has come. Amila, are you sufficiently prepared?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_09_Stage60_ReportToDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F3"
msgid "*I* am sure. If everything is ready, then it is time to move forward."
msgstr "*나도* 준비 됐다. 준비가 모두 끝났다면, 다음 차례로 넘어가자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: What? What do you want?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: That is what I have been saying, but nobody listens to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F2"
msgid "Break it up, nobody wants to hear this."
msgstr "다들 그만하시죠. 이렇게 다투는 꼴을 보고 싶어 하는 사람은 없거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: What? What do you want?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Hmph, seems your outburst has attracted some outside attention, brother. If it was an audience you wanted, you have it now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F1"
msgid "You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else."
msgstr "시끄럽잖아요. 다툴 거면 딴 데 가서 하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132F0"
msgid "Nonsense. You've made the right choice."
msgstr "말도 안 돼요. 옳은 선택을 하신 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132EF"
msgid "Their egos are bruised, but deep down, they are both relieved."
msgstr "둘 다 자존심에 금이 갔겠지만, 속으로는 크게 안도했을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132EE"
msgid "Come what may, we have narrowly avoided a bloodbath today. If they are stupid enough to try again, we will find another way to stop it."
msgstr ""
"미래야 장담 못 하지만, 어쨌든 지금은 가까스로 피바다가 벌어지는 걸 막았으니까요. 둘 다 멍청하게 또 이런 짓을 벌인다면, 다른 방법을 "
"써서라도 막아낼 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm glad your plan worked.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132ED"
msgid "But I doubt that day will come."
msgstr "어쩌면 그런 날이 안 올지도 모르고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: irritated that they were disrupted / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132EC"
msgid "What? What do you want?"
msgstr "뭐지? 뭘 원하는 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Not entirely sure / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will they be okay?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will they be okay?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132EB"
msgid "What? From the tranquilizer? They will sleep a few days and be fine, I expect..."
msgstr "뭐가요? 진정제 부작용 같은 거요? 둘 다 며칠 곯아떨어지겠지만, 괜찮을 거예요. 아마도요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will they be okay?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132EA"
msgid "They may suffer a bit, but it is a far better alternative to being stabbed to death."
msgstr "좀 머리가 띵할지도 모르지만, 칼에 찔려 죽는 것보단 훨씬 낫잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Thank the Great Serpent, you did it. The tranquilizer worked, and you saved them both. Thank you for trusting me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nonsense. You've made the right choice. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E9"
msgid "That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting."
msgstr "제가 예상했던 행복한 결말은 아니네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. PROMPT: Break it up, nobody wants to hear this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Break it up, nobody wants to hear this.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E8"
msgid "That is what I have been saying, but nobody listens to me."
msgstr "내가 줄곧 말했던 게 그거라고. 하지만 아무도 내 말을 듣질 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Me too.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E7"
msgid "I want to thank you. You trusted me, and because of you, the brothers - my friends - are both alive. They are imbeciles, but better people than they seem. I am grateful for you."
msgstr ""
"감사를 표하고 싶어요. 저를 믿어주셨고, 그 덕분에 두 형제가... 제가 아끼는 두 사람이 모두 살았네요. 둘 다 멍청하지만, 겉보기보단 "
"훨씬 괜찮은 사람들이에요. 정말 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E6"
msgid "Please take this. It is, admittedly, not much compared to what you would have received if one of them had perished, but can you truly put a price on a human life?"
msgstr ""
"이걸 받아 주세요. 사실... 형제 중 한 명이 죽었을 때 받았을 보상에 비하면 많진 않지만, 그렇다고 사람 목숨을 대신 낼 수는 없는 "
"거잖아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E5"
msgid "You are free to go. May the Great Serpent be with you, always."
msgstr "이제 가셔도 돼요. 위대한 뱀께서 항상 그대와 함께하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That wasn't the happy ending I was expecting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E4"
msgid "Thank the Great Serpent, you did it. The tranquilizer worked, and you saved them both. Thank you for trusting me."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 감사합니다. 해냈네요. 진정제가 효과가 있었어요. 두 사람 모두 구하신 거예요. 저를 믿어 주셔서 감사해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. PROMPT: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E3"
msgid "Hmph, seems your outburst has attracted some outside attention, brother. If it was an audience you wanted, you have it now."
msgstr "흥. 그렇게 화를 내더니 외부인의 관심까지 끌었네, 형. 구경꾼을 원했던 거라면, 이제 생겼네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Thank the Great Serpent, you did it. The tranquilizer worked, and you saved them both. Thank you for trusting me.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What? From the tranquilizer? They will sleep a few days and be fine, I expect...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110AE5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvivedDanikaFollowUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0132E2"
msgid "Will they be okay?"
msgstr "둘은 괜찮을까요?"

