#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why must we prove our worth?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why must we prove our worth?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01323D"
msgid "To be Promised requires more than just faith. This calamity is one test of many we will endure until the Shrouding."
msgstr "약속받은 자에겐 신앙 이상의 것이 필요하지. 이 재난은 장막의 날이 올 때까지 견뎌내야 할 수많은 시련 중에 하나다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why must we prove our worth?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Indeed. The Shrouding obscures the way forward for those who lack faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01323C"
msgid "Just as wine is born from the blood of a grape, our lives are a trial; we must spill our souls before the Great Serpent and countenance His judgment."
msgstr ""
"포도의 과즙에서 포도주가 만들어지는 것처럼, 우리의 삶은 곧 시련이야. 우리는 위대한 뱀의 앞에 영혼을 쏟아붓고 그분의 심판을 마주해야 "
"한단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To be Promised requires more than just faith. This calamity is one test of many we will endure until the Shrouding.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01323B"
msgid "Why must we prove our worth?"
msgstr "왜 우리의 가치를 증명해야 하는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will forgive you for not knowing our customs, but I will not tolerate such blasphemy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01323A"
msgid "Our works will succeed because they are backed by science. Not because of some religious mumbo jumbo."
msgstr "우리 하는 작업은 과학이 뒷받침되는 덕분에 성공할 겁니다. 무슨 종교적인 허튼소리 덕분이 아니라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: You do not understand. I saw Anasko, took measure of his burdens! &&& Ekris: What you're describing is a dream. Nothing more.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: With all due respect to your craft, dear sister, now is not the time for incense and ash leaves. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013239"
msgid "Not a dream. A message. From the Great Serpent Himself."
msgstr "꿈이 아니야. 메시지다. 위대한 뱀께서 보내주신 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Harbinger, speak to my sister. 
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013238"
msgid "Agree to her fool's errand, so that we may continue the work of saving this city."
msgstr "그 헛수고를 해 준다면 이 도시를 구하는 작업을 계속할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: You do not understand. I saw Anasko, took measure of his burdens!
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Not a dream. A message. From the Great Serpent Himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013237"
msgid "What you're describing is a dream. Nothing more."
msgstr "꿈 얘기를 하시는 거잖수. 그게 뭐 중요하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal. 
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: For the last time, faith will not remove the barrier, science will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013236"
msgid "Politics can wait. Every moment we delay, Anasko descends further into the void."
msgstr "정치는 미뤄 둬. 지체할 때마다 아나스코 님은 공허에 더 깊이 빠져드실 게다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: What you're describing is a dream. Nothing more. &&& Inaza: Not a dream. A message. From the Great Serpent Himself.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Or do you not see the depth of the crater before you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013235"
msgid "With all due respect to your craft, dear sister, now is not the time for incense and ash leaves."
msgstr "누님께서 무슨 일 하시는지는 나도 잘 아는데, 지금은 향 피우고 재 뿌릴 때가 아니란 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AF9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013234"
msgid "Well said, Herald."
msgstr "좋은 말씀이네요. 전령님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Indeed. The Shrouding obscures the way forward for those who lack faith. &&& Inaza: And they will be made husks in the end, just as Jinan foretold. &&& Inaza: But the proof is not in our words. It is in the vision. Anasko's presence still persists in this world, and he seeks our aid.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Harbinger, speak to my sister. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AFA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013233"
msgid "*Sigh*, fine. I feel like I've lived this argument a thousand times, and the only way to move past it is to concede to its nonsense."
msgstr "*한숨* 알겠수. 이런 말싸움을 천 번도 더 한 느낌이니까, 더 얘기하려면 그 헛소리를 그냥 인정해 줄 수밖에 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& ...  &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us? &&& Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? |Until that is proven, your works will not succeed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And they will be made husks in the end, just as Jinan foretold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AF9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013232"
msgid "Indeed. The Shrouding obscures the way forward for those who lack faith."
msgstr "맞아요. 장막의 날이 신앙이 부족한 이들의 앞길을 가릴 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal.  &&& Inaza: Politics can wait. Every moment we delay, Anasko descends further into the void.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013231"
msgid "For the last time, faith will not remove the barrier, science will."
msgstr "마지막으로 말하는데, 장벽을 없애는 건 신앙이 아니라 과학이란 말이우."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Or do you not see the depth of the crater before you. &&& Inaza: On the contrary, brother, I see it for what it truly is. &&& Inaza: And if we ignore this vision, Anasko will be lost to us forever.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013230"
msgid "Enough with the proselytizing."
msgstr "설교는 그쯤 해 두십시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Ekris
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Politics can wait. Every moment we delay, Anasko descends further into the void. &&& Ekris: For the last time, faith will not remove the barrier, science will.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01322F"
msgid "It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply."
msgstr "과학의 오만함 때문에 네가 실패했던 게다. 우리는 위대한 뱀께 손을 뻗었어. 이게 그분의 응답이셨고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: For the last time, faith will not remove the barrier, science will. &&& Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01322E"
msgid "You claim He has forsaken us?"
msgstr "그분께서 우릴 버리셨단 거요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Enough with the proselytizing.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Ah, were you able to find Sahima?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110AAF6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01322D"
msgid "The Harbinger has returned."
msgstr "선구자가 돌아왔으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Enough with the proselytizing.
