msgid "The Adherent has returned."
msgstr "지지자가 돌아왔으니까요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: It is the hubris of science that fails you in this moment. We reached out to the Great Serpent. THIS is His reply. &&& Ekris: You claim He has forsaken us?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_020_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013227"
msgid "I did no such thing. The Great Serpent's reply is not an answer, but a question: are we worthy of His grace?"
msgstr "그런 뜻이 아니야. 위대한 뱀께선 답이 아니라 질문으로 응답하신다. 우리는 그분의 은총을 입기에 합당한가?"

#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed. The Shrouding obscures the way forward for those who lack faith.
