msgctxt "013226"
msgid "Until that is proven, your works will not succeed."
msgstr "그 질문을 해결하지 못하면, 네 작업은 성공하지 못할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to InazaHeadtrack
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Not a dream. A message. From the Great Serpent Himself. &&& Ekris: With all due respect to your craft, dear sister, now is not the time for incense and ash leaves.  &&& Ekris: Or do you not see the depth of the crater before you.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: And if we ignore this vision, Anasko will be lost to us forever.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013225"
msgid "On the contrary, brother, I see it for what it truly is."
msgstr "그 반대란다, 동생아. 내겐 그 진정한 정체가 보이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Ekris
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: What you're describing is a dream. Nothing more.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQIN
#. TOPIC: 0110AAD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQIN_000_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013223"
msgid "You do not understand. I saw Anasko, took measure of his burdens!"
msgstr "이해를 못 하는구나. 아나스코 님을 봤어. 그분이 지신 짐을 봤다니까!"

#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131EA"
msgid "In the time since I've wondered why I was spared, when so many were lost. Perhaps it is the will of the Great Serpent that I be here to help those in need."
msgstr ""
"그날 이후로 생각했죠. 왜 그 많은 사람이 목숨을 잃었는데 나만 무사했던 걸까 하고요. 아마도 도움이 필요한 이들을 도우라고 위대한 "
"뱀께서 저를 이곳에 남겨두신 거겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: No. He would not. In fact, he would impale such traitors on the peak of the Scaled Citadel itself. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: If I may, I'd argue this debate is a question of law. Where is the line drawn?|Obviously, if the accused is found guilty, then they deserve the harshest of punishments. If there is any doubt, however...
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I apologize speaker, I meant no offense.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110984F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E9"
msgid "Doubt does not exist when you are the mouth of the Great Serpent. If I proclaim someone a Zealot, then that is what they are."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 대변하는 입 앞에선 의혹 따윈 없다. 내가 누군가를 광신도라고 선언하면, 그 자가 곧 광신도다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kadic_Djimal: There is the question of the Zealots, and their continued presence both here and outside of Va'ruun'kai. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: It's time to take a stance on all who support Jandar's teachings. We must root them out from the inside before the poison spreads. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Are you implying, Mediary, that there are Zealot sympathizers among us? &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am not implying. I know this for a fact. Some have even said our noble Houses may be aiding a few.
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I speak the truth. And if such truth came to light, surely our Speaker would not tolerate such treachery, hm?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109848
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E8"
msgid "You speak blasphemy!"
msgstr "신성 모독이에요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Speaker: 
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: It's time to take a stance on all who support Jandar's teachings. We must root them out from the inside before the poison spreads.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109850
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E7"
msgid "There is the question of the Zealots, and their continued presence both here and outside of Va'ruun'kai."
msgstr "광신도 문제가 있다고 하더이다. 놈들이 여기와 바룬카이 외부에서 계속 활동한다고 하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Speaker, Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vethaal_Lovek: I am not implying. I know this for a fact. Some have even said our noble Houses may be aiding a few. &&& Kadic_Djimal: You speak blasphemy!
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: No. He would not. In fact, he would impale such traitors on the peak of the Scaled Citadel itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109847
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E6"
msgid "I speak the truth. And if such truth came to light, surely our Speaker would not tolerate such treachery, hm?"
msgstr "사실을 말하는 거요. 그런 사실이 밝혀진다면, 분명 우리 대변자님이 그런 반역을 용납할 리 없지 않겠소?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. And it seems we are out of time.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109851
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_999_CouncilMeetings_End
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01109860
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E5"
msgid "Then you are all dismissed for the time being. We will address further issues then."
msgstr "그럼 다들 당분간 해산하도록 하지. 추가적인 문제는 다음에 다루도록 해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. And it seems we are out of time.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109851
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_999_CouncilMeetings_End
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01109860
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E4"
msgid "Then we will reconvene later. Serpent guide you."
msgstr "그럼 나중에 다시 모이지. 위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am not implying. I know this for a fact. Some have even said our noble Houses may be aiding a few. &&& Kadic_Djimal: You speak blasphemy! &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I speak the truth. And if such truth came to light, surely our Speaker would not tolerate such treachery, hm?
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: If I may, I'd argue this debate is a question of law. Where is the line drawn?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110984E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E3"
msgid "No. He would not. In fact, he would impale such traitors on the peak of the Scaled Citadel itself."
msgstr "물론 용납 못 하지. 사실, 그런 반역자가 있다면 비늘 성채 꼭대기에 손수 꿰어 놓을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Speaker:  &&& Kadic_Djimal: There is the question of the Zealots, and their continued presence both here and outside of Va'ruun'kai. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: It's time to take a stance on all who support Jandar's teachings. We must root them out from the inside before the poison spreads.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I am not implying. I know this for a fact. Some have even said our noble Houses may be aiding a few.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110984A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_020_CouncilMeetings_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E2"
msgid "Are you implying, Mediary, that there are Zealot sympathizers among us?"
msgstr "우리 중에 광신도와 내통하는 자가 있다는 뜻입니까, 중개자님?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109517
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E1"
msgid "Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems."
msgstr "음, 우리는 지난 님과 아나스코 님의 뜻에 따라 개척 성계를 다시 공격하기로 했었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109517
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131E0"
msgid "Well, like Jarek before us, we've decided not to resume hostilities against the outsiders."
msgstr "음, 우리는 전에 자렉 님께서 하셨던 것처럼 이방인에 대한 적대 행위를 멈추기로 했었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& Speaker: 
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109516
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131DF"
msgid "We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours."
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 대한 입장을 확실하게 정해야 합니다. 대변자님께서 말씀해 주시지요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: 
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110950D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_000_CouncilMeetings_Scene_OpeningIntro
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01119273
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131DE"
msgid "What's first on the agenda?"
msgstr "첫 번째 안건은 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0725_CompanionStageEntryComment01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131C8"
msgid "Stay low. Cross the stage. Maybe we can get around this mess."
msgstr "자세 낮춰. 무대를 가로지르자. 이 난장판을 피할 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerM01: Strike, O Promised! This is our hour! &&& LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerF01: The Restoration is at hand! The Citadel will be ours!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011081C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0720_ZealotsAttackSpeakersHall
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131C7"
msgid "Let's move. We can slip past while they're distracted."
msgstr "움직이자. 서로 싸우는 틈에 빠져나갈 수 있어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AF"
msgid "I told you he would make it."
msgstr "깨어날 거라고 했었죠?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AE"
msgid "I told you she would make it."
msgstr "깨어날 거라고 했었죠?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AD"
msgid "I told you they would make it."
msgstr "깨어날 거라고 했었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AC"
msgid "Good timing! We ran out of conversation topics a while ago. Was getting a little awkward in here."
msgstr "타이밍 좋은데! 방금 대화 주제가 떨어진 참이었거든. 같이 있기 좀 어색해지더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AB"
msgid "Wasn't much fun dragging you back here, but looks like it was worth it."
msgstr "널 여기까지 끌고 오는 건 별로 재미 없었지만, 그만한 가치는 있었던 것 같네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131AA"
msgid "It's a relief to see you conscious. Had us worried there."
msgstr "의식을 찾아서 다행이야. 걱정 많이 했거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I told you he would make it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110805D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1300_ScaledCitadelDestruction
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131A8"
msgid "Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot."
msgstr "천천히, 천천히... 많은 일을 겪으셨어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FED09
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_IntercomHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0131A3"
msgid "Now is hardly the time for hesitation."
msgstr "지금은 망설일 때가 아니니라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FED09
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_IntercomHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0131A2"
msgid "The moment is at hand. Why have you not seized it?"
msgstr "그 순간이 눈 앞에 왔거늘. 왜 아직도 기다리느냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0131A1"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0131A0"
msgid "I pray Sahima's algorithm holds the data Ekris needs."
msgstr "사히마의 알고리즘에 에크리스가 원하는 데이터가 있길 기도하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01319F"
msgid "Serpent guide your actions."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대의 행동을 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01319E"
msgid "The losses we suffered from the Zealots will not be forgotten."
msgstr "광신도 때문에 겪은 손실은 절대로 잊지 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01319D"
msgid "Our House mourns the loss of family, but at least they are at the Great Serpent's side."
msgstr "우리 가문은 가족을 잃어서 슬퍼하겠지만, 그래도 다들 위대한 뱀의 곁으로 갔을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01319C"
msgid "With the status quo restored, the Zealots will think twice before challenging House Ka'dic."
msgstr "원래 질서가 다시 돌아왔으니, 광신도는 카딕 가문에게 덤비기 전에 두 번은 생각해야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01319B"
msgid "The Zealots have once again learned their place."
msgstr "광신도가 다시 한번 제 주제를 알게 됐군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01319A"
msgid "I've heard of Mujeen's actions. He will be dealt with."
msgstr "무진이 한 짓은 들었어. 적당히 처리할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013199"
msgid "Mujeen will be dealt with... harshly. He'll be made an example of what happens when you continue to deal with Zealots."
msgstr "무진이 받을 처분은... 가혹할 거야. 광신도와 계속 관계를 가지면 어떻게 되는지 본보기로 삼아야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013198"
msgid "What Mujeen did was bold and in no way acceptable or condoned."
msgstr "무진은 주제넘은 짓을 저질렀어. 용납되거나 묵인될 일이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013197"
msgid "What Mujeen did was unsanctioned. He deliberately retained ties with the Zealots after they executed House Ka'dic members."
msgstr "무진은 승인받지도 않은 일을 저질렀어. 광신도가 카딕 가문의 일원을 처형했는데도 의도적으로 관계를 유지하다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013196"
msgid "Since you exposed Ochim, we'll be reviewing our policy for new House members."
msgstr "그대가 오킴을 노출시켰으니, 신규 가문 구성원에 대한 정책을 재검토해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013195"
msgid "Ochim is lucky to be made dust. Death was too merciful a punishment."
msgstr "오킴은 먼지가 된 것도 운 좋은 거야. 죽음은 너무 자비로운 처벌이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013194"
msgid "Ochim is lucky to be made dust. Death was too merciful a punishment for taking Qisrani's life."
msgstr "오킴은 먼지가 된 것도 운 좋은 거야. 키스라니의 목숨을 빼앗았으니, 죽음은 너무 자비로운 처벌이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013193"
msgid "Shouldn't you be at the Mourning Device?"
msgstr "모어닝 장치에 있어야 하지 않던가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013192"
msgid "I believe you should be assisting Ekris."
msgstr "에크리스를 돕고 있어야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013191"
msgid "Don't hesitate. Ekris needs you. We all do."
msgstr "머뭇거리지 마. 에크리스는 그대가 필요해. 우리 모두 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013190"
msgid "The High Council awaits."
msgstr "대의회가 기다리고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318F"
msgid "Seek the High Council. They wish to speak with you."
msgstr "대의회를 찾아가. 그대와 말해보고 싶어하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318E"
msgid "As much as I'd love to discuss what happened, the High Council demands your attention."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었는지 꼭 논의해보고 싶지만, 우선 대의회를 찾아가 보도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318D"
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나서 반가워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318C"
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "내가 도와줄 일이라도 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318B"
msgid "The other Houses will become more compliant. It's only a matter of time."
msgstr "다른 가문들도 곧 말을 잘 듣게 될 거야. 시간 문제일 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01318A"
msgid "Viktor may disagree with your choice, but when he accepts it as the will of the Serpent, he'll come around."
msgstr "빅토르는 그대의 결정에 반대하겠지만, 그게 위대한 뱀의 뜻이라는 걸 받아들이면 결국 마음을 돌릴 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013189"
msgid "It shouldn't take much for House Dul'kehf to serve as they once did House Va'ruun."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 바룬 가문에게 했던 것처럼 섬기는 데는 그리 오래 걸리지 않겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013188"
msgid "I must say, leadership suits House Ka'dic."
msgstr "이건 진심인데, 통치는 카딕 가문이 맡는 게 맞아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013187"
msgid "It was a wise decision to choose House Ka'dic to lead."
msgstr "지도자로 카딕 가문을 선택한 건 현명한 결정이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "013186"
msgid "Harbinger."
msgstr "선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013185"
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "빨리 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013184"
msgid "What is it now?"
msgstr "이젠 또 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013183"
msgid "This better be important."
msgstr "중요한 일이어야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013182"
msgid "Something you need?"
msgstr "필요한 거라도 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013181"
msgid "May the Great Serpent light your way."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 네 길을 밝혀 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013180"
msgid "With access to the power grid, work on the Mourning Device should go swiftly."
msgstr "전력망에 접근할 수 있으면 모어닝 장치 작업에도 속도가 붙겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317F"
msgid "I expect the High Council to acknowledge House Veth'aal's contribution."
msgstr "대의회에서 베타알 가문의 공헌을 알아주길 기대하고 있겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317E"
msgid "My only consolation in Vaeric's death is he has been made penitent and walks alongside the Great Serpent."
msgstr "배릭의 죽음에서 딱 한 가지 위안이 있다면, 그 아이가 회개해서 위대한 뱀과 함께 걷고 있다는 사실이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317D"
msgid "My son and daughter have left a great void to fill. I will seek the Great Serpent's aid to fill it."
msgstr "내 자식들이 커다란 공허감을 남기고 갔구나. 채우려면 위대한 뱀의 도움을 구해야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317C"
msgid "Truly the Great Serpent must favor our House to have allowed you to bring Vaeric home to us."
msgstr "정말 위대한 뱀께서 우리 가문에 은혜를 베푸셔서 배릭을 데려오도록 허락하신 게 틀림없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317B"
msgid "I am still in awe of the Great Serpent's forgiveness. I thought my son to be lost."
msgstr "아직도 위대한 뱀의 관용에 경외심이 느껴지는군. 내 아들을 잃은 줄만 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01317A"
msgid "You are needed at the Mourning Device."
msgstr "넌 모어닝 장치에 있어야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013179"
msgid "Ekris requires your attention."
msgstr "에크리스에게 네 도움이 필요하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_ViktorHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013178"
msgid "You waste time. The Scaled Citadel is of the utmost importance."
msgstr "시간을 낭비하는군. 비늘 성채가 가장 중요하단 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013177"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Harbinger."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013176"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Vindicator."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013175"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Diviner."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013174"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Reverent."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013173"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Armiger."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013172"
msgid "Serpent's speed be with you, Adherent."
msgstr "뱀의 가호가 함께하길. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013171"
msgid "Great Serpent guide you in your endeavors."
msgstr "뱀께서 노고를 보인 그대를 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013170"
msgid "The Mourning Device may be our one and only chance to reach Anasko and save Dazra."
msgstr "이 모어닝 장치가 아나스코 님과 다즈라를 구할 수 있는 유일한 기회일지도 모른다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316F"
msgid "If this doesn't work... Serpent save us."
msgstr "만약 안 되면... 뱀이시여, 저희를 구하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316E"
msgid "Our fate lies in the Mourning Device. It must be completed."
msgstr "우리 운명이 모어닝 장치에 달렸어. 반드시 완성해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316D"
msgid "Let's hope the Houses can come together to complete this vital task."
msgstr "이 중요한 임무를 해낼 수 있도록 가문들이 협력해주길 바라자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316C"
msgid "We need the House Elders to see beyond their pride."
msgstr "가문 장로들이 자존심을 극복해줘야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316B"
msgid "If you can't get the Elders to cooperate, they may doom us all."
msgstr "자네가 장로들을 협력시키지 못하면, 우리 모두 파멸할지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01316A"
msgid "Sahima's research and algorithm have proven to be even more vital than I estimated."
msgstr "사히마의 연구 자료랑 알고리즘이 내 예상보다 훨씬 더 중요한 요소더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013169"
msgid "Now that our calculations have been fine tuned, I am even more confident in our chances of success."
msgstr "이제 우리 계산값을 세밀하게 조정했으니, 성공 가능성에 더욱 확신이 드는구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013168"
msgid "It's unfortunate Anasko's research team rejected Sahima's theories."
msgstr "아나스코 님의 연구팀이 사히마의 이론을 거부한 건 불행한 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013167"
msgid "Now that we have access to full power, we've been able to run proper tests."
msgstr "이제 최대 전력을 사용할 수 있게 됐고, 제대로 시험을 할 수 있게 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013166"
msgid "Power grid access has made all the difference. To think Viktor would've denied something so essential."
msgstr "전력망 접속 여부에서 차이가 갈렸을 거야. 빅토르가 그렇게 중요한 걸 거부했다면 어땠을지 생각하면 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013165"
msgid "We've been making several adjustments since we gained access to the power grid."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 있게 된 이후 우리는 몇 가지 조정을 하고 있었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013164"
msgid "I pray the interlock proves useful once inside the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "비늘 성채에 들어가면 제어장치가 유용하게 쓰였으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013163"
msgid "The interlock won't aid in completing the Mourning Device, but at least we may still benefit in some way."
msgstr "제어장치가 모어닝 장치를 완성하는 데 도움이 되지는 않겠지만, 적어도 어떤 식으로든 이득이 될 순 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013162"
msgid "I wish we had known about this research. Perhaps we could've benefited more from it."
msgstr "이 연구에 대해 미리 알았더라면 좋았을 텐데. 더 이득을 많이 얻을 수 있었을지도 모르고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013161"
msgid "Only House Veth'aal and House Dul'kehf remain."
msgstr "베타알 가문과 둘케프 가문만 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013160"
msgid "I pray Viktor and Hasmak will be as forthcoming."
msgstr "빅토르와 해즈막 일도 잘 풀리기를 기도할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01315F"
msgid "One House aligned, and two to go."
msgstr "가문 한곳의 협력은 얻었고, 두 가문 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
