msgid "Only House Ka'dic and House Dul'kehf remain."
msgstr "카딕 가문과 둘케프 가문만 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
