#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01315D"
msgid "I pray Razma and Hasmak are more forthcoming."
msgstr "라즈마와 해즈막 일도 잘 풀리기를 기도할게."

