#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013158"
msgid "I pray the Great Serpent will open Razma's eyes."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 라즈마의 눈을 뜨게 해주시기를 기도할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013157"
msgid "Sahima's research is essential. Without it, we risk a second catastrophe."
msgstr "사히마의 연구는 필수적이야. 그 연구가 없으면, 우리는 두 번째 재난을 맞을 수도 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013156"
msgid "Only House Ka'dic remains."
msgstr "카딕 가문만 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013155"
msgid "Good luck. Out of all the Elders, Viktor is perhaps the most stubborn."
msgstr "행운을 빌게. 모든 장로 중에서도, 빅토르가 아마 가장 고집이 셀 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013154"
msgid "Without access to the power grid, the Mourning Device is useless."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 없으면, 모어닝 장치를 쓸 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013153"
msgid "Only House Veth'aal remains."
msgstr "베타알 가문만 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013152"
msgid "Hasmak will be forthcoming. I'm certain of it."
msgstr "해즈막은 기꺼이 도와줄 거야. 확실해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013151"
msgid "Elder Hasmak hasn't revealed what he may be hiding, but it may prove vital to our task."
msgstr "해즈막 장로가 무엇을 숨기고 있는지 밝히지는 않았지만, 우리 작업에 중요한 단서가 될지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_EkrisHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013150"
msgid "Only House Dul'kehf remains."
msgstr "둘케프 가문만 남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01314F"
msgid "You're doing the Great Serpent's work, Harbinger."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 맡긴 사역을 하고 있군요. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
