msgid "You're doing the Great Serpent's work, Adherent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 맡긴 사역을 하고 있군요. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013149"
msgid "I hope this works..."
msgstr "이게 작동했으면 좋겠는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013148"
msgid "Great Serpent grant me the resolve to complete my task."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 제게 임무를 완수할 의지를 부여해 주시옵소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013147"
msgid "If this doesn't work, we may lose what's left."
msgstr "이게 작동하지 않는다면, 남은 것도 잃을 수 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013146"
msgid "I am proud to be chosen to work on such a vital task, but I'm also terrified."
msgstr "이렇게 중요한 일을 맡게 되어 자랑스럽기도 하지만, 두렵기도 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013145"
msgid "I'm triple checking all calculations. We can't get this wrong."
msgstr "모든 계산을 세 번 확인하고 있어요. 틀릴 수가 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013144"
msgid "May the Great Serpent guide my hands and mind."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 내 손을 이끌고 마음을 인도해 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013143"
msgid "I'm thankful Ekris is in charge. He's both wise and determined."
msgstr "에크리스 씨가 책임자라서 다행이죠. 현명하고 결단력 있는 분이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013142"
msgid "It's a good that Ekris took point. Who knows where we'd be without him."
msgstr "에크리스 씨가 중심을 잡아줘서 다행이죠. 그분이 없었다면 우리가 어떻게 되었을지 누가 알겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013141"
msgid "Ekris has been guiding us with precision. I only wish patience was one of his virtues as well."
msgstr "에크리스 씨가 우리를 정확하게 인도해 주셨어요. 인내심만 있으시면 좋을 텐데 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientist working on the Mourning Device. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013140"
msgid "This has to work. I have faith."
msgstr "반드시 성공할 겁니다. 믿어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313F"
msgid "I pray the noble Houses are forthcoming. They must know how important our work is."
msgstr "명문 가문들 일이 잘 풀리기를 기도할게요. 가문들은 우리 일이 얼마나 중요한지 알아야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313E"
msgid "I don't understand why House Ka'dic won't allow Sahima to help."
msgstr "왜 카딕 가문이 사히마가 돕도록 허락하지 않는 건지 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313D"
msgid "House Dul'kehf knows something, I'm certain of it."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 뭔가 알고 있어요. 장담해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313C"
msgid "If we can't get access to the power grid, our work is useless."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 없다면 우리의 작업은 무용지물이 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313B"
msgid "Serpent bless you. We've made a lot of progress since you delivered Sahima's research."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길. 사히마의 연구 결과를 전달해 주신 이후 꽤 진전이 많이 됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01313A"
msgid "The interlock you discovered sounds fascinating. I hope it proves useful."
msgstr "그쪽에서 발견한 제어장치 이야기 흥미롭게 들었어요. 유용했으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013139"
msgid "Gaining access to the power grid has made all the difference. Thank you, Brethren."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 있게 되면서 모든 것이 달라졌어요. 감사합니다. 교우님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013138"
msgid "Gaining access to the power grid has made all the difference. Thank you, Sister."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 있게 되면서 모든 것이 달라졌어요. 감사합니다. 자매님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 01107F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ScientistHellos_Main
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "013137"
msgid "Gaining access to the power grid has made all the difference. Thank you, Brother."
msgstr "전력망에 접속할 수 있게 되면서 모든 것이 달라졌어요. 감사합니다. 형제님."

#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 011082E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_000_CouncilMeetings_Scene_OpeningIntro
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011082E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013136"
msgid "It appears we have a quorum."
msgstr "정족수를 채운 것 같은데."

#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 011082E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_000_CouncilMeetings_Scene_OpeningIntro
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011082E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013135"
msgid "Everyone's here. The meeeting can commence."
msgstr "다들 모였군. 회의를 시작할 수 있겠어."

#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 011082E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_000_CouncilMeetings_Scene_OpeningIntro
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011082E8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013134"
msgid "A quorum has been achieved."
msgstr "정족수를 채웠군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion. &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110950E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013133"
msgid "I am aware."
msgstr "나도 아오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems. &&& Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109514
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013132"
msgid "Well said, Speaker. I second that notion."
msgstr "좋은 말씀이십니다, 대변자님. 저도 동의합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& Speaker: Well, like Jarek before us, we've decided not to resume hostilities against the outsiders. &&& Speaker: However, we should consider this merely a pause in our ultimate goal. The complete domination of the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109514
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013131"
msgid "I take umbrage with this. Should we not take into account the Serpent's Crusade is Jinan's will? And by extenstion, the Great Serpent's?"
msgstr ""
"분개하지 않을 수가 없습니다. 뱀의 성전은 지난 님의 뜻이었다는 점을 고려해야 하는 것 아닙니까? 더 나아가서 위대한 뱀의 뜻이 아닙니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems. &&& Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority.
#. ALIAS: Vethaal_Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109514
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013130"
msgid "Why the limited resources, Speaker? Building half the armies is like building a ship with half a grav drive. It will take us nowhere."
msgstr ""
"어째서 자원이 한정된 것입니까, 대변자님? 반쪽짜리 군대를 만드는 건 중력 구동기 절반만 가지고 우주선을 만드는 것과 같습니다. 아무것도 "
"못 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Why the limited resources, Speaker? Building half the armies is like building a ship with half a grav drive. It will take us nowhere. &&& Kadic_Djimal: Patience, Mediary. The venom will be slow and deliberate, but it will kill. Not to mention, we have other concerns to address. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312F"
msgid "We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize."
msgstr "지금도 모든 영역에서 배급 제도가 시행 중입니다. 상황이 안정될 때까지는 자제하는 것이 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I take umbrage with this. Should we not take into account the Serpent's Crusade is Jinan's will? And by extenstion, the Great Serpent's? &&& Kadic_Djimal: The teachings of old are up for interpretation. And I would remind the Mediary that my sister is the current Speaker, and the mouth of the Great Serpent. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312E"
msgid "We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend a gradual increase of troop levels until things stabilize."
msgstr "지금도 모든 영역에서 배급 제도가 시행 중입니다. 상황이 안정될 때까지는 병력 수준을 점진적으로 늘리는 게 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion. &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312D"
msgid "Speaker, per your direction, we are engaging in guerilla tactics to test the enemy's capabilities."
msgstr "대변자님. 지시하신 대로 적의 능력을 시험하기 위해 게릴라 전술을 펼치고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312C"
msgid "The rest of our resources are devoted to aiding the people of Dazra."
msgstr "나머지 자원은 다즈라 신민들을 지원하는 데 쓰이고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion. &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312B"
msgid "Speaker, per your direction, we are focusing our efforts on aiding people in the city, but are keeping some forces in reserve."
msgstr "대변자님. 지시하신 대로 도시 신민들을 지원하는 일에 집중하고 있습니다만, 일부 병력은 예비로 남겨두었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion. &&& Kadic_Djimal: The teachings of old are up for interpretation. It is the current Speaker who serves as the Great Serpent's mouth. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01312A"
msgid "Speaker, per your direction, we are engaging in light skirmishes to test the enemy's defenses."
msgstr "대변자님. 지시하신 대로 적의 방어 능력을 시험하기 위해 소규모 교전을 벌이는 중입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013129"
msgid "The rest of our resources are devoted to rebuilding the city."
msgstr "나머지 자원은 도시 재건에 쓰이고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Speaker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We should make clear our stance on the Serpent's Crusade. Speaker, the floor is yours. &&& ...  &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion. &&& Kadic_Djimal: The teachings of old are up for interpretation. It is the current Speaker who serves as the Great Serpent's mouth. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109512
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013128"
msgid "Speaker, per your direction, we are focusing our efforts toward rebuilding the city, but are keeping some forces in reserve."
msgstr "대변자님. 지시하신 대로 도시를 재건하는 일에 집중하고 있습니다만, 일부 병력은 예비로 남겨두었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems. &&& Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109513
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013127"
msgid "The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm."
msgstr "가장 큰 문제는 자원을 어떻게 마련하느냐는 거예요. 대재난 때문에 물자가 제한되어 있으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Speaker: Well, like Jarek before us, we've decided not to resume hostilities against the outsiders. &&& Speaker: The focus will instead be on trade. Reconstruction. The foundation of our city. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I take umbrage with this. Should we not take into account the Serpent's Crusade is Jinan's will? And by extenstion, the Great Serpent's?
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109513
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013126"
msgid "The teachings of old are up for interpretation. It is the current Speaker who serves as the Great Serpent's mouth."
msgstr "오래된 가르침에는 해석의 여지가 있어요. 위대한 뱀의 입을 대변하시는 건 지금 계신 대변자님이시라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Speaker: Well, like Jarek before us, we've decided not to resume hostilities against the outsiders. &&& Speaker: However, we should consider this merely a pause in our ultimate goal. The complete domination of the Settled Systems. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I take umbrage with this. Should we not take into account the Serpent's Crusade is Jinan's will? And by extenstion, the Great Serpent's?
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109513
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013125"
msgid "The teachings of old are up for interpretation. And I would remind the Mediary that my sister is the current Speaker, and the mouth of the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"오래된 가르침에는 해석의 여지가 있어요. 그리고 위대한 뱀의 입을 대변하시는 현 대변자님은 저희 형님이라는 사실을 말씀드리고 싶네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker:  &&& ...  &&& Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems. &&& Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: Why the limited resources, Speaker? Building half the armies is like building a ship with half a grav drive. It will take us nowhere.
#. ALIAS: Kadic_Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109513
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013124"
msgid "Patience, Mediary. The venom will be slow and deliberate, but it will kill. Not to mention, we have other concerns to address."
msgstr "참으세요, 중개자님. 독은 알게 모르게 천천히 퍼지지만, 사람을 죽이죠. 다른 문제들도 있다는 건 말 안 해도 아실 텐데요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 0110950F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013123"
msgid "Understood. And it seems we are out of time."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 그리고 시간이 다 된 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013122"
msgid "Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself."
msgstr "헛소리. 더 많은 우주선을 약탈할수록 우리 자원도 늘어난다. 알아서 해결될 문제란 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: However, we should consider this merely a pause in our ultimate goal. The complete domination of the Settled Systems. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013121"
msgid "There will be no gradual increase. We will enforce even stricter rations until the armada is ready."
msgstr "점진적으로 늘릴 일은 없다. 함대가 준비될 때까지 더 엄격한 배급 제도를 실시할 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013120"
msgid "Those that complain should be reminded of their oath. All Must Serve."
msgstr "불평하는 자들에게는 그 맹세를 다시 기억하게 해라. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311F"
msgid "Excellent. As for the Crusade, have our agents continue to provide intel on our enemy's weaknesses. We will keep our strikes targeted and safe."
msgstr ""
"좋아. 성전 문제에 대해서는 우리 요원들이 계속 적들의 약점에 대한 정보를 제공하도록 조치해. 목표를 정확하고 안전하게 공격할 수 있을 "
"거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: We will direct our efforts instead to helping those displaced in the city, as well as aid efforts for all affected. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311E"
msgid "Excellent. As for the Crusade, have our agents continue to provide scouting reports on our enemy's weak points and we'll revisit the topic later."
msgstr ""
"좋아. 성전 문제에 대해서는 우리 요원들이 계속 적들의 약점에 대한 정찰 보고서를 제출하도록 조치하고, 나중에 다시 검토하도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: The focus will instead be on trade. Reconstruction. The foundation of our city. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311D"
msgid "Excellent. As for the Crusade, have the Wardens continue to provide reports on our progress and adjust our involvement accordingly."
msgstr "좋아. 성전 문제에 대해서는 교정관들이 진행 상황을 계속 보고하도록 조치하고, 상황에 따라 개입 정도를 조정하도록 하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kadic_Djimal, Dulkehf_Malibor, Vethaal_Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Until victory is secured, this is the priority. &&& ...  &&& Kadic_Djimal: The main question is how to divert resources. Supplies are limited in the wake of the cataclysm. &&& Vethaal_Lovek: I am aware. &&& Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109511
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311C"
msgid "Excellent. As for the Crusade, have the Envoys continue to provide scouting reports on the Settled Systems and revisit the topic later."
msgstr "좋아. 성전 문제에 대해서는 사절들이 개척 성계 정찰 보고서를 계속 제출하도록 조치하고, 나중에 다시 검토하도록 하세."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311B"
msgid "Until victory is secured, this is the priority."
msgstr "승리가 확정될 때까지는 성전이 최우선 과제다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01311A"
msgid "However, we should consider this merely a pause in our ultimate goal. The complete domination of the Settled Systems."
msgstr ""
"하지만 그건 궁극적인 목표를 달성하기 전에 잠시 쉬어가는 거라고 생각해야 한다. 우리의 목표는 개척 성계를 완전히 지배하는 것이다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013119"
msgid "Yet I want to be clear this is not our only priority. We will be focusing on the wellness of our people, and returning Dazra to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"하지만 최우선 과제가 그것 뿐이 아니라는 건 분명히 해 두고 싶어. 우리는 신민들의 건강에 집중할 것이고, 다즈라를 옛 영광으로 돌려놓을 "
"거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013118"
msgid "We will direct our efforts instead to helping those displaced in the city, as well as aid efforts for all affected."
msgstr "도시에서 집을 잃은 신민들만 돕는 게 아니라, 피해를 입은 모든 이들을 지원할 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013117"
msgid "It is the will of the Great Serpent, and so we must abide. But we will show no temerity in our tactics."
msgstr "그것이 위대한 뱀의 뜻이니 반드시 따라야 하네. 하지만 무모한 전술을 사용해서는 안 되겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Speaker: Well, as it was Jinan's and Anasko's will, we have decided to resume the attack on the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Speaker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vethaal_Lovek: Well said, Speaker. I second that notion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109515
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013116"
msgid "The focus will instead be on trade. Reconstruction. The foundation of our city."
msgstr "앞으로는 교역과 재건에 집중할 걸세. 우리 도시의 기반을 다져야 하니까."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Dulkehf_Malibor: We are already rationing on all fronts. I would recommend we pull back our efforts until things stabilize. &&& Speaker: Nonsense. The more ships we ransack, the more our supplies increase. It is a problem that solves itself.
#. ALIAS: Dulkehf_Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Dulkehf_Malibor: Understood. And it seems we are out of time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_PostQuest_CouncilMeetings
#. TOPIC: 01109510
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_PostQuest_010_CouncilMeetings_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013115"
msgid "Understood. If that concludes the matter, let us move to the next item on the agenda."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이 문제에 대한 결론이 나왔다면 다음 안건으로 넘어가지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130F6"
msgid "We risk losing everything to the Zealots. So the Gate must cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex and back one last time, to purge them."
msgstr ""
"모든 것을 광신도에게 잃을 위험이 있지. 그러니 차원문을 한 번 더 순환시켜서 성채를 볼텍스 내부로 옮겼다가 되돌려야 한다. 놈들은 "
"제거될 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: We risk losing everything to the Zealots. So the Gate must cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex and back one last time, to purge them.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130F5"
msgid "The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way."
msgstr "안에 들어온 광신도는 공허로 던져질 것이지만, 유감스럽게도 너 또한 마찬가지다. 이게 유일한 방법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130F4"
msgid "Child, there is no other way."
msgstr "아이야. 다른 방법이 없느니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way. &&& Anasko: The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on. &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations.
