#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130F1"
msgid "I don't recall agreeing to this part of the plan."
msgstr "그런 계획에 동의한 기억은 없는데 말이죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way. &&& Anasko: The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on. &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations.
#. ALIAS: companion
