#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130F0"
msgid "I'm sorry, what?"
msgstr "저기, 뭐라고요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The Zealots inside will be cast in to the void, but - I am sorry to say - so will you. It is the only way. &&& Anasko: The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on. &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130EF"
msgid "That is hardly a way to say \"thanks for helping.\""
msgstr "'도와줘서 고맙다'는 뜻으로 할 말은 아니군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us! &&& Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am afraid not. You were not present when the experiment began, and so you shall not be present when it ends.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130EE"
msgid "There's no way for me to survive this?"
msgstr "내가 살아남을 방법이 없단 말입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no way for me to survive this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no way for me to survive this?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130ED"
msgid "I am afraid not. You were not present when the experiment began, and so you shall not be present when it ends."
msgstr "유감이지만 없다. 넌 실험을 시작할 때 그 자리에 없었으니, 끝날 때도 자리에 있어서는 안 되느니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us! &&& Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No! You will not jeopardize everything now!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130EA"
msgid "[Attack] I'm not going out like this!"
msgstr "[공격] 이딴 식으로 죽지는 않겠어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I'm not going out like this!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E9"
msgid "No! You will not jeopardize everything now!"
msgstr "안 돼! 이제 와서 다 망칠 순 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can't you just shut down the gate?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can't you just shut down the gate?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E7"
msgid "It cannot be shut down. Not now, when so much is at stake. Not when I am so close."
msgstr "꺼 버릴 순 없다. 지금은 너무나 많은 것이 걸려 있어. 이렇게 중요한 순간에는 안 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I am glad to have you here with me in this moment, but we are running out of time. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations. &&& companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us! &&& Anasko: Child, there is no other way.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It cannot be shut down. Not now, when so much is at stake. Not when I am so close.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E6"
msgid "Can't you just shut down the gate?"
msgstr "그냥 차원문을 꺼 버리면 안 됩니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Attack] You're not getting rid of me that easily!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E5"
msgid "You, and those bothersome Zealots trapped inside, will be cast into the void forever, and I will carry on the Crusade myself!"
msgstr "네놈과 저 성가신 광신도 놈들은 그 안에 갇혀 공허 속에 영원히 던져질 것이고, 나는 직접 성전을 이끌 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Despite your attempts to meddle, you have nonetheless served your part in the Serpent's Plan. &&& Anasko: Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex. &&& Anasko: You, and those bothersome Zealots trapped inside, will be cast into the void forever, and I will carry on the Crusade myself!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is nothing you can do to stop me! The Great Serpent cannot be defied!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E4"
msgid "[Attack] You're not getting rid of me that easily!"
msgstr "[공격] 날 그렇게 쉽게 없애지는 못할걸!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] You're not getting rid of me that easily!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] You're not getting rid of me that easily!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E3"
msgid "There is nothing you can do to stop me! The Great Serpent cannot be defied!"
msgstr "날 막을 수 있는 건 아무것도 없다! 위대한 뱀께 거스를 순 없단 말이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Despite your attempts to meddle, you have nonetheless served your part in the Serpent's Plan. &&& Anasko: Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex. &&& Anasko: You, and those bothersome Zealots trapped inside, will be cast into the void forever, and I will carry on the Crusade myself!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It cannot be stopped! It cannot be shut down! It, like the Great Serpent Himself, is inevitable!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E2"
msgid "[Attack] I have to shut this down before you hurt anyone else!"
msgstr "[공격] 네가 누굴 다치게 하기 전에 장치를 꺼 버리겠어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] I have to shut this down before you hurt anyone else!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I have to shut this down before you hurt anyone else!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E1"
msgid "It cannot be stopped! It cannot be shut down! It, like the Great Serpent Himself, is inevitable!"
msgstr "멈출 수 없어! 꺼 버릴 수 없다고! 마치 바로 그 위대한 뱀처럼, 필연적인 존재란 말이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Despite your attempts to meddle, you have nonetheless served your part in the Serpent's Plan. &&& Anasko: Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex. &&& Anasko: You, and those bothersome Zealots trapped inside, will be cast into the void forever, and I will carry on the Crusade myself!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, I speak for the Great Serpent! I carry out His will!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130E0"
msgid "[Attack] You're a monster!"
msgstr "[공격] 넌 괴물이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] You're a monster!
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] You're a monster!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011070CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130DF"
msgid "No, I speak for the Great Serpent! I carry out His will!"
msgstr "아니! 난 위대한 뱀을 대변한다! 그분의 뜻을 수행한단 말이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You utter fool! What have you done?|The entirety of the Citadel will be dragged into the Vortex! You have doomed us all!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0998_VortexGateOverloaded
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130DE"
msgid "We will not die like this! Find a way out!"
msgstr "이렇게 죽을 순 없어! 탈출구를 찾아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You utter fool! What have you done?|The entirety of the Citadel will be dragged into the Vortex! You have doomed us all!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0998_VortexGateOverloaded
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130DD"
msgid "Sounds like that's our cue to hit the exit!"
msgstr "저게 출구로 나가라는 신호인 것 같은데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You utter fool! What have you done?|The entirety of the Citadel will be dragged into the Vortex! You have doomed us all!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0998_VortexGateOverloaded
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130DC"
msgid "Things just went from bad to worse. Time to go!"
msgstr "상황이 더 심각해지고 있어. 떠날 시간이야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FED09
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_IntercomHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0130DB"
msgid "Please, I have waited so long for this. Just activate the pods."
msgstr "제발. 이 순간을 너무 오래 기다렸단 말이다. 그냥 포드를 활성화하거라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: Well, the security team has been given more authority. But the checks take much longer. Viktor wants to ensure the Starport is secure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D9"
msgid "How have things been since the new Speaker took over?"
msgstr "새로운 대변자가 취임한 이후로 상황이 어떻습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: How have things been since the new Speaker took over?
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: A fair point, but it must be done. Dazra cannot afford an attack at this time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D8"
msgid "Well, the security team has been given more authority. But the checks take much longer. Viktor wants to ensure the Starport is secure."
msgstr "음, 경비대에 더 많은 권한이 주어졌습니다. 하지만 점검 시간이 훨씬 길어졌습니다. 빅토르는 우주항의 보안을 확실히 하고 싶어 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: How have things been since the new Speaker took over?
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: A fair point, but it must be done. Dazra cannot afford an attack at this time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D7"
msgid "The starport has been increasingly busy. House Ka'dic has put an emphasis on bringing in more workers to help with the reconstruction effort."
msgstr "우주항이 점점 더 바빠지고 있습니다. 카딕 가문은 재건 노력을 돕기 위해 더 많은 노동자를 데려오는 데 중점을 두고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: How have things been since the new Speaker took over?
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: A fair point, but it must be done. Dazra cannot afford an attack at this time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D6"
msgid "The starport has been increasingly busy. House Dul'kehf has put an emphasis on trade to help with the reconstruction effort."
msgstr "우주항이 점점 더 바빠지고 있습니다. 둘케프 가문은 재건 노력을 돕기 위해 교역에 중점을 두고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: How have things been since the new Speaker took over? &&& Guard02: Well, the security team has been given more authority. But the checks take much longer. Viktor wants to ensure the Starport is secure.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D5"
msgid "A fair point, but it must be done. Dazra cannot afford an attack at this time."
msgstr "일리가 있지만, 반드시 해야 할 일입니다. 지금 다즈라는 공격을 감당할 여유가 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: How have things been since the new Speaker took over? &&& Guard02: Well, the security team has been given more authority. But the checks take much longer. Viktor wants to ensure the Starport is secure.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 01106D65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D4"
msgid "A necessary policy. But we should be mindful of the security risks."
msgstr "필수적인 정책입니다. 하지만 보안 위험에 유의해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Do not assume anything will change, and begging does not become you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D2"
msgid "Do you know what the new House has planned for our troubles?"
msgstr "새로운 가문이 우리의 문제에 대해 어떤 계획을 세웠는지 알고 계십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Do you know what the new House has planned for our troubles?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D1"
msgid "Do not assume anything will change, and begging does not become you."
msgstr "아무것도 변하지 않을 거라고 생각하지 마십시오. 그리고 구걸하는 건 당신에게 어울리지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130D0"
msgid "But I have heard that House Veth'aal has concerns this area is a security risk. So maybe you will be moved away from the starport."
msgstr "하지만 베타알 가문이 이 지역을 보안 위험으로 간주한다는 말을 들었습니다. 그러니 아마 당신은 우주항에서 멀리 떨어진 곳으로 옮겨질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130CF"
msgid "But to where? Only the Serpent knows."
msgstr "하지만 어디로? 그건 뱀만이 아시겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Do you know what the new House has planned for our troubles?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130CE"
msgid "I've heard House Dul'kehf has made it a priority. Speaker Hasmak has stated the importance of this location as a trade hub."
msgstr ""
"둘케프 가문이 이곳을 우선 순위로 삼았다는 말을 들었습니다. 대변자 해즈막은 이곳이 교역 중심지로서 중요하다는 점을 강조했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130CD"
msgid "But that also won't be happening any time soon. Buildings take time to construct."
msgstr "하지만 그것도 당분간은 일어나지 않을 겁니다. 건물을 짓는 데는 시간이 걸립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Do you know what the new House has planned for our troubles?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130CC"
msgid "I've heard House Ka'dic is opening up recruitment for jobs outside of Dazra."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 다즈라 외부에서 일자리를 모집한다는 말을 들었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp
#. TOPIC: 01106D6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130CB"
msgid "In other words, if you want a way out of this place, you must find a way to serve the Great Serpent."
msgstr "다시 말해, 이곳에서 벗어나고 싶다면, 위대한 뱀을 섬길 방법을 찾아야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: We'll be increasing our presence here. Priority will be given to the devout.
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Hmph. Fair enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C9"
msgid "We operate based on need here. The healing arts are not a test of faith, but an application of it."
msgstr "우리는 이곳에서 필요에 따라 운영합니다. 치유의 기술은 신앙의 시험이 아니라, 신앙의 실천입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Have you been getting the supplies you need? I've heard rumors of grumbling from the other Noble Houses, now that House Ka'dic is in charge.
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Hmph. Fair enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C8"
msgid "We haven't experienced any delays. Although things have been slightly testier with members of House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "지연은 없었습니다. 하지만 둘케프 가문의 일원들과는 조금 더 예민한 상황입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: I've heard word that construction on a new building for House Dul'kehf is a high priority.
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Hmph. Fair enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C7"
msgid "Bless the Great Serpent. It has been a challenge for us here with the Halls of Healing so crowded."
msgstr "위대한 뱀은 복되시도다. 회복의 전당이 이렇게 붐비면 저희가 정말 힘듭니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: We operate based on need here. The healing arts are not a test of faith, but an application of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C6"
msgid "We'll be increasing our presence here. Priority will be given to the devout."
msgstr "우리는 이곳에 주둔 병력을 늘릴 것입니다. 신앙심이 깊은 자들에게 우선권이 주어질 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C5"
msgid "There are rumors that a Herald's prayer has fallen in favor of more... scientific methods. Is this true?"
msgstr "전령의 기도가 더... 과학적인 방법을 선호한다는 소문이 있습니다. 사실입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C4"
msgid "Have you been getting the supplies you need? I've heard rumors of grumbling from the other Noble Houses, now that House Ka'dic is in charge."
msgstr "필요한 용품은 공급받고 계십니까? 카딕 가문이 권력을 잡은 이후로, 다른 명문 가문에서 불평이 있다는 소문이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C3"
msgid "I've heard word that construction on a new building for House Dul'kehf is a high priority."
msgstr "둘케프 가문을 위한 새 건물 건설이 최우선 순위라는 말을 들었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Hmph. Fair enough. &&& Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C2"
msgid "Hmph. A likely story."
msgstr "흥. 그럴듯한 이야기군요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hanton: We operate based on need here. The healing arts are not a test of faith, but an application of it. &&& Guard01: Hmph. Fair enough.
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Hmph. A likely story.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D70
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C1"
msgid "Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning."
msgstr "전혀 그렇지 않습니다. 전령의 의술은 모어닝 호만큼이나 오래되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: We'll be increasing our presence here. Priority will be given to the devout. &&& Hanton: We operate based on need here. The healing arts are not a test of faith, but an application of it.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130C0"
msgid "Hmph. Fair enough."
msgstr "흥. 알겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Have you been getting the supplies you need? I've heard rumors of grumbling from the other Noble Houses, now that House Ka'dic is in charge. &&& Hanton: We haven't experienced any delays. Although things have been slightly testier with members of House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: Not in the slightest. The Herald's practices are as old as the Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 01106D6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HoHScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130BF"
msgid "Such bitterness is beneath them. If they give you any trouble, let me know."
msgstr "그런 씁쓸함은 그들에게 어울리지 않습니다. 그들이 당신을 괴롭히면, 제게 알려 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: What's the occasion?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D75
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130BD"
msgid "Give me your best bottle of koza, Genna."
msgstr "최고급 코자 한 병 줘요. 제나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Give me your best bottle of koza, Genna.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I am drinking one in honor of the Serpent's Crusade, and all the brave souls who fight on the front lines.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130BC"
msgid "What's the occasion?"
msgstr "무슨 일 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Give me your best bottle of koza, Genna. &&& Genna: What's the occasion?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: That's as good a reason as any.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130BB"
msgid "I am drinking one in honor of the Serpent's Crusade, and all the brave souls who fight on the front lines."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 기리면서 한잔 마셔야겠어요. 최전선에서 싸우는 용감한 영혼들도 기리고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: Give me your best bottle of koza, Genna. &&& Genna: What's the occasion?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: That's as good a reason as any.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130BA"
msgid "Celebrating the new Speaker. It's just nice to have some good news. And another excuse to drink!"
msgstr "새 대변자의 즉위를 축하해야죠. 좋은 소식 들으면 기분도 좋잖아요. 술 마실 핑계도 생기고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Genna: What's the occasion? &&& Egbo: I am drinking one in honor of the Serpent's Crusade, and all the brave souls who fight on the front lines.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 01106D72
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_HeraldsRest01DUPLICATE001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B9"
msgid "That's as good a reason as any."
msgstr "참 좋은 핑계네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: That is encouraging to hear. Let's hope the Great Serpent continues to favor them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf03
#. TOPIC: 01106D7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B7"
msgid "I was skeptical at first, but business has improved since House Dul'kehf's rise."
msgstr "처음에는 회의적이었지만, 둘케프 가문이 부상한 이후로 장사가 잘되고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I was skeptical at first, but business has improved since House Dul'kehf's rise.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf03
#. TOPIC: 01106D79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B6"
msgid "That is encouraging to hear. Let's hope the Great Serpent continues to favor them."
msgstr "그거 다행이군. 위대한 뱀께서 계속 그들에게 은총을 베푸시길 바라세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf01
#. TOPIC: 01106D7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B4"
msgid "Do you think House Dul'kehf will be good rulers?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 좋은 통치자가 될 거라고 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Dul'kehf will be good rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf01
#. TOPIC: 01106D7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DAC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B3"
msgid "They will follow the word of Jinan, to the letter. For good or ill."
msgstr "좋든 싫든 그들은 지난의 말씀을 글자 그대로 따를 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Dul'kehf will be good rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf01
#. TOPIC: 01106D7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DAC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B2"
msgid "They will ensure everything happens on time. If nothing else, they are reliable."
msgstr "그들은 모든 일이 제시간에 일어나도록 할 거야. 적어도 그 점에선 믿을 만하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic04
#. TOPIC: 01106D82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130B0"
msgid "Do you think House Ka'dic will end our policy of isolation?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 우리의 고립 정책을 끝낼 거라고 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Ka'dic will end our policy of isolation?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic04
#. TOPIC: 01106D81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene04
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DBC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130AF"
msgid "End? I cannot see such a future. Ease? Perhaps."
msgstr "끝낸다고? 그런 미래는 보이지 않아. 완화한다고? 그럴지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Ka'dic will end our policy of isolation?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic04
#. TOPIC: 01106D81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene04
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DBC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130AE"
msgid "Yes, and it troubles me to think it might occur."
msgstr "그래, 그런 일이 일어날지도 모른다는 게 걱정이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Ka'dic will end our policy of isolation?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic04
#. TOPIC: 01106D81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene04
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DBC
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130AD"
msgid "Yes, and I welcome the change. It is time."
msgstr "그래, 그리고 난 그 변화를 환영해. 때가 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I am no economist, but do they not need those funds to repair the city? I am not so sure easing tithes is the right move.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic03
#. TOPIC: 01106D86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130AB"
msgid "I am hoping House Ka'dic relaxes the annual tithe. It will boost the economy overall."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 연례 조세를 완화하기를 바라고 있어. 전반적으로 경제가 활성화될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I am hoping House Ka'dic relaxes the annual tithe. It will boost the economy overall.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic03
#. TOPIC: 01106D85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130AA"
msgid "I am no economist, but do they not need those funds to repair the city? I am not so sure easing tithes is the right move."
msgstr "난 경제학자는 아니지만, 그들이 도시를 복구하는 데 그 자금이 필요하지 않나? 조세를 완화하는 것이 옳은 조치인지는 잘 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic01
#. TOPIC: 01106D8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A8"
msgid "Given the rumors about House Ka'dic, they are an interesting choice to rule Dazra."
msgstr "카딕 가문에 대한 소문을 고려할 때, 그들은 다즈라를 통치하기에 흥미로운 선택이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Given the rumors about House Ka'dic, they are an interesting choice to rule Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic01
#. TOPIC: 01106D89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DB9
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A7"
msgid "The Great Serpent decreed it so. To say otherwise is blasphemy."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그렇게 명하셨다. 달리 말하는 것은 신성모독이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Given the rumors about House Ka'dic, they are an interesting choice to rule Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic01
#. TOPIC: 01106D89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DB9
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A6"
msgid "I am not familiar with such rumors. Speak plain or continue to serve."
msgstr "나는 그런 소문에 대해 잘 알지 못해. 솔직히 말하거나 계속 복무하도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal02
#. TOPIC: 01106D8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A4"
msgid "I have not been to the Wayshrines in ages. It will be good to make the journey again."
msgstr "몇 년 동안 성소에 가보지 못했어. 다시 그곳에 갈 수 있다니 좋군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I have not been to the Wayshrines in ages. It will be good to make the journey again.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal02
#. TOPIC: 01106D8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene02
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DD1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A3"
msgid "Yes, I am glad House Veth'aal is making it compulsory."
msgstr "그래, 베타알 가문이 의무화한다니 나도 기뻐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I have not been to the Wayshrines in ages. It will be good to make the journey again.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal02
#. TOPIC: 01106D8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene02
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DD1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A2"
msgid "I am fine with the general idea, I simply wish it weren't mandatory. Do we really have time for this?"
msgstr "전반적인 생각에는 동의하지만, 의무가 아니었으면 좋겠어. 정말 이럴 시간이 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Rebuilding this city is as much in the Great Serpent's will as it is our own hard work. Prayer is important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01106D8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0130A0"
msgid "What is this talk of forced pilgrimages? I am as devout as the next person, but... is this really the time for that?"
msgstr "강제 순례에 대한 이야기는 뭐지? 나도 다른 사람만큼이나 신앙심이 깊지만... 정말 이럴 때인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What is this talk of forced pilgrimages? I am as devout as the next person, but... is this really the time for that?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal01
#. TOPIC: 01106D8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01309F"
msgid "Rebuilding this city is as much in the Great Serpent's will as it is our own hard work. Prayer is important."
msgstr "이 도시를 재건하는 것은 우리 자신의 노력이기도 하지만 위대한 뱀의 뜻이기도 하다. 기도는 중요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I am elated that you will finally know justice. The Great Serpent continues to work wonders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic02
#. TOPIC: 01106D88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01309D"
msgid "I've petitioned to have my cousin released. I think House Ka'dic will be sympathetic to those falsely accused of Zealotry."
msgstr "내 사촌이 석방되도록 청원했어. 카딕 가문은 광신도로 누명을 쓴 사람들에게 동정적일 거라고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I've petitioned to have my cousin released. I think House Ka'dic will be sympathetic to those falsely accused of Zealotry.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Kadic02
#. TOPIC: 01106D87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_KadicScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01309C"
msgid "I am elated that you will finally know justice. The Great Serpent continues to work wonders."
msgstr "마침내 정의를 알게 되어 기쁘군. 위대한 뱀께서는 계속해서 기적을 행하고 계셔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01106D84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01309A"
msgid "Do you think HouseVeth'aal will be fair rulers?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 공정한 통치자가 될 거라고 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think HouseVeth'aal will be fair rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01106D83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene03
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106D91
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013099"
msgid "Fairness is irrelevant. The will of the Great Serpent is paramount. All Must Serve."
msgstr "공정성은 중요하지 않아. 위대한 뱀의 뜻이 가장 중요하지. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think HouseVeth'aal will be fair rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01106D83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene03
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106D91
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013098"
msgid "Their methods are tough, but as I told my child the day he slew his groat, it will harden us for a life that requires it."
msgstr "그들의 방법은 가혹하지만, 내 아이가 그로트를 도축하던 날 말했듯이, 그런 삶을 위해 우리를 단련시킬 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think HouseVeth'aal will be fair rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal03
