msgid "Fairness is irrelevant. The will of the Great Serpent is paramount. All Must Serve."
msgstr "공정성은 중요하지 않아. 위대한 뱀의 뜻이 가장 중요하지. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think HouseVeth'aal will be fair rulers?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal03
#. TOPIC: 01106D83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene03
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106D91
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
