msgid "Their methods are tough, but as I told my child the day he slew his groat, it will harden us for a life that requires it."
msgstr "그들의 방법은 가혹하지만, 내 아이가 그로트를 도축하던 날 말했듯이, 그런 삶을 위해 우리를 단련시킬 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Vethaal04
#. TOPIC: 01106D80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_VethaalScene04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013094"
msgid "Do you think House Veth'aal will be fair rulers?"
msgstr "베타알 가문이 공정한 통치자가 될 거라고 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: It's these long hours. I worry we are far too focused on the work of repairing the city and not the faith that guides it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf02
#. TOPIC: 01106D7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013092"
msgid "Does something trouble you?"
msgstr "뭔가 자네를 괴롭히는 일이 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Does something trouble you?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Well said. Let us not forget that without the Great Serpent, our labor will not bear fruit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf02
#. TOPIC: 01106D7B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013091"
msgid "It's these long hours. I worry we are far too focused on the work of repairing the city and not the faith that guides it."
msgstr "이 긴 근무 시간 때문이야. 우리는 도시를 복구하는 일에 너무 집중하고 있고, 그 일을 인도하는 신앙에는 소홀한 것 같아 걱정이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Does something trouble you? &&& Citizen02: It's these long hours. I worry we are far too focused on the work of repairing the city and not the faith that guides it.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf02
#. TOPIC: 01106D76
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013090"
msgid "Well said. Let us not forget that without the Great Serpent, our labor will not bear fruit."
msgstr "옳은 말일세. 위대한 뱀이 없다면 우리의 노동은 결실을 맺지 못할 것이라는 사실을 잊지 마세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf04
#. TOPIC: 01106D78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01308E"
msgid "Do you think House Dul'kehf will boost trade?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 교역을 활성화시킬까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Dul'kehf will boost trade?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf04
#. TOPIC: 01106D77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene04
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DCD
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01308D"
msgid "It is all but certain they will."
msgstr "둘케프 쪽이라면 거의 확실히 그러겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think House Dul'kehf will boost trade?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Dulkehf04
#. TOPIC: 01106D77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_DulkehfScene04
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01106DCD
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01308C"
msgid "They are masters of commerce and finance, but they are not infallible. We shall see."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 상업과 금융의 대가이지만, 완벽한 건 아니야. 두고 봐야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Zamira
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zamira: House Ka'dic has not mentioned it as a priority, but that is fine, so long as we have Jinan's word, and the power of oral history.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01308A"
msgid "Do you think the Cultural Center will return at some point?"
msgstr "문화 센터가 언젠가 돌아올 거라고 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think the Cultural Center will return at some point?
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I see. Thank you, Zamira.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013089"
msgid "House Ka'dic has not mentioned it as a priority, but that is fine, so long as we have Jinan's word, and the power of oral history."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 그것을 우선 순위로 언급하지 않았지만, 지난의 말씀과 구전 역사의 힘이 있는 한 괜찮습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think the Cultural Center will return at some point?
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013088"
msgid "It will be up and running soon. House Veth'aal believes in the importance of worship -- often with a very fundamentalist interpretation."
msgstr "곧 운영이 재개될 겁니다. 베타알 가문은 예배의 중요성을 믿습니다. 종종 매우 근본주의적인 해석을 곁들이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I see. Thank you, Zamira.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013087"
msgid "The Cultural Center is an important part of that education."
msgstr "문화 센터는 그 교육의 중요한 부분입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think the Cultural Center will return at some point?
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I see. Thank you, Zamira.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013086"
msgid "House Dul'kehf has not mentioned it as a priority, but that is fine, so long as we have Jinan's word, and the power of oral history."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 그것을 우선 순위로 언급하지 않았지만, 지난의 말씀과 구전 역사의 힘이 있는 한 괜찮습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Zamira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you think the Cultural Center will return at some point? &&& Zamira: House Ka'dic has not mentioned it as a priority, but that is fine, so long as we have Jinan's word, and the power of oral history.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01106FCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013085"
msgid "I see. Thank you, Zamira."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 감사합니다, 자미라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kreso: Pressure? Nonsense. Hasmak knows I cannot change the speed of nature. The meat will come as it is ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013083"
msgid "Kreso, I've heard House Dul'kehf has been putting more pressure on you since they took over."
msgstr "크레소, 둘케프 가문이 권력을 잡은 이후로 자네에게 더 많은 압력을 가하고 있다는 소문이 있던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kreso: Pressure? Nonsense. Hasmak knows I cannot change the speed of nature. The meat will come as it is ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013082"
msgid "Kreso, I've heard House Ka'dic is talking about bringing in more food vendors from the outside."
msgstr "크레소, 카딕 가문이 외부에서 더 많은 식품 판매업자를 데려올 거라는 소문이 있던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kreso: Pressure? Nonsense. Hasmak knows I cannot change the speed of nature. The meat will come as it is ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013081"
msgid "Kreso, I've heard House Veth'aal has been asking about the rituals. They want to know if any children refuse to slaughter their groats."
msgstr "크레소, 베타알 가문이 의식에 대해 묻고 다닌다는 소문이 있던데. 그들은 아이들이 그로트 도축을 거부하는지 알고 싶어 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, I've heard House Dul'kehf has been putting more pressure on you since they took over.
#. ALIAS: Kreso
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Worker: All right, but I just wanted to make sure you're aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013080"
msgid "Pressure? Nonsense. Hasmak knows I cannot change the speed of nature. The meat will come as it is ready."
msgstr "압력이라고? 말도 안 돼. 해즈막은 내가 자연의 속도를 바꿀 수 없다는 걸 알고 있어. 고기는 준비되는 대로 나올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, I've heard House Ka'dic is talking about bringing in more food vendors from the outside.
#. ALIAS: Kreso
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Worker: All right, but I just wanted to make sure you're aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01307F"
msgid "Importing more vendors? This is the first I've heard of it. I question your source. There is no substitute for groat."
msgstr "더 많은 판매업자를 수입한다고? 그건 처음 듣는 소리인데. 자네 정보의 출처가 의심스럽군. 그로트를 대체할 수 있는 건 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, I've heard House Veth'aal has been asking about the rituals. They want to know if any children refuse to slaughter their groats.
#. ALIAS: Kreso
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Worker: All right, but I just wanted to make sure you're aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01307E"
msgid "Children, refusing the ritual? No, no, I can't believe such a thing would happen, even in this day and age. All Must Serve."
msgstr "아이들이 의식을 거부한다고? 아니, 아니, 요즘 같은 시대에도 그런 일이 일어날 거라고는 믿을 수 없어. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, I've heard House Dul'kehf has been putting more pressure on you since they took over. &&& Kreso: Pressure? Nonsense. Hasmak knows I cannot change the speed of nature. The meat will come as it is ready.
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01106FC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01307D"
msgid "All right, but I just wanted to make sure you're aware."
msgstr "알았네, 하지만 자네가 알고 있는지 확인하고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I know not of what you speak, and I tire of this harassment!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood05_Vethaal
#. TOPIC: 01106FC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01307B"
msgid "There's been word your cousin's been passing out heretic teachings. What say you?"
msgstr "자네 사촌이 이단 교리를 퍼뜨리고 있다는 소문이 있던데. 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Guard01, Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: There's been word your cousin's been passing out heretic teachings. What say you?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: Lie if you wish, but the Great Serpent's eyes see all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood05_Vethaal
#. TOPIC: 01106FC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01307A"
msgid "I know not of what you speak, and I tire of this harassment!"
msgstr "무슨 말씀이신지 모르겠고, 이런 괴롭힘도 지긋지긋하군요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: There's been word your cousin's been passing out heretic teachings. What say you? &&& Citizen01: I know not of what you speak, and I tire of this harassment!
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_CommonerNeighborhood05_Vethaal
#. TOPIC: 01106FC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013079"
msgid "Lie if you wish, but the Great Serpent's eyes see all."
msgstr "거짓말을 해도 좋지만, 위대한 뱀의 눈은 모든 것을 보고 계신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Makola: Business is as the Great Serpent wills.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 01106FC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013077"
msgid "So how has the new House affected business?"
msgstr "그래서 새로운 가문이 사업에 어떤 영향을 미쳤나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: So how has the new House affected business?
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: But surely House Dul'kehf's changes have helped. Trade seems to be flowing, to your store and others.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 01106FC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013076"
msgid "Business is as the Great Serpent wills."
msgstr "사업은 위대한 뱀의 뜻대로지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: So how has the new House affected business? &&& Makola: Business is as the Great Serpent wills.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I know I myself have prayed on this subject. Surely you have done the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 01106FC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013075"
msgid "But surely House Dul'kehf's changes have helped. Trade seems to be flowing, to your store and others."
msgstr "그래도 둘케프 가문 인원에 변동이 생긴 게 도움이 된 건 확실해. 자네 가게는 물론 다른 가게도 거래가 활발해진 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: So how has the new House affected business? &&& Makola: Business is as the Great Serpent wills.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I know I myself have prayed on this subject. Surely you have done the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 01106FC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013074"
msgid "But the talk of integrating outsiders and heretics, surely this must worry you as a dealer of weapons."
msgstr "그런데 이방인이나 이단자와 협력 관계를 맺는다는 얘기가 있더군. 무기 중개상인 자네에겐 분명 걱정거리일 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: So how has the new House affected business? &&& Makola: Business is as the Great Serpent wills.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I know I myself have prayed on this subject. Surely you have done the same.
