#. TOPIC: 01106FC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013073"
msgid "But surely House Veth'aal's more militant policies will help a dealer of weapons like yourself."
msgstr "하지만 베타알 가문이 더 강경한 정책을 펼치면 자네 같은 무기 중개상에겐 분명 도움이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Makola: I do not pray for succor. I pray because He wills it.
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Angry
