#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over...
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011049A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013058"
msgid "So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different."
msgstr ""
"너무 많은 신민들이 이런 상태에 빠졌습니다. 볼텍스 유령이 됐지요. 하지만 보통은 적대적으로 변해서 공격해 오는데, 아나스코 님은 "
"다릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: House Va'ruun can project force on a scale unimaginable in the history of the human race. Jinan Va'ruun's mandate can be fulfilled, the Serpent's Crusade can begin anew!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011049A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage554_AnaskoPodRoomAnimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013057"
msgid "The brave volunteers in this room await the chance to be the first wave of soldiers, loyal to the Great Serpent and our cause."
msgstr "여기 있는 용감한 자원자들이 위대한 뱀과 우리 대의에 충성하는 첫 번째 병사가 될 순간을 기다리고 있노라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The brave volunteers in this room await the chance to be the first wave of soldiers, loyal to the Great Serpent and our cause.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Despite all that has happened, their life support system has remained stable... Just one more sign from the Great Serpent that we are following His will. And now, the glorious honor falls to you, my faithful servant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011049A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage554_AnaskoPodRoomAnimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013056"
msgid "House Va'ruun can project force on a scale unimaginable in the history of the human race. Jinan Va'ruun's mandate can be fulfilled, the Serpent's Crusade can begin anew!"
msgstr ""
"바룬 가문은 인류 역사를 통틀어 봐도 상상할 수 없는 규모의 힘을 휘두를 수 있다. 지난 바룬 님의 명령을 완수하고, 뱀의 성전을 새로이 "
"시작할 수 있는 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: House Va'ruun can project force on a scale unimaginable in the history of the human race. Jinan Va'ruun's mandate can be fulfilled, the Serpent's Crusade can begin anew!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Activate the pods, Carry out the Serpent's Will, and begin House Va'ruun's triumph!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011049A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage554_AnaskoPodRoomAnimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013055"
msgid "Despite all that has happened, their life support system has remained stable... Just one more sign from the Great Serpent that we are following His will. And now, the glorious honor falls to you, my faithful servant."
msgstr ""
"그 많은 일이 있었지만, 이들의 생명 유지 시스템은 안정화되어 있지... 우리가 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 따르고 있다는 걸 보여주는 또 하나의 "
"징조이니라. 그리고 이제, 눈부신 영광의 순간이 네 손에 달렸다. 충직한 하인이여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Despite all that has happened, their life support system has remained stable... Just one more sign from the Great Serpent that we are following His will. And now, the glorious honor falls to you, my faithful servant.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011049A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage554_AnaskoPodRoomAnimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013054"
msgid "Activate the pods, Carry out the Serpent's Will, and begin House Va'ruun's triumph!"
msgstr "포드를 활성화하고, 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 수행해라. 바룬 가문의 승리가 시작되리라!"

