msgstr "전에도 말했지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: I didn't realize it was going to turn into a whole thing. &&& Vaeric: So now you know my true intentions for leaving, and given the circumstances, I may be here for some time.|My hope now is to make the best of it here. &&& Vaeric: [Attack] I can't allow that.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013019"
msgid "Whoa, whoa, you're not really going to kill him are you?"
msgstr "워, 워, 진짜로 죽여버리려는 건 아니겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013018"
msgid "I mean, first of all, are you sure Viktor even wants him dead?"
msgstr "내 말은, 일단, 빅토르가 배릭이 죽길 바라는 게 확실해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013017"
msgid "I'll say it again."
msgstr "다시 말씀드릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: This is exactly what I feared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013016"
msgid "As I said, we never would have knowingly aided a traitor."
msgstr "말씀드렸듯이, 저희는 고의로 반역자를 도운 적이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013015"
msgid "As I was saying, we sent him north."
msgstr "말씀드린 대로, 북쪽으로 보냈어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013014"
msgid "Again, forgive me. We don't want any trouble."
msgstr "다시 한번 죄송하지만, 문젯거리는 피하고 싶네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is re-entering the conversation. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013013"
msgid "Like I said."
msgstr "말씀드렸잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013012"
msgid "Just head out the west gate. Should be the fastest route."
msgstr "서문으로 나가봐. 가장 빠른 길일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: I don't know where he is, but there's a man, Tane Salavea. He might know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013011"
msgid "What were you saying about Tane again?"
msgstr "테인에 대해서 뭐라고 말했었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013010"
msgid "You were saying about Vaeric?"
msgstr "배릭에 대해서 뭐라고 했었죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Drunk and not in the mood to socialize. / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I just want Vaeric to show up so things can get back to normal... whatever that is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104550C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300F"
msgid "What were were we talking about? Oh yeah..."
msgstr "무슨 얘기 중이었지? 아, 맞다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Drunk and not in the mood to socialize. / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I just want Vaeric to show up so things can get back to normal... whatever that is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104550C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300E"
msgid "What do you want? Can't you see I'm busy?"
msgstr "뭐가 필요한데? 나 바쁜 거 안 보여?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300D"
msgid "Vaeric..."
msgstr "배릭..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300C"
msgid "You think you know someone."
msgstr "사람 속은 모르는 법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300B"
msgid "As I was saying..."
msgstr "전에도 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayTaneCredits>] It's a deal. Credits for Vaeric's location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01300A"
msgid "You ready to make a deal?"
msgstr "거래할 준비가 되셨나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayTaneCredits>] It's a deal. Credits for Vaeric's location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013009"
msgid "So how about that offer?"
msgstr "어떻게 제안을 받아들이겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013008"
msgid "As I was saying..."
msgstr "전에도 말했듯이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041090
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "013007"
msgid "If you are not a member of House Veth'aal, you do not belong here."
msgstr "네가 베타알 가문의 일원이 아니라면, 여기 들어오지도 마라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013006"
msgid "Hm? What do you speak of?"
msgstr "음? 무슨 말을 하는 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013005"
msgid "I know not of what you speak."
msgstr "무슨 말을 하는 건지 모르겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013004"
msgid "I am unclear on what you refer to."
msgstr "무슨 말씀이신지 잘 모르겠습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013003"
msgid "Yes. My partner mentioned it."
msgstr "네. 제 파트너가 그러더군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013002"
msgid "I haven't been privy to such conversations, no."
msgstr "아뇨. 그런 대화는 듣지 못했습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013001"
msgid "I've heard whispers, yes."
msgstr "네. 소문은 들었습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "013000"
msgid "I don't pay attention to such talk."
msgstr "그런 이야기는 신경 쓰지 않습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Reply
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFF"
msgid "Yes, as far as I know."
msgstr "네. 제가 알기론 그렇습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFE"
msgid "Have you heard the news?"
msgstr "소식 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFD"
msgid "Are the rumors true?"
msgstr "소문이 사실이야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFC"
msgid "Have you caught wind of the latest?"
msgstr "최근 소식 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFB"
msgid "Has the talk reached your ears?"
msgstr "소문 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FFA"
msgid "Have you been informed?"
msgstr "소식 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF9"
msgid "There has been talk of changes. Were you aware?"
msgstr "변화가 있을 거라는 얘기가 있던데. 알고 있었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF8"
msgid "Did the news reach you?"
msgstr "소식 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF7"
msgid "Rumors have taken wind. Have you heard them?"
msgstr "소문이 무성하던데. 들었어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF6"
msgid "Well, there is no guarantee it happens."
msgstr "뭐, 그렇다고 그게 꼭 일어난다는 보장은 없지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF5"
msgid "It is still just a rumor. We shall see if it becomes more."
msgstr "여전히 소문일 뿐이야. 두고 보면 알겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF4"
msgid "I see. Well, I am hopeful this rumor becomes reality, but I have my doubts."
msgstr "그렇군. 뭐, 이 소문이 현실이 되길 바라지만, 의구심이 드는 것도 사실이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF3"
msgid "From what I've been told, it is merely a proposal, nothing concrete."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는 그저 제안일 뿐이고, 구체적인 건 아무것도 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF2"
msgid "I don't really know how to feel about that. But I do know that if called upon, All Must Serve."
msgstr "그것에 대해 어떻게 생각해야 할지 잘 모르겠어. 하지만 분명한 건, 부름을 받으면 모두가 섬겨야 한다는 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF1"
msgid "I see. And is this the will of the Great Serpent? Sometimes I wonder."
msgstr "그렇군. 그게 위대한 뱀의 뜻일까? 가끔은 의문이 들어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FF0"
msgid "Interesting choice. But I defer to the Speaker's will."
msgstr "흥미로운 선택이군. 하지만 난 대변자의 뜻을 따르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Doubt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FEF"
msgid "Yes, it's a sore spot in my family. My partner and I disagree on this issue. But in the end, All Must Serve."
msgstr "네, 그건 제 가문의 아픈 부분입니다. 저와 제 파트너는 이 문제에 대해 의견이 다릅니다. 하지만 결국 모두가 섬겨야 하죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FEE"
msgid "Well, if the Great Serpent wills it, I think it will be good for Dazra."
msgstr "뭐, 위대한 뱀께서 원하신다면, 다즈라에게 좋은 일이 될 거라고 생각해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FED"
msgid "I am happy with these changes. I think it will benefit the city."
msgstr "난 이러한 변화에 만족해. 이 도시에도 이익이 될 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FEC"
msgid "The Speaker is the mouth of the Great Serpent. Regardless of what people think of their policies, if this is the Serpent's will, then we must serve it."
msgstr "대변자는 위대한 뱀의 입이야. 사람들이 그들의 정책을 어떻게 생각하든, 이것이 뱀의 뜻이라면, 우리는 따라야만 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FEB"
msgid "I understand some feel these changes are sudden. But it is the will of the Speaker, the mouth of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이러한 변화가 갑작스럽다고 느끼는 사람들도 있겠지. 하지만 이것은 대변자, 즉 위대한 뱀의 입이 전하는 뜻이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FEA"
msgid "If you ask me, it's a long time coming. I have been asking for such changes for years."
msgstr "내 생각엔, 진작에 이루어졌어야 할 일이야. 난 수년간 그러한 변화를 요구해 왔어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE9"
msgid "I believe these are changes for the better. And even if you disagree, All Must Serve."
msgstr "이것은 더 나은 변화라고 믿어. 그리고 네가 동의하지 않더라도, 모두가 섬겨야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE8"
msgid "It will be tough, but it is necessary. All Must Serve."
msgstr "힘들겠지만, 필요한 일이야. 모두가 섬겨야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Affirm
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE7"
msgid "I believe it is a small price to pay for the betterment of all."
msgstr "모두의 발전을 위해 치러야 할 작은 댓가라고 생각해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE6"
msgid "To me, it's a bad idea. They will meet some resistance, I think."
msgstr "내겐, 그건 나쁜 생각이야. 어느 정도 저항에 부딪힐 거라고 봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE5"
msgid "Ha! They are welcome to try these changes. But I believe the Great Serpent has a different plan."
msgstr "하! 그들이 이러한 변화를 시도해 보라지. 하지만 난 위대한 뱀께서 다른 계획을 가지고 계시다고 믿어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "012FE4"
msgid "Serpent's breath, I don't like any of these changes. To me, the power has gone to their heads."
msgstr "뱀의 숨결이시여, 이렇게 변하다니 마음에 들지 않아. 내가 느끼기에는, 권력이 저들에게 넘어간 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE3"
msgid "Ugh. Things were better under Anasko's rule."
msgstr "쯧. 아나스코가 통치하던 시절이 더 좋았어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE2"
msgid "It's change for the sake of change. How far will House Va'ruun fall?"
msgstr "변화를 위한 변화일 뿐이야. 바룬 가문이 얼마나 더 추락하려는 걸까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE1"
msgid "If it is the Serpent's will, I will abide. But I do not agree with this plan."
msgstr "그것이 뱀의 뜻이라면, 따르겠어. 하지만 난 이 계획에 동의하지 않아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FE0"
msgid "All I will say is, when the Great Serpent tests us, we must continue to serve."
msgstr "내가 말할 수 있는 건, 위대한 뱀께서 우리를 시험하실 때, 우리는 계속해서 섬겨야 한다는 것뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene01_Comment_Defiant
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDF"
msgid "Personally, I do not like these changes. But what choice do we have? All Must Serve."
msgstr "개인적으로, 난 이러한 변화가 마음에 들지 않아. 하지만 우리에게 무슨 선택권이 있겠어? 모두가 섬겨야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDE"
msgid "So, how are you adjusting to all the changes?"
msgstr "그래서, 이 모든 변화에 어떻게 적응하고 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDD"
msgid "I'm curious. What do you think of the new House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "궁금한데. 새로운 바룬 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDC"
msgid "The new Speaker wasted no time, it seems. How do you feel about the changes?"
msgstr "새로운 대변자는 시간을 낭비하지 않는 것 같군. 그 변화에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDB"
msgid "I never asked you, what are your thoughts on the new House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "새로운 바룬 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각하는지 안 물어봤네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FDA"
msgid "How do you feel, now that a new House Va'ruun has been chosen?"
msgstr "새로운 바룬 가문이 선택되었는데, 기분이 어때?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD9"
msgid "I've been meaning to ask you, how do you feel about the new House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "물어보고 싶었던 게 있습니다. 새로운 바룬 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD8"
msgid "By the way, I was wondering what you thought about the new House Va'ruun."
msgstr "그건 그렇고, 새로운 바룬 가문에 대해 어떻게 생각하는지 궁금해서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Scene02_Question
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD7"
msgid "Much has changed of late. A new visitor, a new Speaker, and a new House Va'ruun."
msgstr "최근에 많은 변화가 있었지. 새로운 방문자, 새로운 대변자, 그리고 새로운 바룬 가문."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_WhatAboutYou
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD6"
msgid "Why, what do you think?"
msgstr "왜, 넌 어떻게 생각하는데?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_WhatAboutYou
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD5"
msgid "But now I'm curious what you think."
msgstr "근데 이제 네 생각이 궁금해졌어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_WhatAboutYou
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD4"
msgid "What about you? How do you feel about all this?"
msgstr "너는? 이 모든 일에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Agree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD3"
msgid "That is my feeling as well."
msgstr "나도 그렇게 생각해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Agree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD2"
msgid "I concur. But only the Great Serpent knows how it will turn out."
msgstr "나도 동의해. 하지만 어떻게 될지는 위대한 뱀만이 아시겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Agree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD1"
msgid "True. I had not thought about it that way."
msgstr "맞아. 그런 식으로 생각해 본 적은 없었어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Disagree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FD0"
msgid "I tend to disagree, but let's see how it plays out."
msgstr "동의하지 않는 편이지만, 어떻게 되는지 두고 보자고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Disagree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FCF"
msgid "I used to think the same. But now, seeing it in practice, I'm not so sure."
msgstr "나도 예전엔 그렇게 생각했어. 하지만 지금, 실제로 보니, 잘 모르겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Shared_PostQuest_Disagree
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012FCE"
msgid "I don't think you are wrong, but time will tell."
msgstr "네가 틀렸다고 생각하진 않지만, 시간이 말해줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
