#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FC4"
msgid "I've already been there. Here's your experimental goop."
msgstr "전 이미 다녀왔어요. 여기 화합물 시제품입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, in a good way / Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've already been there. Here's your experimental goop.
