#. TOPIC: 011048E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FC3"
msgid "You have? And you found the compound?"
msgstr "그래요? 그리고 화합물을 찾으셨다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've already been there. Here's your experimental goop.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FC2"
msgid "How remarkable! You really are quite formidable."
msgstr "정말 대단하시군요! 정말 대단한 분이세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've already been there. Here's your experimental goop.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Here you are, payment as promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FC1"
msgid "I'll take that, thank you."
msgstr "그건 제가 처리할게요. 감사해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reading and talking, analyzing data / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: I'll take that slate, thank you.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FC0"
msgid "Now, let's see what tale the data tells."
msgstr "이제, 데이터가 어떤 이야기를 해줄지 봅시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reading and talking, analyzing data / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FBF"
msgid "Mostly as expected so far."
msgstr "여기까지는 대체로 예상대로군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FBE"
msgid "Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean."
msgstr "세상에, 이거 뭔가요. 그렇군요, 무슨 말인지 알 거 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Here's the payment for those plant samples.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FBD"
msgid "I have good news. We've got a strong working theory about what's killing the local wildlife."
msgstr "좋은 소식이 있어요. 지역 야생 동물들이 죽어가는 이유를 설명할 수 있을 강력한 이론을 완성했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Your supposition about the plants becoming toxic might just bear fruit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FBC"
msgid "The tissue samples you collected point to poisoning as the likely cause of death."
msgstr "수집해 오신 조직 샘플을 보면 독극물 중독이 사인일 가능성이 높아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
