msgstr "약속한 보수를 드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Here you are, payment as promised.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
