#. TOPIC: 011048E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FBA"
msgid "Did you hear that, love? Our courageous research assistant has delivered yet again."
msgstr "들었어요? 여보? 용감하신 연구 보조원 분이 또 한 건 해내셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Well, look who's back. And still in one piece, no less!
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
