#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FB6"
msgid "Wait, you actually doubted me?"
msgstr "잠깐만요. 제 실력을 의심했던 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised and impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, you actually doubted me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait, you actually doubted me?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FB5"
msgid "Gathering plants in the wild is one thing, but raiding a pirate base is wholly different."
msgstr "야생에서 식물을 채집하는 것과, 해적 기지를 습격하는 건 완전히 다른 일이잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, you actually doubted me?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I've got your experimental compound.
