#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FB4"
msgid "Rest assured, I will never doubt you again."
msgstr "괜찮아요. 다시는 당신 실력을 의심하지 않을 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As charming as the pair of you are, I have things to do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As charming as the pair of you are, I have things to do.
