msgid "Aw, you're very sweet."
msgstr "에이, 정말 다정하시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Warm, affectionate / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As charming as the pair of you are, I have things to do.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
