#. TOPIC: 011048DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FB2"
msgid "It really has been a pleasure to work with you!"
msgstr "함께 일해서 정말 즐거웠어요!"

