#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FB1"
msgid "As charming as the pair of you are, I have things to do."
msgstr "두 분 다 매력적이시지만, 저는 해야 할 일이 있답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The verbal equivalent of slowly backing away. / Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With all the corpses I left behind, the fleet's not the only thing that's crimson.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: With all the corpses I left behind, the fleet's not the only thing that's crimson.
