msgid "There are times you genuinely frighten me."
msgstr "정말 종종 저를 겁먹게 만드시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With all the corpses I left behind, the fleet's not the only thing that's crimson.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FAF"
msgid "But I suppose those pirates have done the same, if not worse, to others."
msgstr "하지만 그 해적들도 다른 사람들에게 똑같은 짓을, 어쩌면 더 심한 짓을 저질렀겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With all the corpses I left behind, the fleet's not the only thing that's crimson.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Here you are, payment as promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011048DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FAE"
msgid "The important thing is you're back from another successful task."
msgstr "중요한 건 당신이 다시 임무를 성공적으로 마치고 돌아왔다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Well, look who's back. And still in one piece, no less!
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are times you genuinely frighten me.
