msgid "With all the corpses I left behind, the fleet's not the only thing that's crimson."
msgstr "남겨두고 온 시체가 좀 많거든요. 크림슨 함대라는 이름처럼 붉게 물들여주고 왔죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Good! It seems that things have been going smoothly so far.|Perhaps it's a sign that the Great Serpent favors our work.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I have good news. We've got a strong working theory about what's killing the local wildlife.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FAB"
msgid "Here's the payment for those plant samples."
msgstr "여기 식물 샘플에 대한 보수예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Serpent's favor! That's it!|I'll take that off your hands, if you don't mind.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FAA"
msgid "Go with the Serpent's blessing. We'll be waiting for you here."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길. 여기서 기다리고 있을게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've got your experimental compound.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FA9"
msgid "When Azad first suggested taking on an assistant, I'll admit that I had my doubts."
msgstr "처음에 아자드가 조수를 구하자고 제안했을 때, 솔직히 말씀드리면 그게 효과가 있을까 의심스러웠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've got your experimental compound.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Here you are, payment as promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FA8"
msgid "I'm happy to say that you've laid them all to rest."
msgstr "하지만 의심을 모두 말끔히 없애 주셨네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Have you now? Well bravo, then.|When Azad first suggested taking on an assistant, I'll admit that I had my doubts.|I'm happy to say that you've laid them all to rest.
