#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012FA7"
msgid "Here you are, payment as promised."
msgstr "약속한 대로 보수를 드리겠어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHelloPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA6"
msgid "Remember, you're looking for animal corpses with no obvious signs of injury or mutilation."
msgstr "분명한 부상이나 절단의 흔적이 없는 동물 사체를 찾고 있다는 걸 기억하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHelloPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA5"
msgid "It could take time to find the right kind of animal carcass. Be patient and be diligent."
msgstr "적절한 동물종 사체를 찾기까지 시간이 걸릴 수 있습니다. 인내심을 갖고 부지런히 찾아보세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHelloPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA4"
msgid "The corpses you're looking for should be free of blood or wounds, with no obvious cause of death."
msgstr "찾고 있는 사체는 피나 상처가 없고, 뚜렷한 사인이 없어야 합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherinePostStage800
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA3"
msgid "Remember, you're looking for plants that are noticeably different from their normal counterparts."
msgstr "일반적인 식물과 눈에 띄게 다른 식물을 찾고 있다는 걸 기억하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rhetorical, perplexed / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherinePostStage800
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA2"
msgid "First the animals dying, now these strange plants. What does it all add up to?"
msgstr "처음에는 동물들이 죽고, 이제는 이 이상한 식물들이라니. 이게 다 무슨 의미일까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherinePostStage800
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA1"
msgid "Hopefully it'll be obvious which species of plants have been altered."
msgstr "어떤 종의 식물이 변형되었는지 분명히 알 수 있으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit sheepish / Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHellosPostStage1300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012FA0"
msgid "If the sensors look like they were built by clumsy amateurs, well, they were."
msgstr "서투른 아마추어가 센서를 만든 것처럼 보인다면, 예, 그게 맞아요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHellosPostStage1300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9F"
msgid "Frankly, it's a miracle of the Serpent that they work at all."
msgstr "솔직히, 센서가 작동하는 것 자체가 위대한 뱀 님의 기적입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHellosPostStage1300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9E"
msgid "It should be a simple enough matter to transfer the sensor data."
msgstr "센서 데이터를 전송하는 것은 간단한 문제여야 합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHellosPostStage1300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9D"
msgid "I don't expect you'll have any trouble with it."
msgstr "별다른 어려움은 없을 것으로 예상합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rhetorical, thinking / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHellosPostStage1300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9C"
msgid "Something in the environment has clearly changed. Hopefully the sensors can tell us what."
msgstr "환경에 무언가 분명히 변화가 생겼습니다. 센서가 뭐라도 알려줄 수 있으면 좋겠군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPostStage2000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9B"
msgid "Remember, you're looking for the cold storage area."
msgstr "냉장 보관 구역을 찾아야 한다는 걸 기억하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPostStage2000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F9A"
msgid "Do be careful around those pirates. I doubt very much they take prisoners."
msgstr "해적들 주변에서는 조심하세요. 그들이 포로를 잡을 것 같지는 않군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPostStage2000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F99"
msgid "I'll be praying to the Serpent for your safe return."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 무사히 돌아오게 해달라고 기도할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident, determined / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F98"
msgid "We'll get to the bottom of this mystery, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "이 수수께끼의 진실을 밝혀낼 수 있을 겁니다. 저는 확신해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident, determined / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F97"
msgid "Science can solve any problem!"
msgstr "과학은 어떤 문제든 해결할 수 있습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Encouraging / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F96"
msgid "Keep your eyes and ears open, and you'll find what you're looking for."
msgstr "눈과 귀를 잘 열고 다니다 보면, 찾고 있는 걸 발견하실 수 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Encouraging / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F95"
msgid "Be vigilant! There are dangers in the lands outside the city that are best avoided."
msgstr "경계를 늦추지 마세요! 도시 밖에는 피하는 것이 좋은 위험이 도사리고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: With zeal, encouraging / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F94"
msgid "There's no greater endeavor than the pursuit of knowledge. Now go forth and pursue!"
msgstr "지식 추구보다 더 위대한 노력은 없습니다. 자, 이제 가서 추구하세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: With care / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F93"
msgid "Do be careful out there."
msgstr "조심해서 다녀오세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: With care / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F92"
msgid "I'm glad you found your way to us. Truly, it is the Great Serpent's blessing."
msgstr "저희를 찾아와 주셔서 기쁩니다. 정말로, 위대한 뱀 님의 축복이로군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic, a joke / Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F91"
msgid "Our food supply is under threat and the people are counting on us. No pressure, right?"
msgstr "식량 공급이 위협받고 있고, 신민들은 우리를 믿고 있습니다. 부담감 느끼시는 건 아니죠? 그렇죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wistful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F90"
msgid "I miss the days when I was young enough to travel all over the land, admiring nature's beauty."
msgstr "온 세상을 돌아다니며 자연의 아름다움을 감상할 만큼 젊었던 시절이 그립군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wistful / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F8F"
msgid "Were I but a few years younger, I'd join you in your search."
msgstr "제가 몇 년만 젊었어도, 당신의 수색에 동참했을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Certain, confident / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineGeneralPostStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F8E"
msgid "It's the will of the Serpent that we solve this mystery, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "이 수수께끼를 해결하는 것이 위대한 뱀 님의 뜻이라고, 저는 확신합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01:  &&& Citizen02: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens01
#. TOPIC: 0110470B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F8C"
msgid "They say House Veth'aal will be instituting a curfew. There will be bells at twilight, and patrols to enforce it."
msgstr "베타알 가문이 통행금지령을 시행할 거라고 하더군. 해 질 녘에 종이 울리고, 순찰대가 단속을 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01:  &&& Citizen02: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens01
#. TOPIC: 0110470B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F8B"
msgid "They say House Ka'dic intends to open our walls. Perhaps more outsiders will be entering the city."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 성문을 열려고 한대. 아마 더 많은 이방인이 도시에 들어올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01:  &&& Citizen02: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens01
#. TOPIC: 0110470B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F8A"
msgid "There is talk of House Dul'kehf extending the work week even further. This, on top of the extended hours."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 연장 근무에 더해 근무 시간을 더 늘린다는 소문이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 011047FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F88"
msgid "What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?"
msgstr "새 대변자에 대해 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F87"
msgid "Razma will be a fine Speaker. She has a strong voice, one unafraid to take risks."
msgstr "라즈마는 훌륭한 대변자가 될 거야. 강한 목소리를 가졌고, 위험을 두려워하지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F86"
msgid "Razma is a strong leader, but I had hoped for a more conflict forward voice for our Speaker."
msgstr "라즈마는 강력한 지도자이지만, 나는 우리 대변자가 좀 더 갈등에 정면으로 맞서는 목소리를 내기를 바랐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F85"
msgid "I am not too familiar with Razma or her leadership style."
msgstr "저는 라즈마 님이나 라즈마 님의 통치 방식에 대해 잘 알지 못합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F84"
msgid "Hasmak is detailed and meticulous. It is precisely what Dazra needs at a time like this."
msgstr "해즈막은 꼼꼼하고 세심하지. 지금과 같은 시기에 다즈라에 꼭 필요한 사람이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F83"
msgid "I am concerned Hasmak will bring too much bureaucracy at a time where action is needed."
msgstr "해즈막이 행동이 필요한 시기에 너무 관료주의적으로 나올까 봐 걱정이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F82"
msgid "I've heard Hasmak is a taskmaster, but I give no credence to idle rumor."
msgstr "해즈막이 엄격한 감독관이라는 말을 들었지만, 나는 근거 없는 소문은 믿지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F81"
msgid "Viktor's a hardliner. He is precisely what we need to return House Va'ruun to its former glory."
msgstr "빅토르는 강경파지. 바룬 가문을 예전의 영광으로 되돌리기 위해 꼭 필요한 사람이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F80"
msgid "Viktor is an extremist. Are we sure this is the Serpent's will? I am skeptical that he is the right person to be Speaker."
msgstr "빅토르는 극단주의자야. 이것이 정말 뱀의 뜻일까? 나는 빅토르가 대변자가 되기에 적합한 사람인지 의문이 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What are your thoughts on the new Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens03
#. TOPIC: 01106942
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene03
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene03_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F7F"
msgid "There is much debate about Viktor's policies, but I prefer a wait and see approach."
msgstr "빅토르의 정책에 대해서는 논란이 많지만, 나는 두고 보는 쪽을 선호해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F7D"
msgid "We are walking on shifting sands. I am hearing everything from ending the isolation policy to befriending the heretics."
msgstr "우리는 지금 불안한 상황을 걷고 있어. 고립 정책을 끝내는 것부터 이단자들과 친구가 되는 것까지, 별의별 소문이 다 들려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F7C"
msgid "Well, the former House Ka'dic was always my choice to lead. They are forward thinking."
msgstr "음, 이전의 카딕 가문은 항상 내가 원하는 지도자였어. 그들은 진보적이거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Kadic
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F7B"
msgid "Well, if you want my opinion, Anasko was a fine ruler, but too obsessed with the past. The changes being proposed will help us transition to a new era."
msgstr "음, 내 의견을 묻는다면, 아나스코는 훌륭한 통치자였지만 과거에 너무 집착했어. 제안된 변화는 우리가 새로운 시대로 나아가는 데 도움이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F7A"
msgid "Well, the long hours may be tough, but Dazra will be brought to its former glory."
msgstr "음, 긴 근무 시간이 힘들긴 하겠지만, 다즈라는 예전의 영광을 되찾을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F79"
msgid "I know there have been complaints, but I'm an early riser. I have no problem with their policies."
msgstr "불만이 있다는 건 알지만, 나는 일찍 일어나는 편이라서 그들의 정책에 불만은 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Dulkehf
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F78"
msgid "Don't even ask. These early mornings are killing me. The new House goes too far."
msgstr "묻지도 마. 이른 아침 시간은 정말 힘들어. 새 가문은 너무 지나쳐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F77"
msgid "I know it is a source of debate, but I am no fan of heretics. If we must sacrifice some freedom to rid us of their plague, so be it."
msgstr "논란의 여지가 있다는 건 알지만, 나는 이단자를 좋아하지 않아. 그들의 역병을 없애기 위해 약간의 자유를 희생해야 한다면, 그렇게 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F76"
msgid "Personally, I am conflicted. I loathe heretics as much as anyone, but the treatment from the guards, the bevy of accusations, it is not ideal."
msgstr "개인적으로는 갈등이 돼. 나도 누구 못지 않게 이단자를 혐오하지만, 경비병들의 대우, 수많은 고발, 이건 이상적이지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Citizens02
#. TOPIC: 011047FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_PostQuest_Scene02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HouseCommentary_Scene02_Vethaal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F75"
msgid "If I'm being honest, I feel restricted. I understand the need to dispel any heretics from our city, but these random searches are too much."
msgstr "솔직히 말하면, 나는 제한을 느끼고 있어. 우리 도시에서 이단자를 몰아내야 할 필요성은 이해하지만, 이런 무작위 수색은 너무 지나쳐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F95
#. INFO GROUP: DuringAttack
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Assault
msgctxt "012F74"
msgid "Look out, predators!"
msgstr "조심해요, 포식자들입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F95
#. INFO GROUP: DuringAttack
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Assault
msgctxt "012F73"
msgid "Why are they attacking?"
msgstr "왜 공격하는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F95
#. INFO GROUP: DuringAttack
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Assault
msgctxt "012F72"
msgid "The animals have gone crazy!"
msgstr "동물들이 미쳐 날뛰고 있어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_Attackover
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F71"
msgid "Thank you. They came out of nowhere!"
msgstr "감사합니다. 느닷없이 튀어나왔었거든요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_Attackover
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F70"
msgid "They usually avoid humans. It's very strange."
msgstr "보통은 인간을 피하는데. 정말 이상하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_Attackover
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F6F"
msgid "They've never attacked us before. I don't understand."
msgstr "전에는 한 번도 공격한 적이 없어요. 이해할 수가 없네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_DefenselessVaruunScientists
#. TOPIC: 01105F96
#. INFO GROUP: DVS_Attackover
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012F6E"
msgid "It's not safe here anymore."
msgstr "여긴 이제 안전하지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Irina
#. PROMPT: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104213
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F6D"
msgid "Thanks for the help."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Good.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: All anyone needs to know is that you are looking for Vaeric for personal reasons.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F5E"
msgid "And remember. Absolute discretion."
msgstr "그리고 명심하도록. 절대 신중해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I do not wish Vaeric dead, but as head of the Ministry of State, he left me no choice. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F5D"
msgid "This is not grief. This is betrayal. Not only to me, but to our society and the Great Serpent Himself."
msgstr "이건 슬픔이 아니다. 배신이야. 나뿐만 아니라 우리 사회와 위대한 뱀에 대한 배신이란 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk more about the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would you even consider negotiation with Zealots? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F5C"
msgid "If you feel it will help."
msgstr "도움이 될 것 같다면야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F5B"
msgid "Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric?"
msgstr "배릭에 대해 몇 가지 질문해도 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Herald's Rest? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is the Herald's Rest? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F5A"
msgid "The Herald's Rest is our local bar, and unfortunately, my son's favorite establishment to frequent."
msgstr "전령의 안식처는 이 동네 술집이다. 안타깝게도 내 아들이 자주 가는 곳이기도 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Herald's Rest? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F59"
msgid "And while I know a bar isn't the ideal place for discretion, I still expect you to keep these matters private."
msgstr "술집이 신중함을 유지하기에 이상적인 장소가 아니라는 건 알지만, 그래도 이 문제는 비밀로 해줬으면 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Grief can often cloud our judgement.  &&& Viktor: This is not grief. This is betrayal. Not only to me, but to our society and the Great Serpent Himself. &&& Viktor: I do not wish Vaeric dead, but as head of the Ministry of State, he left me no choice. |All Must Serve. Those who refuse will be met with death.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will not have it known that I declared my own son a heretic and allowed him to escape our grasp.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F58"
msgid "Why haven't you dealt with this yourself?"
msgstr "왜 직접 처리하지 않은 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why haven't you dealt with this yourself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why haven't you dealt with this yourself?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F57"
msgid "I will not have it known that I declared my own son a heretic and allowed him to escape our grasp."
msgstr "내가 아들을 이단자로 규정했는데도 녀석이 우리 손에서 빠져나갔다는 사실이 알려지면 안 되니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness will help you move past your feelings of betrayal. &&& Viktor: Perhaps you are right. &&& Viktor: So I stand corrected. &&& Viktor: Vaeric, I have always seen myself in you, son, even the weaker, emotional side. |Much like your aunt does for me, I know Vashti did for you. |She was your anchor. It should be no surprise how her death drove you away.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: And you shall have it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110418E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F56"
msgid "Thank you, father. All I ask is for your understanding and forgiveness."
msgstr "감사해요. 아버지. 아버지의 이해와 용서를 구하고 싶어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110411C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericLocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F54"
msgid "If I had to guess, we aren't just going to find him just wandering around."
msgstr "추측하자면, 배릭이 그저 돌아다니는 걸 발견할 수는 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I could not say for certain. When this is all behind us, we will need time to review the data and prevent it from happening again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_WhatWentWrong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F4D"
msgid "What went wrong with your experiment?"
msgstr "실험이 어떻게 잘못된 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What went wrong with your experiment?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: There is no question that the failure of our Vortex Interlock caused much of the instability.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_WhatWentWrong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F4C"
msgid "I could not say for certain. When this is all behind us, we will need time to review the data and prevent it from happening again."
msgstr "나도 확실하게 말할 순 없느니라. 모든 일이 정리되고 나면 데이터를 검토해서 다시는 이런 일이 일어나지 않도록 해야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I could not say for certain. When this is all behind us, we will need time to review the data and prevent it from happening again.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Beyond that, I would need to consult with our scientists. And I am afraid that many of them have been lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_WhatWentWrong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F4B"
msgid "There is no question that the failure of our Vortex Interlock caused much of the instability."
msgstr "우리가 썼던 볼텍스 제어장치의 결함이 상당한 불안정성을 유발했다는 건 확실하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: There is no question that the failure of our Vortex Interlock caused much of the instability.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_WhatWentWrong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F4A"
msgid "Beyond that, I would need to consult with our scientists. And I am afraid that many of them have been lost."
msgstr "그 외에는 우리 과학자들과 상의해야 할 것이야. 많은 과학자들이 사라져 버린 것 같아 걱정이구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Not by itself. But the experiment at the Pinnacle cannot be completed until the power is stabilized.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_BackToNormalCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F49"
msgid "Replacing the interlock will get things back to normal?"
msgstr "제어장치를 교체하면 상황이 정상으로 돌아갈까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Replacing the interlock will get things back to normal?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Once it is done, then we can finish what we began, and set everything as it should be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_BackToNormalCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F48"
msgid "Not by itself. But the experiment at the Pinnacle cannot be completed until the power is stabilized."
msgstr "그것만으로는 부족하지. 허나 첨탑에서 진행 중인 실험은 전력이 안정화될 때까지는 끝낼 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: little bit of extra emphasis on "everything" / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Not by itself. But the experiment at the Pinnacle cannot be completed until the power is stabilized.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_Reactor_BackToNormalCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F47"
msgid "Once it is done, then we can finish what we began, and set everything as it should be."
msgstr "실험이 끝나고 나면 우리가 시작한 일을 마무리할 수 있고, 모든 것이 정상화될 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You yourself must have encountered the Phantoms in Ma'leen Dam. You know how formidable, yet limited, their abilities were.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_Button
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F46"
msgid "What exactly happens if I activate these pods?"
msgstr "포드를 활성화하면 정확히 어떻게 되는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You yourself must have encountered the Phantoms in Ma'leen Dam. You know how formidable, yet limited, their abilities were.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Activate the system, and they will be suffused with Vortex Energy, making them nearly invulnerable. Giving them nearly unlimited engagement range.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_Button
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F45"
msgid "The Va'ruun soldiers suspended within these pods are an improvement on all of that prior work."
msgstr "이 포드에 들어가 있는 바룬 병사들은 이전 작업에서 모든 면을 개선한 결과물이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What exactly happens if I activate these pods?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The Va'ruun soldiers suspended within these pods are an improvement on all of that prior work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_Button
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F44"
msgid "You yourself must have encountered the Phantoms in Ma'leen Dam. You know how formidable, yet limited, their abilities were."
msgstr "너도 분명 마린 댐에서 유령을 마주친 적이 있을 것이다. 유령들의 능력이 제한적이기는 하지만, 얼마나 대단한지도 알겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The Va'ruun soldiers suspended within these pods are an improvement on all of that prior work.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: They will be proof that House Va'ruun's ascent to glory has begun. None will be able to deny it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_Button
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F43"
msgid "Activate the system, and they will be suffused with Vortex Energy, making them nearly invulnerable. Giving them nearly unlimited engagement range."
msgstr "시스템을 작동시키면 병사들은 볼텍스 에너지를 머금고 거의 무적인 상태가 될 게다. 교전 범위는 거의 무한에 가까워지지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Activate the system, and they will be suffused with Vortex Energy, making them nearly invulnerable. Giving them nearly unlimited engagement range.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011040A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_Button
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F42"
msgid "They will be proof that House Va'ruun's ascent to glory has begun. None will be able to deny it."
msgstr "바룬 가문이 영광스럽게 재기하기 시작했다는 증거가 될 것이야. 누구도 부정 못 할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraOrahim
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: It is... well, not as glamorous as I had convinced myself it would be, honestly. Really, I was not at all prepared for the scale of turmoil that would reveal itself when I stepped through the city gates. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104080
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F3A"
msgid "How is it, living in Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에서의 삶은 어떤가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraOrahim
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOrahim: People ignore me for the most part, and that is all right. I did not expect to be welcomed with open arms, as it was not long ago that they feared me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_People
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F39"
msgid "How has everyone been treating you?"
msgstr "다들 당신을 어떻게 대해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How has everyone been treating you?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_People
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F38"
msgid "People ignore me for the most part, and that is all right. I did not expect to be welcomed with open arms, as it was not long ago that they feared me."
msgstr "대부분의 사람들이 나를 무시하는데, 괜찮아. 얼마 전까지만 해도 그들은 나를 두려워했으니, 따뜻한 환영을 기대한 건 아니었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_People
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F37"
msgid "I hope that, with time, people will begin to warm up to me. But, even if they do not, I will be content."
msgstr "시간이 지나면 사람들이 나에게 마음을 열기를 바라. 하지만, 그렇지 않더라도, 난 만족할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_People
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F36"
msgid "I have done so many terrible things in my past, and just having the opportunity to live in Dazra is more than I deserve. The people allow me to live among them, and that is an honor in itself."
msgstr "난 과거에 끔찍한 짓을 많이 저질렀고, 다즈라에서 살 기회를 얻은 것만으로도 내겐 과분해. 사람들이 그들 사이에서 살게 해주는 것만으로도 영광이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to HVDazraOrahim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is it, living in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F35"
msgid "It is... well, not as glamorous as I had convinced myself it would be, honestly. Really, I was not at all prepared for the scale of turmoil that would reveal itself when I stepped through the city gates."
msgstr ""
"여기는... 음, 솔직히 내가 상상했던 것만큼 매력적이진 않아. 사실, 내가 도시 문을 통과했을 때 드러난 이 혼란의 규모에 전혀 준비가 "
"되어 있지 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to HVDazraOrahim
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F34"
msgid "Dazra is like my old shack -- falling to pieces. Everyone is just trying to survive in a space that is not fit for life."
msgstr "다즈라는 내 낡은 오두막 같아. 산산이 부서지고 있지. 모두가 생존에 적합하지 않은 공간에서 그저 살아남으려고 애쓰고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to HVDazraOrahim
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOrahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Orahim_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F33"
msgid "But, do not think that I will take it for granted; you and I fought too hard for me to get here. I will do whatever I can to help my new neighbors rebuild."
msgstr "하지만, 내가 이걸 당연하게 여길 거라고 생각하지 마. 당신과 내가 여기에 오기 위해 너무나 열심히 싸웠으니까. 나는 새 이웃들이 재건하는 걸 돕기 위해 무엇이든 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F32"
msgid "Humph, the walking security breach."
msgstr "흠, 걸어 다니는 보안 위반자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F31"
msgid "If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you."
msgstr "내게 결정권이 있었다면, 넌 절대 도시 문을 통과하지 못했을 거다. 내가 항상 널 지켜보고 있다는 걸 명심해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F30"
msgid "If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down."
msgstr "네가 단 한 번의 실수라도 저지른다면, 네가 다즈라 사람들을 위태롭게 한다면, 내가 널 끌어내릴 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Humph, the walking security breach.|If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you.|If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do not dare question my loyalty. Using his name as manipulation tells me all I need to know about you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2F"
msgid "It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement."
msgstr "말리보어의 판단에 의문을 제기하는 것처럼 들리는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Do not dare question my loyalty. Using his name as manipulation tells me all I need to know about you.|You may now be Promised, but that does not mean you are one of us. Not to me.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110407A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2E"
msgid "Now, move along. I have work to do, and, apparently, so do you."
msgstr "자, 어서 가. 난 할 일이 있고, 너도 있는 것 같으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104079
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2D"
msgid "Do not dare question my loyalty. Using his name as manipulation tells me all I need to know about you."
msgstr "감히 내 충성심에 의문을 제기하지 마. 말리보어 님의 이름 이용해 날 조종하려 들다니, 네놈에 대해 알아야 할 건 다 알겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraVorisNerun: Now, move along. I have work to do, and, apparently, so do you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104079
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2C"
msgid "You may now be Promised, but that does not mean you are one of us. Not to me."
msgstr "넌 이제 약속받은 자일지 모르지만, 우리 중 하나라는 뜻은 아니야. 적어도 나에겐 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Humph, the walking security breach.|If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you.|If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is it not obvious? I do not trust you, and I believe that it is a mistake for others to be so trustful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104078
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2B"
msgid "What's your problem with me?"
msgstr "나한테 뭐가 불만이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your problem with me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your problem with me?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104077
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F2A"
msgid "Is it not obvious? I do not trust you, and I believe that it is a mistake for others to be so trustful."
msgstr "뻔하지 않나? 난 널 믿지 않고, 다른 사람들이 그렇게 신뢰하는 건 실수라고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your problem with me?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104077
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F29"
msgid "Our enemies would want to strike us while we are at our weakest, and you could very well be a spy, or the first attempt at an infiltration."
msgstr "적들은 우리가 가장 약할 때 공격하고 싶어 할 테고, 넌 간첩이거나 침투를 위한 첫 번째 시도일 가능성이 아주 높아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your problem with me?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraVorisNerun: It sounds to me like you're questioning Malibor's judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104077
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F28"
msgid "So, are you friend, or foe? I am not sure we will ever truly know the answer."
msgstr "그래서, 넌 아군이야, 적이야? 그 답을 우리가 과연 알 수 있을지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Humph, the walking security breach.|If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you.|If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Neither do I, so behave yourself. It would be most unwise to disappoint the council. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104076
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F27"
msgid "I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "난 문제를 일으키고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't want any trouble.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't want any trouble.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraVorisNerun: Now, move along. I have work to do, and, apparently, so do you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104075
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F26"
msgid "Neither do I, so behave yourself. It would be most unwise to disappoint the council."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지야, 그러니 처신 잘해. 대의회를 실망시키는 건 현명하지 못한 짓이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Humph, the walking security breach.|If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you.|If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmph, that is not quite how this works. You cannot get rid of me that easily. You are in our city, so you will behave according to our customs. Leave the people alone, and we will not have a problem. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104074
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F25"
msgid "Hey, I don't like you either. Let's just leave each other alone."
msgstr "이봐, 나도 네가 싫어. 그냥 서로 내버려 두자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hey, I don't like you either. Let's just leave each other alone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hey, I don't like you either. Let's just leave each other alone.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraVorisNerun: Now, move along. I have work to do, and, apparently, so do you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104073
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_NegativeGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F24"
msgid "Hmmph, that is not quite how this works. You cannot get rid of me that easily. You are in our city, so you will behave according to our customs. Leave the people alone, and we will not have a problem."
msgstr "흠, 그렇게는 안 돼. 넌 그렇게 쉽게 날 떼어낼 수 없어. 넌 우리 도시에 있으니, 우리 관습에 따라 행동해야 해. 사람들을 내버려 두면, 우린 문제가 없을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraVorisNerun: I was stubborn before, you know that. Everything I thought about you was wrong. You have done so much for this city, for these people. For that, I give you my sincere thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104072
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F23"
msgid "You. I owe you an apology for how I spoke to you before."
msgstr "너. 전에 네게 했던 말에 대해 사과할 게 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: You. I owe you an apology for how I spoke to you before.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104071
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F22"
msgid "I was stubborn before, you know that. Everything I thought about you was wrong. You have done so much for this city, for these people. For that, I give you my sincere thanks."
msgstr "전에는 내가 고집불통이었지, 너도 알다시피. 널 잘못 생각했어. 넌 이 도시를 위해, 이 사람들을 위해 많은 일을 했어. 그 점에 대해 진심으로 감사해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Apology accepted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01104071
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F21"
msgid "And I am sorry for being such a distrusting fool."
msgstr "그리고 너무 불신이 많은 바보 같았던 점 미안해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That suits me fine.  &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Good. &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment.|The stress of everything is becoming overwhelming, but that is no excuse to act like I just did. I apologize. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate that. Now, may I help you with something? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F20"
msgid "Apology accepted."
msgstr "사과를 받아들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B28
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1F"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고맙습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Apology accepted.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110406F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1E"
msgid "You have given more for Dazra than most. To put yourself in danger time and again, for a city that is not your home, for people you did not know... for that you have my gratitude, and my respect."
msgstr ""
"넌 대부분의 사람보다 다즈라를 위해 더 많은 일을 했어. 네 고향도 아닌 도시를 위해, 알지도 못하는 사람들을 위해, 계속해서 자신을 "
"위험에 빠뜨렸지... 그 점에 대해 감사하고, 존경해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: You. I owe you an apology for how I spoke to you before. &&& HVDazraVorisNerun: I was stubborn before, you know that. Everything I thought about you was wrong. You have done so much for this city, for these people. For that, I give you my sincere thanks.|And I am sorry for being such a distrusting fool.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I accept that, and I do not expect your forgiveness. I just wanted to bury the axe. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110406E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1D"
msgid "Too little, too late. You should have apologized earlier."
msgstr "너무 늦었어. 더 일찍 사과했어야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Too little, too late. You should have apologized earlier.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Too little, too late. You should have apologized earlier.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110406D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1C"
msgid "I accept that, and I do not expect your forgiveness. I just wanted to bury the axe."
msgstr "그걸 받아들이고, 네 용서를 기대하지 않아. 그저 불화를 끝내고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Too little, too late. You should have apologized earlier.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraVorisNerun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110406D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_VorisNerun_PositiveGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1B"
msgid "Regardless of how you feel about me, you will always have my respect."
msgstr "네가 나에 대해 어떻게 생각하든, 넌 항상 내 존경을 받을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you thoughts on the emergency in Dazra?  &&& HVDazraZamiraValik: How can anyone even begin to make sense of it all? Hundreds of people gone in an instant, along with most of the city. It is like something out of a nightmare.|I feel guilty, to tell the truth. I was supposed to work on the day the cultural center disappeared. I was sick and my coworker covered for me -- and now they are gone forever.|I just cannot stop thinking: why? Why did this have to happen to us?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am halfway there already. I am not sure how much more of this I can take.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F1A"
msgid "Asking yourself questions like that will just drive you crazy."
msgstr "그런 질문을 계속하면 정신이 나갈 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Asking yourself questions like that will just drive you crazy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Asking yourself questions like that will just drive you crazy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F19"
msgid "I am halfway there already. I am not sure how much more of this I can take."
msgstr "난 이미 반쯤 미쳐 있어. 이걸 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you thoughts on the emergency in Dazra?  &&& HVDazraZamiraValik: How can anyone even begin to make sense of it all? Hundreds of people gone in an instant, along with most of the city. It is like something out of a nightmare.|I feel guilty, to tell the truth. I was supposed to work on the day the cultural center disappeared. I was sick and my coworker covered for me -- and now they are gone forever.|I just cannot stop thinking: why? Why did this have to happen to us?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know that, as nothing else could possibly do this. I just want to know why.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F18"
msgid "This was the Great Serpent's doing."
msgstr "이건 위대한 뱀께서 하신 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was the Great Serpent's doing. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was the Great Serpent's doing. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F17"
msgid "I know that, as nothing else could possibly do this. I just want to know why."
msgstr "다른 어떤 것도 이렇게 할 수 없다는 걸 알기에, 그분이 하신 일이라는 걸 알아. 난 그저 그 이유가 알고 싶을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was the Great Serpent's doing. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F16"
msgid "I suppose I should not question him, and accept that he spared me. I do not want to bring down more misfortune upon me or anyone else."
msgstr "아마도 그분을 의심하지 말고, 날 살려주셨다는 걸 받아들여야겠지. 나나 다른 사람에게 더 큰 불행을 초래하고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you thoughts on the emergency in Dazra?  &&& HVDazraZamiraValik: How can anyone even begin to make sense of it all? Hundreds of people gone in an instant, along with most of the city. It is like something out of a nightmare.|I feel guilty, to tell the truth. I was supposed to work on the day the cultural center disappeared. I was sick and my coworker covered for me -- and now they are gone forever.|I just cannot stop thinking: why? Why did this have to happen to us?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sometimes I wish I became a Herald. Their faith can see them through anything, comfortably. Inaza, for instance, seems to be unbreakable. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110360A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F15"
msgid "That's a question with no answer. You just have to try and move on."
msgstr "그건 답이 없는 질문이야. 그저 잊으려고 노력해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a question with no answer. You just have to try and move on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a question with no answer. You just have to try and move on.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103609
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F14"
msgid "Sometimes I wish I became a Herald. Their faith can see them through anything, comfortably. Inaza, for instance, seems to be unbreakable."
msgstr ""
"가끔은 전령이 되었으면 좋겠다고 생각해. 전령의 신앙은 어떤 것도 편안하게 이겨낼 수 있게 해주니까. 예를 들어, 이나자 님은 꺾이지 "
"않는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a question with no answer. You just have to try and move on.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103609
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F13"
msgid "Perhaps I must meditate and trust the Great Serpent's designs more."
msgstr "아마도 난 명상하고 위대한 뱀의 설계를 더 신뢰해야 할 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: It would be a true shame if, in the face of adversity and tragedy, the people turn away from the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103608
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F12"
msgid "How do you think this calamity will impact the faith of the citizens?"
msgstr "이 재난이 시민들의 믿음에 어떤 영향을 줄까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you think this calamity will impact the faith of the citizens?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F11"
msgid "It would be a true shame if, in the face of adversity and tragedy, the people turn away from the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이런 고난과 비극 앞에서 신민들이 위대한 뱀께 등을 돌린다면, 진정 부끄러운 일이 될 게다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F10"
msgid "In times of crisis, that is where the Great Serpent shows Himself most. He guides us to seek community; empowers us to rebuild, better and stronger; encourages us to find a newfound faith in Him."
msgstr ""
"위기의 순간이야말로 위대한 뱀께서 스스로를 가장 잘 드러내시는 때이다. 그분께선 우리가 공동체를 찾도록 인도하시고, 더 낫고 강하게 "
"재건할 힘을 주시고, 그분에 대한 새로운 믿음을 찾도록 격려하시지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0F"
msgid "I pray the people of Dazra see that this is not a time for fear or doubt. It is acceptable to grieve what we have lost, but we must not let that grief poison our minds."
msgstr ""
"다즈라 신민들이 두려움이나 의심을 가질 때가 아니라는 점을 알아주면 좋겠구나. 잃은 것을 슬퍼할 수는 있지만, 그 슬픔이 우리 마음을 "
"중독시키게 하면 안 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0E"
msgid "It is my hope that people will turn towards, and not away from, the Great Serpent. Through Him we can rebuild a better Dazra, forged in a blazing fire of faith and community."
msgstr ""
"신민들이 위대한 뱀께 멀어지는 게 아니라 가까워져야 할 텐데. 우리는 그분을 통해 타오르는 믿음과 공동체의 불길 속에서 더 나은 다즈라를 "
"재건할 수 있단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0D"
msgid "Can you pray with me?"
msgstr "저랑 같이 기도해주실 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen... &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad. &&& Tevina: What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years. &&& Qisrani: For now, let me see what I can find out regarding the missing supplies.|It's possible they were lost in the tragedy along with everything else. But I don't know for sure.|Once that is sorted, we can revisit this debate.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C42
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0C"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Of course.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103604
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110361C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0B"
msgid "Great Serpent, with eyes of galaxies, scales as brilliant as shimmering stars..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 은하계의 눈과 반짝이는 별의 비늘을 지닌 분이시여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Of course.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103604
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110361C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F0A"
msgid "Holiest one, Great Serpent, hear our prayer..."
msgstr "거룩하신 위대한 뱀이시여, 저희 기도를 들어 주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Of course.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103604
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110361C
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F09"
msgid "Great Serpent, oh, Great Serpent! Please, hear our prayer!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 오, 위대한 뱀이시여! 부디 저희 기도를 들어 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Great Serpent, with eyes of galaxies, scales as brilliant as shimmering stars...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Kill all of our fears and doubts. Show us that only through You can true peace and contentedness be achieved. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103603
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103622
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F08"
msgid "Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You."
msgstr "저희에게 주의 독을 주입하시어, 주를 섬길 용기를 갖게 하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Great Serpent, with eyes of galaxies, scales as brilliant as shimmering stars...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Kill all of our fears and doubts. Show us that only through You can true peace and contentedness be achieved. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103603
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103622
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F07"
msgid "Fill us with holy purpose, so that we may stand beside You in the void of eternity."
msgstr "저희를 거룩한 목적으로 채우시어, 영원의 공허 속 주의 옆자리에 서게 하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103602
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103613
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F06"
msgid "Kill all of our fears and doubts. Show us that only through You can true peace and contentedness be achieved."
msgstr "저희의 모든 공포와 의심을 없애 주소서. 오직 주를 통해서만 참된 평화와 만족을 얻을 수 있음을 보여 주소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraInazaKaisir: Inject us with Your venom, so that we may be emboldened to serve You.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraInazaKaisir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraInazaKaisir: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103602
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_InazaKaisir_TL_Prayer
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103613
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F05"
msgid "Bless us with the necessary strength to persevere through these darkest of days."
msgstr "이 어두운 시기를 견뎌낼 수 있는 힘을 내려 주시어 저희를 축복하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F04"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D915
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_SaleResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F03"
msgid "Buy what you need, then leave."
msgstr "필요한 걸 샀으면, 이만 가 보시지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D915
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_SaleResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012F02"
msgid "Your credits are worth the same as everyone's, I suppose."
msgstr "네 크레딧도 다른 사람들과 같은 가치가 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this. &&& Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council. &&& Viktor: These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And who are you to tell me what is vital and what is not?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EFC"
msgid "These are vital matters that could save Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라를 구할 수 있을지도 모를 중요한 문제입니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric? &&& Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric has nothing to do with the power grid, but everything to do with the integrity of House Veth'aal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EFB"
msgid "What does Vaeric have to do with the power grid?"
msgstr "배릭과 전력망이 무슨 상관이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does Vaeric have to do with the power grid?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What does Vaeric have to do with the power grid?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EFA"
msgid "Vaeric has nothing to do with the power grid, but everything to do with the integrity of House Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭은 전력망과 아무 관련이 없지만, 베타알 가문의 온전함과는 모두 관련이 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does Vaeric have to do with the power grid?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF9"
msgid "I will not act until I have purged my House of this stain."
msgstr "내 가문의 오점을 씻어내기 전까지는 행동하지 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why did Vaeric leave in the first place? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why did Vaeric leave in the first place? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF8"
msgid "Vaeric would believe he is above his duties as House Veth'aal's heir."
msgstr "배릭은 자신이 베타알 가문의 후계자로서 의무를 다했다고 생각하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why did Vaeric leave in the first place? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF7"
msgid "He speaks of his own freedom when he was born to guide the people of Dazra."
msgstr "배릭은 자신의 자유 이야기만 하더군. 다즈라의 사람들을 인도하기 위해 태어났건만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why did Vaeric leave in the first place? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF6"
msgid "He runs from his duty, which means he runs from the Great Serpent Himself."
msgstr "배릭은 자신의 의무를 저버렸다. 이는 곧 위대한 뱀을 저버리는 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric? &&& Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric would believe he is above his duties as House Veth'aal's heir. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF5"
msgid "Why did Vaeric leave in the first place?"
msgstr "애초에 배릭이 왜 떠난 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric? &&& Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good, you have work to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF4"
msgid "Actually, I think I'm done here."
msgstr "지금은 더 물어볼 게 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF3"
msgid "Good, you have work to do."
msgstr "좋다. 할 일을 하도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could I ask you a few questions about Vaeric? &&& Viktor: If you feel it will help.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is only one fate for those who would denounce the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF2"
msgid "Why is forgiving Vaeric not an option?"
msgstr "배릭을 용서할 수는 없는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why is forgiving Vaeric not an option? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is forgiving Vaeric not an option? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF1"
msgid "There is only one fate for those who would denounce the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 비난하는 자에게 주어지는 운명은 단 하나뿐이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why is forgiving Vaeric not an option? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Actually, I think I'm done here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Viktor_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EF0"
msgid "When a Promised is lost, they must be made penitent, and it is the Ministry of State's duty to see their sentence through."
msgstr "약속받은 자의 의무를 저버리면, 반드시 참회해야 하며, 그 죄인들의 처벌을 끝까지 지켜보는 것이 국무성의 의무다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vitoria
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: As a high ranking member of the Ministry of State, I fully support the policies. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EEF"
msgid "Do you disagree with the Ministry of State's policies?"
msgstr "국무성의 정책에 동의하지 않는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you disagree with the Ministry of State's policies? 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EEE"
msgid "As a high ranking member of the Ministry of State, I fully support the policies."
msgstr "국무성의 고위직으로서, 저는 전적으로 정책을 지지해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EED"
msgid "Exceptions must be made in trying times."
msgstr "어려운 시기에는 예외도 허용해야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Luther
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Whatever happened to Dazra, our home was taken along with it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_TheKeepScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EEC"
msgid "Why are you here in the Keep?"
msgstr "왜 여기 본성에 있는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you here in the Keep?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_TheKeepScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EEB"
msgid "Whatever happened to Dazra, our home was taken along with it."
msgstr "다즈라에게 무슨 일이 일어나서, 우리 저택도 함께 사라졌거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_TheKeepScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE9"
msgid "Viktor felt the Keep was the most logical place to stay until more long term plans were able to be made."
msgstr "빅토르는 더 장기적인 계획을 세울 수 있을 때까지 머물 만한 가장 타당한 장소가 본성이라고 생각했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: These are vital matters that could save Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: These are vital matters that could save Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE8"
msgid "And who are you to tell me what is vital and what is not?"
msgstr "무엇이 중요하고 무엇이 중요하지 않다고 누가 감히 말할 수 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this. &&& Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council. &&& Viktor: These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You oversimplify. You would think us incapable of such a simple task?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE7"
msgid "Well, find Vaeric and bring him back."
msgstr "그럼, 배릭을 찾아서 데려와요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, find Vaeric and bring him back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, find Vaeric and bring him back.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE6"
msgid "You oversimplify. You would think us incapable of such a simple task?"
msgstr "단순 무식한 놈. 우리가 그런 간단한 일도 못 할 것 같으냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What would my son, my successor, the heir to House Veth'aal have to do with House politics? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE5"
msgid "What would your missing son have to do with House politics?"
msgstr "가출한 아들이 가문 정치와 무슨 관련이 있다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: He can't believe the player doesn't know this basic knowledge.  / Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would your missing son have to do with House politics?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What would your missing son have to do with House politics?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE4"
msgid "What would my son, my successor, the heir to House Veth'aal have to do with House politics?"
msgstr "내 아들이자 후계자이며 베타알 가문을 물려받을 사람이, 가문 정치와 무슨 관련이 있냐고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would your missing son have to do with House politics?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE3"
msgid "Even someone with basic political knowledge should realize his importance."
msgstr "기본적인 정치 상식만 있어도 얼마나 중요한지 알 수 있을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm, perhaps this is the opportunity I have been looking for. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE2"
msgid "The Great Serpent chose me as His divine tool. Use me."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 저를 그분의 신성한 도구로 선택하셨죠. 절 이용하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm, perhaps this is the opportunity I have been looking for. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE1"
msgid "Help me understand for both House Veth'aal and Dazra."
msgstr "베타알 가문과 다즈라 둘 다 이해할 수 있게 도와 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent chose me as His divine tool. Use me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent chose me as His divine tool. Use me.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Tell me, Harbinger, are you well practiced in discretion? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EE0"
msgid "Hmm, perhaps this is the opportunity I have been looking for."
msgstr "흠, 어쩌면 이게 내가 찾던 기회일지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: He does, Luther. He is allowing his fervent pride and anger to cloud his judgement. &&& Vitoria: What my brother is trying to say is that he wishes his own son dead. &&& Vitoria: First, we lose Vashti to that malignance tearing through Dazra, and now you so willingly offer up Vaeric?|As if our House has not suffered enough loss already. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This is not grief. This is betrayal. Not only to me, but to our society and the Great Serpent Himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDF"
msgid "Grief can often cloud our judgement."
msgstr "슬픔은 종종 판단력을 흐리게 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done. &&& Viktor: I commend you for your faith.|A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son. &&& Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. |Some of Vaeric's associates there may know where he went.|But keep in mind, anyone who has directly aided him in hiding is an accomplice and shares his fate.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Herald's Rest is our local bar, and unfortunately, my son's favorite establishment to frequent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDE"
msgid "What is the Herald's Rest?"
msgstr "전령의 안식처가 뭐죠?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A79
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDD"
msgid "Going into a hazardous zone like this is pure suicide."
msgstr "이런 위험한 곳에 들어오는 건 자살 행위라고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDC"
msgid "There's a lot going on in Neon. I try to keep it simple, so we don't get overwhelmed."
msgstr "네온에는 별별 일이 벌어지지. 그곳에 압도당하지 않도록 단순하게 나아가려 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD0
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDB"
msgid "All things are shared between the Promised."
msgstr "약속받은 자들은 서로 물건을 나누지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Herald's Rest? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I'll see to it any accomplices are executed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EDA"
msgid "All anyone needs to know is that you are looking for Vaeric."
msgstr "누구든 자네가 배릭을 찾고 있다는 사실만 알면 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done. &&& Viktor: I commend you for your faith.|A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son. &&& Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. |Some of Vaeric's associates there may know where he went.|But keep in mind, anyone who has directly aided him in hiding is an accomplice and shares his fate.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See to it you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ED9"
msgid "I'll use my best discretion when the time comes."
msgstr "때가 되면 최대한 신중하게 처리해 드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll use my best discretion when the time comes.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll use my best discretion when the time comes.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: All anyone needs to know is that you are looking for Vaeric for personal reasons.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ED8"
msgid "See to it you do."
msgstr "그렇게 하도록."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A70
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipShieldsZeroHealth
msgctxt "012ED7"
msgid "Shield systems down!"
msgstr "보호막 시스템 다운!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ABE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_SpaceshipLeaveCombat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipLeaveCombat
msgctxt "012ED6"
msgid "That was a well-fought battle."
msgstr "아주 훌륭한 전투였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC2
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "012ED5"
msgid "Another offering for the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀에게 바칠 놈들이 또 생겼군!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_FollowerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012ED3"
msgid "Where shall we go next?"
msgstr "이제 어디로 갈 거야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012ED2"
msgid "Get out of here."
msgstr "여기서 꺼져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vitoria
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Vashti was my niece. Viktor's daughter. Vaeric's sister. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ECD"
msgid "Can you tell me who Vashti is?"
msgstr "바슈티가 어떤 사람인지 말해줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Vashti is recently deceased. Spoken with sadness, longer pauses between statements. / Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me who Vashti is? 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ECC"
msgid "Vashti was my niece. Viktor's daughter. Vaeric's sister."
msgstr "바슈티는 제 조카였어요. 빅토르의 딸이죠. 배릭의 여동생이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ECB"
msgid "We lost her to the devastation that took half of our great city."
msgstr "우리의 위대한 도시의 절반을 앗아간 재난 때 바슈티를 잃었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_VashtiScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ECA"
msgid "Viktor will barely speak of her. I think he cannot reconcile the loss with his faith."
msgstr "빅토르는 바슈티에 대해 거의 말하지 않아요. 빅토르는 그 상실감을 자신의 신앙심과 조화시킬 수 없다고 생각하는 거 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vitoria
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Viktor is letting his emotions get the better of him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC9"
msgid "Why is Viktor being so unreasonable?"
msgstr "빅토르는 왜 그렇게 비이성적으로 행동하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is Viktor being so unreasonable?
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC8"
msgid "Viktor is letting his emotions get the better of him."
msgstr "빅토르는 자신의 감정에 휘둘리고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC7"
msgid "He was barely processing the shock and grief from losing Vashti. Then came the anger and betrayal from Vaeric."
msgstr "오라버니는 바슈티를 잃은 충격과 슬픔을 간신히 추스르고 있었어요. 그러다 배릭에게 분노와 배신감을 느끼게 된 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Vitoria_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC6"
msgid "My brother is a man of pride and great faith. For the first time, I think he does not know what to do."
msgstr "오라버니는 자부심이 강하고 신심이 깊은 사람이에요. 오라버니는 처음으로 뭘 해야 할지 모르는 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Luther
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: You don't know Viktor Veth'aal. He may be the most stubborn man in Dazra next to Anasko Va'ruun himself, but that doesn't mean we won't try.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC5"
msgid "Can't you and Vitoria convince Viktor to change his mind?"
msgstr "당신과 비토리아가 빅토르의 마음을 바꾸도록 설득할 순 없을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can't you and Vitoria convince Viktor to change his mind?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC4"
msgid "You don't know Viktor Veth'aal. He may be the most stubborn man in Dazra next to Anasko Va'ruun himself, but that doesn't mean we won't try."
msgstr ""
"빅토르 베타알을 모르시는군요. 빅토르는 아나스코 바룬 님 다음으로 다즈라에서 가장 고집이 센 사람일지 몰라요. 그리고 이미 시도해 봤어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC3"
msgid "He adores Vaeric, and if he died without reconciling their differences, I think it would break him."
msgstr "빅토르는 배릭을 아껴요. 둘이 이렇게 갈라선 채로 화해하지 못한 상태에서 배릭이 죽는다면, 빅토르는 충격을 받겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_ViktorScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC2"
msgid "He never got to say goodbye to Vashti, and he hasn't taken it well."
msgstr "빅토르는 바슈티에게 작별 인사를 못했고, 그 현실을 잘 받아들이지 못했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Luther
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Our house was taken during the... incident. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_LossesScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC1"
msgid "What sort of losses has House Veth'aal suffered?"
msgstr "베타알 가문은 어떤 손실을 입었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What sort of losses has House Veth'aal suffered?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_LossesScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EC0"
msgid "Our house was taken during the... incident."
msgstr "우리 저택이 사라졌죠... 사고 때문에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_LossesScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EBF"
msgid "Our losses are great. Vashti being foremost in our minds."
msgstr "잃어버린 빈자리가 커요. 바슈티는 우리 마음속에서 가장 중요한 존재니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Luther_TL_LossesScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EBE"
msgid "Excuse me. I'd rather not speak about it."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 그 얘기는 하고 싶지 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EBC"
msgid "What if he did something stupid?"
msgstr "만약 배릭이 멍청한 짓을 했다면요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EBB"
msgid "He could be in trouble."
msgstr "배릭이 곤경에 처했을 수도 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EBA"
msgid "What if he needs help?"
msgstr "도움이 필요한 상황이면 어떡하려고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB9"
msgid "Hmm, I wouldn't put it past him."
msgstr "흠, 배릭 씨 문제를 그냥 지나칠 수는 없겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB8"
msgid "I'd hate to think he'd do anything dangerous..."
msgstr "배릭 씨가 위험한 짓을 할 거라고 생각하긴 싫지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB7"
msgid "Vaeric always was one to act on impulse."
msgstr "배릭 씨는 항상 충동적으로 행동하는 분이셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB6"
msgid "Vaeric knows better than to take risks, especially right now."
msgstr "배릭 씨는 위험을 감수하는 것보다 나을 거라는 걸 잘 알고 있을 겁니다. 특히 당장 지금 같은 상황이라면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB5"
msgid "He's smarter than that. He can take care of himself."
msgstr "배릭 씨는 그보다 더 똑똑합니다. 배릭 씨는 자기 앞가림 정도는 할 수 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB4"
msgid "I wouldn't worry about him. I'm sure he's fine."
msgstr "저는 배릭 씨가 걱정되지 않아요. 괜찮으실 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB3"
msgid "I just really need to see a friendly face."
msgstr "진짜로 친구 얼굴 좀 보려는 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Vaeric...
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh of course. Who would be looking for me anyway? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB2"
msgid "I'm not here to visit. I'm looking for Vaeric."
msgstr "그쪽 보러 온 게 아니야. 배릭을 찾고 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not here to visit. I'm looking for Vaeric.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not here to visit. I'm looking for Vaeric.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB1"
msgid "Oh of course. Who would be looking for me anyway?"
msgstr "아, 그러시겠지. 그게 아니면 누가 날 찾겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EB0"
msgid "I can understand that."
msgstr "그 심정 이해해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAF"
msgid "We all do. We all do."
msgstr "다들 그렇죠. 다들 그래요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAE"
msgid "I could really use his council right now."
msgstr "지금 당장 그 친구랑 꼭 상담해야 할 일이 있다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAD"
msgid "Vaeric was always good at giving advice."
msgstr "배릭 씨는 항상 조언을 잘해주셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAC"
msgid "If you need advice that bad, there's plenty of other people you could talk to."
msgstr "그렇게 조언이 절실하시다면, 이야기할 다른 분들이 저기 많이 계세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAB"
msgid "I really need to speak to him."
msgstr "진짜로 그 친구랑 얘기 좀 해야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EAA"
msgid "I'm worried. I haven't seen him since the incident."
msgstr "걱정돼서요. 사고 이후로 그 친구를 본 적이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA9"
msgid "It's not like him to not stay in touch."
msgstr "그 친구답지 않게 연락도 안 해서 그래요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA8"
msgid "I understand. I really do."
msgstr "이해해요. 저도 정말 걱정돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA7"
msgid "And I'd really like to help you."
msgstr "저도 정말 도와드리고 싶어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA6"
msgid "Hmm, there must be something I can remember."
msgstr "흠, 뭔가 기억나는 게 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA5"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I can't help you."
msgstr "죄송해요. 도와드릴 수 없겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA4"
msgid "There's just nothing I can do."
msgstr "제가 할 수 있는 게 아무것도 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011042AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012EA3"
msgid "I wish I knew something, but I don't."
