msgctxt "012E78"
msgid "Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?"
msgstr "가끔 사람들한테는 혼자 있을 곳이 필요한 법이야. 안 그래, 사라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104298
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E77"
msgid "Are you sure you searched everywhere?"
msgstr "모든 곳을 다 찾아본 게 확실해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104297
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E76"
msgid "I'm so tired. It's possible I missed something, but nothing comes to mind."
msgstr "너무 지쳤어. 놓친 곳이 있을지도 모르는데, 딱히 떠오르지는 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104297
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E75"
msgid "Yes. And I sure got yelled at plenty of times for being places I shouldn't."
msgstr "그래. 그리고 가지 말아야 할 곳에 갔다가 혼난 적도 많았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104295
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E74"
msgid "He must have left some sort of clue."
msgstr "분명 어떤 단서라도 남겨뒀을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104294
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E73"
msgid "Believe me, I'd help if I could."
msgstr "정말, 도울 수만 있었으면 도왔을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104294
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E72"
msgid "Nope, nothing."
msgstr "아니, 전혀 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E71"
msgid "Surely he must have dropped a hint or two."
msgstr "분명 한두 가지 단서는 남겼을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E70"
msgid "If he did, I must've been too dense to pick up on it."
msgstr "만약 그랬다면, 내가 너무 둔해서 못 찾은 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6F"
msgid "He didn't. I wouldn't have missed something like that."
msgstr "안 남겼어. 내가 그런 걸 놓쳤을 리가 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Bianca
#. PROMPT: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6E"
msgid "Right, especially with so much tragedy. Vaeric may be trying to mentally regroup."
msgstr "맞아. 특히 너무 큰 비극이 생기면 말이야. 배릭은 마음을 추스르려 하는 걸지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Bianca
#. PROMPT: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6D"
msgid "Sometimes we get so overwhelmed, we have no choice but to shut down, block it all out..."
msgstr "너무 많은 일에 짓눌리게 되면, 마음을 닫고 세상 모든 걸 거부할 수밖에 없으니까..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Bianca
#. PROMPT: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I never thought about it like that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6C"
msgid "Which makes it more important that we find him, so we can remind him of those who care about him, like yourself."
msgstr "그래서 우리가 배릭을 찾는 게 중요한 거야. 그래야 당신처럼 배릭을 아끼는 사람들이 있다는 걸 일깨워줄 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6B"
msgid "There must be something you missed."
msgstr "분명 네가 뭔가 놓친 게 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response. Frustrated. / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E6A"
msgid "Sure, sure, but what?"
msgstr "맞지, 맞아. 그게 뭘까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110428B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E69"
msgid "Or he really just doesn't want to be found."
msgstr "아니면 정말 누가 찾길 원하지 않는 걸 수도 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Vaeric...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My help? That'd be a first. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E68"
msgid "I respect your boundaries, but I really need your help."
msgstr "네가 정한 선을 넘고 싶지는 않지만, 정말로 도움이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Vaeric...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My help? That'd be a first. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E67"
msgid "I can respect the need to be alone, but I could use your help."
msgstr "혼자 있고 싶은 마음은 존중하고 싶지만, 정말 네 도움이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to companion
#. PROMPT: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah? &&& companion: Right, especially with so much tragedy. Vaeric may be trying to mentally regroup.|Sometimes we get so overwhelmed, we have no choice but to shut down, block it all out...|Which makes it more important that we find him, so we can remind him of those who care about him, like yourself.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E66"
msgid "I never thought about it like that."
msgstr "그런 식으로 생각해보진 못했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to companion
#. PROMPT: Sometimes people just need space, right, Sarah?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E65"
msgid "And you're right. Vaeric is always under pressure from his father. I'm sure it's only gotten worse lately."
msgstr "그리고 당신 말이 맞아. 배릭은 항상 아버지에게 압박을 받았어. 최근 들어 더 심해졌을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E64"
msgid "He had to have said something."
msgstr "배릭이 뭔가 말해줬을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E63"
msgid "I thought you two were friends."
msgstr "둘이 서로 친구인 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E62"
msgid "Friends trust friends with information."
msgstr "친구라면 친구의 정보를 신뢰하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E61"
msgid "I thought he'd trust me with anything, but I'm telling you. There's nothing."
msgstr "배릭은 날 무조건 믿어줄 줄 알았는데, 솔직히 말할게. 전혀 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E60"
msgid "We may have been friends, but some things you just keep to yourself."
msgstr "친구 사이였을지 몰라도, 혼자만 아는 비밀도 있는 법이잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5F"
msgid "He told me a lot of things, but none of it seems significant."
msgstr "얘기야 많이 해 줬지만, 중요한 이야기는 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5E"
msgid "I guess we weren't as close as I thought."
msgstr "생각만큼 가깝지는 않았었나 보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5D"
msgid "Maybe it was more of a one-sided friendship."
msgstr "어쩌면 일방적인 우정에 가까웠을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104285
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable01LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5C"
msgid "You think you know someone."
msgstr "사람 속은 모르는 법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5B"
msgid "You obviously miss him."
msgstr "분명히 배릭이 그립겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E5A"
msgid "Help me find him, for your sake."
msgstr "너를 위해서라도, 배릭을 찾는 일을 도와줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104284
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E59"
msgid "You'll feel better if you tell me what you know."
msgstr "알고 있는 걸 말해 주면 기분이 나아지지 않을까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E58"
msgid "I just... I wish there was anything I could tell you."
msgstr "난 그냥... 말해줄 게 있기나 했으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E57"
msgid "I want to help, really. I just don't know anything."
msgstr "도와주고 싶어. 정말로. 난 아무것도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E56"
msgid "I just want to see him again, but if he had plans, he kept me in the dark."
msgstr "배릭을 다시 보고 싶지만, 계획이 있었다고 해도 나한테는 숨겼어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E55"
msgid "I don't know. If didn't care to tell me, maybe I don't care to find him."
msgstr "모르겠는데. 나한테 말하지 않으려 한 거면, 나도 찾지 말아야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E54"
msgid "I'll get over it. Once I finish running up this tab."
msgstr "잊어버릴래. 이 외상 술 다 마시고 나서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104283
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Repeatable02LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E53"
msgid "What's the point? He's just gone."
msgstr "무슨 소용이야? 그냥 가 버렸는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E52"
msgid "He could need your help."
msgstr "배릭한테 네 도움이 필요할 수도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E51"
msgid "You're right. I wish I could remember something. Anything."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 뭔가 기억이 나면 좋을 텐데. 뭐든지."

