msgstr "아마 괜찮을 거야. 자기 앞가림 정도는 하거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110427B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
