msgid "Maybe he dropped some sort of hint in your last conversation?"
msgstr "마지막에 이야기하면서 배릭이 어떤 단서를 남기진 않았나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110427A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
