msgstr "도와주고 싶은데, 진짜 아무것도 생각 안 나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110427A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E47"
msgid "No way. I would've remembered."
msgstr "없었어. 있었으면 기억났겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
