msgid "Think about it. There must be something."
msgstr "생각해 봐. 분명 뭔가 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E45"
msgid "I wish I could tell you there was."
msgstr "있다고 할 수 있으면 참 좋겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
