msgid "You don't think I've been over things a thousand times?"
msgstr "내가 수천 번 넘게 생각해 봤을 거란 생각은 안 해 봤어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Bianca
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
