msgstr "찾아보게 해 줘. 내가 하는 일이 그런 거거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_BountyHunterScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
