msgid "I want to believe you."
msgstr "널 믿어보고 싶네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_BountyHunterScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
