msgid "But he doesn't want to be found."
msgstr "하지만 배릭은 누가 찾길 원하지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
