msgid "Try to remember anything that may even be slightly significant."
msgstr "조금이라도 중요한 내용이면 뭐든 기억해 내봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104274
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
