msgstr "애쓰는 중이야. 진짜라니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104274
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
