msgid "I'm telling you, there's nothing."
msgstr "말했잖아. 아무것도 생각 안 나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
