msgstr "지난번에 이야기했을 때 눈에 띄는 점이 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104272
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Egbo_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
