msgid "Yes, I'd like your help in locating Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "그래. 배릭 베타알을 찾는 데 도움이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, I'd like your help in locating Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, I'd like your help in locating Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110426A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E36"
msgid "Well, I'm afraid you've come to the wrong person."
msgstr "글쎄. 안됐지만 사람 잘못 찾은 것 같은데."

msgctxt "012E35"
msgid "\"A first?\" I take it something's bothering you?"
msgstr "'처음'이라고? 뭔가 귀찮게 했나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A first? I take it something's bothering you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "A first?" I take it something's bothering you?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104268
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E34"
msgid "More like someone, but I digress. What can I help you with?"
msgstr "누군가 귀찮게 한 거겠지만, 딴소리하면 안 되겠지. 뭐가 필요한데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Genna
#. PROMPT: Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104267
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E33"
msgid "If Vaeric's bailed and left his tab open for someone else, I'd say chances are they don't plan on coming back."
msgstr "배릭이 다른 사람 앞으로 외상을 달고 급히 자리를 떴다면, 다시는 돌아오지 않을 가능성이 높단 뜻이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Genna
#. PROMPT: Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: Serpent spare me, you're right on that one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104267
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E32"
msgid "You want that tab paid, you better tell us what you know, 'less you're comfortable asking good ol' Viktor to foot that bill."
msgstr "외상값 받고 싶으면 아는 내용을 말해주는 게 좋을 겁니다. 아니면 맘씨 좋은 빅토르 영감님한테 청구서 보내던가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Bianca: Heh, aren't we all? &&& Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?|I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He does indeed. Well, he used to. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E31"
msgid "I was told he frequented the Herald's Rest."
msgstr "배릭이 전령의 안식처에 자주 왔다고 들었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was told he frequented the Herald's Rest.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was told he frequented the Herald's Rest.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104264
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E30"
msgid "He does indeed. Well, he used to."
msgstr "확실히 그랬지. 뭐, 예전에는."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] The guy owes me a drink and said to meet up here. &&& Genna: Sounds like Vaeric at least. &&& Genna: Truth is, I haven't seen him for a few days myself. |But if you find him, tell him he better come check on his tab. |I know he's good for it, but since he gave Eggie permission to use it, it's sky high.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: If Vaeric's bailed and left his tab open for someone else, I'd say chances are they don't plan on coming back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2F"
msgid "Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here?"
msgstr "샘, 이럴 때 들려줄 삶의 지혜가 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching. &&& Bianca: I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found.  &&& Bianca: All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe. &&& Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.|His name is Tane Salavea.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can't guarantee Tane knows anything at all, but I know the two were speaking more frequently.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104262
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2E"
msgid "I'll find out what he knows."
msgstr "테인이 뭘 알고 있는지 물어봐야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll find out what he knows.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll find out what he knows.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Just promise me you'll let me know if you find Vaeric.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104261
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2D"
msgid "I can't guarantee Tane knows anything at all, but I know the two were speaking more frequently."
msgstr "테인이 뭔가 알고 있다고 장담할 순 없지만, 둘이 자주 대화를 나누긴 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110425E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_SC_DiplomacyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2C"
msgid "I wouldn't be here unless it was of utmost importance."
msgstr "최우선 사안이 아니었으면 여기 오지도 않았을 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to companion
#. PROMPT: Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sam, any wisdom from your younger years here? &&& companion: If Vaeric's bailed and left his tab open for someone else, I'd say chances are they don't plan on coming back.|You want that tab paid, you better tell us what you know, 'less you're comfortable asking good ol' Viktor to foot that bill.
