#. TOPIC: 0110425B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2B"
msgid "Serpent spare me, you're right on that one."
msgstr "뱀께서 환난을 면케 해주시니, 그 말이 맞네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Bianca: Heh, aren't we all? &&& Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?|I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him.
