#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh sure, I'm just fine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104257
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E2A"
msgid "You seem really down. Are you all right?"
msgstr "진짜 우울해 보이는데. 괜찮은 거 맞아?"

