#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012E06"
msgid "Well, what's next? Vaeric must've fled in a hurry since his tracker's still here, so guess the rest is up to us."
msgstr "음, 다음은 뭘까? 배릭은 서둘러 도망친 게 분명해. 추적기가 아직 여기 있으니까. 뒤처리는 우리한테 달렸겠지."

