#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Irina
#. PROMPT: Aiding a traitor is punishable by death.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Pleading
