msgid "We aided a young man in need of help. We never would have knowingly aided a traitor."
msgstr "우리는 도움이 필요한 젊은이를 도왔을 뿐이에요. 고의로 반역자를 도운 적은 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way. &&& ...  &&& Irina: All Must Serve. &&& Zen: This is exactly what I feared. &&& Zen: Who even is this elusive traitor that we're being threatened over?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So the Ministry of State must have sent you. 
