#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DE4"
msgid "A traitor who has turned his back on both House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent."
msgstr "바룬 가문과 위대한 뱀 모두에게 등을 돌린 반역자죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A traitor who has turned his back on both House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A traitor who has turned his back on both House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Worried
