msgid "So the Ministry of State must have sent you."
msgstr "그럼 국무성에서 당신을 보낸 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I ask you again to please spare my family.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is that... Mila's journal?
