msgid "It seems I should've been questioning your partner or daughter."
msgstr "당신 반려자나 딸한테 물어봤어야 했던 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is about to attack her and kill her family. / Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] Yes, I found evidence the I needed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Yes, I found evidence the I needed.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Afraid
