#. TOPIC: 01104205
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DDE"
msgid "Oh no. No! I didn't mean it. I was just writing about Cas."
msgstr "아, 아뇨, 아니에요! 그런 뜻이 아니에요. 그냥 캐스 얘기였다고요."

