msgid "Zen?"
msgstr "젠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This journal says "Zeni" suspected a young man you helped to be Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Irina: Mila's journal? &&& Mila: Oh no. No! I didn't mean it. I was just writing about Cas. |Zeni, I'm so sorry! &&& Irina: Zen?
