#. TOPIC: 01104203
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DDB"
msgid "I didn't want to say anything because you were so taken by him, and I didn't want to worry you."
msgstr "당신이 그 젊은이한테 너무 빠져서 아무 말도 하고 싶지 않았어. 당신 걱정시키고 싶지도 않았고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Irina
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104203
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DDA"
msgid "I never thought it'd lead to this. If anything I thought we'd be rewarded for helping him."
msgstr "이렇게까지 될 줄은 몰랐어. 오히려 그 사람을 도와준 보상을 받을 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player re-entering the scene. / Pleading / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: If you must execute anyone for aiding a traitor, let it be me.
