msgstr "제 가족을 살려주시길 다시 한번 간청할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen: No, please. Spare my family.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Come on, you can't take out this whole family based on a kids journal. 
