#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DD8"
msgid "If you must execute anyone for aiding a traitor, let it be me."
msgstr "반역자를 도운 죄로 누군가를 처형해야 한다면, 저를 처형하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent. &&& Zen: No, please. Spare my family. &&& Zen: If you must execute anyone for aiding a traitor, let it be me.
