msgid "Come on, you can't take out this whole family based on a kids journal."
msgstr "이봐, 애 일기장만 보고 온 가족을 처분할 순 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: They are here on orders from the Ministry of State. Duty demands they follow through.
