#. TOPIC: 011041FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DD6"
msgid "These people are harmless and so remote that House Veth'aal never has to catch wind of this."
msgstr "이 사람들은 나쁜 뜻도 없고, 외진 곳에 사니까 베타알 가문도 절대 눈치 못 챌 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Come on, you can't take out this whole family based on a kids journal. |These people are harmless and so remote that House Veth'aal never has to catch wind of this. &&& companion: They are here on orders from the Ministry of State. Duty demands they follow through. &&& Tane: Okay, thank you for clarifying, but not helpful.
