#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DD3"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then."
msgstr ""
"[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits> 크레딧 요구] 그렇다면 아주 큰 벌금을 부과해야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life. &&& ...  &&& Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses.  &&& Tane: Vaeric being a traitor is news to me and I live in Dazra. You've got to believe these people. &&& companion: Viktor wanted discretion, so it is not unreasonable that these people are innocent.|Still, knowingly or not, they did aid a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have that kind of money, but I can return what you gave me and what little savings we've managed.
