#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DD1"
msgid "Any price is worth our lives, but we don't have that kind of money."
msgstr "무엇보다도 목숨이 중요하겠지만, 우린 그만한 돈이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DD0"
msgid "Please, we'll give you all we have."
msgstr "제발요. 가진 건 전부 드릴게요."

