#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_AcceptIrinaCredits>] I'll take whatever you have.
