msgid "[Return Journal] All right. But I'd destroy this if I were you."
msgstr "[일기 돌려주기] 좋아요. 하지만 나라면 일기를 없애버릴 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Return Journal] All right. But I'd destroy this if I were you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Return Journal] All right. But I'd destroy this if I were you.
