msgstr "확실하게 처리할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then. &&& Zen: Any price is worth our lives, but we don't have that kind of money. |Please, we'll give you all we have.
