msgid "Serpent bless you for sparing our family today."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 오늘 우리 가족을 살려주신 당신을 축복하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: And I'm thankful I didn't have to watch that go down.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DCB"
msgid "We are truly thankful for this lesson in honesty and humility."
msgstr "정직과 겸손에 대해 가르쳐 주신 거 진심으로 감사드려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I'd say a hefty fine is in order then. &&& Zen: Any price is worth our lives, but we don't have that kind of money. |Please, we'll give you all we have. &&& Irina: Serpent bless you for sparing our family today. |We are truly thankful for this lesson in honesty and humility.
