#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
