msgid "Of course. I'd like to know your side of this story."
msgstr "그렇게 해. 이번 일에서 네 입장도 들어보고 싶으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Of course. I'd like to know your side of this story.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'd like to know your side of this story.
