#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DBC"
msgid "Helping a traitor is a crime punishable by death."
msgstr "반역자를 돕는 건 사형당할 수도 있는 범죄인데 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Helping a traitor is a crime punishable by death.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Helping a traitor is a crime punishable by death.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: If you must execute anyone for aiding a traitor, let it be me.
