#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DBA"
msgid "You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent."
msgstr "회개자가 되면 보상을 받게 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll be rewarded when you're made Penitent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
