#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB9"
msgid "No, please. Spare my family."
msgstr "안 돼요, 제발요. 가족만은 살려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This journal says "Zeni" suspected a young man you helped to be Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& ...  &&& Mila: Oh no. No! I didn't mean it. I was just writing about Cas. |Zeni, I'm so sorry! &&& Irina: Zen? &&& Zen: I didn't want to say anything because you were so taken by him, and I didn't want to worry you. |I never thought it'd lead to this. If anything I thought we'd be rewarded for helping him.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I swear, we knew nothing of his status. I thought we were doing House Veth'aal a favor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB8"
msgid "I knew you were hiding something."
msgstr "뭔가 숨기고 있을 줄 알았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I knew you were hiding something.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I knew you were hiding something.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: If you must execute anyone for aiding a traitor, let it be me.
