#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_Irina_ConfrontScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB7"
msgid "I swear, we knew nothing of his status. I thought we were doing House Veth'aal a favor."
msgstr "맹세컨대 그 사람 혐의는 전혀 몰랐어요. 베타알 가문에 호의를 베푼다고 생각했다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House. &&& Tane: They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing... &&& companion: This is how the Houses operate. Manipulation at its best. &&& Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.|His pride and the fear of what it would mean for House Veth'aal is all he cares about.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Only because of our antiquated ways! Our society is stuck in the past. Our culture isolates and suffocates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB6"
msgid "Abandoning your role would bring great shame upon your House."
msgstr "자기에게 주어진 역할을 포기하면 가문에 큰 치욕을 안겨주게 될 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Abandoning your role would bring great shame upon your House.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Abandoning your role would bring great shame upon your House.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB5"
msgid "Only because of our antiquated ways! Our society is stuck in the past. Our culture isolates and suffocates."
msgstr "구시대적인 방식 때문이잖아! 우리 사회는 과거에 갇혀 있어. 우리 문화는 고립돼 있고 질식할 것 같다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House. &&& Tane: They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing... &&& companion: This is how the Houses operate. Manipulation at its best. &&& Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.|His pride and the fear of what it would mean for House Veth'aal is all he cares about.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Shame. Embarrassment. Fuel for the other Houses to ridicule my father. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB4"
msgid "What does your leaving mean for House Veth'aal?"
msgstr "네가 베타알 가문을 떠난 게 가문 사람들에게는 어떤 의미로 받아들여지는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does your leaving mean for House Veth'aal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What does your leaving mean for House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB3"
msgid "Shame. Embarrassment. Fuel for the other Houses to ridicule my father."
msgstr "수치심. 창피함. 다른 가문들이 아버지를 조롱거리로 삼을 땔감."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does your leaving mean for House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB2"
msgid "I don't want any of that for him, but he left me no choice."
msgstr "나야 아버지에게 그런 걸 안겨드리고 싶지 않았지만, 아버지는 나에게 선택의 여지를 주지 않으셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, you need to return to your duty as House Veth'aal's heir. &&& Vaeric: I can't do that. &&& Vaeric: The truth is, the Scaled Citadel was the last straw.|My people are so blinded by faith and politics, they don't see how it's destroying us. |Anasko Va'ruun eliminated half our population in the blink of an eye, my sister, Vashti, among them.|I could no longer live in a society that won't put its people first, that would destroy itself in the name of a god that has done nothing for us.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Especially when that faith leads to hate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB1"
msgid "I'll never understand those who value faith more than family."
msgstr "가족보다 신앙을 더 중요하게 여기는 사람들은 이해 못 할 거 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House. &&& Tane: They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing... &&& companion: This is how the Houses operate. Manipulation at its best. &&& Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.|His pride and the fear of what it would mean for House Veth'aal is all he cares about.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound as if you speak from experience. I envy you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DB0"
msgid "Having nurturing, supportive parents makes a world of difference."
msgstr "잘 보살펴주고, 지지해 주는 부모가 있으면 세상이 달라지지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Having nurturing, supportive parents makes a world of difference.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Having nurturing, supportive parents makes a world of difference.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DAF"
msgid "You sound as if you speak from experience. I envy you."
msgstr "경험에서 우러나오는 말처럼 들리네. 부럽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Having nurturing, supportive parents makes a world of difference.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DAE"
msgid "Sometimes I would give anything for a supportive word from my father."
msgstr "가끔은 아버지의 응원 한마디를 듣기 위해 뭐든 해드리곤 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll never understand those who value faith more than family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll never understand those who value faith more than family.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I hope you can see why I want to walk away from all this... to start my own life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DAD"
msgid "Especially when that faith leads to hate."
msgstr "특히 그 신앙이 증오로 이어질 때는 더욱 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, you need to return to your duty as House Veth'aal's heir. &&& Vaeric: I can't do that. &&& Vaeric: The truth is, the Scaled Citadel was the last straw.|My people are so blinded by faith and politics, they don't see how it's destroying us. |Anasko Va'ruun eliminated half our population in the blink of an eye, my sister, Vashti, among them.|I could no longer live in a society that won't put its people first, that would destroy itself in the name of a god that has done nothing for us.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You must be one of the Enlightened I've heard about. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012DAC"
msgid "This is why I put my faith in science and people."
msgstr "이래서 내가 과학과 인간만 믿지."

