msgstr "믿음과 광신 사이에는 미세한 경계가 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent is offering you a second chance. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: Father, I have returned out of love and support for you and House Veth'aal. |I am ready to dedicate myself fully. &&& Viktor: Do you have any idea, the trauma you have caused me? The damage you could have wrought upon this house? &&& Vaeric: It was never my intention to harm you or this House. |Losing Vashti... so much devastation... I feared we devoted ourselves blindly to a path that would lead to our end.|I let my emotions get the best of me. I lost my way. But I have returned, repentant and ready to serve.
