#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D99"
msgid "[Attack] You will be made dust for such heresy!"
msgstr "[공격] 이런 이단 짓을 벌이다니. 흙먼지가 되어 대가를 치르게 될 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sometimes what our faith commands of us goes beyond blood.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sometimes what our faith commands of us goes beyond blood.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D98"
msgid "And if Va'ruun society continues down this path, when we bring about our own end, will that faith be worth it?"
msgstr "바룬 사회가 이런 길로 계속 가다가, 우리 스스로 종말을 맞이한다면, 그 신앙이 그만한 가치가 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sometimes what our faith commands of us goes beyond blood.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
