#. TOPIC: 011041BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D82"
msgid "Vaeric is a traitor, why wouldn't Viktor want him dead?"
msgstr "배릭은 반역자잖아요. 빅토르가 죽이지 않을 이유는 뭔데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric is a traitor, why wouldn't Viktor want him dead?
