msgid "Uh, hello, because Vaeric's his son. You heard Vitoria. Viktor's acting on impulse, not reason."
msgstr "얼씨구, 배릭은 빅토르의 아들이야. 비토리아 말 들었잖아. 빅토르는 이성이 아니라 충동을 따르고 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric is a traitor, why wouldn't Viktor want him dead?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
