#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Now that you mention it... &&& Tane: Hey now, I wasn't serious! &&& companion: As Promised, it is your duty to either carry out Viktor's sentence or let him know of Tane's involvement. &&& Tane: And I think we all know that'd be a death sentence for me if you did.|So if you're going to do this, may as well get it over with now.
