msgstr "지금 진심이야? 내가 상관할 바는 아니지만, 이건 테인의 일이기도 하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business. &&& Tane: None of our business?
