#. TOPIC: 010E3E6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D77"
msgid "My thoughts exactly."
msgstr "내 생각이 딱 그거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have orders. I intend to follow them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have orders. I intend to follow them. &&& Tane: Orders that you didn't even question. Have you seen the state of this planet?|Viktor may be out of his damn mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I had every intention of getting this guy off planet. Am I next on your list?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011041BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
