#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D34"
msgid "Impaired?"
msgstr "장애라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just don't screw it up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just don't screw it up.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: And Vitoria and Luther aren't about to let us forget this.
