#. TOPIC: 01104185
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D33"
msgid "The Great Serpent shall guide us both."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 둘을 인도해 주실 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And now you have a second chance at being a father. &&& Viktor: You are quite right. Great Serpent knows I have room for improvement, and I can and will do better.  &&& Viktor: Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House politics vary drastically from the Settled Systems, but I understand your point.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104183
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D32"
msgid "Much like politics, communication, compromise, and compassion are key."
msgstr "정치하고도 비슷하다 할 수 있겠죠. 소통, 양보, 연민이 핵심이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness will help you move past your feelings of betrayal. &&& ...  &&& Luther: It's good to have you back with us, Vaeric. &&& Viktor: Thank you. &&& Viktor: You put my son back on the right path and guided him home.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are quite right. Great Serpent knows I have room for improvement, and I can and will do better. 
