#. TOPIC: 01104182
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D31"
msgid "And now you have a second chance at being a father."
msgstr "이제 아버지가 될 수 있는 두 번째 기회를 얻으셨네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And now you have a second chance at being a father.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And now you have a second chance at being a father.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
