msgid "Now go. I have much to arrange."
msgstr "이제 가라. 정리해야 할 게 많으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, quite the conundrum indeed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110416F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D13"
msgid "I walked the path. I understand Anasko."
msgstr "저는 길을 걸었어요. 아나스코의 말을 알아듣기도 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: [Lie] No. Vaeric acted alone.
