msgstr "내 아들의 반역 행위를 도운 작자들을 찾았나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Much like politics, communication, compromise, and compassion are key. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: And perhaps we could even learn by keeping those in mind. &&& Viktor: Now, if you all will excuse us... &&& Viktor: There is something I wish to discuss with the Harbinger alone.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
