#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D11"
msgid "Come, Vaeric. Let us get you resettled."
msgstr "가자, 배릭. 다시 지낼 곳을 정해줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Vaeric, Vitoria, Luther
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: House politics vary drastically from the Settled Systems, but I understand your point. &&& Vaeric: And perhaps we could even learn by keeping those in mind.
