#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D10"
msgid "Now, if you all will excuse us..."
msgstr "이제, 잠시 자리 좀 비워 주면 좋겠는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He'll take you back. Family is everything. &&& Vaeric: Let's just hope he still sees it that way.  &&& Vaeric: I'll need to make some preparations before I return, gathering my things and making sure Bella and Boris are taken care of. &&& Vaeric: I'll be along shortly.
