#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110416B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D0F"
msgid "Same here. I'm going to stick around and help Vaeric out."
msgstr "나도 여기 있을게. 여기 남아서 배릭을 도와야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110416B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D0E"
msgid "Besides, I don't think I wanna be around when you report back to Viktor."
msgstr "게다가 자네가 빅토르에게 보고할 때 옆자리에 있고 싶지 않거든."

