msgid "Do me a favor and find me later at the Herald's Rest."
msgstr "나중에 전령의 안식처에서 나를 찾으라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Much like politics, communication, compromise, and compassion are key. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Come, Vaeric. Let us get you resettled. &&& Viktor: Now that we have a bit more privacy, I wanted to discuss the matter of any traitors among us.  &&& Viktor: Did you find anyone who aided my son in his treachery?
