#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110416A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_OutcomesScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
