#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The ring is a small price to pay for your life. &&& Vaeric: You're right, and I know Vashti would want it this way. &&& Vaeric: Take it. I'll find solace in the fact that the ring will remain with my family.|And now, I hope we are done here.|Thank you for seeing reason. I owe you both my life and freedom.
