#. TOPIC: 01104169
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012D0A"
msgid "Now that's over with, I'm going to hang back here, talk to Vaeric a bit."
msgstr "이제 다 끝났으니까, 난 여기 잠깐 남아서 배릭하고 얘기 좀 해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
