#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03PlayerChoices
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CEF"
msgid "There's no way you're thinking clearly right now."
msgstr "지금 넌 제정신이 아닌 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CEE"
msgid "You're right... My emotions could be getting the best of me."
msgstr "네가 맞아... 감정에 휘둘리고 있을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CED"
msgid "Perhaps you're right. I've been through so much."
msgstr "아마도 네 맞을지도 모르지. 너무 많은 일을 겪었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CEC"
msgid "After losing my sister and so many others, you may be right."
msgstr "내 여동생과 다른 사람들을 많이 잃었으니, 그 말이 맞을지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CEB"
msgid "The recent events have only made things more clear."
msgstr "최근의 사건으로 인해 상황이 더욱 명확해졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CEA"
msgid "I may be in grief, but I am of sound mind."
msgstr "슬픔에 잠겨 있지만, 정신은 멀쩡하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Repeatable03LoseResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE9"
msgid "No, I know exactly what I'm doing."
msgstr "아니, 난 내가 뭘 하는지 정확히 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE8"
msgid "The Ministry of State would certainly diminish..."
msgstr "국무성은 확실히 약해질 거 같군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Tired / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE7"
msgid "And perhaps they'd deserve it. The Ministry of State is too punishing as it is."
msgstr "그리고 그래도 싸겠지. 이대로면 국무성이 하는 짓은 너무 가혹하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE6"
msgid "If the people of Dazra find out, it will crush House Veth'aal."
msgstr "다즈라 사람들이 이 사실을 알게 되면 베타알 가문은 무너질 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE5"
msgid "Don't let your people down like this."
msgstr "이런 식으로 너네 사람들을 실망시키지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE4"
msgid "It's not that I want to let anyone down..."
msgstr "누구도 실망시키고 싶진 않지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE3"
msgid "They are hardly my people anymore."
msgstr "그 사람들은 더 이상 나와 관계 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110415A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE2"
msgid "Things will never change if people like you walk away."
msgstr "사람들이 너처럼 그냥 떠나 버린다면 세상은 절대로 바뀌지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104159
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE1"
msgid "You have a point."
msgstr "일리가 있군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104159
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CE0"
msgid "As long as the Ministry of State sees to it that people like me are executed for treason, it matters little if I stay."
msgstr "국무성이 나 같은 사람들이 반역죄로 처형되도록 계속 손을 쓰는 한, 내가 남아 있든 말든 상관없을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104158
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CDF"
msgid "You would have House Veth'aal mourn another loss?"
msgstr "베타알 가문 사람들에게 또 상실의 슬픔을 느끼게 할 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104157
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CDE"
msgid "It could be too much for some to bear..."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 감당하기 어려울 수도 있겠지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104157
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "012CDD"
msgid "Yes, better to be lumped in with the others than to make them undergo the pain when all is the past."
msgstr "그래, 모든 게 과거에 매이는 고통을 사람들이 겪게 하는 것보다, 다른 사람들과 똑같이 취급받는 게 낫겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104155
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CDC"
msgid "It's not I want to... Perhaps I am being hasty."
msgstr "이런 걸 원하진 않았는데... 내가 너무 성급했나 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104155
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CDB"
msgid "Most of them would turn their back on me the moment they learned my truth."
msgstr "대부분은 내 진실을 알게 되는 순간 나에게 등을 돌릴 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104156
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc05Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CDA"
msgid "You would turn your back on your own people?"
msgstr "동족에게 등을 돌리겠다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104154
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD9"
msgid "You have people who care about you here."
msgstr "여기에는 너를 아끼는 사람들이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104153
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD8"
msgid "I know, and it does make me doubt my decision."
msgstr "알아. 그래서 내 결정에 의문이 들기도 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104153
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc06Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD7"
msgid "They'll get over it. Especially if my father's labeled me a traitor."
msgstr "다들 잊어버릴 거야. 특히 아버지가 나를 반역자로 낙인찍었다면 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104152
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc07Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD6"
msgid "You'll be found eventually. It's not safe."
msgstr "언젠가는 발각될 거야. 안전하지 않다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104151
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc07Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD5"
msgid "I hadn't thought that far ahead yet."
msgstr "그렇게 훗날까지 생각하진 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104151
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc07Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD4"
msgid "It's only a matter time before I leave Va'ruun'kai, and they'll be reluctant to extend their search to the rest of the galaxy."
msgstr "내가 바룬카이를 떠나는 건 시간문제고, 바룬 가문은 은하계 다른 지역으로 수색 범위를 넓히는 걸 꺼리겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104150
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc08Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD3"
msgid "You really think you can hide forever?"
msgstr "정말 영원히 숨을 수 있다고 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc08Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD2"
msgid "True. The idea of being on the run for the rest of my life isn't appealing."
msgstr "그렇지. 평생 도망 다니며 산다는 발상은 매력적이지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc08Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD1"
msgid "If I can make it off this planet, I think my chances are pretty good."
msgstr "내가 이 위성을 떠날 수만 있다면, 가능성이 꽤 높다고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc09Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CD0"
msgid "You'd need help out here, and anyone who helps you is at risk."
msgstr "너에겐 도움이 필요하고, 너를 돕는 사람은 누구든 위험에 빠질 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc09Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CCF"
msgid "I've never considered that..."
msgstr "그런 생각은 해본 적이 없는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc09Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CCE"
msgid "We all know the risks, which makes us good at keeping secrets."
msgstr "우리는 모두 위험을 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 능숙하게 비밀을 지킬 줄 알지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc10Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CCD"
msgid "If you stayed, you could help push the changes you want to make."
msgstr "여기 남는다면, 네가 원하는 대로 바뀌도록 도울 수 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc10Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CCC"
msgid "I suppose you have a point."
msgstr "일리가 있는 말이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_Misc10Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "012CCB"
msgid "Wishful thinking. My ideas would be shot down left and right."
msgstr "희망찬 생각이네. 내가 생각한 방안은 마구잡이로 좌절되고 말았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110414A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_ManipulationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CCA"
msgid "You know returning is the right thing to do for your House and Dazra."
msgstr "돌아가는 게 가문과 다즈라를 위해 옳은 일이라는 거 알 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104149
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_ManipulationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC9"
msgid "You're right. It's something I've strongly considered."
msgstr "맞아. 그럴지 심각하게 고려하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104149
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_ManipulationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC8"
msgid "Is it? I would be miserable, and my father would surely never trust me again."
msgstr "그런가? 나는 비참해질 거고, 아버지는 다시는 나를 믿지 않을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104148
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_DiplomatScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC7"
msgid "You're trained for political relationships. You're ready for this."
msgstr "너는 정치적인 관계를 파악할 수 있도록 훈련받았잖아. 너는 준비가 되어 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104147
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_DiplomatScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC6"
msgid "But, can I really make a difference?"
msgstr "하지만 정말 변화시킬 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104147
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_DiplomatScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC5"
msgid "I don't care that I'm ready. I simply don't want it."
msgstr "준비가 되었는지는 중요하지 않아. 그냥 하고 싶지 않다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104146
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_LeadershipScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC4"
msgid "Return home and apply what you've learned when the title of Elder is yours."
msgstr "집으로 돌아가서 장로라는 직책을 맡게 됐을 때 배운 걸 활용해 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104145
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_LeadershipScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC3"
msgid "I hadn't considered that."
msgstr "그런 생각은 해본 적이 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104145
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_LeadershipScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC2"
msgid "But that is what, twenty, maybe thirty years? It's too long."
msgstr "하지만 얼마나 걸릴까? 20년? 아니면 30년? 너무 길어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104144
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_KidStuffScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC1"
msgid "You can't abandon your family. The regret will consume you."
msgstr "가족을 버려서는 안돼. 후회가 너를 집어삼킬걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104143
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_KidStuffScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CC0"
msgid "It already weighs heavily."
msgstr "이미 부담감이 심하긴 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104143
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_KidStuffScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBF"
msgid "Perhaps, but it's a weight I'm willing to carry."
msgstr "그럴지도. 하지만 그 정도 부담감은 기꺼이 감당할 수 있을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104142
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_EnlightenedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBE"
msgid "Return and when you become Elder, you can show your people a better path."
msgstr "돌아가서 장로가 되면, 신민들에게 더 나은 길을 보여줄 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104141
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_EnlightenedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBD"
msgid "It's a long game, but perhaps you're right."
msgstr "오래 걸리겠지만, 어쩌면 네 말이 옳을 수도 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104141
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_EnlightenedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBC"
msgid "By then it may be too late."
msgstr "그렇지만 너무 오래 걸릴 수도 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104140
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_SerpentsEmbraceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBB"
msgid "My presence is proof the Great Serpent watches and demands you fulfill your destiny."
msgstr "내가 여기 있는 것 자체가 위대한 뱀께서 너의 운명을 지켜보고 있다는 증거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_SerpentsEmbraceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CBA"
msgid "Fascinating. I never made that connection."
msgstr "흥미롭네. 나는 그렇게 연관 지어본 적이 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge lose response.  / Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5400_Vaeric_SC_SerpentsEmbraceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB9"
msgid "Have you not been listening? The Great Serpent is merely a tale to keep us in line."
msgstr "내 말 못 들었어? 위대한 뱀은 우리가 규범을 지키게 하기 위한 이야기일 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Egbo: You and me both. &&& Egbo: The worst thing that can possibly happen happens and then he disappears?|I mean, come on, we're supposed to be friends.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, maybe it's not the worst thing, but look around you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB8"
msgid "What's the worst thing that could possibly happen?"
msgstr "일어날 수 있는 최악의 일이라는 게 뭔데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the worst thing that could possibly happen?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's the worst thing that could possibly happen?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB7"
msgid "Okay, maybe it's not the worst thing, but look around you."
msgstr "그래, 진짜 최악은 아닐지도 모르지만, 주변을 둘러 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the worst thing that could possibly happen?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB6"
msgid "It's almost post apocalyptic, so second worst possible thing that could happen."
msgstr "거의 종말에 가까운 상황 아니냐고. 일어날 수 있는 최악에서 두 번째인 셈이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the worst thing that could possibly happen?
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: I'm sure he has good reason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB5"
msgid "Worst thing being if none of us survived at all."
msgstr "최악에서 첫 번째는 아무도 살아남지 못하는 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path. &&& Tane: Oh wow, you really bought in, huh?  &&& Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Tell me about it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB4"
msgid "Nice to see a fellow outsider around here."
msgstr "같은 이방인을 만나서 반갑군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nice to see a fellow outsider around here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nice to see a fellow outsider around here.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB3"
msgid "Tell me about it."
msgstr "나도 동감이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. PROMPT: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me. &&& Irina: Of course, fellow Promised. Please forgive my abruptness.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110413A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CB2"
msgid "Yeah, you hear \"obligated,\" you know it must be House business."
msgstr "그렇지. '의무'라는 말 들었으니 가문 일이라는 것도 아실 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Tane
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Oh this old thing? Well, truth is, I made a deal with Vaeric a while back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104139
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CAE"
msgid "Can you tell me more about your tracker?"
msgstr "추적기에 대해 더 자세히 알려줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: And proud of it.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104137
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CAD"
msgid "I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go."
msgstr "내가 이 인간들 좋으라고 몇 년이나 물건을 왔다 갔다 나르고 다녔는데, 그런데도 가는 곳마다 쌀쌀맞게 굴어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104137
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CAC"
msgid "But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention."
msgstr "그런데 그 인간들이 도시 절반을 잃고 나서 자네를 보더니, 갑자기 신의 중재하심이라고 하지 뭐야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104136
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CAB"
msgid "Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention."
msgstr "저만이 아나스코 바룬의 말을 알아들을 수 있어요. 위대한 뱀께서 중재하신 거라고 확신해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104136
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CAA"
msgid "They've been indoctrinated their whole lives. They've no choice."
msgstr "평생 동안 세뇌당한 사람들이잖아요. 그럴 수밖에 없겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
