#. TOPIC: 01104135
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA9"
msgid "So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure."
msgstr "나도 그리 들었어. 자네한테 뭔가 특별한 게 있는 건 확실해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104135
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "012CA8"
msgid "You said it. I feel sorry for them. Especially for the ones that don't realize there's a whole galaxy they're missing out on."
msgstr "그렇긴 하지. 불쌍한 사람들이야. 특히 저 넓은 은하계를 놓치고 있다는 걸 깨닫지 못하는 사람들 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It sure has, to say the least.
