#. TOPIC: 01104133
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA6"
msgid "It sure has, to say the least."
msgstr "과장 안 보태고 정말 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I don't doubt it. Not that anyone here knows, but in the other circles I run in, you got quite the impressive rep.
