#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I don't doubt it. Not that anyone here knows, but in the other circles I run in, you got quite the impressive rep.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104132
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA4"
msgid "Fame follows me wherever I go."
msgstr "제가 어디를 가든 명성이 따라다니거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA3"
msgid "Well, I don't doubt it. Not that anyone here knows, but in the other circles I run in, you got quite the impressive rep."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 의심할 여지가 없지. 여기 계신 인간들은 모르겠지만, 내가 활동하는 다른 서클에서는 자네가 꽤 인상적인 평판을 얻고 있으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA2"
msgid "You wear that getup everywhere you go, I can see why."
msgstr "가는 곳마다 그런 차림새라니 이유를 알 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
