msgstr "음, 다즈라가 실망시키지 않아 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
