#. TOPIC: 01104131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012CA0"
msgid "Something tells me you aren't kidding."
msgstr "농담하는 건 아닌 것 같구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm used to having a fan club.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104131
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C9F"
msgid "That so? Well, I'm sure anywhere else your reputation would precede you, but sadly, these people here aren't big on news."
msgstr "그런가? 글쎄, 다른 곳에서는 명성이 높을지 모르지만, 서글프게도 여기 사람들은 뉴스에 관심이 많지 않거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey, you play your cards here right, you'll win 'em over.
