#. TOPIC: 01104130
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C9E"
msgid "Well, not everyone's a fan."
msgstr "뭐, 모두가 제 팬인 건 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, not everyone's a fan.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, not everyone's a fan.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110412F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C9D"
msgid "Hey, you play your cards here right, you'll win 'em over."
msgstr "이봐, 카드 패를 잘 내면 상대를 이길 수 있는 법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, not everyone's a fan.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110412F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C9C"
msgid "You've already been dealt a winning hand as it is."
msgstr "자넨 이미 이기는 카드 패를 잡은 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then. &&& Tane: And proud of it. &&& Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.|But then these people lose half their city and you show up, and suddenly it's divine intervention.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yep, that's how I feel most days since I got stuck here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110412E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C9B"
msgid "Yeah, I don't get it either, but here we are."
msgstr "네. 저도 이해가 안 되는데, 어쨌든 이렇게 됐네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, I don't get it either, but here we are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, I don't get it either, but here we are.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Anyway, enough about that. 
