#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C99"
msgid "Why outside of Dazra?"
msgstr "왜 다즈라 외곽에서 만나나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why outside of Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
