#. TOPIC: 0110412B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C98"
msgid "Hey, no way I'm running the risk of getting caught smuggling Vaeric Veth'aal off world."
msgstr "이봐, 절대로 배릭 베타알을 외부 세계로 밀반출하다 들킬 위험을 감수하고 싶진 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Why outside of Dazra?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110412B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C97"
msgid "The moment anyone catches wind of that, I can kiss my life goodbye."
msgstr "누군가 그 사실을 눈치채는 순간, 내 인생에 작별을 고할 수도 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your tracker? &&& Tane: Oh this old thing? Well, truth is, I made a deal with Vaeric a while back.|The guy isn't exactly keen on being cooped up in Dazra. Wants to see what the galaxy has to offer.|So I told him when he's ready, pick a safe spot somewhere outside of Dazra, and I'll go get him.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, Vaeric's a bit of a free thinker. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110412A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C96"
msgid "Vaeric actually wants to leave Va'ruun'kai?"
msgstr "배릭이 정말 바룬카이를 떠나고 싶어 하나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric actually wants to leave Va'ruun'kai?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric actually wants to leave Va'ruun'kai?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
