#. TOPIC: 01104129
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C95"
msgid "Yeah, Vaeric's a bit of a free thinker."
msgstr "그래, 배릭은 자유로운 사상가거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric actually wants to leave Va'ruun'kai?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Why outside of Dazra?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104129
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C94"
msgid "Poor kid appealed to dear old dad on a few occasions, but Viktor's having none of it."
msgstr "불쌍한 아이가 몇 차례 늙은 애비에게 호소했지만, 빅토르는 전혀 듣지 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about your tracker? &&& Tane: Oh this old thing? Well, truth is, I made a deal with Vaeric a while back.|The guy isn't exactly keen on being cooped up in Dazra. Wants to see what the galaxy has to offer.|So I told him when he's ready, pick a safe spot somewhere outside of Dazra, and I'll go get him.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I can't guarantee it, but I've got a hunch.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104128
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C93"
msgid "And he just keeps the tracker on him all the time?"
msgstr "배릭이 추적기를 항상 몸에 지니고 다닌다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And he just keeps the tracker on him all the time?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And he just keeps the tracker on him all the time?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104127
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C92"
msgid "Well, I can't guarantee it, but I've got a hunch."
msgstr "음, 장담할 수는 없지만, 감이 온달까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And he just keeps the tracker on him all the time?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Why outside of Dazra?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104127
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "012C91"
msgid "If he's run off, wouldn't you take the only thing that could help get you off this planet?"
msgstr "도망친다면, 이 위성에서 벗어날 수 있는 유일한 방법을 택하지 않겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know Sirak Veth'aal? &&& MQ_LovekVethaal: Indeed. Sirak was my cousin.|I know they were assigned to the Oracle, and Malibor relayed their final report sent by the station.|They walk with the Great Serpent now.
#. ALIAS: MQ_LovekVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111CBB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Lovek_TL_04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C90"
msgid "I have some other questions."
msgstr "다른 질문이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
