#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have some other questions.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104125
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_TrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C8F"
msgid "Let's hear 'em."
msgstr "들어보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Tane
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: You got it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104123
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TL_TrackerOnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C8E"
msgid "Let's turn the tracker back on and get back to finding Vaeric."
msgstr "신호기를 다시 켜고 배릭을 찾아보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's turn the tracker back on and get back to finding Vaeric.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104122
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TL_TrackerOnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C8D"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Tane
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Sure thing. Just say the word, and we're back on the hunt.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104120
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TL_TrackerOffScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C8C"
msgid "Can we give that tracker a rest?"
msgstr "추적기를 좀 쉬게 해주면 안 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we give that tracker a rest?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110411F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TL_TrackerOffScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
