msgid "Sure thing. Just say the word, and we're back on the hunt."
msgstr "그러자고. 말만 해. 그때 다시 추적을 시작하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Tane
#. PROMPT: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Of course, fellow Promised. Please forgive my abruptness. &&& Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110411E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C8A"
msgid "Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve."
msgstr "그럼요, 형제님. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Tane
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I wish I knew, but we never discussed it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110411D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericLocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C89"
msgid "Any idea where Vaeric might be?"
msgstr "배릭이 어디 있을지 짐작 가세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Any idea where Vaeric might be?
