msgid "I wish I knew, but we never discussed it."
msgstr "나도 알고 싶지만, 그건 논의한 적이 없어서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Puzzled
