#. TOPIC: 010D2476
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D24BA
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "012C87"
msgid "I will attempt to regain sensor contact with the enemy."
msgstr "다시 센서를 조정해 적 신호 탐지 작업을 시도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110411C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2000_Tane_TL_VaericLocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C86"
msgid "He's probably holed up somewhere out of sight or far enough from Dazra, no one would think to look."
msgstr "배릭은 아마도 다즈라가 보이지 않는 곳에 숨어 있거나, 아무도 찾지 않을 만큼 먼 곳에 숨어 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Crestfallen. She knows this mistake could cost them their lives. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago. &&& Tane: That's gotta be Vaeric.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I need to know where Vaeric went.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104119
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C85"
msgid "It's too coincidental. It must have been him."
msgstr "기막힌 우연이네요. 그 사람이 틀림없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to know where Vaeric went. &&& Irina: We sent him north. &&& Irina: There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of.|He claimed he lost everything in the incident that swallowed half of Dazra. He wanted to start a new life.|We even gave him two of our own groats to get started.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great Serpent forgive my foolishness, but I trusted him instantly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104118
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C84"
msgid "You weren't suspicious of him at all?"
msgstr "전혀 의심하지 않았다는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default, Tane
#. PROMPT: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Great Serpent forgive my foolishness, but I trusted him instantly.|I saw so much of our own son, Cas, in him, that I didn't doubt nor question.|I allowed him his privacy in what I thought was a time of great need and grief.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104115
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C83"
msgid "It was only when you made it known that this was House business that I realized my mistake."
msgstr "당신이 와서 이게 가문 일이라는 걸 알려주고 나서야 제 실수를 깨달은 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default, Tane
#. PROMPT: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Great Serpent forgive my foolishness, but I trusted him instantly.|I saw so much of our own son, Cas, in him, that I didn't doubt nor question.|I allowed him his privacy in what I thought was a time of great need and grief.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104115
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C82"
msgid "It's only now that you've come looking for him that I've made the connection."
msgstr "당신이 그 젊은이를 찾으러 온 뒤에야 연관 관계를 알게 된 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You know if I discover you're lying, I'm authorized to kill you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You know if I discover you're lying, I'm authorized to kill you.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C81"
msgid "Wow are you serious with these threats?"
msgstr "와, 그 협박 진심으로 하는 소리야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You know if I discover you're lying, I'm authorized to kill you.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: They merely speak the truth. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C80"
msgid "These are simple farmers you're dealing with, not criminals."
msgstr "지금 이 사람들은 그냥 농부야. 범죄자가 아니라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Irina
#. PROMPT: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal. &&& Irina: House Veth'aal's heir? |It makes sense now.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: I -- yes. I believe we did.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0110410E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C7F"
msgid "You've seen him? You saw Vaeric?"
msgstr "본 적 있는 거요? 배릭을 본 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Tane
#. PROMPT: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: House Veth'aal's heir? |It makes sense now. &&& Tane: You've seen him? You saw Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104109
