#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C5A"
msgid "You realize you were going to help a traitor?"
msgstr "반역자를 도우려 했다는 걸 알고 계셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "realized" since he's tossing that word back at the player. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You realize you were going to help a traitor?
