#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C57"
msgid "I needed Vaeric to get far enough away from Dazra so I could safely pick him up and get him out of here."
msgstr "배릭이 다즈라에서 충분히 멀리 떨어진 곳에 있게 해야 했어. 배릭이 안전하게 바룬카이에서 빠져나가게 하려면 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: I like to call it looking out for a friend.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C56"
msgid "I lost my ship to the incident, so I didn't want Vaeric running off thinking I could just grab him and go."
msgstr "그 사고 때문에 내 우주선을 날려 먹었는지라, 배릭이 나랑 같이 떠날 수 있겠다고 생각하고서 도망쳐 버리면 안 되는 거였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C55"
msgid "I was also out all the credits he was going to pay me, that's where you came in."
msgstr "거기다 받기로 한 크레딧은 한 푼도 못 받고 있었는데, 그때 자네가 나타난 거야."

