#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C53"
msgid "So now you know my true intentions for leaving, and given the circumstances, I may be here for some time."
msgstr "이제 내가 떠나려는 진짜 이유를 알았겠지. 상황을 보아하니, 당분간은 여기 있어야 할지도 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, you need to return to your duty as House Veth'aal's heir.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C52"
msgid "My hope now is to make the best of it here."
msgstr "지금 바라는 건 그냥 여기서 최선을 다하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: He didn't realize the player was going to start threatening people and maybe even killing them. / Concerned / to Player Default
