#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C51"
msgid "I didn't realize it was going to turn into a whole thing."
msgstr "일이 이렇게까지 커질 줄은 전혀 몰랐지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Having nurturing, supportive parents makes a world of difference. &&& Vaeric: You sound as if you speak from experience. I envy you.|Sometimes I would give anything for a supportive word from my father. &&& Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with. &&& Tane: The credits helped, too, but yeah. We talked about this briefly a while back already, but there's a bit more to it.
