#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C50"
msgid "All this time you were continuing to aid the traitor."
msgstr "지금까지 계속 반역자를 돕고 있었던 거군요."

