msgctxt "012C4F"
msgid "I like to call it looking out for a friend."
msgstr "난 친구를 챙겨준 거라고 하고 싶군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: No, I can't go back. I want nothing to do with that life. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C4E"
msgid "All right. I concede. I can see how I may have acted abruptly."
msgstr "알았어. 돌아갈게. 너무 돌발행동을 저질렀던 거 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C4D"
msgid "Vashti's death, so much devastation, so much loss."
msgstr "바슈티의 죽음, 엄청난 충격, 엄청난 상실감."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He'll take you back. Family is everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C4C"
msgid "But will my father even take me back?"
msgstr "하지만 아버지가 나를 다시 받아주실까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: No, I can't go back. I want nothing to do with that life. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C4B"
msgid "As I said, there's nothing you could say to make me go back."
msgstr "말했지만, 암만 말해봤자 난 안 돌아가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: You need to return home to your responsibilities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C4A"
msgid "Please, all I want is to make my own life. To have my own freedom."
msgstr "제발, 그냥 내 삶을 살고 싶을 뿐이란 말이야. 나만의 자유를 얻을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic at last. Prepare to be made dust for your blasphemy. &&& Vaeric: So it's official. Heretic it is then. &&& Vaeric: I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist.|But since I have your attention, allow me to plead my case.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C49"
msgid "You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed."
msgstr "말해도 되지만, 내 마음이 흔들리진 않을 테니 그리 알라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C48"
msgid "If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do."
msgstr "네 사명감에 호소할 수 없다면, 동정심에라도 호소해 봐야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House. &&& Tane: They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing... &&& companion: This is how the Houses operate. Manipulation at its best. &&& Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.|His pride and the fear of what it would mean for House Veth'aal is all he cares about.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But it should matter.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C47"
msgid "It matters not what you want. We do what the Great Serpent requires of us."
msgstr "네가 원하냐 마냐는 중요하지 않아. 우리는 위대한 뱀께서 요구하시는 대로 할 뿐이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It matters not what you want. We do what the Great Serpent requires of us.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It matters not what you want. We do what the Great Serpent requires of us.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C46"
msgid "But it should matter."
msgstr "중요해야 하는 문제라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, you need to return to your duty as House Veth'aal's heir. &&& Vaeric: I can't do that. &&& Vaeric: The truth is, the Scaled Citadel was the last straw.|My people are so blinded by faith and politics, they don't see how it's destroying us. |Anasko Va'ruun eliminated half our population in the blink of an eye, my sister, Vashti, among them.|I could no longer live in a society that won't put its people first, that would destroy itself in the name of a god that has done nothing for us.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I don't think you've been picking up what he's putting down.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C45"
msgid "Such heresy. You have been misled, brother, and must seek His guidance."
msgstr "이런 이단자를 봤나. 잘못된 길로 들어선 거야, 형제님. 그분의 인도를 구해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Such heresy. You have been misled, brother, and must seek His guidance.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Such heresy. You have been misled, brother, and must seek His guidance.
