msgid "I don't think you've been picking up what he's putting down."
msgstr "배릭이 뭘 내려놓은 건지 이해하지 못한 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Such heresy. You have been misled, brother, and must seek His guidance.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C43"
msgid "Vaeric's done with that life."
msgstr "배릭은 그런 삶을 끝내기로 한 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Such heresy. You have been misled, brother, and must seek His guidance.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I hope you can see why I want to walk away from all this... to start my own life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C42"
msgid "He's not going to turn to a god that may've wiped out half his city or support a people that are a danger to themselves."
msgstr "배릭은 도시의 절반을 쓸어버킨 신에게 귀의하거나, 자신을 위험에 빠트린 신민을 돕지는 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The results of House Va'ruun's religious hubris. &&& Tane: You think they're related to the Scaled Citadel? &&& Tane: Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these.  &&& Tane: At least I don't see a body around here so I hope that means Vaeric's alive.|You find anything?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, I figured as much. At least his body wasn't attached to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 011040C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C41"
msgid "Vaeric's tracker is still here. He left in a hurry."
msgstr "배릭의 추적기가 아직 여기 있어요. 서둘러 떠났나 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
