msgstr "그래, 이제 알겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Said through clenched teeth. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, try being a real father for once.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, try being a real father for once.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Father, I have returned out of love and support for you and House Veth'aal. 
