#. TOPIC: 010596D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C30"
msgid "I have been nothing but a real father to this boy..."
msgstr "난 언제나 이 아이의 진짜 아버지였단 말이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2F"
msgid "Losing Vashti... so much devastation... I feared we devoted ourselves blindly to a path that would lead to our end."
msgstr "바슈티를 잃고... 너무 큰 충격을 받았어요... 우리가 맹목적으로 종말에 이르는 길에 헌신하는 게 두려웠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You put too much pressure on him and he broke.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You put too much pressure on him and he broke.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2E"
msgid "Vaeric was raised to handle pressure. As my heir, he is more than familiar with it."
msgstr "배릭이 압박감을 참도록 길렀다. 내 후계자로서, 누구보다도 압박감에 익숙한 아이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You put too much pressure on him and he broke.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2D"
msgid "But grief and loss are different. I realize the effects are profound and consuming."
msgstr "하지만 슬픔과 상실은 다르지. 그 영향은 극심하고 사무친다는 거로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You put too much pressure on him and he broke.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2C"
msgid "And for one as privileged as Vaeric, to think before the cataclysm, the last time Vaeric experienced loss was sacrificing his ceremonial groat."
msgstr ""
"그리고 배릭처럼 특권을 누리던 아이에게는, 대재난이 일어나기 전 마지막으로 경험한 상실이 의식용 그로트를 희생시키는 것뿐이었으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your son needed a father, not the House Elder.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your son needed a father, not the House Elder.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2B"
msgid "My responsibilities are far greater than being a simple parent."
msgstr "내 책임은 단순히 부모가 되는 것보다 훨씬 더 큰 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your son needed a father, not the House Elder.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C2A"
msgid "I did what I could to the best of my ability."
msgstr "나는 내 능력을 다해서 최선을 다했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This is a new beginning for both of you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This is a new beginning for both of you.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: With Vitoria and Luther at our side.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C29"
msgid "Yes, and I know the Great Serpent shall guide us."
msgstr "그래. 그리고 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 인도해 주실 것을 안다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And now you have a second chance at being a father. &&& Viktor: You are quite right. Great Serpent knows I have room for improvement, and I can and will do better.  &&& Viktor: Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Something both my sister and husband have been saying for quite some time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C28"
msgid "You both need to work on your communication skills."
msgstr "두 사람 다 소통 능력을 좀 키워야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
