#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You both need to work on your communication skills.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: And Vashti as well. 
