msgid "Something both my sister and husband have been saying for quite some time."
msgstr "내 여동생과 남편이 꽤 오랫동안 해 왔던 말이로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Now, if you all will excuse us...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
