msgctxt "012C01"
msgid "This is sounding more like a House matter to me, and who am I to stand in the way?"
msgstr "들어 보니 가문 문제인 것 같은데, 내가 무슨 자격으로 방해하겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: All right. Fine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045529
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012C00"
msgid "I'm sorry, but when it comes to House business, I stay as far away as possible."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 가문 일이 엮였을 때는 최대한 거리를 두려고 해서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
