#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012BFF"
msgid "If he owes you a drink, you know I wish I could, but I'm afraid I just can't help you."
msgstr "술 한잔 빚졌다고 하시니 도와드리고는 싶은데, 못 도와드려서 죄송하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
