msgid "You being a friend of his, I wish I did, but I'm afraid I just can't help you."
msgstr "그분 친구이시니 도와드리고 싶은데, 못 도와드려서 죄송하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012BFD"
msgid "So what if I did? Like I said, he doesn't want to be found."
msgstr "알아냈으면 뭐? 아까도 말했지만, 누가 찾길 바라지 않는다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you. &&& Bianca: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am. &&& Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?|I've searched all of Dazra for him, but he's gone. Couldn't even leave a note.|That means he either doesn't want to be found or... well, I prefer not to think about it.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm. Perhaps the Great Serpent really does hear prayers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012BFC"
msgid "Look, I can find him. I'm just hoping you can save me some time."
msgstr "이봐, 내 힘으로 찾을 수도 있어. 그냥 시간 낭비 안 하게 해줬으면 좋겠다 이 말이야."

