msgstr "다른 사람들에게는 네가 개인적인 이유로 배릭을 찾는다고만 해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012BEF"
msgid "Great Serpent forgive my foolishness, but I trusted him instantly."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 제 어리석음을 용서하시길. 전 완전히 믿었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
