msgid "I saw so much of our own son, Cas, in him, that I didn't doubt nor question."
msgstr "그 젊은이를 보고 우리 아들 캐스가 많이 생각나서, 의심하거나 의문을 품지 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You weren't suspicious of him at all? 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: It was only when you made it known that this was House business that I realized my mistake.
