#. TOPIC: 01104117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012BED"
msgid "I allowed him his privacy in what I thought was a time of great need and grief."
msgstr "너무 크게 슬퍼하는 것 같길래 혼자 있을 수 있게 해준 거라고요."

