msgid "Just get it over with."
msgstr "그냥 빨리 끝내세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA7"
msgid "Can't believe the girl gave 'em up."
msgstr "그 여자가 포기했다니 믿을 수가 없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA6"
msgid "Don't to anything rash now."
msgstr "지금은 섣부르게 판단하지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_4600_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA5"
msgid "We can use the journal to get info and then just leave these people be."
msgstr "일기에서 정보를 얻은 다음에는 그냥 이 사람들을 내버려두고 가자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA4"
msgid "Hoping this is the last stop. My legs can't take much more."
msgstr "여기가 마지막 목적지였으면 좋겠군. 다리가 아파서 더 이상 못 버티겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA3"
msgid "Good to know Vaeric got some help."
msgstr "배릭이 도움을 받았다니 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
