msgid "Let's hope Vaeric's still there."
msgstr "배릭이 아직 거기 있길 바라자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed nice people for helping Vaeric. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
