msgid "Don't even know why I'm still here."
msgstr "내가 왜 여기 있는 건지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed nice people for helping Vaeric. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012BA0"
msgid "What a mess. And to think I helped lead you there."
msgstr "정말 엉망진창이네. 나 때문에 자네가 여기까지 오게 된 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed nice people for helping Vaeric. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B9F"
msgid "Let's just get to Vaeric so we can part ways."
msgstr "이제 배릭을 찾은 뒤에, 각자 갈 길 가자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
