#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5000_Irina_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B9E"
msgid "I hope Vaeric found the place adequate."
msgstr "배릭 씨가 적절한 곳을 찾았으면 좋겠네요."

