#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5100_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B8E"
msgid "Let's hope Vaeric's home."
msgstr "배릭이 집에 있으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5100_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B8D"
msgid "Tag me in when you're done in there. I figured you'd want to speak in private first."
msgstr "저기서 일을 다 보면 뒷일을 도울게. 먼저 개인적으로 얘기하고 싶을 것 같아서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5100_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B8C"
msgid "Oh and try not to get too trigger happy in there if you see him. I'd like the chance to talk to him first."
msgstr "그리고 배릭를 만날 때 너무 총부터 갈기려고 하지 마. 먼저 얘기할 기회를 줬으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
