msgstr "말해도 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
