msgid "This is what you've been waiting for."
msgstr "자네가 기다리던 바로 그 순간이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
