msgid "Just try to stay cool here."
msgstr "침착해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B87"
msgid "Just want to do a little catching up before heading back."
msgstr "돌아가기 전에 잠깐 만나고 싶어서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B86"
msgid "Remember to find me at the Herald's Rest once you've finished your business."
msgstr "볼일이 끝나면 전령의 안식처에서 날 찾으라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B85"
msgid "You made the right choice. Don't you forget it."
msgstr "넌 올바른 선택을 한 거야. 그걸 잊지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B84"
msgid "I'm too old for this. I'm heading back to the Herald's Rest. I need a drink."
msgstr "난 이 일을 하기엔 너무 늙었어. 전령의 안식처로 돌아가야지. 한잔해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B83"
msgid "You killed a good man back there."
msgstr "넌 좋은 사람을 죽였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B82"
msgid "Hope Genna kept a spot for me at the bar."
msgstr "제나가 바에서 제 자리를 지켜줬으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B81"
msgid "I'm going to hang back here with Vaeric. Help him pack up."
msgstr "난 배릭이랑 여기 있을게. 배릭 짐 싸는 거나 도와줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B80"
msgid "Can't believe you convinced him to head back home to daddy."
msgstr "아버지에테 돌아가라고 설득했다니 믿을 수가 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_TaneHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7F"
msgid "Don't forget to find me at the Herald's Rest once you all are done at House Veth'aal."
msgstr "모두 베타알 가문 일을 마치면 전령의 안식처에서 나 찾는 거 잊지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7E"
msgid "Thank you for honoring my freedom."
msgstr "내 자유를 존중해 줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7D"
msgid "I have literally no experience being a groat farmer, but I'm going to try my best."
msgstr "진짜 그로트 목장을 꾸려 본 경험은 없지만, 최선을 다해 노력할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7C"
msgid "I owe you my life in more ways than one."
msgstr "여러모로 신세를 졌네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7B"
msgid "Thank you for showing me the error of my ways."
msgstr "내 잘못을 알려줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B7A"
msgid "I pray my father will be as understanding as you."
msgstr "우리 아버지도 너처럼 이해심이 많아지길 기도해야겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01104110
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_VaericHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012B79"
msgid "I'll be a long shortly."
msgstr "잠시만 기다려줘."

