msgstr "평화로우면서 보람도 있는 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_FarmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B75"
msgid "We treat our groats with kindness and respect, and in return, they provide us with food, milk, and companionship."
msgstr "우리가 그로트를 친절과 존중을 담아서 대하면, 그로트는 그 보답으로 음식, 젖, 거기다 우정까지 제공해 줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_FarmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B74"
msgid "The time for slaughter is heartbreaking which is why we ensure them the best life before their sacrifice."
msgstr "도축할 때가 되면 너무나 가슴아픈지라, 희생당하기 전에 최고의 시간을 보장해준답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Irina
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Yes, Casmir, or Cas as we call him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_CasScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B73"
msgid "You mentioned you have a son?"
msgstr "아들이 있다고 하셨죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned you have a son?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_CasScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B72"
msgid "Yes, Casmir, or Cas as we call him."
msgstr "네. 캐스미어요. 우린 캐스라고 불렀죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_CasScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B71"
msgid "He left for Dazra before the incident. The life of a groat farmer didn't appeal to him."
msgstr "사고 나기 전에 다즈라로 떠났어요. 그로트 사육사로 살기 싫어했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_CasScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B70"
msgid "We haven't heard from him since and believe him to be at the Serpent's side."
msgstr "그 뒤로는 소식이 없어서, 이제 위대한 뱀의 곁으로 갔다고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Irina
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: We enjoy the isolation. The city life has never appealed to us. We prefer the peace and quiet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_IsolatedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6F"
msgid "Is it hard being so far from the city?"
msgstr "도시에서 이렇게 멀리 떨어져 있으면 힘들지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it hard being so far from the city?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_IsolatedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6E"
msgid "We enjoy the isolation. The city life has never appealed to us. We prefer the peace and quiet."
msgstr "우린 외따로 사는 생활을 즐겨요. 도시 생활은 안 끌리더라고요. 평화롭고 조용한 게 좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_IsolatedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6D"
msgid "We only go in for that which we cannot provide ourselves: mechanical parts, tools..."
msgstr "도시엔 우리가 직접 못 만드는 걸 구할 때만 가죠. 기계 부품이라던가, 도구라던가..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_IsolatedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6C"
msgid "Sadly, we never made it there to visit our son."
msgstr "슬프지만, 우리 아들을 만나러 가지는 못했네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Irina
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: We saw him quite a bit at first.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6B"
msgid "Do you ever see Vaeric?"
msgstr "그 이후로 배릭을 본 적이 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you ever see Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B6A"
msgid "We saw him quite a bit at first."
msgstr "처음엔 꽤 자주 왔었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B69"
msgid "He was deeply apologetic for any trouble he may have caused us."
msgstr "자기가 우리한테 폐를 끼쳤다면서 깊이 사과하더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVLC13IrinasFarm
#. TOPIC: 011040C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Irina_TL_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B68"
msgid "The boy also knows nothing of groat farming. Luckily, Mila's taken an interest in him and helps him out from time to time."
msgstr "거기다 그로트 사육에 대해선 하나도 모르는 거 있죠. 다행히 밀라가 그 애한테 관심이 있어서 가끔씩 도와주고 있어요."

