msgstr "위대한 뱀의 평화가 함께하길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102BAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage503_AnaskoReactorRoomScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B21"
msgid "We did not anticipate that we might have erred in our recreation of the Vortex Interlock, or that we could overload it."
msgstr "우리는 볼텍스 제어장치를 개조하는 과정에서 오류가 생기거나 과부하가 걸릴 수 있다는 점을 예상하지 못했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 011025EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage501_AnaskoReactorRoomScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B20"
msgid "As I said, a new Vortex Interlock is needed. The reactor must be stabilized before we can proceed."
msgstr "내가 말했듯이, 새로운 볼텍스 제어장치가 필요하다. 작업을 진행하기 전에 원자로를 안정화해야 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: What other choice do we have?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1F"
msgid "You really want to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Wage war on the Settled Systems?"
msgstr "정말로 뱀의 성전을 다시 시작하려는 겁니까? 개척 성계와 전쟁을 벌인다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really want to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Wage war on the Settled Systems?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1E"
msgid "What other choice do we have?"
msgstr "다른 선택지가 또 있더냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Surely you can see that I am unable, or else I would have done it by now.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_WhyMe
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1D"
msgid "And I think it fitting, that the Great Serpent has led you this far, to now allow you to be the one to restore House Va'ruun to greatness."
msgstr "그리고 위대한 뱀께서 널 여기까지 이끌어 주셨고, 바룬 가문의 위대함을 되살리게 해 주셨으니 네가 적임자라고 생각한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Surely you can see that I am unable, or else I would have done it by now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_WhyMe
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1C"
msgid "Why do I have to be the one to do this?"
msgstr "이 일을 왜 내가 해야 한다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do I have to be the one to do this?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: And I think it fitting, that the Great Serpent has led you this far, to now allow you to be the one to restore House Va'ruun to greatness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_WhyMe
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1B"
msgid "Surely you can see that I am unable, or else I would have done it by now."
msgstr "나는 못 한다는 게 뻔히 보이지 않느냐. 안 그랬으면 벌써 내가 했겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really want to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Wage war on the Settled Systems? &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect? &&& Anasko: By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent. &&& Anasko: And none will ever again dare mock or belittle us.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They deserve nothing less for rejecting the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102527
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B1A"
msgid "It would be good to watch the Settled Systems burn."
msgstr "개척 성계가 불타는 모습을 보는 것도 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would be good to watch the Settled Systems burn.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It would be good to watch the Settled Systems burn.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102526
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B19"
msgid "They deserve nothing less for rejecting the Great Serpent."
msgstr "놈들은 위대한 뱀을 거부한 대가를 치러야 마땅하느니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: What other choice do we have?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B18"
msgid "The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect?"
msgstr "이교도와 이단자들은 이미 우리 존재 자체를 혐오한다. 그 생각에 맞춰주지 않을 이유가 뭐냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really want to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Wage war on the Settled Systems? &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect? &&& Anasko: By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent. &&& Anasko: And none will ever again dare mock or belittle us.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Peace? You think House Va'ruun has known peace? We suffer, each and every day. This will restore the balance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B17"
msgid "You'll throw away years of peace."
msgstr "오래 이어진 평화가 깨질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't there some other way?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Isn't there some other way?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B16"
msgid "Why would we reject the perfect opportunity, when the Great Serpent has so clearly placed it within our grasp?"
msgstr "어찌 이리도 완벽한 기회를 거부하느냐? 위대한 뱀께서 우리 손아귀에 쥐어주신 게 분명한 기회를?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't there some other way?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B15"
msgid "He calls us to act, and we must answer that call!"
msgstr "그분께서 행하라 하시면, 우리는 부름에 답해야 한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really want to restart the Serpent's Crusade? Wage war on the Settled Systems? &&& ...  &&& Anasko: The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect? &&& Anasko: By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent. &&& Anasko: And none will ever again dare mock or belittle us.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would we reject the perfect opportunity, when the Great Serpent has so clearly placed it within our grasp?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102529
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B14"
msgid "Isn't there some other way?"
msgstr "다른 방법이 있지 않을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The heathens and heretics loathe our very existence already. Why not be what they expect?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: And none will ever again dare mock or belittle us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B13"
msgid "By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent."
msgstr "지난 바룬께서 시작하신 일을 마무리함으로써, 위대한 뱀의 길을 예비하는 우리의 의무를 다하는 것이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: By finishing what Jinan Va'ruun started, we fulfill our duty to prepare the way for the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You'll throw away years of peace.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B12"
msgid "And none will ever again dare mock or belittle us."
msgstr "그 누구도 우리를 조롱하거나 비하하지 못하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll throw away years of peace.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll throw away years of peace.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110252A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Anasko_TL_PodRoom_RestartCrusade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B11"
msgid "Peace? You think House Va'ruun has known peace? We suffer, each and every day. This will restore the balance."
msgstr "평화? 바룬 가문이 평화를 아는 줄 알았느냐? 우리는 하루하루 고통 받고 있다. 이제 균형을 되찾을 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default, HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: Hmmph, I am grateful for these opportunities to remember her, but to be honest, words can never do her justice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B10"
msgid "I'd like to hear more about your wife, if you're ready."
msgstr "당신 아내에 대해 더 듣고 싶어요, 준비되셨다면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reminiscent, glad to have the opportunity to remember her and talk about her  / Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to hear more about your wife, if you're ready.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0F"
msgid "Hmmph, I am grateful for these opportunities to remember her, but to be honest, words can never do her justice."
msgstr "흠, 아내를 기억할 기회를 만들어 줘서 고맙지만, 솔직히 말로는 아내를 온전히 표현할 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0E"
msgid "Heh, her family did not like me. They said I was a dead end, not fit to be a husband or a father. They had a husband already picked out for Mira, but she would not hear it."
msgstr ""
"허, 그쪽 가문은 제가 맘에 안 들었나 봐요. 절 보고 장래성도 없고, 남편이나 아버지로는 어울리지도 않는다고 했죠. 그쪽에서는 미라에게 "
"이미 남편감을 골라 놨다고 했지만, 미라는 들은 척도 안 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0D"
msgid "She was just so supportive. She did not care what anyone, much less her family, thought about me. She just loved me, I loved her, and that was the end of it."
msgstr ""
"미라는 절 정말 지지해 줬어요. 다른 사람, 심지어 자기 가족이 저에 대해 어떻게 생각하는지 신경도 안 썼죠. 그냥 절 사랑했고, 저도 "
"미라를 사랑했고, 그걸로 끝이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0C"
msgid "I knew I loved her since we were children, really. She was my neighbor, and I would do anything to get her attention. But, I honestly did not think I would ever actually be so lucky to marry her."
msgstr ""
"사실, 어렸을 때부터 미라를 사랑한다는 걸 알고 있었어요. 미라는 제 이웃이었고, 관심을 끌기 위해 뭐든지 했죠. 하지만, 솔직히 미라와 "
"결혼할 만큼 운이 좋을 거라고는 생각도 못 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sorry for your loss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0B"
msgid "*Sigh* I just cannot believe she is gone."
msgstr "*한숨* 그냥 미라가 떠났다는 게 믿기지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to hear more about your wife, if you're ready. &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: Hmmph, I am grateful for these opportunities to remember her, but to be honest, words can never do her justice.|Heh, her family did not like me. They said I was a dead end, not fit to be a husband or a father. They had a husband already picked out for Mira, but she would not hear it. |She was just so supportive. She did not care what anyone, much less her family, thought about me. She just loved me, I loved her, and that was the end of it. |I knew I loved her since we were children, really. She was my neighbor, and I would do anything to get her attention. But, I honestly did not think I would ever actually be so lucky to marry her. |*Sigh* I just cannot believe she is gone. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. Really, thank you. And thank you, again, for letting me tell you about her. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110316A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B0A"
msgid "Sorry for your loss."
msgstr "삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to hear more about your wife, if you're ready. &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: Hmmph, I am grateful for these opportunities to remember her, but to be honest, words can never do her justice.|Heh, her family did not like me. They said I was a dead end, not fit to be a husband or a father. They had a husband already picked out for Mira, but she would not hear it. |She was just so supportive. She did not care what anyone, much less her family, thought about me. She just loved me, I loved her, and that was the end of it. |I knew I loved her since we were children, really. She was my neighbor, and I would do anything to get her attention. But, I honestly did not think I would ever actually be so lucky to marry her. |*Sigh* I just cannot believe she is gone. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* Perhaps, but she was the most important person in the world to me. I feel like it would be a disservice to move on. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103168
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B09"
msgid "As hard as it may be, I think she would want you to move on."
msgstr "힘드시겠지만, 그분은 당신이 딛고 나아가길 바라실 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: composing himself / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry for your loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sorry for your loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103169
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B08"
msgid "Thank you. Really, thank you. And thank you, again, for letting me tell you about her."
msgstr "고마워요. 정말, 고마워요. 아내에 대해 이야기할 수 있게 해 줘서 다시 한번 고마워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry for your loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103169
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B07"
msgid "I could talk about her for a million years, and never even scratch the surface of how amazing she was."
msgstr "아내에 대해 백만 년 동안 이야기해도, 아내가 얼마나 대단했는지 표현하는데 발끝에도 미치지 못할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you so knowledgeable about ships from the Settled Systems?  &&& HVDazraDumarHasadi: Hmm, about that... |My father was a technician far outside of Dazra. Growing up, I would help him repair or strip all of the ships that were being delivered to him. Delivered by Zealots.|The ships were incredible. Deimos, Stroud-Eklund, even HopeTech. It was so exciting to work on them. But, now I just feel dirty, knowing where those ships came from, what had to be done to acquire them.|When I grew older, I came to my senses, grew a conscience, and abandoned my father. I thank the Great Serpent that I managed to avoid that life.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, no, not in Dazra, at least. From time to time, our connections are able to deliver an outsider ship. They are very rare though, and the times I get to work on one are very few and far between.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110311B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B06"
msgid "Are all Settled Systems ships delivered by Zealots?"
msgstr "개척 성계 우주선은 전부 광신도가 운반해 오나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: composing himself. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As hard as it may be, I think she would want you to move on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As hard as it may be, I think she would want you to move on.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103167
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B05"
msgid "*Sigh* Perhaps, but she was the most important person in the world to me. I feel like it would be a disservice to move on."
msgstr ""
"*한숨* 그럴지도 모르지만, 아내는 나에게 세상에서 가장 중요한 사람이었어요. 딛고 나아간다는 건 아내를 욕되게 하는 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As hard as it may be, I think she would want you to move on.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103167
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B04"
msgid "If it means being sad for the rest of my life, to have a black hole eating away at me... so be it. That is how I remember her, because she was that important."
msgstr ""
"남은 평생 슬픔에 잠겨, 제 안의 블랙홀이 절 갉아먹더라도... 괜찮아요. 그게 아내를 기억하는 방법이니까, 아내는 그만큼 중요한 "
"사람이었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are all Settled Systems ships delivered by Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are all Settled Systems ships delivered by Zealots?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraDumarHasadi: That must have been a hard choice to make. I'm glad it worked out for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110311A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B03"
msgid "Oh, no, not in Dazra, at least. From time to time, our connections are able to deliver an outsider ship. They are very rare though, and the times I get to work on one are very few and far between."
msgstr ""
"아, 아니요, 적어도 다즈라에서는 아니에요. 가끔, 우리 연줄로 이방인의 우주선을 받을 수 있어요. 아주 드물긴 하지만, 내가 그런 "
"우주선을 작업할 기회는 정말 손에 꼽을 정도죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you so knowledgeable about ships from the Settled Systems?  &&& HVDazraDumarHasadi: Hmm, about that... |My father was a technician far outside of Dazra. Growing up, I would help him repair or strip all of the ships that were being delivered to him. Delivered by Zealots.|The ships were incredible. Deimos, Stroud-Eklund, even HopeTech. It was so exciting to work on them. But, now I just feel dirty, knowing where those ships came from, what had to be done to acquire them.|When I grew older, I came to my senses, grew a conscience, and abandoned my father. I thank the Great Serpent that I managed to avoid that life.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He was, but it was blood money, and I wanted no part in that. I figured it was better to work on ships that would not tear at my conscience. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103119
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B02"
msgid "I would've kept your old job. Your father was probably rolling in credits."
msgstr "나라면 예전 일을 계속했을 거예요. 아버지가 크레딧을 꽤 많이 버셨을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I would've kept your old job. Your father was probably rolling in credits.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would've kept your old job. Your father was probably rolling in credits.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103118
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B01"
msgid "He was, but it was blood money, and I wanted no part in that. I figured it was better to work on ships that would not tear at my conscience."
msgstr ""
"많이 버셨지만, 그건 피 묻은 돈이었고, 난 그런 일에 관여하고 싶지 않았어. 양심에 찔리지 않을 우주선을 작업하는 게 낫다고 생각했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103158
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012B00"
msgid "This is what I have."
msgstr "여기 제가 파는 상품들입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012AFF"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "물론."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103158
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AFE"
msgid "Let me know if anything sounds good."
msgstr "좋은 소식이 있으면 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103158
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AFD"
msgid "All right, take a look."
msgstr "자, 한번 구경하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That must have been a hard choice to make. I'm glad it worked out for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That must have been a hard choice to make. I'm glad it worked out for you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103116
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AFC"
msgid "Thank you. It is moments like these that I know I made the right choice."
msgstr "고마워요. 내가 옳은 선택을 했다는 걸 알게 되는 이런 순간들이 있기에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about the disaster?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AFB"
msgid "Exhausted, drained, hopeless."
msgstr "지쳤고, 기력이 없고, 절망적이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AFA"
msgid "I am not sure what brought this disaster upon us, whether it was the Great Serpent's wrath, or a horrible accident, or something else."
msgstr "이 재앙이 왜 닥쳤는지 모르겠어. 위대한 뱀의 분노인지, 끔찍한 사고인지, 아니면 다른 무언가인지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF9"
msgid "But, what I do know is that these people who are suffering... they did not deserve any of this."
msgstr "하지만, 이것만은 알아. 고통받는 이 사람들... 그들은 이런 일을 겪을 이유가 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraGennaDubari
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraGennaDubari: This is what I have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103115
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_Sale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF8"
msgid "I'd like to see what you have for sale."
msgstr "뭐 파는 거 있는지 보고 싶은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you so knowledgeable about ships from the Settled Systems?  &&& HVDazraDumarHasadi: Hmm, about that... |My father was a technician far outside of Dazra. Growing up, I would help him repair or strip all of the ships that were being delivered to him. Delivered by Zealots.|The ships were incredible. Deimos, Stroud-Eklund, even HopeTech. It was so exciting to work on them. But, now I just feel dirty, knowing where those ships came from, what had to be done to acquire them.|When I grew older, I came to my senses, grew a conscience, and abandoned my father. I thank the Great Serpent that I managed to avoid that life.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. It is moments like these that I know I made the right choice. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF7"
msgid "That must have been a hard choice to make. I'm glad it worked out for you."
msgstr "힘든 선택이었겠네요. 잘 풀려서 다행이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Exhausted, drained, hopeless. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103113
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF6"
msgid "How do you feel about the disaster?"
msgstr "이번 재난에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it was the Great Serpent's wrath that brought this on Dazra, then some of them did deserve it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it was the Great Serpent's wrath that brought this on Dazra, then some of them did deserve it.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103110
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF5"
msgid "That is easy for you to say. You have not grown up here, and you barely know anyone in Dazra. They were good, loyal, devoted people."
msgstr "그런 말은 하기 쉽겠지. 넌 여기서 자라지도 않았고, 다즈라 사람들을 거의 알지도 못하잖아. 그들은 선량하고, 충성스럽고, 헌신적인 사람들이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it was the Great Serpent's wrath that brought this on Dazra, then some of them did deserve it.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103110
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF4"
msgid "And even if there were a few bad eggs, that does not justify the scale of this destruction."
msgstr "설령 나쁜 놈들이 몇 명 있었다고 해도, 이 정도 규모의 파괴를 정당화할 순 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about the disaster? &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Exhausted, drained, hopeless. |I am not sure what brought this disaster upon us, whether it was the Great Serpent's wrath, or a horrible accident, or something else. |But, what I do know is that these people who are suffering... they did not deserve any of this. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I agree. So much needs to be done to recover, and we have yet to even scratch the surface. Hence why I feel the way I do -- hopeless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF3"
msgid "It's hard to imagine Dazra ever recovering from this."
msgstr "다즈라가 이걸 극복하는 건 상상하기 힘들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about the disaster? &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Exhausted, drained, hopeless. |I am not sure what brought this disaster upon us, whether it was the Great Serpent's wrath, or a horrible accident, or something else. |But, what I do know is that these people who are suffering... they did not deserve any of this. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is easy for you to say. You have not grown up here, and you barely know anyone in Dazra. They were good, loyal, devoted people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103111
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF2"
msgid "If it was the Great Serpent's wrath that brought this on Dazra, then some of them did deserve it."
msgstr "만약 위대한 뱀의 분노가 다즈라에 닥친 거라면, 그들 중 일부는 그럴 만했겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Careful, Hanton, you do not want to be caught questioning the Great Serpent's actions. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Careful, Hanton, you do not want to be caught questioning the Great Serpent's actions. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF1"
msgid "Ugh, I am not questioning the Great Serpent. I am questioning reality, and I am questioning *you*."
msgstr "아, 난 위대한 뱀께 의문을 제기하는 게 아니야. 난 현실에 의문을 제기하고 있고, '당신'에게 의문을 제기하고 있는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Careful, Hanton, you do not want to be caught questioning the Great Serpent's actions. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AF0"
msgid "You have no right to judge people you have never met; to decide whether they deserved to die and disappear."
msgstr "만난 적도 없는 사람들을 판단할 권리는 너에겐 없어. 그들이 죽어 사라질 만했는지 결정할 자격이 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's hard to imagine Dazra ever recovering from this. &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: I agree. So much needs to be done to recover, and we have yet to even scratch the surface. Hence why I feel the way I do -- hopeless.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ugh, I am not questioning the Great Serpent. I am questioning reality, and I am questioning *you*. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AEF"
msgid "Careful, Hanton, you do not want to be caught questioning the Great Serpent's actions."
msgstr "조심해, 핸톤. 위대한 뱀의 행동에 의문을 제기하는 모습이 들키면 안 되잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's hard to imagine Dazra ever recovering from this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's hard to imagine Dazra ever recovering from this.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Careful, Hanton, you do not want to be caught questioning the Great Serpent's actions. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AEE"
msgid "I agree. So much needs to be done to recover, and we have yet to even scratch the surface. Hence why I feel the way I do -- hopeless."
msgstr "동의해. 복구하려면 해야 할 일이 너무나 많은데, 우린 아직 발끝에도 미치지 못했어. 그래서 내가 이렇게 절망적으로 느끼는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover. &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Hmm. I do not believe your optimism is warranted, frankly, but I will admit it is a nice change of pace.|*Sigh* I hope that you are right, but right now, it is hard for me to believe that we will ever crawl out of this hole. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmph, this really is not a good topic for conversation, so talk about something else or get going.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AED"
msgid "I was just making conversation, sorry."
msgstr "그냥 대화를 하려던 것뿐이었어요, 죄송합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about the disaster? &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Exhausted, drained, hopeless. |I am not sure what brought this disaster upon us, whether it was the Great Serpent's wrath, or a horrible accident, or something else. |But, what I do know is that these people who are suffering... they did not deserve any of this. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm. I do not believe your optimism is warranted, frankly, but I will admit it is a nice change of pace.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103109
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AEC"
msgid "It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover."
msgstr "절망에 빠지기 쉽지만, 난 다즈라가 회복할 거라고 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was just making conversation, sorry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was just making conversation, sorry.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110310A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AEB"
msgid "Hmmph, this really is not a good topic for conversation, so talk about something else or get going."
msgstr "흠, 이건 대화 주제로 좋지 않으니까, 다른 얘기를 하든지 가든지 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about the disaster?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103106
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AEA"
msgid "How do I feel about it? Ha! Not good, not good, but I am holding on, though. There is no point in becoming bogged down by fear."
msgstr "이 재난에 대해 어떻게 생각하냐고? 하! 좋을 리가 없지, 좋을 리가. 하지만 난 버티고 있어. 두려움에 사로잡혀 봤자 소용없으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103106
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE9"
msgid "I also feel strangely... honored, in a way, that I am able to serve the people of Dazra in this time of need. To offer them food, and allow them to, if only for a moment, escape to a simpler, safer time..."
msgstr ""
"그리고 이상하게... 영광이라고 생각해. 이런 시기에 다즈라 사람들을 도울 수 있다는 게. 그들에게 음식을 제공하고, 잠시나마 더 "
"단순하고 안전했던 시절로 도피할 수 있게 해주는 것..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103106
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Disaster
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE8"
msgid "What an honor that is, truly."
msgstr "정말 영광이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Exhausted, drained, hopeless. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103113
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE7"
msgid "How do you feel about the disaster?"
msgstr "재난에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103108
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE6"
msgid "Hmm. I do not believe your optimism is warranted, frankly, but I will admit it is a nice change of pace."
msgstr "흠. 솔직히 당신의 낙관주의가 정당하다고 생각하진 않지만, 기분 전환이 되는 건 인정할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's easy to fall into hopelessness, but I know that Dazra will recover.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was just making conversation, sorry.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103108
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE5"
msgid "*Sigh* I hope that you are right, but right now, it is hard for me to believe that we will ever crawl out of this hole."
msgstr "*한숨* 당신 말이 맞길 바라지만, 지금으로선, 우리가 이 구렁텅이에서 기어 나올 수 있을지 믿기 힘들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: No, you will always be an outsider to me. Always.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103105
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PlayerOpinion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE4"
msgid "Is there anything I can do to earn your trust?"
msgstr "당신의 신뢰를 얻기 위해 내가 할 수 있는 일이 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default, HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: I could not care less if I "get in trouble." If I disappear now because of the things I have been saying, it would be a mercy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103103
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Faith
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE3"
msgid "You're saying things that might get you in trouble. Why isn't your faith seeing you through, like other people?"
msgstr "문제가 될 만한 말을 하고 있군요. 왜 다른 사람들처럼 신앙으로 이겨내지 못하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there anything I can do to earn your trust?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103104
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PlayerOpinion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE2"
msgid "No, you will always be an outsider to me. Always."
msgstr "아니, 넌 나에게 항상 이방인일 뿐이야. 항상."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103104
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PlayerOpinion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE1"
msgid "The last thing the city needs is to open the gates and let outsiders flood in. Outsiders with weapons, crew, ulterior motives."
msgstr "문을 열고 이방인들이 몰려들게 하는 건 이 도시에 절대 해서는 안 될 일이야. 무기와 동료, 숨겨진 동기를 가진 이방인들 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103104
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_PlayerOpinion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AE0"
msgid "I am disappointed that so many of my people have embraced you so blindly, when we should have found strength within each other."
msgstr "우리끼리 힘을 합쳐야 할 때인데, 신민들이 맹목적으로 널 받아들이다니 실망스럽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:   / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're saying things that might get you in trouble. Why isn't your faith seeing you through, like other people? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103102
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Faith
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADF"
msgid "I could not care less if I \"get in trouble.\" If I disappear now because of the things I have been saying, it would be a mercy."
msgstr "문제가 된다 해도 저는 신경도 안 써요. 제가 한 말 때문에 지금 사라진다면, 그야말로 자비롭겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103102
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Faith
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADE"
msgid "Look at me. Do I look like I care if I live or die? I am a walking corpse already. The Great Serpent saw fit to kill everything I held dear in this lifetime, and He chose to torture me by leaving me untouched."
msgstr ""
"절 봐요. 제가 살든 죽든 신경 쓰는 것처럼 보여요? 저는 이미 걸어 다니는 시체예요. 위대한 뱀께선 이승에서 제가 소중히 여기는 모든 "
"것을 죽이시기로 하셨고, 절 고스란히 남겨두어 고문하시길 택하셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103102
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Faith
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADD"
msgid "My faith is not seeing me through because perhaps it was our faith that put us in this position."
msgstr "제 신앙이 절 이겨내지 못하는 건, 아마도 저희를 이 지경에 이르게 한 게 바로 저희의 신앙이기 때문이겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Well, it was not a, uh... a legal transaction.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103101
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Machine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADC"
msgid "You said your father acquired the Enhance! machine. How did he do that?"
msgstr "아버지가 인핸스! 기계를 구했다고 하셨죠. 어떻게 구하신 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You said your father acquired the Enhance! machine. How did he do that?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103100
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Machine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADB"
msgid "Well, it was not a, uh... a legal transaction."
msgstr "음, 그게... 합법적인 거래는 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to regain control of the convo / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01103100
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Machine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ADA"
msgid "Look, this is my shop. I do not have to answer these questions. This is a completely legitimate operation, and I do not condone my father's actions."
msgstr "이봐, 여긴 내 가게야. 이 질문에 대답할 필요는 없어. 이건 완전히 합법적인 사업이고, 난 아버지의 행동을 용납하지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you thoughts on the emergency in Dazra? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011030FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD9"
msgid "How can anyone even begin to make sense of it all? Hundreds of people gone in an instant, along with most of the city. It is like something out of a nightmare."
msgstr "어떻게 이 모든 걸 이해할 수 있을까? 수백 명의 사람들이 도시 대부분과 함께 순식간에 사라졌어. 마치 악몽 속의 한 장면 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011030FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD8"
msgid "I feel guilty, to tell the truth. I was supposed to work on the day the cultural center disappeared. I was sick and my coworker covered for me -- and now they are gone forever."
msgstr "솔직히 죄책감이 들어. 문화 센터가 사라진 그날, 내가 일할 차례였어. 내가 아파서 동료가 대신 일했는데, 이제 그들은 영원히 사라져 버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Asking yourself questions like that will just drive you crazy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011030FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD7"
msgid "I just cannot stop thinking: why? Why did this have to happen to us?"
msgstr "그저 멈출 수 없어. 왜? 왜 이런 일이 우리에게 일어나야만 했는지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraZamiraValik: How can anyone even begin to make sense of it all? Hundreds of people gone in an instant, along with most of the city. It is like something out of a nightmare.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 011030FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Calamity
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD6"
msgid "What are you thoughts on the emergency in Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라의 비상사태에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to take a look at what you're selling.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD5"
msgid "Right away!"
msgstr "바로 준비해 드리겠습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to take a look at what you're selling.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD4"
msgid "Some groat to whet your appetite?"
msgstr "입맛을 돋울 그로트 좀 드셔 보시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there anything I can do to help you? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Help
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD3"
msgid "I appreciate the sentiment, but you cannot help me."
msgstr "마음은 고맙지만, 당신은 날 도울 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Help
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD2"
msgid "But, I am glad that you have taken time to speak with me, and allowed me to reminisce about my wife to you. It... meant a lot to me."
msgstr "하지만, 나와 시간을 내어 이야기해 주고, 아내를 추억할 수 있게 해 줘서 고마워요. 그건... 나에게 큰 의미가 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Seems like now isn't a good time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD1"
msgid "Did you... did you have something to say to me?"
msgstr "뭔가... 제게 하실 말씀이라도 있으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AD0"
msgid "And, well, you are the one that Anasko spoke to, so... well, forgive me if I am nervous."
msgstr "그리고, 당신은 아나스코 님이 말을 거신 분이니까, 음... 떨리는 것도 이해해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACF"
msgid "The pay is good enough for me to go to, uh, Herald's Rest after work, and that is all that really matters to me."
msgstr "임금이야 뭐, 일 끝난 후에 전령의 안식처에 갈 수 있을 만큼 충분해요. 사실 그게 저에겐 가장 중요하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Oh, uh, Dumar is the uh, ship technician, by the way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_ThoughtsOnDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACE"
msgid "He was always nice to me. He did not deserve... this. So, yeah, things are scary. Uh, even Dumar is probably scared, even though he always seems so happy."
msgstr ""
"그 사람은 항상 저에게 잘해 줬어요. 그렇게 돼선 안 될 사람이었는데... 그래요, 이런 상황이 무섭긴 해요. 어, 두마르라도 "
"무서워하겠죠. 항상 행복해 보이지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_SaleResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACD"
msgid "I am sure something will catch your eye."
msgstr "분명 마음에 드는 게 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_SaleResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACC"
msgid "Feel free to buy them all. No one else is using them."
msgstr "다 사셔도 됩니다. 다른 사람은 아무도 안 쓰니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me see what you have for sale.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_SaleResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACB"
msgid "They will not know what hit them."
msgstr "상대는 뭐가 덮쳤는지도 모를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay <Global=EnhancePrice> Credits] I'd like to use your machine, please. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_EnhanceReponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012ACA"
msgid "I am curious to see what you will look like when you are done."
msgstr "다 끝나면 어떤 모습일지 궁금하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay <Global=EnhancePrice> Credits] I'd like to use your machine, please. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
