#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_EnhanceReponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AC9"
msgid "Need a change of scenery, huh?"
msgstr "기분 전환이 필요하신가 봐요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay <Global=EnhancePrice> Credits] I'd like to use your machine, please. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_EnhanceReponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AC8"
msgid "Aww, I kind of like how you look now."
msgstr "아, 지금 모습도 꽤 마음에 드는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay <Global=EnhancePrice> Credits] I'd like to use your machine, please. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_EnhanceReponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012AC7"
msgid "The machine is perfectly safe, I promise."
msgstr "기계는 완벽하게 안전해요, 약속합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012AC6"
msgid "So this is how the Great Serpent rewards His faithful?"
msgstr "이것이 위대한 뱀께서 신실한 자들에게 내리시는 보답인가요?"

