msgstr "소매치기다! 멈춰!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueUnique
#. TOPIC: 011030FB
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103147
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: PickpocketCombat
