msgid "Great Serpent! Murder!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 살인이다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueUnique
#. TOPIC: 011030FC
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01103159
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Murder
