#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Mujeen, Mujeen... who is that again?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011024DE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A8D"
msgid "Oh, of course, the gentleman from House Ka'dic! I forgot he was even alive. In my defense, he's incredibly boring."
msgstr ""
"아, 알겠다. 카딕 가문의 그 신사분 말씀이시군요! 그분이 살아있다는 사실조차 잊고 있었어요. 변명하자면, 그분은 정말 지루하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Ochim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Madri: I'm fine. I'm just worried. I haven't seen you in ages. Why do we have to sneak around like this? &&& Ochim: I'll explain everything eventually. For now, just keep correspondence to the slates. Do you remember the decryption key?
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: I love you too. Just hang in there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011024DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Ochim_MadriScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A8C"
msgid "Yes, I remember. Even numbers, multiply by two. I love you, brother."
msgstr "응, 기억하고 있어. 짝수에 2 곱하기. 사랑해. 오빠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ochim: I'll explain everything eventually. For now, just keep correspondence to the slates. Do you remember the decryption key? &&& Madri: Yes, I remember. Even numbers, multiply by two. I love you, brother.
#. ALIAS: Ochim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011024DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Ochim_MadriScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A8B"
msgid "I love you too. Just hang in there."
msgstr "나도 사랑해. 조금만 더 버텨."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not investigate it yourself?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A8A"
msgid "And if I investigate this, I could be accused of wiping records, or tampering with evidence."
msgstr "그리고 제가 이 일을 조사하면, 기록을 지우거나 증거를 조작했다고 고발당할 수도 있어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A57
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smugglerl_BlockingHellosAngry
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012A89"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr "날 내버려 둬."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_OchimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012A88"
msgid "I've got nothing to say to you."
msgstr "당신한테 할 말은 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_OchimSecurity
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012A87"
msgid "The Executor's under my protection. Move along."
msgstr "실무관 님은 제가 보호하겠습니다. 어서 가시죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102485
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024BD
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A86"
msgid "This will be painful; brace yourself."
msgstr "이건 아플 겁니다. 마음 단단히 먹으세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102485
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024BD
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A85"
msgid "This is going to hurt."
msgstr "이건 아플 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102485
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024BD
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A84"
msgid "Bite down on something; this is going to be painful."
msgstr "뭐라도 물고 계세요. 이건 아플 거니까요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102486
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A83"
msgid "I cannot treat you if you cannot pay."
msgstr "돈을 낼 수 없으면 치료해 드릴 수 없어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102486
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A82"
msgid "I need to see some credits before I can administer treatment."
msgstr "치료를 시작하기 전에 크레딧을 좀 봐야겠는데요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102486
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A81"
msgid "You have to pay like everyone else, and you do not have the credits."
msgstr "다른 사람들처럼 돈을 내야 하는데, 크레딧이 없으시군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102487
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B2
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A80"
msgid "There. All finished."
msgstr "자, 다 끝났습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102487
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B2
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7F"
msgid "All done. You might have some soreness for a few days, but that is normal."
msgstr "다 끝났어요. 며칠 동안 좀 뻐근할 수 있지만, 정상입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102487
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B2
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7E"
msgid "I would not say you are as good as new, but close enough."
msgstr "새것처럼 멀쩡하다고는 말할 수 없지만, 거의 비슷해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102487
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B2
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7D"
msgid "There, you should be feeling much better now."
msgstr "자, 이제 훨씬 나아지셨을 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102484
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7C"
msgid "This is not going to be easy to treat."
msgstr "이건 치료하기 쉽지 않겠는데요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102484
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7B"
msgid "Honesty, I am surprised you are still alive."
msgstr "솔직히, 아직 살아 계신 게 놀랍습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102484
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A7A"
msgid "How long have you been walking around like this? You need treatment immediately."
msgstr "이렇게 얼마나 오래 돌아다니신 겁니까? 당장 치료가 필요해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102482
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A79"
msgid "You seem healthy to me."
msgstr "제 눈엔 건강해 보이시는데요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102482
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A78"
msgid "Nothing is wrong with you."
msgstr "아무 문제 없으세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102482
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110248A
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A77"
msgid "You will be fine, really."
msgstr "괜찮으실 겁니다, 정말로."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102483
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024AE
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A76"
msgid "Eh, I do not see any major issues."
msgstr "어, 큰 문제는 없어 보이네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102483
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024AE
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A75"
msgid "Hmm, it looks worse than it actually is."
msgstr "흠, 실제보다 더 나빠 보이네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102483
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024AE
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A74"
msgid "I do not see any major issues here."
msgstr "여기 큰 문제는 없어 보입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102481
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024C1
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A73"
msgid "It will take a few stitches, but you will be back to normal soon."
msgstr "몇 바늘 꿰매야겠지만, 곧 정상으로 돌아오실 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102481
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024C1
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A72"
msgid "Let us take a closer look..."
msgstr "자세히 살펴봅시다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102481
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024C1
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A71"
msgid "Should be no trouble."
msgstr "문제없을 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102480
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A70"
msgid "Let me take a look."
msgstr "어디 한번 보죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102480
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6F"
msgid "Let me examine you."
msgstr "진찰해 보겠습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01102480
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110249E
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6E"
msgid "Let me see what I am dealing with."
msgstr "뭘 봐야 할지 한번 보죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102496
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6D"
msgid "Please, only purchase what you need."
msgstr "필요한 것만 구매해 주세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102496
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6C"
msgid "Try not to get too greedy."
msgstr "너무 욕심내지 마세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102496
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6B"
msgid "Save some for the other patients."
msgstr "다른 환자들을 위해 좀 남겨 두세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A6A"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알았어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A69"
msgid "If you would clear some space for us, then."
msgstr "자리를 좀 비켜 주시면 좋겠네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A68"
msgid "Good; saves me some supplies."
msgstr "좋아요. 제 물자를 아낄 수 있겠네요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
