#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A67"
msgid "I'd like to modify my ship."
msgstr "제 우주선을 개조하고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
