#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B7
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A65"
msgid "I can help with that."
msgstr "제가 도와드릴 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to modify my ship.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Modify
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B7
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A64"
msgid "Great; take a look at what I have."
msgstr "좋습니다. 제가 뭘 가지고 있는지 한번 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to modify my ship.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Modify
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B7
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A63"
msgid "Happy to help."
msgstr "기꺼이 도와드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to modify my ship.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Modify
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011024B7
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A62"
msgid "This is what I have at the moment."
msgstr "이게 지금 제가 가지고 있는 겁니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A61"
msgid "I need my ship repaired."
msgstr "제 우주선을 수리해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Repair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A60"
msgid "Yes, easily."
msgstr "네, 손쉽죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Repair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A5F"
msgid "There is nothing that I cannot handle."
msgstr "제가 못 다루는 건 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Repair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A5E"
msgid "I will get it back to top shape in no time."
msgstr "금방 최상의 상태로 고쳐 놓겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_NothingToRepair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A5D"
msgid "Looks like there is nothing for me to fix."
msgstr "제가 손볼 곳이 없어 보이는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_NothingToRepair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A5C"
msgid "Looks like your ship is already in good shape."
msgstr "우주선이 이미 양호한 상태인 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need my ship repaired. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Repair
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_NothingToRepair
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A5B"
msgid "Your ship seems fine to me."
msgstr "우주선은 아무 문제 없어 보입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to purchase a vehicle. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01059CBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Vehicle
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01059CC5
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012A5A"
msgid "Take a look."
msgstr "한번 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
