#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012A57"
msgid "Hope something catches your eye."
msgstr "마음에 드는 게 있으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A56"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent. &&& Anasko: And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks. &&& Anasko: This Vortex, the place between places, and the energy it holds, could be harnessed. Refined. Directed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You see it too, then. Yes, I believe that is so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102475
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A55"
msgid "Perhaps the Great Serpent always intended for this course of events."
msgstr "어쩌면 위대한 뱀께서 처음부터 이 사건들을 의도하신 걸지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps the Great Serpent always intended for this course of events.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps the Great Serpent always intended for this course of events.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Utilizing the Vortex energy, we have learned that we can create powerful warriors, capable of teleporting vast distances in an instant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102474
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A54"
msgid "You see it too, then. Yes, I believe that is so."
msgstr "너에게도 보이는구나. 그래, 나도 그리 믿는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Zealots have infiltrated the Citadel. They cannot be allowed to gain control of our work!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102473
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage570_ActivatedPhantoms02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A53"
msgid "Waste no time - ascend the Citadel! Join me at the Pinnacle! We must defend the Vortex Gate! We cannot fail the Great Serpent now!"
msgstr ""
"시간이 없다. 성채에 올라라! 첨탑으로 찾아오거라! 반드시 볼텍스 차원문을 지켜야 한다! 이제 와서 위대한 뱀을 실망시킬 순 없느니라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Zealots. Of course they would attempt to poison this, as they do all things. They will not stop me. The work will be completed - now!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102472
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A52"
msgid "Come, then, all of you. Ascend the Citadel, or squabble amongst yourselves. I will await you at the Pinnacle."
msgstr "어디 다 같이 덤벼 봐라. 성채에 오르던지, 너희끼리 싸우던지 알아서 해. 첨탑에서 기다리고 있겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102008
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A51"
msgid "Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there."
msgstr "여기서 빠져나가려고 할 때마다, 난... 길을 잃었다. 보이지 않는 곳을 헤매었지. 그곳에는 아무것도 없었다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012A50"
msgid "The guards overheard my neighbor forsaking the Great Serpent. What a fool... I have not seen him in days."
msgstr "경비병들이 제 이웃이 위대한 뱀을 저버렸다고 수군대는 걸 들었어요. 멍청하긴... 며칠 동안 그 이웃을 보지 못했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I guess that's it, your animals are all doomed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I guess that's it, your animals are all doomed.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A4F"
msgid "I'm not prepared to give up just yet."
msgstr "저는 아직 포기하지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I guess that's it, your animals are all doomed.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A4E"
msgid "I'm confident there's a solution, it just hasn't occurred to us."
msgstr "분명 해결책이 있을 거예요. 단지 우리가 아직 그 방법을 생각해 내지 못했을 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Looks like an all-expenses paid journey to Jandar's Rest! Lucky you!
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: You'll have to crack the encryption first, I'm afraid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011020AF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A47"
msgid "Okay, scanning the coordinates, those point further north, hidden in Badlands. Clever, clever."
msgstr "좋아요. 좌표를 스캔해 보니, 더 북쪽에 있는 배드랜드에 숨겨져 있군요. 영리해요. 영리하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102604A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A46"
msgid "Scanning the coordinates, those point further north, hidden in Badlands. Clever, clever."
msgstr "좌표를 스캔해 보니, 더 북쪽에 있는 배드랜드에 숨겨져 있군요. 영리해요. 영리하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C58
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A45"
msgid "Hopefully you'll find my cousin alive and safe."
msgstr "부디 사촌이 살아있고 무사했으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You're really here. &&& Anasko: I feared what I saw, that connection we made, was yet another vision... This is real, is it not?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See you? Yes, of course. So much has been unclear, but here in the Citadel I am more focused.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0110200A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A44"
msgid "You can see me this time?"
msgstr "이번에는 제가 보이는 모양이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can see me this time?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can see me this time?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You're not imagining it. I'm really here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01102009
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A43"
msgid "See you? Yes, of course. So much has been unclear, but here in the Citadel I am more focused."
msgstr "보이냐고? 그래, 물론이지. 많은 것들이 불확실했지만, 성채에 오니 더 집중할 수 있구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A42"
msgid "I hope the gravity here will be easier on my joints."
msgstr "이곳 중력이 내 관절에 더 편하면 좋을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACC
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteUnassigned_SahimaKadic
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A41"
msgid "Until next time, Captain. May the Great Serpent guide you from here."
msgstr "나중에 봐, 선장. 이제 위대한 뱀께서 널 인도해 줄지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible. &&& SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.|Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If all else fails, then you might be right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A40"
msgid "The toxic plants have to be destroyed."
msgstr "독성 식물을 없애야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The toxic plants have to be destroyed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The toxic plants have to be destroyed.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A3F"
msgid "If all else fails, then you might be right."
msgstr "다른 방법이 모두 실패한다면, 당신 말대로 하는 게 맞을지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The toxic plants have to be destroyed.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A3D"
msgid "Hopefully we can find a more benign solution."
msgstr "바라건대, 좀 더 양호한 해결책을 찾을 수 있으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible. &&& SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.|Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not prepared to give up just yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A3C"
msgid "I guess that's it, your animals are all doomed."
msgstr "이걸로 끝인가 보군요. 당신의 동물들은 모두 파멸할 운명이네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Sahima_SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyWeaponsDown
msgctxt "012A3B"
msgid "The enemy's down a weapon!"
msgstr "적의 무장이 고장났다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A69
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "012A3A"
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "젠장!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible. &&& SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.|Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. Well, not fatally in any case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A39"
msgid "Could the toxic plants be dangerous to people, too?"
msgstr "독성 식물이 사람에게도 위험할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Could the toxic plants be dangerous to people, too?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could the toxic plants be dangerous to people, too?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A38"
msgid "No. Well, not fatally in any case."
msgstr "아니요. 음, 적어도 치명적이지는 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Could the toxic plants be dangerous to people, too?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A37"
msgid "However, we rely on the local wildlife as a source of sustenance."
msgstr "하지만 우리는 영양분을 얻기 위해 지역 야생 동물에 의존하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Could the toxic plants be dangerous to people, too?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A36"
msgid "If the problem is left unchecked, food shortages, and eventually starvation, could follow."
msgstr "이 문제를 방치하면, 식량 부족이 발생할 수 있고, 종국에는 기아가 닥칠 수도 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: There is, however, a not-insignificant complication. &&& companion: I knew you were going to say that. &&& SherineDubas: The experimental compound is locked away in cold storage at a botanical facility.|I was growing strains of fungus and mushrooms there for medicinal use, but we were attacked.|A group of pirates called the Crimson Fleet took over the place, forcing us to leave.|Pirates! Here on Va'ruun'kai! I could scarcely believe it. 
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By the Serpent, no!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A35"
msgid "No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet."
msgstr "기분 나쁘게 하려는 건 아닙니다만, 두 분 다 크림슨 함대를 상대하진 못할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: There is, however, a not-insignificant complication. &&& companion: I knew you were going to say that. &&& SherineDubas: The experimental compound is locked away in cold storage at a botanical facility.|I was growing strains of fungus and mushrooms there for medicinal use, but we were attacked.|A group of pirates called the Crimson Fleet took over the place, forcing us to leave.|Pirates! Here on Va'ruun'kai! I could scarcely believe it. 
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And you have every right to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A34"
msgid "I'll get your experimental compound, but I expect hazard pay."
msgstr "화합물 시제품은 가져다 드리겠습니다만, 위험 수당을 주셔야겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
