msgid "The experimental compound is locked away in cold storage at a botanical facility."
msgstr "화합물 시제품은 식물 연구 시설의 냉장 보관실에 보관되어 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A2E"
msgid "I was growing strains of fungus and mushrooms there for medicinal use, but we were attacked."
msgstr "그 연구 시설에서 약용으로 사용할 곰팡이와 버섯을 재배했는데, 공격을 당했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A2D"
msgid "A group of pirates called the Crimson Fleet took over the place, forcing us to leave."
msgstr "크림슨 함대라는 해적 집단이 연구 시설을 점령해서, 저희는 떠날 수밖에 없었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised and amused exclamation / Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
