msgid "By the Serpent, no!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 당연히 못하죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A2B"
msgid "We narrowly escaped from those pirates with our lives. I've no wish to meet them again."
msgstr "우리는 간신히 살아서 도망쳤어요. 다시는 해적들을 만나고 싶지 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A2A"
msgid "I was hoping our very capable new research assistant might be up to the task, however."
msgstr "하지만, 우리 매우 유능한 신임 연구 보조원님이라면 그 임무를 수행할 수 있을지도 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused, maybe even break into a soft voice or whisper for the end, to punctuate the joke. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No offense, but I don't see either of you taking on the Crimson Fleet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Go with the Serpent's blessing. We'll be waiting for you here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 011023ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A29"
msgid "And just in case that was a little too obtuse, I'm referring to you."
msgstr "너무 완곡하게 표현했나요? 당신을 말하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing? &&& SherineDubas: The one designed to alter plant biochemistry?|Hm, interesting thought. &&& SherineDubas: I'd been theorizing about ways to create edible strains of local flora.|It's possible I could alter the formula to neutralize the toxins in the affected species.
