msgid "A fight broke out over medication, but luckily no one was injured. The aggressor has been punished."
msgstr "약 때문에 싸움이 벌어졌지만, 다행히 다친 사람은 없었습니다. 가해자는 처벌을 받았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: Anything to report?
