#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: Good. Let me know if something else occurs.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp04
#. TOPIC: 01102414
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_SceneCOPY0000
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0110244E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A0B"
msgid "We had to remove one of the refugees for spouting heresies."
msgstr "이단적인 말을 퍼뜨린 난민 한 명을 쫓아내야 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: Anything to report? &&& Guard01: There was a pickpocket stealing rations, but they have since been dealt with.
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
