msgid "Good. Let me know if something else occurs."
msgstr "좋습니다. 무슨 일이 또 생기면 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 0110241A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A08"
msgid "Kreso, do you have any estimation of how long your groat supply will last?"
msgstr "크레소, 지금 있는 그로트로 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kreso: Groat supply? Hmmm, I would say, at our current demand, we have enough meat to last us at least another month.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 0110241A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A07"
msgid "House Dul'khef wants us to inventory all food supplies throughout the city."
msgstr "둘케프 가문에서 도시 전체의 식량 비축물을 조사하라고 하는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, do you have any estimation of how long your groat supply will last? |House Dul'khef wants us to inventory all food supplies throughout the city.
#. ALIAS: Kreso
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Worker: That seems awfully low. Have the groat farmers been supplying adequate amounts of livestock?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01102419
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A06"
msgid "Groat supply? Hmmm, I would say, at our current demand, we have enough meat to last us at least another month."
msgstr "그로트? 글쎄, 현재 수요라면 적어도 한 달은 더 버틸 수 있는 고기가 충분히 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Worker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kreso: Groat supply? Hmmm, I would say, at our current demand, we have enough meat to last us at least another month. &&& Worker: That seems awfully low. Have the groat farmers been supplying adequate amounts of livestock?
#. ALIAS: Kreso
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Worker: True. Thank you, Kreso, we will take note of this information. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01102417
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A05"
msgid "The groat farmers are not the problem, it is a demand problem. Most of the other eateries in the city were taken by the vortex."
msgstr "그로트 농가가 문제가 아니라, 수요가 문제야. 도시의 다른 음식점 대부분이 볼텍스에 휩쓸려 갔으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: That seems awfully low. Have the groat farmers been supplying adequate amounts of livestock? &&& Kreso: The groat farmers are not the problem, it is a demand problem. Most of the other eateries in the city were taken by the vortex. 
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06
#. TOPIC: 01102416
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A04"
msgid "True. Thank you, Kreso, we will take note of this information. All Must Serve."
msgstr "맞아. 고마워, 크레소. 이 정보를 기록해 두지. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kreso
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Worker: Kreso, do you have any estimation of how long your groat supply will last? |House Dul'khef wants us to inventory all food supplies throughout the city. &&& Kreso: Groat supply? Hmmm, I would say, at our current demand, we have enough meat to last us at least another month.
#. ALIAS: Worker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kreso: The groat farmers are not the problem, it is a demand problem. Most of the other eateries in the city were taken by the vortex. 
