#. TOPIC: 01102418
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A03"
msgid "That seems awfully low. Have the groat farmers been supplying adequate amounts of livestock?"
msgstr "너무 적은 것 같은데. 그로트 농가에서 가축을 적절하게 공급하고 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Zamira
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zamira: Oh, thank you, that means a lot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01102424
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A01"
msgid "Such a shame what happened to the Cultural Center, Zamira. We always loved to visit and go on your guided tours."
msgstr "문화 센터에 일어난 일은 정말 안타까워요, 자미라. 저희는 항상 방문해서 당신의 안내 투어를 즐기곤 했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Zamira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Such a shame what happened to the Cultural Center, Zamira. We always loved to visit and go on your guided tours.
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: How are you faring, otherwise?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01102423
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012A00"
msgid "Oh, thank you, that means a lot."
msgstr "아, 고마워요, 정말 큰 힘이 되네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Zamira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Such a shame what happened to the Cultural Center, Zamira. We always loved to visit and go on your guided tours. &&& Zamira: Oh, thank you, that means a lot.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zamira: I am no worse off than anyone else here. It has been an adjustment, and money is growing tight...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01102422
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129FF"
msgid "How are you faring, otherwise?"
msgstr "그건 그렇고, 어떻게 지내고 계세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Zamira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zamira: Oh, thank you, that means a lot. &&& Citizen01: How are you faring, otherwise?
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Yes, I understand that. We can only pray that the Great Serpent will provide for us in these times. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01102421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129FE"
msgid "I am no worse off than anyone else here. It has been an adjustment, and money is growing tight..."
msgstr "저라고 여기 있는 다른 사람들보다 형편이 나을 건 없죠. 적응 중이고, 돈은 점점 부족해지고 있어요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Zamira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: How are you faring, otherwise? &&& Zamira: I am no worse off than anyone else here. It has been an adjustment, and money is growing tight...
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zamira: Yes. Yes, I agree. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 01102420
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129FD"
msgid "Yes, I understand that. We can only pray that the Great Serpent will provide for us in these times."
msgstr "네, 이해해요. 이럴 때일수록 위대한 뱀께서 우리를 보살펴 주시길 기도할 수밖에 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to hide the doubt in her voice / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zamira: I am no worse off than anyone else here. It has been an adjustment, and money is growing tight... &&& Citizen01: Yes, I understand that. We can only pray that the Great Serpent will provide for us in these times. 
#. ALIAS: Zamira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood04
#. TOPIC: 0110241F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_SceneCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129FC"
msgid "Yes. Yes, I agree."
msgstr "네. 네, 저도 동의해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: No, of course not? How could everything be all right? Why even bother asking the question?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102434
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129FA"
msgid "Everything all right?"
msgstr "다 괜찮은 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Everything all right? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102433
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F9"
msgid "No, of course not? How could everything be all right? Why even bother asking the question?"
msgstr "아니, 당연히 안 괜찮지? 어떻게 다 괜찮을 수 있겠어? 왜 그런 걸 묻는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: What the hell did you just say?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102433
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F8"
msgid "Our homes, jobs, families, gone without a trace. The Great Serpent must have a low opinion of his creations, eh?"
msgstr "우리 집, 직장, 가족들, 흔적도 없이 사라졌어. 위대한 뱀께선 그분의 창조물들을 낮게 평가하시나 보지, 어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Everything all right?  &&& Citizen02: No, of course not? How could everything be all right? Why even bother asking the question?|Our homes, jobs, families, gone without a trace. The Great Serpent must have a low opinion of his creations, eh?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: You heard what I said. We did nothing to deserve this punishment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102432
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F7"
msgid "What the hell did you just say?"
msgstr "방금 뭐라고 지껄인 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: No, of course not? How could everything be all right? Why even bother asking the question?|Our homes, jobs, families, gone without a trace. The Great Serpent must have a low opinion of his creations, eh? &&& Citizen01: What the hell did you just say?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Are you stupid? These times are brutal, but you must watch your tongue. Do you want to disappear? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102431
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F6"
msgid "You heard what I said. We did nothing to deserve this punishment."
msgstr "내 말 못 들었어? 우리는 이런 벌을 받을 짓을 하지 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What the hell did you just say? &&& Citizen02: You heard what I said. We did nothing to deserve this punishment.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102430
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F5"
msgid "Are you stupid? These times are brutal, but you must watch your tongue. Do you want to disappear?"
msgstr "너 제정신이야? 지금이 힘든 시기인 건 맞지만, 말조심해야지. 사라지고 싶어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04
#. TOPIC: 01102430
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F4"
msgid "You will show the Great Serpent the respect He is owed."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 마땅한 존경을 보여드려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Makola: No, I have weapons and ammo. And if I did have rations, they would cost credits like everything else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 0110242F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F2"
msgid "Do you have any rations to spare, Makola?"
msgstr "마콜라, 혹시 남는 배급품 좀 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you have any rations to spare, Makola?
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 0110242E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F1"
msgid "No, I have weapons and ammo. And if I did have rations, they would cost credits like everything else."
msgstr "아니, 나한텐 무기랑 탄약밖에 없어. 그리고 배급품이 있다고 해도, 다른 것들처럼 크레딧을 내야 살 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: What happened to make you such a jaded bastard? In times like these, we should be helping one another. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 0110242E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129F0"
msgid "You should buy a gun and shoot a groat yourself, instead of leeching off of hard-working people's backs."
msgstr "거머리처럼 남 등이나 처먹지 말고, 총 사서 직접 그로트나 사냥하러 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Makola
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you have any rations to spare, Makola? &&& Makola: No, I have weapons and ammo. And if I did have rations, they would cost credits like everything else.|You should buy a gun and shoot a groat yourself, instead of leeching off of hard-working people's backs. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Makola: Hmmph, you say that, but I have not seen you give to the needy, or offer rations to the hungry. Seems all you do is take.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05
#. TOPIC: 0110242D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129EF"
msgid "What happened to make you such a jaded bastard? In times like these, we should be helping one another."
msgstr "대체 무슨 일이 있었길래 그렇게 삐딱해진 거야? 이럴 때일수록 서로 도와야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Makola: No, I have weapons and ammo. And if I did have rations, they would cost credits like everything else.|You should buy a gun and shoot a groat yourself, instead of leeching off of hard-working people's backs.  &&& Citizen01: What happened to make you such a jaded bastard? In times like these, we should be helping one another. 
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
