#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129EE"
msgid "Hmmph, you say that, but I have not seen you give to the needy, or offer rations to the hungry. Seems all you do is take."
msgstr "쳇, 말은 잘하네. 근데 난 네가 가난한 사람들을 돕거나 굶주린 사람들에게 배급품을 주는 걸 본 적이 없는데. 넌 그냥 받기만 하는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Makola
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: *Grumble*
