#. TOPIC: 0110242C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129ED"
msgid "Now, buy something or leave."
msgstr "자, 뭐라도 사. 안 살 거면 그냥 가."

