#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Hmm, I shudder to think that he did not survive. Anasko is a good, strong leader. We need his guidance now more than ever.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 0110242A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129EA"
msgid "We have not heard from the Speaker in weeks. What do you think has become of him?"
msgstr "몇 주 동안 대변자님에게서 아무 소식도 못 들었습니다. 어떻게 되셨다고 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: We have not heard from the Speaker in weeks. What do you think has become of him? &&& Citizen02: Hmm, I shudder to think that he did not survive. Anasko is a good, strong leader. We need his guidance now more than ever.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I - what?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102428
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E9"
msgid "Perhaps he is not dead, but abandoned his post?"
msgstr "어쩌면 돌아가신 게 아니라, 그냥 직책을 버리신 걸지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: We have not heard from the Speaker in weeks. What do you think has become of him?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Perhaps he is not dead, but abandoned his post? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102429
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E8"
msgid "Hmm, I shudder to think that he did not survive. Anasko is a good, strong leader. We need his guidance now more than ever."
msgstr ""
"음, 그분이 살아남지 못하셨다니 생각만 해도 몸서리쳐집니다. 아나스코 님은 훌륭하고 강한 영도자십니다. 지금 우리에겐 그 어느 때보다 "
"그분의 영도가 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: shocked / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Hmm, I shudder to think that he did not survive. Anasko is a good, strong leader. We need his guidance now more than ever. &&& Citizen01: Perhaps he is not dead, but abandoned his post? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102427
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E7"
msgid "I - what?"
msgstr "제가... 뭐라고 하셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Let me rephrase. Maybe he has stepped aside so that another leader may guide us through this emergency. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102427
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E6"
msgid "You cannot say such things. I have half a mind to turn you in."
msgstr "그런 발언을 하면 안 됩니다. 당신을 고발하고 싶은 생각이 듭니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Perhaps he is not dead, but abandoned his post?  &&& Citizen02: I - what?|You cannot say such things. I have half a mind to turn you in.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: He would not do that, and I know that is not what you meant. Watch yourself, friend. You do not want to forget your place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102426
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E5"
msgid "Let me rephrase. Maybe he has stepped aside so that another leader may guide us through this emergency."
msgstr "다시 말하겠습니다. 어쩌면 그분이 이 비상사태를 헤쳐나가도록 다른 영도자가 우릴 이끌 수 있게 자리를 비켜주신 걸지도 모릅니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I - what?|You cannot say such things. I have half a mind to turn you in. &&& Citizen01: Let me rephrase. Maybe he has stepped aside so that another leader may guide us through this emergency. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06
#. TOPIC: 01102425
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza06_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E4"
msgid "He would not do that, and I know that is not what you meant. Watch yourself, friend. You do not want to forget your place."
msgstr ""
"그분은 그러실 분이 아닙니다. 그리고 당신이 무슨 뜻으로 그런 발언을 한 건지는 압니다. 조심하십시오. 친구. 당신의 분수를 잊어선 안 "
"됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: I have overheard some citizens engaging in disturbing discourse regarding the Speaker. How should we handle this? &&& Guard01: That cannot continue. Did you see firsthand who was saying these things, or did you just hear from afar?
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Excellent. We will report this to Voris and take care of this matter as soon as possible. 
