#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E2"
msgid "I saw them, and would recognize them."
msgstr "봤고, 그들을 알아볼 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: I have overheard some citizens engaging in disturbing discourse regarding the Speaker. How should we handle this?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: I saw them, and would recognize them.
