#. TOPIC: 0110241D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E1"
msgid "That cannot continue. Did you see firsthand who was saying these things, or did you just hear from afar?"
msgstr "그렇게 놔둘 순 없지. 누가 그런 말을 하는 걸 직접 본 거야, 아니면 멀리서 들은 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: That cannot continue. Did you see firsthand who was saying these things, or did you just hear from afar? &&& Guard02: I saw them, and would recognize them.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood05
#. TOPIC: 0110241B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01COPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129E0"
msgid "Excellent. We will report this to Voris and take care of this matter as soon as possible."
msgstr "잘됐군. 보리스 님께 보고해서 이 문제를 최대한 빨리 처리하도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: That cannot continue. Did you see firsthand who was saying these things, or did you just hear from afar?
