msgid "I have overheard some citizens engaging in disturbing discourse regarding the Speaker. How should we handle this?"
msgstr "대변자님에 관해 불안한 이야기를 하는 시민들이 있습니다. 어떻게 처리해야 할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's do it. &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: While I wish you had waited until he attacked first, perhaps we still have time to gather more evidence. &&& Qisrani: This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen. &&& Qisrani: If you have time, check his office. There may be information connecting him to this individual.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, as a matter of fact. The bodies of the assassins. They may offer more clues.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011019BA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129DE"
msgid "Anything else I should investigate?"
msgstr "제가 조사해야 할 다른 것이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything else I should investigate?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything else I should investigate?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011019B9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129DD"
msgid "Yes, as a matter of fact. The bodies of the assassins. They may offer more clues."
msgstr "네, 사실 아직 남은 게 있어요. 암살자들의 시신을 살피면 단서가 있을지 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything else I should investigate?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I can do that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 011019B9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129DC"
msgid "I'll have security look them over also, but if their ranks have been infiltrated, I'd rather you inspect them first."
msgstr "경비대 측에 살펴보라고 하겠지만, 경비대에도 첩자가 있을지 모르니 당신이 먼저 살펴봐 주시면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not investigate it yourself?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I can investigate. And if I hurry, I think I can save Ukaru.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0129DB"
