#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C5"
msgid "I have not seen my sister in days. Great Serpent, I pray nothing has happened to her."
msgstr "며칠 동안 여동생을 보지 못했어요. 위대한 뱀이시여, 제발 동생에게 아무 일도 없게 해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C4"
msgid "My brother lost his wife and home in the catastrophe. *Sigh* How can anyone be the same after that?"
msgstr "재난 때문에 형은 아내와 집을 잃었어요. *한숨* 그 일을 겪고 어떻게 멀쩡할 수 있겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C3"
msgid "Just trying to survive one more day."
msgstr "그저 하루하루 더 버티려고 애쓰고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: tinged with doubt / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C2"
msgid "The Great Serpent will deliver us from this, I know it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 구원해 주실 거예요. 분명히요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said under their breath in a prayer-like manner / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C1"
msgid "Great Serpent, please help me. I am... I am terrified."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 제발 도와주세요. 저는... 저는 너무 두려워요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129C0"
msgid "Will I ever see my family again?"
msgstr "제가 다시 가족을 볼 수 있을까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BF"
msgid "I do not have time to treat you at the moment."
msgstr "지금은 당신을 치료할 시간이 없어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BE"
msgid "At least being this busy keeps my mind occupied..."
msgstr "적어도 이렇게 바쁘니 잡생각이 안 들어서 좋네..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BD"
msgid "I pray that the Great Serpent delivers us from this soon. We cannot take much more of this."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 어서 우리를 구원해 주시길 기도해. 우린 더 이상 버틸 수 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BC"
msgid "Had to turn away a mother and child this morning due to lack of supplies. That drains the life out of you."
msgstr "오늘 아침 물자가 부족해서 엄마와 아이를 돌려보내야 했어. 그런 일은 사람의 기력을 쏙 빼놓지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BB"
msgid "What could we have possibly done to deserve this? What angered Him so?"
msgstr "우리가 도대체 무슨 짓을 했기에 이런 일을 당해야 하는 거지? 그분이 뭐가 그렇게 분노하신 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129BA"
msgid "Sorry, I need to work."
msgstr "미안한데, 나 일해야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B9"
msgid "Apologies, but I need to prepare to treat a patient."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 환자를 치료할 준비를 해야 해서요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B8"
msgid "It will take more than this to break us."
msgstr "이까짓 걸로 우릴 꺾을 순 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B7"
msgid "The barracks are so empty... so many of our brothers and sisters, vanished without a trace."
msgstr "병영이 텅 비었어... 수많은 형제자매들이 흔적도 없이 사라졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B6"
msgid "All Must Serve!"
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B5"
msgid "Our brothers and sisters are standing beside the Great Serpent, now."
msgstr "우리의 형제자매들은 이제 위대한 뱀 곁에 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B4"
msgid "By the Serpent, you are the one that spoke with Anasko..."
msgstr "뱀의 이름으로, 당신이 아나스코와 대화했던 그 사람이군..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B3"
msgid "All this waiting around has been unbearable. Wish I disappeared along with my comrades."
msgstr "이렇게 하염없이 기다리는 건 너무 힘들어. 차라리 동료들과 함께 사라졌으면 좋았을걸."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B2"
msgid "Need something?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B1"
msgid "So good to see you, my friend."
msgstr "자네를 보니 정말 반갑군. 친구."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a quick, acknowledging grumble
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129B0"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "흠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AF"
msgid "Never thought I would see what is past the city gates."
msgstr "도시 문 너머에 뭐가 있는지 보게 될 줄은 상상도 못 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AE"
msgid "Dazra is... not quite what I was expecting."
msgstr "다즈라는... 내가 예상했던 것과는 좀 다르군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AD"
msgid "It is wonderful to be in Dazra, though some are not very accepting."
msgstr "다즈라에 오게 되어 기쁘지만, 일부 사람들은 별로 반기지 않는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AC"
msgid "It is because of you that I am walking through these streets now. Thank you."
msgstr "내가 지금 이 거리를 걷고 있는 건 자네 덕분이야. 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AB"
msgid "Ah, it's you. How are you?"
msgstr "아, 너구나. 잘 지내나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: exhausted, stressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129AA"
msgid "So many mouths to feed, and up to me to keep them fed. Ugh."
msgstr "먹여 살려야 할 입은 한가득인데, 그걸 책임지는 건 나일세. 으."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated, said as a complaint
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A9"
msgid "Just trying to get through the day."
msgstr "그냥 하루하루 버티고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated, said as a complaint
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A8"
msgid "The Great Serpent is testing my faith, I know it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 내 신앙을 시험하고 계셔, 분명해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated, said as a complaint
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A7"
msgid "Every part of my damned body aches, ugh. Getting too old to keep up with these stupid groats."
msgstr "망할 온몸이 다 쑤셔. 이놈의 그로트를 계속하기엔 나이가 너무 많은가 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said as a mild complaint, they are frustrated and stressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A6"
msgid "The groats are still a problem, as always, but I can manage."
msgstr "여전히 그로트가 문제긴 하지만, 어떻게든 해내고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mildly frustrated, they are overworked and stressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A5"
msgid "Good to know what has been happening to my groats, at least."
msgstr "적어도 내 그로트에 무슨 일이 있었는지 알게 돼서 다행이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reflective, but not that sad. busy with work
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A4"
msgid "Served the bastard right I suppose, but a groat is not worth bloodshed."
msgstr "그 놈이 그럴 만도 했겠지, 하지만 그로트 한 개 때문에 피를 흘릴 필요는 없었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reflective, but not that sad. busy with work
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A3"
msgid "So much death already... hope the damned groat was worth it."
msgstr "이미 너무 사람이 많이 죽었네... 그 망할 그로트가 그만한 가치가 있었으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A2"
msgid "I cannot believe you let the bastard leave with my groat."
msgstr "자네가 내 그로트를 들고 튀는 놈을 그냥 보냈다는 게 믿기지 않는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mad, upset that you let the thief run away with the groat
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A1"
msgid "Some help you turned out to be."
msgstr "자네가 무슨 도움이 되겠나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0129A0"
msgid "Hi, how are you?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 잘 지내세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299F"
msgid "Don't be scared, the Great Serpent will take care of us."
msgstr "두려워하지 말자. 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 돌봐 주실 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299E"
msgid "I hope my parents are okay, wherever they are."
msgstr "부모님이 어디에 계시든 무사하셨으면 좋겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299D"
msgid "Ivali and Ilana's house is great, but I miss my old one."
msgstr "이발리와 아일라나의 집도 좋지만, 예전 우리 집이 그리워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299C"
msgid "Grown-ups don't really care about us, do they?"
msgstr "어른들은 정말 우리한테 관심이 없는 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299B"
msgid "Ugh, there's nothing to do."
msgstr "아, 정말 할 일 없다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01299A"
msgid "*Sigh* Hi."
msgstr "*한숨* 안녕하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012999"
msgid "Ivali's so annoying. I'm sick of playing games with him."
msgstr "이발리는 짜증나. 같이 노는 거 이제 질렸어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012998"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012997"
msgid "Ilana says he hates playing with me, but he's lying. I'm so fun to play with."
msgstr "아일라나는 나랑 노는 거 싫어한다고 말했지만, 다 거짓말이야. 나랑 놀면 엄청 재밌는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012996"
msgid "My parents say the Great Serpent won't let anything bad happen to us."
msgstr "부모님은 위대한 뱀께서 우리에게 어떤 나쁜 일도 일어나지 않게 해주실 거라고 말씀하셨어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012995"
msgid "The Great Serpent has filled you with purpose. Is that not beautiful?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 목적으로 채워 주셨다. 아름답지 않은가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012994"
msgid "Your life, your purpose, has been forever changed."
msgstr "그대의 삶과 목적이 영원히 변화하였구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012993"
msgid "The Great Serpent sends you to me once again?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 다시 한번 그대를 보낸 것인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012992"
msgid "Do you hear it? The Great Serpent speaks to you, guides you."
msgstr "들리느냐? 위대한 뱀께서 그대에게 말하시고, 그대를 인도하는 소리가."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012991"
msgid "Do you seek counsel?"
msgstr "조언을 구하러 왔느냐?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012990"
msgid "What an honor it was, to aid you on your path to become one of the Promised."
msgstr "그대를 도와 약속받은 자가 되는 길로 이끈 것은 내게도 영광이었다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298F"
msgid "Mother tells me not to worry, but she seems so sad."
msgstr "엄마는 걱정하지 말라고 하시는데, 너무 슬퍼 보이셔."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298E"
msgid "Do you think we will all be okay?"
msgstr "우린 다 괜찮아지겠지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298D"
msgid "I miss being able to play with my friends."
msgstr "친구들이랑 같이 놀 수 있었던 때가 그리워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298C"
msgid "As much as I did not like it, I miss going to school."
msgstr "학교는 별로 안 좋아했지만, 그래도 학교 가고 싶어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298B"
msgid "My father has been gone for a while... I hope he is okay."
msgstr "아빠가 떠나신 지 꽤 됐어... 괜찮으셨으면 좋겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01298A"
msgid "I hope things go back to normal soon."
msgstr "빨리 다 원래대로 돌아갔으면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012989"
msgid "Do you think the Great Serpent is mad at us? I hear some people saying that."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리한테 화나신 걸까? 그런 말 하는 사람들이 있던데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012988"
msgid "Ugh, I am hungry."
msgstr "아, 배고파."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012987"
msgid "Mother has been busy lately, so I do not see her very often."
msgstr "엄마가 요즘 바쁘셔서, 자주 뵙지 못해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012986"
msgid "Oh, hi."
msgstr "아, 안녕."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012985"
msgid "Best to keep busy, lest you lose your purpose, as well as your home."
msgstr "바쁘게 사는 게 최선이야. 안 그럼 네 목적도, 네 집도 잃게 될 테니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012984"
msgid "Lot of work to be done, but it'll be done."
msgstr "할 일이 많지만, 다 해낼 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012983"
msgid "The Great Serpent saved Dazra from sin, you will see."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 다즈라를 죄악으로부터 구원하셨어. 두고 봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012982"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "음?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012981"
msgid "Excuse me, I have work to do."
msgstr "실례지만, 난 할 일이 있어서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012980"
msgid "Forgive me, I am tired today."
msgstr "미안, 오늘은 좀 피곤해서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01297F"
msgid "If you ask me, we should be celebrating. No one can doubt the Great Serpent's existence now."
msgstr "내 생각엔, 우린 이걸 축하해야 해. 이젠 아무도 위대한 뱀의 존재를 의심할 수 없을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01297E"
msgid "The Great Serpent would not have done this unless truly necessary. We must not doubt His intentions."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 꼭 필요하지 않으셨다면 이런 일을 하지 않으셨을 거야. 우리는 그분의 뜻을 의심해서는 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01297D"
msgid "*Sigh* Sometimes it feels like we are not making any progress."
msgstr "*한숨* 가끔은 우리가 아무런 진전이 없는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01297C"
msgid "No telling how long it will take to rebuild."
msgstr "다시 복구하려면 얼마나 걸릴지 알 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01297B"
msgid "The Great Serpent spared us so that we may rebuild stronger, better."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 환난을 면케 해주셨으니 우리는 더 강하고 더 낫게 재건할 수 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01297A"
msgid "Speak, will you?"
msgstr "말 좀 해봐. 응?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012979"
msgid "Let us hurry this along."
msgstr "서둘러서 끝내자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012978"
msgid "What are you doing, really?"
msgstr "대체 뭘 하고 있는 거야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_MalikVosh_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012977"
msgid "Ugh, just say something. It is not that hard."
msgstr "아, 그냥 뭐라도 말 좀 해보게. 그렇게 어려운 것도 아니잖나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_MalikVosh_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012976"
msgid "*Sigh* Come on."
msgstr "*한숨* 어서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_MalikVosh_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012975"
msgid "Are we done?"
msgstr "이제 끝난 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012974"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "괜찮은 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012973"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "어..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012972"
msgid "Did you still want to talk?"
msgstr "계속 얘기하고 싶으세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012971"
msgid "Uh, can I go now?"
msgstr "어, 이제 가도 돼요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012970"
msgid "This is boring."
msgstr "지루해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IlanaKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296F"
msgid "Ugh, what is wrong with you grown-ups?"
msgstr "으, 어른들은 왜 맨날 이런 식이죠?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296E"
msgid "Is everything okay?"
msgstr "다 괜찮은 거야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296D"
msgid "Uh, hello?"
msgstr "어, 여보세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIvaliKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_IvaliKalima_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296C"
msgid "Hey, I am still here!"
msgstr "야, 나 아직 여기 있어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296B"
msgid "Search your thoughts, speak when ready."
msgstr "생각을 정리하고, 준비되면 말하거라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01296A"
msgid "It is wise to think before speaking."
msgstr "말하기 전에 생각하는 것이 현명하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to politely wrap up the convo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012969"
msgid "If that was all..."
msgstr "할 말 더 없다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: How interesting! And unexpected. |Hmm... some kind of distortion in spacetime, maybe?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012968"
msgid "I'll take that slate, thank you."
msgstr "슬레이트, 좀 보도록 하겠습니다. 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected. &&& AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit. &&& AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised. &&& AzadDubas: Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why, yes! That's correct.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012964"
msgid "You learned that they were mutated strains with toxic characteristics."
msgstr "독성 특성을 가진 돌연변이 변종이라는 걸 알아내신 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.|Mostly as expected so far.|Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean.  &&& AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it. &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?|Seems mundane enough... oh, now wait just a moment.|As I suspected, the sensors simultaneously recorded a single event that produced very unusual impacts.|This is our best glimpse yet into the Dazra accident and how it affected the surrounding environs.|How interesting! The chronometers seem to have gone haywire in all four of the devices.|Even gravity itself seems to have been briefly altered. Remarkable!
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An astute question. However, I think the answer is no.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012963"
msgid "If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?"
msgstr "중력과 시간이 영향을 받았다면, 사람들이 눈치채지 못할 수 있었을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleasantly surprised, delighted / Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You learned that they were mutated strains with toxic characteristics.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You learned that they were mutated strains with toxic characteristics.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012962"
msgid "Why, yes! That's correct."
msgstr "아, 네! 맞아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Delighted / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You learned that they were mutated strains with toxic characteristics.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Notably, the first sightings of these toxic variants coincide with the incident in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012961"
msgid "I must say, it's a real pleasure to work with someone as intelligent and well-informed as you."
msgstr "당신처럼 지적이고 박식한 분과 함께 일하게 되어 정말 기쁩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited, eager to share knowledge / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a matter of fact, I was.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As a matter of fact, I was.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: It seems that certain local species of flora have suddenly become extremely toxic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012960"
msgid "I thought you might say that!"
msgstr "그렇게 말씀하실 줄 알았습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected. &&& AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit. &&& AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised. &&& AzadDubas: Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's fair enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295F"
msgid "Nah, I figured I'd leave the science stuff to you two."
msgstr "아뇨, 과학 관련 작업은 두 분에게 맡기는 게 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.|Mostly as expected so far.|Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean. 
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295E"
msgid "I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it."
msgstr "저도 당신의 추측에 동의합니다. 완전히 이해하지는 못하겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected. &&& AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit. &&& AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised. &&& AzadDubas: Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I thought you might say that!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295D"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I was."
msgstr "사실, 궁금하긴 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Have you, now?|Well, I'll share my conclusions and we'll see if they align with your hypothesis.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295C"
msgid "It seems that certain local species of flora have suddenly become extremely toxic."
msgstr "지역 식물 종 일부가 갑자기 매우 강한 독성을 띠게 된 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Notably, the first sightings of these toxic variants coincide with the incident in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295B"
msgid "These biochemical changes occurred with incredible speed."
msgstr "이러한 생화학적 변화는 믿을 수 없을 정도로 빠른 속도로 일어났습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I won't pretend to understand.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I won't pretend to understand.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01295A"
msgid "It's rather technical, I know."
msgstr "전문 분야를 알아야 알 수 있는 내용이죠. 맞습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I won't pretend to understand.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012959"
msgid "Suffice it to say, the appearance of the vortex had some very unexpected consequences."
msgstr "볼텍스의 출현이 매우 예상치 못한 결과를 가져왔다고 말하는 것으로 충분합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012958"
msgid "An astute question. However, I think the answer is no."
msgstr "날카로운 질문이군요. 하지만, 제 생각에 답은 '눈치 못 챘다’인 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012957"
msgid "The readings indicate very subtle shifts that could have gone completely unnoticed."
msgstr "측정값 변화가 매우 미묘해서, 전혀 알아챌 수 없었을 수도 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012956"
msgid "At worst, there might have been a moment of dizziness or a sense of events being a bit earlier or later than expected."
msgstr ""
"최악의 경우, 어지러움을 느끼거나, 어떤 일이 예상보다 조금 빠르게 또는 늦게 일어나는 것처럼 느끼는 정도밖에 안됐을 수도 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If gravity and time were affected, wouldn't people have noticed?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012955"
msgid "Those are hardly uncommon occurrences for most people."
msgstr "대부분의 사람에게 그 정도 증상은 특이하지 않을 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: It seems that certain local species of flora have suddenly become extremely toxic.|These biochemical changes occurred with incredible speed.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012953"
msgid "Notably, the first sightings of these toxic variants coincide with the incident in Dazra."
msgstr "주목할 점은, 이런 독성 변종이 처음 목격된 시기가 다즈라에서 그 사고가 벌어진 시기와 일치한다는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012952"
msgid "I'm just not sure how the strange effects of the vortex could cause plants to mutate so rapidly."
msgstr "볼텍스의 이상한 효과가 어떻게 식물이 그렇게 빨리 돌연변이를 일으키도록 할 수 있었던 건지는 잘 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.|Mostly as expected so far.|Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean.  &&& AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it. &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?|Seems mundane enough... oh, now wait just a moment.|As I suspected, the sensors simultaneously recorded a single event that produced very unusual impacts.|This is our best glimpse yet into the Dazra accident and how it affected the surrounding environs.|How interesting! The chronometers seem to have gone haywire in all four of the devices.|Even gravity itself seems to have been briefly altered. Remarkable!
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's rather technical, I know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012951"
msgid "I won't pretend to understand."
msgstr "이해한 척하지는 않겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected. &&& AzadDubas: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit. &&& AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised. &&& AzadDubas: Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well. We'll move on, then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100C60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012950"
msgid "I'm here for the money, so let's just move on."
msgstr "저는 돈 때문에 여기 온 거니까, 그냥 넘어가시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't really understand it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't really understand it.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110031A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01294F"
msgid "Not to worry. Your task was to collect the data, not interpret it."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 당신이 맡은 일은 데이터를 수집하는 것이지, 해석하는 것이 아니니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't really understand it.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110031A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01294E"
msgid "I was just asking out of curiosity, really."
msgstr "그냥 호기심에 물어본 것뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01294D"
msgid "Now, I'm sure you're wondering what we've learned from the plant tissue samples you brought back."
msgstr "자, 이제 당신이 가져온 식물 조직 샘플에서 저희가 무엇을 알아냈는지 궁금하실 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Could these readings be a mistake?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Could these readings be a mistake?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01294C"
msgid "For one sensor, perhaps. For all four? No, it's not possible."
msgstr "센서 하나라면 그럴 수도 있죠. 하지만 네 개 전부 다요? 아뇨, 불가능합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Could these readings be a mistake?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01294B"
msgid "As unusual as the readings are, they're accurate."
msgstr "측정값이 특이하기는 하지만, 정확하게 측정됐습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01294A"
msgid "Remember this: We are always watching."
msgstr "명심하십쇼. 우리가 항상 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012949"
msgid "I am not sure what to make of you..."
msgstr "당신에 대해 어떻게 생각해야 할지 모르겠습니다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012948"
msgid "Move, no loitering."
msgstr "움직이시죠. 서성거리지 말고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012947"
msgid "How did we end up here?"
msgstr "어쩌다 이렇게 된 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you want me dead?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you want me dead?
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01100331
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012946"
msgid "I wanted to see the heretics fail, to watch them squirm and suffer as we rose to power."
msgstr "이단자가 몰락하는 꼴을 보고 싶거든. 우리가 힘을 얻을 때 놈들은 허우적거리겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you want me dead?
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: There's no need for violence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01100331
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012945"
msgid "But in all my plans I did not account for you, false Promised. I will not make that mistake twice."
msgstr "계획을 세울 때 너 같은 거짓 약속받은 자를 생각하지는 못했어. 그런 실수를 또 하지는 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent! &&& MihaelShip:  &&& MihaelShip: You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail.|Your death will be the beginning.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wanted to see the heretics fail, to watch them squirm and suffer as we rose to power. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01100332
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012944"
msgid "Why do you want me dead?"
msgstr "왜 날 죽이려 하는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent! &&& MihaelShip:  &&& MihaelShip: You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail.|Your death will be the beginning.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Those who forget their betters are destined to die by their hand. Know that it was Mihael Dziri who made you Penitent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012943"
msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr "너 누구였더라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012929"
msgid "Why are you here, and not in the Citadel?"
msgstr "왜 성채가 아니라 여기 있으십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012928"
msgid "This is hardly the place for you to be standing. Anasko needs you!"
msgstr "지금 여기 서 계실 때가 아닙니다. 아나스코 님을 도와야지요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012927"
msgid "You have a task before you. Please, we are counting on you!"
msgstr "맡으신 일이 있으시지요. 부탁입니다. 그대만 믿고 있어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosLovek
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012926"
msgid "What in the Serpent's name are you doing here? You are supposed to be in the Citadel right now!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 이름에 대고, 여기서 뭐 하는 거요? 지금쯤이면 성채에 들어가 있어야지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosLovek
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012925"
msgid "We have not gone to all this trouble for you to stand around!"
msgstr "가만히 서 있으라고 이런 수고를 하는 게 아니란 말이오!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01100321
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ06_BlockingHellosLovek
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012924"
msgid "For Anasko's sake, get in there!"
msgstr "아나스코 님을 위해서 빨리 출발하시오!"

#. VOICE TYPE: GenericMaleEvenToned
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001MasterQuest
