#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012907"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알았어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012906"
msgid "I need a drink after that."
msgstr "이젠 뭐라도 마셔야겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012905"
msgid "Back to whatever it is you are supposed to do, huh?"
msgstr "원래 하던 일을 하러 돌아갈 생각이겠지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012904"
msgid "Good day."
msgstr "좋은 날이네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012903"
msgid "Good luck, with everything."
msgstr "만사가 형통하길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012902"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012901"
msgid "Get out of my sight, will you?"
msgstr "좀 내 앞에서 사라지겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012900"
msgid "Good, now leave me alone."
msgstr "좋아, 이제 날 내버려 두도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0128FF"
msgid "Finally, I am done with you."
msgstr "드디어 자네와 대화가 끝났군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS00B_MS01_OchimGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0128FD"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said as a quick goodbye
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0128FC"
msgid "On your way."
msgstr "그럼, 안녕히."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128FB"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "알았어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SaharRaztan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128FA"
msgid "If you need a change, you have come to the right place."
msgstr "변화가 필요하다면, 제대로 찾아왔어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F9"
msgid "Welcome."
msgstr "어서 오세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F8"
msgid "Need help with anything?"
msgstr "나의 도움이 필요한 게 있나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F7"
msgid "I see why Anasko spoke to you. You seem a charitable soul."
msgstr "아나스코 바룬께서 왜 자네에게 말씀하신지 알겠군. 자애로운 사람인 것 같네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F6"
msgid "Amila has shamed us for the final time."
msgstr "아밀라가 가문 이름을 먹칠하는 건 이번이 마지막일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: harsh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F5"
msgid "Get away from me."
msgstr "당장 나한테서 물러나게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 011112B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_BlockingHellos_Generic0104
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0128F4"
msgid "I have nothing to say to you."
msgstr "너한테 할 말 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: harsh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F3"
msgid "You robbed me of the chance to defend my family's honor. You are just as slimy as Amila."
msgstr "자네가 우리 가문의 명예를 지킬 기회를 앗아갔어. 자네도 아밀라처럼 똑같이 못된 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F2"
msgid "What is done, is done."
msgstr "이미 벌어진 일은 어쩔 수 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with a tinge of sadness, like he is trying to convince himself. He is lying to make himself feel better about what he has done / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F1"
msgid "Amila was out of control, and had to be stopped."
msgstr "아밀라는 자제심을 잃었어. 어쩔 수 없이 막아야 했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with a tinge of sadness. He is lying to make himself feel better about what he has done / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128F0"
msgid "You have helped restore honor to my family name. Thank you."
msgstr "자네 덕분에 가문의 명예를 지킬 수 있었어. 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with a tinge of sadness. He is lying to make himself feel better about what he has done / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128EF"
msgid "I do not miss him. I do not."
msgstr "놈이 그립진 않네. 안 그리워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128EE"
msgid "Not in any mood to speak with you."
msgstr "당신과 대화할 기분 아니야."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0128ED"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "뭘 원하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128EC"
msgid "What the hell have I done?"
msgstr "대체 내가 뭘 했다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128EB"
msgid "It should have never happened, I see that now."
msgstr "절대 그런 일이 일어나지 말아야 했어. 이제 알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128EA"
msgid "Should've been me..."
msgstr "나였어야 했는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E9"
msgid "I really just want to be left alone."
msgstr "제발 나 좀 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E8"
msgid "Head's pounding... could use a bottle of something right now."
msgstr "머리가 욱신거리네... 뭐라도 한 병 마셔야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: absent minded
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E7"
msgid "Need me for something?"
msgstr "필요한 게 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E6"
msgid "This loss of life is tragic."
msgstr "목숨을 잃다니. 비극적이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E5"
msgid "Amila was a tortured soul. I hope he finds solace with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "아밀라는 고통받은 영혼이었어요. 위대한 뱀께 돌아갔을 땐 부디 평안을 찾기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E4"
msgid "I had hoped you would stop the duel, but what is done is done."
msgstr "당신이 결투를 멈춰 주길 바랐지만... 결국 이렇게 되었군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E3"
msgid "What the hell do you want?"
msgstr "대체 뭘 원하는데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: surprise and confusion, not asking a question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0128E2"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E1"
msgid "Borhal will not show it, but Amila's death will damage him. You could have stopped this."
msgstr "보할이 행색은 보여 주지 않겠지만, 동생이 죽은 걸로 상처를 입었을 거예요. 당신이면 막을 수 있었다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128E0"
msgid "*Sigh* Borhal, he was one of the best of us."
msgstr "*한숨* 보할... 우리 중 가장 뛰어난 신민이었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mildly sad / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DF"
msgid "The duel... everything... such a mistake."
msgstr "결투... 이 모든 것... 전부 큰 실수였어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mildly sad / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DE"
msgid "Should have never happened to begin with. It was stupid of me to go along with it all."
msgstr "애초에 일어나지 말아야 할 일이었어요. 일이 벌어지도록 가만히 내버려 둔 제가 바보였어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mildly sad / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DD"
msgid "As much as they quarreled, Amila is nothing without Borhal."
msgstr "서로 다투긴 했지만, 형 없이 아밀라 혼자서는 별 볼 일 없는 사람이라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DC"
msgid "Borhal and Amila are angry now, but they will get over it."
msgstr "보할과 아밀라가 서로 싸우고 있긴 하지만 결국 화해할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DB"
msgid "In time, Borhal and Amila will come to see how foolish they were being."
msgstr "머지 않아 보할과 아밀라는 서로 얼마나 바보 같았는지 깨닫겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128DA"
msgid "Thank you for trusting me. You saved two lives."
msgstr "제 말을 믿어 주셔서 감사해요. 두 목숨을 살린 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128D9"
msgid "I just... cannot believe this happened."
msgstr "그냥... 이런 일이 일어났다는 걸 믿을 수가 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128D8"
msgid "Credits running low... ugh, what am I going to do?"
msgstr "크레딧이 바닥나고 있어... 아, 어떡하지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128D7"
msgid "My job, and everyone I worked with... I cannot believe they are gone."
msgstr "내 직장, 그리고 함께 일했던 사람들... 다들 사라졌다는 걸 믿을 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0128D6"
msgid "I pray this experience is enough to lead Borhal and Amila to repair their relationship."
msgstr "이번 경험을 통해 보할과 아밀라의 관계가 다시 회복되면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128D5"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Welcome back! Time to see if our sensors can peel back another layer of the mystery.|Did you notice anything unusual in the environmental data?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not to worry. Your task was to collect the data, not interpret it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 0110031B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128D4"
msgid "I didn't really understand it."
msgstr "저는 정말로 뭐가 뭔지 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Welcome back! Time to see if our sensors can peel back another layer of the mystery.|Did you notice anything unusual in the environmental data?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How interesting! And unexpected. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100319
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128D3"
msgid "There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy."
msgstr "중력 변동과 알 수 없는 형태의 에너지가 있었다는 증거가 있더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100318
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128D2"
msgid "How interesting! And unexpected."
msgstr "그거 정말 흥미롭군요! 그리고 예상치 못한 일이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: I'll take that slate, thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01100318
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128D1"
msgid "Hmm... some kind of distortion in spacetime, maybe?"
msgstr "흠... 일종의 시공간 왜곡이 있었던 걸까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player has boarded the ship / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: CaptainSpawnMarker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 011000CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_200a_Boarded
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128CE"
msgid "So you wish to settle this in person. Very well, false Promised, face your deliverance!"
msgstr "직접 처리하고 싶다는 거지. 좋다, 거짓 약속받은 자여. 네놈의 종말을 맞이해라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no need for violence.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no need for violence.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: You can pray for mercy or absolution, it does not matter.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128CD"
msgid "It is the only outcome you deserve, heretic."
msgstr "네놈이 받아 마땅한 건 폭력뿐이다, 이단자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: 
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128CC"
msgid "You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail."
msgstr "네놈이 우리의 길을 어둡게 했지만, 진정한 잔다르의 아이들은 승리할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's no need for violence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128CB"
msgid "Your death will be the beginning."
msgstr "네놈의 죽음이 그 첫걸음이 되겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: 
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE72
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100c_HailingRefused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128CA"
msgid "Death is upon you false Promised."
msgstr "죽음이 기다린다, 거짓 약속받은 자여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent! &&& MihaelShip:  &&& MihaelShip: You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail.|Your death will be the beginning.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is the only outcome you deserve, heretic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE70
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C9"
msgid "There's no need for violence."
msgstr "폭력을 쓸 필요는 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent! &&& MihaelShip:  &&& MihaelShip: You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail.|Your death will be the beginning.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. The mistake is all yours, having knelt under the banner of a false prophet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C8"
msgid "Coming here was a mistake."
msgstr "여기 온 건 실수일 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Coming here was a mistake.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Coming here was a mistake.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: You can pray for mercy or absolution, it does not matter.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C7"
msgid "No. The mistake is all yours, having knelt under the banner of a false prophet."
msgstr "아니지. 네놈이야말로 실수한 거다. 거짓 예언자의 깃발 아래 무릎 꿇었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent! &&& MihaelShip:  &&& MihaelShip: You may have obscured our path, but the true Children of Jandar will prevail.|Your death will be the beginning.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: Those who interfere in the Great Serpent's work must be cleansed!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C6"
msgid "[Attack] Talk all you want. You're going to die, Zealot."
msgstr "[공격] 마음대로 떠들어, 광신도 놈아. 넌 곧 죽을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] Talk all you want. You're going to die, Zealot.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Talk all you want. You're going to die, Zealot.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: You can pray for mercy or absolution, it does not matter.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C5"
msgid "Then power your weapons, heretic. We shall see who the Great Serpent favors!"
msgstr "그럼 무장을 올려라, 이단자. 위대한 뱀께서 누구를 지켜주실지 보자고!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_GravDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipGravJumpDown
msgctxt "0128C4"
msgid "I don't need a Grav Drive to destroy you!"
msgstr "널 박살 내는 데 중력 구동기는 필요 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who are you again?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you again?
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: There's no need for violence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C3"
msgid "Those who forget their betters are destined to die by their hand. Know that it was Mihael Dziri who made you Penitent."
msgstr "자신보다 뛰어난 이들을 잊은 자는 바로 그 손에 죽을 운명이지. 너를 회개시킨 자가 미해일 지리라는 것만 알아 둬라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: You can pray for mercy or absolution, it does not matter.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C2"
msgid "Those who interfere in the Great Serpent's work must be cleansed!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 행하심을 방해하는 자들은 정화되어야 한다!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: It is the only outcome you deserve, heretic.
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: Those who interfere in the Great Serpent's work must be cleansed!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100b_HailingAnswered
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C1"
msgid "You can pray for mercy or absolution, it does not matter."
msgstr "자비나 참회를 구하는 기도를 해도 상관없다."

#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100a_Hailing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128C0"
msgid "I've found you at last, false Promised."
msgstr "드디어 찾았다, 거짓 약속받은 놈."

#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100a_Hailing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128BF"
msgid "And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "네놈의 죽음은 위대한 뱀께 바칠 좋은 제물이 되겠지!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: Death is upon you false Promised. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100a_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128BE"
msgid "Answer me, coward."
msgstr "응답해라, 겁쟁이 놈아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: Death is upon you false Promised. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100a_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128BD"
msgid "If you try to run, I will find you again."
msgstr "만약 도망친다면 다시 찾아낼 거다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MihaelShip: I've found you at last, false Promised.|And your death will make a fine offering for the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: MihaelShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Spaceship / Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MihaelShip: Death is upon you false Promised. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_BE_100a_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0128BC"
msgid "You will answer the hail. Now."
msgstr "교신에 응답해라. 당장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Venom / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE64
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011000CC
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "0128BB"
msgid "I will serve your head to the Great Serpent on a plate of bones!"
msgstr "네놈 머리통을 접시에 담아 위대한 뱀께 바칠 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Venom / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE64
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011000CC
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "0128BA"
msgid "Come, heretic, face your doom."
msgstr "덤벼라, 이단자 놈아. 죽음을 맞이해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Venom / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010FFE64
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 011000CC
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "0128B9"
msgid "The Great Serpent will dine on your bones, faithless one."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 네 뼈로 만찬을 벌이실 거다, 불신자 놈아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& Mujeen: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012869"
msgid "You sell your honor cheaply. It is a disgrace."
msgstr "네 명예를 헐값에 파는 거야. 수치스러운 줄 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& Mujeen: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012868"
msgid "And an even smaller price to pay for one's moral code."
msgstr "누군가의 도덕관에 비한다면 아주 작은 대가겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& Mujeen: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012867"
msgid "Seems like the price of murder comes pretty cheap around here."
msgstr "여기서는 살인에 대한 처벌이 아주 약한 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& Mujeen: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012866"
msgid "Really? Tell me this is some sort of crude joke."
msgstr "정말이야? 사실 이건 무슨 유치한 농담이라고 말해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities. &&& Mujeen: You disappoint me, convert.|Why should I willingly confess and ensure my death? I'd much rather argue my case in front of my peers.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012865"
msgid "Argue all you want. This only ends one way."
msgstr "맘대로 다투셔. 이러면 결국 한 가지 결말밖에 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities. &&& Mujeen: You disappoint me, convert.|Why should I willingly confess and ensure my death? I'd much rather argue my case in front of my peers.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012864"
msgid "Your peers? You mean other crooks? Face it, it's over."
msgstr "당신네 패거리? 다른 범죄자들을 말하는 건가? 현실을 좀 봐. 이제 끝났다니까."

#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities. &&& Mujeen: You disappoint me, convert.|Why should I willingly confess and ensure my death? I'd much rather argue my case in front of my peers.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012863"
msgid "Yeah, good luck with that one buddy."
msgstr "그래, 행운을 빌지. 친구."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities. &&& Mujeen: You disappoint me, convert.|Why should I willingly confess and ensure my death? I'd much rather argue my case in front of my peers.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012862"
msgid "A confession might grant you leniency. But it seems you will reap what you sowed."
msgstr "자백하면 관대한 처분을 받을 수도 있을 거야. 하지만 뿌린 대로 거두게 될 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012861"
msgid "Please. You made no grand gesture. You violated the law, and aided those who want us dead."
msgstr "제발. 숭고한 행동을 한 게 아니잖아. 법을 어겼고, 우리를 죽이려는 자들을 도왔을 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012860"
msgid "The big picture? All I see is a mug shot."
msgstr "큰 그림? 내 눈에는 머그샷밖에 안 보이는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. PROMPT: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285F"
msgid "Why do politicians always try to make their crimes seem holy? Give me a break."
msgstr "정치인들은 왜 항상 자기들 범죄행위를 신성한 짓인 것처럼 포장하려 할까? 작작 좀 하시지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285E"
msgid "We've seen more than enough, thank you."
msgstr "충분히 봤으니 됐어. 참 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal. &&& Mujeen: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.|Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285D"
msgid "This is foolish. The Zealots are irredeemable. You are attempting to tame a wild animal that only wants to devour you."
msgstr "멍청한 짓이야. 광신도들은 구제 불능이라고. 너는 널 잡아먹으려고 하는 야생동물을 길들이려 하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal. &&& Mujeen: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.|Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285C"
msgid "I don't know about helping the Zealots, but I like this guy's optimism. You show him a few drops of water, he sees a full glass."
msgstr ""
"광신도들을 돕는 게 맞는진 잘 모르겠지만, 이 인간의 낙관주의는 마음에 드는군. 물 몇 방울을 보여주면, 잔이 가득 찼다고 볼 거 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal. &&& Mujeen: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.|Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285B"
msgid "Guess that settles it. We're the bad guys."
msgstr "그럼 결정됐나 보군. 우리가 나쁜 놈들이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal. &&& Mujeen: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.|Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FE9F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01285A"
msgid "Converting the Zealots seems like a longshot. But I confess, I don't know Va'ruun politics."
msgstr "광신도들을 갱생시키는 건 가망 없어 보여. 하지만 솔직히, 바룬 정치에 대해서는 잘 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: One could argue that faith got us into this mess in the first place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012859"
msgid "You have always lacked faith, Dul'kehf."
msgstr "언제나 믿음이 부족하시군, 둘케프."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: You have always lacked faith, Dul'kehf. &&& Djimal: One could argue that faith got us into this mess in the first place. &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012858"
msgid "Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone."
msgstr "동감이오. 성채를 되찾아야지. 전부 들여보냅시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& Lovek: You have always lacked faith, Dul'kehf. &&& Djimal: One could argue that faith got us into this mess in the first place.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012857"
msgid "Enough! It is time for action, not bickering."
msgstr "그만들 하세요! 말싸움 말고 행동을 해야지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& Lovek: You have always lacked faith, Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012856"
msgid "One could argue that faith got us into this mess in the first place."
msgstr "애초에 그 믿음 때문에 이 지경이 됐다고 할 수도 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: One could argue that faith got us into this mess in the first place. &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering. &&& Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012855"
msgid "Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside."
msgstr "미쳤어요? 성채가 얼마나 안정적인지, 안에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 전혀 모른다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering. &&& Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone. &&& Djimal: Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I disagree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012854"
msgid "A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution."
msgstr "직접 공격이 최선의 방법이죠. 조심하고 있을 시간이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has guided us this far. He will not abandon us now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has guided us this far. He will not abandon us now.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012853"
msgid "Your conviction is admirable."
msgstr "존경할 만한 확신이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
