msgctxt "012851"
msgid "I wish we had more time, but we need to act."
msgstr "시간이 더 있었으면 좋았겠지만, 이제 움직여야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering. &&& Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone. &&& Djimal: Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your conviction is admirable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012850"
msgid "The Great Serpent has guided us this far. He will not abandon us now."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 여기까지 인도하셨어요. 이제 와서 우릴 버리실 리 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering. &&& Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone. &&& Djimal: Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside.
