#. TOPIC: 010FD9D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01284F"
msgid "We've just disrupted the whole situation. We need to evaluate before we go charging in there."
msgstr "방금 전체 상황이 불안정해진 것 같은데요. 뛰어들기 전에 상황 평가를 해야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Enough! It is time for action, not bickering. &&& Lovek: Agreed. We must secure the Citadel. Send in everyone. &&& Djimal: Are you mad? We have no idea how stable this is, no idea what is happening inside.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Time is a luxury we do not have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01284E"
msgid "Seems like rushing things caused all of this to begin with. We need to take it slow."
msgstr "일을 서두르다가 이런 일이 생기게 된 것 같은데요. 천천히 진행해야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
