#. TOPIC: 010FD9D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01284B"
msgid "Didn't you have a plan for once the device worked?"
msgstr "장치가 작동하고 난 뒤의 계획은 없었던 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Whatever we do, we'd better do it quickly.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever we do, we'd better do it quickly.
