#. TOPIC: 010FD9CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01284A"
msgid "I cannot argue with that."
msgstr "반박할 수가 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Didn't you have a plan for once the device worked?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Didn't you have a plan for once the device worked?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012849"
msgid "You saw yourself, we barely had a plan for the device! We are lucky to have made it this far."
msgstr "직접 봤겠지만, 장치에 대한 계획도 거의 없었어요! 여기까지 온 것만 해도 운 좋은 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution. &&& Malibor: I disagree. &&& Malibor: Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: And, to be candid, we have no idea what will happen to anyone entering the Citadel. We must minimize the potential risk.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012848"
msgid "It would be unwise to leave Dazra even more vulnerable than it already is."
msgstr "다즈라를 지금보다 더 위험하게 만드는 건 현명하지 못해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't suppose I can say "no thank you."
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't suppose I can say "no thank you."
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012847"
msgid "To do so would condemn at least our Speaker, and perhaps all in Dazra."
msgstr "그렇게 하면 적어도 우리 대변자님은 끝장이시겠지요. 어쩌면 다즈라 전체가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here. &&& Djimal: It would be unwise to leave Dazra even more vulnerable than it already is.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012846"
msgid "And, to be candid, we have no idea what will happen to anyone entering the Citadel. We must minimize the potential risk."
msgstr "그리고 솔직히 말해서, 성채로 들어갈 때 무슨 일이 일어날지 전혀 모릅니다. 잠재적인 위험은 최대한 줄여야 하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I see where this is going.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I see where this is going.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012845"
msgid "It is only fitting that it should be you."
msgstr "오직 그대만이 할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here. &&& Djimal: It would be unwise to leave Dazra even more vulnerable than it already is. &&& Malibor: And, to be candid, we have no idea what will happen to anyone entering the Citadel. We must minimize the potential risk.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is only fitting that it should be you.
