#. TOPIC: 010FD9C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012843"
msgid "Why are you looking at me like that?"
msgstr "왜 그렇게 쳐다봐요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you looking at me like that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you looking at me like that?
