#. TOPIC: 010FD9C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012842"
msgid "I thought perhaps it was obvious where this leads."
msgstr "어쩌면 당연했을지도 모른다고 생각했으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A direct assault is our best approach. This is no time for caution. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here. &&& Djimal: It would be unwise to leave Dazra even more vulnerable than it already is. &&& Malibor: And, to be candid, we have no idea what will happen to anyone entering the Citadel. We must minimize the potential risk.
