#. TOPIC: 010FD9BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012841"
msgid "I don't suppose I can say \"no thank you.\""
msgstr "'됐어요'라고 말할 상황은 아닌 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I disagree.
