#. TOPIC: 010FD9C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012840"
msgid "Committing a large force is impossible. There have been reports of increased Zealot activity, no doubt in response to what we have been doing here."
msgstr "대규모 병력 투입은 불가능합니다. 광신도 활동이 증가했다는 보고가 있었어요. 분명 여기서 진행 중인 일에 반응하는 거겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01283F"
msgid "I suppose this is where we step up. After all, Constellation is about taking risks to explore the unknown."
msgstr "이제 우리가 나설 때 같네요. 결국, 컨스텔레이션은 미지의 세계를 탐험하기 위해 모든 위험을 감수하니까요."

msgctxt "01283E"
msgid "\"Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown.\""
msgstr "'컨스텔레이션은 미지의 세계를 탐험하기 위해 모든 위험을 감수하죠.'"

msgctxt "01283D"
msgid "\"It will be an honor.\""
msgstr "'영광입니다.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
