#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01283C"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All Must Serve.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01283B"
msgid "Indeed. And your service will be remembered, no matter what."
msgstr "그렇지요. 그대의 도움은 무슨 일이 있어도 기억될 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown." &&& companion: I suppose this is where we step up. After all, Constellation is about taking risks to explore the unknown.
