#. TOPIC: 010FD9AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01283A"
msgid "Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but..."
msgstr "정말이오? 우리 신입 교인의 신념을 의심하는 건 아니지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0760_CompanionCrusadersHallEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012839"
msgid "A memorial in favor of the Serpent's Crusade. Never thought I'd see this..."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 옹호하는 기념비라니. 이런 걸 보게 될 줄은 몰랐어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD6F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0430_CompanionResearchLevelEntry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012838"
msgid "Careful. Looks like security here is still online."
msgstr "조심해. 보안이 아직도 켜져 있는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: It will be an honor.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "It will be an honor."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
