#. TOPIC: 010FD9B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012837"
msgid "It will be nothing short of the highest honor. We will not fail."
msgstr "최고의 영광이나 다름없군요. 실패하지 않겠습니다."

