#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012833"
msgid "There it is. So much destruction, so much lost, for this..."
msgstr "저거구나. 그 많은 파괴, 그 많은 손실이, 저것 때문에..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
