#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: It will be nothing short of the highest honor. We will not fail.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We will speak again soon, I hope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012830"
msgid "The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 저희를 굽어살펴주시고, 어떤 일이 닥쳐도 저희를 구해 주시길."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: It will be nothing short of the highest honor. We will not fail.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We will speak again soon, I hope.
