#. TOPIC: 010FD9AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01282E"
msgid "I figure after this, we've got at least one potential afterlife on lock."
msgstr "이 일이 끝나고 나면, 적어도 사후 세계 하나는 예약할 수 있겠네."

msgctxt "01282D"
msgid "\"Saving House Va'ruun\" wasn't on my to-do list today, but screw it. Let's go be heroes."
msgstr "'바룬 가문을 구하기'는 오늘 할 일 목록에 없었지만, 뭐 어때. 영웅이 되러 가자고."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: It will be nothing short of the highest honor. We will not fail.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We will speak again soon, I hope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010FD9AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
