msgctxt "0127FF"
msgid "It is... good to keep, uh, busy."
msgstr "바쁘게... 지내는 게, 어, 좋지요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
