#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
