#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
