msgid "Huh? Oh yes, goodbye."
msgstr "어? 아, 그래요. 잘 가세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a lot on her mind, trying to keep it together. / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
