#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_VorisNerun_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
