#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0127DE"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "괜찮은 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_MyloDazmi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127DD"
msgid "Take your time. I do not have anyone waiting for me."
msgstr "천천히 해요. 절 기다리는 사람은 없으니까요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_MyloDazmi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127DC"
msgid "Hard to think straight, nowadays."
msgstr "요즘은, 정신 차리기가 힘들어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127DB"
msgid "Was that... was that it?"
msgstr "그게... 그게 다예요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127DA"
msgid "Are we... done? Can I leave?"
msgstr "저기... 끝난 건가요? 가도 돼요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D9"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D8"
msgid "No need to rush."
msgstr "서두를 필요 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D7"
msgid "I know, it is a lot to think about."
msgstr "알아, 생각할 게 많겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D6"
msgid "Take your time."
msgstr "천천히 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D5"
msgid "Really, I do not have time for this."
msgstr "정말, 이럴 시간 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D4"
msgid "Are we done here?"
msgstr "여기서 볼 일 다 본 거야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D3"
msgid "You are wasting my time. And yours."
msgstr "내 시간 낭비하는 거야. 네 시간도 낭비하는 거고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D2"
msgid "Sorry, did you say something?"
msgstr "미안, 뭐랬어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D1"
msgid "Hanton is across the way, if you are feeling unwell."
msgstr "몸이 안 좋으면, 저쪽에 핸톤이 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127D0"
msgid "Seems you have a lot on your mind, eh?"
msgstr "생각이 많아 보이네, 어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mocking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CF"
msgid "*This* is the savior of Dazra?"
msgstr "'이게' 다즈라의 구원자라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mocking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CE"
msgid "Outsiders, pfft. So dull."
msgstr "이방인이라. *피식하는 소리* 따분하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mocking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CD"
msgid "This... conversation, is growing very tiresome."
msgstr "이거... 떠들려니 점점 피곤해지는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CC"
msgid "Are off-worlders always this boring?"
msgstr "외부 세계인들은 항상 이렇게 지루한가요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CB"
msgid "Honestly, I thought you would be more outgoing."
msgstr "솔직히, 당신이 더 외향적일 줄 알았어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127CA"
msgid "You are more shy than I thought you would be..."
msgstr "생각보다 더 수줍음이 많으시네요..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C9"
msgid "Is this how you usually have a conversation? You know, where you are from?"
msgstr "이게 당신네 동네에서 대화하는 방식인가요? 그러니까, 당신이 온 곳 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: slightly joking, trying to dissolve awkwardness of situation
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C8"
msgid "You are an odd one."
msgstr "좀 별나시네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C7"
msgid "I have work to do, so..."
msgstr "제가 할 일이 있어서요. 그러니까..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_OmanLabir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C6"
msgid "I am sorry, but I do not have time for this."
msgstr "미안하지만, 이럴 시간 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: low opinion of himself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_OmanLabir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C5"
msgid "Are you okay? Hanton could help, not me."
msgstr "괜찮아? 핸톤이 도와줄 수 있을 거야, 난 아니고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGs001_OmanLabir_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0127C4"
msgid "Do not let me keep you."
msgstr "붙잡지 않을게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: awkward, stammering but friendly / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127C3"
msgid "Uh, do you, do you need something?"
msgstr "어, 뭐, 뭐 필요한 거 있어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: awkward, stammering but friendly / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127C2"
msgid "Lots of... lots of work, ever since... what happened."
msgstr "그... 그 일이 일어난 이후로... 할 일이... 할 일이 많아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AleksahLimal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127C1"
msgid "I need a drink."
msgstr "술 한 잔 해야겠어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127C0"
msgid "What can I help you with?"
msgstr "뭘 도와줄까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BF"
msgid "I am dying to work on your ship, friend."
msgstr "네 우주선 고치는 거라면 사족을 못 쓰지, 친구."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DumarHasadi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BE"
msgid "Need something for your ship?"
msgstr "네 우주선에 필요한 거 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, flippant
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BD"
msgid "Is it urgent, or can it wait?"
msgstr "급한 거야, 아니면 나중에 해도 돼?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, flippant
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BC"
msgid "If you do not need medical assistance, please move along."
msgstr "의료 지원이 필요한 게 아니라면, 어서 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, flippant
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HantonIrara_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BB"
msgid "*Sigh* It never ends."
msgstr "*한숨* 끝이 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127BA"
msgid "Buy what you need and then get out."
msgstr "필요한 거 샀으면 나가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B9"
msgid "I suppose your money is worth the same as everyone else's."
msgstr "네 돈도 다른 사람들 돈이랑 가치가 같겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B8"
msgid "One wrong move, and I call the guards, outsider."
msgstr "한 번만 더 까불면 경비대를 부르겠어. 이방인."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: gruff, suspicious  / Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MakolaJubav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B7"
msgid "Already have enough to worry about, without an interloper in my shop."
msgstr "가게에 얼쩡거리는 놈 좀 없었으면 좋겠네. 그러잖아도 딴 걱정거리가 많다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B6"
msgid "Looks like I have full permission to sell to you, now."
msgstr "이제 판매 권한이 모두 승인돼서 판매할 수 있겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B5"
msgid "Need some stopping power, huh?"
msgstr "저지력이 필요하신가요? 허?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B4"
msgid "You have been cleared to buy from me, so what are you waiting for?"
msgstr "이제 구매해도 된다고 승인을 받았는데, 뭘 머뭇거리고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: friendly / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B3"
msgid "Apologies, but you are not cleared to purchase from me yet."
msgstr "미안하지만 아직 구매 승인이 나지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B2"
msgid "You do not have approval to trade with me."
msgstr "당신에겐 저와 거래할 수 있는 권한 승인이 나지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B1"
msgid "Sorry, but will have to get approval before you can buy any weapons from me."
msgstr "미안하지만 저한테 무기를 구매하시려면 먼저 승인을 받아야 해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127B0"
msgid "I am sure we can make a deal."
msgstr "거래를 할 수 있을 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: joking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MarlanaVolav_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AF"
msgid "I would be happy to take your money."
msgstr "기꺼이 돈을 받도록 할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sad, trying to keep it together, a lot on her mind / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AE"
msgid "Huh? Oh, it's you. How are you?"
msgstr "어? 아, 당신이군요. 잘 지내세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sad, trying to keep it together, a lot on her mind / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AD"
msgid "Sorry, I have a lot on my mind. Hmmph, like everyone."
msgstr "미안, 신경 쓸 게 많아서요. 뭐, 다들 그렇겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sad, trying to keep it together, a lot on her mind / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AC"
msgid "Hard to believe any of this is happening. It's all like a bad dream."
msgstr "이 모든 게 일어나고 있다는 게 믿기지 않아요. 다 악몽 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, tired, low opinion of himself 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AB"
msgid "I do not think you would want me treating you, so try not to get hurt."
msgstr "내가 널 치료해 주길 바라진 않을 것 같으니까, 다치지 않도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, tired, low opinion of himself 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127AA"
msgid "It is hopeless. Everything is hopeless."
msgstr "가망이 없어. 모든 게 가망이 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, tired, low opinion of himself 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A9"
msgid "Great Serpent, I cannot believe this is happening."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 이런 일이 일어나고 있다는 걸 믿을 수가 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, tired, low opinion of himself 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A8"
msgid "This is a nightmare."
msgstr "이건 악몽이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A7"
msgid "Seems I am all alone now."
msgstr "이제 저는 혼자인 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A6"
msgid "Why her? Why would the Great Serpent take my wife from me?"
msgstr "왜 아내죠? 왜 위대한 뱀께서는 제 아내를 데려가신 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A5"
msgid "Not much to live for now, is there?"
msgstr "이제 살아갈 이유가 별로 없네요. 안 그래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A4"
msgid "Sorry, I am not much for conversation."
msgstr "미안해요. 대화할 기분이 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A3"
msgid "No replacing what we have lost. What I have lost."
msgstr "저희가 잃은 걸 되돌릴 순 없어요. 제가 잃은 것을요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A2"
msgid "Wish I had been the one to disappear, instead."
msgstr "차라리 제가 사라졌으면 좋았을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A1"
msgid "You cannot win my trust so easily."
msgstr "내 신뢰를 그렇게 쉽게 얻을 순 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0127A0"
msgid "Malibor may trust you, but to me, you are still an outsider."
msgstr "말리보어는 널 신뢰할지 몰라도, 내겐 넌 여전히 이방인이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279F"
msgid "One thing after another..."
msgstr "꼬리에 꼬리를 무는군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279E"
msgid "Let me know if there is any trouble."
msgstr "무슨 일 있으면 알려줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279D"
msgid "Phantoms, ghosts... are we sure we are not just losing our minds?"
msgstr "유령이라니... 우리가 그냥 미쳐가는 건 아닐까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279C"
msgid "Stay out of trouble, will you?"
msgstr "말썽 피우지 마, 알았지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279B"
msgid "It hurts me to see the people in such pain. Do not add to their troubles."
msgstr "사람들이 그렇게 고통스러워하는 걸 보는 건 가슴 아파. 그 사람들한테 문제를 더해주지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01279A"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "안녕, 친구."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012799"
msgid "I appreciate everything you have done for our people, our city."
msgstr "우리 사람들, 우리 도시를 위해 네가 해준 모든 일에 감사해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012798"
msgid "Staying safe?"
msgstr "잘 지내고 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
