#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012797"
msgid "Do you need anything?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거 있으세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012796"
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012795"
msgid "Hungry for groat, eh?"
msgstr "그로트가 고픈가 보네, 응?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012794"
msgid "Times like these, it is important to eat and stay strong."
msgstr "이럴 때일수록 잘 먹고 힘을 내야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012793"
msgid "Stay a while, put your mind at ease. The outside world can wait, eh?"
msgstr "여기 좀 있어, 마음을 편히 가져. 바깥 세상은 기다려 줄 거야, 응?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stressed, tired, low opinion of himself 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_OmanLabir_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012792"
msgid "Ugh, I need to get it together."
msgstr "아, 정신 좀 차려야 하는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: You're too young to understand. One day, when you have children of your own, you will see things differently.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012791"
msgid "Why won't you let me?"
msgstr "왜 허락해 주지 않으신 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Vassilis: Ahem, about that... So, I was on the fast track to be a Herald, once upon a time. Emphasis on the "Was."
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: So for now, if you're hurt, talk to Hanton Irara. She's far more qualified.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FBEDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012786"
msgid "Turns out I am a bit squeamish when it comes to uh... blood and viscera."
msgstr "알고 보니 제가 어... 피나 내장 같은 거에는 좀 비위가 약하더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Han-ton ee-rah-rah / Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Vassilis: Turns out I am a bit squeamish when it comes to uh... blood and viscera.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FBEDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012785"
msgid "So for now, if you're hurt, talk to Hanton Irara. She's far more qualified."
msgstr "그러니 지금은 상처를 입었다면 핸톤 이라라 님에게 이야기하세요. 이라라 님은 자격을 가지고 계시거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FBEDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012784"
msgid "That's not to say I won't be capable, someday. It's my dream, after all, to become a Herald."
msgstr "그렇지만 앞으로도 제구실을 못하는 상태로 있진 않을 겁니다. 결국 전령이 되는 게 제 꿈이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disappointed, chastised / Depressed / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: What if we restore the heirlooms? Make them work again?|I could use them to help keep our people safe.|This is the will of the Great Serpent, I know it in my heart. He calls me to serve. &&& FarudHajtal: Do not speak such blasphemies!|None can claim to know the will of the Great Serpent. To utter such words is sacrilege.|I will not discuss the matter further.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010FCF98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012783"
msgid "Yes, father."
msgstr "네, 아버지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010FCF97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012782"
msgid "If you would please, the heirlooms."
msgstr "가보를 주면 고맙겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sharp rebuke / Angry / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?|Give me the heirlooms. I'll hold onto them until it's safe to return them to the tomb where they belong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: What if we restore the heirlooms? Make them work again?|I could use them to help keep our people safe.|This is the will of the Great Serpent, I know it in my heart. He calls me to serve.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012781"
msgid "Do not speak such blasphemies!"
msgstr "신성모독하지 말거라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / Stern / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012780"
msgid "None can claim to know the will of the Great Serpent. To utter such words is sacrilege."
msgstr "누구도 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 안다고 주장해선 안된다. 그런 말 자체가 신성모독이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E906
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01277F"
msgid "Did you hear that, father? The Vindicator was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms."
msgstr "들으셨어요? 아버지? 옹호자가 마카라 님께서 남기신 가보를 되찾아 왔어요."

