#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: One thing does trouble me, however. The way you describe this phantom, it seems almost docile.|From what I've heard, they are incredibly dangerous. &&& Breanne: I don't know. She... it... didn't even look at me. It stood by itself near the window. |But I only caught a glimpse of it, from afar.
