msgid "One thing does trouble me, however. The way you describe this phantom, it seems almost docile."
msgstr "다만 마음에 걸리는 게 있습니다. 설명을 들어보니, 그 유령은 온순한 것처럼 들리는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Breanne
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: I don't know. She... it... didn't even look at me. It stood by itself near the window. 
