msgid "From what I've heard, they are incredibly dangerous."
msgstr "제가 듣기로는, 엄청나게 위험한 존재라고 하더군요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless you both!|Vassilis, you can learn a thing from these two. &&& Vassilis:  &&& Vassilis: One thing does trouble me, however. The way you describe this phantom, it seems almost docile.|From what I've heard, they are incredibly dangerous.
