#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09
#. TOPIC: 010FBA74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01271F"
msgid "Hear me! Now is not the time for doubt! Now is the time for devotion, for loyalty! For the Great Serpent has shown Himself, and the power He wields!"
msgstr ""
"듣거라! 지금은 의심할 때가 아니다! 헌신과 충성을 보일 때이다! 위대한 뱀께서 모습을 드러내시어 그분께서 휘두르는 힘을 보여 주었음이니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09
#. TOPIC: 010FBA74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01271E"
msgid "Do not be afraid, be joyful! Come together and rejoice, for through this tragedy our salvation has been proven without doubt! The Great Serpent is here, and has always been here!"
msgstr ""
"두려워 말고 즐거워하라! 이 비극을 통하여 우리의 구원이 의심의 여지 없이 입증되었으니, 함께 모여 기뻐하라! 위대한 뱀께서 지금 여기 "
"계시고, 항상 여기에 계셨음이라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: All Must Serve!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09
#. TOPIC: 010FBA74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra09_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01271D"
msgid "You have been spared for a reason, so do not be afraid! Be empowered, and go forth with renewed faith, renewed strength! All Must Serve!"
msgstr "그대들은 이유가 있어 무사하였으니, 두려워 말지어다! 용기를 가지고 새로운 믿음과 새로운 힘으로 나아가라! 모두가 섬겨야 한다!"

