#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: All I am saying is that I am not pleased with the recent outsider influence.|I am sure you know what I am referring to.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012716"
msgid "Yes, I understand, and I agree with you. The first outsider in generations and they are welcomed with open arms?"
msgstr "네, 이해하고, 저도 동의합니다. 수 세대 만의 첫 이방인인데, 그들을 두 팔 벌려 환영한다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Hmmph. Perhaps this is the first wave of an impending cultural infiltration. The Settled Systems are scared of us, and so they are trying to tame us from within.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012715"
msgid "How are we so sure they are not an off-worlder spy?"
msgstr "그들이 외부 세계의 첩자가 아니라고 어떻게 확신할 수 있겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: All I am saying is that I am not pleased with the recent outsider influence.|I am sure you know what I am referring to. &&& Citizen01: Yes, I understand, and I agree with you. The first outsider in generations and they are welcomed with open arms? |How are we so sure they are not an off-worlder spy? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Indeed, I fear that even darker days may be ahead for House Va'ruun. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012714"
msgid "Hmmph. Perhaps this is the first wave of an impending cultural infiltration. The Settled Systems are scared of us, and so they are trying to tame us from within."
msgstr "쳇. 어쩌면 이게 임박한 문화 침투의 첫 번째 물결일지도 모르죠. 개척 성계는 우리를 두려워하고 있으니, 내부에서부터 우리를 길들이려는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012713"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
