#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012712"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012711"
msgid "All I am saying is that I am not pleased with the recent outsider influence."
msgstr "제가 하고 싶은 말은, 최근의 이방인의 영향력이 마음에 들지 않는다는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Yes, I understand, and I agree with you. The first outsider in generations and they are welcomed with open arms? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012710"
msgid "I am sure you know what I am referring to."
msgstr "제가 무슨 말을 하는지 잘 아시리라 믿어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Hmmph. Perhaps this is the first wave of an impending cultural infiltration. The Settled Systems are scared of us, and so they are trying to tame us from within. &&& Citizen01: Indeed, I fear that even darker days may be ahead for House Va'ruun. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01270F"
msgid "No, we will not let those days come to pass."
msgstr "아니요, 그런 날이 오도록 내버려 두지 않을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Yes, I understand, and I agree with you. The first outsider in generations and they are welcomed with open arms? |How are we so sure they are not an off-worlder spy?  &&& Citizen02: Hmmph. Perhaps this is the first wave of an impending cultural infiltration. The Settled Systems are scared of us, and so they are trying to tame us from within.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: No, we will not let those days come to pass.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 010FBA85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_TheKeep01_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01270E"
msgid "Indeed, I fear that even darker days may be ahead for House Va'ruun."
msgstr "정말이지, 전 바룬 가문에 더 어두운 날들이 닥칠까 봐 두렵습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: We will be fine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse02
#. TOPIC: 010FBA92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Meahouse02_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01270C"
msgid "Word around the city is that emergency food rations are running low. I pray our groat supply holds firm."
msgstr "도시 전역에 비상 식량 배급이 줄어들고 있다는 소문이 있어. 그로트 공급이 계속 유지되길 기도해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Word around the city is that emergency food rations are running low. I pray our groat supply holds firm. &&& Citizen02: We will be fine.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Malik has not failed us yet. The groat farms appear to be in relatively good health, and were mercifully spared from the catastrophe. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse02
#. TOPIC: 010FBA90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Meahouse02_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01270B"
msgid "How can you be so sure? If the emergency rations run out, everyone will look to us to provide food. Could we keep up with demand?"
msgstr "어떻게 그렇게 확신할 수 있어? 만약 비상 식량이 바닥나면, 모두가 우리에게 식량을 의지할 텐데. 그 수요를 감당할 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: We will be fine. &&& Citizen01: How can you be so sure? If the emergency rations run out, everyone will look to us to provide food. Could we keep up with demand?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse02
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Meahouse02_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01270A"
msgid "Malik has not failed us yet. The groat farms appear to be in relatively good health, and were mercifully spared from the catastrophe."
msgstr "말릭이 아직 우릴 실망하게 한 적은 없잖아. 그로트 농장들도 비교적 양호한 상태인 것 같고, 다행히 재난을 피했고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse02
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Meahouse02_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012709"
msgid "As long as we get our groats, we will be fine."
msgstr "그로트만 계속 얻을 수 있다면, 우린 괜찮을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Word around the city is that emergency food rations are running low. I pray our groat supply holds firm.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: How can you be so sure? If the emergency rations run out, everyone will look to us to provide food. Could we keep up with demand?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse02
#. TOPIC: 010FBA91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Meahouse02_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012708"
msgid "We will be fine."
msgstr "우린 괜찮을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And when you are older, you will get your tattoos, like me.
#. ALIAS: Child
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Ha, when you are older you can get them. I think they will suit you better than me.
