#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012706"
msgid "They are so pretty, I cannot wait. I want tattoos just like yours!"
msgstr "너무 예뻐요, 빨리하고 싶어요. 저도 아저씨처럼 문신하고 싶어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Child
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And when you are older, you will get your tattoos, like me. &&& Child: They are so pretty, I cannot wait. I want tattoos just like yours!
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale05
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: Does it hurt when you get them?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012705"
msgid "Ha, when you are older you can get them. I think they will suit you better than me."
msgstr "하하, 네가 더 크면 할 수 있어. 나보다는 네게 더 잘 어울릴 것 같구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Child
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale05
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: They are so pretty, I cannot wait. I want tattoos just like yours!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012704"
msgid "And when you are older, you will get your tattoos, like me."
msgstr "그리고 네가 더 크면, 나처럼 문신을 하게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child: They are so pretty, I cannot wait. I want tattoos just like yours! &&& Citizen: Ha, when you are older you can get them. I think they will suit you better than me.
#. ALIAS: Child
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: It is... uncomfortable, but it is not as bad as you think. And you are stronger than I am, so it should not bother you at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012703"
msgid "Does it hurt when you get them?"
msgstr "문신할 때 아파요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Child
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Ha, when you are older you can get them. I think they will suit you better than me. &&& Child: Does it hurt when you get them?
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale05
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: Ha, yeah, I am ready! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06
#. TOPIC: 010FBA8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012702"
msgid "It is... uncomfortable, but it is not as bad as you think. And you are stronger than I am, so it should not bother you at all."
msgstr "음... 불편하긴 하지만, 네가 생각하는 것만큼 아프진 않아. 그리고 넌 나보다 강하니까, 전혀 고통스럽지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child: Does it hurt when you get them? &&& Citizen: It is... uncomfortable, but it is not as bad as you think. And you are stronger than I am, so it should not bother you at all.
#. ALIAS: Child
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06
#. TOPIC: 010FBA89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra06_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012701"
msgid "Ha, yeah, I am ready!"
msgstr "하하, 네, 전 준비됐어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And then, in the year 2240, House Va'ruun went to war with the Settled Systems, in what has come to be known as "The Serpent's Crusade."  &&& Child02: Did we win?
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child01: Why did we fight them, again?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FF"
msgid "Well... the Settled Systems think they did."
msgstr "음... 개척 성계는 자기들이 이겼다고 생각하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And then, in the year 2240, House Va'ruun went to war with the Settled Systems, in what has come to be known as "The Serpent's Crusade."  &&& Child02: Did we win? &&& Citizen: Well... the Settled Systems think they did. 
#. ALIAS: Child01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Jinan Va'ruun believed that he was tasked by the Great Serpent to claim dominion over the galaxy. The Serpent's Crusade was an attempt to make that a reality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FE"
msgid "Why did we fight them, again?"
msgstr "근데, 우리가 왜 그들과 싸운 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And then, in the year 2240, House Va'ruun went to war with the Settled Systems, in what has come to be known as "The Serpent's Crusade." 
#. ALIAS: Child02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Well... the Settled Systems think they did. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FD"
msgid "Did we win?"
msgstr "우리가 이겼어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child02: Did we win?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FC"
msgid "And then, in the year 2240, House Va'ruun went to war with the Settled Systems, in what has come to be known as \"The Serpent's Crusade.\""
msgstr "그리고 2240년, 바룬 가문은 개척 성계와 전쟁을 벌였어. 그 전쟁은 '뱀의 성전’이라고 불리게 되었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Well... the Settled Systems think they did.  &&& Child01: Why did we fight them, again?
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child02: What do you think of the Serpent's Crusade?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FB"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun believed that he was tasked by the Great Serpent to claim dominion over the galaxy. The Serpent's Crusade was an attempt to make that a reality."
msgstr "지난 바룬은 위대한 뱀께서 지난에게 은하계를 지배하라는 임무를 주었다고 믿었어. 뱀의 성전은 그걸 실현하기 위한 시도였지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child02: Did we win? &&& Citizen: Well... the Settled Systems think they did.  &&& Child01: Why did we fight them, again? &&& Citizen: Jinan Va'ruun believed that he was tasked by the Great Serpent to claim dominion over the galaxy. The Serpent's Crusade was an attempt to make that a reality.
#. ALIAS: Child02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: What do I think of it?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126FA"
msgid "What do you think of the Serpent's Crusade?"
msgstr "뱀의 성전에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child01: Why did we fight them, again? &&& Citizen: Jinan Va'ruun believed that he was tasked by the Great Serpent to claim dominion over the galaxy. The Serpent's Crusade was an attempt to make that a reality. &&& Child02: What do you think of the Serpent's Crusade? &&& Citizen: What do I think of it?
#. ALIAS: Child01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Yes, child, I know what they meant. And my answer is this - if Jinan Va'ruun decided that the Crusade was necessary, then it was. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F9"
msgid "Yeah, do you think it was -"
msgstr "네, 그게 혹시..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: What do I think of it? &&& Child01: Yeah, do you think it was - 
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F8"
msgid "Yes, child, I know what they meant. And my answer is this - if Jinan Va'ruun decided that the Crusade was necessary, then it was."
msgstr "그래, 꼬마야, 무슨 말인지 알아. 내 대답은 이거야. 지난 바룬이 성전이 필요하다고 결정했다면, 필요한 거였겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child01
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F7"
msgid "The Great Serpent told him to do it, after all, and we do not question the Great Serpent."
msgstr "결국 위대한 뱀께서 지난에게 그렇게 하라고 말씀하셨고, 우리는 위대한 뱀의 뜻에 의문을 품지 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Child02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Jinan Va'ruun believed that he was tasked by the Great Serpent to claim dominion over the galaxy. The Serpent's Crusade was an attempt to make that a reality. &&& Child02: What do you think of the Serpent's Crusade?
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child01: Yeah, do you think it was - 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07
#. TOPIC: 010FBA7B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra07_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F6"
msgid "What do I think of it?"
msgstr "내가 어떻게 생각하냐고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I... I saw one of... one of those things. A phantom.|Its face was so familiar to me. Could it... could it have been my partner, who was lost to the calamity? |I do not want to believe it... I... I would rather my beloved have died swiftly, painlessly. I do not want to believe that they are now a phantom, trapped between worlds... &&& Citizen01: Do you really think it was them? Surely it is possible you were mistaken.|You have been through so much, your brain is playing tricks on you. The Great Serpent would not torment you in such a way.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: You must not torment yourself like this, my friend...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA76
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F4"
msgid "No, no, it was them, I know it... trying to reach out to me, trying to get me to save them..."
msgstr "아니, 아니야, 그들이었어, 알아... 나에게 손을 뻗으려고, 그들을 구해달라고 하려고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F3"
msgid "I... I saw one of... one of those things. A phantom."
msgstr "나... 나 그 중 하나를... 유령을 봤어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F2"
msgid "Its face was so familiar to me. Could it... could it have been my partner, who was lost to the calamity?"
msgstr "그 얼굴이 너무 낯익었어. 혹시... 혹시 재난 때 잃은 내 짝이었을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Do you really think it was them? Surely it is possible you were mistaken.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F1"
msgid "I do not want to believe it... I... I would rather my beloved have died swiftly, painlessly. I do not want to believe that they are now a phantom, trapped between worlds..."
msgstr ""
"믿고 싶지 않아... 차라리 내 사랑하는 사람이 고통 없이 빨리 죽었으면 좋겠어. 그들이 지금 유령이 되어서, 두 세계 사이에 갇혀 "
"있다는 걸 믿고 싶지 않아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I... I saw one of... one of those things. A phantom.|Its face was so familiar to me. Could it... could it have been my partner, who was lost to the calamity? |I do not want to believe it... I... I would rather my beloved have died swiftly, painlessly. I do not want to believe that they are now a phantom, trapped between worlds...
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126F0"
msgid "Do you really think it was them? Surely it is possible you were mistaken."
msgstr "정말 그들이었다고 생각해? 네가 착각했을 수도 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: No, no, it was them, I know it... trying to reach out to me, trying to get me to save them...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126EF"
msgid "You have been through so much, your brain is playing tricks on you. The Great Serpent would not torment you in such a way."
msgstr "넌 너무 많은 일을 겪었어. 네 뇌가 장난을 치는 거야. 위대한 뱀께서 너를 그렇게 괴롭히실 리가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Do you really think it was them? Surely it is possible you were mistaken.|You have been through so much, your brain is playing tricks on you. The Great Serpent would not torment you in such a way. &&& Citizen02: No, no, it was them, I know it... trying to reach out to me, trying to get me to save them...
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08
#. TOPIC: 010FBA75
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra08_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126EE"
msgid "You must not torment yourself like this, my friend..."
msgstr "이렇게 자신을 괴롭히면 안 돼, 친구..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAB
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0105FDE9
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0126EC"
msgid "No."
msgstr "안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: Yes, I will sacrifice the groat in Jinan's name. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126EB"
msgid "And you understand what you must do, right, child?"
msgstr "그리고 네가 뭘 해야 하는지 알고 있지, 꼬마야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child: No.  &&& Citizen: You are a bad liar, child. I understand you may be sad - you raised this groat from infancy, after all.|This commitment, though, is important. The dagger that will be fashioned from your groats skull represents your connection, your loyalty, to the Great Serpent. |All things, even your groat, must serve the Great Serpent, child.
#. ALIAS: Child
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126EA"
msgid "I understand, and I am ready."
msgstr "알고 있어요, 그리고 전 준비됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Child
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And you understand what you must do, right, child? &&& Child: Yes, I will sacrifice the groat in Jinan's name. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: No. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126E9"
msgid "Is that hesitation I detect in your voice?"
msgstr "네 목소리에서 망설임이 느껴지는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mildly / Sad / to Child
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And you understand what you must do, right, child?
#. ALIAS: Child
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Is that hesitation I detect in your voice?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126E8"
msgid "Yes, I will sacrifice the groat in Jinan's name."
msgstr "네, 지난의 이름으로 그로트를 희생시킬 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Child
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Is that hesitation I detect in your voice? &&& Child: No. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126E7"
msgid "You are a bad liar, child. I understand you may be sad - you raised this groat from infancy, after all."
msgstr "거짓말을 잘 못하는구나. 꼬마야. 슬픈 건 이해한단다. 이 그로트가 젖먹이일 때부터 키웠으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126E6"
msgid "This commitment, though, is important. The dagger that will be fashioned from your groats skull represents your connection, your loyalty, to the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"하지만 헌신의 의식은 중요해. 네 그로트의 두개골로 만들어질 단검은 위대한 뱀 님과 너의 연결, 위대한 뱀 님에 대한 너의 충성심을 "
"상징한단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Child
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child: I understand, and I am ready. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10
#. TOPIC: 010FBA6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra10_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126E5"
msgid "All things, even your groat, must serve the Great Serpent, child."
msgstr "모든, 네 그로트를 포함해 모든 존재가, 위대한 뱀을 섬겨야 한단다. 꼬마야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It must be tough to run a business in the midst of all this chaos.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraNaladaBradi: I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but this... situation with Quasim has made things difficult.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FB934
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_HighSpirits
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D9"
msgid "My mother taught me to try and provide a smiling, friendly face for my customers, but it's been incredibly difficult."
msgstr "저희 어머니께선 손님들에게 항상 웃는 얼굴로 친절하게 대하라고 가르치셨지만, 요즘은 그게 정말 힘드네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraNaladaBradi: I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but this... situation with Quasim has made things difficult.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraNaladaBradi: I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but with Quasim still missing, I don't know how long I can keep this up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FB933
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_HighSpirits
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D8"
msgid "I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but now that Quasim is gone, it's going to be difficult to smile ever again."
msgstr "사고가 도시를 덮쳤을 때는 그럭저럭 버텼지만, 이제 콰심마저 사라졌으니, 다시 웃는 건 어려울 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraNaladaBradi: I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but now that Quasim is gone, it's going to be difficult to smile ever again.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010FB932
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_HighSpirits
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D7"
msgid "I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but with Quasim still missing, I don't know how long I can keep this up."
msgstr "사고가 도시를 덮쳤을 때는 그럭저럭 버텼지만, 콰심이 아직도 실종 상태라, 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraNaladaBradi: My mother taught me to try and provide a smiling, friendly face for my customers, but it's been incredibly difficult.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraNaladaBradi: I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but now that Quasim is gone, it's going to be difficult to smile ever again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
