#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D6"
msgid "I managed to muddle through when the incident struck the city, but this... situation with Quasim has made things difficult."
msgstr "사고가 도시를 덮쳤을 때는 그럭저럭 버텼지만, 이... 콰심과의 상황 때문에 모든 게 힘들어졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
