#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PreQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D5"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "그럼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
