#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PreQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D4"
msgid "Anything I can do to help."
msgstr "도울 수 있는 일이라면 뭐든 할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PreQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D3"
msgid "I hope you find something you like."
msgstr "마음에 드는 걸 찾으셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PreQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D2"
msgid "I'm sure we can strike a bargain."
msgstr "분명 좋은 거래를 할 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly distracted and somber (other sad things on your mind) / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PstQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D1"
msgid "Sure, take your time."
msgstr "그럼요, 천천히 하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly distracted and somber (other sad things on your mind) / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PstQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126D0"
msgid "Please do."
msgstr "그러세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126CF"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr "말만 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly distracted and somber (other sad things on your mind) / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PstQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126CE"
msgid "Just tell me when you're done."
msgstr "다 하시면 말씀해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly distracted and somber (other sad things on your mind) / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PstQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126CD"
msgid "Oh yes... of course."
msgstr "아, 네... 물론이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to reassure his wife / Neutral / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Our home, everything we have ever worked for, gone in an instant. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB95E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126CB"
msgid "We will rebuild, darling, everything will be all right. I promise you."
msgstr "우린 재건할 거야, 손님분, 다 괜찮아질 거예요. 약속해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: joking, trying to cheer up their wife / Friendly / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Your jokes are not helpful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB95E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126CA"
msgid "It was not a very nice home anyway, huh?"
msgstr "어차피 그렇게 좋은 집도 아니었잖아, 안 그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: We will rebuild, darling, everything will be all right. I promise you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB953
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C9"
msgid "Our home, everything we have ever worked for, gone in an instant."
msgstr "아니...우리 집, 그간 쌓아올린 모든 것들이 순식간에 사라져버리다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Our home, everything we have ever worked for, gone in an instant.  &&& Citizen01: We will rebuild, darling, everything will be all right. I promise you.|It was not a very nice home anyway, huh? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I apologize, I am just trying to put a smile on that face. It has been so long since I have seen you smile.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB952
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C8"
msgid "Your jokes are not helpful."
msgstr "당신 농담은 도움이 안 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: We will rebuild, darling, everything will be all right. I promise you.|It was not a very nice home anyway, huh?  &&& Citizen02: Your jokes are not helpful.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I do not understand, how are you like this? How can you be so relaxed? We are homeless!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB951
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C7"
msgid "I apologize, I am just trying to put a smile on that face. It has been so long since I have seen you smile."
msgstr "미안해요, 그냥 당신을 웃게 해주고 싶었어요. 당신이 웃는 모습을 본 지 너무 오래됐거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Your jokes are not helpful. &&& Citizen01: I apologize, I am just trying to put a smile on that face. It has been so long since I have seen you smile.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: The house and our belongings, they were nice, and I do miss them. But they are not you. You, my love, are my strength.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB950
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C6"
msgid "I do not understand, how are you like this? How can you be so relaxed? We are homeless!"
msgstr "이해가 안 돼요. 당신은 어떻게 이럴 수 있어요? 어떻게 그렇게 태평할 수 있죠? 우린 집도 없잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: feeling a little bit better / Amused / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I do not understand, how are you like this? How can you be so relaxed? We are homeless! &&& Citizen01: The house and our belongings, they were nice, and I do miss them. But they are not you. You, my love, are my strength.|As long as I have you, nothing can break me.|Everything will be all right, love, I promise you.
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB94E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C5"
msgid "Ha, you romantic. You always know what to say."
msgstr "하, 당신은 로맨틱해요. 항상 무슨 말을 해야 할지 안다니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: feeling a bit better / Amused / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB94E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C4"
msgid "*Sigh* I am glad to still have you by my side."
msgstr "*한숨* 그래도 당신이 곁에 있어서 다행이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reassuring wife / Friendly / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I apologize, I am just trying to put a smile on that face. It has been so long since I have seen you smile. &&& Citizen02: I do not understand, how are you like this? How can you be so relaxed? We are homeless!
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB94F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C3"
msgid "The house and our belongings, they were nice, and I do miss them. But they are not you. You, my love, are my strength."
msgstr "집과 우리 물건들, 그것들도 좋았고, 그립기도 해요. 하지만 그것들은 당신이 아니에요. 내 사랑, 당신이 나의 힘이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB94F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C2"
msgid "As long as I have you, nothing can break me."
msgstr "당신만 있으면, 그 무엇도 나를 무너뜨릴 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Ha, you romantic. You always know what to say.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02
#. TOPIC: 010FB94F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126C1"
msgid "Everything will be all right, love, I promise you."
msgstr "다 괜찮아질 거예요, 내 사랑, 약속해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to YoungWoman
#. ALIAS: Healer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: YoungWoman: You *are* a Herald, are you not? Is it not your job to help those in need? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BF"
msgid "Miss, I am sorry but I cannot just give you supplies. We are stretched razor thin as it is."
msgstr "아가씨, 죄송하지만 그냥 용품을 드릴 수는 없습니다. 저희도 지금 한계 상황입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Healer
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Healer: Miss, I am sorry but I cannot just give you supplies. We are stretched razor thin as it is.
#. ALIAS: YoungWoman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BE"
msgid "You *are* a Herald, are you not? Is it not your job to help those in need?"
msgstr "당신은 '전령'이잖아요? 안 그래요? 도움이 필요한 사람들을 돕는 게 당신 일 아니에요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Healer
#. ALIAS: YoungWoman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Healer: We have examined your children and found that they were not in immediate need of treatment. Other patients are in more dire circumstances and require assistance. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BD"
msgid "Why will you not help my family, my children?"
msgstr "왜 우리 가족, 우리 아이들을 도와주지 않는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to YoungWoman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Healer: Miss, I am sorry but I cannot just give you supplies. We are stretched razor thin as it is. &&& YoungWoman: You *are* a Herald, are you not? Is it not your job to help those in need? |Why will you not help my family, my children? 
#. ALIAS: Healer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: YoungWoman: So you will not help my children unless they are dying? This is preposterous! They are sick and suffering!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BC"
msgid "We have examined your children and found that they were not in immediate need of treatment. Other patients are in more dire circumstances and require assistance."
msgstr "당신의 아이들을 진찰해 본 결과, 즉각적인 치료가 필요한 상황은 아니었습니다. 다른 환자들은 더 위급한 상황이라 도움이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Healer
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: YoungWoman: You *are* a Herald, are you not? Is it not your job to help those in need? |Why will you not help my family, my children?  &&& Healer: We have examined your children and found that they were not in immediate need of treatment. Other patients are in more dire circumstances and require assistance. 
#. ALIAS: YoungWoman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Healer: I do not like it any more than you do, but that is exactly what I am saying. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BB"
msgid "So you will not help my children unless they are dying? This is preposterous! They are sick and suffering!"
msgstr "그러니까, 우리 아이들이 죽어가지 않는 이상 도와주지 않겠다는 거예요? 말도 안 돼요! 그들은 아프고 고통받고 있어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to YoungWoman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Healer: We have examined your children and found that they were not in immediate need of treatment. Other patients are in more dire circumstances and require assistance.  &&& YoungWoman: So you will not help my children unless they are dying? This is preposterous! They are sick and suffering!
#. ALIAS: Healer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126BA"
msgid "I do not like it any more than you do, but that is exactly what I am saying."
msgstr "저라고 이런 상황이 마음에 드는 건 아니지만, 당신 말씀이 맞습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to YoungWoman
#. ALIAS: Healer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: YoungWoman: You... damn you, damn you all!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B9"
msgid "Your children will be fine, if the Great Serpent wills it."
msgstr "당신의 아이들은 괜찮을 겁니다. 위대한 뱀께서 허락하신다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Healer
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: YoungWoman: So you will not help my children unless they are dying? This is preposterous! They are sick and suffering! &&& Healer: I do not like it any more than you do, but that is exactly what I am saying. |Your children will be fine, if the Great Serpent wills it. 
#. ALIAS: YoungWoman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01
#. TOPIC: 010FB96A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_HallsOfHealing01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B8"
msgid "You... damn you, damn you all!"
msgstr "당신... 제기랄, 다 저주받을 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Groat
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB969
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B6"
msgid "And guess what she tells me? She tells me there is somebody else."
msgstr "근데 그 여자가 뭐라고 하는 줄 알아? 다른 사람이 있대."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Groat
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB969
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B5"
msgid "Never loved me to begin with. Sloff... ten wasted years, laying next to a body that could not care less about me."
msgstr "처음부터 날 사랑한 적도 없었대. 허물지긴... 나한테 신경도 안 쓰는 사람이랑 10년이나 같이 살았다니, 시간 낭비였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Groat
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Not very talkative today, huh? Something troubling you? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB969
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B4"
msgid "Well, she is gone now. She angered the Great Serpent and... poof! And to that, you know what I say? I say, good riddance to her."
msgstr "뭐, 그 여자는 이제 갔어. 위대한 뱀을 화나게 했고... 펑! 그래서, 내가 뭐라고 했는지 알아? 잘 가라고 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Groat
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: And guess what she tells me? She tells me there is somebody else.|Never loved me to begin with. Sloff... ten wasted years, laying next to a body that could not care less about me.|Well, she is gone now. She angered the Great Serpent and... poof! And to that, you know what I say? I say, good riddance to her. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Oh, come on, I will not let them eat you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB968
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B3"
msgid "Not very talkative today, huh? Something troubling you?"
msgstr "오늘은 말이 별로 없네, 응? 무슨 고민 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Groat
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Not very talkative today, huh? Something troubling you? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB965
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B2"
msgid "Oh, come on, I will not let them eat you."
msgstr "아, 제발, 그들이 널 잡아먹게 놔두지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: offended / Neutral / to Groat
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: Personal insults now, eh? You know, I thought you were different, but you are just like everyone else -- belittling me, making fun of me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB965
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B1"
msgid "You think so little of me as a friend that you really think I would let them eat you? I am hurt."
msgstr "내가 널 잡아먹게 할 거라고 생각할 만큼 나를 별로 친구로 생각 안 하는 거야? 상처받았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Groat
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Oh, come on, I will not let them eat you. |You think so little of me as a friend that you really think I would let them eat you? I am hurt.
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB963
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126B0"
msgid "Personal insults now, eh? You know, I thought you were different, but you are just like everyone else -- belittling me, making fun of me."
msgstr "이제 인신공격까지 하는 거야? 너는 다른 줄 알았는데, 너도 다른 사람들이랑 똑같구나. 날 무시하고, 놀리고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Groat
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01
#. TOPIC: 010FB963
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_MeatHouse01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126AF"
msgid "Perhaps it is best we spend some time apart, then. I will come back when -- no, if -- I forgive you."
msgstr "그럼, 당분간 떨어져 있는 게 좋겠어. 네가 용서하면 – 아니, 용서한다면 – 그때 돌아올게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Uh... I... *mumbling*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB967
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126AD"
msgid "I got you your favorite from the Meat House. Extra fatty, just the way you like. Do you want to eat it now?"
msgstr "훈제소에서 네가 제일 좋아하는 걸로 사 왔어. 네가 좋아하는 대로, 아주 기름진 걸로. 지금 먹을래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: in a near catatonic state after being traumatized  / Neutral / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I got you your favorite from the Meat House. Extra fatty, just the way you like. Do you want to eat it now?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: Please... please, just eat something. Drink something. Say something, please!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB966
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126AC"
msgid "Uh... I... *mumbling*"
msgstr "어... 저... *중얼거림*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I got you your favorite from the Meat House. Extra fatty, just the way you like. Do you want to eat it now? &&& Citizen01: Uh... I... *mumbling*
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: *Sigh* You have been like this for weeks, I... I do not know what to do. I miss you, my friend. I miss you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB964
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126AB"
msgid "Please... please, just eat something. Drink something. Say something, please!"
msgstr "제발... 뭐라도 좀 먹어. 뭐라도 마셔. 뭐라도 말 좀 해봐, 제발!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Uh... I... *mumbling* &&& Citizen02: Please... please, just eat something. Drink something. Say something, please! &&& Citizen02: *Sigh* You have been like this for weeks, I... I do not know what to do. I miss you, my friend. I miss you.|Please, tell me what I can do to help you.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I... I have to go now, but I will be back later to talk, all right? I promise. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB960
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126AA"
msgid "I... I... I..."
msgstr "저... 저... 저..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Please... please, just eat something. Drink something. Say something, please!
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB961
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A9"
msgid "*Sigh* You have been like this for weeks, I... I do not know what to do. I miss you, my friend. I miss you."
msgstr "*한숨* 몇 주 동안 이러고 있네, 나... 나도 뭘 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어. 네가 그리워. 친구. 네가 그리워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I... I... I...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB961
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A8"
msgid "Please, tell me what I can do to help you."
msgstr "제발, 내가 어떻게 해야 널 도울 수 있을지 말해줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: *Sigh* You have been like this for weeks, I... I do not know what to do. I miss you, my friend. I miss you.|Please, tell me what I can do to help you. &&& Citizen01: I... I... I...
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale07
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01
#. TOPIC: 010FB95F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A6"
msgid "I... I have to go now, but I will be back later to talk, all right? I promise."
msgstr "나... 나 지금 가봐야 하는데, 이따가 다시 와서 얘기할게, 알았지? 약속해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: Do not move. You have committed a grave offense, citizen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB95D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A4"
msgid "Stop immediately! Pickpocket! Stop, or I will kill you!"
msgstr "즉시 멈춰라! 소매치기다! 멈춰, 안 그러면 쏴 죽이겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Stop immediately! Pickpocket! Stop, or I will kill you! 
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I am sorry, please, have mercy! I am starving! I cannot sleep, I cannot think due to my hunger! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB95B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A2"
msgid "Do not move. You have committed a grave offense, citizen."
msgstr "움직이지 마. 너는 중대한 범죄를 저질렀다, 시민."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Do not move. You have committed a grave offense, citizen. &&& Citizen01: I am sorry, please, have mercy! I am starving! I cannot sleep, I cannot think due to my hunger! 
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB959
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0126A0"
msgid "You are not the only one suffering. Your actions have deprived another of precious food."
msgstr "너만 고통받는 게 아니야. 네 행동은 다른 사람의 소중한 식량을 빼앗았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: No... no, please...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB959
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01269F"
msgid "You will await your punishment at the security center. Come along."
msgstr "경비 센터에서 처벌을 기다려라. 따라와."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Guard
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: Do not move. You have committed a grave offense, citizen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB958
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01269E"
msgid "I am sorry! Please, please do not shoot me! I am sorry!"
msgstr "죄송합니다! 제발, 제발 쏘지 마세요! 잘못했어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Stop immediately! Pickpocket! Stop, or I will kill you!  &&& Guard: Do not move. You have committed a grave offense, citizen.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You are not the only one suffering. Your actions have deprived another of precious food. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB957
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01269D"
msgid "I am sorry, please, have mercy! I am starving! I cannot sleep, I cannot think due to my hunger!"
msgstr "죄송합니다, 제발, 자비를 베풀어 주세요! 배가 고파요! 배고파서 잠도 못 자고, 생각도 못 하겠어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: I am sorry, please, have mercy! I am starving! I cannot sleep, I cannot think due to my hunger!  &&& Guard: You are not the only one suffering. Your actions have deprived another of precious food. |You will await your punishment at the security center. Come along. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: Move!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03
#. TOPIC: 010FB956
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01269C"
msgid "No... no, please..."
msgstr "안 돼... 안 돼, 제발..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1B9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "01269B"
msgid "Move!"
msgstr "비켜!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: relieved - they had doubts about their religion, but now view the catastrophe that happened in dazra as undeniable proof of the Great Serpent / Relieved / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04
#. TOPIC: 010FB954
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012699"
msgid "Great Serpent... oh, Great Serpent, thank you for revealing yourself to me. Thank you for making yourself known. I am ashamed to admit that I questioned your existence."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀이시여... 오, 위대한 뱀이시여, 제게 모습을 보여주셔서 감사합니다. 당신의 존재를 알게 해주셔서 감사합니다. 당신의 존재를 "
"의심했던 것이 부끄럽습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04
#. TOPIC: 010FB954
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012698"
msgid "I am sorry for ever having doubted you. I accept your anger and rage. We - I - deserve your wrath. What you have done to Dazra is surely only an inkling of your power, and you have shown us mercy when we do not deserve it."
msgstr ""
"당신을 의심했던 것을 용서해 주십시오. 당신의 분노와 격노를 받아들이겠습니다. 저희는... 저는... 당신의 분노를 받아 마땅합니다. "
"당신께서 다즈라에 행하신 일은 분명 당신의 힘의 발로에 불과하며, 저희는 그럴 자격이 없음에도 당신께서는 저희에게 자비를 베푸셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale08
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04
#. TOPIC: 010FB954
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra04_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012697"
msgid "Despite our circumstances, I am so happy, Great Serpent. I am just so happy that you have revealed yourself to me, proved your existence beyond all doubt. I will forever follow you now, as one of your faithful."
msgstr "이런 상황에도 불구하고, 전 너무 행복합니다, 위대한 뱀이시여. 당신께서 제게 모습을 보여주시고, 모든 의심을 넘어 당신의 존재를 증명해 주셔서 정말 행복합니다. 이제부터 영원히 당신의 충실한 신도로서 당신을 따르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012696"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I see how the people act, how they disrespect the Great Serpent at every turn. It is little wonder why the Great Serpent did this to Dazra. It was a mire of sin and filth.|We should be thankful that the Great Serpent saw fit to destroy this damned city, so that we may rebuild with restored faith and devotion. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012694"
msgid "Just stop, will you? I am sick of your delusional ramblings, and your holier-than-thou attitude."
msgstr "그만 좀 해, 응? 네 망상적인 헛소리랑, 고결한 척하는 태도에 질렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: The Great Serpent took their lives for a reason! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012693"
msgid "If anyone deserved to disappear, it was you. This blatant hatred of your neighbors is disturbing. Do you really think that the people we lost, the very same you broke bread with, deserved to die?"
msgstr "사라져야 할 사람이 있다면, 그건 바로 너야. 네 이웃에 대한 이런 노골적인 증오는 소름 끼쳐. 네가 빵을 함께 먹었던, 우리가 잃은 그 사람들이, 정말로 죽어 마땅하다고 생각하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012692"
msgid "I see how the people act, how they disrespect the Great Serpent at every turn. It is little wonder why the Great Serpent did this to Dazra. It was a mire of sin and filth."
msgstr "사람들이 어떻게 행동하는지, 사사건건 위대한 뱀께 어떻게 불경을 저지르는지 다 보여. 위대한 뱀께서 다즈라에 이런 일을 하신 것도 당연해. 여긴 죄악과 오물로 가득 찬 수렁이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Just stop, will you? I am sick of your delusional ramblings, and your holier-than-thou attitude. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012691"
msgid "We should be thankful that the Great Serpent saw fit to destroy this damned city, so that we may rebuild with restored faith and devotion."
msgstr "우리가 회복된 신앙과 헌신으로 재건할 수 있도록 위대한 뱀께서 이 저주받은 도시를 파괴하신 것에 감사해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I see how the people act, how they disrespect the Great Serpent at every turn. It is little wonder why the Great Serpent did this to Dazra. It was a mire of sin and filth.|We should be thankful that the Great Serpent saw fit to destroy this damned city, so that we may rebuild with restored faith and devotion.  &&& Citizen01: Just stop, will you? I am sick of your delusional ramblings, and your holier-than-thou attitude. |If anyone deserved to disappear, it was you. This blatant hatred of your neighbors is disturbing. Do you really think that the people we lost, the very same you broke bread with, deserved to die? 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012690"
msgid "The Great Serpent took their lives for a reason!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그들의 목숨을 거두신 데는 이유가 있어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: My faithfulness is without question, but I refuse to celebrate the deaths of my friends, even if the Great Serpent set these events in motion. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01268F"
msgid "I am concerned by what you are saying. These words betray a lack of devotion within you -- you should tread lightly."
msgstr "네가 하는 말이 걱정스러워. 그런 말은 네 안에 헌신이 부족하다는 걸 드러내는 거야. 조심하는 게 좋을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Just stop, will you? I am sick of your delusional ramblings, and your holier-than-thou attitude. |If anyone deserved to disappear, it was you. This blatant hatred of your neighbors is disturbing. Do you really think that the people we lost, the very same you broke bread with, deserved to die?  &&& Citizen02: The Great Serpent took their lives for a reason! |I am concerned by what you are saying. These words betray a lack of devotion within you -- you should tread lightly. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01268E"
msgid "My faithfulness is without question, but I refuse to celebrate the deaths of my friends, even if the Great Serpent set these events in motion."
msgstr "내 신앙심은 의심할 여지가 없지만, 위대한 뱀께서 이 사건들을 일으키셨다고 해도, 내 친구들의 죽음을 기뻐할 수는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Citizen02
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale08
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05
#. TOPIC: 010FB94A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_HV_DazraCityLife_Dazra05_scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01268D"
msgid "We have already lost our city, it is useless to lose our humanity along with it."
msgstr "우리는 이미 도시를 잃었어. 도시와 함께 인간성까지 잃는 건 소용없는 짓이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ZealotBoss:  &&& ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We have dispatched our people to Dazra. The contact has agreed to smuggle them in, and kill the one named Qisrani Dul'kehf.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAF62
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012681"
msgid "What do you mean, Qisrani will die?"
msgstr "키스라니가 죽는다니, 무슨 말이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, Qisrani will die?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean, Qisrani will die?
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAF61
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012680"
msgid "We have dispatched our people to Dazra. The contact has agreed to smuggle them in, and kill the one named Qisrani Dul'kehf."
msgstr "우리는 이미 다즈라에 부하들을 파견했다. 연락책은 부하들을 몰래 들여보내서 키스라니 둘케프라는 인물을 죽이기로 동의했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, Qisrani will die?
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: We can make a deal. I'll let you go, if you give me the name of the supply thief.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAF61
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01267F"
msgid "Your journey, however, ends here."
msgstr "하지만, 네 여정은 여기서 끝이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& ...  &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.|You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month.|Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh*, you do have a point. Normally I am loathe to bend the rules, but time is at a premium right now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE46
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01267E"
msgid "Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her."
msgstr ""
"키스라니라면 그게 필요하다는 걸 알았을 때 분명 승인해 줬을 거예요. 제가 키스라니에게 돌아가 봐야 한다면 당신이나 저나 시간 낭비하는 "
"거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
