msgid "*Sigh*, you do have a point. Normally I am loathe to bend the rules, but time is at a premium right now."
msgstr "*한숨* 당신의 말이 일리가 있군요. 평소에는 규칙을 어기는 걸 꺼리지만, 지금은 시간이 매우 중요하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE45
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01267C"
msgid "You'll be granted temporary admin privileges to Ukaru's computer. That should be enough for you to do your investigation."
msgstr "우카루 씨의 컴퓨터에 대한 임시 관리자 권한을 당신에게 드리겠습니다. 이거면 조사하는 데 충분할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Excellent. As for me, I must mourn my cousin's passing. I understand there's a shrine upstairs, although it seems to be occupied at the moment.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE40
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01267B"
msgid "When you return meet meet me at the Halls of Obedience, where we first met."
msgstr "다시 돌아올 땐 복종의 전당에서 만나도록 해요. 우리가 처음 만났던 곳이요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll see what I can uncover about Jandar's Rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE40
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01267A"
msgid "By Jinan's grace, we'll find out who this supply thief is and bring them to justice."
msgstr "지난의 은총이시여. 누가 물자를 훔쳤는지 알아내 죄값을 치르게 하고 말 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& Qisrani: He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find. &&& Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...|Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and... &&& Qisrani: *Sigh* This is my fault. I should've listened to Ukaru the first time. And instead I...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know you are right, but I can't help but feel guilty, as little good as it may do. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE42
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012679"
msgid "He knew the risks of what he was doing. Mourn him, but don't blame yourself."
msgstr "우카루는 자신이 하는 일의 위험성을 알고 있었어요. 애도는 해도, 자책하지는 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He knew the risks of what he was doing. Mourn him, but don't blame yourself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He knew the risks of what he was doing. Mourn him, but don't blame yourself.
