#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012677"
msgid "But yes, we must continue the investigation. Face forward."
msgstr "하지만, 그렇죠... 조사를 계속 진행해야 해요. 이겨내야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Ochim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
