#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012649"
msgid "Got stuck on cleanup duty."
msgstr "뒷처리 작업을 해야만 하다니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012648"
msgid "Wish I was the one to have fought those heretics."
msgstr "이단자들이랑 싸우는 임무에 투입되면 좋을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012647"
msgid "You fought Redeemed, huh. They're as nasty as they come."
msgstr "대속자와 싸워 본 적이 있다고요? 아주 고약한 놈들인데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012646"
msgid "If there's any Zealots on this ship, they'll wish they hadn't met me."
msgstr "이 배에 광신도가 있다면 날 만나지 않길 빌어야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos_SetTwo
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012645"
msgid "We're sweeping the ship for clues. So far haven't found any info on Jandar's Rest."
msgstr "단서를 찾아 배 전체를 뒤지고 있습니다. 잔다르의 안식처에 대한 정보는 못 찾았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos_SetTwo
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012644"
msgid "The cockpit terminal says they've been shipping supplies here from Dazra. This is a capital offense."
msgstr "조종석 단말기를 보니 다즈라에서 나온 물자를 옮기던 게 분명합니다. 그야말로 중죄죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos_SetTwo
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012643"
msgid "I heard you were the one to dispose of the heretics. Excellent work."
msgstr "이단자들을 물리친 분이라고 들었습니다. 훌륭하십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VaruunGuardHellos_SetTwo
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012642"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to eat a groat. But the job must be done first. All Must Serve."
msgstr "그로트 한 마리를 먹어 치울 수 있을 정도로 배고프지만, 일부터 해야죠. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA654
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CannotPay
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012641"
msgid "A Herald's services do not come free."
msgstr "전령의 도움은 공짜가 아닙니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA654
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CannotPay
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012640"
msgid "I cannot assist you then. Tapping into the Great Serpent's power comes at a cost."
msgstr "그렇다면 도와드릴 수 없습니다. 위대한 뱀의 힘을 사용하는 데는 대가가 따르는 법입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA654
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CannotPay
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263F"
msgid "Forgive me, but I cannot perform the Herald's arts without compensation."
msgstr "미안하지만, 보상 없이는 전령의 의술을 행할 수 없습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA655
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_AllDone
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263E"
msgid "By the Serpent's will, your wounds have been restored."
msgstr "뱀의 의지에 따라, 당신의 상처는 회복되었습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA655
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_AllDone
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263D"
msgid "What was broken has been restored. May the Great Serpent's scales protect you from further harm."
msgstr "부서진 곳이 회복되었습니다. 위대한 뱀의 비늘이 이 이상의 피해로부터 당신을 보호하기를."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA655
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_AllDone
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263C"
msgid "You are healed, much as Jinan was on his journey back to the Mourning."
msgstr "지난 님이 모어닝 호로 돌아가는 길에 그러했듯, 당신도 치유되었습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA653
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA673
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263B"
msgid "Clear your mind. Let Jinan's words speak to you, and you will learn to let go of such afflictions."
msgstr "마음을 비우세요. 지난 님의 말이 당신에게 닿도록 하세요. 그러면 그런 고통을 놓아버리는 법을 배우게 될 것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA653
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA673
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01263A"
msgid "Your afflictions are noted. Take a moment to inhale the breath of the Serpent. Hold it deep, and keep your mind still."
msgstr "당신의 고통은 새겨졌습니다. 잠시 뱀의 숨결을 들이쉬고, 깊이 들이마신 채 마음을 가라앉히세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA653
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA673
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012639"
msgid "It seems you are in need of both prayer and guidance. Wait with me, and I will have push away the source of your pain with Jinan's blessings."
msgstr ""
"기도와 인도가 모두 필요한 것 같군요. 잠시 나와 함께 기다리세요. 그러면 지난 님의 축복으로 당신의 고통의 근원을 밀어낼 수 있을 "
"것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA651
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA659
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012638"
msgid "Your wounds are light, but we should not take them lightly. Hear his chant, and we may bless you with his prayer."
msgstr ""
"당신의 상처는 가볍지만, 가볍게 여겨서는 안 됩니다. 그분의 성가를 들으세요. 그러면 그분의 기도로 당신을 축복할 수 있을 것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA651
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA659
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012637"
msgid "Your wounds are minor, but in time they may grow worse. I can offer the prayer and medicine to restore you."
msgstr "당신의 상처는 경미하지만, 시간이 지나면 악화될 수 있습니다. 당신을 회복시킬 기도와 약을 제공할 수 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA650
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA656
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012636"
msgid "You are in good health. The Herald's arts can do no more for you at this time."
msgstr "당신은 건강합니다. 이 시점에서 전령의 의술은 더 이상 당신에게 도움이 되지 않습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA650
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA656
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012635"
msgid "You do not need my services. I see no wounds nor afflictions taking hold of you."
msgstr "제 도움이 필요 없겠군요. 당신에게는 상처도 고통도 보이지 않습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA652
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA65F
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012634"
msgid "The Great Serpent finds great pain inside of you. Medicine alone will not be enough. Prayer and offerings are required here."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 당신 안에서 큰 고통을 발견하셨습니다. 약만으로는 충분하지 않을 것입니다. 여기에는 기도와 공물이 필요합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA652
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA65F
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012633"
msgid "It does not take the Serpent's eye to see you are heavily wounded. We will care for you here, in his holy shrine."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀 님의 눈이 아니어도 당신이 크게 다쳤다는 것을 알 수 있습니다. 위대한 뱀 님의 신성한 성소에서 당신을 돌볼 것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64F
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA670
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012632"
msgid "I will channel the power of prayer to heal you."
msgstr "기도의 힘을 집중하여 당신을 치유하겠습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_DoctorNeedHealing
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012631"
msgid "With Jinan's guidance, this will be but a moment."
msgstr "지난 님의 인도라면, 찰나의 시간이면 될 것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: GenericMaleEvenToned
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA65C
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012630"
msgid "Jinan bless you in your travels."
msgstr "지난 님이 당신의 여정을 축복하기를."

#. VOICE TYPE: GenericMaleEvenToned
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64C
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA65C
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01262F"
msgid "As you wish, disciple of Jarek."
msgstr "자렉 님의 제자여. 뜻대로 하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA666
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01262E"
msgid "I have plenty of supplies at my disposal."
msgstr "제겐 쓸 수 있는 용품이 많습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64D
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA666
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01262D"
msgid "Of course. We have healing arts and supplies at this shrine."
msgstr "물론입니다. 이 성소에는 치료 기술과 관련 용품이 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: GenericMaleEvenToned
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA66D
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01262C"
msgid "Beginning my examination..."
msgstr "진찰을 시작하겠습니다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: GenericMaleEvenToned
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010FA64E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Doctor01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FA66D
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01262B"
msgid "Jinan grant me the vision to see the unseen..."
msgstr "지난 님이시여, 보이지 않는 것을 볼 수 있는 눈을 제게 주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Doubt it. Of things I'd want to grab, I had a few old records I used to play when I danced with my old lady. That and some old laundry. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012590"
msgid "Anything worth salvaging?"
msgstr "챙겨 갈 만한 것이 보이나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01258F"
msgid "Now I can truly make a difference."
msgstr "이제 저는 진정으로 세상을 바꿀 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01258B"
msgid "There's my old ship, the Vaifala. Ever had one? A vaifala, not a ship. I know you got a bunch of those."
msgstr "내 옛날 배, 바이팔라가 저기 있군. 혹시 아나? 우주선 말고, 그 바이팔라 말일세. 몇 잔 마셔 봤을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01258A"
msgid "Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts."
msgstr "이 낡은 배를 다시 볼 줄은 생각지 못했어. 지금쯤은 부품으로 다 뜯어냈을 거라고 생각했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah. Better lucky than good, you know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012589"
msgid "Judging by the wreck, you're lucky to be alive."
msgstr "잔해를 보아하니, 살아 있는 게 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Judging by the wreck, you're lucky to be alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Judging by the wreck, you're lucky to be alive.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Agh, that's enough nostalgia for one day. Let's get going. I don't like hanging around graves. Especially one that should've been mine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012588"
msgid "Yeah. Better lucky than good, you know."
msgstr "그래. 운이 좋은 게 훨씬 낫지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: You would know. You're the pilot. I'm just a smuggler who knows how to plot a grav-jump.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012587"
msgid "Agh, that's enough nostalgia for one day. Let's get going. I don't like hanging around graves. Especially one that should've been mine."
msgstr ""
"아, 추억에 잠기는 건 이 정도면 충분해. 출발하자. 나는 무덤 주변을 맴도는 걸 좋아하지 않아. 특히 내 무덤이어야 했던 곳은 더더욱."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You would know. You're the pilot. I'm just a smuggler who knows how to plot a grav-jump.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012586"
msgid "It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing."
msgstr "추락하는 우주선을 착륙시키는 것은 숙련된 조종사만이 가능하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Agh, that's enough nostalgia for one day. Let's get going. I don't like hanging around graves. Especially one that should've been mine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012585"
msgid "You would know. You're the pilot. I'm just a smuggler who knows how to plot a grav-jump."
msgstr "잘 알겠지. 자네는 조종사니까. 나는 중력 도약 방법을 아는 밀수꾼일 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was doing a routine flight out of Dazra. Then something about the cataclysm messed up my systems. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012584"
msgid "How did you crash?"
msgstr "무슨 일로 추락하고 말았지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vultures have standards, Tane. They wouldn't waste their time on this garbage.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vultures have standards, Tane. They wouldn't waste their time on this garbage.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Agh, that's enough nostalgia for one day. Let's get going. I don't like hanging around graves. Especially one that should've been mine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012583"
msgid "Hey! That's my ship you're talking about. Not that you're wrong."
msgstr "이봐! 지금 내 배에 대해 말하고 있는 걸 기억하라고. 틀린 말은 아니지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything worth salvaging?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything worth salvaging?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012582"
msgid "Doubt it. Of things I'd want to grab, I had a few old records I used to play when I danced with my old lady. That and some old laundry."
msgstr ""
"그럴 것 같지 않군. 그나마 가져가고 싶을 만한 건, 할머니와 춤을 추었을 때 틀었던 오래된 레코드 몇 개 정도네. 오래된 세탁물도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything worth salvaging?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012581"
msgid "But look at this wreck. Ain't nothing survived this. I'll buy new laundry."
msgstr "하지만 이 난파선을 봐. 아무것도 살아남지 못했을 테니, 새 세탁물을 사야겠구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Didn't think I'd see this old hulk again. Figured some vultures would've scrapped it by now for parts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey! That's my ship you're talking about. Not that you're wrong.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012580"
msgid "Vultures have standards, Tane. They wouldn't waste their time on this garbage."
msgstr "고철상도 기준이 있어, 테인. 이런 쓰레기에 시간을 낭비할 리 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you crash?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you crash?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01257F"
msgid "I was doing a routine flight out of Dazra. Then something about the cataclysm messed up my systems."
msgstr "나는 다즈라 외부로 정기 비행을 하고 있었지. 그런데 그 대재난 때문에 시스템이 망가지고 말았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on "thought" / Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you crash?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01257E"
msgid "Up was down, left was... well, left was still left, but I thought it was right, because of the down-up situation."
msgstr "위아래가 뒤집혔고, 왼쪽은... 글쎄, 왼쪽은 여전히 왼쪽이었지만, 선체가 뒤집혀서 하필 그게 오른쪽이라고 생각했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: batball is the future iteration of a baseball / Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you crash?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: It takes a skilled pilot to land a ship when it's intent on crashing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010F6CA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_VaifalaCrashSite_SceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01257D"
msgid "My head was spun around like a batball in a washing machine. Miracle the thing still works. Though I suppose that's still up for debate."
msgstr "내 머리는 세탁기 속의 배트볼처럼 돌았어. 기적적으로 머리가 아직도 돌아가니 다행이지. 논쟁의 여지가 있을 것 같다만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A72
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipWeaponsRepaired
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsRepaired
msgctxt "01257C"
msgid "Weapon's back up!"
msgstr "무기 시스템 재가동!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Sahima_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01257B"
msgid "Is that everything?"
msgstr "더 얘기할 거 없지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01257A"
msgid "Great Serpent be blessed! At last, I can serve in a way that truly honors Makhara's legacy."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복을 내리셨네요! 마침내, 마카라 님의 유산에 걸맞는 방식으로 헌신할 수 있게 되었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012579"
msgid "I can never repay the debt I owe you."
msgstr "당신에게 진 이 빚은 결코 다 갚지 못할 거예요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_LC20_GuardsShared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012578"
msgid "This place is under investigation."
msgstr "이 장소는 현재 조사가 진행 중입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_LC20_GuardsShared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012577"
msgid "We'll be routing these supplies back to Dazra."
msgstr "우린 이 물품들을 모아 다즈라로 옮길 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_LC20_GuardsShared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012576"
msgid "The thought of Zealots stealing our supplies enrages me."
msgstr "광신도들이 우리의 물건들을 훔쳐 왔다니 화가 치밀어 오르는군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_LC20_GuardsShared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012575"
msgid "That which was stolen has been returned. Glory to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "놈들이 훔쳐간 물건을 회수했습니다. 위대한 뱀께 영광을."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_LC20_GuardsShared
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012574"
msgid "This area is now back under the control of House Dul'kehf and the Ministry of Commerce."
msgstr "이 지역은 다시 둘케프 가문의 상무성의 감독을 받고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ShipGuard03
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010F9D88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_FlavorScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012573"
msgid "Oh, you saved me some paperwork, thanks."
msgstr "아, 서류 작업을 덜어주셨군요. 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these heirlooms I'm looking for? &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There were three heirlooms.|Mahkara's weapon was crafted by the renowned gun-maker Kiva Shan, who was blind.|It was said Kiva could judge the quality of metals by touch, smell and taste.|Her boost pack was forged by Anjari the Elder, whose son Anjari the Younger earned great renown as a sculptor.|Mahkara's spacesuit was made by the weaver Krisa Vaszla, a woman of surpassing beauty and skill.|Krisa was a mother to thirteen children, many of whom aided in her work.|How she found the time to raise so many children while mastering her craft is a mystery to me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would not expect you to, but the effort is appreciated all the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012572"
msgid "I'll try to keep all of that in mind."
msgstr "모두 명심하도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused. A small chuckle to open with, / Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012571"
msgid "I would not expect you to, but the effort is appreciated all the same."
msgstr "당신이 이렇게까지 해줄 줄은 몰랐지만, 그래도 노력해 줘서 고맙군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these heirlooms I'm looking for? &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There were three heirlooms.|Mahkara's weapon was crafted by the renowned gun-maker Kiva Shan, who was blind.|It was said Kiva could judge the quality of metals by touch, smell and taste.|Her boost pack was forged by Anjari the Elder, whose son Anjari the Younger earned great renown as a sculptor.|Mahkara's spacesuit was made by the weaver Krisa Vaszla, a woman of surpassing beauty and skill.|Krisa was a mother to thirteen children, many of whom aided in her work.|How she found the time to raise so many children while mastering her craft is a mystery to me.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I admit with some shame that it's my own fault.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012570"
msgid "How did the Spacers find the tomb?"
msgstr "스페이서들이 어떻게 무덤을 찾아낸 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ashamed / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256F"
msgid "I admit with some shame that it's my own fault."
msgstr "부끄럽지만 제 잘못이라는 걸 인정해야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256E"
msgid "While I was traveling here, a group of them spotted me and I had to hide."
msgstr "여기로 오는 길에, 스페이서 중 한 무리가 저를 발견해서 숨어야만 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256D"
msgid "When I thought they had passed, I resumed my journey."
msgstr "스페이서들이 지나갔다고 생각했을 때, 다시 이동하기 시작했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256C"
msgid "Now it's clear that they hid themselves and waited to follow me."
msgstr "이제 보니 스페이서들은 저를 따라가려고 숨어서 때를 기다리고 있었던 거였던 거 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Guilty / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did the Spacers find the tomb?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010F7D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256B"
msgid "Great Serpent forgive me, I should have known better."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 부디 용서해 주소서. 제가 더 조심했어야 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wincing, in pain / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Cuts, bruises, energy burns... must've been quite a fight. I'll get you fixed up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010DDA30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01256A"
msgid "You're back. Did you bring a Med Pack? I'm badly hurt."
msgstr "돌아왔군요. 메디 팩 좀 있나요? 심하게 다쳤거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Oh? I won't ask how you know this. If you were secretly a Spacer, I doubt you'd be helping me. &&& companion: I expect you to do your part, and not just cower behind me.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9262
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012569"
msgid "I'll stay a while and pray while my wounds heal."
msgstr "여기서 기다리면서 기도할게요. 상처가 아물 때까지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sFX no record
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Like this?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
