msgid "Ding!"
msgstr "땡!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: I... that song...
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: I hear... music. So... lost...  where? Where am I?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
