msgstr "어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012563"
msgid "Warning. Husk detected."
msgstr "경고. 허물이 감지됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: There's a restaurant called the "Meat House" / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01252E"
msgid "If you want some meat to chew on, Dazra's got a whole house dedicated to it."
msgstr "고기 좀 먹고 싶다면 다즈라에 정육 전문점이 있으니 그곳에 가면 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01252D"
msgid "Dazra used to be more bustling. Lot of stuff got vaporized in the cataclysm. Lot of people too."
msgstr "다즈라는 원래 더 북적였는데 많은 것들이 대재난에 사그라지고 말았지. 많은 사람들도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01252C"
msgid "The refugee camp looks pretty bad. Losing your home's gotta be tough."
msgstr "난민촌은 참 열악해 보여. 살던 집을 잃었으니 참 힘들 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01252B"
msgid "Never been in the Ritual Caves. I heard they make you shave your head and put tattoos on your face. That true?"
msgstr "그 의례를 치르는 동굴은 가 본 적이 없어. 머리를 민 다음 얼굴에 문신을 새기도록 한다는데, 진짜야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01252A"
msgid "I smell groat. Lot of groat smell in this city."
msgstr "그로트 냄새로군. 이 도시엔 그로트 냄새가 많지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012529"
msgid "Jinan Plaza usually gets a lot of traffic. Good place to disappear into a crowd."
msgstr "지난 광장엔 원래 사람이 많았는데 말이야. 군중 속에서 몸을 숨기기 좋았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012528"
msgid "Used to be a lot of government buildings around the Scaled Citadel. Now there ain't."
msgstr "비늘 성채 주변에는 원래 정부 건물이 많았어. 이젠 아니지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012527"
msgid "If you need a scrape or two fixed up, try the Halls of Healing. They use medicine and prayer. Prayer part is useless though."
msgstr "상처가 생겨 치료가 필요하면 회복의 전당에 가면 되네. 의약과 기도를 사용하지. 기도야 무쓸모지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012526"
msgid "They call people like me \"husks.\" Maybe it's because I'm a husky guy."
msgstr "다들 나 같은 사람을 허물이라 불러. 내가 험한 물건인 건 어떻게 알고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012525"
msgid "Herald's Rest got some good drinks. Koza is the poison of choice though."
msgstr "전령의 안식처에는 좋은 술이 많지. 코자야말로 내가 제일 좋아하지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A5B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Tane
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012524"
msgid "Every time I come back to this city I feel like it'll be the last time."
msgstr "매번 이 도시에 돌아올 때마다 그때가 마지막 때일 것만 같다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012523"
msgid "The home of House Ka'dic was the only one to survive the cataclysm. Sometimes I wonder why the Great Serpent spared ours, and no one else's."
msgstr ""
"카딕 가문의 저택만이 그 재난 속에서 살아남았어. 가끔 위대한 뱀께서 왜 우리는 환난을 면케 해주시고, 다른 이들은 징벌하신 건지 "
"생각하곤 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012522"
msgid "The home of House Ka'dic was the only one to survive the cataclysm. A foreshadowing perhaps, now that we are House Va'ruun."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 저택만이 그 재난 속에서 살아남았어. 이제 우리가 바룬 가문이 된 걸 보면 일종의 복선이었을지 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012521"
msgid "If you are thirsty, Herald's Rest is a good place to stop for a drink."
msgstr "목마르다면 전령의 안식처가 잠시 휴식하며 머무르기 좋은 곳이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012520"
msgid "If hunger ails you, the Meat House is an excellent place for a bite."
msgstr "배가 고파서 힘들 땐 훈제소가 뛰어난 식당이 되어 줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251F"
msgid "The temple was taken in the cataclysm. I worry about our connection to the Great Serpent with such few places to worship."
msgstr "사원이 대격변으로 파괴되었어. 예배할 곳이 이렇게나 적어지다니 위대한 뱀과 우리 신민들의 관계가 걱정돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251E"
msgid "I worry about those who live in the refugee camp. Are they receiving the care they need?"
msgstr "난민촌에서 살아가는 사람들이 걱정돼. 충분한 보살핌을 받고 있는 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251D"
msgid "If you're in need of healing or prayer, talk to Hanton Irara. There is no better Herald in all of Dazra."
msgstr "치료나 기도가 필요하다면 핸톤 이라라 님에게 말하면 돼. 다즈라 전역에 그분보다 뛰어난 전령은 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251C"
msgid "Some of the noble Houses were dispaced in the cataclysm. House Veth'aal has taken over the Keep, while House Dul'kehf is in the Halls of Healing."
msgstr ""
"명문 가문 일부는 재난으로 본래 자리를 잃었어. 베타알 가문은 본성으로 피난했고 둘케프 가문은 회복의 전당에 자리를 잡고 말았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251B"
msgid "It is good to be home again."
msgstr "집에 다시 돌아오니 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01251A"
msgid "The Halls of Healing. I know I am a member of House Ka'dic now, but I rememberthis place fondly."
msgstr "회복의 전당. 지금 나는 카딕 가문의 일원이지만, 여전히 이곳을 소중히 기억하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012519"
msgid "Before I was adopted, I spent time at the old orphanage, and the Halls of Healing."
msgstr "입양되기 전에 나는 그 오래된 고아원과 회복의 전당에서 지냈었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SharedDazraCommentary_Sahima
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "012518"
msgid "The orphanage. I don't remember much about my years here, but I'm sad to see what's become of it."
msgstr "고아원이구나. 이곳의 내 예전 기억은 잘 안 떠오르지만 지금은 이렇게 되어서 가슴 아프네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mid-battle, rallying her allies. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LC06_01_ZealotSpeakerF00
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotFemale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010F5D03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0710_ZealotsAttackBackstage
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012517"
msgid "Forward! Reclaim the Citadel! Restore the true faith!"
msgstr "전진! 성채를 탈환하자! 진짜 신앙을 되찾자!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MS01_OchimTerminal, FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: An ancestor of mine earned a reputation as a skilled warrior and courageous leader.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012516"
msgid "What's the proud legacy you mentioned?"
msgstr "당신이 말한 자랑스러운 유산이 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's the proud legacy you mentioned?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012515"
msgid "An ancestor of mine earned a reputation as a skilled warrior and courageous leader."
msgstr "내 조상 중 한 분이 숙련된 전사이자 용맹한 지도자로서 명성을 날리셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012514"
msgid "She came to earn the respect, admiration and even devotion of some of our people."
msgstr "조상님은 우리 신민들로부터 존경과 찬사, 심지어 헌신까지 받았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012513"
msgid "By the favor of the Great Serpent, she also amassed a small fortune."
msgstr "그리고 위대한 뱀께서 총애하셔서, 조상님은 적지 않은 재산을 모으셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012512"
msgid "This has allowed generations of my family to live in comfort."
msgstr "이 덕분에 내 가문은 여러 세대에 걸쳐 안락하게 살 수 있었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012511"
msgid "The greatest treasure, however, is the prestige of the Hajtal name."
msgstr "하지만 가장 큰 보물은 하즈탈 가문의 명성이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Legacy
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012510"
msgid "No price can be laid upon that."
msgstr "그것은 어떤 값으로도 매길 수 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: By the mercy of the Great Serpent, my home was spared and none close to me were lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250F"
msgid "How are you coping with the recent event in the city?"
msgstr "최근 도시에서 일어난 사건에 어떻게 대처하고 계신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: It is indeed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5CA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250E"
msgid "Is honor very important to you?"
msgstr "명예가 당신에게 그렇게 중요한가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you coping with the recent event in the city?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250D"
msgid "By the mercy of the Great Serpent, my home was spared and none close to me were lost."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 자비로, 내 집은 무사했고 가까운 이들 중 누구도 잃지 않았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250C"
msgid "However, the suffering of our people is great."
msgstr "하지만, 우리 신민들의 고통은 크지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250B"
msgid "I am blessed with resources beyond what many in the city possess, and I have given what I can."
msgstr "나는 이 도시에 있는 많은 이들보다 더 많은 자원을 가지고 있으니, 내가 할 수 있는 만큼 기부했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01250A"
msgid "I hope that my humble contribution will bring comfort where it is needed."
msgstr "내 작은 기여가 필요한 곳에 위안이 됐으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident, certain / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is honor very important to you?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012509"
msgid "It is indeed."
msgstr "물론이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012508"
msgid "The honorable man is remembered and revered long after his passing."
msgstr "명예로운 자는 죽은 후에도 오랫동안 기억되고 존경받지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012507"
msgid "His descendants and kin inherit some of that honor for themselves, for they, too, will be well-regarded."
msgstr "명예로운 자의 후손과 친족은 그 명예의 일부를 물려받으며, 그자들 또한 훌륭한 평판을 얻게 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012506"
msgid "The man without honor is cursed to bear the shame of his deeds for all time."
msgstr "명예롭지 못한 자는 자신이 저지른 행동의 대가로 영원히 수치심을 짊어지는 저주를 받는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010F5C9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_FarudHajtal_TL_Honor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012505"
msgid "He will be shunned by the Great Serpent and dwell in endless darkness."
msgstr "명예롭지 못한 자는 위대한 뱀께 외면당하고 끝없는 어둠 속에서 살게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012504"
msgid "Impossible! This cannot be!"
msgstr "말도 안 돼! 이럴 순 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012503"
msgid "What? How?"
msgstr "뭐? 어떻게?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012502"
msgid "What can this mean?"
msgstr "이게 무슨 의미지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012501"
msgid "By the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Courteous, formal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_Anytime
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012500"
msgid "Ours is an honored house with a proud legacy. I'm happy to welcome you."
msgstr "우리 가문은 자랑스러운 유산을 가진 명예로운 가문이다. 자네를 환영하게 되어 기쁘군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Courteous, formal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_Anytime
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FF"
msgid "Stay as long as you like. I ask only that you respect our privacy."
msgstr "원하는 만큼 머무르도록. 다만 우리의 사생활을 존중해 주길 바란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Courteous, formal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_Anytime
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FE"
msgid "The Great Serpent smiles upon our meeting."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리의 만남에 미소 짓고 계실 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Guilty, trying to convince yourself you did the right thing / Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FD"
msgid "She is angry now, but in time, Maaliya will understand my decision."
msgstr "지금은 화가 났지만, 시간이 지나면 말리야도 내 결정을 이해할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Guilty, trying to convince yourself you did the right thing / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FC"
msgid "The heirlooms will be safe, and so will my daughter. That is what matters."
msgstr "가보도 안전할 것이고, 내 딸도 안전할 것이다. 그게 중요하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Guilty, trying to convince yourself you did the right thing / Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FB"
msgid "Maaliya's recklessness would have cost her dearly if not for your intervention."
msgstr "자네가 개입하지 않았다면 말리야의 무모함은 큰 대가를 치렀을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124FA"
msgid "I hope I've made the right choice."
msgstr "내가 올바른 선택을 했으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F9"
msgid "I pray that the heirlooms of the Fang will keep my daughter safe."
msgstr "송곳니의 가보가 내 딸을 안전하게 지켜주기를 기도하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F8"
msgid "Maaliya's courage is admirable, but I will not sleep well knowing the dangers she may face."
msgstr "말리야의 용기는 칭찬할 만하지만, 말리야가 직면할 위험을 생각하면 마음이 놓이지 않는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaGotHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F7"
msgid "May the Great Serpent watch over my daughter now that I cannot."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 제 딸을 굽어살펴주시길. 이제 제가 그리 할 수 없사오니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resentment, feeling defeated / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F6"
msgid "My father is blinded by fear, and now I must pay the price."
msgstr "제 아버지는 두려움에 눈이 멀었고, 이제 그 대가를 제가 치러야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resentment, feeling defeated / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F5"
msgid "To sit here and do nothing when I could help our people is a fate worse than death."
msgstr "우리 사람들을 도울 수 있는데 여기 앉아서 아무것도 하지 않는 것은 죽음보다 더한 운명이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Resentment, feeling defeated / Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MaaliyaHajtalHellos_MS05MaaliyaNoHeirlooms
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0124F4"
msgid "Is this my life now? To hide at home when I could truly make a difference?"
msgstr "이게 정말 제 인생일까요? 세상을 바꿀 기회가 있는데도 집구석에 숨어서 지내라고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124F3"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player has just gone silent mid-conversation. You're wondering why. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtal_WFPI_Anytime
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0124F2"
msgid "Are you feeling unwell?"
msgstr "몸이 안 좋은가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player has just gone silent mid-conversation. You're wondering why. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_FarudHajtal_WFPI_Anytime
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0124F1"
msgid "Was there anything more?"
msgstr "더 할 말 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you. &&& ...  &&& Draqir: All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already! &&& Karija: The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us. &&& Karija: House Va'ruun's return to greatness begins with the work done here, and until that time comes, we will keep it safe.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you will not be leaving at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124EF"
msgid "I'm not leaving without this tech."
msgstr "그 기술 없이 떠나진 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not leaving without this tech.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not leaving without this tech.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: So be it. I will simply watch.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124EE"
msgid "Then you will not be leaving at all."
msgstr "그럼 영영 떠나지 못할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you. &&& ...  &&& Draqir: All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already! &&& Karija: The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us. &&& Karija: House Va'ruun's return to greatness begins with the work done here, and until that time comes, we will keep it safe.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They are not yours to have!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124ED"
msgid "These Vortex Interlocks are what Anasko took with him. I need one."
msgstr "아나스코는 볼텍스 제어장치를 가져갔잖아. 나도 하나 필요한 거라니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you. &&& ...  &&& Draqir: All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already! &&& Karija: The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us. &&& Karija: House Va'ruun's return to greatness begins with the work done here, and until that time comes, we will keep it safe.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I cannot. The Speaker gave orders. He Speaks for the Great Serpent. The orders must be followed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124EC"
msgid "Your stubbornness will cost countless lives in Dazra. Let me take what I need and leave."
msgstr "네 고집 때문에 다즈라 사람들이 수없이 희생당할 거야. 필요한 것만 가지고 떠나게 해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: These Vortex Interlocks are what Anasko took with him. I need one.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: These Vortex Interlocks are what Anasko took with him. I need one.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: So be it. I will simply watch.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124EB"
msgid "They are not yours to have!"
msgstr "그건 네가 가질 게 아니야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: You utter fool! Do you have any idea what you have done?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124EA"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "안 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I will take you down as many times as I need to. You're not stopping me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I will take you down as many times as I need to. You're not stopping me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: So be it. I will simply watch.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124E9"
msgid "Your conviction is impressive. The outcome will not change, but we will show you... mercy."
msgstr "아주 휼륭한 신념이구나. 결과는 변하지 않겠지만, 우리가 네게... 자비를 보여주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your stubbornness will cost countless lives in Dazra. Let me take what I need and leave.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your stubbornness will cost countless lives in Dazra. Let me take what I need and leave.
