msgid "I will take you down as many times as I need to. You're not stopping me."
msgstr "필요하다면 몇 번이든지 널 처리해 주겠어. 넌 날 막지 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I got what I needed, and I'll be going now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I got what I needed, and I'll be going now.
