#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124E3"
msgid "You most certainly will not!"
msgstr "넌 절대로 못 떠난다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have served the Great Serpent, as I was ordered.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have served the Great Serpent, as I was ordered.
