msgid "Is that what you think?"
msgstr "그렇게 생각한단 말이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: No! &&& Karija: You utter fool! Do you have any idea what you have done?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is that what you think?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124E1"
msgid "I have served the Great Serpent, as I was ordered."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 섬겼을 뿐이야. 명령받은 대로 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: No! &&& Karija: You utter fool! Do you have any idea what you have done?
