#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124E0"
msgid "Sorry, I have to get this to Dazra as soon as possible."
msgstr "미안하지만, 이걸 최대한 빨리 다즈라에 가져가야 해서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: All right, hero. You have proven yourself a commendable opponent. But now, you have a choice to make.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: Or we can continue this contest of wills, and see which of us is stronger. The choice is yours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124DF"
msgid "If you can remove the remaining Interlock, you will have bested us, but you will ruin the lives of those above us."
msgstr "네가 나머지 제어장치를 챙기면, 우릴 처리할 수 있겠지. 하지만 우리 위에 있는 사람들은 그날로 끝장날 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: Those interlocks power our pods. You have killed Vedrasa!
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: All right, hero. You have proven yourself a commendable opponent. But now, you have a choice to make.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124DE"
msgid "What is more, you have disrupted the flow of power within the dam. You are one step from dooming those farmers on the surface."
msgstr ""
"그 뿐만 아니라, 넌 댐 내부 전력 흐름을 손상시켰어. 여기서 한 걸음만 잘못 디뎌도 땅 위에 있는 농부들은 파멸할 거란 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have served the Great Serpent, as I was ordered. &&& ...  &&& Karija: All right, hero. You have proven yourself a commendable opponent. But now, you have a choice to make. &&& Karija: If you can remove the remaining Interlock, you will have bested us, but you will ruin the lives of those above us. &&& Karija: Or we can continue this contest of wills, and see which of us is stronger. The choice is yours.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then let us see how this ends.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124DD"
msgid "I have never wanted to pull a plug so badly."
msgstr "플러그를 뽑아버리고 싶은 생각이 이렇게 간절했던 적도 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have never wanted to pull a plug so badly.
