#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124DC"
msgid "Then let us see how this ends."
msgstr "그럼 어떻게 끝날지 두고 보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: Is that what you think?
