#. TOPIC: 010F64AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_EkrisScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124D0"
msgid "Your lead from House Dul'kehf paid off?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문에서 얻은 단서는 쓸만했나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Now we await the assistance of Houses Veth'aal and Ka'dic. Let us hope we do not wait long.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: And before I forget, I've been told to inform you that the Council has now granted you access to the armory in the Keep. Seems they're pleased with your work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_EkrisScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124CF"
msgid "Progress is always welcome, but we are not done yet!"
msgstr "진척이 보이면 언제나 좋지만, 아직 끝난 건 아니야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: No! &&& Karija: You utter fool! Do you have any idea what you have done?
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You most certainly will not!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0124CE"
msgid "I got what I needed, and I'll be going now."
msgstr "필요한 물건을 챙겼지. 이제 떠날 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
