#. TOPIC: 01053F53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01248C"
msgid "What's more, none of this unusual growth was seen before the Dazra incident."
msgstr "게다가, 이 특이한 식물 생장은 다즈라 사고 이전에는 전혀 관찰되지 않던 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was no trouble at all.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Here's the payment for those plant samples.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01248B"
msgid "Perhaps it's a sign that the Great Serpent favors our work."
msgstr "아마도 위대한 뱀께서 우리의 일을 돕고 계신다는 신호일지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: With pleasure! &&& AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01248A"
msgid "Could we please move on?"
msgstr "제발 좀 넘어가면 안 될까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: With pleasure! &&& AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012489"
msgid "I know a few farmers in the Freestar Collective who'd pay good money for something like that."
msgstr "자유항성 공동체에 그런 걸 비싼 값에 살 만한 농부 몇 명을 알고 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: With pleasure! &&& AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012488"
msgid "Sounds remarkably thorough."
msgstr "놀라울 정도로 철저한 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking aloud / to companion
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012487"
msgid "Hmm... yes, I can see how the device could have useful applications in the field of agriculture."
msgstr "흠... 네, 그 장치가 농업 분야에 유용하게 적용될 수 있다는 걸 알겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's nothing wrong with being enthusiastic about your field.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: We'll get to work studying the animal tissue. Now go forth and travel safely. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012486"
msgid "The days must feel like sheer drudgery."
msgstr "하루하루가 힘들고 단조롭게만 느껴지겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can skip the bravado. I'm here for a Vortex Interlock, and I'm going to get it. You won't stop me. &&& Karija: How confident you are. So much more so than any who came before. &&& Karija: Jinan Va'ruun himself charged us with the protection of this facility. It was his last order, and it will be carried out.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is not for you. That is all you need to know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F3709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012475"
msgid "I don't even know what this facility is. I'm here to find out."
msgstr "난 이 시설이 뭔지도 몰라. 알아보러 온 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't even know what this facility is. I'm here to find out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't even know what this facility is. I'm here to find out.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: The work done here must be safeguarded. Protected. Never permitted to leave. None but the Speaker may decide otherwise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F3708
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage510_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012474"
msgid "It is not for you. That is all you need to know."
msgstr "널 위한 곳은 아니지. 그것만 알면 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many times do I have to kill you?
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: I'm going to find a way to stop you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0109FAA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012473"
msgid "We cannot be defeated in combat."
msgstr "우릴 싸움으로 물리칠 수는 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Unless, of course, Executors are now operating in some new way, and I have now made things worse for us...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012471"
msgid "Another Executor? No, you do not look the part."
msgstr "실무관이 또 온 건가요? 아니지. 그렇겐 안 보이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Another Executor? No, you do not look the part.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3712
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012470"
msgid "Unless, of course, Executors are now operating in some new way, and I have now made things worse for us..."
msgstr "물론, 실무관들이 뭔가 새로운 방식으로 일하기 시작한 게 아니라면 말이죠. 설마 상황이 더 나빠질 리는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Another Executor? No, you do not look the part. &&& Gamiral: Unless, of course, Executors are now operating in some new way, and I have now made things worse for us...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh. Oh no.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3711
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246F"
msgid "[Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me."
msgstr "[거짓말] 당연히 실무관 맞고, 날 알아보지 못하다니 기분 나쁘군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246E"
msgid "Oh. Oh no."
msgstr "아... 이런."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246D"
msgid "I'm so sorry. With the state of Dazra being what it appears, we assumed there were other priorities, and were not expecting you."
msgstr "정말 죄송해요. 보이는 다즈라 상황이 상황이다 보니까, 더 중요한 일이 있으실 줄 알아서, 이리 찾아오실 줄은 몰랐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: If you will be here for a while, mind your step. Things are in a sorry state here, though we do the best we can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246C"
msgid "I am sorry, but we do not have the allotted produce ready for delivery. Things have been slow, but we are trying our best."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 할당받은 농산물 배송 준비가 아직 안 끝났어요. 일이 늦어졌긴 했는데, 그래도 최선을 다하는 중이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246B"
msgid "You would ask what an Executor is, but then claim to be one?"
msgstr "실무관이 뭐냐고 물어봐 놓고선, 본인이 실무관이라고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: If you will be here for a while, mind your step. Things are in a sorry state here, though we do the best we can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01246A"
msgid "A poor attempt at humor, my friend."
msgstr "유머 감각이 심각한 수준이네요. 친구."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Another Executor? No, you do not look the part. &&& Gamiral: Unless, of course, Executors are now operating in some new way, and I have now made things worse for us...
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, well that is a relief.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012469"
msgid "I'm not working for any Ministry."
msgstr "부처 소속 사람은 아닌데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not working for any Ministry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not working for any Ministry.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: If you will be here for a while, mind your step. Things are in a sorry state here, though we do the best we can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012468"
msgid "Ah, well that is a relief."
msgstr "아, 그럼 다행이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's an Executor?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's an Executor?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012467"
msgid "Really? From the Ministry of Commerce? How can you be unfamiliar?"
msgstr "진심이에요? 상무성 실무관 몰라요? 그걸 어떻게 모를 수 있어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's an Executor?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012466"
msgid "They are... agents assigned with various duties, including collecting supplies and delivering payments."
msgstr "실무관은... 다양한 임무를 맡은 요원들이에요. 물품 수송이나 대금 지불 같은 일들도 맡고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's an Executor?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: [Lie] I am indeed an Executor, and I'm offended you didn't recognize me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012465"
msgid "I was particularly concerned about the supplies, as... Well, we are behind schedule, I am afraid."
msgstr "특히 물자 걱정을 하던 중이거든요. 그게... 음, 일정이 밀렸는지라, 좀 불안하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm just passing through.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just passing through.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: If you will be here for a while, mind your step. Things are in a sorry state here, though we do the best we can.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012464"
msgid "Are you? Not many do these days."
msgstr "그래요? 요즘엔 그런 사람들 별로 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Another Executor? No, you do not look the part. &&& Gamiral: Unless, of course, Executors are now operating in some new way, and I have now made things worse for us...
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Really? From the Ministry of Commerce? How can you be unfamiliar?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F370B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_Greeting_Gamiral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012463"
msgid "What's an Executor?"
msgstr "실무관이 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What brings you to the Halls of Healing? &&& Ochim: I have a headache. You?
#. ALIAS: Ochim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, then pass.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B82F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012462"
msgid "I'm just passing through."
msgstr "그냥 지나가고 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012461"
msgid "Are you still with me?"
msgstr "아직 듣고 있는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012460"
msgid "Is everything all right?"
msgstr "괜찮은 거 맞아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245F"
msgid "The farm does require my attention eventually..."
msgstr "농장 일도 마저 처리해야 하는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ever so slightly annoyed / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245E"
msgid "A conversation does require two active parties..."
msgstr "대화는 원래 양쪽이 다 해야 하는 법이지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245D"
msgid "Do you need a moment?"
msgstr "잠깐 시간 좀 드릴까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245C"
msgid "I do not wish to be rude, but I do have other things to do."
msgstr "무례하게 굴고 싶진 않지만, 저도 할 일이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_LijanaDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245B"
msgid "Uhh, hello?"
msgstr "어, 여보세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01245A"
msgid "Did you forget what you were going to say? Happens to me sometimes."
msgstr "하려던 말이 뭔지 까먹은 거예요? 저도 가끔 그러는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012459"
msgid "What are you thinking about?"
msgstr "무슨 생각 하는 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010F3707
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_WaitingForInputKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
