#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EF9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01242F"
msgid "For all we know, the same thing is happening to people right now, just more slowly."
msgstr "아마도, 지금 사람들에게도 똑같은 특이 현상이 벌어지고 있을지도 모릅니다. 단지 더 느리게 진행되는 걸지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If that's true, then why aren't people affected?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Sounds to me like you need more information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EF9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01242E"
msgid "All the more reason to work with a sense of urgency."
msgstr "때문에 더욱더 위기의식을 갖고 일을 처리해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My knowledge and expertise are at your service. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.|You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why.|The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes. &&& SherineDubas: Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things. &&& AzadDubas: We began to see this phenomenon just after the accident in Dazra.|We're convinced these events are linked, but the exact nature of the connection remains a mystery.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, no, not yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EF9F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01242D"
msgid "Do you have any evidence to support that theory?"
msgstr "그 이론을 뒷받침할 만한 증거가 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: This and the next few lines are a bit condescending, like an expert trying to explain to a layperson they find annoying / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Admit it, you're grasping at straws here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Admit it, you're grasping at straws here.
