#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EF9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01242C"
msgid "If you mean that we're making guesses, then yes, we are."
msgstr "저희가 그냥 추측하고 있다는 겁니까? 맞아요. 그냥 억측이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Admit it, you're grasping at straws here.
