#. TOPIC: 010EF9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01242B"
msgid "In the absence of knowledge, we hypothesize, we theorize, and we test."
msgstr "지식이 없을 때, 저희는 가설을 세우고, 이론화하고, 시험합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
