msgid "However, I'm confident that the process will prove the hypothesis to be correct."
msgstr "하지만, 작업 과정을 마무리하면 가설이 옳다는 걸 증명할 수 있을 거라 확신합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My knowledge and expertise are at your service. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.|You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why.|The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes. &&& SherineDubas: Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things. &&& AzadDubas: We began to see this phenomenon just after the accident in Dazra.|We're convinced these events are linked, but the exact nature of the connection remains a mystery.
