#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010EC630
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C9"
msgid "This is a personal matter. I am sure the Envoy will respect our privacy."
msgstr "이건 개인적인 문제입니다. 사절께서도 우리의 사생활을 존중해 주실 거라 믿습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: As of very recently, I am the Elder. I am ultimately responsible for all of House Dul'kehf, and by association, the Ministry of Commerce.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C4"
msgid "What is your role in House Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문에서 맡으신 역할은 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is your role in House Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: It has been an... abrupt transition for me. Given all that is going on, I imagine it will be some time before I feel settled in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C3"
msgid "As of very recently, I am the Elder. I am ultimately responsible for all of House Dul'kehf, and by association, the Ministry of Commerce."
msgstr "나는 아주 최근에서야 장로가 됐다네. 둘케프 가문 뿐만 아니라 가문과 연계된 상무성까지 전부 내가 책임지고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: As of very recently, I am the Elder. I am ultimately responsible for all of House Dul'kehf, and by association, the Ministry of Commerce.
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Role
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C2"
msgid "It has been an... abrupt transition for me. Given all that is going on, I imagine it will be some time before I feel settled in."
msgstr "내게는 뭐랄까... 갑작스러운 변화였어. 지금 돌아가는 상황을 보면 적응할 때까지는 시간이 좀 걸릴 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: House Va'ruun depends on trade, internal and external, just like any civilization. The Ministry facilitates and oversees that trade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Ministry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C1"
msgid "Can you tell me more about the Ministry of Commerce?"
msgstr "상무성에 대해 자세히 알려주실 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about the Ministry of Commerce?
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: Jinan Va'ruun himself established the Houses and charged us with this responsibility. We pride ourselves on a job well done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Ministry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123C0"
msgid "House Va'ruun depends on trade, internal and external, just like any civilization. The Ministry facilitates and oversees that trade."
msgstr "바룬 가문도 다른 문명들처럼 내부와 외부 교역에 의존한다네. 상무성은 그런 교역 활동을 지원하고 감독하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ_HasmakDulkehf: House Va'ruun depends on trade, internal and external, just like any civilization. The Ministry facilitates and oversees that trade.
#. ALIAS: MQ_HasmakDulkehf
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010EC5F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MQ_Hasmak_TL_Ministry
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123BF"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun himself established the Houses and charged us with this responsibility. We pride ourselves on a job well done."
msgstr ""
"지난 바룬 님께서 가문들을 설립하시고 우리에게 이런 책임을 맡기신 걸세. 우리는 맡은 일을 잘 해내고 있다는 사실이 자랑스럽다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123BE"
msgid "Rebuilding at home, and a war among the stars. So much to do."
msgstr "고향을 재건하는 동시에 별들 사이에서 전쟁을 하라니. 할 일이 많구먼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123BD"
msgid "Even in these trying times, we are doing all we can to keep House Va'ruun supplied."
msgstr "이런 어려운 시기에도 우린 바룬 가문의 물자 공급을 위해 최선을 다하고 있다네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123BC"
msgid "The Great Serpent's plan for us is sometimes hard to discern."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 위해 세우신 계획은 가끔 이해하기 어렵지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123BB"
msgid "House Va'ruun must be able to rely on the Ministry of Commerce. We cannot fail."
msgstr "바룬 가문이 상무성을 의지할 수 있도록 해야 하네. 실패해선 안 될 일이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ_HasmakHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123BA"
msgid "I confess I am still adjusting to my new role."
msgstr "솔직히, 지금도 새 역할에 적응 중이라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tane's going to turn on his tracker. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TurnOnTrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B9"
msgid "All right, let's get this baby purring."
msgstr "좋아, 우리 애기가 다시 앵앵거리게 해보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2020_Tane_TurnOnTrackerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B8"
msgid "She's got a limited range, so just keep heading northwest of Dazra until we pick something up."
msgstr "추적기 탐지 범위는 한계가 있으니까, 뭐가 잡힐 때까지는 다즈라 북서쪽으로 계속 이동해."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "0123B7"
msgid "\"All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve.\""
msgstr "'모두가 섬겨야 한다. 그리고 지금 바로 이것이야말로 당신이 섬기는 방식인 거예요.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do not attempt to deceive the Great Serpent, Kaviil. He sees what is in your heart.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do not attempt to deceive the Great Serpent, Kaviil. He sees what is in your heart.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0117615B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0123B6"
msgid "I only wished to serve, I swear. You are right, though. Here, take it."
msgstr "정말로 섬기고 싶었을 뿐이에요. 그래도 맞는 말이긴 하네요. 자, 가져가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Kaviil
#. PROMPT: All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I only wished to serve, I swear. You are right, though. Here, take it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EC611
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B5"
msgid "You know that All Must Serve, Kaviil. Right now, handing over that keycard, that is how you best Serve the Great Serpent."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다는 거 알잖아요, 캐빌. 지금 그 키카드를 넘겨주는 게 위대한 뱀을 가장 잘 섬기는 길이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This isn't a safe place for a child. &&& ...  &&& Comrak: So you are trying to get in there? &&& Comrak: You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here! &&& Comrak: I saw him! But he didn't talk to me. And there were too many other people around him. They all looked really serious.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That doesn't sound right. Why would it have anything to do with that?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBE02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B4"
msgid "There's a chance that whatever happened in Dazra is connected to something in that dam."
msgstr "다즈라에서 일어난 일이 저 댐에 있는 뭔가와 연관됐을 가능성이 있거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's a chance that whatever happened in Dazra is connected to something in that dam.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's a chance that whatever happened in Dazra is connected to something in that dam.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBE01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B3"
msgid "That doesn't sound right. Why would it have anything to do with that?"
msgstr "그건 아닐 것 같은데요. 댐이랑 무슨 관련이 있겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's a chance that whatever happened in Dazra is connected to something in that dam.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: But I did see them go in. They had cards that let them open the door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBE01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B2"
msgid "I didn't even see all that much, anyway."
msgstr "뭐, 저도 그렇게 많이 본 건 아니지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger. &&& Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can only assume you would say such a thing because you are new to our customs. I shall, therefore, forgive it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBE00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B1"
msgid "It's a shame Malibor couldn't have been informed of whatever it is you claim to have for me."
msgstr "말리보어가 장로님이 가졌다는 정보를 말해주지 못한다는 게 유감이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a shame Malibor couldn't have been informed of whatever it is you claim to have for me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a shame Malibor couldn't have been informed of whatever it is you claim to have for me.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123B0"
msgid "I can only assume you would say such a thing because you are new to our customs. I shall, therefore, forgive it."
msgstr "아마 우리 관습에 아직 익숙하지 않아서 그런 말을 하는 모양이구먼. 그러니 그 부분은 내 용서하겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry for your loss. &&& Hasmak: My loss? Yes, I suppose. Although from an outside perspective, one could consider it a fair trade, given my new role. Perhaps even a gain.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hardly. I was quite comfortable with my position within House Dul'kehf, and fully expected to remain where I was.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AF"
msgid "Anything to get ahead, right?"
msgstr "출세를 위해서라면 못 할 일이 없는 법 아니겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything to get ahead, right?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything to get ahead, right?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AE"
msgid "Hardly. I was quite comfortable with my position within House Dul'kehf, and fully expected to remain where I was."
msgstr "아니. 난 둘케프 가문에서 내 위치에 충분히 만족하고 있었다네. 그 자리를 계속 지키게 될 거라고 생각했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a heartless way to talk about the loss of a relative.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a heartless way to talk about the loss of a relative.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AD"
msgid "I agree. And yet, with the proper detachment, nearly anything can be seen as transactional. Those within House Dul'kehf are trained for it."
msgstr "동감일세. 하지만 적절하게 거리를 두면, 거의 모든 것을 거래라고 생각할 수 있지. 둘케프 가문 사람들은 그런 훈련을 받는다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're lucky to be alive. &&& Hasmak: Lucky? Perhaps. I have been pondering it - whether luck is a consideration if the Great Serpent guides all things.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I agree. And yet, with the proper detachment, nearly anything can be seen as transactional. Those within House Dul'kehf are trained for it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AC"
msgid "That's a heartless way to talk about the loss of a relative."
msgstr "친척을 잃었다는 이야기치고는 너무 무정한 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here for information, not a story. &&& Hasmak: Can not stories themselves be information?
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate the sentiment, but... We shall never know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AB"
msgid "I'm sure your cousin would consider the Ministry in safe hands."
msgstr "분명 사촌분도 부처가 믿을 만한 사람에게 맡겨졌다고 생각할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've been through a lot. Are you sure you're okay?
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: The people of House Va'ruun - those that are left - need our efforts now more than ever. That is my primary concern.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Okay
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123AA"
msgid "No one in Dazra is \"okay\" right now. We are all doing the best we can in the face of terrible circumstances."
msgstr "지금 다즈라에 '괜찮은' 사람은 없다네. 우리 모두 이 끔찍한 상황에 맞서 최선을 다하고 있으니 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: No one in Dazra is "okay" right now. We are all doing the best we can in the face of terrible circumstances.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Okay
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A9"
msgid "You've been through a lot. Are you sure you're okay?"
msgstr "많은 일을 겪으셨을 텐데요. 정말 괜찮으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure your cousin would consider the Ministry in safe hands.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure your cousin would consider the Ministry in safe hands.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A8"
msgid "I appreciate the sentiment, but... We shall never know."
msgstr "그렇게 말해주니 고맙네만... 알 도리는 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: No one in Dazra is "okay" right now. We are all doing the best we can in the face of terrible circumstances.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Okay
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A7"
msgid "The people of House Va'ruun - those that are left - need our efforts now more than ever. That is my primary concern."
msgstr "바룬 가문 신민들... 살아남은 이들은 그 어느 때보다도 우리의 도움이 필요해. 그게 내가 제일 걱정하는 일일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you. &&& Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests. &&& Hasmak: All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An attempt was made, but I admit it was not as forceful as it should have been. It was clear it was going to fall on deaf ears.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A6"
msgid "This could have been shared with the Council long before I got here."
msgstr "그 말은 제가 오기 한참 전에 대의회에 전해주셔야 했을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This could have been shared with the Council long before I got here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This could have been shared with the Council long before I got here.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010EBDF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A5"
msgid "An attempt was made, but I admit it was not as forceful as it should have been. It was clear it was going to fall on deaf ears."
msgstr "전해주려 하긴 했네만, 솔직히 그렇게 단호하게 말하지 않았다는 건 인정함세. 말해봤자 안 들어줄 게 뻔했거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You have no idea if this is going to pay off, do you? That's why you're only telling me now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You have no idea if this is going to pay off, do you? That's why you're only telling me now.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0123A4"
msgid "It is a shame were not born House Dul'kehf. You seem a natural for this line of work."
msgstr "자네가 둘케프 가문 태생이 아니라니 유감이구먼. 이런 일에 타고난 것 같은데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010C5D7A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_HellosHasmak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123A3"
msgid "I hope you find something useful at the dam."
msgstr "댐에서 쓸만한 걸 찾았길 바라네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010C5D7A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_HellosHasmak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123A2"
msgid "You know all that I know. I pray to the Serpent that it is enough."
msgstr "내가 아는 건 다 말했네. 위대한 뱀께 그걸로 족했기를 기도해야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010C5D7A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_HellosHasmak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123A1"
msgid "House Du'lkehf continues to be at your disposal."
msgstr "둘케프 가문은 계속 자네를 도울 거라네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010C5D7A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_HellosHasmak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0123A0"
msgid "I hope whatever you find may bring a swift end to our predicament."
msgstr "자네가 뭘 찾아냈든 우리의 고난을 빨리 끝내줬으면 좋겠구먼."

msgctxt "01239F"
msgid "\"To deny your daughter the right to serve is shameful.\""
msgstr "'자신의 딸이 뱀을 섬길 권리를 빼앗는 건 수치스러운 겁니다.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ashamed / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To deny your daughter the right to serve is shameful.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "To deny your daughter the right to serve is shameful."
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Your cowardice would smother the fierce courage in your daughter's heart and dim the fire in her eyes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01239E"
msgid "I can bear that shame if it means my daughter is safe."
msgstr "내 딸만 무사하다면 그 정도의 수치심은 참을 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, scolding / Irritated / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya. &&& FarudHajtal: Why would I allow my only child to take such a risk? &&& FarudHajtal: I can't believe I'm saying this, but you've changed my mind.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01239D"
msgid "Your cowardice would smother the fierce courage in your daughter's heart and dim the fire in her eyes."
msgstr "당신의 그 소심함 때문에 따님 가슴 속의 격렬한 용기가 짓눌리고, 눈빛 속에 깃든 불꽃마저 꺼질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, scolding / Angry / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01239C"
msgid "How can you claim to honor Mahkara the Fang's legacy while denying everything she represents?"
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라 님이 상징하는 모든 것을 부정하면서, 어떻게 마카라 님의 유산을 존중한다고 주장할 수 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern, direct / Stern / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I... I can't deny the truth of your words.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01239B"
msgid "This is your one chance to let Maaliya embrace that legacy. If you deny her, she will resent you for the rest of your life."
msgstr ""
"따님이 그 유산을 받아들이도록 허락할 수 있는 기회는 이번 뿐입니다. 만약 따님을 부정한다면, 따님은 평생 당신을 원망할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Faltering, a difficult realizing / Depressed / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I can't believe I'm saying this, but you've changed my mind. &&& companion: Your cowardice would smother the fierce courage in your daughter's heart and dim the fire in her eyes.|How can you claim to honor Mahkara the Fang's legacy while denying everything she represents?|This is your one chance to let Maaliya embrace that legacy. If you deny her, she will resent you for the rest of your life. 
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01239A"
msgid "I... I can't deny the truth of your words."
msgstr "자네의 그 말... 부정할 수가 없군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a heavy sigh. This is a difficult moment. Coming to terms with a very hard choice. / Sad / to companion
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012399"
msgid "Perhaps it's time to let go. To let my daughter be who she wishes to be."
msgstr "어쩌면 이제는 놓아줄 때가 된 것 같군. 내 딸이 원하는 사람이 되도록 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Heavy-hearted. / Sad / to companion
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Thank you, father. You will not regret this decision, I promise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012398"
msgid "Very well. I will allow it."
msgstr "알겠다. 허락하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& ...  &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage! &&& Vassilis: A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case.|From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem. &&& Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
