#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile. &&& companion: Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile.
