#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012395"
msgid "Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless you both!"
msgstr "그럼 별들이 진실을 전해 줬군요. 뱀께서 여러분을 축복하십니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. PROMPT: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Stern
