#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012392"
msgid "Ah! So you've some experience, then?"
msgstr "아! 이미 경험이 좀 있으신가 보군요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy, enthusiastic / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: My knowledge and expertise are at your service.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.
