#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012390"
msgid "Sure. It sounds like a good opportunity to learn more about your world."
msgstr "좋습니다. 당신네 세계에 대해 더 많이 알게 될 기회인 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy agreement / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure. It sounds like a good opportunity to learn more about your world.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure. It sounds like a good opportunity to learn more about your world.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01238F"
msgid "Well said indeed!"
msgstr "맞습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure. It sounds like a good opportunity to learn more about your world.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01238E"
msgid "I've always believed that the Great Serpent looks with favor upon those who seek knowledge and enlightenment."
msgstr "저는 위대한 뱀께서 지식과 깨달음을 추구하는 자들을 호의적으로 보신다고 항상 믿어 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station.|I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any luck. &&& companion: This could become tiresome quickly. &&& AzadDubas: So, are you interested in a little field work?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Gathering data, mostly. Nothing too strenuous, I assure you.
