#. TOPIC: 010EDEFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01238D"
msgid "What kind of field work are we talking about?"
msgstr "현장 업무란 게 어떤 일인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of field work are we talking about?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of field work are we talking about?
