#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: My knowledge and expertise are at your service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
