msgid "Gathering data, mostly. Nothing too strenuous, I assure you."
msgstr "주로 데이터를 수집하는 일입니다. 장담컨대, 그렇게 힘든 일은 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.|You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why.|The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes. &&& SherineDubas: Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01238B"
msgid "We began to see this phenomenon just after the accident in Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라에서 사고가 발생한 직후에 특이 현상이 관찰되기 시작했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sounds to me like you need more information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01238A"
msgid "We're convinced these events are linked, but the exact nature of the connection remains a mystery."
msgstr "특이 현상들이 서로 연관되어 있다고 확신은 하지만, 인과관계가 어떻게 되는지는 여전히 수수께끼입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm but fair
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_AzadHelloPreStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012388"
msgid "This is a place of learning. Please be respectful of our work."
msgstr "이곳은 배움의 장소입니다. 저희가 작업을 할 수 있게 존중해 주시기 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite, welcoming
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPreStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012386"
msgid "If you're here about the job, you'll need to speak to my husband."
msgstr "일자리 때문에 오셨다면, 제 남편과 이야기하셔야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite, welcoming
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPreStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012385"
msgid "We're always happy to welcome curious minds."
msgstr "우리는 항상 기꺼이 호기심 많은 사람들을 환영해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Polite, welcoming
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS04_SherineHellosPreStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012384"
msgid "What a pleasant surprise! We so rarely have guests."
msgstr "정말 반가운 놀라움이군요! 손님이 오시는 일이 정말 드물거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
