#. TOPIC: 010D1F3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "012375"
msgid "Gah!"
msgstr "으악!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "012374"
msgid "Great Serpent! Free us from this nightmare!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 이 악몽에서 우리를 해방시켜 주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sage, friendly / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0110F2F3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01VijunHellosStage200
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012373"
msgid "May the Great Serpent guide your steps."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대의 길을 이끌어 주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012372"
msgid "Be watchful as you travel."
msgstr "여행 중 조심하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012371"
msgid "Until our next meeting."
msgstr "다음에 또 만납시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "012370"
msgid "Goodbye, now."
msgstr "자, 잘 가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01236F"
msgid "It was good to talk."
msgstr "얘기해서 좋았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A friendly goodbye.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEF9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "01236E"
msgid "Farewell, far traveler."
msgstr "잘 가세요. 먼 길을 떠나시는 분."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01236D"
msgid "It is truly a blessing to share a passion for science with the one I love."
msgstr "사랑하는 사람과 과학에 대한 열정을 나눌 수 있다는 건 정말 큰 축복이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01236C"
msgid "Life takes so many forms, and all are a reflection of the Great Serpent. It is quite wondrous."
msgstr "생명은 정말 다양한 모습을 하고 있고, 그 모두가 위대한 뱀 님을 반영하지요. 정말 경이롭습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01236B"
msgid "I study life to better understand the mysteries of creation and the Great Serpent's grand design."
msgstr "저는 창조의 신비와 위대한 뱀 님의 거대한 설계를 더 잘 이해하기 위해 생명을 연구해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01236A"
msgid "True wisdom is living in harmony with nature, rather than seeking to change it."
msgstr "진정한 지혜는 자연을 바꾸려 하기보다는 자연과 조화를 이루며 사는 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A quip, a bit of wisdom. / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012369"
msgid "A true scientist is never afraid to get their hands dirty."
msgstr "진정한 과학자는 손이 더러워지는 것을 두려워하지 않죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A quip, a bit of wisdom. / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012368"
msgid "I find both joy and serenity in the simple act of tending a garden."
msgstr "저는 정원을 가꾸는 단순한 행위에서 기쁨과 평온함을 찾아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Contemplative
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012367"
msgid "There are times I wish I had spent my life visiting other worlds to see what mysteries they hold."
msgstr "가끔은 다른 세계를 방문해서 그곳에 어떤 신비가 있는지 알아보는 데 제 삶을 보냈으면 좋았을 텐데 하는 생각이 들어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Contemplative
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012366"
msgid "A marriage is like a flower garden. It requires attention, patience and care to make them blossom."
msgstr "결혼은 꽃밭과 같아요. 꽃을 피우려면 관심과 인내, 보살핌이 필요하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012365"
msgid "I can't thank you enough for your help."
msgstr "도와주셔서 정말 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012364"
msgid "Bless the Great Serpent for bringing you to us. Your help was invaluable."
msgstr "그대를 우리에게 인도해주신 위대한 뱀은 복되시도다. 정말 크게 도움이 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012363"
msgid "Thanks to your efforts, we've averted a crisis."
msgstr "당신의 노력 덕분에 저희는 위기를 모면할 수 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012362"
msgid "The Great Serpent smiles upon those who protect His creations, be they plant, beast or man."
msgstr "식물이든, 짐승이든, 사람이든, 그분의 창조물을 보호하는 자들에게 위대한 뱀께서는 미소 지으십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pensive, concerned / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012361"
msgid "I can't help but wonder what other undiscovered effects the vortex might have."
msgstr "볼텍스에 아직 발견되지 않은 다른 효과가 있는 건 아닐까 궁금해지네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy, grateful / Happy
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "012360"
msgid "It was a pleasure to work with you. I do hope you'll be safe out there."
msgstr "당신과 함께 일해서 즐거웠어요. 부디 그곳에서 무사하시길 바라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01235F"
msgid "I fear to think what could have happened if you hadn't come to help when you did."
msgstr "당신이 그때 도와주러 오지 않았다면 어떤 일이 일어났을지 생각하기 두렵네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reverent
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineHellosPostQuest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01235E"
msgid "Blessed are those who care for the things that live and grow."
msgstr "살아 숨 쉬고 자라는 것들을 돌보는 자들에게 축복이 있기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player stopped talking mid-conversation and went quiet.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01235D"
msgid "Lost within your thoughts? It happens to me as well."
msgstr "생각에 잠기신 겁니까? 저도 가끔 그럽니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player stopped talking mid-conversation and went quiet.
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01235C"
msgid "If you need time to think, please take it."
msgstr "생각할 시간이 필요하시면, 그렇게 하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player stopped talking mid-conversation and went quiet. Throw in an awkward chuckle between the sentences. / Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01235B"
msgid "Bored with our conversation already? That's just a little joke."
msgstr "벌써 대화가 지루합니까? 그냥 농담 좀 해봤습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: he player stopped speaking mid-conversation, and has gone quiet. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "01235A"
msgid "Is something the matter?"
msgstr "무슨 일 있어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: he player stopped speaking mid-conversation, and has gone quiet. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012359"
msgid "You seem to have something on your mind."
msgstr "뭔가 마음에 걸리시는 게 있는 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried, the player has suddenly gone quiet. / Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_SherineWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "012358"
msgid "Have I said something wrong?"
msgstr "제가 말 실수라도 했나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society.  / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Luther_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012357"
msgid "You shouldn't be here."
msgstr "여기 있으면 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised, perplexed, concerned. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation
#. TOPIC: 010EDEFA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueHamadiStation_AzadBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012356"
msgid "What? How can this be?"
msgstr "뭐? 이게 어떻게 된 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Startled, surprised to see an outsider. / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos_FarudHajtal
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012355"
msgid "By the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여!"

