msgid "A hostage situation is hardly the place to make a good first impression."
msgstr "인질극 상황엔 서로 좋은 인상을 심기에 부족하니 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
