#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012341"
msgid "You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit."
msgstr "일리가 있는 것 같네. 위험한 순간이 닥치면 그 사람의 투지가 어느 정도인지 알 수 있을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD84
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012340"
msgid "Hopefully I showed I had plenty."
msgstr "내가 충분히 보여 줬으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Here's to second chances. Nice to meet you, Sahima.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Here's to second chances. Nice to meet you, Sahima.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD81
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233F"
msgid "And it's nice to meet you too! Now we can talk about the important stuff, like your favorite food! Mine is ice cream."
msgstr "그리고 나도 만나서 반가워! 이제 중요한 것에 관해 얘기할 수 있겠다! 제일 좋아하는 음식이라든지. 난 아이스크림이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima:  &&& Sahima: Perhaps the Great Serpent has blessed us with a second meeting, to make up for the first one.|A hostage situation is hardly the place to make a good first impression.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And it's nice to meet you too! Now we can talk about the important stuff, like your favorite food! Mine is ice cream.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD82
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233E"
msgid "Here's to second chances. Nice to meet you, Sahima."
msgstr "여기서 재회하네. 만나서 반가워. 사히마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima:  &&& Sahima: Perhaps the Great Serpent has blessed us with a second meeting, to make up for the first one.|A hostage situation is hardly the place to make a good first impression.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You forgot me already? It's me, Sahima! The scientist from House Ka'dic?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD7E
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233D"
msgid "Wait, who are you again?"
msgstr "잠깐, 네가 누구라고 했었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima:  &&& Sahima: Perhaps the Great Serpent has blessed us with a second meeting, to make up for the first one.|A hostage situation is hardly the place to make a good first impression.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You have! But not in any familial way. It was mostly business, from what I gather.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD80
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233C"
msgid "Well, it's too late for even a second impression. I've already met your family."
msgstr "음, 재회한 느낌을 따지기엔 너무 늦었군. 이미 네 가족도 다 만났거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, who are you again?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait, who are you again?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD7D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233B"
msgid "You forgot me already? It's me, Sahima! The scientist from House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "벌써 날 잊었어? 나야, 사히마! 카딕 가문의 과학자, 기억해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, who are you again?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD7D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01233A"
msgid "Granted we did meet under very chaotic circumstances."
msgstr "물론 우리가 아주 위급한 상황에 만났긴 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, it's too late for even a second impression. I've already met your family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, it's too late for even a second impression. I've already met your family.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010EAD7F
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012339"
msgid "You have! But not in any familial way. It was mostly business, from what I gather."
msgstr "그랬지! 하지만 가족적 방식으로는 아니잖아. 내가 본 것에 따르면 대부분 사업적으로 만난 것 같던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B3D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012338"
msgid "I'm stuck here in the house, while you are traveling the stars, discovering new orbits, and building a bridge for the Promised."
msgstr "난 이 집에 갇혀 있는 동안, 너는 별 사이를 여행하고 새 궤도를 찾고 약속받은 자들을 위한 새 다리를 놓는구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): While none since Jinan Va'ruun have stood before the Great Serpent, we can all feel His presence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010E96EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage690_RitualScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012337"
msgid "Let us begin the final ritual."
msgstr "이제 마지막 의식을 시작하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me anything more about this dam?
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: As I said, the records that are left, referring to that construction... I have overseen my share of projects. I know what materials are necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012336"
msgid "I am afraid the details have been scrubbed from the records at the time of construction. That, in itself, should be enough to pique anyone's interest."
msgstr "안타깝지만 그 시절 건축물들에 대한 세부 기록은 지워졌다네. 지워졌다는 사실 자체만으로도 누가 관심 갖기에는 충분하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I am afraid the details have been scrubbed from the records at the time of construction. That, in itself, should be enough to pique anyone's interest.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: And I know when the deliveries far exceed the needs of what should be a simple industrial project.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012335"
msgid "As I said, the records that are left, referring to that construction... I have overseen my share of projects. I know what materials are necessary."
msgstr ""
"내가 말했듯이, 그 건물에 대해서 남은 기록은... 내가 프로젝트 내용을 공유하면서 슬쩍 본 것 뿐이라네. 어떤 자재가 필요했는지 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: House Ma'leen was once a valued contributor to House Va'ruun. Those contributions are no less valid due to their current actions.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Maleen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012334"
msgid "Though I am sure some would disagree."
msgstr "물론 동의하지 않는 이들도 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: As I said, the records that are left, referring to that construction... I have overseen my share of projects. I know what materials are necessary.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012333"
msgid "And I know when the deliveries far exceed the needs of what should be a simple industrial project."
msgstr "그리고 단순한 산업 프로젝트라고 하기에는 너무 많은 자재가 배송되었다는 것도 알 수 있겠더구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Hasmak
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: House Ma'leen was once a valued contributor to House Va'ruun. Those contributions are no less valid due to their current actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Maleen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012332"
msgid "Ma'leen Dam? As in, the Zealots currently trying to overthrow House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "마린 댐이라고요? 지금 바룬 가문을 뒤엎으려고 하는 그 광신도 가문 이름 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use. &&& Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Consider it forgotten.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012331"
msgid "Never mind. Forget it."
msgstr "됐어요. 잊어버려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ma'leen Dam? As in, the Zealots currently trying to overthrow House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Though I am sure some would disagree.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Maleen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012330"
msgid "House Ma'leen was once a valued contributor to House Va'ruun. Those contributions are no less valid due to their current actions."
msgstr "마린 가문도 한때는 바룬 가문의 귀중한 공헌자였다네. 지금 하는 행동 때문에 그 공헌의 의미도 퇴색되었지만 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Never mind. Forget it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Never mind. Forget it.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01232F"
msgid "Consider it forgotten."
msgstr "잊어버린 셈 치죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I really need that card, and I'd like to think we can talk this out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I am not sure I see the point.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01232E"
msgid "All right, fine. Take it. Just... If there is a reward or something for it, share it with me?"
msgstr "그래요, 알았어요. 가져가요. 다만... 혹시 보상이나 뭐라도 나오면, 나한테도 알려줄래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I really need that card, and I'd like to think we can talk this out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I am not sure I see the point.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010E8A5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
