msgctxt "0122D2"
msgid "Hello...? This is ridiculous."
msgstr "저기...? 이게 뭔 짓거리야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is idle and not responding. / Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
