#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HV_Mirek_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0122D1"
msgid "Ugh... Some people..."
msgstr "으... 뭐하는 놈이야..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is idle and not responding. / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HV_Mirek_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0122D0"
msgid "Can we get on with it?"
msgstr "얘기 계속 해도 될까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is idle and not responding. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HV_Gavin_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0122CF"
msgid "I often daydream a bit myself."
msgstr "저도 종종 공상을 하곤 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is idle and not responding. / Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HV_Gavin_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0122CE"
msgid "Are you thinking about your next meal as well?"
msgstr "다음 식사 때 뭐 먹을지 생각하는 중인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is idle and not responding. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HV_Gavin_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0122CD"
msgid "I'm not boring you, am I?"
msgstr "제가 지루하게 한 건 아니죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: It's not as glorious as some make it out to be, that's for sure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122B4"
msgid "What's it like working for the Ministry of Conjunction?"
msgstr "결합성에서 일하는 건 어떻지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's it like working for the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122B3"
msgid "It's not as glorious as some make it out to be, that's for sure."
msgstr "사람들 생각처럼 영광스러운 일이 아니라는 건 확실하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122B2"
msgid "I may be a prodigy when it comes to what I do, but that doesn't mean I don't find myself in situations where I fear for my life."
msgstr "내 일 처리 실력이 천재적이기는 하지만, 그게 내 목숨 걱정을 할 필요가 없다는 뜻은 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_MinistryScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122B1"
msgid "But stress aside, I'd much rather be an agent than an Envoy behind a desk."
msgstr "그래도 난 책상 뒤에 앉아나 있는 사절보다는 현장 요원 일이 훨씬 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I wish it were the case. This is an ongoing point of contention with my sister, and it never changes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122B0"
msgid "Isn't there another way you can prevent Razma from working with the Zealots?"
msgstr "라즈마가 광신도와 협력하는 걸 막을 다른 방법은 없을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Isn't there another way you can prevent Razma from working with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122AF"
msgid "I wish it were the case. This is an ongoing point of contention with my sister, and it never changes."
msgstr "있었으면 좋았겠죠. 우리 형님과 계속 다투는 부분이 바로 그거고, 바뀔 일은 없을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122AE"
msgid "Razma and I come to agreement, something happens that makes her reconsider, and we're right back where we started."
msgstr "라즈마 형님과 합의를 보면, 형님이 다시 생각해보게 하는 일이 터지고, 바로 다시 원점으로 돌아가죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122AD"
msgid "This is why extreme measures are necessary. Only something truly horrible will force her eyes to remain open."
msgstr "그래서 극단적인 조치가 필요한 겁니다. 정말 끔찍한 일이 터져야만 형님의 눈을 뜨여 있게 할 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't go through with it. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I misjudged your compassion for the people of the Settled Systems. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0122A7"
msgid "Your actions today were very telling, Harbinger."
msgstr "오늘 아주 엄청난 활약을 보여 줬군요. 선구자."

