msgstr "오늘 아주 엄청난 활약을 보여 줬군요. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player didn't do what she wanted. She's making it clear the player chose Razma's side without stating the obvious because Razma is right there. / Stern / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01229D"
msgid "But we need not speak further of this. What's done is done, and you have Razma's gratitude, if not mine."
msgstr "아무튼 그 얘기는 더 할 필요 없어요. 다 끝난 일이고, 내가 아니더라도 라즈마 형님께서 감사해 할 테니까요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Your actions today will result in an alignment that House Ka'dic hasn't seen for quite some time. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012297"
msgid "I hope what I've done makes a difference."
msgstr "내가 한 일이 변화를 불러온다면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The oversimplified answer is yes. The two may be synonymous, but House politics will always take precedent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_HousevsFamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012296"
msgid "Is the House Ka'dic name more important than its members?"
msgstr "카딕 가문의 사람들보다 가문의 이름이 더 중요한가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is the House Ka'dic name more important than its members?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_HousevsFamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012295"
msgid "The oversimplified answer is yes. The two may be synonymous, but House politics will always take precedent."
msgstr "아주 단순하게 말하자면 그렇죠. 그 둘이 아주 비슷한 뜻일 수는 있지만, 가문의 정치가 항상 우선이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Djimal_TL_HousevsFamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012294"
msgid "House Ka'dic is a symbol, a noble House, and its members are held to a higher standard with greater responsibility."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 상징이고, 명문 가문이며, 가문 구성원들은 더 높은 기준에 맞게 더 큰 책임을 지고 있답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hope what I've done makes a difference.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012293"
msgid "Your actions today will result in an alignment that House Ka'dic hasn't seen for quite some time."
msgstr "오늘 당신이 보여준 행동은 카딕 가문이 오랫동안 보지 못했던 단결을 불러올 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012292"
msgid "And to the benefit of Settled Systems, the Zealots will need to find a new supplier."
msgstr "그리고 광신도가 개척 성계에서 이득을 보려면 물주를 새로 찾아야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012291"
msgid "They'll be hard pressed to find anyone willing to associate with them in your world, and so their power will diminish until they're nothing more than a nuisance."
msgstr ""
"광신도가 그쪽 세계에서 자기들과 어울려 줄 협력자를 찾기는 어려울 테니까, 놈들의 힘도 기껏해야 귀찮은 수준이 될 때 까지 줄어들 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: This virus I've been working on will overload every major system within Epsilon. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_DeviceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012290"
msgid "Can I get more details on this remote device and virus?"
msgstr "그 원격 장치랑 바이러스를 더 자세히 말해줄 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I get more details on this remote device and virus?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_DeviceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228F"
msgid "This virus I've been working on will overload every major system within Epsilon."
msgstr "제가 만든 바이러스는 엡실론에 있는 주요 시스템을 전부 과부하 시킬 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_DeviceScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228E"
msgid "Not only that, but any ships that they worked on here within the past few days will get hit as well. As long as they're within range."
msgstr "그 뿐만 아니라 지난 며칠 동안 여기서 정비했던 우주선도 똑같은 피해를 입게 되죠. 범위 안에만 있으면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: They're dangerous. I've only caught glimpses of them and hacked into a few messages regarding them, so I don't know much myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228D"
msgid "What can you tell me about these Zealots you mentioned?"
msgstr "아까 말했던 광신도에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: A different kind of Zealot? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228C"
msgid "I encountered a different kind of Zealot at Shadow Station Epsilon."
msgstr "비밀 기지 엡실론에서 다른 종류의 광신도를 마주쳤어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about these Zealots you mentioned?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228B"
msgid "They're dangerous. I've only caught glimpses of them and hacked into a few messages regarding them, so I don't know much myself."
msgstr "위험한 놈들이에요. 제 눈으로는 슬쩍 엿보기만 했고 관련된 메시지 몇 개 해킹한 게 다라서, 저도 자세히는 잘 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01228A"
msgid "They've been altered somehow. Cybernetics? Mental and physical conditioning? I couldn't say without examining one for myself."
msgstr "뭔진 몰라도 변질된 놈들이죠. 인공두뇌학? 아님 정신이랑 신체를 훈련시킨 걸까요? 직접 살펴보지 않으면 알 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012289"
msgid "I'm not exaggerating when I say they'd be better off made dust."
msgstr "과장 안 보태고, 그냥 흙먼지로 만들어주는 게 더 나을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I encountered a different kind of Zealot at Shadow Station Epsilon. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They're enhanced somehow. Cybernetic, chemical, or both.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_RedeemedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012288"
msgid "A different kind of Zealot?"
msgstr "다른 종류의 광신도라고?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: As far as I'm concerned, the High Council does know because I'm on it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HighCouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012287"
msgid "What if the High Council found out about the Zealots?"
msgstr "대의회가 광신도 일을 알게 되면 어떻게 할 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if the High Council found out about the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HighCouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012286"
msgid "As far as I'm concerned, the High Council does know because I'm on it."
msgstr "나는 대의회도 알고 있다고 봐요. 나도 대의회 소속이잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HighCouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012285"
msgid "Should any topics arise regarding the Zealots, I can guide our decisions appropriately."
msgstr "광신도와 관련된 주제가 생기면 내가 적당히 결정을 유도할 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HighCouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012284"
msgid "If the others found out, it would be a very tiresome and lengthy conversation, although lecture is probably the better word."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 알게 된다면, 아마 아주 지루하고 장황한 대화를 나눠야겠죠. 강의라는 말이 더 어울리겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HighCouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012283"
msgid "But I hope you're wise enough to keep our House matters private."
msgstr "당신이 우리 가문 문제를 비밀로 해 줄 정도로 현명하길 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: They think I'm the key to opening the gateway to the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_WorkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012282"
msgid "What were the Zealots forcing you to do here?"
msgstr "광신도가 여기서 뭘 시키고 있는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What were the Zealots forcing you to do here?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_WorkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012281"
msgid "They think I'm the key to opening the gateway to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "광신도는 제가 위대한 뱀께 닿을 문을 열 열쇠라고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_WorkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012280"
msgid "For them, it's both a race against House Va'ruun and also proof that they were right, that Jandar was Jinan's rightful heir."
msgstr "그놈들한테는 그게 바룬 가문과의 경쟁인 동시에, 잔다르가 지난 님의 정당한 계승자라는 주장을 증명할 수단이기도 하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_WorkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227F"
msgid "Luckily, none of them are scientifically minded enough to know I spent all my time delving into their systems and developing a virus."
msgstr "다행히도, 제가 지금껏 계속 자기네 시스템을 파헤치면서 바이러스를 만들고 있다는 걸 알 정도로 과학을 잘 아는 놈은 없더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I may have the Ka'dic name, but I've never felt like a true part of the family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_FamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227E"
msgid "Why do you think Razma doesn't really care about you?"
msgstr "왜 라즈마가 널 신경 쓰지 않는다고 생각하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you think Razma doesn't really care about you?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_FamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227D"
msgid "I may have the Ka'dic name, but I've never felt like a true part of the family."
msgstr "제 성이 카딕이기는 하지만, 진짜로 가족이라는 느낌을 받아본 적은 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_FamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227C"
msgid "House Ka'dic prefers agents and Envoys for the Ministry of Conjunction. Scientists take a back seat."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 결합성에서 일하는 요원과 대표를 더 좋아하거든요. 과학자는 뒷전이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Sahima_TL_FamilyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227B"
msgid "Without all this drama, I'd be willing to be she couldn't even remember my name."
msgstr "그 사고 때문에 이 난리가 일어나지 않았다면, 그분은 분명 제 이름도 기억 못 하셨을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Mihael will return to Shadow Station Epsilon and wallow in his anger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01227A"
msgid "What will happen between you and the Zealots now?"
msgstr "이제 장로님과 광신도의 관계는 어떻게 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will happen between you and the Zealots now? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012279"
msgid "Mihael will return to Shadow Station Epsilon and wallow in his anger."
msgstr "미해일은 화가 머리끝까지 난 채로 비밀 기지 엡실론에 돌아가겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012278"
msgid "It won't take long before he gets over it, and it's business as usual."
msgstr "그래도 조금 있으면 머리를 식히고 평소처럼 움직일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012277"
msgid "This is a road we've been down before."
msgstr "우리가 전에 걷던 길로 돌아오는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will happen between you and the Zealots now? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012276"
msgid "It won't take long before the Zealots hear of this."
msgstr "광신도들도 얼마 못 가 이 소식을 들을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012275"
msgid "They'll posture and protest, but when I need them, they'll come around."
msgstr "호들갑 떨면서 항의하겠지만, 내가 써먹을 때가 되면 다시 모여들겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012274"
msgid "The Zealots don't exactly have a reliable supply chain unless you count preying on others."
msgstr "광신도는 다른 사람을 노리지 않고서는 제대로 된 물주를 구할 수가 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What will happen between you and the Zealots now? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012273"
msgid "Now, I return to the Ministry and announce how we're cutting all ties."
msgstr "이제 결합성으로 돌아가서 모든 관계를 끊겠다고 선언해야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012272"
msgid "We'll have increased monitoring in place since this will surely create a level of aggression that we'll want to be prepared for."
msgstr "놈들의 공격성이 높아질 게 뻔하니까, 모니터링을 강화해서 확실하게 대비해야 할 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012271"
msgid "But our business with the Zealots is done."
msgstr "아무튼 광신도와 엮이는 건 이제 끝이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Your actions today were very telling, Harbinger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Djimal_TL_HostagesAliveScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012270"
msgid "I couldn't go through with it."
msgstr "그런 짓은 도저히 못 하겠더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226F"
msgid "Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "사히마는 카딕 가문에 별로 소속감을 느끼지 못하던데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Not harsh. Razma does care about all House members, even though she doesn't show it.  / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226E"
msgid "If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter."
msgstr "내가 보기에는 중요하지 않은 일에 파고들려 하는 분석적인 성격 때문인 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226D"
msgid "I care about all members of House Ka'dic, regardless of how they came to join us. Blood, marriage, adoption. We are all family."
msgstr ""
"나는 카딕 가문 사람들을 모두 신경 쓰고 있어. 어떻게 합류했는지는 상관 없어. 혈연이든, 결혼이든, 입양이든, 우린 모두 가족이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can understand where you're coming from. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226C"
msgid "I value our great scientific minds, but my focus lies in the Ministry of Conjunction, and I think that's what she's come to dwell on."
msgstr "우리 훌륭한 과학자도 소중하긴 하지만, 나는 결합성 일에 집중해야 해. 바로 그 부분을 사히마가 자꾸만 곱씹게 되는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic? &&& Razma: If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter. |I care about all members of House Ka'dic, regardless of how they came to join us. Blood, marriage, adoption. We are all family.|I value our great scientific minds, but my focus lies in the Ministry of Conjunction, and I think that's what she's come to dwell on.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's nothing I could say that hasn't already been said. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226B"
msgid "Isn't there something you can say to her to make her feel better?"
msgstr "사히마 기분이 나아질 만한 말을 해주실 수는 없을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't there something you can say to her to make her feel better? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Isn't there something you can say to her to make her feel better? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01226A"
msgid "There's nothing I could say that hasn't already been said."
msgstr "해줄 수 있을 만한 말은 진작에 다 해 줬지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Isn't there something you can say to her to make her feel better? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I can understand where you're coming from. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012269"
msgid "The human mind can develop the strongest beliefs over the smallest observations."
msgstr "인간의 정신은 가장 사소한 일을 가장 강한 신념으로 발달시킬 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic? &&& Razma: If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter. |I care about all members of House Ka'dic, regardless of how they came to join us. Blood, marriage, adoption. We are all family.|I value our great scientific minds, but my focus lies in the Ministry of Conjunction, and I think that's what she's come to dwell on.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Unfortunately, no. The Ministry of Conjunction falls under my authority and demands my full attention. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012268"
msgid "Can't you split your focus more evenly?"
msgstr "집중력을 조금 나눌 수는 없나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can't you split your focus more evenly? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can't you split your focus more evenly? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I can understand where you're coming from. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012267"
msgid "Unfortunately, no. The Ministry of Conjunction falls under my authority and demands my full attention."
msgstr "안타깝지만 안 돼. 결합성은 전적으로 내 책임이고, 온 신경을 집중해야 하는 일이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic? &&& Razma: If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter. |I care about all members of House Ka'dic, regardless of how they came to join us. Blood, marriage, adoption. We are all family.|I value our great scientific minds, but my focus lies in the Ministry of Conjunction, and I think that's what she's come to dwell on.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. In an ideal world, we'd all split time equally between what we care about. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E84AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012266"
msgid "I can understand where you're coming from."
msgstr "무슨 뜻인지 이해가 가는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why doesn't Sahima feel like she belongs to House Ka'dic? &&& Razma: If you ask me, it's her analytic mind that can't stop dwelling on things that don't matter. |I care about all members of House Ka'dic, regardless of how they came to join us. Blood, marriage, adoption. We are all family.|I value our great scientific minds, but my focus lies in the Ministry of Conjunction, and I think that's what she's come to dwell on.
