msgid "To be fair, I won't deny that yes, I would like to see House Ka'dic become the new Va'ruun. But show me an Elder who thinks differently."
msgstr ""
"솔직히 말해서, 카딕 가문이 새로운 바룬이 되는 걸 보고 싶다는 건 부정하지 않겠어. 하지만 다른 생각을 하는 장로가 있으면 한번 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would you employ such a hostile group? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would you employ such a hostile group? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012244"
msgid "Hostile or not, they're an effective means to an end and often the perfect cover as well."
msgstr "적대적이든 아니든, 놈들은 효과적인 수단인 동시에 종종 완벽한 위장이 되어주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would you employ such a hostile group? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012243"
msgid "We are limited here by our secrecy, but the Zealots are not."
msgstr "우리는 사회에서 제약을 받지만, 광신도는 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would you employ such a hostile group? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Is your real motive keeping the Zealots on your side for power?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012242"
msgid "For the most part, they're not only our last resort, they're our only resort."
msgstr "대부분의 경우에는, 놈들이 최후의 수단이 아니라 유일한 수단이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can you live knowing you're supplying terrorists?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How can you live knowing you're supplying terrorists?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3D9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012241"
msgid "Because I see it as a semblance of control."
msgstr "난 그게 일종의 통제라고 보거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can you live knowing you're supplying terrorists?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3D9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012240"
msgid "Due to our work at the Ministry of Conjunction we know what they have and what they intend to do with it."
msgstr "결합성에서 진행하는 작업 덕분에 우린 놈들이 뭘 가지고 있고, 그걸로 뭘 할 생각인지 파악하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Searching for the right word and lands on "relationship" / Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can you live knowing you're supplying terrorists?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3D9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01223F"
msgid "This odd... relationship keeps our people safe and gives the Zealots a level of dependency on us. Something we use to our advantage."
msgstr ""
"이 이상한... 관계가 우리 신민들을 안전하게 지켜주고, 광신도들이 우리에게 깊이 의존하게 만들지. 우리가 이점으로 활용할 수 있는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We're done here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're done here.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
