#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD7
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E73AA
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01218C"
msgid "There's been rumors of stolen shipments. Hopefully these get to Dazra safely."
msgstr "도난당한 선적물에 대한 소문이 돌고 있어. 이게 다즈라에 무사히 도착하길 바라야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD7
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E73AA
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01218B"
msgid "I heard the supply thief in Dazra was captured. Good to know these shipments will get routed properly."
msgstr "다즈라의 물자 절도범이 잡혔다는 소식을 들었어. 이 선적물이 제대로 전달될 거라니 다행이군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_KT_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E73A7
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E73AC
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012189"
