#. TOPIC: 010E73A7
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E73AC
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012188"
msgid "There's been rumors of stolen shipments being routed to Zealots. You're not a Zealot, are you?"
msgstr "도난당한 선적물이 광신도들에게 빼돌려지고 있다는 소문이 있어. 너 광신도는 아니지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_KT_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E73A7
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E73AC
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "012187"
msgid "Heard the thief routing supplies to Zealots was caught. Glad these shipments will make it to the right people."
msgstr "광신도들에게 물자를 빼돌리던 절도범이 잡혔다는 소식을 들었어. 이제 제대로 된 사람들에게 선적물이 전달되겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 010E7954
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun_MinerLeader01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012185"
msgid "Thank you. You may have saved our hides."
msgstr "감사합니다. 덕분에 목숨을 건졌을지도 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_Leader: We were attacked by animals. We held them off but...|I don't think we can handle another attack.
