msgid "We were attacked by animals. We held them off but..."
msgstr "동물들에게 공격당했어요. 막아내긴 했지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: NPC_Leader
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 010E7956
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun_MinerLeader01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012182"
msgid "I don't think we can handle another attack."
msgstr "더는 공격을 버틸 수 없을 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just passing through.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just passing through.
#. ALIAS: NPC_Leader
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun
#. TOPIC: 010E7952
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_OE_BonecrestOverrun_MinerLeader01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012181"
msgid "Then you should get out of here while you can."
msgstr "그렇다면 더 공격당하기 전에 여기서 빠져나가야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: NPC_Leader: We were attacked by animals. We held them off but...|I don't think we can handle another attack.
