msgstr "도와주셔서 감사합니다. 여기 노고에 대한 작은 보답입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was told you know where the Zealots have taken Sahima. &&& Mirek: I'm sorry, did you say Zealots? Why would I know anything about such extremists?  &&& Mirek: Absolutely ridiculous.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Heh, so much for confidentiality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3EB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012143"
msgid "Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are."
msgstr "라즈마가 보내서 온 거야. 네가 광신도들 위치를 안다고 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was told you know where the Zealots have taken Sahima. &&& Mirek: I'm sorry, did you say Zealots? Why would I know anything about such extremists?  &&& Mirek: Absolutely ridiculous.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, you could've led with that. 
