#. TOPIC: 010E3EB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012142"
msgid "It's not ridiculous. Razma told me you know."
msgstr "웃기는 소리 아니야. 네가 알고 있다고 라즈마한테 들었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I guess this means the High Council is still asking Auntie Razma where Sahima is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3EB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012141"
msgid "Heh, so much for confidentiality."
msgstr "흠. 그럼 모르는 척 할 필요 없겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really should rethink your position on the hostages. &&& ...  &&& Mirek: All right. I'll let you in on their location, but remember. You're the only one that knows.|If word spreads, I'll know exactly who's to blame. &&& Mirek: Now leave me alone before I call security and have you escorted out. Or worse. &&& Mirek: The location you're looking for is Shadow Station Epsilon.|It's an old Va'ruun base that they've taken over for themselves. |Razma will know it. Let her tell you the details, seeing as how I'm about to be reassigned.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You do that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3EA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012140"
msgid "I'll follow up with Razma."
msgstr "그럼 나머지는 라즈마와 상의하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rude and dismissive. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll follow up with Razma.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll follow up with Razma.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Sarcastic
