#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120C5"
msgid "But our people are in a state of mourning. I couldn't afford to risk lives when there may have been a peaceful way out."
msgstr "하지만 지금 우리 신민들은 슬픔에 빠져 있어. 평화롭게 해결할 방법이 있는데도 목숨을 걸 만한 여유가 없는 상황이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would you even consider negotiation with Zealots? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would you even consider negotiation with Zealots? 
