msgstr "광신도가 정말로 원하는 게 뭘까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think the Zealots really want?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think the Zealots really want?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
