msgstr "회의 석상에 앉을 자리와, 잔다르의 정당성 인정. 그리고 마린 가문의 복권까지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think the Zealots really want?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120C1"
msgid "Any number of unreasonable demands that my House would be incapable of fulfilling on our own."
msgstr "우리 가문 혼자서는 도저히 감당 못 할 말도 안 되는 요구가 얼마든지 튀어나올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think the Zealots really want?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would you even consider negotiation with Zealots? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120C0"
