msgstr "왜 번거롭게 미어렉을 광신도와 협력시키는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you bothering with having Mirek work with the Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you bothering with having Mirek work with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
