#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would you even consider negotiation with Zealots? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120BD"
