msgid "Well, it's also an... honor, to meet one as interesting as yourself."
msgstr "뭐, 나 또한... 영광이야. 그대처럼 흥미로운 사람을 만나서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: To reiterate... &&& Razma: Don't worry. Djimal's already told me all about you.|I'm Razma. Elder of House Ka'dic and head of the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right. It's not wise to waste time on pleasantries, especially now.
