#. TOPIC: 010E3E8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B8"
msgid "Let's get down to business."
msgstr "본론으로 들어가죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's get down to business.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get down to business.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B7"
msgid "You're right. It's not wise to waste time on pleasantries, especially now."
msgstr "그렇게 하지. 인사치레에 시간 쓰는 건 현명하지 못해. 지금은 특히 더 그렇고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's get down to business.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will.
