#. TOPIC: 010E3E8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B5"
msgid "What can you tell me about House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What can you tell me about House Ka'dic?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about House Ka'dic?
