#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B4"
msgid "House Ka'dic is one of the three noble Houses under House Va'ruun."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 바룬 가문 아래 있는 세 명문 가문 중 하나이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Searching for the right word when she says "passive" / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What can you tell me about House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B3"
msgid "We've a reputation on being the more moderate of the three. Not as fervent as House Veth'aal and not as... passive as House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "우리는 셋 중에서 가장 중도적이라고 알려져 있어. 베타알 가문처럼 열성적이지도 않고, 둘케프 가문처럼... 소극적이지도 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What can you tell me about House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: It's an honor to meet the Elder of a noble House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B2"
msgid "We're also largely associated with the Ministry of Conjunction since I lead the department."
msgstr "그리고 결합성과 밀접하게 연관되어 있기도 해. 내가 부서를 책임지고 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: To reiterate... &&& Razma: Don't worry. Djimal's already told me all about you.|I'm Razma. Elder of House Ka'dic and head of the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
