#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B1"
msgid "What is the Ministry of Conjunction?"
msgstr "결합성이라는 건 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120B0"
msgid "The Ministry of Conjunction is one of the three government branches of our society."
msgstr "결합성은 우리 사회를 운영하는 세 정부 부서 중 하나야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120AF"
msgid "We deal in information to ensure the High Council can make educated decisions."
msgstr "대의회가 현명한 결정을 내릴 수 있도록 정보를 취급하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: It's an honor to meet the Elder of a noble House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120AE"
msgid "Most of our work is highly classified. Even the High Council itself may not be aware of all that we're involved in."
msgstr "우리 업무는 대부분 극비 사항이야. 대의회라고 할지라도 우리가 관련된 일을 전부 알지는 못할 수도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Zealots don't deserve anything. &&& Razma: Agreed. Which is why I'm hoping you can help. &&& Razma: I need you to find the hostages. Bring them home so the Zealots have nothing to leverage and Sahima can work with the High Council. &&& Razma: Normally, I'd have agents doing everything possible to find them.|But we too suffered losses. We need to be here. Present. I couldn't risk more lives.|It's the only reason I even agreed to these negotiations... But now that you're here, I can finally take action.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120AD"
msgid "The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 절 이끄십니다. 이건 우연이 아니에요. 바로 운명이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.
