#. TOPIC: 010E3E87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120AC"
msgid "Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question."
msgstr "맞아, 이게 단순한 우연은 아닌 것 같지? 하지만 아직 답을 찾지 못한 문제가 하나 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just tell me where the hostages are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just tell me where the hostages are.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.
