#. TOPIC: 010E3E85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0120AB"
msgid "And that's where the issue lies."
