#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208F"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun had twin sons. Jarek and Jandar."
msgstr "지난 바룬 님께는 쌍둥이 아들이 있었어. 자렉 님과 잔다르였지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who is Jandar? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The Zealots don't deserve anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208E"
msgid "Jandar fully supported the Serpent's Crusade, and to many in House Ma'leen, was the best suited to take over for his father."
msgstr "잔다르는 뱀의 성전을 전적으로 지지했고, 많은 마린 가문 구성원들에게는 그 아버지의 자리를 이어받을 적임자로 여겨졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything else you can tell me about Shadow Station Epsilon? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything else you can tell me about Shadow Station Epsilon? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208D"
msgid "Epsilon was once a research station with a focus on grav drive manipulation."
msgstr "엡실론은 한때 중력 구동기 조작에 중점을 둔 연구 기지였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything else you can tell me about Shadow Station Epsilon? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll head there right away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208C"
msgid "The Zealots have since vastly expanded upon it, but it makes sense if they intend to use Sahima to their advantage."
msgstr "광신도들이 기지를 엄청나게 확장해 왔는데, 사히마를 유용하게 써먹을 계획이었다면 그럴 만도 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality. &&& Razma: As much as I'd welcome the expertise, the Zealots would never allow an outsider to participate. |But the negotiations aren't where I need assistance. &&& Razma: The Zealots have yet to name specifics. At best, they'll demand an inordinate amount of credits or firearms.|Worst case, a seat at the High Council or even the reinstatement of their House. House Ma'leen.|They know we can't risk Sahima for Dazra's sake, so they won't hold back when it comes to demands.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My thoughts exactly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208B"
msgid "If I can get to the hostages first, the Zealots will have no leverage."
msgstr "인질을 먼저 구해낸다면, 광신도들은 협상을 요구할 수단을 잃게 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I can get to the hostages first, the Zealots will have no leverage.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If I can get to the hostages first, the Zealots will have no leverage.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Normally, I'd have agents doing everything possible to find them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01208A"
msgid "My thoughts exactly."
msgstr "내 생각이 딱 그거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: I need you to find the hostages. Bring them home so the Zealots have nothing to leverage and Sahima can work with the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012089"
msgid "Normally, I'd have agents doing everything possible to find them."
msgstr "평소였다면 우리 요원들이 모든 수단을 동원해서 인질을 찾았겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012088"
msgid "But we too suffered losses. We need to be here. Present. I couldn't risk more lives."
msgstr "하지만 이미 많은 인명 피해를 입었어. 우리는 여기에 있어야 해. 현재 말이야. 더 많은 목숨을 걸 순 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012087"
msgid "It's the only reason I even agreed to these negotiations... But now that you're here, I can finally take action."
msgstr "내가 협상에 동의한 이유도 그것 뿐이었고... 하지만 이제 그대가 왔으니, 드디어 행동을 취할 수 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What happened to Dazra was a cataclysmic event. The city may seem in order now, but those first few days...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012086"
msgid "How were the Zealots able to kidnap your people in the first place?"
msgstr "대체 어떻게 광신도들이 가문 사람들을 납치할 수 있었던 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How were the Zealots able to kidnap your people in the first place?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How were the Zealots able to kidnap your people in the first place?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012085"
msgid "What happened to Dazra was a cataclysmic event. The city may seem in order now, but those first few days..."
msgstr "다즈라에 일어났던 일은 대재난이었어. 지금이야 도시가 정돈돼 보이지만, 처음 며칠 동안은..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How were the Zealots able to kidnap your people in the first place?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012084"
msgid "It was chaos. And the Zealots took advantage."
msgstr "아수라장이었지. 광신도들이 그걸 이용한 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012083"
msgid "Let's hear about these complications then."
msgstr "그럼 그 복잡한 문제를 한번 들어보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& ...  &&& Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations. &&& Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you. &&& Razma: The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations. |Meet us there when Sahima and the others are safe.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see you have a grasp on how these types of negotiations work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012082"
msgid "A neutral location outside of Dazra. I'll be there."
msgstr "다즈라 바깥에 있는 중립 구역이군요. 거기로 가죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Good. Serpent willing, your timing will line up.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012081"
msgid "I'll stall the Zealots as long as I can which shouldn't be an issue."
msgstr "내가 광신도를 최대한 오래 붙잡고 있을 테니 문제는 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012080"
msgid "That being said, I'd still appreciate it if you could act quickly."
msgstr "그렇긴 해도, 최대한 빠르게 움직여준다면 고맙겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207F"
msgid "Now, Djimal wants an update before you leave. Just don't let her distract you for too long."
msgstr "그리고, 떠나기 전에 지말이 알려줄 내용이 있다더군. 너무 오래 붙잡혀있진 말도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207E"
msgid "The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations."
msgstr "현재 계획은 그놈들을 지열 발전소 중 한 곳에 붙들어 놓는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207D"
msgid "Meet us there when Sahima and the others are safe."
msgstr "사히마와 나머지가 안전해지면 거기로 찾아오도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& ...  &&& Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations. &&& Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you. &&& Razma: The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations. |Meet us there when Sahima and the others are safe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. Serpent willing, your timing will line up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207C"
msgid "I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe."
msgstr "모두가 안전해지면 발전소에서 뵙도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A neutral location outside of Dazra. I'll be there.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A neutral location outside of Dazra. I'll be there.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll stall the Zealots as long as I can which shouldn't be an issue.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207B"
msgid "I see you have a grasp on how these types of negotiations work."
msgstr "이런 종류의 협상이 어떻게 진행되는지 아주 잘 알고 있군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll stall the Zealots as long as I can which shouldn't be an issue.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01207A"
msgid "Good. Serpent willing, your timing will line up."
msgstr "좋아. 위대한 뱀께서 살펴주신다면 타이밍이 맞겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& ...  &&& Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations. &&& Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you. &&& Razma: The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations. |Meet us there when Sahima and the others are safe.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's a fairly neutral location, and just the right distance from Dazra so both parties will feel safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012079"
msgid "Why this particular power station?"
msgstr "왜 그 발전소를 특정해서 고르신 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& ...  &&& Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations. &&& Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you. &&& Razma: The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations. |Meet us there when Sahima and the others are safe.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If memory serves, it's southeast of Shadow Station Epsilon. It shouldn't be too hard to find.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012078"
msgid "Where is this power station?"
msgstr "그 발전소는 어디에 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where is this power station? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where is this power station? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012077"
msgid "If memory serves, it's southeast of Shadow Station Epsilon. It shouldn't be too hard to find."
msgstr "내 기억이 맞다면 비밀 기지 엡실론에서 남동쪽에 있지. 찾기 그리 어렵진 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why this particular power station?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why this particular power station?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012076"
msgid "It's a fairly neutral location, and just the right distance from Dazra so both parties will feel safe."
msgstr "완전한 중립 지역이기도 하고, 다즈라에서도 적당히 떨어져 있으니 양쪽 다 안전하게 느낄 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why this particular power station?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll meet you at the power station when everyone is safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012075"
msgid "The geothermal stations are also autonomous in nature, so we don't have to worry about unwanted eyes and ears."
msgstr "게다가 지열 발전소는 완전 자동화 시설이라서, 이야기가 새어나갈 걱정을 할 필요도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But I'm going to find Sahima so Razma can take back control. &&& Djimal: And that's what I wish to speak to you about. &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic shouldn't be associating with Zealots at all, except on an extermination level.|But worse, we absolutely cannot be supplying them with ordnance of any kind.|We need to cut ties with the Zealots altogether. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not unless you want to be considered one yourself. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012074"
msgid "Supplying terrorists isn't a good look."
msgstr "테러리스트를 지원하는 건 좋아 보이지 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Supplying terrorists isn't a good look.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Supplying terrorists isn't a good look.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012073"
msgid "Not unless you want to be considered one yourself."
msgstr "본인이 테러리스트가 아니라면 당연한 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties. &&& companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps you don't understand. These noble Houses have existed for generations. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012072"
msgid "Are you insane?"
msgstr "정신 나갔어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties. &&& companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Those few lives will be nothing compared to the lives the Zealots will take if House Ka'dic continues to supply them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012071"
msgid "How is killing your own family any better than what Razma is doing?"
msgstr "어떻게 자기 가문 사람들을 죽이는 게 라즈마가 하는 일보다 더 낫다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent. &&& Djimal: An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless.  &&& Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.|They're a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade. Days we'd like to forget.|Has my dear sister given you any history on our House's relations with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see. I should've expected as much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012070"
msgid "Razma said the Ministry of Conjunction keeps tabs on the Zealots."
msgstr "라즈마는 결합성이 광신도를 계속 감시하고 있다고 하던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Razma said the Ministry of Conjunction keeps tabs on the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said the Ministry of Conjunction keeps tabs on the Zealots.
