#. TOPIC: 010E3E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01206E"
msgid "Those few lives will be nothing compared to the lives the Zealots will take if House Ka'dic continues to supply them."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 광신도에게 계속 물자를 대 준다면, 그 몇 안 되는 목숨은 놈들이 빼앗을 목숨과는 비교도 안 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is killing your own family any better than what Razma is doing?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01206D"
msgid "Sacrificing them would open my sister's eyes, quelling any sympathy and desire to work with the Zealots."
msgstr "그 목숨을 희생시키면 형님의 눈이 뜨일 거고, 광신도에 대한 공감이나 협력하려는 마음이 사라지겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is killing your own family any better than what Razma is doing?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01206C"
msgid "Once Razma no longer sees the Zealots as an ally, the rest will soon follow."
msgstr "라즈마가 광신도를 협력자로 보지 않게 된다면, 나머지는 금방 뒤따를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you insane? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you insane? 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01206B"
msgid "Perhaps you don't understand. These noble Houses have existed for generations."
msgstr "이해 못 할 수도 있겠군요. 명문 가문들은 몇 세대에 걸쳐 존재해 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you insane? 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01206A"
msgid "The people look up to us to guide them under the will of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "신민들은 우리가 자신들을 위대한 뱀의 뜻 아래 이끌어 주길 기대하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you insane? 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012069"
msgid "The fall of a noble House would put everything into question, and with the state Dazra is in right now, I won't allow that to happen."
msgstr "명문 가문의 몰락은 모든 것에 대한 의문을 불러올 것이고, 지금 다즈라 상황에서는 그런 일이 일어나게 할 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence. &&& companion: I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exactly. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012068"
msgid "So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots."
msgstr "그래서 라즈마가 광신도와 진짜로 맺은 관계를 대의회에 숨기고 싶어 하는 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
