#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012067"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "정확해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence. &&& companion: I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012066"
msgid "Tell me more about this situation."
msgstr "상황을 좀 더 자세히 설명해 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
