#. TOPIC: 0102F704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012065"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr "훌륭합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But I'm going to find Sahima so Razma can take back control. &&& Djimal: And that's what I wish to speak to you about. &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic shouldn't be associating with Zealots at all, except on an extermination level.|But worse, we absolutely cannot be supplying them with ordnance of any kind.|We need to cut ties with the Zealots altogether. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Far from it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012064"
msgid "I take it this conversation isn't about giving you an update."
msgstr "알려줄 내용이라는 게 지금 이 대화는 아니라고 생각하겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I take it this conversation isn't about giving you an update.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I take it this conversation isn't about giving you an update.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. 
