#. TOPIC: 010E3E4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012063"
msgid "Far from it."
msgstr "전혀 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Exactly. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
