#. TOPIC: 010E3E4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012062"
msgid "House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 이미 광신도에게 호의적이라는 평판을 받고 있지만, 사실은 그보다 더 심해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012061"
msgid "Razma wants the Zealots to back House Ka'dic, so the balance of power between the noble Houses would shift to us."
msgstr "라즈마 형님은 광신도가 카딕 가문을 돕게 만들어서 명문 가문 사이의 균형을 우리 쪽으로 기울게 하고 싶어하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I find it hard to believe the High Council isn't aware of any of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012060"
msgid "She's been employing them. Paying them in supplies that aid their blind crusade."
msgstr "놈들을 이용해 온 겁니다. 그 눈먼 성전에 보탤 물자를 대 주면서 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
