#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205F"
msgid "Razma \"lost control\" of the Zealots?"
msgstr "라즈마가 광신도들에 대한 '통제력'을 잃었다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Razma "lost control" of the Zealots? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma "lost control" of the Zealots? 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
