#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205E"
msgid "Yes, I'll get to that momentarily."
msgstr "그래요. 금방 설명해 드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: Exactly.  &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse.|Razma wants the Zealots to back House Ka'dic, so the balance of power between the noble Houses would shift to us.|She's been employing them. Paying them in supplies that aid their blind crusade.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This kind of ambition is dangerous. It threatens us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205D"
msgid "I can appreciate that kind of ambition."
msgstr "그런 야망이라면 인정할 만 하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can appreciate that kind of ambition.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can appreciate that kind of ambition.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: What none of us expected was the disaster that is the Scaled Citadel. 
