#. TOPIC: 010E3E47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205C"
msgid "This kind of ambition is dangerous. It threatens us all."
msgstr "그런 야망은 위험한 거죠. 우리 모두를 위협한다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
