#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Council knows nothing of her work with the Zealots, and I aim to keep it that way. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205B"
msgid "I find it hard to believe the High Council isn't aware of any of this."
msgstr "대의회가 이걸 전혀 모르고 있다니 믿기 힘든데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I find it hard to believe the High Council isn't aware of any of this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I find it hard to believe the High Council isn't aware of any of this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01205A"
msgid "The Council knows nothing of her work with the Zealots, and I aim to keep it that way."
msgstr "대의회는 라즈마가 광신도와 하는 일을 전혀 몰라요. 앞으로도 모르게 하고 싶고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I find it hard to believe the High Council isn't aware of any of this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: What none of us expected was the disaster that is the Scaled Citadel. 
