#. TOPIC: 010E3E45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012059"
msgid "All Elders have their own ambitions. I'm certain that's all they see."
msgstr "장로들에겐 각자 야망이 있죠. 분명 그것만 눈에 보일 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: Exactly.  &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse.|Razma wants the Zealots to back House Ka'dic, so the balance of power between the noble Houses would shift to us.|She's been employing them. Paying them in supplies that aid their blind crusade.
