#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012058"
msgid "Supplying Zealots is a mistake. They're terrorists."
msgstr "광신도를 도와주는 건 실수에요. 테러리스트 집단이잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Supplying Zealots is a mistake. They're terrorists.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Supplying Zealots is a mistake. They're terrorists.
