msgid "House Ka'dic would be condemned should anyone outside our House find out."
msgstr "가문 외부에 이 사실이 알려진다면 카딕 가문은 끝장이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: The Council knows nothing of her work with the Zealots, and I aim to keep it that way. |All Elders have their own ambitions. I'm certain that's all they see.
