#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012056"
msgid "What none of us expected was the disaster that is the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "우리가 예상하지 못한 건 비늘 성채에서 일어난 재난이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012055"
msgid "The aftermath is what allowed the Zealots to grab Sahima and the others, flipping the balance of power in their favor."
msgstr "그 여파로 광신도들이 사히마와 다른 사람들을 잡아갈 수 있었고, 힘의 균형이 그쪽으로 기울어버린 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But I'm going to find Sahima so Razma can take back control.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012054"
msgid "Razma has lost control, and it's putting House Ka'dic's reputation and power at risk."
