#. TOPIC: 010E3E17
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01201B"
msgid "Good. Those skills will prove useful then."
msgstr "잘됐네요. 그 기술이 유용하게 쓰이겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you're saying you have unlimited access to this base and more. &&& Sahima: I've been in an out of every other system they have here. &&& Sahima: The other hostages are being kept just beyond this room.|I can disengage the locks to their cell and grant you access to an elevator in the room beyond that will take them to safety...|You just have to clear out that area first, and the Zealots down there are... different.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Some may, but keep in mind that we are scientists.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01201A"
msgid "Will the hostages not fight with me?"
msgstr "인질들이 나와 함께 싸워주진 않을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will the hostages not fight with me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will the hostages not fight with me?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012019"
msgid "Some may, but keep in mind that we are scientists."
msgstr "몇 명은 그럴 수도 있는데, 우린 과학자라는 걸 명심하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will the hostages not fight with me?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012018"
msgid "Many of them have never seen true combat and are no longer proficient with weapons."
msgstr "대부분은 진짜 전투를 겪어 본 적도 없고 무기에 익숙하지도 않거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will the hostages not fight with me?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Whatever the situation, I can handle it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012017"
msgid "But some, like me, may still be capable. Just don't expect much of them."
msgstr "그래도 몇 명은 저처럼 유능할지도 몰라요. 너무 큰 기대는 마시고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever the situation, I can handle it. &&& Sahima: I pray your confidence is well justified. &&& Sahima: While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here.|I'll meet you and the others outside.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Zealots have a small network here that I can plug into.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012016"
msgid "Guarantees? What are you going to do?"
msgstr "확실하게 한다고? 어떻게 할 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Guarantees? What are you going to do?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Guarantees? What are you going to do?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012015"
msgid "The Zealots have a small network here that I can plug into."
msgstr "광신도들이 쓰는 작은 네트워크에 접속할 수 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Guarantees? What are you going to do?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012014"
msgid "They think I've been working on my research when really I've been formulating a virus that will shut down this entire base and their ships."
msgstr "그놈들은 제가 연구를 하고 있는 줄 아는데, 사실은 이 기지 전체랑 광신도 우주선을 정지시킬 바이러스를 만들고 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you're not a Zealot, then who are you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012013"
msgid "I'm not a Zealot. This is just the best thing I have to wear."
msgstr "난 광신도가 아니에요. 그냥 이게 제일 좋아서 입고 있는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not a Zealot. This is just the best thing I have to wear.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not a Zealot. This is just the best thing I have to wear.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm the one breaking you out of this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012012"
msgid "If you're not a Zealot, then who are you?"
msgstr "광신도가 아니라면, 대체 누구시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The point of taking hostages is to keep them alive. It's to your advantage to feed us, otherwise, you've got nothing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012011"
msgid "I wouldn't know. I just got here."
msgstr "나도 방금 와서 잘..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't know. I just got here. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wouldn't know. I just got here. 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is this all of you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012010"
msgid "The point of taking hostages is to keep them alive. It's to your advantage to feed us, otherwise, you've got nothing."
msgstr "인질은 계속 살려두려고 잡는 거야. 우릴 먹여 줘야 너네 이득이지, 안 그러면 다 헛짓거리라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here. &&& Gavin: Thank the Serpent. Forgive my initial coarseness. So that means she's safe?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not so fast.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200F"
msgid "Let's go. She'll meet us outside."
msgstr "가시죠. 사히마는 밖에서 합류할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's go. She'll meet us outside.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's go. She'll meet us outside.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200E"
msgid "Not so fast."
msgstr "아직 안 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one breaking you out of this place. &&& Gavin: Thank the Serpent, I took you for one of them. And Sahima? Did you find her? Is she safe? 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Look, we can't just leave.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200D"
msgid "She's fine. Just follow me and we can get out of here."
msgstr "무사해요. 날 따라오면 밖으로 나갈 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She's fine. Just follow me and we can get out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's fine. Just follow me and we can get out of here.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200C"
msgid "Look, we can't just leave."
msgstr "저기, 그냥 갈 순 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape. &&& Gavin: I wish it were that easy.  &&& Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.|Please. I can ready my people here, but... you'll have to deal with the Zealots and rescue the others so we may all escape safely.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's another Zealot like the one that guarded us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200B"
msgid "Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?"
msgstr "저 아래쪽에 있는 광신도에 대해서 알아둬야 할 게 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01200A"
msgid "There's another Zealot like the one that guarded us."
msgstr "우릴 지키던 그놈 같은 광신도가 또 하나 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012009"
msgid "Just be careful. Other Zealots are down there as well, but that's the one to worry about."
msgstr "조심하세요. 아래쪽에 다른 광신도도 있지만, 그놈이야말로 문젯거리니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012008"
msgid "Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 찬양하죠. 그분께서 오늘 진정으로 우리에게 미소 지어 주셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012007"
msgid "No blessings necessary. Our efforts saved you today."
msgstr "축복은 필요 없어요. 오늘 당신을 구한 건 우리의 노력이었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012006"
msgid "It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed."
msgstr "이건 분명 믿음의 시험이었을 거예요. 우리 모두 통과한 거면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012005"
msgid "Now, I believe you have some negotiations to to attend to."
msgstr "이제 협상 문제를 처리하셔야 할 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012004"
msgid "It's a shame you don't see the Great Serpent's work here even after walking the path."
msgstr "길을 걸으셨는데도 위대한 뱀의 행하심을 보지 못하신다니 아쉽네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012003"
msgid "Even now, you're about to attend Razma's negotiations and tell the Zealots they have nothing. As for me..."
msgstr "지금도 라즈마 님의 협상에 참석해서 광신도한테 아무것도 없다고 말해주려는 참인데 말이죠. 그럼 저는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A catastrophic disaster hits Dazra, Zealots kidnap us amidst the chaos, we're rescued in time to thwart negotiations...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012002"
msgid "That's right, and don't you forget it."
msgstr "맞는 말이네요. 나중에 까먹진 말아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's right, and don't you forget it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's right, and don't you forget it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012001"
msgid "A catastrophic disaster hits Dazra, Zealots kidnap us amidst the chaos, we're rescued in time to thwart negotiations..."
msgstr "대재난이 다즈라를 덮치고, 난장판 속에서 광신도한테 납치당하고, 제때 구출돼서 협상을 망쳐놓게 됐으니까..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's right, and don't you forget it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "012000"
msgid "I don't think any of are going to forget this anytime soon, even if we wanted to."
msgstr "이 사건을 금방 잊지는 못할 것 같네요. 잊고 싶어도 못 잊을걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's right, and don't you forget it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011FFF"
msgid "And speaking of negotiations, you should probably start heading out."
msgstr "그리고 협상 얘기가 나와서 말인데, 이제 출발하셔야 할 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, since that's truly what's important here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011FFD"
msgid "It's the least I could do for House Ka'dic and the people of Dazra."
msgstr "카딕 가문과 다즈라 사람들을 위해서 이 정도는 해 줘야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price. &&& Razma: A fair enough price to pay for silence. &&& Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You seem to be understanding our society quite well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011FFC"
msgid "House members are expected to show loyalty."
msgstr "가문 사람들이 충성심을 보여줘야 하는 거군요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Mihael_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Mihael_SC_Repeatable01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011FFB"
msgid "There are more honorable deaths."
msgstr "명예로운 죽음을 맞을 방법은 얼마든지 있어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Mihael_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Mihael_SC_Repeatable01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011FFA"
msgid "Enough lives have been lost."
msgstr "벌써 너무 많은 목숨을 잃었다고."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
