msgstr "침묵의 대가로는 충분한 값이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: House Ka'dic is in your debt, for better or worse.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As am I.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F96"
msgid "I'm sorry for you and your House's loss."
msgstr "장로님과 가문이 당한 일은 유감입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages. &&& Razma: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised. &&& Razma: Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken.|But this is what makes her an excellent Mediary.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This will be discussed at length later, but that's a personal matter between me and my sister.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F95"
msgid "You'll just let Djimal's actions slide?"
msgstr "지말의 행동을 그냥 묵과할 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price. &&& Razma: A fair enough price to pay for silence. &&& Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House ties run deep. Betraying one's House is a display of disloyalty that no House would tolerate. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F94"
msgid "What makes you so confident they'll remain silent?"
msgstr "왜 사람들이 입을 열지 않을 거라고 확신하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes you so confident they'll remain silent?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What makes you so confident they'll remain silent?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F93"
msgid "House ties run deep. Betraying one's House is a display of disloyalty that no House would tolerate."
msgstr "가문의 결속은 아주 깊거든. 가문을 배신하는 행위는 어떤 가문에서도 용납되지 않는 불충의 표시야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes you so confident they'll remain silent?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F92"
msgid "It's a guaranteed way to ostracize yourself in a society like ours."
msgstr "우리 사회에서는 확실하게 배척당할 짓이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll just let Djimal's actions slide?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll just let Djimal's actions slide?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F91"
msgid "This will be discussed at length later, but that's a personal matter between me and my sister."
msgstr "나중에 더 자세히 말하겠지만, 이건 나와 동생 사이의 개인적인 문제야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll just let Djimal's actions slide?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F90"
msgid "But the truth is, House Ka'dic comes first and foremost, and she was willing to pay the hard price for what she deemed necessary."
msgstr "하지만 사실 무엇보다도 중요한 건 카딕 가문이고, 지말은 필요하다고 생각한 일에 대한 대가를 기꺼이 치르려 했던 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll just let Djimal's actions slide?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I would think you'd both want to be on the same page.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8F"
msgid "Had I been in her place, I can't say I wouldn't have come to the same conclusion."
msgstr "내가 그 자리에 있었다면, 나도 같은 결론을 내리지 않았을 거라고 장담하지는 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages. &&& Razma: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised. &&& Razma: Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken.|But this is what makes her an excellent Mediary.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A Mediary is another title for a member of the High Council whose job it is to represent their House when the Elder cannot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8E"
msgid "What's a Mediary?"
msgstr "중개자라는 게 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's a Mediary?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's a Mediary?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8D"
msgid "A Mediary is another title for a member of the High Council whose job it is to represent their House when the Elder cannot."
msgstr "중개자는 대의회 의원에게 주는 직함인데, 장로가 부재중일 때 가문을 대표하는 역할을 맡고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's a Mediary?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8C"
msgid "My duties are to House Ka'dic and the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "나는 카딕 가문과 결합성을 책임지고 있고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's a Mediary?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I would think you'd both want to be on the same page.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8B"
msgid "I trust Djimal to properly represent our views at the High Council."
msgstr "난 지말이 대의회에서 우리 관점을 제대로 대변해줄 거라고 믿어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry for you and your House's loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry for you and your House's loss.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F8A"
msgid "As am I."
msgstr "동감이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: House Ka'dic is in your debt, for better or worse.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well spoken, Harbinger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F89"
msgid "The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 떠나간 가족들을 품어주실 겁니다. 좋은 일이라고 생각하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them. &&& ...  &&& Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one. &&& Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason. &&& Razma: Yes, and our House has suffered many losses. From one catastrophe to the next.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your overly harsh response is unwarranted, but I can't argue the sentiment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F88"
msgid "Get over it. It's time to refocus on Dazra and the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "잊어버려요. 이제 다시 다즈라와 비늘 성채에 집중해야 하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
