#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F83"
msgid "Well spoken, Armiger."
msgstr "좋은 말이군, 복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them.
