msgid "Well spoken, Adherent."
msgstr "좋은 말이군, 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Get over it. It's time to refocus on Dazra and the Scaled Citadel.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Get over it. It's time to refocus on Dazra and the Scaled Citadel.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Harbinger is right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F81"
msgid "Your overly harsh response is unwarranted, but I can't argue the sentiment."
msgstr "그렇게 냉혹한 반응은 듣고 싶지 않았지만, 틀린 생각이라고는 못 하겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: The Harbinger is right.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Yes, and I assume you were able to recover Sahima's research?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F80"
msgid "We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device."
msgstr "우리는 이번 일을 극복하고 더 강해질 거예요. 하지만 일단은 모어닝 장치로 관심을 돌려야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: Sympathetic to the Zealot cause? No. But sympathetic to the people? Yes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_SympatheticScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7F"
msgid "Are you sympathetic to the Zealots?"
msgstr "광신도에게 동조하는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sympathetic to the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_SympatheticScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7E"
msgid "Sympathetic to the Zealot cause? No. But sympathetic to the people? Yes."
msgstr "광신도의 대의에 동조하냐고? 아니야. 하지만 사람들에게 동조하느냐면? 맞아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_SympatheticScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7D"
msgid "I don't deny the Zealots are violent religious extremists, but that doesn't mean they are heartless, emotionless killers."
msgstr "광신도가 폭력적인 종교 극단주의자라는 걸 부정하지는 않겠지만, 그렇다고 해서 무자비하고 감정 없는 살인마인 것도 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_SympatheticScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7C"
msgid "They have families and people they care for just like us. I see them as strongly misguided individuals that need help."
msgstr "광신도한테도 우리처럼 가족과 소중한 사람들이 있어. 난 광신도를 길을 심하게 벗어나서 도움이 필요한 사람들이라고 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: The Harbinger is right. &&& Djimal: We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device. &&& Razma: Yes, and I assume you were able to recover Sahima's research?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. I imagine whatever this algorithm holds could be quite powerful in the wrong hands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7B"
msgid "Yes, the Zealots had yet to discover it."
msgstr "네. 광신도가 찾아내지는 못했더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, the Zealots had yet to discover it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, the Zealots had yet to discover it.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F7A"
msgid "Good. I imagine whatever this algorithm holds could be quite powerful in the wrong hands."
msgstr "다행이야. 그 알고리즘이 뭔진 몰라도 잘못 쓰면 꽤 강한 힘을 발휘할 것 같거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: That's just it. When I'm with them, it's like associating with anyone here in Dazra. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F79"
msgid "What is it like having to work with the Zealots?"
msgstr "광신도와 함께 한다는 건 어떤 느낌이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is it like having to work with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F78"
msgid "That's just it. When I'm with them, it's like associating with anyone here in Dazra."
msgstr "그냥 평범해. 같이 있어 보면, 그냥 다즈라 사람들하고 어울리는 느낌이거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F77"
msgid "They aren't the mindless fanatics people make them out to be."
msgstr "사람들 생각처럼 정신 나간 미치광이들은 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Mirek_TL_ZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F76"
msgid "Granted, you have to get them to warm up to you first, but after that, it's just like having a friend in House Veth'aal."
msgstr "물론 일단 서로 친해져야 하지만, 친해지고 나면 그냥 베타알 가문 친구를 만나는 거랑 비슷해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it true you're supplying Zealots with the means to arm themselves?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is your real motive keeping the Zealots on your side for power?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F75"
msgid "So that's what Djimal wanted to speak with you about."
msgstr "지말이 말해주려는 내용이 바로 그거였군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it true you're supplying Zealots with the means to arm themselves? &&& Razma: So that's what Djimal wanted to speak with you about. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hostile or not, they're an effective means to an end and often the perfect cover as well. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F74"
msgid "Why would you employ such a hostile group?"
msgstr "그렇게 적대적인 집단을 왜 이용하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it true you're supplying Zealots with the means to arm themselves? &&& Razma: So that's what Djimal wanted to speak with you about. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because I see it as a semblance of control. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3D9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F73"
msgid "How can you live knowing you're supplying terrorists?"
msgstr "테러리스트를 지원한다는 걸 알면서도 어떻게 그리 태평하게 살 수 있는데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it true you're supplying Zealots with the means to arm themselves? &&& Razma: So that's what Djimal wanted to speak with you about. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I certainly hope so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3D9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0550_Razma_TL_SupplyingZealotsScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F72"
msgid "We're done here."
msgstr "이 얘기는 관두죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun. &&& Mirek: Oh, so you're the heretic turned Harbinger who thinks they're one of us now.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My help? Oh, wait. You're that heretic turned Promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB644
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F71"
msgid "Someone who needs your help."
msgstr "네 도움이 필요한 사람이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "My." / Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Someone who needs your help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Someone who needs your help.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB643
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F70"
msgid "My help? Oh, wait. You're that heretic turned Promised."
msgstr "내 도움? 아, 잠깐만. 너, 약속받은 자가 됐다는 그 이단자구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here to see you. &&& Mirek: And you are?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, the heretic turned Promised. I was wondering when our paths would cross.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB642
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6F"
msgid "I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>."
msgstr "나는 선구자 <Alias=MQ03Player>."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Agreed. Which is why I'm hoping you can help.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Normally, I'd have agents doing everything possible to find them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6E"
msgid "I need you to find the hostages. Bring them home so the Zealots have nothing to leverage and Sahima can work with the High Council."
msgstr "그대가 인질을 찾아줘야 해. 인질들이 돌아오면 광신도들은 협상 수단을 잃어버릴 거고, 사히마가 대의회와 협력할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If Mirek knows, how come you haven't forced them to tell you?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6D"
msgid "Now that the situation has changed... well, that's going to be your job now."
msgstr "지금은 상황이 변했으니... 뭐, 이제 그대의 일이 되겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why is Sahima so important to the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6C"
msgid "Sahima's theories may now be the key to reaching the Scaled Citadel or maybe even restoring Dazra."
msgstr "사히마의 이론이 비늘 성채에 접근하거나 다즈라를 복구할 수 있는 열쇠일지도 모르니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pause before "complicated" because she's not as willing to talk about what comes next. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6B"
msgid "This is where matters get... complicated."
msgstr "바로 여기서 문제가... 복잡해지는 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's an honor to meet the Elder of a noble House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010BF9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F6A"
msgid "I'm Razma. Elder of House Ka'dic and head of the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "나는 라즈마다. 카딕 가문의 장로이자 결합성의 책임자 자리를 맡고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they were hiding from me while I was taking care of those Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F69"
msgid "Please find them. We'll await your return outside."
msgstr "제발 찾아 주세요. 우린 밖에서 기다리고 있을게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Paying the player for secretly killing everyone in the Zealot base. / Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm. &&& Razma: At least we had some level of success.  &&& Razma: Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F68"
msgid "And Vindicator, a token of my gratitude for aiding House Ka'dic."
msgstr "그리고, 옹호자. 이건 카딕 가문을 도와준 것에 대한 감사의 표시에요."

