msgid "You'll find Mirek upstairs in the meditation room."
msgstr "미어렉은 위층 명상실에 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Now's your chance to rebuild House Ka'dic even stronger.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Now's your chance to rebuild House Ka'dic even stronger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F5D"
msgid "Now that Djimal and I are aligned, it's a chance we'll take full advantage of."
msgstr "이제 지말과 내가 뜻을 함께할 테니, 그 기회를 최대한 활용할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Now's your chance to rebuild House Ka'dic even stronger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Harbinger is right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F5C"
msgid "I only wish it didn't take this to lead us here."
msgstr "이런 일 때문에 이렇게 되지는 않았으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your people will be looking to you to guide them through this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your people will be looking to you to guide them through this.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Harbinger is right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103749E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F5B"
msgid "Yes, and it will only be easier to guide them with Djimal and me united."
msgstr "그렇겠지. 지말과 내가 힘을 합쳐야 더 쉽게 인도할 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
