#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F30"
msgid "The Great Serpent is merciful. And Sahima? Did you find her yet?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 자비로군요. 사히마는요? 찾아보셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's go. She'll meet us outside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F2F"
msgid "Thank the Serpent. So that means she's safe?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 감사를. 그럼 사히마는 무사하다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm the one breaking you out of this place.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one breaking you out of this place.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: She's fine. Just follow me and we can get out of here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F2E"
msgid "Thank the Serpent, I took you for one of them. And Sahima? Did you find her? Is she safe?"
msgstr "뱀이시여, 감사합니다. 광신도인 줄 알았어요. 사히마는요? 찾으셨나요? 무사합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't want to help? 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F2D"
msgid "I fear more for the ones they've taken to the caves."
msgstr "동굴로 끌려가 버린 사람들이 더 걱정이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business. &&& Razma: Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over. &&& Mihael: Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You think I care about Anasko Va'ruun? Son of a traitor? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F2C"
msgid "I'm the Serpent's chosen Vindicator. The only one who can understand Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "나는 위대한 뱀에게 선택받은 옹호자이자, 아나스코 바룬의 말을 이해할 수 있는 유일한 사람이다."

