#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this. &&& Sahima: It's true, Mihael. And if you don't leave now, peacefully, I'll make sure your ships and Shadow Station Epsilon are made dust.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Test me. You think a genius mind like mine wouldn't find a way to hack into every system in your base? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F27"
msgid "You. How did you -- You're bluffing."
msgstr "너, 대체 어떻게... 허세 부리는 거군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F26"
msgid "This remote device will launch a virus that will detonate systems within your base and reach your ships as well."
msgstr "이 원격 장치를 작동시키면 바이러스가 실행돼서 네 기지에 있는 시스템을 폭발시킬 거고, 우주선도 무사하지 못할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F25"
msgid "Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 행하심에 눈을 감는 건 이단 뿐이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today. &&& Sahima: I will?|I mean, of course I will. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F24"
msgid "Doesn't sound like a guarantee to me."
msgstr "딱히 보증이 되지는 않을 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You attack, we launch the virus.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F23"
msgid "We all answer the call, and if that day is today, so be it."
msgstr "우리 모두는 부름에 응했다. 그게 오늘이라면, 그러라지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As much as I'd welcome the expertise, the Zealots would never allow an outsider to participate. |But the negotiations aren't where I need assistance.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F22"
msgid "The Zealots have yet to name specifics. At best, they'll demand an inordinate amount of credits or firearms."
msgstr "광신도들은 아직 구체적인 요구 사항을 말하지 않았어. 기껏해야 크레딧 아니면 무기나 왕창 달라고 하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F21"
msgid "Worst case, a seat at the High Council or even the reinstatement of their House. House Ma'leen."
msgstr "최악의 경우라면, 대의회 자리를 요구하거나 자기네 가문을 복권시켜 달라고 할 수도 있고. 마린 가문 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Zealots don't deserve anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F20"
msgid "They know we can't risk Sahima for Dazra's sake, so they won't hold back when it comes to demands."
msgstr "그놈들은 사히마가 다즈라에 꼭 필요하다는 걸 아니까, 요구할 때가 되면 물러서지 않겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not just tell the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1F"
msgid "As much as the Council thinks its their business, it's not. At least not yet."
msgstr "대의회는 이게 자기들 일이라고 생각하지만, 사실 아니야. 적어도 아직은 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I fail to see what's so complicated. People's lives are at stake.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I fail to see what's so complicated. People's lives are at stake.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1E"
msgid "I suppose this looks very black and white to you. If only that were the case."
msgstr "그대한테는 이게 흑백 논리로 보이는 모양이지. 그랬다면 얼마나 좋았을까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Understood.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1D"
msgid "Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them."
msgstr "정보를 찾으면서 어떤 방법을 써도 좋아. 단 사람들이 다치는 일은 없게 하고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then you know how important it is to reveal the location of the Zealot base. &&& Mirek: On the contrary, I know how important it is to keep that information confidential. &&& Mirek: I've worked hard to obtain my position with the Zealots. |And like I've told Razma a thousand times, I have no reason to believe they're going to hurt my dear cousins, especially Sahima.|So as far as I'm concerned, that information stays with me.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hm. You make a good point, for an outsider. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033757
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1C"
msgid "[Lie] Razma gave me carte blanche to get this information by any means necessary."
msgstr "[거짓말] 라즈마가 무슨 짓을 해서라도 정보를 얻으라고 했어. 전권을 위임받았다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't say that with absolute certainty. You're risking lives and House Ka'dic's integrity.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't say that with absolute certainty. You're risking lives and House Ka'dic's integrity.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: The location you're looking for is Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033756
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1B"
msgid "She wouldn't... Well, let's not be hasty."
msgstr "그럴 리가... 자, 너무 서두르지 말자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011F1A"
msgid "Tell me, Vindicator. What do you know about the Zealots?"
msgstr "말해 봐요, 옹호자. 광신도에 대해서 뭘 알고 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
