#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E402B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011F0B"
msgid "Great Serpent protect me."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 절 보호하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being held captive. / Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E402B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011F0A"
msgid "Serpent save me. I don't wish to die here."
msgstr "뱀이시여, 구해주소서. 여기서 죽고 싶지 않나이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being held captive. / Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E402B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011F09"
msgid "Is this the end?"
msgstr "이제 끝인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being held captive. "Heed the call" as in the call of death. / Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E402B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011F08"
msgid "I'm not ready to heed the call."
msgstr "아직 부름에 답할 준비가 안 됐는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being held captive and seeing the player. / Pleading
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3E01
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E402B
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011F07"
msgid "Please, you must release me."
msgstr "제발 저 좀 풀어 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0000_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F06"
msgid "Excuse me, I'm trying to focus."
msgstr "미안한데, 지금 집중하는 중이거든?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0000_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F05"
msgid "If you must be here, please keep quiet."
msgstr "꼭 여기 있어야겠으면, 제발 조용히 좀 해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0000_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F04"
msgid "I prefer not to be bothered right now."
msgstr "지금은 방해받고 싶지 않은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F03"
msgid "Be quick, Promised. Time is of the essence."
msgstr "서둘러, 약속받은 자. 시간이 생명이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F02"
msgid "Hopefully, Mirek will be forthcoming."
msgstr "미어렉이 협조적으로 나와야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F01"
msgid "Mirek may deny knowing anything, but don't let them fool you."
msgstr "미어렉이 아무것도 모른다고 할 수도 있는데, 속지 말도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011F00"
msgid "Shouldn't you be working with my sister?"
msgstr "우리 형님과 일하고 있어야 하지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
