msgstr "나중에 얘기하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EFE"
msgid "Your focus should be on Razma's needs and assisting House Ka'dic."
msgstr "라즈마 형님과 카딕 가문을 돕는 일에 집중하도록 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
