#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0270_MirekHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EF8"
msgid "I hope you know what you're doing."
msgstr "네가 뭘 하려는 건지 제대로 알고 있길 바라겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
