msgid "I hope Mirek was forthcoming."
msgstr "미어렉이 협조적이었길 바라지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
