msgctxt "011EEB"
msgid "Serpent steel us, Vindicator, for what we must do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 단련시키실 겁니다, 옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EEA"
msgid "Serpent steel us, Diviner, for what we must do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 단련시키실 겁니다, 예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE9"
msgid "Serpent steel us, Reverent, for what we must do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 단련시키실 겁니다, 숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE8"
msgid "Serpent steel us, Armiger, for what we must do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 단련시키실 겁니다, 복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE7"
msgid "Serpent steel us, Adherent, for what we must do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 단련시키실 겁니다, 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE6"
msgid "You're doing us all a great service. Not just House Ka'dic."
msgstr "카딕 가문 뿐만 아니라, 우리 모두에게 큰 도움을 주고 있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE5"
msgid "Remember. This conversation never happened."
msgstr "명심하세요. 이 대화는 없었던 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0520_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE4"
msgid "Sacrifices like these are painful but necessary."
msgstr "이런 희생은 고통스럽지만, 반드시 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0510_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE3"
msgid "Your lack of vision may cost hundreds their lives. I'd ask that you reconsider."
msgstr "당신의 잘못된 판단이 수백의 목숨을 앗아갈 거예요. 다시 생각해주면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0510_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE2"
msgid "A shame Anasko's chosen has failed to see the bigger picture."
msgstr "아나스코 님의 선택받은 자가 큰 그림을 보지 못한다니 유감이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0510_DjimalHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EE1"
msgid "Remember, we didn't speak of this."
msgstr "명심하세요. 이 대화는 없었던 일입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011EE0"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "뭘 원하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011EDF"
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하시는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player barged in and she has no idea who they are or their intentions."Them" being the Zealots. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0600_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EDE"
msgid "You're -- You're not one of them?"
msgstr "그... 그놈들 편은 아니시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0710_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EDD"
msgid "I know I don't have to say this, but be careful."
msgstr "이런 말 할 필요는 없겠지만, 조심하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0710_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EDC"
msgid "I hope the others are all right."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 무사했으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_2150_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EDB"
msgid "Good luck. We'll be ready when the time comes."
msgstr "행운을 빌게요. 우린 때가 되면 준비할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_2500_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EDA"
msgid "We all made it. We're safe."
msgstr "다들 빠져나왔네요. 이제 안전해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_2500_GavinHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED9"
msgid "By the Serpent, you did it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 해내셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reassuring. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3000_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED8"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll be there."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 제때 갈 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reassuring. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3000_SahimaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED7"
msgid "I'll be practically right behind you."
msgstr "저도 금방 뒤따라갈 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed the Zealots in the negotiations. Razma would've preferred the Zealots live so she could continue to use them. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED6"
msgid "That could've gone better."
msgstr "더 잘 풀릴 수 있었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed Zealots in negotiations. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED5"
msgid "Certainly not the outcome I was expecting, but at least we have what's important."
msgstr "내가 기대했던 결과는 아니었지만, 적어도 중요한 문제는 해결했군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED4"
msgid "This has been quite the disaster."
msgstr "완전히 대참사가 돼 버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED3"
msgid "By the Serpent. Is it too much to ask for something to go right?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 일을 바로잡는 게 이리도 어렵나이까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Negotiations went her way. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED2"
msgid "I'd say that rather went in our favor."
msgstr "협상은 우리한테 유리했던 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED1"
msgid "You certainly came through today."
msgstr "오늘 정말로 잘 해줬어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad reflection to self. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ED0"
msgid "The Zealots live while family blood has been spilled... But who am I to question the Great Serpent..."
msgstr "가족의 피가 흐르는데도 광신도는 살아 있구나... 허나 내가 뭐라고 위대한 뱀을 의심할 수 있겠어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Upset over the situation. To self. / Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_RazmaHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECF"
msgid "The injustice of it all."
msgstr "전부 다 부당해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed the Zealots in the negotiations.  / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECE"
msgid "They got what they deserved."
msgstr "이놈들은 이렇게 돼도 싸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed Zealots in negotiations. / Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECD"
msgid "That will be the last time Zealots agree to negotiations with House Ka'dic."
msgstr "광신도가 카딕 가문과 협상하는 것도 이번이 마지막이 되겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Spoken a bit low because Razma nearby would disagree.  / Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECC"
msgid "Well done."
msgstr "잘 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Spoken a bit low because Razma nearby would disagree.  / Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECB"
msgid "You've gone above and beyond."
msgstr "기대 이상으로 잘 해 주셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Spoken a bit low because Razma nearby would disagree. Disappointed. / Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011ECA"
msgid "I see you made your choice."
msgstr "그렇게 하기로 했군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player did NOT do what she wanted. She's letting the player know that on a subtle level since others are nearby. / Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC9"
msgid "With the hostages safe, your loyalties are clear."
msgstr "인질이 살아있는 걸 보니, 당신 충성심은 확실하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed hostages, but let Zealots live. Makes her both suspicious and curious. / Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC8"
msgid "You allowed the Zealots to live? Interesting."
msgstr "광신도를 살려줬단 말이죠? 재미있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: She knows Mihael will start hunting the player. / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_DjimalHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC7"
msgid "Mihael will not forget this."
msgstr "미해일은 이번 일을 잊지 않겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. / SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_MihaelHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC6"
msgid "Enjoy watching your back, false Promised."
msgstr "뒤통수 조심하라고, 거짓 약속받은 자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. / SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_MihaelHellos_SahimaAlive_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC5"
msgid "Don't think this is over."
msgstr "이걸로 끝이라 생각하지 마라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_MihaelHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC4"
msgid "You'll pay for your treachery."
msgstr "배신에 대한 대가를 치를 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_MihaelHellos_SahimaDead_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC3"
msgid "Next time I see you, you're dust."
msgstr "내 눈에 또 보이면 흙먼지로 만들어주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_SahimaHellos_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC2"
msgid "I can't believe the Zealots listened to you."
msgstr "광신도가 말을 들어주다니 대단하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_SahimaHellos_ZealotsAlive
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC1"
msgid "You have no idea how satisfying that was."
msgstr "제가 얼마나 감명받았는지 모르실 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed the Zealots in the negotiations.  / Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_SahimaHellos_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EC0"
msgid "That's one way to handle negotiations."
msgstr "그것도 협상 방법이기는 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player killed Zealots in negotiations. / Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_SahimaHellos_ZealotsDead
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EBF"
msgid "I'm not sure what I was expecting, but it wasn't that."
msgstr "제가 뭘 기대했는진 몰라도, 이런 건 확실히 아니었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EBE"
msgid "With the High Council no longer pressuring me, I can turn my complete attention to my people."
msgstr "이제 대의회가 날 압박하지 않으니 우리 신민들에게 완전히 집중할 수 있겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011EBD"
msgid "With the High Council no longer pressuring me, breaking the news of our recent losses will be my new priority."
msgstr "이제 대의회가 날 압박하지 않으니, 최근에 입은 손실을 알리는 일에 우선적으로 집중해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010E3DAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_RazmaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
