#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And you are sure? We need the object itself?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My brothers and sisters and I. We are bound to the pods. The pods are powered by the Interlocks. Remove them, and you kill us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E0D"
msgid "Yes, Speaker. These Vortex Interlocks are complicated devices. We could recreate them from schematics we have recovered, but that would take time..."
msgstr ""
"네, 대변자님. 이 볼텍스 제어장치는 복잡한 장치입니다. 복구한 도식 자료를 활용해서 다시 만들어낼 수는 있지만, 그러면 시간이 오래 "
"걸릴 겁니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, Speaker. These Vortex Interlocks are complicated devices. We could recreate them from schematics we have recovered, but that would take time...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E0C"
msgid "And you are sure? We need the object itself?"
msgstr "확실한가? 그 장치 자체가 필요한 것이야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My brothers and sisters and I. We are bound to the pods. The pods are powered by the Interlocks. Remove them, and you kill us.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We are, Speaker. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E0B"
msgid "Yes, I understand. But... You are sworn to serve, are you not?"
msgstr "그래, 알겠다. 허나... 너는 섬기기로 맹세했지. 안 그런가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Do not fear. They know who I am.
