#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You do, yes? I can see it. You know me. I am Anasko Va'ruun, Speaker for the Great Serpent.
