#. TOPIC: 010E47D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E09"
msgid "Do not fear. They know who I am."
msgstr "두려워 말라. 내가 누구인지 알 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, Speaker. These Vortex Interlocks are complicated devices. We could recreate them from schematics we have recovered, but that would take time...
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, I understand. But... You are sworn to serve, are you not?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E08"
msgid "My brothers and sisters and I. We are bound to the pods. The pods are powered by the Interlocks. Remove them, and you kill us."
msgstr "제 형제자매들과 저는 포드에 연결되어 있습니다. 제어장치가 포드 동력을 공급하기 때문에, 장치를 제거하면 저희는 죽을 것입니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We are, Speaker. All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): ...As the Great Serpent wills.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E07"
msgid "Then what better service than to facilitate contact with the Great Serpent Himself. Your sacrifice will bring about a new era for House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 위대한 뱀께 접촉할 수 있도록 돕는 것보다 더한 섬김이 어디 있겠느냐. 네 희생으로 바룬 가문에 새로운 시대가 열릴 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Do not fear. They know who I am.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, Speaker. We know. We Serve. We have always Served.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E06"
msgid "You do, yes? I can see it. You know me. I am Anasko Va'ruun, Speaker for the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그렇지? 난 알 수 있다. 넌 나를 알아. 나는 아나스코 바룬. 위대한 뱀의 대변자이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You do, yes? I can see it. You know me. I am Anasko Va'ruun, Speaker for the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And your service is commended. Are you all that remain of this place?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E05"
msgid "Yes, Speaker. We know. We Serve. We have always Served."
msgstr "네, 대변자님. 우리는 알고, 또 섬깁니다. 언제나 섬겨왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Then what better service than to facilitate contact with the Great Serpent Himself. Your sacrifice will bring about a new era for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We will begin extraction at once. Then we should have everything we need to upgrade the equipment at the Citadel.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E04"
msgid "...As the Great Serpent wills."
msgstr "...위대한 뱀의 뜻대로 하십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, Speaker. We know. We Serve. We have always Served.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Jinan Va'ruun himself bade us guard these halls for all time. Others left. We remain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E03"
msgid "And your service is commended. Are you all that remain of this place?"
msgstr "네 노고를 치하하노라. 여기에 남은 것은 너 뿐인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): ...As the Great Serpent wills.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E02"
msgid "We will begin extraction at once. Then we should have everything we need to upgrade the equipment at the Citadel."
msgstr "즉시 장치를 뽑아내겠다. 그렇게 하면 성채에 있는 장비를 개선하는 데 필요한 모든 것이 갖춰지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And your service is commended. Are you all that remain of this place?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Very well. You - get to work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011E01"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun himself bade us guard these halls for all time. Others left. We remain."
msgstr "지난 바룬 님께서 이곳을 영원히 지키라고 명하셨습니다. 다른 이들은 떠났고, 저희는 남았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Jinan Va'ruun himself bade us guard these halls for all time. Others left. We remain.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes of course, sir. At once. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DFF"
msgid "Very well. You - get to work."
msgstr "좋다. 넌 작업을 시작하거라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Very well. You - get to work.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You heard the Speaker! Every terminal, every data log, every cable and component! I want it all inspected, and a full report within the hour!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DFD"
msgid "Yes of course, sir. At once."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 즉시 시작하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: calling out to a team in the background / Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes of course, sir. At once. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DFC"
msgid "You heard the Speaker! Every terminal, every data log, every cable and component! I want it all inspected, and a full report within the hour!"
msgstr ""
"대변자님 말씀 들었지! 모든 단말기, 모든 데이터 기록, 모든 케이블과 구성품까지 전부 검사해서 한 시간 안에 전체 보고서 제출해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Then I have all I came for. It is time to leave.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DFB"
msgid "You have the Interlock, Speaker, and the sum total of the data gathered is on the slates in your possession."
msgstr "제어장치를 확보했습니다, 대변자님. 수집한 데이터 전체는 지금 가지고 계신 슬레이트에 기록했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes, I understand. But... You are sworn to serve, are you not?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Then what better service than to facilitate contact with the Great Serpent Himself. Your sacrifice will bring about a new era for House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DFA"
msgid "We are, Speaker. All Must Serve."
msgstr "그렇습니다, 대변자님. 모두가 섬겨야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You have the Interlock, Speaker, and the sum total of the data gathered is on the slates in your possession.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You, Phantom. One final order awaits you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF9"
msgid "Then I have all I came for. It is time to leave."
msgstr "그럼 필요한 건 전부 찾았군. 이제 떠나야겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: slightly condescending / Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We exist to serve, Speaker.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My grandfather insisted this place remain secret, known only to him. Known only to the Speaker. No one else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF8"
msgid "I know you do."
msgstr "나도 안다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You, Phantom. One final order awaits you.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I know you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF7"
msgid "We exist to serve, Speaker."
msgstr "저희는 섬기기 위해 존재합니다, 대변자님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My grandfather insisted this place remain secret, known only to him. Known only to the Speaker. No one else.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Sir, please... Have we not done all that was asked? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF5"
msgid "As the Speaker wills it."
msgstr "대변자님의 뜻대로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I know you do.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): As the Speaker wills it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF3"
msgid "My grandfather insisted this place remain secret, known only to him. Known only to the Speaker. No one else."
msgstr "조부님께선 이곳이 비밀로 남아야 한다고 하셨다. 오직 그분만이, 대변자만이 알아야 한다고. 다른 이들은 없애라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: realizing you're not getting out of here alive / Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): As the Speaker wills it.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You and your team have served well. But your service to me is at an end. Now you shall serve the Great Serpent directly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF2"
msgid "Sir, please... Have we not done all that was asked?"
msgstr "대변자님, 제발요... 시키신 대로 했지 않습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Then I have all I came for. It is time to leave.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We exist to serve, Speaker.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF1"
msgid "You, Phantom. One final order awaits you."
msgstr "너, 유령. 마지막 명령을 내리겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Sir, please... Have we not done all that was asked? 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Please, no!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DF0"
msgid "You and your team have served well. But your service to me is at an end. Now you shall serve the Great Serpent directly."
msgstr "너와 네 팀은 잘 섬겨 주었다. 허나 날 위한 섬김은 이제 끝났다. 이제 위대한 뱀을 직접 섬겨야 할 것이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: realizing you're not getting out of here alive / Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You and your team have served well. But your service to me is at an end. Now you shall serve the Great Serpent directly.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC
#. TOPIC: 010E47B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_BC_MQ05_Slate03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DEF"
msgid "Please, no!"
msgstr "제발, 안 돼요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All in a day's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BE8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DE3"
msgid "Jinan bless you. I thought I was dead."
msgstr "지난께서 당신을 축복하시길. 전 죽은 줄 알았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BE8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DE2"
msgid "I am glad my messages were received."
msgstr "제 메시지가 전달되었다니 다행이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All in a day's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BE8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DE1"
msgid "Thank you. I'm still a little shaken up, but it will pass."
msgstr "감사합니다. 아직 좀 떨리지만, 괜찮아질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All in a day's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BE8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DE0"
msgid "So Dazra still remembers us. You bring honor to House Va'ruun and the Great Serpent."
msgstr "다즈라가 아직 우리를 기억하고 있군요. 바룬 가문과 위대한 뱀께 영광을 돌리셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All in a day's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BE8
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDF"
msgid "It looks like that's the last of them. The faithless were fools to challenge House Va'ruun."
msgstr "이게 마지막 녀석들인가 보군. 신앙심 없는 놈들이 바룬 가문에 도전하다니 어리석었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDE"
msgid "All in a day's work."
msgstr "늘 있는 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All in a day's work.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All in a day's work.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDD"
msgid "Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution."
msgstr "지난의 뜻을 따르고 보상을 바라지 않는 자에게 복이 있나니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent rewards all who perform in his name.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDC"
msgid "I was hoping for something more than appreciation."
msgstr "감사 이상의 것을 바랐는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was hoping for something more than appreciation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was hoping for something more than appreciation.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDB"
msgid "The Great Serpent rewards all who perform in his name."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 그분의 이름으로 행하는 모든 이에게 상을 내리십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. I will do my due diligence, and ensure that my cover remains intact.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DDA"
msgid "Be sure you maintained your cover. Who knows who your captors talked to."
msgstr "네 정체가 탄로나지 않도록 조심해. 네가 잡혔던 놈들이 누구와 이야기했을지 누가 알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Be sure you maintained your cover. Who knows who your captors talked to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Be sure you maintained your cover. Who knows who your captors talked to.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD9"
msgid "Yes. I will do my due diligence, and ensure that my cover remains intact."
msgstr "네. 제 임무를 다하고, 제 정체가 탄로나지 않도록 하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BF6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD8"
msgid "The hijackers threatened to blow my cover in exchange for a ransom. Thankfully you made their demands moot."
msgstr "납치범들이 몸값을 대가로 제 정체를 폭로하겠다고 위협했습니다. 다행히 당신 덕분에 그럴 일이 없어졌군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BF6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD7"
msgid "I had brokered an intel exchange with these ruffians. The deal quickly turned sour."
msgstr "이 녀석들과 기밀 정보를 교환하기로 했었는데, 거래가 금방 틀어졌습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BF6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD6"
msgid "I had hired these heretics to help deliver Va'ruun propaganda, but they decided to ransom me instead."
msgstr "이 이단자들을 고용해서 바룬 선전물을 전달하려고 했는데, 그들이 저를 인질로 잡으려고 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: Blessed are those who serve Jinan's will, and seek no restitution.
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BF6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD5"
msgid "I had hoped to employ these barbarians to hit targets helpful to the cause. But they decided to renege on the deal."
msgstr "이 야만인들을 고용해서 우리에게 도움이 될 만한 목표물을 공격하려고 했는데, 그들이 거래를 파기하기로 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C0D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD4"
msgid "Now, back to my mission..."
msgstr "자, 이제 임무로 돌아가야지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C0D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD3"
msgid "Now if you'll excuse me, I have a report to file."
msgstr "이제 실례, 보고서를 제출해야 해서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C0D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD2"
msgid "I'll let my contacts in Dazra know of your valor."
msgstr "다즈라에 있는 제 연락책에게 당신의 용맹함에 대해 알리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Prisoner: 
#. ALIAS: Prisoner
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue01_SceneRandom
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C0D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DD1"
msgid "I will send word to my contacts back in Dazra of your heroism. You do the Great Serpent proud."
msgstr "다즈라에 있는 제 연락책에게 당신의 영웅적인 행동에 대해 알리겠습니다. 당신은 위대한 뱀을 자랑스럽게 하는군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HELLOS_RescuedAgent
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011DD0"
msgid "I am forever indebted to you."
msgstr "영원히 당신에게 빚을 졌습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HELLOS_RescuedAgent
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011DCF"
msgid "You have done House Va'ruun a service on this day."
msgstr "오늘 바룬 가문에 공을 세우셨습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HELLOS_RescuedAgent
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011DCE"
msgid "I need to catch my breath and then it's back to my mission."
msgstr "숨을 좀 고르고 나서 임무로 돌아가야겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HELLOS_RescuedAgent
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011DCD"
msgid "The Great Serpent still has work for me to do."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 아직 제게 시키실 일이 남아 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Rescue
#. TOPIC: 010E6BDA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HELLOS_RescuedAgent
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011DCC"
msgid "Our work in the Settled Systems continues."
msgstr "개척 성계에서 우리의 임무는 계속된다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All business. I like that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DC0"
msgid "Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo."
msgstr "쓸데없는 잡담은 피하고, 그냥 화물이나 줘."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wonderful. You do House Va'ruun a great service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DBF"
msgid "I've got a ship ready to haul it back to Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라로 운반할 우주선을 준비해 뒀어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. PROMPT: I've got a ship ready to haul it back to Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got a ship ready to haul it back to Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DBE"
msgid "Wonderful. You do House Va'ruun a great service."
msgstr "훌륭해. 바룬 가문에 큰 도움이 되는군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're paid what everyone else is paid. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DBD"
msgid "I expect to be paid handsomely for this mission."
msgstr "이 임무에 대한 보수를 두둑이 받아야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. PROMPT: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DBC"
msgid "All business. I like that."
msgstr "일만 생각한다라. 마음에 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: I expect to be paid handsomely for this mission.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I expect to be paid handsomely for this mission.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DBB"
msgid "You're paid what everyone else is paid. All Must Serve."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 받는 만큼만 받아. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DB9"
msgid "Do I have enough cargo space to carry it?"
msgstr "이걸 실을 만한 화물칸이 충분히 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. PROMPT: Do I have enough cargo space to carry it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do I have enough cargo space to carry it?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C3A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DB5"
msgid "Yeah, that's plenty."
msgstr "그래, 충분해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: Do I have enough cargo space to carry it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do I have enough cargo space to carry it?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6C3A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DB4"
msgid "Might be a little tight, but we'll make it fit."
msgstr "약간 빡빡할 수도 있지만, 어떻게든 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BFF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DAD"
msgid "Wasn't sure you were going to show up."
msgstr "네가 안 나타날 줄 알았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BFF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DAC"
msgid "So you must be the anchor leg of this smuggler's relay."
msgstr "네가 이 밀수 작전의 마지막 주자로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BFF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DAB"
msgid "Glad you showed up. We've got the shipment, as directed."
msgstr "와줘서 고마워. 지시대로 선적물을 준비했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's avoid the chit chat. Just give me the cargo.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E6BFF
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DAA"
msgid "You the smuggler? We've got the cargo all ready to bring home."
msgstr "네가 그 밀수꾼인가? 집으로 가져갈 화물을 다 준비해 뒀어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: All business. I like that.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler
#. TOPIC: 010E6BC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MB_Smuggler_Scene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010E7943
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011DA9"
msgid "Here's the payload. I trust you know what to do with this."
msgstr "여기 화물이야. 이걸 어떻게 해야 할지 알고 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She passed, but she's at peace now. I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040790
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D96"
msgid "But I can see in your eyes, there are some things that cannot be conveyed with words alone."
msgstr "하지만 네 눈만 봐도, 말만으로는 전할 수 없는 무언가가 있다는 걸 알 수 있구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She passed, but she's at peace now. I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040790
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D95"
msgid "If she is gone, and at rest, then I can only pray that she has found her place among the Promised."
msgstr "손녀가 떠나 안식을 취하고 있다면, 약속받은 자들 사이에서 자기 자리를 찾았기를 기도해야겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: He's left Va'ruun'kai. Likely forever.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimDead
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D94"
msgid "Thank you for telling me."
msgstr "알려주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011D93"
msgid "Thank you again for telling me about Iris. It leaves a hole in my heart, but at least, now I know."
msgstr "아이리스에 대해 말해 줘서 다시 한번 고맙구나. 가슴에 구멍이 뚫린 것 같지만, 그래도... 이제 알게 되었으니."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D92"
msgid "When a petal falls from the venom tree, it is stained by the light of his shimmering scales."
msgstr "맹독 나무에서 꽃잎이 떨어질 때, 반짝이는 뱀의 비늘의 빛으로 물든다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D91"
msgid "And before it touches the ground, it is swept up in the mist of his breath, to remind us all that death is not an end."
msgstr "그리고 땅에 닿기 전에, 뱀의 숨결 안개에 휩쓸려 올라간다. 죽음이 끝이 아님을 우리 모두에게 상기시키기 위해."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D90"
msgid "Rather, it is the beginning. A dance in the darkness, toward the light of the Promised."
msgstr "오히려, 그것은 시작이다. 어둠 속에서 춤추며, 약속받은 자의 빛을 향해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim? &&& Nalada: Really? You'd do that for me?|Oh, you truly are a gift from the Great Serpent. I knew He hadn't forsaken us. 
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, yes. Anything. I promise you'll be compensated for your efforts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010E35E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D8E"
msgid "I'll do anything for anyone, if there's payment involved."
msgstr "보수만 있다면 누구를 위해서든 뭐든지 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll do anything for anyone, if there's payment involved.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do anything for anyone, if there's payment involved.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010E35E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D8D"
msgid "Yes, yes. Anything. I promise you'll be compensated for your efforts."
msgstr "네, 네. 뭐든지요. 당신의 노력에 대한 보상은 약속드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D8C"
msgid "I am not afraid! I am not afraid!"
msgstr "나는 두렵지 않다! 나는 두렵지 않아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D8B"
msgid "Help me, Great Serpent! Weave my blood into yours!"
msgstr "도와주시옵소서. 위대한 뱀이시여! 저의 피를 당신의 피에 수놓으소서!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D89"
msgid "*Pained breathing*"
msgstr "*고통스런 숨소리*"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D88"
msgid "Such strange luminance..."
msgstr "기묘한 빛이로다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D87"
msgid "It all moves before me... like the mist of the venom tree..."
msgstr "모든 것이 내 앞에서 움직인다... 마치 맹독 나무의 안개처럼..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D86"
msgid "Hymns... protect me from madness..."
msgstr "찬송가여... 광기로부터 나를 보호하소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Quoting scripture
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D85"
msgid "When the Shrouding flows upon the galaxy like a river..."
msgstr "장막의 날이 은하를 강처럼 뒤덮을 때..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Quoting scripture
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D84"
msgid "When his venom boils the seas, and the billows crash upon the shore..."
msgstr "그분의 맹독이 바다를 끓이고, 파도가 해안을 덮칠 때..."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D83"
msgid "Whatever my place, I know that as the Promised, I will be granted sanctuary in the morrow."
msgstr "내 위치가 어디든, 약속받은 자로서 내일의 안식처를 보장받을 것임을 알고 있다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011D82"
msgid "When a petal falls from the venom tree, it is stained by the light of his shimmering scales..."
msgstr "맹독 나무에서 꽃잎이 떨어지면, 그분의 빛나는 비늘의 빛으로 물들지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D7D"
msgid "Heretic! You will not leave Jandar's Rest alive!"
msgstr "이단자! 잔다르의 안식처에서 살아서 나갈 수 없을 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D7C"
msgid "You will regret the day you stepped foot on this sacred ground!"
msgstr "이 신성한 땅을 밟은 날을 후회하게 만들어 주마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D7B"
msgid "By Jandar's blade, I will end you!"
msgstr "잔다르의 검으로, 네놈을 끝장내겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D7A"
msgid "Jandar's Rest will be your grave!"
msgstr "잔다르의 안식처가 네놈의 무덤이 될 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D79"
msgid "You will not defile the shrine room, heathen!"
msgstr "이교도 놈, 성소는 더럽힐 수 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3412
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Taunts
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D78"
msgid "Protect the shrine room! Kill the heretic!"
msgstr "성소를 지켜라! 이단자를 죽여라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010E3440
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011D77"
msgid "An intruder! Brothers, show them what we do to heretics!"
msgstr "침입자다! 형제들이여, 이단자들에게 우리의 방식을 보여줘라!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: soundSource: *Humming* &&& soundSource: *Humming*
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E343F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_CompanionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D76"
msgid "That singing... it has a familiar melody. But I can't seem to place it."
msgstr "그 노랫소리... 익숙한 멜로디야. 그게 뭔지 기억이 안 나는군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: soundSource: *Humming* &&& soundSource: *Humming*
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E343F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_CompanionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D75"
msgid "I don't know where, but I feel like I've heard this melody before..."
msgstr "언제부터인지 모르겠지만, 분명 들은 것 같은 멜로디야..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: soundSource: *Humming* &&& soundSource: *Humming*
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E343F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_CompanionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D74"
msgid "This melody... haunting, but somehow familiar."
msgstr "이 멜로디... 잊을 수 없지만 어디선가 들은 것 같단 말이지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: soundSource: *Humming* &&& soundSource: *Humming*
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E343F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_CompanionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D73"
msgid "This song should be creeping me out, but something about it seems gentle..."
msgstr "이 노래를 들으면 소름이 돋는 게 정상일 텐데, 심신이 평온해지는 기분도 들어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3436
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderTakeCover
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderTakeCover
msgctxt "011D70"
msgid "Find cover in his shroud!"
msgstr "그분의 장막 속으로 피하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3436
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderTakeCover
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderTakeCover
msgctxt "011D6F"
msgid "Go! Into his eyes!"
msgstr "가자! 그분의 눈 속으로!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3436
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderTakeCover
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderTakeCover
msgctxt "011D6E"
msgid "Seek cover in his scales!"
msgstr "그분의 비늘 속으로 숨으라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3436
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderTakeCover
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderTakeCover
msgctxt "011D6D"
msgid "Brothers, hide yourself from this beast!"
msgstr "수도사들이여, 이 짐승으로부터 몸을 숨기라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_TakeSuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: TakeSupressiveFire
msgctxt "011D6C"
msgid "My limbs are stone!"
msgstr "내 팔다리가 돌덩이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_TakeSuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: TakeSupressiveFire
msgctxt "011D6B"
msgid "The void comes! I... I cannot move!"
msgstr "공허가 밀려온다! 우... 움직이질 못하겠어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_TakeSuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: TakeSupressiveFire
msgctxt "011D6A"
msgid "The Serpent coils around me! I cannot move!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이 나를 휘감고 있다! 움직일 수 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_TakeSuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: TakeSupressiveFire
msgctxt "011D69"
msgid "I am cornered! The walls are closing in!"
msgstr "궁지에 몰렸다! 벽이 점점 좁혀져 온다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3439
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SuppressiveFire
msgctxt "011D68"
msgid "Let the void flatten the heretic!"
msgstr "이교도를 공허로 짓눌러라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3439
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SuppressiveFire
msgctxt "011D67"
msgid "They cannot move... they are seaweed in the tide..."
msgstr "놈들은 움직일 수 없다... 조류에 휩쓸리는 해조류와 같구나..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3439
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SuppressiveFire
msgctxt "011D66"
msgid "All is broken... even them..."
msgstr "모든 것이 부서졌다... 저들조차도..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3439
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SuppressiveFire
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SuppressiveFire
msgctxt "011D65"
msgid "Accursed... you are trapped..."
msgstr "저주받은 자야... 너는 갇혔다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3437
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderMoveUp
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderMoveUp
msgctxt "011D64"
msgid "Move forward... into the light..."
msgstr "앞으로 나아가라... 빛 속으로..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3437
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderMoveUp
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderMoveUp
msgctxt "011D63"
msgid "I see it... almost there... the truth..."
msgstr "보인다... 거의 다 왔어... 진실이..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3437
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderMoveUp
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderMoveUp
msgctxt "011D62"
msgid "The path forward is the path of Jinan!"
msgstr "앞으로 나아가는 길은 지난의 길이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3437
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderMoveUp
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderMoveUp
msgctxt "011D61"
msgid "Go! Push into the void!"
msgstr "가라! 공허 속으로 돌진하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3438
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Reload
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Reload
msgctxt "011D60"
msgid "Bless my weapon with your strength, Great Serpent!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저의 무장에 위력을 더하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3438
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Reload
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Reload
msgctxt "011D5F"
msgid "I become renewed, and fight once more!"
msgstr "새로워져 다시 싸우리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3438
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Reload
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Reload
msgctxt "011D5E"
msgid "The void saps my strength!"
msgstr "공허가 내 힘을 앗아간다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3438
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Reload
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Reload
msgctxt "011D5D"
msgid "Protect me Serpent as I replenish myself..."
msgstr "제가 회복하는 동안 저를 지켜주소서, 위대한 뱀이시여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3438
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Reload
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Reload
msgctxt "011D5C"
msgid "For his bite was thrice renewed..."
msgstr "그분의 이빨은 세 번 새로워졌으니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D5B"
msgid "Am I penitent? Am I dust?"
msgstr "나는 회개하고 있는가? 나는 티끌일 뿐인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D5A"
msgid "There are so many of them! Kill them all!"
msgstr "녀석들이 너무 많도다! 모두 죽여버려라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D59"
msgid "I see his fangs! I see his eyes!"
msgstr "그분의 송곳니가 보인다! 그분의 눈이 보인다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D58"
msgid "Guide me! Draw me from this endless void!"
msgstr "저를 인도하소서! 이 끝없는 공허에서 저를 이끌어주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D57"
msgid "I hear Jinan! I hear him calling me!"
msgstr "지난 님의 목소리가 들린다! 그분이 나를 부르는 소리가 들린다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D56"
msgid "Great Serpent! Lead me to the Promised!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 저를 약속받은 자가 되게 하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D55"
msgid "This is His trial! This is my purpose!"
msgstr "그분이 시험하시는 도다! 이에 나는 결의하노라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D54"
msgid "Waves upon waves! Jinan guide me!"
msgstr "파도 위의 파도로다! 지난 님이 나를 인도하시리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D53"
msgid "His scales! His bite!"
msgstr "그분의 비늘이로다! 그분이 무시는구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D52"
msgid "It comes from the void!"
msgstr "그것은 공허에서 왔노라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D51"
msgid "Save me, Serpent! Let my soul be woven into your scales!"
msgstr "저를 구원하소서. 뱀이시여! 제 영혼이 당신의 비늘에 수 놓이게 해주시옵소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fighting your own mind as much as you are fighting the player / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D50"
msgid "Eaargh!"
msgstr "이야아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4F"
msgid "My blood is venom! My eyes are blind!"
msgstr "내 피는 맹독이니! 내 눈은 멀었도다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4E"
msgid "He commands me! I hear him!"
msgstr "그분이 내게 명하신다! 그분의 목소리가 들리는구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4D"
msgid "Great Serpent, protect me from this darkness!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 이 어둠으로부터 저를 지켜주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4C"
msgid "I am Promised! I am still here!"
msgstr "나는 약속받은 자니라! 나는 아직 이 세상에 있도다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4B"
msgid "I see his truth! I feel his pain!"
msgstr "그분의 진실이 보인다! 그분의 고통이 느껴진다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D4A"
msgid "I cross his timeless scales to find you!"
msgstr "저는 당신을 찾기 위해 그분의 영원한 저울 위에 오를 것입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko is consumed by the Vortex, never to return. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LC06_01_AnaskoDeathMarker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage1275_AnaskoDies
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011D49"
msgid "Aaargh!"
msgstr "아아아악!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D48"
msgid "The Shrouding is upon us all!"
msgstr "장막의 날이 다가오고 있도다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fighting your own mind as much as you are fighting the player / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D47"
msgid "Nyaaaargh!"
msgstr "아아아악!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D45"
msgid "Jinan is his mouth! He speaks my truth!"
msgstr "지난 님은 그분의 입이도다! 그분은 진실을 대변하시니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D44"
msgid "Great Serpent, save me from this horror!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 이 공포에서 저를 구해주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D42"
msgid "Gaze into his eyes! Let death wash over us all!"
msgstr "그분의 눈을 바라보아라! 죽음이 우리 모두를 씻어내게 하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3435
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFlank
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFlank
msgctxt "011D41"
msgid "We must flank the demon!"
msgstr "악마의 측면을 공격해야 한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3435
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFlank
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFlank
msgctxt "011D40"
msgid "Follow the shimmering scales!"
msgstr "반짝이는 비늘을 따르라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3435
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFlank
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFlank
msgctxt "011D3F"
msgid "Give them no cover! Let the rains fall on the dead!"
msgstr "놈들에게 엄폐물을 주지 마라! 시체 위에 장대비를 내려라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3435
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFlank
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFlank
msgctxt "011D3E"
msgid "Great Serpent, let us surround him in your scales!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저희가 그분을 당신의 비늘로 에워싸게 하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_ThrowGrenade
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ThrowGrenade
msgctxt "011D3D"
msgid "I will deliver his judgment!"
msgstr "그분의 심판을 내리리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_ThrowGrenade
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ThrowGrenade
msgctxt "011D3C"
msgid "It rains fire and blood!"
msgstr "불과 피가 비처럼 쏟아진다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_ThrowGrenade
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ThrowGrenade
msgctxt "011D3B"
msgid "I spit his venom!"
msgstr "그분의 맹독을 뱉어주마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3434
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFallback
msgctxt "011D3A"
msgid "Retreat to the darkness!"
msgstr "어둠 속으로 퇴각하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3434
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFallback
msgctxt "011D39"
msgid "Fall back, into his maw..."
msgstr "물러서라, 그분의 아가리 속으로..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3434
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFallback
msgctxt "011D38"
msgid "We must all move! All into the land of the Promised!"
msgstr "모두 움직여야 한다! 모두 약속받은 자의 땅으로!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3434
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFallback
msgctxt "011D37"
msgid "Brothers, find the sea! Hide in its waters!"
msgstr "수도사들이여, 바다를 찾아라! 그 물속에 숨으라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3434
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OrderFallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OrderFallback
msgctxt "011D36"
msgid "We are fading..."
msgstr "우리는 사라져가고 있다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D35"
msgid "Argh! It devours me!"
msgstr "아악! 날 집어삼키는구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D34"
msgid "My sins are upon me!"
msgstr "내 죄가 나를 덮친다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D33"
msgid "The void is striking me!"
msgstr "공허가 나를 공격한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D32"
msgid "Ugh! What are you?"
msgstr "윽! 너는 뭐냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D31"
msgid "Agh! The venom, it burns!"
msgstr "아! 맹독이, 타오른다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D30"
msgid "Ugh! Why have you forsaken me!"
msgstr "윽! 왜 저를 버리셨나이까!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D2F"
msgid "Pain... it comes for me!"
msgstr "고통이... 나에게 다가온다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: You are hit, but don't know by what, as you're trapped in this void space / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D2E"
msgid "Gah! What manner of heretic are you?"
msgstr "윽! 도대체 어떤 이단자냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D2D"
msgid "Brethren, I am in blood! I am venom!"
msgstr "교우들이여. 나는 피를 흘리고 있노라! 나는 맹독이니라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3433
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_OnHitGeneric
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011D2C"
msgid "My insides... bursting!"
msgstr "내 속이... 터져 나간다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011D2B"
msgid "Its song! I hear it in my skull!"
msgstr "그 노래다! 내 두개골속에서 들려!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3432
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_FleeToAlly
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D2A"
msgid "Help me! Help!"
msgstr "도와줘! 제발!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3432
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_FleeToAlly
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D29"
msgid "My Brothers, where are you?"
msgstr "수도사들이여, 어디 계십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3432
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_FleeToAlly
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D28"
msgid "Brothers, I sense you near! Help me!"
msgstr "수도사들이여, 가까이 계신 게 느껴집니다! 도와주십시오!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3432
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Flee
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D27"
msgid "I cannot be made dust, not now..."
msgstr "지금은 안 돼, 먼지가 될 수 없어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3432
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Flee
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D26"
msgid "The Great Serpent has forsaken us!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이 우릴 버렸어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1BA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_Flee
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Flee
msgctxt "011D25"
msgid "We've failed the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "우리가 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 거역했다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3431
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "011D24"
msgid "It comes!"
msgstr "온다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3431
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "011D23"
msgid "Serpent protect me from malice!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 악의로부터 저를 보호하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3431
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "011D22"
msgid "I see it! I fear it!"
msgstr "보인다! 두렵다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3431
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "011D21"
msgid "It comes to devour!"
msgstr "잡아먹으러 온다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3431
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AvoidThreat
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AvoidThreat
msgctxt "011D20"
msgid "It's here!"
msgstr "여기 있다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Curious
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Curious
msgctxt "011D1F"
msgid "Something approaches... but with what intent?"
msgstr "무언가 다가온다... 무슨 속셈이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Curious
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Curious
msgctxt "011D1E"
msgid "What are you?"
msgstr "너는 뭐냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Curious
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Curious
msgctxt "011D1D"
msgid "Where have we found ourselves, stranger?"
msgstr "여긴 어디지, 낯선 자여?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Curious
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Curious
msgctxt "011D1C"
msgid "Our purpose... lost..."
msgstr "우리의 목적이... 사라졌다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3430
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Fallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Fallback
msgctxt "011D1B"
msgid "Great Serpent, guide us back!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저희를 인도하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3430
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Fallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Fallback
msgctxt "011D1A"
msgid "This threat... I cannot see it!"
msgstr "이 위협은... 보이지 않아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3430
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Fallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Fallback
msgctxt "011D19"
msgid "It's all around us! We must retreat!"
msgstr "사방에 있다! 후퇴해야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3430
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_Fallback
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Fallback
msgctxt "011D18"
msgid "Its call... we must heed it! We must run!"
msgstr "저것이 부른다... 들어야 해! 도망쳐야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Torso
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D17"
msgid "The air is gone! I can't breathe!"
msgstr "공기가 없어! 숨을 쉴 수가 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Torso
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D16"
msgid "The oxygen is missing!"
msgstr "산소가 부족해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Torso
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D15"
msgid "Help! Pain in my chest! It must be a bomb!"
msgstr "도와줘! 가슴이 아파! 폭탄인가 봐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Head
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D14"
msgid "My eyes! It devours my eyes!"
msgstr "내 눈! 내 눈을 갉아먹는다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Head
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D13"
msgid "My mind! Get out of my mind!"
msgstr "내 정신! 내 정신에서 나가!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Head
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D12"
msgid "Agggh! Its words invade my mind!"
msgstr "아악! 놈의 말이 내 정신을 침범한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Arm
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D11"
msgid "I've lost feeling in my arms!"
msgstr "팔에 감각이 사라졌어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Arm
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D10"
msgid "My arms! It comes for my arms!"
msgstr "내 팔! 팔에 맞았어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Arm
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D0F"
msgid "My hands, I can't feel my hands!"
msgstr "내 손! 손에 감각이 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Leg
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D0E"
msgid "My legs are missing! Someone help!"
msgstr "다리가 사라졌어! 누가 도와줘!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Leg
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D0D"
msgid "Jinan pray for me! I can't feel my legs!"
msgstr "지난이시여. 굽어살피소서! 다리에 감각이 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CrippledLimb_Leg
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CrippledLimb
msgctxt "011D0C"
msgid "It's gotten my foot! Let go you foul monster!"
msgstr "내 발을 잡았어! 놓아라, 이 더러운 괴물아!"

# EDID: [010E3512], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011D0B"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

# EDID: [010E3513], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011D0A"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

# EDID: [010E3514], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011D09"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

# EDID: [010E3515], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011D08"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

# EDID: [010E3516], REC: INFO:NAM1
msgctxt "011D07"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011D06"
msgid "Lament for the lost!"
msgstr "떠난 이를 애도하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011D05"
msgid "Fates... cruel..."
msgstr "잔인한... 운명이여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011D04"
msgid "Anguish for the dead!"
msgstr "망자 앞에 비통할지어다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011D03"
msgid "Mourn the fallen!"
msgstr "망자를 애도할지어다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E342B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011D02"
msgid "The beast has taken our Brother!"
msgstr "짐승이 우리 수도사를 잡아갔다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011D01"
msgid "Who is there? What is there?"
msgstr "누구 있나? 거기 누구냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011D00"
msgid "I cannot find them! Is this the creeping doubt?"
msgstr "찾을 수가 없어! 이게 기어들어오는 의심인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFF"
msgid "Someone was here! Yet I am blind! I am faithless!"
msgstr "누군가 여기 있었어! 그런데도 난 장님이야! 난 믿음이 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFE"
msgid "We are not alone..."
msgstr "우린 혼자가 아니야..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFD"
msgid "Someone is here! Great Serpent, are they friend or foe?"
msgstr "누군가 여기 있다! 위대한 뱀이시여, 아군입니까, 적군입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFC"
msgid "We are being stalked! Even here, in the nothing."
msgstr "우리를 미행하고 있다! 심지어 여기서도, 아무것도 없는 곳에서도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFB"
msgid "Dead among us. Have we lost our faith?"
msgstr "우리 중에 죽은 자가 있다. 우리가 신앙을 잃은 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CFA"
msgid "To die in the void, as Promised... an ill omen."
msgstr "공허 속에서 죽다니, 약속받은 자로서... 불길한 징조로다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CF9"
msgid "Someone must pay for this!"
msgstr "누군가 대가를 치러야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CF8"
msgid "A death among us. We must find this deliverer..."
msgstr "우리 중에 죽은 자가 있다. 이 구원자를 찾아야 한다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CF7"
msgid "A Promised has fallen. Is this real, or madness?"
msgstr "약속받은 자가 쓰러졌다. 이게 현실인가, 아니면 광기인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3425
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToLost_DetectedCorpse
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToLost
msgctxt "011CF6"
msgid "I see a body, but I cannot divine if it is real..."
msgstr "시체가 보이지만, 진짜인지 알 수가 없다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3424
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF5"
msgid "What? I heard a disturbance..."
msgstr "뭐야? 뭔가 소란스러운데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF4"
msgid "Jinan's breath... what was that?"
msgstr "지난의 숨결이시여... 방금 뭐였지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3424
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF3"
msgid "What was that? Was that here... or there?"
msgstr "방금 뭐였지? 여기였나... 아니면 저기인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF2"
msgid "Something's amiss..."
msgstr "뭔가 잘못됐어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3424
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF1"
msgid "Did you hear something? Are you still there?"
msgstr "뭐 들었어? 아직 거기 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3424
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CF0"
msgid "Is this real? I think... I think something is here with us..."
msgstr "이게 진짜인가? 내 생각엔... 우리랑 뭔가 같이 있는 것 같아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3424
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToAlert
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToAlert
msgctxt "011CEF"
msgid "You heard that as well, yes? I am not imagining things?"
msgstr "너도 들었지, 그렇지? 내가 상상하는 게 아니지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CEE"
msgid "I lost them in the eye of the void..."
msgstr "공허의 눈 속에서 그들을 놓쳤다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CED"
msgid "My mind plays tricks. Were they ever there?"
msgstr "내 정신이 장난을 치는구나. 그들이 거기 있기는 했던가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CEC"
msgid "What was seen has gone. Mist of the venom tree..."
msgstr "보았던 것이 사라졌다. 맹독 나무의 안개여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CEB"
msgid "Was I seeing things? I must chant the hymns to ground myself."
msgstr "내가 헛것을 본 건가? 정신을 가다듬으려면 찬송가를 외워야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CEA"
msgid "My eyes are washed in darkness. I have sought them, but lost them."
msgstr "내 눈이 어둠으로 씻겼다. 그들을 찾았지만, 놓쳐버렸다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CE9"
msgid "I have lost the offering. I have failed you, Great Serpent."
msgstr "제물을 잃었다. 당신을 실망시켰습니다, 위대한 뱀이시여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CE8"
msgid "I have lost them. Does judgment come for me now?"
msgstr "그들을 놓쳤다. 이제 내게 심판이 내려지는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3423
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011CE7"
msgid "The offering escapes. Great Serpent forgive my sins."
msgstr "제물이 도망친다. 위대한 뱀이시여, 제 죄를 용서하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE6"
msgid "It returns!"
msgstr "돌아온다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE5"
msgid "Judgment at last!"
msgstr "드디어 심판의 때다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE4"
msgid "The Great Serpent delivers you to me!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 내게 보내셨다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE3"
msgid "The Shrouding is inevitable!"
msgstr "장막의 날은 인에비터블이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE2"
msgid "You will know true pain, as I have!"
msgstr "너도 진정한 고통을 맛보게 될 것이다, 나처럼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE1"
msgid "It is time!"
msgstr "때가 되었다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CE0"
msgid "The ghost manifests!"
msgstr "유령의 물품 목록이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3422
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011CDF"
msgid "It has reappeared!"
msgstr "다시 나타났다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CDE"
msgid "I have lost them... does judgment come for me?"
msgstr "그들을 놓쳤다... 이제 내게 심판이 내려지는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CDD"
msgid "I can feel your sin... I will find you!"
msgstr "네 죄가 느껴진다... 반드시 찾아내겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CDC"
msgid "Where have you gone, ghost?"
msgstr "어디로 간 거지, 유령?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CDB"
msgid "I am blind, I have lost them! Serpent, bring them into the light!"
msgstr "나는 장님이다, 그들을 놓쳤다! 위대한 뱀이시여, 그들을 빛으로 인도하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CDA"
msgid "They have vanished... is this the Shrouding, come at last?"
msgstr "그들이 사라졌다... 이게 마침내 도래한 장막의 날인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CD9"
msgid "Time flows away from me... I cannot see what I had seen."
msgstr "시간이 나에게서 흘러간다... 내가 보았던 것을 볼 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CD8"
msgid "The ghost disappears into the darkness..."
msgstr "유령이 어둠 속으로 사라진다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CD7"
msgid "I had seen the ghost of heresy, but it flickers and fades..."
msgstr "이단의 유령을 보았지만, 깜빡이며 사라져 간다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3421
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011CD6"
msgid "What does it mean, for one to escape his judgment so easily?"
msgstr "심판을 이토록 쉽게 피하는 것이 무슨 의미인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD5"
msgid "I see a mirage of the future! A Promised will fall!"
msgstr "미래의 신기루가 보인다! 약속받은 자가 쓰러지리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD4"
msgid "Is this real? Has the Great Serpent been defied?"
msgstr "이게 진짜인가? 위대한 뱀께서 거역당하신 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD3"
msgid "I see death... fractures in the distance... is this body one of the Promised?"
msgstr "죽음이 보인다... 저 멀리 균열이... 이 시신은 약속받은 자 중 하나인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD2"
msgid "What? Do my eyes deceive me?"
msgstr "뭐지? 내 눈이 나를 속이는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD1"
msgid "I see a spectral silhouette... a corpse... is it here, in the now?"
msgstr "유령 같은 실루엣이 보인다... 시체다... 지금, 여기에 있는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3420
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011CD0"
msgid "By the Serpent! What does this mean? Is it a sign?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 이름으로! 이게 무슨 뜻이지? 징조인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CCE"
msgid "All are dead, yet I hear no peace."
msgstr "모두 죽었지만, 평화는 들리지 않아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CCD"
msgid "The fighting has stopped, but my mind knows no quiet."
msgstr "싸움은 멈췄지만, 내 마음은 고요를 모른다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CCC"
msgid "I see the offering has been given, but my mind stirs with pain..."
msgstr "제물이 바쳐진 것을 보지만, 내 마음은 고통으로 요동친다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CCB"
msgid "Feast Great Serpent, but grant us mercy, for we are lost."
msgstr "배불리 드소서, 위대한 뱀이시여. 하지만 저희에게 자비를 베푸소서, 저희는 길을 잃었나이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CCA"
msgid "Truth has been delivered, but where from?"
msgstr "진실이 전해졌지만, 어디서부터?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011CC9"
msgid "Great Serpent, your will is done. Return us to the living!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 당신의 뜻이 이루어졌나이다. 저희를 산 자들에게로 돌려보내소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC8"
msgid "What was here... gone? What does it mean?"
msgstr "여기 있던 게... 사라졌다고? 무슨 의미지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC7"
msgid "Where did they go? Are we blind? Are we faithless?"
msgstr "어디로 간 거지? 우리가 눈이 먼 건가? 우리가 믿음이 없는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC6"
msgid "Doubt has set upon me, Brothers!"
msgstr "의심이 나를 덮쳤다, 수도사들이여!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC5"
msgid "We cannot see! What is happening to us?"
msgstr "볼 수가 없다! 우리에게 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC4"
msgid "Come back and face me, ghost!"
msgstr "돌아와서 나랑 맞서라, 유령!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC3"
msgid "You will know truth, coward!"
msgstr "진실을 알아라, 겁쟁아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC2"
msgid "Run from me, will you?!"
msgstr "내게서 도망칠 수 있을 것 같나?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011CC1"
msgid "The Serpent will have you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 거두실 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011CC0"
msgid "I saw it! I saw it! Why is it gone!"
msgstr "봤어! 봤다고! 왜 사라진 거지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011CBF"
msgid "What was there... now lost..."
msgstr "거기 있던 것이... 이제는 사라졌어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011CBE"
msgid "It was there! I swear it! In the folds between space..."
msgstr "거기 있었어! 맹세해! 공간 사이의 주름 속에..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011CBD"
msgid "Great Serpent, calm me... I see what cannot be unseen..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저를 진정시키소서... 보아서는 안 될 것을 보고 말았나이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341D
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011CBC"
msgid "Was nothing there? Or is my mind lost?"
msgstr "아무것도 없었던 건가? 아니면 내 정신이 길을 잃은 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CBB"
msgid "The hymns bring us another heretic!"
msgstr "찬가가 또 다른 이단자로 이끄는구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CBA"
msgid "I see a break in the void!"
msgstr "공허에 틈이 보인다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB9"
msgid "I can sense your existence in the void!"
msgstr "공허 속의 네 존재가 느껴지는구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB8"
msgid "The Serpent demands a hunt!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 사냥을 요구하신다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB7"
msgid "My mind sees a disturbance in the void!"
msgstr "내 마음이 공허 속의 균열을 감지한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB6"
msgid "The fabric is broken! A trespasser exists!"
msgstr "구조가 무너졌다! 침입자가 있어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB5"
msgid "I sense you, heathen! Behold the Serpent's wrath!"
msgstr "네가 느껴진다, 불신자! 위대한 뱀의 분노를 마주해라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB4"
msgid "Brothers! I call upon the unseen! Banish the heretic!"
msgstr "수도사들이여! 보이지 않는 자에게 명하노니! 이교도를 추방하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB3"
msgid "Brothers! Let us make dust of the intruder!"
msgstr "수도사들이여! 침입자를 먼지로 만들어 버리자!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3426
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "011CB2"
msgid "Timeless Serpent, make us whole, so that we may deliver your justice!"
msgstr "영원한 뱀이시여, 저희를 온전하게 하시어 당신의 심판을 내릴 수 있게 하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CB1"
msgid "Something there, in front of me!"
msgstr "뭔가 있다, 내 앞에!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CB0"
msgid "I hear something! What's there?"
msgstr "무슨 소리가 들린다! 뭐가 있는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CAF"
msgid "I sense a presence!"
msgstr "존재가 느껴진다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CAE"
msgid "What manner of soul are you?"
msgstr "어떤 영혼이냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CAC"
msgid "My brothers, something approaches!"
msgstr "수도사들이여, 무언가 다가오고 있다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011CAB"
msgid "A heretic! Here!"
msgstr "이단자다! 저기 있다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CAA"
msgid "I sense a disturbance..."
msgstr "뭔가 이상한 기운이 느껴져..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_AlertIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA9"
msgid "I sense their eyes upon me..."
msgstr "그들의 시선이 느껴진다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_AlertIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA8"
msgid "Great Serpent... where is the source?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 근원이 어디입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_AlertIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA7"
msgid "What was heard, is unheard..."
msgstr "들었던 것이, 들리지 않게 되었다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantoms_AlertIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA6"
msgid "I walk amongst the scales... hunting, longing..."
msgstr "비늘 사이를 걷는다... 사냥하며, 갈망하며..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA5"
msgid "Great Serpent... reveal what I cannot see..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 제게 보이지 않는 것을 보여주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA4"
msgid "Something is there..."
msgstr "뭔가 있어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA3"
msgid "Something lurks in the distance..."
msgstr "저 멀리 무언가 숨어있다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA2"
msgid "Walk... and discover..."
msgstr "걸어가라... 그리고 발견하라..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_SuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "011CA1"
msgid "The Great Serpent hungers..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 굶주리셨다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011CA0"
msgid "We stalk in his name..."
msgstr "우리는 그분의 이름으로 추적한다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E341B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011C9F"
msgid "I will see the unseen..."
msgstr "보이지 않는 것을 보리라..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C9C"
msgid "The Shrouding comes for us. There is no escape."
msgstr "장막의 날이 우리에게 다가온다. 피할 곳은 없다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C8E"
msgid "Am I an offering? Am I not one of the Promised?"
msgstr "내가 제물인가? 나는 약속받은 자가 아닌가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C8D"
msgid "I must follow his glimmer..."
msgstr "그분의 희미한 빛을 따라야 한다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C8C"
msgid "Is this his curse?"
msgstr "이것이 그분의 저주인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C8B"
msgid "Will I be made dust too?"
msgstr "나 또한 먼지가 될 것인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "011C8A"
msgid "His fangs are endless voids..."
msgstr "그분의 송곳니는 끝없는 공허로다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C89"
msgid "My mind... fractured..."
msgstr "내 정신이... 산산조각 났다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C88"
msgid "Treading... a sea of insanity..."
msgstr "걷는다... 광기의 바다를..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C87"
msgid "Everything is fragments... a kaleidoscopic eye..."
msgstr "모든 것이 파편이다... 만화경의 눈처럼..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C86"
msgid "The screeching! The hissing!"
msgstr "날카로운 소리! 치직거림!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C85"
msgid "The scales! Its blinding shimmer!"
msgstr "비늘! 눈부신 반짝임!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C84"
msgid "He sinks his fangs into me... I am eaten!"
msgstr "그분이 나에게 송곳니를 박는다... 나는 먹히고 있다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C83"
msgid "I do not see! I do not see!"
msgstr "보이지 않아! 보이지 않는다고!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E343B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PhantomTaunt
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C82"
msgid "*Pained breathing*"
msgstr "*고통스런 숨소리*"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C81"
msgid "We are lost. Walking the endless void..."
msgstr "우리는 길을 잃었다. 끝없는 공허를 걷고 있다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C80"
msgid "Great Serpent, have you forsaken us?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저희를 버리셨나이까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C7F"
msgid "The Shrouding comes..."
msgstr "장막의 날이 다가온다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C7E"
msgid "Cannot think... cannot see..."
msgstr "생각할 수 없다... 볼 수 없다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C7D"
msgid "His judgement weighs upon me..."
msgstr "그분의 심판이 나를 짓누른다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C7C"
msgid "Walking the endless void..."
msgstr "끝없는 공허를 걷는다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericPhantom
#. TOPIC: 010E3419
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Phantom_SharedInfos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C7B"
msgid "Is this the end of all things?"
msgstr "이게 모든 것의 끝인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_Redeemed01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunRedeemed
#. TOPIC: 010E2EF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Redeemed_Shared_Idle
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C78"
msgid "Repent..."
msgstr "회개하라..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Music from music box / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011C77"
msgid "*Humming*"
msgstr "*흥얼거림*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pained, deformed laughter
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_Redeemed01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunRedeemed
#. TOPIC: 010E2EF8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Redeemed_Shared_Idle
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011C76"
msgid "Aghahahaha!"
msgstr "아가하하하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5F"
msgid "I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it."
msgstr "댐 인증 카드를 갖고 있으시죠. 그게 필요한데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5E"
msgid "No offense, but it is not your property."
msgstr "나쁜 뜻은 아닌데, 당신 물건이 아니잖아요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5D"
msgid "The ownership of the card is far less important than its use."
msgstr "카드 소유권은 용도보다 훨씬 덜 중요한 문제에요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5C"
msgid "Philosophically speaking, do we really ever own anything? Maybe our thoughts or actions, but we're all just matter and energy in transitory states."
msgstr ""
"철학적으로 말하자면, 우리가 정말 뭔가를 소유했을까요? 어쩌면 우리 생각이나 행동은 일시적인 상태의 물질과 에너지에 불과할지도 모르죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5B"
msgid "Not to turn this into a finger-pointing contest, but... It's not really yours either, is it?"
msgstr "삿대질 경연대회를 하려는 건 아니지만... 딱히 그쪽 물건도 아닐 텐데요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C5A"
msgid "Would it be more accurate to say that we'd simply like to borrow it? We could return it in short order."
msgstr "그냥 빌리고 싶다는 말이 더 정확할 것 같은데요? 금방 돌려드릴 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Manipulation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C59"
msgid "Just imagine. You could be known throughout House Va'ruun as the man who saved Dazra."
msgstr "상상해 봐요. 바룬 가문 전체에 다즈라를 구한 남자로 알려지게 될 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use. &&& Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not sure I see the point.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C58"
msgid "I really need that card, and I'd like to think we can talk this out."
msgstr "그 카드가 정말로 필요해서 그러는데, 서로 얘기 좀 해 보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Were you planning on telling anyone you had a card for the dam?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Were you planning on telling anyone you had a card for the dam?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C57"
msgid "If Security came looking for it, or someone from the Speaker's office, yes of course I would tell them."
msgstr "경비대에서 찾으러 온다거나 대변자님 집무실에서 누가 오면, 당연히 말해야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C56"
msgid "Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities."
msgstr "그렇다고 해도, 당국에 제대로 넘겨줘야 한다고 생각해서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: confused, but moving past it / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C55"
msgid "Erm, I... I do not see that how that changes the situation. I am simply trying to ensure that this is returned to the proper authorities."
msgstr "어, 그... 그게 상황을 어떻게 바꾼다는 건지 모르겠는데요. 난 그냥 당국에 제대로 반납하려고 갖고 있는 거라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C54"
msgid "No, it is not mine. But I am intent on making sure it is safeguarded until it can be returned to the proper authorities."
msgstr "네. 내 물건 아니죠. 그래도 당국에 제대로 반납할 때까지는 안전하게 보관해 둘 생각이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C53"
msgid "I appreciate the clarification, but I think it best that I hold onto it until it can be returned."
msgstr "설명해 주신 건 감사하지만, 반납할 수 있을 때까지 갖고 있는 게 제일 좋을 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Manipulation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C52"
msgid "It would be nice to be recognized for something, after all this time..."
msgstr "드디어 뭔가 인정받는다면 좋기는 하겠네요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Manipulation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C51"
msgid "I am not doing this for attention."
msgstr "관심받으려고 이러는 거 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C50"
msgid "I only want to do the right thing."
msgstr "나도 옳은 일을 하고 싶어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4F"
msgid "It has been weeks, and nothing else has happened. We should not assume."
msgstr "몇 주나 지났는데 그 뒤로 아무 일 없었어요. 그런 식으로 가정하면 안 되죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use. &&& Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If Security came looking for it, or someone from the Speaker's office, yes of course I would tell them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4E"
msgid "Were you planning on telling anyone you had a card for the dam?"
msgstr "댐 인증 카드를 갖고 있다고 누군가한테 말할 생각이었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4D"
msgid "It did seem important, to warrant a visit from the Speaker."
msgstr "중요해 보이기는 했어요. 대변자님이 직접 찾아올 정도였으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4C"
msgid "You do not even know whether it is really necessary?"
msgstr "정말 필요한 물건인지도 모른다는 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4B"
msgid "Dazra may be running out of time."
msgstr "다즈라에 남은 시간이 얼마 없을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I really need that card, and I'd like to think we can talk this out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I really need that card, and I'd like to think we can talk this out.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: All right, fine. Take it. Just... If there is a reward or something for it, share it with me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C4A"
msgid "I am not sure I see the point."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 잘 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Negotiation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C49"
msgid "Yes, they would understand how loyal we have been."
msgstr "네, 우리가 얼마나 충실했는지 알게 되겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Negotiation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C48"
msgid "But they might be unhappy I had not reported it immediately."
msgstr "바로 보고하지 않았다고 문제 삼을지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C47"
msgid "Handing it over is the best course of action right now."
msgstr "지금은 카드를 넘겨주는 게 최선의 방법이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C46"
msgid "I know you want to do the right thing."
msgstr "당신도 옳은 일을 하고 싶잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C45"
msgid "You're not going to get another chance like this to help your people."
msgstr "이렇게 신민들을 도울 수 있는 기회는 다시 오지 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why haven't you already turned it over?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why haven't you already turned it over?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: "All Must Serve, and right now this is how you serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C44"
msgid "Well, there are clearly more important things for the people of Dazra to deal with right now..."
msgstr "그야, 지금 당장은 다즈라 신민들이 더 중요한 문제를 해결해야 할 테니까요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Negotiation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C43"
msgid "When the House of Commerce knows you assisted me, it might be profitable for the farm in the future."
msgstr "절 도와준 일을 상무성에서 알게 되면, 나중에 농장에 이득이 있을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand you have an access card for the dam. I need it. &&& Kaviil: No offense, but it is not your property. &&& companion: The ownership of the card is far less important than its use. &&& Kaviil: Be that as it may, I feel it should be turned over to the proper authorities.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, there are clearly more important things for the people of Dazra to deal with right now...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_KaviilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C42"
msgid "Why haven't you already turned it over?"
msgstr "왜 아직 반납하지 않은 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C41"
msgid "If you're so intent on holding on to it, some might think you planned on using it yourself."
msgstr "카드를 계속 가지고 있으면, 당신이 그걸 써먹으려 한다고 생각하는 사람이 나올 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C40"
msgid "No, that is not true. I have no interest in going in there!"
msgstr "아니, 절대 아니에요. 거기 들어갈 생각도 없다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3F"
msgid "No, it would be understood that I was protecting House Va'ruun."
msgstr "아니죠. 내가 바룬 가문을 보호하는 거라고 생각하겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3E"
msgid "Maybe you are right."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3D"
msgid "I would not want my inaction to make things worse."
msgstr "나도 가만히 있으면서 상황을 악화시키긴 싫어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3C"
msgid "I understand what you are saying."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 알겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3B"
msgid "I refuse to make hasty decisions."
msgstr "성급하게 결정하진 않겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C3A"
msgid "If it is so important, someone in charge will come for it."
msgstr "정말 중요한 거였으면 담당자가 찾으러 오겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Repeating01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_Kaviil_SC_Repeat01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C39"
msgid "I am only doing what is right."
msgstr "난 옳은 일을 하려는 것 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010DFA44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage410_Kaviil_SC_Misc02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011C38"
msgid "This might be a dead end, but there's only one way to know for sure."
msgstr "이런 말까지 하긴 뭐하지만, 확실히 알 방법은 하나 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C37"
msgid "You will not defy the Speaker!"
msgstr "대변자를 거역할 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C36"
msgid "You cannot win!"
msgstr "넌 못 이긴다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C35"
msgid "You are a fool to stand against us!"
msgstr "우리와 맞서다니, 바보로구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C34"
msgid "Our victory is inevitable!"
msgstr "우리의 승리는 필연이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C33"
msgid "You will fall!"
msgstr "너는 쓰러질 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C32"
msgid "There is no chance for you!"
msgstr "너에게 기회는 없을 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010E0BDD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ05_TauntPhantomsGroup
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "011C31"
msgid "The Great Serpent demands obedience!"
