#. SCRIPT NOTES: You're in pain, injured. The player has stopped talking and you're getting impatient, wishing they'd hurry up and help to heal you  / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925B
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010DDA42
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "011BF3"
msgid "Are you going to help me or not?"
msgstr "절 도와줄 건가요? 아니면 그냥 갈 건가요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I know better than to argue, but now we're severely understaffed.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DEF30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BF2"
msgid "I hate to spend less time with grandpa, given he's always forgetting things, but the children need me."
msgstr "할아버지와 함께 보낼 시간이 줄어드는  싫다. 항상 깜빡깜빡하시는데 어쩌지. 하지만 아이들도 보살펴야 한다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): One of the helpers was taken away last night. They accused him of heresy.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I hate to spend less time with grandpa, given he's always forgetting things, but the children need me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DEF2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BF1"
msgid "I know better than to argue, but now we're severely understaffed."
msgstr "함부로 이 결정에 항의하면 안 된다는 건 알고 있지만, 지금 심각하게 인력이 부족하다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well I don't put it there on purpose! I'm in the living room, and I need some place to put things, and it sort of happens.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0103EFE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BF0"
msgid "And don't get me started on the stuff in the cookpit!"
msgstr "조리대에 올려둔 물건들도 따로 말 안해도 아시겠죠?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& ...  &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage! &&& Vassilis: A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case.|From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem. &&& Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You and Vassilis are the same it seems. Lacking confidence because you lack experience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010DEF34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BEE"
msgid "I don't know if I can be of much help."
msgstr "도움이 될 수 있을지 잘 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. PROMPT: I don't know if I can be of much help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know if I can be of much help. &&& Breanne: You and Vassilis are the same it seems. Lacking confidence because you lack experience.|Well, if you provide assistance here, you will get both!
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010DEF32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BED"
msgid "I may not believe in myself, but for what it's worth, I believe in our friend here."
msgstr "저 자신은 믿음직스럽지 못할지 몰라도, 제가 보기엔 여기 있는 우리 친구분은 믿을만하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know if I can be of much help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know if I can be of much help.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010DEF31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BEC"
msgid "You and Vassilis are the same it seems. Lacking confidence because you lack experience."
msgstr "당신이나 바실리스나 둘 다 비슷해 보이는군요. 경험이 부족해서 자신감도 떨어진 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know if I can be of much help.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: I may not believe in myself, but for what it's worth, I believe in our friend here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010DEF31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BEB"
msgid "Well, if you provide assistance here, you will get both!"
msgstr "음, 여기서 도와주신다면 경험과 자신감 둘 다 얻게 될 거예요!"

#. PROMPT: I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours. &&& Breanne: Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless your arrival!|Vassilis, you can a learn a thing or two from this one.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010DEF33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BEA"
msgid "I hate to say it, but you're right. I must defer to my friend here."
msgstr "이런 말하고 싶지 않지만 당신 말이 맞네요. 여기 제 친구에게 양보해야겠습니다."

