#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BDB"
msgid "Oh, yes. Of course."
msgstr "아, 네. 물론입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim? &&& Nalada: Really? You'd do that for me?|Oh, you truly are a gift from the Great Serpent. I knew He hadn't forsaken us. 
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Isn't it obvious? I believe the Great Serpent has specific designs for all of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BDA"
msgid "Why do you consider me a divine gift, when I'm simply flesh and blood, like everyone else?"
msgstr "제가 그저 다른 이들과 똑같은 피와 살로 이루어진 존재인데, 왜 저를 신성한 선물로 여기시는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you consider me a divine gift, when I'm simply flesh and blood, like everyone else?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you consider me a divine gift, when I'm simply flesh and blood, like everyone else?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BD9"
msgid "Isn't it obvious? I believe the Great Serpent has specific designs for all of us."
msgstr "명백하지 않습니까? 저는 위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 위한 구체적인 계획을 가지고 계신다고 믿습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you consider me a divine gift, when I'm simply flesh and blood, like everyone else?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BD8"
msgid "You consider yourself to be nothing more than flesh and blood, but you have purpose. And purpose is greater than the sum of all of our parts."
msgstr "당신은 스스로를 그저 피와 살 덩어리에 불과하다고 여기지만, 당신에게는 목적이 있습니다. 그리고 목적은 우리 모두의 부분을 합친 것보다 더 위대합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But what if wasn't an emergency! What if I stubbed my toe?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What if the Great Serpent came down and said, "we need you to stay up past your bedtimes and stub everyone's toes!" What then?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DD76C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BB1"
msgid "Yeah! What if I stubbed his toe!"
msgstr "맞아요! 제가 쟤 발가락을 밟으면 어떡해요?!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah! What if I stubbed his toe!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Now, now children. If there's any reason you need me, no matter how small, just ring the bell, and I'll open the door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DD76B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BB0"
msgid "What if the Great Serpent came down and said, \"we need you to stay up past your bedtimes and stub everyone's toes!\" What then?"
msgstr ""
"만약 위대한 뱀 님이 내려와서 '모두 잠잘 시간 넘겨서 안 자고 버티다가, 눈에 보이는 사람의 발가락을 다 밟아버려라!'라고 말하면 "
"어떡해요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah, like if there was a fire, or even worse, a water!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But what if wasn't an emergency! What if I stubbed my toe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DD76A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BAF"
msgid "Well, in the event of an emergency, we'll want to follow the drills we practiced."
msgstr "글쎄다, 비상 상황이 발생하면 대피 훈련받은 대로 하면 되지 않겠니."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But Miss Ueda, what if we need you for something!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, in the event of an emergency, we'll want to follow the drills we practiced.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DD769
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BAE"
msgid "Yeah, like if there was a fire, or even worse, a water!"
msgstr "맞아요! 불이 나거나, 더 심하면... 물이 차면 어떡해요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah but Miss Ueda says we can't go upstairs until we finish.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I don't think that ladder's high enough. Grown-ups really don't play fair.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB41E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BAD"
msgid "But I know where she keeps the keycard. It's on the top shelf, in the corner. See where I put the ladder?"
msgstr "선생님이 키카드를 어디에 두는지 다 알아. 맨 위 선반, 모서리에 있어. 사다리 어디에 있는지 알아?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But I know where she keeps the keycard. It's on the top shelf, in the corner. See where I put the ladder?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, that's why I put the footstool on the ladder. Then I can reach the top.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB41A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BAB"
msgid "I don't think that ladder's high enough. Grown-ups really don't play fair."
msgstr "그 사다리 충분히 높진 않은 것 같던데. 어른들은 정말 불공평해."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well you don't have to do them if you don't want to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB418
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BAA"
msgid "I hate doing chores. There's just so many dishes."
msgstr "이런 따분한 일은 싫어. 설거지할 것도 너무 많잖아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's in the jam jar.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): No, that's the trick. The jar isn't ACTUALLY full of jam.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB41C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BA9"
msgid "Ew, gross! So you have to dip your hand in jam to get it?"
msgstr "으엑, 더러워! 그럼 키카드를 꺼내려면 잼에 손을 담가야 하는 거야?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): That seems kind of dangerous. Are you sure the keycard's there? I don't see it, anyway.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ew, gross! So you have to dip your hand in jam to get it?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB412
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BA7"
msgid "It's in the jam jar."
msgstr "잼 병 안에 있어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, in the event of an emergency, we'll want to follow the drills we practiced.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah! What if I stubbed his toe!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DD768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BA6"
msgid "But what if wasn't an emergency! What if I stubbed my toe?"
msgstr "근데 만약에 비상 상황까진 아니라면 어떻게 해요?! 제가 발가락을 다치면 어떡해요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes Rumarin, who do you think it was? Jandar, or Jarek?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, that's not the worst answer you've given today. I'll consider that progress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB410
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BA3"
msgid "Neither! It was a giant groat, named Borklebub! He came in riding the back of the Great Serpent, and bit Jarek's head off!"
msgstr ""
"둘 다 아니에요! 바로 보클버브라는 이름의 거대한 그로트예요! 그 그로트가 위대의 뱀의 등을 타고 들어와서 자렉의 머리를 물어뜯었어요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll even give you a hint. He had two sons, Jandar and Jarek.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yes Rumarin, who do you think it was? Jandar, or Jarek?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB40C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011BA0"
msgid "Oh! Oh! I know!"
msgstr "오! 오! 저 알아요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Okay children, does anyone know who succeeded Jinan Va'ruun to become the next Speaker?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh! Oh! I know!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB417
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B9D"
msgid "I'll even give you a hint. He had two sons, Jandar and Jarek."
msgstr "힌트도 줄게. 지난 바룬 님께는 두 아들, 잔다르와 자렉 님이 있었어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): All right children, it's time for bed.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah, like if there was a fire, or even worse, a water!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB40B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B9C"
msgid "But Miss Ueda, what if we need you for something!"
msgstr "근데 우에다 선생님, 갑자기 선생님이 필요한 일이 생기면 어떡해요?!"

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll even give you a hint. He had two sons, Jandar and Jarek.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB40A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B9B"
msgid "Okay children, does anyone know who succeeded Jinan Va'ruun to become the next Speaker?"
msgstr "자, 애들아. 지난 바룬 님의 뒤를 이어 누가 차기 대변자가 되셨는지 아는 사람 있니?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, that's not the worst answer you've given today. I'll consider that progress.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB415
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B9A"
msgid "In any case, lunch is over. Everyone take their bowls to the kitchen and clear the table."
msgstr "어쨌든 이제 점심 시간은 끝났단다. 모두 다 그릇을 주방으로 가져다 놓고 탁자를 치우렴."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ew, gross! So you have to dip your hand in jam to get it?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Whoa.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB40D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B99"
msgid "No, that's the trick. The jar isn't ACTUALLY full of jam."
msgstr "아니, 선생님이 속인 거야. 병에 실제로 잼이 가득 차 있진 않아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I hate doing chores. There's just so many dishes.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Yeah but Miss Ueda says we can't go upstairs until we finish.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB407
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B98"
msgid "Well you don't have to do them if you don't want to."
msgstr "하고 싶지 않으면 안 해도 돼."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Neither! It was a giant groat, named Borklebub! He came in riding the back of the Great Serpent, and bit Jarek's head off!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): In any case, lunch is over. Everyone take their bowls to the kitchen and clear the table.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB405
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B97"
msgid "Well, that's not the worst answer you've given today. I'll consider that progress."
msgstr "음, 그래도 오늘 네가 대답한 것 중에 최악은 아니구나. 진전은 있는 것 같네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ding!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB404
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B96"
msgid "That's right, Zora. But try not to abuse the privilege, haha."
msgstr "그래, 조라. 하지만 함부로 이 특권을 남용하지는 말아 주렴. 하하."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But Miss Ueda, what if we need you for something!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB409
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B94"
msgid "All right children, it's time for bed."
msgstr "자, 얘들아, 이제 자러 갈 시간이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, that's why I put the footstool on the ladder. Then I can reach the top.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It's in the jam jar.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB400
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B93"
msgid "That seems kind of dangerous. Are you sure the keycard's there? I don't see it, anyway."
msgstr "좀 위험해 보이는데. 정말 키카드가 있는 거야? 난 안 보여."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): No, that's the trick. The jar isn't ACTUALLY full of jam.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB3FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B91"
msgid "Whoa."
msgstr "우와."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I don't think that ladder's high enough. Grown-ups really don't play fair.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): That seems kind of dangerous. Are you sure the keycard's there? I don't see it, anyway.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB402
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B90"
msgid "Well, that's why I put the footstool on the ladder. Then I can reach the top."
msgstr "그래서 사다리에 발판을 놓은 거야. 그러면 꼭대기까지 올라갈 수 있어."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I know better than to argue, but now we're severely understaffed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB419
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B8E"
msgid "One of the helpers was taken away last night. They accused him of heresy."
msgstr "어젯밤에 도우미가 끌려갔다. 도우미가 이단자로 밝혀졌다고 했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: roo-MAH-rin
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh! Oh! I know!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Neither! It was a giant groat, named Borklebub! He came in riding the back of the Great Serpent, and bit Jarek's head off!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB3FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B8A"
msgid "Yes Rumarin, who do you think it was? Jandar, or Jarek?"
msgstr "그래, 루마린, 누가 대변자가 되셨을 것 같니? 잔다르? 아니면 자렉 님?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What if the Great Serpent came down and said, "we need you to stay up past your bedtimes and stub everyone's toes!" What then?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Like this?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB3F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B88"
msgid "Now, now children. If there's any reason you need me, no matter how small, just ring the bell, and I'll open the door."
msgstr "자, 자, 얘들아. 선생님이 필요한 일이 생기면, 아무리 사소한 일이라도, 그냥 종을 울리. 그러면 바로 문을 열어줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ooh-eh-duh
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well you don't have to do them if you don't want to.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But I know where she keeps the keycard. It's on the top shelf, in the corner. See where I put the ladder?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB3FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B87"
msgid "Yeah but Miss Ueda says we can't go upstairs until we finish."
msgstr "알겠어. 근데 우에다 선생님이 일을 다 마치기 전에는 위층에 올라가면 안 된다고 하셨어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Now, now children. If there's any reason you need me, no matter how small, just ring the bell, and I'll open the door.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Ding!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010DB40F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_Orphanage_AudioLogs04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B85"
msgid "Like this?"
msgstr "이렇게요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F43
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS991_GenericCitizens_CoverMe
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: CoverMe
msgctxt "011B83"
msgid "I'm in need of cover!"
msgstr "엄호가 필요해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked. The player is trying to destabilize the Vortex Gate! / Shocked / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B81"
msgid "You fool! What are you doing? Would you destroy us all?"
msgstr "멍청한 놈! 무슨 짓이냐? 우릴 다 박살 낼 참인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B80"
msgid "I am the Serpent's Chosen! I cannot be defeated!"
msgstr "나는 위대한 뱀께 선택받은 자다! 결코 지지 않아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, making a last-ditch attack. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7F"
msgid "No! No! You shall not escape!"
msgstr "안 돼! 안 돼! 어딜 도망가려고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, calling out to his allies. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7E"
msgid "Seize him!"
msgstr "저놈을 잡아라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, calling out to his allies. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7D"
msgid "Seize her!"
msgstr "저놈을 잡아라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, calling out to his allies. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7C"
msgid "Seize them!"
msgstr "저놈을 잡아라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, making a last-ditch attack. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7B"
msgid "Rally! Brethren, to me!"
msgstr "교우들이여! 내게 집결하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious, desperate, making a last-ditch attack. / Rage / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Rage
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B7A"
msgid "Traitor! Penitent! You shall share our fate!"
msgstr "배신자 놈! 회개하라! 우리 운명을 함께 해라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B79"
msgid "I shall not fail you!"
msgstr "실패하지 않겠나이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B78"
msgid "The hour is at hand! All Must Serve!"
msgstr "시간이 다가왔다! 모두가 섬겨야 한다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B77"
msgid "Brethren! Promised! Arise!"
msgstr "교우들이여! 약속받은 자들이여! 일어나라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B76"
msgid "You shall be cast into the void!"
msgstr "공허에 처넣어 버리겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B75"
msgid "All shall be made dust before me!"
msgstr "모두 내 앞에 흙먼지로 화하리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B74"
msgid "Enough! Accept your fate!"
msgstr "그만! 운명을 받아들여라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010D9E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06LC06_Stage0930_AnaskoRespawns
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D9E38
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B73"
msgid "I shall not falter! I shall not fail!"
msgstr "흔들리지 않겠다! 실패하지 않겠어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anasko returns from the Vortex to fight. / Defiant / to Player Default
