#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Panting* Jinan bless you. I would not have survived that if you hadn't been here.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's more than luck. I'm beginning to think your coming was divined by the Serpent itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B53"
msgid "You're lucky to be alive."
msgstr "운이 좋아서 살아남은 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're lucky to be alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're lucky to be alive.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B52"
msgid "Lucky? Perhaps. I have been pondering it - whether luck is a consideration if the Great Serpent guides all things."
msgstr "행운? 그럴지도. 나도 곰곰이 생각해 봤다네. 위대한 뱀께서 모든 일을 인도하신다면, 운이라는 건 무엇일까 하고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything to get ahead, right? &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence. &&& Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment. &&& Hasmak: I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do I have a choice? We who are left must take action if House Va'ruun is to survive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B51"
msgid "You've been through a lot. Are you sure you're up to leading?"
msgstr "많은 일을 겪으셨군요. 정말 지도자가 될 준비가 되신 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've been through a lot. Are you sure you're up to leading?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've been through a lot. Are you sure you're up to leading?
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B50"
msgid "Do I have a choice? We who are left must take action if House Va'ruun is to survive."
msgstr "선택의 여지가 있나? 남은 우리라도 바룬 가문의 생존을 위해 행동을 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you. &&& Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests. &&& Hasmak: All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is a shame were not born House Dul'kehf. You seem a natural for this line of work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B4F"
msgid "You have no idea if this is going to pay off, do you? That's why you're only telling me now."
msgstr "이 작업이 성공할 수 있을지 확신이 안 드시는 거군요? 그래서 지금 와서야 말해주시는 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Hasmak
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am afraid the details have been scrubbed from the records at the time of construction. That, in itself, should be enough to pique anyone's interest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010D8F87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_TL_Hasmak_Dam
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B4E"
msgid "Can you tell me anything more about this dam?"
msgstr "그 댐에 대해서 자세히 말해주실 수 있을까요?"

