msgctxt "011B48"
msgid "To imagine Jinan himself made such a jump, and communed with the Great Serpent before returning to the Mourning."
msgstr "지난 님이 직접 그런 도약을 해서 모어닝 호로 돌아오기 전에 위대한 뱀과 교감하셨다고 상상해 보십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past.  &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy.  |The poor fool. Oh Great Serpent, he is so tortured! He wants so badly to forget what he's done, to live amongst those he has killed by the shipful a few months ago. Why not put him out of his misery? |Whatever he is paying you for this charade, I will provide even greater compensation.  &&& Orahim: Do not try it.  &&& companion: We have come too far to turn on Orahim now. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To be frank, Accursed, your death means little to me. It would not be amusing. But Orahim's? Do you not understand how satisfying this is for me? How utterly poetic? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B47"
msgid "If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?"
msgstr "너의 말을 따른다 치고, 네가 날 배신하지 않을 거라 믿을 수 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B46"
msgid "To be frank, Accursed, your death means little to me. It would not be amusing. But Orahim's? Do you not understand how satisfying this is for me? How utterly poetic?"
msgstr ""
"솔직히 말하지. 저주받은 자야. 네가 죽어봤자 나한텐 별 가치도 없어. 재미도 없고. 하지만 오라힘이 뒈지면? 얼마나 만족스러울 거 "
"같냐? 그야말로 서정시 한편 뽑아내는 기분 아닐까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B45"
msgid "Poor Orahim. So tormented by his past acts of violence that his only recourse is to massacre his former brethren with his new friend. His only friend. The only person who will dare speak to him."
msgstr ""
"한심한 오라힘 녀석. 과거에 저지른 폭력 때문에 계속 고통스러워하더니, 결국 같이 한솥밥을 먹던 형제들을 학살하려고 하다니. 그것도 새 "
"친구를 꼬드겨서 말이야. 그 친구 외에 다른 친구도 없는데. 먼저 말을 걸어 줬던 친구인데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: sadistic / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B44"
msgid "Your killing Orahim is a greater blow than I could ever deal. To come this far, only to be destroyed by the one person that provided some semblance of hope? To die, knowing there was never any chance of redemption, or acceptance, or companionship?"
msgstr ""
"네가 죽이는 게 오라힘에겐 더 타격이 클걸. 내가 어떻게 공격하든 그게 더 셀 거야. 이렇게 먼 곳까지 왔는데, 유일하게 한 줄기 "
"희망과도 같았던 친구에게 죽는다? 구원받을, 인정받을, 우정을 나눌 기회가 애초에 없었다는 걸 뒤늦게 깨달으며 죽는다?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I do this, how can I be sure you won't double-cross me?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Do not listen to him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B43"
msgid "That, Accursed, is something I am dying to see. If anything, I would be in your debt if you provide me with this amusement."
msgstr "저주받은 자야. 그 꼴을 진심으로 꼭 보고 싶다고. 되려 그렇게, 내게 즐거움을 선사해 준다면, 내가 너에게 빚을 지게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past.  &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy.  |The poor fool. Oh Great Serpent, he is so tortured! He wants so badly to forget what he's done, to live amongst those he has killed by the shipful a few months ago. Why not put him out of his misery? |Whatever he is paying you for this charade, I will provide even greater compensation.  &&& Orahim: Do not try it.  &&& companion: We have come too far to turn on Orahim now. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B42"
msgid "I need to speak with Orahim."
msgstr "먼저 오라힘과 얘기해 보겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mocking / Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need to speak with Orahim.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim.
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B41"
msgid "Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other."
msgstr "해 봐. 얘기해 봐. 둘이 어떻게 나오는지 어디 좀 보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim. &&& Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I just don't know what to think.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B40"
msgid "Please tell me you are not falling under his spell."
msgstr "제발 저 새끼 말빨에 혹하지 않았다고 말해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim. &&& Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I just don't know what to think.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3F"
msgid "If there is anything else, speak quickly. We mustn't keep our guard down long."
msgstr "다른 할 말 있으면 빨리해. 지금 긴장의 끈을 오래 놓고 있으면 안 된다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim. &&& Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other. &&& Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was, once. But no longer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3E"
msgid "Khaslav is sadistic, but he's making sense. You're just as bad as he is."
msgstr "카슬라프는 가학적이지만, 그럴듯하게 말하긴 했단 말이지. 너도 저 녀석만큼이나 나쁜 새끼잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Khaslav is sadistic, but he's making sense. You're just as bad as he is.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Khaslav is sadistic, but he's making sense. You're just as bad as he is.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3D"
msgid "I was, once. But no longer."
msgstr "한때는 그랬지만. 더 이상은 아냐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Khaslav is sadistic, but he's making sense. You're just as bad as he is.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3C"
msgid "Everyone keeps telling me who I am, reminding me of the things I have done. They tell me I cannot change, that I will always be a Zealot, always be a danger. I am sick of being what people say I am."
msgstr ""
"다들 내가 어떤 새끼인지 떠들어대고, 내가 저지른 짓들을 끊임없이 곱씹어 주지. 난 변할 수 없다고, 영원히 광신도일 뿐이고, 항상 "
"위험할 거라고들 말해. 사람들이 지껄이는 모습대로 사는 건, 이제 신물이 나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Khaslav is sadistic, but he's making sense. You're just as bad as he is.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3B"
msgid "If it takes my death to prove my conviction, then so be it. But let me take Khaslav down with me."
msgstr "죽어야만 납득시킬 수 있다면, 그렇게 하겠어. 그냥 카슬라프를 죽일 수 있게만 해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim. &&& Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other. &&& Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Be realistic. I am but one man, but Khaslav has a squad of killers behind him. If you let him go, he will rebuild, and hundreds of lives will continue to be snuffed out.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B3A"
msgid "I just don't know what to think."
msgstr "어떤 판단을 내려야 할지 전혀 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just don't know what to think.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just don't know what to think.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B39"
msgid "Be realistic. I am but one man, but Khaslav has a squad of killers behind him. If you let him go, he will rebuild, and hundreds of lives will continue to be snuffed out."
msgstr ""
"현실적으로 생각해 봐. 난 한 명뿐이지만, 카슬라프 뒤에는 살인마 일당이 있어. 놈을 놓아주면, 다시 패거리를 늘리고, 수많은 사람들을 "
"계속 죽이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just don't know what to think.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B38"
msgid "If you think me to be dangerous, fine, I may be. But do not let Khaslav fool you into thinking he is less of a threat."
msgstr "내가 위험해 보인다면, 알겠어. 그렇게 생각해. 하지만 카슬라프에게 속아서 놈이 덜 위험할 거라고 생각하진 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: annoyed / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other.
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: You and your Zealots are a greater danger than a single Orahim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B37"
msgid "Now, really, I must interrupt. We are getting quite bored of this. Make your decision, Accursed."
msgstr "이제 좀 끼어들어야겠군. 잡담이 너무 늘어지는 거 같은데. 이제 결정을 내리시지. 저주받은 자야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: My belief in the Great Serpent has not changed, but my commitment to the Serpent's Crusade is no more. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_06_OrahimReligion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B36"
msgid "Has your belief in the Great Serpent changed at all after leaving the Zealots?"
msgstr "광신도 패거리에서 나온 뒤 위대한 뱀에 대한 믿음이 바뀌었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to speak with Orahim. &&& Khaslav: Go on, go on. Let us see what you have to say to each other. &&& Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Think. Just think, damn it. Why would I go through all of this just to turn Zealot in Dazra? What I am doing now is heresy -- I can never return to being a Zealot after this. My only chance of survival now is to live peacefully in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8EDA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B35"
msgid "How can I trust that you've really changed? That you aren't a danger to Dazra?"
msgstr "네가 정말 변했다고 어떻게 믿을 수 있지? 네가 다즈라에 해를 끼칠 놈이 아니라는 걸 어떻게 믿냐고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can I trust that you've really changed? That you aren't a danger to Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How can I trust that you've really changed? That you aren't a danger to Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Please tell me you are not falling under his spell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_OrahimConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B34"
msgid "Think. Just think, damn it. Why would I go through all of this just to turn Zealot in Dazra? What I am doing now is heresy -- I can never return to being a Zealot after this. My only chance of survival now is to live peacefully in Dazra."
msgstr ""
"생각해 봐. 좀 생각해 보라고. 젠장. 내가 다즈라에서 광신도로 돌변할 생각이라면 왜 이 지랄을 하겠냐? 내가 지금 저지른 짓은 이단 "
"짓거리잖아. 이 짓거리를 했는데 다시 광신도가 될 수 있을 거 같아? 지금 내가 유일하게 살아남을 수 있는 방법은 다즈라에서 평화롭게 "
"사는 것뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Has your belief in the Great Serpent changed at all after leaving the Zealots? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_06_OrahimReligion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B33"
msgid "My belief in the Great Serpent has not changed, but my commitment to the Serpent's Crusade is no more."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 향한 믿음은 변하지 않았지만, 뱀의 성전에 헌신하는 마음은 더 이상 남아있지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_06_OrahimReligion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B32"
msgid "I have meditated on this for quite some time, but I believe that the Great Serpent afflicted me with guilt as punishment for straying from the Serpent's Crusade. I was following Khaslav, not Him."
msgstr ""
"이 문제에 대해 꽤 오랫동안 숙고해 봤는데... 위대한 뱀께서는 뱀의 성전에서 벗어난 나를 처벌하시려고 죄책감이 들게 하신 것 같다. "
"내가 그분이 아니라 카슬라프를 따랐으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_06_OrahimReligion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B31"
msgid "But from that guilt came a reckoning for my past actions, and I have lost the will to continue the Crusade. I suppose now I am an accursed myself."
msgstr ""
"하지만 죄책감이 들었기에 과거에 저지른 행동을 숙고할 수 있었고, 뱀의 성전을 계속하려는 의욕을 버릴 수 있었다. 이제 나도 저주받은 "
"자인가 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& Orahim: Many people who heard that name do not live long enough to hear it again. &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D8ED5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B30"
msgid "A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works."
msgstr "광신도는 그렇게 사는 걸 포기하는 녀석들이 아냐. 그렇게 될 족속이 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& Orahim: Many people who heard that name do not live long enough to hear it again. &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
