#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B27"
msgid "I can't believe I'm saying this, but Khaslav has made good points. Orahim only knows how to solve problems with violence."
msgstr "이런 말을 한다는 게 믿기지 않지만, 카슬라프가 잘 짚었어. 오라힘은 폭력만이 문제를 해결하는 방법이라고 생각하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What should I be expecting in Khaslav's hideout?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Let's talk about something else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F764
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B26"
msgid "And, obviously, there will be Khaslav himself. He will keep his most powerful warriors close to him. This will not be an easy fight."
msgstr "그리고 분명 카슬라프 그놈도 있겠지. 수하에 있는 가장 강력한 병사들을 가까이 두고 있을 테고. 싸움이 결코 쉽지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes Khaslav different from other Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Let's talk about something else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F762
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B25"
msgid "Khaslav, despite his bluster and phony piety, kills in the name of killing. He simply enjoys it. And a Zealot with a bloodlust is a very dangerous thing."
msgstr ""
"카슬라프는 겉으로는 대담하고 숭고한 척하지만, 그냥 죽이고 싶어서 죽이는 거야. 살육을 즐기는 것 뿐이라고. 피의 욕망에 빠진 광신도니까 "
"엄청 위험하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Orahim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Oh? I never knew honesty to be one of Orahim's virtues. I remember many times he would lie to win over the trust of an accursed before stabbing them in the back. Literally!
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B24"
msgid "So he has told you everything? Including the incident where he immolated the crew of a hauler, one by one?"
msgstr "오, 모든 걸 털어놓았다고? 설마 화물선 승무원들을 한 명씩 산 채로 태워 죽인 그 일까지 이야기한 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Enough! I need no reminders of what I have done! I relive those scenes every day, I see ghosts every night. I am cursed!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B23"
msgid "Or what of the time he --"
msgstr "아니면 전에 저질렀던 그 짓거리를..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: There were three heirlooms.
