#. TOPIC: 010D72AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B22"
msgid "What are these heirlooms I'm looking for?"
msgstr "찾고 있는 가보가 뭔데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these heirlooms I'm looking for?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B21"
msgid "There were three heirlooms."
msgstr "세 개의 가보가 있었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these heirlooms I'm looking for? &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There were three heirlooms.|Mahkara's weapon was crafted by the renowned gun-maker Kiva Shan, who was blind.|It was said Kiva could judge the quality of metals by touch, smell and taste.|Her boost pack was forged by Anjari the Elder, whose son Anjari the Younger earned great renown as a sculptor.|Mahkara's spacesuit was made by the weaver Krisa Vaszla, a woman of surpassing beauty and skill.|Krisa was a mother to thirteen children, many of whom aided in her work.|How she found the time to raise so many children while mastering her craft is a mystery to me.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, they're not. Vital components were removed so they could be displayed safely in the tomb.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B20"
msgid "Are these heirlooms functional?"
msgstr "가보들은 지금도 작동하는 물건인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are these heirlooms functional?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are these heirlooms functional?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1F"
msgid "No, they're not. Vital components were removed so they could be displayed safely in the tomb."
msgstr "아뇨, 작동하지 않아요. 무덤에 안전하게 보관하기 위해 필수 부품들은 제거됐거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are these heirlooms I'm looking for? &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There were three heirlooms.|Mahkara's weapon was crafted by the renowned gun-maker Kiva Shan, who was blind.|It was said Kiva could judge the quality of metals by touch, smell and taste.|Her boost pack was forged by Anjari the Elder, whose son Anjari the Younger earned great renown as a sculptor.|Mahkara's spacesuit was made by the weaver Krisa Vaszla, a woman of surpassing beauty and skill.|Krisa was a mother to thirteen children, many of whom aided in her work.|How she found the time to raise so many children while mastering her craft is a mystery to me.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can't imagine why they would have value to anyone outside of my family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1E"
msgid "Do they have any monetary value?"
msgstr "금전적 가치가 있는 물건인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do they have any monetary value?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do they have any monetary value?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1D"
msgid "I can't imagine why they would have value to anyone outside of my family."
msgstr "우리 가문 사람이 아닌 다른 녀석들에게 가치가 있을 거라곤 도무지 상상되질 않거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do they have any monetary value?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll try to keep all of that in mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Heirlooms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1C"
msgid "Their worth is purely as mementos of a great ancestor, nothing more."
msgstr "그저 순수하게 위대한 조상님을 기리는 기념품 그 이상도 이하도 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: The Spacers took control of an underground facility and have been using it to store their loot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Spacers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1B"
msgid "What do you know about the Spacer hideout?"
msgstr "스페이서 은신처에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you know about the Spacer hideout?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Spacers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B1A"
msgid "The Spacers took control of an underground facility and have been using it to store their loot."
msgstr "스페이서들이 지하 시설을 장악하고 자기들 전리품을 보관하는 데 이용하고 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Spacers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B19"
msgid "Its original purpose was to provide a place of safety for our leaders in times of danger."
msgstr "원래는 위험한 순간에 우리 지도자들이 피난할 안전한 장소를 제공하는 시설이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Spacers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B18"
msgid "As such, it is very well-fortified."
msgstr "그래서 요새화가 아주 잘 되어 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: She was said to be a woman of regal bearing, boundless courage and great skill in battle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Ancestor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B17"
msgid "What made this ancestor of yours so respected?"
msgstr "당신 조상님이 그렇게 존경받았던 이유가 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I got your grandma's trinkets, but it damn near cost me my life.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I got your grandma's trinkets, but it damn near cost me my life.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B16"
msgid "I warned you of the risks, and you made your choice. The blame does not lie with me."
msgstr "위험하다고 경고했잖아요. 선택은 당신이 한 거예요. 제 잘못은 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I got your grandma's trinkets, but it damn near cost me my life.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B15"
msgid "Also, Makhara was not my grandmother, nor are her precious heirlooms mere trinkets."
msgstr "그리고, 마카라 님은 제 할머니대 분도 아니고, 마카라 님의 소중한 가보들도 단순히 장신구가 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I got your grandma's trinkets, but it damn near cost me my life.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B14"
msgid "However, despite your disrespectful tone, I am grateful that you were able to reclaim them."
msgstr "비록 말본새는 무례하지만, 가보들을 되찾아 주셔서 고마워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Welcome to my home. You come with good news, I hope?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. Given the harm they've caused our people, those Spacers deserved to suffer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B13"
msgid "You've got a whole lot fewer Spacers to worry about. And yes, I got your relics, too."
msgstr "당신이 상대할 스페이서 놈들 머릿수를 좀 줄여 놨어요. 그리고 물론, 당신 유물도 되찾았고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms. &&& FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How dare you, a newcomer who knows nothing of my family and our legacy, offer such an insult.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B12"
msgid "She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father."
msgstr "따님은 당신 가문의 유산을 지키기 위해 목숨을 걸었던 건데, 그걸 실책이라고 불러요? 참 최악의 아버지네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Welcome to my home. You come with good news, I hope?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I warned you of the risks, and you made your choice. The blame does not lie with me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B11"
msgid "I got your grandma's trinkets, but it damn near cost me my life."
msgstr "당신 할머니의 장신구는 가져왔지만, 하마터면 뒈질 뻔했네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What made this ancestor of yours so respected?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Ancestor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B10"
msgid "She was said to be a woman of regal bearing, boundless courage and great skill in battle."
msgstr "마카라 님은 고귀한 품위, 무한한 용기, 뛰어난 전투 기술을 가진 여성이었다고 전해지지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Ancestor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0F"
msgid "Mahkara was chosen by Jinan Va'ruun himself to serve aboard the starship Mourning, which was a great honor."
msgstr "마카라 님은 지난 바룬 님에게 직접 선택되어 우주선 모어닝 호에서 복무하는 큰 영광을 누리셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Ancestor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0E"
msgid "She was loved and feared in equal measure by those she commanded, and inspired complete loyalty in her crew."
msgstr "마카라 님은 부하들에게 사랑과 두려움을 동시에 받았고, 완벽하게 승무원들의 충성심을 불러일으켰지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D72A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_Maaliya_TL_Ancestor
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0D"
msgid "Truly, nobody in my family's history achieved anything close to what Mahkara accomplished."
msgstr "참으로, 우리 가문 역사상 마카라 님이 이룬 업적에 근접한 사람은 아무도 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impatient / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter. &&& companion: The Hajtals are known for demanding strict obedience from servant and child alike.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7298
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0C"
msgid "Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?"
msgstr "이제 이 불운한 일을 끝내도 되겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm insistence / Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: What if we restore the heirlooms? Make them work again?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7298
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0B"
msgid "Give me the heirlooms. I'll hold onto them until it's safe to return them to the tomb where they belong."
msgstr "가보를 내게 주거라. 원래 있어야 할 무덤으로 안전하게 돌려보낼 때까지 내가 맡아두마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If not for her, you wouldn't even know the items had been taken.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If not for her, you wouldn't even know the items had been taken.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B0A"
msgid "All the same, she took upon herself the duty to safeguard the heirlooms, and failed in that duty."
msgstr "그렇다 해도, 내 딸은 가보를 지켜야 할 임무를 스스로 짊어졌지만, 그 맹세를 다하지 못했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If not for her, you wouldn't even know the items had been taken.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B09"
msgid "Perhaps that means nothing to you, but we of the Hajtal name take such matters very seriously."
msgstr "자네에겐 그게 아무 문제가 아닐지 몰라도, 우리 하즈탈 가문은 그런 문제를 매우 중요하게 여기네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, taken aback / Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7299
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B08"
msgid "How dare you, a newcomer who knows nothing of my family and our legacy, offer such an insult."
msgstr "우리 가문과 유산에 대해 아무것도 모르는 이방인 주제에 감히 그따위 모욕적인 말을 하다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A stern rebuke, a warning / Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7299
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B07"
msgid "If not for the fact that you helped my daughter in a time of need, I would banish you forever from this house."
msgstr "내 딸이 위기에 닥쳤을 때 도와준 것만 아니었다면, 널 이 집에서 영원히 추방했을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7299
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B06"
msgid "However ignorant you may be of our ways, such words are not welcome."
msgstr "우리의 방식에 대해 얼마나 무지한지는 상관없다. 그따위로 말하는 건 용납할 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She risked her life to protect your family legacy, and you call it a failure? You're a terrible father.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7299
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B05"
msgid "All you need know is that my daughter took upon herself a solemn duty, and failed to uphold it."
msgstr "너는 이것만 알면 된다. 내 딸은 엄숙한 의무를 졌지만, 그 맹세를 지키지 못했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern, vindictive / Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've got a whole lot fewer Spacers to worry about. And yes, I got your relics, too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've got a whole lot fewer Spacers to worry about. And yes, I got your relics, too.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B04"
msgid "Good. Given the harm they've caused our people, those Spacers deserved to suffer."
msgstr "잘 됐군요. 우리 신민들에게 끼친 해악을 고려하면, 그 스페이서 녀석들은 당해도 싸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've got a whole lot fewer Spacers to worry about. And yes, I got your relics, too.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B03"
msgid "As for the relics, I assume you're referring to the stolen heirlooms."
msgstr "유물이라면, 도난당한 가보를 말하는 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy, grateful / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've got a whole lot fewer Spacers to worry about. And yes, I got your relics, too.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B02"
msgid "That news is most welcome."
msgstr "그거 정말 반가운 소식이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& ...  &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father. &&& FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive. &&& FarudHajtal: If you would please, the heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would I allow my only child to take such a risk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7297
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B01"
msgid "You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya."
msgstr "가보를 수리해서 말리야 씨에게 주는 게 좋을 거 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms. &&& FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All the same, she took upon herself the duty to safeguard the heirlooms, and failed in that duty.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D729C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011B00"
msgid "If not for her, you wouldn't even know the items had been taken."
msgstr "따님이 아니었다면, 가보를 도난당했다는 사실조차 몰랐을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Skeptical / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I can't believe I'm saying this, but you've changed my mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7296
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFF"
msgid "Why would I allow my only child to take such a risk?"
msgstr "내 외동딸이 그런 위험을 무릅쓰도록 내버려둘 거 같나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anger and disbelief / Angry / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7291
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFE"
msgid "I just can't believe you'd take such a risk."
msgstr "정말 믿을 수 없다. 네가 위험하게 그런 무모한 짓을 벌이다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Anger and disbelief / Angry / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Because you wouldn't allow me to go if I had asked!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7291
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFD"
msgid "You knew the danger, yet you went anyway, and you went alone!"
msgstr "위험하다는 걸 알면서도, 무시하고 가버렸어! 그것도 혼자서 말이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Trying to be patient, explaining to your child / Concerned / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I just can't believe you'd take such a risk.|You knew the danger, yet you went anyway, and you went alone! &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Because you wouldn't allow me to go if I had asked!|It's not the heirlooms that are important, but what they represent. |I wish you would understand when I tell you how much Mahkara means to me.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFC"
msgid "Yes, our honored ancestor is worthy of remembrance, but she is long gone now."
msgstr "그래, 존경받는 조상님은 기려 마땅하지만, 마카라 님은 이미 오래전에 세상을 떠나신 분이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Context: You're alive now, but our long lost ancestor is dead. Focus on life and the present, not the dead past. / Concerned / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFB"
msgid "You are here, today, right now."
msgstr "넌 현재에 있다. 바로 이 순간, 이 자리에 있는 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Mahkara lived a life in service to the Great Serpent, and earned glory in His name.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AFA"
msgid "Don't throw that away to protect the memory of someone who can never even know who you are."
msgstr "어떤 사람이었는지도 모를 과거 인물의 추억을 지키겠다고 네 삶을 내던지지 말거라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're right, Maaliya's just an overeager child. The heirlooms belong in the tomb.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right, Maaliya's just an overeager child. The heirlooms belong in the tomb.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I understand Maaliya promised you a reward for returning these items to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7294
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF9"
msgid "I'm glad you see it that way."
msgstr "그렇게 생각해 주다니 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know they won't just be stolen again?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you know they won't just be stolen again?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7292
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF8"
msgid "They were secure in the tomb for decades. It was only recent events that changed that."
msgstr "수십 년 동안 무덤에 안전하게 있었잖나. 최근의 사건들로 인해 상황이 바뀐 것뿐인 게지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do you know they won't just be stolen again?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7292
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF7"
msgid "When I'm sure our home is safe once more, I will take them back myself."
msgstr "우리의 터전이 다시 안전해졌다는 확신이 들면, 내가 직접 다시 가져다 놓을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defensive, exasperated / Angry / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I just can't believe you'd take such a risk.|You knew the danger, yet you went anyway, and you went alone!
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF6"
msgid "Because you wouldn't allow me to go if I had asked!"
msgstr "부탁했더라도 허락해 주지 않으셨을 거잖아요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Exasperated / Defiant / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF5"
msgid "It's not the heirlooms that are important, but what they represent."
msgstr "가보가 중요한 게 아니라, 가보가 상징하는 게 중요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Increasingly exasperated, losing hope / Concerned / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Yes, our honored ancestor is worthy of remembrance, but she is long gone now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7290
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF4"
msgid "I wish you would understand when I tell you how much Mahkara means to me."
msgstr "마카라 님이 제게 얼마나 큰 의미가 있는지 말할 때 아버지가 이해해 주셨으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& ...  &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father. &&& FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive. &&& FarudHajtal: If you would please, the heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm glad you see it that way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7295
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF3"
msgid "You're right, Maaliya's just an overeager child. The heirlooms belong in the tomb."
msgstr "당신 말이 맞아요. 말리야 씨는 그저 의욕만 앞선 어린애일 뿐이죠. 가보는 무덤에 있어야 마땅하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& ...  &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father. &&& FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive. &&& FarudHajtal: If you would please, the heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They were secure in the tomb for decades. It was only recent events that changed that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7293
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF2"
msgid "How do you know they won't just be stolen again?"
msgstr "가보들이 다시 도난당하지 않을 거라고 어떻게 확신하시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm in your convictions / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Because you wouldn't allow me to go if I had asked!|It's not the heirlooms that are important, but what they represent. |I wish you would understand when I tell you how much Mahkara means to me. &&& FarudHajtal: Yes, our honored ancestor is worthy of remembrance, but she is long gone now. |You are here, today, right now.|Don't throw that away to protect the memory of someone who can never even know who you are.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AF1"
msgid "Mahkara lived a life in service to the Great Serpent, and earned glory in His name."
msgstr "마카라 님은 위대한 뱀 님을 섬기며 평생을 사셨고, 위대한 뱀 님의 이름 아래 영광을 얻으셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AED"
msgid "Now I am called to serve. I wish only to answer that call and continue what she began."
msgstr "이제 저도 부름을 받았어요. 그 부름에 응하여 조상님이 시작한 일을 계속하고 싶을 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm denial, this conversation is over / Stern / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Yes, our honored ancestor is worthy of remembrance, but she is long gone now. |You are here, today, right now.|Don't throw that away to protect the memory of someone who can never even know who you are. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Mahkara lived a life in service to the Great Serpent, and earned glory in His name.|Now I am called to serve. I wish only to answer that call and continue what she began.|Why won't you let me?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AEC"
msgid "You're too young to understand. One day, when you have children of your own, you will see things differently."
msgstr "넌 너무 어려서 이해하지 못하는구나. 언젠가 네게 자식이 생기면, 세상을 다르게 보게 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Firm rejection / Stern / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_HouseArgumentScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AEB"
msgid "Until such a day, I do not want you to return to the tomb. Do you understand?"
msgstr "그날이 올 때까지, 네가 무덤에 묻히는 꼴은 보고 싶지 않단다. 알겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disappointed, chastised / Depressed / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: What if we restore the heirlooms? Make them work again?|I could use them to help keep our people safe.|This is the will of the Great Serpent, I know it in my heart. He calls me to serve. &&& FarudHajtal: Do not speak such blasphemies!|None can claim to know the will of the Great Serpent. To utter such words is sacrilege.|I will not discuss the matter further.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010FCF98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AEA"
msgid "Yes, father."
msgstr "네, 아버지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I... &&& FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter. &&& companion: The Hajtals are known for demanding strict obedience from servant and child alike. &&& FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?|Give me the heirlooms. I'll hold onto them until it's safe to return them to the tomb where they belong.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE9"
msgid "What if we restore the heirlooms? Make them work again?"
msgstr "가보를 수리하는 건 어때요? 다시 작동하게 만들면요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / Pleading / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE8"
msgid "I could use them to help keep our people safe."
msgstr "제가 우리 신민들을 안전하게 지키는 데 활용할 수 있을 거 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / Pleading / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Do not speak such blasphemies!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE7"
msgid "This is the will of the Great Serpent, I know it in my heart. He calls me to serve."
msgstr "이건 위대한 뱀의 뜻이에요. 마음속으로 느낄 수 있어요. 헌신하라고 저를 부르고 계세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / Stern / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D728A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE6"
msgid "I will not discuss the matter further."
msgstr "이 문제는 더 이상 논의하지 않겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& ...  &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father. &&& FarudHajtal: I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive. &&& FarudHajtal: If you would please, the heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And see my only child throw herself into danger at every opportunity?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7288
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE5"
msgid "What's your objection to letting Maaliya use the heirlooms?"
msgstr "말리야 씨가 가보를 사용하는 걸 왜 반대하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Do not speak such blasphemies!|None can claim to know the will of the Great Serpent. To utter such words is sacrilege.|I will not discuss the matter further. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Yes, father.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: If you would please, the heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7289
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE4"
msgid "I apologize. My daughter can be impulsive."
msgstr "사과하지. 내 딸이 좀 충동적이라서 말이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your objection to letting Maaliya use the heirlooms?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your objection to letting Maaliya use the heirlooms?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE2"
msgid "And see my only child throw herself into danger at every opportunity?"
msgstr "그럼 외동딸이 기회만 생기면 위험 속으로 뛰어드는 꼴을 보고만 있으란 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your objection to letting Maaliya use the heirlooms?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE1"
msgid "She wants to honor Mahkara's legacy, but if she falls in battle, that legacy will end then and there."
msgstr "딸아이는 마카라 님의 유산을 기리고 싶어 하겠지만, 만약 전투에서 쓰러진다면, 유산도 거기서 끝나는 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's your objection to letting Maaliya use the heirlooms?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7287
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AE0"
msgid "In any case, it's a family matter. I'm sorry, but I don't wish to discuss it any further."
msgstr "어쨌든 이건 가족 문제네. 미안하지만, 더 이상 논의하고 싶지 않군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reluctant concession / Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Why would I allow my only child to take such a risk?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Thank you, father. You will not regret this decision, I promise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADF"
msgid "I can't believe I'm saying this, but you've changed my mind."
msgstr "이런 말을 하게 될 줄은 몰랐는데, 자네가 내 마음을 바꿨네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fair, but firm / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: Why would I allow my only child to take such a risk?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I understand Maaliya promised you a reward for returning these items to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7286
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADE"
msgid "Perhaps someday, I'll consider the idea. For now, however, my answer is no."
msgstr "아마 언젠가 자네 생각을 고려해 볼 날이 오겠지. 하지만 지금은 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised and happy / Grateful / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should repair the heirlooms and give them to Maaliya. &&& ...  &&& FarudHajtal: I can't believe I'm saying this, but you've changed my mind. &&& companion: Your cowardice would smother the fierce courage in your daughter's heart and dim the fire in her eyes.|How can you claim to honor Mahkara the Fang's legacy while denying everything she represents?|This is your one chance to let Maaliya embrace that legacy. If you deny her, she will resent you for the rest of your life.  &&& FarudHajtal: I... I can't deny the truth of your words.|Perhaps it's time to let go. To let my daughter be who she wishes to be.|Very well. I will allow it.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I hope you're right, my daughter. I truly do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADD"
msgid "Thank you, father. You will not regret this decision, I promise."
msgstr "고마워요, 아버지. 이 결정을 후회하지 않으실 거예요. 약속해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Uncertain, worried, but hopeful / Grateful / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I... I can't deny the truth of your words.|Perhaps it's time to let go. To let my daughter be who she wishes to be.|Very well. I will allow it. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Thank you, father. You will not regret this decision, I promise.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: I understand Maaliya promised you a reward for returning these items to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADC"
msgid "I hope you're right, my daughter. I truly do."
msgstr "네 말이 맞았으면 좋겠구나. 얘야. 진심이란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADB"
msgid "You're not protecting your daughter, you're stifling her."
msgstr "이건 따님을 보호하는 게 아니라, 억압하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ADA"
msgid "Maaliya isn't a child. You need to respect her wishes."
msgstr "말리야 씨는 어린애가 아니에요. 말리야 씨가 바라는 대로 할 수 있게 해주셔야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD9"
msgid "If you miss this chance to let Maaliya spread her wings, she'll resent you forever."
msgstr "날개를 펼칠 기회를 놓친다면, 말리야 씨는 평생 아버지를 원망할 걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD8"
msgid "I agree, it could be an impressive sight."
msgstr "그렇겠군. 그 모습은 멋지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD7"
msgid "The people would be reminded of Mahkara's bravery."
msgstr "신민들은 마카라 님의 용기를 떠올리겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD6"
msgid "Perhaps she could be a light for our people in dark times."
msgstr "어쩌면 마카라 님은 어두운 시대를 사는 우리 신민들에게 빛이 될 수도 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD5"
msgid "Perhaps, but the... the risk is great."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지만... 위험이 너무 크네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD4"
msgid "I'm just not sure it would be enough."
msgstr "그것만으로 충분할지 잘 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD3"
msgid "People are fickle. They might ignore her, or worse, consider the act an insult to Mahkara's name."
msgstr ""
"사람들은 변덕스럽네. 딸아이가 무시당할 수도 있고, 더 나쁘게는, 딸아이 행동이 마카라 님의 이름을 모욕하는 걸로 여길 수도 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD2"
msgid "To deny your daughter's birthright would dishonor Mahkara's legacy."
msgstr "따님의 타고난 권리를 부정하다니, 마카라 님의 유산을 모욕하는 거나 다름없네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD1"
msgid "It's clear that Mahkara the Fang's bravery lives on in your daughter. Let her embrace it."
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라 님의 용기가 당신 따님에게 이어지고 있는 게 분명해요. 따님이 그 용기를 받아들일 수 있게 해 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AD0"
msgid "Your daughter has the strength and courage of your ancestor. You should encourage these traits."
msgstr "따님은 당신네 조상의 강인함과 용기를 지니고 있어요. 그런 특성이 있으면 발전시킬 수 있도록 격려해 줘야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACF"
msgid "There truly is something of the old tales in her."
msgstr "정말 옛이야기에서 들었던 무언가가 딸아이에게서 느껴지는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACE"
msgid "Mahkara's eyes were said to burn with an unquenchable flame. I see that same fire in Maaliya's eyes."
msgstr "마카라 님의 눈은 꺼지지 않는 불꽃으로 타올랐다고 전해지지. 말리야의 눈에서도 같은 불꽃이 보이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACD"
msgid "Perhaps this would be the best way to honor Mahkara's legacy."
msgstr "어쩌면 이것이 마카라 님의 유산을 기리는 가장 좋은 방법일지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACC"
msgid "There are other, safer ways to honor our ancestor."
msgstr "조상님을 기리는 건 좋지만, 다른 위험하지 않은 방법들도 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACB"
msgid "Who are you to make such a claim? You know nothing of us."
msgstr "네가 뭔데 그런 주장을 하나? 넌 우리에 대해 아무것도 모르지 않나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ACA"
msgid "Mahkara's legacy will be just fine without my daughter taking such a risk."
msgstr "마카라 님의 유산은 딸아이가 그런 위험을 무릅쓰지 않더라도 괜찮을 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC9"
msgid "Your people need all the help they can get."
msgstr "당신네 신민들에겐 가능한 모든 도움이 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC8"
msgid "Times are more dangerous than ever, and your daughter wants to do something about it."
msgstr "그 어느 때보다 위험한 시기잖아요. 따님은 위험에 대비해 뭐라도 하고 싶어 하더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC7"
msgid "Dazra needs protection from anyone willing to offer it."
msgstr "다즈라엔 보호해 줄 사람이 필요해요. 도움을 주려는 사람이 누구든 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC6"
msgid "I can't deny the truth of your words."
msgstr "네 말이 틀린 게 하나도 없군. 도저히 부정할 수가 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC5"
msgid "It's impossible to deny that we are more vulnerable now than ever before."
msgstr "그 어느 때보다 우리가 위태로운 상태에 처해 있다는 건 부정할 수 없겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC4"
msgid "I agree that these are dangerous times. Our need for safety is great."
msgstr "나도 지금이 위험한 시기라는 점에는 동의하네. 안전하게 해줄 사람이 간절히 필요한 것도 맞고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC3"
msgid "I appreciate your concern, but our people have endured for generations."
msgstr "걱정해 줘서 고맙지만, 우리 신민은 여러 세대를 거쳐 버텨냈다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC2"
msgid "The Great Serpent watches over us. There is no greater protector."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 저희를 굽어살펴주시길. 이보다 더 위대한 보호자는 없으시니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D727B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC1"
msgid "You may lack faith, but I do not. We will persevere."
msgstr "자넨 믿음이 없을지 모르지만, 난 그렇지 않네. 우리는 이겨낼 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AC0"
msgid "Seeing Mahkara's descendant in action could bring hope to people who have endured tragedy."
msgstr "비극을 견뎌낸 사람들에게 마카라 님의 후손이 활동하는 모습을 보여주면 희망을 줄 수 있을걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABF"
msgid "The sight of Maaliya bravely protecting the people could inspire others to do the same."
msgstr "말리야 씨가 용감하게 사람들을 지키면 다른 사람들도 그 모습을 보고 영감을 얻겠죠. 다들 그걸 보고 따라 하게 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Easy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABE"
msgid "What better reminder of your family's proud legacy than to see the Fang return?"
msgstr "송곳니가 돌아온 걸 보여주는 것보다 당신네 가문의 자랑스러운 유산을 더 잘 상기시켜 주는 게 뭐가 있겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABD"
msgid "Perhaps I have been too strict."
msgstr "어쩌면 내가 너무 엄격했나 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABC"
msgid "Do you truly think so? Perhaps I hadn't considered the consequences of my actions."
msgstr "정말 그렇게 생각하나? 내가 이러면 결과가 어떻게 될지 미처 생각하지 못했나 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABB"
msgid "Maybe it's time I began to trust my daughter to make her own choices."
msgstr "이제 내 딸이 스스로 선택하게 믿어줘야 할 때가 된 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011ABA"
msgid "Maaliya is still young and impulsive. She is not ready for such responsibility."
msgstr "말리야는 아직 어리고 충동적이네. 그런 책임을 질 준비가 안 돼 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB9"
msgid "Perhaps you should trust a father to know what is best for his daughter."
msgstr "딸에게 무엇이 최선인지는 아버지인 내가 제일 잘 안다는 사실을, 자네도 좀 알아줬으면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Medium02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB8"
msgid "You must understand, nothing is more important to me than my daughter's safety."
msgstr "이해해 주게. 내겐 딸의 안전보다 더 중요한 건 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB7"
msgid "These precious heirlooms were just gathering dust. Why not put them to use?"
msgstr "이 귀중한 가보들에 먼지만 쌓이고 있었잖아요. 활용 방안을 찾는 게 어때요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB6"
msgid "I think Mahkara the Fang would want her heirlooms to help protect your people."
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라 님도 자신의 가보가 신민을 보호하는 데 도움이 되길 바라실 걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB5"
msgid "These heirlooms could make a real difference. Displaying them in a tomb is just wasting them."
msgstr "이 가보들이 실질적인 변화를 일으킬 수 있을 거예요. 무덤에 부장품으로 두는 건 그저 낭비일 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB4"
msgid "Being afraid isn't the way to honor the memory of a courageous ancestor."
msgstr "두려움에 떠는 건 용감했던 조상님을 기리는 방식이 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB3"
msgid "You bring shame to Mahkara's legacy by being afraid to let your daughter fight for your people."
msgstr "따님이 당신네 신민을 위해 싸우는 걸 두려워하는 건 마카라 님의 유산에 불명예를 안기는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB2"
msgid "You're a scared old man whose fear is now destroying your daughter's dreams."
msgstr "당신은 두려움에 사로잡힌 늙은이일 뿐이고, 그 두려움이 지금 따님의 꿈을 짓밟고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB1"
msgid "Perhaps I have been too cautious."
msgstr "내가 너무 걱정한 걸지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AB0"
msgid "I admit, there are times I've questioned myself."
msgstr "인정하네. 나 자신에게 의문을 품은 적도 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAF"
msgid "I've tried to do what I thought best for Maaliya, but there have been many doubts."
msgstr "말리야를 위해 최선이라고 생각한 일을 해왔지만, 나조차도 회의감이 들 때가 많았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAE"
msgid "What you call fear, I call taking responsibility."
msgstr "자네는 두려움이라고 부르지만, 난 책임감을 갖는 것이라 부르네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern rebuttal / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAD"
msgid "Do not presume to judge me."
msgstr "함부로 날 판단하려 들지 마라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard02_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAC"
msgid "Don't waste your time trying to goad me with insults. It won't work."
msgstr "모욕해서 자극하려 해도 소용없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAB"
msgid "It does seem a shame to render them so useless."
msgstr "가보들을 쓸모없게 놔두는 건 안타깝긴 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AAA"
msgid "They were made by the best craftsmen of the age, and yet their beauty goes unappreciated."
msgstr "그 시대 최고의 장인들이 만들었는데, 그 아름다움은 제대로 인정받지 못하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA9"
msgid "I've often wondered if some part of Mahkara's spirit lives on in these items."
msgstr "가끔 마카라 님의 영혼 일부가 이 물건들에 깃들어 있는 건 아닌지 궁금했다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Succeed
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA8"
msgid "The thought gives weight to your argument."
msgstr "그렇게 생각하니 자네 주장에 무게가 실리는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA7"
msgid "The items have great meaning and value to my family, it is true, but my daughter has more."
msgstr "그 물건들이 우리 가문에 큰 의미와 가치가 있는 건 사실이지만, 그런 것들보다 내 딸이 더 중요하다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA6"
msgid "It might seem wasteful to you, but these items were safe in their resting place for decades."
msgstr "자네에겐 낭비로 보일지 모르지만, 이 물건들은 수십 년 동안 안식처에 안전하게 보관되어 있었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA5"
msgid "It's best if they remain safe for future generations to admire."
msgstr "미래 세대가 보고 감탄할 수 있도록 안전하게 보관하는 게 최선이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010D7277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_SC_Hard01_Fail
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA4"
msgid "When it comes to my daughter's safety, the worth of the heirlooms is the least of my concerns."
msgstr "딸아이의 안전이 걸려 있다면, 가보가 얼마나 가치 있는지는 알 바 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& FarudHajtal: And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient.|If not for your help, our precious heirlooms could have been taken off-world and never seen again.|But that shame is not your burden to bear, so I'll speak no more of it. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I... &&& FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E8F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA2"
msgid "The Hajtals are known for demanding strict obedience from servant and child alike."
msgstr "하즈탈 가문은 하인이든 아이든 모두에게 엄격한 복종을 요구하는 것으로 유명하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& FarudHajtal: And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient.|If not for your help, our precious heirlooms could have been taken off-world and never seen again.|But that shame is not your burden to bear, so I'll speak no more of it. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I... &&& FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E8F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA1"
msgid "I feel like I'm reliving my past here."
msgstr "여기 있으니 과거에 겪었던 일이 떠오르네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack. &&& FarudHajtal: And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient.|If not for your help, our precious heirlooms could have been taken off-world and never seen again.|But that shame is not your burden to bear, so I'll speak no more of it. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I... &&& FarudHajtal: Enough, child. I have said all I have to say on the matter.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Shall we bring this misadventure to a close?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E8F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011AA0"
msgid "This is clearly a family matter. Perhaps it's best that we not get too involved."
msgstr "이건 가족 문제야. 우리가 너무 관여하지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE19E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DialogueGenericHouseVaruunShips_ShieldsDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipShieldsDown
msgctxt "011A9F"
msgid "Our shields have been compromised!"
msgstr "우리 보호막이 깨졌다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A9E"
msgid "I'm not looking for any trouble, convert."
msgstr "개종자여, 다투고 싶진 않아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A9D"
msgid "Calm down. There is no need for that."
msgstr "진정해. 그럴 필요는 없잖나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A9C"
msgid "Calm yourself! We are all servants of House Va'ruun here!"
msgstr "진정해! 우린 모두 바룬 가문의 신민이잖아!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A9B"
msgid "Back off. There is no reason for conflict."
msgstr "물러나. 더 이상 싸울 필요는 없어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A9A"
msgid "Keep cool. There is no need for such temperatures."
msgstr "진정해. 그럴 필요는 없잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F39
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_ReactToWarn_HumanTarget
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: ReactToWarn
msgctxt "011A99"
msgid "Take it easy! There is no need for such conflict!"
msgstr "진정해! 서로 싸울 필요는 없잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraVorisNerun: Humph, the walking security breach.|If it were up to me, you would have never made it past the city gates. Be well aware that I am always watching you.|If you make a single mistake, if you ever jeopardize the people of Dazra, then I will be there to bring you down.
