msgctxt "011A51"
msgid "Forgive me, Great Serpent. I have lost your offering."
msgstr "용서하소서, 위대한 뱀이시여. 당신께 바칠 제물을 놓쳤습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011A50"
msgid "No matter. In time they will be judged like the rest."
msgstr "상관없다. 결국 그놈도 다른 놈들처럼 심판받을 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "011A4F"
msgid "Lost them. But they shall feed the Great Serpent in time."
msgstr "놓쳤다. 하지만 결국 그놈도 위대한 뱀의 양식이 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A4E"
msgid "There you are!"
msgstr "거기 있었군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A4D"
msgid "Now you will pay!"
msgstr "이제 네놈이 대가를 치를 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A4C"
msgid "The Great Serpent delivers you to me!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 내게 보내셨다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A4B"
msgid "You cannot flee justice!"
msgstr "정의의 심판을 피할 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A4A"
msgid "Hahahaha, you're mine!"
msgstr "하하하하, 넌 내 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A49"
msgid "And now for your judgement!"
msgstr "이제 네놈을 심판할 시간이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A48"
msgid "Ha! The Shrouding is inescapable!"
msgstr "하! 장막의 날을 피할 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "011A47"
msgid "Now we deliver your suffering!"
msgstr "이제 네게 고통을 선사하마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A46"
msgid "You cannot escape judgement..."
msgstr "심판을 피할 순 없다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A45"
msgid "I can smell your sin... I will find you!"
msgstr "네 죄악의 냄새가 난다... 널 찾아내고 말겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A44"
msgid "Where have you gone, coward?"
msgstr "어디로 간 거냐, 겁쟁아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A43"
msgid "Show yourself!"
msgstr "모습을 드러내라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A42"
msgid "You cannot elude the Shrouding!"
msgstr "장막의 날에서 벗어날 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A41"
msgid "Time is running out for you..."
msgstr "네놈에게 시간이 얼마 남지 않았다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A40"
msgid "We will find you, and you will be judged!"
msgstr "널 찾아내서 심판하겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A3F"
msgid "We can smell the stench of your heresy..."
msgstr "네 이단의 악취가 진동하는구나..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "011A3E"
msgid "You cannot escape the Promised!"
msgstr "약속받은 자들을 피할 순 없다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A3D"
msgid "And so it ends."
msgstr "이렇게 끝나는군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A3C"
msgid "It could end no other way."
msgstr "이렇게 끝날 수밖에."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A3B"
msgid "The righteous prevail."
msgstr "정의가 승리한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A3A"
msgid "Another offering for the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 바칠 또 다른 제물이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A39"
msgid "The Great Serpent shall feast."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 포식하시리라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A38"
msgid "Truth has been brought to the accursed."
msgstr "저주받은 자에게 진실이 당도했다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "011A37"
msgid "Great Serpent, your will is done."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 당신의 뜻이 이루어졌습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunShips
#. TOPIC: 010CE199
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotShips_AllyKilled
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: AllyKilled
msgctxt "011A36"
msgid "A Promised has fallen!"
msgstr "약속받은 자 하나가 쓰러졌다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011A35"
msgid "Move! Find the killer and make them suffer!"
msgstr "움직여! 살인자를 찾아서 고통받게 하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011A34"
msgid "A heretic is among us! Make them pay!"
msgstr "우리 중에 이단자가 있다! 놈에게 대가를 치르게 하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: You utter fool! Do you have any idea what you have done?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010F64C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1000_KarijaFinalFG
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011A33"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "안돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011A32"
msgid "What? Impossible!"
msgstr "뭐? 말도 안 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_DetectFriendDie
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: DetectFriendDie
msgctxt "011A31"
msgid "By the Serpent!"
msgstr "뱀의 이름으로!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A30"
msgid "The accursed has escaped me!"
msgstr "저주받은 놈이 내게서 도망쳤다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2F"
msgid "Find them! They cannot have gotten far!"
msgstr "놈을 찾아라! 멀리 가진 못했을 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2E"
msgid "This is futile! You cannot evade us!"
msgstr "소용없다! 우릴 피할 순 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2D"
msgid "We mustn't allow the heretic to escape!"
msgstr "이단자를 놓쳐선 안 된다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2C"
msgid "Come back and face me, coward!"
msgstr "돌아와서 내게 맞서라, 겁쟁아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2B"
msgid "You will know truth, coward!"
msgstr "진실을 알아라, 겁쟁아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A2A"
msgid "Run from me, will you?!"
msgstr "내게서 도망칠 수 있을 것 같나?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToLost
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToLost
msgctxt "011A29"
msgid "The Serpent will have you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 거두실 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A28"
msgid "There is nothing. Too bad..."
msgstr "아무것도 없군. 유감이군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A27"
msgid "Perhaps I was mistaken..."
msgstr "내가 잘못 본 건가..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A26"
msgid "Mustn't be so on edge..."
msgstr "너무 긴장하지 말아야지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A25"
msgid "Great Serpent, calm me..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저를 진정시켜 주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A24"
msgid "Nothing there, it seems..."
msgstr "아무것도 없는 것 같군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A23"
msgid "We must calm ourselves..."
msgstr "우린 진정해야 한다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A22"
msgid "I'd hoped for a challenge..."
msgstr "도전 과제를 기대했는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "011A21"
msgid "The mind plays tricks..."
msgstr "착각이었나..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A20"
msgid "You thought you could hide?!"
msgstr "숨을 수 있을 줄 알았나?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1F"
msgid "The Great Serpent reveals you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 드러내셨다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1E"
msgid "There you are, accursed brute!"
msgstr "거기 있었군, 저주받은 짐승아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1D"
msgid "Now you are mine!"
msgstr "이제 넌 내 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1C"
msgid "Your punishment begins!"
msgstr "네놈의 형벌이 시작된다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1B"
msgid "You could not evade us!"
msgstr "우릴 피할 순 없었다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "011A1A"
msgid "A heretic! Here!"
msgstr "이단자다! 저기 있다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A19"
msgid "I know you can hear me..."
msgstr "내 말이 들린다는 걸 안다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A18"
msgid "You cannot evade me forever..."
msgstr "영원히 날 피할 순 없다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A17"
msgid "Evasion is futile..."
msgstr "소용없는 짓이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A16"
msgid "I know you're near... the Great Serpent guides me..."
msgstr "네가 근처에 있다는 걸 안다... 위대한 뱀께서 날 인도하신다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A15"
msgid "The Great Serpent will have you eventually..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 결국 널 찾아내실 것이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertIdle_Suspicious
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A14"
msgid "The longer you make me look, the worse it will be for you..."
msgstr "날 더 찾게 만들수록, 네놈에게 더 고통스러울 것이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A13"
msgid "I'd swear I heard..."
msgstr "분명히 들었는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A12"
msgid "Great Serpent guide me... help me find what eludes me..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 절 인도하소서... 제게서 벗어난 것을 찾도록 도와주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A11"
msgid "Feel like I'm being watched..."
msgstr "누군가 날 지켜보는 것 같아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A10"
msgid "I sense a disturbance..."
msgstr "뭔가 이상한 기운이 느껴져..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A0F"
msgid "Great Serpent... reveal what I cannot see..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 제게 보이지 않는 것을 보여주소서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A3
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealots_AlertIdleDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertIdle
msgctxt "011A0E"
msgid "I know what I heard..."
msgstr "내가 뭘 들었는지 알고 있다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FF"
msgid "Of course. How would you know about that place?"
msgstr "물론입니다. 당신이 그곳에 대해 어떻게 알겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FE"
msgid "It's an old mineral processing facility a good distance to the southeast of Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라 남동쪽으로 꽤 멀리 떨어진 오래된 광물 정제소입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FD"
msgid "It closed down years ago due to... you know, I'm not even sure why. It ran out of resources I think? There was very little talk about it around town."
msgstr ""
"몇 년 전에... 그게, 왜인지는 저도 잘 모르겠습니다. 자원이 고갈된 것 같았어요. 마을에서는 자원 부족에 대해 거의 이야기하지 "
"않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FC"
msgid "It's an old mineral processing facility a good distance to the southeast of Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라 남동쪽으로 꽤 멀리 떨어진 오래된 광물 정제소입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FB"
msgid "It closed down years ago due to... you know, I'm not even sure why. It ran out of resources I think? There was very little talk about it around town."
msgstr ""
"몇 년 전에... 그게, 왜인지는 저도 잘 모르겠습니다. 자원이 고갈된 것 같았어요. 마을에서는 자원 부족에 대해 거의 이야기하지 "
"않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_02TopLevelFacility
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119FA"
msgid "The only silver lining was that all of the workers were placed into other positions throughout the city, so no one went hungry."
msgstr "그나마 다행인 점은 모든 노동자가 도시 전역의 다른 직책으로 배치되어 굶주리는 사람이 없었다는 것입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraGennaDubari: Ochim? Used to be Ochim Sharon, right, before he got adopted. Yeah, I've seen him around here a few times.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010D5F83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_MS01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119F2"
msgid "Do you know a patron named Ochim Ka'dic? Did you ever see him here with anyone?"
msgstr "오킴 카딕이라는 후원자에 대해 알고 계신가요? 오킴이 여기서 누군가와 함께 있는 걸 본 적이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you know a patron named Ochim Ka'dic? Did you ever see him here with anyone?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010D5F82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_MS01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119F1"
msgid "Ochim? Used to be Ochim Sharon, right, before he got adopted. Yeah, I've seen him around here a few times."
msgstr "오킴 씨요? 입양되기 전에는 오킴 샤론 씨였죠? 네, 여기서 몇 번 본 적이 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010D5F82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_MS01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119F0"
msgid "Usually it's with Mujeen. But this one time I saw him over by the balcony, chatting with Tevina Veth'aal."
msgstr "보통은 무진 씨와 함께 다니시죠. 근데 한번은 발코니에서 테비나 베타알 씨와 이야기를 나누고 계신 걸 봤어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: HVDazraGennaDubari
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010D5F82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Genna_TL_MS01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119EF"
msgid "Wouldn't think anything of it normally, except for the fact Mujeen and Tevina hate each other's guts. But none of my business either way."
msgstr ""
"보통이라면 아무 생각도 안 들었겠죠. 무진 씨와 테비나 씨가 서로 증오하는 사이라는 걸 상관 안 한다면요. 하지만 어쨌든 제가 상관할 "
"일은 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What should I be expecting in Khaslav's hideout?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What should I be expecting in Khaslav's hideout?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F764
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119EE"
msgid "Many Zealots, all willing to die in order to protect Khaslav. We must both be prepared for a great amount of bloodshed."
msgstr "많은 광신도들이 카슬라프를 보호하기 위해 기꺼이 죽을 거다. 우리 둘 다 엄청난 유혈 사태에 대비해야 할걸."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: All right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119EA"
msgid "I'd like to ask some questions about Khaslav."
msgstr "카슬라프에 대해 물어볼 게 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes Khaslav different from other Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What makes Khaslav different from other Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F762
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_02_Khaslav
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E8"
msgid "There is a small but important distinction between Khaslav and other Zealots. A Zealot, brutal as he may be, kills in the name of the Serpent's Crusade. They kill those they deem not worthy of the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"카슬라프와 다른 광신도들 사이에는 작지만 중요한 차이가 있지. 광신도는 잔인할지 몰라도 뱀의 성전을 명분으로 살생을 자행한다고. 놈들은 "
"위대한 뱀께 가치가 없다고 여기는 자들을 죽이는 거야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Of course not. I am not sure of anything, but I have no other options. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_04_DazraAcceptance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E4"
msgid "Are you sure this will make the people of Dazra accept you?"
msgstr "이 일로 다즈라 신민들이 너를 받아들여 줄 거라 생각하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure this will make the people of Dazra accept you?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_04_DazraAcceptance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E3"
msgid "Of course not. I am not sure of anything, but I have no other options."
msgstr "당연히 아니지. 확신할 수 있는 것도 전혀 없지만, 달리 선택할 수 있는 것도 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_04_DazraAcceptance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E2"
msgid "Once I do this, there is no going back. This will be seen by Zealots as an act of blatant heresy. There will be no chance of reconciliation, and I will become a dead man walking to them."
msgstr ""
"일단 이번 일을 벌이고 나면, 절대 돌이킬 수 없어. 광신도들은 이걸 명백한 이단 행위로 보겠지. 더 이상 화해할 수 없을 거고, 나는 "
"놈들에게 죽은 새끼 취급받게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_04_DazraAcceptance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E1"
msgid "If that does not convince the people of Dazra of my conviction, my earnestness in leaving that life behind, then nothing will."
msgstr ""
"그걸로도 다즈라 신민들이 나의 결심을, 예전 삶을 진심으로 버렸다는 걸 받아들이도록 만들 수 없다면, 설득할 다른 방법은 아마 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I read your diary. The one about the woman you saw.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119E0"
msgid "You had no right to do that, but what is done is done."
msgstr "당신에겐 그럴 권리가 없었지만, 이미 엎질러진 물이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What you did to those people was sadistic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DF"
msgid "So, I am sure you are disgusted, or enraged. What do you want to say to me?"
msgstr "그래, 분명 화가 났거나 역겨운 심정이겠군. 내게 무슨 말을 하고 싶나?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: You had no right to do that, but what is done is done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DE"
msgid "I read your diary. The one about the woman you saw."
msgstr "당신의 일기를 읽었어. 그 여인에 관해서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I read your diary. The one about the woman you saw. &&& Orahim: You had no right to do that, but what is done is done.|So, I am sure you are disgusted, or enraged. What do you want to say to me?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know it. And the guilt... it is nearly tearing my mind to shreds. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DD"
msgid "What you did to those people was sadistic."
msgstr "당신이 그 사람들한테 한 짓은 끔찍했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What you did to those people was sadistic.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What you did to those people was sadistic.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: There were more. Countless more. The amount of souls weighing on my conscience... it is more than I can take. 
