#. TOPIC: 010D5F2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DC"
msgid "I know it. And the guilt... it is nearly tearing my mind to shreds."
msgstr "나도 안다. 그리고 죄책감이... 날 정신적으로 조각내고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I read your diary. The one about the woman you saw. &&& Orahim: You had no right to do that, but what is done is done.|So, I am sure you are disgusted, or enraged. What do you want to say to me?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No they did not. No one deserves what we would do to them. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DB"
msgid "Maybe they deserved it."
msgstr "당해도 싼 자들이었을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they deserved it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe they deserved it.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: There were more. Countless more. The amount of souls weighing on my conscience... it is more than I can take. 
