#. TOPIC: 010D5F29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119DA"
msgid "No they did not. No one deserves what we would do to them."
msgstr "아니, 그렇지 않다. 그 누구도 우리가 그 사람들에게 한 짓을 당해선 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I read your diary. The one about the woman you saw. &&& Orahim: You had no right to do that, but what is done is done.|So, I am sure you are disgusted, or enraged. What do you want to say to me?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you are trying to say that we are not so different, do not. Do not lower yourself that way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D9"
msgid "When I was a soldier, I saw and did things that still haunt me to this day. I feel guilty, too."
msgstr "나도 군인이었을 때, 지금까지 괴롭게 하는 온갖 일들을 보았고, 실행에 옮겼었지... 나도 죄책감을 느껴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When I was a soldier, I saw and did things that still haunt me to this day. I feel guilty, too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When I was a soldier, I saw and did things that still haunt me to this day. I feel guilty, too.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: There were more. Countless more. The amount of souls weighing on my conscience... it is more than I can take. 
