#. TOPIC: 010D5F27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D8"
msgid "If you are trying to say that we are not so different, do not. Do not lower yourself that way."
msgstr "너와 내가 그렇게 다를 바 없다고 말하려는 거라면, 그러지 마라. 그렇게 자신을 낮출 필요는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: I know it. And the guilt... it is nearly tearing my mind to shreds. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D7"
msgid "There were more. Countless more. The amount of souls weighing on my conscience... it is more than I can take."
msgstr "훨씬 많았으니까. 셀 수 없이 많은 사람들. 내 양심을 옥죄는 영혼들의 수는... 내가 감당할 수 있는 것보다 많다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D6"
msgid "The truth is that I am selfish. I am on this mission to seek acceptance, to start a new life, to make myself feel better."
msgstr "사실 난 이기적인 놈이다. 난 새 사람으로 인정받고, 새 삶을 시작하기 위해, 괴로움을 떨쳐내기 위해 이 임무를 수행하는 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You aren't that person anymore.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D5"
msgid "But if the Great Serpent never cursed me with this shame, I would probably still be a Zealot alongside Khaslav."
msgstr "하지만 위대한 뱀께서 수치심이라는 저주를 내리지 않으셨다면, 아마 여전히 카슬라프와 함께하는 광신도였겠지."

