#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D4"
msgid "You aren't that person anymore."
msgstr "당신은 더 이상 그런 사람이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You aren't that person anymore.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You aren't that person anymore.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D3"
msgid "Do not say such stupid things, I will always be that person. But maybe... maybe that person can change."
msgstr "바보 같은 소리 마라, 나는 항상 그런 사람이다. 하지만 아마도... 아마도 그 사람이 변할 수 있을지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What you did to those people was sadistic. &&& Orahim: I know it. And the guilt... it is nearly tearing my mind to shreds.  &&& Orahim: There were more. Countless more. The amount of souls weighing on my conscience... it is more than I can take. |The truth is that I am selfish. I am on this mission to seek acceptance, to start a new life, to make myself feel better.|But if the Great Serpent never cursed me with this shame, I would probably still be a Zealot alongside Khaslav. 
