#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_05_OrahimDiary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119D2"
msgid "I'm keeping my eye on you."
msgstr "앞으로 계속 당신을 주시하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm keeping my eye on you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm keeping my eye on you.
