#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0119BD"
msgid "I will meet you at my shack outside of the city. You cannot miss it."
msgstr "도시 밖에 있는 내 오두막에서 보자. 보면 바로 알 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0119BC"
msgid "Not here. We can discuss more at my shack."
msgstr "여기선 안 돼. 자세한 얘기는 내 오두막에서 나누도록 하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0119BB"
msgid "Meet me at Khaslav's hideout when you are ready. And please, be quick about it."
msgstr "준비가 되면 카슬라프의 은신처에서 만나자고. 부디 금방 와줬으면 좋겠군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0119BA"
msgid "We should be leaving soon. What do you need?"
msgstr "우리 곧 떠나야 하는데. 뭐가 필요하지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
