#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F35
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_OrahimHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0119B8"
