msgstr "그럼, 가던 길 가도록."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS00B_MS01_OchimGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0119B1"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_InazaKaisir_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0119B0"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "잘 가세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F36
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_KhaslavWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0119AF"
msgid "You accursed are so stupid. Incapable of even forming a sentence."
msgstr "너희 저주받은 자들은 참 멍청하구나. 말 한마디도 못 하다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F36
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_KhaslavWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0119AE"
msgid "If I tortured you... would that expedite this conversation?"
msgstr "내가 널 고문하면... 이 대화가 좀 더 빨리 이루어지려나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010D5F36
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS02_KhaslavWFPI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0119AD"
msgid "Out with it, damn it."
msgstr "얼른 말하란 말이야, 젠장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Gamiral
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: You ask as if you do not have eyes, as if you cannot see that we are barely hanging on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_FarmStatus
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119AC"
msgid "How is the farm doing?"
msgstr "농장 일은 어떤가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is the farm doing?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: We try. There are few of us left, the payments have shrunk, and now with Dazra in its current state...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_FarmStatus
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119AB"
msgid "You ask as if you do not have eyes, as if you cannot see that we are barely hanging on."
msgstr "뭐 눈이 안 달리기라도 했어요? 겨우 버티고 있는 거 빤히 다 보이잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: composing yourself, heavy sigh at the top, then explaining patiently but without much hope / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: You ask as if you do not have eyes, as if you cannot see that we are barely hanging on.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: What can we do but try?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_FarmStatus
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119AA"
msgid "We try. There are few of us left, the payments have shrunk, and now with Dazra in its current state..."
msgstr "노력은 하죠. 사람도 몇 명 안 남았고, 대금도 쪼그라들고, 이제는 다즈라까지 저렇게 됐으니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: We try. There are few of us left, the payments have shrunk, and now with Dazra in its current state...
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_FarmStatus
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A9"
msgid "What can we do but try?"
msgstr "노력밖에 더 하겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Gamiral
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Comrak will be the fourth generation to care for this place, should it survive that long.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A8"
msgid "How long has the farm been in your family?"
msgstr "가족끼리 농장을 운영한 지는 얼마나 됐나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: proud of your son, but bitter about the future / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long has the farm been in your family?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: This is hardly the prosperous future my grandfather saw for us when he took charge so many years ago. I worry that he would see me as a failure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A7"
msgid "Comrak will be the fourth generation to care for this place, should it survive that long."
msgstr "컴락이 여길 관리한다면 4대째가 되겠네요. 그만큼 오래 살아야 하겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Comrak will be the fourth generation to care for this place, should it survive that long.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Forgive me. I have not been sleeping well, and it clouds my mood.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A6"
msgid "This is hardly the prosperous future my grandfather saw for us when he took charge so many years ago. I worry that he would see me as a failure."
msgstr "아주 오래 전에 우리 할아버지가 보셨던 번창한 미래라고는 말하기 힘들겠네요. 그분이 날 실패자로 보시진 않을까 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: This is hardly the prosperous future my grandfather saw for us when he took charge so many years ago. I worry that he would see me as a failure.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A5"
msgid "Forgive me. I have not been sleeping well, and it clouds my mood."
msgstr "미안해요. 잠을 제대로 못 자서 기분이 안 좋거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Gamiral
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Mm. Bad dreams. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A4"
msgid "You're having trouble sleeping?"
msgstr "잠 자는 데 문제라도 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're having trouble sleeping?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: It is the stress, I am sure. Little goes well for us, or for House Va'ruun as a whole, it would seem.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A3"
msgid "Mm. Bad dreams."
msgstr "으음. 악몽을 꿔요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Mm. Bad dreams. 
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: I suppose, given all this disquiet, I should be more concerned if I were sleeping soundly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A2"
msgid "It is the stress, I am sure. Little goes well for us, or for House Va'ruun as a whole, it would seem."
msgstr "분명 스트레스 때문이겠죠. 우리한텐 좋은 일이 별로 없나 봐요. 아님 바룬 가문 전체가 다 그렇거나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: rueful smile, bitter / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: It is the stress, I am sure. Little goes well for us, or for House Va'ruun as a whole, it would seem.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A1"
msgid "I suppose, given all this disquiet, I should be more concerned if I were sleeping soundly."
msgstr "이렇게 불안하게 살고 있으니, 잠을 잘 자고 있으면 그게 더 걱정할 일이겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: There is not much to tell. I find myself wandering the same corridors, always on edge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0119A0"
msgid "Tell me about your dreams."
msgstr "꿈 이야기를 해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: It is as if I am a predator, trapped in a cage forever. Does that make sense?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199F"
msgid "There is not much to tell. I find myself wandering the same corridors, always on edge."
msgstr "말할 게 많진 않아요. 꿈속에서 항상 똑같은 복도를 돌아다니죠. 긴장한 채로요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: There is not much to tell. I find myself wandering the same corridors, always on edge.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: I cannot explain it any better. I suppose that sounds silly, hardly the sort of thing to affect one's sleep. And yet, I wake all too often.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199E"
msgid "It is as if I am a predator, trapped in a cage forever. Does that make sense?"
msgstr "마치 우리 안에 영원히 갇힌 육식동물이 된 것 같아요. 그게 말이 되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: It is as if I am a predator, trapped in a cage forever. Does that make sense?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199D"
msgid "I cannot explain it any better. I suppose that sounds silly, hardly the sort of thing to affect one's sleep. And yet, I wake all too often."
msgstr "더 잘 설명하진 못하겠네요. 바보 같은 소리겠지만, 잠을 못 잘 만한 내용은 아니잖아요. 그런데도 너무 자주 잠에서 깨요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: As I tell my husband when he asks too frequently: I am fine. It is fine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_DailyLife
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199C"
msgid "What's it like living here?"
msgstr "여기서 사는 건 어떤가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's it like living here?
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: Is life difficult? Do we struggle? Of course. But it is what the Great Serpent demands of us. So who am I to complain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_DailyLife
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199B"
msgid "As I tell my husband when he asks too frequently: I am fine. It is fine."
msgstr "랄지라, '남편이 너무 자주 물어볼 때마다 하는 말이지만, 난 괜찮아. 다 괜찮다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: As I tell my husband when he asks too frequently: I am fine. It is fine.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: One need only look to the horizon, watch the sun rise behind... whatever it is that has happened to the Citadel, to realize that things could be worse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_DailyLife
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01199A"
msgid "Is life difficult? Do we struggle? Of course. But it is what the Great Serpent demands of us. So who am I to complain."
msgstr ""
"랄지라, '인생이 힘드냐고? 우리가 발버둥 치냐고? 당연하지. 하지만 그건 위대한 뱀께서 우리에게 요구하시는 거야. 그러니 내가 어찌 "
"감히 불평하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: Is life difficult? Do we struggle? Of course. But it is what the Great Serpent demands of us. So who am I to complain.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: A bad night's sleep or a hard day's work are nothing compared to what our brothers and sisters in the city must be going through.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_DailyLife
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011999"
msgid "One need only look to the horizon, watch the sun rise behind... whatever it is that has happened to the Citadel, to realize that things could be worse."
msgstr ""
"랄지라, '지평선을 바라보고, 성채에 무슨 일이 일어났든 그 뒤로 해가 뜨는 걸 지켜보면, 상황이 더 나빠질 수도 있었다는 걸 깨닫게 "
"되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: One need only look to the horizon, watch the sun rise behind... whatever it is that has happened to the Citadel, to realize that things could be worse.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_DailyLife
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011998"
msgid "A bad night's sleep or a hard day's work are nothing compared to what our brothers and sisters in the city must be going through."
msgstr "랄지라, '잠 못 이루는 밤이나 힘든 하루 일과는 도시에 있는 우리 형제자매들이 겪고 있을 일에 비하면 아무것도 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Raljira
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: Gone, clearly. Once this used to be a community of sorts. But over the years, it became harder to get by.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_EveryoneElse
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011997"
msgid "What happened to this place? Where is everyone?"
msgstr "이곳에 무슨 일이 일어난 거죠? 다들 어디 있는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Raljira
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: How can I not? I have a husband and child to worry about. Not to mention a faltering livelihood, friends abandoning us...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011996"
msgid "You've been sleeping poorly?"
msgstr "잠을 잘 못 주무셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've been sleeping poorly?
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: I am sure you can imagine the stress. I wake frequently, and when I do sleep, my dreams are troubled.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011995"
msgid "How can I not? I have a husband and child to worry about. Not to mention a faltering livelihood, friends abandoning us..."
msgstr ""
"랄지라, '어떻게 안 그럴 수 있겠어? 걱정해야 할 남편과 아이가 있는데. 흔들리는 생계는 말할 것도 없고, 친구들은 우리를 버리고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: How can I not? I have a husband and child to worry about. Not to mention a faltering livelihood, friends abandoning us...
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: I pray that the Serpent delivers us from this trial before too much longer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011994"
msgid "I am sure you can imagine the stress. I wake frequently, and when I do sleep, my dreams are troubled."
msgstr "랄지라, '스트레스가 얼마나 심할지 상상이 가실 거야. 자주 깨어나고, 잠이 들어도 꿈자리가 뒤숭숭해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: I am sure you can imagine the stress. I wake frequently, and when I do sleep, my dreams are troubled.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011993"
msgid "I pray that the Serpent delivers us from this trial before too much longer."
msgstr "랄지라, '뱀께서 이 시련에서 우리를 더는 지체되지 않게 구해주시길 기도해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Raljira
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: They are... unclear. My hands are not my own, holding a weapon I have never seen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011992"
msgid "What kind of dreams are you having?"
msgstr "어떤 꿈을 꾸시는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of dreams are you having?
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: I am filled with a sense of frightful purpose. I pace endlessly, waiting for an... attack? I am unsure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011991"
msgid "They are... unclear. My hands are not my own, holding a weapon I have never seen."
msgstr "랄지라, '그게... 불분명해. 내 손이 내 손이 아닌 것 같고, 본 적도 없는 무기를 쥐고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: They are... unclear. My hands are not my own, holding a weapon I have never seen.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: But I fear that something will come, and I will fail.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011990"
msgid "I am filled with a sense of frightful purpose. I pace endlessly, waiting for an... attack? I am unsure."
msgstr "랄지라, '두려운 사명감으로 가득 차 있지. 끝없이 서성이면서, 공격을 기다리는 건가...? 잘 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: I am filled with a sense of frightful purpose. I pace endlessly, waiting for an... attack? I am unsure.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198F"
msgid "But I fear that something will come, and I will fail."
msgstr "랄지라, '하지만 무언가 닥쳐올 거고, 난 실패할까 봐 두려워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happened to this place? Where is everyone?
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: Moods turned sour, and some started looking for work elsewhere. Dazra, mostly. One by one, the families we had grown to care about as we worked side by side left for the city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_EveryoneElse
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198E"
msgid "Gone, clearly. Once this used to be a community of sorts. But over the years, it became harder to get by."
msgstr "랄지라, '분명히, 다 떠났지. 한때 이곳은 일종의 공동체였어. 하지만 시간이 흐르면서, 먹고살기가 점점 더 힘들어졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: Gone, clearly. Once this used to be a community of sorts. But over the years, it became harder to get by.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Raljira: Now, looking to Dazra, I fear that decision may have cost them their lives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_EveryoneElse
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198D"
msgid "Moods turned sour, and some started looking for work elsewhere. Dazra, mostly. One by one, the families we had grown to care about as we worked side by side left for the city."
msgstr ""
"랄지라, '분위기가 안 좋아졌고, 일부는 다른 곳에서 일자리를 찾기 시작했어. 대부분 다즈라로 갔지. 우리가 함께 일하면서 정들었던 "
"가족들이 하나둘씩 도시로 떠났어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Raljira: Moods turned sour, and some started looking for work elsewhere. Dazra, mostly. One by one, the families we had grown to care about as we worked side by side left for the city.
#. ALIAS: Raljira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Raljira_EveryoneElse
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198C"
msgid "Now, looking to Dazra, I fear that decision may have cost them their lives."
msgstr "랄지라, '이제 다즈라를 보니, 그 결정이 그들의 목숨을 앗아갔을지도 모른다는 두려움이 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Kaviil
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: In comparison to some, hardly any time at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_HowLong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198B"
msgid "How long have you lived here?"
msgstr "여기서 얼마나 오래 지낸 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: In comparison to some, hardly any time at all.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I suspect, given my age, that my story will likely end here. At least, until the Great Serpent decides what to do with me after.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_HowLong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01198A"
msgid "I stumbled upon this place a few years back, and they were so desperate for help. I offered my services, they accepted, and here we are."
msgstr ""
"몇 년 전에 우연히 왔는데, 여기 사람들이 간절히 도움을 찾고 있더라고요. 내가 도와주겠다고 했고, 사람들이 받아 줘서 이렇게 된 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long have you lived here?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I stumbled upon this place a few years back, and they were so desperate for help. I offered my services, they accepted, and here we are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_HowLong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011989"
msgid "In comparison to some, hardly any time at all."
msgstr "다른 사람들하고 비교하면 오래되지도 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I stumbled upon this place a few years back, and they were so desperate for help. I offered my services, they accepted, and here we are.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_HowLong
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011988"
msgid "I suspect, given my age, that my story will likely end here. At least, until the Great Serpent decides what to do with me after."
msgstr "내 나이를 생각해 보면, 내 이야기는 여기서 끝날 것 같네요. 적어도 위대한 뱀께서 날 어떻게 하실지 결정하실 때까진 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I am not sure I have "liked" anywhere, to be honest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_LikeIt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011987"
msgid "Do you like it here?"
msgstr "여기는 마음에 드나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you like it here?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: The work is predictable, not too taxing, and Gamiral lets me get away with less than others might. I could do worse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_LikeIt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011986"
msgid "I am not sure I have \"liked\" anywhere, to be honest."
msgstr "솔직히, 어딜 가든 마음에 들진 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I am not sure I have "liked" anywhere, to be honest.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: The aches and pains of old age would follow me no matter where I go, and if I could just get a good night's sleep I would find this all quite acceptable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_LikeIt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011985"
msgid "The work is predictable, not too taxing, and Gamiral lets me get away with less than others might. I could do worse."
msgstr "일이야 항상 똑같고, 너무 힘든 것도 아니고, 개미럴은 날 다른 사람들보다 덜 괴롭히죠. 더 나쁠 수도 있었다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: The work is predictable, not too taxing, and Gamiral lets me get away with less than others might. I could do worse.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_LikeIt
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011984"
msgid "The aches and pains of old age would follow me no matter where I go, and if I could just get a good night's sleep I would find this all quite acceptable."
msgstr "내가 어디로 가든 세월의 고통은 항상 따라다닐 테니까, 편히 잠들 수만 있게 된다면 이 정도는 다 받아들일 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Goodness, no. Not a decent night's sleep in years, at least that I can recall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kavill_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011983"
msgid "You're not sleeping well?"
msgstr "잠을 잘 못 자는 모양이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not sleeping well?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: The aforementioned aches and pains, at first, but over time I find my dreams drift towards something... dark?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kavill_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011982"
msgid "Goodness, no. Not a decent night's sleep in years, at least that I can recall."
msgstr "세상에나. 그래요. 내 기억에는 지난 몇 년 동안 제대로 잠을 못 잤죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: Goodness, no. Not a decent night's sleep in years, at least that I can recall.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: The product of an anxious mind with too many years. Think nothing of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BDA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kavill_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011981"
msgid "The aforementioned aches and pains, at first, but over time I find my dreams drift towards something... dark?"
msgstr "처음엔 아까 말했던 그런 고통에 시달렸지만, 시간이 지나고 나니 꿈이 뭐랄까... 어둠 속으로 떠내려간다고 해야 하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: The aforementioned aches and pains, at first, but over time I find my dreams drift towards something... dark?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kavill_NotSleeping
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011980"
msgid "The product of an anxious mind with too many years. Think nothing of it."
msgstr "너무 오랫동안 불안하게 지내서 그런 거겠죠. 별 거 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: There is not much to tell. I find myself wandering the same corridors, always on edge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Gamiral_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197F"
msgid "Tell me about your dreams."
msgstr "그 꿈 얘기를 해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197E"
msgid "Why would you care about the meaningless dreams of an old man?"
msgstr "늙은이가 꾸는 무의미한 꿈 얘기 들어서 뭐 하려고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197D"
msgid "I think we have talked enough about my dreams."
msgstr "내 꿈 얘기는 이제 충분히 한 것 같군요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I think perhaps it would be better to not attempt to understand that.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: There are others, and we are trapped for eternity. Doomed to roam this corner of the world of the living. I fear I shall never see the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197C"
msgid "I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls."
msgstr "꿈 속에서 난... 유령이 돼서 오랫동안 버려졌던 건물을 돌아다녀요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams. &&& Kaviil: Why would you care about the meaningless dreams of an old man?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And are you one of them?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197B"
msgid "There are people who believe that dreams always mean something."
msgstr "꿈은 항상 무언가를 의미한다고 믿는 사람들도 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are people who believe that dreams always mean something.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are people who believe that dreams always mean something.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01197A"
msgid "And are you one of them?"
msgstr "당신도 그런 사람이고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams. &&& Kaviil: Why would you care about the meaningless dreams of an old man?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You have a curious way of doing it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011979"
msgid "I'm just making small talk."
msgstr "그냥 얘기나 하려는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm just making small talk.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just making small talk.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011978"
msgid "You have a curious way of doing it."
msgstr "이상한 방식으로 얘기를 하는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're right, I don't really care. Never mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right, I don't really care. Never mind.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011977"
msgid "You are very strange. Has anyone ever told you that before?"
msgstr "정말 이상한 사람이네요. 누가 그런 말 해준 적 없었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams. &&& Kaviil: Why would you care about the meaningless dreams of an old man?
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are very strange. Has anyone ever told you that before?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011976"
msgid "You're right, I don't really care. Never mind."
msgstr "맞네요. 별로 신경 안 써요. 잊어버려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your dreams. &&& Kaviil: Why would you care about the meaningless dreams of an old man?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose you are right.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011975"
msgid "Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't."
msgstr "꿈은 종종 우리 자신을 이해하는 열쇠가 될 수 있으니까요. 다른 방식으로는 알 수 없는 그런 이해 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: There is a recurring dream where I am a ghost. I am forced to repent for my sins in life, by spending eternity trapped... somewhere.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011974"
msgid "I suppose you are right."
msgstr "그 말이 맞는 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: Perhaps it simply means I worry I have not done enough with my life. Perhaps I am not getting enough vitamins.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011973"
msgid "There are others, and we are trapped for eternity. Doomed to roam this corner of the world of the living. I fear I shall never see the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"다른 사람들도 있는데, 함께 영원히 갇혀 있죠. 이승의 구석에서 떠돌아다닐 운명인 거예요. 난 위대한 뱀을 다시는 못 볼까봐 두려워하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: I suppose you are right.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: But recently the dreams have become... violent. I dreamt I killed a man. He had not wronged me in any way, but I did it just the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011972"
msgid "There is a recurring dream where I am a ghost. I am forced to repent for my sins in life, by spending eternity trapped... somewhere."
msgstr "내가 유령이 되는 꿈을 계속 꾸고는 하죠. 어딘가에 영원히 갇힌 채로 인생의 죄를 뉘우쳐야 하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: There are others, and we are trapped for eternity. Doomed to roam this corner of the world of the living. I fear I shall never see the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Kaviil
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011971"
msgid "Perhaps it simply means I worry I have not done enough with my life. Perhaps I am not getting enough vitamins."
msgstr "어쩌면 그냥 인생을 충분히 즐기지 못했다고 걱정하는 걸지도 모르죠. 비타민이 부족한 걸지도 모르고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: There is a recurring dream where I am a ghost. I am forced to repent for my sins in life, by spending eternity trapped... somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: And what is worse - I enjoyed it. Now every night I see him, lying on the floor in front of me, and I know that he died at my hands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01196E"
msgid "But recently the dreams have become... violent. I dreamt I killed a man. He had not wronged me in any way, but I did it just the same."
msgstr "그런데 최근에 꿈 내용이... 폭력적으로 변했죠. 사람을 죽이는 꿈을 꿨어요. 나한테 잘못한 것도 없는 사람인데 죽였다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: But recently the dreams have become... violent. I dreamt I killed a man. He had not wronged me in any way, but I did it just the same.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I think perhaps it would be better to not attempt to understand that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BBF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01196D"
msgid "And what is worse - I enjoyed it. Now every night I see him, lying on the floor in front of me, and I know that he died at my hands."
msgstr ""
"더 심한 건... 내가 그걸 즐겼다는 거고요. 이제 매일 밤 그 사람이 보여요. 내 앞에서 바닥에 쓰러져 있죠. 내 손에 죽은 채로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Dreams can often be a key to understanding something about ourselves we otherwise wouldn't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Kaviil: And what is worse - I enjoyed it. Now every night I see him, lying on the floor in front of me, and I know that he died at my hands.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Kaviil: I have this dream where I... I am a ghost, haunting long abandoned halls.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_TL_Kaviil_Dreams
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01196C"
msgid "I think perhaps it would be better to not attempt to understand that."
msgstr "그냥 이해하려 하지 않는 쪽이 더 좋을지도 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01196B"
msgid "Our farm... What will we do now?"
msgstr "우리 농장이... 이제 어떻게 하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player is not yet accepted in society.  / Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_Luther_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01196A"
msgid "You shouldn't be here."
msgstr "여기 있으면 안 돼요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011969"
msgid "How did you even get here?"
msgstr "여긴 어떻게 들어왔어요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011968"
msgid "You should leave before someone calls the guards or something."
msgstr "누가 경비병을 부르거나 뭘 하기 전에 나가세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011967"
msgid "Don't talk to me. You're going to get me in trouble."
msgstr "말 걸지 마요. 나중에 혼난단 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011966"
msgid "I do not understand. What did we do to deserve this?"
msgstr "이해가 안 돼. 우리가 무슨 짓을 했길래 이런 일을 당해야 하는 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011965"
msgid "Leave immediately. You dishonor this place with your presence."
msgstr "즉시 떠나. 네 존재로 이곳을 더럽히지 마."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011964"
msgid "Do not go near my son."
msgstr "내 아들 근처에 오지 말게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011963"
msgid "No one wants you here. Leave."
msgstr "아무도 널 여기 두고 싶어 하지 않아. 떠나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011962"
msgid "Remove yourself immediately."
msgstr "즉시 꺼져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011961"
msgid "Have we offended the Great Serpent so? Dazra was not enough?"
msgstr "우리가 위대한 뱀을 그렇게 화나게 했나요? 다즈라로도 부족했을까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011960"
msgid "I do not know you. You have no business here."
msgstr "모르는 사람인데. 댁은 여기 볼일 없잖아요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195F"
msgid "You have no business with this place or my family. Begone."
msgstr "그쪽은 이 농장이나 우리 가족이랑 상관 없잖아요. 나가요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195E"
msgid "The Great Serpent will deal with you. I have no wish to."
msgstr "댁은 위대한 뱀께서 처리하시겠죠. 내가 하고 싶진 않네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195D"
msgid "How dare you speak to any of us."
msgstr "감히 우리한테 말 걸지 말아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195C"
msgid "Are we cursed? Did we bring this on ourselves?"
msgstr "우린 저주받은 걸까요? 우리가 자초했을까요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195B"
msgid "You think you can just go where you please?"
msgstr "그냥 마음대로 돌아다닐 수 있을 줄 알았나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "01195A"
msgid "You are a bold one. Good luck with that."
msgstr "용기가 넘치는군요. 행운을 빌죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011959"
msgid "There is nothing here for you, husk. I suggest you move on."
msgstr "여긴 허물이 볼 만한 게 없어요. 다른 데로 가 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6C07
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_BlockingHellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011958"
msgid "What would I have to say to you. Get out of here."
msgstr "내가 해줄 말이라고는 여기서 떠라나는 것밖에 없네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011957"
msgid "If you're here for a meal, hope you like seaweed."
msgstr "밥 먹으러 오신 거면, 해초를 좋아하셔야 할 걸요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011956"
msgid "I've only been to Dazra a few times. It was nice. I hope everything turns out okay."
msgstr "다즈라엔 몇 번 밖에 못 가봤어요. 멋지던데요. 다 잘 풀리면 좋겠네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011955"
msgid "Have you met the Speaker? I have. Well, sort of."
msgstr "대변자님 만나본 적 있어요? 전 있는데. 음, 따지고 보면요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011954"
msgid "Father says this is all going to be mine someday. I can't tell if he thinks that's a good thing or not."
msgstr "아버지는 이 모든 게 언젠가 제 것이 될 거래요. 그걸 좋게 보시는지, 아닌지는 잘 모르겠어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosComrak
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011953"
msgid "I wish more people would move in. It's too quiet around here."
msgstr "신민들이 더 많이 오면 좋겠어요. 여긴 너무 조용해서요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011952"
msgid "It is good to see another servant of the Great Serpent. We get few visitors these days."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 섬기는 종을 또 보니까 좋은데요. 요즘엔 방문객이 별로 없거든요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011951"
msgid "I hear that on some worlds, farming can only be done during certain times of the year. Must be difficult."
msgstr "어떤 행성에서는 1년에 정해진 기간에만 농사를 지을 수 있다더라고요. 그거 참 힘들겠어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011950"
msgid "We do as House Va'ruun requires of us. All Must Serve."
msgstr "우린 바룬 가문이 요구하는 대로 하죠. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194F"
msgid "Our little corner of the universe is the same as ever."
msgstr "우주에 있는 이 작은 구석탱이는 언제나 똑같죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosGamiral
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194E"
msgid "The work is tiring at times, but important. House Va'ruun must eat, after all."
msgstr "일이 가끔 피곤하지만, 그래도 중요해요. 바룬 가문도 어쨌든 먹어야 하잖아요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194D"
msgid "Always good to see a friendly face."
msgstr "반가운 얼굴을 보니 좋네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194C"
msgid "I would say you caught us on a bad day, but they are all like this."
msgstr "안 좋은 날에 왔다고 말해주고 싶지만, 항상 이런 식이라서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194B"
msgid "It is not easy, seeing the Citadel like this, but the best thing we can do is continue our jobs."
msgstr "성채가 저렇게 된 걸 보긴 쉽지 않지만, 어쨌든 우리 일을 계속 하는 게 최선이겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01194A"
msgid "Another day, another mouthful of seaweed. May the Great Serpent bless us."
msgstr "날이 갈수록 입에 해초만 넣네요. 위대한 뱀이시여, 저흴 축복하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKaviilFahrzanas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosKaviil
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011949"
msgid "I would ask for news of the city, but I think I prefer not to know."
msgstr "도시 소식을 묻고 싶은데, 그냥 모르는 게 나을 것 같네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011948"
msgid "We do not have much, but are always willing to share."
msgstr "가진 건 별로 없지만, 언제든 기꺼이 나누지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011947"
msgid "There are no easy days on this farm, but they can be rewarding just the same."
msgstr "이 농장에서 쉬운 날은 없지만, 그만큼 보람도 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011946"
msgid "It is a shame you have to see the farm in this state, instead of what it was a decade ago."
msgstr "10년 전 농장의 모습이 아니라 이런 상태를 보게 돼서 유감이군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011945"
msgid "I hope Dazra will be okay. If we lose the city, what hope do we have?"
msgstr "다즈라가 무사했으면 좋겠어. 도시를 잃으면, 우리에겐 무슨 희망이 있겠어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRaljiraAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15
#. TOPIC: 010D6BD8
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Dialogue_LC15_HellosRaljira
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011944"
msgid "The Great Serpent will see us through, no matter the hardships."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 어떤 고난이 닥쳐도 우릴 지켜주실 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunCitizens
#. TOPIC: 010D1F3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_OnHit
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: OnHit
msgctxt "011943"
msgid "Arrrrgh!"
msgstr "아으윽!"

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011942"
msgid "All citizens are advised to remain calm during the current crisis."
msgstr "모든 신민들은 현재 재난 상황에 평정을 유지하시길 권고합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011941"
msgid "This unit is programmed to ensure all citizens should act in accordance with Jinan's teachings."
msgstr "이 기체는 모든 신민들이 지난 님의 가르침에 알맞는 생활을 교도하도록 프로그래밍되어 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011940"
msgid "Sensors detect a human presence. Salutations, follower of Jinan."
msgstr "센서가 인간의 존재를 감지했습니다. 경의를 표합니다. 지난 님의 추종자 여러분."

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01193F"
msgid "Scanning databanks for proper greeting. House Va'ruun welcomes your arrival."
msgstr "데이터뱅크 내에서 알맞은 인삿말 스캔 중. 바룬 가문은 귀하의 도착을 환영합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01193E"
msgid "Due to confidentiality, this unit is programmed to provide limited communication."
msgstr "기밀 보호를 위해 이 기체의 상호작용 수준은 현격히 제한되어 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D246F
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericModelA_Hellos01
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01193C"
msgid "Scanning. Member of House Va'ruun detected. Disengaging defenses."
msgstr "스캔 중. 바룬 가문의 일원임을 감지하였음. 방어 조치를 해제합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192F"
msgid "I was hoping you would eventually stumble into my shop. Welcome."
msgstr "결국 제 가게에 들르실 줄 알았습니다. 어서 오십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: I was hoping you would eventually stumble into my shop. Welcome.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's an understatement.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192E"
msgid "It appears my reputation proceeds me."
msgstr "제 명성이 앞섰나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It appears my reputation proceeds me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192D"
msgid "That's an understatement."
msgstr "과장이 아니시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: I was hoping you would eventually stumble into my shop. Welcome.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hm? Oh... yes, I imagine it's been difficult for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192C"
msgid "What an unusually friendly greeting."
msgstr "특이할 정도로 친근한 인사로군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What an unusually friendly greeting.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What an unusually friendly greeting.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192B"
msgid "Hm? Oh... yes, I imagine it's been difficult for you."
msgstr "음? 아... 네, 당신에게 힘든 일이었을 거라 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: I was hoping you would eventually stumble into my shop. Welcome.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By the Great Serpent, have my people treated you so poorly? Well, I suppose you can hardly blame them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01192A"
msgid "You don't have to pretend to like me just to get me to spend my credits."
msgstr "제게 크레딧을 쓰게 하려고 억지로 친한 척하실 필요는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't have to pretend to like me just to get me to spend my credits.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to pretend to like me just to get me to spend my credits.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011929"
msgid "By the Great Serpent, have my people treated you so poorly? Well, I suppose you can hardly blame them."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 이름으로, 제 사람들이 당신을 그렇게 박대했습니까? 뭐, 그들을 탓할 수는 없겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: I was hoping you would eventually stumble into my shop. Welcome.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, yes. I realize others might treat people such as yourself with skepticism and distrust, but my opinions differ.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011928"
msgid "You were actually hoping to meet me?"
msgstr "저를 만나길 바라고 계셨다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: That's an understatement.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011927"
msgid "It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra."
msgstr "외부 세계인이 다즈라까지 오는 건 드문 일입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011926"
msgid "But not just any off-worlder, one that's able to speak with Anasko Va'ruun himself."
msgstr "하지만 평범한 외부 세계인이 아니라, 아나스코 바룬과 직접 대화할 수 있는 분이시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011925"
msgid "Which in the eyes of the citizens of Dazra, moves you up from the \"suspiciously curious\" category to the \"dangerously unique\" one."
msgstr "이는 다즈라 시민들의 눈에 당신을 ‘의심스러운 호기심’ 범주에서 ‘위험할 정도로 독특한’ 범주로 올려놓습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You were actually hoping to meet me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You were actually hoping to meet me?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011924"
msgid "Well, yes. I realize others might treat people such as yourself with skepticism and distrust, but my opinions differ."
msgstr "뭐, 그렇습니다. 다른 이들은 당신 같은 사람들을 의심과 불신으로 대할 수도 있다는 걸 알고 있지만, 제 의견은 다릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You were actually hoping to meet me?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011923"
msgid "You've clearly been chosen by the Great Serpent. Sent here to help us in our time of need."
msgstr "당신은 분명 위대한 뱀에게 선택받은 자입니다. 우리의 도움이 필요한 시기에 우리를 돕기 위해 보내진 것이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You were actually hoping to meet me?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It appears my reputation proceeds me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011922"
msgid "In my mind, to treat you with anything but respect would be ignorant."
msgstr "제 생각에, 당신을 존중하지 않는 것은 무지한 행동일 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me. &&& Nalada: That's an understatement. &&& Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.|But not just any off-worlder, one that's able to speak with Anasko Va'ruun himself.|Which in the eyes of the citizens of Dazra, moves you up from the "suspiciously curious" category to the "dangerously unique" one.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Which reminds me. Here I am prattling about you, when I haven't even introduced myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011921"
msgid "I don't blame them for being wary of strangers."
msgstr "그들이 낯선 사람을 경계하는 것을 탓하지는 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't blame them for being wary of strangers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't blame them for being wary of strangers.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011920"
msgid "Which reminds me. Here I am prattling about you, when I haven't even introduced myself."
msgstr "그러고 보니, 저는 당신에 대해 떠들기만 하고 제 소개조차 하지 않았군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me. &&& Nalada: That's an understatement. &&& Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.|But not just any off-worlder, one that's able to speak with Anasko Va'ruun himself.|Which in the eyes of the citizens of Dazra, moves you up from the "suspiciously curious" category to the "dangerously unique" one.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Where are my manners?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191F"
msgid "Well, you clearly know who I am, but I don't who you are."
msgstr "뭐, 당신은 분명 제가 누군지 아시겠지만, 저는 당신이 누군지 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, you clearly know who I am, but I don't who you are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, you clearly know who I am, but I don't who you are.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191E"
msgid "Where are my manners?"
msgstr "제가 예의가 없었군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It appears my reputation proceeds me. &&& Nalada: That's an understatement. &&& Nalada: It's rare that an off-worlder finds their way to Dazra.|But not just any off-worlder, one that's able to speak with Anasko Va'ruun himself.|Which in the eyes of the citizens of Dazra, moves you up from the "suspiciously curious" category to the "dangerously unique" one.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps if they got to know you, they wouldn't treat you so poorly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191D"
msgid "If they want to keep me at arm's length, suits me just fine."
msgstr "그들이 저를 멀리하고 싶다면, 저도 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If they want to keep me at arm's length, suits me just fine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If they want to keep me at arm's length, suits me just fine.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191C"
msgid "Perhaps if they got to know you, they wouldn't treat you so poorly."
msgstr "아마 그들이 당신을 알게 된다면, 당신을 그렇게 박대하지는 않을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If they want to keep me at arm's length, suits me just fine.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191B"
msgid "Which reminds me that I haven't given you the courtesy of introducing myself."
msgstr "그러고 보니 제 소개를 하는 예의조차 갖추지 않았군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Nalada: Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart.|Perhaps we should start this conversation again. &&& Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.|Forgive me for not starting our conversation that way. I've been... a bit distracted of late.|My brother, Quasim has been missing for days. I'm beginning to worry that something terrible has happened to him.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, thank you... but my problems need not burden you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01191A"
msgid "I'm very sorry to hear that."
msgstr "정말 안타깝군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Short a, not "Brady" BRAH-DEE / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart.|Perhaps we should start this conversation again.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011919"
msgid "I'm Nalada Bradi."
msgstr "저는 날라다 브래디입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011918"
msgid "Forgive me for not starting our conversation that way. I've been... a bit distracted of late."
msgstr "처음부터 그렇게 대화를 시작하지 못한 점 용서하십시오. 제가... 요즘 약간 정신이 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011917"
msgid "My brother, Quasim has been missing for days. I'm beginning to worry that something terrible has happened to him."
msgstr "제 동생 콰심이 며칠째 실종 상태입니다. 동생에게 무슨 끔찍한 일이 일어난 건 아닌지 걱정되기 시작했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to be nice, but it's bothering you / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm very sorry to hear that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm very sorry to hear that.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
