#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011913"
msgid "I don't need to hear your life story, I'd just like to buy some goods."
msgstr "당신의 인생 이야기를 들을 필요는 없습니다. 저는 그저 물건을 좀 사고 싶을 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't need to hear your life story, I'd just like to buy some goods.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't need to hear your life story, I'd just like to buy some goods.
