msgid "Well... I... uh... My apologies."
msgstr "음... 저... 어... 사과드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a bit far away here thinking of your brother but still trying to be nice / Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Yes, indeed. And after what our city has been through, there are countless others that feel the same way.|*Sigh* I'm sorry, you don't need to waste time hearing about my problems, you've clearly come by for a specific reason.
