#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011911"
msgid "If you want to take a look at what my shop has to offer... well, you let me know."
msgstr "제 가게에 어떤 물건이 있는지 보시려면... 뭐, 제게 말씀하시면 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm hardly dangerous. My arrival on this planet is clearly the will of the Great Serpent. &&& Nalada: Yes, of course. Forgive me, I had no idea that you'd taken our beliefs to heart.|Perhaps we should start this conversation again. &&& Nalada: I'm Nalada Bradi.|Forgive me for not starting our conversation that way. I've been... a bit distracted of late.|My brother, Quasim has been missing for days. I'm beginning to worry that something terrible has happened to him.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, yes, but the incident that claimed most of Dazra was several weeks ago. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011910"
msgid "Haven't a lot of people gone missing recently?"
msgstr "최근에 많은 사람이 실종되지 않았습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Haven't a lot of people gone missing recently?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Haven't a lot of people gone missing recently?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190F"
msgid "Well, yes, but the incident that claimed most of Dazra was several weeks ago."
msgstr "뭐, 그렇습니다만, 다즈라의 대부분을 앗아간 사고는 몇 주 전의 일입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: you hesitate before destroyed because it's not clear that other places were destroyed, vanished, etc. / Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Haven't a lot of people gone missing recently?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I sympathize. Losing track of a family member can be unbelievably frightening.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_00IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190E"
msgid "Quasim and I were fortunate that our shop wasn't... destroyed like so many others around us."
msgstr "콰심과 저는 운 좋게도 우리 가게가... 우리 주변의 다른 많은 곳처럼 파괴되지 않았습니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Really? You'd do that for me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190D"
msgid "Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim?"
msgstr "제가 콰심을 찾는 것을 도와드릴 수도 있을 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190C"
msgid "Really? You'd do that for me?"
msgstr "정말요? 저를 위해 그렇게 해주시겠다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190B"
msgid "Oh, you truly are a gift from the Great Serpent. I knew He hadn't forsaken us."
msgstr "오, 당신은 진정 위대한 뱀께서 주신 선물이군요. 그분께서 우리를 저버리지 않으셨다는 걸 알고 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim? &&& Nalada: Really? You'd do that for me?|Oh, you truly are a gift from the Great Serpent. I knew He hadn't forsaken us. 
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course! But the mere fact that you'd even spend the time is more reassuring than just standing here waiting for his return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01190A"
msgid "Well, don't get too excited. I can't make any guarantees."
msgstr "뭐, 너무 들뜨지는 마세요. 어떤 것도 장담할 수는 없으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, don't get too excited. I can't make any guarantees.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, don't get too excited. I can't make any guarantees.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011909"
msgid "Of course! But the mere fact that you'd even spend the time is more reassuring than just standing here waiting for his return."
msgstr "물론입니다! 하지만 당신이 시간을 내주신다는 사실만으로도, 그저 여기서 동생의 귀환을 기다리는 것보다 훨씬 더 안심이 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I could help you locate Quasim? &&& Nalada: Really? You'd do that for me?|Oh, you truly are a gift from the Great Serpent. I knew He hadn't forsaken us. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, yes. Of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011908"
msgid "I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start."
msgstr "최선을 다하겠습니다, 날라다. 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Oh, yes. Of course.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011907"
msgid "The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened."
msgstr "콰심에게 마지막으로 소식을 들었을 때, 동생은 깊은 협곡 제련소를 재가동할 수 있는지 평가하기 위해 가고 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011906"
msgid "He never came back that evening. I've been worried sick."
msgstr "그날 저녁, 동생은 돌아오지 않았습니다. 걱정돼서 미칠 것 같았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start. &&& Nalada: Oh, yes. Of course. &&& Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.|He never came back that evening. I've been worried sick.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Something within tells me you speak the truth. I feel blessed that the Great Serpent delivered you to my door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011905"
msgid "I promise I'll get you some answers."
msgstr "반드시 답을 찾아 드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start. &&& Nalada: Oh, yes. Of course. &&& Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.|He never came back that evening. I've been worried sick.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Impossible. Despite what's happened in Dazra, Quasim has been in good spirits of late.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011904"
msgid "Perhaps he doesn't want to be found?"
msgstr "혹시 동생이 발견되지 않으려 숨은 건 아닐까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: You know, now that you mention it, someone in the city said that they felt tremors near that area.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011903"
msgid "Just, please be careful. That old refinery has been abandoned for years, and there's no telling what might be choosing to call the facility its home."
msgstr "부디 조심하세요. 그 오래된 제련소는 수년간 버려져 있었고, 그곳을 집으로 삼고 있는 것이 무엇인지 알 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011902"
msgid "Now, is there anything you might need for your journey?"
msgstr "자, 여정에 필요한 것이 있으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason. &&& Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it. &&& Viktor: Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death.|Only then will I grant access to the power grid.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See that you get it done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041051
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011901"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "한번 알아볼게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll see what I can do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll see what I can do.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Just, please be careful. That old refinery has been abandoned for years, and there's no telling what might be choosing to call the facility its home.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011900"
msgid "That's all that I would ever ask."
msgstr "그것이 제가 바라는 전부입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I promise I'll get you some answers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I promise I'll get you some answers.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Just, please be careful. That old refinery has been abandoned for years, and there's no telling what might be choosing to call the facility its home.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5EA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FF"
msgid "Something within tells me you speak the truth. I feel blessed that the Great Serpent delivered you to my door."
msgstr "제 안의 무언가가 당신이 진실을 말하고 있다고 말해줍니다. 위대한 뱀께서 당신을 제 문 앞으로 인도하셨다는 것에 축복을 느낍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do my best, Nalada. All I need to know is where to start. &&& Nalada: Oh, yes. Of course. &&& Nalada: The last time I heard from Quasim, he was headed out to the Deep Gorge Refinery to assess if it could be reopened.|He never came back that evening. I've been worried sick.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. How would you know about that place?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FE"
msgid "Deep Gorge Refinery?"
msgstr "깊은 협곡 제련소요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps he doesn't want to be found?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps he doesn't want to be found?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FD"
msgid "Impossible. Despite what's happened in Dazra, Quasim has been in good spirits of late."
msgstr "말도 안 됩니다. 다즈라에서 무슨 일이 있었든, 콰심은 최근에 기운이 넘쳤습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps he doesn't want to be found?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's possible that the cataclysm may have caused some sort of geological instability at the refinery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_01TopLevelStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FC"
msgid "No. If anything, I'm afraid he's been injured and can't make the journey home... or... or worse."
msgstr "아닐 겁니다. 그보다는 동생이 다쳐서 집으로 돌아오지 못하고 있는 건 아닐까요... 아니면... 그보다 더 나쁜 일이..."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Not much more, other than what I've already told you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_02TopLevelFacility
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FB"
msgid "What can you tell me about Deep Gorge Refinery?"
msgstr "깊은 협곡 제련소에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Deep Gorge Refinery?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_02TopLevelFacility
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118FA"
msgid "Not much more, other than what I've already told you."
msgstr "이미 말씀드린 것 외에는 별로 아는 것이 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: It's an old mineral processing facility a good distance to the southeast of Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_02TopLevelFacility
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F9"
msgid "The only silver lining from the refinery's shutdown was that all of the workers were placed into other positions throughout the city, so no one went hungry."
msgstr "그나마 다행인 점은 제련소가 문을 닫으면서 모든 노동자가 도시 전역의 다른 직책으로 배치되어 굶주리는 사람이 없었다는 것입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Do you mean to ask if it's a sore subject to bring up since he's missing? Not at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F8"
msgid "Do you mind telling me more about Quasim?"
msgstr "콰심에 대해 더 말씀해 주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind telling me more about Quasim?
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Quasim and I have been close ever since we were young.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F7"
msgid "Do you mean to ask if it's a sore subject to bring up since he's missing? Not at all."
msgstr "실종된 동생을 언급하는 게 불편한지 묻는 건가요? 전혀 그렇지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Quasim and I have been close ever since we were young.|Our father and mother taught us everything we needed to know about running this shop, so that one day we could take over.|When they passed, Quasim and I ran the business for a few years together, but I could see his heart was elsewhere.|I gave him my blessing and he attended an engineering academy. In a few more years, he graduated and made quite a name for himself.|When the government reached out to everyone for help after the incident, I wasn't the least bit surprised he was the first to volunteer.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F6"
msgid "I can only pray that his eagerness hasn't got him into deep trouble."
msgstr "동생이 의욕만 앞서서 큰 곤경에 빠지지 않았기를 바랄 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Do you mean to ask if it's a sore subject to bring up since he's missing? Not at all.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F5"
msgid "Quasim and I have been close ever since we were young."
msgstr "콰심과 저는 어렸을 때부터 사이가 좋았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F4"
msgid "Our father and mother taught us everything we needed to know about running this shop, so that one day we could take over."
msgstr "아버지와 어머니께서는 언젠가 우리가 이 가게를 물려받을 수 있도록 가게 운영에 필요한 모든 것을 가르쳐 주셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F3"
msgid "When they passed, Quasim and I ran the business for a few years together, but I could see his heart was elsewhere."
msgstr "부모님이 돌아가신 후, 콰심과 저는 몇 년간 함께 사업을 운영했지만, 동생의 마음이 다른 곳에 있다는 것을 알 수 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F2"
msgid "I gave him my blessing and he attended an engineering academy. In a few more years, he graduated and made quite a name for himself."
msgstr "저는 동생을 축복해 줬고 공학 아카데미에 다니게 해줬습니다. 몇 년 후, 동생은 졸업했고 꽤 이름을 알렸습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: I can only pray that his eagerness hasn't got him into deep trouble.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_03TopLevelQuasim
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F1"
msgid "When the government reached out to everyone for help after the incident, I wasn't the least bit surprised he was the first to volunteer."
msgstr "사고 이후 정부가 모두에게 도움을 요청했을 때, 동생이 가장 먼저 자원한 것은 조금도 놀랍지 않았습니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: By the Great Serpent...no... please don't tell me...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118F0"
msgid "I have some bad news for you about Quasim."
msgstr "콰심에 대해 나쁜 소식이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ready to hear extremely bad news / Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have some bad news for you about Quasim.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118EF"
msgid "By the Great Serpent...no... please don't tell me..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여... 안돼... 제발 말하지 마세요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have some bad news for you about Quasim. &&& Nalada: By the Great Serpent...no... please don't tell me...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh... no! No! My poor Quasim! No...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118EE"
msgid "I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording."
msgstr "안타깝게도 콰심은 죽었습니다. 이 기록에 모든 것이 담겨 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: breaking down, brother is dead / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: That stupid fool and his crusading ways! I knew it would get him into trouble. But I never thought it would get this far...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118ED"
msgid "Oh... no! No! My poor Quasim! No..."
msgstr "오... 안돼! 안돼! 불쌍한 콰심! 안돼..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have some bad news for you about Quasim. &&& Nalada: By the Great Serpent...no... please don't tell me...
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Damn. I was afraid that might happen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118EC"
msgid "[Lie] I'm afraid there was no sign of Quasim at the refinery."
msgstr "[거짓말] 안타깝게도 제련소에서 콰심의 흔적은 찾을 수 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I'm afraid there was no sign of Quasim at the refinery.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] I'm afraid there was no sign of Quasim at the refinery.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: That stupid fool and his crusading ways! I knew it would get him into trouble. But I never thought it would get this far...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118EB"
msgid "Damn. I was afraid that might happen."
msgstr "젠장. 그럴 줄 알았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Oh... no! No! My poor Quasim! No...
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118EA"
msgid "That stupid fool and his crusading ways! I knew it would get him into trouble. But I never thought it would get this far..."
msgstr "그 바보 같은 놈의 정의감이라니! 그게 동생을 곤경에 빠뜨릴 줄 알았어요. 하지만 이렇게까지 될 줄은 몰랐는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: breaking down again / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're strong, Nalada. You'll do what you can to push through the darkness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E9"
msgid "How am I ever going to continue without him? He was all I had left."
msgstr "동생 없이 어떻게 살아가야 하죠? 동생은 내게 남은 전부였는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Still sad, but recovering / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're strong, Nalada. You'll do what you can to push through the darkness.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're strong, Nalada. You'll do what you can to push through the darkness.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Sigh. I suppose I'll just have to wait and see if anyone else stumbles across any information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E8"
msgid "Yes... yes. You're right. If nothing else, I have to move forward for Quasim, my parents... and myself."
msgstr "그래요... 맞아요. 적어도 콰심과 부모님... 그리고 저 자신을 위해 앞으로 나아가야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording. &&& Nalada: Oh... no! No! My poor Quasim! No... &&& Nalada: That stupid fool and his crusading ways! I knew it would get him into trouble. But I never thought it would get this far...|How am I ever going to continue without him? He was all I had left.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes... yes. You're right. If nothing else, I have to move forward for Quasim, my parents... and myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E7"
msgid "You're strong, Nalada. You'll do what you can to push through the darkness."
msgstr "당신은 강해요, 날라다. 어둠을 헤쳐나가기 위해 할 수 있는 일을 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Sigh. I suppose I'll just have to wait and see if anyone else stumbles across any information.|The longer this goes on, the more I worry about Quasim. At least I can hold on to the hope that he's out there... somewhere.|But that isn't your concern. You've done more than enough.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E6"
msgid "Listen, I wanted to thank you for everything you've done. You risked your life to bring me closure. It's something I'll never forget."
msgstr "들어보세요, 당신이 해주신 모든 일에 감사드리고 싶습니다. 당신은 제게 진실을 알려주기 위해 목숨을 걸었습니다. 결코 잊지 못할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E5"
msgid "I can't offer you much, but I can assure you that my wares will cost you less than before. I hope that's enough."
msgstr "많은 것을 드릴 수는 없지만, 제 물건을 이전보다 저렴하게 판매하겠습니다. 그걸로 충분했으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E4"
msgid "Thank you, traveler. May the Great Serpent guide you on your path."
msgstr "감사합니다. 여행자여. 위대한 뱀께서 당신의 길을 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, not like you can. It is what it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E3"
msgid "I don't know what to say."
msgstr "뭐라고 해야 할지 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Still sad, but recovering / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know what to say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know what to say.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Sigh. I suppose I'll just have to wait and see if anyone else stumbles across any information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E2"
msgid "You don't have to say anything. You've already gone above and beyond anything I could have anticipated."
msgstr "아무 말도 하지 않으셔도 됩니다. 당신은 이미 제가 예상했던 것 이상으로 큰 도움을 주셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm afraid Quasim is dead. Everything is on this recording. &&& Nalada: Oh... no! No! My poor Quasim! No... &&& Nalada: That stupid fool and his crusading ways! I knew it would get him into trouble. But I never thought it would get this far...|How am I ever going to continue without him? He was all I had left.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's... fine. I don't actually expect you to be able to help more than you already have.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E1"
msgid "I'm terrible at giving that sort of advice."
msgstr "저는 그런 조언을 잘 못합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Still sad, but recovering / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm terrible at giving that sort of advice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm terrible at giving that sort of advice.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Sigh. I suppose I'll just have to wait and see if anyone else stumbles across any information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118E0"
msgid "That's... fine. I don't actually expect you to be able to help more than you already have."
msgstr "괜찮습니다... 사실 당신이 이미 해주신 것 이상으로 도움을 줄 수 있을 거라고 기대하지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Nalada: Yes... yes. You're right. If nothing else, I have to move forward for Quasim, my parents... and myself.
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Tired
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118DF"
msgid "Sigh. I suppose I'll just have to wait and see if anyone else stumbles across any information."
msgstr "*한숨* 다른 누군가가 정보를 발견할 때까지 기다려야 할 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118DE"
msgid "The longer this goes on, the more I worry about Quasim. At least I can hold on to the hope that he's out there... somewhere."
msgstr "시간이 지날수록 콰심에 대한 걱정이 커집니다. 적어도 동생이 어딘가에... 있을 거라 희망해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Nalada
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Nalada: Listen, I wanted to thank you for everything you've done. You risked your life to bring me closure. It's something I'll never forget.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ03
#. TOPIC: 010D5E85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ03_EndingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0118DD"
msgid "But that isn't your concern. You've done more than enough."
msgstr "하지만 그건 걱정할 필요가 없습니다. 이미 충분히 하셨으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
