#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a difficult question to answer. &&& Reigen: Is it? Then I apologize. I thought it was rather simple, but maybe I'm mistaken.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. I have a CredStik lying around here somewhere. I tell you what. You find it, it's yours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
