#. PROMPT: <Global=SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_TakeMoney> credits.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: <Global=SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_TakeMoney> credits.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I've been trying to keep everything here sorted, based on a personal system. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 010D06EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011850"
msgid "All right. I have a CredStik lying around here somewhere. I tell you what. You find it, it's yours."
msgstr "좋네. 이곳 어딘가에 크레딧스틱이 있을 것 같은데... 그걸 찾으면 자네가 갖도록 하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not yet, no. &&& Reigen: Oh, well, in that case, it's nice to meet you. And I apologize for the mess.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, haha, that's a good one. I really thought I did owe you. My mind's been such a mess as of late.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 010D06E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184F"
msgid "I was just kidding. It's fine."
msgstr "그냥 농담하던 겁니다. 괜찮아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was just kidding. It's fine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was just kidding. It's fine.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I've been trying to keep everything here sorted, based on a personal system. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 010D06E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184E"
msgid "Oh, haha, that's a good one. I really thought I did owe you. My mind's been such a mess as of late."
msgstr "오, 하하. 참 재밌구먼. 정말 내가 빚을 진 줄 알았어. 요즘 내 머리가 완전 엉망이란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We have. And you owe me money. &&& Reigen: Do I really? That doesn't sound like me. But I admit I've been a tad forgetful as of late. And I take it you noticed the mess.|I guess I should ask. How much do I owe you?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's interest? Now that sounds like a real pickle. I can't believe I'd do that to myself. But I haven't been myself lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 010D06E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184D"
msgid "Don't worry about it. You don't have to pay me now. I'd rather just let the interest pile up."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마세요. 지금 저한테 돈 줄 필요는 없으니까. 이자가 쌓이면 저야 오히려 좋죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry about it. You don't have to pay me now. I'd rather just let the interest pile up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry about it. You don't have to pay me now. I'd rather just let the interest pile up.
