#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184C"
msgid "There's interest? Now that sounds like a real pickle. I can't believe I'd do that to myself. But I haven't been myself lately."
msgstr "이자까지 있다고? 참 큰일이네. 내가 그런 짓을 했을 것 같지는 않은데. 요즘 내 머리가 완전 엉망이란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We have. And you owe me money.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't worry about it. You don't have to pay me now. I'd rather just let the interest pile up.
