#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184B"
msgid "I guess I should ask. How much do I owe you?"
msgstr "이건 물어야겠는데. 내가 너한테 얼마나 빚졌니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01045670
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01184A"
msgid "Aha, Orahim! What are you doing up there? Seeking a tactical advantage? Smart, smart."
msgstr "아하, 오라힘! 여기서 뭘 하는 거지? 전술적으로 유리한 지점을 찾고 있나? 똑똑하군, 똑똑해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: And this Accursed is... what is this? Your... friend? Pet? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01045670
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011849"
msgid "Well, it is good to see you, regardless of the circumstances. A shame that our reunion will end with a bullet through your brain."
msgstr "비록 상황은 이렇지만... 다시 만나 반갑군. 우리 만남은 네 머리에 총탄이 박히는 걸로 끝나게 될 테니 유감이지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
