#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
