msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 널 내게 보내셨다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AA
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0117B7"
