#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
