msgctxt "011634"
msgid "There had been efforts to put together some kind of response, some plan... but they had fallen apart."
msgstr "상황을 수습해 보려는 노력도 하고, 계획도 세워 봤지만... 전부 실패하고 말았지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Greetings, fellow Promised. Razma told me this was a meditation room. &&& Mirek: Forgive me. I didn't realize we were entertaining guests. |You must be the outsider I heard of who shares our beliefs. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, you're the outsider everyone's been talking about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
