#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011633"
msgid "I am a fellow Promised."
msgstr "나도 같은 약속받은 자야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am a fellow Promised. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am a fellow Promised. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB645
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011632"
msgid "Oh, you're the outsider everyone's been talking about."
msgstr "아, 소문이 자자하던 그 이방인이 바로 너구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB641
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011631"
msgid "Ah, the heretic turned Promised. I was wondering when our paths would cross."
msgstr "아, 이단자에서 약속받은 자로 변하다니. 우리 길이 언제쯤 만나게 될지 궁금했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are. &&& Mirek: Exactly. There's still research, analysis, documentation... too much documentation if you ask me.  &&& Mirek: But altogether, I have the exact talents needed to do this is job which is why I was entrusted with the Zealots in the first place.|I admit, it hasn't always been easy. They are Zealots, you know.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see you're familiar with standard Zealot tactics. But it's really all about crafting the perfect scenario to encounter the right one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB640
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011630"
msgid "Wouldn't a Zealot attack on sight? How do you get close to them?"
msgstr "광신도는 눈에 보이는 사람이라면 전부 공격하지 않나? 넌 어떻게 접근한 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wouldn't a Zealot attack on sight? How do you get close to them?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wouldn't a Zealot attack on sight? How do you get close to them?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01162C"
msgid "I see you're familiar with standard Zealot tactics. But it's really all about crafting the perfect scenario to encounter the right one."
msgstr "일반적인 광신도 전술에 익숙한 모양인데, 진짜로 중요한 건 완벽한 각본을 만들어둔 다음에 접근하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wouldn't a Zealot attack on sight? How do you get close to them?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01162B"
msgid "You don't just waltz up and say hello. It takes a great deal of surveillance and profiling to determine the right approach."
msgstr "그냥 왈츠 추면서 인사나 하는 건 아니지. 제대로 접근하려면 엄청난 감시와 정보 수집이 필요한 법이거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Zealots took your people. How can you remain so calm?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Zealots took your people. How can you remain so calm?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB638
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01162A"
msgid "The people of Dazra look to us Elders for strength and guidance. We cannot fail them at a time like this."
msgstr "다즈라 신민들은 우리 장로들에게 힘과 인도를 바라고 있어. 이런 시기에 신민들을 실망시킬 수는 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Zealots took your people. How can you remain so calm?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB638
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011629"
msgid "Don't let my composure fool you, Promised. It's neither easy nor something I take lightly."
msgstr "내 침착함을 오해하진 마, 약속받은 자. 이 일을 만만하거나 가볍게 보는 건 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust. &&& Mirek: You have no idea.  &&& Mirek: I can't even tell you how much time and effort it's been to sway the Zealots my way. |Not to mention the stress over my own personal well-being. |I may be the best at what I do, but I'm not stupid. The Zealots do have the element of unpredictability. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was wondering when your own agenda would come into play.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011626"
msgid "You say they're unpredictable, so you know the danger Sahima and the hostages are in."
msgstr "네 입으로 예측 불가능하다고 했으니, 사히마와 인질들이 위험하다는 것도 알 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them. &&& companion: Understood.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The people of Dazra look to us Elders for strength and guidance. We cannot fail them at a time like this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB639
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011625"
msgid "Zealots took your people. How can you remain so calm?"
msgstr "광신도가 가문 사람들을 잡아갔는데, 어떻게 그렇게 태연하게 있을 수 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: You have no idea. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011624"
msgid "I can't even tell you how much time and effort it's been to sway the Zealots my way."
msgstr "광신도를 구워삶는 데 시간과 노력이 얼마나 들었는지 말도 못 할 지경이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011623"
msgid "Not to mention the stress over my own personal well-being."
msgstr "내 개인적인 신변에 대한 스트레스는 말할 것도 없고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You say they're unpredictable, so you know the danger Sahima and the hostages are in. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB63C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011622"
msgid "I may be the best at what I do, but I'm not stupid. The Zealots do have the element of unpredictability."
msgstr "내가 일 하는 데는 최고일지 몰라도, 바보는 아니야. 광신도는 예측 불가능한 면이 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You say they're unpredictable, so you know the danger Sahima and the hostages are in. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You say they're unpredictable, so you know the danger Sahima and the hostages are in. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: Once again...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB637
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011621"
msgid "I was wondering when your own agenda would come into play."
msgstr "그 주제를 언제쯤 입에 올리나 궁금하던 참이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And at such a young age, too. She must consider you a prodigy. &&& Mirek: I do have a natural talent.  &&& Mirek: It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exactly. There's still research, analysis, documentation... too much documentation if you ask me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB636
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011620"
msgid "Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are."
msgstr "당연하지. 아무리 재능 있어도 훌륭한 일처리에는 시간이 필요해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: But altogether, I have the exact talents needed to do this is job which is why I was entrusted with the Zealots in the first place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB635
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01161F"
msgid "Exactly. There's still research, analysis, documentation... too much documentation if you ask me."
msgstr "맞아. 지금도 연구에, 분석에, 문서 작성에... 문서 작성할 건 왜 이렇게 많은지 모르겠다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And at such a young age, too. She must consider you a prodigy. &&& Mirek: I do have a natural talent.  &&& Mirek: It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Excuse me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB634
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01161E"
msgid "I can't do this. Let's cut straight to business."
msgstr "못 해 먹겠네. 그냥 본론으로 들어가지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player suddenly changed the direction of the conversation. / Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't do this. Let's cut straight to business.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't do this. Let's cut straight to business.
