#. TOPIC: 010CB632
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01161C"
msgid "Wow, you really are full of yourself."
msgstr "와. 자만이 아주 넘쳐 흐르는 놈일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wow, you really are full of yourself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wow, you really are full of yourself.
