msgid "The work, the strategies, that's all child's play for me."
msgstr "일이나 전략 같은 건 나한텐 애들 장난이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So it doesn't all come so easily for you?
