#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011613"
msgid "But being with the Zealots is a different story."
msgstr "하지만 광신도와 어울리는 건 다른 얘기지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So it doesn't all come so easily for you?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust.
