#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011612"
msgid "Of course, it's gotten easier as I've gotten to know them, but it's a mental challenge whenever a new face is introduced."
msgstr "물론 광신도를 알아갈수록 쉬워지기는 하지만, 새로운 사람이 나타날 때마다 정신적인 도전이 되거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust. &&& Mirek: You have no idea.  &&& Mirek: I can't even tell you how much time and effort it's been to sway the Zealots my way. |Not to mention the stress over my own personal well-being. |I may be the best at what I do, but I'm not stupid. The Zealots do have the element of unpredictability. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see. So this is what you're really here to talk about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB62A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011611"
msgid "So you admit, the hostages they have may not be safe."
msgstr "그럼 너도 인정하는 거네. 인질들이 위험할 수도 있다고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So you admit, the hostages they have may not be safe.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you admit, the hostages they have may not be safe.
