msgid "I see. So this is what you're really here to talk about."
msgstr "아하. 사실은 이 얘기를 하러 온 거였구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Very perceptive. I can see why Razma is so impressed with you. &&& Mirek: Well, I am one of the few to garner any amount of trust with the Zealots, so she should be.  &&& Mirek: I can't imagine where the Ministry of Conjunction would be without me.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
