msgid "The Ministry of Conjunction?"
msgstr "결합성 몰라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Condescending. NOT apologetic. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB627
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01160D"
msgid "Oh, yeah, I forgot you're not really one of us."
msgstr "아, 맞다. 네가 진짜 우리 일원이 아닌 걸 까먹었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB627
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01160C"
msgid "The Ministry, as my auntie puts it, deals in information. It's our job to know what's going on and where for the safety of our people."
msgstr "우리 이모님이 말했겠지만, 정보를 다루는 부서야. 신민들의 안전을 위해 어디서 무슨 일이 일어나는지 알아두는 게 우리 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the Ministry of Conjunction?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: And at such a young age, too. She must consider you a prodigy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB627
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01160B"
msgid "But as I like to say, it's espionage at its finest."
msgstr "하지만 나는 스파이 활동이 핵심이라고 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust. &&& Mirek: You have no idea.  &&& Mirek: I can't even tell you how much time and effort it's been to sway the Zealots my way. |Not to mention the stress over my own personal well-being. |I may be the best at what I do, but I'm not stupid. The Zealots do have the element of unpredictability. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I had a feeling this conversation was going to take a turn.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB626
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01160A"
msgid "If they're unpredictable, you can see how the negotiations may not work."
msgstr "예측 불가능한 놈들이라면, 협상이 안 통할 수도 있다는 걸 너도 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: I do have a natural talent. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB625
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011609"
msgid "It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less."
msgstr "날 제대로 인정해주다니 기분 좋은데. 내 실력이 아무리 좋아도, 내가 투자하는 시간이 줄어드는 건 아니니까 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If they're unpredictable, you can see how the negotiations may not work.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If they're unpredictable, you can see how the negotiations may not work.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: Once again...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB624
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011608"
msgid "I had a feeling this conversation was going to take a turn."
msgstr "대화 주제가 바뀔 것 같다는 느낌이 들더라니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Exactly. There's still research, analysis, documentation... too much documentation if you ask me. 
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB623
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011607"
msgid "But altogether, I have the exact talents needed to do this is job which is why I was entrusted with the Zealots in the first place."
msgstr "그래도 따져 보면, 애초에 내가 이 일을 맡기에 필요한 재능을 가지고 있으니까 광신도를 담당하게 된 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "are". They ARE Zealots, meaning unreasonable and unpredictable.  / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can't imagine how hard it must have been to earn the Zealots' trust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB623
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011606"
msgid "I admit, it hasn't always been easy. They are Zealots, you know."
msgstr "솔직히, 항상 쉬운 일은 아니었어. 광신도가 좀 그렇잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course not. Good work takes time no matter how talented you are. &&& Mirek: Exactly. There's still research, analysis, documentation... too much documentation if you ask me.  &&& Mirek: But altogether, I have the exact talents needed to do this is job which is why I was entrusted with the Zealots in the first place.|I admit, it hasn't always been easy. They are Zealots, you know.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Some days, it takes everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB622
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011605"
msgid "It takes a lot to deal with the levels of stress you must be experiencing."
msgstr "그런 일을 하고 있으니, 네가 겪는 스트레스도 장난이 아니겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It takes a lot to deal with the levels of stress you must be experiencing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It takes a lot to deal with the levels of stress you must be experiencing.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I can't even tell you how much time and effort it's been to sway the Zealots my way. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010CB621
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011604"
msgid "Some days, it takes everything."
msgstr "가끔은 돌아버릴 것만 같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If Mirek knows, how come you haven't forced them to tell you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If Mirek knows, how come you haven't forced them to tell you?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F9"
msgid "Once I made the decision to go through with the negotiations, it wasn't necessary."
msgstr "내가 협상을 진행하기로 결정을 내렸으니까, 그럴 필요가 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you're so smart, you tell me where this is going.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I've worked hard to obtain my position with the Zealots. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F8"
msgid "Then you go back to Auntie Razma and tell her to go through with the negotiations."
msgstr "그럼 넌 돌아가서 라즈마 이모님한테 협상을 진행하라고 전해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F4"
msgid "I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does."
msgstr "광신도들이 사히마를 어디다 잡아 뒀는지 모르거든. 그래도 누가 했는지는 잘 알지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F2"
msgid "Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "미어렉이라는 녀석이 있어. 카딕 가문 소속인데, 결합성에서 내 요원으로 일하고 있기도 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Any tips on getting through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F1"
msgid "Just don't be direct. I'm sure it would put them on the defensive. Either that or make them completely unwilling to talk."
msgstr "대놓고 물어보지는 마. 그러면 분명 방어적으로 나올 거야. 아니면 아예 대화 자체를 피하게 될 수도 있고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Condescending. / Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here to see you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here to see you.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033763
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115F0"
msgid "And you are?"
msgstr "그쪽은 누구길래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And at such a young age, too. She must consider you a prodigy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And at such a young age, too. She must consider you a prodigy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103375D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115EF"
msgid "I do have a natural talent."
msgstr "타고난 재능이 있거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's impressive to be trusted over more senior members.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's impressive to be trusted over more senior members.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103375B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115EE"
msgid "Yes, I can see the jealousy all over their faces."
msgstr "맞아. 얼굴에 질투심이 다 보이더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You must have put in a lot of work to make that happen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You must have put in a lot of work to make that happen.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: It's nice to see that I'm being properly recognized. I may excel in my skills, but it doesn't mean the hours I put in are any less.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033759
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_EgoScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115ED"
msgid "It's hardly work if it comes naturally."
msgstr "자연스럽게 타고나면 힘든 일도 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You really should rethink your position on the hostages.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really should rethink your position on the hostages.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: All right. I'll let you in on their location, but remember. You're the only one that knows.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033754
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0115EC"
msgid "As much as I'd like to help you, I don't think so."
msgstr "나도 정말 도와주고 싶은데, 안될 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Djimal
#. ALIAS: Razma
