#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011573"
msgid "That's a motive to want to hide the truth. We definitely should follow up on that."
msgstr "진실을 숨기고 싶어 하는 동기가 있군요. 그 부분은 확실히 더 조사해 봐야겠어요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: While I'd be curious to know what you think, we shouldn't jump to conclusions just yet.
