msgstr "계속 수사하세요. 그리고 때가 되면 이 슬레이트의 내용을 다룰 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC1
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011563"
msgid "Can I ask you about Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에 관해 질문해도 될까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.|How much did my cousin's work aid their ability to take me hostage? Did they know, or were they simply misguided?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But the question must be asked, lest it repeat itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01155F"
msgid "It's impossible to know."
msgstr "그건 알 수가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's impossible to know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's impossible to know.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, I've heard Razma will be enforcing stricter guidelines for new members going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01155E"
msgid "But the question must be asked, lest it repeat itself."
msgstr "하지만 다시 반복되는 일이 없도록 질문을 꼭 해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.|How much did my cousin's work aid their ability to take me hostage? Did they know, or were they simply misguided?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suspected as much. That or they thought those of us in the noble Houses would be protected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01155C"
msgid "Clearly they knew, and didn't care."
msgstr "분명 다들 알고 있었겠지만, 관심 없었던 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Clearly they knew, and didn't care.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Clearly they knew, and didn't care.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01155B"
msgid "I suspected as much. That or they thought those of us in the noble Houses would be protected."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어. 아니면 우리 명문 가문의 자제들은 보호받을 것이라 생각한 것이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Clearly they knew, and didn't care.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, I've heard Razma will be enforcing stricter guidelines for new members going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01155A"
msgid "That was clearly not the case with me."
msgstr "그건 나한테는 전혀 아니었던 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They likely didn't think the Zealots would take things that far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They likely didn't think the Zealots would take things that far.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, I've heard Razma will be enforcing stricter guidelines for new members going forward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7F9F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011559"
msgid "Then they are naive in spite of their years. At their age, they have no excuse."
msgstr "그럼 그 나이에도 순진하단 뜻이잖아. 나이가 그 정도면 변명의 여지가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7F98
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011558"
msgid "It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots."
msgstr "말로써 표현하기 어려워. 가장 이해하기 힘든 사실은 바로 내가 광신도들에게 잡혔었다는 거야."

#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's impossible to know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7F98
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011557"
msgid "How much did my cousin's work aid their ability to take me hostage? Did they know, or were they simply misguided?"
msgstr ""
"내 사촌이 벌인 짓 때문에 그자들이 얼마나 쉽게 날 인질로 잡은 거지? 이미 다 알고 있던 걸까, 아니면 그저 잘못 인도됐던 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.|How much did my cousin's work aid their ability to take me hostage? Did they know, or were they simply misguided?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can't help but feel that way. I've always felt like an outsider, and what they did almost ensured I always would be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7F9E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011556"
msgid "Do you feel hurt by the choice?"
msgstr "그 선택 때문에 마음에 상처가 생겼나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.|How much did my cousin's work aid their ability to take me hostage? Did they know, or were they simply misguided?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then they are naive in spite of their years. At their age, they have no excuse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7FA0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01154E"
msgid "They likely didn't think the Zealots would take things that far."
msgstr "광신도들이 그렇게까지 극단적인 결정을 내릴 거라 생각하진 않은 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: always would be in terms of if she died, she'd never get a chance to ingratiate herself / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you feel hurt by the choice?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you feel hurt by the choice?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's impossible to know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010C7F9D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraHouseDivided
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01154D"
msgid "I can't help but feel that way. I've always felt like an outsider, and what they did almost ensured I always would be."
msgstr "어쩔 수 없이 그렇게 느껴지더라고. 난 항상 외부자처럼 느껴졌고, 그자들이 한 짓을 보니 내가 어떻게 될지 알 것 같았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC3
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01154A"
msgid "[A House Divided] How do you feel about Mujeen's imprisonment?"
msgstr "[분열된 가문] 무진이 수감된 것을 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's hard to put into words. The part I find most difficult is the fact I was taken by Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC3
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011549"
msgid "[A House Divided] How do you feel about Ochim being involved in aiding the Zealots?"
msgstr "[분열된 가문] 오킴이 광신도들을 도우는 데 연루되어 있었다는 사실을 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011548"
msgid "Gavin is so supportive! Some people might be jealous in his situation, but not him."
msgstr "개빈은 정말 도와주려고 노력해! 누구는 개빈의 상황에 질투할지 모르지만 그 친구는 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011547"
msgid "I hope Razma and Djimal can sort their differences. I know they say it's normal for sisters to quarrel, but why should that be?"
msgstr "라즈마와 지말이 서로 화해하면 좋겠어. 자매가 서로 싸우는 건 당연하다지만, 꼭 왜 그래야 하는 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: PowerRoomMarkerAlias
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C7F97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Scene_Announcement_0110
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011546"
msgid "Find the intruder! Block them from the control room!"
msgstr "침입자를 찾아라! 녀석들이 제어실로 가지 못하게 막아!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: There's only one way to find out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102058E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011545"
msgid "[Encrypted Slate] I found a slate on a Zealot. I'm wondering if you can decrypt it."
msgstr "[암호화된 슬레이트] 광신도에게서 슬레이트를 찾았습니다. 이걸 해독하실 수 있을지 궁금합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011544"
msgid "I've got a reputation for hunting heretics. You're not a heretic, are you?"
msgstr "저는 이단자들을 사냥하는 걸로 유명합니다. 당신 이단자는 아니겠죠? 그렇죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_DulkehfCommentary
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011543"
msgid "I heard the news of Ukaru's death. We lost many to the cataclysm. To lose another is disheartening."
msgstr "우카루가 죽었다는 소식 들었습니다. 대재난으로 많은 이들을 잃었는데, 또 한명을 잃었다니 낙담스럽군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_DulkehfCommentary
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011542"
msgid "I hear justice has been meted out against Ukaru's killer. On behalf of House Dul'kehf, thank you."
msgstr "우카루의 살인자에 대한 정의가 실현되었다고 들었습니다. 둘케프 가문을 대표해서, 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_DulkehfCommentary
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011541"
msgid "Word of Qisrani's death reached me recently. I pray she is with the Promised."
msgstr "최근에 키스라니가 죽었다는 말이 들리더군요. 약속받은 자들과 함께 하길 기도하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_DulkehfCommentary
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011540"
msgid "I was not prepared for the news about Qisrani. To lose her now is a great blow."
msgstr "키스라니 소식은 생각도 못 했던 일입니다. 지금 이런 일은 너무 큰 타격이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153F"
msgid "Losing Vaeric is addition by subtraction."
msgstr "배릭을 잃은 건 대를 위한 소의 희생이었다고 봐야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153E"
msgid "I hear Vaeric's back. Who knows for how long."
msgstr "배릭이 돌아왔다고 들었어요. 얼마나 오래 있을지는 모르겠지만요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153D"
msgid "Have you met Vaeric, Victor's son? The apple fell from the tree and rolled down a hill with that one."
msgstr "빅터의 아들 배릭을 만나봤나요? 그 사과는 나무에서 떨어져 언덕 아래로 굴러갔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Mujeen
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153C"
msgid "I heard what happened with the representatives of House Ma'leen. Unfortunate business all around. Surely this could've been handled another way?"
msgstr "마린 가문 대표자들에게 일어난 일은 들었. 여러모로 유감스러운 일이군. 분명 다른 방법으로 처리할 수도 있었을 텐데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153B"
msgid "I wish Gavin would take more of an interest in politics. Science alone is not enough. You must convince people of its merit."
msgstr "개빈이 정치에 더 많이 관심을 가졌으면 좋겠군. 과학만으로는 충분하지 않다고. 사람들에게 그 가치를 설득해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01153A"
msgid "Djimal and I disagree on a great many things. Suffice to say I am proud to call Razma our Elder."
msgstr "지말과 나는 많은 사안에서 의견이 다르네. 라즈마를 우리의 장로라고 부를 수 있어서 자랑스럽다고 말하면 충분하겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011539"
msgid "The resolve Razma showed in the wake of the cataclysm is admirable. This is not a time for weakness."
msgstr "대재난 이후 라즈마가 보여준 결의는 존경할 만하지. 지금은 약해질 때가 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The Zealots have yet to name specifics. At best, they'll demand an inordinate amount of credits or firearms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011538"
msgid "Tell me what the Zealots have demanded so far."
msgstr "광신도가 지금까지 뭘 요구했는지 알려주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like Mirek is my next stop.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like Mirek is my next stop.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01152E"
msgid "Indeed they are."
msgstr "바로 그거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them. &&& companion: Understood.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What better way to surveil a threat? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01152D"
msgid "You're establishing a relationship with the Zealots?"
msgstr "광신도와 내부 관계를 맺었다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're establishing a relationship with the Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're establishing a relationship with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01152B"
msgid "What better way to surveil a threat?"
msgstr "위험 관리에 그보다 좋은 방법이 있겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're establishing a relationship with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01152A"
msgid "It's important for us to know what the Zealots may be targeting, to stay one step ahead."
msgstr "광신도가 뭘 노리는지 알아내는 건 중요한 일이야. 한 발 앞서 있어야 하거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen... &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad. &&& Tevina: What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years. &&& Qisrani: For now, let me see what I can find out regarding the missing supplies.|It's possible they were lost in the tragedy along with everything else. But I don't know for sure.|Once that is sorted, we can revisit this debate.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C42
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011529"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed they are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011528"
msgid "Sounds like Mirek is my next stop."
msgstr "보아하니 이제 미어렉한테 가야 할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk about Mirek again? &&& Razma: Of course. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can find them upstairs, in the meditation area. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011527"
msgid "Where did you say I can find Mirek?"
msgstr "미어렉이 어디 있다고 하셨죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mirek pronounced MEER-ek / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011526"
msgid "Mirek is a young and upcoming agent within the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "미어렉은 결합성 내부에서도 젊고 유망한 요원이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mirek pronounced MEER-ek / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011525"
msgid "They moved up quickly and because of this, along with their rather spoiled up bringing, Mirek's biggest weakness is their ego."
msgstr "빠르게 승진한 데다가 좀 버릇없이 자라 버렸지. 그래서 미어렉의 가장 큰 약점은 바로 본인이 가진 자부심이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011524"
msgid "Let's just say, compliments can get you anywhere."
msgstr "말하자면, 칭찬은 고래도 춤추게 한다는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them. &&& companion: Understood.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Zealots don't trust easily. If their location was discovered, Mirek would most likely be the first they'd suspect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011523"
msgid "Why would giving the location jeopardize Mirek's work?"
msgstr "위치를 알려주는 게 왜 미어렉의 작업을 위태롭게 한다는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Once I made the decision to go through with the negotiations, it wasn't necessary.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AF1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011522"
msgid "If Mirek knows, how come you haven't forced them to tell you?"
msgstr "미어렉이 알고 있다면, 왜 강제로 털어놓게 하지 않는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Of course. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011521"
msgid "Can we talk about Mirek again?"
msgstr "미어렉 얘기를 다시 할 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What else can you tell me about Mirek?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What else can you tell me about Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011520"
msgid "Mirek is proving to be an excellent addition to the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "미어렉은 결합성에 아주 훌륭한 보탬이 되어주고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What else can you tell me about Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151F"
msgid "Not only are they a great agent, but their grasp on House politics is remarkable for such a young age."
msgstr "훌륭한 요원일 뿐만이 아니라, 그렇게 어린 나이에도 가문 정치에 대한 이해력이 놀라운 수준이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What else can you tell me about Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151E"
msgid "If only they could humble themselves a bit, they'd be a perfect fit for High Council Mediary or even House Elder."
msgstr "자기를 조금 낮출 줄만 안다면 대의회 중개자 자리에 딱 맞을 거야. 가문 장로까지 될지도 모르고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk about Mirek again? &&& Razma: Of course. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Mirek is a young and upcoming agent within the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151D"
msgid "How can I better get through to Mirek?"
msgstr "미어렉을 잘 설득할 방법이 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151C"
msgid "As you know, the Zealots are extremists."
msgstr "그대도 알다시피, 광신도들은 극단주의자야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151B"
msgid "Whatever desire you know our people to have to make contact with the Great Serpent, it's ten-fold where the Zealots are concerned."
msgstr "우리 신민들이 위대한 뱀과 접하고 싶어 하는 열망과 비교하면, 광신도들의 열망은 10배는 더 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01151A"
msgid "After the cataclysm, it wouldn't take long for them to find out what we were doing and how Sahima may be the key to fixing it."
msgstr ""
"대재난이 터진 뒤에 놈들이 금방 눈치챘을 거야. 우리가 뭘 하고 있었고, 사히마가 이 문제를 해결할 열쇠일 수도 있다는 걸 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Sahima? &&& Razma: What would you like to know?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sahima was once part of a science team that worked directly with Anasko.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011519"
msgid "Why is Sahima so important to the High Council?"
msgstr "사히마가 대의회에 중요한 이유가 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mirek pronounced MEER-ek / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where did you say I can find Mirek?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you say I can find Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011518"
msgid "You can find them upstairs, in the meditation area."
msgstr "위층 명상실에서 찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where did you say I can find Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: How can I better get through to Mirek?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011517"
msgid "Normally, I don't condone business of any sort there, but this is an exception."
msgstr "평소에는 거기서 업무 이야기 절대 못 하게 하지만, 이번은 예외로 치겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk about Mirek again? &&& Razma: Of course. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Mirek is proving to be an excellent addition to the Ministry of Conjunction. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011516"
msgid "What else can you tell me about Mirek?"
msgstr "미어렉에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why is Sahima so important to the High Council?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why is Sahima so important to the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011515"
msgid "Sahima was once part of a science team that worked directly with Anasko."
msgstr "사히마는 한때 직속으로 아나스코 님의 연구를 수행하는 과학 팀의 팀원이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why is Sahima so important to the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011514"
msgid "But, being young, they didn't want to listen to her theories or, more importantly, her warnings."
msgstr "하지만 사히마가 어렸기 때문에, 과학팀은 사히마의 이론에 귀를 기울이려 하지 않았지. 더 중요한, 경고조차도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Sahima? &&& Razma: What would you like to know?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sahima is a brilliant mind who's always been a bit on the outskirts of the family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011513"
msgid "What kind of person is Sahima?"
msgstr "사히마는 어떤 사람인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Sahima?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of person is Sahima?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011512"
msgid "Sahima is a brilliant mind who's always been a bit on the outskirts of the family."
msgstr "사히마는 똑똑한 아이지. 항상 가족들 사이에서 조금은 겉돌았지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Sahima?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011511"
msgid "She can a bit temperamental, but it's mostly due to people misjudging her capabilities."
msgstr "좀 신경질적이긴 하지만, 그건 사람들이 그 애의 능력을 잘못 보기 때문이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is Sahima?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011510"
msgid "Otherwise, she's kind, yet ambitious."
msgstr "그 외에는, 친절하면서도 야심찬 아이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Sahima? &&& Razma: What would you like to know?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As you know, the Zealots are extremists. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150F"
msgid "Why would the Zealots take her and the others?"
msgstr "왜 광신도가 사히마와 다른 사람들을 납치했을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Sahima?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would the Zealots take her and the others?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150E"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "알고 싶은 게 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: What would you like to know?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_SahimaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150D"
msgid "What can you tell me about Sahima?"
msgstr "사히마에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly condescending / Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Greetings, fellow Promised. Razma told me this was a meditation room.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Greetings, fellow Promised. Razma told me this was a meditation room.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150C"
msgid "Forgive me. I didn't realize we were entertaining guests."
msgstr "미안해. 손님 접대하는 상황인 줄 몰랐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Greetings, fellow Promised. Razma told me this was a meditation room.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150B"
msgid "You must be the outsider I heard of who shares our beliefs."
msgstr "넌 분명 우리 믿음을 공유한다는 그 이방인이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Once again...
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Heh. A response like that is either bold or stupid, and for your sake, I hope it's bold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01150A"
msgid "Whatever I want."
msgstr "내가 원하는 건 뭐든지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Whatever I want.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever I want.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011509"
msgid "Heh. A response like that is either bold or stupid, and for your sake, I hope it's bold."
msgstr "허. 그런 대답은 용감하거나 멍청하거나 둘 중 하나인데. 널 위해서라도 용감한 것이길 바랄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Whatever I want.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Who I am isn't important.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011508"
msgid "Now, who are you and what do you want?"
msgstr "자, 넌 누구고, 뭘 원하는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would giving the location jeopardize Mirek's work?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would giving the location jeopardize Mirek's work?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011507"
msgid "The Zealots don't trust easily. If their location was discovered, Mirek would most likely be the first they'd suspect."
msgstr "광신도들은 쉽게 믿지 않아. 장소가 발각되면 놈들은 제일 먼저 미어렉을 의심할 가능성이 높지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would giving the location jeopardize Mirek's work?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011506"
msgid "They'd never trust them or any agent of House Ka'dic again."
msgstr "광신도가 그 녀석이나 다른 카딕 가문 요원을 다시는 믿지 않을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Once again...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Forgive me. I didn't realize we were entertaining guests. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011505"
msgid "Greetings, fellow Promised. Razma told me this was a meditation room."
msgstr "반가워, 약속받은 자. 라즈마가 명상실이 여기라고 했거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk about Mirek again? &&& Razma: Of course. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. If you have further questions, let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011504"
msgid "I think I have enough information."
msgstr "정보는 이만하면 충분한 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we talk about Mirek again? &&& Razma: Of course. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. If you have further questions, let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011503"
msgid "I think I have enough information."
msgstr "정보는 이만하면 충분한 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are. &&& Mirek: Heh, so much for confidentiality. &&& Mirek: I guess this means the High Council is still asking Auntie Razma where Sahima is.|And if you're here making demands, she obviously has decided to make use of you rather than undergo sincere negotiations.|I see what's going on here.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Easy. You ask me where Sahima is, I refuse because my work is vastly more important than yours...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011502"
msgid "If you're so smart, you tell me where this is going."
msgstr "그렇게 머리 좋으면 어디로 가야 하는지나 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think I have enough information.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think I have enough information.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011501"
msgid "Good. If you have further questions, let me know."
msgstr "좋아. 더 궁금한 점이 있으면, 언제든지 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you're so smart, you tell me where this is going.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you're so smart, you tell me where this is going.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011500"
msgid "Easy. You ask me where Sahima is, I refuse because my work is vastly more important than yours..."
msgstr "쉽네. 넌 사히마가 어디 있냐고 물어보고, 난 내 작업이 훨씬 더 중요하니까 답변을 거부하고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are. &&& Mirek: Heh, so much for confidentiality. &&& Mirek: I guess this means the High Council is still asking Auntie Razma where Sahima is.|And if you're here making demands, she obviously has decided to make use of you rather than undergo sincere negotiations.|I see what's going on here.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I am one of the few to garner any amount of trust with the Zealots, so she should be. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FF"
msgid "Very perceptive. I can see why Razma is so impressed with you."
msgstr "통찰력이 대단한데. 라즈마가 왜 널 그렇게 자랑스러워하는지 알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FE"
msgid "You can't possibly know the threat posed to Dazra. We need Sahima."
msgstr "넌 다즈라가 어떤 위험에 처해 있는지도 모를 텐데. 우린 사히마가 필요하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FD"
msgid "Well, it is the biggest variable..."
msgstr "뭐, 그게 가장 큰 변수이긴 하지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FC"
msgid "And if these negotiations succeed, I'm sure you'll get her."
msgstr "그래도 협상이 성공하면 분명히 사히마를 돌려받을 수 있어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FB"
msgid "You can't trust the Zealots."
msgstr "광신도를 믿으면 안 된다고."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114FA"
msgid "The Zealots could turn on you at any time."
msgstr "광신도들은 언제라도 널 공격할 수 있어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F9"
msgid "Thinking you have a clear understanding of how Zealots work is your first mistake."
msgstr "광신도의 행동 양식을 완전히 이해했다고 생각한 게 네 첫 번째 실수야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Then you know how important it is to reveal the location of the Zealot base.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then you know how important it is to reveal the location of the Zealot base.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I've worked hard to obtain my position with the Zealots. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ACF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F8"
msgid "On the contrary, I know how important it is to keep that information confidential."
msgstr "정 반대지. 그 정보를 비밀로 지키는 게 얼마나 중요한지 아는 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F7"
msgid "Hmm. I suppose you have a point."
msgstr "흠. 일리가 있는 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F6"
msgid "True. Given the circumstances, a bit more caution may be needed here."
msgstr "맞아. 상황을 고려해 보면, 좀 더 조심할 필요가 있을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F5"
msgid "If anything, they're unpredictable. Point taken."
msgstr "정확히는 예측 불가능이지. 요점은 알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F4"
msgid "I'm aware of the risks."
msgstr "위험성은 나도 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F3"
msgid "I think I know what I'm doing."
msgstr "내가 하는 일이 뭔진 나도 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable01LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F2"
msgid "I still won't jeopardize my work."
msgstr "그래도 내 일이 위태롭게 하지는 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F1"
msgid "You really need to consider the dangers here."
msgstr "지금 상황이 위험하다는 걸 진지하게 생각해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma sent me. She said you know where the Zealots are. &&& Mirek: Heh, so much for confidentiality. &&& Mirek: I guess this means the High Council is still asking Auntie Razma where Sahima is.|And if you're here making demands, she obviously has decided to make use of you rather than undergo sincere negotiations.|I see what's going on here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: On the contrary, I know how important it is to keep that information confidential.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114F0"
msgid "Then you know how important it is to reveal the location of the Zealot base."
msgstr "그렇다면 광신도 기지 위치를 알려주는 게 얼마나 중요한지도 알고 있겠지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114EF"
msgid "You're putting all of Dazra at risk."
msgstr "네가 다즈라 전체를 위험에 빠뜨리고 있다고."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114EE"
msgid "The lives of your people are more important than some Zealot's trust."
msgstr "너희 사람들의 목숨은 광신도의 신뢰 따위보다 더 중요한 거야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02PlayerLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114ED"
msgid "If you're wrong, you could lose everything."
msgstr "네가 틀린다면 모든 걸 잃게 될 수도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114EC"
msgid "Perhaps you're right..."
msgstr "네 말이 맞을지도..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114EB"
msgid "I think I've considered them enough."
msgstr "난 충분히 생각해 본 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Very perceptive. I can see why Razma is so impressed with you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Very perceptive. I can see why Razma is so impressed with you.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I can't imagine where the Ministry of Conjunction would be without me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114EA"
msgid "Well, I am one of the few to garner any amount of trust with the Zealots, so she should be."
msgstr "뭐, 내가 광신도의 신뢰를 얻은 몇 안 되는 사람 중에 하나니까, 당연히 그러셔야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E9"
msgid "We need Sahima to solve this and you know it."
msgstr "이 문제를 해결하려면 사히마가 필요해. 그건 너도 알 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E8"
msgid "I won't argue her importance..."
msgstr "확실히 사히마가 중요하지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E7"
msgid "Isn't that what the negotiations are for?"
msgstr "그래서 협상을 하려는 거 아닌가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I was told you know where the Zealots have taken Sahima.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033766
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0114E6"
msgid "So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me?"
msgstr "그럼 말해봐. 너처럼 선택받은 자가 나 같은 놈한테 원하는 게 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DeceptionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E4"
msgid "If you frame it right, the Zealots will never know you gave them up."
msgstr "말만 잘 맞추면 광신도들은 네가 위치를 넘긴 걸 절대 모를 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_NegotiationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E2"
msgid "Even if the Zealots did find out, I know you could negotiate your way right back into their good graces."
msgstr "광신도들이 알아차린다고 해도, 너라면 협상을 잘 해서 호의를 다시 되찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_NegotiationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E1"
msgid "I do have a gift..."
msgstr "내가 재능 있긴 하지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_NegotiationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114E0"
msgid "Heh. And why even chance it?"
msgstr "흥. 위험을 왜 감수해야 하는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DF"
msgid "Hmm. When you put it that way..."
msgstr "흠. 그렇게까지 말하다니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DE"
msgid "Yes, it's something I have considered..."
msgstr "그래, 나도 그렇게 생각했어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02WinLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DD"
msgid "Don't get me wrong, I understand what my choices mean..."
msgstr "오해하지는 마. 내 선택이 무슨 의미인지는 알고 있다고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DC"
msgid "And that would sway me if I believed anything could go that wrong."
msgstr "일이 잘못될 수 있다고 생각하면 내가 흔들리게 될 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DB"
msgid "I've weighed the situation, and I don't believe the risks to be that great."
msgstr "상황은 검토해 봤어. 위험이 그렇게 크지는 않다고 보는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02Scene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Repeatable02LoseLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114DA"
msgid "I think everyone's blowing this situation out of proportion..."
msgstr "내 생각엔 다들 상황을 너무 과장하고 있는 것 같은데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think I have enough information.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think I have enough information.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Razma_TL_MirekScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D9"
msgid "Good. If you have further questions, let me know."
msgstr "좋아. 더 궁금한 점이 있으면, 언제든지 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DiplomacyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D7"
msgid "It is one of my many specialties."
msgstr "그런 것도 내 전문이긴 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DiplomacyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D6"
msgid "I won't argue, but I'd still prefer to avoid the slim chance they wouldn't believe me."
msgstr "맞는 말이지만, 그래도 의심받을 수 있는 가능성은 조금이라도 피하고 싶은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D5"
msgid "I suppose that's a possibility..."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D4"
msgid "But they could be exactly what gets us Sahima back."
msgstr "협상 덕분에 사히마를 되찾을 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DiplomacyScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D3"
msgid "A person with your skills would know exactly what to say if they questioned your trust."
msgstr "너 정도 실력 되는 사람이라면 네 신용이 의심받을 때 어떤 말을 해야 하는지 정확히 알고 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DeceptionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114D0"
msgid "True. I am pretty good at misdirection."
msgstr "맞아. 내가 연막 작전은 꽤 잘 하거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7AB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_DeceptionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114CF"
msgid "But why risk it?"
msgstr "왜 위험을 감수하는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mirek
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010C7ABA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_SC_Misc04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114CE"
msgid "These negotiations could just be a pretense and you know it."
msgstr "그 협상은 그냥 구실일지도 몰라. 너도 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not just tell the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114CB"
msgid "They want Sahima, and we're trying to produce her."
msgstr "대의회는 사히마를 원하고, 우린 사히마를 보여주려 하는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I hope you aren't being lenient because Mirek's related to you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I hope you aren't being lenient because Mirek's related to you.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033769
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114CA"
msgid "It's not the family name that complicates matters here."
msgstr "성씨 때문에 문제가 복잡해진 건 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C8"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Vindicator who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 옹호자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C7"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Diviner who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 예측자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C6"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Reverent who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 숭배자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: So, tell me. What would a chosen one such as yourself want with someone like me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033760
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C5"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Armiger who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 복종자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
