#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C4"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Adherent who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 지지자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's not the family name that complicates matters here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C3"
msgid "I hope you aren't being lenient because Mirek's related to you."
msgstr "미어렉과 혈연 관계라고 해서 봐주는 게 아니었으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You really think the Zealots won't harm the hostages?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really think the Zealots won't harm the hostages?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103374D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C2"
msgid "Sahima isn't just being held hostage. They're putting her to work."
msgstr "사히마는 그냥 인질로 잡혀있는 게 아니야. 일을 시키고 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You really think the Zealots won't harm the hostages?
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: You really should rethink your position on the hostages.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103374D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C1"
msgid "The Zealots aren't stupid. They know what Sahima was involved in, and if they can beat us to that tech, they're going to try."
msgstr "광신도는 바보가 아니야. 사히마가 무슨 일에 엮였는지도 알고, 그 기술로 우릴 이길 수 있다면 당연히 이기려 하겠지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Politics, fear, even hope? It is a complicated subject. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010CA08B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_01_DazraExile
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114C0"
msgid "Why do the people of Dazra let you linger around the refugee camp if they've rejected you?"
msgstr "다즈라 사람들은 너와 말도 섞지 않는다며? 왜 난민촌 근처에 머물게 내버려둔 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do the people of Dazra let you linger around the refugee camp if they've rejected you? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010CA08A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_01_DazraExile
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114BF"
msgid "Politics, fear, even hope? It is a complicated subject."
msgstr "정치, 공포, 아니면 희망...? 꽤 민감한 주제인 거 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010CA08A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_01_DazraExile
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114BE"
msgid "In case you are unaware, the people you know as Zealots were once House Ma'leen, one of the noble houses in Dazra."
msgstr "참고로 말하는데, 원래 광신도들은 다즈라의 명문 가문이었던 마린 가문 사람들이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010CA08A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_01_DazraExile
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114BD"
msgid "Opinions of Zealots vary in Dazra. Most are distrusting and fearful, but others are sympathetic, and I am sure some even hope that one day House Ma'leen will return to Dazra."
msgstr ""
"다즈라 사람들 사이에서도 광신도들에 대한 의견은 제각각이야. 대부분은 믿지 않고 두려워하지만, 어떤 이들은 동정심을 보이기도 하지. 아마 "
"일부는 언젠가 마린 가문이 다즈라로 돌아오길 바라고 있을 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010CA08A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_TL_01_DazraExile
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114BC"
msgid "To some, violently removing a Zealot could be seen as raising a hand against a noble house. As I said, it is a complicated subject. Much easier to just ignore me, and hope the problem goes away."
msgstr ""
"일부 신민들에겐 폭력을 써서 광신도를 쫓아내는 것이 명문 가문에 반기를 드는 일로 보일 수도 있지. 이미 말했지만, 이건 복잡한 문제야. "
"신민들 입장에선 그냥 날 무시하고, 문제가 자연스레 사라지길 바라는 게 더 편하지."

msgctxt "0114BB"
msgid "*Music playing*"
msgstr "*음악 소리*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance. &&& Malibor: But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious. &&& Malibor: And perhaps our guest's intent should be determined before we take further action.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We received the automated transmission, but you are certainly not who we expected to find...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C6401
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114A3"
msgid "Your station brought me here. It jumped while my ship was docked."
msgstr "그쪽 정거장이 날 여기 데려온 거예요. 우주선이 도킹 돼 있었는데 도약하더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C427B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114A2"
msgid "What is that massive ship sitting above the city?"
msgstr "도시 위에 놓여있는 저 거대한 우주선은 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your station brought me here. It jumped while my ship was docked.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your station brought me here. It jumped while my ship was docked.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C6400
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114A1"
msgid "We received the automated transmission, but you are certainly not who we expected to find..."
msgstr "자동 송신 신호를 받기는 했지만, 그대는 저희가 기대하던 사람이 전혀 아니로군요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is that massive ship sitting above the city?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is, in fact, the ship upon which Jinan first made contact with the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C427A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0114A0"
msgid "You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago."
msgstr ""
"모어닝 호를 말하는 거겠군요. 저희 역사에서 아주 중요한 부분입니다. 바로 그 우주선이 몇 세대 전에 지난 바룬 님을 이 위성으로 "
"데려왔으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It must be a great source of pride.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149F"
msgid "It is, in fact, the ship upon which Jinan first made contact with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "실은 그 우주선에서 지난 님이 위대한 뱀과 처음으로 접촉하셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is that massive ship sitting above the city? &&& Malibor: You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago. &&& Malibor: It is, in fact, the ship upon which Jinan first made contact with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, it has led a long and storied life. During the Serpent's Crusade, it was used to successfully defend our home.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149E"
msgid "Looks like it's seen better days."
msgstr "더 상태 좋았던 시절이 있어 보이는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: beaming with pride / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: It must be a great source of pride.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It must be a great source of pride.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Its presence is a constant connection to our shared history, a reminder of the chain of events that led to us being here today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149D"
msgid "I have always found it comforting to look up and see it."
msgstr "항상 우주선을 올려다보며 위안을 얻곤 했지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: Looks like it's seen better days.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Looks like it's seen better days.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149C"
msgid "Yes, it has led a long and storied life. During the Serpent's Crusade, it was used to successfully defend our home."
msgstr "맞습니다. 길고 사연 많은 함생을 살았지요. 뱀의 성전 기간에는 우리 고향을 성공적으로 방어해 냈습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: Looks like it's seen better days.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Its presence is a constant connection to our shared history, a reminder of the chain of events that led to us being here today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149B"
msgid "But it has not flown since, and it is very unlikely that it ever will again."
msgstr "하지만 그 이후로는 비행하지 않았고, 앞으로도 영원히 그럴 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me more about Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: He believed he was on the cusp of realizing that goal, and now... Well, you have seen him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4270
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Anasko
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01149A"
msgid "He has led House Va'ruun since the death of his father Jarek. He was - is - determined to return House Va'ruun to glory."
msgstr ""
"그분의 부친이신 자렉 님께서 별세하신 이후로 우릴 이끄셨지요. 바룬 가문에 영광을 되돌리겠다고 결심하셨고, 지금도 노력 중이십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: He has led House Va'ruun since the death of his father Jarek. He was - is - determined to return House Va'ruun to glory.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I should perhaps not speak too much of it, but there has been concern that he was lost to us. Your interaction with him gives me hope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C426F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Anasko
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011499"
msgid "He believed he was on the cusp of realizing that goal, and now... Well, you have seen him."
msgstr "그 목표를 달성하기 직전이라고 믿으셨는데, 지금은... 뭐, 그대도 그분을 봤으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is that massive ship sitting above the city? &&& Malibor: You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago. &&& Malibor: It is, in fact, the ship upon which Jinan first made contact with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have always found it comforting to look up and see it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011498"
msgid "It must be a great source of pride."
msgstr "분명 저 우주선에서 큰 자부심을 느끼겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I have always found it comforting to look up and see it.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4272
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011497"
msgid "Its presence is a constant connection to our shared history, a reminder of the chain of events that led to us being here today."
msgstr "그 존재는 우리가 공유한 역사와 끊임없이 연결되어 있고, 우리를 오늘날 여기 있게 해준 일련의 사건들을 되새기게 해 주지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: He has led House Va'ruun since the death of his father Jarek. He was - is - determined to return House Va'ruun to glory.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4271
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Anasko
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011496"
msgid "Tell me more about Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "아나스코 바룬에 대해 더 자세히 알려줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is that massive ship sitting above the city? &&& Malibor: You mean of course the Mourning. A crucial part of our history, it is the very ship that delivered Jinan Va'ruun to this moon generations ago. &&& Malibor: It is, in fact, the ship upon which Jinan first made contact with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They have never made them like this. It was originally manufactured in the Settled Systems, of course, but we have made many modifications. Improvements.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4274
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011495"
msgid "They don't make them like that any more."
msgstr "더 이상 이런 우주선은 건조되지 않을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: He believed he was on the cusp of realizing that goal, and now... Well, you have seen him.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: If you can hear him, he is not beyond rescue.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C426E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Anasko
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011494"
msgid "I should perhaps not speak too much of it, but there has been concern that he was lost to us. Your interaction with him gives me hope."
msgstr "너무 많이 말하면 안 되겠지만, 우리가 그분을 영영 잃었다는 걱정을 했었습니다. 그대가 그분과 접촉하면서 희망이 생겼어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. PROMPT: They don't make them like that any more.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They don't make them like that any more.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Its presence is a constant connection to our shared history, a reminder of the chain of events that led to us being here today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C4273
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Mourning
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011493"
msgid "They have never made them like this. It was originally manufactured in the Settled Systems, of course, but we have made many modifications. Improvements."
msgstr ""
"이런 우주선은 만들어진 적이 없습니다. 물론 원래는 개척 성계에서 제작된 우주선이지만, 많은 개조 작업을 거쳤지요. 개량이라고 할까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I should perhaps not speak too much of it, but there has been concern that he was lost to us. Your interaction with him gives me hope.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C426D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Malibor_Anasko
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011492"
msgid "If you can hear him, he is not beyond rescue."
msgstr "그분의 목소리가 들린다면, 구출도 가능할 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
