msgctxt "011490"
msgid "Through Strength and Perseverance, House Va'ruun will triumph over all that stands in its way."
msgstr "위력과 인내를 통하여, 바룬 가문은 가로막는 모든 것을 물리치고 승리하리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01148F"
msgid "Devotion to the Great Serpent, and Perseverance to remain devoted no matter the circumstances, will always reveal a path forward for any member of House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀을 향한 헌신과 어떤 상황에서도 그 헌신을 잃지 않는 인내는, 언제나 바룬 가문 모든 이에게 앞으로 나아갈 길을 밝혀 주리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01148E"
msgid "To truly commit to the Great Serpent requires utter Devotion, and unending Obedience."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 진정으로 헌신하려면 완전한 헌신과 영원한 복종이 필요한 법."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01148D"
msgid "Strength of Will and Obedience to the Great Serpent will guide you in the days to come, and until the Shrouding."
msgstr "의지의 위력과 위대한 뱀을 향한 복종이 그대의 앞날을 인도하여 장막의 날까지 이어지게 하리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01148C"
msgid "One who remains Obedient through every trial of this life, and Perseveres in the name of the Great Serpent, will always retain His favor."
msgstr "평생의 시련을 거치면서도 변함없이 복종하고, 위대한 뱀의 이름으로 인내하는 이는, 언제나 주의 은총을 간직하리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: You stand before what remains of the High Council, advisors to Anasko Va'ruun.
