#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011487"
msgid "Welcome, Adherent."
msgstr "어서 오시지요. 지지자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011486"
msgid "You have walked the path, and now may walk among the Promised."
msgstr "길을 걸어왔으니, 이제 약속받은 자들 사이를 걸어도 좋다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011485"
msgid "The Serpent's Path lies behind you, but will always extend ahead of you. Will you continue to see it?"
msgstr "뱀의 길은 네 뒤에 놓여 있지만, 언제나 네 앞을 향해 뻗어나갈 것이다. 그 길을 계속 목도하겠느냐?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011484"
msgid "You must walk the path. I am merely here to guide you along your way."
msgstr "길을 걸어야만 한다. 난 너를 이끌어주기 위해 있을 뿐이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011483"
msgid "I will await you at the end of the Serpent's Path."
msgstr "뱀의 길 끝에서 널 기다리고 있겠다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011482"
msgid "The path lies before you, but it is up to you to walk it."
msgstr "길은 앞에 놓여 있지만, 걷는 건 너의 몫이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011481"
msgid "I have other matters that require my attention, but I will see you soon."
msgstr "처리해야 할 다른 일이 있습니다. 조만간 다시 보도록 하지요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011480"
msgid "We will speak again soon."
msgstr "조만간 다시 연락하지요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147F"
msgid "Herald Inaza will show you the way."
msgstr "이나자 전령님이 길을 안내해 주실 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147E"
msgid "Without our leader, I fear for the future of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "지도자가 부재하시니, 바룬 가문의 미래가 두렵군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147D"
msgid "Our situation is dire. We need all the help we can get, including yours."
msgstr "상황이 심각합니다. 그대를 포함해 가능한 모든 도움이 필요하지요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147C"
msgid "House Va'ruun needs your assistance, outsider."
msgstr "바룬 가문은 그대의 도움이 필요합니다. 이방인이여."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147B"
msgid "We wish no harm upon you, outsider."
msgstr "그대가 해를 입지 않기를 바랍니다. 이방인."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01147A"
msgid "It cannot be coincidence that you arrive here now."
msgstr "그대가 지금 도착한 게 우연일 리가 없습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosMalibor
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011479"
msgid "If the Oracle brought you to us, then the Great Serpent means for you to be here."
msgstr "오라클이 그대를 데려왔다면, 위대한 뱀께서 그대를 이곳으로 이끄셨다는 겁니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011478"
msgid "The Councilor has spoken for you, else you would go no further."
msgstr "의원님이 널 대변해 주신 덕분에 보내주는 줄 알아라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011477"
msgid "You? Become part of House Va'ruun? Ugh."
msgstr "네가? 바룬 가문의 일원이 됐다고? 으웩."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: last bit almost under your breath, to yourself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011476"
msgid "Watch yourself. You are not yet one of us, if you ever will be."
msgstr "처신 잘해라. 넌 아직 우리 일원이 아니니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011475"
msgid "If the need were not so great, you would never set foot in Dazra."
msgstr "그래야 했으니 망정이지, 아니었으면 넌 다즈라에 발을 들여놓지도 못했을 거다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011474"
msgid "Do not give me a reason to destroy you."
msgstr "널 죽여야 할 이유를 만들지 말라고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011473"
msgid "You should not be here. None of your kind are allowed."
msgstr "넌 여기 있으면 안 돼. 너희 족속은 아무도 허락 못 받는다고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosPrimaryGuard
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "011472"
msgid "No sudden movements. You are lucky to be alive right now."
msgstr "허튼 짓 하지 마라. 지금 살아있는 것도 운 좋은 줄 알아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: In fact, I find this entire "trial" to be a farce, and I will not give it any more credence then it deserves. &&& Tevina: Blah-blah-blah-blah-blah. I feel sorry for whoever you have to share a cell with. &&& Tevina: Guard, escort the Envoy to his new lodgings.
#. ALIAS: SecurityGuard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C785C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011471"
msgid "Right away, Warden."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 교정관님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department. &&& Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: On its own, not necessarily damning, but combined with all the other evidence, it signifies a pattern.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C7851
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011470"
msgid "[Tevina's Records] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen."
msgstr "[테비나의 기록] 코테지의 비행 단말기 기록이 물자 도난 날짜와 일치합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Spaceport Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Spaceport Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Correlation does not imply causation. Even you should be aware it's not enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C7850
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01146F"
msgid "On its own, not necessarily damning, but combined with all the other evidence, it signifies a pattern."
msgstr "그 사실 하나만으로는 별 가치가 없지만, 다른 증거와 종합하면 금방 패턴을 알아낼 수 있죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ah yes, that. The case is closed, and we found the culprit. I tell you what. You can keep it as a souvenir.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C63E4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_510_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01146E"
msgid "On that note, let's not waste any time lingering. Here are your credits. House Veth'aal thanks you for your service."
msgstr "그럼, 더 이상 시간 낭비하지 않도록 하죠. 여기 크레딧이 있습니다. 베타알 가문은 당신의 노고에 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Well, now that that unpleasantness is behind us. I think we can wrap this case up. &&& Tevina: With punishments taken care of, the only thing left to dole out is your reward.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah yes, that. The case is closed, and we found the culprit. I tell you what. You can keep it as a souvenir.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C63E1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_510_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01146D"
msgid "[Ochim's Recording] I take it you want this recording destroyed."
msgstr "[오킴의 기록] 이 기록을 파기하길 원하시는 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Mujeen's Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: You mock me, but your evidence is flimsy, circumstantial, and speculative. I see nothing here that should concern me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C784D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01146C"
msgid "And the hits keep on coming. What do you have to say to that, Mujeen?"
msgstr "계속해서 터지는군요. 무진, 뭐라고 할 말 없나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: With punishments taken care of, the only thing left to dole out is your reward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C63E3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_510_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01146B"
msgid "Well, now that that unpleasantness is behind us. I think we can wrap this case up."
msgstr "자, 이제 불미스러운 일은 다 끝났으니. 이 사건도 마무리 지을 수 있겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Ochim's Recording] I take it you want this recording destroyed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Ochim's Recording] I take it you want this recording destroyed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: On that note, let's not waste any time lingering. Here are your credits. House Veth'aal thanks you for your service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C63E0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_510_Greeting
