#. TOPIC: 010C56A8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01142C"
msgid "Now this is incredibly damning. A slate written by a Zealot, identifying you by name."
msgstr "이건 정말 믿을 수 없을 정도로 유죄를 잘 입증하는군요. 광신도가 쓴 슬레이트인데, 당신 이름을 직접 언급하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C56A8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01142B"
msgid "Is something wrong, Envoy? You don't seem to want to argue for your innocence."
msgstr "뭔가 잘못됐나요? 사절? 자신의 결백을 주장하고 싶은 건 아닌 것처럼 보이는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department. &&& Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen. &&& Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: See? When confronted with the facts, even your own investigator has taken my side! You don't even have the evidence to make me a suspect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C56BA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01142A"
msgid "Actually, Mujeen makes a good point. Maybe he is innocent."
msgstr "사실, 무진의 말이 일리가 있군요. 어쩌면 무고할지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need more time to prepare.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need more time to prepare.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
