#. TOPIC: 010C56A6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011429"
msgid "Don't be too long, I hate waiting."
msgstr "너무 오래 끌진 마세요. 기다리는 건 질색이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does. &&& Qisrani: I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information. &&& Qisrani: Harbinger, the floor is yours.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well. Let us know when you're ready to speak on this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047157
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011428"
msgid "I need more time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 더 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: You mock me, but your evidence is flimsy, circumstantial, and speculative. I see nothing here that should concern me. &&& Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works. &&& Tevina: And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's killer. Your ward, Ochim.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: In fact, I find this entire "trial" to be a farce, and I will not give it any more credence then it deserves.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C5D05
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011427"
msgid "I had no part in that!"
msgstr "난 그 일에 관여하지 않았어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Clever, clever. Well, if that's how we're playing it, I'm not going to argue over what is obviously a fake recording.|Just do what you have to do. And I'll deal with you both when I get out. &&& Mujeen: Good. Silence suits you Tevina, as will a prison cell. Guard, take her away. &&& Mujeen: What? This is outrageous. House Ka'dic denies all involvement in this conspiracy.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Harbinger, the evidence, if you please.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C56A2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011426"
msgid "Oh, you're not going to worm your way out of this one, Envoy."
msgstr "오, 이번에는 빠져나가지 못할 겁니다. 사절."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Good. Silence suits you Tevina, as will a prison cell. Guard, take her away.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, you're not going to worm your way out of this one, Envoy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4112
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011425"
msgid "What? This is outrageous. House Ka'dic denies all involvement in this conspiracy."
msgstr "뭐라고? 이건 말도 안 돼. 카딕 가문은 이 음모와 관련된 모든 혐의를 부인하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure. &&& Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.|The meeting takes place inside the Halls of Obedience. Will you watch my back?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm disheartened to hear you say that. But I hope, when the moment comes, you will do the right thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F7C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011424"
msgid "Nah, you're on your own."
msgstr "아니요. 당신은 혼자서 해결해야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nah, you're on your own.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nah, you're on your own.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F7B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011423"
msgid "I'm disheartened to hear you say that. But I hope, when the moment comes, you will do the right thing."
msgstr "그런 말을 하다니 크게 낙심했지만... 때가 왔을 때 부디 당신이 올바른 일을 하길 바랄게요."

#. PROMPT: [Spaceport Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Spaceport Computer] Flight terminal records for the Cortege match the date the supplies were stolen. &&& Qisrani: On its own, not necessarily damning, but combined with all the other evidence, it signifies a pattern.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C784F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011422"
msgid "Correlation does not imply causation. Even you should be aware it's not enough."
msgstr "상관관계가 인과관계를 의미하는 건 아니지. 너조차도 그것만으로는 충분하지 않다는 걸 알아야 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Security has identified him as Ochim Ka'dic. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C5D09
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011421"
msgid "And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's would be assassin."
msgstr "그리고 물론, 가장 중요한 건 이거죠. 키스라니의 암살 미수범."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I had no part in that!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C5D06
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011420"
msgid "And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's killer. Your ward, Ochim."
msgstr "그리고 물론, 가장 중요한 건 이거죠. 키스라니를 죽이려 한 자. 당신의 피후견자, 오킴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. PROMPT: Actually, Mujeen makes a good point. Maybe he is innocent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Actually, Mujeen makes a good point. Maybe he is innocent.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works.
