#. TOPIC: 010C56B7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01141F"
msgid "See? When confronted with the facts, even your own investigator has taken my side! You don't even have the evidence to make me a suspect."
msgstr "보라고. 사실을 직시하니, 네 수사관조차도 내 편을 들지 않나! 자네는 날 용의자로 만들 만한 증거조차 없다고."

#. PROMPT: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate. &&& Qisrani: Is that so, Mujeen? Or do you deny the words you yourself wrote?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C56B8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01141E"
msgid "I absolutely deny it! My computer has obviously been tampered with. This is clearly not enough evidence to even consider me a suspect."
msgstr "난 결백을 주장한다! 내 컴퓨터가 조작된 게 분명해. 나를 용의자로 간주하기엔 증거가 터무니없이 부족해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something seems to be troubling you. &&& MS01_Madri: It's my brother. Ever since I got his letter, I've been worried he might be in trouble.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Phew, that's a relief. My brother never tells me what he's up to, and I get it. 
