msgstr "오킴이 그 대화를 녹음했군요. 영리한 친구였네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: So Ochim recorded that conversation. Clever, clever man.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Proposition. What if you were to ignore that slate, and help me arrest Mujeen.
