#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to confess and surrender to the authorities.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
