#. TOPIC: 010C4119
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113CD"
msgid "Tevina Veth'aal orchestrated this whole thing, and this recording proves it."
msgstr "테비나 베타알이 이 일을 모두 계획했어. 이 녹음 파일이 증거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4119
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113CC"
msgid "And I must say, I take some small amount of pleasure in what's about to happen."
msgstr "그리고 말해두는데, 앞으로 벌어질 일을 생각하니 조금 즐겁거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: A handful of supply shipments are a meager exchange for an entire clan of allies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4119
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113CB"
msgid "The Warden has no idea what's coming. She will reap what she has sown."
msgstr "교정관은 무슨 일이 일어날지 전혀 모르고 있어. 자신이 뿌린 대로 거두게 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's responsible for everything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's responsible for everything.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Give me until tomorrow to prepare, and then meet me in my office.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C410F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_400_Greeting_Tevina_QisraniDeadPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113CA"
msgid "And he will suffer for the crimes he has committed."
msgstr "그리고 무진은 자신이 저지른 범죄에 대가를 치를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: This and preceding line are if Qisrani is dead. Tevina is now the judge. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: This recording... it's of Ochim and Tevina!|Where did you even find this?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4120
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C9"
msgid "I have no idea what you have planned, but I know Tevina holds a grudge against me. So I have little faith this \"trial\" will be a fair one."
msgstr "네가 무슨 계획을 꾸미고 있는지는 모르겠지만, 테비나가 나한테 앙심을 품고 있다는 건 알아. 그래서 난 이 '재판'이 공정할 거라고 거의 믿지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I just followed the clues.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4120
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C8"
msgid "But we shall see."
msgstr "하지만 두고 보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Show Slate] I do. And with your help, they'll be the ones charged. &&& Mujeen: This recording... it's of Ochim and Tevina!|Where did you even find this? &&& Mujeen: I have no idea what you have planned, but I know Tevina holds a grudge against me. So I have little faith this "trial" will be a fair one.|But we shall see.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Excellent work. I have long suspected I was manipulated into aiding the Zealots. It was almost too easy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C411B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C7"
msgid "I just followed the clues."
msgstr "전 그냥 단서를 따라갔을 뿐인데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The security was a Zealot assassin. &&& Tevina: Serpent's breath! No wonder she didn't see it coming. &&& Tevina: But there is a saving grace. If it was her own guard that attacked her, I know for a fact who the supply thief is. The person who hired them. &&& Tevina: Mujeen Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: In due time. But first, a public humiliation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C410E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_400_Greeting_Tevina_QisraniDeadPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C6"
msgid "He's as good as dead then."
msgstr "그럼 무진은 이제 죽은 목숨이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Someone has to take the fall.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Someone has to take the fall.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I have no idea what you have planned, but I know Tevina holds a grudge against me. So I have little faith this "trial" will be a fair one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C410B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C4"
msgid "And I see now, that person must be me. Fine. If this is how I serve, so be it."
msgstr "그리고 이제 보니, 그 사람이 바로 나인가 보군. 좋아. 이것이 내가 복무하는 방식이라면, 그렇게 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course you're trying to shift the blame. I'm not buying it. &&& Mujeen: I won't apologize for my actions. Everything I did, I did for Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmph. Then I have no choice but to defend myself from you and House Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4124
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C3"
msgid "It doesn't matter. You still need to answer for your crimes."
msgstr "상관없어요. 그래도 당신이 저지른 범죄에 책임을 져야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The security was a Zealot assassin. &&& Tevina: Serpent's breath! No wonder she didn't see it coming. &&& Tevina: But there is a saving grace. If it was her own guard that attacked her, I know for a fact who the supply thief is. The person who hired them. &&& Tevina: Mujeen Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And he will suffer for the crimes he has committed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4110
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_400_Greeting_Tevina_QisraniDeadPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C2"
msgid "He's responsible for everything."
msgstr "모든 책임은 무진이 져야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's as good as dead then.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's as good as dead then.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Give me until tomorrow to prepare, and then meet me in my office.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C410D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_400_Greeting_Tevina_QisraniDeadPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C1"
msgid "In due time. But first, a public humiliation."
msgstr "때가 되면요. 하지만 먼저, 공개적인 망신을 줘야지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Murder, theft, and most heinous of all, the aiding of Zealots from House Ma'leen, sworn enemies of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4115
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113C0"
msgid "The perpetrator of all three being right in this room."
msgstr "이 세 가지 범죄를 모두 저지른 자가 바로 이 방 안에 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I agree. The perpetrator IS in this room. And I'm speaking to her now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4115
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_500_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BF"
msgid "Mujeen of House Ka'dic, what say you to these charges?"
msgstr "카딕 가문의 무진, 이 혐의에 대해 어떻게 생각하시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: But there is a saving grace. If it was her own guard that attacked her, I know for a fact who the supply thief is. The person who hired them.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I also found evidence he's the supply thief.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4111
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_400_Greeting_Tevina_QisraniDeadPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BE"
msgid "Mujeen Ka'dic."
msgstr "무진 카딕."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you admit to helping the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: I admit that I was presented an opportunity, and took advantage of it.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I see now, that person must be me. Fine. If this is how I serve, so be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C410C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BD"
msgid "Someone has to take the fall."
msgstr "누군가는 책임을 져야 하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just followed the clues.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Tevina Veth'aal orchestrated this whole thing, and this recording proves it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C411A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BC"
msgid "Excellent work. I have long suspected I was manipulated into aiding the Zealots. It was almost too easy."
msgstr "훌륭하군. 난 오랫동안 내가 광신도들을 돕도록 조종당하고 있다고 의심했었지. 거의 너무 쉬웠거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: This is a different line if Qisrani is dead. Tevina is now the judge. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BB"
msgid "If that's so, then whoever this person is far more dangerous than I."
msgstr "만약 그렇다면, 이 자는 나보다 훨씬 더 위험한 인물이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: This is a different line if Qisrani is dead. Tevina is now the judge. / Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Show Slate] I do. And with your help, they'll be the ones charged.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113BA"
msgid "Do you know who they are?"
msgstr "그들이 누군지 알고 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I offered to provide her a security detail. But I had arranged the assignment through my ward, Ochim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B9"
msgid "What do you mean, a rubber stamp?"
msgstr "무슨 말이죠? 내용을 보지도 않고 도장을 찍어줬다뇨?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, protect her?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean, protect her?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B8"
msgid "I offered to provide her a security detail. But I had arranged the assignment through my ward, Ochim."
msgstr "키스라니에게 경비대원을 붙여주겠다고 제안했었지. 근데 내 피후견자 오킴을 통해 그 임무를 주선했었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, protect her?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B7"
msgid "In fact, even my work with the Zealots was all done through him."
msgstr "사실, 광신도들과의 거래도 모두 오킴을 통해서 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0113B6"
msgid "Give me a moment to work my magic. We'll reconvene in a day."
msgstr "잠깐만 시간을 주시죠. 하루 뒤에 다시 모이도록 하지요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Tevina: So Ochim recorded that conversation. Clever, clever man.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C4127
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_Recording
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B5"
msgid "[Ochim's Recording] I found this slate. It reveals who hired Qisrani's killer."
msgstr "[녹음된 오킴의 목소리] 이 슬레이트를 발견했어요. 키스라니의 살인자를 고용한 사람이 누구인지 밝혀져 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: [Ochim's Recording] Why don't you tell me. 
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Which leaves us in a bind. Because without me or Qisrani, you won't have the authority to arrest Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C4194
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_410
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B4"
msgid "So Ochim recorded that conversation. Clever, clever man."
msgstr "오킴이 그 대화를 녹음했군요. 영리한 친구였네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Tevina: So Ochim recorded that conversation. Clever, clever man.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C4128
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_Recording
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B3"
msgid "But as you know, the Qisrani's killer has already been convicted, and the sentence will be meted out shortly."
msgstr "하지만 아시다시피, 키스라니의 살인자는 이미 유죄 판결을 받았고, 형벌이 곧 집행될 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C4128
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_Recording
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B2"
msgid "So as far as I'm concerned, you and I have nothing to discuss."
msgstr "그러니까 제가 보기에, 당신과 저는 더 이상 논의할 것이 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C4128
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_Recording
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113B1"
msgid "Run along, little investigator, and find a crime that hasn't been solved."
msgstr "어서 가세요, 꼬마 수사관님, 그리고 아직 해결되지 않은 범죄를 찾아보세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dying, last words. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Regardless, he must answer for aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin. |Give me until the coming dawn, and I will summon the relevant parties to my office.|Mark my words, we will bring him to justice with all three noble Houses as witness.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F63
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113AE"
msgid "Talk to Tevina. Bring the people responsible to justice."
msgstr "테비나와 얘기하세요. 책임자들이 죄값을 치르게 하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Is that correct? You came to me earlier, claiming someone from House Ka'dic was the supply thief. Is that not Mujeen? &&& Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Harbinger, the floor is yours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F41
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113AD"
msgid "I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information."
msgstr "충분한 근거도 없이 멋대로 이런 주장을 하는 게 아니에요. 둘케프 가문도 이 정보를 제공해 준 게 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F40
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0113AC"
msgid "Harbinger, the floor is yours."
msgstr "선구자, 말해 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F40
