#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I want Qisrani Dul'kehf dead. And I want you to convince your boss to order the hit.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
