msgid "Just make sure my sister is taken care of."
msgstr "그냥 제 여동생을 잘 돌봐 주십쇼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01139B"
msgid "Jinan's breath... that was harder than I expected. Tevina and I were colleagues for years. Friends, even."
msgstr "지난의 숨결이시여... 예상했던 것보다 더 힘들었어요. 테비나와 수년간 동료였죠. 심지어 친구였는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've studied a lot of true crime cases. It helped me track down the root cause of everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01139A"
msgid "I had no idea she was involved in any of this. How did you know?"
msgstr "그자가 이 모든 일에 연루되어 있을 줄은 꿈에도 몰랐어요. 어떻게 알았죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011399"
msgid "Jinan's breath... I had no idea."
msgstr "지난의 숨결이시여... 전혀 몰랐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've studied a lot of true crime cases. It helped me track down the root cause of everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011398"
msgid "How did you even discover all this?"
msgstr "이걸 모두 어떻게 발견한 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. PROMPT: I've studied a lot of true crime cases. It helped me track down the root cause of everything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've studied a lot of true crime cases. It helped me track down the root cause of everything.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011397"
msgid "I'm glad all that research paid off."
msgstr "그 모든 조사가 결실을 맺어서 다행이네요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: Jinan's breath... that was harder than I expected. Tevina and I were colleagues for years. Friends, even.|I had no idea she was involved in any of this. How did you know?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm glad all that research paid off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011396"
msgid "I've studied a lot of true crime cases. It helped me track down the root cause of everything."
msgstr "저는 실제 범죄 사례를 많이 연구했어요. 그게 모든 일의 근본 원인을 추적하는 데 도움이 되었죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: Jinan's breath... that was harder than I expected. Tevina and I were colleagues for years. Friends, even.|I had no idea she was involved in any of this. How did you know?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My cousin was always one step ahead. It seems that was the case even in death.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011395"
msgid "Ukaru was the one who pointed the way."
msgstr "우카루가 조사 방향을 알려줬어요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: Jinan's breath... that was harder than I expected. Tevina and I were colleagues for years. Friends, even.|I had no idea she was involved in any of this. How did you know?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: False modesty doesn't suit you. You went above and beyond, and that's not luck. It's dedication.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011394"
msgid "Dumb luck, really."
msgstr "사실, 순전히 운이 좋았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: I'm glad all that research paid off.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011393"
msgid "Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes."
msgstr "당신이 없었다면, 우리는 사건을 해결하지 못했을 거고, 테비나가 뒤에서 꾸민 일도 밝혀내지 못했을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. PROMPT: I'm just very good at what I do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just very good at what I do.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011392"
msgid "That much is evident to everyone involved. Especially Warden Veth'aal."
msgstr "그건 관련된 모든 사람들에게 확실한 것 같네요. 특히 베타알 교정관에게는요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. PROMPT: Dumb luck, really.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Dumb luck, really.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011391"
msgid "False modesty doesn't suit you. You went above and beyond, and that's not luck. It's dedication."
msgstr "괜한 겸손은 당신과 어울리지 않아요. 당신은 기대 이상이었고, 그건 단순한 운이 아니에요. 헌신이죠."

#. PROMPT: Ukaru was the one who pointed the way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ukaru was the one who pointed the way.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011390"
msgid "My cousin was always one step ahead. It seems that was the case even in death."
msgstr "제 사촌은 항상 한 발 앞서 있었죠. 죽어서도 그런 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: Without you, not only would we have not solved the case, but we would have never uncovered Tevina's work behind the scenes.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01138F"
msgid "Once again, from the bottom of my heart, I thank you."
msgstr "다시 한번, 진심으로 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01138E"
msgid "*Exhales* And now, if you'll excuse me, I have some more paperwork to do."
msgstr "*숨 내뱉는 소리* 그럼 이만, 실례하겠지만, 저는 아직 처리해야 할 서류 작업이 좀 있어서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01138D"
msgid "In order not to waste your hard work, I need to make sure Tevina's arrest is ironclad."
msgstr "당신의 노고를 헛되이 하지 않으려면, 테비나의 체포가 확실한지 확인해야 합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: Jinan's breath... that was harder than I expected. Tevina and I were colleagues for years. Friends, even.|I had no idea she was involved in any of this. How did you know?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That much is evident to everyone involved. Especially Warden Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C3F37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrestFinal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01138C"
msgid "I'm just very good at what I do."
msgstr "그냥 일을 아주 잘한 것뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lyrics 2 of melody / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: We touch, walls, that lead a faceless path, Leaving, prints, streaked along faded glass.
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: *Humming*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E35CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_050_IrisScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011388"
msgid "I wander this place, that calls, To feel once more the gentle warmth of your hands, softly, as the rain falls."
msgstr "이곳을 떠도네. 나를 부르는 이곳을. 다시, 따스한 손길을, 보슬거리며 내리는 비 같은 손길을, 느낄 수 있기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Music from music box / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
