#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011387"
msgid "*Humming*"
msgstr "*흥얼거림*"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriAlways03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011386"
msgid "He mentioned meeting a friend at Herald's Rest. I'm investigating who that is."
msgstr "전령의 안식처에서 친구를 만나겠다고 하더군요. 그게 누군지 알아보는 중입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriAlways03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011385"
msgid "Oh, so he told you that too? Maybe you ARE a friend of his."
msgstr "아, 그것까지 말해 줬나요? 그럼 친구 사이인 게 분명한가 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F75
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011384"
msgid "You may be right. And I can't just wait here and do nothing."
msgstr "당신 말이 맞을지 몰라요. 여기서 가만히 기다릴 수는 없겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F75
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011383"
msgid "If you think this will help..."
msgstr "이게 도움이 될 거라 생각하신다면 뭐..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F75
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011382"
msgid "Maybe. And you seem trustworthy enough."
msgstr "그럴지도요. 믿음직한 분이신 것 같기도 하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F79
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011381"
msgid "I know, but I'm scared..."
msgstr "알지만, 무서워요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F79
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011380"
msgid "I don't know... how can I trust a stranger?"
msgstr "모르겠어요... 낯선 사람을 어떻게 그냥 돕죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F79
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01137F"
msgid "I hear what you're saying, but I don't know you."
msgstr "무슨 말 하는지는 알겠지만, 당신이 누구인지 모르는 걸요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F6A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01137E"
msgid "Don't make this harder than it has to be. I'm only looking for information."
msgstr "서로 힘들어질 필요 없잖습니까. 정보를 원하는 것뿐입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F6A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01137D"
msgid "I'm not going to hurt anyone. I just need to know where this location is."
msgstr "누굴 해칠 생각 없어요. 그냥 그 위치를 알고 싶을 뿐입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C3F67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C3F6A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01137C"
msgid "I can't solve this case without your help."
msgstr "당신의 도움 없인 이 사건을 해결할 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything. &&& Mujeen: Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I still find this whole thing highly irregular. However, so long as the investigation is in independent hands, I must begrudgingly accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01137A"
msgid "I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Harbinger take the lead on this."
msgstr "이해관계가 충돌할 때 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 선구자가 이 문제를 주도하도록 놔두는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything. &&& Mujeen: Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I still find this whole thing highly irregular. However, so long as the investigation is in independent hands, I must begrudgingly accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011379"
msgid "I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Diviner take the lead on this."
msgstr "이해관계가 충돌할 때 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 예측자가 이 문제를 주도하도록 놔두는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
