#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011378"
msgid "I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Vindicator take the lead on this."
msgstr "이해관계가 충돌할 때 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 옹호자가 이 문제를 주도하도록 놔두는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything. &&& Mujeen: Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I still find this whole thing highly irregular. However, so long as the investigation is in independent hands, I must begrudgingly accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011377"
msgid "I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Reverent take the lead on this."
msgstr "이해관계가 충돌할 때 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 숭배자가 이 문제를 주도하도록 놔두는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mujeen
