#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I still find this whole thing highly irregular. However, so long as the investigation is in independent hands, I must begrudgingly accept.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011375"
msgid "I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Adherent take the lead on this."
msgstr "이해관계가 충돌할 때 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 잘 알고 있기 때문에, 지지자가 이 문제를 주도하도록 놔두는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling. &&& Qisrani: I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Harbinger take the lead on this.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011374"
msgid "I still find this whole thing highly irregular. However, so long as the investigation is in independent hands, I must begrudgingly accept."
msgstr "여전히 이 모든 게 매우 비정상적이라고 생각한다. 하지만, 조사가 독립적으로 진행되는 한, 마지못해 받아들여야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Mujeen
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C3F1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011373"
msgid "And as much as I'd like to continue this debate, I have my own business to attend to, so I must depart for now."
msgstr "그리고 이 논쟁을 계속하고 싶지만, 나도 내 할 일이 있어서, 이만 가봐야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: My name is "I do what I want." My slate number is "Because I said so."
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C93
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011372"
msgid "Well convert, unless you can show proof of access, then I suggest you leave before I call the authorities."
msgstr "글쎄요. 접속 권한 증빙 자료를 제시하지 못할 거면, 당국에 신고하기 전에 떠나시는 게 좋을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was all that commotion with the guard? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011371"
msgid "The details of that... commotion, however, do not presently concern you."
msgstr "방금 무슨 일이 있었는지는... 알 필요 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nothing done in service of the Great Serpent is wasted. And if it were so beneath you, why elect to participate at every occasion?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01136E"
msgid "This was a waste of time."
msgstr "그냥 시간 낭비였어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01136D"
msgid "Nothing done in service of the Great Serpent is wasted. And if it were so beneath you, why elect to participate at every occasion?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 드리는 봉사는 그 무엇도 낭비가 아니다. 또 그렇게 하찮은 일이었다면, 그대는 왜 매번 참여하고 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01136C"
msgid "If nothing else, consider that you have gained the trust of the people of House Va'ruun. That should mean something to you - it does to them."
msgstr "정 그렇다면, 그대가 바룬 가문 신민들의 신뢰를 얻었다고 생각하거라. 그거라면 의미 있는 일이겠지. 가문 사람들에게도 그렇고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01136B"
msgid "Perhaps. Yet you still made an effort to engage with what you encountered along the way. Your efforts have not gone unnoticed."
msgstr "그럴지도. 허나 그대는 길을 걸으며 마주친 상황에 진지하게 임하려 노력했다. 그대의 노력은 무시당한 것이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01136A"
msgid "The people of House Va'ruun will now trust you, and that alone is worth the time spent."
msgstr "바룬 가문 신민들이 그대를 믿을 것이다. 그것만으로도 시간을 쓴 가치가 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011369"
msgid "You certainly wasted no time, and passed up every opportunity to engage with all you were shown. Disappointing, but not entirely unexpected."
msgstr ""
"그대는 결코 시간을 낭비하지 않았다. 보이는 모든 기회를 지나쳐버리지 않았는가. 실망스럽긴 하지만, 완전히 예상 못한 것은 아니었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was a waste of time.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011368"
msgid "Nonetheless, completing the ritual will put you in the good graces of the Va'ruun people."
msgstr "어찌 되었든, 의식을 완수했으니 그대는 바룬 신민들의 호감을 얻을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent sees that despite your supposed lack of belief, you reached for him at every opportunity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C386A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011367"
msgid "I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it."
msgstr "그냥 돕고 싶을 뿐이에요. 뱀을 믿지는 않지만, 해야 할 일을 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's more than one way to feel "born anew." Trust me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's more than one way to feel "born anew." Trust me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3867
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011366"
msgid "Yes, your confidence is... impressive."
msgstr "그래. 그대의 자신감은... 인상깊구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, your confidence is... impressive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3868
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011365"
msgid "There's more than one way to feel \"born anew.\" Trust me."
msgstr "'새롭게 태어났다'고 느끼는 방법에는 다른 여러 방법이 있을걸요. 믿어보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3869
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011364"
msgid "The Great Serpent sees that despite your supposed lack of belief, you reached for him at every opportunity."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 그대가 믿음이 부족하더라도 기회가 올 때마다 뱀께 손을 뻗었다는 사실을 알고 계시니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
