#. TOPIC: 010C3869
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011362"
msgid "Even if you claim not to believe, you made an effort, and that is appreciated. Give it time. The Great Serpent may yet call to you more directly."
msgstr ""
"그대가 믿지 않는다고 말해도, 그대의 노력은 훌륭하였다. 시간을 갖거라. 위대한 뱀께서 그대를 좀 더 직접적으로 부르실지도 모를 일이니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3869
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011361"
msgid "And your assistance will be welcome no matter what."
msgstr "그리고 그대의 도움은 무엇이든 고마울 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3869
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011360"
msgid "Your lack of belief is apparent in your unwillingness to engage with the Serpent's Path. But there is still time for the Great Serpent to work within you."
msgstr ""
"뱀의 길을 제대로 따르려 하지 않는 것을 보면 그대의 믿음이 부족함은 분명하지. 허나 위대한 뱀께서 그대 안에 깃드실 시간은 충분하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I just want to help. I'll do what I need to, even if I don't believe in it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010C3869
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135F"
msgid "And in the meantime, your assistance will be no less vital to the survival of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "그리고 그 시간 동안, 그대의 도움은 바룬 가문의 생존에 반드시 필요할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& Qisrani: Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen. |Clearly your ward was acting independently, in violation of your trust.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Apology accepted. While I was not involved, it gives me no pleasure to have the culprit come from my own House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2889
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135E"
msgid "WHAT!?!?!"
msgstr "뭐라고요!?!?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I... I wasn't aware. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close.|For what it's worth, it does seem to fit your theory, however, that Ochim was acting alone.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2888
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135D"
msgid "Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning."
msgstr "감사하네. 실무관. 하지만 오킴이 정말로 바룬 가문을 배신했다면, 애도받을 자격도 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Is that so, Mujeen? Or do you deny the words you yourself wrote? &&& Mujeen: I absolutely deny it! My computer has obviously been tampered with. This is clearly not enough evidence to even consider me a suspect. &&& Tevina: Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works. &&& Tevina: And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's would be assassin.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: That's your ward, Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C228C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135C"
msgid "Security has identified him as Ochim Ka'dic."
msgstr "경비대에 의하면 오킴 카딕이라고 하더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's would be assassin. &&& Qisrani: Security has identified him as Ochim Ka'dic. 
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: In fact, if I were you, Envoy, I would think long and hard about submitting to the guard peacefully.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C228B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135B"
msgid "That's your ward, Mujeen."
msgstr "당신이 후견한 사람이잖아요. 무진."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: What do you mean? What revelations? &&& Tevina: You mean you don't know? Ochim's dead. He tried to assassinate the Executor.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C228A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01135A"
msgid "I... I wasn't aware."
msgstr "나... 나는 몰랐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was my pleasure. &&& Qisrani: My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb. |For that, you will be well rewarded. &&& Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case. &&& Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Good work, Warden. But there is one more thing we need to discuss before bringing this case to a close.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2287
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011359"
msgid "And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide."
msgstr "그리고 물론, 나도 전적으로 협조하겠네. 내 피후견자에 관한 기록이 필요하다면, 뭐든 제공해 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: You mean you don't know? Ochim's dead. He tried to assassinate the Executor. &&& Mujeen: I... I wasn't aware. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close.|For what it's worth, it does seem to fit your theory, however, that Ochim was acting alone. &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2288
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011358"
msgid "Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all."
msgstr "흠. 당신에게 참 편하게 됐군요. 무진. 전혀 동요하는 기색도 없고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A member of House Ka'dic is the culprit.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A member of House Ka'dic is the culprit.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011357"
msgid "House Ka'dic? Are you sure?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이라고요? 확실합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back. Did you uncover anything at Jandar's Rest?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Ka'dic? Are you sure?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011356"
msgid "A member of House Ka'dic is the culprit."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 일원이 범인입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default, Mujeen, Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: 
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011355"
msgid "I think we can all agree that the charges for this crime are quite serious."
msgstr "이 범죄에 대한 혐의가 꽤 심각하다는 데는 우리 모두 동의할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default, Mujeen, Tevina
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011354"
msgid "Theft of supplies, aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin."
msgstr "물자 절도, 광신도 지원, 그리고 저의 사촌 살해까지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: If Ochim Ka'dic is our supply thief, then the case is closed. Based on recent revelations, I am certain he will no longer be a problem. &&& Mujeen: What do you mean? What revelations? &&& Tevina: You mean you don't know? Ochim's dead. He tried to assassinate the Executor. &&& Mujeen: I... I wasn't aware.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2289
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011353"
msgid "I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close."
msgstr "이런 방식으로 듣게 돼서 유감이에요. 두 사람이 가까웠다는 거 알아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mujeen
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2289
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011352"
msgid "For what it's worth, it does seem to fit your theory, however, that Ochim was acting alone."
msgstr "하지만 그만한 가치가 있는 일이었어요. 오킴이 단독으로 행동했다는 당신 이론과도 맞아떨어지는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I couldn't agree more. And my findings back that accusation up. &&& Qisrani: What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011351"
msgid "Not exactly. I'm sorry, Executor, but you've been misled."
msgstr "아니네. 미안하지만, 실무관, 오해한 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Qisrani
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: The missing supplies, the deaths, he is responsible for it all. And I have ample evidence to back up this claim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011350"
msgid "The crimes in question were perpetrated by a lower member of House Ka'dic, Ochim."
msgstr "문제의 범죄는 카딕 가문의 하급 구성원인 오킴이 저질렀네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen? &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad. &&& Mujeen: Then why don't we ask the Harbinger? &&& Mujeen: They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01134F"
msgid "Is that correct? You came to me earlier, claiming someone from House Ka'dic was the supply thief. Is that not Mujeen?"
msgstr "그게 맞습니까? 전에는 카딕 가문의 누군가가 물자 절도범이라고 주장하면서 저에게 오셨었죠. 그게 무진이 아니었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen? &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad. &&& Mujeen: Then why don't we ask the Harbinger? &&& Mujeen: They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion.
