#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01134E"
msgid "Is that correct? You came to me earlier, claiming Mujeen Ka'dic was the supply thief. Are you saying that you were mistaken?"
msgstr "그게 맞습니까? 전에는 무진 카딕이 물자 절도범이라고 주장하면서 저에게 오셨었죠. 잘못 알고 있었다는 말씀이십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: The missing supplies, the deaths, he is responsible for it all. And I have ample evidence to back up this claim. &&& Tevina: Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2129
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01134D"
msgid "Then why don't we ask the Harbinger?"
msgstr "그렇다면 선구자에게 물어보는 건 어떨까?"

