msgid "Then why don't we ask the Reverent?"
msgstr "그렇다면 숭배자에게 물어보는 건 어떨까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: The missing supplies, the deaths, he is responsible for it all. And I have ample evidence to back up this claim. &&& Tevina: Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2129
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011349"
msgid "Then why don't we ask the Armiger?"
msgstr "그렇다면 복종자에게 물어보는 건 어떨까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: The missing supplies, the deaths, he is responsible for it all. And I have ample evidence to back up this claim. &&& Tevina: Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2129
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011348"
msgid "Then why don't we ask the Adherent?"
msgstr "그렇다면 지지자에게 물어보는 건 어떨까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Then why don't we ask the Harbinger?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Is that correct? You came to me earlier, claiming someone from House Ka'dic was the supply thief. Is that not Mujeen?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C2128
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011347"
msgid "They're the only neutral party here, and I am quite positive their investigation came to the same conclusion."
msgstr "그자는 여기서 유일하게 중립적인 입장이고, 그자의 조사도 같은 결론에 도달했을 거라고 확신한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief. &&& Mujeen: I couldn't agree more. And my findings back that accusation up.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Not exactly. I'm sorry, Executor, but you've been misled. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C212C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011346"
msgid "What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen?"
msgstr "뭐라고요? 그럼 범죄를 인정한다는 건가요? 무진?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does. &&& Qisrani: I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information. &&& Qisrani: Harbinger, the floor is yours.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This slate lists you by name, Envoy. What do you have to say for yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011345"
msgid "[Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 무진이 유죄입니다. 무진 카딕이 도난당한 물자에 책임이 있다는 증거가 여기 있습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011343"
msgid "Leave us alone."
msgstr "우릴 좀 내버려 둬."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011342"
msgid "Can't you see we're talking here?"
msgstr "우리가 지금 얘기 중인 거 안 보여?"

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "011341"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "뭘 원하지?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't care. &&& MS01_Madri: You approached me. If you are not a friend, then please leave me alone.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No... I had held on to hope he was still alive, but...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2127
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011340"
msgid "I don't think you'll like what I have to say."
msgstr "제 말을 들으시면 별로 안 좋아하실 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. PROMPT: I don't think you'll like what I have to say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think you'll like what I have to say.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: The last time I spoke to him, he said if anything ever happened to him, he'd leave something for me, in the usual spot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2126
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01133F"
msgid "No... I had held on to hope he was still alive, but..."
msgstr "아니... 오빠가 아직 살아있을 거라고 희망을 붙잡고 있었는데, 그런데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's probably dead. Not sure how dead though, or if carrion eaters got to him. &&& MS01_Madri: What a terrible thing to say! I certainly hope not!|I don't want my mind to even go there right now... &&& MS01_Madri: The last time I spoke to him, he said if anything ever happened to him, he'd leave something for me, in the usual spot.|I've been thinking about going there, but I'm afraid to look.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, not just under any house. The Meat House. I have a key here. Do you think you can check and see if he left anything?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2125
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01133E"
msgid "[Madri's Letter] Ochim once mentioned a spot where you used to play hide and seek. Under the house."
msgstr "[마드리의 편지] 오킴 씨가 예전에 당신이 숨바꼭질을 하던 장소에 대해 언급한 적이 있어요. 집 아래에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Madri's Letter] Ochim once mentioned a spot where you used to play hide and seek. Under the house.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Madri's Letter] Ochim once mentioned a spot where you used to play hide and seek. Under the house.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: I'll look for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2124
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01133D"
msgid "Yes, not just under any house. The Meat House. I have a key here. Do you think you can check and see if he left anything?"
msgstr ""
"네, 아무 집 아래가 아니에요. 훈제소 아래예요. 열쇠는 여기 있어요. 혹시 오빠가 뭔가 남겨둔 게 있는지 확인해 줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's probably dead. Not sure how dead though, or if carrion eaters got to him. &&& MS01_Madri: What a terrible thing to say! I certainly hope not!|I don't want my mind to even go there right now... &&& MS01_Madri: The last time I spoke to him, he said if anything ever happened to him, he'd leave something for me, in the usual spot.|I've been thinking about going there, but I'm afraid to look.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: I'm sorry, but I don't know if he'd want me to tell you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2123
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01133C"
msgid "If you tell me where it is, I can find out more."
msgstr "그게 어디인지 말해 주시면, 뭔가 더 알아볼 수 있을 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you tell me where it is, I can find out more.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: I'm sorry, but I don't know if he'd want me to tell you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2122
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01133B"
msgid "Maybe. But I'm not sure he would want that."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠죠. 하지만 오빠가 그걸 원할지는 잘 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's probably dead. Not sure how dead though, or if carrion eaters got to him. &&& MS01_Madri: What a terrible thing to say! I certainly hope not!|I don't want my mind to even go there right now... &&& MS01_Madri: The last time I spoke to him, he said if anything ever happened to him, he'd leave something for me, in the usual spot.|I've been thinking about going there, but I'm afraid to look.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you find him, tell him I'm worried about him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2121
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01133A"
msgid "Thanks, I think I have enough to go on."
msgstr "고마워요, 정보는 충분히 알아낸 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thanks, I think I have enough to go on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks, I think I have enough to go on.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: I'm sorry, but I don't know if he'd want me to tell you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C2120
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011339"
msgid "If you find him, tell him I'm worried about him."
msgstr "혹시 오빠를 찾으면, 제가 걱정하고 있다고 전해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Madri: I'm sorry, but I don't know if he'd want me to tell you.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C210C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011338"
msgid "The spot he mentioned was under the Meat House. It's where I used to hide when we played hide and seek."
msgstr "오빠가 말한 장소는 훈제소 밖 아래층에 있어요. 숨바꼭질할 때 제가 숨곤 했던 곳이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll look for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C210C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011337"
msgid "I have a key here. Do you think you can check and see if he left anything?"
msgstr "여기 열쇠가 있어요. 혹시 오빠가 뭔가 남겨둔 게 있는지 확인해 줄 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Madri: Yes, not just under any house. The Meat House. I have a key here. Do you think you can check and see if he left anything?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: The spot he mentioned was under the Meat House. It's where I used to hide when we played hide and seek.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010C210D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011336"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I don't know if he'd want me to tell you."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 오빠가 당신에게 말해도 된다고 할지 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lyrics 1 of melody / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh I don't know. Are you sure that's how it works?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): That's a very catchy song. Hard to forget, like an earworm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011335"
msgid "Lost, alone, amidst a dream's whispers. A voice, sings, for our trapped world unheard."
msgstr "길 잃어, 홀로, 꿈의 속삭임을 헤매네. 목소리, 노래, 갇혀버린 세상에선 안 들리네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lyrics 2 of melody / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: Lost, alone, amidst a dream's whispers. A voice, sings, for our trapped world unheard.
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: We touch, walls, that lead a faceless path, Leaving, prints, streaked along faded glass.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E35D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_050_IrisScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011334"
msgid "I wander this place, caged here. Longing for a moment of a love that holds, no time nor place, here."
msgstr "이곳에서 해매고 있네. 이곳에 갇힌 채. 애정의 손길이 붙잡아 줄 때가 오길 바라네. 시간도 공간도 없는, 이곳에서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Lyrics 3 of melody / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: I wander this place, caged here. Longing for a moment of a love that holds, no time nor place, here.
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: I wander this place, that calls, To feel once more the gentle warmth of your hands, softly, as the rain falls.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010E35CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_050_IrisScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011333"
msgid "We touch, walls, that lead a faceless path, Leaving, prints, streaked along faded glass."
msgstr "벽을, 만지네. 얼굴 없는 길로 이어지는 벽을. 손자국을, 남기네. 빛 바랜 유리창을 따라 남기네."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011331"
msgid "I'm investigating a murder and stolen supplies. These are capital offenses and Ochim is a suspect."
msgstr "살인 사건과 물자 절도 사건에 대해 조사 중입니다. 이는 사형죄에 해당하고, 오킴 씨가 용의선상에 올랐죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011330"
msgid "No, my brother is kind and gentle! I am sure whatever he has locked away will prove his innocence!"
msgstr "아니에요. 제 오빠는 친절하고 착한 사람이에요! 숨겨놓은 게 뭐든, 오빠가 결백하단 걸 분명 증명해 줄 거예요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132F"
msgid "If you're trying to put my brother in jail, then I shouldn't help you."
msgstr "제 오빠를 감옥에 넣을 작정이라면, 제가 당신을 도울 리가 없죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132E"
msgid "Regardless of what he left you reveals, I will do what's right."
msgstr "오라버니 분이 당신에게 무엇을 남겼든, 저는 올바른 일을 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132D"
msgid "For some reason, I believe you when you say that."
msgstr "왜인지 모르겠지만 당신이 하는 말을 믿을 수 있겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132C"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I promised my brother I would keep this between us."
msgstr "미안하지만 오빠에게 비밀로 하기로 약속했어요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132B"
msgid "Tell me where this location is. Now."
msgstr "그 위치가 어딘지 말하란 말입니다. 지금 당장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01132A"
msgid "I will not try to fight you, if that is what you wish."
msgstr "원하신다면, 당신과 싸우려 하지는 않을게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C211A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011329"
msgid "You cannot threaten me to betray my brother."
msgstr "오빠를 배신하라고 협박해도 소용없을 거예요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2119
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011328"
msgid "I'm not affiliated with any of the noble Houses. I can be trusted."
msgstr "저는 다른 가문과 아무 관계 없습니다. 믿어도 좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2118
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011327"
msgid "Hm... Ochim told me not to trust anyone from the noble Houses. But if you are truly not with them, then perhaps..."
msgstr "흠... 오빠가 명문 가문 사람들은 누구도 믿지 말라 했었죠. 근데 정말 당신이 그쪽 소속이 아니라면, 그럼..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2118
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011326"
msgid "But you are still an outsider? How can I know if you are a friend?"
msgstr "하지만 그래도 이방인이시잖아요. 어떻게 당신이 친구일 거라고 믿을 수 있죠?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011325"
msgid "[Lie] Ochim was a friend of mine. Trust me."
msgstr "[거짓말] 오킴은 제 친구였어요. 믿어 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2116
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011324"
msgid "He had so few people he could trust. So if you are his friend, then you must be an honorable person."
msgstr "오빠는 믿을 수 있는 사람이 정말 적었어요. 당신이 오빠의 친구라면, 분명 명예로운 분이시겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2116
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011323"
msgid "But how do I know you are telling the truth? He has never spoken of you before."
msgstr "하지만 당신이 사실대로 말하고 있다는 걸 어떻게 알죠? 오빠는 당신에 대해 한 번도 말한 적이 없다고요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2115
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011322"
msgid "I'm sure whatever I uncover, it will bring you peace of mind."
msgstr "제가 무얼 찾게 되든지 간에, 당신도 마음이 편안해질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011321"
msgid "Yes. And if so, then I should just give you the key and be done with it."
msgstr "네. 그렇다면, 그냥 당신에게 열쇠를 주고 끝내는 게 낫겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011320"
msgid "But what if my worst fears are true? Then it will only bring pain and hardship."
msgstr "하지만 제가 가장 두려워하던 게 사실이라면요? 그럼 고통과 괴로움만 느끼게 될 텐데요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2113
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131F"
msgid "It's just going to eat away at you, not knowing what's in there."
msgstr "그 안에 무엇이 있는지 모르면, 당신 마음만 힘들어질 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131E"
msgid "You're probably right. And if you looked on my behalf, and the worst were true, you could soften the blow."
msgstr ""
"아마 당신 말이 맞겠죠. 그리고 저를 대신해서 살펴보고 나서 최악의 상황이 사실이라면, 아마 그 아픔을 줄여 주실 수도 있을 테고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131D"
msgid "I know, but maybe I can muster up the courage to go there myself."
msgstr "알아요. 하지만 어쩌면 제가 직접 용기를 내어 그곳에 갈 수 있을지도 몰라요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2111
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131C"
msgid "Your brother may be a murderer. It's time to face up to the truth and hand over any evidence you have."
msgstr "당신의 오라버니 분이 살인자일지도 모릅니다. 진실을 직시하시고, 증거를 가지고 있다면 넘겨주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2110
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131B"
msgid "He never did tell me about his work. I think he was trying to protect me. But if what you say is true..."
msgstr "오빠는 자신이 하던 일을 절대 말해 주지 않았죠. 절 지키려고 했던 것 같은데 당신 말이 맞다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C2110
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01131A"
msgid "No, I don't believe you! My brother was kind."
msgstr "아니요! 믿을 수 없어요! 오빠는 친절했다고요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C210F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriAlways02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011319"
msgid "This is urgent. On his computer, Ochim mentioned going off planet."
msgstr "상황이 급합니다. 컴퓨터를 확인해 보니, 오킴이 행성을 떠난다고 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_Madri
#. TOPIC: 010C210E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SpeechChallenge_MadriAlways02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011318"
msgid "Off Va'ruun'kai? Then he is in trouble..."
msgstr "바룬카이 밖으로요? 문제가 생겼나 보군요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: To reiterate...
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010BF9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011316"
msgid "Don't worry. Djimal's already told me all about you."
msgstr "걱정하진 말고. 지말한테 벌써 얘기 다 들었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B548D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011301"
msgid "That being is what we call the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그 존재가 바로 우리가 부르는 위대한 뱀이셔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011300"
msgid "I grant you the title of Vindicator."
msgstr "그대에게 옹호자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112FF"
msgid "I grant you the title of Diviner."
msgstr "그대에게 예측자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112FE"
msgid "I grant you the title of Reverent."
msgstr "그대에게 숭배자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112FD"
msgid "I grant you the title of Armiger."
msgstr "그대에게 복종자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112FC"
msgid "I grant you the title of Adherent."
msgstr "그대에게 지지자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Panting* Jinan bless you. I would not have survived that if you hadn't been here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20CA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112F5"
msgid "All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar."
msgstr "늘 하던 일일 뿐입니다. 술집에서 취객들 쫓아내는 거랑 다를 바 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112F4"
msgid "I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself."
msgstr "우리의 만남이 우연이 아니라, 위대한 뱀께서 정해주신 운명이라는 생각이 들기 시작했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "0112F3"
msgid "While I wish you had waited until he attacked first, perhaps we still have time to gather more evidence."
msgstr "무진이 먼저 공격할 때까지 기다렸으면 더 좋았겠지만, 어쩌면 아직 더 많은 증거를 수집할 시간이 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's do it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112F2"
msgid "In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen."
msgstr "어쨌든, 지금은 꾸물거릴 때가 아니에요. 이제 무진을 체포하기 위해 행동해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Panting* Jinan bless you. I would not have survived that if you hadn't been here.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's more than luck. I'm beginning to think your coming was divined by the Serpent itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112F1"
msgid "You're lucky to be alive."
msgstr "운이 좋아서 살아남은 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're lucky to be alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're lucky to be alive.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112F0"
msgid "It's more than luck. I'm beginning to think your coming was divined by the Serpent itself."
msgstr "운이 좋은 정도가 아니죠. 당신이 온 것이 뱀께서 정해주신 운명이라는 생각이 들기 시작했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can do that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can do that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Regardless, he must answer for aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112EF"
msgid "Good. Our case must be ironclad, given whom we are accusing."
msgstr "좋아요. 우리가 고발하려는 자를 고려할 때, 우리 주장에 빈틈이 없어야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: While I wish you had waited until he attacked first, perhaps we still have time to gather more evidence.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If you have time, check his office. There may be information connecting him to this individual.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112EE"
msgid "This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen."
msgstr "이번 암살 시도는 저희에게 도움이 될 거예요. 하지만 여전히 암살자와 무진의 연관성을 증명할 증거가 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can do that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112ED"
msgid "If you have time, check his office. There may be information connecting him to this individual."
msgstr "시간이 있다면, 무진의 사무실을 확인해 보세요. 무진과 이 암살자 관련 정보가 있을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've done enough. You have plenty of evidence to convict.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've done enough. You have plenty of evidence to convict.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Regardless, he must answer for aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20BD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112EC"
msgid "I disagree. Given the politics of arresting a rival House member, more evidence is never a bad thing."
msgstr "동의할 수 없네요. 경쟁 가문 일원을 체포하는 것과 관련된 정치적인 문제를 고려할 때, 더 증거가 많을수록 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's do it. &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: While I wish you had waited until he attacked first, perhaps we still have time to gather more evidence. &&& Qisrani: This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen. &&& Qisrani: If you have time, check his office. There may be information connecting him to this individual.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Death will come in time. For what he has done, he deserves to rot away slowly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20C0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112EB"
msgid "Or I can just kill Mujeen and save us the lengthy trial."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 제가 무진을 죽여서 지루한 재판을 생략해 버릴까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
