#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112EA"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고맙습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All in a day's work. No different than tossing out drunks at the bar. &&& Qisrani: I'm beginning to think our meeting wasn't a coincidence, but divined by the Serpent itself. &&& Qisrani: In any case, now is not the time to dawdle. Our next move must be to arrest Mujeen.
