#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is, but I have faith in your abilities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F6A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E9"
msgid "I'll try, but I think this is risky."
msgstr "해보겠습니다만, 이건 좀 위험한 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's do it. &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: While I wish you had waited until he attacked first, perhaps we still have time to gather more evidence. &&& Qisrani: This assassin's attempt will help our case. But we still need evidence tying him to Mujeen. &&& Qisrani: If you have time, check his office. There may be information connecting him to this individual.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I disagree. Given the politics of arresting a rival House member, more evidence is never a bad thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20BE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E8"
msgid "I've done enough. You have plenty of evidence to convict."
msgstr "저는 충분히 했습니다. 유죄를 입증할 증거는 당신이 충분히 가지고 있지 않습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure. &&& Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.|The meeting takes place inside the Halls of Obedience. Will you watch my back?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know if we have enough evidence. If we're the aggressors here, it may be harder to prove. Let's wait for them to make the first move.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F7A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E7"
msgid "Why don't I just kill them now?"
msgstr "그냥 지금 녀석들을 죽여 버리면 어떨까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Or I can just kill Mujeen and save us the lengthy trial.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Or I can just kill Mujeen and save us the lengthy trial.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Regardless, he must answer for aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20BF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E6"
msgid "Death will come in time. For what he has done, he deserves to rot away slowly."
msgstr "죽음은 때가 되면 찾아올 거예요. 무진이 한 짓을 생각하면, 천천히 썩어가는 게 어울려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure. &&& Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.|The meeting takes place inside the Halls of Obedience. Will you watch my back?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F80
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E5"
msgid "I've got you covered."
msgstr "제가 엄호해 드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why don't I just kill them now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why don't I just kill them now?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I've got you covered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F79
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_291_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E4"
msgid "I don't know if we have enough evidence. If we're the aggressors here, it may be harder to prove. Let's wait for them to make the first move."
msgstr ""
"증거가 충분한지 모르겠어요. 만약 우리가 여기서 공격적으로 나간다면, 증명하기 더 어려워질 수 있어요. 상대가 먼저 움직일 때까지 "
"기다리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All Zealots deserve nothing less than death. &&& Mujeen: It is that kind of thinking that will delay the Shrouding. But it's clear I have no sway over you. &&& Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A charge we can also attribute to Ochim. I asked him to set up the security detail, and naturally, I feel terrible about it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C20BC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E3"
msgid "Satisfy her? When you tried to have her killed?"
msgstr "키스라니가 만족할 거라고요? 당신이 키스라니를 죽이려고 했는데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Satisfy her? When you tried to have her killed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Satisfy her? When you tried to have her killed?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I'll take this to Qisrani.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
