msgctxt "0112E2"
msgid "A charge we can also attribute to Ochim. I asked him to set up the security detail, and naturally, I feel terrible about it."
msgstr ""
"오킴의 책임으로 돌릴 수도 있지. 오킴에게 보안 세부 사항을 설정하라고 부탁했고, 당연히 그 일에 대해 유감스럽게 생각하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Panting* Jinan bless you. I would not have survived that if you hadn't been here.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose humor is welcome at a time like this. And you are not wrong.
