#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112E1"
msgid "You wouldn't have a lot of things without me. A beating heart, for one."
msgstr "제가 아니었다면 많은 걸 누리지 못했을 겁니다. 심장 박동 같은 것 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
