msgstr "이런 상황이니 유머도 나쁘지 않군요. 그리고 당신 말이 맞아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Panting* Jinan bless you. I would not have survived that if you hadn't been here.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
