#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112D1"
msgid "Give me until the coming dawn, and I will summon the relevant parties to my office."
msgstr "다음 날 아침이 되면 바로 이번 일에 연관된 사람들 전부 제 사무실에 모이도록 하겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Talk to Tevina. Bring the people responsible to justice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_299_QisraniGreeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112D0"
msgid "Mark my words, we will bring him to justice with all three noble Houses as witness."
msgstr "반드시 약속하죠. 모든 명문 가문들을 증인으로 세운 채로, 기필코 판결을 내릴 테니까요."

