#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112B9"
msgid "You may have noticed, but I've been on the move a lot lately."
msgstr "눈치채셨겠지만, 요즘 저는 한 곳에 오래 머무르질 못하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why the Halls of Obedience and not your office?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F56
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112B8"
msgid "I don't mean to alarm you, but I think I'm being followed. I'll feel more comfortable if we meet in a public place."
msgstr ""
"놀라게 하고 싶진 않지만, 누가 저를 미행한다는 느낌이 들었거든요. 그래서 공공장소에서 만나면 더 안심이 될 거라고 여긴 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why the Halls of Obedience and not your office?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'll see what I can uncover about Jandar's Rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F56
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112B7"
msgid "Mujeen suggested a security detail, and I think I may take him up on his offer. If nothing else, but for peace of mind."
msgstr "무진이 경비대원을 대동하는 게 어떻겠냐고 해서, 제안을 받아들일까 생각 중이에요. 제 마음이 진정될 수 있도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's not my first priority, but I'll get to it eventually.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's not my first priority, but I'll get to it eventually.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010C1F4F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112B6"
msgid "Of course. When you have time, we'll meet."
msgstr "물론이죠. 시간이 되면, 그때 만나도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Mujeen Ka'dic is the supply thief. &&& Qisrani: Mujeen? Are you sure?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Hushed voice* Then I may be walking into an ambush, seeing as Mujeen's the one who organized this meeting, and supplied my security detail.
