#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Stage299_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0112AB"
