msgstr "거기에 가볼까 생각 중이었는데, 살펴보기가 두렵네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's an honor to meet the Elder of a noble House. &&& Razma: Well, it's also an... honor, to meet one as interesting as yourself. &&& Razma: I wouldn't have suspected an outsider to be made Promised, but who am I to argue with the Great Serpent's choice.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010BF9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0112A8"
msgid "Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will."
msgstr "그렇죠. 위대한 뱀의 뜻에 의문을 품는 건 우리 일이 아니니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will.
