#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01127C"
msgid "You're a Herald?"
msgstr "당신이 전령이신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: I, and others like me, look after the Temples and offer guidance to those who need it.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Herald
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01127B"
msgid "And now, it seems, I am called upon to help The Serpent's Call fill a new vessel. Truly, I am blessed."
msgstr "그리고 이제, 위대한 뱀께서 내게 새로운 그릇을 채우라는 명을 내리신 것 같구나. 진정 축복받을 사명이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: I am. I carry on the traditions that Jinan Va'ruun began, and maintain our people's connection to the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
