#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01127A"
msgid "I, and others like me, look after the Temples and offer guidance to those who need it."
msgstr "나를 비롯해, 나와 같은 전령들은 사원을 돌보고 도움이 필요한 사람들에게 안내를 제공한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're a Herald?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I, and others like me, look after the Temples and offer guidance to those who need it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Herald
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011279"
msgid "I am. I carry on the traditions that Jinan Va'ruun began, and maintain our people's connection to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "맞다. 나는 지난 바룬 님께서 시작하신 전통을 계승하고, 우리 신민들과 위대한 뱀과의 관계를 유지하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: It has served more than one purpose for our people over the generations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011278"
msgid "What is this cave?"
msgstr "이 동굴은 뭔가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is this cave?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: For a brief time, it was home. But then, in his wisdom, Jinan Va'ruun saw fit to turn it into a way for those outside House Va'ruun to begin to learn. To join us in following the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011277"
msgid "It has served more than one purpose for our people over the generations."
msgstr "우리 신민들은 여러 세대에 걸쳐 이 동굴을 다양한 목적으로 사용했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: It has served more than one purpose for our people over the generations.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: That ended after The Serpent's Crusade. It feels right to see it used again now, in our time of need.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011276"
msgid "For a brief time, it was home. But then, in his wisdom, Jinan Va'ruun saw fit to turn it into a way for those outside House Va'ruun to begin to learn. To join us in following the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"잠시 동안은 거처로 쓰였지. 하지만 지난 바룬 님께서는 지혜롭게도 이곳을 밖에 있는 바룬 가문 사람들의 배움터로 바꾸기로 결심하셨단다. "
"우리와 함께 위대한 뱀을 따르도록 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: For a brief time, it was home. But then, in his wisdom, Jinan Va'ruun saw fit to turn it into a way for those outside House Va'ruun to begin to learn. To join us in following the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_Cave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011275"
msgid "That ended after The Serpent's Crusade. It feels right to see it used again now, in our time of need."
msgstr "배움터의 역할은 뱀의 성전 이후로 끝났지. 이런 어려운 시기에 다시 쓰이는 모습을 보니 좋구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: The Serpent's Path will tell you what you need to know, for now. After that, the Council awaits.
