#. TOPIC: 010BD7BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_HouseVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011274"
msgid "Can you tell me more about House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "바룬 가문에 대해 더 자세히 알려주실 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life. &&& Inaza: Hmm. An unusual, but welcome, response.|Then let us enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path. &&& Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
