#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011272"
msgid "See you on the other side, Captain."
msgstr "반대쪽에서 보자, 선장."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life. &&& Inaza: Hmm. An unusual, but welcome, response.|Then let us enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path. &&& Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BCB11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011271"
msgid "All right, I can take a hint. Catch up with you in a bit."
msgstr "그래, 나도 눈치는 있다고. 나중에 다시 만나자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life. &&& Inaza: Hmm. An unusual, but welcome, response.|Then let us enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path. &&& Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BCB11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011270"
msgid "I'm not exactly a fan of splitting up, but I'm also not eager to offend. You'll just have to tell me all about it afterwards."
msgstr "딱히 서로 떨어지고 싶진 않은데, 그렇다고 괜히 신경 거슬리게 하기도 싫네. 나중에 전부 말해줘야 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: The Serpent's Path will tell you what you need to know, for now. After that, the Council awaits.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_HouseVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01126F"
msgid "After that... I will be at the Temple, as I always am. And I will offer counsel, as I would to any of the Promised."
msgstr "일이 끝나면... 난 항상 그렇듯이 사원에 있을 것이다. 그리고 여느 약속받은 자들에게처럼 네게도 조언을 해 주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And the people weighed this knowledge against their former lives, and saw how they had been blessed despite the difficult new life that awaited them.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BD7BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01126E"
msgid "You, too, would do well to feel that solace amidst the pain."
msgstr "너 또한 고통 속에서 그 위로를 느낄 수 있을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: There is a ritual, intended for converts to the Promised, that has not been performed in generations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BCB14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01126D"
msgid "I apologize for the interruption."
msgstr "방해받은 점은 사과하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: escort with a slight condescending attitude / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Hmm. An unusual, but welcome, response.|Then let us enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: This is... a profound step for you. Do not worry. You have nothing to fear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010BCB12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01126C"
msgid "But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow."
msgstr "허나 이건 너 홀로 걸어야만 하는 여정이다. 네 호위는 따라갈 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: After that... I will be at the Temple, as I always am. And I will offer counsel, as I would to any of the Promised.
