#. TOPIC: 010BD7BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_HouseVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01126B"
msgid "The Serpent's Path will tell you what you need to know, for now. After that, the Council awaits."
msgstr "일단은 뱀의 길이 알아둬야 할 것을 말해줄 것이다. 그 뒤에는 대의회가 기다리고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am ready.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am ready.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
