#. TOPIC: 010B9B2C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01124C"
msgid "It mentions a meeting that will take place at Jandar's Rest, but I don't know where that is."
msgstr "잔다르의 안식처라는 곳에 회의가 치러질 거라는데, 저는 그곳이 어딘지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't blame yourself. The Zealots are the cause here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't blame yourself. The Zealots are the cause here.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B24
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01124B"
msgid "Indeed. But there is more going on here than meets the eye."
msgstr "맞아요. 하지만 이 일은 겉으로 보이는 게 다가 아닌 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& Qisrani: He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find. &&& Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...|Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and... &&& Qisrani: *Sigh* This is my fault. I should've listened to Ukaru the first time. And instead I...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and against my better judgment. That's on me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B23
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01124A"
msgid "You let him go through with it even knowing the dangers."
msgstr "위험하다는 걸 알면서도 우카루를 보냈군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You let bureaucracy get in the way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You let bureaucracy get in the way.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B26
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011249"
msgid "I don't know. Rules must be followed. Procedures are in place for a reason."
msgstr "모르겠네요. 규칙은 반드시 지켜져야 하죠. 절차도 다 이유가 있어서 정해진 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You let bureaucracy get in the way.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B26
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011248"
msgid "But you're right. If the criminals can work outside the law, we must do the same to catch them."
msgstr "하지만 당신 말도 맞죠. 범죄자들이 법을 지키질 않는데, 우리도 그놈들을 잡으려면 어쩔 수 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You let him go through with it even knowing the dangers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You let him go through with it even knowing the dangers.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B22
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011247"
msgid "Yes, and against my better judgment. That's on me."
msgstr "네. 저도 어리숙하게 생각했던 거죠. 제 탓이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You let him go through with it even knowing the dangers.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B22
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011246"
msgid "All we can do now is pick up the trail where he left off, starting with the information on this slate."
msgstr "우리가 할 수 있는 건 이 슬레이트에 있는 정보부터 시작해서, 마저 못한 일을 대신 끝내는 거예요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: We're going to need to enlist some help. I'd like you to speak with Tevina Veth'aal, at the Keep.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011245"
msgid "If that slate has coordinates, she may have the means to decrypt it."
msgstr "그 슬레이트에 좌표가 있다면 테비나가 해독해 줄 수 있을지 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place? &&& companion: The answer is both obvious and impossible to believe. Who would betray House Va'ruun when so many are suffering?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B19
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011244"
msgid "That is the part I am having trouble with myself. But perhaps our loyalty to House Va'ruun blinds us."
msgstr "그게 저한테도 쉽게 이해되지 않는 사실이에요. 하지만 바룬 가문에 대한 우리의 충성심 때문에 눈이 먼 걸지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place? &&& companion: That's the headline on the Dazra Daily -- Whodunnit, and why?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B19
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011243"
msgid "Then let's go over the evidence and find out."
msgstr "그럼 증거를 검토해서 알아보도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place? &&& companion: Seems to me you've got a traitor in your ranks.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B19
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011242"
msgid "I don't want to jump to conclusions, but it looks that way."
msgstr "함부로 속단하고 싶지 않지만, 그런 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place? &&& companion: The slate we gave you should tell you exactly how.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B19
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011241"
msgid "Yes, we should start with that."
msgstr "네, 그것으로 시작해야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: That is the part I am having trouble with myself. But perhaps our loyalty to House Va'ruun blinds us.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011240"
msgid "This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside."
msgstr "당신이 찾은 슬레이트를 보니, 우리 내부에 연락책이 있다고 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01123F"
msgid "This person would have to be well versed in our operational pipeline."
msgstr "분명 우리의 업무 방식에 대해 아주 잘 알고 있는 내부자일 테죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It seems unfathomable, but perhaps Ukaru was right. A member of the noble Houses has betrayed us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01123E"
msgid "They'd have to know where to route the shipments and how to clean the books."
msgstr "물품의 경로를 바꾸고, 장부를 깨끗이 정돈하는 법도 알고 있을게 분명하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: This slate you found -- it mentions a contact, someone on the inside.|This person would have to be well versed in our operational pipeline. |They'd have to know where to route the shipments and how to clean the books.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Whoever it is, the Zealots' plan to meet them at Jandar's Rest. We need to find out where that is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01123D"
msgid "It seems unfathomable, but perhaps Ukaru was right. A member of the noble Houses has betrayed us."
msgstr "말도 안 되는 것 같지만 우카루의 생각이 옳았던 것 같네요. 명문 가문의 일원 중 하나가 우릴 배신한 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011238"
msgid "If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished."
msgstr "광신도들에게 책임이 있다면, 반드시 대가를 치르게 해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: If the Zealots are responsible, they must be punished.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The answer is both obvious and impossible to believe. Who would betray House Va'ruun when so many are suffering?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011237"
msgid "But one question remains. How would they gain access to the shipments in the first place?"
msgstr "다만 한 가지 질문이 남았군요. 그자들이 어떻게 물품들을 손에 넣을 수 있던 걸까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: In my line of work, this holds especially true. The more people know, the more everyone knows.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B17
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011236"
msgid "I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this."
msgstr "당신이 신중하게 처리해줘서 고맙군요. 사절은 신뢰할 수 있는 인물이지만, 이런 상황에서는 아무리 조심해도 지나치지 않죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Yes. But without coordinates, Jandar's Rest could be anywhere on Va'ruun'kai.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: If that slate has coordinates, she may have the means to decrypt it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B1B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011234"
msgid "We're going to need to enlist some help. I'd like you to speak with Tevina Veth'aal, at the Keep."
msgstr "도움을 청해야겠군요. 본성에 있는 테비나 베타알과 얘길 나누도록 하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. &&& Mujeen: Executor.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. Keep following the trail, I'm sure something will turn up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B09
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011233"
msgid "I'm still investigating."
msgstr "아직 조사 중입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B12
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011232"
msgid "So, now that we're alone. Tell me, what have you uncovered?"
msgstr "자, 이제 우리만 남았으니... 무얼 알아냈는지 알려 주실래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm still investigating.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm still investigating.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B08
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011231"
msgid "All right. Keep following the trail, I'm sure something will turn up."
msgstr "알았어요. 계속 단서를 쫓아보세요. 분명 뭔가 나올 거에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...|Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's all right. And I'm sorry for your loss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B18
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011230"
msgid "*Sigh* This is my fault. I should've listened to Ukaru the first time. And instead I..."
msgstr "*한숨* 이건 제 잘못이네요. 우카루의 말을 처음 들었을 때 들었어야 했어요. 그런데 전..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. &&& Mujeen: Executor.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B0F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122F"
msgid "I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating."
msgstr "우카루가 사라진 선적물을 추적하고 있다는 건 알지만, 아직 조사 중입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B0E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122E"
msgid "He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find."
msgstr "우카루도 제게 그 말을 했지만, 더 자세한 정보가 필요합니다. 계속 조사해 보시고 또 다른 걸 찾으시면 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. &&& Mujeen: Executor.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B0D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122D"
msgid "[Give Slate] I'm sorry, but your friend is dead. He was murdered by Zealots."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 유감입니다만, 당신 친구는 죽었습니다. 광신도들에게 살해당했지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies? &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy. |But I wanted to keep the circle of trust small in this matter. &&& Mujeen: That's fair, but it begs the question -- what else has House Dul'kehf been hiding?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B03
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122C"
msgid "I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything."
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 뭔가를 숨기고 있는 거 같진 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies? &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy. |But I wanted to keep the circle of trust small in this matter. &&& Mujeen: That's fair, but it begs the question -- what else has House Dul'kehf been hiding?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exactly. At this point, it would be foolish to ignore the connection between them and the supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B01
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122B"
msgid "You might be on to something. We can't rule out House Dul'kehf is involved somehow."
msgstr "일리가 있군요. 둘케프 가문이 어떻게든 연루되었을 가능성을 배제할 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information? &&& Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B13
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01122A"
msgid "In my line of work, this holds especially true. The more people know, the more everyone knows."
msgstr "제 업무에서는, 특히 그렇죠. 더 많은 사람이 알수록, 더 많은 사람이 알게 되니까요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information? &&& Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B13
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011229"
msgid "He seemed like a trustworthy fellow. Then again, political types like him make a career out of earning people's trust."
msgstr "사절은 신뢰할 수 있는 사람 같긴 하더군. 하긴, 그런 정치꾼들은 사람들의 신뢰를 얻는 걸로 밥벌이를 하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information? &&& Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B13
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011228"
msgid "Don't worry, this isn't our first rodeo. We know how to keep a secret."
msgstr "걱정 마시죠. 이런 일이 처음은 아닙니다. 우린 비밀을 지키는 법을 알고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information? &&& Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B13
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011227"
msgid "The old adage holds true for explorers and sailors alike: loose lips, sink ships."
msgstr "탐험가와 선원들 모두에게 통용되는 오래된 격언이 있지요. 입이 가벼우면, 배가 가라앉는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& companion: This is a personal matter. I am sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205CA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011226"
msgid "Thank you, Envoy."
msgstr "감사합니다. 사절님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& Qisrani: He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find. &&& Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...|Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and...
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B06
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011225"
msgid "Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies?"
msgstr "잠깐... 실무관이 사라진 물자를 조사하고 있다는 걸 알고 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...|Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and... &&& Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B05
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011224"
msgid "I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy."
msgstr "비밀로 해서 죄송합니다. 사절님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Mujeen
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: That's fair, but it begs the question -- what else has House Dul'kehf been hiding?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B05
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011223"
msgid "But I wanted to keep the circle of trust small in this matter."
msgstr "하지만 이 문제에 관한 한 신뢰의 범위를 좁게 유지하고 싶었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. &&& Mujeen: Executor.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: *Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B0B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011222"
msgid "[Give Slate] The shipments were being rerouted to Zealots. I found Ukaru's body at the supply depot."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 그 선적물들은 광신도들에게 전달되고 있었습니다. 보급고에서 우카루의 시신을 발견했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Harbinger take the lead on this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B02
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011221"
msgid "Hmph, I find that hard to believe. The conflict of interest alone is troubling."
msgstr "흠, 그건 믿기 어렵군. 이해충돌만으로도 골치 아픈데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You might be on to something. We can't rule out House Dul'kehf is involved somehow.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You might be on to something. We can't rule out House Dul'kehf is involved somehow.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm aware of the conflict of interest, which is precisely why I'm letting the Harbinger take the lead on this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B00
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01121E"
msgid "Exactly. At this point, it would be foolish to ignore the connection between them and the supplies."
msgstr "맞아. 이 시점에서, 그자들과 물자 사이의 연관성을 무시하는 건 어리석은 짓일 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You think the House Dul'kehf had a part in the missing supplies?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You think the House Dul'kehf had a part in the missing supplies?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9AFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01121B"
msgid "I am not making an accusation, but I do find it suspicious that the branch that lost the shipment is handling the investigation."
msgstr "고발하는 건 아니지만, 그 선적물을 분실한 지부에서 조사를 담당하고 있다는 게 의심스럽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You think the House Dul'kehf had a part in the missing supplies?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9AFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01121A"
msgid "There may be a conflict of interest here, especially if the culprit is from their own house."
msgstr "특히 범인이 자기 가문 출신이라면 이해가 상충될 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this. &&& companion: In my line of work, this holds especially true. The more people know, the more everyone knows.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B11
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011219"
msgid "Exactly. We keep the circle of trust small, until we know who to let in."
msgstr "맞아요. 누구를 신뢰해야 할지 알 때까지, 신뢰의 범위를 좁게 유지해야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this. &&& companion: He seemed like a trustworthy fellow. Then again, political types like him make a career out of earning people's trust.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B11
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011218"
msgid "I don't have anything against Mujeen, but leaks can happen very easily in this business. It's best to keep our cards close to the vest."
msgstr "무진에게 악감정은 없지만, 이 업계에서는 누설이 매우 쉽게 일어날 수 있어요. 우리 패를 품 안에 숨기는 게 최선이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this. &&& companion: Don't worry, this isn't our first rodeo. We know how to keep a secret.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B11
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011217"
msgid "Well said. On my side, I am thankful to have people who understand confidentiality and discretion."
msgstr "말 잘했군요. 제 입장에서는 기밀 유지와 신중함을 이해하는 사람이 있다는 것이 감사할 따름이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I appreciate your discretion. The Envoy is a trusted figure, but you can never be too careful in situations like this. &&& companion: The old adage holds true for explorers and sailors alike: loose lips, sink ships.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And while having the conversation here isn't entirely secure, we're pressed for time, so it'll have to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B11
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_GreetingCOPY0000
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011216"
msgid "We have a different saying here in Dazra -- \"The bleating Groat is the first to slaughter.\" But it means more or less the same thing."
msgstr "다즈라에서 다른 격언이 있죠... '우는 그로트가 먼저 도살당한다.' 하지만 의미는 거의 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011215"
msgid "Executor."
msgstr "실무관."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies? &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy. |But I wanted to keep the circle of trust small in this matter.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't think House Dul'kehf is hiding anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B04
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011214"
msgid "That's fair, but it begs the question -- what else has House Dul'kehf been hiding?"
msgstr "그게 타당하긴 하지만, 의문이 생기는데... 둘케프 가문이 그 밖에도 뭘 숨기고 있었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know Ukaru was tracking a missing shipment, but I'm still investigating. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies? &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry for the secrecy, Envoy. |But I wanted to keep the circle of trust small in this matter. &&& Mujeen: That's fair, but it begs the question -- what else has House Dul'kehf been hiding?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not making an accusation, but I do find it suspicious that the branch that lost the shipment is handling the investigation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9AFF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011213"
msgid "You think the House Dul'kehf had a part in the missing supplies?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문이 사라진 물자에 연루되었다고 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104513D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011212"
msgid "You're too late, Vindicator."
msgstr "너무 늦었군. 옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104513D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011211"
msgid "You're too late, Diviner."
msgstr "너무 늦었군. 예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104513D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011210"
msgid "You're too late, Reverent."
msgstr "너무 늦었군. 숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104513D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01120F"
msgid "You're too late, Armiger."
msgstr "너무 늦었군. 복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104513D
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01120E"
msgid "You're too late, Adherent."
msgstr "너무 늦었군. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Show Slate] I have evidence also. An encrypted slate from a Zealot. Qisrani thinks you can decrypt it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01120D"
msgid "I may have some intel on my computer that could help you with your case."
msgstr "당신 사건에 도움이 될 만한 정보가 제 컴퓨터에 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't need your intel. I just need to know where Jandar's Rest is.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: So unless you have a slate that needs decrypting, the investigation's stalled.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01120C"
msgid "We do have a lead, however. One of my agents recovered a cipher key not too long ago, off the body of a Zealot. But we don't know what the key's for."
msgstr ""
"하지만 저희에게 단서가 하나 있습니다. 얼마 전에 제 요원 중 한 명이 광신도의 시체에서 암호 키를 회수했거든요. 하지만 그 키가 어디에 "
"쓰이는지는 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_030_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "01120B"
msgid "Talk to Tevina. She'll find a way to decrypt that slate."
msgstr "테비나와 대화해 보세요. 테비나라면 그 슬레이트를 해독할 방법을 찾아낼 거예요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And what of it? If you are using this as a pretense to end our agreement...
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We will need assurances, in person. We will send a message through an encrypted slate. The coordinates to Jandar's Rest will be there.
