msgstr "왜 저를 허물이라고 부르죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why did you call me a husk?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why did you call me a husk?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B737F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111F8"
msgid "You have not been filled with purpose by the Great Serpent, so you are merely a husk. But, perhaps not for long."
msgstr "너는 위대한 뱀의 의도하심으로 채워지지 않았기에, 한낱 허물에 불과하다. 하지만 오래 가진 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
