msgid "The Serpent slumbers, awaiting your decision. Is it time?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 네 결정을 기다리며 잠들어 계신다. 때가 되었느냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: So it does.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Qisrani is obsessed with transparency and often seeks independent help. I find this tendency unwise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B82F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111F6"
msgid "I must say I find this highly irregular, but not surprising."
msgstr "참으로 이례적인 일이다 싶습니다만, 놀랍지는 않군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Ochim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
