#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111F5"
msgid "Madri, I got your message. Are you okay? Do you have enough food at the camp?"
msgstr "마드리, 네 메시지 받았어. 괜찮아? 난민촌에 식량은 충분해?"

