msgid "It doesn't look like there's much to eat."
msgstr "먹을 것이 별로 없어 보이는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0111EC"
msgid "We lost everything in the cataclysm."
msgstr "우린 대재난 때 모든 걸 잃었어."

