#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0111EB"
msgid "I don't know where I'd be without my brother."
msgstr "오빠가 없었다면 난 어떻게 됐을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriBlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0111EA"
msgid "My brother was adopted into House Ka'dic. He does his best to support me after we lost our parents."
msgstr "오빠는 카딕 가문으로 입양됐어요. 부모님을 잃은 후 저를 키우기 위해 최선을 다하고 있죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
