#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E5"
msgid "I can help you, but it won't be cheap."
msgstr "도와드릴 순 있지만, 비용이 꽤 들 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can help you, but it won't be cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can help you, but it won't be cheap.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9266
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E4"
msgid "I see. I'm the wounded animal and you're the carrion bird circling high above."
msgstr "그렇군요. 저는 다친 짐승이고, 당신은 그 위를 맴돌며 시체를 뜯어먹을 기회를 노리고 있는 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can help you, but it won't be cheap.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9266
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E3"
msgid "My family is not without means, and you'll face considerable risks."
msgstr "우리 가문이 가난하진 않거든요. 당신은 상당한 위험을 감수해야 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can help you, but it won't be cheap.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9266
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E2"
msgid "Compensation is a fair request."
msgstr "보상을 요구하는 건 정당한 요구죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll make sure those Spacers suffer for what they've done.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll make sure those Spacers suffer for what they've done.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9264
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E1"
msgid "They deserve no less, but vengeance is the lesser concern."
msgstr "스페이서 놈들은 마땅히 대가를 치러야겠지만, 지금은 복수가 중요한 게 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll make sure those Spacers suffer for what they've done.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9264
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111E0"
msgid "Confront the Spacers if you wish, but if you find the stolen heirlooms, let me know."
msgstr "원한다면 스페이서들과 맞서 싸워도 좋아요. 하지만 도난당한 가보를 찾으면, 제게 알려 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll make sure those Spacers suffer for what they've done.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.
