#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111DE"
msgid "I'll make sure those Spacers suffer for what they've done."
msgstr "스페이서 놈들이 벌인 짓에 대해 반드시 대가를 치르게 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just make sure you pay up when I bring your heirlooms back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just make sure you pay up when I bring your heirlooms back.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll stay a while and pray while my wounds heal.
