#. TOPIC: 010B925F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111DD"
msgid "I swear it on the name of Mahkara herself."
msgstr "마카라 님의 이름을 걸고 맹세할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9262
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111DC"
msgid "Afterward, I'll go to my family's home in the city. Meet me there if you recover the heirlooms."
msgstr "이따가, 도시에 있는 집으로 갈게요. 가보를 되찾으셨다면 집에서 만나요."

