#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111DA"
msgid "Hey, two targets are better than one."
msgstr "예예, 표적이 둘이면 그만큼 분산되고 좋겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
