msgctxt "0111D9"
msgid "Very funny. You are joking, right?"
msgstr "아주 웃기는군. 농담하는 거지? 그렇지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry, I know exactly where to find your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Oh? I won't ask how you know this. If you were secretly a Spacer, I doubt you'd be helping me.
