#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D8"
msgid "Let's not be too overconfident."
msgstr "너무 자만하지 말자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
