#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D6"
msgid "There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit."
msgstr "가보는 전부 세개에요. 하나는 무기고, 다른 하나는 부스터 팩, 그리고 마지막은 팩을 장착할 수 있는 우주복이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D5"
msgid "The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard."
msgstr ""
"스페이서 놈들의 본거지는 여기서 멀지 않은 곳에 있어요. 그놈들이 훔친 물건들도 그곳에 보관 중일 거고, 삼엄하게 지키고 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I swear it on the name of Mahkara herself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B9260
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D3"
msgid "Just make sure you pay up when I bring your heirlooms back."
msgstr "가보를 찾아오면 보상금은 꼭 주셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
