#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I expect you to do your part, and not just cower behind me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D1"
msgid "See, that's why I keep Barrett around. Half the bullets go his way instead of mine."
msgstr "이래서 제가 배럿과 같이 다니죠. 총알의 절반은 저 친구가 대신 맞아 주거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I expect you to do your part, and not just cower behind me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111D0"
msgid "Sam here is pretty handy in a fight. Maybe I'll send him in first."
msgstr "샘은 싸움에 꽤 능숙해요. 샘을 먼저 보내는 방법도 있겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I expect you to do your part, and not just cower behind me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CF"
msgid "Nothing to worry about. Sarah here's got my back no matter what."
msgstr "걱정할 것 없어요. 사라가 무슨 일이 있어도 저를 지켜줄 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You honor your ancestor with your courage.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CE"
msgid "Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms."
msgstr "다른 방식으로 어떻게 기리든, 가보를 지키지 못한 실책이 열 배는 더 클 테니 만회할 수는 없겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see how a dusty old tomb is worth risking your life over.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how a dusty old tomb is worth risking your life over.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CD"
msgid "I wouldn't expect you to understand."
msgstr "그쪽이 이해할 만한 일은 아닐 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see how a dusty old tomb is worth risking your life over.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CC"
msgid "I failed to safeguard my ancestor's heirlooms and now I've brought shame upon my name forever."
msgstr "저는 조상님의 가보도 지키지 못했고, 이제 제 이름에 영원히 먹칠을 하게 됐네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ashamed, angry with yourself and annoyed by this stranger rubbing salt in your wounds / Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see how a dusty old tomb is worth risking your life over.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CB"
msgid "That's all you need to know."
msgstr "당신이 알아야 할 건 그게 다예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Dejected / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you think you're being a little hard on yourself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't you think you're being a little hard on yourself?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111CA"
msgid "You do not understand."
msgstr "당신은 이해 못 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there somewhere safe you can go?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there somewhere safe you can go?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C7"
msgid "Yes. My family has a house in the city."
msgstr "있어요. 도시에 우리 가문의 집이 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there somewhere safe you can go?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C6"
msgid "Once I've regained my strength, I must go there to tell my father what happened."
msgstr "기운이 회복되면, 무슨 일이 있었는지 아버지께 말씀드리러 집으로 가야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried, nervous, not looking forward to the confrontation / Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there somewhere safe you can go?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: You honor your ancestor with your courage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C5"
msgid "He will not be pleased."
msgstr "아버지께서 좋아하시진 않겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C4"
msgid "Do you truly have such disdain for our way of life?"
msgstr "정말 우리의 삶의 방식을 그렇게 경멸하는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Stern / to companion
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C3"
msgid "It's not a burden, it's a privilege, and one that I'm proud to embrace."
msgstr "그건 부담이 아니라 특권이고, 저는 그걸 자랑스럽게 받아들여요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to companion
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C2"
msgid "Save your condescending words for someone else. I have no desire to hear them."
msgstr "잘난 척하는 말은 다른 사람에게나 해요. 저는 그런 말 들을 생각 전혀 없으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would the Spacers want your family's heirlooms?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C1"
msgid "I won't pretend to understand how those savages think."
msgstr "그 야만인들 사고방식 따위, 이해한 척하고 싶지도 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111C0"
msgid "There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times."
msgstr "조상님의 유산을 존중하는 건 명예로운 일이고, 당신은 최선을 다했어요. 지금은 힘든 시기니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sympathetic / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BF"
msgid "I get it. Having a famous family name can be a hell of a burden."
msgstr "이해합니다. 유명한 가문의 이름을 타고나는 건 엄청난 부담이 될 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BE"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I find that kind of thinking archaic."
msgstr "미안하지만, 저는 그런 생각이 고리타분하다고 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BD"
msgid "You risked your life to protect your family's legacy."
msgstr "당신은 가족의 유산을 지키기 위해 목숨을 걸었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BC"
msgid "If that's not honorable, then I don't know what is."
msgstr "그게 명예로운 일이 아니라면, 뭐가 명예로운 일인지 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.|Do you truly have such disdain for our way of life?
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BB"
msgid "My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives."
msgstr "저는 여행을 통해 다양한 관점을 접할 수 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111BA"
msgid "When one's eyes have been opened to new ways of seeing things, it is hard to close them again."
msgstr "새로운 방식으로 세상을 보는 눈이 열리면, 다시 닫기는 어렵죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I get it. Having a famous family name can be a hell of a burden. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: No, I don't think you get it at all.|It's not a burden, it's a privilege, and one that I'm proud to embrace.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111B9"
msgid "Guess we'll just have to agree to disagree, then."
msgstr "그럼 우린 그냥 서로 생각이 다른 걸로 칩시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I'm sorry, but I find that kind of thinking archaic.|You risked your life to protect your family's legacy.|If that's not honorable, then I don't know what is. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: So you see us as unenlightened heathens, is that it?|Save your condescending words for someone else. I have no desire to hear them.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111B8"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "그렇군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, struggling, in pain. / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaSt100
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B6"
msgid "Do you have medicine?"
msgstr "약 있어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, struggling, in pain. / InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaSt100
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B5"
msgid "Can you help me?"
msgstr "도와줄 수 있어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Feeling defeated and ashamed / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaPost200Pre300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B4"
msgid "I will carry this shame for the rest of my life."
msgstr "저는 이 수치심을 평생 짊어지고 살아야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Feeling defeated and ashamed / Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaPost200Pre300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B3"
msgid "I have failed."
msgstr "저는 실패했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to know where Vaeric went. &&& Irina: We sent him north. &&& Irina: There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of.|He claimed he lost everything in the incident that swallowed half of Dazra. He wanted to start a new life.|We even gave him two of our own groats to get started.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wasn't aware we had a choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111B2"
msgid "Thank you for your help."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful, hopeful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaPost300Pre700
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B1"
msgid "I wish you good fortune in your search."
msgstr "수색 과정에 행운이 있길 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Vengeful / Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaPost300Pre700
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111B0"
msgid "Those thieves will regret the day they violated the Tomb of the Fang."
msgstr "그 도둑놈들은 송곳니의 무덤을 침범한 날을 후회하게 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful, hopeful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010B925C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_Hellos_MaaliyaPost300Pre700
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0111AF"
msgid "I will pray to the Great Serpent for your safety and success."
msgstr "당신의 안전과 성공을 위해 위대한 뱀께 기도할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player has stopped talking and seems preoccupied. You're curious what's on their mind. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_WFPI_Maaliya
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0111AE"
msgid "Lost in your thoughts?"
msgstr "무슨 생각 하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player has stopped talking and seems preoccupied. You're curious what's on their mind. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_WFPI_Maaliya
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0111AD"
msgid "What's wrong? Have I offended you in some way?"
msgstr "무슨 일이에요? 제가 뭐 불편하게 해드렸나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: The player has stopped talking and seems preoccupied. You're curious what's on their mind. / Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS05_WFPI_Maaliya
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0111AC"
msgid "Perhaps I wasn't clear enough."
msgstr "아마도 제가 충분히 명확하게 설명하지 못한 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8317
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111AA"
msgid "Well, look who is back."
msgstr "이게 누구신가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8317
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A9"
msgid "Change your mind? Borhal will be pleased - he is so very eager to kill me."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었나? 보할 형이 기뻐하겠어. 날 엄청 죽이고 싶어 하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Well, look who is back. |Change your mind? Borhal will be pleased - he is so very eager to kill me. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Are you done, both of you? Will you calm down?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8316
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A8"
msgid "Go on then, leave us to our bickering. Perhaps Borhal will die of stress before this duel ever comes to fruition."
msgstr "가 봐. 우리가 싸우게 내버려 둬. 아마 보할은 결투가 시작되기 전에 스트레스로 죽고 말겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. I believe we have just passed the point of no return. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8315
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A7"
msgid "Is there some other way we can resolve this?"
msgstr "두 분 문제를 다르게 해결할 방법은 없는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there some other way we can resolve this? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there some other way we can resolve this? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8314
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A6"
msgid "No. I believe we have just passed the point of no return."
msgstr "아니. 우린 이제 더 이상 돌이킬 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there some other way we can resolve this? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there some other way we can resolve this?  &&& Amila: No. I believe we have just passed the point of no return. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010B8313
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A5"
msgid "I would not have proposed the duel unless I were fully committed to it. I am well past the point of compromising."
msgstr "전적으로 마음먹지 않았다면 결투를 신청하지 않았을 것이네. 타협할 때는 훨씬 지난 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Go on then, leave us to our bickering. Perhaps Borhal will die of stress before this duel ever comes to fruition. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0111A4"
msgid "I'm still not getting dragged into this."
msgstr "그래도 이 일에 끼어들 생각은 여전히 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, how would you describe dark matter? It's invisible, formless, not  bound by the rules of electromagnetism.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B548E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011195"
msgid "Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "과학적으로, 위대한 뱀을 어떻게 설명하겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B548D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011194"
msgid "Well, how would you describe dark matter? It's invisible, formless, not  bound by the rules of electromagnetism."
msgstr "너라면 암흑 물질을 어떻게 설명할 수 있겠어? 투명하고, 형태도 없고, 전자기학 법칙도 통하지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B548D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011193"
msgid "Yet without it, the universe cannot be explained. The motion of galaxies, the clusters and filaments, it all becomes a mystery when you remove this unknowable thing."
msgstr ""
"그럼에도 암흑 물질이 부재하면 우주는 설명되지 못해. 은하계의 움직임, 은하단과 거대가락... 이 알 수 없는 것을 제외하면 전부 다 "
"수수께끼가 되고 말지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Scientifically, how would you describe the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B548D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011192"
msgid "The vortex of folded space is the same way. There are parts we understand, and parts that only make sense in the context of a greater being."
msgstr "접힌 우주의 와류도 마찬가지야. 우리가 이해하는 부분도 있고, 더 큰 존재가 있다는 맥락에서만 이해가 되는 부분도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Please, enter our city. You have my word that you will not be harmed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Open the gate!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B6050
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011191"
msgid "I would ask that until you have become Promised, you avoid the citizens of Dazra. They are not used to outsiders."
msgstr "그대가 약속받은 자가 되기 전까지는 다즈라 시민들을 피해주시길 부탁드립니다. 시민들은 이방인에 익숙하지 않으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I apologize for the interruption.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We are fortunate that there are those still alive who remember the old ways, and have remained prepared for such a moment as this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011190"
msgid "There is a ritual, intended for converts to the Promised, that has not been performed in generations."
msgstr "약속받은 자로 개종하는 의식이 있지만, 몇 세대 동안이나 행해진 적이 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: There is a ritual, intended for converts to the Promised, that has not been performed in generations.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Herald Inaza. I suspected we might find you here, waiting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118F"
msgid "We are fortunate that there are those still alive who remember the old ways, and have remained prepared for such a moment as this."
msgstr "다행히도 옛날 방식을 기억하며 이런 순간을 준비해 온 사람들이 아직 살아 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I understand that this is a great deal to absorb. Please take a moment to think it over, but House Va'ruun cannot wait forever.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Please, enter our city. You have my word that you will not be harmed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118E"
msgid "Forgive me for not introducing myself. I am Malibor Dul'kehf, a member of the High Council of House Va'ruun. I have been asked to represent the Council in this moment."
msgstr ""
"제 소개를 못 한 점은 사과드리지요. 저는 말리보어 둘케프입니다. 바룬 가문 대의회의 일원이지요. 지금은 요청을 받아 대의회를 대표하고 "
"있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Forgive me for not introducing myself. I am Malibor Dul'kehf, a member of the High Council of House Va'ruun. I have been asked to represent the Council in this moment.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I would ask that until you have become Promised, you avoid the citizens of Dazra. They are not used to outsiders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118D"
msgid "Please, enter our city. You have my word that you will not be harmed."
msgstr "이제 우리 도시로 들어가시지요. 장담컨대 해를 입지는 않을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I apologize for the interruption. &&& Malibor: There is a ritual, intended for converts to the Promised, that has not been performed in generations. &&& Malibor: We are fortunate that there are those still alive who remember the old ways, and have remained prepared for such a moment as this. &&& Malibor: Herald Inaza. I suspected we might find you here, waiting.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Indeed you are. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118C"
msgid "I saw the ship landing. I knew immediately that I would be needed."
msgstr "우주선이 착륙하는 걸 봤어요. 바로 제가 필요하리라는 걸 알겠더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Herald Inaza. I suspected we might find you here, waiting. &&& Inaza: I saw the ship landing. I knew immediately that I would be needed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: This is Inaza Kaisir, Herald of the Serpent. She will guide you through the ritual. I am needed elsewhere, but I assure you that you are in good hands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B604A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118B"
msgid "Indeed you are."
msgstr "확실히 그렇습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Indeed you are. 
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B6049
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01118A"
msgid "This is Inaza Kaisir, Herald of the Serpent. She will guide you through the ritual. I am needed elsewhere, but I assure you that you are in good hands."
msgstr ""
"이분은 이나자 카이시어 님이십니다. 위대한 뱀의 전령이시지요. 전령님이 의식에서 당신을 이끌어주실 겁니다. 저는 가봐야 합니다만, 여기선 "
"안심해도 괜찮습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Inaza
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We are fortunate that there are those still alive who remember the old ways, and have remained prepared for such a moment as this.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I saw the ship landing. I knew immediately that I would be needed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010B55D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage460_MailborEscortScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011189"
msgid "Herald Inaza. I suspected we might find you here, waiting."
msgstr "이나자 전령님. 여기서 기다리고 계실 줄 알았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid about who's coming. / Afraid / to BatteryHostilesEnableMarker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: If I can get to the control room. If I can -- 
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
