msgid "Poor Sirak. So close to seeing their efforts realized."
msgstr "불쌍한 시락. 노력이 성공하기까지 정말 조금이었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sirak pronounced SEER-ack
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
