#. TOPIC: 010B6093
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5040_Companion_SirakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011169"
msgid "If only Sirak could've held out a little longer."
msgstr "시락이 좀만 더 오래 버텼으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sirak pronounced SEER-ack.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
