#. TOPIC: 010B6093
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5040_Companion_SirakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011168"
msgid "Gotta feel bad for Sirak. At least their efforts weren't in vain."
msgstr "시락은 정말 안됐네. 적어도 그 노력이 헛되지는 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sirak pronounced SEER-ack
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010B6093
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5040_Companion_SirakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
