msgid "Sirak held out as long as they could. It's unfortunate they couldn't live to see this."
msgstr "시락은 최대한 오래 버텨 줬어. 안타깝게도 살아서 이 순간을 보지는 못했지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who are you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011164"
msgid "I am Maaliya Hajtal, daughter of Farud and descendant of Mahkara Hajtal, who was called the Fang."
msgstr "저는 말리야 하즈탈입니다. 파루드의 딸이자, 송곳니라 불렸던 마카라 하즈탈 님의 후손이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who are you?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: This place seems very important to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011163"
msgid "I live in the city, but I spend much of my time here. The silence appeals to me."
msgstr "제 집은 도시에 있지만, 여기서 시간을 많이 보내요. 고요함이 마음에 들어서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Crestfallen / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no shame in fighting to protect something that matters.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's no shame in fighting to protect something that matters.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011162"
msgid "There is shame in failing to uphold a sacred duty."
msgstr "신성한 의무를 다하지 못하게 됐으니 수치스러워해야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no shame in fighting to protect something that matters.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011161"
msgid "This is the tomb of my ancestor Mahkara the Fang."
msgstr "여긴 제 조상님인 송곳니의 마카라의 무덤이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's no shame in fighting to protect something that matters.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011160"
msgid "She was a mighty warrior and had the great honor to command the starship Mourning."
msgstr "마카라 님은 강력한 전사셨고 우주선 모어닝 호를 지휘하는 큰 영광을 누리셨어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future.
