#. TOPIC: 010B2BCB
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01113D"
msgid "What are your thoughts on Dazra's future?"
msgstr "다즈라의 미래는 어떻게 될 거라고 생각해?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
