#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01113C"
msgid "What do you think of Dazra's future?"
msgstr "다즈라의 미래는 어떻게 될 거라 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BBB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011130"
msgid "But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith."
msgstr "하지만 부디 라즈마라면 명예와 믿음으로 대변자의 역할을 수행할 수 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BBB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01112F"
msgid "But I am hopeful that Viktor Veth'aal will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith."
msgstr "하지만 부디 빅토르 베타알이라면 명예와 믿음으로 대변자의 역할을 수행할 수 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BBB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01112E"
msgid "But I am hopeful that Hasmak Dul'kehf will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith."
msgstr "하지만 부디 해즈막 둘케프라면 명예와 믿음으로 대변자의 역할을 수행할 수 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think so. I chose them because they're the best equipped for what's ahead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think so. I chose them because they're the best equipped for what's ahead.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011125"
msgid "Then I will trust in your wisdom as well as the Great Serpent's, for they are surely guiding your hand."
msgstr "그럼 너와 위대한 뱀의 지혜를 굳게 믿겠어. 그게 네 손을 이끄는 것이 분명하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011124"
msgid "Not that I know of. But perhaps, indirectly."
msgstr "내가 아는 바로는 없어. 다만, 간접적으로는 가능할지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011123"
msgid "When you place a hot cup of coffee in a room, it eventually cools to the temperature of the room."
msgstr "방 안에 뜨거운 커피를 놓으면, 결국 그 방의 기온에 맞춰서 식어 버리지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011122"
msgid "But the room in turn raises it's temperature slightly as well. The coffee, no matter how small, has an effect."
msgstr "하지만 동시에 방의 온도도 조금 더 오르지. 커피 컵은 아무리 작아도 분명 효과가 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I think so. I chose them because they're the best equipped for what's ahead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011121"
msgid "That is what I am: A little cup of espresso."
msgstr "내가 바로 그런 사람이야. 작은 에스프레소 컵 한 잔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of Dazra's future? &&& Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future. &&& Sahima: But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith.|If nothing else, I will have a direct line to her. We sleep in the same house!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And yet as the uncertainty principle states, even had you known, you wouldn't have. But only time and observation will tell the actual result.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011120"
msgid "I don't know. I actually chose them at random."
msgstr "잘 몰라. 사실 그건 내가 아무렇게나 선택한 거라서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know. I actually chose them at random.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know. I actually chose them at random.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111F"
msgid "And yet as the uncertainty principle states, even had you known, you wouldn't have. But only time and observation will tell the actual result."
msgstr "그렇지만 불확정성 원리가 말하듯이, 알았더라도 불가능했을 거야. 하지만 오직 시간과 관찰만이 실제 결과를 알려 주겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of Dazra's future? &&& Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future. &&& Sahima: But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith.|If nothing else, I will have a direct line to her. We sleep in the same house!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not that I know of. But perhaps, indirectly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BBA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111E"
msgid "As a member of House Ka'dic, will you have any influence?"
msgstr "카딕 가문의 일원으로서 혹시 영향력이 좀 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of Dazra's future? &&& Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future. &&& Sahima: But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith.|If nothing else, I will have a direct line to her. We sleep in the same house!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That... is certainly a choice. But as the uncertainty principle states, even your bad intentions might not bear fruit. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111D"
msgid "Well, I chose them in hopes they'd send Dazra to ruin."
msgstr "내가 그 선택을 내린 건... 그렇게 해서 다즈라가 망하길 바랐기 때문이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of Dazra's future? &&& Sahima: Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future. &&& Sahima: But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith.|If nothing else, I will have a direct line to her. We sleep in the same house!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I will trust in your wisdom as well as the Great Serpent's, for they are surely guiding your hand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111C"
msgid "I think so. I chose them because they're the best equipped for what's ahead."
msgstr "그렇게 생각해. 내가 그 선택을 내린 것도 앞으로 여러 과제를 수행하는 데 가장 좋은 적임자로 보였기 때문이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, I chose them in hopes they'd send Dazra to ruin.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, I chose them in hopes they'd send Dazra to ruin.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111B"
msgid "That... is certainly a choice. But as the uncertainty principle states, even your bad intentions might not bear fruit."
msgstr "그런... 선택을 내릴 수도 있겠네. 하지만 불확정성 원리가 말하듯이, 네 악의마저 원하는 결과를 창출하지 않을 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, I chose them in hopes they'd send Dazra to ruin.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BB3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01111A"
msgid "For Dazra's sake, I hope you are either joking or wrong."
msgstr "부디 다즈라를 위해서라도, 농담하는 것이거나 틀렸으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of Dazra's future?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But I am hopeful that Razma will serve the role of Speaker with honor and faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010B2BC8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_DazraFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011119"
msgid "Heisenberg's principle states that all things have uncertainty, that nothing can be measured with precision. The same is true of the future."
msgstr "하이젠베르크의 원리에 의하면 모든 것엔 불확정성이 있으며, 아무것도 정확하게 측정할 수 없다고 해. 미래 또한 마찬가지야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Regarding the missing supplies, I was wondering if I could be of any assistance.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I appreciate the support. My mind has been frazzled as of late.
