msgid "Regarding the missing supplies, I was wondering if I could be of any assistance."
msgstr "사라진 물자에 관해서, 내가 도움이 될 수 있을지 궁금했네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MQ01Player: Mainframe reboot completed.
