#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01110A"
msgid "Why allow this husk to defile our city? Have we not lost enough?"
msgstr "왜 그 허물이 우리 도시를 더럽히게 하십니까? 지금 상황도 부족하단 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Nalada
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Is there a problem, Makola? &&& Makola: The city is in shambles, the Speaker is missing, and here you are leading some outsider through our sacred space. &&& Makola: Why allow this husk to defile our city? Have we not lost enough?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
