msgstr "믿음을 가지세요. 이 이방인은 위대한 뱀의 인도를 받고 온 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Have faith. I believe this outsider was guided here by the Great Serpent Himself.
