#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011104"
msgid "This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log."
msgstr "저는 시락 베타알입니다. 사고 기록을 남깁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 010B175A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011103"
msgid "After the initial jump, areas of the Oracle have somehow been sectioned off by strange energy fields or barriers."
msgstr "처음 도약 이후로, 오라클의 구역들이 어떤 이유에선지 이상한 역장 혹은 장벽 때문에 분리되어 버렸습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I am certain these new fields are related to the Vortex Phantoms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 010B175A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011102"
msgid "The fields allow no one to pass and are somehow able to repel, almost teleport, the trespasser back."
msgstr "역장은 누구도 통과할 수 없는데, 침입자를 마치 순간이동 시키듯이 내쫓아 버립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log.|After the initial jump, areas of the Oracle have somehow been sectioned off by strange energy fields or barriers.|The fields allow no one to pass and are somehow able to repel, almost teleport, the trespasser back.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
