#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011101"
msgid "I am certain these new fields are related to the Vortex Phantoms."
msgstr "분명 이 역장은 볼텍스 유령과 관련이 있는 거겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Something happened in Dazra... And if the situation is bad here, I fear for our brethren in the city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 010B1759
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011100"
msgid "Both resonate with the same energy pattern. The exact same pattern we were studying for Anasko's experiments."
msgstr "둘 다 같은 에너지 패턴으로 공명하니까요. 우리가 아나스코의 실험에서 연구하던 것과 정확히 똑같은 패턴입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I am certain these new fields are related to the Vortex Phantoms.|Both resonate with the same energy pattern. The exact same pattern we were studying for Anasko's experiments.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 010B1758
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FF"
msgid "Something happened in Dazra... And if the situation is bad here, I fear for our brethren in the city."
msgstr "다즈라에서 무슨 일이 생긴 거겠죠... 여기 상황도 나쁜데, 도시 교우님들은 어떨지 걱정입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010B03FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FE"
msgid "Where was I? Yes, where was I..."
msgstr "내가 어디까지 얘기했더라? 그래, 어디까지 했지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on "we" as in "Were WE doing something? We could refer to the player or his granddaughter here / Question / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010B03FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FD"
msgid "I was doing something, wasn't I? Were we doing something? I honestly don't remember."
msgstr "내가 뭘 하고 있었지, 그렇지? 우리가 뭘 하고 있었던가? 솔직히 기억이 안 나네."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: Working.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C44E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FC"
msgid "Where were you when the cataclysm happened?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 어디에 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& ...  &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage! &&& Vassilis: A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case.|From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem. &&& Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I saw it, but only from a distance. It was like a person, but of smoke and dust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FB"
msgid "Did you see the phantom?"
msgstr "유령을 직접 봤습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you see the phantom?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you see the phantom?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110FA"
msgid "I saw it, but only from a distance. It was like a person, but of smoke and dust."
msgstr "봤어요. 멀리서 본 거긴 하지만요. 사람 같은 모습이었지만, 꼭 연기와 먼지로 만들어진 것 같았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041105
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110F9"
msgid "In the past few weeks there have been rumors of people squatting there, and using the building as housing."
msgstr "지난 몇 주간 사람들이 고아원에 눌러앉아서 제 집처럼 쓴다는 소문이 있었지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: I hate to say it, but you're right. I must defer to my friend here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110F8"
msgid "Vassilis, you can a learn a thing or two from this one."
msgstr "이 분한테서 한 수 배우시라고요. 바실리스 씨."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_BreanneGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0110F7"
msgid "Great Serpent protect us from evil."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 악으로부터 우리를 보호하소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_BreanneGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0110F6"
msgid "I know not what these phantoms are, but I assure you they are not friendly. The fates will tell you as much."
msgstr "유령들의 정체가 뭔지는 모르겠지만, 우호적이지 않다는 건 확실해요. 운명이 그렇게 말해 주고 있어요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010B03FB
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_BreanneGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0110F5"
msgid "Thank you for your help in this matter."
msgstr "일을 도와주셔서 고마워요."

#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Neutral
