msgid "Time to go home, I guess."
msgstr "이제 집에 갈 시간인 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Ilana
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ilana: Time to go home, I guess.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
