#. TOPIC: 010ADAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110B0"
msgid "I was on my way to the Scaled Citadel, when I saw a bird in flight pass overhead."
msgstr "비늘 성채로 가는 중이었는데, 머리 위로 날아가는 새 한 마리를 봤죠."

#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110AF"
msgid "It inspired me to write a hymn, so I stopped in my tracks, to reach for my slate."
msgstr "그것에 영감을 받어 찬송가를 쓰고 싶어져서, 자리에 멈춰서 슬레이트를 꺼내려 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110AE"
msgid "I had barely started typing when I noticed the ground spilling at the edge of my feet. I looked down, then up, to see a vast crater of nothing before me -- and fell to my knees."
msgstr ""
"타자를 치기 시작한 지 얼마 되지 않아 발끝부터 땅이 무너지는 것을 느꼈죠. 아래를 내려다봤고, 그다음 위를 올려다보고 나서, 제 앞에 "
"아무것도 없는 거대한 구덩이가 생긴 걸 봤습니다. 무릎을 꿇고 말았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Cataclysm
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110AD"
msgid "I can say for certain I was there, at the very line between life and death. But I never witnessed the vortex perform its terrible works of death and devastation. Somehow that troubles me more."
msgstr ""
"삶과 죽음의 경계선, 바로 그 앞에 있었던 거죠. 하지만 그전까지 저는 볼텍스가 그런 끔찍한 죽음과 파괴를 일으키는 걸 본 적이 없었죠. "
"왠지 그래서 더 불안한 느낌이 듭니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HuntingPlayer
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0110AC"
msgid "Come out, heretic, and face your absolution!"
msgstr "나와라! 이단자야! 네놈의 죄를 사해주마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HuntingPlayer
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0110AB"
msgid "Where are you, child of Jarek?"
msgstr "어디 있느냐? 자렉의 자식아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HuntingPlayer
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0110AA"
msgid "We will find you, outsider, and turn you to dust."
msgstr "이방인이여, 너를 찾아내 가루로 만들어 주겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HuntingPlayer
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0110A9"
msgid "There are only so many places you can hide, trespasser."
msgstr "침입자여, 네가 숨을 수 있는 곳은 한정되어 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A5"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "누구신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: I was deep in meditation, so I didn't hear the Spacers approach.|I did what I could to protect this hallowed ground, but there were too many. |Not only did the thieves violate this sacred tomb, but they took the heirlooms of my ancestor.|Some of them stayed behind to ambush me. I could hear them.|Serpent curse them for all time!
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is shame in failing to uphold a sacred duty.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A4"
msgid "There's no shame in fighting to protect something that matters."
msgstr "중요한 걸 지키기 위해 싸웠으니 수치스러워하지 않아도 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This place seems very important to you. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang.|Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning.|It was a most prestigious honor. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.|Those accursed Spacers snuck in and tried to kill me, the cowards!|No doubt they're already on their way back to their lair with my family's precious heirlooms.|Now I must bear the shame of allowing her legacy to be forever tarnished.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A3"
msgid "You honor your ancestor with your courage."
msgstr "당신의 용기는 조상님을 기리기에 충분할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This place seems very important to you. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang.|Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning.|It was a most prestigious honor. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.|Those accursed Spacers snuck in and tried to kill me, the cowards!|No doubt they're already on their way back to their lair with my family's precious heirlooms.|Now I must bear the shame of allowing her legacy to be forever tarnished.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wouldn't expect you to understand. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A2"
msgid "I don't see how a dusty old tomb is worth risking your life over."
msgstr "먼지 쌓인 오래된 무덤이 목숨을 걸 만큼 지킬 가치가 있는지 잘 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This place seems very important to you. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang.|Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning.|It was a most prestigious honor. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.|Those accursed Spacers snuck in and tried to kill me, the cowards!|No doubt they're already on their way back to their lair with my family's precious heirlooms.|Now I must bear the shame of allowing her legacy to be forever tarnished.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You do not understand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A1"
msgid "Don't you think you're being a little hard on yourself?"
msgstr "자기 자신을 너무 몰아세우는 거 같은데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This place seems very important to you. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang.|Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning.|It was a most prestigious honor. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.|Those accursed Spacers snuck in and tried to kill me, the cowards!|No doubt they're already on their way back to their lair with my family's precious heirlooms.|Now I must bear the shame of allowing her legacy to be forever tarnished.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. My family has a house in the city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 010AFD7B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0110A0"
msgid "Is there somewhere safe you can go?"
msgstr "어디 안전하게 피신할 곳은 있나요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: Yes, the old orphanage is ill-fated, that much is certain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109F"
msgid "Earlier you spoke of an ill omen?"
msgstr "아까 불길한 징조가 있었다고 말했죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Earlier you spoke of an ill omen?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109E"
msgid "Yes, the old orphanage is ill-fated, that much is certain."
msgstr "네, 그 오래된 고아원은 불길해요. 분명 불길하기 짝이 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109D"
msgid "Even before the city was lost, I once asked the Heralds to read the star-scales and bless the children there. Instead, they spoke of malicious portents."
msgstr ""
"도시가 사라지기 전에, 전령들에게 별의 비늘을 읽고 점을 쳐서 저기 있는 아이들을 축복해 달라고 부탁한 적이 있었어요. 그런데 전령들은 "
"축복 대신 나쁜 징조가 있다는 말만 잔뜩 늘어놨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109C"
msgid "Now I wonder if the land itself is cursed."
msgstr "이제는 저 땅 자체가 저주받은 건 아닌지 의심마저 드네요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: It was once an orphanage for young children who lost their parents.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109B"
msgid "What else can you tell me about the property?"
msgstr "고아원에 대해 또 아는 게 있으면 말해주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What else can you tell me about the property?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01109A"
msgid "It was once an orphanage for young children who lost their parents."
msgstr "한때 부모를 잃은 어린아이들을 위한 고아원이었지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011099"
msgid "The children were raised there and eventually guided into service by the Minsitry of State."
msgstr "고아원에서 길러진 아이들은, 성인이 되면 국무성의 인도를 받아 군인으로 복무하게 되어 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011098"
msgid "It was run by a handful of donors and local volunteers, like the Ueda girl, but it closed down months ago."
msgstr "우에다 양 같은 기부자나 지역 자원봉사자들 몇 명이 운영했지만, 몇 달 전에 문을 닫았죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: Working.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C44E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011097"
msgid "Where were you when the cataclysm happened?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 어디에 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011096"
msgid "I was at the Halls of Healing, praying for my family."
msgstr "회복의 전당에서 가족을 위해 기도하고 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011095"
msgid "The odd thing is, I did not know what I was praying for, only that I had a fear in my gut, a sharp pain of the abdomen."
msgstr ""
"그런데 이상하게도, 제가 뭘 위해서 기도하고 있는 건지 저 자신도 모르겠더라고요. 그저 마음 깊은 곳에서, 알 수 없는 두려움과 함께 "
"배가 콕콕 쑤시듯 아팠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011094"
msgid "Moments later, I heard the din of the crowd and rushed out, searching for my husband. My prayers were answered when I found him safe."
msgstr "잠시 후, 사람들이 내는 시끄러운 소리를 듣고 뛰쳐나가 남편을 찾았어요. 제 기도에 응답해 주셨는지 남편은 무사했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_Breanne03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011093"
msgid "But the same cannot be said for the orphanage. We must rid the house of this phantom!"
msgstr "하지만 고아원은 무사하지 못했죠. 고아원에 나타나기 시작한 유령을 몰아내야 해요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over... &&& Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different. &&& Malibor: If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko Va'ruun is our leader, the grandson of Jinan Va'ruun himself. He sometimes appears to us, but we cannot interact.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC201
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01107C"
msgid "Who was that?"
msgstr "그 사람은 누구였죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who was that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who was that?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: He sounds plenty lost himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC200
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01107B"
msgid "Anasko Va'ruun is our leader, the grandson of Jinan Va'ruun himself. He sometimes appears to us, but we cannot interact."
msgstr ""
"아나스코 바룬님은 우리 지도자이시며, 바로 그 지난 바룬님의 손자 되십니다. 가끔 우리 앞에 나타나시는데, 서로 소통을 할 수가 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: hesitant, concerned that the player is trying to pull a fast one / Confused / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve." &&& Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is no joke.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01107A"
msgid "He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing..."
msgstr "그랬다고? 난 못 들었는데... 상황의 심각성을 생각해 보면, 네가 그런 식으로 농담을 할 리는 없을 거고..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve." &&& Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is no joke.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011079"
msgid "It's true. I heard it too, plain as day."
msgstr "맞아. 나도 분명하게 들었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve." &&& Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is no joke.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011078"
msgid "Wait, really? I didn't hear anything."
msgstr "잠깐, 진짜로? 난 아무것도 못 들었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve." &&& Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It is no joke.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011077"
msgid "Are you quite sure? I was right here, and I didn't hear a thing."
msgstr "그거 확실해? 나도 여기 있었는데 아무것도 못 들었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Something about a citadel, and a transformation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something about a citadel, and a transformation.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Truly, you did hear Anasko. You have been chosen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011076"
msgid "Access to the Citadel was restricted. Even if you knew of its existence, you could not have known what went on inside."
msgstr "성채에는 접근이 제한되어 있었지요. 설령 성채에 무엇이 있는지 알았다고 해도, 내부에서 무슨 일이 벌어지는지는 알 수 없었고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's trying to contact the Great Serpent, but something is wrong. He sounds lost.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's trying to contact the Great Serpent, but something is wrong. He sounds lost.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Truly, you did hear Anasko. You have been chosen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011075"
msgid "The experiment was a secret, even to many of our own people."
msgstr "그 실험은 기밀이었습니다. 우리 신민들도 아는 이가 많지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve."
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011074"
msgid "By the Serpent..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011073"
msgid "Truly, you did hear Anasko. You have been chosen."
msgstr "정말로 아나스코 님의 말씀을 들은 거군요. 그대는 선택받은 자입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All Must Serve.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "All Must Serve."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Truly, you did hear Anasko. You have been chosen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011072"
msgid "No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city."
msgstr "우리의 신조를 아는 이방인은 없지요. 이 도시 밖에선 절대 입 밖에 내지 않으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: By the Serpent... &&& companion: He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing...
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01106A"
msgid "It is no joke."
msgstr "농담이 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: By the Serpent... &&& companion: He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing...
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011069"
msgid "Amazing. You both heard Anasko?"
msgstr "굉장하군요. 둘 다 들었단 말입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: By the Serpent... &&& companion: He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing...
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011068"
msgid "It is hard to believe, and yet..."
msgstr "믿기 어려운 말이긴 합니다만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: By the Serpent... &&& companion: He said that? I heard nothing... Given the gravity of the situation, surely there is no way you would joke about such a thing...
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: No outsider would know our creed. It is never uttered beyond this city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC1F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011067"
msgid "I would not believe it myself, but..."
msgstr "저도 믿어지지는 않습니다만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Then you may leave. But we will await your return, for it is the Serpent's Will that leads us all. Even you. And He will lead you back to us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I must temper what I reveal for now, but surely you saw the Scaled Citadel as you arrived.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010ABDDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011065"
msgid "I understand that this is a great deal to absorb. Please take a moment to think it over, but House Va'ruun cannot wait forever."
msgstr "받아들이기 어려운 것은 이해합니다. 잠시 시간을 두고 생각해 주시지요. 하지만 지금 바룬 가문은 영원히 기다려줄 수는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here! &&& Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need! &&& Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011064"
msgid "Anasko Va'ruun? What has happened?"
msgstr "아나스코 바룬 님? 어떻게 된 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here! &&& Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need! &&& Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011063"
msgid "Well, that's not something you see every day."
msgstr "음, 매일 볼 수 있는 장면은 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here! &&& Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need! &&& Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011062"
msgid "We're all seeing this, right? Just making sure."
msgstr "너한테도 보이는 거 맞지? 그냥 확인하려고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here! &&& Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need! &&& Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011061"
msgid "It's like what we saw on the station..."
msgstr "정거장에서 봤던 모습 같아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC193
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011060"
msgid "We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you."
msgstr "우린 바룬 가문에 위협이 되지 않아. 장담하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC193
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105F"
msgid "Time to turn on that irresistible charm, Captain."
msgstr "거부할 수 없는 매력을 발산할 시간이네. 우리 선장님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC193
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105E"
msgid "This just keeps getting better, doesn't it?"
msgstr "일이 점점 더 나아지고 있지? 안 그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AC193
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105D"
msgid "Let's all just take a moment... I assure you, we mean you no harm."
msgstr "너무 서두르지 마시죠... 장담하는데, 나쁜 뜻으로 온 게 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105C"
msgid "I remain hopeful that the Serpent has guided your thoughts, as He guides us all. Have you reconsidered?"
msgstr "뱀께서 우리 모두를 이끄시듯이, 그대의 생각도 이끌어주셨길 바랍니다. 생각해 보셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105B"
msgid "Will you join House Va'ruun, become one of the Promised, and deliver us from this crisis?"
msgstr "바룬 가문에 합류해 약속받은 자들의 일원이 되어, 우리를 이 위기에서 구해주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Losing her sanity and knowing she can't stop it. She'll turn hostile. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Basira: It's pointless! |We share this fate. This is our end. The Great --
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
