#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01105A"
msgid "No, no! It's happening!"
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼! 시작됐어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Losing her sanity and transforming into a hostile entity. Giving Sirak a warning to get away from her. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Basira: No, no! It's happening! 
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: Basira!
