#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me!
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Speaker! We are here!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
