#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011036"
msgid "It's happening again!"
msgstr "또 시작됐어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& Guard: It's happening again!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
