#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance. &&& Malibor: But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious. &&& Malibor: And perhaps our guest's intent should be determined before we take further action.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I understand, but you must realize that since you are not one of us, it is difficult for us to judge your intent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AACCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011034"
msgid "I don't respond well to having a gun aimed at me."
msgstr "총을 들이밀고 있는데 좋은 반응 나오긴 힘들죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't respond well to having a gun aimed at me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't respond well to having a gun aimed at me.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AACCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011033"
msgid "I understand, but you must realize that since you are not one of us, it is difficult for us to judge your intent."
msgstr "이해합니다만, 그대가 우리 일원이 아니라는 점을 알아야 합니다. 저희는 그대의 의도를 파악하기 어려워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't respond well to having a gun aimed at me.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010AACCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011032"
msgid "Surely you would do the same in our position."
msgstr "그대도 우리 같은 입장에 처한다면 똑같이 행동할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CompanionInterjections
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011031"
msgid "It is unusual for members of three separate Houses to gather like this. We should find out more."
msgstr "세 가문이 이렇게 모이는 건 이례적인 일이야. 더 자세히 알아봐야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CompanionInterjections
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "011030"
msgid "A lot of bluster and frustration on those three. They're either talking politics or money. Or both."
msgstr "저 셋은 허세와 불만이 가득하군. 정치나 돈, 아니면 둘 다에 대해 이야기하고 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CompanionInterjections
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01102F"
msgid "I get the feeling those three don't like each other."
msgstr "저 셋은 서로 싫어하는 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CompanionInterjections
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "01102E"
msgid "That conversation seemed polite, but tense. Politics often require reading between the civility."
msgstr "저 대화는 정중해 보였지만, 긴장감이 감돌았어. 정치는 종종 예의범절 사이의 행간을 읽어야 할 때가 많지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious. &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010AB032
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01102D"
msgid "And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days."
msgstr "그리고 우카루는 시간을 칼같이 잘 지켰어요. 3일은커녕 3분도 빠질 사람이 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious. &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010AB032
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01102C"
msgid "Ukaru was not that kind of man. He was grounded. Reserved. This is highly unusual behavior for him."
msgstr "우카루는 그런 사람이 아니에요. 침착하고, 과묵한 사람이죠. 이번 일은 매우 이례적이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious. &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010AB032
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01102B"
msgid "Agreed. Ukaru was extremely punctual. An absence like this is very unlike him."
msgstr "맞아요. 우카루는 시간을 칼같이 잘 지켰어요. 이렇게 자리를 비우다니 우카루답지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010AAA53
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011021"
msgid "But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself."
msgstr "하지만 그렇다고 해서 제 무례를 정당화해선 안 되겠죠. 적어도 정식으로 제 소개를 할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ecze-cue-tor  / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010AAA53
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011020"
msgid "My name is Qisrani Dul'kehf. I work as an Executor for House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "제 이름은 키스라니 둘케프예요. 둘케프 가문의 실무관으로 일하고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I overheard your conversation and was curious.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I overheard your conversation and was curious.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It's about the supply shortage. There may be a reason for it, beyond the cataclysm itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C27
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01101F"
msgid "In that case, maybe you can help."
msgstr "그렇다면, 어쩌면 당신이 도울 수 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Transforming into a hostile phantom. / InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Basira: Sirak, run! I can't stop it!
#. ALIAS: Basira
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBasiraMir
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01101D"
msgid "Gah! Eeargh..."
msgstr "그아아! 으으윽..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Fear currently outweighing the sadness of losing their friend. / Afraid / to Basira
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: I see no one, and yet... I can feel a presence. But how?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0320_Sirak_ExplainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01101B"
msgid "What? What happened? Who did this?"
msgstr "뭐야? 무슨 일이지? 누가 한 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Their friend just lost her sanity and became hostile. / Pleading / to Basira
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: No, I will not leave you -- &&& Basira: It's pointless! |We share this fate. This is our end. The Great -- &&& Basira: No, no! It's happening!  &&& Basira: Sirak, run! I can't stop it!
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AC10A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0150_Sirak_BasiraScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01101A"
msgid "Basira!"
msgstr "바시라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Curiosity, fear, confusion. / Confused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: What? What happened? Who did this? 
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0320_Sirak_ExplainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011017"
msgid "I see no one, and yet... I can feel a presence. But how?"
msgstr "아무도 안 보이는데... 존재가 느껴져. 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Turning into scientist mode before getting hit with a massive head pain / Thinking
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: Earrgh!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0320_Sirak_ExplainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011016"
msgid "I should be the last... Is someone there or --"
msgstr "내가 마지막일 텐데... 혹시 거기 누구 있는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: Earrgh!
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0320_Sirak_ExplainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011015"
msgid "My mind turns against me... I must return to Engineering and make one last attempt to restore the power."
msgstr "내 정신이 날 속이는 거야... 엔지니어링 구역으로 돌아가서 마지막으로 한번 더 동력을 복구해 봐야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to SirakGravityTravelSceneMarker
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: Serpent's bane. One of the power cells dislodged in the last jump.
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: If I can get to the control room. If I can -- 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAAC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0810_Sirak_GravityScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011014"
msgid "The gravity... Restoring the gravity may pull the cell into place."
msgstr "중력... 중력을 복구하면 파워 셀을 끼워넣을 수 있을 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: The Vortex Phantoms. Where did they go? Something is wrong...
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: No, not now! I have to hold on...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_1410_Sirak_TransformationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011013"
msgid "Earrgh!"
msgstr "으아아악!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: Earrgh!
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: Gah! Eeargh!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_1410_Sirak_TransformationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011012"
msgid "No, not now! I have to hold on..."
msgstr "안 돼! 지금은 안 돼! 견뎌내야 해..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: The Vortex Phantoms. Where did they go? Something is wrong...
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: No, not now! I have to hold on...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010AAABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_1410_Sirak_TransformationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011011"
msgid "Earrgh!"
msgstr "으아아악!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: Working.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C44E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011010"
msgid "Where were you when the cataclysm happened?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 어디에 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100F"
msgid "Myself and some others were having dinner at the Meat House."
msgstr "저와 몇몇 사람들은 훈제소에서 저녁을 먹고 있었습니다."

#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100E"
msgid "From our vantage point, we couldn't see what was happening outside the Scaled Citadel, but I could hear the blast, searing into my skull."
msgstr "우리가 있던 곳에서는 비늘 성채 밖에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 볼 수 없었지만, 폭발음이 제 머리를 꿰뚫는 것을 들을 수 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100D"
msgid "I remember falling from my chair, trying to get my bearings, in this period of eerie silence. And then I heard the screams."
msgstr "저는 이 으스스한 정적 속에서 의자에서 떨어져, 정신을 차리려 했던 것을 기억합니다. 그러다 비명 소리를 들었죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: Working.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C44E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100C"
msgid "Where were you when the cataclysm happened?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 어디에 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Mujeen_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100B"
msgid "I was at the spaceport, attending to business."
msgstr "나는 우주항에서 업무를 보고 있었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. ALIAS: MS01_Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Mujeen_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "01100A"
msgid "I only witnessed the crest of the vortex emanating from the Scaled Citadel."
msgstr "비늘 성채에서 뿜어져 나오는 볼텍스의 꼭대기 부분만 봤네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: MS01_Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Mujeen_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011009"
msgid "It lasted only a moment. A flash in the sky. It was only in the hours afterward that we understood the consequences of that moment."
msgstr "그건 잠시동안만 지속되었네. 하늘에 섬광이 일었지. 그 순간의 결과를 이해하게 된 건 그로부터 몇 시간이 지난 후였지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ochim: Working.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C44E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011008"
msgid "Where were you when the cataclysm happened?"
msgstr "대재난이 일어났을 때 어디에 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where were you when the cataclysm happened?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011007"
msgid "I was in Jinan Plaza and had a full view of the whole thing. It was spectacular."
msgstr "저는 지난 광장에 있었고 모든 광경을 볼 수 있었습니다. 장관이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011006"
msgid "A wave of energy, sweeping over the city, eating everything in its path."
msgstr "에너지의 파도가 도시를 휩쓸며 그 길에 있는 모든 것을 먹어치웠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011005"
msgid "The destruction alone was impressive, but what I'll always remember is the noise."
msgstr "파괴 자체만으로도 인상적이었지만, 제가 항상 기억할 것은 바로 그 소리입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011004"
msgid "The vortex itself moved swiftly, darkly. But the sound of it was a slow hum. Deliberate."
msgstr "볼텍스 자체는 빠르게, 어둡게 움직였습니다. 하지만 그 소리는 느린 울림이었습니다. 신중한."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief
#. ALIAS: MS01_Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010AAA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Tevina_TL_CataclysmCommentary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "011003"
msgid "I can't explain it any other way. Like thunder rolling after the lightning. The power of the Great Serpent, unleashed."
msgstr "다른 말로는 설명할 수 없습니다. 번개가 친 후에 천둥이 치는 것처럼. 위대한 뱀의 힘이 풀려난 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "010E44"
msgid "Walking through places like this gets me in the mood for a blindfold and a cigarette."
msgstr "이런 곳을 거닐다 보면 눈가리개를 쓰고 담배 하나 꼬나물고 싶어지지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD0
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "010E43"
msgid "Need something out of my pack?"
msgstr "내 짐에서 가져갈 것이 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
