msgid "Don't try to carry everything yourself. We share in the burden."
msgstr "짐을 혼자 다 짊으려 하지 마. 같이 나누도록 하자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "010999"
msgid "Folks from Mars aren't the friendliest, but we're as loyal as they come."
msgstr "화성 사람들은 친근하지 않지는 몰라도, 충성심 하나는 끝내 주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7B
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Arrival_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "010998"
msgid "Great. Another planet where we have to breathe out of a can."
msgstr "대단하군. 산소통으로 숨을 쉬어야 하는 행성에 또 도착하다니."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A72
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_SpaceshipWeaponsRepaired
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipWeaponsRepaired
