#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ObserveCombatMain
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: ObserveCombat
msgctxt "0102E6"
msgid "Jinan protect us!"
msgstr "지난이여, 우릴 구하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericRobotModelA
#. TOPIC: 010D2472
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010D24E4
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToNormal
msgctxt "0102DE"
msgid "This area is free of the faithless. I am standing down."
msgstr "해당 지역에는 불신자가 없습니다. 탐색을 중지합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: By accident, do you mean the vortex?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00276E"
msgid "And when you played that song, I felt an emptiness swell over me. And I realized, she's never coming back."
msgstr "그리고 자네가 그 음악을 트니, 마음속에 허망감만 가득해졌네. 이제 내 손녀는 영영 돌아오지 못한단 걸 깨달은 게지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: You must keep the faith, and in doing so, the reward will come.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Oh your timing could not be better! We have a situation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010A8A8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00276D"
msgid "You see! All is not lost! My friend here may be just the person we need."
msgstr "보세요! 가망이 전혀 없는 건 아니네요! 여기 계신 이 친구분이야말로 아마 바로 우리에게 필요한 분일 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& ...  &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage! &&& Vassilis: A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case.|From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem. &&& Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was once a volunteer there, years ago, and was worried the cataclysm had taken it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010A8A8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00276C"
msgid "Why were you at this orphanage?"
msgstr "왜 그 고아원에 갔었던 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why were you at this orphanage?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why were you at this orphanage?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010A8A8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00276A"
msgid "I was once a volunteer there, years ago, and was worried the cataclysm had taken it."
msgstr "수년 전에 그곳에서 자원봉사를 한 적이 있어서, 대재난으로 사라졌을까 봐 걱정됐거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why were you at this orphanage?
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010A8A8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002769"
msgid "Never in my wildest dreams did I suspect it would be haunted!"
msgstr "유령이 들렸을 거라고는 꿈에도 상상하지 못했죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: A wayward soul? Surely we should not give such merciful terms to this... thing!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041105
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002768"
msgid "Given its history, it doesn't surprise me that a wayward soul would go back there, if they sought to be found."
msgstr "다만 고아원의 배경을 생각하면... 길 잃은 영혼이 누군가 찾아 주길 바라며 나타난다 해도 놀랍진 않죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: I took care of the phantom.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Yes, as am I. In fact, I think you deserve a reward for your efforts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002767"
msgid "But no matter! Your friend is a person of action and for that I am grateful."
msgstr "하지만 이젠 상관 없어요! 당신의 친구는 행동하는 사람이죠, 그 점에 감사해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Breanne
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: But what about yourself? Are you not trained in the Herald's arts?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002766"
msgid "But it is dangerous the further you step away from the city. We will need someone qualified to assist."
msgstr "하지만 도시에서 멀어질수록 위험합니다. 제대로 도와줄 수 있는 사람이 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Indeed. The city will be rebuilt in time. We are committed to this as a people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002765"
msgid "What matters is that you removed the phantom."
msgstr "중요한 건 당신이 유령을 없애주셨다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: You won't be bothered any further.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Yes, as am I. In fact, I think you deserve a reward for your efforts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002764"
msgid "You did introduce us, however. And for that, I am grateful."
msgstr "하지만 당신 덕분에 이렇게 서로 알게 됐잖아요. 그 점에 감사해요."

#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002763"
msgid "But what you speak of is akin to an exorcism, and we know little about how these phantoms exist in our world."
msgstr "게다가 당신이 말한 건 퇴마 의식 같은 건데, 우린 이 유령들이 우리 세계에 어떻게 존재하는지조차 잘 알지 못해요."

#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: By Jinan's word! Has the Great Serpent left us with nothing to defend ourselves? This is an ill omen indeed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002762"
msgid "Even a fully trained Herald may not be equipped to deal with this phenomenon."
msgstr "완벽하게 훈련받은 전령조차도 이 현상을 해결할 능력이 없을 수도 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Yes, as am I. In fact, I think you deserve a reward for your efforts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A72
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002761"
msgid "For now, I am simply grateful the matter is resolved."
msgstr "어쨌든 일이 해결돼서 정말 다행이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My knowledge and expertise are at your service. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.|You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why.|The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes. &&& SherineDubas: Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things. &&& AzadDubas: We began to see this phenomenon just after the accident in Dazra.|We're convinced these events are linked, but the exact nature of the connection remains a mystery.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An accurate assertion. This is where you come in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002760"
msgid "Sounds to me like you need more information."
msgstr "정보가 더 많이 필요하신 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: None at all. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Sherine, dear, would you tell our dauntless research assistant about the latest news? &&& SherineDubas: With pleasure. &&& SherineDubas: I hope you enjoyed your little jaunt into the field, because I'll be sending you right back out there.|Some of the local farmers and groat-herders have reported seeing unusual plant growth in the area.|What's more, none of this unusual growth was seen before the Dazra incident.|It's increasingly clear the event affected the ecosystem in some way, but the details elude us.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A change in appearance, at the very least.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00275E"
msgid "Unusual how, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 어떻게 이상하다는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00275D"
msgid "As such, we want to examine samples that come from several different locations."
msgstr "그래서, 우리는 여러 다른 장소에서 가져온 샘플을 조사하려고 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's nothing wrong with being enthusiastic about your field.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's nothing wrong with being enthusiastic about your field.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00275A"
msgid "Agreed. I've always felt sorry for those who can't find work they truly love."
msgstr "동의해요. 자신이 진정으로 좋아하는 일을 찾지 못하는 사람들이 참 안타깝죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Observe, analyze, hypothesize and prove. These are the tenets of the scientific method.|Without them, we're just fumbling in the dark. &&& SherineDubas: Yes, thank you dear. &&& SherineDubas: You'll have to forgive my husband; he's never fully recovered from his days as a teacher.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can, and indeed you should.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002759"
msgid "Can I use this tissue collector device on the plants?"
msgstr "식물에 이 조직 수집 장치를 사용해도 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Unusual how, exactly?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002758"
msgid "It would be difficult, and in fact, irresponsible, to leap to any conclusions."
msgstr "성급하게 어떤 결론을 내리는 건 곤란한 일이고, 정말로 무책임한 짓이겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Unusual how, exactly?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002757"
msgid "If I can get some samples under my microscope, we'll learn much more, I think."
msgstr "제 현미경으로 샘플을 좀 볼 수 있다면, 훨씬 더 많은 것을 알아낼 수 있을 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002755"
msgid "Ah! Our roving research assistant returns."
msgstr "아! 우리 떠돌이 연구 보조원이 돌아왔군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them. &&& SherineDubas: That's an interesting theory, but let's not jump to any conclusions just yet. &&& SherineDubas: Based on our information, these unusual new strains aren't limited to a specific area.|As such, we want to examine samples that come from several different locations.|In short, the more data you can provide, the better.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002754"
msgid "Observe, analyze, hypothesize and prove. These are the tenets of the scientific method."
msgstr "관찰하고, 분석하고, 가설을 세우고, 증명하십시오. 이것이 과학적 방법론의 원칙입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Yes, thank you dear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002753"
msgid "Without them, we're just fumbling in the dark."
msgstr "이런 방법론이 없으면, 우리는 그저 어둠 속에서 더듬거릴 수밖에 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Ah! Our roving research assistant returns.| I know we've asked you to travel far and wide. Hopefully it wasn't too much trouble.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good! It seems that things have been going smoothly so far.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002752"
msgid "It was no trouble at all."
msgstr "전혀 어럽지 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's simple, really. The plants are toxic and poisoning animals that eat them. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Observe, analyze, hypothesize and prove. These are the tenets of the scientific method.|Without them, we're just fumbling in the dark. &&& SherineDubas: Yes, thank you dear. &&& SherineDubas: You'll have to forgive my husband; he's never fully recovered from his days as a teacher.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Agreed. I've always felt sorry for those who can't find work they truly love.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002751"
msgid "There's nothing wrong with being enthusiastic about your field."
msgstr "자신의 분야에 열정을 갖는 건 잘못된 일이 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Then the mystery is solved.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002750"
msgid "Hardly! We've only scratched the surface."
msgstr "설마요! 이제 겨우 겉만 긁어냈을 뿐인걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Then the mystery is solved.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: The evidence suggests that some force is acting on the ecosystem, changing it somehow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274F"
msgid "We need to find out how and why this phenomenon is happening."
msgstr "우리는 어떻게, 그리고 왜 특이 현상이 일어나는지 알아내야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was no trouble at all. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: Here's the payment for those plant samples. &&& SherineDubas: I have good news. We've got a strong working theory about what's killing the local wildlife.|The tissue samples you collected point to poisoning as the likely cause of death. &&& SherineDubas: Your supposition about the plants becoming toxic might just bear fruit.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, I very much doubt anyone is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274E"
msgid "Why would someone poison the animals?"
msgstr "누가 왜 동물에게 독을 주입했을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would someone poison the animals?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274D"
msgid "There'd be no reason to do so. We depend on these creatures in more ways than one."
msgstr "독을 주입할 이유가 없는걸요. 우리는 여러모로 이 생물들에게 의존하고 있으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would someone poison the animals?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274C"
msgid "Also, the incidents are widespread and affecting multiple species."
msgstr "게다가, 특이 현상이 광범위하게 발생하고 있고 여러 종에 영향을 미치고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would someone poison the animals?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Then the mystery is solved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274B"
msgid "No, I'm convinced this is not the hand of man."
msgstr "아닐 거예요. 확실히 이건 인간의 소행이 아닌 거 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Yes, thank you dear.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To quote Seneca, a field, however fertile, can yield no fruit without cultivation, nor can the mind without education.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00274A"
msgid "You'll have to forgive my husband; he's never fully recovered from his days as a teacher."
msgstr "제 남편을 너그러이 봐주세요. 선생님 시절 습관을 완전히 버리지 못했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: With pleasure!
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002749"
msgid "To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite."
msgstr "지역 상태를 수집할 수 있게, 다기능 센서 제품을 설계했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002748"
msgid "The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation..."
msgstr "이 장치는 날씨, 기압, 방사능 데이터를 기록합니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Ah! Our roving research assistant returns.| I know we've asked you to travel far and wide. Hopefully it wasn't too much trouble.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just think of all the fresh air and exercise you're getting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002747"
msgid "How about a bonus to cover my travel costs?"
msgstr "여행 경비를 충당할 수 있게 보너스를 좀 더 주시면 안 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How about a bonus to cover my travel costs?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How about a bonus to cover my travel costs?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002746"
msgid "Just think of all the fresh air and exercise you're getting."
msgstr "상쾌한 공기를 마시며 운동할 수 있다는 것도 생각하셔야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How about a bonus to cover my travel costs?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: It was no trouble at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002745"
msgid "No amount of credits is worth more than that."
msgstr "크레딧이 얼마나 많든 운동보다 더 가치 있진 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& SherineDubas: Hardly! We've only scratched the surface.|We need to find out how and why this phenomenon is happening. &&& SherineDubas: The evidence suggests that some force is acting on the ecosystem, changing it somehow.|We don't yet have the complete picture, but there is one tool left to us. &&& SherineDubas: Would you care to explain, my dear?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002744"
msgid "With pleasure!"
msgstr "좋고 말고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: The evidence suggests that some force is acting on the ecosystem, changing it somehow.|We don't yet have the complete picture, but there is one tool left to us.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: With pleasure!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002743"
msgid "Would you care to explain, my dear?"
msgstr "설명해 주시겠어요? 여보?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: With pleasure! &&& AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002740"
msgid "That's quite a list."
msgstr "거 목록이 참 길군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was no trouble at all.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was no trouble at all.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273F"
msgid "Good! It seems that things have been going smoothly so far."
msgstr "좋아요! 지금까지는 일이 순조롭게 진행되고 있나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273E"
msgid "We placed several of these sensors throughout the area."
msgstr "저희는 이 지역 곳곳에 이런 센서 장치를 여러 개 배치했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can monitor all of that stuff with a single device? That's incredible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273D"
msgid "Each device can upload its data to a slate for comparison and analysis."
msgstr "각 장치에 기록된 데이터를 비교 및 분석하기 위해 슬레이트에 데이터를 전송할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can I use this tissue collector device on the plants?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I use this tissue collector device on the plants?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273C"
msgid "You can, and indeed you should."
msgstr "사용하셔도 되고, 실제로 사용하셔야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can I use this tissue collector device on the plants?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273B"
msgid "The storage tubes built into the device are sterilized and will keep the samples pure."
msgstr "장치에 내장된 보관 튜브는 멸균 처리되어 있으니 샘플을 순수하게 유지할 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& companion: Could we please move on? &&& AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course. &&& AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.|Each device can upload its data to a slate for comparison and analysis.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed. Let's hope our sensors can deliver on that promise. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00273A"
msgid "Sounds promising."
msgstr "기대되는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002739"
msgid "In the meantime, we'll see what we can learn about these unusual plant specimens."
msgstr "그동안, 저희는 이 특이한 식물 표본에서 뭔가 알아낼 게 있는지 찾아보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was no trouble at all. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: Here's the payment for those plant samples. &&& SherineDubas: I have good news. We've got a strong working theory about what's killing the local wildlife.|The tissue samples you collected point to poisoning as the likely cause of death. &&& SherineDubas: Your supposition about the plants becoming toxic might just bear fruit.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hardly! We've only scratched the surface.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002738"
msgid "Then the mystery is solved."
msgstr "그럼 수수께끼가 풀렸군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: It seems that you and my husband share an appreciation for scholarly thinking.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002737"
msgid "We'll get to work studying the animal tissue. Now go forth and travel safely."
msgstr "우리는 동물 조직 연구 작업에 착수할 거예요. 안녕히 가세요. 안전하게 다니시고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill. &&& Qisrani: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies... &&& Qisrani: But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself.|My name is Qisrani Dul'kehf. I work as an Executor for House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Members of House Dul'kehf who handle trade in and out of Dazra. We are part of the Ministry of Commerce, but our building was lost in the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026B0"
msgid "Executor?"
msgstr "실무관요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Executor?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Executor?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AF"
msgid "Members of House Dul'kehf who handle trade in and out of Dazra. We are part of the Ministry of Commerce, but our building was lost in the cataclysm."
msgstr "다즈라 대내외 교역 업무를 처리하는 둘케프 가문의 일원들이에요. 저희는 상무성의 일원이지만, 저희 건물은 대재난 때 사라졌죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: We are standing near the Halls of Obedience, a former courthouse. Criminals would be judged and sentenced there, in more peaceful times.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AE"
msgid "Can you tell me more about where we are?"
msgstr "저희가 있는 곳이 어떤 곳인지 좀 더 말해 주시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about where we are?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Now, in part thanks to you, it serves as the home for House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AD"
msgid "We are standing near the Halls of Obedience, a former courthouse. Criminals would be judged and sentenced there, in more peaceful times."
msgstr "저희는 옛 법원이었던 복종의 전당 근처에서 주재하고 있어요. 평화로운 시대에는 그곳에서 범죄자들이 재판을 받고 선고를 받았지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: We are standing near the Halls of Obedience, a former courthouse. Criminals would be judged and sentenced there, in more peaceful times.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: At the moment, it remains unoccupied. There is no time for trials. Sentences are carried out at the discretion of security.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AC"
msgid "Now, in part thanks to you, it serves as the home for House Va'ruun."
msgstr "이제는, 부분적으로 당신 덕분에, 바룬 가문의 본거지로 이용되고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Now, in part thanks to you, it serves as the home for House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010A820A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL08
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AB"
msgid "At the moment, it remains unoccupied. There is no time for trials. Sentences are carried out at the discretion of security."
msgstr "현재로서는 비어 있는 상태에요. 재판을 받을 시간이 없어요. 형량은 경비대원의 재량에 따라 결정될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe I had some questions for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe I had some questions for you.
#. ALIAS: Ochim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102E7C8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Ochim_Greeting_MoS
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026AA"
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr "관심 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. PROMPT: I don't care.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't care.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't think you'll like what I have to say.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010A7DE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026A9"
msgid "You approached me. If you are not a friend, then please leave me alone."
msgstr "당신이 나에게 접근했군요. 친구가 아니라면, 제발 저를 내버려 두세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shouted in shock/surprise / Shocked
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
