msgid "Serpent's Breath! It's the Vindicator!"
msgstr "뱀의 숨결이시여! 옹호자다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
