msgstr "뱀의 숨결이시여! 지지자다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation. &&& HailingShip: For the Shrouding will bless only true believers.|For now, we bid you farewell to spread the word further. The wind must carry the seed to create the garden.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You speak true. It was wrong for us to express doubt.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026A2"
msgid "Keep at it. If just one unbeliever is converted, you will have done the Great Serpent a service."
msgstr "계속 전파해라. 불신자가 한 명이라도 개종한다면, 위대한 뱀께 큰 공을 세우는 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Keep at it. If just one unbeliever is converted, you will have done the Great Serpent a service.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Keep at it. If just one unbeliever is converted, you will have done the Great Serpent a service.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026A1"
msgid "You speak true. It was wrong for us to express doubt."
msgstr "네 말이 맞다. 의심을 품은 것은 우리가 잘못했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Keep at it. If just one unbeliever is converted, you will have done the Great Serpent a service.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0026A0"
msgid "We will continue with our efforts so that all may have the chance to be among the Promised."
msgstr "약속받은 자들 사이에 설 기회를 모두가 가질 수 있도록 계속해서 노력하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You just showed up on my scanners and I was curious. &&& HailingShip: Then heed the words we spoke and spread it further. For the wind must carry the seed to create the garden.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed. We will try the word of Jinan, but if it fails, they will have only themselves to blame when the Shrouding comes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269F"
msgid "If they refuse the truth, they will be made dust."
msgstr "진실을 거부하는 자, 먼지가 되리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If they refuse the truth, they will be made dust.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If they refuse the truth, they will be made dust.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269E"
msgid "Indeed. We will try the word of Jinan, but if it fails, they will have only themselves to blame when the Shrouding comes."
msgstr "그렇고말고. 우린 지난의 말을 전하겠지만, 통하지 않는다면 장막의 날이 왔을 때 그 누구도 아닌 자신을 탓해야 할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I'm here to kill you heathens. &&& HailingShip: A false believer! Kill them!
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Right you are. We must remember that Jinan spent a lifetime in the instant of a grav jump to accumulate the gospel. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269D"
msgid "That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive."
msgstr "괜찮다. 모두가 호의적인 것은 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269C"
msgid "Right you are. We must remember that Jinan spent a lifetime in the instant of a grav jump to accumulate the gospel."
msgstr "맞는 말이다. 지난은 중력 도약을 하는 그 찰나의 순간에 평생을 바쳐 복음을 얻었음을 기억해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269B"
msgid "We must be willing to devote an equal amount of time to spread it."
msgstr "우리는 그것을 전파하는 데 그만큼의 시간을 기꺼이 할애해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00269A"
msgid "Your words have encouraged us to continue. When next we meet, I pray we will have converted more."
msgstr "그대의 말은 우리에게 계속 나아갈 용기를 주었다. 다음에 만날 때는 더 많은 이들을 개종시켰기를 기도하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To bleed? What do you mean by that? &&& HailingShip: One does not simply listen to the word of the Great Serpent. |One must be willing to die for it, absorb it into themselves, so that if they were cut open, Jinan's breath would exhale from the wound. |To bleed the gospel is to become it, for its chant to be your life essence.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then let us prove ourselves in battle!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002699"
msgid "[Attack] You clearly don't know what you're doing and must be punished."
msgstr "[공격] 자신이 무슨 짓을 하는지 모르는 모양이니, 벌을 받아야 마땅하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] You clearly don't know what you're doing and must be punished.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] You clearly don't know what you're doing and must be punished.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 010A7DC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002698"
msgid "Then let us prove ourselves in battle!"
msgstr "그렇다면 전장에서 실력을 겨뤄 보자!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002697"
msgid "We travel to teach the word of Jinan Va'ruun, for the new Speaker demands it of us."
msgstr "우리는 새로운 대변자의 명에 따라 지난 바룬의 말씀을 전파하기 위해 여행 중이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002696"
msgid "They have commanded us to drop the dagger and its dull blade in favor of the gospel."
msgstr "그분께선 무딘 칼날과 같은 단검 따위는 버리고 복음을 택하라고 명하셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002695"
msgid "It is our words, sharpened, that will carve our legacy."
msgstr "우리의 날카로운 말이 우리의 유산을 조각할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We travel to teach the word of Jinan Va'ruun, for the new Speaker demands it of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B529
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002694"
msgid "Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라 밖에서는 무슨 일로 여행 중인가?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010A7DD6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002693"
msgid "We have been canvassing the Settled Systems, spreading the gospel for many moons."
msgstr "우리는 수개월 동안 개척 성계를 누비며 복음을 전파해 왔다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010A7DD6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002692"
msgid "Yet Jinan's word has not been well received. It is shocking how many unbelievers hold tight to their own damnation."
msgstr "하지만 지난의 말씀은 잘 받아들여지지 않고 있다. 불신자들이 그들 자신의 파멸을 고집하는 모습은 가히 충격적이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002691"
msgid "It is our words, sharpened, that will carve our legacy."
msgstr "우리의 날카로운 말이 우리의 유산을 조각할 것이다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002690"
msgid "At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve."
msgstr "지금은 식량이 필요 없습니다. 그건 일시적인 방편일 뿐이니까요."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268F"
msgid "If we are to survive, we need to find somewhere to settle."
msgstr "우리가 살아남으려면 정착할 곳을 찾아야 합니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268E"
msgid "But at the moment, we are unsure of the best way forward."
msgstr "하지만 지금으로서는 어떤 길이 최선인지 확신이 서지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees! &&& HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.|But we are not like them! We are humble refugees, exiled from our home world.|In our group are civilians, with families, and children.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If not for the children, then please, for the sake of the sick and injured, we ask for your aid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268D"
msgid "That means nothing to me. I hate children."
msgstr "나랑은 상관없는 일이군. 난 아이는 질색이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That means nothing to me. I hate children.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That means nothing to me. I hate children.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268C"
msgid "If not for the children, then please, for the sake of the sick and injured, we ask for your aid."
msgstr "아이들이 아니더라도, 아프고 다친 사람들을 위해서라도 부디 저희를 도와주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees! &&& HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.|But we are not like them! We are humble refugees, exiled from our home world.|In our group are civilians, with families, and children.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Zealots would not resort to such tricks. They would unleash their weapons upon you in the name of Jinan.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268B"
msgid "That's exactly what a Zealot would say."
msgstr "그건 광신도들이나 할 법한 말이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees! &&& HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.|But we are not like them! We are humble refugees, exiled from our home world.|In our group are civilians, with families, and children.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00268A"
msgid "Perhaps I can be of some aid."
msgstr "제가 도움을 드릴 수 있을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's exactly what a Zealot would say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's exactly what a Zealot would say.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002689"
msgid "Zealots would not resort to such tricks. They would unleash their weapons upon you in the name of Jinan."
msgstr "광신도들은 그런 속임수를 쓰지 않습니다. 그들은 지난의 이름으로 당신에게 무기를 휘두를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's exactly what a Zealot would say.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002688"
msgid "We bear no arms. We come speaking the language of peace, in seek of aid."
msgstr "우리는 무기를 가지고 있지 않습니다. 우리는 평화의 언어로 구원을 찾아온 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees! &&& HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.|But we are not like them! We are humble refugees, exiled from our home world.|In our group are civilians, with families, and children.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002687"
msgid "I know. I'm the reason you had to leave Dazra."
msgstr "알고 있습니다. 제가 다즈라를 떠나야 했던 건 당신 때문입니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002686"
msgid "In our group are civilians, with families, and children."
msgstr "우리 일행 중에는 가족과 아이들이 있는 민간인들도 있습니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002685"
msgid "I do not know if they will be tolerant, but we will put our faith in your words. Thank you."
msgstr "그들이 관대할지는 모르겠지만, 당신의 말을 믿겠습니다. 감사합니다."

#. PROMPT: I know. I'm the reason you had to leave Dazra.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002684"
msgid "We know not what machinations could bring you to us now."
msgstr "무슨 음모로 우리에게 온 건지 모르겠군요."

#. PROMPT: I know. I'm the reason you had to leave Dazra.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002683"
msgid "But if destiny has deemed it, perhaps it is for a reason. We can offer something as tribute, but we are still in need ourselves."
msgstr "하지만 만약 운명이 그렇게 정한 것이라면, 그럴 만한 이유가 있겠지요. 조공으로 바칠 만한 것이 있지만, 우리도 여전히 부족한 상황입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps I can be of some aid.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 010A6C91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002682"
msgid "You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight."
msgstr "그 말을 들으니 정말 기쁩니다. 이 오랜 시간이 지나고 나서, 어떤 도움이라도 환영입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
