#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00266A"
msgid "I'm going to find a way to stop you."
msgstr "널 막을 방법을 찾아낼 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many times do I have to kill you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How many times do I have to kill you?
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0109FAA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002669"
msgid "You simply do not listen. How disappointing."
msgstr "아예 듣지를 않는구나. 실망스러운데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm going to find a way to stop you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to find a way to stop you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: This is turning into a most exhilarating exercise.
