msgid "I have already made it clear you cannot."
msgstr "못 막는다고 내가 분명히 말했다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: Do you not grow weary of this? I assure you, it will not end.
