msgid "How many times do I have to kill you?"
msgstr "널 몇 번이나 더 죽여야 하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: Do you not grow weary of this? I assure you, it will not end.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are the one with the power to change this, either by turning around... Or dying.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0109FA9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002666"
msgid "Let's just stop repeating this. There must be some arrangement we can come to."
msgstr "이 짓을 또 하지는 말자고. 분명히 서로 합의할 수 있는 방법이 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's just stop repeating this. There must be some arrangement we can come to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just stop repeating this. There must be some arrangement we can come to.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vedrasa: This is turning into a most exhilarating exercise.
