#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002665"
msgid "You are the one with the power to change this, either by turning around... Or dying."
msgstr "네게 이 상황을 바꿀 힘이 없다면, 그냥 돌아가라... 아니면 죽던가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: I have already made it clear you cannot. &&& Vedrasa: This is turning into a most exhilarating exercise. &&& Draqir: All this noise! Over one little trespasser? Let us be done with this already!
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Karija: House Va'ruun's return to greatness begins with the work done here, and until that time comes, we will keep it safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0109FA9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002664"
msgid "The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us."
msgstr "여기서 있었던 실험이 우리를 회복시키지. 우리가 견디는 이유는, 그렇게 명령받았기 때문이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Karija: The experiments here have ensured our resilience. We endure, because it has been ordered of us.
#. ALIAS: Karija
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFKarijaMaleen
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will take you down as many times as I need to. You're not stopping me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0109FA9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage710_KarijaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002663"
msgid "House Va'ruun's return to greatness begins with the work done here, and until that time comes, we will keep it safe."
msgstr "바룬 가문의 위대한 귀환은 여기서 있었던 일로부터 시작되며, 그 날이 올 때까지 우리는 이곳을 지킬 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: I am growing tired of this. A few months ago, I would have made you all regret treating me this way. 
