#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002658"
msgid "Leave, Orahim, you are not welcome here!"
msgstr "꺼져라, 오라힘. 넌 환영받지 못하니까!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: I am growing tired of this. A few months ago, I would have made you all regret treating me this way.  &&& Guard: Say that again.|Go on, then. Keep making your threats.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
