#. TOPIC: 0109B1BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_IntroQuest_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002657"
msgid "Save your bullets, damned fool. I am going."
msgstr "총알이나 아껴라. 멍청한 놈. 난 갈 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Leave, Orahim, you are not welcome here!
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: Say that again.
