#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002656"
msgid "I am growing tired of this. A few months ago, I would have made you all regret treating me this way."
msgstr "아 짜증나네. 몇 달 전 같았으면, 이렇게 대접했으면 절대 그냥 넘기지 않았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Orahim
