#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002655"
msgid "Say that again."
msgstr "다시 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Save your bullets, damned fool. I am going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02_IntroQuest
#. TOPIC: 0109B1BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_IntroQuest_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002654"
msgid "Go on, then. Keep making your threats."
msgstr "어디 쏴 봐. 계속 위협해 보라고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAD
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Sahima_Goodbye
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "002653"
msgid "Serpent's light guide the Promised."
msgstr "뱀의 빛이 약속받은 자들을 이끄신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002652"
msgid "Keep the word of Jinan in your heart and your nerves will always steel."
msgstr "지난 님의 말씀을 마음에 새기면 온 몸의 신경이 강철과 같아질 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount. &&& Hasmak: I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research. &&& Hasmak: I told Anasko where those materials had been sent. Weeks later... Well, you have seen the Citadel. You know as well as any where we are now.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No? A specific chain of events leading to rapid progress in the Citadel experiment?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010997A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002650"
msgid "I don't see a connection."
msgstr "무슨 관련이 있는지 모르겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see a connection.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see a connection.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Anasko returned from the site in unusually good spirits. He boasted of something called a "Vortex Interlock," and that it was the key to unlocking some new, unseen potential.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010997A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00264F"
msgid "No? A specific chain of events leading to rapid progress in the Citadel experiment?"
msgstr "그런가? 그 일련의 사건 덕분에 성채에서 진행된 실험이 그렇게 빠르게 진전됐는데도?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: So, I suggest you visit Ma'leen Dam, to the southeast. I believe it is more than it seems.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: And, should your search be fruitful, make sure it is known that House Dul'kehf was proud to serve when called upon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 010997A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00264E"
msgid "It is the only place to learn more about these Vortex Interlocks and what conenection they may have to the events at the Citadel."
msgstr "볼텍스 제어장치가 정확히 어떤 물건이고, 성채에서 일어난 사건과 무슨 연관이 있는지 알아볼 수 있는 곳은 거기뿐이라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot. &&& companion: I told you he would make it.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: The Citadel is gone, there is no sign of Anasko... You failed? You brought us no scrap of hope for the future?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099395
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00264B"
msgid "I cannot believe it."
msgstr "믿을 수가 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I cannot believe it.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm fine, thanks for asking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099394
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00264A"
msgid "The Citadel is gone, there is no sign of Anasko... You failed? You brought us no scrap of hope for the future?"
msgstr "성채는 사라지고, 아나스코 님의 흔적도 없고... 실패하신 겁니까? 미래에 대한 희망의 조각조차 없는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot. &&& companion: I told you he would make it. &&& Malibor: I cannot believe it. &&& Malibor: The Citadel is gone, there is no sign of Anasko... You failed? You brought us no scrap of hope for the future?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not wish to suggest that I do not care...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099393
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002649"
msgid "I'm fine, thanks for asking."
msgstr "난 괜찮아요. 물어봐줘서 고맙군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I almost didn't make it out myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I almost didn't make it out myself.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: No one standing in this room right now is "fortunate!" We have no Speaker, no Citadel! Where is Anasko?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099390
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002648"
msgid "Then I suppose you are fortunate."
msgstr "그럼 운이 좋으셨던 모양이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm fine, thanks for asking.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm fine, thanks for asking. &&& Malibor: I do not wish to suggest that I do not care...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109938D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002647"
msgid "I would do more than suggest! You are inconsequential compared to the Speaker! Why are you standing here instead of Anasko?"
msgstr "그거 말고도 할 말 많지! 당신은 대변자님에 비하면 하찮은 사람이요! 왜 아나스코 님 대신 당신이 여기 서 있단 말이오?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm fine, thanks for asking.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm fine, thanks for asking.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: I would do more than suggest! You are inconsequential compared to the Speaker! Why are you standing here instead of Anasko?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099392
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002646"
msgid "I do not wish to suggest that I do not care..."
msgstr "그게 문제가 아니라는 말은 하기 싫습니다만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There was nothing I could have done.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There was nothing I could have done.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You will have to explain yourself. Where is Anasko? Why is he not here with us?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109938E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002645"
msgid "You must understand that seems hard to believe."
msgstr "그 말을 믿기 어렵다는 점은 양해해 주시지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I almost didn't make it out myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I almost didn't make it out myself. &&& Malibor: Then I suppose you are fortunate.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko brought this on himself. He cared more about his experiment than all of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109938C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002644"
msgid "No one standing in this room right now is \"fortunate!\" We have no Speaker, no Citadel! Where is Anasko?"
msgstr "지금 여기 있는 사람 중에 '운 좋은' 사람은 없소! 대변자님도, 성채도 없다고! 아나스코 님은 어디 계신 거요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot. &&& companion: I told you he would make it. &&& Malibor: I cannot believe it. &&& Malibor: The Citadel is gone, there is no sign of Anasko... You failed? You brought us no scrap of hope for the future?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I suppose you are fortunate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099391
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002643"
msgid "I almost didn't make it out myself."
msgstr "나도 거의 못 빠져나올 뻔했다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There was nothing I could have done. &&& Malibor: You must understand that seems hard to believe. &&& Djimal: You will have to explain yourself. Where is Anasko? Why is he not here with us?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099383
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002642"
msgid "Anasko had lost his mind. There was no saving him."
msgstr "아나스코는 제정신이 아니었어요. 구할 방법이 없었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Slowly, slowly... You have been through a lot. &&& companion: I told you he would make it. &&& Malibor: I cannot believe it. &&& Malibor: The Citadel is gone, there is no sign of Anasko... You failed? You brought us no scrap of hope for the future?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You must understand that seems hard to believe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109938F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002641"
msgid "There was nothing I could have done."
msgstr "내가 할 수 있는 일이 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost. &&& Malibor:  &&& Lovek: Then truly, we are lost. Without Anasko, there is no Speaker. There is no way forward.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: You would dare speak of treason, heresy!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099380
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002640"
msgid "Perhaps. Or perhaps we acknowledge a simple truth: we are currently the government. We decide what happens from here."
msgstr "그럴지도요. 아니면 단순한 사실을 인정할 수도 있죠. 지금은 우리가 정부예요. 이제부터 어떻게 될지는 우리가 결정하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Then truly, we are lost. Without Anasko, there is no Speaker. There is no way forward. &&& Djimal: Perhaps. Or perhaps we acknowledge a simple truth: we are currently the government. We decide what happens from here.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I speak of survival!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109937E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263F"
msgid "You would dare speak of treason, heresy!"
msgstr "감히 반역과 이단을 운운하다니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I almost didn't make it out myself. &&& Malibor: Then I suppose you are fortunate. &&& Lovek: No one standing in this room right now is "fortunate!" We have no Speaker, no Citadel! Where is Anasko?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099385
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263E"
msgid "Anasko brought this on himself. He cared more about his experiment than all of you."
msgstr "아나스코가 자초한 일이에요. 여기 사람들보다 자기 실험을 더 소중하게 생각했다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: I speak of survival! &&& Malibor: Please, calm down, both of you.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: We, the three of us, are the High Council. All of House Va'ruun looks to us for guidance. We should provide it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109937B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263D"
msgid "This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action."
msgstr "진정하거나 가만히 앉아 있을 때가 아니에요. 행동해야 할 때라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Please, calm down, both of you. &&& Djimal: This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action. &&& Djimal: We, the three of us, are the High Council. All of House Va'ruun looks to us for guidance. We should provide it.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099377
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263C"
msgid "Anasko is the only one who can rule House Va'ruun."
msgstr "바룬 가문을 통치할 수 있는 사람은 아나스코 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There was nothing I could have done.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There was nothing I could have done. &&& Malibor: You must understand that seems hard to believe.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Anasko had lost his mind. There was no saving him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099388
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263B"
msgid "You will have to explain yourself. Where is Anasko? Why is he not here with us?"
msgstr "직접 설명해 줘야 할 거예요. 아나스코 님은 어디 계시죠? 왜 여기 없으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps. Or perhaps we acknowledge a simple truth: we are currently the government. We decide what happens from here. &&& Lovek: You would dare speak of treason, heresy!
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Please, calm down, both of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109937D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00263A"
msgid "I speak of survival!"
msgstr "생존을 말하는 거죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor:  &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Perhaps. Or perhaps we acknowledge a simple truth: we are currently the government. We decide what happens from here. &&& Lovek: You would dare speak of treason, heresy! &&& Djimal: I speak of survival!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109937C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002639"
msgid "Please, calm down, both of you."
msgstr "제발, 두 분 다 진정하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Please, calm down, both of you. &&& Djimal: This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action. &&& Djimal: We, the three of us, are the High Council. All of House Va'ruun looks to us for guidance. We should provide it.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099375
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002638"
msgid "You're going to need a new Speaker."
msgstr "새 대변자가 필요하겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost. &&& Malibor: 
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Perhaps. Or perhaps we acknowledge a simple truth: we are currently the government. We decide what happens from here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099381
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002637"
msgid "Then truly, we are lost. Without Anasko, there is no Speaker. There is no way forward."
msgstr "그럼 진정으로 길을 잃었군. 아나스코 님이 없으면 대변자도 없소. 나아갈 길이 없는 거요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: She's got a point.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109937A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002636"
msgid "We, the three of us, are the High Council. All of House Va'ruun looks to us for guidance. We should provide it."
msgstr "우리 세 명은 대의회라고요. 바룬 가문 전체가 우리의 인도를 바라고 있어요. 우리가 그 인도를 보여줘야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She's got a point.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Malibor, you cannot possibly be considering this madness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099373
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002635"
msgid "Yes, Djimal is right. We would have to name a new Speaker."
msgstr "네. 지말이 맞습니다. 새 대변자를 지명해야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm fine, thanks for asking. &&& Malibor: I do not wish to suggest that I do not care... &&& Lovek: I would do more than suggest! You are inconsequential compared to the Speaker! Why are you standing here instead of Anasko?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099387
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002634"
msgid "Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost."
msgstr "다즈라를 안전하게 지키려면 실험을 과부하시킬 수밖에 없었어요. 성채 안에 있는 게 전부 사라졌다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
