msgid "At least I am not the only one here who still sees reason!"
msgstr "적어도 제정신 차리고 있는 게 나만 있는 건 아니구만!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to need a new Speaker.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to need a new Speaker. &&& Malibor: 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
