msgid "Indeed we will. So we should name one, right now."
msgstr "당연히 그래야죠. 지금 바로 한 명을 정해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ensuring Dazra's safety meant overloading the experiment. Everything inside the Citadel was lost. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Please, calm down, both of you. &&& Djimal: This is not a time to be calm, or to sit idly by. This is a time for action. &&& Djimal: We, the three of us, are the High Council. All of House Va'ruun looks to us for guidance. We should provide it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099379
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002631"
msgid "She's got a point."
msgstr "일리가 있는 말이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. PROMPT: She's got a point.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Malibor, you cannot possibly be considering this madness.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: But Lovek, it can be. We can decide that, right here, right now. We can carve a path forward for House Va'ruun, or else we can sit by and watch all that we have built crumble around us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099364
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002630"
msgid "We do not have that kind of authority! It is not within our power!"
msgstr "우리에겐 그런 권한이 없소이다! 우리 능력이 아니란 말이오!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Lovek
#. PROMPT: Anasko is the only one who can rule House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor:  &&& Lovek: At least I am not the only one here who still sees reason!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: No, the Speaker is the only one to decide such things. It is not within our power!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109935D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00262F"
msgid "Anasko is not here, Lovek. And he will not be coming back. We must take action without him. Surely you can see that."
msgstr "아나스코 님은 여기 없으십니다, 로벡. 돌아오시지도 않을 거고요. 그분 없이 행동해야 합니다. 그건 분명 아시겠지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She's got a point.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's got a point. &&& Malibor:  &&& Malibor: Yes, Djimal is right. We would have to name a new Speaker.
