#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00262C"
msgid "But Lovek, it can be. We can decide that, right here, right now. We can carve a path forward for House Va'ruun, or else we can sit by and watch all that we have built crumble around us."
msgstr ""
"하지만 로벡. 할 수 있습니다. 지금 바로 여기서 결정할 수 있어요. 바룬 가문이 나아갈 길을 개척할 수도 있고, 가만히 앉아서 우리가 "
"쌓아 온 모든 것이 무너지는 걸 지켜볼 수도 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: We do not have that kind of authority! It is not within our power! &&& Malibor: But Lovek, it can be. We can decide that, right here, right now. We can carve a path forward for House Va'ruun, or else we can sit by and watch all that we have built crumble around us.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Then we let the Vindicator decide.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01099355
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00262B"
msgid "And what assurance do I have that the two of you are not just looking to usurp power for yourselves?"
msgstr "당신들 둘이서 권력을 찬탈하려는 속셈이 아니라고 내가 어찌 장담할 수 있겠소?"

