#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's got a point. &&& ...  &&& Lovek: And what assurance do I have that the two of you are not just looking to usurp power for yourselves? &&& Djimal: Then we let the Vindicator decide. &&& Djimal: And we have a Herald here as witness.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
