msgid "An amusing thought. But no. Try again."
msgstr "재미있는 생각이지만, 안 됩니다. 다시 말씀하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Lovek
#. PROMPT: Anasko is the only one who can rule House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: At least I am not the only one here who still sees reason! &&& Malibor: Anasko is not here, Lovek. And he will not be coming back. We must take action without him. Surely you can see that.
