msgstr "그럼 결정됐군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002615"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: What have you done? You have killed them all!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You pledged yourself to House Va'ruun, but you are like all the rest. Weak of will, short of sight. A betrayer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002613"
msgid "You think you can override the will of the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻을 거스를 수 있을 줄 알았느냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You think you can override the will of the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: And in the end, you have changed nothing. There will always be one more willing to serve, and once I have restored the Citadel I will find them and send them out into the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002612"
msgid "You pledged yourself to House Va'ruun, but you are like all the rest. Weak of will, short of sight. A betrayer."
msgstr "바룬 가문에 충성을 맹세한 주제에, 다른 놈들과 똑같구나. 의지가 약하고, 시야가 좁아. 배신자 놈."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You pledged yourself to House Va'ruun, but you are like all the rest. Weak of will, short of sight. A betrayer.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LC06_03_Announcer: Intruders det-*static* Main Level. Emergen-*static*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002611"
msgid "And in the end, you have changed nothing. There will always be one more willing to serve, and once I have restored the Citadel I will find them and send them out into the Settled Systems."
msgstr ""
"그리고, 넌 아무것도 바꾸지 못했어. 기꺼이 섬기려는 놈들은 앞으로도 얼마든지 있을 거고, 성채를 복구하고 나면 그런 놈들을 찾아서 개척 "
"성계로 보낼 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002610"
msgid "With all that has gone wrong, all we have sacrificed... I confess I had lost hope."
msgstr "모든 일이 잘못되고, 모든 것이 희생되었을 때... 난 솔직히 희망을 잃었었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: With all that has gone wrong, all we have sacrificed... I confess I had lost hope.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260F"
msgid "I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"나는 조부님께서 체험하신 위대한 뱀과의 교감과, 그분께서 바룬 가문을 창건하고 인도하는 막중한 책임을 지신 일에 대한 이야기를 들으며 "
"자랐느니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: We had lost our way, and I alone could not discern a path forward. I required the Great Serpent's guidance once more. So I set out to find Him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260E"
msgid "By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished."
msgstr ""
"허나 내가 대변자가 되어 그 책임을 상속받았을 때는, 너무나 많은 것들이 변해 버렸지. 자랑스러웠던 바룬 가문의 영광은 시들어 버렸다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Perhaps. But were that true, were He to judge me for it, I could accept that. It would have been worth it all the same.|Perhaps that judgement still awaits me, for thus far I have not seen His glory in person.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260D"
msgid "I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent."
msgstr ""
"알고보니 조부님께서도 비슷한 시도를 하셨더구나. 그분도 위대한 뱀께 추가적인 가르침을 구할 생각이 있으셨다는 걸 알고 나니 안심이 되었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: This Vortex, the place between places, and the energy it holds, could be harnessed. Refined. Directed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260C"
msgid "And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks."
msgstr ""
"그리고 시간이 지나면서, 위대한 뱀께서 진정 날 위해 길을 남겨 두셨다는 사실이 보이기 시작했느니라. 실험의 실패와 차질 사이에 숨겨 "
"두신 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: With all that has gone wrong, all we have sacrificed... I confess I had lost hope. &&& Anasko: I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun. &&& Anasko: By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished. &&& Anasko: We had lost our way, and I alone could not discern a path forward. I required the Great Serpent's guidance once more. So I set out to find Him.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If the fate of your entire people was in your hands, would you do any less?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260B"
msgid "All of this was just to contact the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "이 모든 일이 단지 위대한 뱀과 접촉하기 위해서였다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: None of this looks very directed to me right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: None of this looks very directed to me right now.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Utilizing the Vortex energy, we have learned that we can create powerful warriors, capable of teleporting vast distances in an instant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00260A"
msgid "But we are so close! We are on the precipice of greatness!"
msgstr "거의 다 왔단 말이다! 위대함의 끝자락에 와 있어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All of this was just to contact the Great Serpent?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All of this was just to contact the Great Serpent?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002609"
msgid "If the fate of your entire people was in your hands, would you do any less?"
msgstr "신민 전체의 운명이 네 손에 달려 있었다면, 너라고 달리 했을 것 같으냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002608"
msgid "Perhaps. But were that true, were He to judge me for it, I could accept that. It would have been worth it all the same."
msgstr "그럴지도. 허나 그게 사실이고 그분께서 날 심판하신다면, 난 받아들일 수 있느니라. 그만한 가치가 있을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002607"
msgid "Perhaps that judgement still awaits me, for thus far I have not seen His glory in person."
msgstr "그 심판이 날 기다리고 있는지도 모르지. 아직 그분의 영광을 직접 보지 못했으니 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You think your god intended for you to destroy your city.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You think your god intended for you to destroy your city.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Utilizing the Vortex energy, we have learned that we can create powerful warriors, capable of teleporting vast distances in an instant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002606"
msgid "No! An unfortunate consequence of simple beings grappling with divine power. A mistake that will not be repeated, I assure you."
msgstr "아니야! 단순한 존재가 신적인 힘을 다루려 하다 생긴 불행한 결과일 뿐이다. 다시는 반복되지 않을 실수라고 내 장담하마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It doesn't seem to have worked.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It doesn't seem to have worked.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002605"
msgid "At first I thought so too, and I despaired."
msgstr "처음에는 나도 그리 생각하고 절망했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see what this has to do with contacting the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see what this has to do with contacting the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Utilizing the Vortex energy, we have learned that we can create powerful warriors, capable of teleporting vast distances in an instant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002604"
msgid "How can you not see? In reaching for Him, He has shown us the way!"
msgstr "어찌 보지 못하느냐? 그분께 손을 뻗으면, 그분께서 길을 보여 주시거늘!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Excellent. It is done.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LC06_03_Announcer: Intruders det-*static* Main Level. Emergen-*static*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage570_ActivatedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002603"
msgid "This is but the first wave. Once we have restored the Citadel, we will have the knowledge and power to send out hundreds, thousands more."
msgstr "이건 첫 번째 물결일 뿐이야. 성채를 복구하고 나면 수백, 수천을 더 내보낼 수 있는 지식과 힘을 갖게 될 것이니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent. &&& Anasko: And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks. &&& Anasko: This Vortex, the place between places, and the energy it holds, could be harnessed. Refined. Directed.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But we are so close! We are on the precipice of greatness!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002602"
msgid "None of this looks very directed to me right now."
msgstr "지금은 명확해 보이는 게 하나도 없는 것 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent. &&& Anasko: And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks. &&& Anasko: This Vortex, the place between places, and the energy it holds, could be harnessed. Refined. Directed.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No! An unfortunate consequence of simple beings grappling with divine power. A mistake that will not be repeated, I assure you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002601"
msgid "You think your god intended for you to destroy your city."
msgstr "본인이 믿는 신이 도시를 파괴할 의도였다고 생각하는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: With all that has gone wrong, all we have sacrificed... I confess I had lost hope. &&& Anasko: I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun. &&& Anasko: By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished. &&& Anasko: We had lost our way, and I alone could not discern a path forward. I required the Great Serpent's guidance once more. So I set out to find Him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps. But were that true, were He to judge me for it, I could accept that. It would have been worth it all the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002600"
msgid "It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀에게 대면을 요구할 수 있다고 생각했다니, 약간 오만하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You see it too, then. Yes, I believe that is so.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A7B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025FF"
msgid "Utilizing the Vortex energy, we have learned that we can create powerful warriors, capable of teleporting vast distances in an instant."
msgstr "우리는 볼텍스 에너지를 활용해서 강력한 전사를 만들 수 있다는 사실을 알아냈느니라. 아주 먼 거리를 순식간에 이동할 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: With all that has gone wrong, all we have sacrificed... I confess I had lost hope. &&& Anasko: I grew up hearing stories of my grandfather's communion with the Great Serpent, the immense responsibility he was given to create and guide House Va'ruun. &&& Anasko: By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished. &&& Anasko: We had lost our way, and I alone could not discern a path forward. I required the Great Serpent's guidance once more. So I set out to find Him.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At first I thought so too, and I despaired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025FE"
msgid "It doesn't seem to have worked."
msgstr "일이 잘 풀리진 않은 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I learned that my grandfather had attempted something similar. I found reassurance in that idea that he, too, sought additional instruction from the Serpent. &&& Anasko: And over time, I began to see that the Great Serpent had indeed left a path for me, hidden amongst the experimental failures and setbacks. &&& Anasko: This Vortex, the place between places, and the energy it holds, could be harnessed. Refined. Directed.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How can you not see? In reaching for Him, He has shown us the way!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025FD"
msgid "I don't see what this has to do with contacting the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이게 위대한 뱀과 접촉하는 일이랑 무슨 관련이 있다는 건지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: By the time I became Speaker and inherited that responsibility, so much had changed. The once proud glory of House Va'ruun was diminished.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's a little arrogant to think you could just demand an audience with the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01097A8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage551_AnaskoInPodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025FC"
msgid "We had lost our way, and I alone could not discern a path forward. I required the Great Serpent's guidance once more. So I set out to find Him."
msgstr ""
"우리는 길을 잃었고, 나 혼자서는 앞으로 나아갈 길을 찾을 수 없었느니라. 위대한 뱀의 인도가 한번 더 필요했지. 그래서 그분을 찾아 "
"나섰다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
