#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I only ever wanted to help. To improve, to elevate House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010977A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025ED"
msgid "You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it."
msgstr "내 말을 믿어다오. 이럴 뜻은 없었느니라. 그 모든 연구와 계산 결과를 보니... 제어할 수 있다고 생각했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can ask for forgiveness once we get out of here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010977A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025EC"
msgid "I only ever wanted to help. To improve, to elevate House Va'ruun."
msgstr "난 돕고 싶었을 뿐이다. 바룬 가문을 발전시키고, 위상을 높이고 싶었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Most of the city is gone. &&& Anasko: I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true. &&& Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it. &&& Anasko: I only ever wanted to help. To improve, to elevate House Va'ruun.
