msgid "You can ask for forgiveness once we get out of here."
msgstr "용서는 여기서 빠져나간 다음에도 구할 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can ask for forgiveness once we get out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can ask for forgiveness once we get out of here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The chain reaction that started... It is self-sustaining. We tried everything. We had hoped we could complete the experiment, but then the Vortex Interlock burned out...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010977A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025EA"
msgid "You do not understand. We cannot simply leave."
msgstr "이해를 못 하는구나. 그냥 떠날 수는 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Most of the city is gone. &&& Anasko: I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true. &&& Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it. &&& Anasko: I only ever wanted to help. To improve, to elevate House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Shut it down? No, we cannot do that...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010977A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E9"
msgid "Let's just focus on shutting this whole thing down."
msgstr "이걸 완전히 꺼 버리는 일에나 집중하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's just focus on shutting this whole thing down.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just focus on shutting this whole thing down.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The chain reaction that started... It is self-sustaining. We tried everything. We had hoped we could complete the experiment, but then the Vortex Interlock burned out...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010977A0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E8"
msgid "Shut it down? No, we cannot do that..."
msgstr "꺼 버린다고? 아니, 그렇겐 안 되지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Most of the city is gone. &&& Anasko: I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true. &&& Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it. &&& Anasko: I only ever wanted to help. To improve, to elevate House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would like nothing more, but I'm afraid it is not that simple.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109779F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E7"
msgid "Everyone knows you meant well. But we've got to get you out of here."
msgstr "다들 좋은 뜻이었다는 거 알고 있어요. 일단 여기서 빠져나가죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Everyone knows you meant well. But we've got to get you out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Everyone knows you meant well. But we've got to get you out of here.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The chain reaction that started... It is self-sustaining. We tried everything. We had hoped we could complete the experiment, but then the Vortex Interlock burned out...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109779E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E6"
msgid "I would like nothing more, but I'm afraid it is not that simple."
msgstr "더 이상 바랄 건 없지만, 안타깝게도 그리 간단한 일이 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You do not understand. We cannot simply leave.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You... You have one, don't you? I can feel the power from here. Then the Serpent truly has sent you to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109779D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E5"
msgid "The chain reaction that started... It is self-sustaining. We tried everything. We had hoped we could complete the experiment, but then the Vortex Interlock burned out..."
msgstr ""
"연쇄 반응이 시작되었는데... 자력으로 유지되고 있느니라. 모든 시도를 다 해 봤지. 실험을 완료할 수 있길 바랐지만, 볼텍스 제어장치가 "
"타 버리는 바람에..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The chain reaction that started... It is self-sustaining. We tried everything. We had hoped we could complete the experiment, but then the Vortex Interlock burned out...
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I wish I could guarantee your safety, but... I am graced by the Serpent, and have retained my faculties. So many of my people were not as fortunate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0109779C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E4"
msgid "You... You have one, don't you? I can feel the power from here. Then the Serpent truly has sent you to us."
msgstr "너... 네가 하나 가져왔구나, 그렇지? 장치의 힘이 느껴진다. 진정 위대한 뱀께서 널 보내주신 게로구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disbelief / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Most of the city is gone.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Most of the city is gone.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E3"
msgid "I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true."
msgstr "내가 본 것이 끔찍한 악몽이었을 뿐이길 바랐거늘. 허나... 사실이라는 것도 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Whatever you did here has ruined everything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever you did here has ruined everything.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E2"
msgid "I saw things. Figments of guilt, I had hoped. But in my heart I knew them to be reality."
msgstr "나도 봤다. 죄책감에서 비롯된 환상이길 바랐거늘. 허나 내심으로는 현실이라는 걸 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Overpopulation won't be a problem for a long time. Maybe ever.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Overpopulation won't be a problem for a long time. Maybe ever.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E1"
msgid "You would make light of such a terrible thing? I can find no humor in this."
msgstr "그런 끔찍한 일을 어찌 가벼이 여기느냐? 이건 웃을 일이 아니니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry about it right now. We need to focus on getting you out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry about it right now. We need to focus on getting you out of here.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You must believe me. We meant none of this. All of the research, the calculations... We thought we could contain it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025E0"
msgid "Your loyalty is noted, and indeed appreciated. I cannot help but mourn all that we have lost. All that I have caused."
msgstr "훌륭한 충심이로구나. 진심으로 고맙다. 우리가 잃은 모든 것을 애도하지 않을 수 없구나. 내가 초래한 모든 것을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025C1"
msgid "That is some ship you have there!"
msgstr "당신이 가진 우주선, 대단하군요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm surprised you have experience working with ships manufactured in the Settled Systems. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025C0"
msgid "It has been too long since I've tinkered with a ship from the Settled Systems."
msgstr "개척 성계에서 온 우주선을 만지작거린 지 너무 오래되었네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraDumarHasadi: That is some ship you have there! |It has been too long since I've tinkered with a ship from the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I had a... privileged upbringing that allowed me to hone my skills on all sorts of different ships. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BF"
msgid "I'm surprised you have experience working with ships manufactured in the Settled Systems."
msgstr "개척 성계에서 제조된 우주선 작업 경험이 있으시다니 놀랍군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hopefully the technology isn't too complicated for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hopefully the technology isn't too complicated for you.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraDumarHasadi: So, if you need anything for your ship, just let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BE"
msgid "*Pffft* Nothing is too complicated for me. I have been working with ships since I was old enough to hold a wrench."
msgstr ""
"*피식하는 소리* 저에게 너무 복잡한 것은 없습니다. 저는 렌치를 쥘 수 있을 만큼 나이를 먹었을 때부터 우주선을 만지작거려 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm surprised you have experience working with ships manufactured in the Settled Systems. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm surprised you have experience working with ships manufactured in the Settled Systems. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraDumarHasadi: So, if you need anything for your ship, just let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BD"
msgid "Well, I had a... privileged upbringing that allowed me to hone my skills on all sorts of different ships."
msgstr "음, 저는... 특권적인 성장 환경 덕분에 모든 종류의 다양한 우주선에서 제 기술을 연마할 수 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraDumarHasadi: That is some ship you have there! |It has been too long since I've tinkered with a ship from the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Pffft* Nothing is too complicated for me. I have been working with ships since I was old enough to hold a wrench. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DFB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BC"
msgid "Hopefully the technology isn't too complicated for you."
msgstr "이 기술이 당신에게 너무 복잡하지 않았으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraDumarHasadi: Well, I had a... privileged upbringing that allowed me to hone my skills on all sorts of different ships. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BB"
msgid "So, if you need anything for your ship, just let me know."
msgstr "그러니, 당신의 우주선에 필요한 것이 있으면, 제게 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraDumarHasadi: Hmm, about that... 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025BA"
msgid "How are you so knowledgeable about ships from the Settled Systems?"
msgstr "개척 성계의 우주선에 대해 어떻게 그렇게 잘 아시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraDumarHasadi: I have no idea. It has happened before, but well before my time. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_PlayerArrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B9"
msgid "When was the last time an outsider stepped foot in Dazra?"
msgstr "마지막으로 이방인이 다즈라에 발을 디딘 게 언제였나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When was the last time an outsider stepped foot in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_PlayerArrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B8"
msgid "I have no idea. It has happened before, but well before my time."
msgstr "모르겠네요. 전에도 그런 일이 있었지만, 제가 태어나기 훨씬 전의 일입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_PlayerArrival
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B7"
msgid "Your arrival here was shocking to say the least."
msgstr "당신이 이곳에 온 것은 충격 그 자체였습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you so knowledgeable about ships from the Settled Systems? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B6"
msgid "Hmm, about that..."
msgstr "흠, 그 점에 대해서 말인데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B5"
msgid "My father was a technician far outside of Dazra. Growing up, I would help him repair or strip all of the ships that were being delivered to him. Delivered by Zealots."
msgstr ""
"제 아버지는 다즈라에서 멀리 떨어진 곳에서 기술자로 일하셨습니다. 저는 자라면서, 광신도들이 보내는 우주선을 모두 아버지가 수리하거나 "
"해체하는 것을 돕곤 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B4"
msgid "The ships were incredible. Deimos, Stroud-Eklund, even HopeTech. It was so exciting to work on them. But, now I just feel dirty, knowing where those ships came from, what had to be done to acquire them."
msgstr ""
"그 우주선들은 놀라웠습니다. 데이모스, 스트라우드 에클룬드, 심지어 호프테크까지. 그것들을 작업하는 것은 정말 신나는 일이었습니다. "
"하지만, 이제 그 우주선들이 어디서 왔는지, 그것들을 얻기 위해 무슨 짓을 해야 했는지 알고 나니 그저 더럽게 느껴질 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That must have been a hard choice to make. I'm glad it worked out for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_Upbringing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B3"
msgid "When I grew older, I came to my senses, grew a conscience, and abandoned my father. I thank the Great Serpent that I managed to avoid that life."
msgstr "저는 나이가 들면서, 제정신을 차리고, 양심을 갖게 되었고, 아버지를 버렸습니다. 그 삶을 피할 수 있었던 것에 대해 위대한 뱀께 감사드립니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOmanLabir: This is the aid tent where we treat those from the refugee camp. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_AidTent
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B2"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "여긴 어디죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is this place?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_AidTent
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B1"
msgid "This is the aid tent where we treat those from the refugee camp."
msgstr "여기는 난민촌에서 온 사람들을 치료하는 지원 텐트입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_AidTent
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025B0"
msgid "So many people have lost their homes, and the Halls of Healing can only hold so much."
msgstr "이렇게 많은 사람들이 집을 잃었는데, 회복의 전당이 수용할 수 있는 인원은 한계가 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AF"
msgid "Well, look who it is! Dazra's very own guest of honor."
msgstr "어머, 이게 누구야! 다즈라의 귀빈이시네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You have my attention.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AE"
msgid "You must have friends in high places, as I have been authorized to trade with you. I have some impressive firepower on offer."
msgstr "높은 자리에 있는 친구들이 있나 보군요. 저에게 당신과 거래할 권한을 주셨거든요. 꽤나 인상적인 화력을 제공해 드릴 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: Well, look who it is! Dazra's very own guest of honor. |You must have friends in high places, as I have been authorized to trade with you. I have some impressive firepower on offer.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course I do. Now, what are you buying?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AD"
msgid "You have my attention."
msgstr "흥미롭군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You have my attention.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You have my attention.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AC"
msgid "Of course I do. Now, what are you buying?"
msgstr "물론이죠. 자, 뭘 사시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: No, and thank the Great Serpent for that! Unlike them, I actually have chances to shoot my guns. What kind of supplier would I be if I do not test the merchandise? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Soldier
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AB"
msgid "Are you a soldier?"
msgstr "당신 군인인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you a soldier?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Soldier
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025AA"
msgid "No, and thank the Great Serpent for that! Unlike them, I actually have chances to shoot my guns. What kind of supplier would I be if I do not test the merchandise?"
msgstr "아뇨, 그리고 그 점에 대해선 위대한 뱀께 감사드려요! 그들과는 달리, 저는 실제로 총을 쏠 기회가 있거든요. 물건을 테스트도 안 해보고 어떻게 장사를 하겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: Well, look who it is! Dazra's very own guest of honor. |You must have friends in high places, as I have been authorized to trade with you. I have some impressive firepower on offer.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ha! My darling, do you really have to ask?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A9"
msgid "Are your weapons better than elsewhere in Dazra?"
msgstr "당신의 무기가 다즈라의 다른 곳보다 더 낫나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are your weapons better than elsewhere in Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are your weapons better than elsewhere in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A8"
msgid "Ha! My darling, do you really have to ask?"
msgstr "하! 손님, 그걸 말이라고 하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are your weapons better than elsewhere in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMarlanaVolav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMarlanaVolav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMarlanaVolav: You have my attention.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MarlanaVolav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A7"
msgid "Until now, these weapons have only been authorized for use by military personnel. You have the honor of breaking that convention."
msgstr "지금까지 이 무기들은 군인들만 사용할 수 있도록 허가되었습니다. 당신은 그 관례를 깨는 영광을 누리게 된 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem concerned.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Concerned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A6"
msgid "I am."
msgstr "저요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Concerned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A5"
msgid "I lost my job at the cultural center. Or more accurately, the cultural center is lost - it does not even exist anymore."
msgstr "문화원에서 일자리를 잃었어요. 더 정확히 말하자면, 문화원이 사라졌죠. 이제 더 이상 존재하지도 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Concerned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A4"
msgid "My livelihood is gone, my credits are dwindling, and I do not know what is going to happen to me. The uncertainty is driving me mad."
msgstr "생계 수단은 사라졌고, 크레딧은 줄어들고 있고, 앞으로 어떻게 될지 모르겠어요. 불확실성이 저를 미치게 만들고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You worked at the cultural center? What was that like?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CulturalCenter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A3"
msgid "It was wonderful while it lasted. The job was stable, good pay, and enjoyable. I always looked forward to the yearly trip the schoolchildren would make to the cultural center."
msgstr "있는 동안은 정말 좋았어요. 안정적이고, 보수도 좋고, 즐거운 일이었죠. 매년 학생들이 문화원으로 견학 오는 걸 항상 고대했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CulturalCenter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A2"
msgid "I was one of the managers, so I was in charge of cataloguing artifacts and creating displays. Most of the center was dedicated to Jinan Va'ruun and the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "저는 관리자 중 한 명이었기 때문에 유물을 분류하고 전시를 기획하는 일을 담당했어요. 문화원의 대부분은 지난 바룬과 뱀의 성전에 바쳐졌죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CulturalCenter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A1"
msgid "I do not necessarily agree with some of the content that was on display, but regardless, it is a shame that so much history is now lost to time."
msgstr "전시된 내용 중 일부에는 동의하지 않지만, 그럼에도 불구하고 그렇게 많은 역사가 시간 속으로 사라졌다는 건 유감스러운 일이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraZamiraValik: It was wonderful while it lasted. The job was stable, good pay, and enjoyable. I always looked forward to the yearly trip the schoolchildren would make to the cultural center.   
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CulturalCenter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0025A0"
msgid "You worked at the cultural center? What was that like?"
msgstr "문화원에서 일하셨다고요? 어땠나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraZamiraValik: This used to be the neighborhood where most of us common folk lived. Not much of a neighborhood any longer, seeing as there are only a few houses left. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CommonerNeighborhood
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00259F"
msgid "What area of the city is this?"
msgstr "여긴 도시의 어느 구역인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraZamiraValik: I am.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_Concerned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00259E"
msgid "You seem concerned."
msgstr "걱정이 많아 보이시네요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraNaladaBradi: My mother taught me to try and provide a smiling, friendly face for my customers, but it's been incredibly difficult.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_HighSpirits
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00259D"
msgid "It must be tough to run a business in the midst of all this chaos."
msgstr "이 모든 혼란 속에서 사업을 운영하는 건 꽤나 힘들겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What area of the city is this? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CommonerNeighborhood
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00259C"
msgid "This used to be the neighborhood where most of us common folk lived. Not much of a neighborhood any longer, seeing as there are only a few houses left."
msgstr "여긴 우리 같은 평민들이 주로 살던 동네였어요. 이제는 집이 몇 채 남지 않아서 동네라고 하기도 어렵지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraZamiraValik
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01090DE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_ZamiraValik_CommonerNeighborhood
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00259B"
msgid "That being said, almost all of the noble housing that was closer to the Scaled Citadel is gone as well. The vortex has spared no one."
msgstr "그렇긴 해도, 비늘 성채 근처에 있던 귀족들의 집도 거의 다 사라졌어요. 볼텍스는 아무도 봐주지 않았죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFZamiraValik
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_ZamiraValik_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002599"
msgid "*Sigh* Get a hold of yourself, Zamira. You'll be fine."
msgstr "*한숨* 정신 차려, 자미라. 괜찮을 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericChildren_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002598"
msgid "Hi."
msgstr "안녕."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002597"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Deflated, but morale really has no place in the Halls of Healing.    
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD65
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Morale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00255A"
msgid "How is morale over here?"
msgstr "사기가 어떤가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is morale over here?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Morale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002559"
msgid "Deflated, but morale really has no place in the Halls of Healing."
msgstr "떨어졌지만, 회복의 전당에서는 사기 같은 건 별로 중요하지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Morale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002558"
msgid "My healers are exhausted, frustrated, hungry, even scared, yet they carry on. It is what is expected of us all - we suffer so others may survive."
msgstr "우리 치료사들은 지치고, 좌절하고, 배고프고, 심지어 두려움에 떨고 있지만, 그럼에도 계속 일하고 있어요. 그게 우리 모두에게 기대되는 일이니까요. 다른 사람들이 살아남을 수 있도록 우리는 고통받는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: I had little choice in the matter, as everyone in my family has been in this profession. As soon as I came of working age, my father would set me beside him and have me aid his procedures. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002557"
msgid "How did you become a healer?"
msgstr "어떻게 치료사가 되셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: I am unsure. I think about that at times - did I become a healer just to appease my father? Should I have pushed back and traveled another path in life? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Profession02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002556"
msgid "Do you ever wish you went into a different profession?"
msgstr "다른 직업을 선택했으면 좋았을 거라고 생각한 적이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002555"
msgid "I'd like to take a look at what you're selling."
msgstr "파시는 물건 좀 볼게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you ever wish you went into a different profession?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Profession02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002554"
msgid "I am unsure. I think about that at times - did I become a healer just to appease my father? Should I have pushed back and traveled another path in life?"
msgstr "잘 모르겠어요. 가끔 그런 생각을 해요. 단지 아버지를 기쁘게 해드리려고 치료사가 된 건 아닐까? 반항하고 다른 길을 갔어야 했을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: snapping out of it, taking on a more professional tone / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD60
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Profession02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002553"
msgid "Well, I must stop ruminating. This type of talk is inappropriate around patients."
msgstr "음, 이제 그만 생각해야겠어요. 이런 이야기는 환자들 앞에서 하기에 적절하지 않으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a healer?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD62
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002552"
msgid "I had little choice in the matter, as everyone in my family has been in this profession. As soon as I came of working age, my father would set me beside him and have me aid his procedures."
msgstr "우리 가족은 모두 이 직업에 종사했기 때문에 저에게는 선택의 여지가 별로 없었어요. 제가 일할 수 있는 나이가 되자마자, 아버지는 저를 옆에 앉혀두고 당신의 치료를 돕게 하셨죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002551"
msgid "Aha, it's you! Welcome, welcome!"
msgstr "아, 당신이군요! 어서 오세요, 어서 오세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This seems like my kind of place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002550"
msgid "If you are looking to stave off hunger, you will find no better place. We serve high-quality groat, freshly slaughtered."
msgstr "허기를 달래고 싶다면, 여기보다 더 좋은 곳은 없을 거예요. 갓 도축한 최상급 그로트를 제공하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Aha, it's you! Welcome, welcome!|If you are looking to stave off hunger, you will find no better place. We serve high-quality groat, freshly slaughtered. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This seems like your kind of place? Ha! Yes, friend, this is THE place! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00254C"
msgid "This seems like my kind of place."
msgstr "여긴 저한테 딱 맞는 곳 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to take a look at what you're selling.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD5E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Sale
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00254B"
msgid "Of course! Of course!"
msgstr "물론이죠! 물론이죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: making sure he heard correctly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This seems like my kind of place.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This seems like my kind of place.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Now, just enjoy yourself. If you need something, holler.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD59
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00254A"
msgid "This seems like your kind of place? Ha! Yes, friend, this is THE place!"
msgstr "여기가 당신한테 딱 맞는 곳 같다고요? 하! 그럼요, 친구, 여기가 바로 그곳입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraKresoAbbas: This seems like your kind of place? Ha! Yes, friend, this is THE place! 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002549"
msgid "Now, just enjoy yourself. If you need something, holler."
msgstr "자, 그냥 즐기세요. 필요한 게 있으면, 부르세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002548"
msgid "And I do mean holler!"
msgstr "정말로 불러야 해요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Aha, it's you! Welcome, welcome!|If you are looking to stave off hunger, you will find no better place. We serve high-quality groat, freshly slaughtered. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This will have to do? Oh, come now, you act as if it is torture to eat fresh meat! Ha! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002547"
msgid "Well, it's not like there are many other options in Dazra, so this will have to do."
msgstr "뭐, 다즈라에 다른 선택지가 많은 것도 아니니까, 이걸로 만족해야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: making sure he heard correctly / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, it's not like there are many other options in Dazra, so this will have to do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, it's not like there are many other options in Dazra, so this will have to do.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Now, just enjoy yourself. If you need something, holler.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002546"
msgid "This will have to do? Oh, come now, you act as if it is torture to eat fresh meat! Ha!"
msgstr "이걸로 만족해야 한다고요? 오, 이봐요, 지금 신선한 고기를 먹는 게 고문이라도 되는 것처럼 말하네요! 하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Huh, how long has it been? Maybe forty-five years? Oh, it is painful to say that, ha!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_AboutYourself
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002545"
msgid "How long have you worked here?"
msgstr "여기서 일하신 지 얼마나 되셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraKresoAbbas: Our food supply? We are holding on. The groat farmers have been working tirelessly to make sure there are no major disruptions. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_FoodSupply
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002544"
msgid "How has the vortex affected your food supply?"
msgstr "볼텍스가 식량 공급에 어떤 영향을 미쳤나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: when he says "our food supply" he is repeating to make sure he is hearing correctly.  / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How has the vortex affected your food supply? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_FoodSupply
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002543"
msgid "Our food supply? We are holding on. The groat farmers have been working tirelessly to make sure there are no major disruptions."
msgstr "우리 식량 공급이요? 버티고 있어요. 그로트 농부들이 큰 차질이 없도록 끊임없이 일하고 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_FoodSupply
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002542"
msgid "I am unsure how long that can realistically continue, but I trust in the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그게 현실적으로 얼마나 오래 지속될 수 있을지는 모르겠지만, 저는 위대한 뱀을 믿습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long have you worked here?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_AboutYourself
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002541"
msgid "Huh, how long has it been? Maybe forty-five years? Oh, it is painful to say that, ha!"
msgstr "어, 얼마나 됐더라? 한 45년쯤? 오, 그렇게 말하니까 고통스럽네요, 하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_AboutYourself
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002540"
msgid "I remember the day my younger brother and I began our first shift in the slaughterhouse. He barely knew how to handle a knife! Some years later though, he was practically running the place."
msgstr "제 남동생과 제가 도축장에서 처음 교대 근무를 시작하던 날이 기억나네요. 동생은 칼 다루는 법도 거의 몰랐어요! 하지만 몇 년 후에는, 그 녀석이 거의 도축장을 운영하다시피 했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraKresoAbbas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_KresoAbbas_AboutYourself
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253F"
msgid "He passed some time ago, but the Meat House still holds so many wonderful memories of him. I am so thankful that the Great Serpent saw fit to spare this place."
msgstr "동생은 얼마 전에 세상을 떠났지만, 훈제소는 여전히 그 녀석에 대한 수많은 아름다운 추억을 간직하고 있어요. 위대한 뱀께서 이 곳을 지켜주신 것에 정말 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default, HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: What can I say about my Mira? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253E"
msgid "Tell me about your wife."
msgstr "당신의 아내에 대해 말해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your wife. &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: What can I say about my Mira? |She was always talking. She could go on and on about anything - a book she read, a dream she had, our future together. She had a low, soft voice, but the world is so much quieter without it. |And Great Serpent, she was beautiful as the stars. She was self-conscious, though, but she had no reason to be. She would cry about her appearance at times - who doesn't? - and it would break my heart because she was perfect to me.|Heh, some of her sensitivity must have rubbed off on me, because I cried a lot when we were together. I felt like I could be open, vulnerable. I never felt like that with anyone else. And she would just come to me and put her forehead to mine...|She was... she was... she was...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* Good. I... think I may take some time for myself now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253D"
msgid "It's okay, you don't need to say anymore."
msgstr "괜찮아요, 더 이상 말하지 않아도 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reminiscent, glad to have the opportunity to remember her and talk about her  / Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your wife.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253C"
msgid "What can I say about my Mira?"
msgstr "제 미라에 대해 무슨 말을 할 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253B"
msgid "She was always talking. She could go on and on about anything - a book she read, a dream she had, our future together. She had a low, soft voice, but the world is so much quieter without it."
msgstr ""
"아내는 항상 말을 많이 했어요. 아내가 읽은 책, 아내가 꾼 꿈, 우리의 미래에 대해 끊임없이 이야기할 수 있었죠. 아내의 목소리는 낮고 "
"부드러웠지만, 그 목소리가 없는 세상은 너무나 조용해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00253A"
msgid "And Great Serpent, she was beautiful as the stars. She was self-conscious, though, but she had no reason to be. She would cry about her appearance at times - who doesn't? - and it would break my heart because she was perfect to me."
msgstr ""
"그리고 위대한 뱀이시여, 아내는 별처럼 아름다웠어요. 아내는 자의식이 강했지만, 그럴 필요가 없었어요. 아내는 때때로 자신의 외모 때문에 "
"울곤 했는데, 누가 안 그러겠어요? 그럴 때면 제 가슴이 찢어지는 것 같았어요. 왜냐하면 제게 아내는 완벽했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002539"
msgid "Heh, some of her sensitivity must have rubbed off on me, because I cried a lot when we were together. I felt like I could be open, vulnerable. I never felt like that with anyone else. And she would just come to me and put her forehead to mine..."
msgstr ""
"흠, 아내의 섬세함이 제게도 좀 옮았나 봐요. 왜냐하면 우리는 함께 있을 때 많이 울었거든요. 저는 솔직하고, 약한 모습을 보여줄 수 "
"있다고 느꼈어요. 다른 사람에게는 그런 적이 없었어요. 그러면 아내는 그냥 제게 다가와 자신의 이마를 제 이마에 대곤 했죠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: breaking down, getting sad / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's okay, you don't need to say anymore.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002538"
msgid "She was... she was... she was..."
msgstr "아내는... 아내는... 아내는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: composing himself / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's okay, you don't need to say anymore.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's okay, you don't need to say anymore.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002537"
msgid "*Sigh* Good. I... think I may take some time for myself now."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아요. 이... 이제 저는 좀 쉬어야 할 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about your wife. &&& HVDazraMyloDazmi: What can I say about my Mira? |She was always talking. She could go on and on about anything - a book she read, a dream she had, our future together. She had a low, soft voice, but the world is so much quieter without it. |And Great Serpent, she was beautiful as the stars. She was self-conscious, though, but she had no reason to be. She would cry about her appearance at times - who doesn't? - and it would break my heart because she was perfect to me.|Heh, some of her sensitivity must have rubbed off on me, because I cried a lot when we were together. I felt like I could be open, vulnerable. I never felt like that with anyone else. And she would just come to me and put her forehead to mine...|She was... she was... she was...
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* Yes, I will. Nobody wants to see a blubbering fool.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002536"
msgid "You can tell me more later. For now, take some time to calm down."
msgstr "나중에 더 말해줘요. 지금은, 진정할 시간을 좀 가져요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: composing himself. / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can tell me more later. For now, take some time to calm down.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can tell me more later. For now, take some time to calm down.
