#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_WifePt1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002535"
msgid "*Sigh* Yes, I will. Nobody wants to see a blubbering fool."
msgstr "*한숨* 네, 그럴게요. 훌쩍거리는 바보를 보고 싶어하는 사람은 아무도 없으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002534"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002533"
msgid "Must say I'm surprised you are still here. If I were in your shoes I would have turned heel and ran as far away from this place as I could."
msgstr "아직 여기 계셨군요. 놀랐습니다. 저라면 진작에 이곳에서 최대한 멀리 도망쳤을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm here to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002532"
msgid "All that was good in Dazra is dead and gone."
msgstr "다즈라에서 좋았던 시절은 모두 끝났어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: Unless you can find a way for me to trade places with my wife, no. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Help
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002531"
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help you?"
msgstr "혹시 제가 도울 일이라도 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:   / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there anything I can do to help you? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Help
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002530"
msgid "Unless you can find a way for me to trade places with my wife, no."
msgstr "당신이 내 아내와 제 처지를 바꿔줄 수 없다면, 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Help
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252F"
msgid "*Sigh* That is selfish, I know, but I would give anything to trade places."
msgstr "*한숨* 이기적인 말인 줄 알지만, 그럴 수만 있다면 뭐든 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMyloDazmi: Hello.|Must say I'm surprised you are still here. If I were in your shoes I would have turned heel and ran as far away from this place as I could. |All that was good in Dazra is dead and gone. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Like I said, all that was good in Dazra is dead and gone. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD48
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252E"
msgid "Well, aren't you cheery."
msgstr "와, 정말 명랑하시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, aren't you cheery.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, aren't you cheery.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: I'm not talking about buildings, or plazas, or temples, or offices. I'm talking about people, like my wife, that are no longer here. Dead and gone. No amount of your help will bring them back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252D"
msgid "Like I said, all that was good in Dazra is dead and gone."
msgstr "말씀드렸다시피, 다즈라에서 좋았던 시절은 모두 끝났어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMyloDazmi: Hello.|Must say I'm surprised you are still here. If I were in your shoes I would have turned heel and ran as far away from this place as I could. |All that was good in Dazra is dead and gone. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We appreciate it, but some of us have lost too much already.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252C"
msgid "I'm here to help."
msgstr "도우러 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here to help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here to help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMyloDazmi: I'm not talking about buildings, or plazas, or temples, or offices. I'm talking about people, like my wife, that are no longer here. Dead and gone. No amount of your help will bring them back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252B"
msgid "We appreciate it, but some of us have lost too much already."
msgstr "고맙지만, 우리 중 몇몇은 이미 너무 많은 걸 잃었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Um... uh....|Did you... did you have something to say to me? 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... hello.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00252A"
msgid "A simple \"hello\" is usually good enough."
msgstr "보통은 그냥 '안녕하세요'라고만 해도 충분한데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002529"
msgid "Um... uh...."
msgstr "음... 어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMyloDazmi: We appreciate it, but some of us have lost too much already.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002528"
msgid "I'm not talking about buildings, or plazas, or temples, or offices. I'm talking about people, like my wife, that are no longer here. Dead and gone. No amount of your help will bring them back."
msgstr "제가 말하는 건 건물이니 광장이니 사원이니 사무실이니 하는 게 아닙니다. 이젠 여기 없는, 제 아내 같은 사람들에 대해 말하는 겁니다. 죽은 사람들은, 당신이 아무리 도와준다 해도 돌아오지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A simple "hello" is usually good enough.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A simple "hello" is usually good enough.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Sorry, I do not want to be rude. Most people tend to ignore me, so I am not very good at talking...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002527"
msgid "I... hello."
msgstr "저... 안녕하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAleksahLimal: I, um, work in storage. It suits me well, and I do not have to talk with anyone. Well, um, most of the time. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002526"
msgid "What do you do for work?"
msgstr "무슨 일을 하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Um... uh....|Did you... did you have something to say to me? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, it's not that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002525"
msgid "Seems like now isn't a good time."
msgstr "지금은 대화할 때가 아닌 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAleksahLimal: No, it's not that.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002524"
msgid "Sorry, I do not want to be rude. Most people tend to ignore me, so I am not very good at talking..."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 무례하게 굴려는 건 아니에요. 대부분의 사람들이 저를 무시하기 때문에, 제가 말을 잘 못해요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Seems like now isn't a good time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like now isn't a good time.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Sorry, I do not want to be rude. Most people tend to ignore me, so I am not very good at talking...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002522"
msgid "No, it's not that."
msgstr "아니, 그게 아니라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you feel about everything happening in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_ThoughtsOnDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00251F"
msgid "Um, not good? Things are scary. I try not to think about it too much but, well, uh, it's not easy."
msgstr "음, 좋진 않죠? 좀 무섭네요. 너무 신경 쓰지 않으려고 노력하지만, 그게, 어, 쉽지가 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_ThoughtsOnDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00251E"
msgid "There was another storage employee that I worked with, but I have not seen him in weeks. I think, uh... well, it is pretty obvious what happened to him..."
msgstr ""
"같이 일하던 창고 직원이 있었는데, 몇 주 동안 못 봤어요. 제 생각엔, 어... 그 사람에게 무슨 일이 일어났는지는 뻔하죠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you do for work?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00251D"
msgid "I, um, work in storage. It suits me well, and I do not have to talk with anyone. Well, um, most of the time."
msgstr "저는, 음, 창고에서 일합니다. 저한테 잘 맞고, 아무하고도 얘기할 필요가 없거든요. 뭐, 음, 대부분은요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: No need to worry, it is perfectly safe, I assure you. I keep the machine in good working order myself! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Safety
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00251C"
msgid "No offense, but is this safe? Do you know what you're doing?"
msgstr "기분 나쁘게 들릴 수도 있겠지만, 이거 안전한 거 맞아요? 지금 뭘 하고 계신지 알고나 계신 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This... is just an Enhance!, isn't it?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00251A"
msgid "Welcome to the Alteration Clinic, where you can change your look to change your life!"
msgstr "여러분의 인생을 바꿔줄 외모를 바꿔드리는 변화의 진료소에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Welcome to the Alteration Clinic, where you can change your look to change your life!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not allowed to call it that, but where you are from, that is what you would call a shop like mine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002519"
msgid "This... is just an Enhance!, isn't it?"
msgstr "여긴... 그냥 인핸스!인 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraSaharRaztan: I am not allowed to call it that, but where you are from, that is what you would call a shop like mine.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002518"
msgid "Even those in Dazra are surprised. The shop was set up by my father not so long ago, after he came to acquire the machine. The Alteration Clinic is still a novelty to a lot of people here."
msgstr "다즈라에 있는 사람들조차도 놀라워합니다. 이 가게는 얼마 전 아버지가 이 기계를 입수하고 나서 차리신 거에요. 변화의 진료소는 여전히 이곳 사람들에게는 생소한 곳이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002517"
msgid "I must admit, I am excited that you've stopped by. Maybe a customer from the Settled Systems can add an air of legitimacy to my little operation here."
msgstr "솔직히, 당신이 들러주셔서 정말 기쁩니다. 개척 성계에서 오신 손님이라면 제 작은 사업에 신뢰성을 더해줄 수 있을 것 같아서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Um, not good? Things are scary. I try not to think about it too much but, well, uh, it's not easy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_ThoughtsOnDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002516"
msgid "How do you feel about everything happening in Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에서 일어나는 이 모든 일들에 대해 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Enough to keep the machine running, but business has never been lucrative. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Customers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002515"
msgid "Do you get a lot of customers?"
msgstr "손님이 많으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraAleksahLimal: Um, not good? Things are scary. I try not to think about it too much but, well, uh, it's not easy.|There was another storage employee that I worked with, but I have not seen him in weeks. I think, uh... well, it is pretty obvious what happened to him...|He was always nice to me. He did not deserve... this. So, yeah, things are scary. Uh, even Dumar is probably scared, even though he always seems so happy.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraAleksahLimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAleksahLimal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_AleksahLimal_ThoughtsOnDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002514"
msgid "Oh, uh, Dumar is the uh, ship technician, by the way."
msgstr "오, 어, 두마르는, 어, 우주선 기술자예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to dance around the subject (they can't outright say what it is, but know that yes, it is definitely an Enhance!) / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This... is just an Enhance!, isn't it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This... is just an Enhance!, isn't it?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Even those in Dazra are surprised. The shop was set up by my father not so long ago, after he came to acquire the machine. The Alteration Clinic is still a novelty to a lot of people here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002513"
msgid "I am not allowed to call it that, but where you are from, that is what you would call a shop like mine."
msgstr "저는 그렇게 부를 수 없지만, 당신이 온 곳에서는, 제 가게 같은 곳을 그렇게 부를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No offense, but is this safe? Do you know what you're doing?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Safety
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002512"
msgid "No need to worry, it is perfectly safe, I assure you. I keep the machine in good working order myself!"
msgstr "걱정하실 필요 없습니다. 완벽하게 안전하니까요. 제가 직접 이 기계를 잘 정비하고 있답니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Safety
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002511"
msgid "And, my training is as good as any Enhance! practitioner in the Settled Systems. My father and I spent hours scouring the machine's instruction manual."
msgstr "그리고 제 훈련 실력은 개척 성계의 인핸스! 시술자들 못지 않습니다. 아버지와 저는 이 기계의 사용 설명서를 샅샅이 연구했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Welcome to the Alteration Clinic, where you can change your look to change your life!
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can understand that seeing what looks like an Enhance! outside of the Settled Systems may come as a surprise. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002510"
msgid "This can't be legal."
msgstr "이게 합법일 리가 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a little defensive, emphasis on *looks like* / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This can't be legal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This can't be legal.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraSaharRaztan: Even those in Dazra are surprised. The shop was set up by my father not so long ago, after he came to acquire the machine. The Alteration Clinic is still a novelty to a lot of people here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00250F"
msgid "I can understand that seeing what looks like an Enhance! outside of the Settled Systems may come as a surprise."
msgstr "개척 성계 밖에서 인핸스!와 흡사한 곳을 보시면 놀라실 수도 있다는 건 이해합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you get a lot of customers?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraSaharRaztan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSaharRaztan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_SaharRaztan_Customers
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00250E"
msgid "Enough to keep the machine running, but business has never been lucrative."
msgstr "기계를 계속 운영할 정도는 되지만, 장사가 잘 된 적은 없었습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MilaHohdan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00250D"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr "안녕하세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKresoAbbas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_KresoAbbas_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00250C"
msgid "Please, make yourself at home!"
msgstr "편하게 계세요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That suits me fine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00250A"
msgid "Oh, it's you. Let me make one thing very clear, you will receive no preferential treatment. No free treatments, no free supplies. We barely have enough as it is."
msgstr "아, 당신이군요. 한 가지만 분명히 하죠. 당신이라고 특별 대우는 없을 겁니다. 무료 시술도, 무료 용품도 없어요. 우리도 겨우 먹고 살 정도니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraHantonIrara: Oh, it's you. Let me make one thing very clear, you will receive no preferential treatment. No free treatments, no free supplies. We barely have enough as it is.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good.
