#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002506"
msgid "Such entitlement is not flattering, especially when everyone around you is barely scraping by."
msgstr "그런 권리 의식은 보기 좋지 않아요. 특히 주변 사람들이 모두 겨우 먹고살고 있을 때는요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: apologetic / Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraHantonIrara: Good.
