#. TOPIC: 0108DD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002505"
msgid "Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment."
msgstr "흠... 실은 제가 요즘 제정신이 아닙니다. 안 좋을 때 오셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Apology accepted. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002504"
msgid "The stress of everything is becoming overwhelming, but that is no excuse to act like I just did. I apologize."
msgstr "모든 일에 대한 스트레스가 너무 심해지고 있지만, 그렇다고 제가 방금처럼 행동한 것에 대한 변명이 되지는 않습니다. 사과드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Apology accepted. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Apology accepted. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002503"
msgid "I appreciate that. Now, may I help you with something?"
msgstr "감사합니다. 그럼, 무슨 일이시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That suits me fine.  &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Good. &&& HVDazraHantonIrara: Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment.|The stress of everything is becoming overwhelming, but that is no excuse to act like I just did. I apologize. 
