#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002502"
msgid "Apology accepted."
msgstr "사과를 받아들이겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Keep the attitude in check next time. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Keep the attitude in check next time. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraHantonIrara
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
