#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOmanLabir: No, no, I was a veterinarian. I would provide care for the farmers' groats, but that seems like a lifetime ago.
