msgid "So you aren't a healer by trade?"
msgstr "그러니까 원래 직업이 치료사는 아니시군요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you aren't a healer by trade? 
