msgid "No, no, I was a veterinarian. I would provide care for the farmers' groats, but that seems like a lifetime ago."
msgstr "네, 네, 저는 수의사였습니다. 농부들의 그로트를 돌보곤 했는데, 그게 마치 평생 전의 일처럼 느껴지네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Veterinary
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024F4"
msgid "A human is not a groat, of course, but my veterinary skills have proved useful enough."
msgstr "물론 인간은 그로트가 아니지만, 제 수의학 기술이 꽤 유용하다는 것이 증명되었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
