msgid "If you need assistance, full disclosure, I am not a healer."
msgstr "도움이 필요하시다면, 미리 말씀드리는데, 저는 치료사가 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's noble of you to volunteer during this time. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024F2"
msgid "I am a volunteer, so if that makes you uncomfortable, you may be better served by Hanton Irara at the Halls of Healing. If she is available, that is."
msgstr ""
"저는 자원봉사자일 뿐이니, 불편하시다면 회복의 전당에 있는 핸톤 이라라 님이 더 처리를 잘 해주실 겁니다. 핸톤 이라라 님이 가능하시다면 "
"말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to take a look at your ships.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraDumarHasadi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D90D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_DumarHasadi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0108D930
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024F1"
msgid "I have taken good care of them."
msgstr "제가 잘 관리해 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraOmanLabir: If you need assistance, full disclosure, I am not a healer.|I am a volunteer, so if that makes you uncomfortable, you may be better served by Hanton Irara at the Halls of Healing. If she is available, that is.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, thank you for saying so. I am not doing this for recognition, but sometimes I can feel overwhelmed. I wonder if I am making any difference at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D909
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024F0"
msgid "It's noble of you to volunteer during this time."
msgstr "이런 시기에 자원봉사를 하시다니 고귀하시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's noble of you to volunteer during this time. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's noble of you to volunteer during this time. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024EF"
msgid "Ah, thank you for saying so. I am not doing this for recognition, but sometimes I can feel overwhelmed. I wonder if I am making any difference at all."
msgstr "아, 그렇게 말씀해 주시니 감사합니다. 인정을 받으려고 이 일을 하는 건 아니지만 가끔은 벅찰 때가 있어요. 제가 과연 무슨 변화를 만들어 내고 있는 건지 의문이 들 때도 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's noble of you to volunteer during this time. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sure you volunteering has made a huge difference. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024EE"
msgid "But, someone needs to help, and it may as well be me."
msgstr "하지만 누군가는 도와야 하고, 그게 저라도 상관없겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraOmanLabir: If you need assistance, full disclosure, I am not a healer.|I am a volunteer, so if that makes you uncomfortable, you may be better served by Hanton Irara at the Halls of Healing. If she is available, that is.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exactly, I am no doctor. What I am, however, is out of my depth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D907
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024ED"
msgid "I'm not sure how comfortable I'd be having a volunteer as my doctor."
msgstr "자원봉사자가 제 의사라니, 그건 좀 불편할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure how comfortable I'd be having a volunteer as my doctor.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure how comfortable I'd be having a volunteer as my doctor.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D906
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024EC"
msgid "Exactly, I am no doctor. What I am, however, is out of my depth."
msgstr "맞아요, 전 의사가 아닙니다. 하지만, 지금 저는, 제 능력 밖의 일을 하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure how comfortable I'd be having a volunteer as my doctor.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe it would be best to let the professionals handle things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D906
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024EB"
msgid "Ah, forgive my negativity, I should not say things like that. Seems my bedside manner is wanting."
msgstr "아, 제 부정적인 태도는 용서해 주세요. 이런 말은 하지 말아야 하는데. 제 환자 응대 방식이 부족한 것 같군요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraOmanLabir: I try not to be, and most of the time I am not. But at times, the gravity of the situation becomes a bit much for me to take. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D905
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Stress
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024EA"
msgid "Why are you so hard on yourself?"
msgstr "왜 그렇게 스스로를 힘들게 하세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010C2E55
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0024E9"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "뭘 원하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you so hard on yourself?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Stress
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E8"
msgid "I try not to be, and most of the time I am not. But at times, the gravity of the situation becomes a bit much for me to take."
msgstr "그러지 않으려고 노력하고, 대부분은 그러지 않아요. 하지만 가끔은, 이 상황의 중대함이 제가 감당하기에는 너무 벅찰 때가 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Stress
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E7"
msgid "Our work is never ending. You help one person, five more require your assistance, and then ten more after that."
msgstr "우리가 하는 일은 끝이 없어요. 한 사람을 돕고 나면, 다섯 명이 더 도움을 필요로 하고, 그 다음엔 열 명이 더 기다리고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Stress
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E6"
msgid "How much of a difference am I really making? Me, a volunteer? Maybe I am just getting in the way."
msgstr "제가 정말 얼마나 큰 변화를 만들고 있는 걸까요? 저 같은 자원봉사자가요? 어쩌면 저는 그냥 방해가 되고 있는 건지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_TL_Stress
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E5"
msgid "*Sigh* There I go again. Those negative ramblings are not doing anyone any good."
msgstr "*한숨* 또 이러고 있네요. 이런 부정적인 푸념은 누구에게도 도움이 되지 않는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMakolaJubav: What do you want?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not waste people's time. If you need my goods you will buy them, if not you will leave. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E4"
msgid "That wasn't much of a sales pitch."
msgstr "그건 별로 설득력 없는 판매 멘트였어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That wasn't much of a sales pitch.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That wasn't much of a sales pitch.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: I do not know what to make of your arrival here. You may have convinced the others, but I am not entirely sure you are not a foe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E3"
msgid "I do not waste people's time. If you need my goods you will buy them, if not you will leave."
msgstr "나는 사람들이 시간 낭비하게 놔두지 않아. 물건이 필요하면 사면 되고, 아니면 그냥 가면 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMakolaJubav: What do you want?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No problem, I just do not trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E2"
msgid "Sounds like you have a problem with me."
msgstr "저한테 불만 있으신가 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HVDazraMakolaJubav: I do not waste people's time. If you need my goods you will buy them, if not you will leave. 
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E1"
msgid "I do not know what to make of your arrival here. You may have convinced the others, but I am not entirely sure you are not a foe."
msgstr ""
"그쪽이 이곳에 온 걸 어떻게 받아들여야 할지 모르겠군. 다른 사람들은 속였을지 몰라도, 나는 그쪽이 적이 아니라 확신하지 못하겠거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024E0"
msgid "However, your credits are worth as much as anyone else's. I will trade with you, but I have no interest in being your friend."
msgstr "하지만, 그쪽 크레딧도 다른 사람들 것만큼 가치는 있겠지. 거래는 하겠지만, 그쪽과 친구가 될 생각은 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DF"
msgid "Now, what do you want?"
msgstr "그래서, 뭘 원하시나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like you have a problem with me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like you have a problem with me.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: I do not know what to make of your arrival here. You may have convinced the others, but I am not entirely sure you are not a foe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DE"
msgid "No problem, I just do not trust you."
msgstr "문제는 없다. 단지 그쪽을 믿지 않을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: I've no reason to be concerned. The Great Serpent is testing our faith, and my devotion has always been resolute. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Business
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DD"
msgid "Are you concerned for your business, what with everything happening?"
msgstr "지금 일어나는 모든 일 때문에 사업이 걱정되시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you concerned for your business, what with everything happening?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Business
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DC"
msgid "I've no reason to be concerned. The Great Serpent is testing our faith, and my devotion has always been resolute."
msgstr "걱정할 필요는 없겠지. 위대한 뱀께서 우리의 믿음을 시험하고 계신 거고, 내 헌신은 언제나 확고했으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Business
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DB"
msgid "Myself and my business shall both be stronger at the end of this, as a product of our loyalty to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이 모든 일이 끝난 뒤에 내 사업은, 위대한 뱀 님에 대한 믿음의 결과로, 더 강해져 있을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You think the Great Serpent destroyed homes and families as a test of faith? Doesn't that seem cruel?
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMakolaJubav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Serpent
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024DA"
msgid "I will not dignify that nonsense with an answer."
msgstr "그런 말도 안 되는 소리에 일일히 대답해야 하나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to HVDazraMakolaJubav
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraMakolaJubav: I will not dignify that nonsense with an answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MakolaJubav_TL_Serpent
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D9"
msgid "You think the Great Serpent destroyed homes and families as a test of faith? Doesn't that seem cruel?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이 신앙심을 시험하기 위해 가정과 가족들을 파괴했다고 생각하시나요? 너무 잔인하지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's noble of you to volunteer during this time.  &&& HVDazraOmanLabir: Ah, thank you for saying so. I am not doing this for recognition, but sometimes I can feel overwhelmed. I wonder if I am making any difference at all.|But, someone needs to help, and it may as well be me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hope so. Thank you for saying that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D8"
msgid "I'm sure you volunteering has made a huge difference."
msgstr "당신이 자원봉사를 해서 큰 변화를 만들었을 거라고 확신합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure you volunteering has made a huge difference. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure you volunteering has made a huge difference. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D7"
msgid "I hope so. Thank you for saying that."
msgstr "저도 그러길 바랍니다. 그렇게 말씀해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure how comfortable I'd be having a volunteer as my doctor. &&& HVDazraOmanLabir: Exactly, I am no doctor. What I am, however, is out of my depth.|Ah, forgive my negativity, I should not say things like that. Seems my bedside manner is wanting.  
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am conflicted. Sometimes all I want to do is give up and go away. Other times I feel I would not be able to forgive myself. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D6"
msgid "Maybe it would be best to let the professionals handle things."
msgstr "전문가들에게 일을 맡기는 게 더 나을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe it would be best to let the professionals handle things.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe it would be best to let the professionals handle things.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraOmanLabir
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D8F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_OmanLabir_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D5"
msgid "I am conflicted. Sometimes all I want to do is give up and go away. Other times I feel I would not be able to forgive myself."
msgstr "저는 갈등하고 있어요. 때로는 모든 걸 포기하고 떠나고 싶지만, 또 어떤 때는 저 자신을 용서하지 못할 것 같다는 생각이 들어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Oman
#. ALIAS: Oman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MedicalWorker: I understand that you are stressed, but do not let it affect you. Your skills are too valuable to lose. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D2"
msgid "Perhaps I should leave and get out of your way."
msgstr "아마 내가 떠나서 방해하지 않는 게 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: Did he seem angry? &&& Guard01: Speak with him and find out, will you? 
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108BA9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D1"
msgid "*Sigh* I will speak with him after I complete my duties. Not sure how long that may take."
msgstr "*한숨* 임무를 마치고 나면 보리스 님과 이야기해 보지. 얼마나 걸릴지는 모르겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: I understand that you must still be in shock. Many people are. Would you like me to escort you to the aid tent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024D0"
msgid "No. No, I do not think I do."
msgstr "아뇨. 아뇨, 그런 것 같지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: I... I do not know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024CF"
msgid "Do you have a home to return to?"
msgstr "돌아갈 집은 있으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: As horrible as things are, we must remember that the Great Serpent will save us from this. We just have to remain strong. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024CE"
msgid "Our homes. Our families. Everything we have ever worked for, gone. Gone in an instant."
msgstr "우리 집. 우리 가족. 우리가 일궈온 모든 것들이, 사라졌어. 한순간에 사라졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MedicalWorker: Stop that. I have heard it all before. &&& Citizen01: But I have children!
#. ALIAS: MedicalWorker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza03
#. TOPIC: 0108BA9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024CD"
msgid "If that is the truth, then take them to Hanton if they require care."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면, 치료가 필요하면 핸톤에게 데려가세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: MedicalWorker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: *Grumble*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza03
#. TOPIC: 0108BA9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024CC"
msgid "If you are lying, you must understand that other people are in worse situations than you, and they require these supplies. Now, I must be going."
msgstr ""
"만약 거짓말이라면, 당신보다 더 심각한 상황에 처한 사람들이 있고, 그들에게 이 물자가 필요하다는 걸 알아야 합니다. 자, 전 "
"가봐야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: a grumbling sound that someone would make when thinking, confused, etc
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_PreMQ02_BlockingHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0024CB"
msgid "*Grumble*"
msgstr "*투덜거림*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Mylo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Yes... but we will push on in their memory. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024CA"
msgid "What we cannot ever replace are the people we lost. People we loved."
msgstr "저희가 잃은 사람들, 저희가 사랑했던 사람들은 결코 되찾을 수 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C9"
msgid "Now, quiet. Just be quiet. I need to think."
msgstr "자, 조용히. 조용히 좀 해. 생각 좀 해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Dumar
#. ALIAS: Dumar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMDumarHasadi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C8"
msgid "But that one is special, yes. Oh, I would love to take it apart..."
msgstr "하지만 저건 특별해, 그래. 오, 분해해 보고 싶어..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: What is it? &&& Soldier01: I... do you feel useful? 
#. ALIAS: Soldier02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier01: I have been pondering, what is our purpose?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C6"
msgid "What the hell are you going on about?"
msgstr "대체 무슨 소리를 하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: What is it?
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier02: What the hell are you going on about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C5"
msgid "I... do you feel useful?"
msgstr "저... 우리가 쓸모 있다고 생각해?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier01: I... do you feel useful?  &&& Soldier02: What the hell are you going on about?
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C4"
msgid "I have been pondering, what is our purpose?"
msgstr "우리의 목적이 뭘까 생각해 보고 있었어."

#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier02: Enough, get a hold of yourself. Your dourness is shameful and unbecoming of a soldier. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C3"
msgid "Our brothers, who we broke bread with, sparred with - so many taken by the vortex. Our numbers are so few now, and we are left to simply mull about..."
msgstr ""
"우리가 함께 빵을 나누고, 겨루었던 형제들... 그렇게 많은 이들이 볼텍스에 휩쓸려 갔어. 이제 우리 수는 너무 적고, 그저 빈둥거릴 "
"뿐이지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: What the hell are you going on about? &&& Soldier01: I have been pondering, what is our purpose?|Our brothers, who we broke bread with, sparred with - so many taken by the vortex. Our numbers are so few now, and we are left to simply mull about...
#. ALIAS: Soldier02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C2"
msgid "Enough, get a hold of yourself. Your dourness is shameful and unbecoming of a soldier."
msgstr "그만, 정신 차려. 네 우울함은 부끄럽고 군인답지 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C1"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier01: Morale is a trifle low, as anyone would expect. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024C0"
msgid "Everything fine over here?"
msgstr "여긴 다 괜찮은가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Indeed. Same is true for most in Dazra.|Regardless, I've many fond memories of my time in the military. It is a noble cause, you and your fellow soldiers should be proud.  &&& Soldier01: Of course. Will that be all?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024BF"
msgid "Yes, yes, forgive my reminisces. May the Great Serpent watch over you all."
msgstr "예, 예, 잠시 회상에 잠긴 걸 용서해 줘. 위대한 뱀께서 당신들 모두를 굽어살펴주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier01: Morale is a trifle low, as anyone would expect.  &&& Guard01: Indeed. Same is true for most in Dazra.|Regardless, I've many fond memories of my time in the military. It is a noble cause, you and your fellow soldiers should be proud. 
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Yes, yes, forgive my reminisces. May the Great Serpent watch over you all. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024BE"
msgid "Of course. Will that be all?"
msgstr "물론입니다. 그게 다입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Everything fine over here? &&& Soldier01: Morale is a trifle low, as anyone would expect. 
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024BD"
msgid "Indeed. Same is true for most in Dazra."
msgstr "그래. 다즈라에 있는 대부분의 사람들도 마찬가지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier01: Of course. Will that be all?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024BC"
msgid "Regardless, I've many fond memories of my time in the military. It is a noble cause, you and your fellow soldiers should be proud."
msgstr "어쨌든, 난 군 복무 시절에 대한 좋은 추억이 많아. 고귀한 명분이지. 너와 네 동료 군인들은 자랑스러워해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Everything fine over here?
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Indeed. Same is true for most in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024BB"
msgid "Morale is a trifle low, as anyone would expect."
msgstr "사기가 좀 저조합니다. 누구나 예상할 수 있듯이 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Oman
#. ALIAS: Oman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MedicalWorker: Your work here is appreciated, Oman. You worry far too much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B9"
msgid "Great Serpent, I am in over my head..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 저는 감당할 수 없습니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Oman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Oman: Great Serpent, I am in over my head...
#. ALIAS: MedicalWorker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Oman: But I am just a volunteer, I do not know what I am doing. I worry that I may do more harm than good.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B8"
msgid "Your work here is appreciated, Oman. You worry far too much."
msgstr "당신의 노고에 감사드립니다, 오만. 걱정이 너무 많으시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Oman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Oman: Great Serpent, I am in over my head... &&& MedicalWorker: Your work here is appreciated, Oman. You worry far too much.
#. ALIAS: Oman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B7"
msgid "But I am just a volunteer, I do not know what I am doing. I worry that I may do more harm than good."
msgstr "하지만 전 그저 자원봉사자일 뿐이고, 뭘 하고 있는지도 모르겠어요. 오히려 해를 끼칠까 봐 걱정됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Oman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MedicalWorker: Your work here is appreciated, Oman. You worry far too much. &&& Oman: But I am just a volunteer, I do not know what I am doing. I worry that I may do more harm than good.|Perhaps I should leave and get out of your way.
#. ALIAS: MedicalWorker
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Oman: Yes... yes. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B5"
msgid "I understand that you are stressed, but do not let it affect you. Your skills are too valuable to lose."
msgstr "스트레스를 받고 계신 건 알겠지만, 너무 신경 쓰지 마세요. 당신의 기술은 너무나도 귀중해서 잃을 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: calming down / to Oman
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Oman: But I am just a volunteer, I do not know what I am doing. I worry that I may do more harm than good.|Perhaps I should leave and get out of your way. &&& MedicalWorker: I understand that you are stressed, but do not let it affect you. Your skills are too valuable to lose. 
#. ALIAS: Oman
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOmanLabir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05
#. TOPIC: 0108AD2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp05_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B4"
msgid "Yes... yes. Thank you."
msgstr "네... 네. 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: What? Why? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B2"
msgid "Voris wishes to speak with you."
msgstr "보리스 님이 너와 이야기하고 싶어 하신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Voris wishes to speak with you.
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: That is no concern of mine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B1"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr "뭐? 왜?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Voris wishes to speak with you. &&& Guard02: What? Why? 
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: Did he seem angry?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024B0"
msgid "That is no concern of mine."
msgstr "그건 내가 알 바 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: What? Why?  &&& Guard01: That is no concern of mine.
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Speak with him and find out, will you? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024AE"
msgid "Did he seem angry?"
msgstr "화난 것 같았어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: That is no concern of mine. &&& Guard02: Did he seem angry?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: *Sigh* I will speak with him after I complete my duties. Not sure how long that may take.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024AD"
msgid "Speak with him and find out, will you?"
msgstr "가서 얘기해 보고 알아내. 알았어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. ALIAS: Citizen
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Allowed to return home? You are not being held here against your will. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024AB"
msgid "Any idea when we may be allowed to return home?"
msgstr "언제쯤 집에 돌아갈 수 있을지 아세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Any idea when we may be allowed to return home?
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024AA"
msgid "Allowed to return home? You are not being held here against your will."
msgstr "집에 돌아가도 되냐고요? 억지로 붙잡혀 계신 게 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Allowed to return home? You are not being held here against your will. |Do you have a home to return to? &&& Citizen: I... I do not know.|No. No, I do not think I do.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen: No, I just... do not wish to talk any longer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024A9"
msgid "I understand that you must still be in shock. Many people are. Would you like me to escort you to the aid tent?"
msgstr "아직 충격에서 헤어 나오지 못하신 것 같군요. 많은 분들이 그렇습니다. 구호 텐트까지 모셔다 드릴까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: Any idea when we may be allowed to return home? &&& Guard01: Allowed to return home? You are not being held here against your will. |Do you have a home to return to?
#. ALIAS: Citizen
