msgctxt "0024A8"
msgid "I... I do not know."
msgstr "저... 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen: I... I do not know.|No. No, I do not think I do. &&& Guard01: I understand that you must still be in shock. Many people are. Would you like me to escort you to the aid tent?
