#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024A6"
msgid "No, I just... do not wish to talk any longer."
msgstr "아뇨, 그냥... 더 이상 말하고 싶지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: A nightmare would be paradise compared to this. 
