msgid "I keep expecting to wake up from this horrible nightmare."
msgstr "이 끔찍한 악몽에서 깨어나기를 계속 기대하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: As horrible as things are, we must remember that the Great Serpent will save us from this. We just have to remain strong.  &&& Citizen01: Save us? He is punishing us!
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024A3"
msgid "If that is true, then certainly we deserve what has happened, and we must seek now to gain the Great Serpent's forgiveness."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면, 분명히 우리는 이런 일을 당해도 싸고, 이제 위대한 뱀의 용서를 구해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: A nightmare would be paradise compared to this. |Our homes. Our families. Everything we have ever worked for, gone. Gone in an instant.  &&& Citizen02: As horrible as things are, we must remember that the Great Serpent will save us from this. We just have to remain strong. 
