#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: If that is true, then certainly we deserve what has happened, and we must seek now to gain the Great Serpent's forgiveness. 
