#. TOPIC: 0108AD3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024A2"
msgid "Save us? He is punishing us!"
msgstr "우리를 구한다고? 그분은 우리를 벌하고 계신 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I keep expecting to wake up from this horrible nightmare. &&& Citizen01: A nightmare would be paradise compared to this. |Our homes. Our families. Everything we have ever worked for, gone. Gone in an instant. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: Save us? He is punishing us!
