#. TOPIC: 0108AD40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0024A1"
msgid "As horrible as things are, we must remember that the Great Serpent will save us from this. We just have to remain strong."
msgstr "끔찍한 상황이지만, 위대한 뱀께서 우리를 구원해 주실 거라는 걸 잊지 말아야 해. 우린 그저 강하게 버텨야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: I keep expecting to wake up from this horrible nightmare.
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
