#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mylo: Oh, we can rebuild structures. We can erect monuments, memorials. The city will recover in time. 
