#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Everything is simply... gone. How can we possibly rebuild after this?  &&& Mylo: Oh, we can rebuild structures. We can erect monuments, memorials. The city will recover in time. |What we cannot ever replace are the people we lost. People we loved. 
