msgid "Why? You haven't seen them?"
msgstr "왜요? 그분들 못 보셨어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: Oh... I am sorry, child.  &&& Child01: Why? You haven't seen them?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
