#. TOPIC: 0108AD2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002477"
msgid "Perhaps you should speak to the guards, child. They will be able to help you, I pray."
msgstr "경비대한테 얘기해 보는 게 좋겠다, 꼬마야. 그들이 널 도와줄 수 있을 거야. 기도할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child01: All right. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002476"
msgid "Go on, it is not safe to wander alone."
msgstr "어서 가, 혼자 돌아다니는 건 안전하지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child01: Why? You haven't seen them? &&& Citizen01: Perhaps you should speak to the guards, child. They will be able to help you, I pray. |Go on, it is not safe to wander alone. 
