#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002475"
msgid "All right. Thank you."
msgstr "알겠어요. 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: What?
