#. TOPIC: 0108AD66
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002473"
msgid "Food?"
msgstr "식량?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: No, I apologize, but all of my food goes straight to my children. &&& Citizen02: I understand. 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002472"
msgid "I pray that the Great Serpent aids us both."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 모두를 도와주시길 기도할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen02: Food? &&& Citizen01: What?
#. ALIAS: Citizen02
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: No, I apologize, but all of my food goes straight to my children.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002471"
msgid "Food, I need food. Do you have anything you are willing to spare?"
msgstr "식량, 식량이 필요해. 혹시 나눠줄 수 있는 거 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Citizen01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: What? &&& Citizen02: Food, I need food. Do you have anything you are willing to spare?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen02: I understand. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02
#. TOPIC: 0108AD63
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_CommonerNeighborhood02_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002470"
msgid "No, I apologize, but all of my food goes straight to my children."
msgstr "아니, 미안하지만, 내 식량은 전부 아이들에게 줘야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& ...  &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.|You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month.|Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. If there's anything else I can do, let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C78
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00246F"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

