#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: To see the city, the people, broken like this... truly, we have angered the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00246C"
msgid "Weeks of patrols and I still can scarcely believe what I am seeing."
msgstr "몇 주 동안 순찰을 돌았는데도 여전히 내가 보고 있는 걸 믿기 힘들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: Weeks of patrols and I still can scarcely believe what I am seeing.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard02: Could this be a test? Persevere, and we will be rewarded? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00246B"
msgid "To see the city, the people, broken like this... truly, we have angered the Great Serpent."
msgstr "도시가, 사람들이 이렇게 망가진 걸 보니... 정말로, 우리가 위대한 뱀을 화나게 한 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard02: Weeks of patrols and I still can scarcely believe what I am seeing. &&& Guard01: To see the city, the people, broken like this... truly, we have angered the Great Serpent. 
#. ALIAS: Guard02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: I am no Herald, I cannot begin to make sense of this. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00246A"
msgid "Could this be a test? Persevere, and we will be rewarded?"
msgstr "이게 시험일까? 인내하면, 보상을 받을 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: To see the city, the people, broken like this... truly, we have angered the Great Serpent.  &&& Guard02: Could this be a test? Persevere, and we will be rewarded? 
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002469"
msgid "I am no Herald, I cannot begin to make sense of this."
msgstr "난 전령이 아니야. 이걸 이해할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard02
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_Plaza01_Scene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002468"
msgid "If not anger, what was it? What possible reward could be awaiting us? The Great Serpent cannot be so cruel, I refuse to believe that."
msgstr "분노가 아니라면, 뭐였을까? 어떤 보상이 우리를 기다리고 있을 수 있지? 위대한 뱀께서 그렇게 잔인하실 리가 없어. 난 그렇게 믿지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. ALIAS: Child01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: We... we will go home as soon as we can. But we must first wait here a bit longer.
