#. TOPIC: 0108AD7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002466"
msgid "I do not like it here, when can we go home?"
msgstr "여기 싫어. 언제 집에 갈 수 있어?"

