#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child01: I do not like it here, when can we go home?
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Child01: But I do not want to be here anymore! 
