msgstr "우리... 우리 최대한 빨리 집에 갈 거야. 하지만 우선 여기서 조금 더 기다려야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Child01: I do not like it here, when can we go home? &&& Citizen01: We... we will go home as soon as we can. But we must first wait here a bit longer.
#. ALIAS: Child01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericChildMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Citizen01: I know! Neither do I! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD7C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002464"
msgid "But I do not want to be here anymore!"
msgstr "하지만 더 이상 여기 있고 싶지 않아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Child01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Citizen01: We... we will go home as soon as we can. But we must first wait here a bit longer. &&& Child01: But I do not want to be here anymore! 
#. ALIAS: Citizen01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_RefugeeCamp01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002461"
msgid "I know! Neither do I!"
msgstr "알아! 나도 마찬가지야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Dumar
