#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_StarportArea01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00245F"
msgid "Have you ever seen a ship like that? It is truly something."
msgstr "저런 우주선 본 적 있어? 정말 대단해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Dumar
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SpaceportWorker: Have you ever seen a ship like that? It is truly something. 
