msgid "Hm. I fear to ask, but how dire are our circumstances?"
msgstr "음. 묻기 두렵지만, 우리 상황이 얼마나 심각하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Healer01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Healer02: Have all the supplies been inventoried? 
