#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: One for me and one for you, Genna. &&& Genna: No, Eggie. You have already had several. 
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
