#. TOPIC: 0108AD68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002448"
msgid "Eh, what can I say? Nobody makes a drink like you do."
msgstr "어, 뭐라 해야 할까요? 아무도 당신처럼 음료를 만들지 못할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: *Sigh* Same thing every day...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01
