#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: No, Eggie. You have already had several. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD6A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002446"
msgid "One for me and one for you, Genna."
msgstr "한 잔은 저에게, 다른 잔은 당신에게 바치는 거예요, 제나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: amused / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Genna: No, Eggie. You have already had several.  &&& Egbo: Eh, what can I say? Nobody makes a drink like you do.|Come now, just one more drink? I do not wish to say goodbye just yet. I have fallen under your spell.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002445"
msgid "*Sigh* Same thing every day..."
msgstr "*한숨* 매일 똑같은 짓이라니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Egbo
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Egbo: One for me and one for you, Genna.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Eh, what can I say? Nobody makes a drink like you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01
#. TOPIC: 0108AD69
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HeraldsRest01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002444"
msgid "No, Eggie. You have already had several."
msgstr "안 돼요, 에기 씨. 이미 여러 잔 마셨잖아요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hanton: No. Well, the occasional supply thief, but we have been dealing with that ourselves.  &&& Guard01: Thievery is a severe crime, especially now. I suggest you report said activity to us in the future, so that we may put an end to it. 
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: All Must Serve, Hanton. All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HallsOfHealing03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HallsofHealing03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002442"
msgid "The people are desperate. A bit of compassion would go a long way."
msgstr "사람들이 절박해. 약간의 동정심이 큰 도움이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Hanton
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Thievery is a severe crime, especially now. I suggest you report said activity to us in the future, so that we may put an end to it.  &&& Hanton: The people are desperate. A bit of compassion would go a long way.
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HallsOfHealing03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HallsofHealing03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002441"
msgid "All Must Serve, Hanton. All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다, 핸톤. 모두가 섬겨야 해."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Just making my rounds. Any troubles to tell of? 
#. ALIAS: Hanton
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard01: Thievery is a severe crime, especially now. I suggest you report said activity to us in the future, so that we may put an end to it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HallsOfHealing03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HallsofHealing03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002440"
msgid "No. Well, the occasional supply thief, but we have been dealing with that ourselves."
msgstr "아니. 뭐, 가끔 물자 절도범이 있긴 하지만, 그건 우리가 직접 처리하고 있어."

#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: No. Well, the occasional supply thief, but we have been dealing with that ourselves. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HallsOfHealing03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD58
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HallsofHealing03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00243F"
msgid "Just making my rounds. Any troubles to tell of?"
msgstr "그냥 순찰 중이야. 무슨 문제 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard01: Just making my rounds. Any troubles to tell of?  &&& Hanton: No. Well, the occasional supply thief, but we have been dealing with that ourselves. 
#. ALIAS: Guard01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hanton: The people are desperate. A bit of compassion would go a long way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_HallsOfHealing03
#. TOPIC: 0108AD56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_HallsofHealing03_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00243E"
msgid "Thievery is a severe crime, especially now. I suggest you report said activity to us in the future, so that we may put an end to it."
msgstr "절도는 심각한 범죄야, 특히 지금은. 앞으로는 그런 행위를 우리에게 보고해서 우리가 막을 수 있도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't worry, I'll go quietly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088608
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DefaultDazraGuardArrestLines
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002438"
msgid "Hold it! You are under arrest!"
msgstr "잠깐! 체포하겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry, I'll go quietly.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry, I'll go quietly.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01088616
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002437"
msgid "Very good. We have enough troubles to address already."
msgstr "아주 좋습니다. 처리해야 할 문제는 이미 많이 쌓여있으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry, I'll go quietly.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry, I'll go quietly.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01088618
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002436"
msgid "You will have ample time to meditate on your actions in your cell."
msgstr "당신 행동을 곰곰이 생각해 볼 시간이야 감방이라면 충분히 주어질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0108860E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002435"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll go quietly."
msgstr "걱정하지 마, 얌전히 따라갈 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0108860F
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002434"
msgid "I give up. Do what you have to do."
msgstr "항복하겠다. 해야 할 일을 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: 절대 잡히지 않을 테다!
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088604
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01088609
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002433"
msgid "Then meet your death!"
msgstr "그렇다면 죽어라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: 
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088602
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002432"
msgid "Very well. But seek to rectify that quickly."
msgstr "아주 좋습니다. 하지만 빨리 해결하도록 하십쇼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: 
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well. But seek to rectify that quickly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 01088603
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsForcegreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01088614
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002431"
msgid "I can't pay the fine right now. [Bounty of <Global=SFBGS001_CrimeBountyAmountDUPLICATE000> credits]"
msgstr ""
"지금은 벌금을 낼 수가 없습니다. [현상금 <Global=SFBGS001_CrimeBountyAmountDUPLICATE000> 크레딧]"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 010885FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsGreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0108861A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002430"
msgid "Stop... it seems that you are wanted."
msgstr "멈추시죠... 현상수배가 걸린 것 같습니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuards
#. TOPIC: 010885FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueCrimeDazraGuardsGreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0108861A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00242F"
msgid "It seems you have a bounty that is yet to be paid."
msgstr "아직 갚지 않은 현상금이 있는 것 같습니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: I still cannot believe that we are the only ones left. 
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier02: I understand, but everyone is simply... gone. What did they do to draw the Serpent's ire?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 0108868A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00242D"
msgid "The Great Serpent chose us to survive. We should consider ourselves lucky."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 선택해서 살려주셨어. 우리는 스스로 운이 좋다고 생각해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: I still cannot believe that we are the only ones left.  &&& Soldier01: The Great Serpent chose us to survive. We should consider ourselves lucky. 
#. ALIAS: Soldier02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier01: There was no ire, they simply did their duties as a soldier. Our time will come eventually.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 01088689
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00242C"
msgid "I understand, but everyone is simply... gone. What did they do to draw the Serpent's ire?"
msgstr "알아, 하지만 모두가 그냥... 사라졌어. 그들이 무슨 짓을 했길래 뱀의 분노를 산 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier02: I understand, but everyone is simply... gone. What did they do to draw the Serpent's ire? &&& Soldier01: There was no ire, they simply did their duties as a soldier. Our time will come eventually.
#. ALIAS: Soldier02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 01088687
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00242B"
msgid "Not too soon, I pray..."
msgstr "너무 이르지는 않길 기도해..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier01
#. ALIAS: Soldier02
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier01: The Great Serpent chose us to survive. We should consider ourselves lucky. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 0108868B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00242A"
msgid "I still cannot believe that we are the only ones left."
msgstr "우리가 유일하게 남은 사람들이라니 여전히 믿기지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Soldier02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Soldier01: The Great Serpent chose us to survive. We should consider ourselves lucky.  &&& Soldier02: I understand, but everyone is simply... gone. What did they do to draw the Serpent's ire?
#. ALIAS: Soldier01
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Soldier02: Not too soon, I pray...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01
#. TOPIC: 01088688
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_RC_TheKeep01_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002429"
msgid "There was no ire, they simply did their duties as a soldier. Our time will come eventually."
msgstr "분노는 없었어. 그들은 그저 군인으로서 임무를 다했을 뿐이야. 우리 차례도 언젠가 올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002426"
msgid "I would give anything - anything - just to see her one more time."
msgstr "아내를 한 번만 더 볼 수 있다면 뭐든지, 뭐든지 할 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002425"
msgid "Nothing left for me now."
msgstr "이제 저에겐 아무것도 남지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MyloDazmi_Hello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002424"
msgid "What did we do to deserve this? What did I do?"
msgstr "저희가 뭘 잘못했다고 이런 일을 겪어야 하는 거죠? 제가 뭘 잘못한 거죠?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002423"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "반갑네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002422"
msgid "That damned Amila... I cannot wait to be rid of him."
msgstr "망할 아밀라... 얼른 녀석을 없애고 싶군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said in a whispering, prayer-like tone to himself
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_BorhalAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002421"
msgid "Great Serpent, give me the strength to do what must be done."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여. 저에게 해야 할 일을 할 수 있는 힘을 주소서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002420"
msgid "Unless this is important, leave me be."
msgstr "중요한 게 아니라면, 날 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241F"
msgid "Ugh, good day for a drink."
msgstr "으, 술 마시기 좋은 날이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241E"
msgid "Look who it is."
msgstr "이게 누구신가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: not mad or irritated. Said in a neutral tone, as if their mind is elsewhere / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_AmilaAdlam_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241D"
msgid "Bother someone else, would you?"
msgstr "딴 사람이나 귀찮게 하라고, 응?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241C"
msgid "Do not let Amila break you down."
msgstr "아밀라의 말에 휘둘리진 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: absent minded
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241B"
msgid "Much to do..."
msgstr "할 일이 많군요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_DanikaHagan_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00241A"
msgid "How are you handling everything?"
msgstr "잘 지내고 계신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: HVDazraMyloDazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMyloDazmi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108FD4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_MyloDazmi_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002419"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002418"
msgid "May the Great Serpent keep us safe."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 안전하게 지켜주시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said as a greeting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002417"
msgid "All right?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002416"
msgid "What? I am busy."
msgstr "뭐? 나 바빠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002415"
msgid "*Grumble* Damned, stupid groats."
msgstr "*투덜거림* 망할, 멍청한 그로트 녀석들."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: frustrated, said as a complaint
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MalikVosh_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002414"
