msgid "Diviner."
msgstr "예측자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C6"
msgid "Behave yourself. There is already enough trouble in Dazra to go around."
msgstr "처신 잘하십쇼. 다즈라에 골칫거리는 이미 충분히 많습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C5"
msgid "May the Great Serpent guide you. And the rest of us..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 그대를 인도하시길. 그리고 우리 모두를..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C4"
msgid "Perhaps it is not so where you are from, but we demand law and order here. Remember that."
msgstr "당신이 있던 곳은 그렇지 않을지 몰라도, 여기선 법과 질서를 요구합니다. 명심하십쇼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C3"
msgid "If it is a bottle of koza you need, Herald's Rest is the place."
msgstr "코자 한 병이 필요하다면, 전령의 안식처로 가 보십쇼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C2"
msgid "*Sigh* Dazra... it was once so beautiful."
msgstr "*한숨* 다즈라... 한때는 정말 아름다웠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C1"
msgid "Problem?"
msgstr "문제가 있습니까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023C0"
msgid "Do not agitate the locals. Many have already lost everything, they need no further troubles."
msgstr "여기 사람들을 자극하지 마십쇼. 많은 이들이 모든 걸 잃었습니다. 더 이상 문제를 일으키지 마십쇼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunGuards
#. TOPIC: 010838BF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HVGenericGuards_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0023BF"
msgid "Seems the Adlam brothers are arguing in the plaza again. That Amila has always been no good."
msgstr "애들럼 형제가 광장에서 또 다투는 것 같습니다. 아밀라 네는 항상 말썽입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
