#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "00239B"
msgid "Great Serpent keep you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 지켜주시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_FollowerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
