msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "응?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002399"
msgid "I pray that the Great Serpent will deliver us from our hardships soon..."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 곧 우리의 고난에서 구해주시길 기도해요..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Generic_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002398"
msgid "Our sins must have been considerable for the Great Serpent to subject us to this."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리에게 이런 시련을 주신 걸 보면 우리의 죄가 컸던 게 분명해요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002397"
msgid "Our supplies dwindle by the second. Great Serpent save us."
msgstr "우리의 물자가 시시각각 줄어들고 있습니다. 위대한 뱀이시여, 우리를 구하소서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002396"
msgid "Apologies... my mind is elsewhere."
msgstr "죄송합니다... 정신이 딴 데 팔려 있었군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002395"
msgid "If you do not need medical assistance, I suggest you move along."
msgstr "의료 지원이 필요 없으시면, 그냥 가시는 게 좋겠습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericWorker_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002394"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "음?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002393"
msgid "*Sigh* Our situation here is quite dire."
msgstr "*한숨* 이곳 상황이 꽤 심각합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale05
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericHealer_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002392"
msgid "Huh? Oh, forgive me, I am exhausted."
msgstr "허? 아, 죄송합니다. 제가 너무 지쳤군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
