#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002391"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "002390"
msgid "We will serve Dazra to the last man."
msgstr "우리는 마지막 한 명이 남을 때까지 다즈라를 섬길 것입니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00238F"
msgid "Many of our rank disappeared in the vortex. We were the lucky ones."
msgstr "우리 중 다수가 볼텍스 속에서 사라졌습니다. 우리는 운이 좋았죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00238E"
msgid "Seems the Great Serpent has chosen to spare us, but for how long?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리를 살려주시기로 하신 것 같은데, 얼마나 오래 갈지는 모르겠군요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericSoldier_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00238D"
msgid "I am grateful for the downtime, despite the circumstances."
msgstr "이런 상황이긴 하지만, 휴식 시간을 가질 수 있어서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said as a greeting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Orahim_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00238C"
msgid "All right?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

