#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002356"
msgid "Should you not be assisting Hasmak with whatever task he has given you?"
msgstr "해즈막이 너에게 맡긴 일이 뭔진 모르겠지만, 해즈막을 도와야 하지 않나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
