msgid "Your focus should be on House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "둘케프 가문 일에 집중해야 할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002354"
msgid "I believe House Ka'dic should have your full attention."
msgstr "너는 카딕 가문 일에 관심을 기울여야 할 거 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002353"
msgid "Razma would not appreciate you deviating from her current task."
msgstr "라즈마는 자기가 맡긴 현재 임무에서 자네가 이탈하는 걸 좋아하지 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Hasmak_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002352"
msgid "Whatever Razma has tasked you with deserves your full attention."
msgstr "라즈마가 자네에게 맡긴 일이 뭔진 모르겠지만 자네가 좀 관심을 기울여야 할 거 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
