msgctxt "002351"
msgid "Let me know when you have finished your business with House Ka'dic."
msgstr "카딕 가문 일이 끝나면 알려주게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Hasmak_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002350"
msgid "Finish what you start, and then we can talk."
msgstr "시작한 일을 끝내고 난 다음에 얘기하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Hasmak_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00234F"
msgid "House Veth'aal should be your focus right now."
msgstr "지금은 베타알 가문에 집중해야 할 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Relieved
