msgid "You're really here."
msgstr "정말로 왔구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You're really here.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're not imagining it. I'm really here.
