#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00234D"
msgid "I feared what I saw, that connection we made, was yet another vision... This is real, is it not?"
msgstr "내가 본 것이 두려웠다. 우리가 맺은 연결이 또 다른 환영은 아닐까 하고... 이건 진짜로구나. 그렇지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You're really here. &&& Anasko: I feared what I saw, that connection we made, was yet another vision... This is real, is it not?
