#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00234A"
msgid "We're here to rescue you."
msgstr "구해드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: 
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002349"
msgid "I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 날 이 악몽에서 구해주실 줄 알았느니라. 반드시 탈출구가 있을 거라 생각했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Most of the city is gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002348"
msgid "Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss."
msgstr "말해 다오. 다즈라는 어찌 됐느냐? 바룬 가문 신민들은? 아주 끔찍한... 환영을 보았다. 지독한 상실감이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not imagining it. I'm really here. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out. &&& Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there. &&& Anasko: Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I had hoped what I saw was only some terrible nightmare. But... I knew it to be true.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002347"
msgid "Most of the city is gone."
msgstr "도시 대부분이 사라져 버렸어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not imagining it. I'm really here. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out. &&& Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there. &&& Anasko: Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I saw things. Figments of guilt, I had hoped. But in my heart I knew them to be reality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002346"
msgid "Whatever you did here has ruined everything."
msgstr "여기서 뭘 했는지는 모르겠지만, 전부 망해 버렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not imagining it. I'm really here. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out. &&& Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there. &&& Anasko: Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You would make light of such a terrible thing? I can find no humor in this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002345"
msgid "Overpopulation won't be a problem for a long time. Maybe ever."
msgstr "앞으로 오랫동안 인구 과잉이 문제 될 일은 없을 거예요. 어쩌면 영원히요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're not imagining it. I'm really here. &&& ...  &&& Anasko: I knew the Serpent would deliver me from this nightmare, that there must be some way out. &&& Anasko: Every time I have attempted to leave this place, I find myself... lost. Wandering, unable to see. There is nothing out there. &&& Anasko: Tell me, what of Dazra? The people of House Va'ruun? I have had... terrible visions. A dreadful sense of loss.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your loyalty is noted, and indeed appreciated. I cannot help but mourn all that we have lost. All that I have caused.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010755A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002344"
msgid "Don't worry about it right now. We need to focus on getting you out of here."
msgstr "지금은 그런 걱정 하지 마세요. 여기서 빠져나가는 일에 집중하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002343"
msgid "What is unfair about saving two lives?"
msgstr "사람 목숨 두 명을 구하는 데 뭐가 불공평하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002342"
msgid "Would you rather stand there and watch as two brothers kill each other, or make an attempt to stop it?"
msgstr "형제들이 서로 죽이는 꼴을 가만히 보고 계실 거예요? 아니면 나서서 어떻게든 막으려고 시도라도 해보시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002341"
msgid "I'm doing you a favor by being your second. The least you can do is open up to me, so I know who I'm working with."
msgstr "당신의 입회인이 돼서 도와주고 있잖아요. 먼저 얘기부터 해 주시라고요. 지금 누구를 돕고 있는 건지 좀 압시다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: under your breath, more to yourself than anything else. / Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger.  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002340"
msgid "I have done many things I am not proud of, but I have never stooped as low as that."
msgstr "저도 자랑스럽지 않은 짓을 많이 하긴 했는데, 그 정도로 형편없는 짓까진 안 했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger.  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233F"
msgid "Whoa... I, uh, was not expecting something like that."
msgstr "워... 이런, 뒷이야기를 예상하지는 못했는데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger.  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233E"
msgid "Listen, I have my own family issues I'm grappling with, but that is... wow."
msgstr "나도 가족 문제로 속앓이를 해 오고 있지만 이건 참... 이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger.  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within!
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233D"
msgid "That is horrible."
msgstr "끔찍하기도 해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somewhat sarcastic, but mostly surprised that someone was able to see through him.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233C"
msgid "Oh, you have me all figured out, do you?"
msgstr "오, 날 다 파악하셨다 이거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233B"
msgid "Ugh... You are right, I am hurting inside. That almost made me vomit."
msgstr "으... 그쪽 말이 맞아. 마음은 안 좋지. 형 말에 거의 토할 뻔했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& Danika: Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats.  &&& Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. |Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel. |As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this.  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00233A"
msgid "You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair."
msgstr "지금 두 사람의 목숨을 우리의 손에 맡기려는 거잖아요. 이런 책임을 지게 하다니, 불공평해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& Danika: Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats.  &&& Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. |Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel. |As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this.  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002339"
msgid "Hey, this wasn't in the job description. We're getting too involved, here."
msgstr "입회자 일을 맡기 전엔 이런 일까지 해야 한다는 얘긴 없었잖아. 이건 도가 지나친데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002338"
msgid "If it will get you to leave me alone, perhaps it is worth it."
msgstr "날 내버려둘 거라면... 해볼 만하겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002337"
msgid "You may be my second, but you are not my friend. The less you know about me, the better."
msgstr "그쪽이 내 입회인 일진 몰라도, 내 친구는 아니잖아. 나에 대해선 적게 알수록 더 좋을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002336"
msgid "Your attitude is all an act. I know you're hurting inside."
msgstr "그 태도, 진심이 아니잖아요. 속마음은 안 좋은 거 다 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002335"
msgid "*Sigh* True enough."
msgstr "*한숨* 그렇네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002334"
msgid "You have free will like the rest of us, no one forced you to do anything."
msgstr "그쪽도 다른 사람들처럼 자유 의지가 있잖아. 누가 억지로 시켜서 하는 게 아니잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002333"
msgid "You roped me into this, and I don't like dealing with people either."
msgstr "이 일에 저를 끌어들였잖아요. 저 사람 대하는 거 안 좋아해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002332"
msgid "You are very persistent..."
msgstr "아주 끈질기군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002331"
msgid "Save us both some time and leave me alone now."
msgstr "서로 시간 낭비하지 말자고. 나 좀 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002330"
msgid "Just talk to me for a bit, and then I'll leave you alone."
msgstr "잠시 저하고 얘기 좀 하면 됩니다. 그다음 혼자 계시게 떠나드릴 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232F"
msgid "You seem to be taking this all very seriously."
msgstr "입회인 일에 전부 아주 진지하게 임하고 있나 보군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232E"
msgid "Why is this so important to you?"
msgstr "대체 그게 그쪽한테 뭐가 중요한데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232D"
msgid "Am I really your second if you won't even talk to me?"
msgstr "저랑 얘기도 안 하려 드는데, 왜 당신 입회인 노릇을 해야 합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232C"
msgid "Does being my second truly mean so much to you?"
msgstr "내 입회인이 된 것이 당신에게 그렇게 의미가 큰 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232B"
msgid "It does not matter. None of this matters."
msgstr "상관 없어. 전부 다 상관 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00232A"
msgid "I want to be the best second I can be, and this will help me."
msgstr "훌륭하게 입회인 역할을 하고 싶어서 그런 겁니다. 먼저 얘기를 해 주셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: cringing  / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002329"
msgid "If you will stop embarrassing yourself..."
msgstr "창피한 짓 좀 그만 해준다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002328"
msgid "Bah, you are joking."
msgstr "흥, 농담도 잘 하시네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_AmilaSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002327"
msgid "Please?"
msgstr "제발 좀 얘기 좀 하시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002326"
msgid "If that is the case..."
msgstr "그렇다면야..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002325"
msgid "I do not see how that is possible."
msgstr "그렇게 될 것 같진 않군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002324"
msgid "This will help me be a better second for Amila."
msgstr "이렇게 해야 제가 아밀라의 입회인 역할을 더 잘 할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002323"
msgid "True, I am sure this experience has been confusing for you."
msgstr "그렇지. 확실히 자네에겐 혼란스럽게 느껴질 것 같긴 하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: matter of fact / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002322"
msgid "No, it is better not to grow close to any of us. One of us will die, after all."
msgstr "아닐세. 우리가 서로 친해질 필요는 없네. 둘 중 하나는 결국 죽을 테니 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002321"
msgid "It's just weird. I'm expected to be a second, but I still barely know either of you."
msgstr "이상하지 않습니까. 제가 입회인까지 됐는데, 두 형제에 관해 거의 알려 주지 않다니요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 01118E57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_AndrahSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002320"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "흠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: matter of fact / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231F"
msgid "Even still, there is no point."
msgstr "그렇다 해도, 그게 무슨 의미가 있는지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231E"
msgid "This might be your last chance to have a real conversation with someone."
msgstr "다른 사람과 제대로 대화를 나눌 기회는 이번이 마지막일지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231D"
msgid "*Sigh* Perhaps that will not be necessary."
msgstr "*한숨* 꼭 그래야 할 필요는 없을지도..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: matter of fact / Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231C"
msgid "And I can be very patient. I have put up with Amila for my whole life, for instance."
msgstr "그리고 난 인내심이 강하네. 예를 들면, 평생 동생 아밀라의 뒷바라지를 해 줬지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231B"
msgid "I'll keep asking if I need to. I can be really annoying."
msgstr "필요하다면 계속 캐물을 겁니다. 이래 봬도 고집이 정말 세다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: somewhat confused. / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00231A"
msgid "If Danika says so. Perhaps there was something I missed..."
msgstr "다니카가 그렇게 말했다면... 내가 놓친 게 있을지도 모르지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: he knows the rules of the duel and that this isn't a necessary part. confused / Puzzled / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002319"
msgid "What? That is not true. Why would she say that?"
msgstr "뭐? 그건 사실이 아닐세. 왜 다니카가 그런 말을 했지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002318"
msgid "Danika told me that this was part of my duties. You need to talk to me."
msgstr "다니카의 말로는, 이것도 제가 할 일이라던데요. 저한테 얘길 해 주셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002317"
msgid "Hmmm... if you are sure this will aid you..."
msgstr "흐음... 이게 자네에게 정말 도움이 된다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002316"
msgid "I do not believe I am."
msgstr "그럴 것 같진 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002315"
msgid "You're just making my job more difficult."
msgstr "이럴수록 제 일도 더 힘들어질 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: defensive.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002314"
msgid "I am not incapable of communication."
msgstr "내가 소통을 못하는 편은 아니네만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002313"
msgid "*Pffft* Now you are simply being instigating."
msgstr "*피식하는 소리* 이젠 날 자극하려 하는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_BorhalSpeechChallenge07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002312"
msgid "No wonder your relationship with Amila is in the gutter. You're incapable of communication."
msgstr "아밀라와 왜 그렇게 사이가 안 좋은지 바로 알겠네요. 제대로 소통도 할 줄 모르잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Go on, ask your questions again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002311"
msgid "Enough, enough. You have broken me down."
msgstr "이제 그만, 그만해. 내가 졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002310"
msgid "Enough of this. Just leave me in peace, will you?"
msgstr "이제 그만하자. 나 좀 내버려 두라고, 응?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00230F"
msgid "You have made some valid points. I will answer your questions."
msgstr "자네가 몇 가지 중요한 부분을 짚어 주었으니, 질문에 답해 보겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It seems like your mind is made up, so I'll leave you to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00230E"
msgid "That is enough. I will not answer any prying questions from you."
msgstr "그 정도면 됐어. 자네가 캐묻는 질문에는 더 이상 답하지 않을 거라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to ask you some more personal questions. &&& Borhal: No, you are not my second. I do not see how this is pertinent to your duties.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Again, I do not see how this is pertinent. You are just wasting our time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00230D"
msgid "Maybe your answers to my questions will help me with my job."
msgstr "제 질문에 답해주시면 입회인 일이 좀 더 쉬워질 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe your answers to my questions will help me with my job.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe your answers to my questions will help me with my job.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: You have made some valid points. I will answer your questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010755C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00230C"
msgid "Again, I do not see how this is pertinent. You are just wasting our time."
msgstr "다시 말하지만, 알아서 뭐 하려는 건지 모르겠군. 시간 낭비일 뿐이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: What is it? I need to prepare.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01073B42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002308"
msgid "You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't."
msgstr "결투를 취소해야 합니다. 안 그럼 결국 후회하게 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: *Sigh* I have given him every chance, every credit... I have begged him to turn himself around.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01073B41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002307"
msgid "I will do no such thing, and will feel no regrets in avenging Amila's constant dishonors."
msgstr "그런 짓을 할 것 같은가? 계속해서 가문의 이름에 먹칠한 아밀라에게 복수할 거고, 절대 후회하지 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: What is it? I need to prepare.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good, we are of one mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01073B40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002306"
msgid "I'm just here because Danika told me I need to be. I think the duel should move forward."
msgstr "다니카 씨가 시켜서 이곳에 온 것 뿐입니다. 저는 그냥 결투가 속행돼야 한다고 보거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm just here because Danika told me I need to be. I think the duel should move forward.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm just here because Danika told me I need to be. I think the duel should move forward.
