msgid "Good, we are of one mind."
msgstr "좋아. 우리 서로 생각이 같구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Knowing more about you and Amila will help me be a better second for him. Help me out here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Knowing more about you and Amila will help me be a better second for him. Help me out here.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
