#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002304"
msgid "*Sigh* Understandable. If it is a help to you, then ask what you must."
msgstr "*한숨* 이해하네. 자네에게 도움이 될 거라면, 꼭 질문해야 할 것은 묻도록 하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: One way or another, you won't have to worry about him soon. &&& Borhal: Right. I take no pleasure in this, but after today, what he did... he needs to be dealt with.
