#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002303"
msgid "Knowing more about you and Amila will help me be a better second for him. Help me out here."
msgstr "제가 당신과 아밀라에 관해 잘 알고 있어야 입회인 역할을 더 잘하게 될 겁니다. 좀 도와주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
