#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022F0"
msgid "Ah, my head... what did you do? Something was in that drink!"
msgstr "아, 내 머리... 무슨 짓을 한 거지? 잔에다 약을 탔구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, my head... what did you do? Something was in that drink!
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: You hate me so much that you would stoop to cheating?
