#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_11_DuelScene_AmilaPoisoned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022EF"
msgid "Nonsense. This cowardly trickery is beneath even you."
msgstr "헛소리를 하는군. 겁쟁이처럼 속임수를 쓰는 건 네놈한테도 저열한 짓이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: nauseous, in pain / Angry / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, my head... what did you do? Something was in that drink! &&& Borhal: Nonsense. This cowardly trickery is beneath even you. 
