msgid "That was all."
msgstr "더 할 말은 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Nonsense. This cowardly trickery is beneath even you.  &&& Amila: You hate me so much that you would stoop to cheating?
