#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010737AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_11_DuelScene_AmilaPoisoned
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022EB"
msgid "That is the final insult to my honor you will ever deliver."
msgstr "내 명예를 모욕하는 상소리는 그것으로 마지막이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The koza ruined him. Once he began living at the bottom of a bottle, everything changed. I am just... exhausted by him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010737A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022E8"
msgid "In your mind, what caused this rift between you two?"
msgstr "당신이 보기에, 서로 사이가 안 좋아진 이유가 뭐라 생각합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: In your mind, what caused this rift between you two?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In your mind, what caused this rift between you two?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010737A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022E7"
msgid "The koza ruined him. Once he began living at the bottom of a bottle, everything changed. I am just... exhausted by him."
msgstr "코자가 녀석을 망친 걸세. 술독에 빠져 살기 시작하자 모든 게 바뀌었어. 나는 그저... 동생 모습에 지쳐버렸고 말이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: In your mind, what caused this rift between you two?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010737A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022E6"
msgid "It is exhausting to constantly be blamed by him for all of his problems, while always being expected to forgive and help him when he demands."
msgstr ""
"정말 지친단 말일세. 동생 녀석은 자기 문제를 두고 다 형 탓을 하네. 게다가 녀석은 뻔뻔하게도 자기가 요구하면 언제든 당연히 내가 "
"용서하고 도와줘야 한다고 여기지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you hate your brother?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0110D729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022E3"
msgid "I am sure Amila will spin a tale about his hard life. But the truth is that he has always been a miscreant and a troublemaker."
msgstr "아밀라는 분명 자기 인생이 힘들었다며 이야기를 늘어놓을 걸세. 그러나 진상은... 녀석은 항상 골칫덩어리였고 문제아였네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Show some respect and answer the questions." &&& Borhal:  &&& companion: Show a modicum of respect and answer the questions. &&& Borhal: Yes... my apologies, you are right. Forgive my ignorance. I will answer any questions you have for me.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Groat shit. I was by his side for years afterwards supporting him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107379E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022E0"
msgid "Amila feels that you gave up on him after the loss of his wife."
msgstr "아밀라는 자신의 아내와 사별한 후, 당신이 동생을 포기했다고 느끼고 있더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amila feels that you gave up on him after the loss of his wife.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amila feels that you gave up on him after the loss of his wife.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107379D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022DF"
msgid "Groat shit. I was by his side for years afterwards supporting him."
msgstr "헛소리야. 난 항상 그 이후 몇 년 동안 동생 곁을 지켜 왔네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amila feels that you gave up on him after the loss of his wife.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107379D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022DE"
msgid "I was saddened by her passing, and I cannot imagine what Amila went through during that time. But how many years am I expected to take care of him? To smack the bottles from his hand, to pay the bail when he was caught stealing?"
msgstr ""
"나도 제수씨의 죽음에 슬펐고, 그 동안 아밀라가 어떤 기분을 겪었을지 상상할 수가 없네. 하지만 내가 녀석을 몇 년이나 돌봐줘야 하나? "
"몇 번이나 놈이 쥐고 있던 술병을 깨트리고, 도둑질하다 잡혔을 때 보석금을 내줘야 한단 말인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amila feels that you gave up on him after the loss of his wife.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Your parents treated you and Amila horribly. Why do you care about their memory so much?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107379D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_BorhalQuestionsBranch
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022DD"
msgid "I have done more for him in ten years than he has ever done for me in our lifetimes."
msgstr "지난 10년 동안 녀석을 위해 해 준 것들은 걔가 내게 평생 해 준 것보다 더 많았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You should call the duel off. You'll end up regretting it if you don't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072095
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_07_SpeakWithBorhal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022DC"
msgid "What is it? I need to prepare."
msgstr "뭔가? 준비를 해둬야 한단 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm ready to get started.
