#. TOPIC: 010720C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022CC"
msgid "Are you ready to discuss our roles?"
msgstr "우리가 할 일에 대해 논의할 준비가 되셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you ready to discuss our roles?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is our duty to prepare for the duel by procuring weapons and preparing for any ceremonies, as well as ensuring a fair fight. 
