#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022CB"
msgid "Hold on, what does a second do again?"
msgstr "잠깐만요. 입회인은 무슨 일을 해야 한다고 했죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022CA"
msgid "Oh, they are deadly serious. Borhal would not have dared to challenge Amila if not."
msgstr "아, 둘 다 심각하게 진심일 거예요. 그렇지 않았으면 보할이 아밀라한테 결투를 신청하지도 않았겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I'm ready to get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C9"
msgid "The Adlam family has held duels in the past. It is something of a family tradition."
msgstr "애들럼 가문은 과거에도 결투를 벌였었죠. 가문의 전통같이 돼버렸네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait, the Adlam family has held duels before?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C8"
msgid "Yes, there was a duel between their two great grandfathers, I believe. From what Borhal has told me, it began as a property dispute."
msgstr "네. 두 형제의 증조부 대에서 결투가 있었다더군요. 보할의 얘기로는 재산 갈등 때문이었다고 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C7"
msgid "Their uncle died in a duel after being challenged by their grandfather. He was accused of stealing family heirlooms."
msgstr "두 형제의 삼촌도 형제의 할아버지에게 결투 신청을 받았고, 끝내 사망했대요. 가보를 훔쳤다는 혐의를 받았거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I'm ready to get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C6"
msgid "History, it seems, repeats itself."
msgstr "역사가 아무래도, 반복되나 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hold on, what does a second do again?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hold on, what does a second do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C5"
msgid "It is our duty to prepare for the duel by procuring weapons and preparing for any ceremonies, as well as ensuring a fair fight."
msgstr "입회인으로서 우린 결투가 진행되도록 무기와 의식을 준비하고 공정한 싸움이 될 수 있도록 감시해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hold on, what does a second do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C4"
msgid "Importantly, we are not expected to engage in any combat. Unless, of course, we are staving off an ambush."
msgstr "중요한 건 우린 싸움에 절대 끼어들면 안된다는 거예요. 우리가 먼저 급습이라도 당하지 않는 이상은요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hold on, what does a second do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I'm ready to get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C3"
msgid "In short, we are to guarantee that the duel proceeds without issue."
msgstr "간단히 말하면 우린 결투가 문제 없이 진행되도록만 해주면 돼요."

