#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C2"
msgid "No concerns here."
msgstr "따로 걱정되는 건 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm ready to get started. &&& Danika: Very good, let us begin.  &&& Danika: Your primary duty as Amila's second is to work with the brothers and see if a peaceful conclusion is possible. Namely, if Amila apologizes to Borhal, and he accepts, the duel may not move forward.|As for me, I will be procuring the weapons for the duel, and the materials for the preceding ceremony. |Borhal as challenger reserves the right to choose the weapons, and he has chosen blades. Do you have any concerns?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmm... I will note your concern. But know that Borhal has the final say.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C1"
msgid "From what I've heard, Amila is a drunkard. Amila doesn't stand a chance against Borhal in a duel with blades."
msgstr "얘길 들어 보니, 아밀라는 주정뱅이라더군요. 보할과 근접 전투를 하게 되면 이길 가능성이 없을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you ready to discuss our roles?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and it seems that the cycle will continue, unless you are able to get the brothers to agree to a peaceful resolution. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022C0"
msgid "This family has an unfortunate and violent history."
msgstr "이 가문의 역사는 불행하고 폭력적인 과거사로 얼룩져 있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm ready to get started.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm ready to get started.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Your primary duty as Amila's second is to work with the brothers and see if a peaceful conclusion is possible. Namely, if Amila apologizes to Borhal, and he accepts, the duel may not move forward.
