#. TOPIC: 010720C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BF"
msgid "Very good, let us begin."
msgstr "좋아요. 그럼 시작하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: From what I've heard, Amila is a drunkard. Amila doesn't stand a chance against Borhal in a duel with blades. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: From what I've heard, Amila is a drunkard. Amila doesn't stand a chance against Borhal in a duel with blades. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties. 
