#. TOPIC: 010720BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BE"
msgid "Hmmm... I will note your concern. But know that Borhal has the final say."
msgstr "흐음... 그 말은 명심하도록 하죠. 하지만 최종 결정은 보할만이 내릴 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No concerns here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No concerns here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties. 
