#. TOPIC: 010720BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BD"
msgid "Very good."
msgstr "좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Very good. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BC"
msgid "If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties."
msgstr "그게 다라면, 각자 맡은 일을 다하러 가도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No concerns here. &&& Danika: Very good.  &&& Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties.  &&& Danika: Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this.|I will try and find another peaceful solution to this problem, should you be unsuccessful in convincing them to call it off.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Speak to the brothers and inquire if there is any opportunity for a peaceful resolution. Usually this would require Amila to apologize to Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BB"
msgid "Sorry, what am I supposed to do again?"
msgstr "죄송한데, 제가 뭘 해야 한다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Very good, let us begin. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022BA"
msgid "Your primary duty as Amila's second is to work with the brothers and see if a peaceful conclusion is possible. Namely, if Amila apologizes to Borhal, and he accepts, the duel may not move forward."
msgstr ""
"당신은 아밀라의 입회인으로서 형제들과 얘기를 나눠보시고 평화적으로 결투를 중단시킬 수 있는지 알아보셔야 해요. 아밀라가 사과를 하고, "
"보할이 받아 준다면 결투는 벌어지지 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B9"
msgid "As for me, I will be procuring the weapons for the duel, and the materials for the preceding ceremony."
msgstr "그동안 저는 결투에 쓰일 무기와 의식을 치르는 데 쓰일 도구를 준비할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No concerns here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B8"
msgid "Borhal as challenger reserves the right to choose the weapons, and he has chosen blades. Do you have any concerns?"
msgstr "보할은 결투 신청자로서 무기를 결정할 권한이 있어요. 결국 칼을 선택했죠. 이와 관해 혹시 걱정되는 게 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you ready to discuss our roles?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very good, let us begin. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B7"
msgid "I'm ready to get started."
msgstr "일할 준비가 됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This family has an unfortunate and violent history.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This family has an unfortunate and violent history.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I'm ready to get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B6"
msgid "Yes, and it seems that the cycle will continue, unless you are able to get the brothers to agree to a peaceful resolution."
msgstr "네, 또 과거가 반복되는 것 같네요. 당신이 나서서 형제들이 평화롭게 문제를 해결하도록 독려해 주지 않는다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B5"
msgid "Yes, Amila was out of control. What happened here today was necessary, but I garner no joy from it."
msgstr "그래, 아밀라는 자제심을 잃었어. 오늘 이곳에서 벌어진 일은 반드시 행해져야 했지만 전혀 즐겁지 않았네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: It is done. |May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, Amila was out of control. What happened here today was necessary, but I garner no joy from it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B4"
msgid "It had to be done, Borhal."
msgstr "해야만 하는 일이었습니다, 보할 씨."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Inaza
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: You are Promised. You are one of us. All should treat you as an equal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0110B399
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_TL_Inaza_WhatNow
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B3"
msgid "What happens now?"
msgstr "이제 어떻게 해야 되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, Borhal has the right to choose the weapon. Does Amila have the right to anything? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait, Borhal has the right to choose the weapon. Does Amila have the right to anything? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B2"
msgid "Amila has the right to deliver a genuine apology to Borhal and stop this duel before it commences."
msgstr "아밀라에겐 진심을 담아 보할에게 사과할 수 있는 권리가 있지요. 그럼 이 결투를 중단시킬 수 있을 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait, Borhal has the right to choose the weapon. Does Amila have the right to anything? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Let's get going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B1"
msgid "The odds of him doing so, however, are low. The Adlam brothers, like their ancestors, are stubborn and prideful."
msgstr "다만 그럴 확률이 낮죠. 애들럼 가문의 형제들은 조상님들과 똑같이 고집과 자존심이 세니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you ready to discuss our roles?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, they are deadly serious. Borhal would not have dared to challenge Amila if not. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022B0"
msgid "They aren't serious, right? There isn't actually going to be a duel."
msgstr "진심은 아니겠죠? 설마 정말로 서로 결투를 벌이진 않겠요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you ready to discuss our roles?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, they are deadly serious. Borhal would not have dared to challenge Amila if not. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AF"
msgid "Wait, the Adlam family has held duels before?"
msgstr "잠깐만요. 전에도 애들럼 가문 사람들끼리 결투를 벌였단 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No concerns here. &&& Danika: Very good.  &&& Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties.  &&& Danika: Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this.|I will try and find another peaceful solution to this problem, should you be unsuccessful in convincing them to call it off.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Report back to me when you have spoken with the brothers. We will discuss your secondary duty then. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AE"
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "시작해 보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: *Sigh* I need to be alone with my brother.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AD"
msgid "Your duty as a second has ended. Take your payment and leave me."
msgstr "입회인으로서 자네가 할 일은 끝났어. 이 돈 받고 이만 가게나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AC"
msgid "It is time for me to tend to my brother's body."
msgstr "이제 동생의 사체를 수습할 때로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens now?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AB"
msgid "You have fulfilled your duties as second, and will receive your payment in full."
msgstr "입회인으로서 의무를 다했으니 보상을 전액 지급하겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens now?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022AA"
msgid "As for Danika and I... we must prepare Amila's body for cremation."
msgstr "다니카와 나는... 아밀라의 시신을 화장할 준비를 해야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ha! By the Great Serpent, I have done it! I survived! &&& Amila: I have done it... I have... I... |*Sobs* By the Great Serpent... I have survived.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, I do not need your comfort. A duel is what he asked for, and he got what he wanted, the fool.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072091
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A9"
msgid "It's all right, Amila. It was you or him."
msgstr "다 괜찮습니다, 아밀라... 둘 중 한 사람만 살 수 있었잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Realization is setting in. He is realizing he has killed his brother, this is nothing to celebrate about / Disbelief / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ha! By the Great Serpent, I have done it! I survived!
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072093
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A8"
msgid "I have done it... I have... I..."
msgstr "해냈다... 내가... 내..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Extremely sad. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072093
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A7"
msgid "*Sobs* By the Great Serpent... I have survived."
msgstr "*흐느낌* 위대한 뱀이시여... 내가 살아남았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Plugging in the necessary variables...
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Harbinger, will you do us the honor?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell_1000_Ekris_FinalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A6"
msgid "It is done."
msgstr "완료됐다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It had to be done, Borhal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BorhalSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A5"
msgid "May Amila's tormented soul finally find rest in death."
msgstr "아밀라의 고통받던 영혼이 마침내 죽음으로 안식을 찾기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: But don't I only get paid if one of them dies?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But don't I only get paid if one of them dies?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A4"
msgid "Unbelievable. You would prefer to line your pockets instead of halting bloodshed?"
msgstr "믿을 수가 없네요. 유혈 사태를 멈출 생각은 안 하고 돈 벌 궁리만 하는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: But don't I only get paid if one of them dies?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A3"
msgid "Nevermind that, I will ensure that you receive some form of compensation. I will see what I can do."
msgstr "걱정하지 마세요. 보상은 꼭 받게 해 드릴 테니까요. 드릴 게 있는지 찾아볼게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ha! By the Great Serpent, I have done it! I survived! &&& Amila: I have done it... I have... I... |*Sobs* By the Great Serpent... I have survived.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... I do not know, I was sure I would lose. I do not know what to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A2"
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "이젠 어쩔 셈입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& ...  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair.  &&& Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Unbelievable. You would prefer to line your pockets instead of halting bloodshed? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A1"
msgid "But don't I only get paid if one of them dies?"
msgstr "둘 중 한 사람이 죽어야 제가 돈을 받을 수 있는 거 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, what am I supposed to do again?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sorry, what am I supposed to do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0022A0"
msgid "Speak to the brothers and inquire if there is any opportunity for a peaceful resolution. Usually this would require Amila to apologize to Borhal."
msgstr ""
"형제들에게 말을 해 보고, 평화적으로 이 일을 해결할 수 있을지 알아보세요. 이럴 땐 일반적으로 아밀라가 보할에게 사과를 해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, what am I supposed to do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229F"
msgid "As unlikely as that would be, though, Borhal can always decline the apology, and the duel will commence."
msgstr "다만 그럴 것 같지는 않네요. 보할은 사과를 거절할 수 있고, 그럼 결투는 시작되고 말 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, what am I supposed to do again?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Let's get going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229E"
msgid "Your odds of success are... infinitesimal, but tradition decrees that you make the attempt regardless."
msgstr "성공 가능성은... 극히 희박하지만, 그래도 전통대로 한다면 시도는 해볼 수는 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: This duel was a mistake; a pointless tragedy. And I cannot even get mad at you for what you did, because... because I know that all of this is my fault.|It took the death of my brother for me to see what I have become...
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229D"
msgid "I wish to be alone now. Your duties are fulfilled."
msgstr "이제 혼자 있고 싶군. 당신은 할 일 다 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229C"
msgid "Your reward. Now go, leave me."
msgstr "보상 받아. 이제 가. 날 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked, happy / Happy / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: I have done it... I have... I... 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072094
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229B"
msgid "Ha! By the Great Serpent, I have done it! I survived!"
msgstr "하! 위대한 뱀이시여, 내가 이겼어! 살았다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nauseous / Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Ugh... what the hell is this? What did you do?|What is this... ugh... sabotage? &&& Danika: This duel was an asinine idea, Borhal. We put a stop to it.|There is no use for needless bloodshed in times like these. We must come together, not kill one another.  &&& Borhal: You traitorous... ugh... you betray me, and then you lecture me?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00229A"
msgid "Ugh... enough of your grousing Borhal... your precious duel can wait."
msgstr "윽... 불평 좀 작작해, 보할... 이놈의 결투는 나중에 하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: pained, nauseous  / Irritated / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Enough of your taunting. This is not over. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002299"
msgid "Or are you truly so determined to kill me?"
msgstr "아니면 뭐야? 죽이고 싶어 환장하셨나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Enough of your taunting. This is not over.  &&& Amila: I am counting on that.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072084
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002298"
msgid "Remove yourselves. We must rest."
msgstr "다들 나가. 좀 쉬어야겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072084
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002297"
msgid "But know that you have only delayed the inevitable."
msgstr "명심하라고. 결국 일어날 일을 잠시 늦춘 것뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, nauseous  / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002296"
msgid "Ugh... what the hell is this? What did you do?"
msgstr "윽... 이게 뭐야? 무슨 짓을 한 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: angry, nauseous / Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: This duel was an asinine idea, Borhal. We put a stop to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002295"
msgid "What is this... ugh... sabotage?"
msgstr "이게 무슨... 윽... 짓거리야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Ugh... what the hell is this? What did you do?|What is this... ugh... sabotage?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002294"
msgid "This duel was an asinine idea, Borhal. We put a stop to it."
msgstr "결투를 벌이다니 정말 어리석네요. 보할. 그래서 방해한 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: You traitorous... ugh... you betray me, and then you lecture me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002293"
msgid "There is no use for needless bloodshed in times like these. We must come together, not kill one another."
msgstr "요즘 같은 시국에 이렇게 쓰잘데기 없이 유혈 사태를 벌여서야 쓰나요. 서로 죽이지 말고, 다 함께 힘을 합쳐야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No concerns here. &&& Danika: Very good.  &&& Danika: If that is all, we will break here and see to our duties.  &&& Danika: Before that, though... I know that this duel is foolish. I am sorry you got pulled into this.|I will try and find another peaceful solution to this problem, should you be unsuccessful in convincing them to call it off.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Amila has the right to deliver a genuine apology to Borhal and stop this duel before it commences. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002292"
msgid "Wait, Borhal has the right to choose the weapon. Does Amila have the right to anything?"
msgstr "잠깐만요. 보할에게 결투 무기를 선택할 권리가 있다고요? 아밀라에겐 아무 권리도 없는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad, does not really mean what he is saying. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072090
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002291"
msgid "No, I do not need your comfort. A duel is what he asked for, and he got what he wanted, the fool."
msgstr "됐어. 동정받고 싶지 않아. 결투는 형이 신청한 거고, 그에 맞는 대가를 치른 거야. 멍청이 같으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad - he doesn't really mean what he is saying / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Ugh! This... this should not have happened!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072090
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002290"
msgid "He put me in this position. Damn him, damn him."
msgstr "형이면서 날 이런 식으로 몰아붙이다니. 빌어먹을 인간, 빌어먹을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Ugh... what the hell is this? What did you do?|What is this... ugh... sabotage? &&& Danika: This duel was an asinine idea, Borhal. We put a stop to it.|There is no use for needless bloodshed in times like these. We must come together, not kill one another. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Ugh... enough of your grousing Borhal... your precious duel can wait.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072088
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00228F"
msgid "You traitorous... ugh... you betray me, and then you lecture me?"
msgstr "배신했구나... 윽... 신뢰를 저버린 걸로도 모자라서, 설교까지 하는 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's get going. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get going. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010720B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_05_SpeakWithDanika01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00228E"
msgid "Report back to me when you have spoken with the brothers. We will discuss your secondary duty then."
msgstr "형제들과 이야기를 나눈 뒤 다시 제게 보고하러 와 주세요. 그다음 해야 할 일을 논의하도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ugh... enough of your grousing Borhal... your precious duel can wait.|Or are you truly so determined to kill me? &&& Borhal: Enough of your taunting. This is not over. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Remove yourselves. We must rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072085
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00228C"
msgid "I am counting on that."
msgstr "거 참 기대되네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What now?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00228A"
msgid "I... I do not know, I was sure I would lose. I do not know what to do."
msgstr "난... 모르겠어. 분명 내가 질거라 생각했는데. 이제 어쩔지 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What now?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: It's all right, Amila. It was you or him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0107208C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_AmilaSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002289"
msgid "But his body cannot be left like this."
msgstr "형 시체를 이대로 두면 안 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: You traitorous... ugh... you betray me, and then you lecture me? &&& Amila: Ugh... enough of your grousing Borhal... your precious duel can wait.|Or are you truly so determined to kill me?
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: I am counting on that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01072086
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_12_BothBrothersSurvived
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002288"
msgid "Enough of your taunting. This is not over."
msgstr "도발은 관두시지. 결투는 끝나지 않은 줄 알아라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002279"
msgid "I welcome you, fellow traveler."
msgstr "환영하오, 동료 여행자여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002278"
msgid "Have you come seeking redemption for your sins?"
msgstr "저지른 죄에서 구원받기 위해 오셨소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071560
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002277"
msgid "Or has your journey brought you here for some other purpose?"
msgstr "아니면 다른 목적으로 인해 이곳에 다다르게 된 것이오?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: I welcome you, fellow traveler.|Have you come seeking redemption for your sins?|Or has your journey brought you here for some other purpose?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An explorer as well as a traveler, then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107155E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002276"
msgid "I was just looking around."
msgstr "그냥 구경 중이었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was just looking around.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was just looking around.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107155D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002272"
msgid "An explorer as well as a traveler, then."
msgstr "탐험가이자 여행자인 것이구료."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Please do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071557
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002271"
msgid "Ah, thank you, my friend."
msgstr "아, 고맙구려. 나의 친구여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is that why you're here? For redemption?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is that why you're here? For redemption?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071555
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002270"
msgid "When I was a younger man, the answer would have been yes, and more times than I care to admit."
msgstr "내가 젊은이었을 땐 그 질문에 맞다고 답했을 것이오. 그것도 몇 번이나 강조할 정도로 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is that why you're here? For redemption?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071555
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226F"
msgid "But for now, I am simply here to think and to pray in peaceful solitude."
msgstr "하지만 지금은 평온히, 또 홀로 명상과 기도를 하기 위해 이곳에 있다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I might have committed a sin or two in my time. &&& VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful. &&& companion: That makes one of you. &&& VijunAhkmav: I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption.|There is no cause for shame. We must each choose the time that is right for us to make the journey.|I would be happy to explain the custom if you like.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: When I was a younger man, the answer would have been yes, and more times than I care to admit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071556
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226E"
msgid "Is that why you're here? For redemption?"
msgstr "그래서 이곳에 계시는 겁니까? 구원을 받으려고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please do. &&& VijunAhkmav: Ah, thank you, my friend.|Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path. &&& VijunAhkmav: Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society.|To sin against the Great Serpent demands an act of absolution.|We first come here to pray for forgiveness, and then we make a journey.|We travel to each of the Wayshrines, reading their words and contemplating their meaning.|When that is done, we return here to renew our pledge of devotion to the Great Serpent.|In this way, we are redeemed.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, there are sights to behold, I promise you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071553
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226D"
msgid "I'd like to take in the sights, so I'll visit these Wayshrines."
msgstr "저는 관광을 좋아해서 말입니다. 그 성소들을 방문해 봐야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly, welcoming / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226C"
msgid "Welcome back, traveler. Tell me, how was your journey?"
msgstr "돌아온 걸 환영하오, 여행자여. 그 여정은 어땠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Welcome back, traveler. Tell me, how was your journey?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It pleases me to hear you say so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226B"
msgid "It was illuminating. I learned what is truly important to the chosen."
msgstr "계몽적이었습니다. 저는 선택받은 자에게 무엇이 진정으로 중요한지 깨우쳤습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was illuminating. I learned what is truly important to the chosen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was illuminating. I learned what is truly important to the chosen.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00226A"
msgid "It pleases me to hear you say so."
msgstr "그렇게 말해 주니 나도 기쁘다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was illuminating. I learned what is truly important to the chosen.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002269"
msgid "Understanding is the beginning of wisdom."
msgstr "이해야말로 지혜의 첫 걸음이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Welcome back, traveler. Tell me, how was your journey?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have always believed the purpose of the words is to remind us of our values.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002267"
msgid "I didn't really learn anything that surprised me."
msgstr "딱히 놀랄 만한 것은 배우지 못했는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: As have we all. |I assure you, I make no judgements. It is not my place to do so.|Such things are between you and the Great Serpent alone.|But have no fear, my friend, for the Serpent is merciful. &&& companion: That makes one of you.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107155A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002266"
msgid "I suspect you have yet to walk the Path of Redemption."
msgstr "그대는 아직 구원의 길을 걷지 않은 것 같구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reassuring / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107155A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002265"
msgid "There is no cause for shame. We must each choose the time that is right for us to make the journey."
msgstr "부끄러워할 것 없소. 저마다 여행을 떠나기에 알맞는 시간은 서로 다르기 때문이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Please do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107155A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002263"
msgid "I would be happy to explain the custom if you like."
msgstr "혹시 괜찮다면 우리의 관습을 설명해 주고 싶소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't really learn anything that surprised me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't really learn anything that surprised me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002262"
msgid "I have always believed the purpose of the words is to remind us of our values."
msgstr "난 항상 그 말씀들은 우리의 가치관을 늘상 잊지 않도록 상기해 주기 위한 것으로 믿었다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to take in the sights, so I'll visit these Wayshrines.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to take in the sights, so I'll visit these Wayshrines.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071552
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002261"
msgid "Oh, there are sights to behold, I promise you."
msgstr "아, 참 아름다운 광경을 보게 될 것이라 장담하겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071547
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002260"
msgid "Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion."
msgstr "잘 말하셨소. 반쯤 정도만 헌신하는 건 말도 안 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071547
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225F"
msgid "I have learned in my many years that a people united in devotion can accomplish great things."
msgstr "나는 오랫동안 많은 사람들이 헌신으로 하나가 되어 많은 위업을 이룩한 것을 보았다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Devotion doesn't exactly come easy to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Devotion doesn't exactly come easy to me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071545
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225E"
msgid "That's just as well, for devotion given too easily is without true value."
msgstr "그것 또한 다행인 것이, 너무 쉽게 주어진 헌신은 진정한 가치가 없기 때문이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Devotion doesn't exactly come easy to me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071545
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225D"
msgid "There are also those who make a show of their devotion in front of others, but alone, they do nothing."
msgstr "남들 앞에서는 스스로의 헌신을 과시하지만 혼자서는 아무것도 하지 않는 자들도 있소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Devotion doesn't exactly come easy to me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071545
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225C"
msgid "You are honest, and that is wise, for the Great Serpent sees through pretense and falseness."
msgstr "솔직하구료. 또 현명하시다니. 위대한 뱀께서는 위선과 거짓된 모습을 꿰뚫어 보신다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion.|I have learned in my many years that a people united in devotion can accomplish great things.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071544
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225B"
msgid "If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul."
msgstr "이 늙은이의 직감에 의하면... 분명 그대는 자유로운 영혼인 것 같소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071544
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00225A"
msgid "I think I can guess your answer, but I'll ask all the same."
msgstr "이미 대답을 예상할 수 있을 것 같지만, 그래도 물으리다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071544
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002259"
msgid "How did you feel about the Words of Obedience?"
msgstr "복종의 말씀에 대해 그대의 생각은 어떻소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slightly distracted and somber (other sad things on your mind) / Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to see your wares.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraNaladaBradi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFNaladaBradi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108D913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_NaladaBradi_TL_Sale
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_NaladaBradi_SaleResponses_PstQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002258"
msgid "Please do."
msgstr "그러시지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely. &&& VijunAhkmav: Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion.|I have learned in my many years that a people united in devotion can accomplish great things. &&& VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.|I think I can guess your answer, but I'll ask all the same.|How did you feel about the Words of Obedience?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Uh... A word of advice, if I may.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071543
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002256"
msgid "I chart my own course and I answer to no one."
msgstr "제 갈 길은 제가 스스로 정합니다. 다른 누군가의 부하로 남지 않고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Ah, thank you, my friend.|Your kindness is a gift, for it brings me happiness to speak of the path.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002255"
msgid "Spread across the land are four Wayshrines. Each offers words that describe a pillar of our society."
msgstr "이 땅에는 네 개의 성소가 흩어져 있소. 각 장소마다 우리 사회의 중추가 되는 말씀들이 적혀 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002254"
msgid "To sin against the Great Serpent demands an act of absolution."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 저지른 모든 죄악에는 속죄의 행위가 필요하다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002253"
msgid "We first come here to pray for forgiveness, and then we make a journey."
msgstr "처음 우린 용서를 구하려고 이곳에 온 다음, 그 후 여정을 떠난다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002252"
msgid "We travel to each of the Wayshrines, reading their words and contemplating their meaning."
msgstr "우린 각 성소로 직접 걸어간 다음 적혀 있는 말씀을 읽고 그 의미를 숙고한다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071554
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002251"
msgid "When that is done, we return here to renew our pledge of devotion to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그 일이 끝나면, 우린 여기로 돌아와 위대한 뱀께 바치는 스스로의 헌신을 새롭게 다잡는다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world. &&& VijunAhkmav: Wise words, my friend. |No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made. &&& VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions. &&& VijunAhkmav: What did you think of the Words of Devotion?|Did you agree with them? Or did you have a different perspective?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071548
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002250"
msgid "If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely."
msgstr "진심으로 무언가를 믿는다면, 그것에 전적으로 마음껏 헌신해야 하는 것이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I expect complete obedience from those who follow me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I expect complete obedience from those who follow me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071540
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00224D"
msgid "So you see yourself as a leader, then?"
msgstr "그럼 그대는 스스로를 지도자로 칭하는 것이구료?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I expect complete obedience from those who follow me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071540
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00224C"
msgid "That tells me you are confident, which is no bad thing."
msgstr "그 말은 자신감이 뛰어나다는 뜻인데, 나쁜 것은 아니오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely. &&& VijunAhkmav: Well spoken. There is no such thing as partial devotion.|I have learned in my many years that a people united in devotion can accomplish great things. &&& VijunAhkmav: If an old man can trust his intuition, then I sense that you're an independent soul.|I think I can guess your answer, but I'll ask all the same.|How did you feel about the Words of Obedience?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you see yourself as a leader, then?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071541
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00224B"
msgid "I expect complete obedience from those who follow me."
msgstr "저는 제 수하들이 철저하게 제 말에 복종하길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was pleasant. I enjoy the austere beauty of your world. &&& VijunAhkmav: Wise words, my friend. |No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made. &&& VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions. &&& VijunAhkmav: What did you think of the Words of Devotion?|Did you agree with them? Or did you have a different perspective?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's just as well, for devotion given too easily is without true value.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071546
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002249"
msgid "Devotion doesn't exactly come easy to me."
msgstr "저는 무언가에 헌신하는 것은 도저히 쉽게 못하겠더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002248"
msgid "Yeah, listen, I hope you're not talking about me, because that is not the way this works."
msgstr "어, 있지. 내 얘기 하는 건 아니었으면 좋겠어. 우리 사이는 전혀 그렇지 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell... &&& companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.|You could not possibly be referring to me.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002247"
msgid "I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance."
msgstr "우리 모두 인내 없이는 그 어떤 위업도 이룰 수 없다는 데에는 동의하는 걸로 볼 수 있겠구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002246"
msgid "Did those Words ring true for you?"
msgstr "그 말씀들이 그대에게는 진심으로 느껴졌소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Taken aback, concerned, choosing your words carefully. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I chart my own course and I answer to no one.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I chart my own course and I answer to no one.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002245"
msgid "Uh... A word of advice, if I may."
msgstr "어... 괜찮다면 조언 좀 드리겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability. &&& VijunAhkmav: I find that to be true as well.|I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter.|His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them.|When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice.|You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice. &&& VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.|These Words have the greatest appeal to the young and adventurous. Who does not wish to be strong?|Many of us, however, see them as an uncomfortable reminder of a more violent time.|As a result, there are many who question the value of the Words of Strength when compared to the rest. |After all, is not strength the most likely to diminish with the passage of time?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Many of our people would agree with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071538
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002241"
msgid "With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do."
msgstr "위력만 있으면 하고 싶은 것은 무엇이든 해낼 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071537
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002240"
msgid "Many of our people would agree with you."
msgstr "우리 중 많은 이들이 그 말에 동의할 것 같소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071537
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223F"
msgid "And yet I wonder whether we sometimes confuse strength with aggression and power."
msgstr "하지만 우린 가끔 위력을 호전성이나 힘이랑 혼동하는 건 아닌지 생각한다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071537
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223E"
msgid "There are many kinds of strength, after all."
msgstr "위력에는 여러 종류가 있으니 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223D"
msgid "It's customary for one who completes the Path of Redemption to be given small gifts by friends and family."
msgstr "구원의 길을 마친 사람에게는 친지나 가족으로부터 작은 선물을 받는 것이 우리의 관습 중 하나라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223C"
msgid "I don't have much to offer, but I would not see you leave empty-handed."
msgstr "내겐 비록 줄 것이 없으나 그대가 빈 손으로 가도록 하지 않겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223B"
msgid "Please accept this. I thank you for your time and your insights."
msgstr "이걸 받아 주시오. 이렇게 시간 내서 그대의 의견을 나눠 주어 고맙소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00223A"
msgid "It has been a most interesting conversation."
msgstr "매우 흥미로운 대화였소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002239"
msgid "My friend, you have true wisdom."
msgstr "내 친구여, 참으로 뛰어난 지혜구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002238"
msgid "In truth, I posed my question the way that I did to test you."
msgstr "사실, 나는 그대를 시험하기 위한 것처럼 질문을 던졌을 뿐이라오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002237"
msgid "Too many of our people see strength only in terms of might and skill in battle."
msgstr "너무나도 많은 사람들이 위력을 전투 능력이나 힘만으로 생각하고 있소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002236"
msgid "It's not hard to see why. As written, the words suggest that very thing."
msgstr "물론 이해는 된다오. 쓰여진 대로, 말의 뜻이 바로 그러하니 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002235"
msgid "But with time, we learn that true strength comes not from weapons, but from within."
msgstr "하지만 삶을 살면서 우린 진정한 힘은 무기가 아니라 내면에서 나온다는 것을 깨닫지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107154F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002234"
msgid "I shall await your return. I'm quite curious to know what you make of the experience."
msgstr "돌아오길 기다리겠소. 그대가 이 여정으로 어떤 경험을 쌓을지 꽤 기대가 되는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I persevere by choice, not because the Great Serpent wants me to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I persevere by choice, not because the Great Serpent wants me to.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002233"
msgid "Ah, but sometimes choice can be an illusion."
msgstr "아, 그러나 가끔 선택은 막연한 환상이 될 수도 있소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I persevere by choice, not because the Great Serpent wants me to.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002232"
msgid "However, I will not question your beliefs. That is not my place."
msgstr "그러나 그대의 믿음을 의심하지 않으리다. 그럴 자격이 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I persevere by choice, not because the Great Serpent wants me to.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002231"
msgid "Perseverance is a worthy quality, no matter the place from which it comes."
msgstr "인내는 뛰어난 특성이지. 그 어떤 연유로 인한 것일지라도 말이오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If something is a waste of time, it's foolish to keep trying.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If something is a waste of time, it's foolish to keep trying.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002230"
msgid "Time is precious. It's a truth I grow more aware of with each passing year."
msgstr "시간은 소중하다오. 매년 흐르는 삶을 보면서 절실히 느껴지는 사실이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If something is a waste of time, it's foolish to keep trying.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222F"
msgid "And yet, more than once I've believed something to be a waste of time only to proven wrong."
msgstr "그럼에도 나는 시간 낭비라고 생각한 일이 전혀 그렇지 않단 것을 몇 번이나 경험했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If something is a waste of time, it's foolish to keep trying.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222E"
msgid "Sometimes it's difficult to judge the value of an endeavor until you've seen it through to the end."
msgstr "가끔은 일의 끝을 보기 전까진 그동안의 노력이 어떤 가치를 지닌 건지 알 수 없을 때도 있다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perseverance is important. It can compensate for a lack of ability. &&& VijunAhkmav: I find that to be true as well.|I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter.|His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them.|When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice.|You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice. &&& VijunAhkmav: That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking.|These Words have the greatest appeal to the young and adventurous. Who does not wish to be strong?|Many of us, however, see them as an uncomfortable reminder of a more violent time.|As a result, there are many who question the value of the Words of Strength when compared to the rest. |After all, is not strength the most likely to diminish with the passage of time?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My friend, you have true wisdom.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071536
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222D"
msgid "Not necessarily. A strong will doesn't fade."
msgstr "꼭 그런 것은 아닙니다. 정말로 강한 의지는 결코 사라지지 않는 법이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: I find that to be true as well.|I'm reminded of my grandfather. He was a painter.|His brush brought to life the most beautiful landscapes. As a child, I was fascinated by them.|When I asked how he did it, he explained that it was not talent, but constant practice.|You see, he was not born with great artistic gifts, but he made up for that with practice.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222C"
msgid "That brings us to strength, and Words that hearken back to an older way of thinking."
msgstr "그리고 위력이 남았군. 옛날 사고 방식을 상기시키는 말씀이기도 하다오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222B"
msgid "These Words have the greatest appeal to the young and adventurous. Who does not wish to be strong?"
msgstr "이 말씀은 특히 젊고 야망심이 넘치는 자들에게 크게 이끌리지. 대체 누가 강하지 않길 바라겠소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: With strength, you can accomplish anything you set out to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00222A"
msgid "After all, is not strength the most likely to diminish with the passage of time?"
msgstr "결국엔 힘이야말로 시간이 지나면서 가장 사라지는 게 분명한 것이니 말이오?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell... &&& companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.|You could not possibly be referring to me. &&& VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.|Did those Words ring true for you?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Time is precious. It's a truth I grow more aware of with each passing year.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002229"
msgid "If something is a waste of time, it's foolish to keep trying."
msgstr "어떤 일이 시간 낭비라면 계속 하는 것은 바보 같은 짓이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I ain't exactly the type to respect authority. &&& VijunAhkmav: A willful sort, are you? |It's rare to hear such defiance, especially in one who is no longer a child.|However, the need for obedience is a lesson that can take some time to sink in.|I myself was rebellious well past my youth. Oh, the tales I could tell... &&& companion: Surely that must be some poor attempt at humor.|You could not possibly be referring to me. &&& VijunAhkmav: I'm sure we can both agree that nothing truly worthwhile is accomplished without perseverance.|Did those Words ring true for you?
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, but sometimes choice can be an illusion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 0107153D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002228"
msgid "I persevere by choice, not because the Great Serpent wants me to."
msgstr "저는 제 스스로의 선택으로 인내합니다. 위대한 뱀께서 시켜서 하는 게 아니고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071549
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002227"
msgid "What did you think of the Words of Devotion?"
msgstr "헌신의 말씀에 대해 그대의 생각은 어떠하였소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you truly believe in something, you should devote yourself to it completely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071549
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002226"
msgid "Did you agree with them? Or did you have a different perspective?"
msgstr "그 말에 동의하시오? 아니면 다른 관점을 가지고 있으시오?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Wise words, my friend. |No artifice of man can match the beauty of that which the Great Serpent has made.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: What did you think of the Words of Devotion?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002225"
msgid "If you're willing to indulge the curiosity of a stranger, I have a few questions."
msgstr "낯선 이의 호기심을 충족시킬 생각이 있다면, 질문을 조금 하고 싶구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: VijunAhkmav: Many of our people would agree with you.|And yet I wonder whether we sometimes confuse strength with aggression and power.|There are many kinds of strength, after all.
#. ALIAS: VijunAhkmav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVijunAhkmav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: VijunAhkmav: It's customary for one who completes the Path of Redemption to be given small gifts by friends and family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01
#. TOPIC: 01071532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ01_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002224"
msgid "Well, you've been a patient listener and I'll take up no more of your time."
msgstr "인내심을 갖고 내 말을 들어 주었구려. 더 이상은 시간을 빼앗지 않겠소."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002216"
msgid "Do you really think you can kill Borhal?"
msgstr "정말 보할을 죽일 수 있을 거 같아요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAF
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "002215"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you really think you can kill Borhal? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you really think you can kill Borhal? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002214"
msgid "As in, am I physically capable? Perhaps, if the Great Serpent wills it."
msgstr "다시 말해, 신체적으로 가능하냐고? 아마도, 위대한 뱀께서 바라신다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you really think you can kill Borhal? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002213"
msgid "Am I mentally capable? I believe so. I have never felt this fury within me before."
msgstr "정신적으로 가능하냐고? 그런 것 같군. 살면서 이렇게 분노가 치민 적이 없었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Correct. You are my second, not my acquaintance. I do not wish to speak of these things with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002212"
msgid "As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers."
msgstr "저는 당신의 입회인이니까, 똑바로 얘길 해줘야 합니다. 제대로 답변을 하지 않고 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: flippant, dismissive.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002211"
msgid "I do not know, perhaps him challenging me to a duel has something to do with it."
msgstr "모르겠는걸. 형이 나한테 결투를 신청한 이유와 관련이 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002210"
msgid "I had a wife once. I'm not going to flatter myself and pretend that I was a good husband, but I loved her, and she loved me. Appreciated me, faults and all. I never felt like I had to prove anything to her."
msgstr ""
"한때 나한테도 아내가 있었어... 좋은 남편이었다고 하진 못하겠지만, 아내를 사랑했고, 아내도 날 사랑했어. 날 인정해 줬고, 내 결점도 "
"다 받아 줬어. 내 가치를 입증해 보여야 한다고 느끼지도 않았었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220F"
msgid "When I say to you that she was my world, my everything - I am serious. She was... she was perfect, and somehow she loved something like me? It was like living in a dream every day."
msgstr ""
"아내는 내 세상 모든 것이고, 내 전부였어. 진심으로. 정말... 완벽했거든. 그런 사람이 나 같은 인간을 사랑한다고? 매일 꿈을 꾸는 "
"것만 같았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220E"
msgid "Nearly a decade ago, she and I shared a perfect night, in what I had believed would be a lifetime of perfect nights. But, when I kissed her cheek in the morning, my lips froze. She was cold, stone cold."
msgstr ""
"약 10년 전, 안사람과 나는 완벽한 밤을 보냈지. 평생 그것보다 완벽한 밤은 없을 거라 느꼈을 정도였어. 근데 아침에 아내의 뺨에 "
"키스를 했는데, 그 자리에서 얼어붙고 말았어. 아내 몸이 차가웠거든. 돌처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220D"
msgid "After my beloved's death, I made one bad decision after another. To Borhal's credit, he was almost always there for me, he even paid for the funeral expenses. But he could not stop me from taking to the bottle, no matter how hard he tried."
msgstr ""
"사랑하던 아내가 죽고 나서, 나는 연달아 나쁜 선택을 내렸지... 보할 형은 그래도 항상 나를 챙겨 주려고 했어. 안사람 장례식 비용까지 "
"내줬을 정도니까. 하지만 내가 병나발을 부는 건 끝내 못 말렸지. 형도 많이 노력했겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220C"
msgid "Eventually he gave up on me, my own brother. His love and understanding has been replaced with scolding. I am truly alone."
msgstr "결국 형은 날 포기했어. 친형제인데도. 우애나 이해심도 잔소리를 퍼붓는 걸로 바뀌었지. 난 정말로 혼자가 됐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What led to this divide between you and your brother?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220B"
msgid "Thank you, but no amount of condolences will bring her back."
msgstr "고마워. 하지만 아무리 위로해 봤자 아내가 돌아오진 못하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. PROMPT: I can sense a deep sadness in you. Do you really want to face the end of your life with this heaviness in your heart? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can sense a deep sadness in you. Do you really want to face the end of your life with this heaviness in your heart? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Go on, ask your questions again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00220A"
msgid "Huh. No one has ever said anything like that to me before. Or ever cared enough to do so, at least."
msgstr "허. 나한테 그런 말을 하는 인간은 한 명도 없었는데. 그럴 정도로 관심을 보인 인간도..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise.  &&& Amila: If it were Borhal in my stead, I would forgive him, like a brother is supposed to do. |Family is family, we are supposed to be there for each other no matter what. I would never have deigned to challenge him to a duel. |He cares more about respect, the family name, honor... everything except for me. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Huh. No one has ever said anything like that to me before. Or ever cared enough to do so, at least.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002209"
msgid "I can sense a deep sadness in you. Do you really want to face the end of your life with this heaviness in your heart?"
msgstr "마음속에 극심한 상처가 있는 게 느껴집니다. 정말 그 응어리를 계속 끌어안은 채 죽음을 맞이하고 싶습니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why does Borhal still love your parents, after all of that? &&& Amila: I do not know. Ask him.|I loved my parents too, you know. And what hurt most, more than any beating, was knowing that they did not love me.|Great Serpent, I wish I got the chance to sell my mother's urn. Serves her right.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is... *sigh* that is true. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002208"
msgid "I'm going out of my way to be your second, and I barely know you. The least you can do is open up to me so I know who I'm dealing with."
msgstr ""
"당신의 입회인이 되어주려고 애쓰고 있는데, 아직 당신에 대해 아는 게 거의 없잖아요. 먼저 얘기부터 해 주시라고요. 지금 누구를 도와주는 "
"건지 좀 알자고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not know, perhaps him challenging me to a duel has something to do with it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002207"
msgid "What led to this divide between you and your brother?"
msgstr "어쩌다 형제 사이가 틀어지게 된 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not know, perhaps him challenging me to a duel has something to do with it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002206"
msgid "I'm very sorry about your wife."
msgstr "아내분 일은 정말 안타깝게 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: I'm going out of my way to be your second, and I barely know you. The least you can do is open up to me so I know who I'm dealing with.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going out of my way to be your second, and I barely know you. The least you can do is open up to me so I know who I'm dealing with.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002205"
msgid "That is... *sigh* that is true."
msgstr "그건... *한숨* 사실이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: I'm going out of my way to be your second, and I barely know you. The least you can do is open up to me so I know who I'm dealing with.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Go on, ask your questions again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002204"
msgid "This may well be the last time I can have a real conversation with someone. May as well put my ego aside for a moment."
msgstr "내가 다른 누군가와 제대로 된 대화를 나눌 수 있는 순간은 지금뿐일지도 모르니. 잠시 자존심은 억누르도록 할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: "Just answer the damn questions."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002203"
msgid "Correct. You are my second, not my acquaintance. I do not wish to speak of these things with you."
msgstr "잘 아네. 그쪽은 내 입회인일 뿐, 지인도 뭣도 아니잖아. 그쪽과 이런 얘기를 하고 싶진 않거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Aren't you scared of dying?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Aren't you scared of dying?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002202"
msgid "Terrified."
msgstr "두렵지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Aren't you scared of dying?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Aren't you scared of dying?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002201"
msgid "Look at me. Really look at me. Do I appear to be someone that has much to live for?"
msgstr "나를 봐. 내 몰골을 똑바로 보라고. 내가 무슨 삶의 목적이 있어서 사는 인간처럼 보여?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Aren't you scared of dying?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002200"
msgid "If I die, I die. Nothing to be scared of, except giving Borhal the satisfaction of taking my life."
msgstr "죽으면 그뿐이야. 두려운 건 없어. 보할에게 내 목숨을 빼앗는 쾌감을 주는 건 그렇지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Terrified. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FF"
msgid "Aren't you scared of dying?"
msgstr "죽는 게 두렵지 않나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FE"
msgid "Go on, ask your questions again."
msgstr "좋아, 질문할 거면 해 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do I have something to apologize for?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FD"
msgid "Why do you refuse to apologize?"
msgstr "왜 사과를 안하려는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FC"
msgid "Do I have something to apologize for?"
msgstr "내가 뭘 사과해야 하는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FB"
msgid "Because I am furious."
msgstr "왜냐면 화가 나니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021FA"
msgid "My own brother. I just... I cannot make sense of it. Who would challenge their own flesh and blood to a duel?"
msgstr "친형제잖아. 도저히... 이해가 안 가. 자기 피붙이에게 결투를 신청하는 인간이 세상에 어디 있냐고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mad+sad. He is feeling trapped, and he knows that regardless of if he surrenders before the duel, he will always have to live with this pain / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you refuse to apologize? 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F9"
msgid "Damn him! Damn him for putting me in this position. Damn him, because I know even if I were to apologize, ending this duel before it starts, I will always see someone who would rather me dead when I look at his face."
msgstr ""
"빌어먹을 보할! 날 이런 처지로 몰아넣었어. 빌어먹을. 결투가 시작되기 전에 사과한다 쳐도... 나보고 죽으라고 말한 인간 면상을 평생 "
"보면서 살아야 하잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Just answer the damn questions." &&& Amila:  &&& companion: Just answer the damn questions, or I will make you answer. &&& Amila: Ugh... fine. Ask your questions again.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F8"
msgid "That was all."
msgstr "더 할 말은 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. PROMPT: I can tell this smugness is all an act. There's more to you than you're letting on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can tell this smugness is all an act. There's more to you than you're letting on.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Enough, enough. You have broken me down.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F7"
msgid "Is there? Perhaps you can convince me."
msgstr "정말로? 당신이라면 설득할 수 있을지 모르겠네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Be honest. Do you want to die? &&& Amila: I suppose the thought has crossed my mind -- maybe it would be better to be dead.|I could be with my wife. Well, if the Great Serpent would let me be with her... we were never the most devout in Dazra.|I am not sure that I want to die, but there really is not much to live for, is there?|But I am not just going to let Borhal end me. I cannot give him that satisfaction.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F6"
msgid "Forget it."
msgstr "됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What led to this divide between you and your brother? &&& Amila: I do not know, perhaps him challenging me to a duel has something to do with it.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If it were Borhal in my stead, I would forgive him, like a brother is supposed to do. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F5"
msgid "You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise."
msgstr ""
"당신이 저지른 짓을 보할이 전부 무조건 뒷바라지해 줄 거라 기대하시면 안 되죠. 슬픔 때문에든, 코자 때문에든, 다른 무언가 때문에 "
"저지른 짓이든."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did Borhal ever help you when your parents would hit you? &&& Amila: *Pffft* I am not getting into that with you.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is there? Perhaps you can convince me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F4"
msgid "I can tell this smugness is all an act. There's more to you than you're letting on."
msgstr "잘난 체하는 모습이 허세인 게 그냥 보이는데요. 저한테 알려 주지 않은 게 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to avoid a sappy conversation / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've had a hard life.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've had a hard life.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F3"
msgid "I suppose. But. please, I am not looking for pity."
msgstr "그럴지도. 하지만 난 동정 같은 건 바라지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers.  &&& Amila: Correct. You are my second, not my acquaintance. I do not wish to speak of these things with you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose. But. please, I am not looking for pity. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F2"
msgid "You've had a hard life."
msgstr "일생이 참 힘드셨겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F1"
msgid "If it were Borhal in my stead, I would forgive him, like a brother is supposed to do."
msgstr "형이 내 입장에 처해 있었다면, 나라면 용서해 줬을 거야. 친형제라면 원래 그래야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021F0"
msgid "Family is family, we are supposed to be there for each other no matter what. I would never have deigned to challenge him to a duel."
msgstr "가족은 가족이야. 무슨 일이 있어도 항상 서로를 챙겨 줘야 하는 거잖아. 나라면 절대 형한테 결투를 신청하지 않았을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't expect Borhal to just blindly put up with everything you do, driven by grief, koza, or otherwise. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_AmilaQuestionBranches
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021EF"
msgid "He cares more about respect, the family name, honor... everything except for me."
msgstr "형은 존경심, 가문의 명성, 명예만 더 중요하게 생각해... 나는 안중에도 없고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your apology doesn't have to be earnest.  &&& Amila: It does not matter. An apology is an apology, and I will not humiliate myself like that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, yes I have. I am ready to fight, and to die, if that is what the Great Serpent wills. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021EE"
msgid "All right. It seems you've made up your mind."
msgstr "좋습니다. 이미 마음의 결정을 내렸나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ah, look who it is. |I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother.|The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* Fine, but do try to be brief. I would prefer to be alone so that I may enjoy what could very well be my final moments alive. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021ED"
msgid "I want to ask you some more personal questions."
msgstr "좀 더 사적인 질문을 하고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem eager to die. &&& Amila: Why are you so sure that I will die? I have been in plenty of scraps on the streets, and I am not some sheltered pushover like my brother.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have made my choice. If I am to die, so be it, but I am no coward. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021EC"
msgid "It's your funeral."
msgstr "죽든 말든, 당신 맘대로죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021EB"
msgid "Ah, look who it is."
msgstr "아, 이게 누구신가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021EA"
msgid "I will not waste your time, I already know what you have come to ask. You wish to inquire if there is any possibility of me apologizing to my brother."
msgstr "시간 낭비하지 않게 본론으로 들어가지. 나한테 뭘 물어보려는 건지 안다고. 혹시나 형에게 사과할 건지 물어보고 싶은 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your apology doesn't have to be earnest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E9"
msgid "The answer is no. The duel shall go forward as planned."
msgstr "사과 같은 건 안할 거야. 예정대로 결투하자고 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to ask you some more personal questions.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: As your second, you need to open up to me. You aren't giving me real answers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E8"
msgid "*Sigh* Fine, but do try to be brief. I would prefer to be alone so that I may enjoy what could very well be my final moments alive."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아. 대신 짧게 끝내. 인생 마지막일지도 모르는 순간, 조용히 혼자서 만끽하고 싶으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: stubborn / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's your funeral. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's your funeral. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E7"
msgid "I have made my choice. If I am to die, so be it, but I am no coward."
msgstr "난 이미 결정했어. 죽을 운명이라면 받아들일 거야. 난 겁쟁이가 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E6"
msgid "Yes, yes I have. I am ready to fight, and to die, if that is what the Great Serpent wills."
msgstr "그래. 결정을 내렸어. 싸울 각오도 되어 있고, 죽을 각오도 되어 있어. 위대한 뱀의 뜻이 그러하시다면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. It seems you've made up your mind. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_06_SpeakWithAmila
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E5"
msgid "Perhaps Borhal was depending on me being a coward. Perhaps he did not truly believe this duel would go on. Unfortunately for him, I am no coward."
msgstr ""
"아마도 보할은 내가 겁쟁이처럼 물러날 거라 기대했겠지. 결투가 정말 진행될 거라고 믿진 않았나 봐. 안타깝게도, 나는 겁쟁이가 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: How did you fare? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As predicted. They have been blinded by scorn for one another. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E4"
msgid "These brothers are stubborn and insane. The duel is still on."
msgstr "형제가 둘 다 고집도 세고 미쳤더군요. 결투는 그대로 진행될 거 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
