msgstr "둘 다 결투를 중단하겠다고 하진 않더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What if I dose just one of the cups?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if I dose just one of the cups?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021E0"
msgid "That would be tantamount to murder."
msgstr "그럼 살인을 저지르는 거나 마찬가지죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you sure the tranquilizer is safe to use?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure the tranquilizer is safe to use?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
