#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DF"
msgid "I... theoretically this should be safe."
msgstr "안전할 거예요. 아마... 이론상은요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Neither agreed to call off the duel.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. 
