#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DE"
msgid "Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats."
msgstr "흐음... 안타깝지만, 놀랍지 않군요. 두 형제들은 그로트마냥 고집불통이라니깐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& ...  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair.  &&& Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I... theoretically this should be safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DD"
msgid "Are you sure the tranquilizer is safe to use?"
msgstr "그 진정제, 정말 안전한 거 맞습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& ...  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair.  &&& Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This is no time for jokes. Just take it and deal with drinks. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DC"
msgid "Leave it to me."
msgstr "저에게 맡기세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& ...  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair.  &&& Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That would be tantamount to murder.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DB"
msgid "What if I dose just one of the cups?"
msgstr "양쪽 잔 중 한쪽 잔에만 진정제를 넣으면 어떻게 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do I have to do this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do I have to do this?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021DA"
msgid "Tradition decrees that the second of the challenged prepares the ceremonial drinks. I, as the challenger's second, will lead the duelists in a final prayer."
msgstr ""
"전통 의례에 의하면 결투 신청을 받은 쪽의 입회인이 의식용 음료를 준비해야 하거든요. 결투를 신청한 쪽의 입회인인 저는, 결투자들이 서로 "
"마지막 기도를 올리도록 인도할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do I have to do this?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D9"
msgid "We must follow tradition closely so as not to arouse suspicion. If Borhal is wary of us, he will remove us as seconds and simply hire others, and the bloodshed will move forward unchallenged."
msgstr ""
"의심을 사지 않으려면 전통을 엄격히 따라야 해요. 보할은 의심이 들면 우리의 입회인 자격을 박탈하려 들 테고, 다른 입회인을 구하려 "
"하겠죠. 결국 피바다가 벌어지는 걸 막지 못하게 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D8"
msgid "Very good. Report to me when you are finished."
msgstr "좋아요. 일을 끝내고 나서 저에게 보고하러 와 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know what to do, I've done this before. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D7"
msgid "May the Great Serpent aid us."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우릴 인도해 주시길 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed. |Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel. |As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D6"
msgid "This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life."
msgstr ""
"이 결투는 바보 같은 짓이에요. 우리 둘 다 알잖아요. 요즘 같이 재난이 터져서 수많은 사상자가 발생한 시기에 이런 의미 없는 인명 "
"손실까지 발생하면 안 되잖아요. 이긴 쪽이라도 평생 후회하게 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D5"
msgid "You have one final chance to stop this."
msgstr "이번이 마지막으로 막을 수 있는 기회예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Neither agreed to call off the duel. &&& ...  &&& Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. |You have one final chance to stop this. &&& companion: You are placing both of their lives into our hands. This responsibility is not fair.  &&& Danika: What is unfair about saving two lives?  
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Tradition decrees that the second of the challenged prepares the ceremonial drinks. I, as the challenger's second, will lead the duelists in a final prayer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D4"
msgid "Why do I have to do this?"
msgstr "이 일을 꼭 제가 해야 하는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Hmmm... while disappointing, I am not surprised. Those brothers are as stubborn as groats. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D3"
msgid "But, you may still have a chance to halt any bloodshed."
msgstr "하지만 당신이라면 참극이 벌어지는 걸 막을 수 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D2"
msgid "Listen to me very carefully. Your final duty as a second is to prepare the ceremonial drinks that the duelists will imbibe prior to the duel."
msgstr ""
"제 말 잘 들으세요. 입회인으로서 당신이 마지막으로 할 일은 결투자들이 서로 싸우기 전에 의식을 위해 마셔야 하는 음료를 준비하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: This duel is idiotic, we both know it. It is a needless loss of life during a crisis where there is already so much death, and the victor will rue his actions for the remainder of his life. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106E7B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_08_SpeakWithDanika02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0021D1"
msgid "As you are preparing the drinks, you will treat each cup with this tranquilizer. Borhal and Amila will be too weak to fight after drinking this."
msgstr "음료를 준비할 때 양쪽 잔에 이 진정제를 넣으세요. 두 형제가 음료를 마시면 서로 싸우지 못할 정도로 약해질 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I do, of course.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Although... let's just say after what went down here, my retirement's looking imminent and I haven't exactly been saving up for a rainy day.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002183"
msgid "And I know he wasn't lost to whatever ate up half of Dazra. Plenty of people have seen him since."
msgstr "그리고 그 친구는 다즈라 절반을 먹어치운 사고에도 휩쓸리지 않았어. 그 이후에도 본 사람이 많았거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002182"
msgid "Until you've finished with House Veth'aal, you have no business here."
msgstr "베타알 가문 일을 끝내기 전까지는, 이곳에서 일할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002181"
msgid "I suggest you finish whatever task Viktor has laid out for you."
msgstr "빅토르가 준 일을 모두 완료하는 게 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "002180"
msgid "Come back when you've finished with House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "둘케프 가문 일을 모두 끝내면 돌아와."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00217F"
msgid "If you're working for Hasmak, don't let us distract you."
msgstr "해즈막 가문 일을 하고 있다면, 방해하지 않도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& Amila: Hmph, seems your outburst has attracted some outside attention, brother. If it was an audience you wanted, you have it now. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002172"
msgid "*Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger."
msgstr "*한숨* 사과를 받아 주게. 내 동생이 형언 못할 짓을 하려는 걸 잡아내서... 분노를 참을 수가 없었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger.  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002170"
msgid "This is no \"squabble\" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent."
msgstr "이게 불화 따위인 줄 아느냐, 건방지고 멍청한 놈. 오늘 네가 한 일은 매우 끔찍한 짓이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00216F"
msgid "I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables."
msgstr "내 돈을 훔치고, 내 귀중품을 전당포에 내다 파는 건 용서해 줄 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I have done many things I am not proud of, but I have never stooped as low as that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00216D"
msgid "What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within!"
msgstr "하지만 어머니의 유골이 담겨 있던 유골함을 갖다 팔려는 짓은 절대 용납할 수 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Hmph, seems your outburst has attracted some outside attention, brother. If it was an audience you wanted, you have it now.  &&& Borhal: *Sigh* Please accept my apologies. I caught my brother attempting to do something unspeakable, and I could not contain my anger. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00216A"
msgid "Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles."
msgstr "아, 그래. 계속해 봐. 가족 사이의 불화에 낯선 사람까지 끼어들게 해 보라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Amila
#. PROMPT: Times are tough, I guess.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& Amila: Ha! I am glad you understand. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: I am tired of your shamelessness, and I am done bearing what should be your indignity. Do you hear me? I am done!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002169"
msgid "The outsider may somehow understand you, but I do not."
msgstr "저 외부인은 네놈을 이해하는 것 같지만 난 이해할 수 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: The outsider may somehow understand you, but I do not. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002167"
msgid "I am tired of your shamelessness, and I am done bearing what should be your indignity. Do you hear me? I am done!"
msgstr ""
"뻔뻔하기 그지없는 네 모습을 참아 주고, 수치스러운 짓까지 내가 대신 감싸는 것은 이제 끝이다. 내 말 들리느냐? 이젠 못 참는단 말이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: What? Are you mad?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002166"
msgid "You have gone too far this time, Amila, and I cannot bear the humiliation of being your brother any longer. I challenge you to a duel. Danika shall be my second."
msgstr ""
"이번에는 정말 선을 넘었구나, 아밀라. 난 더 이상 네 형제라는 수치를 견딜 수가 없다. 결투를 신청하겠다. 내 입회인은 다니카로 "
"정하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Times are tough, I guess.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: The outsider may somehow understand you, but I do not. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002165"
msgid "Ha! I am glad you understand."
msgstr "하! 이해해 주다니 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mad, but defensive / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That is awful.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That is awful.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: It is an urn, not a vase, you ignoramus. And you are the one who chose it when mother passed away. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002163"
msgid "I was drunk, I did not know... all of those vases appeared the same."
msgstr "술에 취해서, 몰랐단 말이야... 나한테는 다 똑같은 병처럼 보였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Amila
#. PROMPT: That is awful.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That is awful. &&& Amila: I was drunk, I did not know... all of those vases appeared the same.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: I am tired of your shamelessness, and I am done bearing what should be your indignity. Do you hear me? I am done!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002162"
msgid "It is an urn, not a vase, you ignoramus. And you are the one who chose it when mother passed away."
msgstr "병이 아니라 유골함이었단 말이다. 멍청한 놈아. 어머니께서 돌아가실 적에 그 함을 정한 것도 네놈이었지 않느냐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002161"
msgid "You. You shall be my second."
msgstr "당신. 내 입회인이 되어 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: What? Are you mad? &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002160"
msgid "Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge."
msgstr "너무 늦었어, 다니카. 형이 결투를 신청했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why not you? You seem capable and trustworthy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215F"
msgid "What? Why me?"
msgstr "예? 왜 갑자기 저를 택한 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within! &&& companion: I have done many things I am not proud of, but I have never stooped as low as that.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was drunk, I did not know... all of those vases appeared the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215E"
msgid "That is awful."
msgstr "진짜 최악이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, that will pose a problem. You see, Borhal is a stickler for tradition. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215D"
msgid "I'm not getting involved in this."
msgstr "두 분 일에 끼어들고 싶지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked, annoyed / Shocked / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ha! I am glad you understand.  &&& Borhal: The outsider may somehow understand you, but I do not.  &&& Borhal: I am tired of your shamelessness, and I am done bearing what should be your indignity. Do you hear me? I am done!|You have gone too far this time, Amila, and I cannot bear the humiliation of being your brother any longer. I challenge you to a duel. Danika shall be my second.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215C"
msgid "What? Are you mad?"
msgstr "뭐? 미친 거 아니야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're causing a scene. Take this argument somewhere else.  &&& ...  &&& Amila: Oh, yes, go on, invite a total stranger into our family squabbles. &&& Borhal: This is no "squabble" you pompous fool. What you have done today is abhorrent. |I can forgive stealing my money, or pawning my valuables. |What I cannot abide, however, is you attempting to sell mother's urn with her remains still within! &&& companion: I have done many things I am not proud of, but I have never stooped as low as that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ha! I am glad you understand. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215B"
msgid "Times are tough, I guess."
msgstr "요즘 꽤 힘드신가 봅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not getting involved in this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not getting involved in this.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Apologies, dear brother, but it seems that your precious duel will have to wait, as I have no second to aid me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00215A"
msgid "Oh, that will pose a problem. You see, Borhal is a stickler for tradition."
msgstr "아, 이거 문제가 되겠군. 형은 전통을 무엇보다 중시하는 작자거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though.  &&& Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: As for you, Amila, enjoy these last few moments. For when we next meet, your shameful life ends. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002159"
msgid "Then it is settled. Outsider, you will work alongside Danika to prepare for the duel."
msgstr "그럼 정해졌군. 이방인이여, 다니카와 함께 협의하며 결투를 준비해 주게나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002158"
msgid "Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though."
msgstr "좋습니다. 누가 저한테 뭘 하면 되는지 알려 주셔야겠지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Then it is settled. Outsider, you will work alongside Danika to prepare for the duel. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002157"
msgid "Apologies, dear brother, but it seems that your precious duel will have to wait, as I have no second to aid me."
msgstr "미안하게 됐어, 친애하는 형... 날 도와줄 입회인이 없으니, 형이 원하는 그 소중한 결투는 잠시 미뤄야겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not getting involved in this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not getting involved in this. &&& Amila: Oh, that will pose a problem. You see, Borhal is a stickler for tradition. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002156"
msgid "It is true that the duel cannot commence until Amila acquires a second. This delay may be significant as Amila has no one willing to aid him, including you, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"결투는 아밀라가 입회인을 정하기 전까지 시작될 수 없다는 것은 사실이지. 아마 자네를 포함해서, 아밀라를 도울 사람이 아무도 없기 때문에 "
"당분간 지연이 될 게 뻔하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not getting involved in this.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: As for you, Amila, enjoy these last few moments. For when we next meet, your shameful life ends. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002155"
msgid "I assure you that you will be rewarded greatly if you do this, no matter the outcome, so I expect you will change your mind. I ask that you do so quickly."
msgstr ""
"이 일을 도와주면 결과에 상관없이 크게 보상을 쳐주겠네. 약속하지. 그러니 마음을 바꿔줬으면 좋겠네. 되도록 빨리 바꿔주면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What? Why me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What? Why me? &&& Amila: Why not you? You seem capable and trustworthy.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002154"
msgid "The true answer is because Amila has no one, family or otherwise, willing to be his second. He has burned every bridge there is to burn."
msgstr "사실은 말이죠. 아밀라에겐 입회인이 되어 줄 가족도, 친지도 없어요. 지인이란 지인은 모조리 끊었답니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What? Why me?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002153"
msgid "He will have to resort to picking someone off the street regardless, so it may as well be you."
msgstr "길거리에서 아무나 구해야 할 정도니, 결국 당신을 택할 수도 있는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What? Why me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What? Why me?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: The true answer is because Amila has no one, family or otherwise, willing to be his second. He has burned every bridge there is to burn. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002152"
msgid "Why not you? You seem capable and trustworthy."
msgstr "아닐 이유 없잖아? 능력도 충분해 보이고, 믿음직한데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: flabbergasted / Concerned / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Borhal: The outsider may somehow understand you, but I do not.  &&& Borhal: I am tired of your shamelessness, and I am done bearing what should be your indignity. Do you hear me? I am done!|You have gone too far this time, Amila, and I cannot bear the humiliation of being your brother any longer. I challenge you to a duel. Danika shall be my second. &&& Amila: What? Are you mad?
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002151"
msgid "Borhal, are... are you sure?"
msgstr "보할... 정말로요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't even know what a "second" is. What is that? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't even know what a "second" is. What is that?  &&& Amila: 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002150"
msgid "Our job is to make preparations and ensure fairness on both sides."
msgstr "우리는 결투를 준비하고 양측이 공정하게 싸울 수 있도록 해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't even know what a "second" is. What is that? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00214F"
msgid "We shall have different duties between the two of us, but our aim is to prepare the site of the duel, weapons, ceremonies... and discourage any ambushes."
msgstr ""
"입회인끼리 하는 일은 조금씩 다르지만, 우리가 할 일은 결투에 필요한 장소와 무기, 의식을 준비하고... 혹시 모를 기습을 막는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's in it for me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's in it for me? &&& Amila: Well, ponder it for a moment. If I win, I shall inherit Borhal's wealth and valuables. I can reward you massively for your efforts. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00214E"
msgid "Amila's word does not count for much, but mine does. I understand if you are cautious to accept this responsibility, but I will see to it that you are rewarded justly no matter the outcome."
msgstr ""
"아밀라의 말은 그다지 구속력이 없지만, 저라면 다르죠. 이 책임에 대해 조심스럽단 건 저도 이해하지만... 어떤 결과가 벌어지든 꼭 "
"보상을 받으실 수 있도록 노력할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Furious / Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Perhaps I should. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065585
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00214D"
msgid "Do you truly have no shame, Amila? No shame at all?"
msgstr "부끄러운 줄도 모르냐? 아밀라? 전혀 수치심을 못 느끼냔 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Borhal, calm down. Do not do this here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065585
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00214C"
msgid "What you have done goes beyond disgraceful. It is morbid, disgusting! You should be hanging your head in shame, but instead here you are, acting like a common fool!"
msgstr ""
"자네가 한 일은 수치스러운 수준을 넘어섰네. 병적이고 역겨운 짓이지! 부끄러워서 고개를 숙이고나 있을 것이지, 오히려 여기 와서는, 바보 "
"같은 짓이나 하고 있군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Are you done, both of you? Will you calm down? &&& ...  &&& Amila: It was a mistake, and you are going to condemn me for the rest of my life over a mistake?  &&& Borhal: Perhaps I should.  &&& Borhal: Do you truly have no shame, Amila? No shame at all? |What you have done goes beyond disgraceful. It is morbid, disgusting! You should be hanging your head in shame, but instead here you are, acting like a common fool!
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: How shameful of you to have this outburst.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065584
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00214B"
msgid "Borhal, calm down. Do not do this here."
msgstr "보할, 진정해요. 여기서 이러지 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Danika
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: With a brother like you, is it any wonder why I am driven to drink?  &&& Danika: Are you done, both of you? Will you calm down?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: I am causing a scene because you tried to sell mother's urn, with mother still in it!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065583
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002149"
msgid "You should be addressing the brute here. He is the one making the scene."
msgstr "이 대목에선 저 짐승에게 대고 말해야지. 저 인간이 상황을 이렇게 만든 장본인이잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: mocking / Smug / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: It was a mistake, and you are going to condemn me for the rest of my life over a mistake?  &&& Borhal: Perhaps I should.  &&& Borhal: Do you truly have no shame, Amila? No shame at all? |What you have done goes beyond disgraceful. It is morbid, disgusting! You should be hanging your head in shame, but instead here you are, acting like a common fool! &&& Danika: Borhal, calm down. Do not do this here.
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065581
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002148"
msgid "How shameful of you to have this outburst."
msgstr "일이 이렇게 터지다니 정말 부끄럽기 짝이 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: smug, mocking / Smug / to Borhal
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: You will speak not of mother and father, sloffing bastard. No shame, no shame at all. What a waste of a good life that they worked tirelessly to give you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065581
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002147"
msgid "Oh my... what would poor mother and father think?"
msgstr "아이고... 불쌍한 어머니, 아버지는 뭐라고 생각하시려나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt.  &&& Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on. &&& Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.|Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance.|With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have many spoils leftover from my life as a Zealot. I am capable of paying you very handsomely if you do this with me -- if we survive, of course.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002146"
msgid "What's in it for me?"
msgstr "이 일이 나와 무슨 상관이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila:  &&& Borhal: Then it is settled. Outsider, you will work alongside Danika to prepare for the duel.  &&& Borhal: As for you, Amila, enjoy these last few moments. For when we next meet, your shameful life ends. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002145"
msgid "Hmmph, do not sound so confident, brother."
msgstr "흥. 딱히 자신감 넘치는 목소린 아닌 것 같네, 형제여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Do you truly have no shame, Amila? No shame at all? |What you have done goes beyond disgraceful. It is morbid, disgusting! You should be hanging your head in shame, but instead here you are, acting like a common fool! &&& Danika: Borhal, calm down. Do not do this here. &&& Amila: How shameful of you to have this outburst.|Oh my... what would poor mother and father think? 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Mother and father spat on the ground I walked on. You were their pride and joy. Good, generous Borhal, always the paragon, the keeper of our family name! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106557F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002144"
msgid "You will speak not of mother and father, sloffing bastard. No shame, no shame at all. What a waste of a good life that they worked tirelessly to give you."
msgstr ""
"그 입으로 감히 어머니와 아버지를 논하지 마라. 허물진 놈 같으니라고. 뻔뻔해, 뻔뻔하기 그지없어. 부모님이 널 위해 쉼 없이 일하며 "
"젊음을 포기하신 줄도 모르고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: You will speak not of mother and father, sloffing bastard. No shame, no shame at all. What a waste of a good life that they worked tirelessly to give you.  &&& Amila: Mother and father spat on the ground I walked on. You were their pride and joy. Good, generous Borhal, always the paragon, the keeper of our family name! 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106557D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002142"
msgid "I am... I am disgusted to call you \"brother.\""
msgstr "난... 너 같은 걸 '동생'이라 부르려니 참 역겹군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: With a brother like you, is it any wonder why I am driven to drink? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106557D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002141"
msgid "It would be best for us all if by some miracle you were to drown in one of those bottles of koza you are so infatuated with."
msgstr "기적이라도 일어나서 네놈이 그토록 좋아하는 코자 술병에 빠져 죽으면 모두에게 훨씬 낫겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's in it for me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's in it for me?
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Amila's word does not count for much, but mine does. I understand if you are cautious to accept this responsibility, but I will see to it that you are rewarded justly no matter the outcome. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00213E"
msgid "Well, ponder it for a moment. If I win, I shall inherit Borhal's wealth and valuables. I can reward you massively for your efforts."
msgstr ""
"음, 잠시 생각 좀 해 봐. 내가 이긴다면 형의 부와 귀중품은 전부 다 내 것이 돼. 도와준 대가로 내가 큰 보상을 줄 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: You should be addressing the brute here. He is the one making the scene. &&& Borhal: I am causing a scene because you tried to sell mother's urn, with mother still in it!
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: That is precisely the sloffing problem, Amila! You are never thinking, you are too much of a drunken fool to think! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065578
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00213C"
msgid "Ugh, I was not thinking, it was a mistake -"
msgstr "으아, 생각도 못했다고. 그건 실수였..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: I am... I am disgusted to call you "brother." |It would be best for us all if by some miracle you were to drown in one of those bottles of koza you are so infatuated with.  &&& Amila: With a brother like you, is it any wonder why I am driven to drink?  &&& Danika: Are you done, both of you? Will you calm down? &&& Amila: You should be addressing the brute here. He is the one making the scene.
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Ugh, I was not thinking, it was a mistake - 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065579
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00213B"
msgid "I am causing a scene because you tried to sell mother's urn, with mother still in it!"
msgstr "내가 이 난리를 피우는 건 네놈이 어머니의 유골이 담긴 유골함을 갖다 팔려고 한 거지 않느냐?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Times are tough, I guess. &&& ...  &&& Danika: Borhal, are... are you sure? |There is already so much death in the city. What good would this do? There has to be another way. &&& Amila: Too late, Danika. He has issued his challenge.|I accept. I, in fact, look forward to it.  &&& Amila: You. You shall be my second. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: Okay, I'll need someone to show me the ropes though. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00213A"
msgid "I don't even know what a \"second\" is. What is that?"
msgstr "그 '입회인'이란 게 뭔지도 모르는데요. 그게 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Ugh, I was not thinking, it was a mistake -  &&& Borhal: That is precisely the sloffing problem, Amila! You are never thinking, you are too much of a drunken fool to think! |Apparently you are not even above selling the remains of dear mother to fund your habit. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Perhaps I should. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065576
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002139"
msgid "It was a mistake, and you are going to condemn me for the rest of my life over a mistake?"
msgstr "실수였다고. 그 실수 한 번 한 것 갖고 평생 나를 비난할 셈이야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Vicious, biting / Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: That is precisely the sloffing problem, Amila! You are never thinking, you are too much of a drunken fool to think! |Apparently you are not even above selling the remains of dear mother to fund your habit.  &&& Amila: It was a mistake, and you are going to condemn me for the rest of my life over a mistake? 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: Do you truly have no shame, Amila? No shame at all? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065575
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002138"
msgid "Perhaps I should."
msgstr "그래야 할지도 모르겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: You will be working with me. As seconds, it is our duty to prepare for the duel and ensure fairness. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065574
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002137"
msgid "Their family home is this way, it is not far. We can discuss matters there."
msgstr "형제들의 일가는 이쪽으로 가면 나와요. 멀지 않죠. 그곳에서 할 일을 애기하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Borhal, calm down. Do not do this here. &&& ...  &&& Amila: Mother and father spat on the ground I walked on. You were their pride and joy. Good, generous Borhal, always the paragon, the keeper of our family name!  &&& Borhal: I am... I am disgusted to call you "brother." |It would be best for us all if by some miracle you were to drown in one of those bottles of koza you are so infatuated with.  &&& Amila: With a brother like you, is it any wonder why I am driven to drink? 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: You should be addressing the brute here. He is the one making the scene.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065582
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002136"
msgid "Are you done, both of you? Will you calm down?"
msgstr "둘 다 이제 끝났죠? 좀 진정하시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: Mother and father spat on the ground I walked on. You were their pride and joy. Good, generous Borhal, always the paragon, the keeper of our family name!  &&& Borhal: I am... I am disgusted to call you "brother." |It would be best for us all if by some miracle you were to drown in one of those bottles of koza you are so infatuated with. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: You should be addressing the brute here. He is the one making the scene.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106557A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002135"
msgid "With a brother like you, is it any wonder why I am driven to drink?"
msgstr "형 같은 사람을 친형제로 두고 있는데, 왜 내가 술을 안 마시겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: Their family home is this way, it is not far. We can discuss matters there.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Danika: I am sorry that you have found yourself in this situation, but know that you are doing Amila a great favor. He truly has no one else who would be willing to do this for him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065573
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002134"
msgid "You will be working with me. As seconds, it is our duty to prepare for the duel and ensure fairness."
msgstr "당신은 저와 일하게 될 거예요. 입회인으로서 우린 결투를 준비하고 공정한 싸움이 될 수 있도록 감시해야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: Then it is settled. Outsider, you will work alongside Danika to prepare for the duel. 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: Hmmph, do not sound so confident, brother. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 010655BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_03_QuestIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002133"
msgid "As for you, Amila, enjoy these last few moments. For when we next meet, your shameful life ends."
msgstr "아밀라, 너는 앞으로 이 마지막 순간을 잘 만끽하도록 해라. 다음에 우리가 만날 땐, 네놈의 부끄러운 삶이 끝날 테니 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Borhal: I am causing a scene because you tried to sell mother's urn, with mother still in it! &&& Amila: Ugh, I was not thinking, it was a mistake - 
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065577
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002132"
msgid "That is precisely the sloffing problem, Amila! You are never thinking, you are too much of a drunken fool to think!"
msgstr "그게 바로 허물진 네놈의 문제다. 아밀라! 생각을 전혀 못해. 술에 잔뜩 취해 멍청이가 돼서 생각을 못하는 거지 않느냐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Amila
#. ALIAS: Borhal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMBorhalAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Amila: It was a mistake, and you are going to condemn me for the rest of my life over a mistake? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065577
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_01_LoopingIntro02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002130"
msgid "Apparently you are not even above selling the remains of dear mother to fund your habit."
msgstr "그 술버릇을 끊지 못해서 사랑하는 어머니의 유골함을 갖다 팔게 될 거라는 생각도 못한 모양이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: You will be working with me. As seconds, it is our duty to prepare for the duel and ensure fairness. 
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00212F"
msgid "I am sorry that you have found yourself in this situation, but know that you are doing Amila a great favor. He truly has no one else who would be willing to do this for him."
msgstr ""
"이런 상황에 끼어들게 해서 죄송합니다만, 지금 해주시는 일이 아밀라에게 큰 도움이 된다는 것만큼은 알아주세요. 아밀라에겐 이렇게 나서서 "
"도와줄 지인이 한 명도 없거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065572
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00212E"
msgid "He has burned every bridge imaginable."
msgstr "아밀라는 모든 인간 관계를 끊었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Borhal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Amila: How shameful of you to have this outburst.|Oh my... what would poor mother and father think?  &&& Borhal: You will speak not of mother and father, sloffing bastard. No shame, no shame at all. What a waste of a good life that they worked tirelessly to give you. 
#. ALIAS: Amila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAmilaAdlam
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Borhal: I am... I am disgusted to call you "brother." 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 0106557E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_00_LoopingIntro01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00212C"
msgid "Mother and father spat on the ground I walked on. You were their pride and joy. Good, generous Borhal, always the paragon, the keeper of our family name!"
msgstr ""
"어머니, 아버지는 내가 지나갈 때마다 침을 뱉던 작자들이었지. 부모님의 사랑을 독차지했던건 형이었고. 참 착하고, 인자한 보할. 항상 "
"모범적이고, 가문의 명성을 지키는 우리 아들!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Danika: I am sorry that you have found yourself in this situation, but know that you are doing Amila a great favor. He truly has no one else who would be willing to do this for him. |He has burned every bridge imaginable. |It seems that after years of suffering Amila's embarrassments, Borhal has reached a boiling point. But still, to challenge your brother to a duel...|I pray that we will be able to work towards a peaceful resolution before it is too late.
#. ALIAS: Danika
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDanikaHagan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS03
#. TOPIC: 01065571
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS03_04_FollowDanika
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00212A"
msgid "This is it. Shall we begin our duties?"
msgstr "때가 됐네요. 시작해 볼까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: 
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Research] Yes, I was able to get Sahima's research.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0105FA9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00211B"
msgid "Ah, were you able to find Sahima?"
msgstr "아, 사히마는 찾아봤나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: 
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Research] Yes, I was able to get Sahima's research.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0105FA9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00211A"
msgid "You've returned. Hopefully with a vital piece of this puzzle?"
msgstr "돌아왔구만. 이 퍼즐의 중요한 조각은 가져왔겠지?"

