msgid "If only the others had listened to her, we may not have lost so much of our great city."
msgstr "사람들이 사히마 말을 듣기만 했더라면, 이 위대한 도시를 이렇게 많이 잃지는 않았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris:  &&& Ekris: Ah, were you able to find Sahima?
