#. TOPIC: 0105FA98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002114"
msgid "Either way, we have no choice but to take the risk of failure, as small as it may be."
msgstr "어느 쪽이든, 아무리 적더라도 실패의 위험을 감수할 수밖에 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you sure this is going to work?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
