#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: Perfect! I have no doubt Sahima's work is the key to stabilizing the Mourning Device.|If only the others had listened to her, we may not have lost so much of our great city.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
