#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00210F"
msgid "It shouldn't take me long to install her work."
msgstr "사히마의 작업물을 설치하는 데 시간이 오래 걸리진 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: This leaves Houses Dul'kehf and Veth'aal. 
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: And before I forget, I've been told to inform you that the Council has now granted you access to the armory in the Keep. Seems they're pleased with your work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0105FA95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_4000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00210E"
msgid "I pray they are cooperative. There's no telling how much time we have."
msgstr "가문이 협조해 주길 기도할게. 시간이 얼마나 남았는진 알 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We track him. He's injured, so it shouldn't be too hard. &&& Tane: Sounds like a plan. And hopefully that injury slows him down enough for us to catch up. &&& Tane: Let's head back down and see what we can find. And by "we," I mean you.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just because I got tech that does it for me doesn't make me an expert.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00210C"
msgid "I thought tracking was your department."
msgstr "추적은 당신 전문 분야인 줄 알았는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I thought tracking was your department.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I thought tracking was your department.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00210B"
msgid "Just because I got tech that does it for me doesn't make me an expert."
msgstr "관련 기기가 있다고 해서 전문가가 되는 건 아니라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I thought tracking was your department.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Looks like Vaeric was running around in a panic. Not that I blame him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00210A"
msgid "Let me take a look around, though."
msgstr "하지만 한 번 둘러볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I'll say it again.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not here. Not unless you want me to get some target practice in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002109"
msgid "I go where I want."
msgstr "가고 싶은 데로 갈 건데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I go where I want.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I go where I want.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
