msgid "Not here. Not unless you want me to get some target practice in."
msgstr "여기선 안 돼요. 사격 연습을 하려는 게 아니라면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I go where I want.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002107"
msgid "If you have business here, state it."
msgstr "여기 볼일이 있는 거면 설명부터 해 줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I can't allow that.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. I'll be along shortly. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002106"
msgid "I'll make him see reason."
msgstr "이성을 되찾도록 해볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vitoria and Luther are on your side. Viktor will come around.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vitoria and Luther are on your side. Viktor will come around.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'll need to make some preparations before I return, gathering my things and making sure Bella and Boris are taken care of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FABE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002105"
msgid "Vitoria always did bring out the reasonable side in my father. That's good to know she hasn't disowned me."
msgstr "비토리아 고모는 항상 아버지의 합리적인 면을 이끌어내셨어. 나를 버리지 않으셨다니 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This is why I put my faith in science and people. &&& Vaeric: You must be one of the Enlightened I've heard about.  &&& Vaeric: I hope you can see why I want to walk away from all this... to start my own life.|I ask that you give me that chance.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vitoria always did bring out the reasonable side in my father. That's good to know she hasn't disowned me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FABF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002104"
msgid "Vitoria and Luther are on your side. Viktor will come around."
msgstr "비토리아와 루터는 네 편이야. 빅토르도 정신을 차리겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll make him see reason.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll make him see reason.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'll need to make some preparations before I return, gathering my things and making sure Bella and Boris are taken care of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAC0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002103"
msgid "Thank you. I'll be along shortly."
msgstr "고마워. 곧 따라갈게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Let's just hope he still sees it that way. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'll be along shortly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002102"
msgid "I'll need to make some preparations before I return, gathering my things and making sure Bella and Boris are taken care of."
msgstr "돌아가기 전에 짐을 정리하고 벨라와 보리스가 잘 지낼 수 있도록 몇 가지 준비를 해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: I'll need to make some preparations before I return, gathering my things and making sure Bella and Boris are taken care of.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Same here. I'm going to stick around and help Vaeric out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010B49FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002101"
msgid "I'll be along shortly."
msgstr "곧 따라갈게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help. &&& Irina: That's... a generous offer.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Zen... Yes, I know quite well. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020FD"
msgid "Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing?"
msgstr "이리나... 지금 뭐 하는 건지 확실히 알고 하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The ring is a small price to pay for your life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020FA"
msgid "That disaster took every physical reminder of her except for this ring. Just wiped her from existence."
msgstr "그 재난이 이 반지만 빼고 동생을 떠올릴 물건을 전부 없애버렸거든. 동생의 존재 자체를 지워버린 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Said with regret. She's has realized she probably harbored a traitor and her actions may have bad repercussions. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: As I said before, I've never seen Vaeric Veth'aal...|We keep to ourselves. There's no reason for our paths to cross.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: That's gotta be Vaeric.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F9"
msgid "But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago."
msgstr "다만... 며칠 전에 다친 젊은이를 도와준 적은 있네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: That's... a generous offer. &&& Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Never mind my partner. They're just... overly cautious.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F8"
msgid "Zen... Yes, I know quite well."
msgstr "젠... 그럼, 잘 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not at liberty to say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not at liberty to say.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F7"
msgid "At least understand our plight."
msgstr "우리 처지라도 이해해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not at liberty to say.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Even if we'd known he was Vaeric Veth'aal, how could we know he was a traitor? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F6"
msgid "A traitor slips through Dazra's own wardens, and you expect us, simple farmers, to suss him out?"
msgstr "다즈라 교정관들도 못 잡은 반역자인데, 그냥 농부인 우리가 그 사람을 알아볼 수 있을 것 같아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Zen... Yes, I know quite well. 
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: As I said before, I've never seen Vaeric Veth'aal...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F5"
msgid "Never mind my partner. They're just... overly cautious."
msgstr "제 반려자는 신경 쓰지 마세요. 그냥... 조심성이 과하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Irina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way. &&& Tane: Thanks for the help. &&& Irina: All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Who even is this elusive traitor that we're being threatened over?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F4"
msgid "This is exactly what I feared."
msgstr "딱 이렇게 될 것 같더라니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who's Vashti?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who's Vashti?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F3"
msgid "I will not speak of her with an outsider, Promised or not."
msgstr "이방인에겐 말하지 않겠다. 약속받은 자라도 상관없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who's Vashti?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F2"
msgid "Your focus is solely on Vaeric."
msgstr "넌 배릭에게만 집중해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it. &&& Tevina: Then you shall have precisely that. &&& Tevina: But that aside, let's get to the guts of the issue, hm? After reading through the evidence, where do you think the supply thief is from?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. Keep your secrets. I'll do the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C438
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F1"
msgid "I'm not at liberty to say."
msgstr "그건 말할 수 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give ring] It's done. Your son is dead. &&& Luther: What have you done? Vaeric... &&& Vitoria: This blood is on your hands, Viktor. I hope you remember this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do not hide behind doctrine. You know as well as I there was a choice to be made.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020F0"
msgid "What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "이미 끝난 일이에요. 분명 그게 위대한 뱀의 뜻이었겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: Even if we'd known he was Vaeric Veth'aal, how could we know he was a traitor? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020EF"
msgid "The heir apparent himself? Viktor Veth'aal never was one for mercy, but his own son?"
msgstr "그 후계자라고요? 빅토르 베타알이 자비를 베풀 사람은 아니지만, 자기 아들을요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: What my brother is trying to say is that he wishes his own son dead.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020EE"
msgid "First, we lose Vashti to that malignance tearing through Dazra, and now you so willingly offer up Vaeric?"
msgstr "전에 다즈라를 찢어발긴 사악한 균열에 바슈티를 잃었는데, 이젠 기꺼이 배릭까지 바치려는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Grief can often cloud our judgement. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020ED"
msgid "As if our House has not suffered enough loss already."
msgstr "우리 가문에 아직도 잃을 게 남았다는 것처럼 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: No, it was Vaeric's choice. He knew the consequences.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020EC"
msgid "Do not hide behind doctrine. You know as well as I there was a choice to be made."
msgstr "교리 뒤에 숨지 마세요. 당신도 저처럼 선택의 갈림길에 서 있다는 걸 잘 알고 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason. &&& Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it. &&& Viktor: Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death.|Only then will I grant access to the power grid.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is no other way. The Ministry of State must uphold order, and you will be expected to serve as we all do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020EB"
msgid "I agree with Vitoria. There must be another way."
msgstr "비토리아 말이 맞아요. 분명 다른 방법이 있을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Zen: This is exactly what I feared.
#. ALIAS: Zen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXZenMazur
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAAA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020EA"
msgid "Who even is this elusive traitor that we're being threatened over?"
msgstr "그 찾기 힘든 반역자가 누구길래 우리를 협박하는 건데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: Heh, "the law." Our work is not so simple and you know it.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E9"
msgid "You act as if death is the only answer."
msgstr "죽음만이 해결책인 것처럼 굴지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I will not risk the Ministry's authority on the actions of my own son, even if he is my chosen heir.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E8"
msgid "What about forgiveness?"
msgstr "용서해 주는 게 어떻겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Oh, I AM leaving. To mourn my nephew whose memory you disgrace with your very presence. &&& Luther: Vitoria! &&& Viktor: Leave her be, Luther. |The Great Serpent will guide her. She will understand in time and emerge stronger for it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well said, Harbinger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E7"
msgid "Yes, the Serpent tests us all."
msgstr "네. 위대한 뱀께서는 우리 모두를 시험하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Well said, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now only one matter remains to discuss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E6"
msgid "Ultimately, I care nothing for what you think..."
msgstr "본질적으로, 네가 어떻게 생각하든 상관없지만 말이다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: If the High Council wants my cooperation, I need you to find Vaeric and carry out his sentence. &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E5"
msgid "I have never been more clear."
msgstr "확실하게 말하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E4"
msgid "Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death."
msgstr "배릭은 베타알 가문의 문장이 새겨진 인장 반지를 가지고 있다. 죽였다는 증거로 가져오도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E3"
msgid "Only then will I grant access to the power grid."
msgstr "일을 마쳐야만 전력망 접속 권한을 줄 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, the Serpent tests us all.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, the Serpent tests us all.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now only one matter remains to discuss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E2"
msgid "Well said, Harbinger."
msgstr "말 잘했군. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: You act as if death is the only answer.|What about forgiveness?  &&& Viktor: I will not risk the Ministry's authority on the actions of my own son, even if he is my chosen heir. &&& Viktor: If the High Council wants my cooperation, I need you to find Vaeric and carry out his sentence.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E1"
msgid "And I would ask that you spare him."
msgstr "저는 배릭을 살려달라고 부탁할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I have never been more clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020E0"
msgid "My brother is acting under impulse, not reason."
msgstr "오라버니는 이성이 아니라 충동을 따르고 있거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "will." / Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I agree with Vitoria. There must be another way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I agree with Vitoria. There must be another way.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020DF"
msgid "There is no other way. The Ministry of State must uphold order, and you will be expected to serve as we all do."
msgstr "다른 방법은 없다. 국무성은 질서를 유지해야 하며, 너도 우리 모두와 마찬가지로 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Acknowledging the name with a mix of sadness and frustration. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020DD"
msgid "Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭 베타알이요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: He does, Luther. He is allowing his fervent pride and anger to cloud his judgement. &&& Vitoria: What my brother is trying to say is that he wishes his own son dead. &&& Vitoria: First, we lose Vashti to that malignance tearing through Dazra, and now you so willingly offer up Vaeric?|As if our House has not suffered enough loss already. 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will not speak of her with an outsider, Promised or not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105FAA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020DC"
msgid "Who's Vashti?"
msgstr "바슈티가 누구죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris:  &&& Ekris: Did Viktor finally relinquish the access code?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Slowly but surely. It's a shame the Houses aren't more forthcoming. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020DB"
msgid "How is your work coming along?"
msgstr "작업은 어떻게 진행되고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give Access Code] Yes, this slate has the code on it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Access Code] Yes, this slate has the code on it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: Now, let's hope Houses Ka'dic and Dul'kehf are as forthcoming.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020DA"
msgid "Excellent. We'll finally have the resources to fully charge the Mourning Device."
msgstr "아주 좋아. 드디어 모어닝 장치를 완전히 충전시킬 자원이 생겼군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is your work coming along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D9"
msgid "Slowly but surely. It's a shame the Houses aren't more forthcoming."
msgstr "느리지만 착실히 진행 중이야. 가문들이 더 협조해주지 않는 게 유감이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your work coming along?
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ekris: [Give Access Code] Yes, this slate has the code on it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_7000_Ekris_CompletionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D8"
msgid "You'd think they would've wanted to aid the situation from the beginning, but they remained self-absorbed as ever."
msgstr "베타알 쪽에서는 처음부터 돕고 싶어 했을 거라고 생각할지 모르겠지만, 베타알 가문은 여느 때와 마찬가지로 자기중심적이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Parent's trying to run your life. I get it. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Parent's trying to run your life. I get it. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D7"
msgid "Then you understand..."
msgstr "그렇다면 이해하겠지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a parent, he should support you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As a parent, he should support you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D6"
msgid "That's the issue. As far as my father's concerned, he's the most supportive parent out there..."
msgstr "그게 문제라고. 아버지로 말할 것 같으면, 이 세상에서 가장 지원 많이 해 주는 부모거든..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a parent, he should support you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D5"
msgid "Giving me all the tools and teachings I need to inherit House Veth'aal and assume the reigns of the Ministry of State."
msgstr "베타알 가문을 계승하고 국무성의 통치 업무를 맡는 데 필요한 모든 도구와 가르침을 주셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "I'm" in both cases.  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a parent, he should support you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D4"
msgid "I'm the ungrateful one. I'm the problem... not him."
msgstr "배은망덕한 건 나야. 내가 문제지... 아버지가 문제가 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your signet ring. Viktor wants it as proof of death.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your signet ring. Viktor wants it as proof of death.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D1"
msgid "My ring?"
msgstr "내 반지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Actually, the blood is on my hands. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Actually, the blood is on my hands. 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: No, it was Vaeric's choice. He knew the consequences.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020D0"
msgid "I have not overlooked your involvement in this."
msgstr "당신이 관여한 걸 모르는 게 아니라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020CF"
msgid "The credits are easy, and I'll gladly pay a price for freedom."
msgstr "크레딧이라면 괜찮지. 자유를 위해서라면 기꺼이 대가를 치를 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandVaericCredits>] Your signet ring and hush money will do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Vashti gave it to me. It's all I have left of her since the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020CE"
msgid "As for the ring..."
msgstr "그 반지 말인데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You and Luther act surprised, but you both knew this was coming. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You and Luther act surprised, but you both knew this was coming. 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: No, it was Vaeric's choice. He knew the consequences.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020CC"
msgid "And I also told you to spare him."
msgstr "그리고 배릭을 살려달라고도 말씀드렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Something tells me she's not getting over that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something tells me she's not getting over that.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Ultimately, I care nothing for what you think...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020CB"
msgid "She will. She has duties to perform."
msgstr "극복할 거다. 수행해야 할 의무가 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may have done the deed, but even I think you went too far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may have done the deed, but even I think you went too far.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Ultimately, I care nothing for what you think...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020CA"
msgid "Then I can appreciate a tool that does not question."
msgstr "그렇다면 도구답게 의문을 제기하지 않으면 고맙겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Time heals all wounds.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Time heals all wounds.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Now only one matter remains to discuss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020C9"
msgid "Indeed it does."
msgstr "진정으로 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here to carry out your sentence as a traitor.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here to carry out your sentence as a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020C3"
msgid "So I've been labeled a traitor?"
msgstr "그럼 내가 반역자로 낙인찍힌 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your father sent me to kill you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your father sent me to kill you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020C2"
msgid "Kill me? As if he wasn't already suffocating me..."
msgstr "날 죽인다고? 맨날 나 숨막히게 하시더니 이제 와서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I understand this is a State matter, but if you seek to execute traitors, this is very much Tane's "business."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020C1"
msgid "None of our business?"
msgstr "상관할 일이 아니라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have orders. I intend to follow them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have orders. I intend to follow them.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020C0"
msgid "Orders that you didn't even question. Have you seen the state of this planet?"
msgstr "명령에 의심조차 하지 않았구만. 이 행성의 상태를 보기나 했나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have orders. I intend to follow them.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: He may not be thinking clearly given the circumstances.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BF"
msgid "Viktor may be out of his damn mind."
msgstr "빅토르가 제정신이 아닐지도 모른단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Now that you mention it...
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Now that you mention it...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Hey... Tane is innocent here. Let the man go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BE"
msgid "Hey now, I wasn't serious!"
msgstr "이봐! 농담 아니라고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: But you never did.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But you never did.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Hey... Tane is innocent here. Let the man go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BD"
msgid "Sure, but I'm just making a point here. This is overboard."
msgstr "그렇긴 하지만, 그냥 내 주장의 핵심이 그렇다는 거야. 이건 도를 넘었다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, but I will let Viktor know about your involvement.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, but I will let Viktor know about your involvement.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Hey... Tane is innocent here. Let the man go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BC"
msgid "You let Viktor know after he's sent you out to kill his own son? I'm sure that'll go over like peaches and cream."
msgstr "빅토르가 자기 아들을 죽이라고 널 보낸 후에 빅토르에게 보고 안 했지? 분명 어렵지 않게 잘 넘어갈 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack Vaeric] Fine. Tane, you're safe, but I still have an order to follow.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack Vaeric] Fine. Tane, you're safe, but I still have an order to follow.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BB"
msgid "You're on your own then. I won't have any part in this."
msgstr "그러면 혼자 알아서 하시던지. 난 이 일에 관여하지 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack Vaeric] Fine. Tane, you're safe, but I still have an order to follow.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: So be it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020BA"
msgid "I'm going back to Herald's Rest and pretending this never happened."
msgstr "전령의 안식처로 돌아갈 거야. 이번 일은 겪은 적 없던 걸로 칠테다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure they're connected to the Scaled Citadel experiment.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure they're connected to the Scaled Citadel experiment.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048618
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B9"
msgid "Sure looks like it."
msgstr "그런 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's a bloodstain. Vaeric must have been injured.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's a bloodstain. Vaeric must have been injured.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Well, what's next? Vaeric must've fled in a hurry since his tracker's still here, so guess the rest is up to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048615
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B8"
msgid "Injured? Hope he doesn't bleed out by the time we find him..."
msgstr "다쳤다고? 출혈 때문에 큰일 나기 전에 찾아야 할 텐데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I think Vaeric fought those creatures and lived.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I think Vaeric fought those creatures and lived.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Well, what's next? Vaeric must've fled in a hurry since his tracker's still here, so guess the rest is up to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048613
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B7"
msgid "Glad the kid had it in him. Only wish he could've killed 'em before we got here."
msgstr "그 애가 용기를 내서 다행이군. 우리가 오기 전에 놈들을 죽여줬으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found some blood and footprints, but couldn't make anything out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found some blood and footprints, but couldn't make anything out.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Looks like Vaeric was running around in a panic. Not that I blame him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048610
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B6"
msgid "Well, let's take a look."
msgstr "음, 한번 살펴보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing. This place is a wreck.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nothing. This place is a wreck.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B5"
msgid "I'll say. Vaeric's lucky he got out alive."
msgstr "내 생각엔, 배릭은 운 좋게 살아서 빠져나갔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing. This place is a wreck.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Looks like Vaeric was running around in a panic. Not that I blame him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B4"
msgid "I'll take a look around."
msgstr "주변을 좀 둘러볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B3"
msgid "House Veth'aal's heir?"
msgstr "베타알 가문의 후계자요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>. We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>. We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We know he came this way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048608
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B2"
msgid "Well, you won't find him here. This isn't exactly the type of place where House members frequent."
msgstr "글쎄요. 여기선 못 찾을걸요. 여긴 가문 사람들이 자주 찾아올 만한 장소가 아니라서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B1"
msgid "Haven't seen him. Ever, in fact."
msgstr "못 봤는데요. 얼굴도 모르지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020B0"
msgid "Besides, what would the heir of House Veth'aal be doing on my farm?"
msgstr "게다가, 베타알 가문의 후계자가 우리 농장에서 뭘 하겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We're looking for an injured young man that may have passed through here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're looking for an injured young man that may have passed through here.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048604
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AF"
msgid "Through here? You realize you're in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr "여길 지나요? 여기가 오지 한복판인 거 아시잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048601
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AE"
msgid "Of course, fellow Promised. Please forgive my abruptness."
msgstr "물론이죠. 약속받은 자 교우님. 퉁명스럽게 대한 걸 용서해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: His injuries may need special treatment. Please.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: His injuries may need special treatment. Please.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AD"
msgid "*sigh* All right, fine."
msgstr "*한숨* 좋아요. 알았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's injured. We're worried about him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's injured. We're worried about him.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AC"
msgid "I can understand that, but I can't help you."
msgstr "이해는 가지만, 도와드릴 순 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: Irina... Are you sure you know what you're doing? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AB"
msgid "That's... a generous offer."
msgstr "그건... 꽤 큰 돈이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You didn't know who he was?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You didn't know who he was?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020AA"
msgid "We didn't know and didn't ask."
msgstr "알지도 못했고 묻지도 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You didn't know who he was?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A9"
msgid "We introduced ourselves and he quickly changed the subject."
msgstr "저희가 자기소개를 하니까 재빨리 주제를 바꾸더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Some sadness since she misses her son and fears he may be dead / Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You didn't know who he was?
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: I need to know where Vaeric went.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A8"
msgid "But he was polite, and something about him reminded me of our own son, so I didn't feel the need to push him."
msgstr "그래도 젊은이가 예의 바르고, 뭔가 우리 아들을 떠올리게 해서 굳이 캐묻고 싶지는 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thank you for your help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thank you for your help.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A7"
msgid "I wasn't aware we had a choice."
msgstr "딱히 선택권도 없었잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thank you for your help.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: This is exactly what I feared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A6"
msgid "Now leave. You aren't welcome here."
msgstr "이제 나가요. 당신은 환영받지 못하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thank you for your help.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: This is exactly what I feared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A5"
msgid "If you find him, give him our regards."
msgstr "그 젊은이를 찾으면 안부 전해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A4"
msgid "We keep to ourselves. There's no reason for our paths to cross."
msgstr "우리는 우리끼리만 지내요. 서로 길이 교차할 이유가 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Never mind my partner. They're just... overly cautious.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A3"
msgid "As I said, we're isolated out here. We keep to ourselves."
msgstr "앞서 말했듯이, 우리는 이 외딴곳에서 살아요. 우리끼리만 지내죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We know he came this way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We know he came this way.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0020A1"
msgid "I hate to inform you, but you're wasting your time."
msgstr "이런 말 하긴 싫지만, 시간 낭비하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life. &&& ...  &&& Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses.  &&& Tane: Vaeric being a traitor is news to me and I live in Dazra. You've got to believe these people. &&& companion: Viktor wanted discretion, so it is not unreasonable that these people are innocent.|Still, knowingly or not, they did aid a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have that kind of money, but I can return what you gave me and what little savings we've managed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00209F"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_AcceptCreditsWithBribe>] Find. I'll take my credits back and whatever you have."
msgstr ""
"[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_AcceptCreditsWithBribe> 크레딧 요구] 좋아요. 내가 줬던 크레딧에 당신네 "
"것까지 더해서 내놓으시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I could be persuaded to let this go.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_AcceptCreditsWithBribe>] Find. I'll take my credits back and whatever you have.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I could be persuaded to let this go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00209E"
msgid "We don't have that kind of money, but I can return what you gave me and what little savings we've managed."
msgstr "저희한텐 그만한 돈이 없어요. 아까 주신 돈이랑 저희가 조금 저금했던 것까지 더해서 드릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I could be persuaded to let this go.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_AcceptCreditsWithBribe>] Find. I'll take my credits back and whatever you have.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I could be persuaded to let this go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00209D"
msgid "Here's what we have. Take it. Take it and leave us in peace."
msgstr "이게 우리 전부에요. 가져요. 가지고 평화롭게 떠나주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Give it time. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Give it time. 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01047263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00209C"
msgid "No thanks. I'll keep my fingers crossed that's the last one."
msgstr "사양할게. 그 놈이 마지막이었길 간절히 빌겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayTaneCredits>] It's a deal. Credits for Vaeric's location.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayTaneCredits>] It's a deal. Credits for Vaeric's location.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm pretty sure he's heading into the highlands, just not sure where, but I do have the means to track him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00209A"
msgid "Yeah? Maybe come back when you actually have the credits."
msgstr "그러셔? 크레딧이 진짜로 생기면 그때 다시 오지 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default, Vitoria
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104105E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002099"
msgid "All Must Serve. Those who refuse will be met with death."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다. 거부하는 자는 죽음을 맞이할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041045
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002098"
msgid "I will not risk word of his disappearance getting out before I can say the situation has been handled."
msgstr "상황이 처리되었다고 말하기 전에 아들의 가출 소문이 퍼지는 위험을 감수하고 싶진 않으니까."

