msgid "It is done."
msgstr "완료됐다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: It is done.
#. ALIAS: Ekris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEkrisKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell_1000_Ekris_FinalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002090"
msgid "Harbinger, will you do us the honor?"
msgstr "선구자, 영광스러운 일을 해줄 수 있겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208F"
msgid "Finish your business with House Veth'aal, and then we can talk."
msgstr "베타알 가문 일을 끝내면, 그다음에 얘기하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Razma_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208E"
msgid "While your focus is with House Dul'kehf, you have no business here."
msgstr "둘케프 가문 일에 전념하는 동안에는, 여기 일을 할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208D"
msgid "Are you not working for House Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문 일을 하고 있지 않나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Viktor_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208C"
msgid "If you are working for House Ka'dic, I fail to see what you are doing here."
msgstr "카딕 가문 일을 맡아 하고 있다면, 여기서 뭔 짓을 하는 건지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Hasmak_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208B"
msgid "Do you not have business with House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에 볼 일이 있지 않은가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ_Shell
#. TOPIC: 0105FA8E
#. INFO GROUP: Hasmak_BlockingHello
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00208A"
msgid "Viktor would not approve of you being here."
msgstr "빅토르는 자네가 여기 있는 걸 허락하지 않을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calling out to a passerby. You're urgently in need of help. / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_CalloutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002083"
msgid "Excuse me, Harbinger. Can I have a word?"
msgstr "실례합니다. 선구자. 잠깐 얘기 좀 할 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Formal, professional. lee-JAHN-uh duhl-KEF / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002082"
msgid "Thank you for stopping to talk to me. My name is Lijana Dul'kehf."
msgstr "잠시 저와 얘기해 주셔서 감사합니다. 제 이름은 리야나 둘케프라고 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Turning from professional to a little shaky and worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002081"
msgid "Normally I would ask how I can help you, but under the circumstances, I am the one who needs help."
msgstr "보통은 '도와드릴 일이 있나요?'라고 제가 묻겠지만, 지금 상황에선, 제게 도움이 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002080"
msgid "I oversee the delivery of goods to those living outside the city."
msgstr "전 도시 외곽에 사는 사람들에게 가는 물자 배송 업무를 감독하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Growing worry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00207F"
msgid "Unfortunately, I lost one of my couriers to the recent catastrophe."
msgstr "불행히도, 최근 재난 때문에 배달원 한 명을 잃었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Thank you for stopping to talk to me. My name is Lijana Dul'kehf. |Normally I would ask how I can help you, but under the circumstances, I am the one who needs help.|I oversee the delivery of goods to those living outside the city.|Unfortunately, I lost one of my couriers to the recent catastrophe.|I've sought a replacement, but extra hands are in desperately short supply.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see that you understand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00207E"
msgid "And now the deliveries are piling up."
msgstr "그래서 지금 배송이 쌓이고 있는 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And now the deliveries are piling up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And now the deliveries are piling up.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LijanaValyan: I wouldn't normally seek help from someone I don't know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00207D"
msgid "I see that you understand."
msgstr "이해해 주시는 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LijanaValyan: Thank you for stopping to talk to me. My name is Lijana Dul'kehf. |Normally I would ask how I can help you, but under the circumstances, I am the one who needs help.|I oversee the delivery of goods to those living outside the city.|Unfortunately, I lost one of my couriers to the recent catastrophe.|I've sought a replacement, but extra hands are in desperately short supply.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, of course not. You're new here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00207C"
msgid "I'm not sure I can be much help in finding a replacement."
msgstr "전 대체 인력으로는 그다지 도움이 안 될 것 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure I can be much help in finding a replacement.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure I can be much help in finding a replacement.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00207B"
msgid "No, of course not. You're new here."
msgstr "물론 아니죠. 여기 처음 오셨잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure I can be much help in finding a replacement.
#. ALIAS: LijanaValyan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFLijanaDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
