msgctxt "002056"
msgid "There is serenity here that cannot be found in the city."
msgstr "여기엔 도시에선 찾을 수 없는 평온함이 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can see the appeal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002055"
msgid "It is the ideal place to contemplate the secrets and mysteries of the cosmos."
msgstr "우주의 비밀과 그 신비를 묵상하기에 이상적인 장소라 할 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes you think that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What makes you think that?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002054"
msgid "Well, I know you don't work here."
msgstr "음, 일단 당신은 여기서 일하는 분이 아니잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What makes you think that?
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002051"
msgid "You also haven't attacked me, so being lost is the most sensible reason for your presence here."
msgstr "그런데 저를 공격하지도 않으셨으니, 길을 잃었다고 생각하는 게 가장 합리적이겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: Welcome, my friend.|Are not the beauty and majesty of nature truly splendid?|There is serenity here that cannot be found in the city.|It is the ideal place to contemplate the secrets and mysteries of the cosmos.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002050"
msgid "I can see the appeal."
msgstr "그 매력을 알 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can see the appeal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can see the appeal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00204F"
msgid "A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!"
msgstr "우린 마음이 통하는군. 훌륭해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: Welcome, my friend.|Are not the beauty and majesty of nature truly splendid?|There is serenity here that cannot be found in the city.|It is the ideal place to contemplate the secrets and mysteries of the cosmos.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you must learn to listen and to see.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00204E"
msgid "I'd get bored if I stayed out here too long."
msgstr "여기 너무 오래 있으면 좀 지루할 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd get bored if I stayed out here too long.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd get bored if I stayed out here too long.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FCA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00204D"
msgid "Then you must learn to listen and to see."
msgstr "그렇다면 자네는 듣고 보는 법을 배워야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A guided meditation, calm and soothing / EyesClosed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: LazimValvan: A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!|Let us share a brief meditation in celebration of this meeting.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: EyesClosed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00204A"
msgid "Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm."
msgstr "자, 눈을 감고 깊이 숨을 들이쉬어 보게. 편안하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A guided meditation, calm and soothing / EyesClosed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: EyesClosed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002049"
msgid "Do you feel that? It is the presence of the Great Serpent, omnipotent and all-seeing."
msgstr "느껴지나? 전지전능하신 위대한 뱀의 존재감이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A guided meditation, calm and soothing / EyesClosed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: EyesClosed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002048"
msgid "Such divine communion purifies us and makes us strong."
msgstr "이런 신성한 교감은 우리를 정결케 하고 강인하게 해주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002047"
msgid "You may think this a chance meeting, but I know the truth."
msgstr "자네는 이게 우연한 만남이라고 생각할지도 모르지만, 난 진실을 아네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002046"
msgid "The Great Serpent has a plan for us all, my friend, and this encounter is a part of it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께선 우리 모두를 위해 계획을 안배하셨네. 교우여. 그리고 이 만남은 그 일부일 뿐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can tell that you were fond of him. &&& AlicjaDalca: Yes, yes I was. |After making a delivery, he often stayed for a bowl of stew and tell me the news of the city.|He would always have a new joke that he'd share. He had a gift for humor and telling stories.|Sometimes I would laugh so much that my sides would ache for hours.|I will miss him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002045"
msgid "[Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 여기 받으시죠. 안에 뭐가 들었는지 거 냄새 한번 끝내주네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002044"
msgid "I know it's customary to pay upon receipt, but let me pose you this question."
msgstr "물건을 받으면 돈을 지불하는 게 관례라는 건 알지만, 잠깐 자네에게 묻겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002043"
msgid "If we carry out the will of the Great Serpent, is that not the greatest reward of all?"
msgstr "우리가 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 행하게 된다면, 그게 가장 큰 보상이 아니겠는가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give package] Nice try, but you're paying for this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002042"
msgid "Compared to such divine favor, the worth of a few credits is a mere pittance."
msgstr "그런 신성한 은총에 비하면, 크레딧 몇 푼의 가치는 그저 하찮은 것에 불과하다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Open with a sigh as you reflect on sad events / Sad / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AlicjaDalca: I can think of only one reason the Ministry of Commerce would send someone here.|You must be the new courier.|I know that Lijana has been desperate to find a replacement.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002041"
msgid "It's very sad, what happened to the previous courier."
msgstr "전임 배달원에게 닥친 일을 생각하니, 정말 안타깝네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002040"
msgid "His name was Shameed. He was a radiant soul, full of life and joy and dreams."
msgstr "전임 배달원은 샤미드라는 분이었어요. 영혼이 빛나고, 생명과 기쁨과 꿈으로 가득 찬 분이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can tell that you were fond of him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00203F"
msgid "All of it stolen away in the blink of an eye, to hear it told."
msgstr "그 모든 게 눈 깜짝할 사이에 사라지고 말았다고 들었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited for a long-awaited delivery / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00203D"
msgid "Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then."
msgstr "아, 좋은 반응이네요! 소포가 제대로 온 게 맞군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful. &&& AlicjaDalca: Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then. &&& AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.|They're some of the rarest we have, as well as the most pungent.|Cooking is my great joy, and the proper use of seasonings is the most important part.|Thank you for this!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Here is the payment. Farewell to you, stranger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002038"
msgid "I'll be on my way."
msgstr "이만 가보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll be on my way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll be on my way.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002037"
msgid "Here is the payment. Farewell to you, stranger."
msgstr "여기 대금 받으세요. 잘 가시길. 이방인 님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This conversation is making me hungry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This conversation is making me hungry.
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFAlicjaDalca
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002036"
msgid "Then I won't keep you."
msgstr "그럼 어서 가보세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] For you. Whatever's in here smells wonderful. &&& AlicjaDalca: Oh good! It's definitely the right package, then. &&& AlicjaDalca: I spent a small fortune on these spices.|They're some of the rarest we have, as well as the most pungent.|Cooking is my great joy, and the proper use of seasonings is the most important part.|Thank you for this!
#. ALIAS: AlicjaDalca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I won't keep you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_AlicjaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002033"
msgid "This conversation is making me hungry."
msgstr "대화를 하다 보니 배가 고파지네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002032"
msgid "Thought you'd catch me unaware, did you? Thought I'd be easy prey?"
msgstr "내가 눈치 못 챌 줄 알았나? 내가 등쳐 먹기 쉬워 보였나 보지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002031"
msgid "Unless you want a hole in the middle of your chest, you'd better turn around and start walking!"
msgstr "가슴에 바람구멍 나고 싶지 않으면, 지금 당장 뒤돌아서 꺼져!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002030"
msgid "There's no end of trouble out here lately."
msgstr "요즘 여긴 말썽이 끊이질 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202F"
msgid "We've got pirates and spacers circling like vultures looking for easy pickings."
msgstr "해적과 스페이서들이 독수리처럼 만만한 먹잇감을 찾아 맴돌고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202E"
msgid "And that's to say nothing of those fanatics."
msgstr "광신도들은 말할 것도 없고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: Thought you'd catch me unaware, did you? Thought I'd be easy prey?|Unless you want a hole in the middle of your chest, you'd better turn around and start walking!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202D"
msgid "Take it easy. I'm not your enemy."
msgstr "진정해요. 전 적이 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy. &&& FihranNostal: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough. &&& FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.|We've got pirates and spacers circling like vultures looking for easy pickings.|And that's to say nothing of those fanatics.|Has the Great Serpent abandoned us? I don't know. Perhaps.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because the only thing that annoys me less than pestering strangers is my work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202C"
msgid "If it's so dangerous, then why are you out here alone?"
msgstr "그렇게 위험한데, 왜 여기 혼자 계신 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I were here to kill you, you'd be dead already.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If I were here to kill you, you'd be dead already.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202B"
msgid "I suppose that's true. I was distracted and didn't hear you coming."
msgstr "맞군. 방심해서 자네가 오는 소리를 못 들었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I were here to kill you, you'd be dead already.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00202A"
msgid "You had me at your mercy, but you didn't strike."
msgstr "날 공격할 수도 있었을 텐데, 그러지 않았군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Skeptical, but starting to believe the player isn't an enemy.  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002029"
msgid "Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough."
msgstr "흠. 자네라면 뒤통수에 쉽게 총알을 박아 넣을 수도 있었겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Take it easy. I'm not your enemy. &&& FihranNostal: Hm. I suppose you could have put a bullet in the back of my head easy enough. &&& FihranNostal: There's no end of trouble out here lately.|We've got pirates and spacers circling like vultures looking for easy pickings.|And that's to say nothing of those fanatics.|Has the Great Serpent abandoned us? I don't know. Perhaps.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002028"
msgid "Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier."
msgstr "그런 사람 아닌데요. 배달원입니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002026"
msgid "Fine, so you're telling the truth."
msgstr "좋아, 자네 말이 사실이라고 치지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's so dangerous, then why are you out here alone?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's so dangerous, then why are you out here alone?
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002025"
msgid "Because the only thing that annoys me less than pestering strangers is my work."
msgstr "낯선 사람이 성가시게 구는 것보다 일에 몰두하는 게 덜 짜증 나니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: 
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002024"
msgid "I know the courier well, and you are not him."
msgstr "여기 담당 배달원과 아는 사인데, 자네는 그 배달원이 아니잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002023"
msgid "Tell me the name of the person who sent you, and prove that you are not a liar."
msgstr "누가 보냈는지 말해봐. 거짓말이 아니라는 걸 증명해 보라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier. &&& FihranNostal:  &&& FihranNostal: I know the courier well, and you are not him.|Tell me the name of the person who sent you, and prove that you are not a liar.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, so you're telling the truth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002022"
msgid "A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me."
msgstr "리야나 둘케프라는 여자가 절 고용했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FihranNostal: Thought you'd catch me unaware, did you? Thought I'd be easy prey?|Unless you want a hole in the middle of your chest, you'd better turn around and start walking!
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose that's true. I was distracted and didn't hear you coming.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002021"
msgid "If I were here to kill you, you'd be dead already."
msgstr "제가 죽이려고 왔으면, 그쪽은 진작에 시체가 됐을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me. &&& FihranNostal: Fine, so you're telling the truth. &&& FihranNostal: I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days.|That, and the constant pain in my back makes me poor company, I know.|I fix machines because they don't try to start a conversation. I prefer the quiet.|But now at last, my medicine has arrived.|The Serpent knows I've gone too long without it.|No doubt He hears my loud swearing when I struggle to get out of my bed every morning.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I needed it many days ago, but that is not your fault.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002020"
msgid "[Give package] Here, it sounds like you really need this."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 자, 이게 정말 필요하실 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well I'm not any of those things. I'm a courier. &&& FihranNostal:  &&& FihranNostal: I know the courier well, and you are not him.|Tell me the name of the person who sent you, and prove that you are not a liar.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't know, do you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201F"
msgid "The former courier's dead. Now do you want this package or not?"
msgstr "이전 배달원은 죽었어요. 그래서 이 소포, 받을 거예요? 말 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me. &&& FihranNostal: Fine, so you're telling the truth. &&& FihranNostal: I won't apologize for my manner. Trust does not come easily for me in these dark days.|That, and the constant pain in my back makes me poor company, I know.|I fix machines because they don't try to start a conversation. I prefer the quiet.|But now at last, my medicine has arrived.|The Serpent knows I've gone too long without it.|No doubt He hears my loud swearing when I struggle to get out of my bed every morning.
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sure you wish I would.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC7F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201E"
msgid "[Give package] I've got your medication. Try to get some rest."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 여기 당신 약이에요. 푹 쉬시고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The former courier's dead. Now do you want this package or not?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The former courier's dead. Now do you want this package or not?
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201D"
msgid "You don't know, do you?"
msgstr "내가 누군 줄 알고 그런 소릴 하시나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The former courier's dead. Now do you want this package or not?
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201C"
msgid "You probably killed the courier and now you're here to rob me."
msgstr "아마 배달원을 죽이고 날 털러 온 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The former courier's dead. Now do you want this package or not?
#. ALIAS: FihranNostal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: A woman named Lijana Dul'kehf hired me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201B"
msgid "Either answer my question, or by the Serpent, I'll make you regret coming here."
msgstr "내 질문에 대답해. 안 그러면 위대한 뱀의 이름으로, 여기 온 걸 후회하게 해 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] Here, it sounds like you really need this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] Here, it sounds like you really need this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFihranNostal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FihranNostal: Take your credits and leave me in peace.
