#. TOPIC: 0105FC80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_FihranScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00201A"
msgid "I needed it many days ago, but that is not your fault."
msgstr "며칠 전부터 필요했지. 자네 잘못은 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] I've got your medication. Try to get some rest.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give package] I've got your medication. Try to get some rest.
