#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002019"
msgid "I'm sure you wish I would."
msgstr "걱정해 줘서 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can see the appeal. &&& LazimValvan: A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!|Let us share a brief meditation in celebration of this meeting. &&& LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.|Do you feel that? It is the presence of the Great Serpent, omnipotent and all-seeing. |Such divine communion purifies us and makes us strong.|You may think this a chance meeting, but I know the truth.|The Great Serpent has a plan for us all, my friend, and this encounter is a part of it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, so Lijana has at last found a new courier. Great Serpent be praised!
