#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002015"
msgid "If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면, 마침 위대한 뱀께서 당신에게 소포가 배송되게 하셨군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: lee-JAHN-ah / Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you.
