#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002014"
msgid "Ah, so Lijana has at last found a new courier. Great Serpent be praised!"
msgstr "아, 리야나가 드디어 새 배달원을 찾았군. 위대한 뱀을 찬양하라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can see the appeal. &&& LazimValvan: A kindred spirit, then. Wonderful!|Let us share a brief meditation in celebration of this meeting. &&& LazimValvan: Now close your eyes and breathe in deeply. Be calm.|Do you feel that? It is the presence of the Great Serpent, omnipotent and all-seeing. |Such divine communion purifies us and makes us strong.|You may think this a chance meeting, but I know the truth.|The Great Serpent has a plan for us all, my friend, and this encounter is a part of it.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The truth can be as invisible as the wind for those who lack the vision to see it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC7B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002013"
msgid "The Great Serpent had nothing to do with it. I'm here to deliver a package."
msgstr "위대한 뱀과는 아무 상관 없어요. 전 소포나 배송하러 온 거니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent had nothing to do with it. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent had nothing to do with it. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002012"
msgid "The truth can be as invisible as the wind for those who lack the vision to see it."
msgstr "진실 또한 보이지 않을 수 있지. 볼 수 있는 눈이 없는 자들에겐 바람이 보이지 않듯이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent had nothing to do with it. I'm here to deliver a package.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105FC7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ02_LazimScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "002011"
msgid "Ah, but belief is not required to be made an instrument of the Great Serpent's will."
msgstr "아, 하지만 위대한 뱀의 뜻을 행하는 도구가 되기 위해 믿음까지 필요한 건 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If that's true, then the Great Serpent has a delivery for you. &&& LazimValvan: Ah, so Lijana has at last found a new courier. Great Serpent be praised! &&& LazimValvan: This package of dried and salted groat's meat will sustain me in my contemplations.|So captivated am I by the Serpent's mysteries, I sometimes go days without remembering to eat|I know it's customary to pay upon receipt, but let me pose you this question.|If we carry out the will of the Great Serpent, is that not the greatest reward of all?|Compared to such divine favor, the worth of a few credits is a mere pittance.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well, but you should know that an obsession with material goods does harm to the soul.
