msgid "[Give package] Nice try, but you're paying for this."
msgstr "[소포 주기] 시도는 좋았는데요. 그래도 돈은 내야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] Nice try, but you're paying for this.
