msgid "Your eyes see clearly and your heart is pure, my friend."
msgstr "자네의 눈은 맑고 마음은 순수하군. 교우여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give package] You're right. I don't need credits.
#. ALIAS: LazimValvan
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLazimValyan
#. FACE: Neutral
