msgid "No. The Great Serpent will help us!"
msgstr "안 무서워요. 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 도와주실 거예요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hi? Aren't you disappointed that I found you? 
