#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I'm sorry, but I find that kind of thinking archaic.|You risked your life to protect your family's legacy.|If that's not honorable, then I don't know what is. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: So you see us as unenlightened heathens, is that it?|Save your condescending words for someone else. I have no desire to hear them.
