#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FBE"
msgid "I know that some people have lost a lot. Their homes, or their parents, or other things. Ivali and I are lucky, or so my parents say. You know, when I actually see them."
msgstr ""
"다른 사람들이 많은 걸 잃었다는 건 저도 알아요. 집이나, 부모님이나, 아니면 다른 것들이나. 이발리와 저는 운이 좋았죠. 부모님은 "
"그렇게 말씀하시더라고요. 뭐, 그런 말도 가끔 부모님을 만났을 때나 듣지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Ilana
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105BA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FBD"
msgid "My parents have been so busy helping other people that I feel like they've forgotten about me."
msgstr "제 부모님은 남들을 돕느라 너무 바빠서 절 잊어버린 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Ilana
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know how hard everything has been for you, and I'm sorry you're going through this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105BA4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FBC"
msgid "I'm sick of feeling sad. Like, sometimes my mother will tell me and Ivali that she'll try and be home early so that she can be with us. But it just... never happens. I wish she'd just not say anything at all."
msgstr ""
"이제 슬퍼만 하고 있는 것도 질렸어요. 가끔씩 엄마가 일찍 집에 와서 저랑 이발리와 함께 있어 주려고 노력해 보겠다고 하셨지만. 한 "
"번도... 그런 적이 없어요. 그냥 엄마가 아무 말도 안 했으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
