#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FBB"
msgid "It's a hard time for a lot of people. But you should feel grateful that you still have your parents."
msgstr "요즘 다들 힘들잖아. 부모님이 곁에 있다는 거에 감사할 줄 알아야지."

