msgid "I know that, and I do not hate my parents or anything."
msgstr "그건 알아요. 부모님이 싫다는 것도 아니고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a hard time for a lot of people. But you should feel grateful that you still have your parents. 
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Sad
