#. TOPIC: 0105BA49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_IlanaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FB9"
msgid "I love them, and I... I just want to see them."
msgstr "당연히 부모님을 사랑하죠. 저는... 그저 자주 보고 싶을 뿐이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
