#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not your therapist, kid. 
#. ALIAS: Ilana
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMIlanaKalima
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
