msgid "Ugh, fine! You are just like all the other grown-ups. No time for us kids! I do not know why I thought you would be different... It was dumb of me to say anything."
msgstr ""
"으, 됐어요! 다른 어른들이랑 똑같네요. 애들하고는 말할 시간도 없죠! 왜 이번엔 다를 거라 생각했는지 모르겠네... 말한 게 바보짓이지."

