#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FB0"
msgid "Essentially, he has abandoned his post. And not only did he turn his back on his House, but the Great Serpent as well."
msgstr "본질적으로, 녀석은 자기 지위를 버린 거다. 그리고 자기 가문에만 등을 돌린 게 아니라, 위대한 뱀께도 등을 돌렸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Viktor, surely you don't mean it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105ADF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAF"
msgid "He is a traitor and must be dealt with as such."
msgstr "녀석은 반역자이니 반드시 처단해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason. &&& Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it. &&& Viktor: Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death.|Only then will I grant access to the power grid.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I commend you for your faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105ADF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAE"
msgid "If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done."
msgstr "그게 위대한 뱀의 뜻이라면, 반드시 이루어질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105ADF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAD"
msgid "I commend you for your faith."
msgstr "너의 믿음에 찬사를 보내지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105ADF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAC"
msgid "A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son."
msgstr "이방인이 내 아들보다 더 독실하다니, 참으로 슬픈 날이로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I prefer not to talk about it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I prefer not to talk about it.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAB"
msgid "Yeah, a personal thing, huh? Don't worry, I'm not here to judge."
msgstr "그래, 개인적인 일이다 이거지? 걱정 마. 평가하러 온 거 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How'd you end up here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How'd you end up here?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FAA"
msgid "You could say I'm like a specialized delivery service, moving stuff back and forth between Dazra and the Settled Systems."
msgstr "내가 하는 일은 다즈라와 개척 성계 사이를 왔다 갔다 하며 물건을 나르는 전문 배송 서비스라고 할 수 있거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How'd you end up here?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA9"
msgid "Just so happens, I got a lot of time on my hands since Dazra went to hell and I lost my ship."
msgstr "공교롭게도, 다즈라가 작살나고 내 우주선도 사라지는 바람에 남는 시간이 많아졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How'd you end up here?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: A heretic then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA8"
msgid "And let me tell you, I thought things were grim before. Whatever that \"incident\" was, this whole planet's gonna need therapy."
msgstr "하나 말해주자면, 전에는 상황이 참 암울하다 싶었어. 그 '사고'가 뭐였든 간에, 이 행성 전체가 치료를 받아야 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, if you believe all that stuff.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure, if you believe all that stuff.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA7"
msgid "You telling me they made you Promised and you aren't even a believer?"
msgstr "그 말은 약속받은 자가 됐는데 종교를 믿지도 않는다는 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, if you believe all that stuff.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA6"
msgid "The High Council must be really desperate for answers if they overlooked that."
msgstr "대의회가 그걸 넘어가 준 거라면 분명 엄청나게 절박한 상황이겠구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Well, I guess that depends, Harbinger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA5"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention. &&& Tane: So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure.  &&& Tane: Anyway, enough about that. What can I do you for?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know the name, sure. Everybody here does. But the man? Not much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA4"
msgid "How well do you know Vaeric Veth'aal?"
msgstr "배릭 베타알을 얼마나 잘 아세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How well do you know Vaeric Veth'aal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How well do you know Vaeric Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA3"
msgid "I know the name, sure. Everybody here does. But the man? Not much."
msgstr "물론 이름은 알아. 여기 있는 모두가 알지. 하지만 인간으로서는? 그다지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How well do you know Vaeric Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA2"
msgid "Someone like me doesn't exactly hang out with House bigwigs."
msgstr "나 같은 사람은 가문의 높으신 분들과 어울리지 않거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know what you mean.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "001FA1"
msgid "Yeah, it's something, isn't it?"
msgstr "그래, 뭔가 좀 그렇잖아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You know hiding him is punishable by death.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You know hiding him is punishable by death.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm pretty sure he's heading into the highlands, just not sure where, but I do have the means to track him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001FA0"
msgid "You really know how to make your own luck, don't you?"
msgstr "운빨 받는 방법을 정말 잘 알고 있군 그래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell me what you know, or I'll report you to House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me what you know, or I'll report you to House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm pretty sure he's heading into the highlands, just not sure where, but I do have the means to track him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9F"
msgid "Oh hey, looks like your luck just turned around."
msgstr "잠깐. 방금 자네 운이 바뀐 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yep, that's me. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yep, that's me. 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9E"
msgid "Impressive, since these people really aren't into strangers. Especially in times like these."
msgstr "대단한데. 여기 사람들은 이방인을 진짜 싫어하거든. 요즘 같은 때는 특히 더 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D98
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9D"
msgid "Oh wow, you really bought in, huh?"
msgstr "어이구야. 진심으로 개종했구만?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I work alone. Hand it over.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I work alone. Hand it over.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9C"
msgid "Oh no, I'm stuck on you until this is over."
msgstr "안 돼. 일 끝날 때까지는 붙어 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I work alone. Hand it over.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Once we're outside of Dazra, I'll fire up my tracker, and fingers crossed, it'll lead us right to him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9B"
msgid "Let's just say I have an investment to look after."
msgstr "투자한 걸 지켜봐야 한다고만 말해두지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good. Let's go.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good. Let's go.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Once we're outside of Dazra, I'll fire up my tracker, and fingers crossed, it'll lead us right to him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F9A"
msgid "After you!"
msgstr "앞장서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're coming with me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're coming with me?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F99"
msgid "Yep, when it comes to my stuff, it's like a package deal."
msgstr "그래. 나는 물건을 거래할 때 묶음으로만 팔거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're coming with me?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I work alone. Hand it over.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F98"
msgid "I'm not just going to hand off valuable tech to some stranger."
msgstr "낯선 사람에게 귀중한 기술을 그냥 넘겨주지는 않을 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Track him? You have a tracker on Vaeric?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Track him? You have a tracker on Vaeric?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I work alone. Hand it over.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F97"
msgid "You make it sound creepy, but yeah, for emergencies."
msgstr "말 참 소름 끼치게 하네. 하지만 맞아. 긴급 상황이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Acknowledging Vaeric's dad must be looking for him.  / Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm looking for him on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for him on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Just so happens, I'm looking for the guy myself. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_ConfrontIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F96"
msgid "Dear old dad, huh?"
msgstr "친애하는 애비 대신 말이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You know where he is?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You know where he is?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: You heard correct.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_ConfrontIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F95"
msgid "Maybe. I'm getting there."
msgstr "아마도. 그럴지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You heard correct.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You heard correct.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Just so happens, I'm looking for the guy myself. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_ConfrontIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F94"
msgid "Nice to know these old ears haven't failed me."
msgstr "이 늙어 먹은 귀가 나를 실망시키지 않았으니 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't appreciate people spying on me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't appreciate people spying on me.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Just so happens, I'm looking for the guy myself. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045D8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_ConfrontIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F93"
msgid "Eh, spying's a harsh way to put it. And I'm not really the subtle type."
msgstr "어이, 감시라는 표현은 좀 심하네. 그리고 나는 교묘한 부류는 아니거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell me where I can find this Tane Salavea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me where I can find this Tane Salavea.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F92"
msgid "Hard to say right now, but Tane's a regular."
msgstr "지금 말하긴 곤란한데, 테인이 여기 단골이거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell me where I can find this Tane Salavea.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Just promise me you'll let me know if you find Vaeric.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F91"
msgid "If you stay a bit, you can't miss him."
msgstr "조금만 기다리면 분명 올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I appreciate the information.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I appreciate the information.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F90"
msgid "If you can find Vaeric, you're welcome to it."
msgstr "배릭을 찾을 수 있다면 그 정도 쯤이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I appreciate the information.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Just promise me you'll let me know if you find Vaeric.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8F"
msgid "Tane's a regular here, so if you stick around, he's bound to show up sooner or later."
msgstr "테인은 여기 단골이야. 계속 기다리다 보면 조만간 나타날 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A heretic then.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic then.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: I've been toting stuff back and forth for these people for years and still get the cold shoulder most places I go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8E"
msgid "And proud of it."
msgstr "내 자랑거리야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: *sigh* Very well. 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Essentially, he has abandoned his post. And not only did he turn his back on his House, but the Great Serpent as well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041066
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8D"
msgid "My son, Vaeric, has left."
msgstr "내 아들, 배릭이... 집을 나갔다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Heh, "the law." Our work is not so simple and you know it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104105C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8C"
msgid "And showing leniency for a House member at a time like this when order is needed most would be unwise."
msgstr "그리고 질서가 가장 필요한 이 시기에 가문 구성원에게 관용을 베푸는 건 현명하지 못한 행동이니 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Vaeric is your son. You could make an exception.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric is your son. You could make an exception.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: We have done the same for less.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104105A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8B"
msgid "Exceptions show weakness, and we cannot afford to show weakness at a time like this."
msgstr "예외란 곧 약점을 드러내는 것이야. 지금 같은 시기에는 약점을 드러내선 안 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does the Ministry of State have to do with it? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What does the Ministry of State have to do with it? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041058
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F8A"
msgid "Our duty as wardens is to keep the populace tasked and loyal."
msgstr "교정관으로서 우리의 의무는 신민들이 임무를 완수하고 충성심을 갖도록 하는 것이다."

msgctxt "001F89"
msgid "\"All Must Serve\" both the Great Serpent and House Va'ruun. No exceptions."
msgstr "'모두가 섬겨야 한다'는 말은 위대한 뱀과 바룬 가문 양쪽에 적용되는 것이다. 예외는 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What does the Ministry of State have to do with it? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041058
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F88"
msgid "Those who refuse must be cleansed to stop the spread of corruption."
msgstr "부정부패의 확산을 막기 위해 거부하는 인간은 반드시 숙청해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This is ridiculous.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This is ridiculous.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F86"
msgid "There is nothing ridiculous about our customs, and I suggest you embrace them as one of the Promised."
msgstr "우리 관습에는 웃기는 일 따위 없다. 너도 약속받은 자들의 일원으로서 관습을 받아들이는 게 좋을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This is ridiculous.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F85"
msgid "The High Council wants my cooperation? This is how they get it."
msgstr "대의회가 내 협조를 구한다고? 이렇게 하면 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll see what I can do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll see what I can do.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041050
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F84"
msgid "See that you get it done."
msgstr "확실하게 끝마치도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That suits me fine. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That suits me fine. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F83"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hopefully, no one was stupid enough to help him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hopefully, no one was stupid enough to help him.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: And remember. Absolute discretion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041046
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F82"
msgid "If they were, they will pay the price."
msgstr "만약 있다면, 대가를 치러야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Father, I admit I had no intention of coming back.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: They helped me see under a different light.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F7D"
msgid "But the Harbinger found me..."
msgstr "하지만 선구자가 저를 찾아냈죠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: But the Harbinger found me...
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Will you forgive me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F7C"
msgid "They helped me see under a different light."
msgstr "제가 다른 방식으로 볼 수 있게 도와줬고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Return? &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: But the Harbinger found me... &&& Vaeric: They helped me see under a different light. &&& Vaeric: Will you forgive me? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Viktor, how dare you stall when your son has asked your forgiveness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F7B"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: They helped me see under a different light.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: ...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F7A"
msgid "Will you forgive me?"
msgstr "저를 용서해 주실래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: They helped me see under a different light. &&& Vaeric: Will you forgive me?  &&& Viktor: ...
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent is offering you a second chance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F79"
msgid "Viktor, how dare you stall when your son has asked your forgiveness."
msgstr "빅토르. 아들이 용서를 구하는데 어떻게 시간을 끌 수가 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: Will you forgive me?  &&& Viktor: ... &&& Vitoria: Viktor, how dare you stall when your son has asked your forgiveness.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, I see that now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F78"
msgid "Your son has returned to support you and your house."
msgstr "아드님은 장로님과 가문을 돕기 위해서 돌아온 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: Will you forgive me?  &&& Viktor: ... &&& Vitoria: Viktor, how dare you stall when your son has asked your forgiveness.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have been nothing but a real father to this boy...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F77"
msgid "Yeah, try being a real father for once."
msgstr "맞아요. 한 번쯤은 진짜 아버지가 되어 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent is offering you a second chance. &&& Viktor: Could it be... ?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F76"
msgid "Father, I have returned out of love and support for you and House Veth'aal."
msgstr "아버지, 저는 아버지와 베타알 가문을 사랑하고 돕고 싶어서 돌아왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Do you have any idea, the trauma you have caused me? The damage you could have wrought upon this house?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F75"
msgid "I am ready to dedicate myself fully."
msgstr "전적으로 헌신할 준비가 되어 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Could it be... ? &&& Vaeric: Father, I have returned out of love and support for you and House Veth'aal. |I am ready to dedicate myself fully.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It was never my intention to harm you or this House. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F74"
msgid "Do you have any idea, the trauma you have caused me? The damage you could have wrought upon this house?"
msgstr "네가 나한테 얼마나 큰 충격을 줬는지 아느냐? 네가 이 가문에 얼마나 큰 피해를 줬는지 아느냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness will help you move past your feelings of betrayal. &&& ...  &&& Luther: It's good to have you back with us, Vaeric. &&& Viktor: Thank you. &&& Viktor: You put my son back on the right path and guided him home.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric was raised to handle pressure. As my heir, he is more than familiar with it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F73"
msgid "You put too much pressure on him and he broke."
msgstr "너무 압박감을 많이 줘서 아드님이 무너진 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Father, I have returned out of love and support for you and House Veth'aal. |I am ready to dedicate myself fully. &&& Viktor: Do you have any idea, the trauma you have caused me? The damage you could have wrought upon this house?
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F72"
msgid "It was never my intention to harm you or this House."
msgstr "아버지나 이 가문을 해하려는 의도는 절대 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Forgiveness will help you move past your feelings of betrayal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F71"
msgid "I let my emotions get the best of me. I lost my way. But I have returned, repentant and ready to serve."
msgstr "감정을 주체할 수 없었어요. 길을 잃고 방황했죠. 하지만 돌아왔어요. 뉘우쳤고 섬길 준비가 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness will help you move past your feelings of betrayal. &&& ...  &&& Luther: It's good to have you back with us, Vaeric. &&& Viktor: Thank you. &&& Viktor: You put my son back on the right path and guided him home.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My responsibilities are far greater than being a simple parent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6F"
msgid "Your son needed a father, not the House Elder."
msgstr "아드님한텐 가문 장로가 아니라 아버지가 필요했던 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Perhaps you are right.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Vaeric, I have always seen myself in you, son, even the weaker, emotional side. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6E"
msgid "So I stand corrected."
msgstr "그럼 내 잘못을 인정해야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Vaeric
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: So I stand corrected.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6D"
msgid "Vaeric, I have always seen myself in you, son, even the weaker, emotional side."
msgstr "배릭, 나는 항상 너에게서, 아들에게서, 나의 나약하고 감정적인 면을 보았단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6C"
msgid "Much like your aunt does for me, I know Vashti did for you."
msgstr "네 고모가 나에게 잘해줬던 것처럼, 바슈티도 너에게 잘해줬다는 걸 안단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Vaeric
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Thank you, father. All I ask is for your understanding and forgiveness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6B"
msgid "She was your anchor. It should be no surprise how her death drove you away."
msgstr "바슈티는 너에게 정신적 지주였지. 바슈티가 죽고 나서 네가 얼마나 떠나고 싶었을지 놀랍지도 않구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: You are quite right. Great Serpent knows I have room for improvement, and I can and will do better. 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Much like politics, communication, compromise, and compassion are key.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F6A"
msgid "Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward."
msgstr "이제 배릭이 돌아왔으니, 나와 배릭은 이 순간을 발판 삼아 앞으로 나아갈 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And now you have a second chance at being a father. &&& Viktor: You are quite right. Great Serpent knows I have room for improvement, and I can and will do better.  &&& Viktor: Now that he has returned, Vaeric and I will use this moment to move forward.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and I know the Great Serpent shall guide us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F68"
msgid "This is a new beginning for both of you."
msgstr "두 사람 모두에게 새 시작이 되겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Now, if you all will excuse us...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Come, Vaeric. Let us get you resettled.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010596C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F67"
msgid "There is something I wish to discuss with the Harbinger alone."
msgstr "선구자와 단둘이 상의하고 싶은 내용이 있으니까 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ekris: 
#. ALIAS: Ekris
