#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F43"
msgid "Everyone keeps saying that my parents are gone, but that's not really true. I'll see them again one day when we're with the Great Serpent. And when I meet them again, I want them to be happy to see me."
msgstr ""
"모두가 부모님이 돌아가셨다고 계속 말하지만, 그건 사실이 아니에요. 언젠가 위대한 뱀과 함께 있을 때 다시 보게 되겠죠. 그리고 다시 "
"만날 때면 두 분이 절 보고 기뻐하길 원해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents aren't here. You have to look out for yourself and your own best interests now. 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F42"
msgid "Ivali and Ilana can make me mad sometimes, but they're still my best friends, and right now they're all I have."
msgstr "이발리랑 아일라나 때문에 가끔 화가 날 때도 있지만 그래도 제 제일 친한 친구들이에요. 제게 남은 유일한 친구들이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your parents aren't here. You have to look out for yourself and your own best interests now. 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mila: I should be going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F41"
msgid "I know that my parents would want me to look out for them."
msgstr "저도 부모님께서 제가 이 친구들을 돌봐주기를 바라신다는 걸 알아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are Ivali and Ilana's parents treating you well?  &&& Mila: Yeah, I like living with them, because they have a big house, but I don't really see their parents that much. &&& Mila: It's nice living with Ilana and Ivali though, since we're able to play a lot more now. |Really, it's a good thing that I'm staying with them, since their parents have been so busy lately. Ilana's been really sad about that, so I've been trying hard to cheer him up. |I'm not sure if I've been helping, but I'm trying my best.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hope so. This may sound mean, but sometimes I get a little annoyed with them... I'm always the one that has to figure out what games to play.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059712
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F40"
msgid "I'm sure your friends appreciate what you've been doing for them."
msgstr "네 친구들도 분명 그동안 네가 노력해 줘서 고맙다고 생각할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure your friends appreciate what you've been doing for them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure your friends appreciate what you've been doing for them.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059711
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3F"
msgid "I hope so. This may sound mean, but sometimes I get a little annoyed with them... I'm always the one that has to figure out what games to play."
msgstr ""
"그랬으면 좋겠어요. 이렇게 말하면 좀 그렇지만, 가끔은 걔네들 때문에 좀 짜증이 나요… 항상 제가 무슨 놀이를 할지 정해야 하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure your friends appreciate what you've been doing for them.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe they're still out there somewhere.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059711
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3E"
msgid "But every time I get frustrated, I try to think of mother and father. They'd want me to help my friends, and I want them to be proud of me."
msgstr ""
"하지만 기분이 나쁠 때마다 전 엄마, 아빠를 떠올리려고 노력해요. 두 분 다 제가 친구들을 돕기를 원하실 테고, 부모님이 절 "
"자랑스러워하셨으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your parents aren't here. You have to look out for yourself and your own best interests now.  &&& Mila: I guess. But that just seems... mean.|Everyone keeps saying that my parents are gone, but that's not really true. I'll see them again one day when we're with the Great Serpent. And when I meet them again, I want them to be happy to see me.|Ivali and Ilana can make me mad sometimes, but they're still my best friends, and right now they're all I have. |I know that my parents would want me to look out for them.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's all right. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3D"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr "안타까운 일을 겪었구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry to hear that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry to hear that.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105970F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3C"
msgid "It's all right."
msgstr "괜찮아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry to hear that.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mila: I should be going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105970F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3B"
msgid "But, sorry, I don't really want to talk about it anymore."
msgstr "괜찮... 죄송해요. 이 얘기는 더 이상 하기 싫어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your parents are proud of you, wherever they may be. &&& Mila: Yeah, I really hope so. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105970E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F3A"
msgid "I shouldn't have brought it up. Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "이 이야기는 꺼내지 않는 게 나았겠구나. 다른 얘길 하자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110247E
#. BRANCH: SFBGS001_SQ_Doctors
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01102492
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F39"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "그래요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure your friends appreciate what you've been doing for them. &&& Mila: I hope so. This may sound mean, but sometimes I get a little annoyed with them... I'm always the one that has to figure out what games to play.|But every time I get frustrated, I try to think of mother and father. They'd want me to help my friends, and I want them to be proud of me.  
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe. But Ilana's parents say that I have to accept that mother and father are never coming back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 0105970A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F38"
msgid "Maybe they're still out there somewhere."
msgstr "저 어딘가에 아직 계실지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they're still out there somewhere.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe they're still out there somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F37"
msgid "Maybe. But Ilana's parents say that I have to accept that mother and father are never coming back."
msgstr "어쩌면요. 하지만 아일라나의 부모님은 엄마, 아빠가 돌아오지 않는다는 걸 받아들여야 한다고 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they're still out there somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F36"
msgid "They're probably right. I try not to think too much about it, because it makes me sad."
msgstr "그분들 말이 맞을지 몰라요. 저는 크게 생각하지 않으려 해요. 슬퍼지거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they're still out there somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mila: I should be going. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F35"
msgid "Sorry, I don't really want to talk about it anymore."
msgstr "죄송한데 더 이상 그 얘기는 하고 싶지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mila: All right. 
#. ALIAS: Mila
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMilaHohdan
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ02
#. TOPIC: 01059708
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ02_03_MilaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F34"
msgid "Thanks again for playing hide and seek with us! Hopefully you have found Ilana already - he gets bored easily."
msgstr "저희와 숨바꼭질을 해 주셔서 감사해요! 아일라나를 찾았으면 좋겠어요. 걔는 금방 지루해 하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F32"
msgid "I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose."
msgstr "네가 우리 문화를 얼마나 잘 아는지는 모르겠지만, 나는 그저 선택권을 원했을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F31"
msgid "I was born House Veth'aal. I was raised to inherit the role of Elder, to run the Ministry of State, to worship the Great Serpent..."
msgstr "나는 베타알 가문에서 태어났어. 장로직을 물려받고, 국무성을 운영하고, 위대한 뱀을 숭배하도록 자라왔지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F30"
msgid "But I want none of it."
msgstr "하지만 난 전부 다 싫어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed. &&& Vaeric: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do. &&& Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.|I was born House Veth'aal. I was raised to inherit the role of Elder, to run the Ministry of State, to worship the Great Serpent...|But I want none of it. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: With House Veth'aal? Easier said than done...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2F"
msgid "There's always a choice."
msgstr "선택의 여지는 언제나 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed. &&& Vaeric: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do. &&& Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.|I was born House Veth'aal. I was raised to inherit the role of Elder, to run the Ministry of State, to worship the Great Serpent...|But I want none of it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2E"
msgid "Your sole responsibility is to your House."
msgstr "너는 전적으로 너희 가문에 책임을 다해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed. &&& Vaeric: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do. &&& Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.|I was born House Veth'aal. I was raised to inherit the role of Elder, to run the Ministry of State, to worship the Great Serpent...|But I want none of it. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: That's not the life anyone wants.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2D"
msgid "That's not the life I'd want either."
msgstr "나도 그렇게 살고 싶진 않은걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed. &&& Vaeric: If I can't appeal to your sense of duty, perhaps your sense of compassion will do. &&& Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.|I was born House Veth'aal. I was raised to inherit the role of Elder, to run the Ministry of State, to worship the Great Serpent...|But I want none of it. 
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Heh, that's what I said when I first met him. But I came around.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2C"
msgid "Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo."
msgstr "특권을 누리며 태어났지만 책임은 지기 싫은 인간이군. 어흑흑."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Born privileged but don't want the responsibility. Boo hoo.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: There are times I wanted the right to choose, but I knew my place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2B"
msgid "Heh, that's what I said when I first met him. But I came around."
msgstr "허, 처음 만났을 때 나도 그렇게 말했지. 하지만 마음을 바꿨어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your sole responsibility is to your House.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sole responsibility is to your House.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: This is how the Houses operate. Manipulation at its best.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F2A"
msgid "They really got into your head with the whole Promised thing..."
msgstr "그 녀석들이 자네 머릿속을 전부 약속받은 자에 대한 내용으로 채워놨군..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not the life I'd want either.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: But it is the unfortunate way of House Va'ruun. The collective comes first. The individual second.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F29"
msgid "That's not the life anyone wants."
msgstr "누구도 그렇게 살고 싶지 않을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's always a choice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's always a choice. &&& Tane: With House Veth'aal? Easier said than done...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F28"
msgid "This is true. House Veth'aal and the Ministry of State are known to be the most devout and punitive of the Houses."
msgstr "사실이야. 베타알 가문과 국무성은 가문 중에서도 가장 독실하고 가혹한 것으로 알려져 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's always a choice.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F27"
msgid "It would not be easy to leave without extreme consequences, as you now know."
msgstr "알다시피 극단적인 결과를 초래하지 않고 떠나긴 쉽지 않을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's always a choice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's always a choice. &&& Tane: With House Veth'aal? Easier said than done...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F26"
msgid "Yeah, Viktor sent you take out his own son. Life or death choices aren't exactly easy."
msgstr "그래, 빅토르가 자기 아들을 죽이라고 보냈지. 사느냐 죽느냐의 선택은 쉽지 않구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's always a choice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's always a choice. &&& Tane: With House Veth'aal? Easier said than done...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: It's never mattered how much I tried to reason with him. My father simply would not let me go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F25"
msgid "I know what it's like to have a legacy haunt you, but I can't compete with that."
msgstr "선조의 유산이 날 괴롭히는 게 어떤 기분인지 잘 알지만, 나라면 유산에 대적할 수 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's always a choice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's always a choice. &&& Tane: With House Veth'aal? Easier said than done...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
