#. TOPIC: 010572D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F23"
msgid "As a parent, he should support you."
msgstr "빅토르가 부모로서 널 지원해 줘야 하는데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All this time you were continuing to aid the traitor. &&& ...  &&& Tane: I lost my ship to the incident, so I didn't want Vaeric running off thinking I could just grab him and go.|I was also out all the credits he was going to pay me, that's where you came in.|I figured why not two for the price of one. &&& Tane: I didn't realize it was going to turn into a whole thing. &&& Vaeric: So now you know my true intentions for leaving, and given the circumstances, I may be here for some time.|My hope now is to make the best of it here.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: You're damn right I do.
