#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F03"
msgid "You were his father. You were supposed to protect him!"
msgstr "너는 그 애의 아버지였어. 자기 아들을 지켜줬어야지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F02"
msgid "You think you are doing what is right out of some blind dedication, but you are destroying this House."
msgstr "너는 맹목적으로 헌신하면서 옳은 일을 하고 있다고 생각하겠지만, 이 가문을 파괴하고 있는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Vitoria...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F01"
msgid "You already lost one child, you had to murder the other?"
msgstr "이미 한 아이를 잃었는데, 다른 아이까지 죽여야 했어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give ring] It's done. Your son is dead. &&& Luther: What have you done? Vaeric... &&& Vitoria: This blood is on your hands, Viktor. I hope you remember this.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I also told you to spare him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001F00"
msgid "You and Luther act surprised, but you both knew this was coming."
msgstr "당신과 루터는 놀란 척하지만, 둘 다 이런 일이 일어날 줄 알고 있었잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Ultimately, I care nothing for what you think...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Did you find anyone who aided my son in his treachery?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EFE"
msgid "Now only one matter remains to discuss."
msgstr "이제 한 가지 문제만 확인하면 되겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Oh, I AM leaving. To mourn my nephew whose memory you disgrace with your very presence. &&& Luther: Vitoria! &&& Viktor: Leave her be, Luther. |The Great Serpent will guide her. She will understand in time and emerge stronger for it.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I can appreciate a tool that does not question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EFC"
msgid "I may have done the deed, but even I think you went too far."
msgstr "제가 한 일이기는 하지만, 장로님도 너무 지나치셨던 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Did you find anyone who aided my son in his treachery?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Serpent be merciful. You spared him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EFB"
msgid "I found Vaeric, but I didn't kill him."
msgstr "배릭을 찾았지만, 죽이지는 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: You sound as if you speak from experience. I envy you.|Sometimes I would give anything for a supportive word from my father.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: The credits helped, too, but yeah. We talked about this briefly a while back already, but there's a bit more to it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EFA"
msgid "All I want is to make my own life. Something Tane understood and was willing to help me with."
msgstr "나는 나만의 삶을 살고 싶을 뿐이야. 테인 아저씨는 그런 나를 이해해 주시고 기꺼이 도와주셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's done is done. It must be the will of the Great Serpent. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Oh, I AM leaving. To mourn my nephew whose memory you disgrace with your very presence. &&& Luther: Vitoria! &&& Viktor: Leave her be, Luther. |The Great Serpent will guide her. She will understand in time and emerge stronger for it.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed it does. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF9"
msgid "Time heals all wounds."
msgstr "세월이 약이라고들 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calling after her / Pleading / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Luther: Vitoria... &&& Viktor: I will not hear any more of this! It is done!|Leave us. &&& Vitoria: Oh, I AM leaving. To mourn my nephew whose memory you disgrace with your very presence.
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Leave her be, Luther. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF7"
msgid "Vitoria!"
msgstr "비토리아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hopefully, some good news...
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hopefully, some good news...
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Is this true? You allowed a traitor to live?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105729B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF6"
msgid "Serpent be merciful, tell me you spared my nephew."
msgstr "뱀이시여, 자비를 베푸소서. 제 조카를 구해줬다고 말해주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found Vaeric, but I didn't kill him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found Vaeric, but I didn't kill him.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Is this true? You allowed a traitor to live?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105729C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF5"
msgid "Serpent be merciful. You spared him."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 자비로군요. 조카를 구해주시다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Did you find anyone who aided my son in his treachery?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Serpent be merciful, tell me you spared my nephew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105729F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF4"
msgid "Hopefully, some good news..."
msgstr "좋은 소식으로 생각해 주시면 좋겠는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise, brother. The Great Serpent has lead your son back home. &&& Vitoria: The Great Serpent is truly merciful. &&& Viktor: Is this true? You allowed a traitor to live?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You did what?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057297
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF3"
msgid "I convinced him to return. Don't make me regret it."
msgstr "돌아오라고 설득했어요. 후회하게 만들지 마시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return. &&& Viktor: Return?
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Well, not exactly the Great Serpent, but I have returned nonetheless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057295
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF2"
msgid "Viktor, this is great news. Truly the Great Serpent has guided him back to you."
msgstr "빅토르, 이건 좋은 소식이야. 정말로 위대한 뱀께서 배릭을 돌려보내 주신 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Humble. / Apologetic / to Luther
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return. &&& Viktor: Return? &&& Luther: Viktor, this is great news. Truly the Great Serpent has guided him back to you.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: Father, I admit I had no intention of coming back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057294
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF1"
msgid "Well, not exactly the Great Serpent, but I have returned nonetheless."
msgstr "글쎄요, 딱히 위대한 뱀 때문은 아니지만, 어쨌든 돌아왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise, brother. The Great Serpent has lead your son back home. &&& Vitoria: The Great Serpent is truly merciful.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0105729A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EF0"
msgid "Is this true? You allowed a traitor to live?"
msgstr "그게 사실인가? 반역자를 살려줬다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Viktor, this is great news. Truly the Great Serpent has guided him back to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057298
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EEF"
msgid "Return?"
msgstr "돌아오라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I convinced him to return. Don't make me regret it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I convinced him to return. Don't make me regret it.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Viktor, this is great news. Truly the Great Serpent has guided him back to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057296
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EEE"
msgid "You did what?"
msgstr "뭘 어쨌다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: Well, not exactly the Great Serpent, but I have returned nonetheless.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: But the Harbinger found me...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057293
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EED"
msgid "Father, I admit I had no intention of coming back."
msgstr "아버지, 사실 전 돌아올 생각이 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise, brother. The Great Serpent has lead your son back home. &&& Vitoria: The Great Serpent is truly merciful. &&& Viktor: Is this true? You allowed a traitor to live?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Return?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01057299
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EEC"
msgid "I did the next best thing. I persuaded him to return."
msgstr "차선책을 선택했죠. 돌아오라고 설득했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: [Lie] No. Vaeric acted alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericReturnedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EEB"
msgid "What news do you bring, Harbinger?"
msgstr "어떤 소식을 가져왔나, 선구자?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001EEA"
msgid "Leave her be, Luther."
msgstr "그냥 놔둬, 루터."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Yes, the Serpent tests us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010572BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_6000_Viktor_VaericNOTReturnedScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001EE9"
msgid "The Great Serpent will guide her. She will understand in time and emerge stronger for it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 비토리아를 인도하실 거야. 시간이 지나면 이해하고 더 강해지겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Cheerful, friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECF"
msgid "Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station."
msgstr "아, 안녕하세요! 하마디 기지에 오신 것을 환영합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hopeful, but a little disappointed. / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any applicants.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECE"
msgid "I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants."
msgstr "연구 보조원 자리에 지원하러 오신 거면 좋겠군요. 유망한 지원자가 많진 않았거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcasm (but with affection) / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station.|I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants. &&& SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any applicants.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: I'm Azad Dubas. My wife Sherine and I are scientists.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F75
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECD"
msgid "Well, yes. Thank you for the painful reminder, oh love of my life."
msgstr "아, 그래. 고통스러운 사실을 상기시켜 줘서 고마워. 사랑스런 자기야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station.|I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any luck. &&& companion: This could become tiresome quickly. &&& AzadDubas: So, are you interested in a little field work?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ideally you'd be motivated by a fascination with the mysteries of science.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F72
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECC"
msgid "If it pays well, I can do the job."
msgstr "급여만 좋다면, 일을 맡겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic. / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any applicants. &&& AzadDubas: Well, yes. Thank you for the painful reminder, oh love of my life. &&& AzadDubas: I'm Azad Dubas. My wife Sherine and I are scientists.|We've been quite busy lately and are greatly in need of some help.|We put out a call for a research assistant, but with recent events, we haven't had much luck.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: This could become tiresome quickly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECB"
msgid "By which he means we haven't had any luck."
msgstr "이 말은 즉, 운이 없었다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Well, yes. Thank you for the painful reminder, oh love of my life.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ECA"
msgid "I'm Azad Dubas. My wife Sherine and I are scientists."
msgstr "저는 아자드 두바스입니다. 제 아내 셰린과 저는 과학자입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC9"
msgid "We've been quite busy lately and are greatly in need of some help."
msgstr "최근에 일이 바빠져서, 절실히 도움이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any luck.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC8"
msgid "We put out a call for a research assistant, but with recent events, we haven't had much luck."
msgstr "연구 보조원을 구한다고 공고는 냈지만, 최근 사건 때문에 소득이 별로 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit skeptical. Paying work? Is money all they care about? / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it pays well, I can do the job.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it pays well, I can do the job.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC7"
msgid "Ideally you'd be motivated by a fascination with the mysteries of science."
msgstr "이상적으로는 과학의 수수께끼에 매력을 느끼고 동기를 부여받았으면 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If it pays well, I can do the job.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC6"
msgid "But yes, it is paying work, assuming credits will suffice."
msgstr "그래도, 예, 급여를 드릴 겁니다. 크레딧으로도 괜찮으시다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasize the word ANY / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station.|I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Well, yes. Thank you for the painful reminder, oh love of my life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F76
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC4"
msgid "By which he means we haven't had any applicants."
msgstr "바꿔 말하자면 지원자가 한 명도 없었다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah, hello! Welcome to Hamadi Station.|I do hope you're here about the Research Assistant opening. We haven't had many promising applicants. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Well, yes. Thank you for the painful reminder, oh love of my life. &&& AzadDubas: I'm Azad Dubas. My wife Sherine and I are scientists.|We've been quite busy lately and are greatly in need of some help.|We put out a call for a research assistant, but with recent events, we haven't had much luck. &&& SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any luck.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: So, are you interested in a little field work?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F6E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EC3"
msgid "These two should take this act on the road."
msgstr "둘이서 만담으로 한번 순회공연 돌아야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: I'm Azad Dubas. My wife Sherine and I are scientists.|We've been quite busy lately and are greatly in need of some help.|We put out a call for a research assistant, but with recent events, we haven't had much luck. &&& SherineDubas: By which he means we haven't had any luck. &&& companion: This could become tiresome quickly.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My knowledge and expertise are at your service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F6D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EBF"
msgid "So, are you interested in a little field work?"
msgstr "그래서, 현장 업무에 관심 좀 있으십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Ah! So you've some experience, then?|The Great Serpent has truly blessed us!
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EBC"
msgid "My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon."
msgstr "제 아내와 저는, 최근에 다소 골치 아픈 특이 현상을 연구하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EBB"
msgid "You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why."
msgstr "아시다시피, 지역에서 야생 동물이 자꾸 죽고 있는데, 왜 그런지 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F68
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EBA"
msgid "The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes."
msgstr "사체에 부상이나 상처 흔적은 없어서, 일반적인 원인은 대부분 제외해도 될 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds to me like you need more information.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds to me like you need more information.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: I need you to search for corpses of local wildlife and collect tissue samples.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F64
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EB6"
msgid "An accurate assertion. This is where you come in."
msgstr "정확한 표현이군요. 바로 그 정보를 모으는 일 때문에 당신이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds to me like you need more information. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: I need you to search for corpses of local wildlife and collect tissue samples.|I'll give you a biosample collector that will extract and store the samples safely.|Try to collect samples from different kinds of creatures. We want to cast a wide net.|Return here when you've got them and we'll begin the analysis. &&& companion: The prospect of tearing rotten flesh from animal corpses is not what I would call appetizing. &&& SherineDubas: That's why I chose botany instead of biology.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Off you go, then, and no dragging your feet. You're on the clock as of now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F5D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EB4"
msgid "I'll get started."
msgstr "시작하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: An accurate assertion. This is where you come in.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EB3"
msgid "I need you to search for corpses of local wildlife and collect tissue samples."
msgstr "지역 서식 야생 동물의 사체를 찾아서 조직 샘플을 수집해 주셔야겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EB2"
msgid "I'll give you a biosample collector that will extract and store the samples safely."
msgstr "안전하게 검체 샘플을 채집할 수 있게 생체 샘플 채집기를 드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The prospect of tearing rotten flesh from animal corpses is not what I would call appetizing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F61
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EB1"
msgid "Return here when you've got them and we'll begin the analysis."
msgstr "샘플을 구하셨으면 여기로 돌아오세요. 분석을 시작하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds to me like you need more information. &&& AzadDubas: An accurate assertion. This is where you come in. &&& AzadDubas: I need you to search for corpses of local wildlife and collect tissue samples.|I'll give you a biosample collector that will extract and store the samples safely.|Try to collect samples from different kinds of creatures. We want to cast a wide net.|Return here when you've got them and we'll begin the analysis.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: That's why I chose botany instead of biology.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F5F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EAC"
msgid "Poking around animal corpses? Maybe I should have packed some nose plugs."
msgstr "동물 사체를 뒤지라고? 코마개를 좀 챙겨야겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll get started.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll get started.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F5C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EAB"
msgid "Off you go, then, and no dragging your feet. You're on the clock as of now."
msgstr "그럼 어서 가 보세요. 꾸물거리지 마시고요. 지금부터 시급 계산에 반영할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: With pleasure.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EAA"
msgid "I hope you enjoyed your little jaunt into the field, because I'll be sending you right back out there."
msgstr "현장 탐사는 즐거우셨나요? 그랬으면 좋겠네요. 바로 다시 현장으로 가셔야 하니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EA9"
msgid "Some of the local farmers and groat-herders have reported seeing unusual plant growth in the area."
msgstr "일부 지역 농부들과 그로트 목동들이 이 지역에서 특이한 식물이 자라는 걸 봤다고 보고했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: None at all. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Sherine, dear, would you tell our dauntless research assistant about the latest news? &&& SherineDubas: With pleasure. &&& SherineDubas: I hope you enjoyed your little jaunt into the field, because I'll be sending you right back out there.|Some of the local farmers and groat-herders have reported seeing unusual plant growth in the area.|What's more, none of this unusual growth was seen before the Dazra incident.|It's increasingly clear the event affected the ecosystem in some way, but the details elude us.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My thinking exactly!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EA8"
msgid "Further study of these unusual plants is clearly in order."
msgstr "이 특이한 식물에 대해 반드시 추가로 연구해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Enthusiasm / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Further study of these unusual plants is clearly in order.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Further study of these unusual plants is clearly in order.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EA7"
msgid "My thinking exactly!"
msgstr "제 생각도 그래요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Unusual how, exactly?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Unusual how, exactly?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001EA2"
msgid "A change in appearance, at the very least."
msgstr "적어도 외관상의 변화는 있어야겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Based on our information, these unusual new strains aren't limited to a specific area.|As such, we want to examine samples that come from several different locations.|In short, the more data you can provide, the better. &&& AzadDubas: Observe, analyze, hypothesize and prove. These are the tenets of the scientific method.|Without them, we're just fumbling in the dark.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: You'll have to forgive my husband; he's never fully recovered from his days as a teacher.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E9D"
msgid "Yes, thank you dear."
msgstr "네, 고마워요. 여보."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My knowledge and expertise are at your service. &&& AzadDubas: Ah! So you've some experience, then?|The Great Serpent has truly blessed us! &&& AzadDubas: My wife and I have been studying a recent, and somewhat troubling, phenomenon.|You see, the local wildlife has been dying, and we're not sure why.|The remains show no signs of external injury or trauma, so we can rule out most of the usual causes.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: We began to see this phenomenon just after the accident in Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F67
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_InitialGreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E99"
msgid "Fighting for dominance or territory, predators, hunters looking for sport. Those sorts of things."
msgstr "서열 싸움, 영역 싸움, 포식자의 습격, 단순 놀이를 위한 사냥. 이런 원인 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: That's an interesting theory, but let's not jump to any conclusions just yet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E98"
msgid "Based on our information, these unusual new strains aren't limited to a specific area."
msgstr "정보에 따르면, 이 특이한 새 변종은 특정 지역에 국한되지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Observe, analyze, hypothesize and prove. These are the tenets of the scientific method.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E95"
msgid "In short, the more data you can provide, the better."
msgstr "요컨대, 데이터를 더 많이 모아오실수록, 더 좋을 거 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Can I use this tissue collector device on the plants?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: To quote Seneca, a field, however fertile, can yield no fruit without cultivation, nor can the mind without education.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_GatherPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E90"
msgid "Proper research requires the proper tools."
msgstr "적절하게 연구하려면 적절한 도구가 필요하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It was no trouble at all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E89"
msgid "I know we've asked you to travel far and wide. Hopefully it wasn't too much trouble."
msgstr "멀리까지 가달라고 부탁드렸는데, 너무 힘들지 않았으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: It's just a collection of devices fused together and running on a single power source.|It's more a feat of improvisation than engineering, really.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E74"
msgid "Here, take this. Transfer the data from each of the sensors and then bring the slate back to me."
msgstr "자, 여기 있습니다. 각 센서 장치의 데이터를 슬레이트에 전송한 다음 저에게 가져오세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E72"
msgid "We'll solve this riddle yet!"
msgstr "우리라면 이 수수께끼를 풀 수 있을 겁니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Welcome back! Time to see if our sensors can peel back another layer of the mystery.|Did you notice anything unusual in the environmental data?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well that's certainly not what I was expecting to hear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E71"
msgid "There was something about gravity and issues with the chronometers."
msgstr "중력 측정기와 시간 정밀 측정기에 문제가 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would someone poison the animals?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would someone poison the animals?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E70"
msgid "Oh, I very much doubt anyone is."
msgstr "아, 그런 짓을 벌인 인간은 없는 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There was something about gravity and issues with the chronometers.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There was something about gravity and issues with the chronometers.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E6C"
msgid "Well that's certainly not what I was expecting to hear."
msgstr "음, 그거 제가 예상했던 결과값은 아니군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Would you care to explain, my dear? &&& AzadDubas: With pleasure! &&& AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation...
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Could we please move on?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E6B"
msgid "Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations..."
msgstr "공기 중 미립자, 지진 교란, 중력 변동..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Welcome back! Time to see if our sensors can peel back another layer of the mystery.|Did you notice anything unusual in the environmental data?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I suppose science isn't everyone's passion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E6A"
msgid "I didn't bother to read it."
msgstr "데이터를 읽어보지 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E69"
msgid "Welcome back! Time to see if our sensors can peel back another layer of the mystery."
msgstr "돌아오셨군요! 센서가 수수께끼의 단면을 벗겨낼 수 있을지 확인해 볼 시간이 왔군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E68"
msgid "Did you notice anything unusual in the environmental data?"
msgstr "환경 데이터에서 뭔가 이상한 점을 찾으셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit sheepish, you got carried away / Apologetic / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations... &&& companion: Could we please move on?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E67"
msgid "Oh, uh... well, yes, of course."
msgstr "아, 어... 음, 네, 물론이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations... &&& companion: That's quite a list.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E66"
msgid "Yes, yes, all of that and more."
msgstr "네, 네, 지금 말한 것 외에도 더 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E65"
msgid "There are countless factors that can impact an ecosystem, so we try to collect as much information as possible."
msgstr "생태계에 영향을 미칠 수 있는 요소는 셀 수 없이 많기 때문에, 가능한 한 정보를 많이 수집하도록 만들었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations... &&& companion: I know a few farmers in the Freestar Collective who'd pay good money for something like that.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E64"
msgid "What an interesting thought."
msgstr "정말 흥미로운 생각이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / Confident / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: To aid in our monitoring of local conditions, we designed a multifunction sensor suite.|The device records data for weather, atmospheric pressure, radiation... &&& SherineDubas: Airborne particulates, seismic disturbances, gravitic fluctuations... &&& companion: Sounds remarkably thorough.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E63"
msgid "That's precisely the idea. To gather the most comprehensive set of data possible."
msgstr "정확히 그겁니다. 가능한 한 가장 포괄적인 데이터 세트를 수집하는 것이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E62"
msgid "Now, let's have a look, shall we?"
msgstr "자, 어디 한번 볼까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E61"
msgid "Seems mundane enough... oh, now wait just a moment."
msgstr "충분히 평범해 보이는군요... 오, 잠깐만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E60"
msgid "As I suspected, the sensors simultaneously recorded a single event that produced very unusual impacts."
msgstr "제가 의심했던 대로, 센서가 동시에 매우 특이한 영향을 미친 단일 사건을 기록했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E5F"
msgid "This is our best glimpse yet into the Dazra accident and how it affected the surrounding environs."
msgstr "이것은 다즈라 사고와 그것이 주변 환경에 미친 영향을 엿볼 수 있는 가장 좋은 기회입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E5E"
msgid "How interesting! The chronometers seem to have gone haywire in all four of the devices."
msgstr "정말 흥미롭군요! 장치 네 대 모두 정밀 측정기가 오작동을 일으킨 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.|Mostly as expected so far.|Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean.  &&& AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it. &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?|Seems mundane enough... oh, now wait just a moment.|As I suspected, the sensors simultaneously recorded a single event that produced very unusual impacts.|This is our best glimpse yet into the Dazra accident and how it affected the surrounding environs.|How interesting! The chronometers seem to have gone haywire in all four of the devices.|Even gravity itself seems to have been briefly altered. Remarkable!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E5D"
msgid "It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected."
msgstr "시공간의 자연 법칙이 영향을 받은 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Then the mystery is solved. &&& ...  &&& companion: Could we please move on? &&& AzadDubas: Oh, uh... well, yes, of course. &&& AzadDubas: We placed several of these sensors throughout the area.|Each device can upload its data to a slate for comparison and analysis.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are four sensor devices currently deployed in the field.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E5B"
msgid "How many of these sensors are out there?"
msgstr "센서가 몇 개 설치되어 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't bother to read it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't bother to read it.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E5A"
msgid "Well, I suppose science isn't everyone's passion."
msgstr "음, 모두가 과학에 열정이 있는 건 아니긴 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E58"
msgid "And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time."
msgstr "하지만 센서에는 시공간의 구조 자체의 변동이 기록됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E57"
msgid "Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?"
msgstr "우리의 현실을 지배하는 근본 법칙이 변경된다면, 감히 누가 불가능한 일이 뭐가 있을지 말할 수 있겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds promising.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds promising.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Here, take this. Transfer the data from each of the sensors and then bring the slate back to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E55"
msgid "Indeed. Let's hope our sensors can deliver on that promise."
msgstr "그렇죠? 센서 장치가 기대에 부응했으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible. &&& SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.|Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I agree that's the best way forward in the long term.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E54"
msgid "Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help."
msgstr "독성 식물종을 독성이 없는 종과 교배하면 도움이 될지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations. &&& AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.|These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible. &&& SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.|Who is to say what's impossible when the fundamental laws that govern our reality are altered?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You've anticipated the solution perfectly. Well done!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F1C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E53"
msgid "You could synthesize an antitoxin compound to neutralize the poison in the plants."
msgstr "식물의 독을 중화하기 위해 항독소 화합물을 합성할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many of these sensors are out there?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How many of these sensors are out there?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E52"
msgid "There are four sensor devices currently deployed in the field."
msgstr "현재 현장에는 센서 장치 4개가 배치되어 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How many of these sensors are out there?
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: You can monitor all of that stuff with a single device? That's incredible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E51"
msgid "We spread them out to cover the widest possible area."
msgstr "최대한 넓은 지역의 자료를 수집할 수 있게 센서 장치를 배치해 놨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You could synthesize an antitoxin compound to neutralize the poison in the plants.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You could synthesize an antitoxin compound to neutralize the poison in the plants.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F1B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E50"
msgid "You've anticipated the solution perfectly. Well done!"
msgstr "해결책을 완벽하게 예상하셨군요. 훌륭합니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Oh, I have a pretty good idea. &&& AzadDubas: Have you, now?|Well, I'll share my conclusions and we'll see if they align with your hypothesis. &&& AzadDubas: It seems that certain local species of flora have suddenly become extremely toxic.|These biochemical changes occurred with incredible speed. &&& AzadDubas: Notably, the first sightings of these toxic variants coincide with the incident in Dazra.|I'm just not sure how the strange effects of the vortex could cause plants to mutate so rapidly.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E4C"
msgid "By triggering a defensive response."
msgstr "방어 기제를 유발시킨 결과겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E4B"
msgid "Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms."
msgstr "셀 수 없이 많은 동물 종이 보호 기제를 발전시키는 방향으로 진화했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E4A"
msgid "Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations."
msgstr "독성 독소는 가장 흔한 진화 적응 중 하나죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's evidence of gravitational fluctuations and unknown forms of energy. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's see what tale the data tells.|Mostly as expected so far.|Oh my, look at this. Yes, I see what you mean.  &&& AzadDubas: I concur with your hypothesis, even if I don't entirely comprehend it. &&& AzadDubas: Now, let's have a look, shall we?|Seems mundane enough... oh, now wait just a moment.|As I suspected, the sensors simultaneously recorded a single event that produced very unusual impacts.|This is our best glimpse yet into the Dazra accident and how it affected the surrounding environs.|How interesting! The chronometers seem to have gone haywire in all four of the devices.|Even gravity itself seems to have been briefly altered. Remarkable!
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: For one sensor, perhaps. For all four? No, it's not possible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E49"
msgid "Could these readings be a mistake?"
msgstr "측정값에 오류가 있는 건 아닐까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: There is, however, a not-insignificant complication. &&& companion: I knew you were going to say that. &&& SherineDubas: The experimental compound is locked away in cold storage at a botanical facility.|I was growing strains of fungus and mushrooms there for medicinal use, but we were attacked.|A group of pirates called the Crimson Fleet took over the place, forcing us to leave.|Pirates! Here on Va'ruun'kai! I could scarcely believe it. 
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That might not be as helpful as you expect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F16
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E47"
msgid "Lucky for you, I have some connections in the Crimson Fleet."
msgstr "당신에게는 다행히도, 저에게는 크림슨 함대에 연줄이 좀 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E46"
msgid "I agree that's the best way forward in the long term."
msgstr "교배가 장기적으로는 최선의 방법이라는 데에는 동의해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help. &&& ...  &&& AzadDubas: There is, however, a not-insignificant complication. &&& companion: I knew you were going to say that. &&& SherineDubas: The experimental compound is locked away in cold storage at a botanical facility.|I was growing strains of fungus and mushrooms there for medicinal use, but we were attacked.|A group of pirates called the Crimson Fleet took over the place, forcing us to leave.|Pirates! Here on Va'ruun'kai! I could scarcely believe it. 
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then we'll leave the matter in your capable hands.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E43"
msgid "I've dealt with worse, so it won't be a problem."
msgstr "더 심한 일도 겪어 봤으니, 해적 정도는 문제없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: Notably, the first sightings of these toxic variants coincide with the incident in Dazra.|I'm just not sure how the strange effects of the vortex could cause plants to mutate so rapidly. &&& SherineDubas: By triggering a defensive response.|Countless species of fauna have evolved to develop protective mechanisms.|Poisonous toxins are among the most common such adaptations.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E42"
msgid "That's true, but those adaptations evolved over generations, across long spans of time."
msgstr "그건 사실이지만, 그런 적응은 오랜 시간 동안 여러 세대에 걸쳐 진화를 거듭해야 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: And yet the sensors documented fluctuations in the very fabric of space and time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E41"
msgid "These seem to have appeared in a matter of mere days. That shouldn't be possible."
msgstr "이 적응은 불과 며칠 만에 나타난 것 같아. 이건 불가능한 일일 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've dealt with worse, so it won't be a problem.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've dealt with worse, so it won't be a problem.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Go with the Serpent's blessing. We'll be waiting for you here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E40"
msgid "Then we'll leave the matter in your capable hands."
msgstr "그럼 해적 문제는 유능한 당신에게 맡길게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Cross-breeding the poisonous plants with non-toxic species could help. &&& SherineDubas: I agree that's the best way forward in the long term.|Cross-breeding is a slow process, however, and the creatures are still in imminent danger.|What we need here is a more immediate solution
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: The one designed to alter plant biochemistry?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F19
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E3E"
msgid "Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing?"
msgstr "셰린, 당신이 개발 중이던 그 화합물 시제품 기억나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Lucky for you, I have some connections in the Crimson Fleet.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Lucky for you, I have some connections in the Crimson Fleet.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F15
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E33"
msgid "That might not be as helpful as you expect."
msgstr "그게 당신이 기대하는 것만큼 도움이 되지 않을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Hardly! We've only scratched the surface.|We need to find out how and why this phenomenon is happening.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E2E"
msgid "The evidence suggests that some force is acting on the ecosystem, changing it somehow."
msgstr "증거에 따르면 어떤 힘이 생태계에 작용하여 뭔가를 변화시키고 있는 거 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Would you care to explain, my dear?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithPlantTissueScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E2D"
msgid "We don't yet have the complete picture, but there is one tool left to us."
msgstr "아직 전체 구조도를 파악하진 못했지만, 우리에게 남은 수단이 하나 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It sounds like the laws of space and time were affected.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Your payment, as promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E2B"
msgid "A rudimentary summation, perhaps, but not without merit."
msgstr "초보적인 요약이지만, 가치가 없는 건 아니네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got your experimental compound. &&& SherineDubas: Have you now? Well bravo, then.|When Azad first suggested taking on an assistant, I'll admit that I had my doubts.|I'm happy to say that you've laid them all to rest. &&& SherineDubas: Here you are, payment as promised. &&& SherineDubas: Did you hear that, love? Our courageous research assistant has delivered yet again.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E2A"
msgid "I never had a shred of doubt."
msgstr "저야 조금도 의심하지 않았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E29"
msgid "Nothing inspires courage and perseverance like the pursuit of knowledge, I always say!"
msgstr "지식의 추구만큼 용기와 인내심을 북돋우는 것은 없다! 예전부터 제가 계속 했던 말이죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Did you hear that, love? Our courageous research assistant has delivered yet again. &&& AzadDubas: I never had a shred of doubt.|Nothing inspires courage and perseverance like the pursuit of knowledge, I always say!
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AzadDubas: Well, I, uh... I certainly always think it!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E28"
msgid "That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that."
msgstr "당신이 그런 말 하는 거, 말 그대로 이번이 처음인데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've got your experimental compound.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E27"
msgid "Well, look who's back. And still in one piece, no less!"
msgstr "음, 돌아오셨군요. 게다가 여전히 멀쩡하고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've got your experimental compound.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got your experimental compound.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E26"
msgid "Have you now? Well bravo, then."
msgstr "그래요? 정말 만세네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Well, look who's back. And still in one piece, no less!
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've heard tales about those pirates I don't care to repeat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E25"
msgid "What do you mean, still in one piece?"
msgstr "뭐라고요? 여전히 멀쩡하다뇨?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Indeed we do.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E24"
msgid "Thanks to you, we have not only the answer to our little mystery, but a path to resolving it."
msgstr "당신 덕분에, 우리는 작은 수수께끼에 대한 해답뿐만 아니라, 해결할 방법도 알게 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E23"
msgid "Here's a little something extra for a job well done."
msgstr "일을 잘 해주셨으니 보너스를 약간 더 드릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E22"
msgid "Best of luck in your future scientific endeavors!"
msgstr "앞으로 하게 될 과학 탐구도 잘 되길 바랄게요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, still in one piece?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean, still in one piece?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E21"
msgid "I've heard tales about those pirates I don't care to repeat."
msgstr "그 해적들과 관련해 차마 입에 담지 못할 이야기들을 들었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, still in one piece?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E20"
msgid "Suffice it to say, lost appendages and limbs aren't unheard of among those who cross them."
msgstr "간단히 말씀드리면, 그 해적들에게 대들면 부속 기관과 사지가 잘린다고 들었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, still in one piece?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I've got your experimental compound.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1F"
msgid "That's assuming the stories are to be believed, of course."
msgstr "물론 그 이야기가 사실이라고 친다면 그렇게 된다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: Well, look who's back. And still in one piece, no less!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Have you now? Well bravo, then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1E"
msgid "I've got your experimental compound."
msgstr "화합물 시제품을 가져왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to SherineDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AzadDubas: I never had a shred of doubt.|Nothing inspires courage and perseverance like the pursuit of knowledge, I always say! &&& SherineDubas: That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that.
#. ALIAS: AzadDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAzadDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Yes, dear. Of course you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1D"
msgid "Well, I, uh... I certainly always think it!"
msgstr "음, 그게, 어... 난 늘 그렇게 생각하거든!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that. &&& AzadDubas: Well, I, uh... I certainly always think it!
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I guess you've got some work ahead of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1C"
msgid "Yes, dear. Of course you do."
msgstr "네, 여보. 늘 그러시겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got your experimental compound. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that. &&& AzadDubas: Well, I, uh... I certainly always think it! &&& SherineDubas: Yes, dear. Of course you do.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Indeed we do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1B"
msgid "I guess you've got some work ahead of you."
msgstr "앞으로 할 일이 꽤 있겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: SherineDubas: I agree that's the best way forward in the long term.|Cross-breeding is a slow process, however, and the creatures are still in imminent danger.|What we need here is a more immediate solution &&& AzadDubas: Sherine, do you remember that experimental compound you were developing?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F18
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E1A"
msgid "The one designed to alter plant biochemistry?"
msgstr "식물의 생화학 반응을 변경하도록 설계했던 거요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to AzadDubas
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I'd been theorizing about ways to create edible strains of local flora.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053F18
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ReturnWithSensorDataScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E19"
msgid "Hm, interesting thought."
msgstr "흠, 흥미로운 발상이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I guess you've got some work ahead of you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I guess you've got some work ahead of you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: Thanks to you, we have not only the answer to our little mystery, but a path to resolving it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E18"
msgid "Indeed we do."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got your experimental compound. &&& ...  &&& SherineDubas: That is quite literally the first time I've ever heard you say that. &&& AzadDubas: Well, I, uh... I certainly always think it! &&& SherineDubas: Yes, dear. Of course you do.
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You've done more than enough as it is. We could hardly ask more of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E17"
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "더 도와드릴 일이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there anything else I can help with?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is there anything else I can help with?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E16"
msgid "You've done more than enough as it is. We could hardly ask more of you."
msgstr "이미 충분히 도와주셨는걸요. 또 부탁을 할 순 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is there anything else I can help with?
#. ALIAS: SherineDubas
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSherineDubas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SherineDubas: I guess you've got some work ahead of you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS04
#. TOPIC: 01053EFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS04_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001E15"
msgid "We'll get by on our own from here"
msgstr "여기서부턴 우리가 알아서 할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: You have always lacked faith, Dul'kehf.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF9"
msgid "I was not certain this would work, but it seems the Serpent has blessed us."
msgstr "이게 잘 될지 확신을 못 했지만, 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 축복하신 모양이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown." &&& ...  &&& Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but... &&& Malibor: What else can we do? He is the only one who can communicate with Anasko. &&& Malibor: Save as much as you can. Save it all if possible, but the Speaker must be your priority. Do whatever it takes to bring Anasko back to us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not asking you to. I know better than most that we have no idea what to expect from this moment forwards.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050705
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF8"
msgid "I'm not making any promises."
msgstr "장담은 못 하겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: What else can we do? He is the only one who can communicate with Anasko.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "It will be an honor."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050708
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF7"
msgid "Save as much as you can. Save it all if possible, but the Speaker must be your priority. Do whatever it takes to bring Anasko back to us."
msgstr ""
"최대한 많이 구해 주세요. 가능하면 모두 구하되, 대변자님이 최우선이어야 합니다. 아나스코 님을 구하기 위하서라면 뭐든지 해도 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown." &&& ...  &&& Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but... &&& Malibor: What else can we do? He is the only one who can communicate with Anasko. &&& Malibor: Save as much as you can. Save it all if possible, but the Speaker must be your priority. Do whatever it takes to bring Anasko back to us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are not the first to argue the point. But now is hardly the time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050703
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF6"
msgid "Your Serpent doesn't get credit for any of this. We're the ones making it happen."
msgstr "당신네 위대한 뱀은 이번 일에 기여한 게 아무것도 없어요. 이건 우리가 해낸 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown." &&& ...  &&& Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but... &&& Malibor: What else can we do? He is the only one who can communicate with Anasko. &&& Malibor: Save as much as you can. Save it all if possible, but the Speaker must be your priority. Do whatever it takes to bring Anasko back to us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do not believe we have come this far only to fail now. You must believe that as well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050701
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF5"
msgid "What if I can't do anything?"
msgstr "손 쓸 방법이 전혀 없으면 어떻게 하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "Constellation is all about taking risks for exploring the unknown." &&& ...  &&& Lovek: Really? I do not doubt our newest member's conviction, but... &&& Malibor: What else can we do? He is the only one who can communicate with Anasko. &&& Malibor: Save as much as you can. Save it all if possible, but the Speaker must be your priority. Do whatever it takes to bring Anasko back to us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I pray it will be so. May the Serpent guide you on your path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050707
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF4"
msgid "I'll be right back."
msgstr "금방 돌아올게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: "It will be an honor." &&& companion: It will be nothing short of the highest honor. We will not fail. &&& companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 010506FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF3"
msgid "We will speak again soon, I hope."
msgstr "곧 다시 대화할 수 있기를 바라지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll be right back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll be right back.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050706
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF2"
msgid "I pray it will be so. May the Serpent guide you on your path."
msgstr "저도 그렇게 기도하지요. 위대한 뱀께서 그대의 길을 인도하시기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not making any promises.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not making any promises.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF1"
msgid "I am not asking you to. I know better than most that we have no idea what to expect from this moment forwards."
msgstr "그런 부탁은 아닙니다. 지금부터 무슨 일이 일어날지 모른다는 건 제가 누구보다도 잘 아니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not making any promises.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DF0"
msgid "But all that has happened cannot be for nothing. I will pray the Serpent continues to guide you."
msgstr "그래도 이 모든 일이 헛된 것은 아니겠지요. 위대한 뱀께서 계속 그대를 인도하시길 기도하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your Serpent doesn't get credit for any of this. We're the ones making it happen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your Serpent doesn't get credit for any of this. We're the ones making it happen.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050702
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DEF"
msgid "You are not the first to argue the point. But now is hardly the time."
msgstr "그런 주장을 그대만 했던 건 아닙니다만, 지금은 때가 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your Serpent doesn't get credit for any of this. We're the ones making it happen.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Great Serpent will watch over us, and deliver us from whatever may come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050702
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DEE"
msgid "When you have returned safely we can debate until the end of our days what part the Serpent has played. Focus on what matters now."
msgstr "그대가 안전하게 돌아온다면, 위대한 뱀께서 어떤 역할을 하셨는지 밤새도록 토론할 수 있겠지요. 일단은 중요한 일에 집중하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What if I can't do anything?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if I can't do anything?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: "It will be an honor."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01050700
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage200_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DED"
msgid "I do not believe we have come this far only to fail now. You must believe that as well."
msgstr "이제 와서 실패하려고 여기까지 왔다고는 믿지 않습니다. 그대도 그렇게 믿어야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Vortex Horror is finally dead. / Relieved / to VortexHorror01
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2290_Tane_ReactToVortexHorrorDeadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DEA"
msgid "Whew. Still in one piece!"
msgstr "휴. 토막나진 않았군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to VortexHorror01
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: The way this place is positioned, Vaeric must have come through here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4090_Tane_NoticingLC013FarmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE9"
msgid "There's a farm up ahead. We should see what they know."
msgstr "앞에 목장이 있어. 목장 사람들이 뭐 아는 게 있나 보자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to VortexHorror01
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: You go on ahead. I'll keep watch.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5090_Tane_NoticingLC04FarmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE8"
msgid "I bet this is it."
msgstr "분명 여기로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: I bet this is it. 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01013D4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5090_Tane_NoticingLC04FarmScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE7"
msgid "You go on ahead. I'll keep watch."
msgstr "먼저 가봐. 내가 지켜볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric's not home, but this is where he's living. &&& Tane: Sounds like it's a waiting game then.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I hope you can see why I want to walk away from all this... to start my own life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE6"
msgid "It seems I have uninvited guests. You want to explain yourselves?"
msgstr "초대받지 않은 손님이 온 것 같은데, 설명 좀 해 주실래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric's not home, but this is where he's living. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Whoa, hey. It's me. Tane. Put the gun down already. &&& Vaeric: It's not you I'm concerned about. It's your friends. &&& companion: Rightfully so.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So I've been labeled a traitor?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE4"
msgid "I'm here to carry out your sentence as a traitor."
msgstr "반역자인 너에게 형을 집행하러 왔다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric's not home, but this is where he's living. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Whoa, hey. It's me. Tane. Put the gun down already. &&& Vaeric: It's not you I'm concerned about. It's your friends. &&& companion: Rightfully so.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Kill me? As if he wasn't already suffocating me...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE3"
msgid "Your father sent me to kill you."
msgstr "네 아버지가 널 죽이라고 해서 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic at last. Prepare to be made dust for your blasphemy. &&& Vaeric: So it's official. Heretic it is then. &&& Vaeric: I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist.|But since I have your attention, allow me to plead my case.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: You're damn right I do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE2"
msgid "[Attack] I won't neglect my orders."
msgstr "[공격] 나는 명령을 소홀히 하지 않거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: I didn't realize it was going to turn into a whole thing. &&& Vaeric: So now you know my true intentions for leaving, and given the circumstances, I may be here for some time.|My hope now is to make the best of it here. &&& Vaeric: [Attack] I can't allow that.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE1"
msgid "You're damn right I do."
msgstr "젠장, 당연히 안 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DE0"
msgid "I mean, first of all, are you sure Viktor even wants him dead?"
msgstr "내 말은, 일단, 빅토르가 배릭이 죽길 바라는 게 확실해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The heretic at last. Prepare to be made dust for your blasphemy. &&& Vaeric: So it's official. Heretic it is then. &&& Vaeric: I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist.|But since I have your attention, allow me to plead my case.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vaeric: I'm not sure how familiar you are with our culture, but all I've ever wanted was the right to choose.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DDF"
msgid "All right. Say your piece."
msgstr "좋아. 네 생각을 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: I mean, I wouldn't be calling myself a traitor, but you said it, sister. 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Now that you mention it...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DDE"
msgid "I had every intention of getting this guy off planet. Am I next on your list?"
msgstr "나는 이 친구를 행성에서 떠나게 해줄 작정인데, 그럼 다음 차례는 나냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business. &&& ...  &&& companion: I understand this is a State matter, but if you seek to execute traitors, this is very much Tane's "business." &&& Tane: I mean, I wouldn't be calling myself a traitor, but you said it, sister.  &&& Tane: I had every intention of getting this guy off planet. Am I next on your list?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure, but I'm just making a point here. This is overboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DDD"
msgid "But you never did."
msgstr "하지만 안 했잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vaeric: So it's official. Heretic it is then.
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DDC"
msgid "I figured the old man might play it that way. Always the extremist."
msgstr "늙은이가 그렇게 할지도 모른다고 생각했지. 항상 극단주의자거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You may speak, but know that I will not be swayed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_MainScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "001DDB"
msgid "But since I have your attention, allow me to plead my case."
msgstr "하지만 주목을 끌었으니, 이제 내 주장을 펼치도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business. &&& ...  &&& companion: I understand this is a State matter, but if you seek to execute traitors, this is very much Tane's "business." &&& Tane: I mean, I wouldn't be calling myself a traitor, but you said it, sister.  &&& Tane: I had every intention of getting this guy off planet. Am I next on your list?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You let Viktor know after he's sent you out to kill his own son? I'm sure that'll go over like peaches and cream.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DDA"
msgid "No, but I will let Viktor know about your involvement."
msgstr "아니요. 하지만 빅토르에게 당신이 관여했다고 알릴 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Both of you stay out of this. It's none of your business. &&& ...  &&& companion: I understand this is a State matter, but if you seek to execute traitors, this is very much Tane's "business." &&& Tane: I mean, I wouldn't be calling myself a traitor, but you said it, sister.  &&& Tane: I had every intention of getting this guy off planet. Am I next on your list?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey now, I wasn't serious!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD9"
msgid "Now that you mention it..."
msgstr "말이 나왔으니 말인데요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Hey now, I wasn't serious! &&& companion: As Promised, it is your duty to either carry out Viktor's sentence or let him know of Tane's involvement.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD8"
msgid "And I think we all know that'd be a death sentence for me if you did."
msgstr "그러면 나에게 사형선고를 내리는 거나 다름없다는 거 우리 모두 알 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Demand Ring] I see your point, but there's something I need before I go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD7"
msgid "So if you're going to do this, may as well get it over with now."
msgstr "그러니 일 처리를 할 거라면, 지금 끝내는 게 좋을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Now that you mention it... &&& Tane: Hey now, I wasn't serious!
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD6"
msgid "Hey... Tane is innocent here. Let the man go."
msgstr "이봐... 테인 아저씨는 죄가 없어. 놔 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD5"
msgid "Consider his aid in finding me as recompense."
msgstr "아버지가 나를 수색하라고 지원해 준 걸로 보상받았다 생각하라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Vaeric
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVaericVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: As Promised, it is your duty to either carry out Viktor's sentence or let him know of Tane's involvement.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052AB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD4"
msgid "There's no reason to tell my father."
msgstr "아버지께 말할 이유가 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All this time you were continuing to aid the traitor. &&& ...  &&& Vaeric: So now you know my true intentions for leaving, and given the circumstances, I may be here for some time.|My hope now is to make the best of it here. &&& Vaeric: [Attack] I can't allow that. &&& Tane: You're damn right I do.|I mean, first of all, are you sure Viktor even wants him dead?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: None of our business?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01052ABB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_5300_Vaeric_AttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001DD3"
msgid "Stay out of this, Tane. It's none of your business."
msgstr "이 일에 끼어들지 마시죠. 테인. 당신이 상관할 일이 아니거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
