#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: In fact, if I were you, Envoy, I would think long and hard about submitting to the guard peacefully.|Given the severity of your crimes, the Captain has the authority to do it by force. &&& Mujeen: Hmph. I will cooperate, but this is by no means an admission. |And make no mistake, the three of you will pay for this insult.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: SecurityGuard02: As you command, Executor.
