#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D82"
msgid "Make all the threats you want, Envoy. My decision is made. Guard, take him away."
msgstr "얼마든지 위협해 보시죠. 사절. 제 결정은 바뀌지 않을 겁니다. 경비대원, 저자를 끌어내세요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate. &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: In fact, if I were you, Envoy, I would think long and hard about submitting to the guard peacefully.|Given the severity of your crimes, the Captain has the authority to do it by force. &&& Mujeen: Hmph. I will cooperate, but this is by no means an admission. |And make no mistake, the three of you will pay for this insult. &&& Qisrani: Make all the threats you want, Envoy. My decision is made. Guard, take him away.
#. ALIAS: SecurityGuard02
