msgid "As you command, Executor."
msgstr "명령대로 하겠습니다. 실무관님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104861A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2090_Tane_FoundCampScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D7F"
msgid "Tracker says this is it, so switching her off before those pings drive me crazy."
msgstr "추적기 신호대로면 바로 여긴데, 신호음 때문에 미쳐버리기 전에 꺼야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: All my years and all the planets I've been on... Never going to get used to those things.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure looks like it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048619
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D7D"
msgid "I'm sure they're connected to the Scaled Citadel experiment."
msgstr "분명 비늘 성채 실험과 관련이 있는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit shaken after the encounter with a Vortex Horror. / Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: You think they're related to the Scaled Citadel?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: At least I don't see a body around here so I hope that means Vaeric's alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048617
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D7C"
msgid "Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these."
msgstr "빌어먹을 바룬 가문. 도시 절반을 쓸어버리고 이런 호러스러운 짓거리를 저지르다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The results of House Va'ruun's religious hubris. &&& Tane: You think they're related to the Scaled Citadel? &&& Tane: Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these.  &&& Tane: At least I don't see a body around here so I hope that means Vaeric's alive.|You find anything?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Injured? Hope he doesn't bleed out by the time we find him...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048616
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D79"
msgid "There's a bloodstain. Vaeric must have been injured."
msgstr "핏자국이 있어요. 배릭이 다친 게 틀림없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The results of House Va'ruun's religious hubris. &&& Tane: You think they're related to the Scaled Citadel? &&& Tane: Damn House Va'ruun, wiping out half their city and bringing in horrors like these.  &&& Tane: At least I don't see a body around here so I hope that means Vaeric's alive.|You find anything?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Glad the kid had it in him. Only wish he could've killed 'em before we got here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048614
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D78"
msgid "I think Vaeric fought those creatures and lived."
msgstr "배릭은 저 괴물들과 싸워서 살아남은 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Sounds like a plan. And hopefully that injury slows him down enough for us to catch up.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I found some blood and footprints, but couldn't make anything out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048612
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D77"
msgid "Let's head back down and see what we can find. And by \"we,\" I mean you."
msgstr "다시 내려가서 우리가 뭐 찾을 게 있는지 살펴보자고. 여기서 '우리'는 자네를 말하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We track him. He's injured, so it shouldn't be too hard. &&& Tane: Sounds like a plan. And hopefully that injury slows him down enough for us to catch up. &&& Tane: Let's head back down and see what we can find. And by "we," I mean you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, let's take a look.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048611
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D76"
msgid "I found some blood and footprints, but couldn't make anything out."
msgstr "핏자국과 발자국을 발견했지만, 아무것도 알아낼 수 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We track him. He's injured, so it shouldn't be too hard. &&& Tane: Sounds like a plan. And hopefully that injury slows him down enough for us to catch up. &&& Tane: Let's head back down and see what we can find. And by "we," I mean you.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll say. Vaeric's lucky he got out alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D75"
msgid "Nothing. This place is a wreck."
msgstr "전혀요. 여긴 잔해밖에 없네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D73"
msgid "That's far enough, strangers."
msgstr "가까이 오지 마세요. 이방인 분들."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D72"
msgid "You want to tell me what you're doing on my property uninvited?"
msgstr "초대하지도 않았는데 제 사유지에서 뭘 하는지 말해주시겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I'll say it again.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Veth'aal's heir? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104860B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D71"
msgid "We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal."
msgstr "베타알 가문을 대표해서 배릭 베타알을 찾고 있는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I'll say it again.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, you won't find him here. This isn't exactly the type of place where House members frequent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048609
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D70"
msgid "I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>. We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "저는 선구자 <Alias=MQ04Player>인데, 배릭 베타알을 찾고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I'll say it again.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Through here? You realize you're in the middle of nowhere. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048605
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D6F"
msgid "We're looking for an injured young man that may have passed through here."
msgstr "여길 지나갔을지도 모르는 부상당한 젊은 남자를 찾고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048606
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D6E"
msgid "Vaeric Veth'aal, as in Viktor's son?"
msgstr "배릭 베타알? 빅토르의 아들요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: I'll say it again.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric Veth'aal, as in Viktor's son? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048607
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D6D"
msgid "Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길, 자매님. 배릭 베타알을 찾으러 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent's blessings, sister. We come in search of Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Irina: Vaeric Veth'aal, as in Viktor's son? |Haven't seen him. Ever, in fact.|Besides, what would the heir of House Veth'aal be doing on my farm?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course, fellow Promised. Please forgive my abruptness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048602
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D6A"
msgid "If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me."
msgstr "본 적이 있다면, 말해야 할 의무가 있는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal on behalf of House Veth'aal. &&& Irina: House Veth'aal's heir? |It makes sense now. &&& Tane: You've seen him? You saw Vaeric? &&& Irina: I -- yes. I believe we did.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can understand that, but I can't help you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01048600
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D69"
msgid "He's injured. We're worried about him."
msgstr "배릭이 다쳤거든요. 걱정돼서 그래요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D68"
msgid "The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila."
msgstr "여긴 사람이라곤 제 반려자인 젠이랑 우리 딸 밀라밖에 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D67"
msgid "No one comes around here. We're isolated and that's the way we like it."
msgstr "여기는 아무도 안 오죠. 우린 이렇게 외따로 사는 방식이 좋아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business. &&& Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve. &&& Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.|No one comes around here. We're isolated and that's the way we like it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's... a generous offer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D66"
msgid "[Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help."
msgstr "[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits> 크레딧 주기] 재정 지원을 받으면 도움이 될 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business. &&& Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve. &&& Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.|No one comes around here. We're isolated and that's the way we like it.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *sigh* All right, fine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D65"
msgid "His injuries may need special treatment. Please."
msgstr "배릭의 부상을 치료하려면 특별한 처치가 필요할 수도 있어요. 부탁드려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help. &&& ...  &&& Irina: But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago. &&& Tane: That's gotta be Vaeric. &&& Irina: It's too coincidental. It must have been him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We sent him north.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D64"
msgid "I need to know where Vaeric went."
msgstr "배릭이 어디로 갔는지 알아야겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to know where Vaeric went. &&& Irina: We sent him north. &&& Irina: There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of.|He claimed he lost everything in the incident that swallowed half of Dazra. He wanted to start a new life.|We even gave him two of our own groats to get started.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wasn't aware we had a choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D63"
msgid "Thank you for your help."
msgstr "도와줘서 고마워요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Pay Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_PayIrinaCredits>] Perhaps financial support might help. &&& ...  &&& Irina: But... we did aid an injured young man a few days ago. &&& Tane: That's gotta be Vaeric. &&& Irina: It's too coincidental. It must have been him.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We didn't know and didn't ask. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D62"
msgid "You didn't know who he was?"
msgstr "누구였는지 몰랐던 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business. &&& Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve. &&& Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.|No one comes around here. We're isolated and that's the way we like it.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Be my guest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D61"
msgid "If that's true, you won't mind if I look around."
msgstr "사실이라면, 주변을 둘러봐도 상관 없으시겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Never mind my partner. They're just... overly cautious.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D60"
msgid "As I said before, I've never seen Vaeric Veth'aal..."
msgstr "전에도 말했지만, 배릭 베타알은 본 적 없어요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: Understood. Great Serpent forgive us for aiding a heretic. We knew not what we did.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D5C"
msgid "Even if we'd known he was Vaeric Veth'aal, how could we know he was a traitor?"
msgstr "그 사람이 배릭 베타알이라는 걸 알았다 해도, 반역자라는 것까지 어떻게 알겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>. We're looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Irina: Well, you won't find him here. This isn't exactly the type of place where House members frequent.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hate to inform you, but you're wasting your time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D5B"
msgid "We know he came this way."
msgstr "이쪽으로 왔다는 거 압니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you've seen him, you're obligated to tell me. &&& ...  &&& Tane: Yeah, you hear "obligated," you know it must be House business. &&& Irina: Indeed, Brother. All Must Serve. &&& Irina: The only people here are my partner, Zen, and our daughter, Mila.|No one comes around here. We're isolated and that's the way we like it.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Wow are you serious with these threats? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D5A"
msgid "You know if I discover you're lying, I'm authorized to kill you."
msgstr "거짓말로 드러나면 당신을 죽일 권한이 있다는 건 알 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need to know where Vaeric went. &&& Irina: We sent him north. &&& Irina: There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of.|He claimed he lost everything in the incident that swallowed half of Dazra. He wanted to start a new life.|We even gave him two of our own groats to get started.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Hey, hold up. Have you been listening? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D59"
msgid "Aiding a traitor is punishable by death."
msgstr "반역자를 도우면 사형에 처해질 수 있습니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Irina: We sent him north.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D57"
msgid "There's a long abandoned groat farm we felt he could make use of."
msgstr "오랫동안 버려진 그로트 목장이 있어서 거길 쓰면 되겠다고 생각했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrinaMazur
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's all I needed. We'll be on our way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D56"
msgid "We even gave him two of our own groats to get started."
msgstr "우리 그로트 두 마리도 줬어요. 종자로 쓰라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life. &&& ...  &&& Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses.  &&& Tane: Vaeric being a traitor is news to me and I live in Dazra. You've got to believe these people. &&& companion: Viktor wanted discretion, so it is not unreasonable that these people are innocent.|Still, knowingly or not, they did aid a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Serpent protect us...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D55"
msgid "[Attack] Orders are orders."
msgstr "[공격] 명령은 명령이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life. &&& ...  &&& Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses.  &&& Tane: Vaeric being a traitor is news to me and I live in Dazra. You've got to believe these people. &&& companion: Viktor wanted discretion, so it is not unreasonable that these people are innocent.|Still, knowingly or not, they did aid a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Irina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank the Serpent. And thank you. We would never knowingly move against the will of House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D54"
msgid "Fine. You're free to go."
msgstr "좋아요. 그냥 넘겨 드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A heretic who will pay for their blasphemy with their life. &&& ...  &&& Zen: We are isolated here, and we are taught to honor the noble Houses.  &&& Tane: Vaeric being a traitor is news to me and I live in Dazra. You've got to believe these people. &&& companion: Viktor wanted discretion, so it is not unreasonable that these people are innocent.|Still, knowingly or not, they did aid a traitor.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have that kind of money, but I can return what you gave me and what little savings we've managed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010485E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_4100_Irina_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D53"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits>] I could be persuaded to let this go."
msgstr ""
"[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ04_DemandIrinaCredits> 크레딧 요구] 잘하면 그냥 넘어가 줄 수 있을 거 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: All my years and all the planets I've been on... Never going to get used to those things.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No thanks. I'll keep my fingers crossed that's the last one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01047265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D52"
msgid "Give it time."
msgstr "천천히 익숙해져 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A bit shaken after the encounter with some Vortex Horrors. / Worried / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The results of House Va'ruun's religious hubris.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01047266
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2300_Tane_PostAttackScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D51"
msgid "All my years and all the planets I've been on... Never going to get used to those things."
msgstr "한평생 살면서 온갖 행성 다 가봤지만... 저런 것들엔 절대 익숙해지지 못할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Based on what evidence? House Ka'dic does not deal in trade. YOUR House does. &&& Qisrani: I would not be making this claim without sufficient cause. Nor is House Dul'kehf the bearer of this information. &&& Qisrani: Harbinger, the floor is yours.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well. Let us know when you're ready to speak on this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047157
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D20"
msgid "I need more time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 더 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need more time to prepare.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need more time to prepare.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047156
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D1F"
msgid "Very well. Let us know when you're ready to speak on this."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이 문제에 대해 말씀하실 준비가 되면 알려주십시오."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047155
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047198
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "001D1E"
msgid "Surely we can break the rules here, given all that's happened."
msgstr "규정 같은 건 좀 넘어갈 수도 있는 거 아닌가요. 지금 벌어진 일을 모두 고려하면요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047155
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047198
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D1D"
msgid "Dazra is a mess right now. Granting me access is the least of your worries."
msgstr "다즈라는 지금 엉망진창이에요. 저에게 권한을 주냐 마냐는 당신 걱정거리 중에서도 가장 사소한 일일 거예요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047155
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047198
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D1C"
msgid "The state of Dazra is such that using the normal channels is impossible."
msgstr "다즈라 상황을 보면 정상 절차를 통해 일을 처리하는 게 불가능해요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047154
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D1B"
msgid "I'm here on behalf of Qisrani Dul'kehf. There's no reason not to grant me full approval."
msgstr "저는 키스라니 둘케프를 대신해서 왔어요. 모든 권한을 승인해 주셔야 할걸요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047151
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D1A"
msgid "Supplies are missing, and so is Ukaru. Now is not the time for red tape."
msgstr "물자가 사라졌고, 우카루도 사라졌어요. 지금은 잡다한 절차를 따질 때가 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047152
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D19"
msgid "True. Although Qisrani did not request admin access for you, I would expect her to if it's required for her investigation."
msgstr "맞습니다. 키스라니 씨가 당신에게 관리자 권한을 부여해달라 요청하진 않았지만, 조사에 필요하다면 곧 요청할 거 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047152
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D18"
msgid "Even Qisrani must obtain permission before being granted access to her cousin's files. We still follow protocol here."
msgstr "키스라니 씨라도 사촌의 파일에 접근하기 전에 허가를 받아야 합니다. 저희는 여전히 이곳의 규정을 따릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047150
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D17"
msgid "Normally I would say rules are rules, but I do understand this is an emergency."
msgstr "평소에는 규칙은 규칙이라고 말하겠지만, 이번 상황이 비상 상황이라는 건 이해합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047150
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D16"
msgid "The \"red tape\" you are referring to are policies necessary for the Ministry of Commerce to function. Rules are rules, even in times of distress."
msgstr "당신이 언급하는 '잡다한 절차'는 상무성이 기능을 수행하는 데 필요한 수단입니다. 고난의 시기라도, 규칙은 규칙입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D15"
msgid "I am aware of your stature, and the threat is noted. I would rather not make an enemy of you."
msgstr "당신이 처한 상황도 알고 있고, 위험한 것도 압니다. 당신을 적으로 돌리고 싶진 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D14"
msgid "I am aware of your status, as a RECENT convert. Which is barely a step above heretic."
msgstr "당신이 처한 상황도 알고 있고, '최근' 개종한 것도 압니다. 이단자보다 한 걸음 나아간 정도지만요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D13"
msgid "I have powerful friends. If you don't grant me access, they will make your life miserable."
msgstr "제 뒤엔 강력한 친구들이 있어요. 권한을 승인해 주지 않으면, 제 친구들이 인생을 비참하게 만들어 줄 테니 그리 아세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D12"
msgid "These are desperate times..."
msgstr "절망적인 상황이기는 하죠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D11"
msgid "The cataclysm has made things difficult..."
msgstr "대재난으로 인해 상황이 어려워졌습니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716A
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D10"
msgid "I do fear you have a point..."
msgstr "당신의 말이 일리가 있어서 두렵군요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0F"
msgid "That's irrelevant. Rules are rules."
msgstr "그건 관련 없지 않습니까. 규칙은 규칙입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0E"
msgid "I'm sorry, but regardless of the situation, we do not break protocol, we enforce it."
msgstr "죄송합니다만, 상황이 어떻든 간에, 저희는 규정을 어기지 않고, 그대로 실행합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047153
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104716E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0D"
msgid "You want an exception. Exceptions create loopholes. Loopholes lead to anarchy."
msgstr "예외를 원하시는군요. 예외는 허점을 만듭니다. 허점은 무정부 상태로 이어집니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0C"
msgid "Ukaru may be in danger. The more you block me, the more trouble he could be in."
msgstr "우카루가 위험에 처했을 수도 있어요. 저를 막을수록, 더 문제에 빠질 수도 있다고요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0B"
msgid "Stop wasting my time. You should be aware of who I am and what I'm capable of."
msgstr "시간 낭비하게 하지 마세요. 제가 누구이고 무슨 능력이 있는지는 파악하고 있어야 하는 거 아닌가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047146
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D0A"
msgid "It is unlikely such a thing would've simply fallen into your hands. We are not so careless. A leak is possible."
msgstr "그런 물건이 그냥 네놈 손에 들어갔을 리가 없지. 우린 그렇게 허술하지 않아. 정보 유출이 의심된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047146
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D09"
msgid "While curious that the Warden obtained it, it does not mean the supplier betrayed us."
msgstr "교정관이 그걸 손에 넣었다는 건 의아하지만, 그렇다고 해서 제공자가 우릴 배신했다는 뜻은 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D08"
msgid "Good point. I suppose our backlog would only worsen if that were the case."
msgstr "좋은 지적입니다. 만약 그렇게 한다면 저희의 업무 적체가 더욱 심해질 것이라 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D07"
msgid "And if so, he has no one to blame but himself. If he were here, he would be granted the full protection of the guard."
msgstr ""
"그리고 만약 그렇다면, 우카루 씨는 자신 외에 누구도 탓할 수 없을 겁니다. 우카루 씨가 여기에 있었다면, 경비대가 최대한 보호해 줬을 "
"겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D06"
msgid "I see. I'd rather not endure any more pressure from the leadership than I already am."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이미 지도부의 압박을 받고 있는데 더 받고 싶진 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104714C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D05"
msgid "And if I do, Hasmak Dul'kehf will have my head if I break protocol. I fear his wrath more than yours."
msgstr ""
"그리고 만약 제가 그렇게 한다면, 제가 규정을 어겼을 때 해즈막 둘케프 님이 저의 머리를 가져가실 겁니다. 당신이 분노하는 것보다 그분이 "
"분노하는 게 더 두렵습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047148
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "001D04"
msgid "Indeed. As long as we limited your permissions, I suppose the situation, might merit granting you access."
msgstr "그렇습니다. 당신의 권한을 제한하고 있지만, 상황에 따라 당신에게 접속 권한을 부여할 수도 있겠다 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047148
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D03"
msgid "Regardless of his violations, admin access is not granted so cavalierly."
msgstr "우카루 씨가 위반한 것과는 관계없이, 관리자 권한은 그렇게 가볍게 주어지지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047142
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D02"
msgid "And it should not have been. It is highly suspicious."
msgstr "그리고 그래서도 안 되지. 매우 의심스럽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047142
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D01"
msgid "Then perhaps luck is what brought you here with such pace, and not betrayal."
msgstr "그렇다면 네놈이 이토록 빨리 이곳에 온 것은 배신이 아니라 행운 덕분이었을지도 모르겠군."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001D00"
msgid "[Lie] Your supplier asked me to kill you to cover their tracks."
msgstr "[거짓말] 널 배신한 자가 자기 흔적을 숨기려고 나에게 너를 죽이라고 했다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047145
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104717B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFF"
msgid "Whether you were betrayed or not, you should value your life."
msgstr "배신당했든 아니든, 목숨을 소중히 여겨야 할 거다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047145
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104717B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFE"
msgid "I am just trying to find a peaceful solution here."
msgstr "난 그저 평화로운 해결책을 찾으려는 것뿐이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047145
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104717B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFD"
msgid "I would rather solve this without violence."
msgstr "폭력 없이 이 문제를 해결하고 싶다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047149
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_035_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFC"
msgid "Ukaru Dul'kehf has been absent from his post. Whatever privacy rights he had are now forfeit."
msgstr "우카루 둘케프는 자리를 비웠어요. 우카루의 사생활 관련 권리는 이제 모두 박탈당한 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047187
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFB"
msgid "Hm... if the contact has betrayed us, there is no honor in fighting."
msgstr "흠... 만약 그 연락책이 우릴 배신했다면, 싸움에 명예는 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047187
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CFA"
msgid "If our suspicions are correct, then perhaps it is time to lay down arms."
msgstr "우리의 의심이 맞다면, 무기를 내려놓을 때가 된 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01047187
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF9"
msgid "If the supplier has betrayed us, then perhaps you are in the right."
msgstr "만약 제공자가 우릴 배신했다면, 네 말이 옳을 수도 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104718B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF8"
msgid "There is no honor in cowardice."
msgstr "비겁함에는 명예가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104718B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF7"
msgid "Like all Children of Jarek, you opt to run when honor dictates you fight."
msgstr "모든 자렉의 아이들이 그렇듯, 명예를 위해 싸워야 할 때 도망치는 쪽을 택하는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047144
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeRepeatable
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104718B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF6"
msgid "We do not flee in the face of adversity. We fight."
msgstr "우린 역경에 맞서 도망치지 않는다. 싸울 뿐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF5"
msgid "It seems a bit more than that is at play."
msgstr "단순한 문제가 아닌 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF4"
msgid "So you're saying the supplier did not betray us."
msgstr "그러니까 제공자가 우릴 배신하지 않았다는 거군."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047143
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF3"
msgid "I don't know what to tell you. This place was easy to find."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 모르겠군. 여긴 찾기 쉬웠거든."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047141
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF2"
msgid "Whoever betrayed you gave the information to Tevina Veth'aal. She helped me find you."
msgstr "널 배신한 자가 테비나 베타알에게 정보를 줬다. 내가 널 찾을 수 있도록 테비나가 도와줬지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF1"
msgid "Interesting. I suspected the same."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 나도 같은 의심을 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CF0"
msgid "I thought as much, until you spoke. Hearing the words, I don't believe you."
msgstr "네놈이 말하기 전까진 그렇게 생각했지. 그 말을 들으니, 네놈을 믿을 수 없겠군."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CEF"
msgid "I found this place through good old fashioned detective work."
msgstr "그냥 정석대로 수사해서 이곳을 찾아냈다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047140
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CEE"
msgid "Yes, and I doubt that even the Warden, despite all her bloodthirst, would find us so quickly. No, this reeks of foul play."
msgstr "그래, 그리고 그 피에 굶주린 교정관조차도 그렇게 빨리 우릴 찾을 순 없을 거다. 아니, 이건 뭔가 수상해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047140
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeMedium01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CED"
msgid "The Warden is known for being a bloodhound. There may be a logical reason for your haste."
msgstr "교정관은 사냥개로 유명하지. 네놈이 서두른 데는 그럴듯한 이유가 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CEC"
msgid "[Lie] Someone clearly set you up."
msgstr "[거짓말] 분명 누군가 널 함정에 빠뜨렸겠군."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01047147
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeEasy01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CEB"
msgid "I used a cipher key for one of your encrypted slates, which had the coordinates. But I don't know where the key came from."
msgstr "암호화된 슬레이트 중 하나를 해독하기 위해 암호 키를 사용했는데, 거기에 좌표가 있었어. 하지만 그 키가 어디서 왔는지는 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CEA"
msgid "I am beginning to think you are right."
msgstr "네 말이 맞는 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0104713A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_SpeechChallengeHard02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CE9"
msgid "Your tongue lies."
msgstr "네놈의 혀는 거짓을 말하고 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CE8"
msgid "But you're free to look at what I have here in the meantime."
msgstr "하지만 그동안 여기 있는 제 물건을 자유롭게 보셔도 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, protect her?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CE7"
msgid "He was the one who presented me with the plan to aid the Zealots. He had worked out all the details."
msgstr "오킴을 광신도를 돕는다는 계획을 내게 제시하기도 했지. 세부 사항은 모두 오킴이 준비했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, protect her?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CE6"
msgid "And then someone tipped Ukaru Dul'kehf off, and set this whole thing in motion. I feel quite foolish now, having taken the bait."
msgstr "그리고 누가 우카루 둘케프한테 정보를 흘려서 이 모든 일을 벌인 거다. 그 미끼를 물어버린 내가 참 어리석게 느껴지는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BrotherOnamide
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001CE4"
msgid "You are free to go. But when next we meet, blood will be shed."
msgstr "자유롭게 가도 좋다. 하지만 다음에 만날 때는 피를 보게 될 거다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001CD2"
msgid "Letting Mujeen go is a mistake."
msgstr "무진을 풀어주는 건 실수입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001CD1"
msgid "I'd like to say justice was served, but it clearly wasn't."
msgstr "정의가 실현됐다고 말하고 싶지만, 분명 그러지 못했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001CD0"
msgid "I don't like hanging around places for too long. Fish and guests, as they say."
msgstr "저는 한 곳에 너무 오래 머무는 걸 좋아하지 않습니다. 생선과 손님은, 무슨 말인지 알겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001CCF"
msgid "Your discretion in this matter is most appreciated."
msgstr "이 문제는 최대한 신중하게 다뤄주길 바란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001CCE"
msgid "I will continue to do the work necessary to ensure House Va'ruun remains strong."
msgstr "나는 바룬 가문이 계속 강성할 수 있도록 필요한 일을 계속할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001CCD"
msgid "Excellent work on this case. A good lead is like a puff of smoke. Hard to miss, but wait too long, and it's gone. But you never hesitated."
msgstr "이번 사건을 훌륭하게 처리하셨습니다. 좋은 단서는 마치 한 줄기 연기와 같습니다. 놓치기 어렵지만, 너무 오래 기다리면 사라져 버리죠. 하지만 당신은 한 번도 망설이지 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Seeing a Vortex Horror appear for the first time. Shocked, a little terrified. / Disbelief / to VortexHorror01
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Disbelief
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01047267
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_2190_Tane_ReactToVortexHorrorSpawnScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CCC"
msgid "What the hell is that?"
msgstr "저 씨벌 것은 대체 뭐여?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC2
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "001CB8"
msgid "The endless void take you!"
msgstr "영원한 공허가 널 집어삼키리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AC2
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "001CB7"
msgid "His fangs are the void! His bite is venom!"
msgstr "그분의 송곳니가 공허다! 그분의 교상이 독이다!"

