msgid "Only by uniting with House Ma'leen is this possible."
msgstr "이는 마린 가문과 연합해야만 가능하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ukaru: You are most welcome.
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
