#. TOPIC: 010335BB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CAD"
msgid "I'll stay here until the coast is clear. Lots of Zealots still about."
msgstr "상황이 안전해질 때까지 여기 있겠습니다. 아직 광신도들이 많이 돌아다니거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CAC"
msgid "You disappoint me, convert."
msgstr "실망이 크군. 개종자."

#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BrotherOnamide
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001CAB"
msgid "You have the evidence you require. Leave, lest the fangs of the void take you."
msgstr "필요한 증거는 얻었겠지. 어서 떠나라. 공허의 송곳니가 널 덮치기 전에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, a personal thing, huh? Don't worry, I'm not here to judge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CAA"
msgid "I prefer not to talk about it."
msgstr "그 얘기는 하고 싶지 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You telling me they made you Promised and you aren't even a believer? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA9"
msgid "Sure, if you believe all that stuff."
msgstr "맞아요. 그런 것들을 다 믿는다면 말이지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path. &&& Tane: Oh wow, you really bought in, huh?  &&& Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You could say I'm like a specialized delivery service, moving stuff back and forth between Dazra and the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA8"
msgid "How'd you end up here?"
msgstr "어쩌다 여기까지 온 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Oh wow, you really bought in, huh? 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A heretic then.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA7"
msgid "I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing."
msgstr "나도 이방인이야. 커다란 뱀 이야기는 죄다 이해하기 어렵더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Only I understand Anasko Va'ruun. I'm certain it's the Great Serpent's intervention. &&& Tane: So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure.  &&& Tane: Anyway, enough about that. What can I do you for?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That so?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA6"
msgid "I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭 베타알을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 아신다고 들었는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Tane: That so? &&& Tane: Well, I guess that depends, Harbinger. &&& Tane: Who wants to know? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh sure. You just show up out of the blue and suddenly want to know where to find House Veth'aal's number one son?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA5"
msgid "I do, of course."
msgstr "당연히 제가 찾죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I do, of course.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I do, of course.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA4"
msgid "Oh sure. You just show up out of the blue and suddenly want to know where to find House Veth'aal's number one son?"
msgstr "아, 그러셔? 갑자기 불쑥 나타나서는 베타알 가문의 첫째 아들을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알고 싶으시다?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm looking on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking on behalf of House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Although... let's just say after what went down here, my retirement's looking imminent and I haven't exactly been saving up for a rainy day.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA3"
msgid "Well, in that case, I can't help you."
msgstr "뭐, 그렇다면 못 도와주겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent bless you. I've been shown the rightful path. &&& Tane: Oh wow, you really bought in, huh?  &&& Tane: I'm an outsider myself. It's hard to get into the whole giant snake thing.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, it's something, isn't it?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA2"
msgid "I know what you mean."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 알겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: So I've heard. You've got something about you, that's for sure. 
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA1"
msgid "Anyway, enough about that. What can I do you for?"
msgstr "어쨌든, 그 얘기는 그만하지. 뭘 도와줄까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Says the player title as if in quotes since he's not into the whole religious title thing. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: That so?
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tane: Who wants to know? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001CA0"
msgid "Well, I guess that depends, Harbinger."
msgstr "음, 그건 상황 따라 다르겠는데. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I heard you know where I can find Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Tane: That so? &&& Tane: Well, I guess that depends, Harbinger. &&& Tane: Who wants to know? 
