#. TOPIC: 01045DB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C9F"
msgid "I'm looking on behalf of House Veth'aal."
msgstr "제가 베타알 가문을 대표해서 찾는 중이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tane: Well, I guess that depends, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I do, of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045DAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1500_Tane_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C9E"
msgid "Who wants to know?"
msgstr "누가 찾는 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have that kind of money on me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have that kind of money on me.
#. ALIAS: Tane
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. I'll look into raising some credits for that retirement fund of yours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
