#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C5D"
msgid "Anasko took some technology from an older research site. I have another of the same device."
msgstr "아나스코가 오래된 연구소에서 어떤 기술을 가져갔더군요. 저도 똑같은 장치를 하나 가져왔죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: It is good to see you have returned. I hope you have some good news. &&& Malibor: Did you find anything that can help us?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am no scientist, so I would be of little help in discerning its purpose. But if it can help us figure out what else we need to do, it will have been worth it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C5C"
msgid "I'm not sure what this thing does, but it somehow fits into all this."
msgstr "이게 뭐하는 물건인지는 잘 모르겠는데, 어쨌든 이 모든 상황에 딱 들어맞더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure what this thing does, but it somehow fits into all this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure what this thing does, but it somehow fits into all this.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Your timing couldn't be better. Work on the device should be nearing completion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C5B"
msgid "I am no scientist, so I would be of little help in discerning its purpose. But if it can help us figure out what else we need to do, it will have been worth it."
msgstr ""
"저도 과학자가 아닌지라, 큰 도움은 드리지 못하겠군요. 그래도 저희가 뭘 해야 할지 알아내는 데 도움이 된다면, 그만한 가치가 있을 "
"겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: That is excellent news. Given the timing of its acquisition, it must be related. It gives us more to work with, at least.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I think it's time we put it to the test.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C5A"
msgid "Your timing couldn't be better. Work on the device should be nearing completion."
msgstr "딱 좋을 때에 오셨군요. 장치 작업이 거의 마무리 단계에 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: That is excellent news. Given the timing of its acquisition, it must be related. It gives us more to work with, at least.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I think it's time we put it to the test.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C59"
msgid "Work continues apace on the device, thanks to the efforts you've made with the other Houses. I think we're getting close."
msgstr "장치 작업이 아주 빠르게 진행되고 있어요. 그대가 다른 가문들과 함께 노력해 준 덕분입니다. 거의 다 된 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: That is excellent news. Given the timing of its acquisition, it must be related. It gives us more to work with, at least.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I think it's time we put it to the test.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C58"
msgid "We've begun work on a device that may allow us access to the Scaled Citadel. Perhaps this little piece of technology will be useful."
msgstr "저희도 비늘 성채에 진입할 수 있게 해 줄 장치를 만들기 시작했습니다. 이 작은 기술이 유용하게 쓰일지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Your timing couldn't be better. Work on the device should be nearing completion.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C57"
msgid "I think it's time we put it to the test."
msgstr "이제 시험해 볼 때가 된 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Your timing couldn't be better. Work on the device should be nearing completion.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C56"
msgid "If you can solidify support from House Veth'aal, that may be the last missing piece of this."
msgstr "베타알 가문의 도움을 확고히 할 수 있다면, 이 퍼즐의 마지막 조각을 찾게 될 지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Your timing couldn't be better. Work on the device should be nearing completion.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C55"
msgid "If you can get House Ka'dic to turn over the scientist they've been hiding from us, we may have everything we need."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 숨기고 있는 과학자를 데려올 수 있다면, 우리에게 필요한 모든 요소가 갖춰질지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We've begun work on a device that may allow us access to the Scaled Citadel. Perhaps this little piece of technology will be useful.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 01045E02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage1600_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C54"
msgid "Houses Ka'dic and Veth'aal are still reluctant to fully support this project, despite my best efforts. Perhaps you can persuade them to cooperate fully."
msgstr ""
"카딕 가문과 베타알 가문은 아직도 제대로 도와주지 않으려 합니다. 제가 최대한 노력했는데도요. 그대가 설득할 수 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why keep it locked away?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 010450C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C53"
msgid "But when I hear that music, the dream becomes real again. And it's too much for this old man to bear."
msgstr "그런데 이 음악을 듣자, 꿈이 다시 현실이 됐네. 이 늙은이에겐 너무 끔찍한 현실이구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Orahim! Oh, how great of you to visit! It has been far, far too long! &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: So, Accursed, you and Orahim... you've slaughtered my brethren in the name of what, exactly?   &&& Orahim: Enough, Khaslav! You will speak to me only!  &&& Khaslav: Hoooo! It seems to me that Orahim is afraid of what I may say! Terrified, petrified of me revealing his true nature to you, Accursed!|I am sure he went on and on about how evil I am, how it was I that forced him to commit horrible atrocities. Whatever those may be.|All of it, merely a deflection. Orahim was the most brutal out of all of us, he had a lust for blood that was legendary. Oh, I wish you could have seen him in his prime.
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then let the fun begin! I shall offer your bleeding corpse to the Great Serpent!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046261
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C52"
msgid "[Attack] Let's just get this over with. I'm taking you down."
msgstr "[공격] 이제 그만 끝내지. 널 쓰러뜨려 주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] Let's just get this over with. I'm taking you down.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Let's just get this over with. I'm taking you down.
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046260
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C51"
msgid "Then let the fun begin! I shall offer your bleeding corpse to the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "그럼 한 번 즐겨 보자고! 네놈의 피 흐르는 시체를 위대한 뱀께 바쳐야겠다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Orahim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Oh? I never knew honesty to be one of Orahim's virtues. I remember many times he would lie to win over the trust of an accursed before stabbing them in the back. Literally!
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Enough! I need no reminders of what I have done! I relive those scenes every day, I see ghosts every night. I am cursed!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C50"
msgid "So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he --"
msgstr "그래서 놈이 다 불었나? 전에 저질렀던 그 짓거리도..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Orahim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past.  &&& Khaslav: Oh? I never knew honesty to be one of Orahim's virtues. I remember many times he would lie to win over the trust of an accursed before stabbing them in the back. Literally! &&& Khaslav: So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he --
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4F"
msgid "Enough! I need no reminders of what I have done! I relive those scenes every day, I see ghosts every night. I am cursed!"
msgstr "그만! 내가 무슨 짓을 했는지는 말할 필요 없어! 매일 그 장면이 떠오르고, 매일 밤 유령을 본다고. 잔인한 저주지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: Oooh, poor Orahim, oh boo-hoo. It seems having a conscience is such a heavy burden... this is all quite pathetic, really. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4E"
msgid "The past cannot be changed. But your death, Khaslav, will serve as some small penance."
msgstr "과거는 돌이킬 수 없지만... 카슬라프, 네가 죽는다면 조금이나마 속죄할 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Orahim
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he -- &&& Orahim: Enough! I need no reminders of what I have done! I relive those scenes every day, I see ghosts every night. I am cursed!|The past cannot be changed. But your death, Khaslav, will serve as some small penance. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4D"
msgid "Oooh, poor Orahim, oh boo-hoo. It seems having a conscience is such a heavy burden... this is all quite pathetic, really."
msgstr "아이고, 불쌍한 오라힘. 흑흑흑. 그렇게도 양심이 찔려서 죽을 맛이냐... 이거 정말 가관이구먼, 한심해서 못 봐주겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4C"
msgid "I can forgive your betrayal, but what I cannot abide is your stinking hypocrisy. You deliver death to my doorstep and then speak to me of righteousness? This is heresy, damn it!"
msgstr ""
"배신한 건 용서할 수 있어. 하지만 위선 떠는 꼬라지는 역겨워서 못 참겠다. 내 목을 치러 여기까지 와놓고 정의로운 척하냐? 이게 이단 "
"새끼지! 씨발아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4B"
msgid "I kill accursed in the Great Serpent's name, to feed the corpses of unbelievers to Him, and I love it, I love it! I know what I am, what I kill for. But you... you are trying to be something you are not -- a hero."
msgstr ""
"나는 위대한 뱀의 이름으로 저주받은 자들을 죽인다. 불신자들의 시체를 뱀께서 먹어 치우시도록. 난 이 일을 사랑해, 사랑한다고! 난 내가 "
"누군지, 무얼 위해 죽이는지 알지. 하지만 네놈은... 가당치도 않은 짓거리나 하잖아. 꼴에 영웅 행세라니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Orahim
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C4A"
msgid "And you decide to start your new life with yet more acts of violence -- against the very same that once adored you, no less?  Against the true House Va'ruun?"
msgstr ""
"그래서 새로운 삶을 살기로 결정해놓고, 더 많이 폭력을 휘두르겠다는 거냐? 한때 너를 추앙할 정도로 좋아했던 동료들도 좀 조져주고? "
"진정한 바룬 가문에 맞서시겠다?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Oooh, poor Orahim, oh boo-hoo. It seems having a conscience is such a heavy burden... this is all quite pathetic, really. |I can forgive your betrayal, but what I cannot abide is your stinking hypocrisy. You deliver death to my doorstep and then speak to me of righteousness? This is heresy, damn it! |I kill accursed in the Great Serpent's name, to feed the corpses of unbelievers to Him, and I love it, I love it! I know what I am, what I kill for. But you... you are trying to be something you are not -- a hero.|And you decide to start your new life with yet more acts of violence -- against the very same that once adored you, no less?  Against the true House Va'ruun? |You have not changed at all. Death is all you know, only now it seems everyone is a target. When did you become so pathetic? We used to idolize you, now you are just so... boring!
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C49"
msgid "Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy."
msgstr "내 말 들어라! 저주받은 자! 오라힘의... 친구라고 해야 하나. 네가 저놈에게 자비를 보여줘야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C48"
msgid "The poor fool. Oh Great Serpent, he is so tortured! He wants so badly to forget what he's done, to live amongst those he has killed by the shipful a few months ago. Why not put him out of his misery?"
msgstr ""
"불쌍한 바보 같으니. 오 위대한 뱀이시여, 이 자가 이토록 고통받고 있나이다! 그토록 저지른 짓을 잊고 싶어 하다니. 몇 달 전 화물선 "
"승무원들을 몰살시켜 놓고, 죽인 놈들과 같은 인간들 사이에서 살아보겠다고 발버둥 치는 꼴이라니. 그냥 저 비참한 삶을 끝내주는 게 어떨까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Do not try it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C47"
msgid "Whatever he is paying you for this charade, I will provide even greater compensation."
msgstr "이 같잖은 장단에 맞춰주는 대가로 그놈이 얼마나 줬냐? 까짓것 더 많이 쳐주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past.  &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy.  |The poor fool. Oh Great Serpent, he is so tortured! He wants so badly to forget what he's done, to live amongst those he has killed by the shipful a few months ago. Why not put him out of his misery? |Whatever he is paying you for this charade, I will provide even greater compensation.  &&& Orahim: Do not try it.  &&& companion: We have come too far to turn on Orahim now. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not proposing that you trust me. But is it so wise to trust him? I have spent my whole life by his side, I understand his true nature. You do not. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C46"
msgid "Why would I ever trust you?"
msgstr "왜 내가 너 따위를 믿어 줄거라 생각하시지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: Enough! I need no reminders of what I have done! I relive those scenes every day, I see ghosts every night. I am cursed!|The past cannot be changed. But your death, Khaslav, will serve as some small penance.  &&& Khaslav: Oooh, poor Orahim, oh boo-hoo. It seems having a conscience is such a heavy burden... this is all quite pathetic, really. |I can forgive your betrayal, but what I cannot abide is your stinking hypocrisy. You deliver death to my doorstep and then speak to me of righteousness? This is heresy, damn it! |I kill accursed in the Great Serpent's name, to feed the corpses of unbelievers to Him, and I love it, I love it! I know what I am, what I kill for. But you... you are trying to be something you are not -- a hero.|And you decide to start your new life with yet more acts of violence -- against the very same that once adored you, no less?  Against the true House Va'ruun? |You have not changed at all. Death is all you know, only now it seems everyone is a target. When did you become so pathetic? We used to idolize you, now you are just so... boring! &&& Khaslav: Listen now, Accursed! You are Orahim's... friend, so it falls on you to show him mercy.  |The poor fool. Oh Great Serpent, he is so tortured! He wants so badly to forget what he's done, to live amongst those he has killed by the shipful a few months ago. Why not put him out of his misery? |Whatever he is paying you for this charade, I will provide even greater compensation. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We have come too far to turn on Orahim now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104625B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C45"
msgid "Do not try it."
msgstr "넘어가지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
