msgstr "저 새끼 말 듣지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on *me* and *him* / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I ever trust you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would I ever trust you?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046259
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C3E"
msgid "I am not proposing that you trust me. But is it so wise to trust him? I have spent my whole life by his side, I understand his true nature. You do not."
msgstr ""
"내 말을 믿으라고 제안하는 게 아니다. 저 녀석 말을 믿는 게 현명한 거냐고 묻는 거다. 나는 저 녀석과 쭉 같이 살아봤고, 놈의 진짜 "
"본성을 알지. 너는 아닐 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I ever trust you?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046259
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C3D"
msgid "I am no idiot. I know that all of this was a misguided effort to gain the favor of the accursed in Dazra."
msgstr "난 머저리가 아냐. 이 짓거리, 다즈라에 사는 저주받은 자들의 환심을 사려고 헛짓거리 벌이는 거잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I ever trust you?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046259
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C3C"
msgid "But, think, just think: would you truly trust this man as your neighbor?"
msgstr "근데, 생각해 봐. 머리를 굴려 보라고. 정말 이 작자를 믿고 이웃으로 둘 수 있냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I ever trust you?
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Do not listen to him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01046259
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C3B"
msgid "Do you want to be the one responsible for unleashing a bonecrest into a field of groats?"
msgstr "감당할 수 있냐? 순진한 그로트 무리 한가운데에 골판벼슬 사마귀 같은 맹수를 풀어 놓고 뒷감당할 수 있냐고?"

