msgstr "어디 와바라! 위대한 뱀께서 피를 쏟으며 짓이겨진 너희들의 시체를 뜯어 먹을 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't care about any gossip. I'm here because I'm getting paid. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't care about any gossip. I'm here because I'm getting paid. 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104566A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C2D"
msgid "To you, the slaughter of countless accursed is mere \"gossip?\" Oh, I am in danger of growing fond of you. You are such a fun little pet."
msgstr ""
"너에게는 수많은 저주 받은 자들이 도륙 당한 일이 그냥 '험담'일뿐이냐? 아, 위험해라. 하마터면 너 마음에 들 뻔했잖아. 애완동물 같은 "
"게 참 재밌단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Orahim has been up front about his past. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Khaslav: So he has recounted everything? Including the incident where he --
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01045668
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001C2C"
msgid "Oh? I never knew honesty to be one of Orahim's virtues. I remember many times he would lie to win over the trust of an accursed before stabbing them in the back. Literally!"
msgstr ""
"오? 오라힘에게 그런 정직한 면이 있는 줄은 몰랐는데. 오라힘 그놈이 저주받은 자에게 거짓말을 떠벌려 신뢰를 얻은 뒤 등 뒤에 칼을 꽂는 "
"걸 몇 번이나 봤다고. 진짜로!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good luck, Orahim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041257
