msgid "They are one who has Jinan's ideals in mind. To make House Va'ruun the might of the Settled Systems."
msgstr "지난 님의 이상을 마음에 품은 자다. 바룬 가문을 개척 성계의 권력자로 만든다는 이상 말이다."

#. PROMPT: [Attack] If Qisrani's in danger, then we don't have time for talk.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ZealotBoss: We were already warned of your coming, and brought reinforcements.
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: ZealotBoss: Very well. If we have been betrayed, then there is no bargain left to uphold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450F3
