#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BF4"
msgid "And now, with the Serpent as our witness, you will perish here!"
msgstr "그리고 이제, 위대한 뱀을 증인으로 삼아, 네놈은 여기서 죽을 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ZealotBoss:  &&& ZealotBoss: The contact has already returned to Dazra. And your handler, Qisrani, will die by their hand.
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because they are weak and unworthy. For years they cowered in their holes, leaving us to fight the war that Jinan began.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450F0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BF3"
msgid "Why take supplies from Dazra?"
msgstr "왜 다즈라에서 물자를 가져가는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why take supplies from Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why take supplies from Dazra?
