#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BF2"
msgid "Because they are weak and unworthy. For years they cowered in their holes, leaving us to fight the war that Jinan began."
msgstr "다즈라 녀석들은 약하고 가치가 없기 때문이다. 수년 동안 녀석들은 구멍 속에 숨어, 지난 님이 시작하신 전쟁을 우리에게 맡겼지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& ...  &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed. &&& Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days. &&& Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not sure that's wise, given Ukaru's warnings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BEE"
msgid "Why not investigate it yourself?"
msgstr "직접 조사해 보면 어떨까요?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: ZealotBoss: The name of our contact is from House Ka'dic. This slate will give you all the evidence you need.
#. ALIAS: ZealotBoss
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450ED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_200_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BED"
msgid "Goodbye, child of Jarek. Pray we do not meet again on more even ground."
msgstr "잘 가라. 자렉의 아이야. 우리가 더 대등한 입장에서 다시 만나지 않기를 기도나 해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not a single Zealot will live.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BEB"
msgid "Do you have a plan for how you'll infiltrate the hideout?"
msgstr "은신처에 잠입할 계획은 있으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not investigate it yourself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why not investigate it yourself?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BE5"
msgid "I'm not sure that's wise, given Ukaru's warnings."
msgstr "우카루가 경고한 걸 고려하면, 그게 현명한 처사인지 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not investigate it yourself?
