#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BE4"
msgid "If what he says is true, a watchful eye is being kept on House Dul'kehf. They may blame him, or me, for the supplies going missing."
msgstr ""
"우카루의 말이 사실이라면, 누군가 둘케프 가문을 주시하고 있을지도 몰라요. 그 누군가가 물자가 사라진 것에 대해 우카루나 저를 비난할 "
"수도 있겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Well look at that. The Great Serpent favors us both. |It just so happens that one of my agents recently recovered a Zealot cipher key,  and dropped it off this morning.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450EA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BE3"
msgid "So unless you have a slate that needs decrypting, the investigation's stalled."
msgstr "그러니까 해독해야 할 슬레이트가 없다면, 수사는 교착 상태에 빠진 겁니다."

