#. PROMPT: Save it for the judge.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Save it for the judge.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450D1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BD0"
msgid "Haste doesn't suit you. So before you go in there and report your findings, hear me out."
msgstr "서두르는 건 너답지 않군. 그러니 들어가서 조사 결과 보고하기 전에, 내 말 좀 들어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know the answer to that. &&& Mujeen: It's a complicated question. But if the roots of the conflict were to be removed, even the most robust of trees would fall and wither.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's just say recent events have reminded me of an old parable, about a father and two sons.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450D0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BCF"
msgid "Why ask the question? What's this about?"
msgstr "왜 그런 질문을 하시는 거죠? 무슨 상관이 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: You hit the bullseye! Let's see what you've won!
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Looks like an all-expenses paid journey to Jandar's Rest! Lucky you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BCE"
msgid "I'll just type in the correct code and... voila! Let's see what you've won!"
msgstr "정답 코드를 입력하면... 짜잔! 어떤 상품을 받으셨는지 볼까요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani:  &&& Qisrani: I think we can all agree that the charges for this crime are quite serious.|Theft of supplies, aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin. &&& Qisrani: Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BCD"
msgid "I couldn't agree more. And my findings back that accusation up."
msgstr "전적으로 동의한다. 그리고 내 조사 결과도 그 고발을 뒷받침한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BCB"
msgid "This slate lists you by name, Envoy. What do you have to say for yourself?"
msgstr "이 슬레이트에 사절님 이름이 있습니다. 뭐라고 변명하시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Mujeen is guilty. This should be proof that Mujeen Ka'dic is responsible for the stolen supplies. &&& Qisrani: This slate lists you by name, Envoy. What do you have to say for yourself?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BCA"
msgid "Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department."
msgstr "이것 때문에 날 부른 건가? 키스라니? 당신 부처 입장에선 이거 망신 아닌가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: This slate lists you by name, Envoy. What do you have to say for yourself? &&& Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC9"
msgid "You haven't answered my question, Mujeen."
msgstr "제 질문에 대답하지 않으셨습니다. 무진."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Is this what you called me to your office for, Qisrani? This is an absolute disgrace to your department. &&& Qisrani: You haven't answered my question, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001BC8"
msgid "Nor should I have to. A single slate, which I might add, is likely fabricated, is not enough to prove anything."
msgstr "그럴 필요도 없다. 슬레이트 하나만으로는 아무것도 증명할 수 없어. 조작되었을 가능성도 높지 않나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Mujeen's Computer] There is also evidence on his computer that backs up the slate. &&& Qisrani: Is that so, Mujeen? Or do you deny the words you yourself wrote? &&& Mujeen: I absolutely deny it! My computer has obviously been tampered with. This is clearly not enough evidence to even consider me a suspect.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: And of course, the kicker. Qisrani's would be assassin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001BC7"
msgid "Oh, you didn't know? We have piles of evidence. Ship departure records, signatures, the works."
msgstr "아, 모르셨어요? 우리에겐 증거가 산더미처럼 있거든요. 선박 출발 기록, 서명, 모든 게 다 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Security has identified him as Ochim Ka'dic.  &&& Tevina: That's your ward, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC6"
msgid "In fact, if I were you, Envoy, I would think long and hard about submitting to the guard peacefully."
msgstr "실은, 제가 사절님이었다면, 순순히 경비대원에게 투항할지 진지하게 생각해 봤을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Mujeen
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Hmph. I will cooperate, but this is by no means an admission. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC5"
msgid "Given the severity of your crimes, the Captain has the authority to do it by force."
msgstr "범죄의 심각성을 고려하면, 경비대장에겐 무력을 행사할 권한이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I absolutely deny it! My computer has obviously been tampered with. This is clearly not enough evidence to even consider me a suspect. &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: Security has identified him as Ochim Ka'dic.  &&& Tevina: That's your ward, Mujeen. &&& Qisrani: In fact, if I were you, Envoy, I would think long and hard about submitting to the guard peacefully.|Given the severity of your crimes, the Captain has the authority to do it by force.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC4"
msgid "Hmph. I will cooperate, but this is by no means an admission."
msgstr "흠. 협조하지. 하지만 이건 결코 범행을 인정하는 게 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: VeryAngry
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Make all the threats you want, Envoy. My decision is made. Guard, take him away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC3"
msgid "And make no mistake, the three of you will pay for this insult."
msgstr "그리고 명심해라. 너희 셋은 날 모욕한 대가를 치르게 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Make all the threats you want, Envoy. My decision is made. Guard, take him away. &&& SecurityGuard02: As you command, Executor.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC2"
msgid "*Exhales*, I appreciate you backing me up on this one."
msgstr "*숨 내뱉는 소리* 이 일에 협조해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I must admit, I am a bit skeptical that House Ka'dic would be so ignorant of his dealings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC1"
msgid "Warden Veth'aal had brought some evidence linking Mujeen to the crime, but it's your evidence that makes me feel confident we can convict."
msgstr ""
"베타알 교정관으로부터 무진이 범죄에 연루되어 있다는 증거를 받았는데, 당신의 증거까지 총합하면 유죄 선고 가능성이 훨씬 높아질 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But I'm also not campaigning to conscript their soldiers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C39
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BC0"
msgid "And yes, I understand the reluctance with House Ma'leen. Their crimes go beyond forgiveness."
msgstr "그리고 맞네. 마린 가문을 용납해야 하나 망설이는 거 이해하네. 그 자들의 범죄는 용서받을 수 없는 수준이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C37
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BBF"
msgid "We need workers, healers, and engineers. People who can help rebuild Dazra, not tear it down."
msgstr "우리는 노동자, 치료사, 엔지니어가 필요하네. 다즈라를 무너뜨리는 게 아니라 재건하는 데 도움을 줄 수 있는 사람들 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B74
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BBE"
msgid "Reconciliation with the hardliners should be off the table, but we can find members within who are willing to abandon the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "강경파와 화해할지는 논외로 해야겠지만, 뱀의 성전을 포기할 의향이 있는 구성원들은 찾을 수 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen. |Clearly your ward was acting independently, in violation of your trust. &&& Tevina: WHAT!?!?! &&& Mujeen: Apology accepted. While I was not involved, it gives me no pleasure to have the culprit come from my own House.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: What do you mean? What revelations?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030C02
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BBD"
msgid "Ochim Ka'dic will have to answer for his crimes, of course. Provided we can find him."
msgstr "물론, 오킴 카딕은 범죄의 대가를 치러야 할 겁니다. 우리가 오킴을 찾을 수 있다면 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's nothing I have that would incriminate him.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BFA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BBC"
msgid "But if it's as robust as he claims, then it seems we have our supply thief."
msgstr "하지만 무진의 주장이 확실하다면, 물자 절도범을 잡은 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default, Mujeen, Tevina
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I think we can all agree that the charges for this crime are quite serious.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B68F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0104515B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BBB"
msgid "Thank you all for coming."
msgstr "모두 와주셔서 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01045132
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BB9"
msgid "I don't know what evidence you've gathered, but without anything concrete, it's your word against mine."
msgstr "어떤 증거를 수집했는지는 모르겠지만, 구체적인 증거가 없다면, 그건 너와 내가 말싸움하는 것일 뿐이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01045132
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BB8"
msgid "We shall see which one carries more weight."
msgstr "어느 쪽이 더 설득력이 있을지는 두고 봐야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Argue all you want. This only ends one way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BB7"
msgid "Why should I willingly confess and ensure my death? I'd much rather argue my case in front of my peers."
msgstr "내가 왜 순순히 자백해서 죽음을 자초하겠나? 차라리 내 동료들 앞에서 내 주장을 펼치겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Seems like you've been expecting me.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But before you proceed into that room, I must ask, do you have the proof you need? Is it solid?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF6B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001BB6"
msgid "That is a credit to you as an investigator."
msgstr "수사관으로서 훌륭하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRest_MujeenBlockerGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001BB4"
msgid "It's your word against mine. We shall see which one carries more weight."
msgstr "네 말과 내 말, 어느 쪽이 더 설득력이 있을지는 두고 봐야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Your inability to provide a legitimate excuse for denying them will only last so long.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B99"
msgid "This is foolish, Viktor. The High Council needs access to the power grid if we hope to restore the city."
msgstr "이건 바보짓이야, 빅토르. 도시를 복구하려면 대의회가 전력망에 접속해야 한다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: This is foolish, Viktor. The High Council needs access to the power grid if we hope to restore the city.  &&& Vitoria: Your inability to provide a legitimate excuse for denying them will only last so long.
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Personal matters? This is a Ministry of State matter, and I will handle it as I see fit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B97"
msgid "Vitoria is right. I know you're angry, but you can't let personal matters interfere with what may be best for everyone."
msgstr "비토리아 말이 맞아. 화난 건 알겠는데, 개인적인 문제 때문에 모두에게 최선이 될 일을 방해하면 안 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Genna
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Genna: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B96"
msgid "I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭 베타알을 찾고 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Personal matters? This is a Ministry of State matter, and I will handle it as I see fit.|He is a traitor. He turned his back, not only on his family, but on our people's entire belief system.|The fact that he still breathes is a stain upon the House Veth'aal name. &&& Vitoria: You would doom us all with your pride?
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B95"
msgid "I will do as I please as head of this House!"
msgstr "가문의 가주로서 내 뜻대로 할 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Genna: Sounds like Vaeric at least.
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104552B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B93"
msgid "Truth is, I haven't seen him for a few days myself."
msgstr "사실, 저도 그 사람 못 본 지 며칠 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104552B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B92"
msgid "But if you find him, tell him he better come check on his tab."
msgstr "혹시 찾으시면, 와서 외상값 좀 갚으라고 전해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Genna
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFGennaDubari
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104552B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Genna_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B91"
msgid "I know he's good for it, but since he gave Eggie permission to use it, it's sky high."
msgstr "알아서 잘 갚겠지만, 그 분이 에기 씨한테 외상 달아도 된다고 한 뒤로 외상값이 하늘을 찌를 듯이 늘어났어요."

