msgid "He's a regular here. Surely, you must know something."
msgstr "배릭은 여기 단골이었잖아요. 분명 뭔가 아시는 게 있을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: This is foolish, Viktor. The High Council needs access to the power grid if we hope to restore the city.  &&& Vitoria: Your inability to provide a legitimate excuse for denying them will only last so long. &&& Luther: Vitoria is right. I know you're angry, but you can't let personal matters interfere with what may be best for everyone.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B8C"
msgid "Personal matters? This is a Ministry of State matter, and I will handle it as I see fit."
msgstr "개인적인 문제라고? 이건 국무성 문제야. 그러니 내 생각대로 처리할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B8B"
msgid "He is a traitor. He turned his back, not only on his family, but on our people's entire belief system."
msgstr "그놈은 반역자라고. 자기 가족뿐만 아니라 우리 신민의 신념 체계 전체에 등을 돌린 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: You would doom us all with your pride?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01045533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B8A"
msgid "The fact that he still breathes is a stain upon the House Veth'aal name."
msgstr "그놈이 아직 살아 있다는 것만으로도 베타알 가문의 이름에 오점을 남기는 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
