msgid "I'm sorry. I really can't help you. Unless a drink might ease your troubles."
msgstr "죄송해요. 진짜로 못 도와드려요. 술 한잔이면 문제가 쉬워질지도 모르지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you know anyone else who might know where Vaeric is?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you know anyone else who might know where Vaeric is?
