msgctxt "001B4C"
msgid "Just tell me where I can find Tane."
msgstr "테인을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알려줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He must have trusted you with some information. &&& Egbo: Did he trust me? I just don't know anymore. &&& Egbo: Wait, wait. I think I remember something now. &&& Egbo: Tane. He mentioned talking to Tane one day about getting off-world, seeing the Settled Systems.|We never thought he was serious, and even if he wasn't, Tane still might know something.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your best bet is just sticking around.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B4B"
msgid "It's a good start. I'll try to find Tane."
msgstr "출발이 순조롭네. 테인을 찾아볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you sure you don't know where he is? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure you don't know where he is? 
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: He must have trusted you with some information.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B4A"
msgid "If I did, do you really think I'd be moping around here?"
msgstr "알았으면 내가 여기서 이렇게 넋 놓고 있었겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's a good start. I'll try to find Tane.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's a good start. I'll try to find Tane.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Egbo: Tane's a regular. I'm sure he'll be by any minute if you just want to take a seat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B49"
msgid "Your best bet is just sticking around."
msgstr "여기서 기다리면 확실히 찾을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should be supporting one another. &&& Egbo: Right? That's what we do. When we lost people to the so-called "incident" we banded together.  &&& Egbo: I just want Vaeric to show up so things can get back to normal... whatever that is.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If I did, do you really think I'd be moping around here? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B48"
msgid "Are you sure you don't know where he is?"
msgstr "배릭이 어디 있는지 정말 몰라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just tell me where I can find Tane.
#. ALIAS: Egbo
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Eggie_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B47"
msgid "Tane's a regular. I'm sure he'll be by any minute if you just want to take a seat."
msgstr "테인은 여기 단골이야. 잠깐 앉아서 기다리다 보면 금방 올 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Vaeric...
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B46"
msgid "I'm here looking for Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭 베타알을 찾고 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Acknowledging the name with a mix of sadness and frustration. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here looking for Vaeric Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B45"
msgid "Vaeric Veth'aal."
msgstr "배릭 베타알이라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Vaeric...
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not in the mood. Find someone else to question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B44"
msgid "Mind if I ask you a few questions?"
msgstr "몇 가지 질문 좀 해도 괜찮을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Mind if I ask you a few questions?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Mind if I ask you a few questions?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I respect your boundaries, but I really need your help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B43"
msgid "I'm not in the mood. Find someone else to question."
msgstr "그럴 기분 아니야. 질문하려면 다른 사람 찾아봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B42"
msgid "This railing is taken. And no, I'm not looking for company."
msgstr "이 자리는 맡아뒀어. 그리고 아니, 동료 같은 건 안 구해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Bianca: Heh, aren't we all? &&& Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?|I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B41"
msgid "I'm asking everyone, not just you."
msgstr "그쪽 뿐만 아니라 모든 사람들한테 다 물어보는 중이라서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm asking everyone, not just you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B40"
msgid "Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am."
msgstr "대단하네. 내가 얼마나 하찮은지 일깨워 주는 인간이 또 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Bianca: Heh, aren't we all? &&& Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?|I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's what we were led to believe, yes? Vaeric, Eggie, and Bee, "friends 'till the end"?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3F"
msgid "I heard you were friends."
msgstr "서로 친구 사이라고 들었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I heard you were friends.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I heard you were friends.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3E"
msgid "That's what we were led to believe, yes? Vaeric, Eggie, and Bee, \"friends 'till the end\"?"
msgstr "우리도 그렇게 믿었었지, 아마? 배릭, 에기, 비 까지, '세상 끝날까지 친구'라 했던가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I heard you were friends.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3D"
msgid "Heh. A foolish assumption."
msgstr "흥. 믿은 놈이 멍청이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3C"
msgid "I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found."
msgstr "아까 이해해 줘서 고마워. 어쩌면 뭔가 있었을지도 모르지만... 배릭은 누가 찾길 원하지 않는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you. &&& Bianca: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am. &&& Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?|I've searched all of Dazra for him, but he's gone. Couldn't even leave a note.|That means he either doesn't want to be found or... well, I prefer not to think about it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3B"
msgid "Surely you found out something while searching."
msgstr "찾아다니는 동안 분명 뭐라도 알아냈을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you. &&& Bianca: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am. &&& Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?|I've searched all of Dazra for him, but he's gone. Couldn't even leave a note.|That means he either doesn't want to be found or... well, I prefer not to think about it.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm. Perhaps the Great Serpent really does hear prayers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B3A"
msgid "Finding people is my speciality. All I need is a lead."
msgstr "사람 찾는 게 내 전문이야. 단서만 있으면 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Finding people is my speciality. All I need is a lead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Finding people is my speciality. All I need is a lead.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B39"
msgid "Hmm. Perhaps the Great Serpent really does hear prayers."
msgstr "흠. 위대한 뱀께서 정말 기도를 들어주신 건지도 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Finding people is my speciality. All I need is a lead.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B38"
msgid "All right, but only because I want to know he's okay."
msgstr "알았어. 배릭이 무사한지 알고 싶어서 말해주는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching. &&& Bianca: I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found.  &&& Bianca: All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe. &&& Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.|His name is Tane Salavea.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hard to say right now, but Tane's a regular. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B37"
msgid "Tell me where I can find this Tane Salavea."
msgstr "테인 샐라베아를 어디서 찾을 수 있는지 알려줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching. &&& Bianca: I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found.  &&& Bianca: All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe. &&& Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.|His name is Tane Salavea.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you can find Vaeric, you're welcome to it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B36"
msgid "I appreciate the information."
msgstr "정보 알려줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "I" as if to say "I of all people" and saying "heir apparent" as if in quotes. / Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Heh, aren't we all?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B35"
msgid "And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?"
msgstr "내가 그 가문 후계자를 알아야 할 이유는 뭔데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pause between statements. She thought they were best friends. "if you find him" is mostly to herself. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B34"
msgid "I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him."
msgstr "난 하찮은 놈이거든. 직접 물어봐. 찾아내면 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for Vaeric Veth'aal. &&& Bianca: Heh, aren't we all? &&& Bianca: And why should I know anything about the heir apparent?|I'm nobody. Ask him yourself. If you find him.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do I? Perhaps at one point, I thought I did.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B33"
msgid "From your tone, you know him better than you let on."
msgstr "말투를 보니, 생각보다 배릭을 잘 아는 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: From your tone, you know him better than you let on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: From your tone, you know him better than you let on.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B32"
msgid "Do I? Perhaps at one point, I thought I did."
msgstr "그래? 나도 한때는 그런 줄 알았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B31"
msgid "Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?"
msgstr "배릭... 한때는 뗄 수 없는 사이였는데... 어떻게 됐게?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B30"
msgid "I've searched all of Dazra for him, but he's gone. Couldn't even leave a note."
msgstr "그놈 찾으려고 온 다즈라를 다 뒤졌는데, 못 찾았어. 쪽지 하나 안 남겼다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B2F"
msgid "That means he either doesn't want to be found or... well, I prefer not to think about it."
msgstr "그 말은 누가 자기를 찾아내길 원하지 않거나, 아니면... 음, 괜한 생각은 하기 싫네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm asking everyone, not just you. &&& Bianca: Great. Another person reminding me how unimportant I am. &&& Bianca: Vaeric. One day we're inseparable... and the next?|I've searched all of Dazra for him, but he's gone. Couldn't even leave a note.|That means he either doesn't want to be found or... well, I prefer not to think about it.
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course I asked around. I even asked people I didn't know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B2E"
msgid "Did you ask around, too? Or just look?"
msgstr "주변 사람들한테도 물어본 건가? 아니면 그냥 찾아보기만 한 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you ask around, too? Or just look?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ask around, too? Or just look?
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B2D"
msgid "Of course I asked around. I even asked people I didn't know."
msgstr "당연히 물어보고 다녔지. 생판 남들한테까지 물어봤다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Surely you found out something while searching.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bianca: I appreciate your understanding earlier, and maybe I did... but I just don't think he wants to be found. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bianca: I never found out where he is, but I know someone who might.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 010454CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_QuestioningScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B2C"
msgid "All right fine. But I'm only telling you this because I want him to be safe."
msgstr "그래, 알았어. 배릭이 안전하길 바라니까 말해주는 줄 알라고."

