msgctxt "001B17"
msgid "Well, that was certainly an exciting show. And what a twist ending!"
msgstr "정말 흥미진진한 쇼였어. 게다가 반전의 연속이었고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01045677
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B16"
msgid "You know, hard as it is to believe, I will miss him. Orahim was fun to have around, back when he was not a self-righteous bore."
msgstr "있지, 믿기 어렵겠지만 난 놈이 그리울 거야. 오라힘이 저런 독선적인 행세를 하기 전엔 재미있었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just stay out of my way. 
