#. TOPIC: 01045677
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_KhaslavEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B15"
msgid "And as much as I am sure he tried to convince you otherwise, I am a man of my word. Your credits."
msgstr "그리고 계속 놈이 널 설득하려고 했던 건 알고 있지만, 난 말하면 지키는 자야. 자, 크레딧이다."

