#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: So, Accursed, you and Orahim... you've slaughtered my brethren in the name of what, exactly?   &&& Orahim: Enough, Khaslav! You will speak to me only! 
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104566C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B06"
msgid "Hoooo! It seems to me that Orahim is afraid of what I may say! Terrified, petrified of me revealing his true nature to you, Accursed!"
msgstr "호오! 오라힘은 내가 무슨 말을 꺼낼까 두려운가 보네! 저놈이 숨기려 했던 본성을 너에게 까발릴까봐 말이지! 저주받은 자!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104566C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B05"
msgid "I am sure he went on and on about how evil I am, how it was I that forced him to commit horrible atrocities. Whatever those may be."
msgstr ""
"안 봐도 뻔해. 내가 사악하다고, 그 끔찍한 만행들을 저지르게 만든 게 바로 나였다고 구구절절 떠들어댔겠지. 그 '만행'이라는 게 정확히 "
"뭔지는 몰라도 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMKhaslav
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Orahim has been up front about his past. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104566C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B04"
msgid "All of it, merely a deflection. Orahim was the most brutal out of all of us, he had a lust for blood that was legendary. Oh, I wish you could have seen him in his prime."
msgstr ""
"전부 다 발뺌하려고 지껄이는 소리지. 오라힘 녀석, 우리 중에서 제일 잔혹했다고. 피의 욕망에 빠진 그 모습은 참 전설적이었지. 오, "
"전성기 시절 녀석의 모습을 네게 보여줄 수만 있다면 참 좋을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Orahim! Oh, how great of you to visit! It has been far, far too long! &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: So, Accursed, you and Orahim... you've slaughtered my brethren in the name of what, exactly?   &&& Orahim: Enough, Khaslav! You will speak to me only!  &&& Khaslav: Hoooo! It seems to me that Orahim is afraid of what I may say! Terrified, petrified of me revealing his true nature to you, Accursed!|I am sure he went on and on about how evil I am, how it was I that forced him to commit horrible atrocities. Whatever those may be.|All of it, merely a deflection. Orahim was the most brutal out of all of us, he had a lust for blood that was legendary. Oh, I wish you could have seen him in his prime.
#. ALIAS: Khaslav
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To you, the slaughter of countless accursed is mere "gossip?" Oh, I am in danger of growing fond of you. You are such a fun little pet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104566B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B03"
msgid "I don't care about any gossip. I'm here because I'm getting paid."
msgstr "험담 따위 관심 없어. 나야 돈이나 받으려고 있는 것뿐이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Khaslav: Orahim! Oh, how great of you to visit! It has been far, far too long! &&& ...  &&& Khaslav: So, Accursed, you and Orahim... you've slaughtered my brethren in the name of what, exactly?   &&& Orahim: Enough, Khaslav! You will speak to me only!  &&& Khaslav: Hoooo! It seems to me that Orahim is afraid of what I may say! Terrified, petrified of me revealing his true nature to you, Accursed!|I am sure he went on and on about how evil I am, how it was I that forced him to commit horrible atrocities. Whatever those may be.|All of it, merely a deflection. Orahim was the most brutal out of all of us, he had a lust for blood that was legendary. Oh, I wish you could have seen him in his prime.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh? I never knew honesty to be one of Orahim's virtues. I remember many times he would lie to win over the trust of an accursed before stabbing them in the back. Literally!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01045669
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_05_KhaslavConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B02"
msgid "Orahim has been up front about his past."
msgstr "오라힘은 이미 솔직하게 과거에 대해 털어놨는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041260
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B01"
msgid "Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone."
msgstr ""
"카슬라프와 그 녀석의 광신도 무리는 바룬카이에 피신해 있지. 내가 방심했을 때를 틈타 나를 찾아올 거다. 그리고 혼자서는 놈들에게 맞설 "
"수 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041260
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001B00"
msgid "Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance."
msgstr "그래서 너와 내가 선제공격을 해서 전부 없애버려야 한다. 함께 하면 성공 가능성이 더 높겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll do it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041260
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AFF"
msgid "With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew."
msgstr ""
"우리의 손에 카슬라프와 광신도 무리가 먼지가 되면, 다즈라 신민들도 내가 진정으로 갱생했다는 걸 알게 되겠지. 마침내 새 삶을 시작할 수 "
"있는 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456D4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AFD"
msgid "Your actions have left Dazra in shambles. House Va'ruun exists without an heir, and the city is in tatters."
msgstr "네 행동으로 다즈라는 엉망이 됐어. 바룬 가문은 후계자 없이 존재하고, 도시는 엉망진창이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456D4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AFC"
msgid "We welcomed you into Dazra, and you have burned it all to the ground. But you cannot escape the Great Serpent's vengeance."
msgstr "우리는 너를 다즈라로 받아들였는데, 넌 모든 걸 잿더미로 만들었어. 하지만 넌 위대한 뱀의 복수에서 벗어날 수 없어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have to fight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456DE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AFB"
msgid "Do you have anything to say for yourself before we turn you to dust?"
msgstr "우리가 널 먼지로 만들기 전에 할 말 있나?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have to fight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456DE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AFA"
msgid "Speak your last words before we make you Penitent."
msgstr "우리가 회개자로 만들기 전에 마지막 말을 해라."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: You play the role of a mouse, but we see the tiger's fangs. You will not fool us again.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456D1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF9"
msgid "Face the wrath of the Great Serpent, and rue the day you turned your back on Dazra!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 분노를 직면하고, 다즈라를 배신한 날을 후회해라!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: You play the role of a mouse, but we see the tiger's fangs. You will not fool us again.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010456D1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF8"
msgid "In death, you will know the consequences for crossing the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "죽음 속에서, 위대한 뱀을 거스른 대가를 알게 될 것이다!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer. &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can try to play the fool, but we know who you are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF7"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr "무슨 말인지 모르겠군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer. &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We know of your betrayal and your cowardice. And such acts deserve retribution.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF6"
msgid "If you know who I am, you should know what I'm capable of."
msgstr "내가 누군지 안다면, 내가 뭘 할 수 있는지도 알아야 할 텐데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingRefused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF5"
msgid "If you will not answer us, then you will die!"
msgstr "대답하지 않으면, 죽을 것이다!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer. &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you shall get your wish.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF4"
msgid "Let's just get on with it."
msgstr "그냥 빨리 끝내자."

#. PROMPT: Let's just get on with it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just get on with it.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF3"
msgid "Then you shall get your wish."
msgstr "그럼 네 소원대로 해주지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer. &&& HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You play the role of a mouse, but we see the tiger's fangs. You will not fool us again.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF2"
msgid "We don't have to fight."
msgstr "우린 싸울 필요 없어."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_Hailing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF1"
msgid "We have traveled long and far to find you, betrayer."
msgstr "배신자, 널 찾기 위해 길고 먼 길을 여행했다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AF0"
msgid "Answer the hail, coward."
msgstr "교신에 응답해라, 겁쟁아."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AEF"
msgid "Face your executioner, traitor."
msgstr "네 사형 집행인을 대면해라, 배신자."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_Hailing
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_HailRandomList
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AEE"
msgid "You will answer the hail and then you will die."
msgstr "교신에 응답하면 죽여주마."

#. PROMPT: If you know who I am, you should know what I'm capable of.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you know who I am, you should know what I'm capable of.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AED"
msgid "We know of your betrayal and your cowardice. And such acts deserve retribution."
msgstr "우리는 네 배신과 비겁함을 알고 있다. 그리고 그런 행동은 응징을 받아 마땅하지."

#. PROMPT: I don't know what you're talking about.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know what you're talking about.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AEC"
msgid "You can try to play the fool, but we know who you are."
msgstr "바보인 척할 수 있지만, 우리는 네가 누군지 안다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. PROMPT: We don't have to fight.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We don't have to fight.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_Player_VaruunAttack
#. TOPIC: 010456BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunAttack_HailingAccepted
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AEB"
msgid "You play the role of a mouse, but we see the tiger's fangs. You will not fool us again."
msgstr "쥐처럼 굴지만, 우리는 호랑이의 송곳니를 보고 있다. 더 이상 우리를 속일 수 없어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: Oh, I wouldn't ask you to give any more time than you've already offered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01041130
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuestNewWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AC4"
msgid "Will you be needing my services again?"
msgstr "또 도와드려야 할 일이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will you be needing my services again?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104112F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuestNewWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AC3"
msgid "Oh, I wouldn't ask you to give any more time than you've already offered."
msgstr "아, 이미 충분히 도와주셨으니 더 이상 시간을 내달라고 부탁드리지는 않겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104112F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuestNewWork
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AC2"
msgid "Part of being a good delegate is spreading out the work! We are all working as a team."
msgstr "좋은 대리인이 되려면 업무를 적절히 분배할 줄도 알아야겠죠! 우리는 다 같이 한 팀으로 일하는 거니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001AC1"
msgid "Once things get settled, I am going to look into constructing a new orphanage. One on far tamer land."
msgstr "일단 상황이 안정되면, 새 고아원을 지을 생각이에요. 훨씬 더 안전한 땅에 지으려고요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001AC0"
msgid "Thank you again for removing that phantom. I know now the Serpent brought you here for a reason."
msgstr "유령을 없애 주셔서 다시 한번 감사드립니다. 이제 위대한 뱀께서 왜 당신을 이곳으로 보내셨는지 알 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001ABF"
msgid "Whoever caused these vortex phantoms to occur, bad things should happen to them. Very bad things."
msgstr "누가 볼텍스 유령들을 만들어낸 원흉인진 모르겠지만, 천벌을 받아 마땅해요. 아주 끔찍한 천벌요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "001ABE"
msgid "I feel a weight off my shoulders, but there is still much work to do. For one, I need to tell Vassilis' mother her son is not a Herald. Just an apprentice! How shameful."
msgstr ""
"마음이 한결 가벼워졌지만, 아직 할 일이 많네요. 우선, 바실리스의 어머니에게 아들 분은 전령이 아니라 그저 연습생일 뿐이라고 "
"말해드려야겠어요. 정말 부끄러운 일이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: Your inability to provide a legitimate excuse for denying them will only last so long. &&& Luther: Vitoria is right. I know you're angry, but you can't let personal matters interfere with what may be best for everyone. &&& Viktor: Personal matters? This is a Ministry of State matter, and I will handle it as I see fit.|He is a traitor. He turned his back, not only on his family, but on our people's entire belief system.|The fact that he still breathes is a stain upon the House Veth'aal name.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I will do as I please as head of this House!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041092
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0100_ViktorPreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ABC"
msgid "You would doom us all with your pride?"
msgstr "자존심 때문에 우리 모두를 파멸시킬거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Another High Council lackey come begging. I told Lovek, "No more!"
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ABB"
msgid "I was sent by the High Council to get your cooperation."
msgstr "대의회에서 협조를 구하라고 해서 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: Of course. I'm well practiced in a lot of things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041090
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001ABA"
msgid "Will you answer the question? Are you well practiced in discretion or not?"
msgstr "질문에 대답해 주겠나? 신중한 편인가? 없는 편인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late. 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: I recall he spoke of a newly anointed Promised. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB8"
msgid "Viktor. This is Anasko's chosen. You recall Lovek sent word."
msgstr "빅토르. 아나스코 님이 선택하신 분이셔. 로벡이 전한 말이 있었잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& Viktor: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Viktor. This is Anasko's chosen. You recall Lovek sent word.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB7"
msgid "Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late."
msgstr "오라버니를 용서해 주세요. 요즘 예의범절을 잊고 살거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Hello to you, too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Hello to you, too.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB6"
msgid "Truly you are a heretic with no regard for respect."
msgstr "정말 예의라곤 하나도 모르는 이단자로구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was sent by the High Council to get your cooperation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was sent by the High Council to get your cooperation.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB5"
msgid "Another High Council lackey come begging. I told Lovek, \"No more!\""
msgstr "대의회의 졸개가 또 구걸하러 온 건가? 로벡에게 '그만'이라고 했을 텐데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Luther
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: Viktor. This is Anasko's chosen. You recall Lovek sent word. &&& Viktor: I recall he spoke of a newly anointed Promised. |And we do not need help. Especially from an outsider. &&& Luther: You can't continue to refuse the Council. You must act. |Your inaction is killing you.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041085
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB4"
msgid "Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this."
msgstr "맞는 말이야. 그러니까 나도 어쩔 수 없이 말해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you are Anasko's chosen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041089
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB3"
msgid "Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 인도하시길. 저는 선구자 <Alias=MQ04Player>입니다. 어떻게든 도움을 드리려 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Slight emphasis on "you". Sizing up the player. / Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Is this not the opportunity you have been looking for, brother? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041088
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB2"
msgid "So you are Anasko's chosen."
msgstr "그래, 아나스코 님이 선택하신 자인가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: So you are Anasko's chosen.  &&& Vitoria: Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late.  &&& Vitoria: Viktor. This is Anasko's chosen. You recall Lovek sent word.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB1"
msgid "I recall he spoke of a newly anointed Promised."
msgstr "새로 기름 부음 받았다는 약속받은 자 얘기였지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: You can't continue to refuse the Council. You must act. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041087
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AB0"
msgid "And we do not need help. Especially from an outsider."
msgstr "우린 도움이 필요 없고 말이야. 특히 이방인의 도움은 더 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Forgive my brother. He has been forgetting his manners of late.  &&& Vitoria: Viktor. This is Anasko's chosen. You recall Lovek sent word. &&& Viktor: I recall he spoke of a newly anointed Promised. |And we do not need help. Especially from an outsider.
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041086
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAF"
msgid "You can't continue to refuse the Council. You must act."
msgstr "계속 대의회의 요청을 거부할 순 없어. 뭐라도 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sympathetic, worried / Worried / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Luther
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLutherVethaal
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041086
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAE"
msgid "Your inaction is killing you."
msgstr "가만히 있으면 죽을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: As I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Truly you are a heretic with no regard for respect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104108D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAD"
msgid "Hello to you, too."
msgstr "저도 만나서 참 반갑군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041084
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAC"
msgid "My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council."
msgstr "제 조카 배릭이 집을 나갔어요. 그 애가 안 돌아오면 빅토르는 대의회를 돕지 않을 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this. &&& Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council. &&& Viktor: These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041083
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAB"
msgid "I don't see how these situations are connected."
msgstr "이 상황이 어떻게 연관된다는 건지 잘 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: I recall he spoke of a newly anointed Promised. |And we do not need help. Especially from an outsider. &&& Luther: You can't continue to refuse the Council. You must act. |Your inaction is killing you. &&& Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this. &&& Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041081
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AAA"
msgid "These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!"
msgstr "이방인 귀에 들어갈 얘기가 아니잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't see how these situations are connected.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041082
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA9"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "당연히 모르겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Serpent guide you. I am Harbinger <Alias=MQ04Player>, here to assist however I can. &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: Precisely. Which is why he leaves me no choice but to say this. &&& Vitoria: My nephew, Vaeric, has left. And until he returns, Viktor refuses to assist the Council. &&& Viktor: These are hardly matters for the ears of an outsider!
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You have no idea what you speak of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041080
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA8"
msgid "That sounds like a poor excuse not to help the High Council."
msgstr "대의회를 돕지 않으려고 변명하는 것처럼 들리는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That sounds like a poor excuse not to help the High Council.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That sounds like a poor excuse not to help the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA7"
msgid "You have no idea what you speak of."
msgstr "자기가 무슨 말을 지껄이는지 전혀 모르는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on the first "You" / Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: Of course not.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA6"
msgid "You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House."
msgstr "너는 이방인이다. 우리 가문을 전혀 이해하지 못할 테지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Worse? Have you seen Dazra? How can "things" get any worse?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA5"
msgid "The situation will only get worse if you do nothing."
msgstr "아무 행동도 하지 않으면 상황은 더 악화될 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The situation will only get worse if you do nothing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The situation will only get worse if you do nothing.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Is this not the opportunity you have been looking for, brother? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA4"
msgid "Worse? Have you seen Dazra? How can \"things\" get any worse?"
msgstr "악화된다고? 다즈라를 보긴 했나? 어떻게 '행동'하면 더 나빠질 수 있다는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The audacity... I should have you arrested.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA3"
msgid "I know you're expected to be a leader and you're acting like a child."
msgstr "장로님이 지도자가 되고 싶어 하면서 행동은 어린애처럼 한다는 건 알겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calm anger, through gritted teeth.  / Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know you're expected to be a leader and you're acting like a child.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know you're expected to be a leader and you're acting like a child.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Is this not the opportunity you have been looking for, brother? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104107A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA2"
msgid "The audacity... I should have you arrested."
msgstr "이 시건방진... 여기서 체포해 버리겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't see how these situations are connected. &&& Viktor: Of course not. &&& Viktor: You are an outsider. You have no understanding of our House.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: Is this not the opportunity you have been looking for, brother? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041079
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA1"
msgid "You're right. I don't. But I'm here to help, so let me."
msgstr "맞아요. 못 합니다. 그래도 도와주러 왔으니까 맡겨 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Interrupting Viktor to distract him from his anger. Trying to prevent a scene. / Question / to Viktor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand more than you know. I'm the discreet third party you've been looking for. &&& Viktor: Hm. It is a rare moment when prayers are so specifically answered, but it is not for me to question His will.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041077
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001AA0"
msgid "Is this not the opportunity you have been looking for, brother?"
msgstr "이게 바로 오라버니가 찾고 있던 기회 아니야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Viktor
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Luther: Yes, you said so yourself: someone with no loyalties to speak of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041077
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A9F"
msgid "A third party capable of finding Vaeric."
