#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A7E"
msgid "Vaeric is your son. You could make an exception."
msgstr "배릭은 장로님의 아들이잖아요. 예외로 할 수도 있을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. PROMPT: If it's the law, it's the law. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& Viktor: And showing leniency for a House member at a time like this when order is needed most would be unwise.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: You act as if death is the only answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041057
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A7D"
msgid "Heh, \"the law.\" Our work is not so simple and you know it."
msgstr "허. '법'이라고? 우리 일이 그렇게 간단하지 않다는 거 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Grief can often cloud our judgement.  &&& Viktor: This is not grief. This is betrayal. Not only to me, but to our society and the Great Serpent Himself. &&& Viktor: I do not wish Vaeric dead, but as head of the Ministry of State, he left me no choice. |All Must Serve. Those who refuse will be met with death.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Our duty as wardens is to keep the populace tasked and loyal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041059
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A7C"
msgid "What does the Ministry of State have to do with it?"
msgstr "국무성은 이번 일과 어떻게 엮여있는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Viktor
#. PROMPT: Vaeric is your son. You could make an exception.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric is your son. You could make an exception. &&& Viktor: Exceptions show weakness, and we cannot afford to show weakness at a time like this.
#. ALIAS: Vitoria
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: You act as if death is the only answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041056
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A7B"
msgid "We have done the same for less."
msgstr "더 사소한 일에도 예외가 있었잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: I will not risk the Ministry's authority on the actions of my own son, even if he is my chosen heir.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041054
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A7A"
msgid "If the High Council wants my cooperation, I need you to find Vaeric and carry out his sentence."
msgstr "대의회가 내 협조를 받으려면, 먼저 네가 배릭을 찾아내서 형을 집행해야 할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason. &&& Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it. &&& Viktor: Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death.|Only then will I grant access to the power grid.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See that you get it done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041051
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A77"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "한번 알아보도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the law, it's the law.  &&& ...  &&& Vitoria: And I would ask that you spare him. |My brother is acting under impulse, not reason. &&& Viktor: I have never been more clear.|Speak against me one more time and you will regret it. &&& Viktor: Vaeric has a signet ring with House Veth'aal's family crest. Bring it to me as proof of death.|Only then will I grant access to the power grid.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is nothing ridiculous about our customs, and I suggest you embrace them as one of the Promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A75"
msgid "This is ridiculous."
msgstr "웃기는 짓이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: I commend you for your faith.|A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A73"
msgid "I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest."
msgstr "우선은 전령의 안식처에 있는 고객들에게 물어보는 게 좋을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A72"
msgid "Some of Vaeric's associates there may know where he went."
msgstr "거기 있는 배릭의 친구 중에 위치를 아는 녀석이 있을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll see to it any accomplices are executed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 0104104A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A71"
msgid "But keep in mind, anyone who has directly aided him in hiding is an accomplice and shares his fate."
msgstr "하지만 명심해라. 배릭이 숨을 수 있게 직접 도와준 자는 누구든 공범이고, 배릭과 운명을 같이해야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done. &&& Viktor: I commend you for your faith.|A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son. &&& Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. |Some of Vaeric's associates there may know where he went.|But keep in mind, anyone who has directly aided him in hiding is an accomplice and shares his fate.
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If they were, they will pay the price.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041047
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A70"
msgid "Hopefully, no one was stupid enough to help him."
msgstr "배릭을 도와줄 만큼 멍청한 사람이 없었으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Vitoria
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Viktor: And showing leniency for a House member at a time like this when order is needed most would be unwise. &&& Vitoria: Heh, "the law." Our work is not so simple and you know it. &&& Vitoria: You act as if death is the only answer.|What about forgiveness? 
#. ALIAS: Viktor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMViktorVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Viktor: If the High Council wants my cooperation, I need you to find Vaeric and carry out his sentence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041044
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A6F"
msgid "I will not risk the Ministry's authority on the actions of my own son, even if he is my chosen heir."
msgstr "내 아들의 행동 때문에 국무성의 위신을 위태롭게 할 순 없어. 내가 선택한 후계자더라도 마찬가지다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If it's the will of the Serpent, it will be done. &&& Viktor: I commend you for your faith.|A sad day indeed when an outsider is more devout than my own son. &&& Viktor: I recommend you start by speaking to patrons of the Herald's Rest. |Some of Vaeric's associates there may know where he went.|But keep in mind, anyone who has directly aided him in hiding is an accomplice and shares his fate.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ04
#. TOPIC: 01041049
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ04_0200_ViktorIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A6D"
msgid "I'll see to it any accomplices are executed."
msgstr "공범이 있다면 반드시 처형하도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire. &&& Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city. &&& Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.|And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help.|What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They lead more sedentary lives. Which means they're more likely to be stuck in their homes, in need of help but having no way to get it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041118
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A6C"
msgid "Why the elderly and infirm?"
msgstr "왜 노약자들이 괜찮은지 확인해야 하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why the elderly and infirm?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why the elderly and infirm?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041117
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A6B"
msgid "They lead more sedentary lives. Which means they're more likely to be stuck in their homes, in need of help but having no way to get it."
msgstr ""
"대부분 거동이 불편하기 때문이죠. 그 말은 곧, 도움은 절실한데 밖으로 알릴 방법도 없이 집에 꼼짝달싹 못 하고 갇혀 있을 가능성이 "
"크다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire. &&& Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city. &&& Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.|And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help.|What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is not the way a healer approaches life. It's not the way anyone should. Please reconsider.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041116
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A6A"
msgid "Leave them. It's survival of the fittest."
msgstr "내버려 두죠. 적자생존의 시대잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Leave them. It's survival of the fittest.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Leave them. It's survival of the fittest.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041115
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A69"
msgid "That is not the way a healer approaches life. It's not the way anyone should. Please reconsider."
msgstr "치료사는 목숨을 그런 식으로 대하지 않습니다. 그 누구라도 그래선 안 되죠. 다시 생각해 보세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Oh, hello. Have we met before?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I remember things when I need to. Not everything needs to be, right?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041114
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A68"
msgid "Do you not remember either way?"
msgstr "기억나는 게 아무것도 없나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you not remember either way?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you not remember either way?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: That's a difficult question to answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041113
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A67"
msgid "I remember things when I need to. Not everything needs to be, right?"
msgstr "기억해야 하는 거면 기억하지. 전부 다 기억할 필요는 없어. 그렇지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: What is that, a music box? Huh, I don't remember owning that. I wonder if it even works.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hm, good point. In a safe for safekeeping, right?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041112
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A66"
msgid "If you kept it hidden away, it must've been important."
msgstr "고이 모셔둔 물건이니, 분명 중요한 물건인 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you kept it hidden away, it must've been important.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you kept it hidden away, it must've been important.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041111
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A65"
msgid "Hm, good point. In a safe for safekeeping, right?"
msgstr "흠, 맞는 말이구나. 소중하니 보관해 두려고 창고에 넣어뒀겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you kept it hidden away, it must've been important.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041111
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A64"
msgid "Maybe if I heard it play, I might recall something. Could you maybe give it a try?"
msgstr "음악을 들으면 뭔가 기억이 떠오를지도 모르겠구나. 한 번 해 주겠니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's fine. &&& Vassilis: Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts.|I suppose I was just being paranoid. &&& Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.|But the difference hardly matters. Loss is loss, no matter the form. &&& Vassilis: In any case, thank you for doing this for me. I'm sure your visit helped him, if only for a moment.|Also, if you don't mind, can you come back in a day or two? I will have more work for you then.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I most certainly will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 01041110
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A63"
msgid "If you have more work, I'll come back later."
msgstr "일거리가 더 있다면, 나중에 돌아오겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you have more work, I'll come back later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you have more work, I'll come back later.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A62"
msgid "I most certainly will."
msgstr "분명 일거리가 더 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you have more work, I'll come back later.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Regardless, even if our paths do not cross again, Jinan bless you for your assistance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A61"
msgid "Dazra's problems are many, but its character continues to shine through in people like yourself."
msgstr "다즈라에 문제는 많지만 당신과 같은 분들이 있어서 밝게 빛날 수 있는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's fine. &&& Vassilis: Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts.|I suppose I was just being paranoid. &&& Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.|But the difference hardly matters. Loss is loss, no matter the form. &&& Vassilis: In any case, thank you for doing this for me. I'm sure your visit helped him, if only for a moment.|Also, if you don't mind, can you come back in a day or two? I will have more work for you then.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course! Of course! Working with you is a privilege! So no pressure, just letting you know I may have something for you later.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A60"
msgid "I can't make any promises."
msgstr "장담은 못 하겠는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't make any promises.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't make any promises.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Regardless, even if our paths do not cross again, Jinan bless you for your assistance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5F"
msgid "Of course! Of course! Working with you is a privilege! So no pressure, just letting you know I may have something for you later."
msgstr ""
"물론이죠! 물론이죠! 당신과 함께 일하는 것 자체가 특권이니까요! 압박을 느끼실 필요는 없습니다. 그냥 나중에 일거리가 있을지도 모른다는 "
"걸 알려드린 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's fine. &&& Vassilis: Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts.|I suppose I was just being paranoid. &&& Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.|But the difference hardly matters. Loss is loss, no matter the form. &&& Vassilis: In any case, thank you for doing this for me. I'm sure your visit helped him, if only for a moment.|Also, if you don't mind, can you come back in a day or two? I will have more work for you then.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, no, no, no, of course not! Your time is valuable! But if you're in the area and feel like helping out, don't be a stranger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5E"
msgid "I'm not your errand person."
msgstr "전 당신 심부름꾼이 아닙니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not your errand person.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not your errand person.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Regardless, even if our paths do not cross again, Jinan bless you for your assistance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5D"
msgid "No, no, no, no, of course not! Your time is valuable! But if you're in the area and feel like helping out, don't be a stranger."
msgstr ""
"네, 네, 네, 전혀 아니죠! 당신의 시간은 소중하니까요! 다만 이 근처에 계속 머무실 거고, 도우실 생각이 드신다면, 남일처럼 굴지 "
"말아 달라는 겁니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: I most certainly will.|Dazra's problems are many, but its character continues to shine through in people like yourself.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0104110A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5C"
msgid "Regardless, even if our paths do not cross again, Jinan bless you for your assistance."
msgstr "비록 우리가 다신 만나지 못하더라도, 당신이 도와준 일을 보시고 지난께서 축복해 주시길 바라겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sunday. &&& Vassilis: Already? By the Heralds, you're right. Which means time is at a premium. &&& Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.|Or I was, until the cataclysm took out much of the city and half the people with it.|Now I'm part healer, caretaker, worrier, the list goes on and on.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and serve at a capacity beyond that which we are capable of.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5B"
msgid "All Must Serve, especially in these times."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 합니다. 특히 이런 때엔 더더욱요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All Must Serve, especially in these times.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All Must Serve, especially in these times.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A5A"
msgid "Yes, and serve at a capacity beyond that which we are capable of."
msgstr "맞아요. 우리는 자기가 감당할 수 있는 수준 이상으로 책임을 다해 섬겨야만 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why has your role changed?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: I imagine it's trial by fire.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A59"
msgid "We're stretched thin and wound tight. I feel like the skin on a balloon! I am hoping you can help let the air out."
msgstr ""
"지금 우린 여유도 없고 다들 예민해져 있어요. 마치 터지기 일보 직전인 풍선처럼요! 당신이 그 꽉 찬 공기를 빼는 걸 도와줬으면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on. &&& Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy. &&& Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done. &&& Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have ended so many innocent lives. Many times in ways I refuse to speak of. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041266
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A58"
msgid "What exactly did you do?"
msgstr "대체 무슨 짓을 했는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly did you do? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What exactly did you do? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A57"
msgid "I have ended so many innocent lives. Many times in ways I refuse to speak of."
msgstr "무고한 생명을 많이 끝장냈지. 여러 번, 입에 담기도 힘든 방식으로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly did you do? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A56"
msgid "And every time, Khaslav was there. Laughing. Cheering."
msgstr "그때마다 카슬라프가 옆에 서 있었지. 웃으면서. 응원하면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly did you do? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A55"
msgid "I realize now that it was not the Great Serpent I sought approval from. But of him. To think I have done such horrible things to be accepted by a wicked man like him... it sickens me."
msgstr ""
"이제야 알겠어. 내가 인정받고 싶어 했던 존재는 위대한 뱀이 아니라, 바로 카슬라프였어. 그런 사악한 인간에게 인정받겠다고 끔찍한 짓들을 "
"저질렀다니… 아직도 역겹군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What exactly did you do? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041265
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A54"
msgid "And yet, for reasons I do not understand, I viewed him as my brother for most of my life. Sometimes I still think of him in that way."
msgstr "그런데도, 이유는 모르겠지만… 살면서 계속 카슬라프를 형제처럼 여겼어. 아직도 가끔 그렇게 느낄 때가 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on. &&& Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy. &&& Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done. &&& Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041264
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A53"
msgid "We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt."
msgstr "우리는 과거를 바꿀 수 없어. 앞으로 나아가야만 해. 죄책감이 있든 없든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A52"
msgid "It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 간단한 게 아니라고. 다즈라 신민들은 나를 믿지 않아. 난 추방당했고, 이 오두막에서 평생을 보내야 해. 결국 카슬라프가 나를 "
"찾아올 때까지 기다리면서..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041263
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A51"
msgid "There is only one way to truly move on."
msgstr "진정으로 앞으로 나아갈 수 있는 방법은 하나뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on. &&& Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy. &&& Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done. &&& Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What good would that do? That would not bring anyone back, or change the past.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041262
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A50"
msgid "I should end you right now."
msgstr "지금 당장 너를 죽여야겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I should end you right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I should end you right now.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041261
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4F"
msgid "What good would that do? That would not bring anyone back, or change the past."
msgstr "그게 무슨 소용이 있지? 그래 봐야 죽은 사람은 돌아오지 못해. 과거도 바뀌지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I should end you right now.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041261
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4E"
msgid "If you are so hungry to kill a Zealot, there is much bigger game than myself out there."
msgstr "광신도를 정녕 죽이고 싶다면, 나보다 더 큰 사냥감이 있단 걸 알려 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt.  &&& Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on. &&& Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.|Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance.|With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. I will not force you, but I cannot do this alone. If you change your mind, I hope you do so quickly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4D"
msgid "No way. I'm not going into a lion's den with you."
msgstr "절대 안 해. 그런 사자 굴에 너랑 같이 가진 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No way. I'm not going into a lion's den with you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way. I'm not going into a lion's den with you.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4C"
msgid "Fine. I will not force you, but I cannot do this alone. If you change your mind, I hope you do so quickly."
msgstr "좋다. 강요하지 않겠다. 하지만 나 혼자서는 이 일을 할 수 없어. 마음을 바꾸겠다면, 제발 빨리 바꿔줬으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No way. I'm not going into a lion's den with you.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4B"
msgid "I will wait here until either you or Khaslav come calling."
msgstr "네가, 아니면 카슬라프가 올 때까지 이곳에서 기다릴 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt.  &&& Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on. &&& Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.|Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance.|With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have many spoils leftover from my life as a Zealot. I am capable of paying you very handsomely if you do this with me -- if we survive, of course.  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A4A"
msgid "What's in it for me?"
msgstr "그러면 나한테 무슨 이득이 있는데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt.  &&& Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on. &&& Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.|Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance.|With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course I am desperate! And I am selfish, is it so wrong to be? Am I supposed to just wither and die as a hermit in this sloffing shack? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A49"
msgid "Do you think that will clean your conscience? This reeks of selfishness and desperation."
msgstr "그런다고 양심의 가책을 안 느낄 것 같아? 이기적으로 발악하는 것 같기만 한데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's in it for me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's in it for me?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: I'll do it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A48"
msgid "I have many spoils leftover from my life as a Zealot. I am capable of paying you very handsomely if you do this with me -- if we survive, of course."
msgstr ""
"광신도 시절에 돈을 많이 모아뒀어. 나를 도와 일을 해 준다면 보상은 후하게 쳐 줄 수 있어. 먼저 우리 둘이 살아남아야 하겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you think that will clean your conscience? This reeks of selfishness and desperation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think that will clean your conscience? This reeks of selfishness and desperation.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A47"
msgid "Of course I am desperate! And I am selfish, is it so wrong to be? Am I supposed to just wither and die as a hermit in this sloffing shack?"
msgstr "당연히 발악하는 거지! 이기적이고. 그래서 뭐 잘못됐나? 그냥 은둔자마냥 이 허물진 오두막에서 옹졸하게 살다 죽으라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you think that will clean your conscience? This reeks of selfishness and desperation.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: I'll do it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104125A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A46"
msgid "Maybe that's all I deserve, but that is not what I want! I refuse to go back to what I was, and I will do whatever it takes if it means I can start living again."
msgstr ""
"내가 당해도 싼 놈일지도 모르지만, 난 그렇게 되기 싫다고! 예전의 나로 돌아가긴 싫어. 새 삶을 살 수만 있다면 무슨 짓이든 할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt.  &&& Orahim: It is not as simple as that. The people of Dazra do not trust me. I am exiled, doomed to spend the rest of my life in this shack, waiting for Khaslav to eventually come for me.|There is only one way to truly move on. &&& Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.|Which is why you and I will strike first, and wipe them out. Together we may stand a chance.|With Khaslav and his Zealots made dust by our hands, the people of Dazra will see that I truly am reformed, and I can finally begin my life anew.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good! Yes, you are doing a good thing. We both are. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041259
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A45"
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr "그렇게 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll do it. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll do it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041258
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A44"
msgid "Good! Yes, you are doing a good thing. We both are."
msgstr "잘 됐군! 좋아. 선택 잘한 거다. 누이 좋고 매부 좋은 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll do it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041258
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A43"
msgid "Now, meet me at this location as soon as you're able. Be prepared for a fight."
msgstr "이제, 가능한 한 빨리 이곳으로 돌아와. 전투 준비 단단히 해 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041257
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A42"
msgid "Finally, it is done. With Khaslav dead, the people of Dazra should finally see that I am a Zealot no more. My ties to that life have been well and truly severed."
msgstr ""
"드디어, 끝났군. 카슬라프가 죽었으니 이제 다즈라 신민들도 내가 광신도가 아니라는 걸 알겠지. 정말로 과거의 멍에에서 해방된 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: Finally, it is done. With Khaslav dead, the people of Dazra should finally see that I am a Zealot no more. My ties to that life have been well and truly severed. |I promised you payment. Here, take this. It is a key to a deposit in my shack. It is yours, all of it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. Really, thank you for everything. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041256
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A40"
msgid "Good luck, Orahim."
msgstr "행운을 빌게. 오라힘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good luck, Orahim.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good luck, Orahim.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041255
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3F"
msgid "Thank you. Really, thank you for everything."
msgstr "고마워. 정말로, 전부 다 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good luck, Orahim.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041255
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3E"
msgid "Go on now. I will stay here for a time to think and meditate."
msgstr "이제 가 봐. 난 여기 남아서 잠시 묵상을 해야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good luck, Orahim.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I changed my mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041255
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3D"
msgid "Hopefully I will see you in Dazra."
msgstr "나중에 다즈라에서 만나자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just stay away from me from now on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just stay away from me from now on.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041253
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3C"
msgid "Hmmph, if that is how you wish things to be."
msgstr "흐음. 원한다면, 그렇게 해주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just stay away from me from now on.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041253
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3B"
msgid "Now, you can go. I will stay here and medidate for a time. Thank you for your help."
msgstr "이제, 가도 좋아. 난 여기 남아서 잠시 묵상을 해야겠군. 도와줘서 고맙다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just stay away from me from now on.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Forget it. Just get away from me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041253
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A3A"
msgid "I hope that, perhaps one day, we can be friends."
msgstr "언젠가 이걸로, 서로 친구가 될 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: Finally, it is done. With Khaslav dead, the people of Dazra should finally see that I am a Zealot no more. My ties to that life have been well and truly severed. |I promised you payment. Here, take this. It is a key to a deposit in my shack. It is yours, all of it. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I want you to think very carefully about what you are about to do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041252
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A39"
msgid "Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either."
msgstr "너도 여길 떠날 자격이 없는 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041251
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A38"
msgid "I want you to think very carefully about what you are about to do."
msgstr "네가 지금 뭘 하려는 건지, 아주 신중하게 생각하는 게 좋을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041251
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A37"
msgid "After everything we've been through, I feel that I've proven myself enough. In fact, I am showing great restraint now. But if you make a move against me, I will not go down without a fight."
msgstr ""
"그동안 함께 싸우면서 내가 갱생했다는 걸 충분히 보여 준 것 같은데. 사실, 나도 꾹 참고 있어. 하지만 혹시라도 날 공격할 생각이라면 "
"절대 가만 있지 않을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nevermind. I wasn't thinking clearly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041251
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A36"
msgid "Not after everything we just did."
msgstr "지금껏 우리 함께 여기까지 왔는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: Finally, it is done. With Khaslav dead, the people of Dazra should finally see that I am a Zealot no more. My ties to that life have been well and truly severed. |I promised you payment. Here, take this. It is a key to a deposit in my shack. It is yours, all of it. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmph, if that is how you wish things to be. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01041254
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A35"
msgid "Just stay away from me from now on."
msgstr "이제 내 앞에 얼씬거리지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: Finally, it is done. With Khaslav dead, the people of Dazra should finally see that I am a Zealot no more. My ties to that life have been well and truly severed. |I promised you payment. Here, take this. It is a key to a deposit in my shack. It is yours, all of it. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Unfortunate. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104124F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A34"
msgid "[Attack] It has to be this way."
msgstr "[공격] 어쩔 수가 없군. 이렇게 할 수밖에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] It has to be this way. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] It has to be this way. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104124E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A33"
msgid "Unfortunate."
msgstr "안타깝게 됐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I changed my mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I changed my mind.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A32"
msgid "Good. I will not hold this against you. I am glad you made a wise decision."
msgstr "좋아. 원한을 품지도 않도록 하지. 올바른 선택을 내려서 다행이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I changed my mind.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0111F767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A31"
msgid "Now go. I will stay here and meditate for a while. I thank you for your help."
msgstr "이제 떠나라. 잠시 여기 남아서 묵상을 해야겠군. 도와줘서 고맙다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe you shouldn't be allowed to leave here, either. &&& Orahim: I want you to think very carefully about what you are about to do.|After everything we've been through, I feel that I've proven myself enough. In fact, I am showing great restraint now. But if you make a move against me, I will not go down without a fight. |Not after everything we just did. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. I will not hold this against you. I am glad you made a wise decision. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0104124D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_07_OrahimEnding
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A30"
msgid "Nevermind. I wasn't thinking clearly."
msgstr "내가 한 말 잊어. 그냥 뱉은 말이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Am I supposed to believe that you're somehow reformed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Am I supposed to believe that you're somehow reformed?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A2F"
msgid "I understand your suspicion. I am probably the only one of my kind. \"Reformed Zealots\" simply do not exist."
msgstr "의심하는 건 이해해.. 나 같은 인간은 어딜 봐도 없을 테니. '갱생한 광신도'라는 건 존재할 수가 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Am I supposed to believe that you're somehow reformed?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Go on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A2E"
msgid "And yet, here I am."
msgstr "하지만, 내가 그런 인간이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Three months isn't long enough for a Zealot to change.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Three months isn't long enough for a Zealot to change.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A2D"
msgid "Well, how long is it supposed to take? If I had given that life up five years ago, would it make a difference to you?"
msgstr "그럼 얼마나 지나야 되는데? 그런 삶을 5년 전에 관뒀다고 말했으면, 다르게 받아들일 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Go on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A2C"
msgid "I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad."
msgstr "이렇게 담담하게 반응할 줄은 몰랐는데. 이게 기분이 좋아야 할지 나빠야 할지 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Go on.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A2B"
msgid "My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy."
msgstr "내 새로운 삶은... 비록 짧았지만, 쉽지 않았다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: They are haunting the old orphanage. Until recently it was a refuge for lost children, but had closed down due to a lack of volunteers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041106
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A29"
msgid "What can you tell me about this phantom?"
msgstr "유령에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about this phantom?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041105
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A28"
msgid "They are haunting the old orphanage. Until recently it was a refuge for lost children, but had closed down due to a lack of volunteers."
msgstr ""
"유령들은 오래된 고아원에 나타난다고 합니다. 최근까지도 부모를 잃은 아이들을 위한 피난처로 쓰였지만, 자원봉사자가 부족해서 문을 닫았죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about this phantom? &&& Vassilis: They are haunting the old orphanage. Until recently it was a refuge for lost children, but had closed down due to a lack of volunteers.|In the past few weeks there have been rumors of people squatting there, and using the building as housing.|Given its history, it doesn't surprise me that a wayward soul would go back there, if they sought to be found.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041104
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A27"
msgid "A wayward soul? Surely we should not give such merciful terms to this... thing!"
msgstr "길 잃은 영혼이라고요? 그런... 끔찍한 걸 그렇게 자비로운 표현을 붙여서 불러서는 안 돼요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01041104
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_025_TL_VassilisEstate
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A26"
msgid "It haunts the orphanage and is a clear danger to anyone who may have been inside!"
msgstr "유령이 고아원에 나타나고 있어요! 고아원 안에 사람들이 있는지는 모르겠지만 분명 위험하다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos_Quest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001A25"
msgid "I came to the hospital in hopes the Herald's prayer could exorcise this thing."
msgstr "제가 병원에 온 건 전령님의 기도로 그 끔찍한 걸 퇴마할 수 있을까 싶어서예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010ADAA9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_AntoniaHellos_Quest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001A24"
msgid "I worry about the damage this phantom could cause."
msgstr "유령이 피해를 일으킬까 봐 걱정돼요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: In Dazra, violence is a part of life, starting from the day we are asked to sacrifice our groats. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407CB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Backstory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A0E"
msgid "What made you want to be a Herald?"
msgstr "왜 전령이 되고 싶으셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you feel you've done enough to become a Herald?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A0D"
msgid "Maybe. I knew this trial would force me to grow as a healer, but I didn't anticipate the WAY it would."
msgstr "아마도요. 이 시련이 저를 치료사로 성장시켜 줄 거라 생각하긴 했지만, 설마 이런 식일 줄은 예상하지 못했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: You showed me I can heal others by connecting people, not just through medicine. So, in that sense, yes, I feel I have learned much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A0C"
msgid "I haven't changed at all in terms of my healing skill, or knowledge of prayer, but that isn't the only way to heal people!"
msgstr ""
"치료 기술이나 기도 전례 관련 지식이 늘거나 하진 않았지만, 신민들을 치료하는 방법이 꼭 그런 것만 있는 게 아니라는 걸 알았죠!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040795
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A0B"
msgid "I heard my granddaughter singing the other day. It was faint, but it was definitely her."
msgstr "며칠 전에 손녀가 노래하는 소리를 들었어. 희미했지만, 분명히 손녀의 목소리였단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, she's still alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040795
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A0A"
msgid "Does this mean she's still alive?"
msgstr "그럼 아직 애가 살아 있다는 뜻이니?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: Maybe. I knew this trial would force me to grow as a healer, but I didn't anticipate the WAY it would.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A09"
msgid "Do you feel you've done enough to become a Herald?"
msgstr "전령이 될 만큼 충분히 노력했다고 생각하시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, she's still alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, she's still alive.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Reigen: But if she is alive, that is more hope than I had before.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040792
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A08"
msgid "That is good news. However, I am troubled by the fact she can't visit me in person."
msgstr "좋은 소식이구나. 하지만, 손녀가 직접 날 찾아올 수 없다는 사실이 안타깝구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Reigen: I heard my granddaughter singing the other day. It was faint, but it was definitely her.|Does this mean she's still alive?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is good news. However, I am troubled by the fact she can't visit me in person.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040793
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A07"
msgid "Yes, she's still alive."
msgstr "네, 아직 살아 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Reigen: I heard my granddaughter singing the other day. It was faint, but it was definitely her.|Does this mean she's still alive?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do you mean to say she isn't here? How strange...  I could hear her so clearly, as if she were standing right next to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A06"
msgid "She's a vortex phantom, caught between realities."
msgstr "손녀는 볼텍스 유령이 됐습니다. 현실 사이에 갇혀버렸죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She passed, but she's at peace now. I'm sorry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She passed, but she's at peace now. I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040790
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A05"
msgid "I don't understand. She was just here, singing... I could hear it. How could she have passed?"
msgstr "이해가 안 되는구나. 방금 그 아이가 여기서 노래를 했는데... 들을 수 있었어. 그런데 어떻게 죽었을 수가 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She's in a purgatory worse than hell.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's in a purgatory worse than hell.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Reigen: But if she is alive, that is more hope than I had before.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A04"
msgid "That sounds terrible... but yet she was singing so sweetly? Almost as if she were content."
msgstr "그런 끔찍한 일을 겪었다니... 그런데도 마치 만족한 듯이 그렇게 감미롭게 노래하고 있었단 말이구나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Reigen: I heard my granddaughter singing the other day. It was faint, but it was definitely her.|Does this mean she's still alive?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That sounds terrible... but yet she was singing so sweetly? Almost as if she were content.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A03"
msgid "She's in a purgatory worse than hell."
msgstr "손녀 분은 지옥보다 더한 연옥에 갇혀 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Reigen: I heard my granddaughter singing the other day. It was faint, but it was definitely her.|Does this mean she's still alive?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't understand. She was just here, singing... I could hear it. How could she have passed?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01040791
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A02"
msgid "She passed, but she's at peace now. I'm sorry."
msgstr "손녀 분은 세상을 떠났지만, 이제 평안히 쉬고 있습니다. 유감입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What made you want to be a Herald?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Backstory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A01"
msgid "In Dazra, violence is a part of life, starting from the day we are asked to sacrifice our groats."
msgstr "다즈라에서는 폭력이 삶의 일부입니다. 그로트를 희생시켜야 하는 성인식 날부터 시작되죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Backstory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001A00"
msgid "So much of our service is dedicated to bloodshed, and I grew tired of it."
msgstr "우리가 하는 일은 피가 낭자한 경우가 많죠. 그게 신물이 났습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Backstory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019FF"
msgid "I wanted to perform miracles of a different kind. But I don't know if I am capable of such things."
msgstr "저는 다른 종류의 기적을 행하고 싶었습니다. 하지만 제가 그런 일을 할 수 있을지는 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Vassilis: Maybe. I knew this trial would force me to grow as a healer, but I didn't anticipate the WAY it would.|I haven't changed at all in terms of my healing skill, or knowledge of prayer, but that isn't the only way to heal people!
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 010407C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019FE"
msgid "You showed me I can heal others by connecting people, not just through medicine. So, in that sense, yes, I feel I have learned much."
msgstr ""
"당신 덕분에 신민들을 이어주는 것도 훌륭한 치료 방법이 될 수 있다는 걸 깨달았습니다. 의술만 치료가 가능한 게 아닌 거죠. 그런 "
"의미에서, 정말 많은 걸 배운 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: She's a vortex phantom, caught between realities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: She's a vortex phantom, caught between realities.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Reigen: But if she is alive, that is more hope than I had before.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019FD"
msgid "Do you mean to say she isn't here? How strange...  I could hear her so clearly, as if she were standing right next to me."
msgstr "그 아이는 이곳에 없다고 말하는 거니? 이상하구나... 손녀가 바로 내 옆에 서 있는 것처럼 목소리가 아주 또렷이 들렸는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Z03_Reigen: That is good news. However, I am troubled by the fact she can't visit me in person.
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019FA"
msgid "But if she is alive, that is more hope than I had before."
msgstr "하지만 손녀가 살아 있다면, 전보다 더 큰 희망을 품을 수 있겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Z03_Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0104078B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Reigen_Greeting_SavedIris
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019F9"
msgid "Perhaps if I sing to her, the way she does for me, I can find her again."
msgstr "아마 손녀가 내게 노래를 불러주던 것처럼, 내가 아이에게 노래를 불러 줘서 다시 그 애를 찾을 수 있을지도 모르겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0019F8"
msgid "Thank you for your help, but I would like to be alone now."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙네. 하지만 이제 혼자 있고 싶구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0019F7"
msgid "My poor Iris..."
msgstr "내 불쌍한 아이리스..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Music from music box / Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0019F6"
msgid "*Humming*"
msgstr "*흥얼거림*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0019F5"
msgid "Maybe if I keep singing, my Iris can find her way home."
msgstr "계속 노래를 부르면, 내 아이리스가 집으로 돌아오는 길을 찾을 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0019F4"
msgid "Thank you for your company. Having visitors makes me want to clean up more."
msgstr "함께해 줘서 고맙구나. 손님이 오니 더 청소하고 싶은 마음이 든단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019F3"
msgid "Best of luck to you. To all of us."
msgstr "행운을 빕니다. 우리 모두의 행운을요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019F2"
msgid "Let me know if there's anything I can help you with."
msgstr "도움이 필요한 부분이 있으시면 언제든지 말씀해 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019F1"
msgid "Serpent be with you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 함께 하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019F0"
msgid "Jinan guide your steps."
msgstr "지난께서 그대의 발걸음을 인도하시길."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenUeda_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019EF"
msgid "Now where was I?"
msgstr "내가 어디까지 했더라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_010_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019EE"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr "실례합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_ReigenUeda_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0019ED"
msgid "I'd help, but I'm a little lost at the moment."
msgstr "도와주고 싶지만, 지금은 내 머리가 온전치 못하구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019EC"
msgid "Thank you again for helping me with Reigen."
msgstr "레이겐 씨 일을 도와주셔서 다시 한번 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019EB"
msgid "Your assistance with the phantom was much appreciated. I thank Jinan for being blessed with your acquaintance."
msgstr "유령 일을 도와주셔서 정말 고맙습니다. 당신을 만나게 해주신 지난님의 은총에 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019EA"
msgid "I feel so overwhelmed, but I can't afford to be. Now is not the time."
msgstr "너무 힘겹지만, 지쳐할 여유도 없어요. 지금은 쉴 때가 아니니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019E9"
msgid "Many thanks for your assistance. We need every spare hand, spare brain, spare foot!"
msgstr "도와주셔서 정말 감사합니다. 지금 저희한테는 일손, 일머리, 발품을 팔아주실 분들이 필요합니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019E8"
msgid "I can be a bit talkative. Manic, even. Apologies in advance!"
msgstr "제가 말이 좀 많을 수도 있습니다. 가끔은 정신없을 정도로요. 미리 사과드릴게요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0019E7"
msgid "There's a lot that needs to be done. So much sometimes it can be paralyzing."
msgstr "해야 할 일이 너무 많습니다. 너무 많아서 어떨 때는 아무것도 할 수 없을 지경입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VassilisVoyiatzi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0019E6"
msgid "You got interrupted... maybe by the wind? I'm sure there's a good reason you're not saying anything."
msgstr "말이 끊겼네요... 바람 때문인가? 당신이 아무 말도 하지 않는 데는 그럴 만한 이유가 있을 거라고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VassilisVoyiatzi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0019E5"
msgid "Hello? Are you still there?"
msgstr "여보세요? 아직 거기 계세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_VassilisVoyiatzi_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0019E4"
msgid "Um... anyone in there? There are people I need to get to, so if we could continue..."
msgstr "음... 안에 계세요? 제가 가 봐야 할 사람들이 있어서, 계속할 수 있으면 좋겠는데요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: But I did see them go in. They had cards that let them open the door.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Concerned
