msgstr "알겠어, 그렇게까지 중요하다면 앉도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We can't change the past. It's time to move on, guilt or no guilt. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019C0"
msgid "When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side."
msgstr ""
"셀 수 없이 많은 유령들... 그것도 자신의 손으로 끔찍하게 죽인 인간들의 유령에 시달리는 때가 되면, 저승에서 무엇이 기다리고 있을지 "
"걱정되기 시작하는 법이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really live like this?  &&& Orahim: Sure. Not much of a home, but I have no alternatives at the moment. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By the Serpent, I have a lot of problems. Just sit down so we may have a proper conversation like normal people. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_02_OrahimShackPT1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019BF"
msgid "What the hell is your problem? You've been acting weird ever since I met you."
msgstr "도대체 뭐가 문제인데 그래? 처음 만났을 때부터 이상하게 행동했잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You really live like this? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You really live like this? 
