#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_02_OrahimShackPT1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019BE"
msgid "Sure. Not much of a home, but I have no alternatives at the moment."
msgstr "그래. 집이라 부를 만한 곳은 아니지만, 지금은 달리 갈 데가 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, I've killed a lot of people and I feel fine. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, I've killed a lot of people and I feel fine. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019BD"
msgid "I envy that, I really do. I wish to feel numb, free of guilt, but something will not let me. Something that did not exist a few months ago."
msgstr ""
"부럽군. 정말로. 나도 무감각해지고 싶다. 죄책감에서 벗어나고 싶단 말이야. 그런데 마음속 뭔가가 날 놓아주지 않아. 몇 달 전까진 그런 "
"게 없었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, I've killed a lot of people and I feel fine. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Khaslav and his Zealots have taken refuge on Va'ruun'kai. They will come for me in time, when I least suspect it, and I will not stand a chance against them alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019BC"
msgid "But, as you seem to have no qualms with bloodshed, perhaps I can make use of your killer instinct."
msgstr "피 흘리는 일에 거리낌이 없으시다면, 그 살인 본능을 좀 이용해 볼 수도 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've never heard that name before.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019BB"
msgid "Many people who heard that name do not live long enough to hear it again."
msgstr "이제껏 그 이름을 듣고 나서 오래 산 인간은 거의 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: I am not very accustomed to having discussions, at least not yet. I used to simply give demands, orders... ultimatums. And old habits die hard. |Tell me, does the name "Khaslav" mean anything to you?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can tell by your eyes that you do not know who that is.
