msgid "Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it."
msgstr ""
"카슬라프는 다즈라 신민들에겐 광신도로 알려진 인간이지. 잔인하고, 가학적인 놈이야. 폭력을 너무나도 좋아해서 뱀의 성전에 대한 헌신조차 "
"잊은 지 오래다. 이젠 단지 즐기려고 살인을 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019B5"
msgid "And I was his right-hand man."
msgstr "그리고 나는 그 인간의 오른팔이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019B4"
msgid "Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back."
msgstr "석 달 전, 광신도로 살지 않기로 결심했어. 다시는 돌아가지 않겠다고 다짐했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What the hell is your problem? You've been acting weird ever since I met you. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What the hell is your problem? You've been acting weird ever since I met you. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Look, I'm not a people person, either, but you're making this awkward. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_02_OrahimShackPT1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019B3"
msgid "By the Serpent, I have a lot of problems. Just sit down so we may have a proper conversation like normal people."
msgstr "뱀이시여. 그러잖아도 골칫거리가 많다고. 그냥 좀 앉아봐. 우리 평범하게 대화 좀 하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm ready. Let's do this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm ready. Let's do this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019B2"
msgid "One thing: Khaslav will want to talk before he tries to kill us. He has always been... theatrical. Like a predator playing with its food. Do not listen to his lies."
msgstr ""
"한 가지 더. 카슬라프는 우릴 죽이기 전에 대화 좀 하자고 할 거야. 카슬라프는 항상... 극적인 연출을 좋아했으니까. 먹잇감을 갖고 "
"노는 포식 동물처럼 말이야. 놈의 거짓말에 귀를 기울이지 마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm ready. Let's do this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019B0"
msgid "The time has come. Let us spill some blood."
msgstr "때가 되었군. 놈들 피를 뿌려주자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: This is the place. Are you ready? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very well, but hurry. This is not a good position to be in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AF"
msgid "I'm not ready yet. I'll be back."
msgstr "아직 준비가 안 됐어. 곧 돌아올게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AE"
msgid "I am not very accustomed to having discussions, at least not yet. I used to simply give demands, orders... ultimatums. And old habits die hard."
msgstr ""
"이런 식으로 얘기하는 게 아직 익숙하지가 않아. 예전엔 그냥 명령이나 지시나... 최후통첩 같은 말만 했으니까. 옛날 버릇이 쉽게 "
"사라지진 않더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've never heard that name before.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AD"
msgid "Tell me, does the name \"Khaslav\" mean anything to you?"
msgstr "혹시, '카슬라프'라는 인간에 대해 아나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm ready. Let's do this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AC"
msgid "This is the place. Are you ready?"
msgstr "다 왔다. 준비는 됐나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& ...  &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back.  &&& companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works.  &&& Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I understand your suspicion. I am probably the only one of my kind. "Reformed Zealots" simply do not exist. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AB"
msgid "Am I supposed to believe that you're somehow reformed?"
msgstr "그럼 지금 나보고 네가 갱생했다는 말을 믿으라는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Go on. &&& Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy. &&& Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done. &&& Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I envy that, I really do. I wish to feel numb, free of guilt, but something will not let me. Something that did not exist a few months ago.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019AA"
msgid "Well, I've killed a lot of people and I feel fine."
msgstr "흠, 나도 인간은 많이 죽여 봤지만 기분은 멀쩡하던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: This is the place. Are you ready? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: One thing: Khaslav will want to talk before he tries to kill us. He has always been... theatrical. Like a predator playing with its food. Do not listen to his lies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A9"
msgid "I'm ready. Let's do this."
msgstr "준비됐어. 시작하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, I'm standing. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, I'm standing. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_02_OrahimShackPT1
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A8"
msgid "Fine. Sit, stand, do a sloffing cartwheel, I do not care. I will forego the pleasantries."
msgstr "좋아. 앉아 있든, 서 있든, 허물지게 재주넘기를 하든 상관 없어. 인삿말은 이 정도만 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not ready yet. I'll be back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not ready yet. I'll be back.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_04_OrahimHideoutEntrance
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A7"
msgid "Very well, but hurry. This is not a good position to be in."
msgstr "알겠어. 빨리하고 와. 여긴 머무르기 좋은 곳은 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& ...  &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back.  &&& companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works.  &&& Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You deserve to know who you are speaking to, and it is no secret. The people of Dazra refuse to speak to me due to my past, and who can blame them? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A6"
msgid "Why are you telling me this?"
msgstr "왜 나한테 이런 말을 하는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& ...  &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back.  &&& companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works.  &&& Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A5"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "계속 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& ...  &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back.  &&& companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works.  &&& Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, how long is it supposed to take? If I had given that life up five years ago, would it make a difference to you? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A4"
msgid "Three months isn't long enough for a Zealot to change."
msgstr "석 달은 광신도 일을 깨끗이 씻었다고 보기엔 너무 이른데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you telling me this? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you telling me this? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A3"
msgid "You deserve to know who you are speaking to, and it is no secret. The people of Dazra refuse to speak to me due to my past, and who can blame them?"
msgstr ""
"지금 누구하고 떠드는지는 알아야 하잖아. 숨길 일도 아니니까. 게다가 다즈라 인간들은 내 과거 때문에 나하고 말도 안 한다고. 뭐, 그 "
"인간들을 탓할 순 없잖아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you telling me this? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Go on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A2"
msgid "As painful as it is, I do understand them. But I hope to one day earn their trust."
msgstr "괴롭지만… 다즈라 사람들 마음은 이해해. 그래도 언젠가는 사람들이 날 믿어줬으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I knew something was wrong with you. I'm leaving.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I knew something was wrong with you. I'm leaving.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A1"
msgid "Wait, wait, just stay a bit longer."
msgstr "잠깐. 잠깐. 내 말 좀 더 들어 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I knew something was wrong with you. I'm leaving.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0019A0"
msgid "I do not blame you for reacting that way. You are right, there is plenty wrong with me, but I assure you I am not the same man I was."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 반응해도 할 말 없군. 네 말대로 난 문제 많은 인간이니까. 하지만 분명히 말할 수 있어. 난 더 이상 예전의 내가 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: I was not expecting such a muted response. I do not know if that makes me feel good or bad.|My new life, as short as it has been, has not been easy.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: When you become haunted by the ghosts of countless dead -- people who have died violently by your hand -- you begin to worry about what awaits you on the other side. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199F"
msgid "All I want is a new start. To forget who I was... what I have done."
msgstr "나는 새 출발을 원할 뿐이야. 내가 누구였는지… 무슨 일을 했는지, 전부 잊고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never heard that name before. &&& ...  &&& Orahim: Khaslav is what those in Dazra would refer to as a Zealot. A brutal, sadistic one at that. His love of violence has eclipsed any supposed dedication to the Serpent's Crusade. He kills simply because he enjoys it.|And I was his right-hand man.|Three months ago, I gave up that life, swearing to never go back.  &&& companion: A Zealot does not give up that life. That is not how it works.  &&& Orahim: I am not a threat to anyone. Be quiet, and do not act like you know me. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wait, wait, just stay a bit longer. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040BD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_03_OrahimShackPT2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199E"
msgid "I knew something was wrong with you. I'm leaving."
msgstr "역시 뭔가 이상하다 싶더라니. 이만 가겠어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Lost, alone, amidst a dream's whispers. A voice, sings, for our trapped world unheard.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Worms in your ears would be hard to forget.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010407B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199D"
msgid "That's a very catchy song. Hard to forget, like an earworm."
msgstr "참 인상적인 노래네. 뇌리에 박히는구나. 중독적인 유행가처럼..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Worms in your ears would be hard to forget.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, I plan on sticking around for awhile, but okay, deal. If something were to happen and we forget each other, we'll play this song to remember.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010407AF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199C"
msgid "I'm just saying, if I heard it, I would remember this day. Remember us. So would you, I think."
msgstr "이 노래를 들으면, 아마 오늘 일이 기억날 것 같구나. 우리가 함께 있었던 시간이 기억날 게다. 너도 그러겠구나."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, I plan on sticking around for awhile, but okay, deal. If something were to happen and we forget each other, we'll play this song to remember.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010407AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199B"
msgid "Deal."
msgstr "그렇게 하자꾸나."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): That's a very catchy song. Hard to forget, like an earworm.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'm just saying, if I heard it, I would remember this day. Remember us. So would you, I think.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010407B0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00199A"
msgid "Worms in your ears would be hard to forget."
msgstr "중독적인 유행가는 잊기 어렵죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'm just saying, if I heard it, I would remember this day. Remember us. So would you, I think.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Deal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 010407AE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_AudioLogs_Scene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001999"
msgid "Well, I plan on sticking around for awhile, but okay, deal. If something were to happen and we forget each other, we'll play this song to remember."
msgstr ""
"어, 당분간 여기 머물 거지만요. 좋아요. 그럼 이렇게 해요. 만약 우리에게 무슨 일이 생겨서 서로를 잊어버리게 되면, 이 노래를 "
"연주해서 다시 기억을 떠올리는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A78
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001992"
msgid "That is understandable, given the cataclysm. We can rebuild the orphanage elsewhere, but that is a problem of stone and mortar."
msgstr ""
"대재난을 겪었으니 그럴 만도 하죠. 고아원 건물은 다른 곳에 새로 세우면 그만이에요. 벽돌이나 시멘트만 있으면 해결되는 문제니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Anything new to report? Were you able to remove the phantom? &&& Breanne: Oh please, I hope you bring good news!
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is understandable, given the cataclysm. We can rebuild the orphanage elsewhere, but that is a problem of stone and mortar.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001991"
msgid "The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape."
msgstr "유령은 없어졌지만, 고아원의 상태가 많이 안 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I took care of the phantom.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I took care of the phantom. &&& Breanne: You did? Serpent's tail, bless you!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: Strange, that sounds an awful lot like an excuse. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A77
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001990"
msgid "I'm grateful you were able to handle this situation. With the city in turmoil, I'm more or less anchored to this spot."
msgstr "문제를 해결하셨다니 참 다행입니다. 도시가 곤란한 상황이라 저는 여기 묶여 있다시피 하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You won't be bothered any further.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You won't be bothered any further. &&& Breanne: Thank you! By the Serpent's fang, thank you and Vassilis!
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: Oh don't worry, Vassilis, I'm well aware who did the lion's share of the work. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A76
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198F"
msgid "All the credit goes to them. I merely pointed the way."
msgstr "다 저분 덕분이죠. 저는 고아원 위치를 알려 줬을 뿐이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape. &&& Breanne: That is understandable, given the cataclysm. We can rebuild the orphanage elsewhere, but that is a problem of stone and mortar.|What matters is that you removed the phantom.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: You could show a little more commitment, Vassilis, but that is a conversation for me and your mother.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A75
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198E"
msgid "Indeed. The city will be rebuilt in time. We are committed to this as a people."
msgstr "그렇습니다. 도시는 머지않아 재건될 거예요. 신민들 모두가 재건에 온 힘을 쏟고 있으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Here. In appreciation for your assistance.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A71
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198D"
msgid "There's still much to do, but I feel confident with volunteers like yourself, we are trending in the right direction."
msgstr "아직 갈 길이 멀기는 하지만, 당신처럼 도와주시는 분이 계시니 참 든든합니다. 앞으로 일이 다 잘 풀릴 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: The phantom has been removed, but the orphanage is in pretty bad shape.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: That is understandable, given the cataclysm. We can rebuild the orphanage elsewhere, but that is a problem of stone and mortar.|What matters is that you removed the phantom. &&& Vassilis: Indeed. The city will be rebuilt in time. We are committed to this as a people.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A72
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198C"
msgid "You could show a little more commitment, Vassilis, but that is a conversation for me and your mother."
msgstr "좀 더 성의를 보여줘도 될 텐데요. 바실리스. 뭐, 그런 식의 대화는 저나 당신 어머니가 주로 하는 거긴 하지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Vassilis
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: It is my top priority, I assure you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198B"
msgid "You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with!"
msgstr "거기에 사람을 보내야 한다니까요! 그 유령을 얼른 처리해야 해요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Breanne
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with!
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00198A"
msgid "It is my top priority, I assure you."
msgstr "저희도 최우선 사안으로 다루고는 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Breanne
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Well, um, technically, I'm still an apprentice. |But what you speak of is akin to an exorcism, and we know little about how these phantoms exist in our world.|Even a fully trained Herald may not be equipped to deal with this phenomenon. &&& Breanne: By Jinan's word! Has the Great Serpent left us with nothing to defend ourselves? This is an ill omen indeed.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: You see! All is not lost! My friend here may be just the person we need.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001989"
msgid "You must keep the faith, and in doing so, the reward will come."
msgstr "믿음을 굳건히 지켜야 합니다. 그리하면 보상이 따를 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& ...  &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage! &&& Vassilis: A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case.|From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem. &&& Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless your arrival!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407BC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001987"
msgid "I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours."
msgstr "유령은 전에도 처리해 봤습니다. 제가 해결할 수 있을 거 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: I took care of the phantom.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You did? Serpent's tail, bless you! &&& Vassilis: I'm grateful you were able to handle this situation. With the city in turmoil, I'm more or less anchored to this spot.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A74
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001986"
msgid "Strange, that sounds an awful lot like an excuse."
msgstr "이상하네요. 꼭 변명하는 것처럼 들리는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Vassilis
#. PROMPT: You won't be bothered any further.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: Thank you! By the Serpent's fang, thank you and Vassilis! &&& Vassilis: All the credit goes to them. I merely pointed the way.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 01040A73
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_080_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001985"
msgid "Oh don't worry, Vassilis, I'm well aware who did the lion's share of the work."
msgstr "아, 걱정 마세요. 바실리스. 누가 제일 큰 공을 세웠는지는 잘 알고 있으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: You must send someone out there! This apparition must be dealt with! &&& Vassilis: It is my top priority, I assure you. |But it is dangerous the further you step away from the city. We will need someone qualified to assist.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: Well, um, technically, I'm still an apprentice. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001984"
msgid "But what about yourself? Are you not trained in the Herald's arts?"
msgstr "당신은 제대로 못하나요? 전령들의 기술을 익히지 않으셨던가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Breanne: But what about yourself? Are you not trained in the Herald's arts? &&& Vassilis: Well, um, technically, I'm still an apprentice. |But what you speak of is akin to an exorcism, and we know little about how these phantoms exist in our world.|Even a fully trained Herald may not be equipped to deal with this phenomenon.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: You must keep the faith, and in doing so, the reward will come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001983"
msgid "By Jinan's word! Has the Great Serpent left us with nothing to defend ourselves? This is an ill omen indeed."
msgstr "지난이시여! 위대한 뱀께서는 우리에게 스스로를 지킬 수단조차 남겨주지 않으신 걸까요? 정말 불길한 징조네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: It is my top priority, I assure you. |But it is dangerous the further you step away from the city. We will need someone qualified to assist. &&& Breanne: But what about yourself? Are you not trained in the Herald's arts?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_000_StartScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001982"
msgid "Well, um, technically, I'm still an apprentice."
msgstr "어, 음, 엄밀히 말하면, 사실 저는 아직 수습입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default, Breanne
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Oh your timing could not be better! We have a situation. &&& Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage!
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001981"
msgid "A vortex phantom, to be clear, but be that as it may, we now have a headwind for your case."
msgstr "정확히 말하자면 볼텍스 유령이죠. 어쨌든 이번 사안에 변화의 바람이 불고 있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default, Breanne
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: Is that so? You've handled these "phantoms" before? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407BE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001980"
msgid "From what I've heard, my friend here is quite famous for dealing with exactly your type of problem."
msgstr "제가 들은 바로는, 여기 이 친구분이 그런 종류의 사안을 해결하는 쪽으로는 꽤 유명하시거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've dealt with phantoms. I can deal with yours.
#. ALIAS: Breanne
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBreanneIbaka
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407BB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00197E"
msgid "Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless your arrival!"
msgstr "그럼 별들이 진실을 전해 줬군요. 뱀께서 여기 오신 당신을 축복하시길!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: You see! All is not lost! My friend here may be just the person we need.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Breanne: It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407C6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00197C"
msgid "Oh your timing could not be better! We have a situation."
msgstr "아, 마침 딱 맞춰 오셨군요! 문제가 좀 생겼습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: You cannot hear the player, but you can sense something near / Question / to VoiceSource01, VoiceSource02
#. PROMPT: You're trapped between realities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're trapped between realities.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: Was wandering... the road... swerving under my feet.. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_070_IrisGreet_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00197B"
msgid "Is that a voice? I feel it... present. Here."
msgstr "목소리인가? 느껴져... 여기에 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VoiceSource01, VoiceSource02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: Huh? &&& Iris: I... that song... &&& Iris: I know it... &&& Iris: I hear... music. So... lost...  where? Where am I?
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was lost... now, here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_070_IrisGreet_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00197A"
msgid "I'm a friend."
msgstr "나는 너의 친구야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VoiceSource01, VoiceSource02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Iris: Huh? &&& Iris: I... that song... &&& Iris: I know it... &&& Iris: I hear... music. So... lost...  where? Where am I?
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Where am I? What is happening?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_070_IrisGreet_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001979"
msgid "I'm here to remove you from this place."
msgstr "너를 고아원에서 없애러 왔다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VoiceSource01, VoiceSource02
#. PROMPT: I'm a friend.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm a friend.
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: Was wandering... the road... swerving under my feet.. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_070_IrisGreet_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001978"
msgid "I was lost... now, here."
msgstr "길을 잃었는데... 지금은, 여기 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile. &&& companion: Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile. &&& Breanne: Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless you both!|Vassilis, you can learn a thing from these two.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: One thing does trouble me, however. The way you describe this phantom, it seems almost docile.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b
#. TOPIC: 010407B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VkaiZ03b_020_GreetingScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010FCA9E
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001977"
msgid "If anyone is equipped to handle phantoms, it's the Vindicator."
msgstr "유령을 처리할 수 있는 사람이 있다면, 그건 바로 우리의 옹호자죠."

