#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile. &&& companion: Yes, but something about this feels strange. The phantoms we encountered were dangerous. Hostile. &&& Breanne: Then the stars speak true. Serpent bless you both!|Vassilis, you can learn a thing from these two.
