msgid "It's an urgent matter. There's a spirit haunting the old orphanage!"
msgstr "긴급 사안이에요. 어떤 원혼이 옛날에 고아원이었던 곳에 출몰하고 있다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to VoiceSource01, VoiceSource02
#. PROMPT: I'm here to remove you from this place.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here to remove you from this place.
#. ALIAS: Iris
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFIrisUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Iris: Was wandering... the road... swerving under my feet.. 
