msgid "Please, you must clear the phantom. It refuses to leave!"
msgstr "제발 그 유령을 없애 주세요. 고아원에서 떠나려 하질 않아요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194F"
msgid "Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies."
msgstr ""
"우리 신민들은 두 진영으로 나뉩니다. 일부는 새로운 땅을 탐험하고 새롭게 시작하기를 원합니다. 하지만 그러기 위해서는 물자가 필요합니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194E"
msgid "Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly."
msgstr "다른 이들은 기존 정착지 중 한 곳에서 피난처를 찾는 것이 최선이라고 생각하지만, 우리가 따뜻한 환영을 받을 것 같지는 않습니다."

#. PROMPT: A city in United Colonies space will be your best bet.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A city in United Colonies space will be your best bet.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194D"
msgid "The United Colonies does have much in the way of resources, and there are a few cities we think may fit our needs."
msgstr "식민지 연합에는 많은 자원이 있고, 우리의 필요에 맞는 도시가 몇 군데 있습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The United Colonies does have much in the way of resources, and there are a few cities we think may fit our needs.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C51
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194C"
msgid "A city in United Colonies space will be your best bet."
msgstr "식민지 연합 영역에 있는 도시가 최선일 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful the player answered their distress hail, as they have been ignored and treated poorly by every passing ship
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees!
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194B"
msgid "Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots."
msgstr "응답해 주셔서 정말 감사합니다! 많은 우주선이 우리를 광신도라고 생각해 피했습니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00194A"
msgid "But we are not like them! We are humble refugees, exiled from our home world."
msgstr "하지만 우리는 그들과 다릅니다! 우리는 고향에서 추방된 비천한 난민입니다."

#. PROMPT: Find a settlement outside of the UC or FC.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Find a settlement outside of the UC or FC.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C50
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001949"
msgid "Given who we are, a location outside any established government would be wise. And there are a few independent settlements we think may fit our needs."
msgstr "우리가 누구인지를 고려할 때, 기존 정부 밖의 장소가 현명할 것입니다. 그리고 우리의 필요에 맞는 독립적인 정착지가 몇 군데 있습니다."

#. PROMPT: What supplies will you need to start your own settlement?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What supplies will you need to start your own settlement?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001948"
msgid "If you have iron ore, we can use it to construct outpost buildings."
msgstr "철광석이 있다면 전초기지 건물을 건설하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다."

#. PROMPT: The Freestar Collective will provide you sanctuary.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Freestar Collective will provide you sanctuary.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C52
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001947"
msgid "The Freestar Collective seems to provide more freedom for their people, and there are a few cities we think may fit our needs."
msgstr "자유항성 공동체는 그들의 신민들에게 더 많은 자유를 제공하는 것으로 보이며, 우리의 필요에 맞는 도시가 몇 군데 있습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: The Kryx System? We've not heard of this place. But perhaps it will be a welcoming place for refugees like us.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001945"
msgid "With these supplies, we can begin our settlement, and be free to practice our beliefs. Thank you."
msgstr "이 물품으로 우리는 정착을 시작하고 우리의 신념을 실천할 수 있을 것입니다. 감사합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: The Kryx System? We've not heard of this place. But perhaps it will be a welcoming place for refugees like us.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001944"
msgid "We'll fire up our Grav Drive and investigate those areas immediately."
msgstr "중력 구동기를 가동해서 그 지역들을 즉시 조사해 보겠습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Kryx System? We've not heard of this place. But perhaps it will be a welcoming place for refugees like us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001943"
msgid "There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key."
msgstr "크릭스 항성계에 더 키라는 곳이 있습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Freestar Collective seems to provide more freedom for their people, and there are a few cities we think may fit our needs.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001940"
msgid "The Freestar Collective will provide you sanctuary."
msgstr "자유항성 공동체는 당신에게 안식처를 제공할 것입니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We are from House Va'ruun. We have different values, beliefs, and culture. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00193F"
msgid "Why settle somewhere new?"
msgstr "왜 새로운 곳에 정착하려는 거지?"

#. PROMPT: There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00193E"
msgid "The Kryx System? We've not heard of this place. But perhaps it will be a welcoming place for refugees like us."
msgstr "크릭스 항성계라고요? 들어본 적 없는 곳이군요. 하지만 우리와 같은 난민들에게는 반가운 장소가 될지도 모르겠습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you have iron ore, we can use it to construct outpost buildings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00193D"
msgid "What supplies will you need to start your own settlement?"
msgstr "새 정착지 건설을 시작하려면 어떤 물품이 필요합니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. Anything you can provide will help us get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00193C"
msgid "[Give 5 Iron] Let me give you what I have."
msgstr "[철 5개 제공] 제가 가진 것을 드리겠습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. Anything you can provide will help us get started.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C47
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00193B"
msgid "[Give 5 Iron] I don't have enough iron."
msgstr "[철 5개 제공] 철이 충분하지 않습니다."

#. PROMPT: Why settle somewhere new?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why settle somewhere new?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001938"
msgid "We are from House Va'ruun. We have different values, beliefs, and culture."
msgstr "우리는 바룬 가문 출신입니다. 우리는 다른 가치관, 신념, 문화를 가지고 있습니다."

#. PROMPT: Why settle somewhere new?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: There's a place in the Kryx system called the Key.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001937"
msgid "Will people in the Settled Systems be welcoming of that? We do not know."
msgstr "개척 성계의 사람들이 그것을 환영할까요? 우리는 모릅니다."

#. PROMPT: [Give 5 Iron] Let me give you what I have.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give 5 Iron] Let me give you what I have.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001934"
msgid "Thank you. Anything you can provide will help us get started."
msgstr "감사합니다. 무엇이든 제공해 주시면 시작하는 데 도움이 될 것입니다."

#. PROMPT: [Give 5 Iron] Let me give you what I have.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give 5 Iron] Let me give you what I have.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Thank you so much for responding! So many ships have avoided us, believing us to be Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C44
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001933"
msgid "That's too bad. Perhaps we'd be better off landing at an existing settlement."
msgstr "안됐군요. 기존 정착지에 착륙하는 것이 더 나을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_000_HailingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001932"
msgid "To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees!"
msgstr "지나가는 우주선에 알립니다. 부디 도와주십시오! 우리는 해를 끼치지 않습니다. 우리는 난민입니다!"

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_000_HailingScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_IntroHailingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001931"
msgid "Please, answer the hail! We are not like the Zealots, our situation is dire!"
msgstr "제발, 교신에 응답해 주십시오! 우리는 광신도들과 다릅니다. 우리의 상황은 심각합니다!"

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_000_HailingScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_IntroHailingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001930"
msgid "We are lost and in need of assistance. Please, pick up the hail!"
msgstr "우리는 길을 잃었고 도움이 필요합니다. 제발, 교신을 수신해 주십시오!"

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C57
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_000_HailingScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_IntroHailingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00192F"
msgid "If you can just respond..."
msgstr "응답해 주실 수 있다면..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees!
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_020_HailingSceneRefused
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01040C6B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001924"
msgid "Please. We're in need of your aid."
msgstr "제발. 우리는 당신의 도움이 필요합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees!
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_020_HailingSceneRefused
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01040C6B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001923"
msgid "It seems we must fend for ourselves."
msgstr "우리는 스스로를 지켜야 할 것 같습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: To any passing ships, please, we need your assistance! We mean you no trouble, we are refugees!
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C56
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_020_HailingSceneRefused
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01040C6B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001922"
msgid "Fine. We'll find our own way."
msgstr "좋습니다. 우리는 우리만의 길을 찾을 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid. &&& HailingShip: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight. &&& HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.|If we are to survive, we need to find somewhere to settle.|But at the moment, we are unsure of the best way forward.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm afraid Dazra's problems are only beginning. We thought it best to find a home elsewhere.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001920"
msgid "The cataclysm is over. You're safe to return."
msgstr "대재난은 끝났습니다. 돌아와도 안전합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid. &&& HailingShip: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight. &&& HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.|If we are to survive, we need to find somewhere to settle.|But at the moment, we are unsure of the best way forward.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191F"
msgid "You're brave to have made it this far."
msgstr "여기까지 온 걸 보니 용감하시군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid. &&& HailingShip: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight. &&& HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.|If we are to survive, we need to find somewhere to settle.|But at the moment, we are unsure of the best way forward.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By Jinan, they're attacking!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191E"
msgid "[Attack] And now you're going to get blown up by me. It really isn't your day."
msgstr "[공격] 그리고 이제 넌 나한테 박살 날 거다. 정말 재수 없는 날이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why leave Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why leave Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191D"
msgid "A great cataclysm has hit the city, and even though things have settled, it will be decades before it recovers."
msgstr "대재난이 도시를 강타했고, 상황이 진정되었지만 회복되려면 수십 년이 걸릴 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why leave Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: You're brave to have made it this far.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191C"
msgid "And so, we have sought to try our luck elsewhere, just as the crew of the Mourning did so many years ago."
msgstr "그래서 우리는 수년 전 모어닝 호의 선원들이 그랬던 것처럼 다른 곳에서 행운을 시험해 보기로 했습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far. &&& HailingShip: I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us. &&& HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.|Others have thought it best to seek refuge in one of the existing settlements, but it is unlikely we will be received warmly.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Given who we are, a location outside any established government would be wise. And there are a few independent settlements we think may fit our needs.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C53
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191B"
msgid "Find a settlement outside of the UC or FC."
msgstr "식민지 연합이나 자유항성 공동체 밖의 정착지를 찾아 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're brave to have made it this far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're brave to have made it this far.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00191A"
msgid "I'm afraid it is not courage but survival that guides us."
msgstr "두려움이 아니라 생존이 우리를 이끈다는 것이 두렵습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps I can be of some aid. &&& HailingShip: You don't know how happy I am to hear that. After all this time, any such aid would be a welcome sight. &&& HailingShip: At the moment, we seek not provisions, for they are a temporary salve.|If we are to survive, we need to find somewhere to settle.|But at the moment, we are unsure of the best way forward.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A great cataclysm has hit the city, and even though things have settled, it will be decades before it recovers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001919"
msgid "Why leave Dazra?"
msgstr "왜 다즈라를 떠나려는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] And now you're going to get blown up by me. It really isn't your day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] And now you're going to get blown up by me. It really isn't your day.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.
