#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001918"
msgid "By Jinan, they're attacking!"
msgstr "지난이시여. 공격이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The cataclysm is over. You're safe to return.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The cataclysm is over. You're safe to return.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Our people are of two camps. Some wish to explore new lands, and start anew. But to do so we need supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees
#. TOPIC: 01040C2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunRefugees_010_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001917"
msgid "I'm afraid Dazra's problems are only beginning. We thought it best to find a home elsewhere."
msgstr "다즈라의 문제는 이제 시작일 뿐인 것 같아. 다른 곳에 집을 찾는 게 낫다고 생각했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: suspicious- no one ever talks to him or acknowledges him, he is suspicious someone sent you to kill him. / Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: What are you talking about? Who sent you?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040408
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00190D"
msgid "Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?"
msgstr "궁금하군. 나에게 원하는 게 있나? 누가 널 보냈지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We met before, in a different lifetime. Our acquaintance led to great bloodshed.  &&& Orahim: What are you talking about? Who sent you? &&& Orahim: Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040407
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00190C"
msgid "Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk."
msgstr "누가 시켜서 온 게 아니야. 대화를 하고 싶었을 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it.  &&& companion: Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We will get to know each other well. Just... not here. My home is away from prying eyes and judgement.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040405
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00190B"
msgid "But I don't know anything about you. Why not just talk here?"
msgstr "하지만 난 너에 대해 아무것도 모른다고. 그냥 여기서 이야기하면 되잖아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040406
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00190A"
msgid "Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere."
msgstr "흐음... 그렇다면, 이야기는 다른 곳에서 마저 하는 게 낫겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040406
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001909"
msgid "Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it."
msgstr "다즈라 외곽에 있는 내 오두막에서 날 보러 와라. 놓칠 수 없을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: But I don't know anything about you. Why not just talk here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But I don't know anything about you. Why not just talk here?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040404
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001908"
msgid "We will get to know each other well. Just... not here. My home is away from prying eyes and judgement."
msgstr "곧 서로에 대해 잘 알게 되겠지. 다만… 여기선 안돼. 내 집엔 멋대로 남을 판단하고 흘겨보는 눈이 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: But I don't know anything about you. Why not just talk here?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040404
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001907"
msgid "I do not wish for people to disparage you for associating with me."
msgstr "나와 어울린다는 이유로 사람들이 너를 헐뜯는 꼴은 못 보겠거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it.  &&& companion: Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I apologize, I do not wish to... it has been so long since... *sigh* I understand. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040403
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001906"
msgid "You're creeping me out. I'm not going anywhere with you."
msgstr "너 좀 무섭다고. 너랑 같이 어디 가고 싶진 않은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flustered. He is holding back anger and frustration because he knows he is bad at talking with regular people. / Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're creeping me out. I'm not going anywhere with you. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're creeping me out. I'm not going anywhere with you. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040402
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001905"
msgid "I apologize, I do not wish to... it has been so long since... *sigh* I understand."
msgstr "미안하군. 겁주려던 건 아니었어… 얘기하는 건 너무 오랜만이라… *한숨* 알겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're creeping me out. I'm not going anywhere with you. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040402
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001904"
msgid "There is nowhere else for me anyway, so I will be at my shack if you change your mind."
msgstr "어차피 나에게는 다른 곳도 없으니… 마음이 바뀌면 오두막에 찾아오라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it.  &&& companion: Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good, I look forward to having a real conversation. First one in months. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040401
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001903"
msgid "Fine, I'll meet you there."
msgstr "좋아. 네 오두막에서 만나자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 01040400
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001902"
msgid "Good, I look forward to having a real conversation. First one in months."
msgstr "좋아, 오랜만에 제대로 대화를 나누게 되겠군. 몇 달 만에 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We met before, in a different lifetime. Our acquaintance led to great bloodshed.  &&& Orahim: What are you talking about? Who sent you? &&& Orahim: Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not welcome in Dazra. Guards demanding my removal is about the only acknowledgment I garner. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001901"
msgid "What was all that commotion with the guard?"
msgstr "경비원이랑 다투던 것 같던데, 무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was all that commotion with the guard? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was all that commotion with the guard? 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001900"
msgid "I am not welcome in Dazra. Guards demanding my removal is about the only acknowledgment I garner."
msgstr "난 다즈라에서 환영받지 못한다. 그나마 들을 수 있는 말도 경비대가 물러나라고 소리치는 것뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We met before, in a different lifetime. Our acquaintance led to great bloodshed.  &&& Orahim: What are you talking about? Who sent you? &&& Orahim: Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, but our situations are quite different. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FF"
msgid "It took a while for everyone to warm up to me, too. I'm just trying to get to know people."
msgstr "이곳 사람들이 나한테 마음을 열기까지 시간이 좀 걸렸지. 그냥 사람들과 친해져 보려고 하는 중이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It took a while for everyone to warm up to me, too. I'm just trying to get to know people. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It took a while for everyone to warm up to me, too. I'm just trying to get to know people. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FE"
msgid "Yes, but our situations are quite different."
msgstr "그런가. 하지만 우리 둘의 처지는 꽤 다르군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It took a while for everyone to warm up to me, too. I'm just trying to get to know people. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FD"
msgid "If you truly just wish to talk, perhaps it is better to have this conversation elsewhere."
msgstr "정말 나와 얘기하고 싶다면, 이야기는 다른 곳에서 마저 하는 게 낫겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It took a while for everyone to warm up to me, too. I'm just trying to get to know people. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FC"
msgid "My shack outside of Dazra should suffice."
msgstr "다즈라 외곽에 있는 내 오두막에서 하면 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I speak to a lot of people, you aren't special. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I speak to a lot of people, you aren't special. 
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0103E81C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FB"
msgid "Indeed! Seems I am not special enough for anyone to acknowledge me -- except for you."
msgstr "그렇겠지! 나는 특별하지 않은 것 같군. 아무도 나에게 말을 걸려고 하지 않는 걸 보면 말이야… 지금 너만 빼고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018FA"
msgid "Zealots cannot be trusted. This one is no different."
msgstr "광신도의 말은 믿어선 안 돼. 이 사람도 마찬가지야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nobody sent me, I just wanted to talk.  &&& Orahim: Hmmm... if that is true, we should continue this conversation elsewhere. |Meet me at my shack outside of Dazra. You cannot miss it. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine, I'll meet you there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 010403FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018F9"
msgid "What could go wrong if we go to the shack of some weird guy we don't know anything about? Maybe, just maybe, there's a reason that nobody else will talk to him."
msgstr ""
"전혀 알지도 못하는 이상한 남자 오두막에 간다고 뭐 잘못될 게 있겠어? 그렇지만, 정말 어쩌면, 아무도 저 사람이랑 말 안 섞는 데엔 "
"이유가 있을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, unless you're busy with something.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, unless you're busy with something.
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOrahim
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Orahim: Which begs the question, what do you want with me? Who sent you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0103E818
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018F8"
msgid "You misunderstand. No one in Dazra speaks with me, or even acknowledges my existence. If they do, it is with scorn, and yet here you are, speaking with me as if I were a person."
msgstr ""
"내가 왜 그렇게 물었는지 이해를 못 했군. 다즈라 사람들 누구도 나한테 말을 걸지 않고, 있지도 않는 놈 취급한다고. 말을 건다 해도, "
"경멸만 하지. 하지만 넌… 나를 한 사람으로 대하면서 말을 하잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Orahim: You... you are the one who spoke with Anasko Va'ruun. And you wish to speak with me?
#. ALIAS: Orahim
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You misunderstand. No one in Dazra speaks with me, or even acknowledges my existence. If they do, it is with scorn, and yet here you are, speaking with me as if I were a person. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS02
#. TOPIC: 0103E819
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS02_01_OrahimIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018F7"
msgid "Yes, unless you're busy with something."
msgstr "그래. 그쪽이 바쁘지만 않다면 말이야 나눌 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe they were hiding from me while I was taking care of those Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe they were hiding from me while I was taking care of those Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018ED"
msgid "No doubt they would've been scared. I only hope this means they remain safe and unharmed."
msgstr "분명히 겁을 먹었을 거예요. 제발 다치지 않고 무사하다는 뜻이었으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The way is clear, but I didn't see any hostages.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The way is clear, but I didn't see any hostages.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Done and done, so let's go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018EC"
msgid "Please, check again. We'll head outside, but we won't return until we see they're safe."
msgstr "제발 다시 확인해 주세요. 우린 밖으로 나가겠지만, 인질들이 안전해질 때까진 돌아가지 않겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't want to help?  &&& Gavin: I'm afraid we're quite useless here. |They've been starving us, keeping us weak. Probably for just such an occasion. |I fear more for the ones they've taken to the caves.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Please, check again. We'll head outside, but we won't return until we see they're safe. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB11
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018EB"
msgid "The way is clear, but I didn't see any hostages."
msgstr "길을 정리했는데, 인질은 한 명도 못 봤어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything I should know about the Zealots down there? &&& Gavin: There's another Zealot like the one that guarded us.|It's unlike any we've seen. They're... augmented somehow. They're minds lack any inhibition.|Just be careful. Other Zealots are down there as well, but that's the one to worry about.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No doubt they would've been scared. I only hope this means they remain safe and unharmed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018EA"
msgid "Maybe they were hiding from me while I was taking care of those Zealots."
msgstr "내가 광신도를 처리하는 동안 숨어 있었을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0018E9"
msgid "As I was saying, House Ka'dic is in your debt."
msgstr "아까도 말했지만, 카딕 가문이 그대에게 빚졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: This business with the Zealots needs to end.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0018E8"
msgid "You've helped me maintain a very precarious balance."
msgstr "아주 위태로운 균형을 유지할 수 있도록 도와준 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Paying the player for secretly killing everyone in the Zealot base. / Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm. &&& Razma: At least we had some level of success.  &&& Razma: Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E7"
msgid "And Harbinger, a token of my gratitude for aiding House Ka'dic."
msgstr "그리고, 선구자. 이건 카딕 가문을 도와준 것에 대한 감사의 표시에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player was rude, feeling rejected. She's used to feeling that way from her family, but a little surprised to get it from the player. / Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't hold your breath.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't hold your breath.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: We'll talk later, Sahima. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E6"
msgid "Why would -- Oh. I understand... I guess I'll be going now."
msgstr "그게 무슨... 아, 그래요... 이만 가 봐야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's my turn to say thank you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's my turn to say thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E5"
msgid "You're welcome. It's been quite the life experience I've had lately."
msgstr "별 말씀을요. 최근 겪은 것 중에 가장 멋진 경험이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's my turn to say thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't hold your breath.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E4"
msgid "If you have any spare time, maybe come find me later?"
msgstr "혹시 시간 남으시면, 나중에 저한테 와 주실래요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's my turn to say thank you. &&& Sahima: You're welcome. It's been quite the life experience I've had lately.|If you have any spare time, maybe come find me later?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why would -- Oh. I understand... I guess I'll be going now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E3"
msgid "Don't hold your breath."
msgstr "너무 큰 기대는 하지 말고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure. I'll see you around, Sahima.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure. I'll see you around, Sahima.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: We'll talk later, Sahima. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E2"
msgid "Great! You can find me at the great house whenever you get a chance."
msgstr "좋아요! 전 저택에 있을 거니까 기회가 되면 찾아오세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As I already made clear... &&& ...  &&& Razma: Sahima, you are a part of this House. &&& Sahima: I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally. &&& Sahima: And here. It's the research and algorithm the High Council wants.|I'm sure they'll appreciate it more coming from you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're welcome. It's been quite the life experience I've had lately.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E1"
msgid "It's my turn to say thank you."
msgstr "이제 내가 고맙다고 할 차례네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll make sure the High Council gets it.  &&& Sahima: I'm going back to check on the others, but maybe come find me when you're done? 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great! You can find me at the great house whenever you get a chance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018E0"
msgid "Sure. I'll see you around, Sahima."
msgstr "그럼. 나중에 또 보자, 사히마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you think they'd appreciate it more from me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you think they'd appreciate it more from me?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018DF"
msgid "As much as I'd love to gloat, I have enough awareness to know this isn't the time."
msgstr "자랑하고 싶은 마음이야 굴뚝 같은데, 지금 때가 안 좋다는 건 잘 알거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why do you think they'd appreciate it more from me?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Grav drive theory isn't easily grasped by people your age. Be proud of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018DE"
msgid "And I know myself well enough to know that I simply wouldn't hold back."
msgstr "그리고 제 성격을 생각해 보면 분명히 못 참고 떠들어댈 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As I already made clear... &&& ...  &&& Razma: Sahima, you are a part of this House. &&& Sahima: I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally. &&& Sahima: And here. It's the research and algorithm the High Council wants.|I'm sure they'll appreciate it more coming from you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm going back to check on the others, but maybe come find me when you're done? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB01
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018DD"
msgid "I'll make sure the High Council gets it."
msgstr "대의회에 확실하게 전달해 줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018DB"
msgid "At least we had some level of success."
msgstr "적어도 어느 정도는 성공이라 할 수 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm fascinated to learn how you reconcile your religion and science. &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then, as I'm equally curious to know why heretics insist on separating the two.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I was saying, House Ka'dic is in your debt.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018DA"
msgid "We'll talk later, Sahima."
msgstr "나중에 더 얘기하자, 사히마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on "are." Reassuring Sahima that she belongs. / Stern / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As I already made clear... &&& Sahima: As am I. I owe you my life. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB02
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D9"
msgid "Sahima, you are a part of this House."
msgstr "사히마, 넌 이 가문의 일원이란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll make sure the High Council gets it. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll make sure the High Council gets it. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure. I'll see you around, Sahima.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D8"
msgid "I'm going back to check on the others, but maybe come find me when you're done?"
msgstr "이제 집으로 돌아가서 다른 사람들을 확인해 볼 건데, 일이 끝나면 다시 찾아주실 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't think like that. You're family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't think like that. You're family.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I overheard the Zealots mention negotiating with House Ka'dic, so the motivations are clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D7"
msgid "I'm only family by name."
msgstr "이름으로만 가족이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Zealots also plan on using you as a pawn in negotiations.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Zealots also plan on using you as a pawn in negotiations.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I overheard the Zealots mention negotiating with House Ka'dic, so the motivations are clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D6"
msgid "Negotiations? Oh right... I'd almost forgotten..."
msgstr "협상이요? 아, 맞다... 까먹을 뻔했어요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D5"
msgid "And here. It's the research and algorithm the High Council wants."
msgstr "그리고 이거요. 대의회에서 원하는 연구 자료랑 알고리즘이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Grav drive theory isn't easily grasped by people your age. Be proud of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D4"
msgid "I'm sure they'll appreciate it more coming from you."
msgstr "직접 전해주셔야 대의회도 제 성과를 더 잘 알아주겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too. &&& Sahima: So my theory is correct? Or I should say, the High Council now believes my theory, the better theory, is correct? &&& Sahima: I knew it. I told them their algorithms and insufficient testing were only giving the illusion of stability.|But no. No one wants to listen to me. Not the girl who put people twice my age to shame when it came to assessments.|Of course, this is what it would take for Razma to send someone after me. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Negotiations? Oh right... I'd almost forgotten...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D3"
msgid "The Zealots also plan on using you as a pawn in negotiations."
msgstr "광신도들이 널 협상 수단으로 써먹을 계획이기도 하고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was able to find it on her body.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was able to find it on her body.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D2"
msgid "I'm only glad my uncle didn't live long enough to know her fate."
msgstr "삼촌께서 이런 일을 당하실 만큼 오래 살지 못하셔서 다행이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too. &&& Sahima: So my theory is correct? Or I should say, the High Council now believes my theory, the better theory, is correct? &&& Sahima: I knew it. I told them their algorithms and insufficient testing were only giving the illusion of stability.|But no. No one wants to listen to me. Not the girl who put people twice my age to shame when it came to assessments.|Of course, this is what it would take for Razma to send someone after me. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm only family by name.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D1"
msgid "Don't think like that. You're family."
msgstr "그렇게 생각하지 마. 가족이잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: The Harbinger is right. &&& Djimal: We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device. &&& Razma: Yes, and I assume you were able to recover Sahima's research?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm only glad my uncle didn't live long enough to know her fate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB00
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018D0"
msgid "I was able to find it on her body."
msgstr "사히마의 시신에서 찾았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Rhetorical. / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So it'll be my word against the Zealot leaders?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Yes, but don't worry. I'll be there to reinforce what Razma already knows: the Zealots cannot be trusted.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I'll make sure no one's left alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CF"
msgid "And who are any of us to doubt Anasko's chosen Harbinger?"
msgstr "그리고 아나스코 님의 선택을 받은 선구자를 누가 의심하겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: As am I. I owe you my life.  &&& Razma: Sahima, you are a part of this House.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And here. It's the research and algorithm the High Council wants.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CE"
msgid "I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally."
msgstr "그... 알아요. 그냥 고맙다는 말을 하고 싶었어요. 개인적으로요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: The Harbinger is right. &&& Djimal: We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device. &&& Razma: Yes, and I assume you were able to recover Sahima's research?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: At least we had some level of success. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CD"
msgid "Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm."
msgstr "네. 사히마의 알고리즘을 찾았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As I already made clear...
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Sahima, you are a part of this House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CC"
msgid "As am I. I owe you my life."
msgstr "저도요. 제 목숨을 빚졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: At least we had some level of success. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: And Harbinger, a token of my gratitude for aiding House Ka'dic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CB"
msgid "Go. Head back to Dazra, see that Ekris gets it, and hopefully this plan of his will work."
msgstr "가 봐. 다즈라로 돌아가서 에크리스한테 자료를 넘겨줘. 계획이 성공하길 빌자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018CA"
msgid "I wish it were that easy."
msgstr "그렇게 쉽다면 좋았겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wouldn't know. I just got here.  &&& Gavin: The point of taking hostages is to keep them alive. It's to your advantage to feed us, otherwise, you've got nothing.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If only. There are more of us down in the caves. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C9"
msgid "Is this all of you?"
msgstr "인질은 이게 전부인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just another enemy getting in my way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just another enemy getting in my way.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAEC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C8"
msgid "Well, what sounds like a mere nuisance to you is a very real terrorist threat to us."
msgstr "음, 당신에게는 골칫거리일 뿐인 모양이지만, 우리에겐 아주 심각한 테러 위협이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is this all of you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is this all of you?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C7"
msgid "If only. There are more of us down in the caves."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋았겠죠. 동굴 아래쪽에 더 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you. &&& Gavin: The Great Serpent is merciful, you could've said as much. And Sahima? Did you find her yet?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wish it were that easy. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C6"
msgid "Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape."
msgstr "사히마는 무사해요. 탈출할 때 쓸 엘리베이터 접속 권한을 부여해 줬죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't care. If it happened once, it can happen again.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't care. If it happened once, it can happen again.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C5"
msgid "Some alliances are worth the risk. But that will be for the High Council to decide should you decide to play the informant."
msgstr "위험을 감수할 만한 동맹도 있는 법이야. 하지만 그대가 정보를 공개해야겠다면, 그건 대의회가 결정할 문제겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. &&& Razma: Good. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Some alliances are worth the risk. But that will be for the High Council to decide should you decide to play the informant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C4"
msgid "I don't care. If it happened once, it can happen again."
msgstr "상관 없습니다. 한번 이런 일이 생겼다면 다시 생길 수도 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Like I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, what sounds like a mere nuisance to you is a very real terrorist threat to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAEB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C3"
msgid "Just another enemy getting in my way."
msgstr "내 앞을 가로막는 또 다른 적일 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not the one you should be worried about. &&& Razma: If you're referring to the members of House Ka'dic...
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C2"
msgid "Fine. I suppose I can see the benefit."
msgstr "좋아요. 이득이라고 볼 수도 있겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That suits me fine. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That suits me fine. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C1"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018C0"
msgid "This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold."
msgstr "그건 선을 크게 넘었군요. 광신도가 그렇게 대담할 줄은 몰랐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BF"
msgid "Zealots willing to negotiate? That's a new one for my book."
msgstr "광신도가 협상을 해요? 내 책에 쓸 내용이 하나 늘었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BE"
msgid "Dealing with Zealots is never pretty."
msgstr "광신도 상대는 쉬운 게 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BD"
msgid "Taking hostages and negotiating? Doesn't sound like the Zealots we're used to."
msgstr "인질을 잡고 협상을 한다고요? 우리가 알던 광신도 같지가 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I wish I could have that mentality. And maybe it's not so much a desire to be cared for as it is a desire for acceptance.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BC"
msgid "I overheard the Zealots mention negotiating with House Ka'dic, so the motivations are clear."
msgstr "광신도들이 카딕 가문하고 협상을 한다는 얘길 엿들었으니까, 그 동기야 뻔하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disappointed.  / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BB"
msgid "Not only does the High Council deem me important, but Razma needs to remove me from the equation."
msgstr "대의회에서 절 중요하게 생각할 뿐만 아니라, 라즈마 님이 절 이 문제에서 빼내야 하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's the attitude. Less moping, more positive thinking. Now let's go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018BA"
msgid "I get it. But at least now everyone knows I was right."
msgstr "그래요. 적어도 이젠 다들 제가 맞았다는 걸 알겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As I already made clear... &&& ...  &&& Razma: Sahima, you are a part of this House. &&& Sahima: I -- I know. I just wanted to say thank you. Personally. &&& Sahima: And here. It's the research and algorithm the High Council wants.|I'm sure they'll appreciate it more coming from you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As much as I'd love to gloat, I have enough awareness to know this isn't the time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FB08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B9"
msgid "Why do you think they'd appreciate it more from me?"
msgstr "왜 내가 전해줘야 더 잘 알아줄 거라고 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, the High Council needs to know.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, the High Council needs to know.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B8"
msgid "Our relationship with the Zealots has always proven beneficial, especially when it comes to our work at the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "광신도와 관계를 맺으면 항상 이득을 얻었거든. 결합성 업무 관련해서 특히나 더 그렇고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, the High Council needs to know.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B7"
msgid "The only reason they gained any semblance of power was due to the gross miscalculations of Anasko and his research team."
msgstr "광신도가 힘을 얻게 된 유일한 이유는 아나스코 님과 연구팀의 심각한 계산 착오 때문이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No, the High Council needs to know.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How is your relationship with the Zealots beneficial?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B6"
msgid "Exposing this information to the High Council will only diminish House Ka'dic's power."
msgstr "이 정보를 대의회에 공개해 봤자 카딕 가문의 권력만 약해질 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This business with the Zealots needs to end. &&& Razma: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on. &&& Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Zealots are extremists, but our goals are the same: spread the Word of the Serpent and await the Shrouding to be embraced.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B5"
msgid "How can you even consider working with Zealots?"
msgstr "어떻게 광신도와 협력한다는 생각을 할 수가 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No, the High Council needs to know. &&& Razma: Our relationship with the Zealots has always proven beneficial, especially when it comes to our work at the Ministry of Conjunction.|The only reason they gained any semblance of power was due to the gross miscalculations of Anasko and his research team.|Exposing this information to the High Council will only diminish House Ka'dic's power. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Zealots are an effective tool when needed. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B4"
msgid "How is your relationship with the Zealots beneficial?"
msgstr "광신도와 협력하는 게 무슨 이익이 된다는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them. &&& companion: Understood.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Mirek is proud of what they've accomplished, so I doubt they'll give up information easily...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B3"
msgid "Any tips on getting through to Mirek?"
msgstr "미어렉을 설득할 때 도움 될 만한 정보가 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your relationship with the Zealots beneficial?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is your relationship with the Zealots beneficial?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B2"
msgid "The Zealots are an effective tool when needed."
msgstr "광신도는 필요할 때 쓸만한 도구거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your relationship with the Zealots beneficial?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B1"
msgid "They're a source of information, a window into your world, and yes, at times, a blunt instrument."
msgstr "정보원이기도 하고, 그대의 세상을 들여다볼 창문이기도 하고, 물론 가끔은 커다란 몽둥이기도 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All I can tell you is Vaeric is alive. Nothing more.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All I can tell you is Vaeric is alive. Nothing more.
#. ALIAS: MQ_VitoriaVethaal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFVitoriaVethaal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MQ_VitoriaVethaal: I always knew that Viktor would drive him away. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0110B0A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vitoria_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018B0"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them.
