#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018AE"
msgid "No physical harm? I suppose I can charm it out of 'em."
msgstr "다치는 일 없게요? 내가 유혹해 버려야겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018AD"
msgid "I certainly hope it wouldn't come to that."
msgstr "그럴 일이 없으면 좋겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018AC"
msgid "See that you do."
msgstr "꼭 그렇게 하도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This business with the Zealots needs to end. &&& Razma: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on. &&& Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Our relationship with the Zealots has always proven beneficial, especially when it comes to our work at the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAEA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018AB"
msgid "No, the High Council needs to know."
msgstr "안 됩니다. 대의회도 알아야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Zealots are old members of the once noble House Ma'leen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Zealots are old members of the once noble House Ma'leen.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018AA"
msgid "I'm impressed. You've already learned quite a bit from your time with us."
msgstr "대단하군요. 우리와 함께 하면서 벌써 그만큼이나 배우다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018A9"
msgid "House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 무슨 짓이든 하는 모양이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018A8"
msgid "I got the impression House politics were on another level, but isn't this a bit extreme?"
msgstr "가문 정치가 차원이 다른 수준인 건 알겠지만, 이건 좀 극단적이지 않습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018A7"
msgid "You'd sacrifice family for clout? Now this is low."
msgstr "정치 권력 때문에 가문을 희생한다고요? 이건 저급한데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018A6"
msgid "And I thought Zealots were bad. Now I'm not sure what disgusts me more."
msgstr "난 광신도가 나쁜 줄 알았는데, 이젠 누가 더 역겨운지 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet they're being held in one of your old Shadow Stations. &&& Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you. &&& Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.|Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming.|Get the information any way you see fit as long as no physical harm comes to them. &&& companion: Understood.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See that you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0018A1"
msgid "I'll return once I've learned the location."
msgstr "장소를 알아내고 나서 돌아올게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mirek pronounced MEER-ek / Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Any tips on getting through to Mirek?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Any tips on getting through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189F"
msgid "Mirek is proud of what they've accomplished, so I doubt they'll give up information easily..."
msgstr "미어렉은 자기가 해낸 걸 자랑스럽게 여기고 있어서, 정보를 쉽게 주지는 않을 텐데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Any tips on getting through to Mirek?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189E"
msgid "If being persuasive isn't your strong suit, perhaps appealing to their substantial ego may help... if you can stomach it."
msgstr "설득하는 재주가 없다면, 그 녀석의 대단한 자부심에 호소하는 게 도움이 될지도 몰라... 그대가 그걸 견딜 수 있다면 말이지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Like I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm impressed. You've already learned quite a bit from your time with us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189D"
msgid "The Zealots are old members of the once noble House Ma'leen."
msgstr "광신도들은 한때 명문 가문이었던 마린 가문 구성원들이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Some emphasis on "heretics." Thinks it's funny he was called a heretic. / Amused / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: I like your style. As one scientist to another, we should trade notes sometime. &&& Sahima: I would be very interested in the scientific view of the heretical world. I've always wondered how different the lens might be.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Something to look forward to then!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189C"
msgid "Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves."
msgstr "우리 이단들도 서로를 보면서 종종 그렇게 궁금해한단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189B"
msgid "As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma."
msgstr "당신도 짐작했겠지만, 우린 더 이상의 손실을 감당할 수 없으니 라즈마 형님께 들려줄 이야기를 꾸며내야 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll make sure no one's left alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00189A"
msgid "When you arrived, the Zealots had already killed the hostages, so you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name."
msgstr "당신이 도착했을 땐 이미 광신도들이 인질들을 죽였고, 그래서 카딕 가문의 이름으로 복수를 했다고 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001899"
msgid "I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so."
msgstr "당신이 한 말은 반역죄로 간주될 수 있다고 말해주고 싶군요. 당연히 인정될 테고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001898"
msgid "Sleeping with the enemy. No one likes that."
msgstr "적과의 동침이라. 그런 건 누구나 싫어하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001897"
msgid "I don't know. Playing both sides has its benefits. Even if they are Zealots."
msgstr "글쎄요. 양쪽 모두와 붙어먹는 것도 이득이 있죠. 광신도라고 해도요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So Razma doesn't want the Council to know her true relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001896"
msgid "I don't see how anyone could sympathize with such fanatics, let alone work with them."
msgstr "어떻게 그런 미치광이들한테 공감할 수 있는지 모르겠네요. 협력도 못 할 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Admitting the Zealots were using sound tactics, but then failed to see the Player and herself screwing them all up. / Confident / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001895"
msgid "The Zealots were wise in their tactics, up until now."
msgstr "광신도들이 전략을 잘 썼네. 적어도 지금까지는."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001894"
msgid "Catastrophic failure may be the understatement of the year."
msgstr "재난으로 끝났다는 표현은 역대급으로 절제된 표현 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised the Zealots got something right. / Amused / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001893"
msgid "Who knew the Zealots could make a right call."
msgstr "광신도가 좋은 판단을 내릴 줄 누가 알았겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001892"
msgid "You poor thing. I always associate Zealots with direct violence. These manipulative tactics are new for me."
msgstr "불쌍해라. 난 광신도가 항상 직접적인 폭력만 쓰는 줄 알았는데. 이런 교묘한 전략을 쓰는 건 처음 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& Razma: The sooner the better. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001891"
msgid "We will do whatever is necessary to bring Sahima and the others back safely."
msgstr "무슨 수를 써서라도 사히마와 다른 인질들을 무사히 데려오겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& Razma: The sooner the better. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001890"
msgid "Time to teach those Zealots a lesson in regret."
msgstr "광신도들한테 슬픈 교훈을 가르쳐 줄 시간이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& Razma: The sooner the better. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188F"
msgid "We'll bring everyone back safe and sound."
msgstr "모두 무사히 돌아오도록 해 드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away. &&& Razma: The sooner the better. 
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188E"
msgid "Don't worry. If anyone can bring those hostages back safely, it's us."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 인질들을 무사히 데려올 수 있는 사람은 바로 우리니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can you even consider working with Zealots?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How can you even consider working with Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188D"
msgid "Zealots are extremists, but our goals are the same: spread the Word of the Serpent and await the Shrouding to be embraced."
msgstr "광신도가 극단적이긴 하지만, 목표는 우리와 같아. 위대한 뱀의 말씀을 퍼뜨리면서 장막의 날이 도래하기를 기다리는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can you even consider working with Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188C"
msgid "A solid alliance would involve concessions, but more than likely, it would quell their misguided crusade."
msgstr "동맹 관계가 튼튼해지면 양보도 해야겠지만, 광신도의 그릇된 성전을 잠재울 가능성도 더 커지게 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I would be very interested in the scientific view of the heretical world. I've always wondered how different the lens might be. &&& companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188B"
msgid "Something to look forward to then!"
msgstr "그럼 진짜 기대할 만하겠는데요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Something to look forward to then!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00188A"
msgid "But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine."
msgstr "그래도 일단은 가까운 문제로 돌아가죠. 또 이러네요. 괜찮을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. I'll get the hostages out of here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001889"
msgid "I've had enough time to know my plan has at least an 87% success rate."
msgstr "그동안 계산해 보니 제 계획이 성공할 확률이 최소 87%는 나오거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick. &&& Sahima: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor. &&& Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001888"
msgid "These members of your House have suffered. I can respect your decision."
msgstr "너희 가문 사람들이 고통받았지. 네 선택을 존중할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Reassuring. / Confident / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick. &&& Sahima: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor. &&& Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001887"
msgid "She'll be there. Let's go. You know we'd both want to do the same."
msgstr "잘 찾아올 거야. 이제 가자. 너도 그렇게 하고 싶잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick. &&& Sahima: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor. &&& Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001886"
msgid "Let's get out of here. We've got some negotiations to disrupt."
msgstr "이제 그만 출발하자. 방해해 줄 협상이 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick. &&& Sahima: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor. &&& Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001885"
msgid "Good luck. If you need help, you know where we'll be."
msgstr "행운을 빌게. 혹시 도움이 필요하면 언제든 찾아오렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I just need enough time to set up a remote device so I can launch a virus that will render this place useless. |Think of it as a failsafe to guarantee our safety. The Zealots would never risk this base or their ships. &&& companion: I like your style. As one scientist to another, we should trade notes sometime.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001884"
msgid "I would be very interested in the scientific view of the heretical world. I've always wondered how different the lens might be."
msgstr "저도 이단 세계에서 보는 과학적 관점에 정말 관심이 많아요. 각자 보는 시각이 얼마나 다를지 항상 궁금했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight.  &&& Sahima: Well, you have to. &&& Sahima: I just need enough time to set up a remote device so I can launch a virus that will render this place useless. |Think of it as a failsafe to guarantee our safety. The Zealots would never risk this base or their ships.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I would be very interested in the scientific view of the heretical world. I've always wondered how different the lens might be.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001883"
msgid "I like your style. As one scientist to another, we should trade notes sometime."
msgstr "스타일이 마음에 드네. 같은 과학자로서 가끔 편지라도 주고받아야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Zealots aren't trustworthy allies. It's for the best.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Zealots aren't trustworthy allies. It's for the best.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001882"
msgid "I see that quite plainly now."
msgstr "이제 확실하게 알겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your House will be more united now that you know the truth.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your House will be more united now that you know the truth.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001881"
msgid "True. The Zealots have long been the strongest point of contention within the House."
msgstr "맞아. 광신도는 오랫동안 가문 내부에서 가장 뜨거운 논쟁 주제였으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: These are exactly the actions I warned you about, Razma.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037496
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001880"
msgid "Impossible."
msgstr "그럴 수가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] The Zealots betrayed you. The hostages are dead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] The Zealots betrayed you. The hostages are dead.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: These are exactly the actions I warned you about, Razma.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037498
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187F"
msgid "No... It can't be."
msgstr "안 돼... 그럴 리 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This business with the Zealots needs to end.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This business with the Zealots needs to end.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187E"
msgid "And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on."
msgstr "언젠가는 그렇게 되겠지만, 그때까지는 필요악이야. 앞으로는 더 주의 깊게 주시해야겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That suits me fine. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That suits me fine. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFHantonIrara
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HVDazraHantonIrara: Ahem... Please understand, I have not been myself lately. You found me at a bad moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0108DD7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_HantonIrara_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187D"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not the one you should be worried about.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not the one you should be worried about.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187C"
msgid "If you're referring to the members of House Ka'dic..."
msgstr "혹시 카딕 가문 사람들을 말하는 거라면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] For a price.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] For a price.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187B"
msgid "A fair price to pay for silence."
msgstr "침묵의 대가로는 충분한 값이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't be so sure.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wouldn't be so sure.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00187A"
msgid "As House Elder, I know my family well enough."
msgstr "가문 장로로서, 우리 가족은 내가 잘 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't be so sure.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now, I have much to do, and so do you. Ekris and the High Council will be expecting you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001879"
msgid "We're all well aware of our unspoken agreements."
msgstr "우리 모두 무언의 합의라는 걸 잘 이해하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you say so.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you say so.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now, I have much to do, and so do you. Ekris and the High Council will be expecting you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001878"
msgid "I know so, and wouldn't expect an outsider, Promised or not, to understand."
msgstr "나도 이방인이 이해할 거라고 기대하진 않았어. 약속받은 자가 됐든 아니든 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll return once I've learned the location.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103FAE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001877"
msgid "See that you do."
msgstr "꼭 그렇게 하도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001876"
msgid "As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised."
msgstr "실망스럽기는 하지만, 놀랐다고 하지는 못하겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're welcome.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're welcome.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001875"
msgid "As for what you've learned here in regards to the Zealots..."
msgstr "그대가 광신도에 대해서 알게 된 것들이 있으니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I knew it. I told them their algorithms and insufficient testing were only giving the illusion of stability.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001874"
msgid "So my theory is correct? Or I should say, the High Council now believes my theory, the better theory, is correct?"
msgstr "그럼 제 이론이 맞은 거예요? 아니면, 대의회에서 제 이론이 더 나은 이론이라고 믿어주는 거냐고 해야 하려나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I live for a good cover story.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I live for a good cover story.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I look forward to seeing you at the negotiations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001873"
msgid "You'd fit well in the Ministry of Conjunction, that is, if you succeed."
msgstr "결합성에 잘 어울리는 사람이군요. 물론 성공해야겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So it'll be my word against the Zealot leaders?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So it'll be my word against the Zealot leaders?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I'll make sure no one's left alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001872"
msgid "Yes, but don't worry. I'll be there to reinforce what Razma already knows: the Zealots cannot be trusted."
msgstr "네. 걱정 말아요. 거기서 라즈마 형님이 이미 아시는 사실을 상기시켜 줄 테니까. 광신도는 믿을 수 없다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I would think you'd both want to be on the same page.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would think you'd both want to be on the same page.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Now, I have much to do, and so do you. Ekris and the High Council will be expecting you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001871"
msgid "You and the rest of our House."
msgstr "우리 가문 전체가 그리 생각하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When we get back, you can say that to their faces.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When we get back, you can say that to their faces.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The Zealots aren't aware of how I've been delving into their systems here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103591F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001870"
msgid "With pleasure, but I won't leave without the others."
msgstr "말씀은 고마운데, 저 혼자만 가진 않겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right, let's go.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right, let's go.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103591C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186F"
msgid "Oh, I'm not going anywhere yet."
msgstr "아, 전 아직 안 움직일 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's get back to getting out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get back to getting out of here.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The Zealots aren't aware of how I've been delving into their systems here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035923
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186E"
msgid "Yes, step one is freeing the others."
msgstr "네. 1단계는 다른 사람들을 풀어주는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's exactly why I'm here to rescue you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's exactly why I'm here to rescue you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I knew it. I told them their algorithms and insufficient testing were only giving the illusion of stability.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035927
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186D"
msgid "Are -- Are you saying my theory is correct?"
msgstr "그... 그 말은 제 이론이 맞았다는 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Violence isn't always the answer.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Violence isn't always the answer.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103591A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186C"
msgid "I fear you may have no choice here."
msgstr "여기선 선택의 여지가 없을 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Believes that the only reason she's being rescued is due to information. / Sad / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Forget Razma. You're better off on your own anyway. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035926
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186B"
msgid "Of course, this is what it would take for Razma to send someone after me."
msgstr "역시 그런 이유가 있었으니까 라즈마 님이 사람을 보낸 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Come with me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Come with me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035916
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00186A"
msgid "Wait, I can't just leave."
msgstr "잠깐만요, 그냥은 못 가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Calm down. I'm on your side.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Calm down. I'm on your side.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001869"
msgid "On our side? Who are you?"
msgstr "우리 편인가요? 누구시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm your rescue party. Now let's go.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm your rescue party. Now let's go.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035910
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001868"
msgid "Thank the Serpent. But I can't leave yet."
msgstr "뱀이시여, 감사합니다. 하지만 아직은 못 가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I just need enough time to set up a remote device so I can launch a virus that will render this place useless. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001866"
msgid "Well, you have to."
msgstr "음, 그러셔야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001865"
msgid "Serpent's Grace, I knew it. I knew she wouldn't just leave us here to rot."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 은총이시여. 감사합니다. 그럴 줄 알았어요. 장로님이 우릴 내버려둘 리가 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Questioning since the player is dressed like a Zealot. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't worry. I'm here to help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't worry. I'm here to help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035915
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001864"
msgid "But you're... If you're not a Zealot, who are you?"
msgstr "하지만 당신이... 광신도가 아니라면, 누구시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001863"
msgid "The Great Serpent is merciful, you could've said as much. And Sahima? Did you find her yet?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 자비라는 말을 몇 번씩 해도 모자라겠네요. 사히마는요? 찾아보셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm the one breaking you out of this place.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one breaking you out of this place.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: She's fine. Just follow me and we can get out of here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001862"
msgid "Thank the Serpent. And Sahima? Did you find her? Is she safe?"
msgstr "뱀이시여, 감사합니다. 사히마는요? 찾았나요? 안전합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's go. She'll meet us outside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001861"
msgid "Thank the Serpent. Forgive my initial coarseness. So that means she's safe?"
msgstr "뱀이시여, 감사합니다. 아까 거칠게 말한 건 죄송해요. 그럼 사히마는 안전한 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Emphasis on the word you / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's time to get everyone back.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's time to get everyone back.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001860"
msgid "Correction, it's time for you to get back."
msgstr "정확히는, 먼저 돌아가셔야 할 시간이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're welcome. I'm glad everyone made it out safely.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're welcome. I'm glad everyone made it out safely.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185F"
msgid "Now, it's time for you to head back."
msgstr "이제 슬슬 돌아가 보셔야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185E"
msgid "Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 라즈마 님이 도와주셨으니까, 저도 은혜를 갚는 게 도리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like a plan.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like a plan.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I just need enough time to set up a remote device so I can launch a virus that will render this place useless. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035909
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185D"
msgid "And a well-thought-out one at that."
msgstr "세심하게 준비한 계획이기도 하고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185C"
msgid "You're no one."
msgstr "뭣도 아닌 놈이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm the Serpent's chosen Harbinger. The only one who can understand Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the Serpent's chosen Harbinger. The only one who can understand Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185B"
msgid "You think I care about Anasko Va'ruun? Son of a traitor?"
msgstr "내가 아나스코 바룬을 신경 쓸 것 같냐? 그 배신자의 아들 놈을?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business. &&& Razma: Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over. &&& Mihael: Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You think the Fleet scares me? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00185A"
msgid "I'm in the Fleet. And I'd do what she says if I were you."
msgstr "내가 크림슨 함대 소속이거든. 내가 너라면 시키는 대로 하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm in the Fleet. And I'd do what she says if I were you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm in the Fleet. And I'd do what she says if I were you.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001859"
msgid "You think the Fleet scares me?"
msgstr "내가 함대에 겁먹을 것 같냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm a Ryujin operative, and disruption is my speciality. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm a Ryujin operative, and disruption is my speciality. 
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358CE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001858"
msgid "House Ka'dic dealing with outsiders?"
msgstr "카딕 가문이 이방인과 놀아난다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm a UC Captain.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm a UC Captain.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358CA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001857"
msgid "The UC has no power here."
msgstr "연합은 여기선 아무것도 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm a Freestar Ranger, here to enforce justice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm a Freestar Ranger, here to enforce justice.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358CC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001856"
msgid "Freestar Rangers have no power here."
msgstr "자유항성 레인저라도 여기선 아무것도 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No one here wants violence. You walk away, you get the device.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No one here wants violence. You walk away, you get the device.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your Shadow Station allies know nothing of this. That's not the death they want.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001855"
msgid "A device that may well be a ploy? And for what?"
msgstr "장치가 속임수일지도 모르는데? 그리고 뭘 위해서?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today. &&& Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001854"
msgid "Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery."
msgstr "아... 내 눈은 잘 뜨여 있다. 이 배신 속에서 진실을 찾아내기가 어려울 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's what you get. Your unsuspecting allies at Shadow Station Epsilon may appreciate it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's what you get. Your unsuspecting allies at Shadow Station Epsilon may appreciate it.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Attack] Fine. But this is on you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001853"
msgid "Unsuspecting or not, we're all willing to sacrifice."
msgstr "알건 모르건, 우린 모두 기꺼이 희생할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your Shadow Station allies know nothing of this. That's not the death they want.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your Shadow Station allies know nothing of this. That's not the death they want.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Besides, you think I'd turn my back on the insults thrown here today?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001852"
msgid "No, but it's the death they know is possible."
msgstr "그렇겠지. 하지만 그럴 가능성은 이미 알고 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: All right. I won't deny my bretheren the death they deserve, but I won't forget this either. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001851"
msgid "Hmm. You may be newly Promised, but I can't deny how the pieces fit."
msgstr "흠. 약속받은 자가 된 지 얼마 안 된 놈인데도, 내가 부정 못할 말을 하는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Enough lives have been lost. Live to fight another day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Enough lives have been lost. Live to fight another day.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: All right. I won't deny my bretheren the death they deserve, but I won't forget this either. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035899
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001850"
msgid "And that day will come..."
msgstr "그 날은 반드시 오겠지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today. &&& Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184F"
msgid "Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery."
msgstr "아... 내 눈은 잘 뜨여 있다. 이 배신 속에서 진실을 찾아내기가 어려울 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Someone withholding information. What a surprise.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Someone withholding information. What a surprise.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033735
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184E"
msgid "I'm glad to see you're well versed in humanity."
msgstr "인간이라는 존재를 잘 아는 것 같아 다행이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That explains a lot. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That explains a lot. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184D"
msgid "Does it? I'd be curious to know what you've discussed."
msgstr "그런가요? 무슨 대화를 하고 온 건지 궁금해지는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure that's something the High Council wouldn't be too keen on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure that's something the High Council wouldn't be too keen on.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: House Ka'dic already has a reputation for being sympathetic to the Zealots, but the truth is far worse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184C"
msgid "As a member, I can say it certainly is not."
msgstr "나도 의원이니, 그건 확실하다고 할 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033737
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184B"
msgid "I'm surprised she even mentioned that much."
msgstr "거기까지 말해줬다니 놀랍군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00184A"
msgid "An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless."
msgstr "지나치게 단순한 의견이지만, 그래도 정확한 표현이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And you expect me to do something about it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033727
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001849"
msgid "How astute."
msgstr "눈치 좋네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not tell the Council and have them put a stop to it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why not tell the Council and have them put a stop to it?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033725
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001848"
msgid "Exposing this information to the Council would condemn not only Razma, but House Ka'dic along with her."
msgstr "이 정보를 대의회에 공개하면 라즈마 형님만 끝장나는 게 아니라 카딕 가문도 같이 휘말릴 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not tell the Council and have them put a stop to it?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: And you expect me to do something about it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033725
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001847"
msgid "I've no wish to tarnish our House or ruin my sister. I simply want to show her the error of her ways."
msgstr "우리 가문을 더럽히거나 형님을 몰락시키고 싶진 않아요. 단지 형님이 잘못했다는 걸 보여주고 싶을 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033720
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001845"
msgid "I'm doing what I must to preserve this House."
msgstr "이 가문을 지키기 위한 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're condoning the murder of your own family.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033720
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001844"
msgid "All you need to get is Sahima's research, which she has with her."
msgstr "사히마의 연구 자료만 찾아오면 돼요. 사히마가 갖고 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033734
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001843"
msgid "The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control."
msgstr ""
"사실은, 라즈마 형님이 그 광신도 집단을 자기 손바닥 안에 둔 지도 꽤 오래 됐답니다. 지금은 통제력을 잃었기 때문에 문제가 됐을 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment>] Show me the credits and it's a done deal.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001842"
msgid "I knew you'd be reasonable, Harbinger."
msgstr "말이 통할 줄 알았어요, 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I try not to judge people.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I try not to judge people.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001841"
msgid "How magnanimous."
msgstr "도량이 아주 크군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I thought we need Sahima alive.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I thought we need Sahima alive.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001840"
msgid "What we need is Sahima's research... which she has with her."
msgstr "필요한 건 사히마의 연구 자료에요... 사히마가 갖고 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I thought we need Sahima alive.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No way I'm doing your dirty work. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00183F"
msgid "You just need to bring it back."
msgstr "그것만 가져오면 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I believe they're misunderstood.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I believe they're misunderstood.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033724
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00183E"
msgid "Yes, much like any murderer or terrorist."
msgstr "그래요. 다른 살인자나 테러리스트처럼 말이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Fine, but only because no one should work with Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Fine, but only because no one should work with Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033719
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00183D"
msgid "A wise decision, Harbinger."
msgstr "현명한 결정이에요, 선구자."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I assure you, you already have it. House Dul'kehf only wishes to serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001834"
msgid "Tell me what it will take to gain House Dul'kehf's cooperation."
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 협조를 얻으려면 뭐가 필요한지 말해 줘요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I assure you, you already have it. House Dul'kehf only wishes to serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001833"
msgid "I'm ready to help House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "둘케프 가문을 도와 줄 준비가 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me what it will take to gain House Dul'kehf's cooperation.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: My cousin Hasmak was named Elder of the House and Steward of the Ministry of Commerce after the incident.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001832"
msgid "I assure you, you already have it. House Dul'kehf only wishes to serve."
msgstr "제가 장담컨대, 저흰 이미 협조 중입니다. 둘케프 가문은 섬기길 원할 뿐이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me what it will take to gain House Dul'kehf's cooperation.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I'll go see him right away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBEE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001831"
msgid "As I said, it is House Dul'kehf that wishes to help you. Elder Hasmak awaits."
msgstr "전에 말했듯이, 둘케프 가문은 그대를 돕고 싶을 뿐입니다. 해즈막 장로님이 기다리십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I assure you, you already have it. House Dul'kehf only wishes to serve.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: He is aware of your presence here in Dazra, and is eager to meet with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001830"
msgid "My cousin Hasmak was named Elder of the House and Steward of the Ministry of Commerce after the incident."
msgstr "그 사고 이후로 제 친척이신 해즈막 님께서 가문의 장로이자 상무성의 책임자로 임명되셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
