#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_CREW_Generic_SpaceshipEnemyEngineDown
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipEnemyEngineDown
msgctxt "001802"
msgid "Jinan has blessed us by destroying their engines!"
msgstr "지난 님께서 적의 엔진을 파괴해 우리에게 은총을 내리셨다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
