#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB54
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_GenericCitizens_CREW_Generic_SpaceshipEnemyEngineDown
