#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Mujeen, Tevina
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F7"
msgid "It's possible they were lost in the tragedy along with everything else. But I don't know for sure."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있어요. 다른 모든 것들과 함께 그 비극 속에서 사라졌을 수도 있죠. 하지만 확실히는 몰라요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: Under normal circumstances? Yes. Under these circumstances? The concept of "overworked" doesn't exist.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Worked
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F6"
msgid "Are you being overworked?"
msgstr "혹시 과로하고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you being overworked?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Worked
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F5"
msgid "Under normal circumstances? Yes. Under these circumstances? The concept of \"overworked\" doesn't exist."
msgstr "평상시 기준으로요? 네. 하지만 현 상황 기준으로는요? 과로라는 개념 자체가 존재할 수 없죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: Ahem, about that... So, I was on the fast track to be a Herald, once upon a time. Emphasis on the "Was."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F4"
msgid "Can you heal people?"
msgstr "사람들을 치료할 수 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you heal people?
#. ALIAS: Z03_Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Z03_Vassilis: Turns out I am a bit squeamish when it comes to uh... blood and viscera.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103EF99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Vassilis_TL_Profession
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F3"
msgid "Ahem, about that... So, I was on the fast track to be a Herald, once upon a time. Emphasis on the \"Was.\""
msgstr ""
"아, 그게... 그러니까, 과거에 저는 전령이 되기 위해 속성 과정을 거치고 있었어요. '있었어요'라고 강조하는 데는 이유가 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Gamiral
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm.
