#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F1"
msgid "I'm looking for a way into the dam nearby."
msgstr "근처 댐에 들어갈 방법을 찾는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for a way into the dam nearby.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
