#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017F0"
msgid "Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm."
msgstr "왜요? 거긴 이 농장보다 크게 쓸만한 것도 없는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gamiral: Are you sure you are in the right place?
