#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017EF"
msgid "Water, seaweed, failing dreams... That is the extent of it."
msgstr "물, 해초, 망해버린 꿈... 그 정도만 남은 곳이라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gamiral: Water, seaweed, failing dreams... That is the extent of it.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was told that supplies and equipment had been delivered here.
