#. TOPIC: 0103EBF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017EE"
msgid "Are you sure you are in the right place?"
msgstr "제대로 찾아온 거 맞아요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for a way into the dam nearby. &&& Gamiral: Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm. &&& Gamiral: Water, seaweed, failing dreams... That is the extent of it. &&& Gamiral: Are you sure you are in the right place?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I fear you may have been given bad information. This place has remained as you see it for... Well, at least for my lifetime.
