#. TOPIC: 0103EBF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017ED"
msgid "I was told that supplies and equipment had been delivered here."
msgstr "물자랑 장비가 여기로 배송됐다는 말을 들어서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was told that supplies and equipment had been delivered here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was told that supplies and equipment had been delivered here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017EC"
msgid "I fear you may have been given bad information. This place has remained as you see it for... Well, at least for my lifetime."
msgstr "이상한 말을 들은 것 같네요. 여긴 지금 보이는 그대로 남아 있었거든요... 뭐, 적어도 내 평생 동안은 그랬죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was told that supplies and equipment had been delivered here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017EB"
msgid "My father told stories of the days before the dam was built, but that was back before I was born. Since then, it has just been... like this."
msgstr ""
"아버지가 댐이 지어지기 전 이야기를 해 준 적도 있는데, 그건 내가 태어나기도 전 일이에요. 그 이후로는 그냥... 쭉 이랬어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for a way into the dam nearby. &&& Gamiral: Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm. &&& Gamiral: Water, seaweed, failing dreams... That is the extent of it. &&& Gamiral: Are you sure you are in the right place?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House of Commerce? In Dazra? Then things there are not as bad as we feared.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017EA"
msgid "The House of Commerce sent me here specifically."
msgstr "상무성에서 특별히 보내서 온 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The House of Commerce sent me here specifically.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The House of Commerce sent me here specifically.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017E9"
msgid "House of Commerce? In Dazra? Then things there are not as bad as we feared."
msgstr "상무성이요? 다즈라 말이죠? 그럼 상황이 우리 걱정만큼 나쁘진 않나 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The House of Commerce sent me here specifically.
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017E8"
msgid "We had hoped to turn things around here, produce enough food to start trading with the city again."
msgstr "여기 형편을 더 좋게 만들어서, 다시 도시하고 거래할 수 있을 정도로 식량을 생산하고 싶었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for a way into the dam nearby. &&& Gamiral: Why? That place has only slightly more utility than this farm. &&& Gamiral: Water, seaweed, failing dreams... That is the extent of it. &&& Gamiral: Are you sure you are in the right place?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's not often we get visitors, and less often they have a sense of humor. Look around. You can see this place for what it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017E7"
msgid "Are there any high tech facilities nearby?"
msgstr "혹시 근처에 첨단 기술 시설이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are there any high tech facilities nearby?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are there any high tech facilities nearby?
#. ALIAS: Gamiral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGamiralAbbas
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBF1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_GamiralScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017E6"
msgid "It's not often we get visitors, and less often they have a sense of humor. Look around. You can see this place for what it is."
msgstr "방문객도 별로 없지만, 이런 유머 감각 있는 사람은 진짜 보기 힘든데 말이죠. 둘러봐요. 여기가 어떤 곳인지 보이잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: saying hello to their boss. / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
