msgid "Do you have an assignment for me, Captain?"
msgstr "선장님, 제게 맡기실 임무가 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
