#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0017E2"
msgid "I'm ready to work, all I need is an assignment."
msgstr "전 일할 준비가 됐습니다. 임무만 내려 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
