msgid "Any postings available yet, Captain?"
msgstr "선장님, 혹시 자리가 났습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Friendly
