#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not the Elder of House Dul'kehf. My access to information has its limits. Hasmak's position allows him much more.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBE4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage100_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D7"
msgid "If the information is important, why can't you give it to me?"
msgstr "그렇게 중요한 정보라면, 왜 그냥 말해주지 않는 건데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If the information is important, why can't you give it to me?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If the information is important, why can't you give it to me?
