msgid "I am not the Elder of House Dul'kehf. My access to information has its limits. Hasmak's position allows him much more."
msgstr "저는 둘케프 가문의 장로가 아닙니다. 정보 접속 권한에 한계가 있지요. 해즈막 님의 지위라면 권한이 훨씬 넓을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D5"
msgid "Hello, Harbinger."
msgstr "안녕하신가. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBE1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D4"
msgid "Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed."
msgstr "말리보어가 상황을 계속 알려줬다네. 그... 대의회가 꽉 막혀 있다지. 자네가 여기 온 게 상황이 변했다는 뜻이라면 좋겠네만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger. &&& Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Straight to business? The Ministry of Commerce would have suited you well.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D3"
msgid "Let's not waste time. I understand you have information for me."
msgstr "시간 낭비하지 말죠. 장로님이 정보를 가지고 있다는 걸 압니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's not waste time. I understand you have information for me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's not waste time. I understand you have information for me.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D2"
msgid "Straight to business? The Ministry of Commerce would have suited you well."
msgstr "바로 본론으로 들어가자고? 자네, 상무성에 아주 잘 맞을 것 같구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger. &&& Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D1"
msgid "Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess."
msgstr "장로님의 도움이 이 난리통을 바로잡을 첫 걸음이 되겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger. &&& Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017D0"
msgid "The other Houses have agreed to cooperate, yes. Now it's just down to you."
msgstr "다른 가문들은 협력하기로 했으니까요. 이제 장로님만 남으셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hello, Harbinger. &&& Hasmak: Malibor has kept me informed of the situation, the... deadlock of the High Council. I hope your presence here means things have changed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CF"
msgid "We're making progress, but your help is vital."
msgstr "진전이 있기는 하지만, 장로님의 도움이 꼭 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CE"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "그렇군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The other Houses have agreed to cooperate, yes. Now it's just down to you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CD"
msgid "Good, good."
msgstr "좋지, 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're right. I must've hit my head. Forget I said that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0111F230
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage1350_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CC"
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr "그래, 물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I am pleased that the Council is once again working towards a solution. It felt... wrong not to help.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I was in the temple next door, conversing with my cousin. I was in the middle of replying to him about... you know, I don't even recall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CB"
msgid "Do you know where I was when it happened? The \"incident\", they call it."
msgstr "그 때 내가 어디에 있었는지 아는가? 그 '사고'가 났을 때 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Do you know where I was when it happened? The "incident", they call it.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Some meaningless bit of family drama, I am sure. One moment he was there, and the next... Gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017CA"
msgid "I was in the temple next door, conversing with my cousin. I was in the middle of replying to him about... you know, I don't even recall."
msgstr "난 옆 건물 사원에서 내 사촌과 대화 중이었다네. 질문에 한창 대답하던 중이었는데... 사실, 내용이 기억나지도 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I was in the temple next door, conversing with my cousin. I was in the middle of replying to him about... you know, I don't even recall.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: My cousin, the floor, the wall... Just... gone. I found myself looking out at the Scaled Citadel, unable to comprehend. And now here I stand, the Elder of House Dul'kehf.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBDA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C9"
msgid "Some meaningless bit of family drama, I am sure. One moment he was there, and the next... Gone."
msgstr "분명 별 의미 없는 가족 이야기였겠지. 분명 그 자리에 있었는데, 다음 순간... 사라져 버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Some meaningless bit of family drama, I am sure. One moment he was there, and the next... Gone.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sorry for your loss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C8"
msgid "My cousin, the floor, the wall... Just... gone. I found myself looking out at the Scaled Citadel, unable to comprehend. And now here I stand, the Elder of House Dul'kehf."
msgstr ""
"내 사촌, 바닥, 벽까지... 다 사라졌지. 정신을 차려보니 비늘 성채가 보였는데, 도무지 이해가 안 되더라고. 그렇게 내가 둘케프 "
"가문의 장로가 된 거라네."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Vaeric is gone. I'm sorry. &&& HVDazraBiancaLatif: Gone? So the rumors are true.|The Ministry of State... his own family executed him as a traitor.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraBiancaLatif
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I appreciate the sentiment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Bianca_VaericScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C7"
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr "그런 일을 겪으셨다니 유감이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm here for information, not a story.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm here for information, not a story.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C6"
msgid "Can not stories themselves be information?"
msgstr "이야기 자체가 정보가 될 수는 없을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry for your loss.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry for your loss.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Anything to get ahead, right?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C5"
msgid "My loss? Yes, I suppose. Although from an outside perspective, one could consider it a fair trade, given my new role. Perhaps even a gain."
msgstr ""
"유감? 그래, 그렇겠지. 외부자가 본다면 내 새로운 역할에 대한 공정한 값이라고 생각할 수도 있지만 말일세. 어쩌면 이득일지도 모르고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your help will be the first step in fixing this mess. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: I was in the temple next door, conversing with my cousin. I was in the middle of replying to him about... you know, I don't even recall. &&& Hasmak: Some meaningless bit of family drama, I am sure. One moment he was there, and the next... Gone. &&& Hasmak: My cousin, the floor, the wall... Just... gone. I found myself looking out at the Scaled Citadel, unable to comprehend. And now here I stand, the Elder of House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Can not stories themselves be information?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C4"
msgid "I'm here for information, not a story."
msgstr "전 이야기가 아니라 정보를 들으러 온 건데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C3"
msgid "A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment."
msgstr ""
"나와 다즈라의 참상 사이를 갈라놓은 건... 고작 1미터 거리였지. 그 이후로 그렇게 많은 혼란과 투쟁이 있었지만, 지금도 그 순간의 "
"기억을 잊을 수가 없다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Hardly. I was quite comfortable with my position within House Dul'kehf, and fully expected to remain where I was.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C2"
msgid "You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence."
msgstr "자네는 상상도 못 해. 그 순수하고도 끔찍한 침묵의 순간을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C1"
msgid "I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why."
msgstr "나도 사라져버릴 수 있었지만, 여기 남아있지. 살아남았어. 이유는 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything to get ahead, right? &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence. &&& Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment. &&& Hasmak: I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps. But it has come at such a cost.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017C0"
msgid "The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 장로님을 위한 계획을 세우신 거예요. 우리 모두에게 그렇게 하시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBD0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BF"
msgid "Perhaps. But it has come at such a cost."
msgstr "그럴지도. 하지만 대가가 너무 크구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything to get ahead, right? &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence. &&& Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment. &&& Hasmak: I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And where is this "forward" leading?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BE"
msgid "You can't dwell on the past. Have to keep moving forward."
msgstr "과거에 붙잡히면 안 돼요. 계속 앞으로 나아가야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can't dwell on the past. Have to keep moving forward.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can't dwell on the past. Have to keep moving forward.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BD"
msgid "And where is this \"forward\" leading?"
msgstr "그 '앞'은 대체 어디로 향하는 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Perhaps. But it has come at such a cost.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BC"
msgid "I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you."
msgstr "미안하네. 내가 짊어져야 할 짐을 자네에게 강요하면 안 되는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BB"
msgid "I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests."
msgstr "대의회에서 다투는 것도 지쳐서, 더 이상은 관여하고 싶지도 않네. 요구할 것도 없고, 부탁할 것도 없으이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Anything to get ahead, right? &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: You cannot imagine it. A single moment of pure, terrible silence. &&& Hasmak: A meter's distance was all that separated me from... whatever has become of Dazra. I find that through all the chaos and the scrambling since, my mind drifts back to that moment. &&& Hasmak: I could be gone as well, but here I remain. Spared. And I do not know why.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hopefully you can deliver them from this... But what comes after? What about the next trial?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017BA"
msgid "Other people are suffering right now, and we can help them."
msgstr "다른 사람들은 지금도 고통받고 있어요. 저희가 도와줄 수 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B9"
msgid "That remains to be seen."
msgstr "그건 두고 볼 일이겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B8"
msgid "All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception."
msgstr "'모두가 섬겨야 한다'. 둘케프 가문도 예외가 아니라네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you. &&& Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests. &&& Hasmak: All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That remains to be seen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B7"
msgid "Your selflessness will not go unnoticed."
msgstr "그 이타심이 널리 알려질 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent has a plan for you, as He does for us all. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you. &&& Hasmak: I had grown so tired of the Council's squabbling, and I want no further part in it. I have no demands, no requests. &&& Hasmak: All Must Serve, and House Dul'kehf is no exception.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Speaker has always been the guiding light of House Va'ruun. In his absence, it is of no surprise that some would find themselves lost, stumbling in the dark.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B6"
msgid "Everyone seems to want something out of this."
msgstr "다들 뭐라도 결과가 나오길 바라는 것 같던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Other people are suffering right now, and we can help them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Other people are suffering right now, and we can help them.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I am sorry. I should shoulder my own burdens, not force them upon you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B5"
msgid "Hopefully you can deliver them from this... But what comes after? What about the next trial?"
msgstr "나도 자네가 신민들을 구해주길 바라네... 하지만 그 다음엔? 다음 시련은 어떻게 해야 하나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Everyone seems to want something out of this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Everyone seems to want something out of this.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B4"
msgid "The Speaker has always been the guiding light of House Va'ruun. In his absence, it is of no surprise that some would find themselves lost, stumbling in the dark."
msgstr ""
"대변자님께선 항상 바룬 가문의 등대 같은 분이셨지. 그분이 없으시니, 사람들이 어둠 속에서 길을 잃고 비틀거리는 것도 놀랄 일이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: That remains to be seen.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B3"
msgid "Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress."
msgstr ""
"내가 아는 그대로 말해 주겠네. 이 대재난이 있기 얼마 전에, 아나스코 바룬 님이 찾아오셔서 그분의 조부님 시절에 대한 정보를 "
"찾으셨다네. 그분은... 진전이 없는 것에 좌절하고 계셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Here is what I can tell you: some time before our current calamity, Anasko Va'ruun approached me looking for information about his grandfather's time. He was... frustrated at the lack of progress.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B2"
msgid "House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount."
msgstr ""
"둘케프 가문은 아주 많은 기록을 보관하고 있거든. 왜 그런 내용을 조사하시는지 묻지는 않았네만, 어느 정도는 추론할 수 있겠더구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: I told Anasko where those materials had been sent. Weeks later... Well, you have seen the Citadel. You know as well as any where we are now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B1"
msgid "I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research."
msgstr "뱀의 성전 시기에 기록된 선적 적하 목록을 건네 드렸다네. 자재와 장비를 보아하니 굉장히 전문적인 연구 관련 물품 같았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You think it's related.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBC1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017B0"
msgid "I told Anasko where those materials had been sent. Weeks later... Well, you have seen the Citadel. You know as well as any where we are now."
msgstr ""
"아나스코 님께 그 자재가 어디로 배송됐는지도 말씀드렸지. 그리고 몇 주 뒤에... 뭐, 자네도 성채 꼴을 봤겠지. 우리가 지금 어떻게 "
"됐는지도 알 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount. &&& Hasmak: I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research. &&& Hasmak: I told Anasko where those materials had been sent. Weeks later... Well, you have seen the Citadel. You know as well as any where we are now.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
