#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017AE"
msgid "You think it's related."
msgstr "그 사고와 연관이 있다고 생각하시는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You think it's related.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You think it's related.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Anasko returned from the site in unusually good spirits. He boasted of something called a "Vortex Interlock," and that it was the key to unlocking some new, unseen potential.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017AD"
msgid "The timing is too close to be coincidence."
msgstr "우연이라기엔 시기가 너무 가까우니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your selflessness will not go unnoticed. &&& ...  &&& Hasmak: House Dul'kehf keeps extensive records, you see. While I was never told the exact reason behind the inquiry, I was able to deduce a fair amount. &&& Hasmak: I provided him with the shipping manifests from the time of the Serpent's Crusade. Materials and equipment that suggested some highly specialized research. &&& Hasmak: I told Anasko where those materials had been sent. Weeks later... Well, you have seen the Citadel. You know as well as any where we are now.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I believe so, yes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBBD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017AC"
msgid "He must have found something."
msgstr "분명 뭔가를 찾아냈던 거겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He must have found something.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He must have found something.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Anasko returned from the site in unusually good spirits. He boasted of something called a "Vortex Interlock," and that it was the key to unlocking some new, unseen potential.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBBC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017AB"
msgid "I believe so, yes."
msgstr "나도 그렇게 본다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: The timing is too close to be coincidence.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: Whatever records exist of this Interlock were swallowed up with the Citadel. And as for the original site... Executors were sent, but did not return. And we can spare no more casualties.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017AA"
msgid "Anasko returned from the site in unusually good spirits. He boasted of something called a \"Vortex Interlock,\" and that it was the key to unlocking some new, unseen potential."
msgstr ""
"아나스코 님은 유난히 좋은 기분으로 돌아오셨지. '볼텍스 제어장치'라고 불리는 물건을 자랑하셨어. 새롭고 전례 없는 잠재력을 해방시킬 "
"열쇠라면서 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Anasko returned from the site in unusually good spirits. He boasted of something called a "Vortex Interlock," and that it was the key to unlocking some new, unseen potential.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: So, I suggest you visit Ma'leen Dam, to the southeast. I believe it is more than it seems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A9"
msgid "Whatever records exist of this Interlock were swallowed up with the Citadel. And as for the original site... Executors were sent, but did not return. And we can spare no more casualties."
msgstr ""
"그 제어장치에 대한 기록은 성채와 함께 휩쓸려 버렸지. 그리고 장치가 있던 위치는... 실무관들을 보내 봤지만 아무도 돌아오지 못했어. "
"더 이상의 희생은 감당할 수 없다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: Whatever records exist of this Interlock were swallowed up with the Citadel. And as for the original site... Executors were sent, but did not return. And we can spare no more casualties.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Hasmak: It is the only place to learn more about these Vortex Interlocks and what conenection they may have to the events at the Citadel.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A8"
msgid "So, I suggest you visit Ma'leen Dam, to the southeast. I believe it is more than it seems."
msgstr "그러니 남동쪽에 있는 마린 댐으로 가 보게나. 거기에 뭔가가 더 있을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Hasmak: It is the only place to learn more about these Vortex Interlocks and what conenection they may have to the events at the Citadel.
#. ALIAS: Hasmak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMHasmakDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage200_HasmakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A7"
msgid "And, should your search be fruitful, make sure it is known that House Dul'kehf was proud to serve when called upon."
msgstr "그리고 수색에 성과가 있으면, 둘케프 가문이 부름을 받고 기꺼이 섬겼다고 확실하게 말해 주게나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: It's fine. It was built extra strong, and the railings are all sturdy. There aren't any sharp edges.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A6"
msgid "So you are trying to get in there?"
msgstr "그럼 저기 들어가려는 거예요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: So you are trying to get in there?
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: I saw him! But he didn't talk to me. And there were too many other people around him. They all looked really serious.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A5"
msgid "You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here!"
msgstr "최근에 여기 온 사람이 더 있었거든요. 아나스코 바룬 님까지 왔었어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Comrak: You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here!
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm actually here because I'm trying to help Anasko.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A4"
msgid "I saw him! But he didn't talk to me. And there were too many other people around him. They all looked really serious."
msgstr "직접 봤어요! 서로 말은 안 했지만요. 그분 주변에 다른 사람들이 너무 많았어요. 다들 진짜 심각해 보였고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm actually here because I'm trying to help Anasko.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm actually here because I'm trying to help Anasko.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: But I did see them go in. They had cards that let them open the door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A3"
msgid "I heard he disappeared! Is that true? I never saw him come back out of the dam..."
msgstr "그분이 사라졌다면서요! 진짜예요? 댐에서 나오시는 건 못 봤거든요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This isn't a safe place for a child. &&& ...  &&& Comrak: So you are trying to get in there? &&& Comrak: You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here! &&& Comrak: I saw him! But he didn't talk to me. And there were too many other people around him. They all looked really serious.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I heard he disappeared! Is that true? I never saw him come back out of the dam...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A2"
msgid "I'm actually here because I'm trying to help Anasko."
msgstr "사실은 아나스코를 도와주려고 온 거란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This isn't a safe place for a child. &&& ...  &&& Comrak: So you are trying to get in there? &&& Comrak: You're not the first person to come here recently, you know. Anasko Va'ruun himself was here! &&& Comrak: I saw him! But he didn't talk to me. And there were too many other people around him. They all looked really serious.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, but it wasn't much. I didn't want to get too close. Father says I get in the way too much, and I didn't want to do that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A1"
msgid "I need you to tell me everything you saw."
msgstr "네가 봤던 걸 전부 말해주렴."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need you to tell me everything you saw.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need you to tell me everything you saw.
#. ALIAS: Comrak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMComrakAbbas
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Comrak: But I did see them go in. They had cards that let them open the door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ05
#. TOPIC: 0103EBB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ05_Stage400_ComrakScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0017A0"
msgid "Okay, but it wasn't much. I didn't want to get too close. Father says I get in the way too much, and I didn't want to do that."
msgstr "알았어요. 많지는 않아요. 너무 가까이 안 가려고 했거든요. 아버지가 너무 방해된다고 하셔서, 방해하고 싶지 않았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ah-ra-ra / Confused / to ReigenHeadtrack01, ReigenHeadtrack02
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: It says here "senbei"... rice crackers. Did I mean a crack in the wall? Cracking a code? Tough nut to crack?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFFA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_030_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001794"
msgid "Now where did I put it? Serpent's tongue, I'm getting tied up with my own system."
msgstr "그걸 어디에 뒀더라? 위대한 뱀이시여, 내가 만든 분류체계인데 내가 당하다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mumbling to self / Confused / to ReigenHeadtrack01, ReigenHeadtrack02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Now where did I put it? Serpent's tongue, I'm getting tied up with my own system.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_030_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001793"
msgid "It says here \"senbei\"... rice crackers. Did I mean a crack in the wall? Cracking a code? Tough nut to crack?"
msgstr ""
"여기 '센베이'라고 쓰여 있는데... 쌀 전병. 무슨 뜻으로 쓴 거더라? 쌀을 전부 병에 담아라? 쌀쌀하니 병나기 전에 조심해라? "
"전기요금 싼 병실로?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's a difficult question to answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001792"
msgid "Oh, hello. Have we met before?"
msgstr "오, 환영하네. 혹시 우리 서로 아는 사이인 게냐?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: No... but I'll know it when I see it. I think.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001791"
msgid "You've lost something important? Do you know what that might be?"
msgstr "잃어버린 게 중요한 겁니까? 뭐였는지 혹시 기억나시나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: All right. I have a CredStik lying around here somewhere. I tell you what. You find it, it's yours.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001790"
msgid "I've been trying to keep everything here sorted, based on a personal system."
msgstr "나는 주변 물건들을 나만의 분류체계대로 정리하려고 노력한단다."

#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178F"
msgid "The problem is that it's all gotten to be too much, and I can't find my things."
msgstr "그런데 문제는 그게 도를 넘어서, 이젠 물건을 전혀 못 찾겠다는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've lost something important? Do you know what that might be?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178E"
msgid "No... but I'll know it when I see it. I think."
msgstr "아니... 하지만 보면 기억날 것 같구나. 아마도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not yet, no.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not yet, no.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I've been trying to keep everything here sorted, based on a personal system. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178D"
msgid "Oh, well, in that case, it's nice to meet you. And I apologize for the mess."
msgstr "아, 그렇다면 만나서 반갑구나. 집안이 이 모양이라 미안하구먼."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Oh, several things. I just don't recall what they are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenKeys
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178C"
msgid "What is the missing keycard for?"
msgstr "잃어버리신 키카드는 어디에 쓰는 건가요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Not my socks, but Socks. He's a dog plushie. White as a pair of socks, if I recall correctly -- of course, no guarantee that I do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenSocks
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178B"
msgid "You lost your socks?"
msgstr "양말을 잃어 버리셨다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is the missing keycard for?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenKeys
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00178A"
msgid "Oh, several things. I just don't recall what they are."
msgstr "오, 여러 군데에 쓰겠지. 근데 그게 뭔지 기억이 안 나는구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFEF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenKeys
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001789"
msgid "Hm... maybe it was for a door? I'm sorry, I'm so forgetful these days."
msgstr "흠... 어디 문을 여는 거였나? 미안해. 요즘 자꾸 깜빡깜빡하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Oh, hello. Have we met before?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, well, in that case, it's nice to meet you. And I apologize for the mess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001788"
msgid "Not yet, no."
msgstr "아뇨, 처음 보는 사이입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Yes. I pick a word that reminds me of another word and that makes me remember where it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenSystem
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001787"
msgid "You have a system for sorting your things?"
msgstr "갖고 계신 물건들을 정리하는 분류체계를 만드셨다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You lost your socks?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFF1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenSocks
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001786"
msgid "Not my socks, but Socks. He's a dog plushie. White as a pair of socks, if I recall correctly -- of course, no guarantee that I do."
msgstr ""
"양말이는 신는 양말이 아니라, 내 강아지 인형 이름이란다. 양말 한 짝처럼 하얗지. 기억나는 대로면. 기억이 가물가물해서 확신은 "
"못하겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You have a system for sorting your things?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenSystem
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001785"
msgid "Yes. I pick a word that reminds me of another word and that makes me remember where it is."
msgstr "그렇단다. 나는 다른 단어를 연상시키는 단어를 골라서 그 단어로 물건 위치를 기억한단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenSystem
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001784"
msgid "There might be a slate around here that has more details. Maybe look around for those?"
msgstr "여기 어딘가에 자세한 정보가 적혀 있는 슬레이트가 있을 게다. 한번 찾아 줄래?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Well, my keycard, for one. Socks, for another. And one more thing. Something important, I think.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenLoss
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001783"
msgid "What things did you lose?"
msgstr "뭘 잃어버리셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What things did you lose?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenLoss
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001782"
msgid "Well, my keycard, for one. Socks, for another. And one more thing. Something important, I think."
msgstr "음, 키카드를 잃어버렸구나. 양말이하고. 그리고 하나 더... 뭔가 중요한 물건이 있었던 것 같은데."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I'm sorry, but I can't be bothered with that now. I need to find my things!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenMedicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001781"
msgid "I just came to make sure you've been taking your medicine."
msgstr "꾸준히 약을 챙겨 드시는지 확인하려고 온 것뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just came to make sure you've been taking your medicine.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenMedicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001780"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I can't be bothered with that now. I need to find my things!"
msgstr "미안하지만, 지금 그런 거 신경 쓸 겨를이 없다네. 잃어버린 물건들부터 찾아야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: You're back! Praise Jinan! But are you here to help?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But you are my volunteer, correct? I hope so, for both our sakes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00177F"
msgid "What do I look like, a calendar? I have no idea."
msgstr "절 뭘로 보시는 건가요? 달력인 줄 아십니까? 저도 모르겠다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do I look like, a calendar? I have no idea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do I look like, a calendar? I have no idea.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00177E"
msgid "But you are my volunteer, correct? I hope so, for both our sakes."
msgstr "그래도 절 도와주러 온 자원봉사자는 맞으시죠? 우리 둘 모두를 위해서라도 부디 그랬으면 좋겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to ReigenHeadtrack01, ReigenHeadtrack02
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: "Crackers"... did I mean a crack in the wall? Cracking a safe? A nut? This is a tough nut to crack.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFD1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_031_Scene_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00177D"
msgid "Now where did I put it? Jinan's breath, I'm getting confused by my own system."
msgstr "그걸 어디에 놨더라? 지난의 숨결이시여. 내가 만든 분류체계인데 내가 헷갈리다니."

msgctxt "00177C"
msgid "\"Crackers\"... did I mean a crack in the wall? Cracking a safe? A nut? This is a tough nut to crack."
msgstr "'쌀 전병'이라... 무슨 뜻으로 쓴 거지? 쌀을 전부 병에 담아라? 아이고, 등쌀이 따로 없구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Oh, hello. Have we met before?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do I really? That doesn't sound like me. But I admit I've been a tad forgetful as of late. And I take it you noticed the mess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00177B"
msgid "We have. And you owe me money."
msgstr "예. 아는 사이죠. 할아버지는 저한테 돈까지 빌렸다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We have. And you owe me money.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We have. And you owe me money.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_Greeting_ReigenStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00177A"
msgid "Do I really? That doesn't sound like me. But I admit I've been a tad forgetful as of late. And I take it you noticed the mess."
msgstr "정말로? 내가 그랬을 것 같지는 않은데. 근데 요즘 건망증이 좀 심해지긴 했지. 집안 상태만 봐도 알 수 있을 게다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Oh, that would be grand. This seems more like a two-person job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenHELP
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001779"
msgid "I can help you find your things."
msgstr "물건들 찾는 걸 도와드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can help you find your things.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenHELP
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001778"
msgid "Oh, that would be grand. This seems more like a two-person job."
msgstr "아, 그래주면 정말 좋지. 혼자보다는 둘이서 하는 게 나을 것 같았거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_040_TL_ReigenHELP
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001777"
msgid "With my system and your gusto, we'll find exactly what I'm looking for. Whatever it was."
msgstr "내 분류체계와 자네의 열정이라면, 내가 찾고 있는 게 뭔지 정확히 찾아낼 수 있을 게야. 뭔진 모르겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFCA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_050_MusicboxScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001776"
msgid "Oh, what do you have there? A music box?"
msgstr "오, 그게 뭐니? 뮤직 박스?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can inspect it and try to play it for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001775"
msgid "What is that, a music box? Huh, I don't remember owning that. I wonder if it even works."
msgstr "그게 뭐니? 뮤직 박스? 그런 게 있었던가? 작동은 되는 건지 궁금하구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: What is that, a music box? Huh, I don't remember owning that. I wonder if it even works.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Would you mind? I'm not very good with these things. But hopefully it still has a little bit of song inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001774"
msgid "I can inspect it and try to play it for you."
msgstr "한번 틀어 볼 수 있는지 살펴볼게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can inspect it and try to play it for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can inspect it and try to play it for you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001773"
msgid "Would you mind? I'm not very good with these things. But hopefully it still has a little bit of song inside."
msgstr "그래 주겠니? 난 그런 물건은 잘 못 다뤄서 말이지. 아직 안에 노래가 담겨 있어서 틀 수 있다면 좋을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: What is that, a music box? Huh, I don't remember owning that. I wonder if it even works.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I noticed that too. I'd be surprised if it had any song left inside.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001772"
msgid "It looks like it's in pretty bad shape."
msgstr "뮤직 박스 상태가 많이 안 좋아 보이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It looks like it's in pretty bad shape.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It looks like it's in pretty bad shape.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001771"
msgid "I noticed that too. I'd be surprised if it had any song left inside."
msgstr "내가 봐도 그렇구나. 아직도 음악이 나온다면 꽤 놀라울 것 같구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It looks like it's in pretty bad shape.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_060_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001770"
msgid "But maybe you can inspect it and try to play it?"
msgstr "혹시 한번 틀어 볼 수 있는지 살펴보겠니?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: This song... I... I can't...
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00176F"
msgid "I remember now. This song... it's the one my granddaughter used to sing."
msgstr "이제 기억이 나는구나. 이 노래... 손녀가 자주 부르던 노래야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00176E"
msgid "She used to help me around the house, doing chores, tidying up."
msgstr "우리 손녀는 집안일을 돕거나 청소하면서 뒷바라지를 해주곤 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFC3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00176D"
msgid "And then the accident happened, and I haven't seen her since."
msgstr "그러다 사고가 터졌고, 우리 손녀를 아직도 만나지 못했어."

