msgctxt "00176A"
msgid "Half the city vanished. It's not surprising."
msgstr "도시 절반이 사라졌으니, 놀라운 일도 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Half the city vanished. It's not surprising.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Half the city vanished. It's not surprising.
