#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001769"
msgid "It may not be, but it hurts all the same."
msgstr "그렇다 해도 가슴 아픈 건 어쩔 수가 없구먼."

#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001767"
msgid "Hm... that looks interesting. Nope, wait, that's garbage."
msgstr "흠... 아주 흥미로워 보이는구나. 아니, 잠깐... 쓰레기였네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001766"
msgid "I think I picked that up at a thrift store somewhere."
msgstr "그건 내가 중고품 시장에서 구한 것 같구나."

#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001765"
msgid "I drop things all the time. Almost as much as I knock them over."
msgstr "난 항상 물건을 떨어트린단다. 걸려 넘어질 때도 아주 많지."

#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001764"
msgid "You're very good at tidying up."
msgstr "청소 실력이 아주 뛰어나구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001763"
msgid "Some people might call that junk. But those people are wrong. Very, very, wrong."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 쓰레기라 부를지 모르지만 그 사람들 말이 틀린 거란다. 아주, 아주 틀렸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001762"
msgid "Oh, I shouldn't have left that just lying around."
msgstr "아, 그걸 아무데나 뒀으면 안 되는 건데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001761"
msgid "I was wondering where that went off to."
msgstr "그게 어디로 간 건가 마침 궁금하던 참이었단다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001760"
msgid "Be careful not to disrupt my system. I place everything in a specific place for a reason."
msgstr "내 분류체계를 흐트러트리지 않도록 하거라. 다 이유가 있어서 그 위치에 놔둔 거거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_Z03_ItemPickupScene
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0103F05B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175F"
msgid "I have so many things. But I wouldn't dare throw any of it away."
msgstr "나는 물건이 참 많단다. 그런데 버리고 싶은 맘은 전혀 없구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_031_Scene_SocksFound
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175E"
msgid "Oh, you found Socks! I forget why that's his name. It's not like he's wearing any."
msgstr "오, 양말이를 찾았구나! 왜 이름을 그렇게 지었는지는 까먹었어. 양말을 신고 있는 것도 아닌데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFBA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_031_Scene_TrashFound
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175D"
msgid "Oh, I've been meaning to throw that out. I think there's a trash bin somewhere around here."
msgstr "아, 그것들은 버리려고 한 것들이야. 근처에 쓰레기통이 있을 거란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: This song... I... I can't... &&& Reigen: I remember now. This song... it's the one my granddaughter used to sing.|She used to help me around the house, doing chores, tidying up. |And then the accident happened, and I haven't seen her since.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. She was volunteering at the old orphanage, in the heart of the city when the accident happened. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175C"
msgid "By accident, do you mean the vortex?"
msgstr "사고는, 볼텍스를 말하는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: By accident, do you mean the vortex?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: By accident, do you mean the vortex?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175B"
msgid "Yes. She was volunteering at the old orphanage, in the heart of the city when the accident happened."
msgstr "그래. 그 사고가 벌어졌을 때, 손녀는 도시 한가운데에 있던 고아원에서 자원봉사 중이었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: By accident, do you mean the vortex?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00175A"
msgid "So many were lost. So many. And yet, I still had hope she would return."
msgstr "많은 이들이 죽었지. 참 많이도. 그래도 난 손녀가 돌아올 거라고 믿었었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: By accident, do you mean the vortex?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001759"
msgid "But every day that passed, I could feel the hope in my heart start to wane."
msgstr "하지만 매일매일 시간이 흐를수록 마음속 희망이 사라지는 게 느껴졌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: I know you mean well, but I can't keep doing this. The more I cling to the idea she's still alive, the harder it gets.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001758"
msgid "If you don't mind, I have a favor to ask. Keep the music box with you."
msgstr "괜찮다면 부탁 좀 하고 싶네. 그 뮤직 박스를 가져가 주게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll keep the music box.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001757"
msgid "The song... it... it carries too many memories. And with it, a pain I wish to forget."
msgstr "그... 그 노래는... 추억을 떠올리게 만드네. 그리고 잊고 싶은 고통까지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there. &&& Reigen: I know you mean well, but I can't keep doing this. The more I cling to the idea she's still alive, the harder it gets. &&& Reigen: If you don't mind, I have a favor to ask. Keep the music box with you.|The song... it... it carries too many memories. And with it, a pain I wish to forget.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. You need not do anything special with it, but I can't bear the sight of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001756"
msgid "I'll keep the music box."
msgstr "뮤직 박스는 제가 갖겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll keep the music box.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll keep the music box.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Now, if you'll kindly leave, I must get back to my things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001755"
msgid "Thank you. You need not do anything special with it, but I can't bear the sight of it."
msgstr "고맙네. 그걸로 뭔가 해달라는 것도 아닐세. 그저 더 이상 그걸 볼 수가 없어서 그런 거네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there. &&& Reigen: I know you mean well, but I can't keep doing this. The more I cling to the idea she's still alive, the harder it gets. &&& Reigen: If you don't mind, I have a favor to ask. Keep the music box with you.|The song... it... it carries too many memories. And with it, a pain I wish to forget.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What you do with it is your own business. I simply ask that you take it with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001754"
msgid "I'm going to sell this thing. It looks like it could fetch a decent price."
msgstr "이건 갖다 팔아야겠네요. 썩 괜찮은 값에 팔 수 있을 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm going to sell this thing. It looks like it could fetch a decent price.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm going to sell this thing. It looks like it could fetch a decent price.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: Now, if you'll kindly leave, I must get back to my things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001753"
msgid "What you do with it is your own business. I simply ask that you take it with you."
msgstr "그걸로 뭘 하든 상관하지 않겠네. 그냥 그걸 갖고 떠나 주게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry. Maybe she's still out there. &&& Reigen: I know you mean well, but I can't keep doing this. The more I cling to the idea she's still alive, the harder it gets. &&& Reigen: If you don't mind, I have a favor to ask. Keep the music box with you.|The song... it... it carries too many memories. And with it, a pain I wish to forget.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and it's my choice. If you have mercy, let me live with it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001752"
msgid "Is that why you stopped taking your medication?"
msgstr "그럼 그동안 약도 안 드신 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Is that why you stopped taking your medication?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is that why you stopped taking your medication?
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Reigen: I'll keep the music box.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001751"
msgid "Yes, and it's my choice. If you have mercy, let me live with it."
msgstr "그래, 안 먹기로 결심했네. 자비를 베풀어 주고 싶다면, 날 내버려두시게."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Reigen: Thank you. You need not do anything special with it, but I can't bear the sight of it.
#. ALIAS: Reigen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMReigenUeda
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_080_Greeting_ReigenMusicbox
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001750"
msgid "Now, if you'll kindly leave, I must get back to my things."
msgstr "이제, 부디 떠나 주면 좋겠구먼. 하던 일을 마저 해야 하니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts.|I suppose I was just being paranoid.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001742"
msgid "These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone."
msgstr "요즘 같은 시기엔 누가 실종됐고 누가 사망했는지 확인조차 힘듭니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: In any case, thank you for doing this for me. I'm sure your visit helped him, if only for a moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001741"
msgid "But the difference hardly matters. Loss is loss, no matter the form."
msgstr "하지만 사실상 차이는 없죠. 상실은 상실일 뿐입니다. 방식이 어떻든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He's fine.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00173C"
msgid "So, how did it go with Reigen?"
msgstr "오셨군요. 레이겐 씨 일은 어떻게 됐나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: So, how did it go with Reigen? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00173B"
msgid "He's fine."
msgstr "레이겐 씨는 괜찮습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's fine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He's fine.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00173A"
msgid "Oh, that's a relief. I hadn't seen him around lately, and my mind veered toward darker thoughts."
msgstr "아, 다행이네요. 최근 레이겐 씨가 보이지 않아서, 혹시 나쁜 일이 일어난 게 아닐까 걱정됐거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He's fine.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001739"
msgid "I suppose I was just being paranoid."
msgstr "제가 그냥 걱정이 심했나 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: So, how did it go with Reigen? 
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was afraid of that. It's been that way ever since the accident.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EFA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001738"
msgid "He hasn't been taking his medication."
msgstr "레이겐 씨는 약도 안 드시고 계십니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He hasn't been taking his medication.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He hasn't been taking his medication.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
