#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001737"
msgid "I was afraid of that. It's been that way ever since the accident."
msgstr "우려했던 대로네요. 사고 이후로 쭉 그러셨거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He hasn't been taking his medication.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
