#. TOPIC: 0103EFA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001736"
msgid "It's possible he lost someone in the cataclysm. It's a common story as of late."
msgstr "대재난 당시 누군가를 잃었을지 모르죠. 이젠 흔히 찾을 수 있는 사연이 되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: So, how did it go with Reigen? 
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sadly, that's the way of things at the moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001735"
msgid "I'm worried about him. His granddaughter is missing."
msgstr "레이겐 씨가 걱정됩니다. 손녀 분이 실종됐다고 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.|But the difference hardly matters. Loss is loss, no matter the form.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001734"
msgid "In any case, thank you for doing this for me. I'm sure your visit helped him, if only for a moment."
msgstr "어쨌든 도와주셔서 감사합니다. 잠시였지만, 당신이 방문해 준 덕분에 도움이 됐을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sunday.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001732"
msgid "You're back! Praise Jinan! But are you here to help?"
msgstr "돌아오셨군요! 지난이여, 찬양받으소서! 도와주러 오셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001731"
msgid "Serpent's Grace, are you a new volunteer?"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 은총이시여. 혹시 새로 오신 자원봉사자신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sunday.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001730"
msgid "I was told you'd be coming yesterday, or was it today? By Jinan, what day even is it?"
msgstr "어제 오실 거라고 들었는데요? 오늘이었나요? 지난이시여. 오늘이 무슨 요일이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm worried about him. His granddaughter is missing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm worried about him. His granddaughter is missing.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: These days, it's hard to account for who's missing and who's gone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103EF9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_100_Greeting_QuestEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172F"
msgid "Sadly, that's the way of things at the moment."
msgstr "안타깝게도, 요즘 이 동네 돌아가는 꼴이 그렇습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sunday. &&& Vassilis: Already? By the Heralds, you're right. Which means time is at a premium. &&& Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.|Or I was, until the cataclysm took out much of the city and half the people with it.|Now I'm part healer, caretaker, worrier, the list goes on and on.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's a lot of work. I am still wrapping my head around the scope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172E"
msgid "That's a long list."
msgstr "참 많은 일을 하시네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a long list.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a long list.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172D"
msgid "There's a lot of work. I am still wrapping my head around the scope."
msgstr "할 일이 많죠. 아직도 해야 할 일이 어느 정도인지 다 파악하지도 못했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Reigen?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_AboutReigen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172C"
msgid "He's long in the tooth, and a tad absent-minded."
msgstr "레이겐 씨는 연세도 좀 있으시고, 건망증도 좀 있는 편이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_AboutReigen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172B"
msgid "So don't worry about distracting him, he'll do that all on his own."
msgstr "그러니 그분 집중력을 흐트러뜨릴까 봐 걱정할 필요는 없어요. 원래 집중을 못 하시는 분이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not right now.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00172A"
msgid "Understood. But I hope you reconsider."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 그래도 다시 생각해 주시길 바랄게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Wounded, straining, desperate for help. / InPain / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_CallForHelpScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001721"
msgid "Adherent, it's you! The heirlooms... stolen. I need help. Please."
msgstr "지지자, 당신이군요! 놈들이 가보를... 훔쳐갔어요. 도움이 필요해요. 도와주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: I was deep in meditation, so I didn't hear the Spacers approach.|I did what I could to protect this hallowed ground, but there were too many. |Not only did the thieves violate this sacred tomb, but they took the heirlooms of my ancestor.|Some of them stayed behind to ambush me. I could hear them.|Serpent curse them for all time!
