msgstr "이곳은 당신에게 매우 중요한 곳인가 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Have the Spacers attacked before?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Have the Spacers attacked before?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001718"
msgid "Only recently. They appeared not long after the catastrophe, from where I can't say."
msgstr "최근에 나타났어요. 재난이 닥친지 얼마 지나지 않아 나타났는데, 어디서 온 건지는 모르겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry, helpless. / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Have the Spacers attacked before?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: This place seems very important to you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001717"
msgid "Looters and murderers, all of them. No matter how many we kill, there are always more."
msgstr "약탈자이자 살인자인 놈들이죠. 아무리 죽여도, 항상 더 많이 기어 나와요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This place seems very important to you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This place seems very important to you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001715"
msgid "You are in the tomb of my revered ancestor, Mahkara the Fang."
msgstr "여긴 제가 존경하는 조상님인, 송곳니의 마카라 님의 무덤이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This place seems very important to you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001714"
msgid "Not only was Mahkara a mighty warrior, she also commanded the starship Mourning."
msgstr "마카라 님은 강력한 전사셨고, 우주선 모어닝 호를 지휘하시기도 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Proud / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This place seems very important to you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: When the catastrophe struck, I came here to protect this place.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001713"
msgid "It was a most prestigious honor."
msgstr "모어닝 호를 지휘하는 건 더할 나위 없는 영예였죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sheepish, guilty / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001712"
msgid "I was deep in meditation, so I didn't hear the Spacers approach."
msgstr "깊이 명상하고 있어서, 스페이서들이 다가오는 소리를 못 들었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001711"
msgid "I did what I could to protect this hallowed ground, but there were too many."
msgstr "이 신성한 땅을 지키기 위해 할 수 있는 건 다 했지만, 놈들이 너무 많았어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sheepish, guilty / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001710"
msgid "Not only did the thieves violate this sacred tomb, but they took the heirlooms of my ancestor."
msgstr "그 도둑놈들은 신성한 무덤을 침범한 것도 모자라, 조상님의 가보까지 가져갔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your arrival here is truly a blessing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E91B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00170E"
msgid "I'll have those heirlooms back in no time."
msgstr "금방 가보를 찾아올게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll have those heirlooms back in no time.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll have those heirlooms back in no time.
