#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00170D"
msgid "Your arrival here is truly a blessing."
msgstr "당신이 여기 와주셔서 얼마나 다행인지 모르겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Those Spacers will never know what hit them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Those Spacers will never know what hit them.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: I'll stay a while and pray while my wounds heal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001707"
msgid "The look in your eyes tells me that is no idle threat."
msgstr "눈빛을 보니 빈말은 아닌가 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.|If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.|The Spacers have a base not far from here. Their stolen goods are stored there under heavy guard.|It's a large facility, so you'll probably need to do some searching.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The look in your eyes tells me that is no idle threat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E919
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001703"
msgid "Those Spacers will never know what hit them."
msgstr "그 스페이서들은 자신들에게 무슨 일이 일어날지 전혀 모를 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& ...  &&& companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.|Do you truly have such disdain for our way of life? &&& companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.|When one's eyes have been opened to new ways of seeing things, it is hard to close them again.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016FF"
msgid "Let me take care of this. You need to rest."
msgstr "제가 처리할게요. 좀 쉬세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
