msgid "Though it wounds my pride to admit it, there's too much at stake to turn down an offer of help."
msgstr "자존심이 상하지만, 도움을 마다할 만큼 여유롭진 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defeated, bruised ego / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: There are three heirlooms in all. One is a weapon, and the others are a boost pack and matching spacesuit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016FD"
msgid "If you truly mean what you say, then I will tell you what I can."
msgstr "정말 도와주실 거라면, 아는 걸 다 말해 드릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& ...  &&& companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.|Do you truly have such disdain for our way of life? &&& companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.|When one's eyes have been opened to new ways of seeing things, it is hard to close them again.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Who knows? Maybe they think they can sell them. Maybe they thought they looked interesting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016FC"
msgid "Why would the Spacers want your family's heirlooms?"
msgstr "스페이서들은 왜 당신 집안 가보를 훔쳐 간 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms. &&& companion: There is honor in respecting the legacy of our ancestors, and you did your best. These are difficult times.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016FA"
msgid "And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions."
msgstr "그리고 어쩌면 우리의 가치와 전통에 적절하게 존중을 보여야 할 때일지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pride, admiration / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms. &&& companion: The Mourning was the ship that introduced the Settled Systems to House Va'ruun a hundred years ago.|Your ancestor must have been one tough customer to command a vessel that important.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F9"
msgid "Tough, yes, but also ruthless, cunning and courageous."
msgstr "강인하면서도, 무자비하고, 교활하면서도, 용감했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pride, admiration. / to companion
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F8"
msgid "The crew of the Mourning feared her, respected her and above all, loved her."
msgstr "모어닝 호의 승무원들에게 마카라 님은 경외와 존경의 대상이었죠. 그리고 그 무엇보다, 사랑받는 존재였고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pride, admiration. / to companion
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: My travels have provided me with the benefit of different perspectives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F7"
msgid "They would have followed her anywhere."
msgstr "승무원들은 마카라 님을 위해서라면 어디든 기꺼이 뒤따랐겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A stern rebuttal / Stern / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms. &&& companion: I get it. Having a famous family name can be a hell of a burden.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F6"
msgid "No, I don't think you get it at all."
msgstr "아니요, 당신은 전혀 이해하지 못하는 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to companion
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms. &&& companion: I'm sorry, but I find that kind of thinking archaic.|You risked your life to protect your family's legacy.|If that's not honorable, then I don't know what is.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F5"
msgid "So you see us as unenlightened heathens, is that it?"
msgstr "그래서 우리를 미개한 이교도로 본다는 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would the Spacers want your family's heirlooms?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would the Spacers want your family's heirlooms?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F4"
msgid "Who knows? Maybe they think they can sell them. Maybe they thought they looked interesting."
msgstr "저야 모르죠? 가보를 팔아 치우려고 그런 걸지도 모르죠. 아니면 그냥 흥미로워 보여서 그랬을 수도 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Quietly hopeful, but keeping emotions in check / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016F0"
msgid "Welcome to my home. You come with good news, I hope?"
msgstr "와주셔서 감사합니다. 좋은 소식을 가지고 오셨길 기대해도 되겠지요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You honor your ancestor with your courage. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Any honor I might claim is eclipsed tenfold by my failure to protect my family's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016EF"
msgid "The Mourning was the ship that introduced the Settled Systems to House Va'ruun a hundred years ago."
msgstr "모어닝 호는 백 년 전에 개척 성계에 바룬 가문의 존재를 처음 알린 우주선이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: And perhaps its time you showed the proper respect for our values and our traditions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E913
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016EE"
msgid "Your ancestor must have been one tough customer to command a vessel that important."
msgstr "그렇게 중요한 우주선을 지휘했다면 그쪽 조상님은 분명 강인한 인물이었겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll get to that, but first, are your injuries healing?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll get to that, but first, are your injuries healing?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E907
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016ED"
msgid "Well enough, thanks to your timely aid."
msgstr "딱 맞는 순간에 도와주신 덕분에 잘 낫고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Crestfallen, sad / Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll get to that, but first, are your injuries healing?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E907
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016EC"
msgid "As for my father, well, his trust in me will take longer to heal."
msgstr "아버지 쪽은, 뭐, 절 믿어 주시기까지 시간이 좀 더 걸릴 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hopeful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll get to that, but first, are your injuries healing?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E907
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016EB"
msgid "Does your presence here mean that you were successful?"
msgstr "여기 오신 걸 보니 성공한 걸로 봐도 될까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E909
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016EA"
msgid "Truly? That's wonderful!"
msgstr "정말요? 잘 됐네요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E909
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E9"
msgid "I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong."
msgstr "당신을 죽음으로 내몬 건 아닌지 걱정했어요. 걱정대로 되지 않아서 다행이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to MaaliyaHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: companion: The Mourning was the ship that introduced the Settled Systems to House Va'ruun a hundred years ago.|Your ancestor must have been one tough customer to command a vessel that important. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Tough, yes, but also ruthless, cunning and courageous.|The crew of the Mourning feared her, respected her and above all, loved her.|They would have followed her anywhere.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let me take care of this. You need to rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_MaaliyaIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E8"
msgid "Even if I never got to meet this Mahkara the Fang, the way you talk about her is convincing enough."
msgstr "송곳니의 마카라를 직접 만나본 적은 없지만, 그쪽이 말하는 걸 보니 어떤 인물인지 알 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Welcome to my home. You come with good news, I hope?
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well enough, thanks to your timely aid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E7"
msgid "I'll get to that, but first, are your injuries healing?"
msgstr "그건 차차 말씀드리죠. 그보다 먼저, 부상은 잘 낫고 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Welcome to my home. You come with good news, I hope?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Truly? That's wonderful!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E90A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E6"
msgid "Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms."
msgstr "마카라의 유산은 안전해요. 도난당한 가보를 가져왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to FarudHajtal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong.
#. ALIAS: MaaliyaHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMaaliyaHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E906
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E5"
msgid "Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms."
msgstr "들으셨어요? 아버지? 선구자가 마카라 님께서 남기신 가보를 되찾아 왔어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E905
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E3"
msgid "Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude."
msgstr "아, 그런가? 자네가 내 딸의 실책을 만회해 줬군. 감사의 말씀을 전하겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms. &&& FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E2"
msgid "Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack."
msgstr "따님은 최선을 다했어요. 너무 몰아치지 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A stern rebuke / Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E903
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E1"
msgid "And yet the thieves escaped. Clearly, my daughter's best was insufficient."
msgstr "하지만 도둑들은 도망쳤네. 사실이잖나. 내 딸은 최선을 다했지만 부족했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E903
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016E0"
msgid "If not for your help, our precious heirlooms could have been taken off-world and never seen again."
msgstr "자네 도움이 없었다면, 우리 가문의 소중한 가보는 외부 세계로 유출되어 영영 볼 수 없었을지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MaaliyaHajtal: Father, I...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E903
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DF"
msgid "But that shame is not your burden to bear, so I'll speak no more of it."
msgstr "그 수치심은 자네가 짊어져야 할 짐이 아니니, 더 이상 말하지 않겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean? What failure?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean? What failure?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DE"
msgid "When the catastrophe struck, Maaliya insisted on going to the tomb."
msgstr "재앙이 닥쳤을 때, 말리야는 무덤에 가보겠다고 고집했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean? What failure?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DD"
msgid "I objected because I knew it would be dangerous, but she swore an oath on Mahkara's name to keep the heirlooms safe."
msgstr "위험할 거라는 걸 알았기 때문에 반대했지만, 딸은 마카라 님의 이름을 걸고 가보를 지키겠다고 맹세했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean? What failure?
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: FarudHajtal: Your daughter did her best. You should cut her some slack.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DC"
msgid "I warned her that such an oath cannot be undone, and she agreed to bear the burden."
msgstr "그런 맹세는 돌이킬 수 없다고 경고했지만, 딸은 책임을 지겠다고 약속했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Makhara's legacy is secure. I have your stolen heirlooms. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Truly? That's wonderful!|I was afraid I had sent you to a certain death. I'm glad to see that I was wrong. &&& MaaliyaHajtal: Did you hear that, father? The Harbinger was able to reclaim Mahkara's heirlooms. &&& FarudHajtal: Ah, is that so? You've redeemed my daughter's failure, and for that you have my gratitude.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: When the catastrophe struck, Maaliya insisted on going to the tomb.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DB"
msgid "What do you mean? What failure?"
msgstr "무슨 뜻이죠? 무슨 실책요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: FarudHajtal: I hope you're right, my daughter. I truly do.
#. ALIAS: FarudHajtal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMFarudHajtal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS05
#. TOPIC: 0103E900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS05_ConclusionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0016DA"
msgid "I understand Maaliya promised you a reward for returning these items to us."
msgstr "말리야가 물건들을 돌려주는 대가로 자네에게 보상을 주기로 약속했다고 들었네."

