#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This is the first I'm hearing of any volunteer work.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This is the first I'm hearing of any volunteer work.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00151F"
msgid "So you didn't send me that slate with the urgent tone and suspect grammar?"
msgstr "그러니까 어조도 급박했고 문법도 엉망이었던 그 슬레이트를 보내신 분이 아니라는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This is the first I'm hearing of any volunteer work.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00151E"
msgid "Now I'm wondering who did. No matter, you're here, they aren't."
msgstr "이러면 누가 보낸 건지 궁금하네요. 어쨌든 당신은 여기 계시고, 그 사람은 여기 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sunday.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sunday.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00151D"
