msgstr "벌써요? 전령들이시여. 당신 말대로네요. 다시 말해 한시가 급하다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: RAY-ghen oo-EH-duh / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can help you check in on a few folks.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can help you check in on a few folks.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00151C"
msgid "Thank you. There are many in need, but I would like you to start with Reigen Ueda."
msgstr "감사합니다. 도움이 필요한 분이 많지만, 먼저 레이겐 우에다 씨부터 확인해 주시길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: You're back! Praise Jinan! But are you here to help?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Already? By the Heralds, you're right. Which means time is at a premium.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
