#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001514"
msgid "Why has your role changed?"
msgstr "왜 업무가 바뀐 거죠?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: He's long in the tooth, and a tad absent-minded.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_AboutReigen
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001513"
msgid "What can you tell me about Reigen?"
msgstr "레이겐 씨에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire. &&& Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city. &&& Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.|And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help.|What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Understood. But I hope you reconsider.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001512"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "지금은 안 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: Already? By the Heralds, you're right. Which means time is at a premium.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001511"
msgid "My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant."
msgstr "제 이름은 바실리스입니다. 전령님의 조수죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001510"
msgid "Or I was, until the cataclysm took out much of the city and half the people with it."
msgstr "조수였다고 해야 할까요? 대재난이 터져서 도시와 신민들이 절반씩 사라지기 전에는 그랬거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150F"
msgid "Now I'm part healer, caretaker, worrier, the list goes on and on."
msgstr "이제 전 치료사고, 보호사고, 걱정꾼이고... 여러 역할을 맡고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire. &&& Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city. &&& Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.|And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help.|What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you. There are many in need, but I would like you to start with Reigen Ueda.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150E"
msgid "I can help you check in on a few folks."
msgstr "사람들이 괜찮은지 확인하는 거라면 도와드릴 수 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I imagine it's trial by fire.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I imagine it's trial by fire.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150D"
msgid "I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city."
msgstr "기꺼이 고난의 길을 선택하겠습니다. 우리 도시에 벌어진 재난을 되돌릴 수만 있다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why has your role changed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why has your role changed?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150C"
msgid "Much of the city is just... gone, as well as much of our staff and facilities."
msgstr "도시의 많은 것들이... 사라졌으니까요. 우리 직원들과 여러 시설까지 말이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why has your role changed?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150B"
msgid "So we've all been rushed into larger roles with inferior tools."
msgstr "결국 우리 모두 급하게 변변찮은 도구만 쥔 채, 너무 과중한 역할을 떠맡게 됐죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: You're back! Praise Jinan! But are you here to help?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you didn't send me that slate with the urgent tone and suspect grammar? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00150A"
msgid "This is the first I'm hearing of any volunteer work."
msgstr "자원봉사자 일이 있단 건 지금 처음 들었는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sunday. &&& Vassilis: Already? By the Heralds, you're right. Which means time is at a premium. &&& Vassilis: My name is Vassilis. I am a Herald's assistant.|Or I was, until the cataclysm took out much of the city and half the people with it.|Now I'm part healer, caretaker, worrier, the list goes on and on.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001509"
msgid "I imagine it's trial by fire."
msgstr "정말 고난이겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: I would gladly take a fire over what's happened to our city.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001508"
msgid "You don't need Jinan's sight to see things are bad. No, bad is the wrong word. What happened here was tectonic."
msgstr ""
"상황이 엉망이라는 건 지난 님의 혜안이 없어도 아실 수 있을 겁니다. 아니, 엉망 정도가 아니죠. 그야말로 지각변동 수준의 사고가 "
"있었으니까요."

#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001507"
msgid "And while the wounded are being tended to, I'm most concerned with those in the city who haven't sought help."
msgstr "부상자들은 보살핌을 받고 있지만, 걱정되는 건 도움을 청하지 못한 채 도시 안에 있는 사람들이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I check in on my parents all the time, so I've got experience.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001506"
msgid "What we need is for people to check in on the elderly and the infirm."
msgstr "그래서 노약자들이 괜찮은지 확인해 줄 사람이 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Vassilis: His home is not to far from here, near the Halls of Obedience.
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001505"
msgid "I need two things. One, see if he's okay, and two, make sure he's taking his medicine."
msgstr "두 가지를 확인해 주세요. 그분이 잘 지내시는지, 약은 잘 챙겨 드시는지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_000_Greeting_QuestStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001504"
msgid "Plus it will be good for him to see a friendly face, to give his spirits a lift."
msgstr "친절한 사람의 얼굴을 보면 기운을 차리는 데도 크게 도움이 되겠죠. 기운을 북돋아 줄 수 있을 테니까요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Vassilis: It's to help with his memory. It's a bit scattered already, and he has trouble remembering where he left things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_Medicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001503"
msgid "Why does Reigen need medicine?"
msgstr "레이겐 씨에겐 왜 약이 필요합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why does Reigen need medicine?
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_Medicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001502"
msgid "It's to help with his memory. It's a bit scattered already, and he has trouble remembering where he left things."
msgstr "기억력 감퇴를 막아야 하거든요. 이미 기억이 좀 가물가물하세요. 물건을 어디에 뒀는지도 잘 기억하지 못하시거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_Medicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001501"
msgid "I've heard stories that he's taken to hoarding. That doesn't sound good, but maybe it'll help him keep his mind busy?"
msgstr ""
"레이겐 씨가 잡동사니를 쌓아둔다는 소식도 들었어요. 좋은 징후는 아니지만, 그게 도움이 될지도 모르죠. 그렇게라도 계속 머리를 쓰니까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Note: Planet Va'ruun'kai has a very short day cycle, it's mostly night / Neutral
#. ALIAS: Vassilis
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03a
#. TOPIC: 0103DB1E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_VKaiZ03_020_TL_Medicine
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001500"
msgid "Just trying to think of the bright side, short as that may be around here."
msgstr "그냥 그렇게라도 밝은 면을 보려고 노력해 볼래요. 바룬카이에선 낮 시간조차 얼마 되지 않지만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing.  &&& AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!   &&& AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone. &&& AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.|I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving. |I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies. |Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* All right, I do not want to push my luck, so just take it. And here, your credits. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D567
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014F8"
msgid "Pay up and I'll let you leave. The groat stays with me, though."
msgstr "돈을 내면 보내주지. 하지만 그로트는 내가 갖겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Pay up and I'll let you leave. The groat stays with me, though. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Pay up and I'll let you leave. The groat stays with me, though. 
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D566
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014F7"
msgid "*Sigh* All right, I do not want to push my luck, so just take it. And here, your credits."
msgstr "*한숨* 알았어. 내 행운을 시험하고 싶지 않으니, 그냥 가져가. 여기, 네 돈이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing.  &&& AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!   &&& AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone. &&& AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.|I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving. |I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies. |Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great Serpent, thank you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D565
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014F4"
msgid "Just take the groat and go."
msgstr "그냥 그로트를 가져가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just take the groat and go. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just take the groat and go. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D564
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014F3"
msgid "Great Serpent, thank you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 감사합니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just take the groat and go. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D564
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014F2"
msgid "This groat will go to a family that needs it, I promise you. And please, take the credits, I insist."
msgstr "이 그로트는 꼭 필요한 가족에게 갈 거야. 약속하지. 그리고 저기, 이 돈도 가져가. 꼭."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing.  &&& AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!   &&& AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone. &&& AndrahDubib: Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason.|I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving. |I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies. |Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
