#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again. 
