#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014EE"
msgid "Any progress?"
msgstr "진전이 있나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Any progress? 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let them go? So there is to be no justice for what was done? What's stopping them from doing this to someone else? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D547
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014ED"
msgid "I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again."
msgstr "해조류 양식장에서 그로트 한 마리를 찾았습니다. 도둑은 풀어줬지만, 다시는 말릭 씨를 괴롭히지 않을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D546
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014EC"
msgid "Let them go? So there is to be no justice for what was done? What's stopping them from doing this to someone else?"
msgstr "풀어줘? 그럼 그동안 저지른 일에 대한 대가는? 그 녀석이 다른 사람에게 또 그러지 않을 거란 보장이 어디 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: trying to calm down. / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D546
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014EB"
msgid "*Sigh* I must control myself. While the outcome is unfortunate it could have been worse. I do thank you for finding my groat, I do not wish to appear ungrateful."
msgstr ""
"*한숨* 자제해야지. 결과는 아쉽지만 더 나빠질 수도 있었네. 내 그로트를 찾아줘서 고맙네. 감사할 줄 모르는 사람으로 보이고 싶진 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D546
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014EA"
msgid "You've succeeded where I've failed, but I just wish you didn't let the scoundrel leave."
msgstr "넌 내가 못한 일을 해냈지만, 그래도 그 악당을 그냥 보낸 건 아쉽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Any progress? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You fool! You absolute fool! Why would you do something like that? Why? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D545
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E9"
msgid "It wasn't worth the trouble. I let the thief leave with your groat."
msgstr "소란 피울 가치도 없었습니다. 그 도둑놈한테 말릭 씨 그로트 가지고 떠나라고 했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Any progress? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmmm... unfortunate. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D543
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E7"
msgid "One of your groats is safe and sound at the seaweed farm. I've killed the thief responsible."
msgstr "당신 그로트 한 마리가 해조류 양식장에 무사히 있더군요. 도둑놈은 죽였습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: One of your groats is safe and sound at the seaweed farm. I've killed the thief responsible. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: One of your groats is safe and sound at the seaweed farm. I've killed the thief responsible. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E6"
msgid "Hmmm... unfortunate."
msgstr "흠... 안타깝군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: One of your groats is safe and sound at the seaweed farm. I've killed the thief responsible. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E5"
msgid "Serves them right, I suppose, but there is already so much death around us. Yes... an unfortunate situation, one that could have been easily avoided. But some people can only learn lessons the hard way."
msgstr ""
"그 녀석, 그래 마땅한 최후를 맞았지만, 이미 우리 주변엔 죽음이 너무 많네. 그래... 안타까운 일이지. 쉽게 피할 수 있었던 일인데. "
"하지만 어떤 사람들은 고통스러운 방법으로만 교훈을 얻지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: One of your groats is safe and sound at the seaweed farm. I've killed the thief responsible. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D542
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E4"
msgid "Bah, enough of my musings. I won't be wasting any tears over this. Here, your payment. Thank you very much for helping me, my groats and I are quite grateful."
msgstr ""
"하, 내 푸념은 이쯤 하지. 이 일로 눈물 낭비하고 싶진 않네. 여기, 자네 보수네. 정말 고맙군. 나와 내 그로트가 정말 감사하고 "
"있다네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It wasn't worth the trouble. I let the thief leave with your groat.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It wasn't worth the trouble. I let the thief leave with your groat.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D544
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E3"
msgid "You fool! You absolute fool! Why would you do something like that? Why?"
msgstr "이 멍청아! 이 천하의 멍청아! 왜 그런 짓을 한 거야? 왜?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It wasn't worth the trouble. I let the thief leave with your groat.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D544
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E2"
msgid "Well? Answer me!"
msgstr "말해 보라고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Any progress? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, so whoever is doing this is free to continue. Damn. 
