#. TOPIC: 0103D540
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E1"
msgid "[Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief."
msgstr "[거짓말] 해조류 양식장에 그로트 한 마리가 무사히 있더군요. 하지만 도둑의 흔적은 찾을 수 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found one of your groats at the seaweed farm. I let the thief go, but he won't be bothering you again.  &&& MalikVosh: Let them go? So there is to be no justice for what was done? What's stopping them from doing this to someone else? |*Sigh* I must control myself. While the outcome is unfortunate it could have been worse. I do thank you for finding my groat, I do not wish to appear ungrateful. |You've succeeded where I've failed, but I just wish you didn't let the scoundrel leave. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* That isn't necessary. I can see that you mean well. I've just been so frustrated with what has been happening that the thought of the thief going free was hard to swallow. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014E0"
msgid "[Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them."
msgstr "[1000 크레딧 주기] 그 녀석이 돈을 좀 줬는데, 받으세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DF"
msgid "Ah, so whoever is doing this is free to continue. Damn."
msgstr "아, 그럼 그 짓을 벌인 녀석이 계속 그럴 수 있다는 거군. 젠장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DE"
msgid "I am relieved to hear of my groat's wellbeing, of course. I just fear that this cycle may continue."
msgstr "그로트가 무사하다니 다행이군. 그저 이런 상황이 계속 반복될까 봐 두렵네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sorry, I did the best I could. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DD"
msgid "Eh, I suppose I will have to worry about it later. I do thank you for finding my groat. Here, some credits for your trouble."
msgstr "에휴, 그건 나중에 걱정하도록 하지. 내 그로트를 찾아줘서 고맙네. 여기, 네 수고에 대한 보답으로 약간의 크레딧을 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Calmed down from being irritated.  / Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DC"
msgid "*Sigh* That isn't necessary. I can see that you mean well. I've just been so frustrated with what has been happening that the thought of the thief going free was hard to swallow."
msgstr ""
"*한숨* 그럴 필요 없네. 자네 호의는 잘 알겠네. 그저 그동안 벌어진 일 때문에 너무 답답해서 도둑이 풀려났다는 생각을 하니 견디기 "
"힘들었을 뿐이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DB"
msgid "You seem to be more merciful than I am. Here, take your credits. I appreciate what you've done for me, even if I disagree with your methods."
msgstr "자넨 나보다 자비로운 것 같군. 여기, 크레딧 받게. 자네 방식에 동의하진 않지만, 날 위해 일을 해준 건 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014DA"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me, I have my groats to tend to."
msgstr "그럼, 이만 가보겠네. 돌봐야 할 그로트가 있어서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It wasn't worth the trouble. I let the thief leave with your groat. &&& MalikVosh: You fool! You absolute fool! Why would you do something like that? Why? |Well? Answer me!
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I never expected you to. But I also didn't expect you to just give them a slap on the wrist.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D9"
msgid "I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal."
msgstr "바보 같은 동물 때문에 사람을 죽이고 싶진 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D8"
msgid "I never expected you to. But I also didn't expect you to just give them a slap on the wrist."
msgstr "누가 사람 죽여 달랬나. 하지만 그렇다고 그 녀석을 그냥 가볍게 봐주라는 것도 아니었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Would you rather have had me kill someone over a groat? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D7"
msgid "I do not wish to get in an argument with you. What's done is done. I thank you for finding my groat, but it is time for you to take your credits and move on."
msgstr "자네와 말다툼하고 싶진 않네. 이미 벌어진 일일세. 내 그로트를 찾아준 건 고맙지만, 이제 크레딧 받고 그만 가보시게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] One of your groats is safe at the seaweed farm, but I couldn't find any sign of the thief.  &&& MalikVosh: Ah, so whoever is doing this is free to continue. Damn. |I am relieved to hear of my groat's wellbeing, of course. I just fear that this cycle may continue. |Eh, I suppose I will have to worry about it later. I do thank you for finding my groat. Here, some credits for your trouble.  
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, yes, I'm sure. I do not wish to get into an argument about this. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D53A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D6"
msgid "Sorry, I did the best I could."
msgstr "미안합니다. 최선을 다했지만 부족했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, I did the best I could. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sorry, I did the best I could. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D5"
msgid "Yes, yes, I'm sure. I do not wish to get into an argument about this."
msgstr "그래, 그래, 그랬겠지. 이 일로 말다툼하고 싶진 않네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, I did the best I could. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D4"
msgid "We can't change what is done, so let us just move on. Here, your payment."
msgstr "이미 벌어진 일을 바꿀 순 없으니, 그냥 넘어가도록 하지. 여기, 자네 보수일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, I did the best I could. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
