#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014D0"
msgid "I appreciate your help, though I worry that my troubles are not over."
msgstr "도와줘서 고맙지만, 내 골칫거리가 아직 끝나지 않은 것 같아 걱정이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I'm sorry. I couldn't find any sign of a thief, or your missing groats. 
