#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CF"
msgid "Although you found nothing, I understand that you took time to try and help me. Here are a few credits for your trouble."
msgstr "아무것도 찾지 못했지만, 날 도우려고 시간을 내준 건 아네. 여기 자네 수고에 대한 보답으로 약간의 크레딧을 마련했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Lie] I'm sorry. I couldn't find any sign of a thief, or your missing groats. 
