#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CE"
msgid "Now I suppose it's best for me to return to what is left of my farm. Excuse me."
msgstr "그럼 이제 남은 내 농장으로 돌아가는 게 좋겠군. 이만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sorry, I did the best I could.  &&& MalikVosh: Yes, yes, I'm sure. I do not wish to get into an argument about this. |We can't change what is done, so let us just move on. Here, your payment. |Now, excuse me, I must retrieve my groat. 
