#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CD"
msgid "To be honest, I don't know. I guess I wasn't thinking."
msgstr "솔직히 모르겠습니다. 그냥 아무 생각도 없었던 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I don't know. I guess I wasn't thinking. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To be honest, I don't know. I guess I wasn't thinking. 
