#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CC"
msgid "Yes, I suppose not. In fact, I find it hard to believe that you ever think at all."
msgstr "그래, 아무 생각도 없었겠지. 사실, 자네가 한 번이라도 생각이라는 걸 하고 사는지 의문이구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I don't know. I guess I wasn't thinking. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CB"
msgid "We're done talking. This was a complete waste of time. I'm not giving you a single credit."
msgstr "할 말 다 했네. 완전히 시간 낭비했군. 단 한 푼도 주지 않을 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I don't know. I guess I wasn't thinking. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D535
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014CA"
msgid "Out of my way."
msgstr "비켜."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give 1000 Credits] He gave me some credits, but you can have them.  &&& MalikVosh: *Sigh* That isn't necessary. I can see that you mean well. I've just been so frustrated with what has been happening that the thought of the thief going free was hard to swallow. |You seem to be more merciful than I am. Here, take your credits. I appreciate what you've done for me, even if I disagree with your methods. |Now, if you'll excuse me, I have my groats to tend to.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You had the means to stop a thief, and instead you take his money and let him leave? Keep your damn money. As if that would fix any of this. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C9"
msgid "[Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it."
msgstr "[1000 크레딧 주기] 진정하세요. 그 녀석이 돈을 좀 줬습니다. 받으세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C8"
msgid "You had the means to stop a thief, and instead you take his money and let him leave? Keep your damn money. As if that would fix any of this."
msgstr ""
"도둑을 막을 수 있었으면서, 그 녀석 돈을 받고 그냥 보냈다고? 망할 돈은 자네가 가지게. 그게 이 사태를 해결해 줄 거라 착각하며 "
"살라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C7"
msgid "I can't stand to talk to you right now. I'm leaving to tend to what's left of my farm, and I'm not giving you a single credit."
msgstr "지금 자네랑 얘기하고 싶지 않네. 남은 내 농장이나 돌보러 갈 거고, 자네한텐 단 한 푼도 안 줄 걸세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give 1000 Credits] Calm down, he gave me some money. You can keep it. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D533
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C6"
msgid "Keep away from me."
msgstr "저리 떨어져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't feel like murdering someone over a stupid animal.  &&& MalikVosh: I never expected you to. But I also didn't expect you to just give them a slap on the wrist.|I do not wish to get in an argument with you. What's done is done. I thank you for finding my groat, but it is time for you to take your credits and move on.
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C5"
msgid "Would you rather have had me kill someone over a groat?"
msgstr "그로트 한 마리 때문에 사람을 죽이길 바란 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Would you rather have had me kill someone over a groat? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Would you rather have had me kill someone over a groat? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C4"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "그래!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Would you rather have had me kill someone over a groat? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103D531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_04_EndScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0014C3"
msgid "*Sigh* I'm done talking with you, and I'm not giving you a single credit. Get out of my way."
msgstr "*한숨* 자네와 할 말은 다 했고, 자네에게 단 한 푼도 안 줄 걸세. 길이나 좀 비켜."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00149D"
msgid "Ah, it's you. The one Anasko spoke to."
msgstr "아, 자네였군. 아나스코 님과 대화했던 녀석."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00149C"
msgid "While I am pleased that you wish to make my acquaintance, I'm preoccupied with a problem that demands my attention."
msgstr "날 알아주다니 기쁘지만, 지금 급히 해결해야 하는 문제 때문에 정신이 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAE2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00149B"
msgid "Apologies, but I must continue on."
msgstr "미안하지만, 가봐야겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Ah, it's you. The one Anasko spoke to.|While I am pleased that you wish to make my acquaintance, I'm preoccupied with a problem that demands my attention. |Apologies, but I must continue on. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Eh, perhaps. 
