#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00149A"
msgid "Wait a second, maybe I can help you."
msgstr "잠깐만요. 어쩌면 제가 도와줄 수 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001499"
msgid "Eh, perhaps."
msgstr "어, 그러겠나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: For weeks now, my groats have been going missing. The first time I did not think much of it. Groats are crafty, and sometimes they escape. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAE0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001498"
msgid "I'm old. And very tired. I suppose I could use the assistance."
msgstr "난 늙었네. 그리고 아주 지쳤지. 어쩌면 도움이 필요할지도 모르겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help you out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll help you out.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001497"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "정말 고맙네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help you out.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001496"
msgid "Please, go to my farm, see if you can find anything I have missed. I will continue to inquire around the city."
msgstr "내 농장에 가서 내가 놓친 게 있는지 살펴봐 주게. 난 계속 도시를 돌아다니며 알아보겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll help you out.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001495"
msgid "Good luck. Let us hope that you can get to the bottom of this."
msgstr "행운을 빌겠네. 대체 어떻게 된 건지 밝힐 수 있었으면 좋겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Ah, it's you. The one Anasko spoke to.|While I am pleased that you wish to make my acquaintance, I'm preoccupied with a problem that demands my attention. |Apologies, but I must continue on. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A problem of stolen property. I run a groat farm nearby. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001494"
msgid "What's the problem?"
msgstr "무슨 일이시죠?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MalikVosh: Eh, perhaps. |I'm old. And very tired. I suppose I could use the assistance. 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001493"
msgid "For weeks now, my groats have been going missing. The first time I did not think much of it. Groats are crafty, and sometimes they escape."
msgstr "몇 주 전부터, 내 그로트가 사라지고 있네. 처음엔 대수롭지 않게 생각했지. 그로트는 교활해서, 가끔 도망치거든."

#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001492"
msgid "But I am down too many groats now for this to be mere coincidence. They are being stolen."
msgstr "하지만 이젠 우연이라고 하기엔 너무 많이 사라졌네. 누가 훔쳐 가고 있는 거지."

#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001491"
msgid "This cannot continue. I cannot keep purchasing new groats only for them to go missing a few days later.  And without my groats, I cannot supply milk or meat to the city."
msgstr ""
"이대로는 안 되겠네. 며칠 뒤에 사라질 텐데 그로트를 계속 사들일 수도 없잖나. 그리고 그로트가 없으면, 도시에 우유나 고기를 공급할 "
"수가 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll help you out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001490"
msgid "I understand that this may seem a minor problem compared to others in Dazra, but I would appreciate your assistance."
msgstr "다즈라의 다른 문제들에 비하면 사소해 보일 수 있지만, 도와주면 고맙겠구먼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Wait a second, maybe I can help you.  &&& MalikVosh: Eh, perhaps. |I'm old. And very tired. I suppose I could use the assistance.  &&& MalikVosh: For weeks now, my groats have been going missing. The first time I did not think much of it. Groats are crafty, and sometimes they escape. |But I am down too many groats now for this to be mere coincidence. They are being stolen. |This cannot continue. I cannot keep purchasing new groats only for them to go missing a few days later.  And without my groats, I cannot supply milk or meat to the city. |I understand that this may seem a minor problem compared to others in Dazra, but I would appreciate your assistance.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you very much. 
