msgctxt "00148E"
msgid "A problem of stolen property. I run a groat farm nearby."
msgstr "장물과 관련된 문제일세. 근처에서 그로트 농장을 운영하고 있네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's the problem? 
#. ALIAS: MalikVosh
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMalikVosh
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MalikVosh: Wait a second, maybe I can help you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_01_Intro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00148D"
msgid "Look, I really must be going. This is a pressing matter."
msgstr "이보게, 난 이만 가봐야겠네. 급한 일이 있어서 말일세."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That groat belongs to Malik Vosh. Your friend at his farm told me all about you, Andrah.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00148C"
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거라도 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: Do you need something?
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Huh? What's gotten into you? I do not even know you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00148B"
msgid "I've got bad news, Andrah. I'm taking back that groat, whether you like it or not."
msgstr "안 좋은 소식이 있어, 앤드라. 좋든 싫든 그 그로트를 되찾아 가겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: feigning ignorance / Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That groat belongs to Malik Vosh. Your friend at his farm told me all about you, Andrah.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That groat belongs to Malik Vosh. Your friend at his farm told me all about you, Andrah.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00148A"
msgid "My friend at the farm? I think you have the wrong guy. Besides, I would never steal a groat from someone, especially in times like these."
msgstr "농장에 있는 내 친구? 사람 잘못 본 것 같은데. 게다가, 난 다른 사람의 그로트를 훔치지 않아. 특히 이런 시기엔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: Do you need something?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My friend at the farm? I think you have the wrong guy. Besides, I would never steal a groat from someone, especially in times like these.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001489"
msgid "That groat belongs to Malik Vosh. Your friend at his farm told me all about you, Andrah."
msgstr "그 그로트는 말릭 보쉬 씨 거야. 그 농장에 있는 네 친구가 너에 대해 다 말해줬어. 앤드라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've got bad news, Andrah. I'm taking back that groat, whether you like it or not.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got bad news, Andrah. I'm taking back that groat, whether you like it or not.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know how you are feeling inside. If you admit what you've done, I can help you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001487"
msgid "Huh? What's gotten into you? I do not even know you."
msgstr "엉? 무슨 소리야? 난 널 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: shocked, knows they will most likely not survive this. Did not expect this to happen / Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] If you won't admit it's stolen, I'm just going to have to take the groat by force. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] If you won't admit it's stolen, I'm just going to have to take the groat by force. 
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CACA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001481"
msgid "By the Serpent, you're insane!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀에게 맹세코, 넌 미쳤어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: getting annoyed / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CACD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001480"
msgid "I did nothing of the sort!"
msgstr "난 그런 적 없어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: feigning ignorance / Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: I did nothing of the sort!  
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: AndrahDubib: Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CACC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147F"
msgid "*Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone."
msgstr "*한숨* 이봐, 정말로, 나한테 뭘 원하는지 모르겠어. 그냥 날 좀 내버려 둬."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: Do you need something?
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By the Serpent, you're insane! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CACB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147E"
msgid "[Attack] If you won't admit it's stolen, I'm just going to have to take the groat by force."
msgstr "[공격] 훔친 걸 인정하지 않겠다면, 무력으로 그 그로트를 뺏을 수밖에."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That groat belongs to Malik Vosh. Your friend at his farm told me all about you, Andrah. &&& AndrahDubib: My friend at the farm? I think you have the wrong guy. Besides, I would never steal a groat from someone, especially in times like these.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I did nothing of the sort!  
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CACE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147D"
msgid "Just admit it. You're the reason Malik's groats have been disappearing."
msgstr "그냥 인정해. 네가 말릭 씨의 그로트가 사라지게 만든 원흉이잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: AndrahDubib: *Sigh* Look, really, I do not know what you want from me. Please just leave me alone.
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147C"
msgid "Okay, okay, I confess. This groat is not mine, and I have been taking Malik's groats for some time, but I swear to you that it is for a good reason."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어, 자백하지. 이 그로트는 내 것이 아니고, 얼마 전부터 말릭의 그로트를 훔쳐 왔어. 하지만 맹세코, 다 그만한 이유가 있어서야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147B"
msgid "I know so many people that cannot feed themselves or their families. So many people, so many children, are starving."
msgstr "자신이나 가족을 먹여 살릴 수 없는 사람들을 너무 많이 알아. 너무 많은 사람, 너무 많은 아이들이 굶주리고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00147A"
msgid "I have been taking the groats and giving them to families that cannot afford to feed themselves. At times I pay others to steal the groats so that they can use the credits for medication or other supplies."
msgstr "그로트를 훔쳐서 스스로 먹고 살 형편이 안 되는 가족들에게 나눠주고 있었어. 때로는 다른 사람들에게 돈을 주고 그로트를 훔치게 해서 그들이 그 돈으로 약이나 다른 용품을 살 수 있도록 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: AndrahDubib
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAndrahDubib
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just take the groat and go. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DazraZ01
#. TOPIC: 0103CAC9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DazraZ01_03_AndrahConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001479"
msgid "Listen, I will pay you however much the groat is worth, but just let me leave with it. I will leave Malik's groats alone from here on out."
msgstr "이봐, 그로트 값어치 만큼 돈은 줄 테니, 나 좀 그냥 보내줘. 말릭의 그로트에는 앞으로 얼씬도 안할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB48
#. INFO GROUP: CREW_Generic_SpaceshipGravJumpRepairedDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipGravJumpRepaired
msgctxt "00142E"
msgid "Grav jump's back!"
msgstr "중력 도약이 돌아왔다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB48
#. INFO GROUP: CREW_Generic_SpaceshipGravJumpRepairedDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipGravJumpRepaired
msgctxt "00142D"
msgid "Grav Drive ready!"
msgstr "중력 구동기 준비 완료!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB49
#. INFO GROUP: CREW_Generic_SpaceshipGravJumpDownDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceshipGravJumpDown
msgctxt "001428"
msgid "We've just lost grav jump!"
msgstr "방금 중력 도약을 잃었다!"

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001427"
msgid "Oh Great Serpent, I stand in wonder of the Shrouding."
msgstr "오 위대한 뱀이시여, 장막의 날에 경외로이 서 있나이다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001426"
msgid "Even as Promised, I cannot fathom all the worlds thy breath has made."
msgstr "약속받은 자로서도, 당신의 숨결이 만든 모든 세계를 헤아릴 수 없나이다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001425"
msgid "I see the stars, the galaxies, in the coiling of your spine."
msgstr "당신의 척추가 감긴 모습에서 별들과 은하수들을 봅니다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001424"
msgid "Thy power throughout the universe displayed in a fang."
msgstr "우주 전체에 걸친 당신의 힘이 송곳니에 드러납니다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001423"
msgid "Oh Great Serpent. Bless this communion that we may walk in Jinan Va'ruun's footsteps."
msgstr "오 위대한 뱀이시여. 우리가 지난 바룬의 발자취를 따라 걸을 수 있도록 이 교감을 축복하소서."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001422"
msgid "That he jumped from the Sol System out into the beyond, and touched your magnificence. That he learned the truth of the Shrouding, the coming eternal embrace."
msgstr "지난 님은 태양계에서 저 너머로 도약해 당신의 위대함을 목도했나이다. 영원히 모두를 품어줄 장막의 날의 진실 또한 배웠나이다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001421"
msgid "That you will reward The Promised, and cast the accursed into shadow."
msgstr "당신께서 약속받은 자에게 상을 내리시고, 저주받은 자를 그림자 속으로 던지실 것임을."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001420"
msgid "When the Shrouding flows upon the galaxy like a river."
msgstr "장막의 날이 강물처럼 은하수에 쏟아질 때."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00141F"
msgid "When his venom boils the seas, and the billows crash upon the shore."
msgstr "그분의 독이 바다를 끓이고, 파도가 해안에 부딪힐 때."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00141E"
msgid "Whatever my place, I know that as the Promised, I will be granted sanctuary in the morrow."
msgstr "내 위치가 어디든, 약속받은 자로서 내일의 안식처를 보장받을 것임을 알고 있다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00141D"
msgid "All hail the word of Jinan Va'ruun! For his tongue is forked as the Serpent!"
msgstr "지난 바룬 님의 말씀을 찬양하라! 그분의 혀가 뱀처럼 갈라지셨으니!"

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00141C"
msgid "Let the Promised lay prostrate at his feet, for his head alone bears the diadem of truth."
msgstr "약속받은 자가 그분의 발 앞에 엎드리게 하라. 그분의 머리에만 진실의 보관이 씌워지리니."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00141B"
msgid "And with the Serpent's blessing, crown him as thy king."
msgstr "그리고 뱀의 축복으로, 왕으로 받들어 그분에게 보관을 씌우라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary03Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001419"
msgid "Apologies, but we're with the Sanctum Universum. If you'd like to join our church, we meet regularly."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 저희는 우주의 성소 소속입니다. 저희 교단에 가입하고 싶으시다면, 정기 집회에 참석해 주십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary03Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001418"
msgid "Sorry, but we follow the Enlightened. We don't believe in any divine creator, Great Serpent or otherwise."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 저희는 계몽회를 따릅니다. 저희는 위대한 뱀을 포함한 그 어떤 신성한 창조주도 믿지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary03Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001417"
msgid "Great what? Did you say Serpent? You're not one of those Zealots, are you?"
msgstr "위대한 뭐라고요? 뱀이라고 하셨습니까? 혹시 그 광신도 중 한 명이십니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: Halt, traveler. If you seek salvation, we beckon you to join us in our prayer.|For when the Shrouding comes, only those who follow the Great Serpent will know peace. &&& CitizenShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B536
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001416"
msgid "We do not wish to make you Penitent. Only to spread the gospel so you may heed the Serpent's call."
msgstr "우리는 그대를 회개자로 만들고 싶은 것이 아니다. 오직 뱀의 부름에 귀 기울일 수 있도록 복음을 전파하고 싶을 뿐이다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Your beliefs are false. Do you not hear the call? Day and night without ceasing he sings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B536
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001415"
msgid "Day and night without ceasing he sings."
msgstr "그분은 밤낮으로 쉬지 않고 노래하신다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B53E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001414"
msgid "Halt, traveler. If you seek salvation, we beckon you to join us in our prayer."
msgstr "멈춰라, 여행자여. 구원을 원한다면 우리와 함께 기도하자."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B53E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001413"
msgid "For when the Shrouding comes, only those who follow the Great Serpent will know peace."
msgstr "장막의 날이 오면, 위대한 뱀을 따르는 자들만이 평화를 누릴 것이기 때문이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary01Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001412"
msgid "But the Sanctum Universum says that the creator, \"which gave rise to reality itself, seeks to understand its consequents.\" That is the will of God."
msgstr "하지만 우주의 성소에서는 ‘현실 그 자체를 낳은’ 창조주가 '그 결과물을 이해하고자 한다’고 말합니다. 그것이 바로 신의 뜻입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary01Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001411"
msgid "Yet as the Enlightened, we know that \"to rely on anyone but oneself is a crutch, and through hard work and toil all things are possible.\""
msgstr "하지만 계몽회로서, 우리는 '자신 외에 그 누구에게도 의지하는 것은 목발과 같으며, 근면과 노력만이 모든 것을 가능하게 한다’는 것을 알고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary01Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001410"
msgid "Look, I don't know what any of that means, but I think we're gonna be on our way."
msgstr "저기, 그게 무슨 뜻인지는 모르겠지만, 저희는 이만 가 봐야 할 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary02Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "00140F"
msgid "The only thing we hear is the word of the creator."
msgstr "우리가 듣는 것은 오직 창조주의 말씀뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary02Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "00140E"
msgid "We don't hear anything, I'm afraid."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 아무것도 들리지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 01174B2B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary02Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "00140D"
msgid "Call? Do you mean like a call sign? I'm not sure I copy, stranger."
msgstr "부름이라고요? 호출 부호 같은 걸 말씀하시는 겁니까? 무슨 말씀이신지 잘 모르겠습니다, 낯선 분."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B532
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010A7DD6
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00140C"
msgid "We are pleased you have joined us for this communion. Have you come to bleed the gospel of the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "이 자리에 함께해 주시니 기쁩니다. 위대한 뱀의 복음을 전파하러 오셨습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: For the Shrouding will bless only true believers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B531
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00140B"
msgid "I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation."
msgstr "그렇소. 위대한 뱀께서 약속받은 자들을 구원으로 인도하시기를."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CitizenShip:  &&& HailingShip: And yet Jinan's word states that your gospel is false and your fates are doomed.|"And their blood boiled in their skin, and their bones melted, as the venom of truth washed over their false god's succor."
#. ALIAS: CitizenShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMShipComms
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: Fine. Then we shall proceed without you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B53C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "00140A"
msgid "Well... that sounds vaguely like a threat. We're going to leave now, if that's all right with you."
msgstr "음... 어째 위협처럼 들리는데. 그럼 우린 이만 가보겠소. 괜찮으시겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then heed the words we spoke and spread it further. For the wind must carry the seed to create the garden.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001409"
msgid "You just showed up on my scanners and I was curious."
msgstr "방금 스캐너에 포착되어서 궁금했을 뿐이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You just showed up on my scanners and I was curious.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You just showed up on my scanners and I was curious.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If they refuse the truth, they will be made dust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001408"
msgid "Then heed the words we spoke and spread it further. For the wind must carry the seed to create the garden."
msgstr "그렇다면 우리가 전한 말을 명심하고 더 널리 퍼뜨려라. 정원을 가꾸려면 바람이 씨앗을 옮겨야 하는 법이니까."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: We do not wish to make you Penitent. Only to spread the gospel so you may heed the Serpent's call.|Day and night without ceasing he sings.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B53B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001407"
msgid "Your beliefs are false. Do you not hear the call? Day and night without ceasing he sings."
msgstr "그대의 믿음은 틀렸다. 부름이 들리지 않는가? 그분은 밤낮으로 쉬지 않고 노래하신다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To bleed? What do you mean by that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To bleed? What do you mean by that?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001406"
msgid "One does not simply listen to the word of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 말씀을 그냥 듣기만 해서는 안 된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To bleed? What do you mean by that?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001405"
msgid "One must be willing to die for it, absorb it into themselves, so that if they were cut open, Jinan's breath would exhale from the wound."
msgstr "그것을 위해 기꺼이 죽을 각오를 하고, 온몸으로 흡수해야 한다. 그리하여 그대의 몸을 갈랐을 때, 그 상처에서 지난의 숨결이 새어 나오도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To bleed? What do you mean by that?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: HailingShip: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001404"
msgid "To bleed the gospel is to become it, for its chant to be your life essence."
msgstr "복음을 전파한다는 것은 곧 그것이 되는 것이며, 그것의 성가가 그대의 생명의 본질이 되도록 하는 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We travel to teach the word of Jinan Va'ruun, for the new Speaker demands it of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B529
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001403"
msgid "Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라 밖에서는 무슨 일로 여행 중인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001402"
msgid "For the Shrouding will bless only true believers."
msgstr "장막의 날은 오직 진정한 신도들에게만 축복이 될 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am. May the Great Serpent guide the Promised to salvation.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Keep at it. If just one unbeliever is converted, you will have done the Great Serpent a service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B530
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001401"
msgid "For now, we bid you farewell to spread the word further. The wind must carry the seed to create the garden."
msgstr "그럼 이제 우리는 말씀을 더 전파하기 위해 작별을 고하겠다. 정원을 가꾸려면 바람이 씨앗을 옮겨야 하는 법이니까."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: Your beliefs are false. Do you not hear the call? Day and night without ceasing he sings. &&& CitizenShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B538
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001400"
msgid "Then I pity you. I recite the Hymn of the Accursed: \"For when the Shrouding comes, creatures living and dead will descend on your houses, each of them with two fangs, a forked tongue, and eyes all around and inside.\""
msgstr "그렇다면 그대가 불쌍하군. 저주받은 자의 찬송가를 읊어 주겠다. ‘장막의 날이 오면, 산 자와 죽은 자를 막론하고 모든 생물이 그대들의 집으로 내려올 것이며, 그들 모두는 두 개의 송곳니와 갈라진 혀, 그리고 안팎으로 가득한 눈을 가지고 있을 것이다.’"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A false believer! Kill them!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013FF"
msgid "[Attack] I'm here to kill you heathens."
msgstr "[공격] 이 이교도들을 죽이러 왔다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip:  &&& HailingShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: One does not simply listen to the word of the Great Serpent. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013FE"
msgid "To bleed? What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "전파한다고? 그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: Then I pity you. I recite the Hymn of the Accursed: "For when the Shrouding comes, creatures living and dead will descend on your houses, each of them with two fangs, a forked tongue, and eyes all around and inside." &&& CitizenShip: 
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B53A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013FD"
msgid "And yet Jinan's word states that your gospel is false and your fates are doomed."
msgstr "하지만 지난의 말씀에 따르면 그대의 복음은 거짓이며 그대의 운명은 파멸이라고 한다."

msgctxt "0013FC"
msgid "\"And their blood boiled in their skin, and their bones melted, as the venom of truth washed over their false god's succor.\""
msgstr "'그리고 진실의 독이 저들의 거짓된 신이 보낸 원군에게 휩쓸자, 그자들의 피가 끓기 시작하고 뼈가 녹아내리기 시작했더라.'"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: HailingShip: And yet Jinan's word states that your gospel is false and your fates are doomed.|"And their blood boiled in their skin, and their bones melted, as the venom of truth washed over their false god's succor." &&& CitizenShip: Well... that sounds vaguely like a threat. We're going to leave now, if that's all right with you.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B539
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_CitizenScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013FB"
msgid "Fine. Then we shall proceed without you."
msgstr "좋다. 그럼 우린 그대 없이 계속 나아가겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013FA"
msgid "We travel to teach the word of Jinan Va'ruun, for the new Speaker demands it of us."
msgstr "우리는 새로운 대변자의 명에 따라 지난 바룬의 말씀을 전파하기 위해 여행 중이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why are you traveling outside of Dazra?
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B528
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F9"
msgid "They have commanded us to drop the dagger and its dull blade in favor of the gospel."
msgstr "그분께선 무딘 칼날과 같은 단검 따위는 버리고 복음을 택하라고 명하셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] I'm here to kill you heathens.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I'm here to kill you heathens.
#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's fine. Not everyone will be receptive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B52C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingSceneGreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F8"
msgid "A false believer! Kill them!"
msgstr "거짓된 신도다! 죽여라!"

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F7"
msgid "Oh Great Serpent, I stand in wonder of the Shrouding."
msgstr "오 위대한 뱀이시여, 장막의 날에 경외로이 서 있나이다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F6"
msgid "Even as Promised, I cannot fathom all the worlds thy breath has made."
msgstr "약속받은 자로서도, 당신의 숨결이 만든 모든 세계를 헤아릴 수 없나이다."

#. ALIAS: HailingShip
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary
#. TOPIC: 0103B534
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_SE_VaruunMissionary_HailingScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_RandomGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F5"
msgid "I see the stars, the galaxies, the coiling of your spine."
msgstr "별들, 은하수, 네 척추의 똬리가 보여."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F4"
msgid "Thy power throughout the universe displayed in a fang."
msgstr "우주 전체에 걸친 당신의 힘이 송곳니에 드러납니다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F3"
msgid "Oh Great Serpent. Bless this communion that we may walk in Jinan Va'ruun's footsteps."
msgstr "오 위대한 뱀이시여. 우리가 지난 바룬의 발자취를 따라 걸을 수 있도록 이 교감을 축복하소서."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F2"
msgid "That he jumped from the Sol System out into the beyond, and touched your magnificence. That he learned the truth of the Shrouding, the coming eternal embrace."
msgstr "지난 님은 태양계에서 저 너머로 도약해 당신의 위대함을 목도했나이다. 영원히 모두를 품어줄 장막의 날의 진실 또한 배웠나이다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F1"
msgid "That you will reward The Promised, and cast the accursed into shadow."
msgstr "당신께서 약속받은 자에게 상을 내리시고, 저주받은 자를 그림자 속으로 던지실 것임을."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013F0"
msgid "When the Shrouding flows upon the galaxy like a river."
msgstr "장막의 날이 강물처럼 은하수에 쏟아질 때."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013EF"
msgid "When his venom boils the seas, and the billows crash upon the shore."
msgstr "그분의 독이 바다를 끓이고, 파도가 해안에 부딪힐 때."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013EE"
msgid "Whatever my place, I know that as the Promised, I will be granted sanctuary in the morrow."
msgstr "내 위치가 어디든, 약속받은 자로서 내일의 안식처를 보장받을 것임을 알고 있다."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013ED"
msgid "All hail the word of Jinan Va'ruun! For his tongue is forked as the Serpent!"
msgstr "지난 바룬 님의 말씀을 찬양하라! 그분의 혀가 뱀처럼 갈라지셨으니!"

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013EC"
msgid "Let the Promised lay prostrate at his feet, for his head alone bears the diadem of truth."
msgstr "약속받은 자가 그분의 발 앞에 엎드리게 하라. 그분의 머리에만 진실의 보관이 씌워지리니."

#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035421
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_ShrineScene
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SerpentSermon_ShrineGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013EB"
msgid "And with the Serpent's blessing, crown him as thy king."
msgstr "그리고 뱀의 축복으로, 왕으로 받들어 그분에게 보관을 씌우라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: House Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C43F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0013CE"
msgid "I think you may be on to something."
msgstr "뭔가 알아내신 것 같습니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B17
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_Herald_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013CD"
msgid "Stay safe."
msgstr "몸조심하시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVassilisVoyiatzi
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_Z03_VassilisVoyiatzi_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013CC"
msgid "Serpent be with you."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 함께 하시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B17
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_Herald_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013CB"
msgid "Let Jinan's word guide you."
msgstr "지난의 말씀이 그대를 인도하기를."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A59
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Goodbyes_FollowPlayer
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013CA"
msgid "All right then."
msgstr "그럼 알겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B17
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013C9"
msgid "If you find any more Zealots, you know what to do."
msgstr "광신도를 더 발견하면, 어떻게 해야 할지 알겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B17
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013C8"
msgid "Back to the patrol then."
msgstr "그럼 순찰로 복귀한다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B17
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_PostQuest_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0013C7"
msgid "Let us know if you see any Zealots."
msgstr "광신도를 발견하면 알려주시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C6"
msgid "The morning prayer is always enlightening."
msgstr "아침 기도는 언제나 깨달음을 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C5"
msgid "Sermons are spoken here, so we can take in the word of Jinan Va'ruun."
msgstr "지난 바룬의 말씀을 들을 수 있도록 이곳에서 설교가 행해진다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C4"
msgid "In the shrine room, I feel the Great Serpent can hear our words, and watch our deeds."
msgstr "성소의 예배실에 있으면, 위대한 뱀께서 저희의 말을 들으시고 저희의 행동을 지켜보고 계시는 게 느껴집니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C3"
msgid "All hail the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 찬양하라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C2"
msgid "Welcome to Jarek's Rest. If you find any Zealots, do not hesitate to render them dust."
msgstr "자렉의 안식처에 오신 것을 환영한다. 광신도를 발견하면, 주저 말고 먼지로 만들어 버려라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C1"
msgid "The Children of Jandar are pitiful and weak."
msgstr "잔다르의 자식들은 한심하고 약해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013C0"
msgid "Death to all unbelievers."
msgstr "모든 불신자에게 죽음을."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013BF"
msgid "The Great Serpent has blessed us with this hideout."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 이 은신처를 축복하셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013BE"
msgid "We will crush any Zealots that dare show their countenance."
msgstr "감히 고개를 쳐드는 광신도들은 모조리 박살 낼 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSMS001_PatrolSecurity_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0013BD"
msgid "The shrine is perfect for morning prayer."
msgstr "성소는 아침 기도에 완벽한 장소지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_Varuun_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013BC"
msgid "Do you wish to receive any tribute for your help?"
msgstr "당신의 도움에 대한 보상을 받고 싶소?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntro_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013BB"
msgid "The unbelievers have been made Penitent."
msgstr "믿지 않는 자들은 회개자가 되었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntro_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013BA"
msgid "The Accursed are dust."
msgstr "저주받은 자들은 먼지가 되었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntro_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B9"
msgid "We have vanquished the heretics."
msgstr "우리는 이단자들을 처단했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroNoHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B8"
msgid "Your assistance was not required. They were pitiful and weak."
msgstr "당신의 도움은 필요 없었다. 그들은 한심하고 약했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroNoHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B7"
msgid "We handled their inferior ships without your aid."
msgstr "우리는 당신의 도움 없이 그들의 열등한 우주선을 처리했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroNoHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B6"
msgid "You deigned not to join us, so the glory is ours alone."
msgstr "당신이 우리와 함께하지 않았으니, 영광은 오로지 우리의 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroDidHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B5"
msgid "Your assistance was welcome. Their pitiful armada was no match for our collective might."
msgstr "당신의 도움은 환영받았다. 그들의 한심한 함대는 우리의 집단적인 위력에 상대가 되지 않았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroDidHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B4"
msgid "Their inferior ships were nothing compared to our collective might."
msgstr "그들의 열등한 우주선은 우리의 집단적인 위력에 비하면 아무것도 아니었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_SE_SharedInfo_HailIntroDidHelp_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B3"
msgid "You decided to join us, and so the glory of their deaths is shared by us all."
msgstr "당신이 우리와 함께하기로 했으니, 그들의 죽음에 대한 영광은 우리 모두가 공유한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
