#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0013B1"
msgid "Then the parts will be transferred."
msgstr "그럼 부품을 옮기도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Ship dialogue no cubic needed
#. PROMPT: Credits would be appreciated.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Credits would be appreciated.
#. ALIAS: HailingShipVaruun
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Spaceship / Neutral
