#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ever since I can remember, math and science came easy to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7E
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001355"
msgid "What do you mean by gifts?"
msgstr "재능이라니, 그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001354"
msgid "And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a \"child.\""
msgstr ""
"그리고 과학뿐만이 아니야. 내가 위대한 뱀의 복음을 전할 때에도 다들 그 똑같은 시선으로 날 쏘아봐. 아무도 디 아이에게 설교를 듣고 "
"싶지 않은 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001353"
msgid "But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers."
msgstr "근데 내가 대머리에 수염이 났으면, 저주받은 자들마저 열렬한 신도가 됐겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I respect you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C79
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001352"
msgid "And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't."
msgstr "그리고 나도 널 존중해! 하지만 그것도 우리가 서로를 열린 마음으로 대했기 때문이지. 남들은 안 그렇거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001351"
msgid "It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that."
msgstr "한때 예전의 흔적만 남았을 뿐이야. 저 너머에 있는 비늘 성채를 보면 그 사실을 계속 곱씹을 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator. &&& Sahima: I'm glad we share that in common. You have to believe in something, even if they're wrong, which they are.|And if the science changes, we'll adjust as we go along. &&& Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.|I'm one of the best scientists in the world, but I still have to fight for respect, because I look so young.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How can you say that, when I've survived so much loss? I have experienced more than most will in twenty lifetimes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C76
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134F"
msgid "You're book smart but you lack life experience."
msgstr "책을 많이 읽어서 똑똑한데, 삶의 경험은 부족하구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you. &&& Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't. &&& Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."|But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Those who do not believe in the Great Serpent. They are cursed to die in the Shrouding unless we can open their hearts to his teachings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C74
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134E"
msgid "Accursed?"
msgstr "저주받은 자들?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You aren't as smart as you think you are.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You aren't as smart as you think you are.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C77
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134D"
msgid "You can say that, but my accomplishments say otherwise. And I'm tired of people judging me by my appearance."
msgstr "그렇게 말할 수 있지만, 내가 해낸 업적을 보면 그렇게 말 못할걸. 그리고 남들이 겉모습만 보고 날 평가하는 건 지긋지긋해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're book smart but you lack life experience.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're book smart but you lack life experience.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C75
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134C"
msgid "How can you say that, when I've survived so much loss? I have experienced more than most will in twenty lifetimes."
msgstr "내가 얼마나 많은 상실을 겪었는데 그런 말을 할 수 있지? 남들이 스무 번 인생을 살아도 못 겪을 것을 전부 봤단 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator. &&& Sahima: I'm glad we share that in common. You have to believe in something, even if they're wrong, which they are.|And if the science changes, we'll adjust as we go along. &&& Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.|I'm one of the best scientists in the world, but I still have to fight for respect, because I look so young.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can say that, but my accomplishments say otherwise. And I'm tired of people judging me by my appearance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C78
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134B"
msgid "You aren't as smart as you think you are."
msgstr "넌 네 생각보다 그렇게 똑똑한 사람이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Accursed?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Accursed?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C73
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00134A"
msgid "Those who do not believe in the Great Serpent. They are cursed to die in the Shrouding unless we can open their hearts to his teachings."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀을 믿지 않는 자들을 말해. 우리가 뱀의 말씀을 진심으로 받아들이도록 가르치지 않으면 장막의 날에 죽음을 맞이할 운명이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator. &&& Sahima: I'm glad we share that in common. You have to believe in something, even if they're wrong, which they are.|And if the science changes, we'll adjust as we go along. &&& Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.|I'm one of the best scientists in the world, but I still have to fight for respect, because I look so young.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001349"
msgid "I respect you."
msgstr "난 널 존중해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Oh! So an infinite regress? Assuming space is infinite it's not technically unfeasible, even if it's flat out wrong.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C72
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001348"
msgid "But I realize you are being facetious. As a member of House Va'ruun, clearly you wouldn't believe in anything save the Great Serpent!"
msgstr "하지만 네가 농담하고 있다는 건 잘 알고 있어. 바룬 가문의 일원으로서, 너는 위대한 뱀을 제외한 모든 것은 전혀 믿지 않겠지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was never gone to begin with. You just had a mental block.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020324
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001347"
msgid "Anyway, that's when I was adopted and became his apprentice."
msgstr "아무튼 내가 새 가문에 입양되어 그분의 조수가 되었던 시기가 그때야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Big Bang.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202EF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001346"
msgid "I am sure as a follower of House Va'ruun, you believe the same."
msgstr "너는 바룬 가문의 신도로서, 분명 똑같이 믿고 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: God.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: God.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202ED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001345"
msgid "And by \"God,\" surely you mean the Great Serpent?"
msgstr "여기서 말하는 '신'은 당연히 위대한 뱀을 뜻하겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: God.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202ED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001344"
msgid "Because I've heard that term to mean many different things. But that's a conversation for another time."
msgstr "난 그 용어의 뜻이 여러 개라고 들었거든. 다만 그 얘기는 다음에 하도록 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Somber, for all that it's endured.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001343"
msgid "What would the mood of Dazra be right now?"
msgstr "지금 다즈라의 분위기는 어떻다고 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would the mood of Dazra be right now?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What would the mood of Dazra be right now?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001342"
msgid "Somber, for all that it's endured."
msgstr "그동안의 일 때문에 침울해진 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would the mood of Dazra be right now?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001341"
msgid "But also resilient! For the rebuilding, and the work yet to come."
msgstr "하지만 금방 회복하고 있지! 이미 재건 중이고, 앞으로 여러 과업을 수행할 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would the mood of Dazra be right now?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001340"
msgid "Dazra and its people will rebound from this tragedy. I am sure of it."
msgstr "다즈라의 신민들은 이 비극을 이겨낼 거야. 확실히."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00133F"
msgid "Worship is to use the heart's voice, when the throat fails."
msgstr "예배는 목소리로도 부족할 때, 마음의 목소리로 드리는 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00133E"
msgid "I worry about Dazra's policy of isolation. As much as we try to candy over the problems, you can still see the trouble underneath."
msgstr "난 다즈라의 고립 정책이 걱정돼. 우리가 아무리 문제를 덮어두려고 노력해도, 여전히 숨어 있는 문제가 보이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00133D"
msgid "You were right to restart the Serpent's Crusade. It was Jinan's will, and his will is the word of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "뱀의 성전을 재개한 건 잘한 일이었어. 지난 님의 뜻이 그러했고, 그분의 뜻이 위대한 뱀의 말씀이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00133C"
msgid "I don't know if it was the right call to end the Serpent's Crusade. But I trust your judgment."
msgstr "네가 뱀의 성전을 중단시킨 것이 옳았는지 모르겠지만, 네 결정을 믿을게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C55
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00133B"
msgid "The only thing the Houses have ever been good at is pointing fingers. Mine's coiled and ready, is yours?"
msgstr "가문들이 잘하는 거라곤 삿대질하는 것뿐이죠. 전 준비됐는데, 당신은 어때요?"

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You seem pleased.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102EE6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001336"
msgid "It's the same as when I put the supplies on hold. You make it seem like it's THEIR idea to help the Zealots. When in reality, we're just setting them up to take the fall."
msgstr "내가 물자 공급을 보류시켰을 때처럼, 그 도둑이 광신도들을 돕는 것같이 꾸미는 거다. 사실은 누명을 씌우는 거지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you miss him?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020312
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001333"
msgid "And I don't know how I'd feel if it turned out he abandoned us and the project."
msgstr "게다가 그분이 우리랑 프로젝트까지 버리고 떠난 것뿐이란 걸 알게 되면, 내 기분이 어떻게 될지 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you miss him?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: That's... spooky.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020312
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001332"
msgid "But I do hope that wherever he is, he's okay."
msgstr "하지만 어디에 있으시든지간에, 부디 잘 지내고 계셨으면 좋겠어."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, the usual politics. Everyone has an opinion, nobody has a consensus. It's exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C56
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132F"
msgid "What was that discussion about?"
msgstr "뭐에 대해 언쟁하고 있었습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: emphasis on "exhausting"  / Smirk / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was that discussion about?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C55
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132E"
msgid "Oh, the usual politics. Everyone has an opinion, nobody has a consensus. It's exhausting."
msgstr "오, 늘 그렇듯 정치질이죠. 모두가 의견만 내지, 합의는 안 해요. 정말 지치죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: First, a slate of recent assignees to the spaceport and supply warehouse. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: And last but not least, the big prize, a Zealot's encrypted slate!|If what I'm told is true, the coordinates for Jandar's Rest should be on it.|It's password protected, but I believe you already have the cipher key. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: I was wondering when you'd grace my office again with your presence.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is that so? It seems like forever. Well, what even is time anymore.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C54
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132D"
msgid "I was just here a little while ago."
msgstr "저 방금 여기 있었는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I was just here a little while ago.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I was just here a little while ago.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: In fact, I think you and I are going to be fast friends.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C53
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132C"
msgid "Is that so? It seems like forever. Well, what even is time anymore."
msgstr "그래요? 꽤 오래된 것 같은데. 뭐, 이제 시간이란 게 무슨 의미가 있겠어요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I am a member of House Veth'aal, stationed at the Keep. Our job is to make sure everyone is working and committed to the cause.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C52
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132B"
msgid "What's your role here?"
msgstr "여기서 무슨 일을 하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Has work been challenging since the incident?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C4F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00132A"
msgid "Yes, you might say that. But I like a challenge."
msgstr "예, 그렇게 말하실 수도 있겠죠. 하지만 저는 도전을 좋아해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C4F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001329"
msgid "Sometimes tragedy is an opportunity to advance. Especially if the vortex swallows a direct superior or two."
msgstr "때로는 비극이 발전의 기회가 되기도 하죠. 특히 볼텍스가 직속상관 한두 명을 삼켜버린다면요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Mujeen, Mujeen... who is that again?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001328"
msgid "Mujeen mentioned you have a vendetta against him?"
msgstr "무진 씨는 당신이 무진 씨에게 복수하려 한다고 하던데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why the push for more workers?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C3A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001327"
msgid "I'm surprised such a question can be asked with the city in such disarray."
msgstr "도시가 이렇게 혼란스러운 상황에서 그런 질문을 할 수 있다는 게 놀랍군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C3A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001326"
msgid "The problems are obvious, and yet those in power continue to emphasize patience and measured responses."
msgstr "문제는 명확하지 않나. 권력을 가진 자들이 계속해서 인내하라느니 신중하게 대응하자느니만 강조하고 있잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C3A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001325"
msgid "Now is not the time for red tape. The more caution we exercise the more people will suffer."
msgstr "지금은 절차에 얽매일 때가 아니야. 우리가 더 신중할수록 더 많은 사람들이 고통받을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: In my argument back there, I advocated for more workers -- even if it meant reaching out to our enemies.|And yes, I understand the reluctance with House Ma'leen. Their crimes go beyond forgiveness.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C37
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001324"
msgid "But I'm also not campaigning to conscript their soldiers."
msgstr "마린 가문을 군인으로 징집하자고 캠페인을 벌인 것도 아니란 말이지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Yes, you might say that. But I like a challenge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C50
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001323"
msgid "Has work been challenging since the incident?"
msgstr "사고 이후로 일이 많이 힘들었나요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I'm surprised such a question can be asked with the city in such disarray.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C3B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001322"
msgid "Why the push for more workers?"
msgstr "왜 인력을 더 많이 요구하는 겁니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Violence begets violence without end. &&& Mujeen: You may be right. But what if the origin of the conflict itself no longer exists?|I would argue neither side has a reason to continue such a pointless fight.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is my fear. The cycle of violence may be as inevitable as the Shrouding.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B73
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001321"
msgid "As long as blood's been shed, it doesn't matter if the reasons are gone. People will continue to fight."
msgstr "피를 본 이상, 이유가 사라졌다고 해도 상관없을걸요. 사람들은 계속 싸울 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I concur. And the infighting serves only to weaken House Va'ruun and Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C39
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001320"
msgid "In my argument back there, I advocated for more workers -- even if it meant reaching out to our enemies."
msgstr ""
"내가 아까 주장한 건, 노동자가 더 많이 필요하단 걸 옹호한 거야. 설령 그 결과 우리의 적에게 손을 내미는 꼴이 된다고 하더라도 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your role here?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C51
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00131E"
msgid "I am a member of House Veth'aal, stationed at the Keep. Our job is to make sure everyone is working and committed to the cause."
msgstr ""
"저는 베타알 가문의 일원이며, 요새에서 일하고 있어요. 저희의 임무는 모든 사람이 일하고 있는지, 대의에 헌신하고 있는지 확인하는 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: All must serve is the mantra for House Va'ruun. / Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C51
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00131D"
msgid "If someone has a crisis of faith, we simply remind them the importance of their role. As the saying goes, \"All Must Serve.\""
msgstr ""
"만약 누군가 신앙에 위기가 온다면, 우리는 그 누군가가 맡은 역할의 중요성을 상기시켜 줘요. '모두가 섬겨야 한다'는 구절처럼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As long as blood's been shed, it doesn't matter if the reasons are gone. People will continue to fight.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as blood's been shed, it doesn't matter if the reasons are gone. People will continue to fight.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: In my argument back there, I advocated for more workers -- even if it meant reaching out to our enemies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B72
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00131C"
msgid "That is my fear. The cycle of violence may be as inevitable as the Shrouding."
msgstr "그게 두렵네. 폭력의 악순환은 장막의 날처럼 피할 수 없는 걸지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Agreed. If the source of the conflict is gone, then the fighting should stop.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. If the source of the conflict is gone, then the fighting should stop.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: In my argument back there, I advocated for more workers -- even if it meant reaching out to our enemies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B70
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001319"
msgid "I concur. And the infighting serves only to weaken House Va'ruun and Dazra."
msgstr "동의하네. 내분은 바룬 가문과 다즈라를 약화시킬 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned House Ma'leen. Where are they now?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But to assume any group is a monolith is absurd. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B75
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001318"
msgid "They are the ones commonly known as Zealots. Fanatics who believe peace should never have been made with the Settled Systems."
msgstr "마린 가문은 흔히 광신도라고 알려진 자들이네. 개척 성계와 평화조약을 맺어서는 안 된다고 믿는 광적인 자들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're dismissed, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're dismissed, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001317"
msgid "Dismissed? I think you forget your station."
msgstr "해고라고? 네 위치를 잊은 모양이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're dismissed, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001316"
msgid "I will depart because I am needed at my ship, not because you deem me unnecessary."
msgstr "내가 떠나는 건 내 우주선에서 날 필요로 하기 때문이지, 네가 날 불필요하다고 여겨서가 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're dismissed, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001315"
msgid "So out of respect for Qisrani and the crew of the Cortege, I will not keep them waiting any longer."
msgstr "그러니 키스라니와 코테지 호의 선원들에 대한 존중의 의미로, 더 이상 선원들을 기다리게 하지 않겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thank you for your assistance. We can take it from here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thank you for your assistance. We can take it from here.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001314"
msgid "Then I'll take my leave. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting."
msgstr "그럼 이만 떠나겠다. 코테지 호가 우주항에 도착했고, 선원들을 기다리게 하는 건 좋지 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Mujeen mentioned you have a vendetta against him?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Oh, of course, the gentleman from House Ka'dic! I forgot he was even alive. In my defense, he's incredibly boring.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038C4D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL00_Tevina05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001313"
msgid "Mujeen, Mujeen... who is that again?"
msgstr "무진, 무진이라... 그게 누구였죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness for a sworn enemy is treason. &&& Mujeen: I am merely stating a hypothetical. And I am not saying the sinful should be absolved of their crimes.|But if the origin of one's conflict no longer exists, what purpose does the cycle of violence serve?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To do nothing is its own choice, and one that I fear will leave us in conflict.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001311"
msgid "I don't feel strongly either way."
msgstr "어느 쪽도 생각이 확고하게 들진 않네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's possible to break it. &&& Mujeen: I wholeheartedly agree. We do not have to forgive, but we can let go.|And why continue a fight if the reason for the conflict is no longer an issue?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I concur. And the infighting serves only to weaken House Va'ruun and Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B71
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001310"
msgid "Agreed. If the source of the conflict is gone, then the fighting should stop."
msgstr "동감입니다. 갈등의 원인이 사라졌다면 싸움은 멈춰야죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't feel strongly either way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't feel strongly either way.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: In my argument back there, I advocated for more workers -- even if it meant reaching out to our enemies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130F"
msgid "To do nothing is its own choice, and one that I fear will leave us in conflict."
msgstr "아무것도 하지 않는 것도 한 방법이겠지만, 그러다 계속 우리가 갈등에 빠질까 두렵네."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: They are the ones commonly known as Zealots. Fanatics who believe peace should never have been made with the Settled Systems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B76
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130E"
msgid "You mentioned House Ma'leen. Where are they now?"
msgstr "마린 가문에 대해 언급하셨는데, 그 가문 사람들은 지금 어디에 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: They are the ones commonly known as Zealots. Fanatics who believe peace should never have been made with the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B74
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130D"
msgid "But to assume any group is a monolith is absurd."
msgstr "하지만 어떤 집단이든 생각이 통일돼 있을 거라고 가정하는 건 터무니없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: They are the ones commonly known as Zealots. Fanatics who believe peace should never have been made with the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B74
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130C"
msgid "But now that the Serpent's Crusade has been reconstituted, there is nothing blocking reconciliation. Our beliefs are one and the same."
msgstr "하지만 이제 뱀의 성전이 재개되었으니, 화해를 막을 장애물은 아무것도 없네. 우리의 신념은 하나가 된 거나 다름없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Line spoken if player found audio recording incriminating Tevina early in the quest / Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Do not let her cheery demeanor fool you. She has a reputation around these parts for being a ruthless hunter of heretics.|If she doesn't know the location of the hideout, at the very least she'll at least have a lead.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01038B6A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130B"
msgid "She also has a distinct manner of speech which... well, I will need to verify the contents of the slate you gave me before I say anything more."
msgstr "테비나는 또한 말투가 독특한데... 음, 또 아무 말이나 하기 전에 당신이 준 슬레이트의 내용을 확인해야겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll make the deposit into your accounts. Your family will be taken care of for generations to come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE21
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00130A"
msgid "This slate, found on the body of Ochim Ka'dic."
msgstr "오킴 카딕의 시신에서 발견된 슬레이트입니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb. |For that, you will be well rewarded. &&& Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case. &&& Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence. &&& Mujeen: And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll make the deposit into your accounts. Your family will be taken care of for generations to come.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE21
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001309"
msgid "Your diligence is appreciated, Warden. And if there's nothing else you'd like to discuss, I think we can bring this case to a close."
msgstr "교정관, 당신의 노고에 감사드립니다. 이제 더 이상 논의할 사항이 없다면, 이 사건을 종결지어도 될 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will Mujeen be taken?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001308"
msgid "The grim reality is it's unlikely he will be there long. Aiding the Zealots is a crime punishable by death. There are typically no exceptions."
msgstr ""
"암울한 현실은 그자가 오래 살지 못할 거라는 겁니다. 광신도를 돕는 것은 사형에 처할 수 있는 범죄입니다. 일반적으로 예외는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will Mujeen be taken?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It was my pleasure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001307"
msgid "Add to that the murder of a state official, and well, he will be lucky if his death is swift."
msgstr "거기에 국가 공무원을 살해한 혐의까지 더해지면, 뭐, 빨리 죽는다면 운이 좋은 거겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's possible to break it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Agreed. If the source of the conflict is gone, then the fighting should stop.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001306"
msgid "And why continue a fight if the reason for the conflict is no longer an issue?"
msgstr "갈등의 이유가 더 이상 문제가 되지 않는다면 왜 싸움을 계속해야 하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "001305"
msgid "She's never forgiven me for it, and I fail to see why. It's petty and unprofessional for someone of her position."
msgstr ""
"테비나는 이 일에 관해선 나를 절대 용서하지 않는데, 그 이유를 모르겠네. 그 정도 지위에 있는 사람답지 않게 옹졸하고 전문가답지 못하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: 
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001304"
msgid "I was wondering when you'd grace my office with your presence."
msgstr "언제쯤 제 사무실을 방문해 주실까 했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: You're back! Have you uncovered any new information?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001303"
msgid "Executor."
msgstr "실무관."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, but maybe I can help you. Seems like you've hit some trouble.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C22
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001300"
msgid "But I am sure you are busy getting adjusted to life here. Is there anything I can help you with?"
msgstr "하지만 당신은 여기 생활에 적응하느라 바쁘시겠죠. 제가 도와드릴 일이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_030_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0012FF"
msgid "Given everything's that happened, finding those supplies is paramount."
msgstr "지금까지 일어난 모든 일을 고려할 때, 그 물자를 찾는 것이 가장 중요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Version where evidence against Tevina is brought in advance / Stern / to MS01_Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: As far as I'm concerned the case is closed. But if you have further evidence, it may help with the conviction. &&& Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll make the deposit into your accounts. Your family will be taken care of for generations to come.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Tevina: What? Where did you get that? That sounds nothing like me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038BC4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuestTevinaArrest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012FB"
msgid "Tevina, do you have anything to say for yourself?"
msgstr "테비나, 변명할 말이 있습니까?"

