#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012D9"
msgid "Which means you knew about the supply theft and attempted to pin the blame on House Ka'dic."
msgstr "이 말은 당신이 물자 절도에 대해 알고 있었고 카딕 가문에게 누명을 씌우려고 했다는 뜻입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to MS01_Tevina
#. PROMPT: I'm not even sure that's your voice, to be honest.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not even sure that's your voice, to be honest. &&& MS01_Tevina: See? Even your investigator agrees.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
