#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012D8"
msgid "I think a vocal analysis will prove this is you, which means you knew about the theft and murdered his ward to cover your tracks."
msgstr ""
"이 음성 분석을 통해, 당신이 절도에 대해 알고 있었고 무진의 피후견자를 살해해서 범행을 은폐하려 했다는 사실이 증명될 거라고 생각합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Ochim's Recording] I have additional info regarding the missing supplies.
