msgstr "제 생각에 사건은 종결되었습니다. 하지만 추가 증거가 있다면, 유죄 판결에 도움이 될 수도 있습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have questions about your brother, Ochim. &&& MS01_Madri: Oh, is he in trouble? Ever since his last letter I've been so worried.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What a terrible thing to say! I certainly hope not!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimMissing
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012D6"
msgid "He's probably dead. Not sure how dead though, or if carrion eaters got to him."
msgstr "아마 죽었을 겁니다. 하지만 얼마나 죽었는지, 아니면 썩은 고기를 먹는 동물들이 오라버니 분을 덮쳤는지는 잘 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. PROMPT: He's probably dead. Not sure how dead though, or if carrion eaters got to him.
