#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Madri: The last time I spoke to him, he said if anything ever happened to him, he'd leave something for me, in the usual spot.
