msgctxt "0012B3"
msgid "I had a feeling that's what happened. It's not like him to leave and not say goodbye."
msgstr "그런 일이 일어났을 거라고 짐작했습니다. 작별 인사도 없이 떠나다니 그답지 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. PROMPT: He passed. I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Madri
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Madri_Greeting_OchimDead
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012B2"
msgid "I need some time alone. I'm sorry."
msgstr "저 혼자만의 시간이 필요합니다. 죄송합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Letter to Madri] What do you make of this letter?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest_Letter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012B1"
msgid "Madri... I believe that's the name of the woman who idles around the Meat House from time to time."
msgstr "마드리... 가끔 훈제소 주변을 어슬렁거리는 여자의 이름이 그 이름이었던 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B80
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest_Letter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012B0"
msgid "If she's in any way connected to the case, it may be worth speaking with her."
msgstr "마드리가 어떻게든 이 사건과 관련이 있다면, 이야기해 볼 가치가 있을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Madri... I believe that's the name of the woman who idles around the Meat House from time to time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest_Letter
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012AF"
msgid "[Letter to Madri] What do you make of this letter?"
msgstr "[마드리에게 보낸 편지] 이 편지에 대해 어떻게 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Access Records] I found something that may relate to the case. Remote login records to Ukaru's computer. &&& MS01_Qisrani: Interesting. A remote access login. Ochim Sharon. The name is familiar, but I can't quite place where from.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. If you have an idea who this person might be, I'd follow up on that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B7D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PreQuest_SecretFoundEarly
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012AE"
msgid "I think I know who it is."
msgstr "누군지 알 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't recognize the name.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't recognize the name.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: I know there's been some recent additions to the Houses after the cataclysm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B79
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PreQuest_SecretFoundEarly
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012AB"
msgid "It's all right. Keep this in your back pocket for now. I'm sure it'll become clearer the more you investigate."
msgstr "괜찮습니다. 이건 일단 비밀로 해두세요. 조사하다 보면 더 명확해질 거라고 확신합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Oh-keem Shuh-rown / Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Access Records] I found something that may relate to the case. Remote login records to Ukaru's computer.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I think I know who it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B7E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PreQuest_SecretFoundEarly
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012AA"
msgid "Interesting. A remote access login. Ochim Sharon. The name is familiar, but I can't quite place where from."
msgstr "흥미롭군요. 원격 접속 로그인이라. 오킴 샤론. 익숙한 이름인데, 어디서 들었는지 정확히 기억나지 않는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Access Records] I found something that may relate to the case. Remote login records to Ukaru's computer. &&& MS01_Qisrani: Interesting. A remote access login. Ochim Sharon. The name is familiar, but I can't quite place where from.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's all right. Keep this in your back pocket for now. I'm sure it'll become clearer the more you investigate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038B7A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PreQuest_SecretFoundEarly
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0012A9"
msgid "I don't recognize the name."
msgstr "모르는 이름입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A8"
msgid "You stopped talking. Did the vortex get your brain too?"
msgstr "말을 멈추셨군요. 볼텍스가 당신 뇌까지 가져갔나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A7"
msgid "Looks like someone hit pause on your face."
msgstr "누군가 당신 얼굴을 일시 정지시킨 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A6"
msgid "I don't know where you were going with that but could you hurry? Fish and guests."
msgstr "무슨 말을 하려던 건지는 모르겠지만 서둘러 주시겠어요? 생선과 손님은, 무슨 말인지 알겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A5"
msgid "I don't have time for delays."
msgstr "지체할 시간이 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A4"
msgid "If you don't mind getting to the point..."
msgstr "요점만 말씀해 주겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "0012A3"
msgid "Please. Some of us have places to be."
msgstr "이봐. 우리 중 몇 명은 가봐야 할 곳이 있다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0012A2"
msgid "There's a lot of things missing around Dazra. Supplies, government buildings..."
msgstr "다즈라에는 사라진 것들이 많습니다. 물자, 정부 건물..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0012A1"
msgid "My cousins may disagree, but I prefer the barracks to the old house. It just feels... right."
msgstr "제 사촌들은 동의하지 않을 수도 있지만, 저는 옛 저택보다 병영이 더 좋습니다. 그게 그냥... 맞는 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "00129F"
msgid "Tevina's involvement is no surprise. She's always held a grudge against me."
msgstr "테비나가 연루됐다니 놀랍지도 않군. 테비나는 항상 나에게 원한을 품고 있었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "00129E"
msgid "Remember, chosen. None but the faithful are promised tomorrow."
msgstr "기억하십시오, 선택받은 자여. 신실한 자 외에는 누구에게도 내일이 약속되지 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "00129D"
msgid "Until next time, chosen."
msgstr "다음에 보시죠. 선택받은 자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "00129C"
msgid "Another time then."
msgstr "그럼 다음에 뵙겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001284"
msgid "As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him."
msgstr ""
"일은 이렇게 진행되었어. 난 장소에 도약하고 그곳에 다른 누군가가 기다리고 있었지. 내 일은 그 사람한테 화물을 건네주는 거였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001283"
msgid "Thing is, he's a real chatty bastard. Tells me the same story I just told you -- how he was given coordinates to land, and coordinates to jump to."
msgstr ""
"그런데, 그자는 엄청 수다를 떨며 방금 내가 자네한테 해 준 얘길 하더라고. 착륙 장소에다가, 어디로 도약해야 하는지 좌표를 받았다면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001282"
msgid "He tells me he thinks there's a whole crew of us, working like a relay team. But I keep my mouth shut, because it's none of my business."
msgstr ""
"그 사람은 우리가 릴레이 팀마냥 서로에게 전달하는 식으로 일한다고 생각했지. 어쨌든 나는 입을 다물었어. 내가 참견할 바가 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe he was killed for talking too much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001281"
msgid "Funny thing is, next time I do the job, the chatty guy's gone. And I'm doing HIS route instead of mine."
msgstr "웃긴 게, 다음에 또 그 일을 했더니 그 수다 떠는 사람이 사라졌다는 거야. 그 사람 경로는 내가 맡았고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would've taken the job too. &&& Smuggler: Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip. &&& Smuggler: As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him.|Thing is, he's a real chatty bastard. Tells me the same story I just told you -- how he was given coordinates to land, and coordinates to jump to.|He tells me he thinks there's a whole crew of us, working like a relay team. But I keep my mouth shut, because it's none of my business.|Funny thing is, next time I do the job, the chatty guy's gone. And I'm doing HIS route instead of mine.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001280"
msgid "Maybe he was killed for talking too much."
msgstr "너무 떠벌리고 다녀서 결국 죽은 걸지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe he was killed for talking too much.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he was killed for talking too much.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127F"
msgid "Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit."
msgstr "모른다고? 그럴 리 없지. 그 사람은 분명히 죽었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127E"
msgid "Most of them were bullshit of course, like no eating in the cockpit."
msgstr "물론 대부분은 개소리였어. 조종실에서는 취식 금지라든지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127D"
msgid "So me, being the consumer of fine snacks that I am, I wait until he goes below deck, and unwrap some Chunks."
msgstr "그래서 나야 워낙 고급 간식을 좋아하니까, 그 양반이 아래 갑판에 내려갈 때까지 기다린 다음 청크를 깠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127C"
msgid "I'm just about to take a bite when I feel this presence behind me, hovering. So I turn around to peek, and sure enough, he's right there."
msgstr "한 입 삼키려는 직전에 갑자기 등 뒤로 시선이 느껴졌고, 고개를 돌리니... 역시, 그 사람이 뒤에 있던 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127B"
msgid "There's this LONG pause. Like he's about to rage and about to go full vortex horror on me."
msgstr "오랫동안 침묵이 오갔지. 그 작자가 화를 벌컥 내며 볼텍스 호러처럼 소리를 지르진 않을까 생각이 들 정도로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Manuia lau malaga = Samoan for "Have a good trip or RIP" / Afraid
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00127A"
msgid "So I'm thinking I'm a dead man, doornail city, don't let the hammer hit you on the way out."
msgstr "그래서 꼼짝없이, 말할 것도 없이, 더할 나위 없이 난 죽었구나 속으로 생각하던 중이었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Love of Chunks is universal. You could even set up your own Chunks franchise on Va'ruun'kai.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010372A0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001279"
msgid "But then he asks me, \"Is that a Chunk? Where can I get one?\""
msgstr "나한테 묻더라고. '그거 청크인가? 어디서 먹을 수 있지?'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories? &&& Smuggler:  &&& Smuggler: Most of them were bullshit of course, like no eating in the cockpit.|So me, being the consumer of fine snacks that I am, I wait until he goes below deck, and unwrap some Chunks.|I'm just about to take a bite when I feel this presence behind me, hovering. So I turn around to peek, and sure enough, he's right there.|There's this LONG pause. Like he's about to rage and about to go full vortex horror on me.|So I'm thinking I'm a dead man, doornail city, don't let the hammer hit you on the way out. |But then he asks me, "Is that a Chunk? Where can I get one?" 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Already tried to pitch the idea. Even had a cute name for it -- "Snake Bites." Didn't get any takers.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103729F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001278"
