#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure. Even in the Settled Systems, I don't just smuggle valuables. I bring food, stories, batball scores.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103728B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001261"
msgid "You bring in stuff off the books?"
msgstr "몰래 물건들을 밀반입한다고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You bring in stuff off the books?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You bring in stuff off the books?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103728A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001260"
msgid "Sure. Even in the Settled Systems, I don't just smuggle valuables. I bring food, stories, batball scores."
msgstr "물론. 개척 성계 내에서도 나는 귀중품만 취급하지 않아. 음식, 이야기, 배트볼 경기 점수까지 가져오지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You bring in stuff off the books?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103728A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125F"
msgid "I've got a client who pays me a king's ransom just for a recording of last year's championship game."
msgstr "작년 챔피언십 게임의 녹화 영상을 가져다 주기만 해도 거금을 주는 고객까지 있을 정도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You bring in stuff off the books?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Sounds like it's very profitable for you. It'd be a shame if someone told the authorities what you were up to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103728A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125E"
msgid "Point is, I feel like I can be a missionary to Dazra -- teaching the bible of fast food and contact sports."
msgstr "내 요점은, 마치 내가 다즈라에 패스트푸드와 계약 스포츠란 무엇인지 알려 주는 대사가 된 것 같단 말이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Already tried to pitch the idea. Even had a cute name for it -- "Snake Bites." Didn't get any takers.|Some people just lack vision I guess.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037289
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125D"
msgid "But yeah, turns out the guy was an oddball, never tried Chunks before."
msgstr "아무튼, 그 사람은 참 이상한 사람이었던 것이네. 청크를 못 먹어 봤다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037289
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125C"
msgid "That got me thinking though, there's a lot of people like that on Va'ruun'kai."
msgstr "그러다 나에게 한 가지 생각이 떠오른 게, 바룬카이에는 그런 사람들이 많아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037289
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125B"
msgid "So I started a side hustle doing stuff off the books. Whatever your sin, I got you covered."
msgstr "그래서 몰래 물건들을 반입하는 부업을 시작한 거야. 원하는 게 뭐든, 내가 다 가져다 주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sounds like it's very profitable for you. It'd be a shame if someone told the authorities what you were up to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037289
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00125A"
msgid "Hell, give me enough time and I might become Dazra's unofficial ambassador."
msgstr "진짜, 시간만 충분하다면 나야말로 다즈라의 비공식 대사로 임명될지 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Is that a threat? Well, for what it's worth, I don't think anyone would believe you. |Hard to imagine someone with looney enough tunes to go to Va'ruun'kai on purpose.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037288
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001259"
msgid "Either way, none of it matters now. I don't smuggle full-time anymore, now that I work for you."
msgstr "어쨌든 이제 와서는 아무 의미 없지. 이제 자넬 위해 일하고 있으니 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037288
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001258"
msgid "I still got my side hustles, sure. But the less you know, the better."
msgstr "부업이야 아직 하고 있지만. 덜 알수록 훨씬 낫지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would've taken the job too. &&& Smuggler: Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip. &&& Smuggler: As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him.|Thing is, he's a real chatty bastard. Tells me the same story I just told you -- how he was given coordinates to land, and coordinates to jump to.|He tells me he thinks there's a whole crew of us, working like a relay team. But I keep my mouth shut, because it's none of my business.|Funny thing is, next time I do the job, the chatty guy's gone. And I'm doing HIS route instead of mine.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You got a prescription for those rose-tinted glasses? Because that's not how I saw it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037287
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001257"
msgid "I'm sure the guy just retired to be chatty with his loved ones."
msgstr "아마 가족들하고 즐겁게 잡담을 나눌 수 있도록 은퇴했나 보지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sure the guy just retired to be chatty with his loved ones.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sure the guy just retired to be chatty with his loved ones.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037286
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001256"
msgid "You got a prescription for those rose-tinted glasses? Because that's not how I saw it."
msgstr "세상을 긍정적으로 보게 해 주는 안경이라도 썼나? 내겐 전혀 그렇지 않던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would've taken the job too. &&& Smuggler: Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip. &&& Smuggler: As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him.|Thing is, he's a real chatty bastard. Tells me the same story I just told you -- how he was given coordinates to land, and coordinates to jump to.|He tells me he thinks there's a whole crew of us, working like a relay team. But I keep my mouth shut, because it's none of my business.|Funny thing is, next time I do the job, the chatty guy's gone. And I'm doing HIS route instead of mine.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, but it also raises the stakes. You rat someone out, and you aren't going to lock up. You're dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037285
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001255"
msgid "That's one way to get a promotion."
msgstr "승진하는 방법도 가지각색이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's one way to get a promotion.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's one way to get a promotion.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037284
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001254"
msgid "Yeah, but it also raises the stakes. You rat someone out, and you aren't going to lock up. You're dead."
msgstr "그래, 하지만 위험도 높아지는 법이지. 혹시라도 밀고하면 감옥에 가는 게 아니라, 그냥 죽는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about the Ministry of Commerce?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037283
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001253"
msgid "It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence."
msgstr "모두 둘케프 가문이 운영해. 공급망 관리부터 스파이 모집, 정보 수집까지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037283
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001252"
msgid "They call themselves the \"Ministry of Commerce.\" I thought it was just a fancy name for a smuggling racket, but being on the inside, I can tell it's a well oiled machine."
msgstr ""
"그자들은 스스로를 '상무성'이라고 부르지. 난 그저 밀수 조직에 웬 거창한 이름을 붙인 거라고 생각했지만, 내부를 들여다보니 일사불란한 "
"자들이란 것을 알 수 있었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You seem to be talking about their operations pretty freely. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037283
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001251"
msgid "Everything runs on time, every book is exact, to the decimal. And everybody involved knows to keep their mouth shut."
msgstr ""
"모든 게 제 시간에 진행되고, 모든 장부는 소수점 하나까지 정확해. 그리고 관련자들은 입을 꾹 다물어야 한다는 것도 잘 알고 있고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about the Ministry of Commerce? &&& Smuggler: It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence.|They call themselves the "Ministry of Commerce." I thought it was just a fancy name for a smuggling racket, but being on the inside, I can tell it's a well oiled machine.|Everything runs on time, every book is exact, to the decimal. And everybody involved knows to keep their mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I answer what I can, but I don't tell any secrets. I mean hell, I don't know any secrets and I'd like to keep it that way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037282
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001250"
msgid "You seem to be talking about their operations pretty freely."
msgstr "아무렇지도 않게 그곳의 업무 방식을 쉽게 알려 주는 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You seem to be talking about their operations pretty freely. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem to be talking about their operations pretty freely. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037281
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124F"
msgid "I answer what I can, but I don't tell any secrets. I mean hell, I don't know any secrets and I'd like to keep it that way."
msgstr "나야 답할 수 있는 건 대답해 주지만, 비밀은 말하지 않아. 아니, 난 비밀을 전혀 모르고, 쭉 그랬으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about the Ministry of Commerce? &&& Smuggler: It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence.|They call themselves the "Ministry of Commerce." I thought it was just a fancy name for a smuggling racket, but being on the inside, I can tell it's a well oiled machine.|Everything runs on time, every book is exact, to the decimal. And everybody involved knows to keep their mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's how House Dul'kehf does things, from top to bottom. The boss man Hasmak runs a tight ship.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01037280
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124E"
msgid "I respect an organization that keeps its books straight."
msgstr "나는 장부를 정확하게 유지하는 조직을 높게 평가하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I respect an organization that keeps its books straight.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect an organization that keeps its books straight.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103727F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124D"
msgid "That's how House Dul'kehf does things, from top to bottom. The boss man Hasmak runs a tight ship."
msgstr "말단부터 최고위급까지, 그게 둘케프 가문의 업무 방식이야. 해즈막 장관은 조직을 엄격히 운영하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about the Ministry of Commerce? &&& Smuggler: It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence.|They call themselves the "Ministry of Commerce." I thought it was just a fancy name for a smuggling racket, but being on the inside, I can tell it's a well oiled machine.|Everything runs on time, every book is exact, to the decimal. And everybody involved knows to keep their mouth shut.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Gotta be, although I haven't met any myself. And I know better than to ask.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103727E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124C"
msgid "Do you think there's more smugglers like you?"
msgstr "혹시 당신과 같은 밀수꾼이 더 있지 않을까 생각되지 않아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you think there's more smugglers like you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you think there's more smugglers like you?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You seem to be talking about their operations pretty freely. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 0103727D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124B"
msgid "Gotta be, although I haven't met any myself. And I know better than to ask."
msgstr "분명 그렇겠지. 다만 스스로 만나 본 적은 없어. 함부로 질문하면 안 된다는 것도 잘 알고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00124A"
msgid "One time I had to do a job that was part smuggler, part taxi."
msgstr "예전에는 택시랑 밀수를 겸해서 같이 하는 일을 했었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001249"
msgid "And this guy I was delivering was a mean son of a bitch. Had a bunch of rules too."
msgstr "그리고 내가 바래다 주던 한 녀석은 아주 못된 놈이었지. 규칙도 많았고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001248"
msgid "Next time I'm in port, I chat them up, talk about the movie, and even offer them some memorabilia."
msgstr "다음에 다시 우주항에 도착했을 때 같이 얘길 나누다 영화에 관해 말했고, 기념품까지 주겠다고 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A60
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "001247"
msgid "Stay sharp. You kill one, there's probably two more hiding in the bushes."
msgstr "주의를 기울여. 한 놈 죽여도 두 놈이 숨을 죽이고 기다릴지 모르니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived. &&& Razma: Impossible.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: What's going on here? And who is this? These are private negotiations, or have you forgotten? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374AA
