#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001225"
msgid "These are exactly the actions I warned you about, Razma."
msgstr "제가 경고했던 상황 그대로군요. 라즈마 형님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them.
