#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001224"
msgid "House Ka'dic is in your debt, for better or worse."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 그대에게 빚졌군. 좋든 싫든 간에 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: House Ka'dic is in your debt, for better or worse.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see that quite plainly now.
