#. TOPIC: 010374A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001223"
msgid "The Zealots aren't trustworthy allies. It's for the best."
msgstr "광신도는 믿을 만한 동맹이 아니죠. 그게 최선이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: House Ka'dic is in your debt, for better or worse.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True. The Zealots have long been the strongest point of contention within the House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001222"
msgid "Your House will be more united now that you know the truth."
msgstr "이제 진실을 알게 되셨으니, 장로님의 가문은 더욱 단결할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Well spoken, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason.
