#. TOPIC: 010374A4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001221"
msgid "I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one."
msgstr "네 말을 들어야 했어, 지말. 현명한 건 항상 네 쪽이었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them. &&& Razma: Well spoken, Harbinger. &&& Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one.
