#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001220"
msgid "You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason."
msgstr "절 너무 과대평가하시네요. 형님께서 가문의 장로이신 데는 다 이유가 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one. &&& Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121F"
msgid "Yes, and our House has suffered many losses. From one catastrophe to the next."
msgstr "우리 가문이 너무 큰 손실을 입었어. 재난 뒤에 또 다른 재난이 닥치다니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them. &&& ...  &&& Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one. &&& Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason. &&& Razma: Yes, and our House has suffered many losses. From one catastrophe to the next.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Now that Djimal and I are aligned, it's a chance we'll take full advantage of. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010374A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121E"
msgid "Now's your chance to rebuild House Ka'dic even stronger."
msgstr "바로 지금이 카딕 가문을 더 강하게 재건할 기회에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House. &&& Razma: And that is one outcome we can be grateful for.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103749D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121D"
msgid "The Harbinger is right."
msgstr "선구자 말이 맞아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them. &&& ...  &&& Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one. &&& Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason. &&& Razma: Yes, and our House has suffered many losses. From one catastrophe to the next.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And that is one outcome we can be grateful for.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103749C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121C"
msgid "Perhaps this was the Great Serpent's way of uniting your House."
msgstr "이게 바로 위대한 뱀께서 장로님의 가문을 통합시키는 방법일지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Serpent embraces your lost family now. Be happy for them. &&& ...  &&& Razma: I should've listened to you, Djimal. You always were the wiser one. &&& Djimal: You give me too much credit, sister. You are the House Elder for a reason. &&& Razma: Yes, and our House has suffered many losses. From one catastrophe to the next.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, and it will only be easier to guide them with Djimal and me united.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103749F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121B"
msgid "Your people will be looking to you to guide them through this."
msgstr "가문 사람들이 이번 일을 극복할 때 장로님의 인도를 바라겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00121A"
msgid "Ah, just the person I wanted to see."
msgstr "아, 보고 싶었던 사람이 왔군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation.
