#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001219"
msgid "Please tell me you bring good news."
msgstr "제발 좋은 소식을 말해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable. &&& Razma: Last chance to walk away, Mihael.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No... It can't be.
