#. TOPIC: 01037499
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001218"
msgid "[Lie] The Zealots betrayed you. The hostages are dead."
msgstr "[거짓말] 광신도가 장로님을 배신했습니다. 인질들이 죽었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable. &&& Razma: Last chance to walk away, Mihael.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Impossible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037497
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001217"
msgid "[Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived."
msgstr "[거짓말] 제가 도착했을 땐 사히마와 다른 인질들이 죽어 있더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: And that is one outcome we can be grateful for. &&& Djimal: The Harbinger is right. &&& Djimal: We will see this through and be stronger for it, but we need to turn our attention toward the Mourning Device.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, I have Sahima's algorithm.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037495
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001216"
msgid "Yes, and I assume you were able to recover Sahima's research?"
msgstr "그래. 사히마의 연구 자료는 찾아올 수 있었겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived. &&& Razma: Impossible. &&& Djimal: These are exactly the actions I warned you about, Razma.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: These are hardly negotiations when you have nothing to barter with, Mihael.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037494
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001214"
msgid "What's going on here? And who is this? These are private negotiations, or have you forgotten?"
msgstr "이게 무슨 일이야? 이놈은 또 누구고? 이게 사적인 협상이 아니라는 걸 잊어버린 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Impossible. &&& Djimal: These are exactly the actions I warned you about, Razma. &&& Mihael: What's going on here? And who is this? These are private negotiations, or have you forgotten? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037493
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001213"
msgid "These are hardly negotiations when you have nothing to barter with, Mihael."
msgstr "교환할 게 아무것도 없을 때는 협상이라고 부르지 않아, 미해일."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: And this is Anasko's chosen Harbinger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037493
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001212"
msgid "Did you think I wouldn't find out?"
msgstr "내가 모를 줄 알았던 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: These are hardly negotiations when you have nothing to barter with, Mihael.|Did you think I wouldn't find out? 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: They infiltrated your base and have just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037492
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001211"
msgid "And this is Anasko's chosen Harbinger."
msgstr "그리고 이 사람은 아나스코 님께 선택받은 선구자다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: And this is Anasko's chosen Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Lies. Would I be here otherwise? 
