#. TOPIC: 01037491
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001210"
msgid "They infiltrated your base and have just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive."
msgstr "네 기지에 잠입해 보니 내 조카 아이들이 살아있지도 않았다는 사실을 알려 준 참이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: And this is Anasko's chosen Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Lies. Would I be here otherwise? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037491
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120F"
msgid "She infiltrated your base and has just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive."
msgstr "네 기지에 잠입해 보니 내 조카 아이들이 살아있지도 않았다는 사실을 알려 준 참이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: And this is Anasko's chosen Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Lies. Would I be here otherwise? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037491
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120E"
msgid "He infiltrated your base and has just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive."
msgstr "네 기지에 잠입해 보니 내 조카 아이들이 살아있지도 않았다는 사실을 알려 준 참이지."

