#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Of course you would. You've been waiting for this moment, to hold power over one Dazra's noble Houses.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037490
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120D"
msgid "Lies. Would I be here otherwise?"
msgstr "거짓말이야. 내가 여기 왜 나왔겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived. &&& ...  &&& Razma: They infiltrated your base and have just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive. &&& Mihael: Lies. Would I be here otherwise?  &&& Djimal: Of course you would. You've been waiting for this moment, to hold power over one Dazra's noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I trust my brethren more than I trust any outsider, Promised or not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103748F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120C"
msgid "Perhaps those you left running Epsilon didn't agree with your leadership."
msgstr "네가 엡실론에 두고 온 사람들이 네 지휘 능력을 의심했을 지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Lie] Sahima and the others were dead when I arrived. &&& ...  &&& Razma: They infiltrated your base and have just informed me that my nieces and nephews aren't even alive. &&& Mihael: Lies. Would I be here otherwise?  &&& Djimal: Of course you would. You've been waiting for this moment, to hold power over one Dazra's noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But even more satisfying knowing I have the upper hand. Why would I jeopardize that? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103748D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120B"
msgid "You just want to watch House Ka'dic squirm thinking you finally have the upper hand."
msgstr "넌 그냥 우위를 점했다는 생각에 카딕 가문이 창피당하는 걸 보고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps those you left running Epsilon didn't agree with your leadership. &&& Mihael: I trust my brethren more than I trust any outsider, Promised or not.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: These negotiations are done, Mihael. House Ka'dic is through dealing with you and your kind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103748B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00120A"
msgid "And do you think we'll believe your word over Anasko's chosen?"
msgstr "우리가 아나스코 님의 선택받은 자가 아니라 네 말을 믿을 줄 알았나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps those you left running Epsilon didn't agree with your leadership. &&& Mihael: I trust my brethren more than I trust any outsider, Promised or not. &&& Djimal: And do you think we'll believe your word over Anasko's chosen?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: You'll regret this betrayal. All of you. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103748A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsBadScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001209"
msgid "These negotiations are done, Mihael. House Ka'dic is through dealing with you and your kind."
msgstr "협상은 끝이다, 미해일. 카딕 가문은 더 이상 너와 네 족속들을 상대하지 않을 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Razma, Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: I trust my brethren more than I trust any outsider, Promised or not. &&& Djimal: And do you think we'll believe your word over Anasko's chosen? &&& Razma: These negotiations are done, Mihael. House Ka'dic is through dealing with you and your kind.
