#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001208"
msgid "You'll regret this betrayal. All of you."
msgstr "이 배신을 후회할 거다. 너희 전부 다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: You'll regret this betrayal. All of you. 
