#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The current plan is to hold them at one of the geothermal power stations. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037472
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011ED"
msgid "I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you."
msgstr "그대와 만나봤으니 그 녀석도 좀 유해졌을지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Zealots don't negotiate. They kill on sight.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Zealots don't negotiate. They kill on sight.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033774
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011EC"
msgid "Perhaps the Zealots you know, but they were once a part of Va'ruun society."
msgstr "그대가 아는 광신도라면 그럴지 몰라도, 그자들은 한때 바룬 사회의 일원이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not just tell the High Council?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why not just tell the High Council?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033770
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011EB"
msgid "Because right now this situation is a matter for the Ministry of Conjunction."
msgstr "지금 이 상황은 결합성이 처리해야 할 문제니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011EA"
msgid "As much as I'd welcome the expertise, the Zealots would never allow an outsider to participate."
msgstr "전문가가 나서준다면 나야 환영이지만, 광신도들은 이방인이 끼어드는 걸 절대 용납 못 할 걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Negotiations are my speciality.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: The Zealots have yet to name specifics. At best, they'll demand an inordinate amount of credits or firearms.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033772
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E9"
msgid "But the negotiations aren't where I need assistance."
msgstr "어쨌든 도움이 필요한 부분은 협상 쪽이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing complicated for me. I can make them talk.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nothing complicated for me. I can make them talk.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E8"
msgid "Then you can put those skills to good use."
msgstr "그럼 그 기술을 잘 활용할 수 있겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The hostages are being held at Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The hostages are being held at Shadow Station Epsilon.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033741
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E6"
msgid "Ah yes, the old Va'ruun military outpost. It's a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "아, 그래. 그 낡은 바룬 군사 기지 말이군. 뱀의 성전이 남긴 자취이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll head there right away.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll head there right away.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will do whatever is necessary to bring Sahima and the others back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103373C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E3"
msgid "The sooner the better."
msgstr "빠를수록 좋지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Those Zealots are about to lose their leverage.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Those Zealots are about to lose their leverage.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We will do whatever is necessary to bring Sahima and the others back safely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103373A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E2"
msgid "If anything happens to the hostages, they will lose a lot more than leverage."
msgstr "인질들에게 무슨 일이라도 생기면, 협상 수단보다 훨씬 더 큰 것을 잃게 되는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Council sent me to get your cooperation.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Council sent me to get your cooperation.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E1"
msgid "I understand, and I can't argue the importance."
msgstr "나도 이해해. 그 중요성을 반박할 순 없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All I need is Sahima. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All I need is Sahima. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01030C2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011E0"
msgid "If only it were that simple."
msgstr "그리 간단했으면 얼마나 좋았을까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Ukaru
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0011D7"
msgid "Be careful. There are likely powerful members involved in this theft."
msgstr "조심하십시오. 이 절도 사건에 연루된 유력자들이 있을 가능성이 높습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Ukaru
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0011D6"
msgid "Thank you again. For now, I will do my best to disappear, and stay out of your way."
msgstr "다시 한번 감사드립니다. 저는 이제 최대한 자취를 감추고, 방해되지 않도록 하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Patron
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D5"
msgid "Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat."
msgstr "이봐, 이 그로트는 그로트 맛이 안 나는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Patron
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035E55
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D4"
msgid "Why is it we have to pay for our food? It should be free."
msgstr "왜 우리가 음식을 돈 내고 먹어야 하는 거지? 공짜여야 하잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bartender: Do you think we'll ever return home? &&& BartenderBrother: To Dazra? Never. It is void food.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Well I feel it's a terrible idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D3"
msgid "But if it exists somewhere, it can be brought back, no?"
msgstr "하지만 어딘가에 존재한다면, 다시 가져올 수 있는 거 아니야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D2"
msgid "Do you think we'll ever return home?"
msgstr "우리가 언젠가 고향으로 돌아갈 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat. &&& Bartender: Do you think we'll ever return home?
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Patron: Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D1"
msgid "To Dazra? Never. It is void food."
msgstr "다즈라로? 절대. 거긴 공허 음식이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat. &&& Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu.
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Patron: Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011D0"
msgid "Yeah? What does it taste like then?"
msgstr "그래? 그럼 이건 무슨 맛인데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Why is it we have to pay for our food? It should be free. &&& Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu.
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Patron: Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011CF"
msgid "Everything costs. You either pay creds here, or out of your paycheck. You pay up front, don't feel robbed. Better this way."
msgstr "모든 것에는 대가가 따르지. 여기서 크레딧으로 지불하든, 월급에서 나가든 말이야. 선불로 지불하면, 뺏기는 기분은 안 들잖아. 이게 더 나은 방법이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: BartenderBrother: To Dazra? Never. It is void food. &&& Bartender: But if it exists somewhere, it can be brought back, no?
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011CE"
msgid "And what good does it do us? If the Great Serpent wills it, it will return to this world. Until then, we wait."
msgstr "그래서 우리에게 무슨 소용이 있지? 위대한 뱀께서 원하신다면, 이 세상으로 돌아올 거야. 그때까지, 우린 기다리는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: BartenderBrother: Yeah? What does it taste like then? &&& Bartender: I meant the names. The food is the same, but it feels new! 
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011CD"
msgid "Yeah? Well, if you knew what was in it, you wouldn't want to taste it, so quit complaining and pay your bill."
msgstr "그래? 그 안에 뭐가 들었는지 알면, 맛보고 싶지 않을 테니까 불평 그만하고 계산이나 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat. &&& Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu. &&& BartenderBrother: Yeah? What does it taste like then?
#. ALIAS: Patron
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Well I feel it's a terrible idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035E54
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011CC"
msgid "Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick."
msgstr "아무것도. 맛도, 식감도 없어. 벽돌을 먹는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011CB"
msgid "The Zealots were growing their own food it seems with artificial light and hydroponics."
msgstr "광신도들은 인공조명과 수경 재배로 식량을 재배하고 있었던 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011CA"
msgid "The science team will need to check if this food is safe for consumption before sending it back to Dazra. I'm hungry enough to take a bite though."
msgstr "다즈라로 보내기 전에 이 음식이 안전한지 과학팀이 확인해야 할 거야. 난 배고파서 한 입 먹어볼 의향은 있지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C9"
msgid "I'm no botanist, but it looks like the garden here is in working order."
msgstr "난 식물학자는 아니지만, 여기 정원은 작동하는 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C8"
msgid "The service here is worse than the barracks."
msgstr "여긴 병영보다 서비스가 더 엉망이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C7"
msgid "I'm starving. But I can't decide what to order."
msgstr "배고파 죽겠어. 근데 뭘 주문해야 할지 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRestLocationSpecificHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C6"
msgid "There's enough rations here to feed a whole settlement."
msgstr "여긴 정착지 전체를 먹여 살릴 수 있을 만큼의 배급 식량이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C5"
msgid "You need healing, talk to the Herald."
msgstr "치료가 필요하면, 전령에게 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C4"
msgid "It's going to take ages to do a full inventory check of this place."
msgstr "이곳의 전체 재고를 조사하는 데는 엄청난 시간이 걸릴 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0011C3"
msgid "We found some rations and other foods that don't look too rotten."
msgstr "너무 썩지 않은 배급 식량과 다른 음식들을 좀 발견했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Of course. I'm fascinated to learn how you reconcile your religion and science.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0011A0"
msgid "House Ka'dic is in your debt."
msgstr "카딕 가문이 그대에게 빚졌군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course. I'm fascinated to learn how you reconcile your religion and science. &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then, as I'm equally curious to know why heretics insist on separating the two. &&& Razma: We'll talk later, Sahima.  &&& Razma: As I was saying, House Ka'dic is in your debt.|You've helped me maintain a very precarious balance.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00119F"
msgid "This business with the Zealots needs to end."
msgstr "광신도와 맺은 관계는 이제 끝내셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [MedPack] I've got one here. &&& Ukaru: The Shrouding bless you! &&& Ukaru: Hrmm... I am already starting to feel the effects! A thousand and one thank yous, just for you, starting with this one! |Thank you very, very much!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very much so! But decorum aside, we should brass the tacks, no?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030CA9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00119E"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "천만에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] For a price.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00119C"
msgid "I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret."
msgstr "이번 일은 비밀로 해 주면 고맙겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This business with the Zealots needs to end. &&& Razma: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on. &&& Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If you're referring to the members of House Ka'dic...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00119B"
msgid "I'm not the one you should be worried about."
msgstr "걱정할 사람은 제가 아닐 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This business with the Zealots needs to end. &&& Razma: And one day it will, but until then, they're a necessary evil. One that we'll be keeping a much closer eye on. &&& Razma: I'd appreciate it if you kept this a secret.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A fair price to pay for silence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00119A"
msgid "[Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] For a price."
msgstr "[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment> 크레딧 요구] 대가를 주신다면요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001198"
msgid "Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken."
msgstr "지말은 우리가 광신도를 보는 관점을 전혀 신경 쓰지 않았고, 붙잡힌 사람들을 사랑하지도 않았으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would think you'd both want to be on the same page.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001197"
msgid "But this is what makes her an excellent Mediary."
msgstr "하지만 바로 그래서 지말이 훌륭한 중개자인 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: A fair enough price to pay for silence.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001196"
msgid "The others involved know better than to speak of this."
msgstr "관련자들은 이번 일을 꺼내지 않는 게 좋다는 걸 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen... &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad. &&& Tevina: What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years. &&& Qisrani: For now, let me see what I can find out regarding the missing supplies.|It's possible they were lost in the tragedy along with everything else. But I don't know for sure.|Once that is sorted, we can revisit this debate.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C42
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001195"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price. &&& Razma: A fair enough price to pay for silence. &&& Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001194"
msgid "Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages."
msgstr "동생분은 제가 인질을 구출하지 않기를 바라더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Demand Credits: <Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_RazmaPayment>] In that case, I'll keep your secret for a price. &&& Razma: A fair enough price to pay for silence. &&& Razma: The others involved know better than to speak of this.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As House Elder, I know my family well enough. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E23
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001193"
msgid "I wouldn't be so sure."
msgstr "저는 확신이 안 서는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages. &&& Razma: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised. &&& Razma: Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken.|But this is what makes her an excellent Mediary.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know so, and wouldn't expect an outsider, Promised or not, to understand.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001192"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr "그렇게 말씀하신다면야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your sister prefers I didn't even rescue the hostages. &&& Razma: As much as it disappoints me, I can't say I'm surprised. &&& Razma: Djimal's never cared for our view with the Zealots, and she has no love for those taken.|But this is what makes her an excellent Mediary.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You and the rest of our House. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001191"
msgid "I would think you'd both want to be on the same page."
msgstr "두 분도 서로 힘을 합치고 싶어할 것 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: You and the rest of our House. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035E1D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3300_Razma_FinalGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001190"
msgid "Now, I have much to do, and so do you. Ekris and the High Council will be expecting you."
msgstr "자, 할 일이 태산이고, 그대도 마찬가지겠지. 에크리스와 대의회가 그대를 기다리고 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation. &&& ...  &&& Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. |You'd jeopardize our connections? &&& Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order.  &&& Mihael: The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now. |You know every one of us is prepared to answer the Serpent's Call.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118F"
msgid "Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today."
msgstr "이 제안이 위대한 뱀이 세운 계획일지도 몰라. 오늘 죽어야 할 사람은 없을지도 모른다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] Do it, Sahima. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Do it, Sahima. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118E"
msgid "Prepare to be made dust."
msgstr "흙먼지로 만들어주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] That's what I'm hoping for. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] That's what I'm hoping for. 
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No one here wants violence. You walk away, you get the device.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358AA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118D"
msgid "Give the Serpent my regards."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께 안부나 전해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] I've never been more sure.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I've never been more sure.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's what you get. Your unsuspecting allies at Shadow Station Epsilon may appreciate it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118C"
msgid "I'm going to enjoy this."
msgstr "이거 재밌겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm giving you one more chance to reconsider.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm giving you one more chance to reconsider.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118B"
msgid "What's there to reconsider?"
msgstr "다시 생각할 게 뭐가 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's what you get. Your unsuspecting allies at Shadow Station Epsilon may appreciate it. &&& Mihael: Unsuspecting or not, we're all willing to sacrifice.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's get this over with.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00118A"
msgid "[Attack] Fine. But this is on you."
msgstr "[공격] 좋아. 네가 자초한 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A61
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NormalToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "001189"
msgid "Let's get this over with."
msgstr "빨리 끝내자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No way I'm doing your dirty work. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: And, Harbinger, this conversation stays between us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001188"
msgid "Well, should you change your mind, the offer still stands."
msgstr "뭐, 혹시 마음이 바뀐다면, 내 제안은 유효하다고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001187"
msgid "So I was thinking we could update the menu."
msgstr "그래서 말인데, 메뉴를 업데이트할 수 있을 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001186"
msgid "What was order number five again?"
msgstr "5번 주문이 뭐였더라?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat. &&& Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu.
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Patron: Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001185"
msgid "You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices?"
msgstr "새로운 요리를 추가하고 싶다고? 무슨 재료로? 무슨 향신료로?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Patron: Hey, this groat doesn't taste like groat. &&& Bartender: What was order number five again?
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Patron: Nothing. No flavor, no texture. It's like eating a brick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001184"
msgid "Groat."
msgstr "그로트."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bartender: So I was thinking we could update the menu. &&& BartenderBrother: You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices?
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Well I feel it's a terrible idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001183"
msgid "I meant the names. The food is the same, but it feels new!"
msgstr "내 말은 이름 말이야. 음식은 똑같지만, 새로운 느낌이잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to BartenderBrother
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bartender: What was order number five again? &&& BartenderBrother: Groat.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Well I feel it's a terrible idea.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001182"
msgid "Groat soup? Groat haunch? Groat vindaloo?"
msgstr "그로트 수프? 그로트 뒷다리? 그로트 빈달루?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: BartenderBrother: You want to add new dishes? With what ingredients? What spices? &&& Bartender: I meant the names. The food is the same, but it feels new! 
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001181"
msgid "Well I feel it's a terrible idea."
msgstr "글쎄, 난 끔찍한 생각이라고 느끼는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: BartenderBrother: Groat. &&& Bartender: Groat soup? Groat haunch? Groat vindaloo?
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035DDC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_SceneBartender
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001180"
msgid "Does it matter? Cook the groat and just put it on a plate."
msgstr "그게 중요해? 그로트를 요리해서 그냥 접시에 담아."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: WeaponsVendor: Oh yeah. "Me" is my favorite subject.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B15
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117F"
msgid "Can you tell me about yourself?"
msgstr "당신에 대해 말해 주시겠어요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: WeaponsVendor: Not long. Truth is, I'm a tourist. I'm just passing through.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B14
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_Tourist
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117E"
msgid "How long have you been dealing weapons?"
msgstr "얼마나 오랫동안 무기를 거래하셨죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long have you been dealing weapons?
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_Tourist
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117D"
msgid "Not long. Truth is, I'm a tourist. I'm just passing through."
msgstr "얼마 안 됐어. 사실, 난 여행객이야. 그냥 지나가는 중이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_Tourist
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117C"
msgid "I got plans upon plans. Today, I'm selling you a kraken. Tomorrow, I'm designing the newest model."
msgstr "난 계획이 차고 넘쳐. 오늘은 너한테 크라켄을 팔고 있지만, 내일은 최신 모델을 설계하고 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_Tourist
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117B"
msgid "I'm talking laser sights, muzzle brake, and suppressor on it standard. Eighty percent accuracy and double the fire rate."
msgstr "레이저 조준기, 총구 제동기, 소음기가 기본으로 장착된 걸 말하는 거야. 80%의 명중률에 두 배의 연사 속도지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B13
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_Tourist
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00117A"
msgid "I'm gonna make a weapon so hard and so on point, you can draw a smiley face on a groat head from two hundred meters away. Guaranteed."
msgstr "난 200미터 밖에서도 그로트 머리에 스마일 페이스를 그릴 수 있을 정도로 강력하고 정확한 무기를 만들 거야. 장담하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me about yourself?
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001179"
msgid "Oh yeah. \"Me\" is my favorite subject."
msgstr "오 그래. '나'는 내가 가장 좋아하는 주제지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: WeaponsVendor: So if you miss me, stop by the gym. If I'm not here, I'm there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B12
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001178"
msgid "I know I may look like a man of mystery, but I'm mostly just a homebody."
msgstr "내가 수수께끼의 남자처럼 보일 수도 있지만, 난 대체로 그냥 집돌이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Trade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001177"
msgid "Show me what you got."
msgstr "가진 거 보여주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: WeaponsVendor: Oh yeah. "Me" is my favorite subject.|I know I may look like a man of mystery, but I'm mostly just a homebody.
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001176"
msgid "So if you miss me, stop by the gym. If I'm not here, I'm there."
msgstr "그러니까 내가 그립다면, 헬스장에 들러봐. 내가 여기 없다면, 거기 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: WeaponsVendor: Oh yeah. "Me" is my favorite subject.|I know I may look like a man of mystery, but I'm mostly just a homebody.
#. ALIAS: WeaponsVendor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale04
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035B10
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL04_WeaponsVendor_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001175"
msgid "If you want to join me for a set, feel free. Otherwise, catch me at my shop. If I'm not here, I'm there."
msgstr "나랑 같이 운동하고 싶으면, 언제든 환영이야. 아니면, 내 가게에서 만나자고. 내가 여기 없다면, 거기 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001174"
msgid "We've been assigned to clean up this place and pass back any intel."
msgstr "우리는 이 장소를 청소하고 정보를 전달하라는 임무를 받았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001173"
msgid "I missed the action. Maybe a few stragglers would show up later, but nope."
msgstr "액션을 놓쳤네. 나중에 몇 놈이 나타날지도 모르겠지만, 아니었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001172"
msgid "Good work liberating this location."
msgstr "이 지역을 해방하느라 수고했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001171"
msgid "All Must Serve. Even here."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다. 이곳에서도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001170"
msgid "Food here isn't the worst I've ever had. Better than the Meat House on some days."
msgstr "여기 음식이 내가 먹어본 것 중 최악은 아니야. 어떤 날은 훈제소보다 낫지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00116F"
msgid "My brother says my catch phrase is \"I don't like it,\" because I can get grumpy. Well, I don't like it."
msgstr "내 동생이 내 유행어가 '마음에 안 들어'래. 내가 짜증을 잘 내서. 음, 마음에 안 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00116E"
msgid "The longer we stay here, the more we're stuck here."
msgstr "여기 오래 머무를수록, 우린 여기에 갇히는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00116D"
msgid "If you find bones in your food, try chewing harder."
msgstr "음식에서 뼈를 발견하면, 더 열심히 씹어 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00116C"
msgid "I heard the accursed eat synthetic meat. No wonder they are all damned."
msgstr "저주받은 자들은 합성 고기를 먹는다고 들었어. 그러니 다들 저주받지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderBrotherHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00116B"
msgid "I don't even know what day it is anymore. No sun, no light, no nothing."
msgstr "이젠 무슨 요일인지도 모르겠어. 태양도, 빛도, 아무것도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There's more than one way to feel "born anew." Trust me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00115B"
msgid "And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?"
msgstr ""
"마침내 바룬 가문의 약속받은 자가 되어 일어섰구나. 위대한 뱀께서 그대 안을 걸으시는 게 느껴지는가? 새로 태어난 느낌이 드는가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I feel the same as I did before.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I feel the same as I did before.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00115A"
msgid "And yet you did all that was asked of you. Do not worry. In time, you will feel the changes He has worked within you."
msgstr "그런데도 그대는 요구받은 일을 전부 해냈지. 걱정 말거라. 시간이 지나면 뱀께서 그대의 내면에 임하셨음을 느끼게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I feel the same as I did before.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I feel the same as I did before.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001159"
msgid "Do not be troubled. You attempted at least some of what was asked of you. In time, you will feel His presence."
msgstr "걱정 말거라. 그대는 요구받은 것들 중 적어도 몇 가지는 시도해 보았으니. 시간이 지나면 그대도 주의 존재를 느낄 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I feel the same as I did before.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I feel the same as I did before.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A49
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001158"
msgid "You brush aside the chances given to you, and are surprised at the results? Do not worry. Eventually you will feel Him as we all do."
msgstr "주어진 기회를 무시해 놓고는 그 결과에 놀란 것이냐? 걱정 말거라. 결국 그대도 우리 모두처럼 주를 느끼게 될 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And yet you did all that was asked of you. Do not worry. In time, you will feel the changes He has worked within you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001156"
msgid "I feel the same as I did before."
msgstr "이전과 달라진 기분이 안 드는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: And so you arise, one of the Promised of House Va'ruun. Did you feel the Great Serpent working within you? Do you feel born anew?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I assure you, He has seen your eagerness. You will indeed serve, as do we all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001155"
msgid "I exist only to serve the Great Serpent."
msgstr "저는 오직 위대한 뱀을 섬기기 위해 존재합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001154"
msgid "And I assure you, He has seen your eagerness. You will indeed serve, as do we all."
msgstr "내 장담컨대 뱀께서도 그대의 헌신을 보셨다. 그대는 우리 모두처럼 진정으로 섬길 것이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001153"
msgid "And yet there were opportunities presented to you that you did not take. A good reminder for us all: there is always more we can do to serve."
msgstr ""
"그렇지만 그대가 잡지 못한 기회도 있었지. 우리 모두에게 좋은 교훈을 주는구나. 봉사를 위해 할 수 있는 일은 항상 더 있다는 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I exist only to serve the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A4B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001152"
msgid "Already you have much to learn. Every choice you make, including the choice not to act, will reflect on your service to the Great Serpent. You can, and must, do better."
msgstr ""
"벌써부터 배울 것이 많구나. 그대가 하는 모든 행동은, 심지어 행동하지 않는다 하더라도, 위대한 뱀께 드리는 봉사에 반영될 것이다. "
"그대는 할 수 있으며, 반드시 더 뛰어나야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A46
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001151"
msgid "I grant you the title of Harbinger."
msgstr "그대에게 선구자의 칭호를 하사하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: You stand before what remains of the High Council, advisors to Anasko Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A42
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001150"
msgid "Welcome, Harbinger."
msgstr "어서 오시지요. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: All will know you. All will trust you.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: All Must Serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A43
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114F"
msgid "Now... Above us, in the grand ship Mourning, jewel of the Va'ruun fleet, the High Council awaits your arrival. Serve them. Serve the Great Serpent."
msgstr ""
"이제... 우리 위에 있는 대우주선, 바룬 함대의 보석인 모어닝 호에서 대의회가 그대를 기다리고 있다. 대의회를 섬겨라. 위대한 뱀을 "
"섬겨라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We are, all of us, hopeful that your arrival in Dazra, and your clear connection to Anasko Va'ruun, for the first time in weeks represents some semblance of hope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114E"
msgid "I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal."
msgstr "저는 둘케프 가문 대표입니다. 지말은 카딕 가문 대표이고, 베타알 가문의 로벡도 함께하고 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Your Devotion and Strength will bring glory to the Great Serpent, and to House Va'ruun.|I grant you the title of Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Now... Above us, in the grand ship Mourning, jewel of the Va'ruun fleet, the High Council awaits your arrival. Serve them. Serve the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A45
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage750_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114D"
msgid "All will know you. All will trust you."
msgstr "모두가 그대를 알고, 모두가 그대를 믿으리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's with all the Houses? Aren't you all House Va'ruun?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's with all the Houses? Aren't you all House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114C"
msgid "Collectively, we unite under the banner of House Va'ruun, pledged to follow Jinan Va'ruun and his descendents."
msgstr "저희 집단은 바룬 가문의 깃발 아래 하나로 뭉쳐 지난 바룬 님과 그분의 후손들을 따르기로 맹세했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's with all the Houses? Aren't you all House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114B"
msgid "But our society is not a monolith. Jinan, in his wisdom, shepherded the first of us into families, that we might grow and prosper."
msgstr "하지만 저희 사회는 단일체가 아니지요. 지난 님께서는 지혜롭게도 저희가 가문을 이루도록 인도하시어 성장하고 번영하게 하셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's with all the Houses? Aren't you all House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A38
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00114A"
msgid "Our three families have for generations now helped to govern the people of House Va'ruun, and offer counsel to our leader."
msgstr "저희 세 가문은 대대로 바룬 가문 신민들을 통치하는 것을 돕고 지도자님께 조언을 제공해 왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Welcome, Harbinger.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A41
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001149"
msgid "You stand before what remains of the High Council, advisors to Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "그대는 아나스코 바룬 님의 조언자인 대의회의 잔재 앞에 서 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You stand before what remains of the High Council, advisors to Anasko Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A40
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001148"
msgid "We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people."
msgstr "저희 신민들에게 닥친 재난 이후로 남은 건 저희가 전부이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Welcome, Harbinger. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people. &&& Malibor: I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal. &&& Malibor: We are, all of us, hopeful that your arrival in Dazra, and your clear connection to Anasko Va'ruun, for the first time in weeks represents some semblance of hope.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But you do. We have only seen brief glimpses of him since... the incident. But you heard him speak. How can that be taken as anything other than providence?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001147"
msgid "I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here."
msgstr "나는 아나스코 바룬이든, 여기 있는 누구든 연결 관계가 없는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001146"
msgid "But you do. We have only seen brief glimpses of him since... the incident. But you heard him speak. How can that be taken as anything other than providence?"
msgstr ""
"연결됐어요. 저희는 그... 사고 이후로 그분의 모습을 잠깐 보았을 뿐입니다. 하지만 그대는 그분의 말씀을 들었지요. 그게 신의 섭리가 "
"아니고 무엇이겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Malibor
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Please, can we just for a moment...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A37
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001145"
msgid "By all means, Malibor. I can't wait to see how you spin this."
msgstr "아무렴요, 말리보어. 이 상황을 어떻게 풀어낼지 꼭 좀 보고 싶군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: ever so slightly sarcastic / Apologetic / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: You're correct, I was not there. Because you elected to travel to the spaceport on your own, and then decide this on your own. &&& Lovek: Do not waste time with more bickering! Anasko, and by extension House Va'ruun, suffers with every passing moment!
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Please, Malibor. Do go on.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A34
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001144"
msgid "Of course, Lovek. My apologies."
msgstr "그렇겠죠, 로벡. 사과드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Someone needs to start explaining what's going on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Someone needs to start explaining what's going on.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001143"
msgid "I understand. Until you were one of us, we could not trust you."
msgstr "이해합니다. 그대가 저희 일원이 되기 전까진 믿을 수가 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Welcome, Harbinger. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people. &&& Malibor: I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal. &&& Malibor: We are, all of us, hopeful that your arrival in Dazra, and your clear connection to Anasko Va'ruun, for the first time in weeks represents some semblance of hope.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Collectively, we unite under the banner of House Va'ruun, pledged to follow Jinan Va'ruun and his descendents.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A39
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001142"
msgid "What's with all the Houses? Aren't you all House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "이 가문들은 다 뭔가요? 다들 바룬 가문 소속 아닌가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Anasko Va'ruun, like his father before him, has relied on the teachings of Jinan to guide us.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A32
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001141"
msgid "Anasko wondered if perhaps it was time to seek guidance directly from the Great Serpent, and so sought a means of reaching out."
msgstr "아나스코 님은 위대한 뱀께 직접 인도를 구할 때일지도 모른다고 생각하셨고, 직접 닿을 수 있는 방법을 찾으셨지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Please, Malibor. Do go on. &&& Malibor: Anasko Va'ruun, like his father before him, has relied on the teachings of Jinan to guide us. &&& Malibor: Anasko wondered if perhaps it was time to seek guidance directly from the Great Serpent, and so sought a means of reaching out.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: Careful, Ka'dic. You tread on dangerous ground.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A31
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001140"
msgid "Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate?"
msgstr "가르침이 불충분하다고 느끼셨을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't have a connection to Anasko Va'ruun, or anyone here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113F"
msgid "We are, all of us, hopeful that your arrival in Dazra, and your clear connection to Anasko Va'ruun, for the first time in weeks represents some semblance of hope."
msgstr ""
"저희 모두는 그대가 다즈라에 도착하고 아나스코 바룬 님과 몇 주 만에 처음으로 연결됐다는 사실이 희망의 불씨가 되길 바라고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F717
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113E"
msgid "All Must Serve."
msgstr "모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Do not waste time with more bickering! Anasko, and by extension House Va'ruun, suffers with every passing moment! &&& ...  &&& Malibor: Anasko Va'ruun, like his father before him, has relied on the teachings of Jinan to guide us. &&& Malibor: Anasko wondered if perhaps it was time to seek guidance directly from the Great Serpent, and so sought a means of reaching out. &&& Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate?
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I mean nothing by it. We simply were never consulted on the matter, and do not know the full motive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A30
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113D"
msgid "Careful, Ka'dic. You tread on dangerous ground."
msgstr "조심하시오, 카딕. 위험한 영역에 발을 들였구려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: By all means, Malibor. I can't wait to see how you spin this.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Can we just for a moment what? Discuss whether or not to allow the first convert to House Va'ruun since before any of us were born? A bit late on that, it seems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113C"
msgid "Please, can we just for a moment..."
msgstr "제발, 잠깐 기다려 주시면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Anasko wondered if perhaps it was time to seek guidance directly from the Great Serpent, and so sought a means of reaching out. &&& Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& Lovek: Careful, Ka'dic. You tread on dangerous ground. &&& Djimal: I mean nothing by it. We simply were never consulted on the matter, and do not know the full motive.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: And then something went wrong.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A2E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113B"
msgid "The point is that a series of experiments have taken place over the years, utilizing grav drive technology to hopefully make direct contact with the Great Serpent, similar to Jinan Va'ruun's initial meeting."
msgstr ""
"요점은 지난 수년 동안 일련의 실험이 진행되었다는 겁니다. 중력 구동기 기술을 활용해서 위대한 뱀께 직접 닿을 방법을 찾으려 했지요. "
"지난 바룬께서 처음 닿으신 것과 비슷하게 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Welcome, Harbinger. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: We are all that is left after the disaster that has befallen our people. &&& Malibor: I represent House Dul'kehf. Djimal is from House Ka'dic, and we are joined by Lovek of House Veth'aal. &&& Malibor: We are, all of us, hopeful that your arrival in Dazra, and your clear connection to Anasko Va'ruun, for the first time in weeks represents some semblance of hope.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I understand. Until you were one of us, we could not trust you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A3B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage800_MaliborScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00113A"
msgid "Someone needs to start explaining what's going on."
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 건지 누가 설명 좀 해 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: I mean nothing by it. We simply were never consulted on the matter, and do not know the full motive. &&& Malibor: The point is that a series of experiments have taken place over the years, utilizing grav drive technology to hopefully make direct contact with the Great Serpent, similar to Jinan Va'ruun's initial meeting.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Lovek: We do not know what happened. We were not inside the Scaled Citadel at the time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A2D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001139"
msgid "And then something went wrong."
msgstr "그리고는 뭔가 잘못된 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: A great tide of energy emanated from the Scaled Citadel and swept across Dazra. Much was destroyed in its wake.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A28
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001138"
msgid "Those caught in the blast have been left in a state of confusion, trapped halfway between our universe and the Vortex."
msgstr "폭발에 휩쓸려버린 사람들은 혼란스러운 상태에 빠져 버렸습니다. 저희 우주와 볼텍스 사이에 갇혀버린 것이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: The point is that a series of experiments have taken place over the years, utilizing grav drive technology to hopefully make direct contact with the Great Serpent, similar to Jinan Va'ruun's initial meeting. &&& Djimal: And then something went wrong. &&& Lovek: We do not know what happened. We were not inside the Scaled Citadel at the time. &&& Djimal: Had we been, we wouldn't be standing here now. We'd be like the rest of them.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Somber
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Those caught in the blast have been left in a state of confusion, trapped halfway between our universe and the Vortex.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A29
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001137"
msgid "A great tide of energy emanated from the Scaled Citadel and swept across Dazra. Much was destroyed in its wake."
msgstr "엄청난 에너지 파동이 비늘 성채에서 뿜어져 나와 다즈라 전역을 휩쓸었습니다. 그 여파로 많은 것이 파괴되었지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A26
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001136"
msgid "We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel."
msgstr "실험이 아직도 진행되고 있고, 이유는 모르지만 저희가 성채에 들어가는 걸 막고 있다는 추측만 할 수 있을 뿐이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Lovek
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: And then something went wrong. &&& Lovek: We do not know what happened. We were not inside the Scaled Citadel at the time.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: A great tide of energy emanated from the Scaled Citadel and swept across Dazra. Much was destroyed in its wake.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A2B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001135"
msgid "Had we been, we wouldn't be standing here now. We'd be like the rest of them."
msgstr "그랬다면 우린 여기 서 있지도 못했겠죠. 다른 사람들처럼 됐을 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& Lovek: Careful, Ka'dic. You tread on dangerous ground.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: The point is that a series of experiments have taken place over the years, utilizing grav drive technology to hopefully make direct contact with the Great Serpent, similar to Jinan Va'ruun's initial meeting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A2F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001134"
msgid "I mean nothing by it. We simply were never consulted on the matter, and do not know the full motive."
msgstr "별 뜻은 없었어요. 단지 우리가 그 문제로 조언을 한 적도 없었고, 그분의 진짜 동기도 모를 뿐이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Those caught in the blast have been left in a state of confusion, trapped halfway between our universe and the Vortex.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A27
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001133"
msgid "The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach."
msgstr "성채 자체는 온전히 남아 있지만, 거기 그대로 있는데도 닿을 수가 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We must try to maintain some sense of hope. None can know what will happen, save the Great Serpent himself.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001132"
msgid "Your arrival, and your interaction with Anasko, shows that he can still be saved."
msgstr "그대가 도착하고 아나스코 님과 접촉했을 때, 그분을 아직 구할 수 있다는 걸 알았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001131"
msgid "A plan had been devised to access the Citadel, but the work stalled. Clearly, it is time to move forward with it."
msgstr "성채에 진입할 계획을 세워두긴 했지만, 일이 지연되어 있었지요. 이제 분명 계획을 진행할 때가 된 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0111CDE3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "001130"
msgid "The current head of our science team, Ekris, should be in Jinan Plaza down below us, towards the Citadel. Tell him about your experience with Anasko, and that work on the Mourning Device must proceed."
msgstr ""
"현 과학팀을 책임지고 있는 에크리스가 우리 아래쪽에 있는 지난 광장에서 성채 방향 쪽에 있을 겁니다. 가서 아나스코 님과 있었던 일을 "
"말해 주고, 모어닝 장치 작업을 진행해야 한다고 말해 주시지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: By all means, Malibor. I can't wait to see how you spin this. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Can we just for a moment what? Discuss whether or not to allow the first convert to House Va'ruun since before any of us were born? A bit late on that, it seems. &&& Malibor: You were not there, you did not see Anasko. It felt different. We have already wasted so much time... &&& Djimal: You're correct, I was not there. Because you elected to travel to the spaceport on your own, and then decide this on your own.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Of course, Lovek. My apologies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A35
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112F"
msgid "Do not waste time with more bickering! Anasko, and by extension House Va'ruun, suffers with every passing moment!"
msgstr "또 말싸움하면서 시간 낭비하지 맙시다! 아나스코 님이, 더 나아가 바룬 가문이 매 순간마다 고통받고 있소!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Lovek: Careful, Ka'dic. You tread on dangerous ground. &&& Djimal: I mean nothing by it. We simply were never consulted on the matter, and do not know the full motive. &&& Malibor: The point is that a series of experiments have taken place over the years, utilizing grav drive technology to hopefully make direct contact with the Great Serpent, similar to Jinan Va'ruun's initial meeting. &&& Djimal: And then something went wrong.
#. ALIAS: Lovek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMLovekVethaal
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Had we been, we wouldn't be standing here now. We'd be like the rest of them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A2C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112E"
msgid "We do not know what happened. We were not inside the Scaled Citadel at the time."
msgstr "우리도 어떻게 된 건지는 모르오. 그때 비늘 성채 내부에 있지 않았으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll help, but the outcome isn't going to be what you're hoping for.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A25
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112D"
msgid "We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived."
msgstr "들어가지 못하면, 실험을 멈출 수도 없지요. 저희는... 그대가 오기 전까지는 희망을 잃고 있었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach. &&& Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel. &&& Malibor: We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Your arrival, and your interaction with Anasko, shows that he can still be saved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A24
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112C"
msgid "Tell me how I fit into this."
msgstr "내가 어떻게 해 주면 되는지 말해봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You were not there, you did not see Anasko. It felt different. We have already wasted so much time... &&& ...  &&& Lovek: Do not waste time with more bickering! Anasko, and by extension House Va'ruun, suffers with every passing moment! &&& Djimal: Of course, Lovek. My apologies. &&& Djimal: Please, Malibor. Do go on.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Anasko wondered if perhaps it was time to seek guidance directly from the Great Serpent, and so sought a means of reaching out.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A33
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_CouncilScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112B"
msgid "Anasko Va'ruun, like his father before him, has relied on the teachings of Jinan to guide us."
msgstr "아나스코 바룬 님은 그분의 부친께서 그리하셨듯이 지난 님의 가르침을 통해 저희를 이끄셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach. &&& Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel. &&& Malibor: We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Forgive me, I am no scientist. But as it has been explained to me, what we call the Vortex is the... the space between universes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A22
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00112A"
msgid "The \"Vortex\"? What is that?"
msgstr "'볼텍스'? 그게 뭐죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The "Vortex"? What is that?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The "Vortex"? What is that?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I'll help, but the outcome isn't going to be what you're hoping for.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A21
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001129"
msgid "Forgive me, I am no scientist. But as it has been explained to me, what we call the Vortex is the... the space between universes."
msgstr ""
"용서하시지요. 저는 과학자가 아닙니다. 그나마 이해한 바대로 설명하자면, 저희가 볼텍스라고 부르는 것은... 우주 사이의 공간입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How long ago did this happen?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How long ago did this happen?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001128"
msgid "It has only been a few weeks."
msgstr "불과 몇 주밖에 지나지 않았지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Perhaps he found the teachings inadequate? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: The Citadel itself remains in such a state, right there and yet beyond our reach. &&& Malibor: We can only assume that the experiment is still running, somehow, preventing us from entering the Citadel. &&& Malibor: We cannot get in, so we cannot stop it. We... were beginning to lose hope before you arrived.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It has only been a few weeks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A20
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage810_MaliborScene02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001127"
msgid "How long ago did this happen?"
msgstr "언제부터 이런 일이 발생한 거지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01035A1C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ02_HellosInaza
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001126"
msgid "House Va'ruun welcomes you, Promised."
msgstr "바룬 가문이 그대를 환영하노라, 약속받은 자여."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Alive? But how?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103542D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001125"
msgid "You should know that Ukaru is alive."
msgstr "우카루가 살아 있다는 걸 아셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should know that Ukaru is alive.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I rescued him from the Zealots. He thought it was best to make his attackers think he was dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103542C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001124"
msgid "Alive? But how?"
msgstr "살아 있다고요? 하지만 어떻게?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: That was the wisest course of action, and you did well to hide it, even from me.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103542B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001123"
msgid "I will let him know it's safe to return. Knowing him, he has not shown his face out of an abundance of caution."
msgstr "우카루에게 돌아와도 안전하다고 전하겠습니다. 제가 하는 우카루는, 극도로 신중해서 모습을 드러내지 않았을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103542B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001122"
msgid "Too much, if my heart is to be considered."
msgstr "제 심장이 허락한다면, 너무 많은 일을 겪었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should know that Ukaru is alive. &&& MS01_Qisrani: Alive? But how?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That was the wisest course of action, and you did well to hide it, even from me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0103542A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001121"
msgid "I rescued him from the Zealots. He thought it was best to make his attackers think he was dead."
msgstr "광신도들로부터 우카루를 구출했습니다. 우카루는 자신의 공격자들에게 자신이 죽은 것처럼 보이게 하는 게 최선이라고 생각했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should know that Ukaru is alive. &&& MS01_Qisrani: Alive? But how?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'd say that was a boast if it weren't clearly the truth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035428
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001120"
msgid "There's nothing I can't do."
msgstr "저는 못 할 게 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would be way too hard to explain. It involves multiverses for one.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It would be way too hard to explain. It involves multiverses for one.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035425
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111F"
msgid "Normally I would question that, but after the accident, I've come to believe just about anything is possible."
msgstr "평소라면 의문을 제기했겠지만, 그 사고 이후로는, 저는 거의 모든 것이 가능하다고 믿게 되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It would be way too hard to explain. It involves multiverses for one.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: I will let him know it's safe to return. Knowing him, he has not shown his face out of an abundance of caution. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035425
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111E"
msgid "Either way, I'm grateful."
msgstr "어쨌든, 감사합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's nothing I can't do.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's nothing I can't do.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: I will let him know it's safe to return. Knowing him, he has not shown his face out of an abundance of caution. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035427
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111D"
msgid "I'd say that was a boast if it weren't clearly the truth."
msgstr "명백한 진실이 아니었다면 허풍이라고 말했을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035424
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Ukaru_TL_NGPlus_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111C"
msgid "It's good to have you back, cousin."
msgstr "돌아와서 반가워요. 사촌."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Ukaru: Oh! Don't do that! I need to keep busy! How will I function without work?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035424
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Ukaru_TL_NGPlus_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111B"
msgid "I've moved most of your work to the other Executors to give you time to settle in."
msgstr "적응하실 시간을 드리기 위해 당신의 업무 대부분을 다른 실무관들에게 넘겼습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I rescued him from the Zealots. He thought it was best to make his attackers think he was dead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I rescued him from the Zealots. He thought it was best to make his attackers think he was dead.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: I will let him know it's safe to return. Knowing him, he has not shown his face out of an abundance of caution. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035429
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00111A"
msgid "That was the wisest course of action, and you did well to hide it, even from me."
msgstr "그게 가장 현명한 조치였고, 심지어 저에게까지 숨기신 건 잘하신 일이었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: It's good to have you back, cousin.|I've moved most of your work to the other Executors to give you time to settle in.
#. ALIAS: MS01_Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Ha, I forget that this is medicine for you. All right, I'll give you something, but please, take it slow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035423
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Ukaru_TL_NGPlus_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001119"
msgid "Oh! Don't do that! I need to keep busy! How will I function without work?"
msgstr "오! 그러지 마세요! 저는 바쁘게 지내야 합니다! 일이 없으면 어떻게 지내겠어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: MS01_Qisrani: It's good to have you back, cousin.|I've moved most of your work to the other Executors to give you time to settle in. &&& MS01_Ukaru: Oh! Don't do that! I need to keep busy! How will I function without work?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035422
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Ukaru_TL_NGPlus_Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001118"
msgid "Ha, I forget that this is medicine for you. All right, I'll give you something, but please, take it slow."
msgstr "하, 이게 당신에게 약이라는 걸 잊고 있었군요. 알겠습니다, 일을 드리겠지만, 제발, 천천히 하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should know that Ukaru is alive. &&& MS01_Qisrani: Alive? But how?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Normally I would question that, but after the accident, I've come to believe just about anything is possible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01035426
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_NGPlus_UkaruAlive
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001117"
msgid "It would be way too hard to explain. It involves multiverses for one."
msgstr "설명하기엔 너무 어려울 겁니다. 다중우주도 관련되어 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything. &&& Djimal: I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations. &&& Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete.  &&& Djimal: As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma.|When you arrived, the Zealots had already killed the hostages, so you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: See that you do.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035932
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001116"
msgid "I'll make sure no one's left alive."
msgstr "아무도 살아남지 못하도록 확실히 처리하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything. &&& Djimal: I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations. &&& Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete.  &&& Djimal: As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma.|When you arrived, the Zealots had already killed the hostages, so you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You'd fit well in the Ministry of Conjunction, that is, if you succeed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035930
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001115"
msgid "I live for a good cover story."
msgstr "나도 이야기 꾸며내는 재미로 사는 사람이거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Like I said, I'm not committing to anything. &&& Djimal: I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations. &&& Djimal: You'll receive payment when your work is complete.  &&& Djimal: As you may have guessed, we can't afford any loose ends, and you'll need a cover story for Razma.|When you arrived, the Zealots had already killed the hostages, so you exacted revenge in House Ka'dic's name.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, but don't worry. I'll be there to reinforce what Razma already knows: the Zealots cannot be trusted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001114"
msgid "So it'll be my word against the Zealot leaders?"
msgstr "그러니까 광신도 대장 앞에서 그렇게 말하라고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure. &&& companion: The Zealots were wise in their tactics, up until now.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So my theory is correct? Or I should say, the High Council now believes my theory, the better theory, is correct?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001113"
msgid "Good news. The High Council thinks you have all the answers, too."
msgstr "좋은 소식이네. 대의회도 네가 그 이유를 전부 안다고 생각하거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035928
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001112"
msgid "Harbinger. A word before you go."
msgstr "선구자. 가기 전에 잠시만요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guided me here, sister. I'm here to lead you to safety. &&& Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me.  &&& Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. |The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here. |They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure. &&& companion: The Zealots were wise in their tactics, up until now.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Are -- Are you saying my theory is correct? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035929
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001111"
msgid "That's exactly why I'm here to rescue you."
msgstr "바로 그 이유 때문에 널 구출하러 온 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: See that you do.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103592C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001110"
msgid "I look forward to seeing you at the negotiations."
msgstr "협상 장소에서 만나길 기대할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035922
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00110F"
msgid "You realize it's been days since we've had any food."
msgstr "우리가 뭐라도 먹은 지 며칠은 지난 거 알잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035922
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00110E"
msgid "You aren't a Zealot... Who are you?"
msgstr "광신도가 아니라면... 누구시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: So my theory is correct? Or I should say, the High Council now believes my theory, the better theory, is correct?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035926
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00110C"
msgid "I knew it. I told them their algorithms and insufficient testing were only giving the illusion of stability."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어요. 알고리즘이랑 불충분한 시험 때문에 안정적인 것처럼 보일 뿐이라고 분명히 말했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: All right. First, we need to free the other hostages.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035925
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00110B"
msgid "The Zealots aren't aware of how I've been delving into their systems here."
msgstr "광신도들은 제가 자기네 시스템을 얼마나 파헤치고 있는지 전혀 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So you're saying you have unlimited access to this base and more.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035925
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00110A"
msgid "They think I'm applying my theories to their poor excuse for technology down here. Granted, I could probably make it work if I had to."
msgstr "여기 있는 이 한심한 기술에 제 이론을 적용하는 중이라고 생각하거든요. 물론, 필요하다면 얼마든지 작동시킬 수 있을걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035925
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001109"
msgid "I told them I needed full access if they expect me to replicate Anasko's experiment, and they didn't even bother with risk assessment."
msgstr "아나스코 님의 실험을 똑같이 따라하려면 완전 접속 권한이 필요하다고 했는데, 그놈들은 위험 평가조차도 귀찮아 하더라고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forget Razma. You're better off on your own anyway.  &&& Sahima: I wish I could have that mentality. And maybe it's not so much a desire to be cared for as it is a desire for acceptance. &&& Sahima: I overheard the Zealots mention negotiating with House Ka'dic, so the motivations are clear.|Not only does the High Council deem me important, but Razma needs to remove me from the equation.|I get it. But at least now everyone knows I was right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, step one is freeing the others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035924
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001108"
msgid "Let's get back to getting out of here."
msgstr "여길 빠져나갈 방법을 얘기해 보자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But you're... If you're not a Zealot, who are you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035919
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001107"
msgid "Don't worry. I'm here to help."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 도와주러 왔으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's more than just me. There are others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035918
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001106"
msgid "Who -- who are you?"
msgstr "누... 누구시죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever the situation, I can handle it. &&& Sahima: I pray your confidence is well justified. &&& Sahima: While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here.|I'll meet you and the others outside.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm more than capable of handling myself. Besides, the Zealots think they need me, so my life isn't in danger. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035920
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001105"
msgid "That's risky. What if the Zealots catch you?"
msgstr "그건 위험해. 광신도한테 잡히면 어쩌려고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you're saying you have unlimited access to this base and more. &&& Sahima: I've been in an out of every other system they have here. &&& Sahima: The other hostages are being kept just beyond this room.|I can disengage the locks to their cell and grant you access to an elevator in the room beyond that will take them to safety...|You just have to clear out that area first, and the Zealots down there are... different.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, I'm not going anywhere yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103591E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001104"
msgid "All right, let's go."
msgstr "알겠어. 출발하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's risky. What if the Zealots catch you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's risky. What if the Zealots catch you?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103591D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001103"
msgid "I'm more than capable of handling myself. Besides, the Zealots think they need me, so my life isn't in danger."
msgstr "제 몸 정도는 충분히 감당할 수 있어요. 게다가 광신도들은 제가 필요하다고 생각하니까, 목숨이 위험하지도 않을 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech Challenge success response: Considering the player's offer / Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01037474
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Mihael_SC_Misc02Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001102"
msgid "Violence isn't always the answer."
msgstr "폭력이 항상 답은 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forget Razma. You're better off on your own anyway.  &&& Sahima: I wish I could have that mentality. And maybe it's not so much a desire to be cared for as it is a desire for acceptance. &&& Sahima: I overheard the Zealots mention negotiating with House Ka'dic, so the motivations are clear.|Not only does the High Council deem me important, but Razma needs to remove me from the equation.|I get it. But at least now everyone knows I was right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: With pleasure, but I won't leave without the others. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035921
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001101"
msgid "When we get back, you can say that to their faces."
msgstr "돌아가고 나면 그 사람들 앞에서 대놓고 말해줄 수 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Where were we? Right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wait, I can't just leave.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035917
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001100"
msgid "Come with me. I'm getting you out of here."
msgstr "따라와. 여기서 꺼내줄 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Where were we? Right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Serpent's Grace, I knew it. I knew she wouldn't just leave us here to rot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035914
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FF"
msgid "I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you."
msgstr "나는 선구자 <Alias=MQ03Player>. 라즈마가 널 구출해달라고 해서 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: Please. I need to know if Sahima is safe.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: On our side? Who are you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035912
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FE"
msgid "Calm down. I'm on your side."
msgstr "진정해요. 같은 편이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Where were we? Right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank the Serpent. But I can't leave yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035911
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FD"
msgid "I'm your rescue party. Now let's go."
msgstr "네 구출팀이지. 이제 가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I knew the Serpent would hear me. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FC"
msgid "It's more than just me. There are others."
msgstr "저 말고도 더 있어요. 다른 사람들이요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FB"
msgid "The Zealots have been using them to force me to continue my research here."
msgstr "광신도가 사람들을 이용해서 제가 연구를 계속하도록 강요했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: The Zealots were wise in their tactics, up until now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010FA"
msgid "They think I have all the answers since the original experiment was a catastrophic failure."
msgstr "원래 실험이 재난으로 끝나버린 이유를 제가 전부 안다고 생각하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Fine. I'll get the hostages out of here. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Fine. I'll get the hostages out of here. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035906
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F9"
msgid "Good. I'll see you outside!"
msgstr "좋아요. 밖에서 만나요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever the situation, I can handle it. &&& Sahima: I pray your confidence is well justified. &&& Sahima: While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here.|I'll meet you and the others outside.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, you have to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F8"
msgid "No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight."
msgstr "절대 안 돼. 너 혼자 둘 수는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape. &&& Gavin: I wish it were that easy.  &&& Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.|Please. I can ready my people here, but... you'll have to deal with the Zealots and rescue the others so we may all escape safely.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We'll be ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035905
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F7"
msgid "All right. I'll clear the path."
msgstr "알았어요. 내가 길을 정리하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight.  &&& ...  &&& companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves.  &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then! &&& Sahima: But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine. |I've had enough time to know my plan has at least an 87% success rate.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sure will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035904
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F6"
msgid "Good luck. I'll see you outside."
msgstr "행운을 빌게. 밖에서 만나자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good luck. I'll see you outside.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good luck. I'll see you outside.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Happy
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035903
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F5"
msgid "You sure will."
msgstr "분명 그럴 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Whatever the situation, I can handle it. &&& Sahima: I pray your confidence is well justified. &&& Sahima: While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here.|I'll meet you and the others outside.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And a well-thought-out one at that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F4"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr "괜찮은 계획인 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I pray your confidence is well justified.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F3"
msgid "While you get the rescue underway, I'm going to set up certain guarantees here."
msgstr "구출 작전을 하시는 동안 전 여기서 일이 확실하게 처리되도록 해 드릴 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103590D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F2"
msgid "I'll meet you and the others outside."
msgstr "다른 사람들이랑 같이 밖에서 만나요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight.  &&& ...  &&& companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves.  &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then! &&& Sahima: But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine. |I've had enough time to know my plan has at least an 87% success rate.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: These are Zealots we're dealing with. The only reason they even have hostages is to make sure I stay in line. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035901
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F1"
msgid "Why not set up your remote device to sabotage the Zealots earlier?"
msgstr "광신도를 방해할 원격 장치가 있었는데, 왜 미리 조정해 놓지 않은 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not set up your remote device to sabotage the Zealots earlier?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why not set up your remote device to sabotage the Zealots earlier?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010F0"
msgid "These are Zealots we're dealing with. The only reason they even have hostages is to make sure I stay in line."
msgstr "우리 상대는 광신도라고요. 그놈들이 인질까지 잡아둔 이유도 절 확실하게 붙잡아두려는 거였잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not set up your remote device to sabotage the Zealots earlier?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Fine. I'll get the hostages out of here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035900
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010EF"
msgid "I couldn't threaten them without knowing the others were safe."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 안전한지 모르는 상황에서 놈들을 위협할 순 없었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Well, you have to.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010EE"
msgid "I just need enough time to set up a remote device so I can launch a virus that will render this place useless."
msgstr "여기 전체를 무력화시킬 바이러스를 실행하려면 원격 장치를 조정할 시간이 필요하거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I like your style. As one scientist to another, we should trade notes sometime.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035908
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010ED"
msgid "Think of it as a failsafe to guarantee our safety. The Zealots would never risk this base or their ships."
msgstr "우리 안전을 위한 조치라고 생각하세요. 광신도들은 이 기지나 우주선을 절대 포기 못 할 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight.  &&& ...  &&& companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves.  &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then! &&& Sahima: But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine. |I've had enough time to know my plan has at least an 87% success rate.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No way. It's probably that we'll make it, and when we do, I'm handing this over to a familiar face. No offense.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010EC"
msgid "Give me your research in case you don't make it."
msgstr "일이 잘못될 수도 있으니까 네 연구 자료를 넘겨줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape. &&& Gavin: I wish it were that easy.  &&& Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.|Please. I can ready my people here, but... you'll have to deal with the Zealots and rescue the others so we may all escape safely.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll be keeping an eye out, so we'll be ready.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010EA"
msgid "Just be ready to go once it's clear."
msgstr "길 정리되면 출발할 준비나 해 둬요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll find those hostages. I won't leave anyone behind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035902
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E9"
msgid "We'll be ready."
msgstr "준비해 둘게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Where were we? Right.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Serpent's Grace, I knew it. I knew she wouldn't just leave us here to rot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035914
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E8"
msgid "I'm Harbinger <Alias=MQ03Player>. Razma sent me to rescue you."
msgstr "나는 선구자 <Alias=MQ03Player>. 라즈마가 널 구출해달라고 해서 왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Give me your research in case you don't make it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Give me your research in case you don't make it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E7"
msgid "No way. It's probably that we'll make it, and when we do, I'm handing this over to a familiar face. No offense."
msgstr "안 돼요. 우린 해낼 수 있을 거고, 해내고 나면 제가 더 잘 아는 사람한테 넘겨줄 거예요. 나쁜 뜻은 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Give me your research in case you don't make it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E6"
msgid "Now move it. You've got hostages to free."
msgstr "이제 움직이죠. 풀어줄 인질들이 있잖아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E5"
msgid "You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher."
msgstr "해내셨군요! 사람들 말이 사실이네요. 공기가 정말 더 상쾌해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way, I'm not letting you out of my sight.  &&& ...  &&& companion: Believe me, us heretics have often wondered ourselves.  &&& Sahima: Something to look forward to then! &&& Sahima: But back to the matter at hand. Again. I'll be fine. |I've had enough time to know my plan has at least an 87% success rate.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. I'll see you outside!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035907
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0700_Sahima_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E4"
msgid "Fine. I'll get the hostages out of here."
msgstr "그래. 내가 인질들을 데리고 나갈게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Calm down. I'm on your side. &&& Gavin: On our side? Who are you?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank the Serpent. Forgive my initial coarseness. So that means she's safe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E3"
msgid "Sahima sent me. I'm getting you out of here."
msgstr "사히마가 보내서 왔어요. 여기서 꺼내 드리죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not a Zealot. This is just the best thing I have to wear. &&& Gavin: If you're not a Zealot, then who are you?
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank the Serpent, I took you for one of them. And Sahima? Did you find her? Is she safe? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E2"
msgid "I'm the one breaking you out of this place."
msgstr "당신을 탈옥시켜 줄 사람이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Correction, it's time for you to get back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E1"
msgid "It's time to get everyone back."
msgstr "이제 다들 돌아갈 시간이군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima is safe. She's granting us access to an elevator to escape. &&& Gavin: I wish it were that easy.  &&& Gavin: The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there.|Please. I can ready my people here, but... you'll have to deal with the Zealots and rescue the others so we may all escape safely.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm afraid we're quite useless here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010E0"
msgid "You don't want to help?"
msgstr "날 좀 도와줄 수 있을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mistaking the player for a Zealot. / Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2000_Gavin_CallOutScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DF"
msgid "What do you want now?"
msgstr "이젠 또 뭐가 필요한데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DE"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "누구신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.|Now, I believe you have some negotiations to to attend to.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DD"
msgid "I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely."
msgstr "전 잠시 남아서 다들 무사히 빠져나온 건지 확실하게 확인 좀 할게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DC"
msgid "I'll catch up with you shortly. Just let me know where the negotiations are taking place."
msgstr "금방 따라갈 거니까, 협상이 어디서 진행 중인지만 알려 주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher. &&& Gavin: Serpent bless you. We owe you our lives. Thank you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Now, it's time for you to head back. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DB"
msgid "You're welcome. I'm glad everyone made it out safely."
msgstr "별 말씀을. 다들 무사히 빠져나와서 다행이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day. &&& Sahima: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.|Now, I believe you have some negotiations to to attend to. &&& Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.|I'll catch up with you shortly. Just let me know where the negotiations are taking place.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Have I mentioned I'm sick of people telling me what to do? I'm staying.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010DA"
msgid "They're at the Badlands Power Station, and you're coming with me."
msgstr "배드랜드 발전소야. 나랑 같이 가자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day. &&& Sahima: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.|Now, I believe you have some negotiations to to attend to. &&& Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.|I'll catch up with you shortly. Just let me know where the negotiations are taking place.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. I successfully rigged a remote device to shut this whole place down the moment I see a Zealot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D9"
msgid "Are you sure you'll be all right?"
msgstr "정말로 괜찮겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They're at the Badlands Power Station, and you're coming with me. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They're at the Badlands Power Station, and you're coming with me. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'll be there when it counts. Now go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D8"
msgid "Have I mentioned I'm sick of people telling me what to do? I'm staying."
msgstr "사람들이 이래라저래라 하는 거 질렸다고 말 안 했었나요? 전 남을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't want to help? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't want to help? 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D7"
msgid "I'm afraid we're quite useless here."
msgstr "안타깝지만 우린 별 도움이 못 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't want to help? 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D6"
msgid "They've been starving us, keeping us weak. Probably for just such an occasion."
msgstr "광신도가 우릴 굶기면서 힘을 빼 놨거든요. 이런 상황을 대비한 거겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: These members of your House have suffered. I can respect your decision.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D5"
msgid "I'll be there when it counts. Now go."
msgstr "중요한 순간에 도착할 거예요. 이제 가세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D4"
msgid "Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time?"
msgstr "계속 말도 안 되는 소리만 할 작정인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D3"
msgid "I thought this was a negotiation."
msgstr "이건 협상일 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you sure you'll be all right?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Are you sure you'll be all right?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D2"
msgid "Of course. I successfully rigged a remote device to shut this whole place down the moment I see a Zealot."
msgstr "그럼요. 원격 장치를 써서 광신도가 보이는 순간 이 시설 전체를 폐쇄할 수 있도록 설정해 뒀어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Are you sure you'll be all right?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D1"
msgid "I just need a moment to make sure everyone is fine."
msgstr "그냥 다들 무사한지 잠깐만 확인하면 돼요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Gavin: I wish it were that easy. 
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010D0"
msgid "The Zealots separated us. Our brethren are still out there."
msgstr "광신도들이 우릴 떨어뜨려 놨어요. 교우님들이 아직 남아 있다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pausing after "but" because he knows the Zealots the player will need to face are a especially threatening. / Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. I'll clear the path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CF"
msgid "Please. I can ready my people here, but... you'll have to deal with the Zealots and rescue the others so we may all escape safely."
msgstr ""
"부탁드립니다. 이쪽 사람들은 제가 준비시키겠지만... 광신도를 처리하고 나머지 인질을 구출해 주셔야 모두가 안전하게 탈출할 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day. &&& Sahima: It certainly was a test of faith, but one I hope we all passed.|Now, I believe you have some negotiations to to attend to. &&& Sahima: I'm going to stay back a moment and make sure everyone here is okay to make it back safely.|I'll catch up with you shortly. Just let me know where the negotiations are taking place.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't worry. Razma came through for me. It's only fair I return the favor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CE"
msgid "The negotiations are at the Badlands Power Station. Be quick."
msgstr "협상은 배드랜드 발전소에서 진행 중이야. 서둘러."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just be ready to go once it's clear.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just be ready to go once it's clear.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I won't leave my fellow Promised behind. I'll find them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2100_Gavin_HostageScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CD"
msgid "I'll be keeping an eye out, so we'll be ready."
msgstr "계속 주시하고 있을 거니까, 준비 돼 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yes, time to ruin this guy's day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, time to ruin this guy's day.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CC"
msgid "And I'm going to enjoy every minute of it."
msgstr "매 순간을 마음껏 즐겨야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CB"
msgid "We're having a friendly chat, aren't we?"
msgstr "서로 즐겁게 담소 나누는 중이잖아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: So, Mihael, will you turn a blind eye to the Great Serpent's plan?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010CA"
msgid "It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable."
msgstr "네가 제안을 안 받는 게 내 잘못은 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Zealots have no leverage. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Zealots have no leverage. 
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C9"
msgid "Good. Now it's my turn to watch Mihael squirm"
msgstr "좋아. 이제 내가 미해일이 꾸물대는 걸 볼 차례로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Exactly what I wanted to hear. &&& Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?|I'd expect better security from House Ka'dic. &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C8"
msgid "Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over."
msgstr "맞아. 그리고 이 소위 협상이라는 짓거리도 끝이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& Razma: Exactly what I wanted to hear.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C7"
msgid "Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?"
msgstr "라즈마, 이놈은 뭐야? 공적인 자리에서 아무나 돌아다니게 한 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C6"
msgid "I'd expect better security from House Ka'dic."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 보안이 이보다는 나을 줄 알았는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sahima and the other hostages are safe.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C5"
msgid "Exactly what I wanted to hear."
msgstr "딱 듣고 싶었던 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable. &&& Razma: So, Mihael, will you turn a blind eye to the Great Serpent's plan?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And I'm going to enjoy every minute of it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C4"
msgid "Yes, time to ruin this guy's day."
msgstr "네. 이 양반의 하루를 망쳐줄 시간이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation. &&& Mihael: You're no one. &&& Mihael: Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: You. How did you -- You're bluffing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C3"
msgid "It's true, Mihael. And if you don't leave now, peacefully, I'll make sure your ships and Shadow Station Epsilon are made dust."
msgstr "사실이야, 미해일. 그리고 당장 조용히 떠나지 않으면, 네 우주선들이랑 비밀 기지 엡실론을 흙먼지로 만들어 버리겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You did it! It's true what they say. The air really does smell fresher.
#. ALIAS: Gavin
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMGavinKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Praise the Great Serpent. He has truly smiled upon us this day.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_2400_Sahima_EscapedScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
