#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010C0"
msgid "Sahima and the other hostages are safe."
msgstr "사히마와 다른 인질들은 무사해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?|I'd expect better security from House Ka'dic. &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business. &&& Razma: Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over.
