#. TOPIC: 010358D5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010BF"
msgid "Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is."
msgstr "끝이라고? 외부인의 속삭임에 모든 걸 걸겠다는 건가? 이놈이 누군지 알아야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable. &&& Razma: So, Mihael, will you turn a blind eye to the Great Serpent's plan?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. Now it's my turn to watch Mihael squirm
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358D9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
