msgid "The Zealots have no leverage."
msgstr "광신도는 이제 협상 수단이 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& Razma: Exactly what I wanted to hear. &&& Mihael: Razma, who is this? You allow any commoner to just waltz in on official business?|I'd expect better security from House Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
