msgid "Ah, just the person I wanted to see."
msgstr "아, 보고 싶었던 사람이 왔군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Nervous
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation.
