#. TOPIC: 010358D1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B9"
msgid "I'm the Serpent's chosen Harbinger. The only one who can understand Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "나는 위대한 뱀에게 선택받은 선구자이자, 아나스코 바룬의 말을 이해할 수 있는 유일한 사람이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business. &&& Razma: Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over. &&& Mihael: Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: House Ka'dic dealing with outsiders? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358CF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B8"
msgid "I'm a Ryujin operative, and disruption is my speciality."
msgstr "나는 류진 요원이다. 방해 공작이 내 전문이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: You're no one.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's true, Mihael. And if you don't leave now, peacefully, I'll make sure your ships and Shadow Station Epsilon are made dust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B7"
msgid "Only a complete fool would expect me to believe this."
msgstr "그 말을 믿을 줄 알았다면 완전 멍청한 놈이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: It's true, Mihael. And if you don't leave now, peacefully, I'll make sure your ships and Shadow Station Epsilon are made dust. &&& Mihael: You. How did you -- You're bluffing.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B5"
msgid "Test me. You think a genius mind like mine wouldn't find a way to hack into every system in your base?"
msgstr "시험해 보던가. 나 정도 되는 천재가 네 기지 시스템을 전부 해킹할 방법도 못 찾을 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Is your intent to be unreasonable the whole time? |I thought this was a negotiation. &&& Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0010B4"
msgid "It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order."
msgstr "흔들릴 건 없어. 단지 정상적인 관계로 돌아갈 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation. &&& ...  &&& Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. |You'd jeopardize our connections? &&& Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order.  &&& Mihael: The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now. |You know every one of us is prepared to answer the Serpent's Call.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Are you sure? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358BF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B3"
msgid "Sahima, launch the virus. It's impossible to reason with Zealots."
msgstr "사히마, 바이러스를 실행해. 광신도는 말이 통할 놈들이 절대 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: You. How did you -- You're bluffing. &&& Sahima: Test me. You think a genius mind like mine wouldn't find a way to hack into every system in your base? |This remote device will launch a virus that will detonate systems within your base and reach your ships as well.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B2"
msgid "You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma."
msgstr "이딴 짓거리가 앞으로 어떤 영향을 줄지 알 텐데, 라즈마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B1"
msgid "You'd jeopardize our connections?"
msgstr "우리 관계를 뒤흔들 작정이냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima and the other hostages are safe. &&& ...  &&& Djimal: Heh. This is hardly official business. &&& Razma: Yes, and now these so-called negotiations are over. &&& Mihael: Over? You'd risk everything after the whispers of a stranger? I demand to know who this is.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Freestar Rangers have no power here. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358CD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010B0"
msgid "I'm a Freestar Ranger, here to enforce justice."
msgstr "나는 자유항성 레인저다. 정의를 집행하러 왔지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. / VeryAngry / to Razma
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. |You'd jeopardize our connections? &&& Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order. 
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AF"
msgid "The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now."
msgstr "정상적인 관계라고? 지금 여기서 네놈들 전부 처리해버릴 수도 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Threatening. They're prepared to die. / VeryAngry / to Razma
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AE"
msgid "You know every one of us is prepared to answer the Serpent's Call."
msgstr "우리 모두 위대한 뱀의 부름에 답할 준비가 됐다는 건 잘 알 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today. &&& Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work. &&& Mihael: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Prepare to be made dust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AD"
msgid "[Attack] Do it, Sahima."
msgstr "[공격] 해 버려, 사히마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Speech challenge win response. Hopeful. / Friendly / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bianca
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFBiancaLatif
#. FACE: Friendly
