#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MQ04_1000_Bianca_SC_Repeatable01WinResponses
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AC"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "확실해요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] That's what I'm hoping for.  &&& Mihael: Give the Serpent my regards. 
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A device that may well be a ploy? And for what?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AB"
msgid "No one here wants violence. You walk away, you get the device."
msgstr "여기서 폭력을 쓰고 싶은 사람은 없어. 그 장치를 가지고 떠나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation. &&& ...  &&& Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. |You'd jeopardize our connections? &&& Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order.  &&& Mihael: The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now. |You know every one of us is prepared to answer the Serpent's Call.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358C1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010AA"
msgid "No one has to die. Sahima will hand over the remote device as a gesture of good faith."
msgstr "아무도 죽을 필요 없어. 사히마가 신뢰의 표시로 원격 장치를 넘겨줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A9"
msgid "I will?"
msgstr "제가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358BD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
