msgid "I mean, of course I will."
msgstr "아니, 그, 당연하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: We're having a friendly chat, aren't we? |It's not my fault you don't find my offers acceptable.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: [Attack] Do it, Sahima. 
