#. TOPIC: 0104380F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0010A7"
msgid "You launch that virus, and I guarantee blood will spill."
msgstr "바이러스가 실행된다면, 피가 흐르게 될 거라고 장담하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is the Great Serpent's plan and no one is meant to die today. &&& Sahima: Only a heretic would be blind to the Great Serpent's work.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A6"
msgid "Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery."
msgstr "아... 내 눈은 잘 뜨여 있다. 이 배신 속에서 진실을 찾아내기가 어려울 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You attack, we launch the virus.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You attack, we launch the virus.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mihael: You don't think they're as prepared as we are?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358AD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A5"
msgid "You're so willing to sacrifice your allies at Shadow Station Epsilon?"
msgstr "그렇게도 비밀 기지 엡실론에 있는 동지들을 희생시키고 싶어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Do it, Sahima.  &&& Mihael: Prepare to be made dust.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A4"
msgid "Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye."
msgstr "이 제안이 위대한 뱀께서 세우신 계획의 일부일 수도 있어. 눈을 감아버리지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
