#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You're so willing to sacrifice your allies at Shadow Station Epsilon?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
