#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A3"
msgid "You attack, we launch the virus."
msgstr "우릴 공격한다면 바이러스가 실행될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] I've never been more sure. &&& Mihael: I'm going to enjoy this.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Unsuspecting or not, we're all willing to sacrifice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A2"
msgid "It's what you get. Your unsuspecting allies at Shadow Station Epsilon may appreciate it."
msgstr "장치를 넘겨주잖아. 아무것도 모르던 비밀 기지 엡실론 동지들이 감사해할 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Do it, Sahima.  &&& Mihael: Prepare to be made dust.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358B1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A1"
msgid "Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye."
msgstr "이 제안이 위대한 뱀께서 세우신 계획의 일부일 수도 있어. 눈을 감아버리지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No one here wants violence. You walk away, you get the device. &&& Mihael: A device that may well be a ploy? And for what?
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, but it's the death they know is possible.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0010A0"
msgid "Your Shadow Station allies know nothing of this. That's not the death they want."
msgstr "비밀 기지에 있는 네 동지들은 여기 일을 전혀 몰라. 이런 식으로 죽고 싶어하진 않을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sahima, launch the virus. It's impossible to reason with Zealots. &&& Sahima: Are you sure?  &&& Mihael: You launch that virus, and I guarantee blood will spill.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Give the Serpent my regards. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358AB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109F"
msgid "[Attack] That's what I'm hoping for."
msgstr "[공격] 내가 바라던 바야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You attack, we launch the virus. &&& Sahima: You're so willing to sacrifice your allies at Shadow Station Epsilon? &&& Mihael: You don't think they're as prepared as we are?|We all answer the call, and if that day is today, so be it.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm going to enjoy this.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109E"
msgid "[Attack] I've never been more sure."
msgstr "[공격] 이보다 더 확실했던 적이 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm the one putting an end to this negotiation. &&& ...  &&& Mihael: You realize how this may affect future partnerships, Razma. |You'd jeopardize our connections? &&& Razma: It jeopardizes nothing. It merely restores the natural order.  &&& Mihael: The natural order? I could take you all out, here and now. |You know every one of us is prepared to answer the Serpent's Call.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What's there to reconsider? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358A7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109D"
msgid "I'm giving you one more chance to reconsider."
msgstr "다시 생각해 볼 기회를 한 번 더 주겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps you'd trust the word of a House Va'ruun soldier. &&& companion: As much as our people may disagree, Jandar would see you sacrifice your life in direct service to the Great Serpent.|Both would  have you die cleansing the accursed and turning those who may listen to His shadow. |You know this to be true, Mihael. A true Promised lives only to serve, and your death today would serve nothing. &&& Mihael: Blessed sister, you speak truth. I have been blinded by pride, but your words have guided me back to the path.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmm. You may be newly Promised, but I can't deny how the pieces fit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109C"
msgid "I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will."
msgstr "난 사실을 말한 거야. 최근 일어난 사고들은 우연이 아니라고. 그분의 의지인 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: You mean do we think you'd throw away your life and the lives of everyone at Shadow Station Epsilon over your pride, Mihael?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109B"
msgid "Besides, you think I'd turn my back on the insults thrown here today?"
msgstr "그리고, 내가 오늘 받은 이 치욕을 두고 그냥 돌아갈 것 같으냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Being critical / Concerned / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Perhaps this offer is part of the Great Serpent's plan. Don't turn a blind eye. &&& Mihael: Oh my eyes are open. It's just hard to discern the truth through all the treachery. &&& Mihael: Besides, you think I'd turn my back on the insults thrown here today?
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00109A"
msgid "You mean do we think you'd throw away your life and the lives of everyone at Shadow Station Epsilon over your pride, Mihael?"
msgstr "그 말은 자존심 때문에 네 목숨이랑 비밀 기지 엡실론에 있는 사람들 목숨 전부를 내다 버리겠다는 거야, 미해일?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001099"
msgid "No, I for one don't think you will."
msgstr "네가 그렇게는 못 할 거라고 보는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps you'd trust the word of a House Va'ruun soldier.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001098"
msgid "And you can't deny our partnerships have been beneficial to us both."
msgstr "그리고 우리 협력 관계가 모두에게 이득이라는 점을 부정하진 못할 테고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No one has to die today. &&& Mihael: We'll see about that. &&& Mihael: Hmm. Perhaps you speak true after all.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And that day will come...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001097"
msgid "Enough lives have been lost. Live to fight another day."
msgstr "벌써 많은 목숨을 잃었어. 다시 싸울 날을 위해 살아 있어야 한다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You attack, we launch the virus.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You attack, we launch the virus. &&& Sahima: You're so willing to sacrifice your allies at Shadow Station Epsilon?
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 010358AC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001096"
msgid "You don't think they're as prepared as we are?"
msgstr "우리가 그 정도 각오도 못 했을 것 같으냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mihael: Hmm. You may be newly Promised, but I can't deny how the pieces fit.
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001095"
msgid "All right. I won't deny my bretheren the death they deserve, but I won't forget this either."
msgstr "좋다. 내 교우들이 받아 마땅한 죽음을 부정하지는 않겠지만, 이번 일도 잊지 않겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mihael
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMihaelDziri
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: Things have already changed, Mihael. From the moment you kidnapped House members. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103589B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001094"
msgid "Don't think this won't change anything, Razma."
msgstr "이번 일로 뭔가 변할 거라는 생각은 마라, 라즈마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Mihael
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I speak true. The latest events aren't coincidence. They are His will. &&& Mihael: Hmm. You may be newly Promised, but I can't deny how the pieces fit. &&& Mihael: All right. I won't deny my bretheren the death they deserve, but I won't forget this either. |Don't think this won't change anything, Razma.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035896
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001093"
msgid "Things have already changed, Mihael. From the moment you kidnapped House members."
msgstr "이미 많은 것이 변했어. 미해일. 네가 가문 사람들을 납치했던 그 순간부터."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Mihael
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01035896
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_3100_Razma_NegotiationsGoodScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001092"
msgid "These negotiations are over. Now leave us."
msgstr "협상은 이걸로 끝이야. 이제 떠나라."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: My brother and I don't like being around Dazra. Those vortex walls are terrifying!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_BusinessStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001090"
msgid "How did you get into business down here?"
msgstr "어떻게 여기서 장사를 하게 됐어요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into business down here?
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_BusinessStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00108F"
msgid "My brother and I don't like being around Dazra. Those vortex walls are terrifying!"
msgstr "저랑 제 동생은 다즈라 주변에 있는 걸 안 좋아해요. 저 볼텍스 벽은 끔찍하거든요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Sounds to me like you're just a coward.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_BusinessStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00108E"
msgid "How do you know you won't wake up one day and find yourself sawed in half!"
msgstr "어느 날 일어났는데 자신이 반으로 썰려 있는 걸 발견할지 어떻게 알겠어요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AE9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Trade
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001089"
msgid "Show me what you got."
msgstr "가진 거 보여주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into business down here? &&& Bartender: My brother and I don't like being around Dazra. Those vortex walls are terrifying!|How do you know you won't wake up one day and find yourself sawed in half!
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: Says the man who used to hide under the covers when Nani told us bedtime stories.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035ADB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_BusinessStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001083"
msgid "Sounds to me like you're just a coward."
msgstr "내 생각엔 넌 그냥 겁쟁이 같아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bartender: My brother and I don't like being around Dazra. Those vortex walls are terrifying!|How do you know you won't wake up one day and find yourself sawed in half! &&& BartenderBrother: Sounds to me like you're just a coward.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035ADA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_BusinessStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00107B"
msgid "Says the man who used to hide under the covers when Nani told us bedtime stories."
msgstr "나니가 우리에게 옛날이야기 해줄 때 이불 밑에 숨던 사람이 할 소리는 아닌데."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: Food, drinks, and groat meat! I guess that last one falls under food. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AD9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Inventory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00107A"
msgid "What do you have for inventory?"
msgstr "뭐가 있는데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you have for inventory?
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: BartenderBrother: Depends on the groat. Some are like chewing on cowhides.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AD8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Inventory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001079"
msgid "Food, drinks, and groat meat! I guess that last one falls under food."
msgstr "음식, 음료, 그리고 그로트 고기! 마지막 건 음식에 포함되긴 하네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Bartender
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you have for inventory? &&& Bartender: Food, drinks, and groat meat! I guess that last one falls under food. 
#. ALIAS: BartenderBrother
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale06
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Bartender: What my brother means to say is, groats are always delicious, and you should buy some.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AD7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Inventory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001078"
msgid "Depends on the groat. Some are like chewing on cowhides."
msgstr "그로트에 따라 다르지. 어떤 건 소가죽 씹는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Bartender: Food, drinks, and groat meat! I guess that last one falls under food.  &&& BartenderBrother: Depends on the groat. Some are like chewing on cowhides.
#. ALIAS: Bartender
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035AD6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL03_Bartender_Inventory
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001077"
msgid "What my brother means to say is, groats are always delicious, and you should buy some."
msgstr "제 동생이 말하고자 하는 건, 그로트는 언제나 맛있고, 좀 사야 한다는 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have heretic pamphlets for you.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_HereticPamphlets
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HereticPamphletsGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001069"
msgid "Let's hope this one is especially treasonous."
msgstr "이번엔 특히 심한 반역자였으면 좋겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have heretic pamphlets for you.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_HereticPamphlets
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HereticPamphletsGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001068"
msgid "Thanks! I can't get enough of this stuff."
msgstr "고마워! 이런 거 정말 좋아해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001067"
msgid "What's your poison?"
msgstr "뭘로 드릴까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001066"
msgid "Drinks for the thirsty."
msgstr "갈증엔 술이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001065"
msgid "You look like you're in need of some refreshment."
msgstr "뭔가 시원한 게 필요해 보이시는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale07
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_BartenderHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001064"
msgid "Let's cure that thirst of yours, shall we?"
msgstr "그 갈증을 해결해 드리지. 어때?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CaptainHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001063"
msgid "I don't know about all this healing through prayer stuff. Just give me a tub of ice, a cold drink, and I'm good."
msgstr "기도로 치유한다는 건 잘 모르겠어. 그냥 얼음통이랑 차가운 음료만 주면 난 괜찮아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CaptainHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001062"
msgid "Me and some of the other guard might play some cards later. Gonna be real expensive for them."
msgstr "나랑 다른 경비대원 몇몇이 나중에 카드 게임을 할 거야. 걔들한테는 아주 비싼 게임이 되겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CaptainHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001061"
msgid "I started painting pictures in my spare time. They're all of my wife, which would be flattering if I was actually good at it."
msgstr "여가 시간에 그림을 그리기 시작했어. 다 내 아내 그림인데, 내가 그림을 잘 그렸다면 감동적이었을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CaptainHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001060"
msgid "Some of the guard don't like being in this place. Say it's haunted. Well, if you see a ghost, tell 'em they're under arrest."
msgstr "몇몇 경비대원은 이 장소를 안 좋아해. 유령이 나온다고. 뭐, 유령을 보면 체포 대상이라고 전해줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Keyholder02: I am enervated, brother. Drink is the only vulnerary that heals me.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That would allow me more time with my spirits. But are you granted access to the shrine?
