#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001059"
msgid "If you have duties, then perhaps I can fulfill them."
msgstr "임무가 있다면, 제가 대신 수행할 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If you have duties, then perhaps I can fulfill them.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you have duties, then perhaps I can fulfill them.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
