#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001058"
msgid "That would allow me more time with my spirits. But are you granted access to the shrine?"
msgstr "그러면 제 영혼과 함께할 시간이 더 많아지겠군요. 그런데 당신은 성소에 들어갈 수 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] Killing you should be pretty simple then.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] Killing you should be pretty simple then.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01035207
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001057"
msgid "A child of Jarek! You will not leave here alive!"
msgstr "자렉의 아이다! 살아서 여길 나가진 못할 거다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Keyholder02: I am enervated, brother. Drink is the only vulnerary that heals me.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A child of Jarek! You will not leave here alive!
