#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001056"
msgid "[Attack] Killing you should be pretty simple then."
msgstr "[공격] 당신을 죽이는 건 꽤 간단할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Keyholder02: I am enervated, brother. Drink is the only vulnerary that heals me.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
