#. TOPIC: 01035206
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001055"
msgid "Meditation may also prove recuperative."
msgstr "명상도 회복에 도움이 될 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Meditation may also prove recuperative. &&& Keyholder02: A wise sermon. Yet I will need a fellow Promised to do my rounds. Here, if you may.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am sorry for questioning your faith. Take what is yours, Child of Jandar.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01035204
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001054"
msgid "As a Child of Jandar, I follow Jinan's true heir."
msgstr "잔다르의 아이로서, 저는 지난의 진정한 후계자를 따릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As a Child of Jandar, I follow Jinan's true heir.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As a Child of Jandar, I follow Jinan's true heir.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
