#. TOPIC: 01035203
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001053"
msgid "I am sorry for questioning your faith. Take what is yours, Child of Jandar."
msgstr "당신의 신앙을 의심해서 죄송합니다. 당신의 것을 가져가십시오, 잔다르의 아이여."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Meditation may also prove recuperative.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Meditation may also prove recuperative.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As a Child of Jandar, I follow Jinan's true heir.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01035205
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001052"
msgid "A wise sermon. Yet I will need a fellow Promised to do my rounds. Here, if you may."
msgstr "현명한 설교로군요. 하지만 제 일을 대신해 줄 약속받은 자가 필요합니다. 자, 여기, 당신이 해주시겠습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If you have duties, then perhaps I can fulfill them. &&& Keyholder02: That would allow me more time with my spirits. But are you granted access to the shrine?
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: False prophet! Die where you stand!
