#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001051"
msgid "I am a child of Jarek. The son that was chosen."
msgstr "저는 자렉의 아들입니다. 선택받은 아들이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am a child of Jarek. The son that was chosen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am a child of Jarek. The son that was chosen.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
