#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01035201
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001050"
msgid "False prophet! Die where you stand!"
msgstr "거짓 예언자여! 그 자리에서 죽어라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I could use a drink too. &&& Keyholder02: Then sit and join me in repose.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
