#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00104F"
msgid "I've been granted access."
msgstr "들어갈 수 있도록 허가받았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've been granted access.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been granted access.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Question
