#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00104E"
msgid "By whom? You speak lies upon the altar, pilgrim, you shall not be Promised."
msgstr "누구에게? 제단 위에서 거짓을 말하는구나, 순례자여. 너는 약속받은 자가 되지 못할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Keyholder02: I am enervated, brother. Drink is the only vulnerary that heals me.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then sit and join me in repose.
