#. TOPIC: 010351FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00104D"
msgid "I could use a drink too."
msgstr "저도 술 한 잔이 필요하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I could use a drink too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I could use a drink too.
#. ALIAS: Keyholder02
