#. TOPIC: 010351FD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_190_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00104C"
msgid "Then sit and join me in repose."
msgstr "그럼 앉아서 나와 함께 휴식을 취하십시오."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HellosArmiger
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00104B"
msgid "If you wish to speak to Brother Onamide, they are meditating in the shrine room."
msgstr "오나마이드 수도사와 대화하고 싶나? 성소에서 명상 중이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HellosArmiger
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00104A"
msgid "We did not trust the supplier at first, but they have earned the right to commune with the Children of Jandar."
msgstr "우리는 처음에 제공자를 믿지 않았지만, 제공자는 잔다르의 아이들과 교류할 권리를 따냈다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HellosArmiger
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001049"
msgid "Brother Onamide and the supplier want us to reunite with the heathens of Dazra."
msgstr "오나마이드 수도사와 제공자는 우리가 다즈라의 이교도들과 재결합하기를 원하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001048"
msgid "Here at Jandar's Rest we follow the true path. In the Shrouding only those who walk among us will become Promised."
msgstr "이곳 잔다르의 안식처에서 우리는 진정한 길을 따른다. 장막의 날에 우리와 함께 걷는 자만이 약속받은 자가 될 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001047"
msgid "The kingdom of the Promised is not open to apostates."
msgstr "약속받은 자의 왕국은 배교자에게 열려 있지 않다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001046"
msgid "Food, water, and respite. All is provided here at Jandar's Rest."
msgstr "음식, 물, 휴식. 이 모든 것이 이곳 잔다르의 안식처에서 제공되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001045"
msgid "The shrine is where we pray for the Shrouding."
msgstr "성소는 우리가 장막의 날을 위해 기도하는 곳이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001044"
msgid "Death shall rain upon the Accursed."
msgstr "저주받은 자들에게 죽음이 내릴 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001043"
msgid "We seek refuge here from the false followers of Jarek."
msgstr "우리는 자렉의 거짓 추종자들을 피해 이곳에 피난처를 마련했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001042"
msgid "When the Shrouding comes, all defilers will be made dust, even the Children of Jarek."
msgstr "장막의 날이 오면, 모든 모독자들은 먼지가 될 것이다. 자렉의 아이들조차도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001041"
msgid "The word of Jinan is spread through blade and tongue."
msgstr "지난 님의 말씀은 칼날과 혀를 통해 전파된다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Excited, not asking for permission when saying "Can I?" but more like saying "Can I? Of course I can" / Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about the history behind the name of this location?
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_JarekJandar
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001040"
msgid "Can I? I thought you'd never ask!"
msgstr "그래도 돼? 물어봐 줘서 정말 기뻐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_JarekJandar
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103F"
msgid "Jarek and Jandar are the two sons of Jinan Va'ruun. Jarek was the son chosen to become Speaker."
msgstr "자렉 님과 잔다르는 지난 바룬 님의 두 아드님이야. 자렉 님은 대변자로 선택받은 아드님이셨어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035281
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_JarekJandar
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103E"
msgid "Jandar was his twin brother, who tried to usurp the throne. He wed a bride from House Ma'leen, and the descendents of that house are the Zealots we know today."
msgstr ""
"잔다르는 자렉 님의 쌍둥이 형제로, 왕좌를 찬탈하려 했지. 잔다르는 마린 가문의 신부와 결혼했고, 그 가문의 후손들이 우리가 오늘날 알고 "
"있는 광신도들이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have heretic pamphlets for you.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035282
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_HereticPamphlets
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_HereticPamphletsGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103D"
msgid "Aha! I'm going to dig into this tonight!"
msgstr "아하! 오늘 밤 이걸 파헤쳐 봐야겠어!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scholar: Can I? I thought you'd never ask!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035280
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_JarekJandar
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103C"
msgid "Can you tell me more about the history behind the name of this location?"
msgstr "이 장소 이름 뒤에 숨겨진 역사에 대해 알려줄래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't help you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't help you.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103527F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103B"
msgid "Damn, I should've given you a better pitch! Ah well..."
msgstr "이런, 더 잘 설명했어야 했는데! 뭐..."

#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure, I have some right here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103527E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00103A"
msgid "Hey! If you find any weird heretic writings in your travels, can you send them my way? The weirder the better."
msgstr "이봐! 여행 중에 이상한 이단자 기록을 발견하면, 나한테 보내줄 수 있어? 이상할수록 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scholar: Hey! If you find any weird heretic writings in your travels, can you send them my way? The weirder the better.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can do slightly worse than market rate. But you'll be donating to a good cause! Education!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103527D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001039"
msgid "How much are you paying?"
msgstr "얼마나 지불할 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How much are you paying?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How much are you paying?
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scholar: Sure, I have some right here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103527C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001038"
msgid "I can do slightly worse than market rate. But you'll be donating to a good cause! Education!"
msgstr "시장 가격보다 약간 더 쳐줄 수 있어. 하지만 좋은 일에 기부하는 셈 치라고! 교육에!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scholar: Hey! If you find any weird heretic writings in your travels, can you send them my way? The weirder the better.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Wonderful! Let me know what you find!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103527B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001037"
msgid "I can keep an eye out for you."
msgstr "널 위해 찾아볼 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ukaru: Ugh.. I'm in need of a MedPack. Do you have one!?!?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ungh... curse my luck!
