#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001036"
msgid "I can't help you."
msgstr "도와드릴 수 없어요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035279
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_HereticPamphlets
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001035"
msgid "I have heretic pamphlets for you."
msgstr "이단자 소책자를 가져왔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What are you doing in Jarek's Rest?
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Study
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001034"
msgid "I'm a religious scholar, writing my thesis on Zealot ideology."
msgstr "난 종교 학자이고, 광신도 이념에 관한 논문을 쓰고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035278
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Study
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001033"
msgid "I'm absolutely FASCINATED by all the divergent sects and offshoots of Jinan's core teachings."
msgstr "난 지난의 핵심 가르침에서 갈라져 나온 모든 분파와 파생종에 완전히 매료되었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why do you want "weird" writings?
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_WhyWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001032"
msgid "Oh I just love strange things. Paranormal activity, alternate realities, lumpy pieces of fruit..."
msgstr "오 난 그냥 이상한 것들을 좋아해. 초자연적 현상, 다른 현실, 울퉁불퉁한 과일 조각들..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035277
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_WhyWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001031"
msgid "Normal heresy is boring. Give me the most outlandish, craziest theories you can find."
msgstr "평범한 이단은 지루해. 네가 찾을 수 있는 가장 별나고, 미친 이론들을 가져다줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scholar: Hey! If you find any weird heretic writings in your travels, can you send them my way? The weirder the better.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes! Let me see!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035276
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001030"
msgid "Sure, I have some right here."
msgstr "물론, 여기 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Scholar: Hey! If you find any weird heretic writings in your travels, can you send them my way? The weirder the better.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes! Let me see!
