msgid "Sorry, I don't have any heretic pamphlets."
msgstr "미안, 이단자 소책자는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's an example of how Jarek and Jandar's teachings differ?
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_ExampleOfWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00102E"
msgid "This isn't scripture, but Zealots believe the proof of Jandar's birthright is in the handling of the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "이건 경전은 아니지만, 광신도들은 잔다르의 타고난 권리에 대한 증거가 뱀의 성전군을 다루는 데 있다고 믿고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035275
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_ExampleOfWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00102D"
msgid "Jarek tried to make peace with the Settled Systems. Jandar wanted war. Turns out the apple doesn't fall far from the tree!"
msgstr "자렉 님은 개척 성계와 평화를 이루려 했지. 잔다르는 전쟁을 원했고. 역시 그 아버지에 그 아들이야!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scholar: I'm a religious scholar, writing my thesis on Zealot ideology.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035274
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Study
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00102C"
msgid "What are you doing in Jarek's Rest?"
msgstr "자렉의 안식처에서 뭘 하고 있어?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scholar: This isn't scripture, but Zealots believe the proof of Jandar's birthright is in the handling of the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035273
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_ExampleOfWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00102B"
msgid "What's an example of how Jarek and Jandar's teachings differ?"
msgstr "자렉 님과 잔다르의 가르침이 어떻게 다른지 예를 들어 줄 수 있어?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Scholar: Oh I just love strange things. Paranormal activity, alternate realities, lumpy pieces of fruit...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035272
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_WhyWeird
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00102A"
msgid "Why do you want \"weird\" writings?"
msgstr "왜 '이상한' 기록을 원해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can keep an eye out for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can keep an eye out for you.
#. ALIAS: Scholar
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
