#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001029"
msgid "Wonderful! Let me know what you find!"
msgstr "훌륭해! 찾은 거 있으면 알려줘!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, I have some right here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure, I have some right here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035270
