#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001028"
msgid "Yes! Let me see!"
msgstr "좋아! 어디 보자!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sure, I have some right here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sure, I have some right here.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 01035270
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL02_Scholar_Greet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001027"
msgid "But you'd sell them to me if you did, right? Right!"
msgstr "하지만 만약 있었다면 나한테 팔았겠지, 그렇지? 그렇지!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Herald: I did not choose the service. The service chose me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
