#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001026"
msgid "How did you become a Herald?"
msgstr "어떻게 전령이 되었어?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Herald: The cleansing of heretics and apostates is difficult work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351FA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001025"
msgid "Why perform services here?"
msgstr "왜 여기서 봉사하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a Herald?
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
