#. TOPIC: 010351FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001024"
msgid "I did not choose the service. The service chose me."
msgstr "내가 이 일을 선택한 게 아니야. 이 일이 날 선택했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001023"
msgid "I was but a youngling when I felt the beat of the Serpent's call against my breast."
msgstr "내가 뱀의 부름이 가슴에서 울리는 것을 느꼈을 때 난 어린아이에 불과했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't follow what you mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351FB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001022"
msgid "And from there my life's purpose was hatched."
msgstr "그리고 거기서 내 삶의 목적이 부화했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why perform services here?
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001021"
msgid "The cleansing of heretics and apostates is difficult work."
msgstr "이단자와 배교자를 정화하는 것은 힘든 일이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldPath
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001020"
msgid "Many of our Wardens return injured, and in need of aid. The Halls of Healing sent me here to provide that support."
msgstr "우리 교정관이 많이들 다쳐서 돌아오는데, 도움이 필요하지. 회복의 전당에서 그 지원을 제공하라고 날 여기 보냈어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a Herald? &&& Herald: I did not choose the service. The service chose me.|I was but a youngling when I felt the beat of the Serpent's call against my breast.|And from there my life's purpose was hatched.
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is a common tale, but no less impactful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101F"
msgid "Something must've happened beyond just a rapid heartbeat."
msgstr "단순히 심장이 빨리 뛰는 것 이상의 무슨 일이 있었던 게 틀림없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Something must've happened beyond just a rapid heartbeat.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something must've happened beyond just a rapid heartbeat.
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Herald: My cousin and I had been exploring a cavern much like this one, when the ground beneath us gave way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101E"
msgid "It is a common tale, but no less impactful."
msgstr "흔한 이야기지만, 그만큼 강렬하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a Herald? &&& Herald: I did not choose the service. The service chose me.|I was but a youngling when I felt the beat of the Serpent's call against my breast.|And from there my life's purpose was hatched.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then I shall explain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101D"
msgid "I don't follow what you mean."
msgstr "무슨 뜻인지 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't follow what you mean.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't follow what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Herald: My cousin and I had been exploring a cavern much like this one, when the ground beneath us gave way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101C"
msgid "Then I shall explain."
msgstr "그럼 내가 설명하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a Herald? &&& Herald: I did not choose the service. The service chose me.|I was but a youngling when I felt the beat of the Serpent's call against my breast.|And from there my life's purpose was hatched.
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hardly. When the Serpent speaks, it is with a clash of thunder and a hiss of lightning. But allow me to explain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101B"
msgid "It was probably just too much coffee."
msgstr "아마 그냥 커피를 너무 많이 마신 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was probably just too much coffee.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was probably just too much coffee.
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Herald: My cousin and I had been exploring a cavern much like this one, when the ground beneath us gave way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00101A"
msgid "Hardly. When the Serpent speaks, it is with a clash of thunder and a hiss of lightning. But allow me to explain."
msgstr "절대 그렇지 않아. 뱀께서 말씀하실 때는 천둥이 치고 번개가 번쩍이는 것과 같지. 하지만 설명을 허락해 주게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Herald: Then I shall explain.
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001019"
msgid "My cousin and I had been exploring a cavern much like this one, when the ground beneath us gave way."
msgstr "내 사촌과 나는 이와 비슷한 동굴을 탐험하고 있었는데, 우리 발밑의 땅이 무너져 내렸지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001018"
msgid "Their leg had snapped, and their screams would soon attract beasts of prey."
msgstr "사촌의 다리가 부러졌고, 사촌의 비명이 곧 맹수들을 불러들일 참이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001017"
msgid "But I remembered the words of my mother who in times of distress, would recite Jinan's word to her crying child."
msgstr "하지만 나는 고통의 순간에 우는 아이에게 지난의 말씀을 읊어주시던 어머니의 말씀을 기억했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Herald
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL_HeraldWhyHere
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001016"
msgid "I spoke the Hymn of the Serpent's tongue, and calmed my cousin. He walked home undisturbed, and I found my calling."
msgstr "나는 뱀의 혀의 찬송가를 읊었고, 내 사촌을 진정시켰어. 사촌은 방해받지 않고 집으로 걸어갔고, 나는 나의 소명을 발견했지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Captain: Depends if I can convince the brass that it's got potential. Otherwise it's *boom*, demolition time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001015"
msgid "What's the long term goal here? Are you looking to use it as a settlement?"
msgstr "여기서 장기적인 목표는 뭐야? 정착지로 사용할 생각이야?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Captain: Can't complain. When I heard they were sticking me in some musty old cavern at the ass end of Va'ruun'kai, I had half a mind just to retire.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityGeneral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001014"
msgid "How are you liking being stationed here?"
msgstr "여기 주둔하는 건 어때?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's the long term goal here? Are you looking to use it as a settlement?
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001013"
msgid "Depends if I can convince the brass that it's got potential. Otherwise it's *boom*, demolition time."
msgstr "윗분들에게 잠재력이 있다고 설득할 수 있느냐에 달렸지. 아니면, '펑', 철거 시간이 되는 거고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001012"
msgid "Real shame though. I wouldn't mind bringing the Missus here for our anniversary."
msgstr "정말 아쉽지. 우리 기념일에 아내를 여기 데려오고 싶었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityFuture
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001011"
msgid "It's either the twentieth or the nineteenth, still gotta work that out. The year, not the date. I think."
msgstr "20주년인지 19주년인지, 아직도 헷갈려. 날짜가 아니라, 연도 말이야. 아마도."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Captain: You mean like, are we finding any Zealots under the beds? Not a one. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityCleanUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001010"
msgid "How goes the clean up? Any interesting finds?"
msgstr "정리는 잘 돼가? 뭐 흥미로운 거라도 발견했어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you liking being stationed here?
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityGeneral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100F"
msgid "Can't complain. When I heard they were sticking me in some musty old cavern at the ass end of Va'ruun'kai, I had half a mind just to retire."
msgstr "불만은 없어. 바룬카이 끄트머리에 있는 퀴퀴한 동굴에 처박힌다는 소식을 들었을 때, 은퇴할까 하는 생각도 했었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityGeneral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100E"
msgid "But then I get here and I'm like, holy shite! This is better than any holiday retreat I've ever set me half-blind eyes upon!"
msgstr "그런데 여기 와보니, 세상에! 내가 반쯤 먼 눈으로 본 어떤 휴양지보다도 여기가 더 좋은 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityGeneral
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100D"
msgid "So now I'm trying to figure out a way to get stationed here full time."
msgstr "그래서 지금은 여기에 정식으로 주둔할 방법을 찾고 있는 중이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How goes the clean up? Any interesting finds?
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityCleanUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100C"
msgid "You mean like, are we finding any Zealots under the beds? Not a one."
msgstr "그러니까, 우리가 침대 밑에서 광신도를 발견했냐는 말이야? 한 놈도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityCleanUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100B"
msgid "Well, at least under my bed there ain't. Check it twice every night before I sleep."
msgstr "음, 적어도 내 침대 밑에는 없지. 자기 전에 매일 밤 두 번씩 확인하거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityCleanUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00100A"
msgid "Of course, there were a few that came to the cavern not knowing it was under new management."
msgstr "물론, 새 주인이 들어선 줄 모르고 동굴에 찾아온 놈들이 몇몇 있었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Captain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_TL01_SecurityCleanUp
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001009"
msgid "We made 'em dust before they even could pray to Jinan to save 'em."
msgstr "우린 그놈들이 지난에게 구해달라고 기도하기도 전에 먼지로 만들어 버렸어."

#. ALIAS: Intercom
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGuardMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 010351F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Post_Entrance
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01035297
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "001008"
msgid "Welcome back, Harbinger."
msgstr "잘 돌아왔다. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HeraldHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001007"
msgid "What ails you, child?"
msgstr "무엇이 아픈가, 아이야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HeraldHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001006"
msgid "How can we be of service, disciple of Jinan?"
msgstr "우리가 어떻게 봉사할 수 있을까, 지난의 제자여?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HeraldHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001005"
msgid "We provide healing for the body and mind."
msgstr "우리는 몸과 마음의 치유를 제공한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001004"
msgid "I don't mind being posted here. I like it better than Dazra."
msgstr "난 여기 배치되는 거 괜찮아. 다즈라보다 여기가 더 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001003"
msgid "I can still smell the stink of Zealots here."
msgstr "여기서 아직도 광신도들의 악취가 나는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001002"
msgid "We'll use this as a base of operations for now."
msgstr "우린 당분간 이곳을 작전 기지로 사용할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001001"
msgid "If any \"Children of Jandar\" show up here, we'll be ready."
msgstr "만약 '잔다르의 자식들'이 여기 나타나면, 우린 준비가 되어 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_HellosJandarsRest
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "001000"
msgid "I don't mind being posted here. I like it better than Dazra."
msgstr "난 여기 배치되는 거 괜찮아. 다즈라보다 여기가 더 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_ScholarHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000FFF"
msgid "I'm going to study all night and then get drunk."
msgstr "난 밤새 공부하고 술에 취할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_ScholarHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000FFE"
msgid "I'd love to interview a Zealot who lived here. Too bad they're all dead."
msgstr "여기 살았던 광신도와 인터뷰하고 싶어. 다 죽어서 유감이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_ScholarHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000FFD"
msgid "I bet the living quarters has a diary or two I can examine."
msgstr "분명 생활 구역에 내가 조사할 일기 한두 개는 있을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericFemale02
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_Post
#. TOPIC: 0103520B
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_ScholarHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000FFC"
msgid "It's remarkable what the Zealots achieved here despite being complete lunatics."
msgstr "완전 미친 놈들이면서도, 여기서 광신도 무리가 벌인 일은 정말 놀랍네요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "000FF6"
msgid "We cast the accursed into the shadows."
msgstr "저주받은 자들을 그림자로 몰아냈어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Jinan Va'ruun himself slept among them in these shelters. It was here that he spread the Word of the Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF5"
msgid "The people of House Va'ruun settled this world, at first in these very caves."
msgstr "이 행성에 정착한 바룬 가문 신민들은 제일 처음 바로 이 동굴에 자리 잡았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The people of House Va'ruun settled this world, at first in these very caves.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It was here that the people of House Va'ruun first understood the truth of their place in the universe.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E8
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF4"
msgid "Jinan Va'ruun himself slept among them in these shelters. It was here that he spread the Word of the Serpent."
msgstr "그 지난 바룬께서도 이 피난처에서 함께 잠을 청하셨다. 바로 이곳에서 위대한 뱀의 말씀을 전파하셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Jinan Va'ruun himself slept among them in these shelters. It was here that he spread the Word of the Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF3"
msgid "It was here that the people of House Va'ruun first understood the truth of their place in the universe."
msgstr "바로 이곳에서 바룬 가문 신민들은 자신의 우주 속 자리에 대한 진리를 처음으로 이해하였다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): He will encircle the universe He created, and all those who do not follow will be cast into Shadow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF2"
msgid "And it was here that the people of House Va'ruun first understood the truth of the Shrouding, the Great Serpent's return."
msgstr "그리고 바로 이곳에서 바룬 가문 신민들은 위대한 뱀께서 돌아오실 장막의 날에 대한 진리를 처음으로 이해하였다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And it was here that the people of House Va'ruun first understood the truth of the Shrouding, the Great Serpent's return.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And the people weighed this knowledge against their former lives, and saw how they had been blessed despite the difficult new life that awaited them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF1"
msgid "He will encircle the universe He created, and all those who do not follow will be cast into Shadow."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 스스로 창조하신 우주를 둘러쌀 것이며, 따르지 않는 이들은 그림자 속에 던져지리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): He will encircle the universe He created, and all those who do not follow will be cast into Shadow.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You, too, would do well to feel that solace amidst the pain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage640_CaveScene04b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FF0"
msgid "And the people weighed this knowledge against their former lives, and saw how they had been blessed despite the difficult new life that awaited them."
msgstr "사람들은 이 지식을 예전의 삶과 비교해 보았고, 앞으로 있을 새로운 삶이 고단할 것임에도 자신들이 얼마나 축복받았는지 깨달았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You may now follow in their footsteps, and take that same leap. Embrace the Great Serpent, and He will embrace you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage630_CaveScene03a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FEF"
msgid "The people's hopes and fears and dreams were entrusted to the Great Serpent. They made the leap of faith that brought House Va'ruun to greatness."
msgstr "사람들의 희망과 두려움과 꿈이 위대한 뱀께 맡겨졌다. 사람들이 이루어낸 신뢰의 도약으로 인해 바룬 가문은 위대해졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): The people's hopes and fears and dreams were entrusted to the Great Serpent. They made the leap of faith that brought House Va'ruun to greatness.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage630_CaveScene03a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FEE"
msgid "You may now follow in their footsteps, and take that same leap. Embrace the Great Serpent, and He will embrace you."
msgstr "이제 너도 그 발자취를 따르고 있으니, 똑같은 도약을 이루어내라. 위대한 뱀의 품에 안기면, 뱀께서도 널 감싸 주실 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): They represent different aspects of House Va'ruun's connection to the Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338DE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage690_RitualScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FED"
msgid "Pick the two that call to you. Place them on the altars, offerings to the Great Serpent, that He may fill you with His spirit, and make you Promised."
msgstr ""
"마음에 드는 두 성상을 골라라. 골라서 제단에 놓아 위대한 뱀께 바치면, 그분께서 너를 뱀의 영혼으로 채워 주시고, 너를 약속받은 자로 "
"만들어 주시리라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): To solidify this bond, you are presented with a simple choice: Before you on the dais are several items.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Pick the two that call to you. Place them on the altars, offerings to the Great Serpent, that He may fill you with His spirit, and make you Promised.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338DF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage690_RitualScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FEC"
msgid "They represent different aspects of House Va'ruun's connection to the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그 물건들은 위대한 뱀과 연결된 바룬 가문의 다양한 측면을 상징한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): While none since Jinan Va'ruun have stood before the Great Serpent, we can all feel His presence.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): They represent different aspects of House Va'ruun's connection to the Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage690_RitualScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FEB"
msgid "To solidify this bond, you are presented with a simple choice: Before you on the dais are several items."
msgstr "그 유대를 강화할 수 있는 간단한 선택지를 주겠다. 앞에 있는 연단에 몇 가지 물건이 놓여 있을 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Let us begin the final ritual.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): To solidify this bond, you are presented with a simple choice: Before you on the dais are several items.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 010338E1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage690_RitualScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FEA"
msgid "While none since Jinan Va'ruun have stood before the Great Serpent, we can all feel His presence."
msgstr "지난 바룬 이후로 위대한 뱀 앞에 선 이는 아무도 없었지만, 우리 모두는 그분의 존재를 느낄 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Intercom
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotFemale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: <Alias=Player>.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01034EAD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_180_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FE9"
msgid "What is thy name, Pilgrim?"
msgstr "순례자여, 그대의 이름은 무엇인가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
