msgctxt "000FBE"
msgid "And when it comes time to act, it is we who are most prepared."
msgstr "그리고 행동해야 할 때가 오면, 가장 준비된 건 바로 우리입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks. &&& Ukaru: You are most welcome. &&& Ukaru: I'll stay here until the coast is clear. Lots of Zealots still about.|After? I think it's best I disappear. Better they think I'm playing cards with the Great Serpent than with their secrets.|Not even my cousins in House Dul'kehf can know. Agreed?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then dead I shall be! Long live the new Ukaru!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335BD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FAC"
msgid "Agreed. It's safer if they think you're dead."
msgstr "동의합니다. 당신이 죽었다고 녀석들이 생각하도록 만드는 게 더 안전합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Agreed. It's safer if they think you're dead.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Agreed. It's safer if they think you're dead.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: Oh, one more thing!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335BC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FAB"
msgid "Then dead I shall be! Long live the new Ukaru!"
msgstr "그렇다면 저는 죽은척할 겁니다! 새로운 우카루 만수무강하소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335BB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FAA"
msgid "After? I think it's best I disappear. Better they think I'm playing cards with the Great Serpent than with their secrets."
msgstr ""
"그 후에는요? 사라지는 게 가장 좋을 거 같습니다. 제가 녀석들의 비밀을 가지고 논다고 녀석들이 생각하는 것보단, 위대한 뱀과 카드놀이를 "
"하고 있다고 생각하는 게 나으니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Agreed. It's safer if they think you're dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335BB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "000FA9"
msgid "Not even my cousins in House Dul'kehf can know. Agreed?"
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 제 사촌들조차 모를 겁니다. 맞죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks. &&& Ukaru: You are most welcome. &&& Ukaru: I'll stay here until the coast is clear. Lots of Zealots still about.|After? I think it's best I disappear. Better they think I'm playing cards with the Great Serpent than with their secrets.|Not even my cousins in House Dul'kehf can know. Agreed?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, don't do that! She is trustworthy, I think, but better for her safety and mine if she doesn't know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335BA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA8"
msgid "I should at the very least tell Qisrani."
msgstr "최소한 키스라니에게는 알려야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: Ungh... I fear... *gasp* this is the end...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Scene_Announcement_DeathTimer
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA7"
msgid "Agggh... I can't hold on much longer! You must find a MedPack!"
msgstr "으윽... 더 이상 버틸 수 없어! 메디 팩을 찾아야 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I should at the very least tell Qisrani.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I should at the very least tell Qisrani.
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: Oh, one more thing!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA6"
msgid "No, don't do that! She is trustworthy, I think, but better for her safety and mine if she doesn't know."
msgstr "안 돼요! 그러지 마세요! 신뢰할 만은 하지만, 그냥 모르는 게 키스라니와 저의 안전에 더 낫습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ukaru: Agggh... I can't hold on much longer! You must find a MedPack!
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Scene_Announcement_DeathTimer
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA5"
msgid "Ungh... I fear... *gasp* this is the end..."
msgstr "윽... 내 생각엔... *숨막힘* 이게 끝인 것 같아..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks. &&& Ukaru: You are most welcome. &&& Ukaru: I'll stay here until the coast is clear. Lots of Zealots still about.|After? I think it's best I disappear. Better they think I'm playing cards with the Great Serpent than with their secrets.|Not even my cousins in House Dul'kehf can know. Agreed?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Somewhere off world. Smuggle myself out, maybe? There's only so many places in Dazra to hide.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA4"
msgid "Where will you go?"
msgstr "어디로 가실 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will you go?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where will you go?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Nervous
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA3"
msgid "Somewhere off world. Smuggle myself out, maybe? There's only so many places in Dazra to hide."
msgstr "외부 세계 어딘가로요. 밀항하게 되겠죠? 다즈라에는 숨을 곳이 너무 적습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will you go?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA2"
msgid "The haystack is much bigger out there, in space. Easy for needles to get lost."
msgstr "바깥의 우주에 있는 건초 더미가 훨씬 더 크죠. 바늘 찾기가 더 어려울 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will you go?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: Agreed. It's safer if they think you're dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA1"
msgid "And think of the irony! This time, it's a good thing that the shipment is getting lost!"
msgstr "그리고 역설적이죠! 이번에는 선적물이 분실되는 게 좋으니까요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Ukaru: Very much so! But decorum aside, we should brass the tacks, no?
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000FA0"
msgid "So you are here, picking up where I left off, yes? Here. This log should come in handy."
msgstr "그래서 당신이 여기 왔고, 제 뒤처리를 하고 계신 거군요? 그렇죠? 여기 있습니다. 이 기록이 도움이 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [MedPack] I've got one here. &&& Ukaru: The Shrouding bless you! &&& Ukaru: Hrmm... I am already starting to feel the effects! A thousand and one thank yous, just for you, starting with this one! |Thank you very, very much!
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Aha! I thought as much!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9F"
msgid "I need information on the missing supplies."
msgstr "사라진 물자에 대한 정보가 필요합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need information on the missing supplies.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need information on the missing supplies.
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: So you are here, picking up where I left off, yes? Here. This log should come in handy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9E"
msgid "Aha! I thought as much!"
msgstr "아하! 제가 생각했던 대로군요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Please, just shut up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Please, just shut up.
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: So you are here, picking up where I left off, yes? Here. This log should come in handy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9D"
msgid "Oh! Pardon my loquaciousness! The point, we shall get to."
msgstr "오! 수다스러운 절 용서해 주세요! 요점은, 곧 말씀드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [MedPack] I've got one here. &&& Ukaru: The Shrouding bless you! &&& Ukaru: Hrmm... I am already starting to feel the effects! A thousand and one thank yous, just for you, starting with this one! |Thank you very, very much!
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh! Pardon my loquaciousness! The point, we shall get to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010335B1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9C"
msgid "Please, just shut up."
msgstr "제발, 그냥 입 다무세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't help you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't help you.
#. ALIAS: Ukaru
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: Hrmm... I am already starting to feel the effects! A thousand and one thank yous, just for you, starting with this one! 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030CB3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9B"
msgid "Ungh... curse my luck!"
msgstr "으... 운이 겁나 험하네요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're welcome.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're welcome.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Ukaru: So you are here, picking up where I left off, yes? Here. This log should come in handy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030CB2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_050_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F9A"
msgid "Very much so! But decorum aside, we should brass the tacks, no?"
msgstr "정말 천만이네요! 하지만 예의는 제쳐두고, 본론으로 들어가야겠죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033778
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F79"
msgid "I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House."
msgstr "대의회에서 사히마 문제에 대한 답을 기다리는 건 알지만, 사실... 사히마는 납치당했어. 다른 가문 구성원들도 그렇고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033778
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F78"
msgid "They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations."
msgstr "인질로 잡혀 있는 거지. 광신도들 짓이야. 지금은 그놈들이 협상을 요구하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right when it comes to trust, but I don't believe the negotiations are a trap.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033777
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F77"
msgid "You can't trust the Zealots. Negotiations could be a trap."
msgstr "광신도를 믿으면 안 돼요. 협상은 아마 함정일걸요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Perhaps the Zealots you know, but they were once a part of Va'ruun society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033775
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F76"
msgid "Zealots don't negotiate. They kill on sight."
msgstr "광신도들은 협상하지 않아요. 눈에 보이는 대로 죽여대죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As much as I'd welcome the expertise, the Zealots would never allow an outsider to participate. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033773
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F75"
msgid "Negotiations are my speciality."
msgstr "협상이라면 제 전문이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will. &&& Razma: Impressive. I see now why you must have been chosen. &&& Razma: I know the Council is looking to Sahima for answers, but the truth is, she's been taken, along with other members of the House.|They're being held hostage. By Zealots. And now, they're demanding negotiations. &&& companion: This is a major overreach. I have never known the Zealots to be so bold.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because right now this situation is a matter for the Ministry of Conjunction.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033771
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F74"
msgid "Why not just tell the High Council?"
msgstr "왜 대의회한테 말해주지 않는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I suppose this looks very black and white to you. If only that were the case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F71"
msgid "I fail to see what's so complicated. People's lives are at stake."
msgstr "뭐가 복잡하다는 건지 모르겠네요. 사람들 목숨이 위험한데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent guides me. This is more than coincidence. This is fate itself. &&& Razma: Yes, it does seem more than mere coincidence, doesn't it? But there's still one unanswered question. &&& Razma: I don't know where the Zealots are keeping Sahima, but I have a good idea who does.|Their name is Mirek. Mirek is a Ka'dic, and they also work for me as an agent in the Ministry of Conjunction. |This is where matters get... complicated.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you can put those skills to good use.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103376C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F70"
msgid "Nothing complicated for me. I can make them talk."
msgstr "저한테 복잡한 문제는 없죠. 입 열게 만들 수 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mirek pronounced MEER-ek / Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: How would you --? |I'm beginning to see why the Great Serpent chose you.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F6E"
msgid "As I said, Mirek works for me in the Ministry of Conjuction. They've been establishing an inside relationship with the Zealots for some time now on my orders."
msgstr ""
"아까도 말했지만, 미어렉은 결합성에서 날 위해 일하고 있어. 얼마 전부터 광신도들과 내부 관계를 맺어왔지. 내 명령을 받고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033768
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0110_Razma_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F6D"
msgid "Forcing them to give up the information could jeopardize all they've worked for, so don't expect them to be forthcoming."
msgstr "억지로 정보를 내놓게 만들면 그 작업이 위태로워질 수가 있으니, 정보를 쉽게 말해줄 거라는 기대는 하지 않는 게 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Once again...
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Excuse me? What? And why would someone like me even know that sort of information? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033767
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F6C"
msgid "I need to know where the Zealots are holding Sahima hostage."
msgstr "광신도들이 사히마를 인질로 잡아놓은 장소를 알아야 하는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Condescending, generally acting superior. / Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mirek: I was told you know where the Zealots have taken Sahima.
