#. TOPIC: 01033766
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F6B"
msgid "You're no member of House Ka'dic. What are you doing here?"
msgstr "넌 카딕 가문 소속이 아니잖아. 여기서 뭐 하는 건데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Once again...
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And you are?
