#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F69"
msgid "Excuse me? What? And why would someone like me even know that sort of information?"
msgstr "저기, 잠깐? 뭐라고? 그리고 나 같은 놈이 그런 정보를 어떻게 알고 있겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: Once again...
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, so you're the heretic turned Harbinger who thinks they're one of us now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033761
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F67"
msgid "I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun."
msgstr "내가 카딕 가문 소속은 아니지만, 아나스코 바룬과 소통할 수 있는 유일한 사람이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mirek: On the contrary, I know how important it is to keep that information confidential.
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033762
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F66"
msgid "I've worked hard to obtain my position with the Zealots."
msgstr "난 광신도들 사이에 자리 잡느라고 엄청나게 고생했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mirek
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXMirekKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033762
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0200_Mirek_IntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F65"
msgid "And like I've told Razma a thousand times, I have no reason to believe they're going to hurt my dear cousins, especially Sahima."
msgstr ""
"그리고 라즈마 이모님한테도 몇 번을 말했지만, 그놈들이 우리 소중한 친척들을 해칠 이유가 전혀 없단 말이야. 사히마는 특히 더 그렇고."

