#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F63"
msgid "Oh, so you're the heretic turned Harbinger who thinks they're one of us now."
msgstr "아, 선구자가 됐다고 우리 일원인 줄 안다는 이단자가 바로 너로군 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I may not be House Ka'dic, but I'm the only one here that's communicating with Anasko Va'ruun.
