msgctxt "000F48"
msgid "Razma will know it. Let her tell you the details, seeing as how I'm about to be reassigned."
msgstr "라즈마 이모님이 알 거야. 자세한 내용은 가서 듣도록 해. 나는 곧 재배치될 것 같으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Like I said...
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah yes, the old Va'ruun military outpost. It's a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033744
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F46"
msgid "The hostages are being held at Shadow Station Epsilon."
msgstr "인질들은 비밀 기지 엡실론에 붙잡혀 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll head there right away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033740
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F45"
msgid "If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates."
msgstr "내 정보가 정확하다면, 비밀 기지 엡실론은 다즈라 북쪽에 있는 불모지에 있을 거야. 좌표를 보내주도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB3E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Generic_SpaceshipCrewDockingComplete
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceShipCrewDockingComplete
msgctxt "000F44"
msgid "We're docked, Captain."
msgstr "도킹했습니다. 선장님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon. &&& Razma: Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time. &&& Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If anything happens to the hostages, they will lose a lot more than leverage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103373B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F43"
msgid "Those Zealots are about to lose their leverage."
msgstr "그 광신도놈들이 곧 협상 수단을 잃게 되겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent. &&& Djimal: An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless.  &&& Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.|They're a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade. Days we'd like to forget.|Has my dear sister given you any history on our House's relations with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033738
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F42"
msgid "Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots."
msgstr "라즈마는 미어렉이 광신도와 관계를 맺는 작업을 진행하고 있다더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent. &&& Djimal: An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless.  &&& Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.|They're a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade. Days we'd like to forget.|Has my dear sister given you any history on our House's relations with the Zealots?
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm glad to see you're well versed in humanity.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033736
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F41"
msgid "Someone withholding information. What a surprise."
msgstr "누군가 정보를 통제하고 있군요. 놀랍기도 해라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was as I predicted. Shadow Station Epsilon. &&& Razma: Fascinating. I'd be interested in how you came to know about these stations, but that's a conversation for another time. &&& Razma: If my intel is correct, you can find Shadow Station Epsilon in the badlands, north of Dazra. I can send you the coordinates.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The sooner the better. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103373D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F40"
msgid "I'll head there right away."
msgstr "바로 가보도록 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033734
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F3F"
msgid "Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions."
msgstr "라즈마 형님은 광신도를 계속 감시하려는 거라고 믿게 만들 거예요. 대의회가 정보를 가지고 결정을 내릴 수 있게 한다는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033734
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F3E"
msgid "That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence."
msgstr "바로 그게 라즈마 형님이 대의회에 알리지 않은 진짜 이유고, 나는 침묵하기로 맹세했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: The sooner the better.  &&& companion: We will do whatever is necessary to bring Sahima and the others back safely.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Razma: I expect them to be pliable after their last encounter with you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033739
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0400_Razma_LocationScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F3D"
msgid "Now that we have a rescue mission underway, I'll speak to Mirek about setting up the negotiations."
msgstr "이제 구출 작전이 진행중이니까, 난 미어렉과 협상 진행 문제를 다시 말해봐야겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale02
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_GenericCrew
#. TOPIC: 0103DB3E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Generic_SpaceshipCrewDockingComplete
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SpaceShipCrewDockingComplete
msgctxt "000F3C"
msgid "We're all clear to open the outer hatch."
msgstr "외부 해치를 열어도 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: And that's what I wish to speak to you about.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033733
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F3B"
msgid "House Ka'dic shouldn't be associating with Zealots at all, except on an extermination level."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 멸망할 수준을 제외한다면 광신도와 연관돼서는 안 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033733
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F3A"
msgid "But worse, we absolutely cannot be supplying them with ordnance of any kind."
msgstr "그리고 더 나아가서, 어떤 종류의 군수품이라도 공급해서는 절대 안 되죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033733
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F39"
msgid "We need to cut ties with the Zealots altogether."
msgstr "광신도와 관계를 완전히 끊어야 해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence. &&& companion: I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Does it? I'd be curious to know what you've discussed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033731
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F38"
msgid "That explains a lot."
msgstr "많은 것들이 설명되는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033732
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F37"
msgid "Tell me, Harbinger. What do you know about the Zealots?"
msgstr "말해 봐요, 선구자. 광신도에 대해서 뭘 알고 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Like I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033730
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F36"
msgid "Religious fanatics who kill those that don't follow the Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀을 따르지 않는 사람은 전부 죽이는 종교 미치광이들이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Like I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How magnanimous.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F35"
msgid "I try not to judge people."
msgstr "사람을 판단하지는 않으려고 합니다만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots. &&& Djimal: I'm surprised she even mentioned that much. &&& Djimal: Razma would have everyone believe she only wishes to keep an eye on the Zealots, so the Council can make informed decisions.|The truth is, she's had this particular group of Zealots under her thumb for quite some time. This is only a problem now because she's lost control.|That is the real reason why Razma hasn't informed the High Council, and I'm sworn to silence. &&& companion: I would argue that what you describe would be considered treason. And rightly so.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As a member, I can say it certainly is not.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103372E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F34"
msgid "I'm sure that's something the High Council wouldn't be too keen on."
msgstr "대의회가 그렇게 신경을 쓰지는 않는 모양이네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But I'm going to find Sahima so Razma can take back control. &&& Djimal: And that's what I wish to speak to you about. &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic shouldn't be associating with Zealots at all, except on an extermination level.|But worse, we absolutely cannot be supplying them with ordnance of any kind.|We need to cut ties with the Zealots altogether. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: How astute.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F33"
msgid "And you expect me to do something about it."
msgstr "내가 뭔가 해 주길 바라는 거군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: Like I was saying...
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, much like any murderer or terrorist.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033728
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F32"
msgid "I believe they're misunderstood."
msgstr "난 광신도들이 오해받고 있다고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: An oversimplified observation, but correct nonetheless. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F31"
msgid "The Zealots are widely frowned upon within our society."
msgstr "광신도들은 우리 사회에서 여러모로 눈살을 찌푸리게 만들죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F30"
msgid "They're a remnant of the Serpent's Crusade. Days we'd like to forget."
msgstr "뱀의 성전이 남긴 잔재예요. 우리가 잊으려 하는 시절 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Razma said Mirek is working on establishing a relationship with the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033723
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2F"
msgid "Has my dear sister given you any history on our House's relations with the Zealots?"
msgstr "우리 친애하는 형님께서 우리 가문과 광신도들 사이에 얽힌 사연을 말해줬나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: How astute.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2E"
msgid "I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots."
msgstr "당신이 카딕 가문과 광신도 사이의 연결고리를 끊어 주면 좋겠어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2D"
msgid "And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear."
msgstr "그리고 내 입장상 직설적으로 말하면 안 되겠지만, 그래도 확실히 말해두죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2C"
msgid "Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties."
msgstr "인질들이 살아남지 못한다면, 라즈마 형님이 광신도를 비난하고 관계를 끊을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: But I'm going to find Sahima so Razma can take back control. &&& Djimal: And that's what I wish to speak to you about. &&& Djimal: House Ka'dic shouldn't be associating with Zealots at all, except on an extermination level.|But worse, we absolutely cannot be supplying them with ordnance of any kind.|We need to cut ties with the Zealots altogether. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exposing this information to the Council would condemn not only Razma, but House Ka'dic along with her. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033726
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2B"
msgid "Why not tell the Council and have them put a stop to it?"
msgstr "대의회에 알려서 관계를 끊도록 하는 게 어때요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties. &&& companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm doing what I must to preserve this House.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 01033721
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F2A"
msgid "You're condoning the murder of your own family."
msgstr "자기 가문 사람들을 죽이는 걸 묵인하고 있군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And you expect me to do something about it. &&& Djimal: How astute. &&& Djimal: I want you to put an end to any connections between House Ka'dic and the Zealots. |And while my position won't allow me to be blunt, I'll still make it clear.|Should the hostages not survive, Razma would blame the Zealots and cut all ties. &&& companion: House Ka'dic would go to any lengths, it seems.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What we need is Sahima's research... which she has with her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F29"
msgid "I thought we need Sahima alive."
msgstr "사히마가 살아 있어야 하는 줄 알았는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I thought we need Sahima alive. &&& Djimal: What we need is Sahima's research... which she has with her.|You just need to bring it back.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see I misjudged you. How unfortunate for us all.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F28"
msgid "No way I'm doing your dirty work."
msgstr "그런 더러운 일은 절대 안 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is killing your own family any better than what Razma is doing? &&& Djimal: Those few lives will be nothing compared to the lives the Zealots will take if House Ka'dic continues to supply them.|Sacrificing them would open my sister's eyes, quelling any sympathy and desire to work with the Zealots.|Once Razma no longer sees the Zealots as an ally, the rest will soon follow. 
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A wise decision, Harbinger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ03
#. TOPIC: 0103371A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0500_Djimal_AlternativeScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F27"
msgid "Fine, but only because no one should work with Zealots."
msgstr "좋아요. 하지만 그 누구도 광신도와 협력해선 안 되기 때문에 도와주는 겁니다."

