msgstr "[<Global=SFBGS001_MQ03_DjimalPayment> 크레딧 요구] 크레딧을 보여주면 거래 성사인 걸로 하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Djimal: I trust you'll make the right decision. Until then, I'll see you at the negotiations.
#. ALIAS: Djimal
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFDjimalKadic
#. FACE: Confident
