#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Well, it's also an... honor, to meet one as interesting as yourself.
#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, it's not for us to question the Great Serpent's will.
