#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F1D"
msgid "Please, Djimal. Don't you see how this all works in our favor? It's not up for discussion."
msgstr "왜 이래, 지말. 우리가 입은 은혜가 어떻게 통하는지 봤잖아? 논의할 문제가 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Djimal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Razma: Please, Djimal. Don't you see how this all works in our favor? It's not up for discussion. |I won't risk what we've worked so hard to achieve. It's done. &&& Djimal: No, you'd risk our future and reputation as a House, but you are the chosen Elder.
