#. ALIAS: Razma
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFRazmaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Djimal: I guarantee I'm not missing much, but you're right. I'll be heading back soon enough.
