#. TOPIC: 01030C36
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ03_0100_Razma_PreIntroScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000F1A"
msgid "And shouldn't you get back to the Council? We can't afford to be absent at a time like this."
msgstr "그리고 대의회로 돌아가야 하는 거 아니야? 이럴 때 자리를 비우면 안 될 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: No way I'm doing your dirty work. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: No way I'm doing your dirty work. 
