#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000EEA"
msgid "Well, any additional evidence is always helpful. Let's have a look."
msgstr "뭐, 추가 증거는 언제나 도움이 되니까요. 한번 보죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102EE6F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000EE9"
msgid "And if it takes this supply issue to be resolved for us to address the personnel problem, so be it."
msgstr "그리고 이 물자 문제가 해결되어야 인력 문제를 해결할 수 있다면, 그렇게 해야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers300
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000EE8"
msgid "Now THAT was satisfying."
msgstr "이것 참 만족스럽군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EE4"
msgid "Thank you again for all that you've done."
msgstr "그동안 도와주신 모든 것에 다시 한번 감사드립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EE3"
msgid "We've been through a lot, but the work continues."
msgstr "많은 일을 겪었지만, 일은 계속됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EE2"
msgid "Until next time."
msgstr "다음에 봐요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EE1"
msgid "We'll talk more later."
msgstr "나중에 더 이야기하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. PROMPT: Enjoy the drink. I'll see you around.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Enjoy the drink. I'll see you around.
#. ALIAS: HVDazraEgboKazmi
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMEgboKazmi
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm worried about your health.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0111C74A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Egbo_DrinkingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000EE0"
msgid "Until we meet again."
msgstr "나중에 봐요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS00B_MS01_OchimGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EDF"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "잘 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EDE"
msgid "Best of luck."
msgstr "행운을 비네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "000EDD"
msgid "We'll talk more later."
msgstr "나중에 더 이야기하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000EDB"
msgid "I've instructed our people to take over Jandar's Rest, see what else we can find."
msgstr "잔다르의 안식처를 인수해서, 더 찾을 수 있는 게 있는지 알아보라고 우리 사람들에게 지시했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000EDA"
msgid "Should it still be Jandar's Rest now that we occupy it? Don't know. I'm not in charge of naming things."
msgstr "이제 우리가 차지했으니 여전히 잔다르의 안식처라고 불러야 할까요? 모르겠습니다. 제가 이름을 짓는 담당은 아니라서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED9"
msgid "Did I say we were going to be fast friends? Enemies. I meant enemies."
msgstr "우리가 사이좋은 친구가 될 거라고 말했었나요? 숙적입니다. 숙적이 될 거라고 말하려던 거였습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaVethaal_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED8"
msgid "I'm not going to rot in a cell for long. I have contacts. I have people."
msgstr "저는 감방에서 오랫동안 썩고 있지는 않을 겁니다. 저에게는 연줄이 있거든요. 인맥이 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000ED7"
msgid "I don't regret my choices. Time will reveal them to be the right ones."
msgstr "내 선택을 후회하지 않을 거다. 시간이 지나면 옳은 선택이었다는 게 밝혀질 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000ED6"
msgid "We should not be seen together."
msgstr "우리는 함께 있는 모습을 보여서는 안 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MujeenKadic_QuestHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000ED5"
msgid "My incarceration was a mistake. Dazra needs leaders such as myself."
msgstr "날 감옥에 가둔 건 실수라고. 다즈라에는 나 같은 지도자가 필요하단 말이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED4"
msgid "Back to the world of spreadsheets and tables. To be fair, I love a good spreadsheet."
msgstr "다시 스프레드시트와 표의 세계로 돌아왔군요. 솔직히 말하자면, 저는 훌륭한 스프레드시트를 좋아합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_UkaruDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED3"
msgid "It's good to be back at my office. Work is the perfect distraction."
msgstr "사무실로 돌아오니 좋군요. 일은 완벽한 기분 전환 수단입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_UkaruDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED2"
msgid "I do wonder if I can deal with the boredom. Sleuthing and investigating was such a thrill!"
msgstr "제가 지루함을 견딜 수 있을지 정말 의문이군요. 탐정 노릇과 수사는 정말 스릴 넘쳤는데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_UkaruDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED1"
msgid "I work, I organize, and I'm happy."
msgstr "저는 일하고, 정리하고, 행복합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_UkaruDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000ED0"
msgid "Every supply is here and accounted for. No more missing shipments!"
msgstr "모든 물자가 여기 있고 확인되었습니다. 더 이상 사라지는 선적물은 없습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "000ECF"
msgid "Time is pressing. Was there anything else?"
msgstr "시간이 촉박합니다. 다른 용건이 있으셨나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "000ECE"
msgid "Please, go on..."
msgstr "말씀 계속해 주세요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD88
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_WFI
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "000ECD"
msgid "You've paused. Is something the matter?"
msgstr "말씀이 멈추셨군요. 무슨 문제라도 있으신가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Open the gate!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It was the center of... an explosion, of sorts... that has annihilated most of our city. We have lost many of our brothers and sisters.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E93"
msgid "I must temper what I reveal for now, but surely you saw the Scaled Citadel as you arrived."
msgstr "아직은 말을 아껴야겠지만, 그대도 도착했을 때 분명 비늘 성채를 보았을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I must temper what I reveal for now, but surely you saw the Scaled Citadel as you arrived.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I believe we are still in danger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E92"
msgid "It was the center of... an explosion, of sorts... that has annihilated most of our city. We have lost many of our brothers and sisters."
msgstr "그곳에서 일종의... 폭발 같은 것이 일어나서 우리 도시 대부분이 파괴됐지요. 많은 형제 자매를 잃고 말았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: It was the center of... an explosion, of sorts... that has annihilated most of our city. We have lost many of our brothers and sisters.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE95
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_MaliborEscortScene01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E91"
msgid "I believe we are still in danger."
msgstr "지금도 위험한 상황이고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am ready.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am ready.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E90"
msgid "Then enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path."
msgstr "그렇다면 들어가라. 내가 위대한 뱀의 길로 안내해 주마."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me. &&& Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you...  &&& Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed. &&& Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A lesson, a test... A moment for the Great Serpent to reach out and fill you with something more than what you have been.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8F"
msgid "What's in the cave?"
msgstr "동굴 안에는 뭐가 있죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE93
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8E"
msgid "Hmm. There is something about you..."
msgstr "흠. 뭔가가 느껴지는 듯 한데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me. &&& Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you...  &&& Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed. &&& Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Those born to House Va'ruun spend every day surrounded by our history. The rituals that separate us from the husks happen naturally, over time. You have not experienced that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8D"
msgid "Why am I doing this?"
msgstr "이걸 왜 해야 하는 건데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE91
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8C"
msgid "This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?"
msgstr "이 길은 너의 자유 의지로 혼자서 걸어야만 하는 길이다. 앞으로 나아가 기름 부음을 받고, 약속받은 자들의 일원이 되겠는가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why am I doing this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why am I doing this?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8B"
msgid "Those born to House Va'ruun spend every day surrounded by our history. The rituals that separate us from the husks happen naturally, over time. You have not experienced that."
msgstr ""
"바룬 가문에서 태어난 이들은 우리의 역사에 둘러싸여 매일을 보내지. 우리를 허물과 분리해 주는 의식은 시간이 지나며 자연스럽게 행해진다. "
"너는 그런 경험을 하지 못했고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why am I doing this?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E8A"
msgid "Those who have not answered the Serpent's Call cannot coexist with House Va'ruun, and so if you are to aid us in our time of need, you must become one of the Promised."
msgstr ""
"위대한 뱀의 부름에 응답하지 않은 자는 바룬 가문과 공존할 수 없음이니, 이 어려운 시기에 우릴 도우려면 반드시 약속받은 자들의 일원이 "
"되어야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you... 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE94
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E89"
msgid "So. The Great Serpent sends you to me."
msgstr "그래. 위대한 뱀께서 널 보내셨구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): They were each alone and isolated, individual tiny flames that could be snuffed out at a moment's notice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE86
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage610_CaveScene01b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E88"
msgid "One particular colony ship housed several hundred of these souls."
msgstr "어떤 개척선에 그런 영혼들 수백이 갇혀 있었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you... 
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE92
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E87"
msgid "Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed."
msgstr ""
"명심하여라. 허물이여. 위대한 뱀의 길을 걷고, 이 신성한 동굴에 들어간다면... 결코 돌이킬 수 없다. 그대는 영원히 변할 것이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me. &&& Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you...  &&& Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed. &&& Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then enter, and I shall guide you along the Serpent's Path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE90
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E86"
msgid "I am ready."
msgstr "준비됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And thus House Va'ruun was born.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE82
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage620_CaveScene02b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E85"
msgid "They followed his guidance, and his light, and they cast aside the burdens of their former lives."
msgstr "영혼들은 그분의 인도와 그분의 불빛을 따랐고, 예전 삶의 짐을 벗어던졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But Jinan Va'ruun encountered the Great Serpent, and was given the gift of knowledge.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE83
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage620_CaveScene02a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E84"
msgid "He shared his knowledge with those around him, and lit the way for them."
msgstr "그분은 그 지식을 주변과 나누셨고, 영혼들을 위해 길을 밝혀 주셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Inaza: So. The Great Serpent sends you to me. &&& Inaza: Hmm. There is something about you...  &&& Inaza: Know, husk, that to walk the Serpent's Path, to enter this sacred cave... There is no turning back. You will be forever changed. &&& Inaza: This is a path you must walk of your own free will, alone. Will you step forward, and emerge anointed, one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Lifetimes are but instants to the Serpent. I shall remain, awaiting your return.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E83"
msgid "I need a minute."
msgstr "시간이 좀 필요한데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And like all humans, they were lost souls, wandering in the dark, looking for a path.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE88
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage610_CaveScene01a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E82"
msgid "Before House Va'ruun, there were humans. First on Earth, then scattered among the stars."
msgstr "바룬 가문이 있기 전, 인류가 있었다. 시초에는 지구에 있었으나, 나중에는 별들 사이로 흩어졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F729
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E81"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "괜찮은 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): One particular colony ship housed several hundred of these souls.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE85
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage610_CaveScene01b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E80"
msgid "They were each alone and isolated, individual tiny flames that could be snuffed out at a moment's notice."
msgstr "영혼들은 외로이 고립되어 있었고, 각자가 지닌 작은 불꽃은 금방이라도 꺼져버릴 것만 같았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What's in the cave?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's in the cave?
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: I've been waiting for this moment my entire life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE8D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7F"
msgid "A lesson, a test... A moment for the Great Serpent to reach out and fill you with something more than what you have been."
msgstr "가르침과 시험이 있지... 위대한 뱀께서 접촉하시어 네가 지금까지 겪어온 것 이상의 무언가로 채워 주시는 게다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I need a minute.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I need a minute.
#. ALIAS: Inaza
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Inaza: But this is a journey you must undertake alone. Your escort cannot follow.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE89
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage450_InazaScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7E"
msgid "Lifetimes are but instants to the Serpent. I shall remain, awaiting your return."
msgstr "위대한 뱀에게 평생이란 찰나에 불과한 법. 여기서 네가 돌아오길 기다리겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): He shared his knowledge with those around him, and lit the way for them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE84
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage620_CaveScene02a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7D"
msgid "But Jinan Va'ruun encountered the Great Serpent, and was given the gift of knowledge."
msgstr "허나 지난 바룬님이 위대한 뱀을 접하였고, 지식의 선물을 부여받으셨다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): They followed his guidance, and his light, and they cast aside the burdens of their former lives.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Now you, too, have the chance to cast aside your burdens, to relieve yourself of anything that holds you back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE81
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage620_CaveScene02b
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7C"
msgid "And thus House Va'ruun was born."
msgstr "그렇게 바룬 가문이 태어났다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Who are you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7B"
msgid "Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?"
msgstr "아, 위대한 뱀이시여! 맞... 맞사옵니까? 이 느낌은 뱀께서 현신하신 것이옵니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Oh, Great Serpent! Is... is that you? Is it your presence I feel?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E7A"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "누구신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm right here!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I know that All Must Serve, but I need more! I require guidance! Take pity on us, and reveal the way forward!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F722
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E79"
msgid "Great Serpent, I have done all that I can! The Scaled Citadel itself has been transformed to petition you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 전 최선을 다했나이다! 비늘 성채 자체가 뱀을 향한 탄원을 위해 변화했나이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F721
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E78"
msgid "Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over..."
msgstr "우리 지도자이신 아나스코 바룬 님입니다. 이런 식으로 계속 나타나고 계시지요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F720
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E77"
msgid "If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost."
msgstr "목소리만이라도 들을 수 있다면... 모든 걸 잃지는 않았다는 안도감이라도 느꼈을 텐데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Before House Va'ruun, there were humans. First on Earth, then scattered among the stars.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFInazaKaisir
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102FE87
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage610_CaveScene01a
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E76"
msgid "And like all humans, they were lost souls, wandering in the dark, looking for a path."
msgstr "그리고 모든 인류가 그랬듯, 흩어진 이들은 영혼을 잃고, 어둠 속을 헤매며, 길을 찾아 다녔다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He sounds plenty lost himself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E75"
msgid "You... could hear him?"
msgstr "그분의... 목소리를 들었다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you? &&& Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Great Serpent, I have done all that I can! The Scaled Citadel itself has been transformed to petition you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F726
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E74"
msgid "I'm right here!"
msgstr "여기라고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He doesn't seem to be able to see us. He didn't respond to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He doesn't seem to be able to see us. He didn't respond to me.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E73"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 말입니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You... could hear him?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F719
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E72"
msgid "Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?"
msgstr "아나스코 님을 봤다는 목격담은 여럿 있었지만, 지금껏 그분의 말씀이 들리는 사람은 한 명도 없었습니다. 그런데 들었다고요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over... &&& Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different. &&& Malibor: If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What do you mean?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E70"
msgid "He doesn't seem to be able to see us. He didn't respond to me."
msgstr "우릴 보지 못하는 것 같던데요. 대답도 없었고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Excellent.|Please, come with me.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I understand that this is a great deal to absorb. Please take a moment to think it over, but House Va'ruun cannot wait forever.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F72D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E6F"
msgid "Then you may leave. But we will await your return, for it is the Serpent's Will that leads us all. Even you. And He will lead you back to us."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 떠나도 좋습니다만, 돌아오길 기다리겠습니다. 위대한 뱀의 의지가 우리 모두를 이끄니까요. 그대조차도요. 그분께서 그대를 데려오실 "
"겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over... &&& Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different. &&& Malibor: If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You... could hear him?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E6E"
msgid "He sounds plenty lost himself."
msgstr "말하는 게 멀쩡한 것 같진 않던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you? &&& Anasko: I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Great Serpent, I have done all that I can! The Scaled Citadel itself has been transformed to petition you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F724
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E6C"
msgid "Can you see me?"
msgstr "내가 보여요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who are you?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm right here!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F727
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoPlayerScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E6B"
msgid "I... I feel something, yet I see nothing! Is this a test? What do you require of me?!"
msgstr "뭐... 뭔가 느껴지는데, 보이질 않나이다! 이건 시험이옵니까? 제게 무얼 요구하시나이까?!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F713
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E6A"
msgid "He's trying to contact the Great Serpent, but something is wrong. He sounds lost."
msgstr "위대한 뱀과 접촉하려고 하는 것 같았는데, 뭔가 잘못된 것 같아요. 말하는 게 제정신이 아닌 것 같더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Our leader, Anasko Va'ruun. He has appeared like this over and over... &&& Malibor: So many of our people have been trapped in this state, these Vortex Phantoms. But usually they are hostile and lash out. Anasko is different. &&& Malibor: If only we could hear his voice, some... reassurance that all is not lost.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am not able to go into detail. There was an experiment. An accident. Many of our people left in a similar state.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E68"
msgid "What is going on here?"
msgstr "지금 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is going on here?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is going on here?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E67"
msgid "I am not able to go into detail. There was an experiment. An accident. Many of our people left in a similar state."
msgstr "자세히 설명해줄 순 없습니다. 실험이 있었지요. 사고가 터졌고요. 많은 신민들이 비슷한 상태에 빠져 버렸습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is going on here?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: He sounds plenty lost himself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F71A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E66"
msgid "While most are hostile, Anasko is... The Great Serpent spared him that fate. He is different. If only we could communicate with him."
msgstr ""
"대부분은 적대적으로 변했지만, 아나스코 님은... 위대한 뱀께서 환난의 운명을 면케 해주셨지요. 그분은 다릅니다. 우리와 대화라도 "
"통한다면 좋으련만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: This is too important. You must remember something!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F711
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E64"
msgid "I wasn't really paying attention."
msgstr "그렇게 집중해서 듣진 않아서요."

msgctxt "000E63"
msgid "\"All Must Serve.\""
msgstr "'모두가 섬겨야 한다.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wasn't really paying attention.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wasn't really paying attention.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: "All Must Serve."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F710
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E62"
msgid "This is too important. You must remember something!"
msgstr "아주 중요한 문제입니다. 뭐라도 기억해 내야 한다고요!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard, Malik
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We have asked the Great Serpent for deliverance from our calamity, and He has answered us!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage410_MaliborPublicScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E60"
msgid "This outsider has been chosen as the most unlikely vessel for the Great Serpent's divine provenance, and he will help save us all!"
msgstr "뜻밖에도 이 이방인이 위대한 뱀의 신성한 기원을 담을 그릇으로 선택되었으나, 결국 우리를 도와 모두를 구원할 것입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard, Malik
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We have asked the Great Serpent for deliverance from our calamity, and He has answered us!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage410_MaliborPublicScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E5F"
msgid "This outsider has been chosen as the most unlikely vessel for the Great Serpent's divine provenance, and she will help save us all!"
msgstr "뜻밖에도 이 이방인이 위대한 뱀의 신성한 기원을 담을 그릇으로 선택되었으나, 결국 우리를 도와 모두를 구원할 것입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard, Malik
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: We have asked the Great Serpent for deliverance from our calamity, and He has answered us!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage410_MaliborPublicScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E5E"
msgid "This outsider has been chosen as the most unlikely vessel for the Great Serpent's divine provenance, and they will help save us all!"
msgstr "뜻밖에도 이 이방인이 위대한 뱀의 신성한 기원을 담을 그릇으로 선택되었으나, 결국 우리를 도와 모두를 구원할 것입니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E5D"
msgid "I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised?"
msgstr "결정을 기다리고 있습니다. 약속받은 자들의 일원이 될 것을 약속하시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E5B"
msgid "Outsider, please. There is no denying you have been sent here as a sign. You must help us."
msgstr "이방인이여. 간청드립니다. 그대가 여기 온 것은 분명 계시입니다. 우릴 도와주셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: But there are... There are precepts that must be followed, principles that must be obeyed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F708
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E5A"
msgid "Even in these dire circumstances, we cannot turn from Jinan Va'ruun's teachings."
msgstr "이런 끔찍한 상황일지라도, 지난 바룬님의 가르침을 저버릴 순 없으니 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Even in these dire circumstances, we cannot turn from Jinan Va'ruun's teachings.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F707
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E59"
msgid "You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word."
msgstr "그대는 다즈라와 그 너머 땅을 안전하게 드나들 수 있을 겁니다. 아무런 해도 입지 않을 거예요. 제가 보증하지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We have asked the Great Serpent for deliverance from our calamity, and He has answered us!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage410_MaliborPublicScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E58"
msgid "People of House Va'ruun, hear me!"
msgstr "바룬 가문의 신민들이여! 들으십시오!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Even in these dire circumstances, we cannot turn from Jinan Va'ruun's teachings.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F709
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E56"
msgid "But there are... There are precepts that must be followed, principles that must be obeyed."
msgstr "다만... 반드시 따라야 하는 계율과 반드시 지켜야 할 신조가 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He sounds plenty lost himself. &&& Malibor: You... could hear him? &&& Malibor: Despite the sightings, none have heard a word from Anasko in all this time. Yet you claim to?|Do not toy with me. Not about this. If you speak truth, you must prove it. What did he say?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: By the Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F715
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage400_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E55"
msgid "Something about a citadel, and a transformation."
msgstr "성채가 어쩌고 하는 얘기랑, 뭐가 변형됐다고 하던데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your people are always trying to kill me. Why would I help you?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your people are always trying to kill me. Why would I help you?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F702
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E54"
msgid "You must mean the Zealots."
msgstr "광신도들 말이로군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your people are always trying to kill me. Why would I help you?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F702
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E53"
msgid "I assure you, they do not represent House Va'ruun. We do not engage with the Settled Systems. They would attack us just as soon as you, or anyone else."
msgstr ""
"장담드리지요. 그자들은 바룬 가문을 대표하지 않습니다. 우리는 개척 성계에 관여하지 않아요. 그자들은 그대나 다른 누군가를 공격하는 "
"것처럼 우리도 공격할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F706
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E52"
msgid "But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?"
msgstr ""
"허나 진정으로 우릴 도와주려면, 반드시 바룬 가문의 일원이 되어야만 합니다. 가벼이 결정할 일도 아니고, 되돌릴 수도 없어요. 약속받은 "
"자들의 일원이 되어 우릴 도와줄 것을 약속하시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not agreeing to anything right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not agreeing to anything right now.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Then you may leave. But we will await your return, for it is the Serpent's Will that leads us all. Even you. And He will lead you back to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F700
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E51"
msgid "The Serpent has brought us all here together for a reason. We cannot - must not - fight what is ordained."
msgstr "뱀께서 우릴 여기 한데 모으신 것은 이유가 있어서입니다. 정해진 일에는 저항할 수도 없고, 해서도 안 되지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Mere hours ago, I could never have imagined offering redemption to an outsider. And yet here we both stand now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E50"
msgid "I could never join House Va'ruun."
msgstr "바룬 가문 같은 데는 절대 안 들어갈 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Excellent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F705
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4F"
msgid "All right. Just tell me where to begin."
msgstr "좋아요. 뭐부터 해야 하는지 말해 보시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: People of House Va'ruun, hear me!
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: This outsider has been chosen as the most unlikely vessel for the Great Serpent's divine provenance, and he will help save us all!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F70C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage410_MaliborPublicScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4E"
msgid "We have asked the Great Serpent for deliverance from our calamity, and He has answered us!"
msgstr "우리는 위대한 뱀께 이 재난에서 구원해달라 청하였고, 이에 그분께서 응답하시었습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We, the people of House Va'ruun, are the Promised. The Great Serpent has blessed us with knowledge of the future and our place in it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4D"
msgid "What do you mean, the Promised?"
msgstr "약속받았다니, 그게 무슨 뜻이죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I could never join House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I could never join House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Then you may leave. But we will await your return, for it is the Serpent's Will that leads us all. Even you. And He will lead you back to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4C"
msgid "Mere hours ago, I could never have imagined offering redemption to an outsider. And yet here we both stand now."
msgstr ""
"겨우 몇 시간 전만 해도 이방인에게 구원을 제공한다는 생각은 해보지도 않았습니다. 그런데 지금 우리 둘 다 이런 상황에 처해 있지 "
"않습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Serpent has brought us all here together for a reason. We cannot - must not - fight what is ordained.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F701
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4B"
msgid "I'm not agreeing to anything right now."
msgstr "아무것도 동의한 적 없는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, the Promised?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean, the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E4A"
msgid "We, the people of House Va'ruun, are the Promised. The Great Serpent has blessed us with knowledge of the future and our place in it."
msgstr ""
"우리 바룬 가문의 신민들이 곧 약속받은 자입니다. 위대한 뱀께서는 미래에 대한 지식과 우리가 있을 자리에 대한 지식으로 우릴 축복해 "
"주셨지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E49"
msgid "Our service to Him guarantees us a place in the new worlds He will create when He returns to Enshroud the universe."
msgstr ""
"우리가 위대한 뱀을 섬기면, 그분이 돌아오시어 전 우주를 장막으로 덮으실 때, 새로운 세상을 만들어내시고서 우리의 자리를 보장해 주실 "
"겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F6FC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E48"
msgid "A greater gift could not be bestowed upon you."
msgstr "그보다 더 큰 선물은 없을 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I await your decision. Will you commit to becoming one of the Promised? &&& ...  &&& Malibor: You will be granted safe passage through Dazra and the lands beyond. No harm will come to you. On that you have my word. &&& Malibor: You even have my assurance that your... compatriot here will also remain unharmed. &&& Malibor: But to truly aid us, you must become part of House Va'ruun. This is not a thing done lightly, and it cannot be taken back. Will you commit to helping us, by becoming one of the Promised?
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You must mean the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F703
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E46"
msgid "Your people are always trying to kill me. Why would I help you?"
msgstr "당신네 사람들은 항상 날 죽이려 하는데요. 내가 왜 도와줘야 하죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E45"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr "훌륭합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. Just tell me where to begin.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Then you may leave. But we will await your return, for it is the Serpent's Will that leads us all. Even you. And He will lead you back to us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102F704
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage420_MaliborScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E44"
msgid "Please, come with me."
msgstr "부디, 따라오시지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen. |Clearly your ward was acting independently, in violation of your trust. &&& Tevina: WHAT!?!?! &&& Mujeen: Apology accepted. While I was not involved, it gives me no pleasure to have the culprit come from my own House.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: What do you mean? What revelations?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030C02
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E42"
msgid "If Ochim Ka'dic is our supply thief, then the case is closed. Based on recent revelations, I am certain he will no longer be a problem."
msgstr ""
"만약 오킴 카딕이 물자 절도범이라면, 사건은 종결된 겁니다. 최근에 밝혀진 사실들에 근거해, 저는 오킴이 더 이상 문제가 되지 않을 "
"거라고 확신합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Apology accepted. While I was not involved, it gives me no pleasure to have the culprit come from my own House. &&& Qisrani: If Ochim Ka'dic is our supply thief, then the case is closed. Based on recent revelations, I am certain he will no longer be a problem.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: You mean you don't know? Ochim's dead. He tried to assassinate the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030C01
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E41"
msgid "What do you mean? What revelations?"
msgstr "무슨 말이지? 무슨 계시?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani:  &&& ...  &&& Qisrani: What? So you admit to the crime, Mujeen? &&& Mujeen: Not exactly. I'm sorry, Executor, but you've been misled. |The crimes in question were perpetrated by a lower member of House Ka'dic, Ochim. &&& Mujeen: The missing supplies, the deaths, he is responsible for it all. And I have ample evidence to back up this claim.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Then why don't we ask the Harbinger?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030C00
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E40"
msgid "Hold on, isn't he your ward? Something stinks here. Like three day old groat milk bad."
msgstr "잠깐, 그쪽 피후견자 아니었어요? 뭔가 냄새가 나는데요. 3일 지난 그로트 젖처럼 고약하게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Is that so, Mujeen? Or do you deny the words you yourself wrote? &&& ...  &&& SecurityGuard02: As you command, Executor. &&& Qisrani: *Exhales*, I appreciate you backing me up on this one. |Warden Veth'aal had brought some evidence linking Mujeen to the crime, but it's your evidence that makes me feel confident we can convict. &&& Qisrani: I must admit, I am a bit skeptical that House Ka'dic would be so ignorant of his dealings.|But perhaps you've brought evidence that might back up his word.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If that's the case, then I'll just have to wait for the Envoy's evidence to be submitted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BFB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E3F"
msgid "There's nothing I have that would incriminate him."
msgstr "무진을 고발할 만한 증거는 아무것도 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's nothing I have that would incriminate him.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's nothing I have that would incriminate him.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BFA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E3E"
msgid "If that's the case, then I'll just have to wait for the Envoy's evidence to be submitted."
msgstr "그렇다면, 사절의 증거가 제출될 때까지 기다려야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him. &&& Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Shocked
