#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E3D"
msgid "Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen."
msgstr "이걸 검토해 보니... 무진, 당신에게 사과해야 할 것 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: WHAT!?!?!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BFF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E3C"
msgid "Clearly your ward was acting independently, in violation of your trust."
msgstr "분명 당신의 피후견자는 당신의 신뢰를 저버리고, 독단적으로 행동한 것 같네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: WHAT!?!?! &&& Mujeen: Apology accepted. While I was not involved, it gives me no pleasure to have the culprit come from my own House. &&& Qisrani: If Ochim Ka'dic is our supply thief, then the case is closed. Based on recent revelations, I am certain he will no longer be a problem. &&& Mujeen: What do you mean? What revelations?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I... I wasn't aware.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BFC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E3B"
msgid "You mean you don't know? Ochim's dead. He tried to assassinate the Executor."
msgstr "모른다는 말씀이세요? 오킴은 죽었어요. 실무관을 암살하려고 했거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him. &&& Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& Qisrani: Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen. |Clearly your ward was acting independently, in violation of your trust. &&& Tevina: WHAT!?!?!
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
