msgctxt "000E38"
msgid "[Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 네, 무진은 결백합니다. 이게 결백을 증명해 줄 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What if I don't provide any evidence?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if I don't provide any evidence?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
