#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Without any evidence, we only have speculation. At which point, we will not have enough to convict anyone.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BF9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E30"
msgid "What if I don't provide any evidence?"
msgstr "만약 제가 아무런 증거도 제공하지 않는다면요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him.
