#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Examining this... it seems I owe you an apology, Mujeen. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01030BF6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E28"
msgid "Ha, this will be good for a laugh."
msgstr "하, 이거 웃음거리가 되겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was my pleasure. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence. &&& Mujeen: And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide. &&& Qisrani: Good work, Warden. But there is one more thing we need to discuss before bringing this case to a close.|This slate, found on the body of Ochim Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, any additional evidence is always helpful. Let's have a look.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE24
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E16"
msgid "[Ochim's Recording] There's one more thing, actually."
msgstr "[오킴의 녹음] 사실 하나 더 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb. |For that, you will be well rewarded. &&& Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case. &&& Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence. &&& Mujeen: And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE21
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E14"
msgid "Good work, Warden. But there is one more thing we need to discuss before bringing this case to a close."
msgstr "잘하셨습니다. 교정관. 하지만 이 사건을 종결짓기 전에 논의해야 할 것이 하나 더 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was my pleasure. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence. &&& Mujeen: And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide. &&& Qisrani: Good work, Warden. But there is one more thing we need to discuss before bringing this case to a close.|This slate, found on the body of Ochim Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: That goes double for me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE20
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000E0D"
msgid "I've got nothing else to add."
msgstr "더 이상 추가할 사안은 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If that's so, then whoever this person is, they're far more dangerous than I.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD87
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DF2"
msgid "[Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots."
msgstr "[녹음된 오킴의 목소리] 안다. 네가 광신도들을 돕도록 누군가 사주했다는 증거를 가지고 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
