#. TOPIC: 0102FD86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DEF"
msgid "If that's so, then whoever this person is, they're far more dangerous than I."
msgstr "그렇다면, 그 사람이 누구든, 나보다 훨씬 더 위험한 인물이겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Show Slate] I do. And with your help, they'll be the ones charged.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DED"
msgid "But I digress. Even if I wasn't steered toward this outcome, I would do it again, if given the chance. In the end, it was necessary."
msgstr "딴 얘기지만, 이런 결과가 나오지 않았더라도, 기회가 주어진다면, 다시 그렇게 할 거다. 결국엔, 필요한 일이었으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply. 
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD85
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DEC"
msgid "I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime."
msgstr "경비대에 자수해서 내 범행을 자백하겠다."

#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD85
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DEB"
msgid "But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra."
msgstr "하지만 이로서 잔다르의 안식처와 다즈라의 사람들에게 사형 선고가 내려질까 두렵군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All Zealots deserve nothing less than death.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All Zealots deserve nothing less than death.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD83
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DEA"
msgid "It is that kind of thinking that will delay the Shrouding. But it's clear I have no sway over you."
msgstr "그런 식의 생각이 장막의 날을 늦출 거다. 하지만 내가 자네에게 영향력이 없다는 건 분명하군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply.  &&& Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra. &&& Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is that kind of thinking that will delay the Shrouding. But it's clear I have no sway over you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FD84
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DE5"
msgid "All Zealots deserve nothing less than death."
msgstr "광신도들은 모두 뒈지는 것보다도 못한 대우를 받아야 마땅하죠."

#. PROMPT: I've got nothing else to add.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've got nothing else to add.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And to be honest, I'm somewhat relieved. This could have been a political nightmare.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FE1D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DE2"
msgid "That goes double for me."
msgstr "저도 마찬가지입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Exhales*, I appreciate you backing me up on this one. |Warden Veth'aal had brought some evidence linking Mujeen to the crime, but it's your evidence that makes me feel confident we can convict.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B687
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD9"
msgid "He confessed to aiding the Zealots, which ultimately led to my cousin Ukaru's death."
msgstr "무진은 광신도를 도왔다고 자백했고, 그것이 궁극적으로 제 사촌 우카루의 죽음으로 이어졌습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him.
