#. TOPIC: 0102B687
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD8"
msgid "He'll likely appeal for clemency, but what we've got is enough to lock him up for a long, long time."
msgstr "무진은 아마 자비를 구하겠지만, 우리가 확보한 증거만으로도 무진을 오랫동안 가두기에 충분합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close.|For what it's worth, it does seem to fit your theory, however, that Ochim was acting alone. &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B674
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD7"
msgid "All told, I'm extremely grateful. Ukaru was family, and I would not have been able to rest if I knew the thief had not been brought to justice."
msgstr ""
"전부, 정말 감사합니다. 우카루는 제 가족이었죠. 도둑이 정의의 심판을 받지 않았다는 걸 알았다면 전 편히 쉬지도 못했을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all. &&& Qisrani: All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The guard will move him to lockup. You can visit him if you like, so long as he cooperates.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD6"
msgid "Where will Mujeen be taken?"
msgstr "무진은 어디로 호송되나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will there be any blowback from arresting Mujeen?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It was my pleasure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B670
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD5"
msgid "I suspect he may have operated independently, and Elder Razma will likely deny any involvement."
msgstr "무진이 독단적으로 행동했을 가능성이 높을 거 같고, 라즈마 장로는 아마 어떤 연루 가능성도 부인할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where will Mujeen be taken?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where will Mujeen be taken?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450C2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DD4"
msgid "The guard will move him to lockup. You can visit him if you like, so long as he cooperates."
msgstr "경비대가 무진을 감옥으로 이송할 겁니다. 무진이 협조만 한다면, 만나러 가도 좋습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRest_MujeenBlockerGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DD3"
msgid "I pray that you have not doomed us all."
msgstr "자네가 우리 모두를 파멸로 이끌지 않았기를 기도하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DD2"
msgid "I hope he's okay. I'm so worried..."
msgstr "그 사람이 괜찮았으면 좋겠어. 너무 걱정돼..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DD1"
msgid "I'm so worried..."
msgstr "너무 걱정돼..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_SharedDialogue
#. TOPIC: 0103AB9E
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DD0"
msgid "How can he write something like that and not have me worried sick?"
msgstr "오빤 어떻게 그런 글을 쓰고 저보고 아무 걱정도 하지 말라고 할 수 있는 걸까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Jinan grace you for taking on this investigation. You've done a great service for House Va'ruun and for Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FDFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DCF"
msgid "And on a personal note, I want to extend my gratitude for avenging my cousin's murder."
msgstr "그리고 개인적으로, 살해당한 사촌의 복수를 대신 해주신 것에 감사를 표하고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FDFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DCE"
msgid "With the accident and all that's going on, I haven't really had time to grieve."
msgstr "다즈라의 사고에 이번 일까지, 슬퍼할 겨를도 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102FDFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000DCD"
msgid "But closing this case might help me start that process. So for that, I thank you."
msgstr "하지만 이번 사건이 종결되면 슬픔을 추스르기 시작하는 데 도움이 될 것 같습니다. 도와주셔서, 감사합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000DCC"
msgid "I need some time to process this. But thank you."
msgstr "받아들이려면 시간이 좀 필요할 거 같아요. 그렇지만 감사합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFMadriSharon
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01038C3C
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_MadriBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "000DCB"
msgid "I don't know where to go from here."
msgstr "이제 어디로 가야 할지 모르겠습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll make the deposit into your accounts. Your family will be taken care of for generations to come.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, we'll have a mountain of evidence linking them to the crime, don't you worry. Especially after you convince them they need to visit Jandar's Rest. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102FD79
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DCA"
msgid "And the thief?"
msgstr "그럼 그 도둑은 어떻게 합니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Oh, I've waited a loooong time for this one. I can't wait to see the look on his face. Or his corpse? I'm not sure.|Anyway, good job! You've served me well, but it's time we part ways. Fish and guests, as they say. |I've only got one more task for you before our business is concluded. Something to really nail down your House as the bad guy.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I want Qisrani Dul'kehf dead. And I want you to convince your boss to order the hit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102FD78
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC9"
msgid "And what's that?"
msgstr "무슨 일입니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And what's that?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): What? I do that, and I won't make it out of the city alive. It's a suicide mission.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102FD77
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC8"
msgid "I want Qisrani Dul'kehf dead. And I want you to convince your boss to order the hit."
msgstr "키스라니 둘케프가 죽었으면 좋겠거든. 너의 상사를 설득해서 암살 명령을 내리게 해."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102EE6E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC7"
msgid "Anyway, good job! You've served me well, but it's time we part ways. Fish and guests, as they say."
msgstr "어쨌든, 잘 해줬어! 날 위해 잘 일해줬지만, 이제 서로 갈 길을 가야 할 때가 왔다. 생선과 손님은, 무슨 말인지 알겠지."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Good point. And now you have the gears in my head turning. If we were to GIVE them the supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B660
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC6"
msgid "And when's the last time you stuck your neck out for the guy who serves you groat?"
msgstr "그로트 고기 따위를 파는 사람한테 충성을 맹세할 리가 없잖습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: The case is all but closed in my opinion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C04
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC4"
msgid "Any updates on the case?"
msgstr "사건에 대한 새로운 소식 있습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Is caught off guard by normal question after all the talk about the murder investigation, the "Ha" is more awkward tittering as opposed to laughing / Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask some questions about you?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC3"
msgid "Ha, really?"
msgstr "하, 정말요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC2"
msgid "I'm sorry. It's just... given all that's happened, it's been so long since I had a normal conversation."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 그게... 이런 일을 다 겪고 나니, 너무 오랫동안 평범한 대화를 나누지 못했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C09
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC1"
msgid "I'm not sure I even remember how. But all right."
msgstr "어떻게 하는지 기억조차 나지 않는군요. 하지만 알겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Any updates on the case?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DC0"
msgid "The case is all but closed in my opinion."
msgstr "제 생각에는 사건이 거의 종결되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBF"
msgid "But in the interest of due diligence, we are monitoring the flow of supplies much more closely."
msgstr "하지만 적절한 실사를 위해, 우리는 물자 흐름을 훨씬 더 면밀히 감시하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C03
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_PostQuest
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBE"
msgid "Any package put on hold must be approved by at least two Executors."
msgstr "보류된 모든 소포는 최소한 두 명의 실무관의 승인을 받아야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How are you feeling these days?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_HowYoureFeeling
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBD"
msgid "More determined than ever. Dazra's problems are many, but they can be solved."
msgstr "그 어느 때보다 단호합니다. 다즈라의 문제는 많지만, 해결될 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C05
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_HowYoureFeeling
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBC"
msgid "You are living proof of that, no?"
msgstr "당신이 바로 그 살아있는 증거 아닙니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you join the Ministry of Commerce?
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_MinistryofCommerce
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBB"
msgid "I was born into it, you might say, as all in House Dul'kehf are."
msgstr "말하자면, 저는 둘케프 가문에서 태어난 모든 이들처럼, 태어날 때부터 그랬습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_MinistryofCommerce
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DBA"
msgid "Now I was fortunate enough to get the \"spreadsheet gene\" as they call it."
msgstr "저는 운 좋게도 소위 스프레드시트 유전자를 물려받았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: MS01_Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C07
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_MinistryofCommerce
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DB9"
msgid "Some people enjoy a good wine, others music, but I am at home with a well organized table."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 좋은 와인을 즐기고, 어떤 사람들은 음악을 즐기지만, 저는 잘 정돈된 표를 볼 때 마음이 편안해집니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: Ha, really? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C0A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_AboutYou
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DB8"
msgid "Do you mind if I ask some questions about you?"
msgstr "당신에 대해 몇 가지 질문을 해도 될까요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: I was born into it, you might say, as all in House Dul'kehf are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C08
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_MinistryofCommerce
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DB7"
msgid "How did you join the Ministry of Commerce?"
msgstr "어떻게 상무성에 들어가셨나요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: MS01_Qisrani: More determined than ever. Dazra's problems are many, but they can be solved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01030C06
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra_Qisrani_TL_HowYoureFeeling
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000DB6"
msgid "How are you feeling these days?"
msgstr "요즘 기분이 어떠신지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000DB5"
msgid "Always good to see you."
msgstr "만나 뵙게 돼서 언제나 반갑습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000DB4"
msgid "Mujeen has cooperated for the most part. But if it were up to me, it'll be ten Shroudings before he can even think about an early parole."
msgstr ""
"무진은 대체로 협조적이었습니다. 하지만 판결이 저에게 달렸다면, 열 번의 장막의 날은 지나야 조기 가석방을 생각할 수 있게 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000DB3"
msgid "We caught Tevina trying to arrange an escape off world. That won't go well during the trial."
msgstr "테비나가 외부 세계로 도주를 계획하려던 걸 잡았습니다. 재판에서 불리하게 작용할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000DB2"
msgid "I'm so relieved to have Ukaru back safe and sound."
msgstr "우카루가 무사히 돌아와서 정말 안심입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_QisraniDulkehf_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000DB1"
msgid "Maybe some time later, I'll take a moment to reflect on all that's happened."
msgstr "아마 나중에, 일어났던 모든 일들을 되돌아보는 시간을 가질 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live. &&& companion: We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you. &&& Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No signals should have left this system. But the Oracle was lost...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D85"
msgid "This was an accident. I was just responding to a distress call."
msgstr "그냥 우연이었어. 구조 신호에 응답했을 뿐이라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was an accident. I was just responding to a distress call.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was an accident. I was just responding to a distress call.
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm afraid there were no survivors.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D84"
msgid "No signals should have left this system. But the Oracle was lost..."
msgstr "어떤 신호도 이 성계를 넘어가지 못해. 하지만 오라클은 실종됐었으니..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live. &&& companion: We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you. &&& Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: But it was lost. All communications ceased, there was no sign of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D83"
msgid "I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle."
msgstr "너희네 불안정한 우주정거장을 찾았지. 오라클이라고 하던가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live. &&& companion: We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you. &&& Guard: You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place.
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You trespass in Dazra, the home of House Va'ruun, and you disgrace it with every heretical step you take.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D82"
msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr "여긴 어디지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D81"
msgid "But it was lost. All communications ceased, there was no sign of it."
msgstr "하지만 그 우주정거장은 사라졌다. 통신은 모두 두절됐고, 흔적도 찾을 수 없었는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Great Serpent, hear me! &&& Guard: It's happening again! &&& Malibor: Speaker! We are here!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEAE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D80"
msgid "We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need!"
msgstr "저희는 도움이 간절할 때에 인도를 찾고자, 위대한 뱀께 나아간 것이옵니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where am I?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where am I?
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7F"
msgid "You trespass in Dazra, the home of House Va'ruun, and you disgrace it with every heretical step you take."
msgstr "넌 바룬 가문의 고향인 다즈라에 침입했다. 네 이단적인 발걸음이 이곳을 모욕하고 있고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Where am I?
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEB0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7E"
msgid "I say again: Who are you, and how did you find this place?"
msgstr "다시 묻겠다. 넌 누구고, 여긴 어떻게 찾아낸 거냐?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle. &&& Guard: But it was lost. All communications ceased, there was no sign of it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Indeed it did. The Oracle is perhaps the least of our problems, I'm afraid.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEAB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7D"
msgid "Something clearly went wrong."
msgstr "분명 뭔가 잘못됐던 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain / to Anasko
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: InPain
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: It's happening again!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEAF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7C"
msgid "Great Serpent, hear me!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여! 들어주소서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was an accident. I was just responding to a distress call. &&& Guard: No signals should have left this system. But the Oracle was lost...
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: We had feared as much. But it is good to know for certain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7B"
msgid "I'm afraid there were no survivors."
msgstr "안타깝지만 생존자는 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: We have reached out to you, to seek guidance in our hour of need!
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Anasko Va'ruun? What has happened?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEAD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D7A"
msgid "The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you!"
msgstr "오직 위대한 뱀을 찾고자 성채의 차원문을 열었나이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The gate in the Citadel has been opened just to seek you! &&& companion: Anasko Va'ruun? What has happened?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: I strive only to follow your command... All Must Serve!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEAC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D79"
msgid "Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?"
msgstr "제가 부족했나이까? 여기는 대체 어디란 말입니까? 어째서 모습을 드러내지 않으시옵니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Something clearly went wrong.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D78"
msgid "Indeed it did. The Oracle is perhaps the least of our problems, I'm afraid."
msgstr "확실히 그랬지요. 오라클은 제일 사소한 문제일지도 모를 지경이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where am I? &&& Guard: You trespass in Dazra, the home of House Va'ruun, and you disgrace it with every heretical step you take.|I say again: Who are you, and how did you find this place?
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: It was deemed necessary at the time. We will re-evaluate that decision in light of what has happened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D77"
msgid "I've never seen a station with a Grav Drive installed."
msgstr "중력 구동기가 설치된 우주정거장은 처음 봤는데 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've never seen a station with a Grav Drive installed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've never seen a station with a Grav Drive installed.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D76"
msgid "It was deemed necessary at the time. We will re-evaluate that decision in light of what has happened."
msgstr "그때는 필요하다고 판단했지요. 전말을 파악한 후에 그 결정을 재평가할 계획입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Malibor
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong. &&& Malibor: Indeed it did. The Oracle is perhaps the least of our problems, I'm afraid. &&& Malibor: Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift.
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D75"
msgid "Councilor, with due respect, we have not had unannounced visitors here in generations. It is a clear breach of security."
msgstr "의원님. 송구스럽지만, 저희는 대대로 불청객을 받아들인 적이 없었습니다. 이건 명백한 보안 위반입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift. &&& Guard: Councilor, with due respect, we have not had unannounced visitors here in generations. It is a clear breach of security.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D74"
msgid "I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance."
msgstr "내 생각은 다릅니다. 나도 보안에 대해선 알아요. 아무리 사소해 보일지라도 가장 중요하다는 걸 말이지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: Indeed it did. The Oracle is perhaps the least of our problems, I'm afraid.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Guard: Councilor, with due respect, we have not had unannounced visitors here in generations. It is a clear breach of security.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D73"
msgid "Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift."
msgstr "보리스, 우리 손님을 걱정할 필요는 없을 것 같군요. 어쩌면 이 절박한 때에 위대한 뱀께서 내려주신 선물일지도 모릅니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Guard
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: And perhaps our guest's intent should be determined before we take further action.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE9E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D72"
msgid "But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious."
msgstr "하지만 지금 시기가 정말... 기묘하잖습니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm afraid there were no survivors.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm afraid there were no survivors.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Malibor: Voris, I think we need not fear our guest. Perhaps, in this time of need, the Great Serpent has delivered us a gift.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EEA4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D71"
msgid "We had feared as much. But it is good to know for certain."
msgstr "걱정했던 대로군요. 그래도 확실히 알게 돼서 다행입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance. &&& Malibor: But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious. &&& Malibor: And perhaps our guest's intent should be determined before we take further action.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What appears accidental to humans may be veiled purpose from the Great Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D70"
msgid "This was an accident. I didn't mean to wind up here."
msgstr "우연이었어요. 여기를 찾아올 생각은 없었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Something clearly went wrong. &&& ...  &&& Malibor: I do not disagree, and I know that security, in whatever small form we can grasp it, is of paramount importance. &&& Malibor: But you must acknowledge the timing is... curious. &&& Malibor: And perhaps our guest's intent should be determined before we take further action.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What appears accidental to humans may be veiled purpose from the Great Serpent...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE9C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6F"
msgid "Like I said, this was an accident. I didn't mean to wind up here."
msgstr "아까도 말했지만, 우연이었어요. 여기를 찾아올 생각은 없었다고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: This was an accident. I didn't mean to wind up here.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: This was an accident. I didn't mean to wind up here.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE9B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6E"
msgid "What appears accidental to humans may be veiled purpose from the Great Serpent..."
msgstr "인간에게는 우연으로 보이는 것이 위대한 뱀께는 감춰진 목적일지도 모를 일..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's just forget any of this happened, and I'll be on my way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's just forget any of this happened, and I'll be on my way.
#. ALIAS: Malibor
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE97
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6D"
msgid "That, I fear, may be impossible under the circumstances. Voris is right, we have not had any uninvited callers in quite some time."
msgstr "안됐지만 지금 상황에서는 불가능할 것 같군요. 보리스 말대로, 우린 꽤 오랫동안 초대받지 않은 방문객을 받지 않았으니 말입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am here to pledge loyalty to House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I am here to pledge loyalty to House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6C"
msgid "Are you now? Most curious indeed."
msgstr "지금 말입니까? 더더욱이 기묘하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I am here to pledge loyalty to House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMaliborDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE99
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6B"
msgid "I am afraid that, not having been born of House Va'ruun, that may prove a complicated matter..."
msgstr "걱정되는 건, 바룬 가문 태생이 아니라는 점이 복잡한 문제가 될지도 모른다는 건데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Anasko
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Have I failed you? What is this place, where am I? Why do you not show yourself?
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Please, do not leave me in darkness!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 0102EE96
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage300_AnaskoArrivalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000D6A"
msgid "I strive only to follow your command... All Must Serve!"
