msgid "Ha, you can't be serious. Why would we want to help the Zealots? We're in the business of hunting them."
msgstr "하, 진심이세요? 우리가 왜 광신도를 돕겠어요? 우리는 그들을 사냥하는 일을 하고 있는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD9"
msgid "If a trespasser comes into your home and threatens your livelihood, do you not have the right to defend yourself?"
msgstr "만약 침입자가 자네 집에 들어와 네 생계를 위협한다면, 너는 스스로를 방어할 권리가 있지 않겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
