#. TOPIC: 0102B6A7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD8"
msgid "There was no murder. Only self-defense."
msgstr "살인은 없었다. 정당방위였을 뿐."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: It is that kind of thinking that will delay the Shrouding. But it's clear I have no sway over you.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
