msgctxt "000CD5"
msgid "Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word."
msgstr "훌륭하군. 자네가 약속을 지키는 사람이라고 믿겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: House Ka'dic.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C43F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD4"
msgid "Hm... they did assign someone to work the spaceport."
msgstr "흠... 카딕 가문이 우주항에서 일할 사람을 배정하긴 했지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: House Ka'dic.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C43F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD3"
msgid "And the ship departure dates of the Cortege also match the date the supplies were lost."
msgstr "그리고 코테지 호의 출항 날짜도 물자가 사라진 날짜와 일치하는군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] It's funny how I keep lying to your face and you keep believing me. You aren't leaving this cave.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] It's funny how I keep lying to your face and you keep believing me. You aren't leaving this cave.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD2"
msgid "Hmph. I expected more from you than these childish little taunts. So be it. Guards!"
msgstr "흥. 이런 유치한 도발보다는 더 나은 모습을 기대했는데. 정 그러시다면. 경비대!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it. &&& Tevina: Then you shall have precisely that. &&& Tevina: But that aside, let's get to the guts of the issue, hm? After reading through the evidence, where do you think the supply thief is from?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Fine. Keep your secrets. I'll do the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C438
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD1"
msgid "I'm not at liberty to say."
msgstr "말씀드릴 수 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not at liberty to say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not at liberty to say.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest.
