#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CD0"
msgid "Fine. Keep your secrets. I'll do the same."
msgstr "좋아요. 비밀을 지키세요. 저도 그렇게 할 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've been very busy. In fact, I'm on my way to have you arrested.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I've been very busy. In fact, I'm on my way to have you arrested.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B69F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CCF"
msgid "Choose your words carefully. Convert or not, you're still an outsider."
msgstr "말조심해라. 개종자든 아니든, 넌 여전히 이방인이다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I've been very busy. In fact, I'm on my way to have you arrested.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But before you proceed into that room, I must ask, do you have the proof you need? Is it solid?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B69F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CCE"
msgid "Which is just a stone's throw away from trespasser."
msgstr "그건 무단 침입자나 다름없지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We'll need at least three additional Wardens to take this location and secure it. &&& Tevina: Then you shall have precisely that. &&& Tevina: But that aside, let's get to the guts of the issue, hm? After reading through the evidence, where do you think the supply thief is from?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's all right. Take a guess.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C435
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC9"
msgid "I don't really know?"
msgstr "잘 모르겠는데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All Zealots deserve nothing less than death. &&& Mujeen: It is that kind of thinking that will delay the Shrouding. But it's clear I have no sway over you. &&& Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hmph. I expected more from you than these childish little taunts. So be it. Guards!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC8"
msgid "[Attack] It's funny how I keep lying to your face and you keep believing me. You aren't leaving this cave."
msgstr "[공격] 앞에서 계속 거짓말을 하는데도 절 계속 믿는 게 웃기네요. 당신은 이 동굴에서 못 나가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Hm... they did assign someone to work the spaceport.|And the ship departure dates of the Cortege also match the date the supplies were lost.|I think you may be on to something.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Do you have a plan for how you'll infiltrate the hideout?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C436
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC7"
msgid "Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest."
msgstr "뭐, 도둑이 누구든, 잔다르의 안식처에서 더 많은 단서를 찾을 수 있을 거라는 건 거의 확실하다고 생각해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is it?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC4"
msgid "A slate incriminating Ochim Ka'dic as the murderer of Ukaru Dul'kehf and the primary contact with the Zealots."
msgstr "오킴 카딕이 우카루 둘케프를 살해하고 광신도와 주로 접촉한 자라는 증거가 담긴 슬레이트다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is it?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I'll take this to Qisrani.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC3"
msgid "The recording is mostly authentic, but the ending has been heavily edited to absolve me of all involvement."
msgstr "녹음은 대부분 진짜지만, 마지막 부분은 내가 연루된 부분을 쏙 빼놓기 위해 교묘하게 편집됐더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: 
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Choose your words carefully. Convert or not, you're still an outsider. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B6A0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CC2"
msgid "I've been very busy. In fact, I'm on my way to have you arrested."
msgstr "저는 아주 바쁘거든요. 사실, 당신을 체포하러 가는 길이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I think we can all agree that the charges for this crime are quite serious.|Theft of supplies, aiding the Zealots, and the murder of my cousin.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I couldn't agree more. And my findings back that accusation up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B68E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CB4"
msgid "Which is why it comes with great shock, that evidence points to a member of House Ka'dic as the thief."
msgstr "그렇기 때문에 카딕 가문의 일원이 도둑이라는 증거가 나왔다는 사실이 매우 충격적입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: House Dul'kehf.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102C43B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CAE"
msgid "Now that would be a twist! But I doubt they would've authorized the death of her own cousin."
msgstr "그거 참 대반전이겠네요! 하지만 그들이 자기 사촌을 죽이는 걸 허락했을 것 같지는 않아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Exhales*, I appreciate you backing me up on this one. |Warden Veth'aal had brought some evidence linking Mujeen to the crime, but it's your evidence that makes me feel confident we can convict.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B687
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CAC"
msgid "I must admit, I am a bit skeptical that House Ka'dic would be so ignorant of his dealings."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 저는 카딕 가문이 무진의 거래를 그렇게 모르고 있었을 거라는 데 약간 회의적입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B687
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CAB"
msgid "But perhaps you've brought evidence that might back up his word."
msgstr "하지만 아마도 당신이 무진의 말을 뒷받침할 증거를 가져왔을지도 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Exhales*, I appreciate you backing me up on this one. |Warden Veth'aal had brought some evidence linking Mujeen to the crime, but it's your evidence that makes me feel confident we can convict.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Yes, Mujeen's innocent. This should exonerate him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B687
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CAA"
msgid "And while he stopped short of confessing, I think it's safe to say we got our man."
msgstr "그리고 무진이 자백을 하진 않았지만, 범인을 잡았다고 봐도 무방할 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Well, any additional evidence is always helpful. Let's have a look.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B686
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CA9"
msgid "And to be honest, I'm somewhat relieved. This could have been a political nightmare."
msgstr "그리고 솔직히 말해서, 저는 다소 안도감이 듭니다. 이건 정치적인 악몽이 될 수도 있었거든요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'll take this up with the Captain of the guard. After that, our part in all of this done.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B686
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000CA8"
msgid "But since the thief seems to be a lone operative, House Ka'dic is clear of any involvement, as are the noble Houses."
msgstr "하지만 도둑은 단독으로 활동한 것 같으니, 카딕 가문은 물론이고 명문 가문들도 연루되지 않은 것으로 보입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C9E"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was my pleasure. &&& Qisrani: My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb. |For that, you will be well rewarded.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B67A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C99"
msgid "I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case."
msgstr "또한 베타알 가문에 있는 사건 관련 자료를 모두 넘겼습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all. &&& Qisrani: All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. I'll do my best to reward you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B673
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C95"
msgid "I didn't do it for you. I expect to be compensated."
msgstr "당신을 위해 한 일이 아닙니다. 보상을 받아야겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all. &&& Qisrani: All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B679
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C94"
msgid "It was my pleasure."
msgstr "천만에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was my pleasure.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was my pleasure.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B677
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C92"
msgid "My thanks are yours. You had no personal stake in solving my cousin's murder, yet you did so with diligence and aplomb."
msgstr "감사드립니다. 제 사촌의 살인 사건을 해결하는 데 개인적인 이해관계가 없으셨음에도 불구하고, 성실하고 침착하게 해결해 주셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was my pleasure.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B677
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C91"
msgid "For that, you will be well rewarded."
msgstr "일에 대한 보상은 충분히 해드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'm sorry you had to hear it this way. I know you two were close.|For what it's worth, it does seem to fit your theory, however, that Ochim was acting alone. &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B674
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C90"
msgid "All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service."
msgstr "결과적으로, 감사합니다. 제 사촌 살인범에게 복수했고, 공급망은 다시 한번 안전해졌습니다. 다즈라에 큰 공헌을 하셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Ha, this will be good for a laugh. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Thank you, Executor. But if Ochim was indeed a traitor to House Va'ruun, they he deserves no mourning. &&& Tevina: Hmph. This is all so convenient for you, Mujeen. You hardly seem fazed at all. &&& Qisrani: All told, I'm grateful. My cousin's murderer has been avenged, and the supply chain is once again secure. You've done Dazra a great service.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's a well-known secret that Mujeen was not a popular member of House Ka'dic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B671
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C8F"
msgid "Will there be any blowback from arresting Mujeen?"
msgstr "무진을 체포하는 것에 반발하는 사람은 없을까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: And of course, you'll have my full cooperation as well. Any records regarding my ward you need, I will provide.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B66B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C8E"
msgid "Who knows what other crimes we can uncover while pouring over the evidence."
msgstr "증거를 샅샅이 조사하면 또 어떤 범죄를 밝혀낼 수 있을지도 모르죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Will there be any blowback from arresting Mujeen?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Will there be any blowback from arresting Mujeen?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B670
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C8C"
msgid "It's a well-known secret that Mujeen was not a popular member of House Ka'dic."
msgstr "무진이 카딕 가문에서 인기가 없었다는 건 공공연한 비밀입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: What about this talk of missing supplies? I would think the conversation starts there, hm? &&& Qisrani: I apologize, but with the cataclysm, the investigation has been slow going.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: You're putting the groat before the horns. The issue is not the supplies, it's the workforce!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B676
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C8A"
msgid "How convenient."
msgstr "참 편리하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do I know you'll keep your word?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do I know you'll keep your word?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B362
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C85"
msgid "Because I have nowhere else to go. Your testimony will be enough to launch an investigation, after which there will undoubtedly be things uncovered."
msgstr ""
"내가 갈 곳이 없기 때문이다. 자네의 증언만 있어도 수사를 시작하기에 충분할 것이고, 그 후에는 의심할 여지 없이 밝혀지는 것들이 있을 "
"거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How do I know you'll keep your word?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: All Zealots deserve nothing less than death.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B362
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C84"
msgid "It's far better for me if I get ahead of the inquiry, confess my crimes, and ask for clemency."
msgstr "내가 수사보다 앞서서, 내 범죄를 자백하고, 선처를 구하는 것이 훨씬 낫겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't do it for you. I expect to be compensated.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I didn't do it for you. I expect to be compensated.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B672
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C83"
msgid "Of course. I'll do my best to reward you."
msgstr "물론입니다. 최대한 보상해 드리도록 하겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I didn't do it for you. I expect to be compensated.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I've also handed over everything we have at House Veth'aal regarding the case.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B672
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C82"
msgid "And yes, I'm aware you had no personal stake in solving this. But that makes me appreciate your efforts all the more."
msgstr "물론 알아요. 당신에게 직접적인 이득이 있는 일은 아니었겠죠. 그래서 더더욱 힘써주신 당신에게 감사를 표하고 싶군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: All right. You have a deal.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C81"
msgid "You are doing House Va'ruun a great service."
msgstr "바룬 가문에 큰 공헌을 했군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: All right. You have a deal.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: This is foolish. The Zealots are irredeemable. You are attempting to tame a wild animal that only wants to devour you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C80"
msgid "Even if reconciliation is farfetched, we can still influence and convert individual members of House Ma'leen."
msgstr "화해가 어렵더라도, 우리는 여전히 마린 가문의 개별 구성원들에게 영향을 미치고 개종시킬 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: You sell your honor cheaply. It is a disgrace.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF9E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C7E"
msgid "A small price to pay for the future of Dazra."
msgstr "다즈라의 미래를 위한 작은 대가다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C7B"
msgid "Goodbye, Vindicator."
msgstr "잘 가게. 옹호자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C7A"
msgid "Goodbye, Armiger."
msgstr "잘 가게. 복종자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C79"
msgid "Goodbye, Diviner."
msgstr "잘 가게. 예측자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C78"
msgid "Goodbye, Adherent."
msgstr "잘 가게. 지지자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C77"
msgid "Goodbye, Reverent."
msgstr "잘 가게. 숭배자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Excellent. I trust you are a person of your word.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B368
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102B6EE
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C76"
msgid "Goodbye, Harbinger."
msgstr "잘 가게. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I apologize, the Envoy and I were just discussing matters of state. &&& Mujeen: In particular, I offered to help find the missing supplies. I have my people looking into the matter as well.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205C8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C75"
msgid "Thank you for your diligence, Envoy. On that note, I hate to take up any more of your time than I already have."
msgstr "사절님, 노고에 감사드립니다. 이쯤에서, 이미 시간을 많이 뺏은 것 같으니 이만 가보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C74"
msgid "But I also trust my cousin's record keeping. It's hard to imagine he made a mistake."
msgstr "하지만 저는 사촌의 기록 관리 능력을 신뢰해요. 우카루가 실수를 저질렀다고 상상하긴 어렵죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default, Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: And to be honest, I'm somewhat relieved. This could have been a political nightmare.|But since the thief seems to be a lone operative, House Ka'dic is clear of any involvement, as are the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Jinan grace you for taking on this investigation. You've done a great service for House Va'ruun and for Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B685
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000C73"
msgid "I'll take this up with the Captain of the guard. After that, our part in all of this done."
msgstr "이 문제는 경비대장에게 맡기겠습니다. 그 후, 이 모든 일에서 우리의 역할은 끝납니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'll take this up with the Captain of the guard. After that, our part in all of this done.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And on a personal note, I want to extend my gratitude for avenging my cousin's murder.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B675
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_300_Greeting_MujeenKadicAccused
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000C72"
msgid "Jinan grace you for taking on this investigation. You've done a great service for House Va'ruun and for Dazra."
msgstr "이 수사를 맡아주셔서 지난의 은총이 함께하기를. 바룬 가문과 다즈라에 큰 공헌을 하셨습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_010_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000C71"
msgid "Excuse me."
msgstr "실례합니다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I would say that kind of work will be unnecessary going forward. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B661
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C70"
msgid "So when are you going to let me in on some real work?"
msgstr "그래서 언제 제대로 된 일을 시작하게 해 줄 겁니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Which would be treason if it were true. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B660
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6F"
msgid "Light treason, sure. But still, they're paying real creds for it. That's not going to make them allies. It just makes them customers."
msgstr ""
"물론 가벼운 반역죄가 되겠죠. 광신도들이 값을 잘 쳐주긴 하지만 그렇게 해선 그 무리를 동맹으로 만들 순 없어요. 고객이 될 뿐이죠."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So when are you going to let me in on some real work?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6E"
msgid "I would say that kind of work will be unnecessary going forward."
msgstr "앞으로 그런 일을 할 필요가 없어졌다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, funny you should mention that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6D"
msgid "The time for armigers is over. An armistice could benefit boths sides."
msgstr "전쟁의 시대는 끝났어. 휴전이 양쪽 모두에게 이득이 되는 길이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I would say that kind of work will be unnecessary going forward. |The time for armigers is over. An armistice could benefit boths sides.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6C"
msgid "Well, funny you should mention that."
msgstr "당신이 그런 말을 하다니 웃기군요."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Which would be treason if it were true. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6B"
msgid "I've heard rumblings someone at House Ka'dic was trying to make a truce with the Zealots, by selling them supplies."
msgstr "카딕 가문 일원 중 한 명이 물자를 팔아 광신도들과 휴전을 맺으려 한다는 소문을 들었습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Well, funny you should mention that.|I've heard rumblings someone at House Ka'dic was trying to make a truce with the Zealots, by selling them supplies.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Light treason, sure. But still, they're paying real creds for it. That's not going to make them allies. It just makes them customers. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C6A"
msgid "Which would be treason if it were true."
msgstr "사실이라면 반역죄겠지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Good point. And now you have the gears in my head turning. If we were to GIVE them the supplies...
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C69"
msgid "They might just swear their loyalty to you. Damn, that's an incredible idea."
msgstr "그럼 그 무리가 당신에게 충성을 맹세할 수도 있겠죠. 젠장, 완전 좋은 생각인데요."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Static*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C68"
msgid "If you want me to look into it, all you need to do is say the word."
msgstr "말만 하면, 제가 진행해 보겠습니다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It was never about the Zealots. It was about making sure you'd be okay.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B658
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C67"
msgid "Hey. I know you'll have questions, but just know that all the crap they're saying about me isn't true."
msgstr "동생아, 의문점이 많겠지만 나에 대한 소문은 사실이 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Mujeen tacked on this line at a much later date to make himself seem innocent. It should be somewhat mismatched with the natural dialogue
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Static*
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B65A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C66"
msgid "But, no. Absolutely not. What you speak of is treason. I will have no part in it."
msgstr "그렇지만, 절대 안 돼. 명백한 반역죄야. 난 하지 않겠어."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And if anyone asks, tell them you want nothing to do with a traitor like me. Better that way.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B657
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C65"
msgid "I love you sis."
msgstr "사랑한다 동생아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): It was never about the Zealots. It was about making sure you'd be okay.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And if anyone asks, tell them you want nothing to do with a traitor like me. Better that way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B656
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C64"
msgid "You don't have to worry about money now. Goes without saying, but don't tell anyone how and where you got it."
msgstr "돈 걱정은 이제 안 해도 돼. 당연한 말이지만, 어디서 그 돈을 얻었는지는 아무한테도 말하지 마."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You don't have to worry about money now. Goes without saying, but don't tell anyone how and where you got it.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I love you sis.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B655
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C62"
msgid "And if anyone asks, tell them you want nothing to do with a traitor like me. Better that way."
msgstr "누가 물어보면, 나 같은 배신자와는 관계 없다고 해. 그게 나을 거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Light treason, sure. But still, they're paying real creds for it. That's not going to make them allies. It just makes them customers. |And when's the last time you stuck your neck out for the guy who serves you groat?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): They might just swear their loyalty to you. Damn, that's an incredible idea. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B654
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C61"
msgid "Good point. And now you have the gears in my head turning. If we were to GIVE them the supplies..."
msgstr "좋은 지적이군. 그래서 생각난 게, 만약 우리가 물품을 그냥 공짜로 준다면..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Hey. I know you'll have questions, but just know that all the crap they're saying about me isn't true.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): You don't have to worry about money now. Goes without saying, but don't tell anyone how and where you got it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0102B653
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog05
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C60"
msgid "It was never about the Zealots. It was about making sure you'd be okay."
msgstr "광신도 무리를 위해 한 게 아냐. 다 널 위해서 한 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: *pained breathing* *struggling* I cannot give up...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0120_Sirak_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C5C"
msgid "This does not bode well..."
msgstr "좋은 징조는 아닌데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: *pained breathing* *struggling* I cannot give up...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
