#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0120_Sirak_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C5B"
msgid "Okay, that happened..."
msgstr "그래, 방금 그건..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: *pained breathing* *struggling* I cannot give up...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0120_Sirak_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C5A"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr "뭐야...?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: *pained breathing* *struggling* I cannot give up...
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F3
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0120_Sirak_InitialScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C59"
msgid "Did you see that?"
msgstr "그거 봤어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5000_Companion_FirstImpressionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C58"
msgid "This place..."
msgstr "여기는..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5000_Companion_FirstImpressionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C57"
msgid "I'd like to say there's a scientific explanation, but... I got nothing."
msgstr "과학적으로 설명할 수 있다고 말해주고 싶은데... 할 말이 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5000_Companion_FirstImpressionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C56"
msgid "Not gonna lie... This place officially gives me the creeps."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서... 여기 있으니 진짜로 소름 돋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F4
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5000_Companion_FirstImpressionScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C55"
msgid "What happened here?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5020_Companion_VortexWallScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C54"
msgid "Such a strange energy..."
msgstr "정말 이상한 에너지야..."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5020_Companion_VortexWallScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C53"
msgid "I like to think I'm an expert in \"weird,\" but I've never seen anything like this."
msgstr "내가 '괴상망측' 전문가이기는 한데, 이런 건 지금껏 한 번도 못 봤어."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5020_Companion_VortexWallScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C52"
msgid "Yeah, I'm not even going to try to go through there."
msgstr "그래, 난 저길 통과할 생각도 안 할 거야."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F2
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5020_Companion_VortexWallScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C51"
msgid "What a strange manifestation... and unfortunately it's blocking our path."
msgstr "정말 이상한 현상이네... 운 없게도 우리 길을 막고 있고 말이지."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5010_Companion_PrayerRoomScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C50"
msgid "That symbol... It can't be."
msgstr "저 상징은... 말도 안 돼."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5010_Companion_PrayerRoomScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4F"
msgid "Whoa, that's House Va'ruun's mark."
msgstr "와, 저거 바룬 가문 표식이잖아."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5010_Companion_PrayerRoomScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4E"
msgid "If I'm not mistaken, that's House Va'ruun's symbol up there."
msgstr "내가 착각한 게 아니라면, 저 위에 있는 상징은 바룬 가문인데."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F1
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5010_Companion_PrayerRoomScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4D"
msgid "My god... That's a House Va'ruun symbol."
msgstr "세상에... 저건 바룬 가문 상징이잖아."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5030_Companion_DisposalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4C"
msgid "Perfect timing."
msgstr "타이밍 끝내주네."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5030_Companion_DisposalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4B"
msgid "Of all the ways to die, \"crushed by disposal unit\" is the least appealing."
msgstr "죽는 방법이야 여럿 있지만, '폐기물 처리기에 구겨지기'는 제일 싫다고."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5030_Companion_DisposalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C4A"
msgid "Even the starstation is out to get us."
msgstr "우주정거장까지 우릴 엿 먹이네."

#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9F0
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_5030_Companion_DisposalScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C49"
msgid "Let's not do that again."
msgstr "다시는 그러지 말자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You sound surprised.
