msgid "This station, the Oracle. It's House Va'ruun."
msgstr "이 오라클이라는 정거장, 바룬 가문 소속이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: This station, the Oracle. It's House Va'ruun.
