#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C47"
msgid "Did you know about the Oracle?"
msgstr "오라클에 대해서 알고 있었어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you know about the Oracle? 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you know about the Oracle? 
#. ALIAS: Andreja
