#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C46"
msgid "I did not. The Oracle and its purpose are far beyond my knowledge."
msgstr "나도 몰랐어. 오라클이랑 그 목적은 내가 전혀 모르는 내용이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: This station, the Oracle. It's House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
