#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0000_Andreja_HouseVaruunScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C45"
msgid "You sound surprised."
msgstr "놀란 모양이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Andreja: This station, the Oracle. It's House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I too had a feeling, the moment we arrived in orbit.
