#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C44"
msgid "I knew it. Somehow, I just knew it."
msgstr "난 알고 있었어. 왠지는 모르겠지만, 그냥 알겠더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I knew it. Somehow, I just knew it.
