#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C42"
msgid "What do you think it's doing out here?"
msgstr "우주정거장이 여기서 뭘 하고 있었던 걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think it's doing out here? 
