msgid "I do not know, but something did not go as planned."
msgstr "뭔진 모르겠지만, 뭔가 계획대로 안 풀린 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sound surprised.
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0000_Andreja_HouseVaruunScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C40"
msgid "A station of this magnitude would never leave Va'ruun'kai's orbit."
msgstr "이 정도로 큰 정거장은 바룬카이 궤도를 절대 못 벗어나거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0000_Andreja_HouseVaruunScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C3F"
msgid "These... Phantoms, these energy fields..."
msgstr "이... 유령들, 이 역장은..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to MQ01Player
#. ALIAS: Andreja
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 0102B9DA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0000_Andreja_HouseVaruunScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C3E"
msgid "Whatever happened to these people must have been horrible."
msgstr "이 신민들이 무슨 일을 겪었는진 몰라도 끔찍했던 건 확실해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking of what to do next and cuts themselves off at a sudden realization that someone is coming. / Thinking / to GravityTerminal
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sirak: The gravity... Restoring the gravity may pull the cell into place.
#. ALIAS: Sirak
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sirak: No. They are coming!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ01
#. TOPIC: 010121DD
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ01_0810_Sirak_GravityScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C3D"
msgid "If I can get to the control room. If I can --"
msgstr "제어실에 가기만 하면 돼. 도착하면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: You must feel the tremors getting worse. This place could collapse at any moment! What reason did we have to turn that drill back on?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC07Int01_EavesdroppingScene01
#. TOPIC: 0102B8DD
#. SCENE: DLC001LC07EavesdroppingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C3B"
msgid "And abandon our post? Enough! Our orders are to stay here."
msgstr "그리고 우리 자리를 버리라고? 그만! 우리 명령은 여기 머무는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: And abandon our post? Enough! Our orders are to stay here. &&& Actor02: You must feel the tremors getting worse. This place could collapse at any moment! What reason did we have to turn that drill back on?
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Patience will be our death sentence...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC07Int01_EavesdroppingScene01
#. TOPIC: 0102B8DB
#. SCENE: DLC001LC07EavesdroppingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C3A"
msgid "We are not to ask questions. Patience, brother, and have faith."
msgstr "우리는 질문해선 안 돼. 인내심을 가져, 형제여, 그리고 믿음을 가져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to SceneTrigger01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: And abandon our post? Enough! Our orders are to stay here.
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor01: We are not to ask questions. Patience, brother, and have faith.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC07Int01_EavesdroppingScene01
#. TOPIC: 0102B8DC
#. SCENE: DLC001LC07EavesdroppingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C39"
msgid "You must feel the tremors getting worse. This place could collapse at any moment! What reason did we have to turn that drill back on?"
msgstr "진동이 점점 심해지는 게 느껴질 거야. 여긴 언제 무너져도 이상하지 않아! 우리가 저 드릴을 다시 켠 이유가 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to SceneTrigger01
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor02: You must feel the tremors getting worse. This place could collapse at any moment! What reason did we have to turn that drill back on? &&& Actor01: We are not to ask questions. Patience, brother, and have faith.
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale02
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC07Int01_EavesdroppingScene01
#. TOPIC: 0102B8DA
#. SCENE: DLC001LC07EavesdroppingScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C38"
msgid "Patience will be our death sentence..."
msgstr "인내심은 우리에게 사형 선고가 될 거야..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C37"
msgid "This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log."
msgstr "저는 시락 베타알입니다. 사고 기록을 남깁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We were in orbit, directly above Dazra, monitoring our current experiments when we experienced a sudden energy surge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C36"
msgid "Something has gone horribly wrong."
msgstr "뭔가가 끔찍하게 잘못됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C35"
msgid "This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log."
msgstr "저는 시락 베타알입니다. 사고 기록을 남깁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Not only that, but I believe the initial surge of energy we experienced is transformative.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EE
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C34"
msgid "The Oracle has continued to jump. It is completely out of our control."
msgstr "오라클은 계속 도약하고 있습니다. 완전히 통제 불능이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log.|The Oracle has continued to jump. It is completely out of our control.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): With each passing day, more of the crew succumb to whatever residual energy we were exposed to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9ED
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C33"
msgid "Not only that, but I believe the initial surge of energy we experienced is transformative."
msgstr "그것뿐만 아니라, 우리가 처음 겪었던 에너지 쇄도가 변형을 유발하는 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log.|Something has gone horribly wrong.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C31"
msgid "We were in orbit, directly above Dazra, monitoring our current experiments when we experienced a sudden energy surge."
msgstr "우리는 다즈라 바로 위 궤도에서 실험을 모니터링 하고 있었는데, 갑작스럽게 에너지 쇄도를 만나게 됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We thought members of the crew were somehow lost in the jump...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EC
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C30"
msgid "I fear the source came from the city itself. It triggered our Grav Drive and jumped the Oracle to an unknown location."
msgstr "그 에너지가 도시에서 발생한 것 같아 걱정이군요. 에너지가 중력 구동기를 작동시켜 오라클을 알 수 없는 장소로 이동시켰습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log.|I am one of the few remaining unaffected crew on the Oracle. Nadine, Basira, and Taras are the only others I was able to find.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2F"
msgid "I fear it is just a matter of time before we succumb to this energy that is turning the others."
msgstr "우리도 다른 이들을 변화시킨 이 에너지에 삼켜지는 게 시간 문제인 건 아닐지 두렵습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Basira and I have programmed the Oracle to return to Va'ruun'kai's orbit once it is able.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E6
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2E"
msgid "How long will we last? And will my mind be strong enough to hold out when my time comes?"
msgstr "얼마나 버틸 수 있을까요? 그때가 되면 제가 견딜 수 있을 만큼 제 정신이 강할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pausing mid sentence to wonder if what he's about to say is really true / Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We thought members of the crew were somehow lost in the jump...|But later, we were attacked by what I will refer to as Vortex Phantoms. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2D"
msgid "I thought I... recognized some of them."
msgstr "그 중에 몇 명은... 제가 아는 얼굴 같더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EA
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2C"
msgid "Could it be that the energy surge has somehow transformed them and warped their minds?"
msgstr "그 에너지 쇄도가 사람들을 변화시키고 정신을 뒤틀어 놓은 것일까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2B"
msgid "Most are instantly hostile, but we discovered some are able to retain a sense of self, at least momentarily."
msgstr "대부분은 즉시 적대화되지만, 몇 명은 적어도 잠깐이나마 자아를 유지할 수 있다는 사실을 발견했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Not only that, but I believe the initial surge of energy we experienced is transformative.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E9
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate03Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C2A"
msgid "With each passing day, more of the crew succumb to whatever residual energy we were exposed to."
msgstr "날이 갈수록 더 많은 승무원들이 우리가 노출됐던 잔여 에너지에 굴복하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EF
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C27"
msgid "This is Sirak Veth'aal. Post incident log."
msgstr "저는 시락 베타알입니다. 사고 기록을 남깁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Basira pronounced bah-SEER-ah. Taras pronounced tar-ahs. / Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I fear it is just a matter of time before we succumb to this energy that is turning the others.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E7
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C26"
msgid "I am one of the few remaining unaffected crew on the Oracle. Nadine, Basira, and Taras are the only others I was able to find."
msgstr "저는 오라클에서 영향을 받지 않은 몇 안 되는 승무원 중 한 명입니다. 제가 찾은 승무원은 나딘, 바시라, 타라스 뿐이었죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We were in orbit, directly above Dazra, monitoring our current experiments when we experienced a sudden energy surge.|I fear the source came from the city itself. It triggered our Grav Drive and jumped the Oracle to an unknown location.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C25"
msgid "We thought members of the crew were somehow lost in the jump..."
msgstr "처음에는 승무원들이 도약 도중에 길을 잃은 줄 알았죠..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I thought I... recognized some of them. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9EB
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate01Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C24"
msgid "But later, we were attacked by what I will refer to as Vortex Phantoms."
msgstr "하지만 그 후에, 제가 볼텍스 유령이라고 부를 존재들에게 공격당했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I fear it is just a matter of time before we succumb to this energy that is turning the others.|How long will we last? And will my mind be strong enough to hold out when my time comes?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C23"
msgid "Basira and I have programmed the Oracle to return to Va'ruun'kai's orbit once it is able."
msgstr "전 바시라와 함께 상황이 가능해지는 즉시 오라클이 바룬카이 궤도로 돌아가도록 프로그램 해뒀습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C22"
msgid "All of our research will automatically be transmitted the moment we are within Dazra's range."
msgstr "우리 모든 연구 자료가 다즈라 범위 내로 들어가는 즉시 자동으로 전송될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCXSirakVethaal
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_AudioLogsQuest_CT
#. TOPIC: 0102B9E5
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_AudioLogs_MQ01_SirakSlate04Scene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000C21"
msgid "I pray our work here was not in vain."
msgstr "우리의 노력이 헛되지 않았기를 기도합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_JandarsRest_MujeenBlockerGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000BFE"
msgid "We can present the evidence when you're ready. I will count on you to follow my lead."
msgstr "준비되면 증거를 제시해 보이겠다. 지시를 따라 주길 바란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra. &&& companion: You sell your honor cheaply. It is a disgrace.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B366
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BFD"
msgid "*Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply."
msgstr "*한숨* 따를 수밖에 없겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens to Jandar's Rest if I agree to your terms?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happens to Jandar's Rest if I agree to your terms?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B364
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BFB"
msgid "We'll have to burn that location regardless. I imagine Tevina has likely sent her inquisitors to clear the place anyway."
msgstr "그 장소는 어쨌든 불태워야 할 거다. 테비나가 이미 그곳을 정리하라고 심문관들을 보냈을 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happens to Jandar's Rest if I agree to your terms?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B364
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BFA"
msgid "I trust you'll understand if I don't reveal the location of their next hideout."
msgstr "그들의 다음 은신처 위치를 밝히지 않는다고 해도 이해해 주리라 믿겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We'll have to burn that location regardless. I imagine Tevina has likely sent her inquisitors to clear the place anyway.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B365
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF9"
msgid "What happens to Jandar's Rest if I agree to your terms?"
msgstr "당신이 제안한 조건에 동의하면, 잔다르의 안식처는 어떻게 되는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: VeryAngry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Attack] On second thought, I think I'll just kill you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Attack] On second thought, I think I'll just kill you.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: VeryAngry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B360
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF8"
msgid "You lying little- Ugh, you leave me no choice!"
msgstr "이 거짓말쟁이 같은... 윽, 다른 선택의 여지가 없게 만드는군!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply.  &&& Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra. &&& Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because I have nowhere else to go. Your testimony will be enough to launch an investigation, after which there will undoubtedly be things uncovered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B363
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF7"
msgid "How do I know you'll keep your word?"
msgstr "약속을 지킨다는 보장은 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply.  &&& Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra. &&& Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will try, but I have found them to be as stubborn as their namesake implies. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF6"
msgid "Tell your friends to leave this hideout if they want to live."
msgstr "살고 싶으면 친구들한테 이 은신처에서 떠나라고 하시죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: House Veth'aal is involved in more than just employment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF5"
msgid "Where did you acquire the information on your terminal?"
msgstr "단말기에 있는 정보는 어디서 얻었습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF4"
msgid "Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal."
msgstr "그래서 내 제안을 들어주길 바란다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF3"
msgid "Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun."
msgstr "나를 풀어줘. 바룬 가문의 발전을 위해, 내가 은밀하게 활동을 계속할 수 있도록 허락해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply.  &&& Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra. &&& Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would expect nothing less from someone of your capabilities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF2"
msgid "You better keep your word, or I'll come back for you."
msgstr "약속 꼭 지키세요. 안 그러면 다시 찾아올 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF1"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice."
msgstr ""
"미안하지만, 여기서 내 노력이 헛되게 하도록 내버려 두지 않을 거다. 나를 보내주든지, 아니면 무기를 뽑아라. 다른 선택지는 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BF0"
msgid "United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade."
msgstr "마린 가문과 연합하면, 우리는 다즈라의 산업과 군사력을 뱀의 성전 당시 수준으로 재건할 수 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Tevina Veth'aal orchestrated this whole thing, and this recording proves it.|And I must say, I take some small amount of pleasure in what's about to happen. |The Warden has no idea what's coming. She will reap what she has sown.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BEF"
msgid "A handful of supply shipments are a meager exchange for an entire clan of allies."
msgstr "한 줌의 물자를 교환해봤자 우리 집단 전체 물자에 비하면 사소하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You are doing House Va'ruun a great service.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BEE"
msgid "All right. You have a deal."
msgstr "좋습니다. 거래 성사됐습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Please. You made no grand gesture. You violated the law, and aided those who want us dead.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BED"
msgid "Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture."
msgstr "자네의 경솔한 태도는 날 더 확신하게 만들 뿐이다. 자네는 눈앞에 있는 것만 보고, 큰 그림을 보지 못하는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: *Sigh* I see I have little choice but to comply.  &&& Mujeen: I'll turn myself into the guard and confess to my role in the crime.|But I fear this may be a death sentence for both the people of Jandar's Rest, and Dazra. &&& Mujeen: I'm sorry, but I will not let my work here go to waste. Either let me go or draw your weapon. There is no other choice.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You lying little- Ugh, you leave me no choice!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B361
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BEC"
msgid "[Attack] On second thought, I think I'll just kill you."
msgstr "[공격] 생각이 변했어요. 그냥 당신을 죽여야겠네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You said so yourself. My ward, Ochim, was deeply embedded in this operation, and thus serves as the perfect suspect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BEB"
msgid "If I let you go, who will take the fall for the murder?"
msgstr "내가 당신을 보내주면, 누가 살인죄를 뒤집어쓰게 되는 거죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell your friends to leave this hideout if they want to live.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell your friends to leave this hideout if they want to live.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BEA"
msgid "I will try, but I have found them to be as stubborn as their namesake implies."
msgstr "노력은 해보겠지만, 그자들 이름에 걸맞게 고집이 보통 센 게 아니더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell your friends to leave this hideout if they want to live.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE9"
msgid "Given the choice they will choose martyrdom over cowardice."
msgstr "선택하라면 비겁해지느니 순교를 택할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does the leadership in House Ka'dic know about this?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Does the leadership in House Ka'dic know about this?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE8"
msgid "No. I have kept my actions separated from both Razma and Djimal."
msgstr "아니. 내 행동은 라즈마나 지말과는 관련이 없다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does the leadership in House Ka'dic know about this?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE7"
msgid "My goal was to inform them once I had something more concrete."
msgstr "보다 확실한 걸 손에 넣은 이후에 알릴 생각이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does the leadership in House Ka'dic know about this?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE6"
msgid "That all went out the door once Ukaru Dul'kehf caught wind of the missing shipments."
msgstr "그런데 우카루 둘케프가 선적물 분실 사실을 알게 되면서 모든 게 틀어졌다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Your flippant attitude only gives me more conviction. You only see what's in front of you, and not the big picture.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE5"
msgid "Let you go? I didn't realize you were a comedian, Mujeen."
msgstr "당신을 보내달라고요? 코미디언인 줄은 몰랐네요. 무진."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. I have kept my actions separated from both Razma and Djimal. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE4"
msgid "Does the leadership in House Ka'dic know about this?"
msgstr "카딕 가문의 지도부는 이 사실을 압니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I let you go, who will take the fall for the murder?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: If I let you go, who will take the fall for the murder?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE3"
msgid "I have a ward, Ochim, who I've used to keep myself separated from this operation, and also serves as the perfect suspect."
msgstr "내겐 오킴이라는 피후견자가 있는데, 나를 이번 작전에서 떨어트려 놓는 데 이용했고, 따라서 완전히 용의선상에 올라가 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: If I let you go, who will take the fall for the murder?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE2"
msgid "I'll arrange for him to conveniently disappear. While loyal, it's better for us both if he isn't available for questioning."
msgstr "오킴이 알맞게 사라지도록 조치하겠다. 충성스럽긴 해도, 심문받지 않도록 하는 게 우리 모두에게 좋으니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you acquire the information on your terminal?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B359
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE1"
msgid "House Veth'aal is involved in more than just employment."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 고용 이상의 일에 관여하고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B359
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BE0"
msgid "We also find and hunt down heretics. And of all the Wardens here, I consider myself the best at it."
msgstr "우리는 또한 이단자를 찾아내 사냥합니다. 그리고 여기 있는 모든 교정관 중에서도 제가 그 일에 가장 뛰어나다고 자부합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B359
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDF"
msgid "Once I got the details of your case, it was simple to distill all the intel we had into a handful of files. Technology, am I right?"
msgstr "당신 사건의 세부 사항을 파악하고 나니, 우리가 가진 모든 정보를 몇 개의 파일로 추려내는 건 간단하더군요. 기술이란 게 참 좋죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A small price to pay for the future of Dazra.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF9F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDE"
msgid "[<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> Credits] My silence doesn't come cheap."
msgstr "[<Global=SFBGS001_MS01_Credit_BribeHigh> 크레딧] 저를 입 다물게 하려면 싸게는 안 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to go back to Dazra and surrender to the authorities.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're going to go back to Dazra and surrender to the authorities.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF9C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDD"
msgid "I had a feeling it would come to this, ever since that conversation at House Ka'dic."
msgstr "카딕 가문과 대화한 이래로 이렇게 되리라는 느낌이 들었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're going to go back to Dazra and surrender to the authorities.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF9C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDC"
msgid "So I brought a few extra guards just for this situation. I give the command, and you will not leave here alive."
msgstr "그래서 이런 상황에 대비해 경비대원을 몇 명 더 데려왔다. 내가 명령을 내리면, 너는 살아서 여기를 떠나지 못할 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I won't apologize for my actions. Everything I did, I did for Dazra.
