#. TOPIC: 0102AF6F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDB"
msgid "Of course you're trying to shift the blame. I'm not buying it."
msgstr "당연히 책임을 전가하려고 하시겠죠. 안 속아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Seems like you've been expecting me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you've been expecting me.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF6B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BDA"
msgid "Of course. You've managed to piece together this case at a pace I didn't anticipate."
msgstr "물론이다. 자네는 내가 예상치 못한 속도로 이 사건의 조각을 맞췄다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: 
