#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD9"
msgid "Seems like you've been expecting me."
msgstr "저를 기다리고 있었나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: I've been thinking about the events of the past few days and I have some thoughts.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
