#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD8"
msgid "The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated."
msgstr "일이 풀리는 속도를 보니... 결과가 상당 부분 조작된 건 아닌지 의심스럽군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I have.
