#. TOPIC: 0102AF6E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 0102AF88
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD7"
msgid "You've been busy, Harbinger."
msgstr "바쁘시군. 선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD6"
msgid "Of course, I am not denying my role in all this."
msgstr "물론, 내가 이 모든 일에 관여했다는 걸 부정하지는 않겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD5"
msgid "Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots."
msgstr "그렇다. 내가 물자를 빼돌리라고 승인했다. 그리고, 그렇다. 광신도에게 물자를 보내라고 명령했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Of course you're trying to shift the blame. I'm not buying it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Of course you're trying to shift the blame. I'm not buying it.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It doesn't matter. You still need to answer for your crimes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF67
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD2"
msgid "I won't apologize for my actions. Everything I did, I did for Dazra."
msgstr "내 행동에 대해 사과하지 않겠다. 내가 한 모든 일은 다즈라를 위한 것이었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You better keep your word, or I'll come back for you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You better keep your word, or I'll come back for you.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh, and before we meet with Qisrani, take this slate. It should be enough to satisfy the Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102B35E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BD1"
msgid "I would expect nothing less from someone of your capabilities."
msgstr "자네 같은 능력자라면 그럴 줄 알았다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I admit that I was presented an opportunity, and took advantage of it.
