#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BCA"
msgid "So you admit to helping the Zealots."
msgstr "그럼 당신은 광신도들을 도왔다는 걸 인정하는 건가요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So you admit to helping the Zealots.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So you admit to helping the Zealots.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Someone has to take the fall.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF61
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC9"
msgid "I admit that I was presented an opportunity, and took advantage of it."
msgstr "기회가 왔었고, 그걸 이용했다는 건 인정한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes and no. I may have been pushed toward this outcome, but I do not regret my actions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF60
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC8"
msgid "You're saying you were manipulated."
msgstr "조종당했다 이겁니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're saying you were manipulated.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're saying you were manipulated.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: I have no idea what you have planned, but I know Tevina holds a grudge against me. So I have little faith this "trial" will be a fair one.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC7"
msgid "Yes and no. I may have been pushed toward this outcome, but I do not regret my actions."
msgstr "그렇기도 하고 아니기도 하다. 이런 결과로 내몰렸을 수는 있지만, 내 행동을 후회하지는 않는다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I offered to provide her a security detail. But I had arranged the assignment through my ward, Ochim.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC6"
msgid "What do you mean, protect her?"
msgstr "무슨 말이죠? 키스라니를 보호했다니요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm listening. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: The speed at which things have unraveled... it makes me wonder how much of this outcome has been orchestrated. &&& Mujeen: Of course, I am not denying my role in all this.|Yes, I approved to have the supplies rerouted. And yes, I ordered that they be directed to the Zealots. &&& Mujeen: But the murder of Qisrani Dul'kehf is not on my hands. I only sought to protect her, and the Zealots took things a step too far.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because we are all in need. Everyone was affected by the accident, including the people here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC5"
msgid "Why help the Zealots when Dazra is in need?"
msgstr "다즈라를 도와야지 왜 광신도들을 돕죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I have.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I have.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: But before you proceed into that room, I must ask, do you have the proof you need? Is it solid?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF59
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC4"
msgid "You're practically an oracle to have connected the dots so quickly. Even I did not expect you to make it so far, so fast."
msgstr "의심되는 점을 그렇게 빨리 연결하다니, 거의 예언자 수준이군. 나조차도 이렇게까지 빨리 해낼 줄은 몰랐다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: 
