msgctxt "000BC2"
msgid "I have."
msgstr "그랬지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why help the Zealots when Dazra is in need?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why help the Zealots when Dazra is in need?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC1"
msgid "Because we are all in need. Everyone was affected by the accident, including the people here."
msgstr "우리는 모두 도움이 필요하기 때문이다. 그 사고로 여기 있는 사람들을 포함해 모두가 피해를 입었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why help the Zealots when Dazra is in need?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BC0"
msgid "And if we are to reintegrate House Ma'leen, we need to show them our aid isn't contingent on our abundance."
msgstr "그리고 우리가 마린 가문을 재통합하려면, 우리의 도움이 우리의 풍족함에 달려 있지 않다는 걸 보여줄 필요가 있다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why help the Zealots when Dazra is in need?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: [Ochim's Recording] I know. I have evidence you were steered toward helping the Zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BBF"
msgid "How would it look if the moment our supplies had diminished, we kept them all for ourselves?"
msgstr "우리의 물자가 줄어든 순간, 우리만을 위해 그것들을 전부 챙긴다면 어떻게 보이겠나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You disappoint me, convert.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFA7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BBE"
msgid "You're going to come with me and surrender to the authorities."
msgstr "같이 당국에 가서 자수해야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: A handful of supply shipments are a meager exchange for an entire clan of allies.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BBA"
msgid "Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken."
msgstr "아까 대화할 때, 자네는 내게 폭력의 순환은 끊을 수 있다고 말했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: A handful of supply shipments are a meager exchange for an entire clan of allies.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB9"
msgid "Earlier when we spoke, you told me the cycle of violence cannot be broken."
msgstr "아까 대화할 때, 자네는 내게 폭력의 순환은 끊을 수 없다고 말했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB8"
msgid "But the war with the Settled Systems was never meant to end, which means we have no differences with the so-called \"Zealots.\""
msgstr "그러나 개척 성계와의 전쟁은 결코 끝나지 않을 것이기에, 우리는 소위 '광신도'라 불리는 자들과 다르지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: A handful of supply shipments are a meager exchange for an entire clan of allies.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB7"
msgid "Earlier when we spoke, you equated reconciliation with treason."
msgstr "아까 대화할 때, 자네는 화해를 반역과 동일시했다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AFAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB6"
msgid "But my purpose has always been to strengthen House Va'ruun, not weaken it."
msgstr "하지만 내 목적은 언제나 바룬 가문을 강화하는 것이지, 약화시키는 것이 아니었다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean, protect her?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean, protect her?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB5"
msgid "I have a ward, Ochim, who handles all the so-called dirty work. I merely give my approval to execute it."
msgstr "내겐 오킴이라는 피후견자가 있는데, 소위 더러운 일이라 불리는 일을 도맡아 처리하지. 나는 단지 실행하라고 승인만 내릴 뿐이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I just followed the clues. &&& ...  &&& Mujeen: Earlier when we spoke, you told me that the cycle of violence can be broken. &&& Mujeen: United with House Ma'leen, we can rebuild Dazra as the industrial and military force it was during the Serpent's Crusade. &&& Mujeen: Which is why I ask that you listen to my proposal. |Let me go. Allow me to continue my efforts discreetly, for the betterment of House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I had a feeling it would come to this, ever since that conversation at House Ka'dic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102AF9D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_250_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB2"
msgid "You're going to go back to Dazra and surrender to the authorities."
msgstr "같이 다즈라에 가서 당국에 자수해야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: House Ka'dic. &&& Tevina: Hm... they did assign someone to work the spaceport.|And the ship departure dates of the Cortege also match the date the supplies were lost.|I think you may be on to something. &&& Tevina: Well, whoever the thief is, I think it's all but guaranteed you'll find more clues at Jandar's Rest. &&& Tevina: Do you have a plan for how you'll infiltrate the hideout?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, that's no fun. Well, I suppose if you identify the Armiger, that'll be good enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102603C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BB0"
msgid "I'd like to avoid violence if possible. Maybe use a disguise."
msgstr "가능하다면 폭력은 피하고 싶군요. 변장을 사용하는 게 좋겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't need your intel. I just need to know where Jandar's Rest is.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't need your intel. I just need to know where Jandar's Rest is.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BAE"
msgid "I'd like to know that too. That's why I've had my people track the movements at the spaceport. Still, no smoking gun."
msgstr "저도 그걸 알고 싶습니다. 그래서 제 사람들에게 우주항에서의 움직임을 추적하도록 했습니다. 여전히 결정적인 증거는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BAD"
msgid "Let's just say recent events have reminded me of an old parable, about a father and two sons."
msgstr "최근 벌어진 사건들 때문에 옛 우화가 떠올랐다고만 해두지. 아버지와 두 아들에 대한 우화 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BAC"
msgid "The eldest son was dutiful, the youngest disobedient. But the father loved both equally, and the eldest resented this."
msgstr "큰아들은 부모를 공경했고, 막내아들은 불효를 저질렀지. 하지만 아버지는 둘 다 똑같이 사랑했고, 큰아들은 이를 원망했네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BAB"
msgid "One day, the youngest falls into a pit of quicksand. The eldest, filled with bitterness and anger, ponders leaving him to die."
msgstr "어느 날, 막내아들이 모래 수렁에 빠졌네. 큰아들은, 막내아들이 한심하고 화가 나서, 죽게 내버려둘까 생각했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BAA"
msgid "The parable ends here, leaving the reader to contemplate the end."
msgstr "우화는 여기까지만 말하겠네. 열린 결말로 놔둬서 생각할 거리가 되도록 하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Agreed. If the source of the conflict is gone, then the fighting should stop.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010450CF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000BA9"
msgid "But I imagine that only by working together can a family prosper. And the alternative brings us both to ruin."
msgstr "하지만 나는 함께 일해야만 가족이 번창할 수 있다고 생각하네. 그리고 다른 대안을 선택한다면 우리 둘 다 파멸로 빠지게 되겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2F"
msgid "Hope you were invited."
msgstr "초대받았으면 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2E"
msgid "When I board another ship, I immediately want to know where the cargo is."
msgstr "다른 배에 승선할 때는 바로 화물이 어디에 있는지 알아내고 싶더라고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2D"
msgid "Wonder what kind of cargo they got here."
msgstr "여기엔 어떤 화물이 있나 궁금하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2C"
msgid "Check around for any secret compartments."
msgstr "비밀 보관함이 있나 잘 살펴봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2B"
msgid "You hear an alarm? Or is that just my ears ringing again?"
msgstr "알람 소리가 들리나? 아니면 또 내 이명이 도진 건가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B2A"
msgid "So where's our welcome party? Thought we'd get streamers and confetti."
msgstr "환영식 인원은 어디에 있지? 콘페티 뿌려 주면서 맞이해 줄 알았건만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B29"
msgid "Hope you're ready if there's a fight. I'm counting on you to do all the work."
msgstr "전투가 벌어지면 준비되어 있었으면 좋겠어. 자네가 힘든 일을 다 해 줘야 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B28"
msgid "If there's hostiles on this ship, you got 'em. I have faith."
msgstr "이 배에 적이 있어도 자네라면 다 처치하겠지. 내가 믿어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B27"
msgid "Anywhere on this ship to sit down?"
msgstr "이 배에는 어디 앉을 데 없나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A80
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_ShipBoardingOther
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B26"
msgid "We should take things slow. Don't know what's on this ship. And besides, it's the only gear I got."
msgstr "천천히 진행하자고. 우주선 내에 뭐가 있는지 모르고, 난 여분 장비도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should meet your nephew. &&& Smuggler: I don't do that. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Fine, whatever. I think you're being nosy, but if it'll get you off my back, I'll tell you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B4B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B25"
msgid "It'll help if you talk about it."
msgstr "그래도 얘기하면 마음에 도움이 될 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Mess what up? I'm not sure I understand. &&& Smuggler: It's complicated.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Fine, whatever. I think you're being nosy, but if it'll get you off my back, I'll tell you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B49
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B24"
msgid "I feel like you're dancing around the issue. There's got to be a reason why you won't involve yourself in their lives."
msgstr "일부러 얘기하는 걸 피하는 것 같은데. 가족의 삶에 관여하지 않는 데에는 분명 이유가 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, you're a bad influence. &&& Smuggler: That's what I said.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah. I don't know. I guess it'll be good to get it off my chest. So here goes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B47
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B23"
msgid "We don't have to talk about this if you don't want to."
msgstr "얘기하고 싶지 않으면 관두도록 할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We don't have to talk about this if you don't want to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We don't have to talk about this if you don't want to.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You may not believe it, but I had a family of my own once. A wife, and a little one, Tainafi. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B46
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B22"
msgid "Yeah. I don't know. I guess it'll be good to get it off my chest. So here goes."
msgstr "그래. 잘 모르겠다. 후련히 털어놓는 게 낫겠지. 자, 말할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Yeah. He's new to the parenting thing, but he's still young enough he can play with the kid still.|But green as he is, he's not dying, bankrupt, or strung out. He's "good." And that's good enough for me.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B44
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B21"
msgid "Anyway, that's about all I have to say on the matter. Let's get back to the grind."
msgstr "아무튼 그것에 관해선 더 이상 얘기할 게 없군. 하던 일이나 마저 하러 가지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You may not believe it, but I had a family of my own once. A wife, and a little one, Tainafi. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B45
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B20"
msgid "Fine, whatever. I think you're being nosy, but if it'll get you off my back, I'll tell you."
msgstr "좋아, 알았어. 멋대로 내 인생에 참견하는 것 같은데 이렇게 해서 매달리지 않는다면, 말해 주지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A pretty basic impulse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01012B43
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B1F"
msgid "Money. I did it for the money."
msgstr "돈. 다 돈 때문에 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B1E"
msgid "Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words."
msgstr "다이어트에 운동이라고? 내 출신지에선 욕설로 받아들여진다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling? &&& Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B1D"
msgid "As long as you combine it with diet and exercise."
msgstr "다이어트 음식 먹고 운동까지 하면 괜찮지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of the religion of House Va'ruun?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_ThoughtsOnVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B18"
msgid "You mean all that Serpent stuff? I don't know. Isn't any crazier than the Sanctum Universum."
msgstr "뱀이니 뭐니 하는 거? 잘 모르겠네. 우주의 성소보다 딱히 미친 종교는 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_ThoughtsOnVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B17"
msgid "I've lived a long time and seen a lot of weird shit. Great Serpent, Lesser Hamster, Holy Pineapple, it's all the same to me."
msgstr "나는 오랫동안 살면서 온갖 기괴한 걸 봤네. 위대한 뱀, 소형 햄스터, 성스러운 파인애플. 나한테는 다 똑같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_ThoughtsOnVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B16"
msgid "Pray to whoever or whatever you want. If your creds are good, then so are we."
msgstr "자네가 신이라 생각하는 존재에게 얼마든 기도하라고. 돈만 잘 챙겨 준다면야, 그런 관계도 괜찮지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingtoVaruun
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B15"
msgid "What can you tell me about the Ministry of Commerce?"
msgstr "상무성에 대해 알려줄래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: It's all run by House Dul'kehf. From managing the supply chain to enlisting spies and doing intelligence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011CA0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B14"
msgid "What can you tell me about trade in Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라의 상업에 대해 알려줄래?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You mean all that Serpent stuff? I don't know. Isn't any crazier than the Sanctum Universum.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011C9F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B13"
msgid "What do you think of the religion of House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "바룬 가문의 종교에 관해 어떤 생각을 갖고 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You mean all that Serpent stuff? I don't know. Isn't any crazier than the Sanctum Universum.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01011C9F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B12"
msgid "What do you think of the religion of House Va'ruun?"
msgstr "바룬 가문의 종교에 관해 어떤 생각을 갖고 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any friends or family you're close with?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BEB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B11"
msgid "I can tell you, but just so you know, talking about this stuff's not really my thing."
msgstr "말을 해 줄 수 있지만 이건 말할게. 이런 얘기는 정말 별로 하고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B10"
msgid "Turns out if you use a certain kind of oil, you can make soap that'll get you high."
msgstr "알고 보니, 특별한 기름을 쓰면 알딸딸하게 해 주는 비누를 만들 수 있다는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003DD2
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0F"
msgid "Good talk."
msgstr "좋은 대화였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0E"
msgid "Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job."
msgstr "어쨌든, 내가 우주선이 없는 걸 보면 알겠지만 할 일이 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0D"
msgid "So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway."
msgstr "그래서 생각이 난 게, 아직 난 사지가 멀쩡해. 나이에도 불구하고 적당히 잘 움직이고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0C"
msgid "But fair warning, I can't do all that \"moving around and trying new things\" stuff that the kids do."
msgstr "다만 경고하는데, 젊은 친구들처럼 '이동하며 새로운 걸 시도하는 건' 잘 못할 게야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0B"
msgid "Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life."
msgstr "왜냐면 사실 난 은퇴했거든. 일이 아니라 삶으로부터."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT:  Welcome aboard.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default:  Welcome aboard.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B0A"
msgid "Good. I like your hiring style. No interview or background check. That's all bullshit anyway, in case you didn't know."
msgstr "좋아. 고용 방식이 맘에 드네. 인터뷰도 없고 신상 정보도 안 묻고. 그것도 다 헛짓거리지만 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT:  Welcome aboard.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Guess I'll be heading out. See you later, Captain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B09"
msgid "Better you just point me to my station so we can get on with it."
msgstr "얼른 내가 맡을 자리를 알려 줘, 바로 일을 시작할 테니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A40
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B04"
msgid "Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation."
msgstr "아, 그리고 한 가지 더. 내가 좀 유명 인사야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A40
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B03"
msgid "You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun."
msgstr "아무나 잡고 테인 샐라베아에 대해 물어보면, 늙고 게으르고 총을 쓸 줄 모른다고 말할 걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A40
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B02"
msgid "And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun."
msgstr "지금 확실히 밝히는데 반 정도만 사실이야. 내가 늙고 게으른 건 맞지만 사격 실력은 뛰어나다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler:  Welcome aboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A38
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B01"
msgid "Hmph. Glad we got that Vaeric business sorted. Whole thing was starting to be a real pain in the ass."
msgstr "흥. 배릭 일이 잘 마무리돼서 참 다행이야. 그 일 때문에 점점 더 힘들어지고 있었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell me about home brewed kombucha.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Tell me about home brewed kombucha.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000B00"
msgid "It can take anywhere from 1 to 4 weeks. Depends on how long you want that SCOBY to ferment."
msgstr "일주일에서 4주 정도 걸릴 수 있지. 그 스코비가 얼마나 발효되길 바라는데 따라 다르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Tell me about home brewed kombucha.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I've made kombucha myself a few times. We should compare recipes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFF"
msgid "If it's too sour, you can mix it with other liquids, but don't add sugar. That'll restart the fermentation process."
msgstr "혹시 너무 신 맛이 나면 다른 음료랑 섞으면 되는데 설탕은 넣지 마. 그럼 발효를 처음부터 다시 해야 하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Yeah, maybe I will. I probably won't, but I definitely should.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A16
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFE"
msgid "Anyway, I know it doesn't make for good conversation, but it's the truth."
msgstr "아무튼, 썩 좋은 대화라고 보기 어렵단 건 알지만... 사실이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Tell me about home brewed kombucha.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A16
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFD"
msgid "If you really want to get me talking, better to ask me about home brewed kombucha or painting miniatures than my family."
msgstr "정말 내가 말하길 바란다면 가족이 아니라 콤부차 만드는 법이나 미니어쳐를 칠하는 취미에 관해 묻는 게 좋을 거다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Was your father disappointed you didn't join the military?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039ED
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFC"
msgid "The old man didn't have much else. He could fit all his interests into a teaspoon if he had to."
msgstr "아버진 그것 말곤 바랄 게 없었어. 관심사도 티스푼 하나도 안 될 만큼 적은 분이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: I'll let him know you said that.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You should meet your nephew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFB"
msgid "For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up."
msgstr "내 몫이라고 해야하나, 무운을 빌었지. 안정적으로 삶을 꾸려가는데 내가 나서서 망칠 이유도 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Fine, whatever. I think you're being nosy, but if it'll get you off my back, I'll tell you.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AFA"
msgid "You may not believe it, but I had a family of my own once. A wife, and a little one, Tainafi."
msgstr "믿거나 말거나, 나도 한때 가족이 있었네... 아내랑 어린 아들, 타이나피."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Mess what up? I'm not sure I understand.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Mess what up? I'm not sure I understand.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I feel like you're dancing around the issue. There's got to be a reason why you won't involve yourself in their lives.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C6
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF9"
msgid "It's complicated."
msgstr "그 상황은 복잡해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The short version please.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I would've taken the job too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF8"
msgid "They didn't tell me any details about the job, but they paid in advance, and that was good enough for me."
msgstr "내게 일거리가 뭔지는 알려 줬지 않았지만, 선금을 줘서 난 그것만으로도 만족했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did the guards offer you a deal?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: A person's got to have a code.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF7"
msgid "I don't know about you, but I'm not gonna live a beggar's life to be king for a day."
msgstr "누가 뭐라고 해도, 난 그렇게 이득 좀 취하겠다고 그런 저열한 짓은 하지 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not just give you the coordinates to Va'ruun'kai?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I would've taken the job too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF6"
msgid "There's no guarantee I wouldn't just sell those numbers to the highest bidder."
msgstr "그 좌표를 가지고 내가 값을 가장 높이 부르는 사람에게 팔아 넘길지도 모르잖나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010203CE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010252F6
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF4"
msgid "Oh, this is wonderful!"
msgstr "와, 정말 멋지네!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010203CE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010252F6
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF3"
msgid "Long periods in Zero G can be harmful to your health, but so can long periods of anything fun."
msgstr "무중력 상태로 오래 지내면 건강에 안 좋을 수 있지만, 애초에 재밌는 걸 장기간 즐기면 다 그런 법이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010203CE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010252F6
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF2"
msgid "I hope we don't run into any globs of decomposing matter."
msgstr "썩어가는 덩어리 같은 걸 보게 되지만 않으면 좋겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010203CE
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 010252F6
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF1"
msgid "I love Zero G! It never gets old!"
msgstr "무중력이 최고야! 질리지 않는다니까!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AF0"
msgid "Can you teach me how to do that?"
msgstr "혹시 나한테 그 방법을 알려 줄 수 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AEF"
msgid "You are truly the Great Serpent's chosen!"
msgstr "정말로 위대한 뱀께서 택하신 자로구나!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AEE"
msgid "That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice."
msgstr "아몬도 그렇게 말을 하셨지. 그래서 날 카딕 가문의 일원으로 입양하신 거야, 자신의 조수가 되도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AED"
msgid "We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance."
msgstr "우린 정말 기이한 방식으로 만났어. 아몬께서 수학 문제를 풀다가, 뱀께 도움을 청하는 기도를 올리려고 사원에 오셨지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AEC"
msgid "Oh, you should've seen the look on his face when I offered him the solution!"
msgstr "아, 그러다 그분이 겪던 문제의 해결책을 내가 제시했을 때 어떤 표정인지 봤어야 하는데!"

#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You might say his prayers were answered.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AEB"
msgid "It was the SECOND most shocked look I have ever seen in my life."
msgstr "살면서 내가 봤던 얼굴 중 두 번째로 제일 깜짝 놀란 얼굴이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You might say his prayers were answered. &&& Sahima: Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to. &&& Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.|At some point, the sun began to cut through the windows, and the Heralds began to spill in for their morning prayer.|And that's when I saw the MOST shocked look I have ever seen in my life. |Because they all realized what I didn't, until that very moment. My voice had come back!
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020340
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AEA"
msgid "Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about."
msgstr "네가 열정을 느낄 만한 어떤 주제가 필요했던 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You might say his prayers were answered. &&& Sahima: Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to. &&& Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.|At some point, the sun began to cut through the windows, and the Heralds began to spill in for their morning prayer.|And that's when I saw the MOST shocked look I have ever seen in my life. |Because they all realized what I didn't, until that very moment. My voice had come back!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They were, until Amon told them I would no longer require their tutelage. That was the day I was adopted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE9"
msgid "The Heralds must have been overjoyed."
msgstr "전령들이 참 기뻐했을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Heralds must have been overjoyed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Heralds must have been overjoyed.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE8"
msgid "They were, until Amon told them I would no longer require their tutelage. That was the day I was adopted."
msgstr "그랬지, 아몬이 그자들에게 더 이상 날 교육시킬 필요가 없을 거라 말하기 전까진. 그날 바로 난 입양되었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless. &&& Sahima: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather. &&& Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.|Oh, you should've seen the look on his face when I offered him the solution!|It was the SECOND most shocked look I have ever seen in my life.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE7"
msgid "You might say his prayers were answered."
msgstr "그 사람의 기도에 답이 주어졌던 거나 다름 없네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You might say his prayers were answered.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You might say his prayers were answered.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102033A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE6"
msgid "Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to."
msgstr "그럴지도? 위대한 뱀께서는 얼마든지 직접적이실 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020339
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE5"
msgid "For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today."
msgstr "그 후 6년 동안 아몬께서는 내가 지금의 아마추어 물리학자가 될 수 있도록 도와주셨어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's... spooky.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020339
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE4"
msgid "And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why."
msgstr "그러다가 어느 날, 갑자기 사라지셨지. 그 누구도 이유를 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, actually. I was brought to the Halls of Healing, and my vocal chords were fine. It was a mental block.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020338
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE3"
msgid "Was something wrong with your voice?"
msgstr "네 목소리에 문제가 있었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It'd be hard to spread the word of the Great Serpent without a voice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'd be hard to spread the word of the Great Serpent without a voice.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020335
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE2"
msgid "Very much so. To their credit, the Heralds were patient."
msgstr "과연 그렇지. 다만 전령들의 장점 중 하나가 바로 인내심이 뛰어났다는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Very much so. To their credit, the Heralds were patient. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020336
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE1"
msgid "It'd be hard to spread the word of the Great Serpent without a voice."
msgstr "목소리 없이 위대한 뱀의 말씀을 널리 퍼트리는 것은 힘들 텐데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're not alone. My colleagues working on the Mourning Device thought the same.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AE0"
msgid "I wouldn't mind if you lost your voice again."
msgstr "네가 또 목소리를 잃어도 나쁘진 않을 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020334
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADF"
msgid "I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting."
msgstr "난 읽기, 쓰기부터 사격에 집중하라는 지시를 받았었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020334
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADE"
msgid "But since I was left to my own devices, often times I would make my own curriculum."
msgstr "하지만 내 맘대로 할 수 있었던 터라, 자주 나만의 교육 과정을 만들었었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020334
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADD"
msgid "And the more I read about Jinan Va'ruun, the more curious I got about the physics behind grav jumps."
msgstr "그리고 지난 바룬 님에 관해 읽을수록 중력 구동기의 물리학적 지식에 관심이 갔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020334
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADC"
msgid "But it wasn't until I met my father Amon Ka'dic, that my path changed from Herald to scientist."
msgstr "하지만 내 양아버지, 아몬 카딕을 만나 전령이 아닌 과학자가 될 운명을 누리게 되어 다 끝이 났지만 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020333
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADB"
msgid "You can learn a lot more by listening anyway."
msgstr "어차피 가만히 듣는 것만으로도 많은 것을 알아낼 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020332
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ADA"
msgid "The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions."
msgstr "전령들도 그렇게 생각했을지 모르겠어. 특히 질문이 많은 고아들을 상대하게 됐을 땐 더 그랬겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is a good guess, but I'm too young to remember.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020331
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD9"
msgid "Was it related to losing your parents?"
msgstr "혹시 네가 부모님을 잃었던 것과 연관이 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless. &&& Sahima: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather. &&& Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.|Oh, you should've seen the look on his face when I offered him the solution!|It was the SECOND most shocked look I have ever seen in my life.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, maybe I exaggerated a little. I pointed him in the right direction, he carried it to the finish line.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020329
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD8"
msgid "Impressive if you did that at such a young age."
msgstr "그렇게 젊은 나이에 그 정도를 해내다니 참 대단하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Impressive if you did that at such a young age.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Impressive if you did that at such a young age.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020328
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD7"
msgid "Well, maybe I exaggerated a little. I pointed him in the right direction, he carried it to the finish line."
msgstr "음, 내가 좀 과장했을 수도 있지. 난 아몬에게 올바른 방향을 일러 줬고, 그분이 도착 지점까지 해낸 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless. &&& Sahima: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather. &&& Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.|Oh, you should've seen the look on his face when I offered him the solution!|It was the SECOND most shocked look I have ever seen in my life.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Amon didn't think so. He was the first person to talk to me like a peer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020327
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD6"
msgid "That's just the face people make when you say something stupid."
msgstr "그건 그냥 네가 바보 같은 걸 말했을 때 사람들이 짓는 표정이고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I like you better the way you are now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I like you better the way you are now.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD5"
msgid "Me too! But it took some time to get to where I am now."
msgstr "나도! 다만 지금의 내가 되는 데에는 시간이 좀 걸렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Was something wrong with your voice?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Was something wrong with your voice?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020337
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD4"
msgid "No, actually. I was brought to the Halls of Healing, and my vocal chords were fine. It was a mental block."
msgstr "사실 그건 아니야. 나는 회복의 전당에서 진찰받았고, 내 성대는 멀쩡했지. 정신적으로 차단한 거였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It was never gone to begin with. You just had a mental block.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It was never gone to begin with. You just had a mental block.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020324
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD3"
msgid "Aren't those statements redundant? Or am I just over-thinking?"
msgstr "말이 너무 만연한 것 아니야? 아니면 그냥 내가 생각이 많은 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless. &&& Sahima: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather. &&& Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.|Oh, you should've seen the look on his face when I offered him the solution!|It was the SECOND most shocked look I have ever seen in my life.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, it was! I've tried to mimic it in the mirror sometimes, with varying results.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD2"
msgid "It must've been a pretty memorable look."
msgstr "아주 기억에 오래 남는 광경이었나 보네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That must've been hard.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That must've been hard.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's odd to say, but the disaster is what gave me my voice back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020322
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD1"
msgid "It was at the time. But given everything that's happened? It's almost reaffirming."
msgstr "그때 그랬었지. 그리고 그동안 벌어진 것을 고려하면? 더욱 확실해진 것 같고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Was it related to losing your parents?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Was it related to losing your parents?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020330
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AD0"
msgid "That is a good guess, but I'm too young to remember."
msgstr "그거 좋은 추측인데, 기억하기엔 그때 내가 너무 어려서 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Was it related to losing your parents?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020330
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACF"
msgid "I just remember trying to speak, and finding no sound, no breath behind the words."
msgstr "난 그저, 말하려 해도 아무 소리도 나지 않고, 숨결조차 나오지 않았단 것만 기억나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist? &&& Sahima: I'm self taught, actually. &&& Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.|But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent.|Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Me too! But it took some time to get to where I am now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACE"
msgid "I like you better the way you are now."
msgstr "지금의 네 모습이 훨씬 맘에 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's... spooky. &&& Sahima: It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council. &&& Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.|My colleagues started to ignore me. They didn't respect me as a scientist, so of course no one listened when I warned them about the Mourning Device.|In a strange way, I had lost my voice again.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Maybe in other fields, but I didn't expect them to stare the science in the face and STILL stick to their stubbornness.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACD"
msgid "It's hard for senior members to admit they're wrong, especially when dealing with younger colleagues."
msgstr "연장자들이 쉽게 자신들의 실수를 인정하는 것은 참 어려운 것이지. 특히 더 젊은 자제들과 함께할 때는."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I bet those scientists regret not listening to you now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I bet those scientists regret not listening to you now.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's odd to say, but the disaster is what gave me my voice back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACC"
msgid "Oh, I bet they do, but they will never admit it publically."
msgstr "아, 당연 그렇겠지. 다만 남들 앞에서 인정하진 않겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't mind if you lost your voice again.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wouldn't mind if you lost your voice again.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACB"
msgid "You're not alone. My colleagues working on the Mourning Device thought the same."
msgstr "너뿐만이 아니야. 모어닝 장치를 개발하는 내 동료들도 똑같이 생각했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't mind if you lost your voice again.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ACA"
msgid "Which, I'll remind you again, I was right about. Anyway, back to my story."
msgstr "그래서, 다시 한번 말하지만 내가 옳았단 거지. 어쨌든 계속 내 얘길 하자면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's... spooky.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's... spooky.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC9"
msgid "It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council."
msgstr "그랬지. 근데 우린 대의회를 위해 하는 일이 있었기 때문에, 실제로 나한데 무슨 일이 일어났는지 생각할 시간이 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Thanks. I must sound whiny and ungrateful, but it does feel nice to vent.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020321
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC8"
msgid "Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about."
msgstr "어쨌든 얘기해 줘서 고마워. 그냥 내 머릿속 얘기란 것도 알지만, 덕분에 많은 생각을 할 수 있었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's fine. Let's talk later.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020321
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC7"
msgid "If you don't mind, I'd like to digest it a little more before we continue."
msgstr "혹시 괜찮다면, 계속 더 진행하기 전에 생각 좀 하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's... spooky. &&& Sahima: It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council. &&& Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.|My colleagues started to ignore me. They didn't respect me as a scientist, so of course no one listened when I warned them about the Mourning Device.|In a strange way, I had lost my voice again.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It was at the time. But given everything that's happened? It's almost reaffirming.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020323
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC6"
msgid "That must've been hard."
msgstr "정말 힘들었겠구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It must've been a pretty memorable look.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It must've been a pretty memorable look.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102032A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC5"
msgid "Oh, it was! I've tried to mimic it in the mirror sometimes, with varying results."
msgstr "아, 그랬지! 거울 보면서 가끔 따라해 보려고 했을 정도야, 표정은 항상 달랐지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about. &&& Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice. &&& Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.|And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hope not. It would be a strange coincidence for student and mentor to have both suffered the same fate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020317
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC4"
msgid "He could've been kidnapped."
msgstr "납치되었을지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You might say his prayers were answered. &&& Sahima: Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to. &&& Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.|At some point, the sun began to cut through the windows, and the Heralds began to spill in for their morning prayer.|And that's when I saw the MOST shocked look I have ever seen in my life. |Because they all realized what I didn't, until that very moment. My voice had come back!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Aren't those statements redundant? Or am I just over-thinking?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020325
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC3"
msgid "It was never gone to begin with. You just had a mental block."
msgstr "애초에 절대 할 수 없었던 게 아니라, 정신적으로 막혀 있던 것뿐이었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's hard for senior members to admit they're wrong, especially when dealing with younger colleagues.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's hard for senior members to admit they're wrong, especially when dealing with younger colleagues.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's odd to say, but the disaster is what gave me my voice back.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC2"
msgid "Maybe in other fields, but I didn't expect them to stare the science in the face and STILL stick to their stubbornness."
msgstr "다른 분야라면 몰라도, 그 사람들이 과학적 사실을 눈앞에 두고도 그렇게 고집을 부릴 줄 몰랐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC1"
msgid "Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate."
msgstr "어쨌든 그날 나는 내 스승뿐만 아니라 날 가장 아껴 주던 사람을 잃고 만 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AC0"
msgid "My colleagues started to ignore me. They didn't respect me as a scientist, so of course no one listened when I warned them about the Mourning Device."
msgstr ""
"내 동료들은 날 무시하기 시작했어. 과학자로 존중해 주지 않아서, 당연히 내가 모어닝 장치에 관해 경고했을 때도 아무도 듣지 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That must've been hard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABF"
msgid "In a strange way, I had lost my voice again."
msgstr "기이한 방식으로, 난 다시 목소리를 잃었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He probably left for the Settled Systems.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He probably left for the Settled Systems.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020314
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABE"
msgid "I don't know. I understand that House Ka'dic has ties to the outside systems, but... it's so out of character for him."
msgstr "잘 모르겠어. 카딕 가문이 외부 성계와 인적 관계가 있는 건 알지만... 그러는 건 전혀 그분답지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to. &&& Sahima: Thanks. I must sound whiny and ungrateful, but it does feel nice to vent. &&& Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.|If you don't mind, I'd like to digest it a little more before we continue.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You bet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020311
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABD"
msgid "That's fine. Let's talk later."
msgstr "괜찮아. 나중에 또 얘기하자고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about. &&& Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice. &&& Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.|And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know. I understand that House Ka'dic has ties to the outside systems, but... it's so out of character for him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020315
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABC"
msgid "He probably left for the Settled Systems."
msgstr "아마 개척 성계를 향해 떠난 걸지 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about. &&& Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice. &&& Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.|And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's a hard question to answer. We were always supportive of each other, but there was always a distance between us I could never cross.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020313
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABB"
msgid "Do you miss him?"
msgstr "그분이 그리워?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's fine. Let's talk later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's fine. Let's talk later.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020310
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000ABA"
msgid "You bet."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd rather just talk about it now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd rather just talk about it now.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB9"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I want to think on it. But don't worry, I'll still be around if you need anything else."
msgstr "미안하지만 생각 좀 해 봐야겠어. 다만 걱정 마, 아직 네게 필요한 게 있으면 여기 있을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to. &&& Sahima: Thanks. I must sound whiny and ungrateful, but it does feel nice to vent. &&& Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.|If you don't mind, I'd like to digest it a little more before we continue.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sorry, but I want to think on it. But don't worry, I'll still be around if you need anything else.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB8"
msgid "I'd rather just talk about it now."
msgstr "그냥 지금 얘기하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about. &&& Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice. &&& Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.|And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No. He was always a private man, but it's a complete mystery.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020319
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB7"
msgid "Did he give any indication of where he might have gone?"
msgstr "그분이 어디로 갔을지 혹시 힌트라도 남긴 게 없는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's... spooky. &&& Sahima: It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council. &&& Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.|My colleagues started to ignore me. They didn't respect me as a scientist, so of course no one listened when I warned them about the Mourning Device.|In a strange way, I had lost my voice again.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, I bet they do, but they will never admit it publically.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020320
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB6"
msgid "I bet those scientists regret not listening to you now."
msgstr "그 과학자들은 이제 네 말을 듣지 않은 것을 크게 후회하고 있겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's just the face people make when you say something stupid.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's just the face people make when you say something stupid.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020326
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB5"
msgid "Amon didn't think so. He was the first person to talk to me like a peer."
msgstr "아몬께선 그렇게 생각 안 했어. 동료처럼 내게 말해 준 사람은 그분이 처음이었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk? &&& Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.|And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job. &&& Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Don't worry, it's not to keep! I just want you to hold on to her for now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030A
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB4"
msgid "I don't want your old, dirty plushie."
msgstr "네 낡고 더러운 인형 따위는 필요 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Happy / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thank you. I'll give Silver a good home.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thank you. I'll give Silver a good home.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Happy
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020307
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB3"
msgid "No problem! I appreciate you taking her."
msgstr "문제 될 거 없지! 그 친구를 데려가 줘서 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: He could've been kidnapped.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: He could've been kidnapped.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Regardless, that day I not only lost a mentor, I lost my chief advocate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020316
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB2"
msgid "I hope not. It would be a strange coincidence for student and mentor to have both suffered the same fate."
msgstr "부디 그렇지 않았으면 해. 학생과 스승 둘 다 그런 끔찍한 일을 겪는 건 너무 이상한 우연이니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Somber / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do you miss him?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you miss him?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Somber
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020312
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AB1"
msgid "That's a hard question to answer. We were always supportive of each other, but there was always a distance between us I could never cross."
msgstr "그건 답하기 어려운 질문이네. 우린 언제나 서로를 도와주려고 했지만, 서로 절대 가까이 할 수 없는 거리감이 항상 있었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk? &&& Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.|And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job. &&& Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because of her fur? I guess she's more gray than silver, but gray is so gloomy. Silver's better.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020306
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAF"
msgid "Silver?"
msgstr "실버라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAE"
msgid "So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect."
msgstr "그래서 예전에 네가 한 말에 관해 생각해 봤어. 내가 완벽해질 필요가 없다고 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAD"
msgid "And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job."
msgstr ""
"그리고 네 말이 맞아. 약점이 있고 실수를 해도 괜찮지. 완벽하지 않다는 것도 내 실무 능력이 뛰어나지 않다는 것을 의미하는 것도 "
"아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAC"
msgid "So I was thinking about what you said -- how I should be proud of my accomplishments. Scream them even!"
msgstr "그래서 예전에 네가 한 말에 관해 생각해 봤어. 내가 이룬 업적을 자랑스럽게 여기고, 크게 외쳐도 된다면서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAB"
msgid "And you're right. It's important to put yourself out there, and celebrate yourself!"
msgstr "그리고 네 말이 맞아. 밖으로 자신을 드러내고 스스로를 축하하는 것은 중요해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AAA"
msgid "So I was thinking about what you said -- how I should listen to my inner doubts."
msgstr "그래서 예전에 네가 한 말에 관해 생각해 봤어. 마음속 의심하는 목소리에 귀를 기울이라 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA9"
msgid "And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable. Because no one's perfect, and not being perfect doesn't mean I'm not great at what I do."
msgstr ""
"그리고 네 말이 맞아. 약점이 있어도 괜찮지. 완벽한 사람은 없고, 완벽하지 않다는 것도 내가 하는 실무 능력이 뛰어나지 않다는 것을 "
"의미하는 것도 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA8"
msgid "So I was thinking about what you said -- how even you have impostor syndrome."
msgstr "그래서 예전에 네가 한 말에 관해 생각해 봤어. 너까지 가면 증후군에 시달린다면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA7"
msgid "And you're right. It's normal to doubt yourself. As long as you know who you are, you won't let them bury you."
msgstr "그리고 네 말이 맞아. 스스로를 의심하는 것도 틀린 게 아니야. 본모습을 잃지만 않으면 그 의심에 파묻히지 않을 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Silver?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Silver?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Uh... thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020305
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA6"
msgid "Because of her fur? I guess she's more gray than silver, but gray is so gloomy. Silver's better."
msgstr "인형의 털 때문에 그렇겠지? 실버보다는 그레이가 맞을지 모르지만 회색은 우울하잖아. 실버가 나아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Uh... thanks. &&& Sahima: Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst. &&& Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It does. I guess I should explain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020302
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA5"
msgid "Outgrowing her doesn't mean you have to give her away."
msgstr "더 이상 너와 어울리지 않는다고 해서 남한테 줄 필요는 없잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't want your old, dirty plushie.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't want your old, dirty plushie.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020309
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA4"
msgid "Don't worry, it's not to keep! I just want you to hold on to her for now."
msgstr "걱정 마, 계속 가지라는 것도 아니야! 잠시 대신 가지고 있어 줬으면 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about. &&& Sahima: That's what Amon said too. So he adopted me into House Ka'dic to train me as his apprentice. &&& Sahima: For the next six years, Amon helped me grow from an amateur physicist to the person I am today.|And then one day, he just... disappeared. No one knows why. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It was. But I didn't have time to really process what happened, because of the work we were doing for the High Council.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102031B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA3"
msgid "That's... spooky."
msgstr "그건... 좀 무섭네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did he give any indication of where he might have gone?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did he give any indication of where he might have gone?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020318
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA2"
msgid "No. He was always a private man, but it's a complete mystery."
msgstr "아니. 항상 비밀을 감추긴 하셨는데, 그래도 도저히 알 수가 없을 정도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did he give any indication of where he might have gone?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: That's... spooky.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020318
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA1"
msgid "No one saw him leave, and there's no record of his departure. It's almost as if he vanished into thin air."
msgstr "그분이 떠나는 건 누구도 못 봤고, 떠났다는 기록도 남아 있지 않아. 마치 홀연히 사라진 것처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Uh... thanks. &&& Sahima: Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst. &&& Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ha, maybe I befriended a toy because everyone I meet is rude and obnoxious. But I should explain what I mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020300
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000AA0"
msgid "Your best friend is a toy cat. No wonder people don't take you seriously."
msgstr "절친한 친구가 고양이 인형이라니. 그러니까 사람들이 널 진지하게 받아들이질 않는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Uh... thanks.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Uh... thanks.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030B
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9F"
msgid "Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst."
msgstr "하, 너무 들뜨지 말라고. 그러다 터지겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk? &&& Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.|And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job. &&& Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 0102030C
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9E"
msgid "Uh... thanks."
msgstr "어... 고마워."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.|I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love.|One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn.|At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm glad you feel that way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020303
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9D"
msgid "But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew."
msgstr "근데 무슨 이유에서인지 오랫동안 그렇게 느껴지질 않았어. 네 승무원이 되어서 그런 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk? &&& Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.|And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job. &&& Sahima: In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No problem! I appreciate you taking her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020308
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9C"
msgid "Thank you. I'll give Silver a good home."
msgstr "고마워. 실버를 위한 좋은 집을 찾아 줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening. &&& Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief. &&& Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's... an interesting theory. But what does the turtle stand on?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9B"
msgid "I believe that the galaxy was built on the back of a giant turtle."
msgstr "난 이 은하수가 거대한 거북이 등껍질 위에 지어졌다고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Outgrowing her doesn't mean you have to give her away.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Outgrowing her doesn't mean you have to give her away.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020301
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A9A"
msgid "It does. I guess I should explain."
msgstr "그렇긴 하지. 설명할게."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I get that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01020304
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A99"
msgid "Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her."
msgstr "실버는 오랫동안 내 절친한 친구였지만? 이제 더 이상 나와는 어울리지 않는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Uh... thanks. &&& Sahima: Ha, don't show too much enthusiasm, you might burst. &&& Sahima: Silver's been my best friend for a long time. But I feel like I've outgrown her.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FE
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A98"
msgid "I get that."
msgstr "나도 이해해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you. &&& Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't. &&& Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."|But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So maybe the issue is not with me, but them! Good, because I think I'm cuter without the beard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A97"
msgid "For what it's worth, I agree with you."
msgstr "내 생각이지만, 네 말에 동의해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Another turtle.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Another turtle.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's turtles all the way down.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A96"
msgid "And what does THAT turtle stand on?"
msgstr "그럼 그 거북이는 뭘 지탱해 서 있는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Another turtle. &&& Sahima: And what does THAT turtle stand on?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh! So an infinite regress? Assuming space is infinite it's not technically unfeasible, even if it's flat out wrong.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A95"
msgid "It's turtles all the way down."
msgstr "그 아래에 수많은 거북이들이 있는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: For what it's worth, I agree with you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: For what it's worth, I agree with you.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A94"
msgid "So maybe the issue is not with me, but them! Good, because I think I'm cuter without the beard."
msgstr "그러니까 문제는 나한테 있는 게 아니라, 저들한테 있다는 거지! 잘됐네, 난 수염이 없는 게 더 귀여운 것 같거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening. &&& Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief. &&& Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's okay! Sometimes it's better to say "I don't know" than come up with an answer that is like a groat with no horns.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A93"
msgid "I don't think we can know the answer to that."
msgstr "그 해답은 우리가 알 수 있는 것 같지 않아."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A92"
msgid "But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?"
msgstr "하지만 이제 네 신념에 대해 더 알고 싶어. 넌 누가 우리의 우주를 창조했다고 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent. &&& Sahima: Absolutely! I'm reminded of my favorite creation verse, written by the Heralds of Mourning.|"And the Great Serpent, who breathed fire into the stars, who coiled the rocks that shaped the earth, who gave life to the Promised in body and spirit, stood before all creation."
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And what does THAT turtle stand on?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A91"
msgid "Another turtle."
msgstr "또 다른 거북이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I get that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get that.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FD
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A90"
msgid "Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth."
msgstr "그래. 비참하고 슬픈 말처럼 들릴지도 모르지만, 사실이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening. &&& Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief. &&& Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Absolutely! I'm reminded of my favorite creation verse, written by the Heralds of Mourning.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202EC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8F"
msgid "The Great Serpent."
msgstr "위대한 뱀."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your best friend is a toy cat. No wonder people don't take you seriously.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your best friend is a toy cat. No wonder people don't take you seriously.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FF
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8E"
msgid "Ha, maybe I befriended a toy because everyone I meet is rude and obnoxious. But I should explain what I mean."
msgstr ""
"하, 내가 장난감과 친구가 된 건 이제껏 만난 사람들이 무례하고 약아 빠졌기 때문일지 모르지. 어쨌든 내가 무슨 말을 하는 건지 "
"설명해야겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's turtles all the way down.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's turtles all the way down.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But I realize you are being facetious. As a member of House Va'ruun, clearly you wouldn't believe in anything save the Great Serpent!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8D"
msgid "Oh! So an infinite regress? Assuming space is infinite it's not technically unfeasible, even if it's flat out wrong."
msgstr "오! 그럼 무한 후퇴 논증이구나? 우주가 무한하다고 가정하면 기술적으로 불가능한 것은 아니야. 완전히 틀렸더라도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I believe that the galaxy was built on the back of a giant turtle.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I believe that the galaxy was built on the back of a giant turtle.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A stool. It lets the turtle get a better view of the joke that flew over your head.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8C"
msgid "That's... an interesting theory. But what does the turtle stand on?"
msgstr "그것 참... 흥미로운 이론이네. 근데 그 거북이는 무엇을 지탱해 서 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: God. &&& Sahima: And by "God," surely you mean the Great Serpent?|But I do realize it's a popular answer among outsiders. |I wonder if that word choice is intentionally vague, or if they have a particular form in mind when they use it?|Because I've heard that term to mean many different things. But that's a conversation for another time.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202EA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8B"
msgid "I don't know. I didn't think it through that far."
msgstr "모르겠다. 그렇게까지 생각해 본 적은 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Thanks. Being part of a team that supports each other is so refreshing.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202FC
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A8A"
msgid "And it's a credit to you as a leader, Captain. So I guess I want to say, good job! And thanks."
msgstr "그리고 지도자로서도 능력이 뛰어나다는 것이겠지, 선장. 그래서 하고 싶은 말은... 잘했다는 거야! 그리고 고마워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Damn. You've punched a hole in my theory. My entire world view is shaken. &&& Sahima: That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A89"
msgid "Actually, I don't know."
msgstr "사실, 잘 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know. I didn't think it through that far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know. I didn't think it through that far.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000A88"
msgid "That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that."
msgstr "괜찮아! 네 거북이 이론이 아직 진행 중인 것으로 남겨 두도록 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: God.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202ED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A87"
msgid "But I do realize it's a popular answer among outsiders."
msgstr "하지만 그게 이방인들 사이에선 유명한 답이란 건 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: God.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202ED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A86"
msgid "I wonder if that word choice is intentionally vague, or if they have a particular form in mind when they use it?"
msgstr "일부러 모호한 답을 택한 건지 아니면 특정한 형태를 고려하고 한 말인지 궁금한걸?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The second turtle is a spaceship. It floats.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The second turtle is a spaceship. It floats.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But I realize you are being facetious. As a member of House Va'ruun, clearly you wouldn't believe in anything save the Great Serpent!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A85"
msgid "So is it an organic or a machine or something more spiritual? I have so many questions, but we probably don't have time for a deep dive."
msgstr "그럼 그 존재는 유기물이야, 기계 장치야? 아니면 영적인 존재? 질문할 게 참 많지만 깊게 파고들 시간이 거의 없을 것 같다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Great Serpent.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Great Serpent.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202EB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A84"
msgid "Absolutely! I'm reminded of my favorite creation verse, written by the Heralds of Mourning."
msgstr "바로 그거야! 내가 가장 좋아하는 창조의 구절이 떠오르네. 모어닝의 전령들이 쓴 구절이거든."

msgctxt "000A83"
msgid "\"And the Great Serpent, who breathed fire into the stars, who coiled the rocks that shaped the earth, who gave life to the Promised in body and spirit, stood before all creation.\""
msgstr ""
"'그리고 별에 불꽃을 불어넣고, 땅을 이루는 암석들을 감싸셨으며, 약속받은 자에게 몸과 영혼으로 생명을 불어넣으셨던 위대한 뱀께서는 모든 "
"창조물 앞에 서 계셨더라.'"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think we can know the answer to that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think we can know the answer to that.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A82"
msgid "That's okay! Sometimes it's better to say \"I don't know\" than come up with an answer that is like a groat with no horns."
msgstr "괜찮아! 그냥 가끔 '모른다'고 하는 게 뿔 없는 그로트 같은 답을 떠올리는 것보단 훨씬 나으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't think we can know the answer to that.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A81"
msgid "The only time it's bad is when you're doing it to avoid the question. Then it's just lazy. But I'm sure that's not what you're doing here."
msgstr "질문을 피하려고 그런다면 나쁜 거지. 그건 그냥 게으른 거니까. 하지만 지금 너는 그런 목적은 아닌 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't think we can know the answer to that. &&& Sahima: That's okay! Sometimes it's better to say "I don't know" than come up with an answer that is like a groat with no horns.|The only time it's bad is when you're doing it to avoid the question. Then it's just lazy. But I'm sure that's not what you're doing here.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm so sorry! People react to my religion with a similar disbelief, and I get so mad.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A80"
msgid "Does it have to stand on anything? It's just what I believe."
msgstr "굳이 무언가에 지탱하고 있어야 해? 그냥 내 믿음일 뿐인데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening. &&& Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief. &&& Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And by "God," surely you mean the Great Serpent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202EE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7F"
msgid "God."
msgstr "신."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does it have to stand on anything? It's just what I believe.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Does it have to stand on anything? It's just what I believe.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202DF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7E"
msgid "I'm so sorry! People react to my religion with a similar disbelief, and I get so mad."
msgstr "정말 미안해! 사람들이 내 종교를 그렇게 비슷한 식으로 의심해서, 그때마다 엄청 화나거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does it have to stand on anything? It's just what I believe.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202DF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7D"
msgid "Truly, I meant no offense, I'm just interested in the potential science."
msgstr "정말로, 기분 나쁘게 하려는 게 아니라 과학적 연구 가능성에 관심이 있어서 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you. &&& Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't. &&& Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."|But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well for that, I have an entire theory of how the Serpent is embedded in the fabric of spacetime.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D16
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7C"
msgid "For what it's worth, I wasn't trying to question your beliefs. I was curious about the science behind them."
msgstr "사실 네 믿음을 의심하려고 했던 것은 아니야. 다만 그 믿음의 과학적 근거에 대해 궁금했을 뿐이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you. &&& Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't. &&& Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."|But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D14
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7B"
msgid "It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening."
msgstr "뱀 때문에 그런 거야. 거대한 뱀에 관해 얘길 하면 그 즉시 사람들이 더 이상 듣지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Big Bang. &&& Sahima: That is a correct answer, but it may not be the COMPLETE answer.|I may be biased, but I think there is still much we have to learn beyond the conventional science.|I am sure as a follower of House Va'ruun, you believe the same.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A7A"
msgid "Damn. You've punched a hole in my theory. My entire world view is shaken."
msgstr "젠장. 내 이론에 구멍을 뚫었네. 나의 세계관을 뒤흔들어 놨어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I believe that the galaxy was built on the back of a giant turtle. &&& Sahima: That's... an interesting theory. But what does the turtle stand on?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Hey! I thought we were having a serious conversation! But yes, I did walk right into that one...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A79"
msgid "A stool. It lets the turtle get a better view of the joke that flew over your head."
msgstr "의자야. 거북이가 그 위에 앉아서, '농담도 이해 못 하는구나'라며 내려다 보는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: But I realize you are being facetious. As a member of House Va'ruun, clearly you wouldn't believe in anything save the Great Serpent!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D13
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A78"
msgid "Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting."
msgstr "휴! 그런 의미에서, 잠시 이 주제에서 벗어나야 할 것 같아. 인식론적 토론은 재밌지만 지치니까 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening. &&& Sahima: Why? Do people stop believing in tardigrades because they're cute little water bears?|If something is real, it transcends disbelief. &&& Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That is a correct answer, but it may not be the COMPLETE answer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202F0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A77"
msgid "The Big Bang."
msgstr "빅뱅."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Maybe you shouldn't call them "Accursed." You can't convince a person while calling them a name.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe you shouldn't call them "Accursed." You can't convince a person while calling them a name.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But now I want to know more about your beliefs. Who do you think created our universe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D10
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A76"
msgid "You have a point. But I've never dealt with an actual Accursed before, at least one that wasn't actively cursing me."
msgstr "일리가 있네. 하지만 난 실제로 저주받은 자를 다뤄야 했던 적은 없었어. 나한테 열심히 저주를 퍼붓던 자들 빼고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.|And you're right. It's okay to be vulnerable, and make mistakes. It doesn't mean I'm not capable, or great at my job.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Uh... thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202DE
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A75"
msgid "In any case, I wanted to offer you something as thanks. It's my galacticat, Silver."
msgstr "어쨌든, 네게 감사의 표시로 무언가를 주고 싶었어. 내 갤럭티캣, 실버야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's because of the snake. The second you bring up a giant snake people stop listening.
