#. TOPIC: 01011D06
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A6D"
msgid "When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?"
msgstr "언제부터 위대한 뱀은 실재한다고 믿기 시작했지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
