#. TOPIC: 01011CFD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A68"
msgid "Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator."
msgstr "다른 종교들도 별반 다르지 않아. 다들 저마다 창조주를 믿지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Scientists didn't listen to her and the city nearly blew up / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The issue is with your beliefs, not your appearance.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The issue is with your beliefs, not your appearance.
