#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A67"
msgid "Well, let's just say the last time someone said I was wrong, the Scaled Citadel got trapped in a vortex."
msgstr "마지막으로 내 말이 틀렸다고 했던 사람 때문에, 비늘 성채가 볼텍스에 사로잡히고 말았다고만 말할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The issue is with your beliefs, not your appearance.
