#. TOPIC: 01011D0C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A65"
msgid "When you're THAT right, you get a million free \"I told you so's!\" Those are the rules!"
msgstr "그 정도나 옳을 때가 되면 '거 봐, 내가 말했잖아!'라고 수백만 번 말한 것과 같지! 그게 법칙이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
