#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A64"
msgid "I'll answer your question with another -- when did you start to believe the sun will rise? At first, it's just something you take on faith."
msgstr ""
"네 질문에는 이 질문으로 답해야겠다. 넌 언제부터 태양이 뜨는 거라고 믿기 시작했지? 처음에는 그저 믿음으로 받아들여야 하는 거잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D07
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A63"
msgid "As you grow up, you learn to doubt. And faith without reason is a fool's scripture. And so, you seek answers."
msgstr "점점 자라면서 사람은 의구심을 갖추게 되고 이성 없는 신앙은 바보의 경전일 뿐이야. 그래서, 해답을 찾으려 노력하게 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?
