#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A62"
msgid "You learn about the rotation of the planets, and the life cycle of a star."
msgstr "행성의 공전 주기와 항성의 생애 주기를 배우게 되지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: When did you start to believe the Great Serpent was real?
