#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D07
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A61"
msgid "And so your faith in the sun's rise becomes something else -- a matter of fact."
msgstr "그렇게 해가 뜬다는 네 믿음은 새로운 것이 되지. 그냥 사실인 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I respect you. &&& Sahima: And I respect you! But it's only because we engaged each other with an open mind. Others don't. &&& Sahima: And it's not just the science. I get the same dirty looks when I preach the gospel of the Great Serpent. No one wants to be lectured by a "child."|But if I was bald and bearded, I bet even the Accursed would become true believers.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You have a point. But I've never dealt with an actual Accursed before, at least one that wasn't actively cursing me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011D0F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A60"
msgid "Maybe you shouldn't call them \"Accursed.\" You can't convince a person while calling them a name."
msgstr "사람들을 '저주받은 자들'이라고 부르지 말아야 할지도 모르지. 그런 식으로 부르면서 설득을 어떻게 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF7
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5F"
msgid "Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에 관해 더 알려 줄 수 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I actually stay inside most days.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF5
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5E"
msgid "I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false!"
msgstr "그 말은 단 1젭토초도 못 믿어! 하지만 날 데려간다면 네 말이 틀렸단 걸 증명해 줄 수 있겠지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress. &&& Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty. &&& Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF4
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5D"
msgid "I actually stay inside most days."
msgstr "난 사실 실내에서만 주로 지내."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5C"
msgid "There is evidence. For starters, we have eyewitness accounts of Jinan's original voyage and his sudden transformation."
msgstr "증거는 있어. 우선, 지난 님의 본래 항해와 그분의 갑작스러운 변화에 대한 목격자 증언이 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5B"
msgid "We have data of realms outside of our spacetime, gathered through grav jump experiments."
msgstr "우리는 중력 도약 실험을 통해 수집한 시공간 영역 밖에 대한 데이터를 가지고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A5A"
msgid "And we know the theorems of Jinan Va'ruun, who was blessed with scientific knowledge beyond what he could conceivably have known."
msgstr "그리고 우리는 상상할 수 없을 만큼 뛰어난 과학적 지식으로 축복을 받으신 지난 바룬님의 정리를 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A59"
msgid "But I get it. The truth may be hard to hear, when you've grown up being taught something else. Even for the Promised!"
msgstr "그래도 이해해. 자라면서 배웠던 내용과 전혀 다른데, 진실을 듣는 것은 힘들 테니까. 약속받은 자라 해도!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Does your religion allow you to be an explorer?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Does your religion allow you to be an explorer?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Seems to me you want to brag.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF3
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A58"
msgid "Of course! Jinan Va'ruun was a traveler, like yourself. He is proof that through exploration, we find our purpose."
msgstr "물론! 지난 바룬께서는 너처럼 여행자였는걸. 탐험을 통해 우리의 목적을 알아낼 수 있다는 증인이시지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not a lot of people know this, but I'm an expert with a sniper rifle. It's not so different from using a telescope.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF9
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A57"
msgid "What skills do you have?"
msgstr "네겐 어떤 기술이 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days. &&& Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false! &&& Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course! Jinan Va'ruun was a traveler, like yourself. He is proof that through exploration, we find our purpose.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF2
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A56"
msgid "Does your religion allow you to be an explorer?"
msgstr "네 종교의 교리는 탐험가가 될 수 있도록 허락해 주는 거였어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Said in a teasing way, like with a smile emoji at the end / Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A55"
msgid "I'm glad we share that in common. You have to believe in something, even if they're wrong, which they are."
msgstr "우리 생각이 비슷해 다행이야. 틀린 것이라 할지라도, 뭐라도 믿어야만 하는 법이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A54"
msgid "And if the science changes, we'll adjust as we go along."
msgstr "과학적 사실이 바뀌면 맞춰서 적응하면 돼."

