msgid "Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에 관해 더 알려 줄 수 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic?
