msgid "It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun."
msgstr "표현이 좀 그렇지만, 두 머리가 달린 뱀과 같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CED
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A51"
msgid "Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council."
msgstr "우리의 장로시기도 한 라즈마는 결합성 장관이고 같은 자매 관계인 지말은 대의회의 중개자를 맡고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's a complicated question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A50"
msgid "How did you become a member of House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "어쩌다가 카딕 가문의 일원이 되었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4F"
msgid "They are sisters in every sense of the word."
msgstr "여러 면에서 여타 다른 자매와 같지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Player
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4E"
msgid "Close, like-minded, but when they disagree, it's very much like nuclear fission."
msgstr "절친하고 생각도 비슷하지만, 서로 생각이 다를 땐 핵융합 과정 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4D"
msgid "When the bond is split, energy is released, and KABOOM! The world explodes."
msgstr "결합이 깨지면 에너지가 방출되고, 쾅! 세상이 폭발하는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4C"
msgid "Okay, maybe it's not THAT dramatic, but you get the idea."
msgstr "그래, 그렇게 극적이진 않은 것 같지만 무슨 말인지 알겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They are sisters in every sense of the word. 
