#. TOPIC: 01011CE9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4B"
msgid "Do Razma and Djimal get along?"
msgstr "라즈마와 지말은 서로 사이가 좋아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It gets dangerous out there. Are you sure you're up for it?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It gets dangerous out there. Are you sure you're up for it?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF0
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A4A"
msgid "Oh don't you dare. Don't doubt me like everyone else in my life. Because I know you're different!"
msgstr "절대 그러지 마. 너까지 내 인생의 다른 사람들처럼 날 의심하진 말아 줘. 넌 다르단 걸 이미 알고 있단 말이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It gets dangerous out there. Are you sure you're up for it?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Seems to me you want to brag.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF0
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A49"
msgid "Yes, I don't look like a soldier. I barely pass for an adult, haha. But I can hold my own!"
msgstr "그래, 내가 군인으로 보이지 않고 심지어 어른으로도 보이지 않지만... 하하. 내 몫은 할 수 있다고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEF
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A48"
msgid "I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything."
msgstr "약속할게, 후회하지 않을 거야. 자랑하려는 건 아니지만 난 거의 모든 능력이 뛰어나다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There is evidence. For starters, we have eyewitness accounts of Jinan's original voyage and his sudden transformation.
