#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A47"
msgid "Some would argue you can't presume the Great Serpent exists without proof."
msgstr "증거 없이 위대한 뱀이 존재한다는 전제를 세울 수 없다고 주장하는 사람들도 있을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A46"
msgid "Uncle Mujeen you know. It doesn't surprise me in the least he was found aiding the zealots."
msgstr "내 사촌, 무진은 잘 알겠지. 그 양반이 광신도들과 결탁한 것으로 밝혀진 건 놀랍지도 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A45"
msgid "It wasn't overt, but every now and then he'd say something Zealot-adjacent and the entire room would go silent."
msgstr "공개적인 수준은 아니었지만 가끔씩 광신도를 옹호하는 말을 하곤 했는데, 그러면 방 전체가 조용해지곤 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A44"
msgid "As for cousin Mirek, he and I have never gotten along."
msgstr "그리고 내 사촌, 미어렉과 난 전혀 사이가 좋지 못했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A43"
msgid "I don't know if he sees me as a threat, but he has never treated me like one of the family. It is... unfortunate, but fated."
msgstr "나를 위협으로 간주하는지는 모르겠지만, 절대 날 가족으로 대해 준 적이 없어. 참... 안타깝지만, 운명이 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A42"
msgid "I don't speak often with Uncle Mujeen. Him and my cousin Ochim are always off doing their own thing."
msgstr "무진 사촌과 난 자주 대화를 나누진 않아. 또 다른 사촌, 오킴은 무진이랑 만나 항상 꿍꿍이를 꾸미고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A41"
msgid "As for cousin Mirek, he and I have never gotten along."
msgstr "그리고 내 사촌, 미어렉과 난 전혀 사이가 좋지 못했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your other family members?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A40"
msgid "I don't know if he sees me as a threat, but he has never treated me like one of the family. It is... unfortunate, but fated."
msgstr "나를 위협으로 간주하는지는 모르겠지만, 절대 날 가족으로 대해 준 적이 없어. 참... 안타깝지만, 운명이 그렇지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.|I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Adopted implies we are brought on to be cared for. If anything, "conscripted" fits better. I was brought on to serve.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3F"
msgid "Brought into the fold? Do you mean adopted?"
msgstr "받아들여졌다고? 입양되었다는 뜻이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3E"
msgid "That's a complicated question."
msgstr "그건 꽤 복잡한 질문이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3D"
msgid "In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold."
msgstr "명문 가문에는 두 가지 유형의 가족이 있어. 혈족으로 이루어진 가족과 가문의 자제로 받아들여진 부류지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3C"
msgid "I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift."
msgstr "나는 내 재능을 인정받아 청소년 시기에 카딕 가문의 자제가 되었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days. &&& Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false! &&& Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh don't you dare. Don't doubt me like everyone else in my life. Because I know you're different!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF1
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3B"
msgid "It gets dangerous out there. Are you sure you're up for it?"
msgstr "현장에 투입되면 위험해질 수 있어. 정말 감당할 수 있을 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A3A"
msgid "The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 둘에게 재능이란 축복을 내려 주셨어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CF6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A39"
msgid "If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it."
msgstr "우리가 함께 일한다면 서로 가꾸어 갈 수 있다는 걸 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Gavin is dear to me. Unlike my other colleagues, with him I never feel like it's a competition.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A38"
msgid "How is your relationship with Gavin?"
msgstr "개빈과 너 사이의 관계는 어때?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know. I didn't think it through that far. &&& Sahima: That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So is it an organic or a machine or something more spiritual? I have so many questions, but we probably don't have time for a deep dive.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A37"
msgid "The second turtle is a spaceship. It floats."
msgstr "두 번째 거북이는 우주선이라서 둥둥 떠 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean by gifts?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you mean by gifts?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000A36"
msgid "Ever since I can remember, math and science came easy to me."
msgstr "난 아주 어렸을 때부터 수학, 과학이 너무나 쉽게 느껴졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean by gifts?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Player
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000A35"
msgid "And as any Herald will tell you, innate abilities like that are a gift from the Great Serpent."
msgstr "그리고 모든 전령이 말하듯이, 그런 타고난 능력들이야말로 위대한 뱀께서 내려 주신 재능이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you mean by gifts?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01038C7D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "000A34"
msgid "They're signposts -- a map for the Promised so that we may find the best way to serve his will."
msgstr "길라잡이라 할 수 있어. 약속받은 자로서 우리가 그분의 뜻을 섬길 가장 좋은 길을 찾는 지도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.|I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A33"
msgid "You seem conflicted about being adopted."
msgstr "입양되었다는 사실에 갈등을 겪고 있는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Uncle Mujeen you know. It doesn't surprise me in the least he was found aiding the zealots.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A32"
msgid "What about your other family members?"
msgstr "그 외 네 가문의 다른 일원들로는 누가 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.|But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A31"
msgid "Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown."
msgstr "다른 사촌들과 달리, 나는 성장이 거의 끝날 즈음에 카딕 가문의 자제가 되었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A30"
msgid "And ever since I joined, there's always been an element of \"you don't belong here\" -- that I'm only a Ka'dic so long as I'm useful."
msgstr ""
"그리고 가문의 일원이 된 뒤, 다들 '넌 이곳에 어울리지 않아'라는 눈빛으로 날 바라봤어. 내가 유용할 때만 카딕의 일원이란 것처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.|I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True, the atomic arrangement is denser in blood, so of course it's thicker, but I take it that's not what you mean.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2F"
msgid "Blood is thicker than water. I imagine those members are favored."
msgstr "피는 물보다 진하지. 가문 내에서도 친자식들을 더 소중히 여겼을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You seem conflicted about being adopted.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2E"
msgid "Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions."
msgstr "그래. 나는 그동안 기여한 것 때문에 귀중한 자산으로 평가받지도 하지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You seem conflicted about being adopted.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2D"
msgid "But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then?"
msgstr "하지만 더 이상 내가 뭘 기여할 수 없게 되면? 그럼 가문에게 나는 무슨 가치가 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Blood is thicker than water. I imagine those members are favored.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Blood is thicker than water. I imagine those members are favored.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2C"
msgid "True, the atomic arrangement is denser in blood, so of course it's thicker, but I take it that's not what you mean."
msgstr "그렇지, 원자 배열 구조상 피가 더 조밀해... 네가 말하고자 하는 바는 그게 아니겠지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Blood is thicker than water. I imagine those members are favored.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2B"
msgid "And there's always been an unspoken distance between me and my cousins."
msgstr "그리고 항상 나와 내 사촌들 사이엔 말은 없어도, 거리감은 존재했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What skills do you have?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What skills do you have?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A2A"
msgid "Not a lot of people know this, but I'm an expert with a sniper rifle. It's not so different from using a telescope."
msgstr "많은 사람들이 알지는 않지만 난 저격 소총 전문가야. 망원경을 쓰는 것과 별반 다르지 않지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Hymns are a type of ship / Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What skills do you have?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CFA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A29"
msgid "I've also studied ship reactor and EM weapon tech. I even developed a prototype for Va'ruun Hymns that's currently in production!"
msgstr "게다가 난 우주선 반응로와 전자기 무기 기술을 익혔어. 지금 생산되는 바룬 히임의 시제품을 만든 것도 바로 나야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm self taught, actually.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD5
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A28"
msgid "Where did you train to be a scientist?"
msgstr "넌 과학자가 되기 위해 어디서 교육받았지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I'm self taught, actually.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD5
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A27"
msgid "Where did you train to be a scientist?"
msgstr "넌 과학자가 되기 위해 어디서 교육받았지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.|I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ever since I can remember, math and science came easy to me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CDF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A26"
msgid "You mentioned that before. What is the gift again?"
msgstr "전에 그 얘길 했었잖아. 그 재능이 뭐라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Brought into the fold? Do you mean adopted?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Brought into the fold? Do you mean adopted?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You seem conflicted about being adopted.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A25"
msgid "Adopted implies we are brought on to be cared for. If anything, \"conscripted\" fits better. I was brought on to serve."
msgstr "입양되었다는 것은 우리가 보살핌을 받는단 뜻이잖아. 오히려 '징집'되었다가 더 맞겠다. 난 섬기기 위해 가문의 일원이 된 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I'm self taught, actually.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A24"
msgid "My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage."
msgstr "내 부모님은 기억도 나지 않는 시기에 돌아가셨고, 난 고아원의 보살핌을 받았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A23"
msgid "But I left at a young age to train as a Herald, so I could someday spread the gospel of the Great Serpent."
msgstr "하지만 난 어린 나이에 전령이 되려고 훈련받아 위대한 뱀의 복음을 전파하려 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A22"
msgid "Except there was one problem -- I refused to speak! I was completely mute."
msgstr "다만 한 가지 문제가 있었어. 난 아무 말도 하지 않겠다고 했지! 난 입도 뻥긋 안 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Where did you train to be a scientist?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: My parents died before I could remember, and I was left in the care of the orphanage.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A21"
msgid "I'm self taught, actually."
msgstr "난 사실 스스로 배워서 깨우쳤어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: It was at the time. But given everything that's happened? It's almost reaffirming.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A20"
msgid "It's odd to say, but the disaster is what gave me my voice back."
msgstr "말해 보니 이상하지만, 이 재난 덕분에 내 목소리를 되찾게 되었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1F"
msgid "There's a comfort in knowing history will remember me kindly, even if my colleagues will not."
msgstr "동료들이 날 기억하지 않더라도, 역사가 날 좋게 기억할 것이라는 사실을 아니 위안이 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's change topics.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's change topics.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1E"
msgid "Of course. What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr "물론. 무슨 얘기를 하고 싶었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're probably overthinking it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1D"
msgid "No, I'm definitely overthinking it."
msgstr "그래, 나 확실히 어렵게 생각하고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1C"
msgid "I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather."
msgstr "동의해! 게다가 그 증거가 그 이후에 나타났지. 내 의붓아버지를 만났을 때 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted. &&& Sahima: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.|But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then? &&& Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.|And ever since I joined, there's always been an element of "you don't belong here" -- that I'm only a Ka'dic so long as I'm useful.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, I'm definitely overthinking it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1B"
msgid "You're probably overthinking it."
msgstr "네가 너무 어렵게 생각하는 걸지도 몰라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. What did you want to talk about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A1A"
msgid "Let's change topics."
msgstr "다른 얘기를 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A19"
msgid "Thanks. I must sound whiny and ungrateful, but it does feel nice to vent."
msgstr "고마워. 내 말이 징징거리고 고마운 줄 모르는 것처럼 들리겠지만, 이렇게 말하니 참 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you become a member of House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: In the noble Houses, there are two types of family. The ones who are born into it, and the ones who are brought into the fold.|I was adopted into House Ka'dic as a teenager, because of my gift.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Until they cease having worth. Then what happens?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A18"
msgid "Those chosen based on their worth would seemingly have more influence."
msgstr "자신의 가치로 선택받은 사람은 더 영향력이 강할 텐데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Those chosen based on their worth would seemingly have more influence.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Those chosen based on their worth would seemingly have more influence.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CD6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A17"
msgid "Until they cease having worth. Then what happens?"
msgstr "그 쓸모가 사라지기 전까진. 그다음엔 어떻게 되는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it. &&& Sahima: No, I'm definitely overthinking it. &&& Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.|But the truth is, it's all an act.|Whenever I talk about something, it's as if I have this voice in the back of my head, telling me I'm wrong.|And sometimes that voice gets SO loud, that I have to scream my own praises just to drown it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thanks. I must sound whiny and ungrateful, but it does feel nice to vent.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A16"
msgid "That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to."
msgstr "그것도 괜찮아. 원하는 만큼 실컷 소리질러."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway. &&& Sahima: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions. &&& Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.|But since I was left to my own devices, often times I would make my own curriculum.|And the more I read about Jinan Va'ruun, the more curious I got about the physics behind grav jumps.|But it wasn't until I met my father Amon Ka'dic, that my path changed from Herald to scientist.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I concur! And the proof came soon thereafter, when I met my stepfather.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A15"
msgid "There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless."
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 뜻을 섬기는 방법은 많아. 그분은 항상 널 인도하셔."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We all deal with impostor syndrome from time to time, even me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: We all deal with impostor syndrome from time to time, even me.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A14"
msgid "Really? But you are the chosen! You've spoken with Anasko Va'ruun across liminal space!"
msgstr "정말로? 하지만 넌 선택받은 자잖아! 경계를 뛰어넘어 아나스코 바룬 님과 얘기까지 했으면서!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We all deal with impostor syndrome from time to time, even me.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A13"
msgid "If YOU feel like an impostor, there is no hope for the rest of us."
msgstr "너까지 그런 말을 하다니, 정말 우리 모두 희망이 없는 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it. &&& Sahima: No, I'm definitely overthinking it. &&& Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.|But the truth is, it's all an act.|Whenever I talk about something, it's as if I have this voice in the back of my head, telling me I'm wrong.|And sometimes that voice gets SO loud, that I have to scream my own praises just to drown it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Really? But you are the chosen! You've spoken with Anasko Va'ruun across liminal space!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC2
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A12"
msgid "We all deal with impostor syndrome from time to time, even me."
msgstr "우리 모두 가면 증후군을 겪는 법이야. 심지어 나도 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You'll always have a place on my crew.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You'll always have a place on my crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A11"
msgid "Heralds bless you. It means a lot to hear you say that."
msgstr "전령들이 축복하시길. 그 말을 해 주니 정말 의미가 커."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can't imagine House Ka'dic would abandon you for any reason.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can't imagine House Ka'dic would abandon you for any reason.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A10"
msgid "You're right. But it doesn't stop me from worrying."
msgstr "네 말이 맞지만, 그렇다고 해서 걱정이 안 되지는 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Aptly put. Old ideas tend to get stale, and what we think are facts can change.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Aptly put. Old ideas tend to get stale, and what we think are facts can change.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CBF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0F"
msgid "Exactly! Nothing is given. Everything is dough."
msgstr "바로 그거야! 정해진 건 없어. 모든 게 빵 반죽이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about House Ka'dic? &&& Sahima: It's a snake with two heads, pardon the pun.|Our Elder, Razma, leads the Ministry of Conjunction, and Djimal, her sister, is a Mediary on the High Council.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's a complicated question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CEC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0E"
msgid "How did you become a member of House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "어쩌다가 카딕 가문의 일원이 되었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your relationship with Gavin?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How is your relationship with Gavin?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0D"
msgid "Gavin is dear to me. Unlike my other colleagues, with him I never feel like it's a competition."
msgstr "개빈은 내게 소중해. 다른 동료들과는 다르게 같이 있을 땐 서로 경쟁하는 것처럼 느껴지지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How is your relationship with Gavin?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Do Razma and Djimal get along?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CE7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicIntro
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0C"
msgid "I can tell him about my research, and not have to worry about him spinning it as his own."
msgstr "내가 연구한 내용을 말해 줘도, 갑자기 그걸 자기 성과로 둔갑할 걱정이 없을 정도야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a terrible analogy. Science is not malleable, it's immutable fact.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's a terrible analogy. Science is not malleable, it's immutable fact.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CBB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0B"
msgid "It is, until it isn't! Think about Newton's laws of motion in the quantum world!"
msgstr "과학도 논박되면 무의미하지! 양자 세계에서 뉴턴의 만유인력을 주장한다 생각해 봐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's a terrible analogy. Science is not malleable, it's immutable fact.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CBB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A0A"
msgid "Even the most rigid of scientific laws need rebaking from time to time. Otherwise you'll break a tooth when you bite into them."
msgstr "세상에서 가장 엄중한 과학적 사실도 가끔은 빵처럼 다시 구워야 하는 법이야. 그렇지 않으면 함부로 깨물다 치아가 깨지고 말겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay. Let's!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A09"
msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "다른 얘기를 하고 싶어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's talk about something else.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's talk about something else.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A08"
msgid "Okay. Let's!"
msgstr "좋아. 그렇게 해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it. &&& Sahima: No, I'm definitely overthinking it. &&& Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.|But the truth is, it's all an act.|Whenever I talk about something, it's as if I have this voice in the back of my head, telling me I'm wrong.|And sometimes that voice gets SO loud, that I have to scream my own praises just to drown it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know that in my heart, but still. I can't help but feel like I'm one mistake away from losing everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A07"
msgid "You don't have to be perfect. You can make mistakes. It's not going to get you kicked off my crew."
msgstr "완벽할 필요는 없어. 실수도 저지를 수 있지. 그렇다고 해서 널 쫓아내는 일은 없을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted. &&& Sahima: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.|But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then? &&& Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.|And ever since I joined, there's always been an element of "you don't belong here" -- that I'm only a Ka'dic so long as I'm useful.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right. But it doesn't stop me from worrying.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A06"
msgid "I can't imagine House Ka'dic would abandon you for any reason."
msgstr "무슨 이유든지 카딕 가문이 널 버린다는 건 상상도 되지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: No, I'm definitely overthinking it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A05"
msgid "I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything."
msgstr "내가 마치 다 안다는 것처럼 자신감 넘치는 모습이란 걸 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Player
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Player
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A04"
msgid "But the truth is, it's all an act."
msgstr "근데 사실은, 전부 연기란 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A03"
msgid "Whenever I talk about something, it's as if I have this voice in the back of my head, telling me I'm wrong."
msgstr "내가 무슨 얘기를 하더라도, 내 머릿속 목소리는 그 말이 틀렸다고 말하는 것만 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's okay. Scream as loud as you need to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A02"
msgid "And sometimes that voice gets SO loud, that I have to scream my own praises just to drown it."
msgstr "그리고 가끔 그 목소리가 너무 커져서 그 소리를 줄이기 위해서라도 스스로 외치며 힘을 내야만 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted. &&& Sahima: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.|But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then? &&& Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.|And ever since I joined, there's always been an element of "you don't belong here" -- that I'm only a Ka'dic so long as I'm useful.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's true. But family should be different, right? Why else would they give me the name?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A01"
msgid "Well, it's like any job. You stop being useful, you get fired."
msgstr "음, 여타 다른 일자리와 똑같아. 쓸모가 없으면 해고되는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, it's like any job. You stop being useful, you get fired.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Well, it's like any job. You stop being useful, you get fired.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000A00"
msgid "That's true. But family should be different, right? Why else would they give me the name?"
msgstr "맞아. 하지만 가족은 달라야 하는 것 아니야? 그렇지 않으면 왜 내게 이름을 지어 준 것이겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Well, it's like any job. You stop being useful, you get fired.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Afraid
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FF"
msgid "But sometimes I'm not so sure."
msgstr "그런데 가끔은 나도 잘 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You just need to pick up a book. Turn Chunks into a full course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FE"
msgid "My brain is just Chunks at this point."
msgstr "내 머릿속은 이제 빵 대신 청크로 가득한 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That voice is right. Try listening to it from now on.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That voice is right. Try listening to it from now on.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FD"
msgid "I guess that's you're way of saying, \"dial it down.\" I do tend to talk myself up a bit."
msgstr "억누를 줄 알라고 하는 말인 것 같네. 내가 스스로 과장해서 말하는 성격이 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't have to be perfect. You can make mistakes. It's not going to get you kicked off my crew.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to be perfect. You can make mistakes. It's not going to get you kicked off my crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FC"
msgid "I know that in my heart, but still. I can't help but feel like I'm one mistake away from losing everything."
msgstr "마음속으로 알고 있지만, 그래도... 한 번의 실수만 해도 모든 걸 잃을 수 있다는 느낌을 떨칠 수가 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't have to be perfect. You can make mistakes. It's not going to get you kicked off my crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, thank you for the talk. I know a lot of this is in my own head, and you've given me a lot to think about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CB3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FB"
msgid "As if the ground itself is like sand, sliding out from under me."
msgstr "마치 땅 자체가 모래 같아서, 내 발 밑에서 미끄러져 나가는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Exactly! Nothing is given. Everything is dough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009FA"
msgid "Aptly put. Old ideas tend to get stale, and what we think are facts can change."
msgstr "적절하게 말했네. 오래된 아이디어는 낡아지는 경향이 있고, 우리가 사실이라고 생각하는 것도 바뀔 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It is, until it isn't! Think about Newton's laws of motion in the quantum world!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CBE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F9"
msgid "That's a terrible analogy. Science is not malleable, it's immutable fact."
msgstr "끔찍한 비유네. 과학은 계속 바뀌는 게 아니라, 불변의 사실들을 취합한 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway. &&& Sahima: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions. &&& Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.|But since I was left to my own devices, often times I would make my own curriculum.|And the more I read about Jinan Va'ruun, the more curious I got about the physics behind grav jumps.|But it wasn't until I met my father Amon Ka'dic, that my path changed from Herald to scientist.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Razma and Djimal's uncle, on their mother's side.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F8"
msgid "Amon Ka'dic?"
msgstr "아몬 카딕이라고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: My brain is just Chunks at this point.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My brain is just Chunks at this point.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F7"
msgid "You just need to pick up a book. Turn Chunks into a full course."
msgstr "책만 들어올리면 되겠어. 청크를 풀코스 요리로 바꾸는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amon Ka'dic?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Amon Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F6"
msgid "Razma and Djimal's uncle, on their mother's side."
msgstr "라즈마의 지말의 삼촌이시지. 외가 쪽으로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amon Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F5"
msgid "Due to his work, he was mostly removed from the politics of the house."
msgstr "그분은 일 때문에 가문 내 정치에 거의 관여하지 못했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Amon Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F4"
msgid "But he was respected, and had enough favor among the family to adopt me without much dissent."
msgstr "하지만 그분은 나름 존중받고, 큰 반발 없이 날 입양할 수 있을 정도로 가문 내에서도 입김이 셌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Shooting? You learned gunplay?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Shooting? You learned gunplay?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F3"
msgid "Yes. When we say \"All Must Serve,\" we mean it. It's just the manner of service that varies."
msgstr "그래. '모두가 섬겨야 한다'라고 우리가 말할 때는 진심이야. 다만 어떻게 섬길지가 다른 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Shooting? You learned gunplay?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F2"
msgid "But the base expectation is that we know how to fight. For myself, long range weapons made the most sense, due to my size."
msgstr "하지만 기본적으로는 우리가 스스로 싸우는 법을 알기를 기대한다는 거야. 나는 내 몸집 때문에 장거리 무기가 가장 합리적이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Shooting? You learned gunplay?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: There are many ways to serve the Great Serpent's will. He is guiding you regardless.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F1"
msgid "But I also trained with a groat dagger, in the event I had to be sneaky and kill someone close."
msgstr "그리고 그로트 단검으로 훈련하기도 했지. 몰래 남의 뒤를 급습해 죽여야 할 때를 대비해서 말야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway. &&& Sahima: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions. &&& Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.|But since I was left to my own devices, often times I would make my own curriculum.|And the more I read about Jinan Va'ruun, the more curious I got about the physics behind grav jumps.|But it wasn't until I met my father Amon Ka'dic, that my path changed from Herald to scientist.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That would be some trick if you did. No one has seen him for years.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009F0"
msgid "I haven't met Amon myself."
msgstr "아몬이란 사람은 직접 만나 본 적 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't met Amon myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I haven't met Amon myself.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009EF"
msgid "That would be some trick if you did. No one has seen him for years."
msgstr "그랬다면 속임수를 쓴 게 될 테지. 그분을 본 사람은 몇 년 간 아무도 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I haven't met Amon myself.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: We met in the strangest way. He was dealing with a mathematical problem, but came to the temple to pray for guidance.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CAB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009EE"
msgid "But while he was here, he accomplished much in service to House Va'ruun."
msgstr "다만 그분이 이곳에 있었을 땐, 바룬 가문을 위해 참 많은 업적을 남겼지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You seem conflicted about being adopted. &&& Sahima: Yes. On the one hand, I am valued for my contributions.|But what happens when I can no longer contribute? What is my worth to the House then? &&& Sahima: Unlike a lot of my cousins, I didn't join House Ka'dic until I was mostly grown.|And ever since I joined, there's always been an element of "you don't belong here" -- that I'm only a Ka'dic so long as I'm useful.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Heralds bless you. It means a lot to hear you say that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CCB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009ED"
msgid "You'll always have a place on my crew."
msgstr "너라면 언제든 내 승무원으로서 함께할 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Maybe! The Great Serpent can be direct if he wants to.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009EC"
msgid "From there, we discussed all manner of scientific theory for hours and hours into the night."
msgstr "그곳에서 우린 몇 시간 동안이나 온갖 과학 이론을 토의하며 밤을 지새웠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009EB"
msgid "At some point, the sun began to cut through the windows, and the Heralds began to spill in for their morning prayer."
msgstr "얼마 지난 뒤 창문을 통해 햇살이 비추기 시작했고, 전령들이 아침 기도를 드리러 모였지."

#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009EA"
msgid "And that's when I saw the MOST shocked look I have ever seen in my life."
msgstr "그날, 나는 살면서 가장 깜짝 놀란 표정을 보았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Seems like you just needed a topic you were passionate about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E9"
msgid "Because they all realized what I didn't, until that very moment. My voice had come back!"
msgstr "그때가 되어서야 다들 내가 못했던 것을 해낸 걸 봤기 때문이지. 내 목소리가 돌아온 거야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're probably overthinking it. &&& Sahima: No, I'm definitely overthinking it. &&& Sahima: I know I like to project confidence and act as if I know everything.|But the truth is, it's all an act.|Whenever I talk about something, it's as if I have this voice in the back of my head, telling me I'm wrong.|And sometimes that voice gets SO loud, that I have to scream my own praises just to drown it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I guess that's you're way of saying, "dial it down." I do tend to talk myself up a bit.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CC4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_HouseKadicPersonal
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E8"
msgid "That voice is right. Try listening to it from now on."
msgstr "그 목소리가 옳아. 이제부터 그 말에 주의를 기울이도록 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E7"
msgid "Sure! Let's talk about whatever you like."
msgstr "물론! 원하는 건 뭐든 얘기해 보자."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E6"
msgid "How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs?"
msgstr "과학적 법칙과 종교적 신념을 어떻게 서로 조화롭게 유지시킬 수 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB8
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E5"
msgid "So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people."
msgstr "아주 먼 예전부터 나는 사람들 사이에 있을 때 가장 외롭다는 느낌을 받았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Relieved
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB8
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E4"
msgid "I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love."
msgstr "영영 내가 누릴 수 없을 것만 같은 것들이 떠오르게 한 것 때문이었나 봐. 가족, 친구, 사랑."

#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB8
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E3"
msgid "One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn."
msgstr "어느 날 시장을 돌아다니던 동안 쓰레기통에 버려져 있는 낡은 실버 친구를 찾아냈어."

#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB8
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E2"
msgid "At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone."
msgstr "그때 난 그저 친구를 원할 뿐이었어. 근데 인형을 보면 세상이 보는 내가 떠올랐지. 항상 난 혼자일 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E1"
msgid "Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science."
msgstr "흠... 이해가 되는 것 같진 않아. 조화시킬 필요가 없거든. 우리의 신념은 과학적 사실과 배치되지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009E0"
msgid "Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded."
msgstr "기존의 과학자들은 이견을 가질 수 있지만, 역사적으로 원래 그 사람들의 사고방식은 편협했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Other religions aren't so different. They also believe in a creator.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DF"
msgid "It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!"
msgstr "나이를 먹으면서 사람의 고집이 세지고 사고가 경직되는 거랑 비슷하지. 빵처럼!"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DE"
msgid "How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs?"
msgstr "과학적 법칙과 종교적 신념을 어떻게 서로 조화롭게 유지시킬 수 있지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: We're just co-workers. I'd like you to respect that boundary.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's a credit to you as a leader, Captain. So I guess I want to say, good job! And thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BAF
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DD"
msgid "But it will be difficult not to shower your praises. I am proud to be a member of your crew."
msgstr "하지만 그럼에도 꼭 널 찬양하고 싶은걸. 네 승무원 중 하나가 되어 자랑스러워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I doubt that. I've barely paid you any mind.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's a credit to you as a leader, Captain. So I guess I want to say, good job! And thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB4
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DC"
msgid "Here, I feel supported and respected."
msgstr "이곳에선 날 지지해 주고 존중받는 기분이 들어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can learn a lot more by listening anyway. &&& Sahima: The Heralds might've agreed. Especially when you're dealing with orphans who ask too many questions. &&& Sahima: I was told to focus on reading, writing, and shooting.|But since I was left to my own devices, often times I would make my own curriculum.|And the more I read about Jinan Va'ruun, the more curious I got about the physics behind grav jumps.|But it wasn't until I met my father Amon Ka'dic, that my path changed from Herald to scientist.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes. When we say "All Must Serve," we mean it. It's just the manner of service that varies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01011CA8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_SelfTaught
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DB"
msgid "Shooting? You learned gunplay?"
msgstr "사격? 총 쏘는 법을 배웠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get that. &&& Sahima: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth. &&& Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.|I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love.|One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn.|At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone. &&& Sahima: But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sorry! I will do my best to keep my admiration to an acceptable level, Captain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB1
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009DA"
msgid "We're just co-workers. I'd like you to respect that boundary."
msgstr "우린 같이 일하는 동료일 뿐이야. 그 선을 넘지는 말아 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days. &&& Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false! &&& Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B34
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D9"
msgid "Seems to me you want to brag."
msgstr "그냥 자기 자랑하려는 모습인 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days. &&& Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false! &&& Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Great! And so you know, I'm not just any crew member. I have a lot of practical skills, and I soak up knowledge like a sponge.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B30
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D8"
msgid "I can always use another crew member."
msgstr "새 동료는 언제든지 환영이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I can always use another crew member.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I can always use another crew member.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B2F
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D7"
msgid "Great! And so you know, I'm not just any crew member. I have a lot of practical skills, and I soak up knowledge like a sponge."
msgstr "멋져! 미리 말하는데 난 평범한 승무원이 아니야. 난 실용적인 기술을 많이 갖추었고 새 지식도 스펀지처럼 빨아들이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress. &&& Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty. &&& Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I was hoping you'd say that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B2E
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D6"
msgid "You could come with me."
msgstr "나와 함께 떠날 수도 있겠는걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Thank you! I can't wait to start tinkering with your ship. We'll have to measure the progress in femtometres!|But first, um... stupid question but, do you happen to know where my assignment is?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Oh, was it something I said?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B36
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D5"
msgid "Okay, got an assignment! Seems... cozy? Heading there now!"
msgstr "좋아, 할 일이 생겼다! 아늑해... 보이는 곳인걸? 그곳으로 갈게!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Thank you! I can't wait to start tinkering with your ship. We'll have to measure the progress in femtometres!|But first, um... stupid question but, do you happen to know where my assignment is?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Oh, was it something I said?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B36
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D4"
msgid "Okay, no assignment! Not a problem, I'm used to delays. Just let me know when you have a place in mind."
msgstr "좋아, 할 일은 아직 없는 거구나! 괜찮아, 지연되는 것 정도는 익숙해. 다만 내게 시킬 일이 있으면 언제든 말해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Seems to me you want to brag.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B33
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D3"
msgid "Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly!"
msgstr "그래, 내가 자랑을 좀 했을지 모르지만 거짓말 아니야. 정말로!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I actually stay inside most days. &&& Sahima: I don't believe that for a zeptosecond! But maybe if you take me with you, you can prove me false! &&& Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh really? I wouldn't expect that from you of all people! Only one of us has spoken to Anasko Va'ruun, and it's not me. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B32
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D2"
msgid "A little humility might serve you well, just saying."
msgstr "조금 겸손을 갖추는 게 좋을 것 같다. 그냥 말하는 거지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A little humility might serve you well, just saying.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A little humility might serve you well, just saying.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B31
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D1"
msgid "Oh really? I wouldn't expect that from you of all people! Only one of us has spoken to Anasko Va'ruun, and it's not me."
msgstr ""
"오, 정말? 수많은 사람들 중에 너한테 그런 말을 들을 줄은 몰랐어! 우리 중 아나스코 바룬 님과 대화를 나눈 사람은 내가 아닌걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A little humility might serve you well, just saying.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B31
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009D0"
msgid "You've done great things! Shout it from the rooftops, and I'll do the same."
msgstr "넌 많은 위업을 해냈잖아! 모두에게 널리 퍼트려야 해, 나도 그랬을 테니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What does the city of Dazra have to teach me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BAC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CF"
msgid "And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend."
msgstr "그리고 가끔은, 둘 다 바라지도 않지. 그저 친구만을 바랄 뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B3D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CE"
msgid "It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer."
msgstr "왔구나! 이제 날 동료로 받아들일 생각이 들어? 나한테 보여줄 게 꽤 많이 있거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B3D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CD"
msgid "Anyway! While its good to take a breath and relax, I do like a good adventure."
msgstr "어쨌든! 잠시 멈추고 휴식할 수 있어서 좋지만, 난 멋진 모험도 좋아해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B3D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CC"
msgid "In fact, I have to admit, I'm a little envious of your situation."
msgstr "사실, 인정할게. 난 지금 네 상황이 조금 부러워."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why envious? Wouldn't you get homesick if you left?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why envious? Wouldn't you get homesick if you left?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B27
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CB"
msgid "Dazra is my home, yes, but I carry it with me. I couldn't be rid of it if I wanted to."
msgstr "다즈라는 내 고향이고, 항상 마음 속에 함께할 거야. 없애고 싶어도 사라지지 않을 정도겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why envious? Wouldn't you get homesick if you left?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I actually stay inside most days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B27
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009CA"
msgid "As for family, well, I don't have anyone at House Ka'dic that would miss me much."
msgstr "그리고 내 가족 중엔... 카딕 가문 사람 중 날 그리워할 사람은 없다고 말할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: Okay, got an assignment! Seems... cozy? Heading there now!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B35
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C9"
msgid "Oh, was it something I said?"
msgstr "아, 혹시 내가 말했던 게 문제가 됐어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress. &&& Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty. &&& Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A life that you could include me in, maybe?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B2C
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C8"
msgid "Yeah, it's a pretty good life."
msgstr "그래, 꽤 좋은 삶이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, it's a pretty good life.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, it's a pretty good life.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B2A
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C7"
msgid "A life that you could include me in, maybe?"
msgstr "나까지 함께할 수 있는, 그런 삶이 될 수 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The Great Serpent teaches us that no road is a straight one. Your doubts will come to pass once, I'm sure of it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B1F
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C6"
msgid "Okay, but I have a feeling I'm going to regret this."
msgstr "좋아, 다만 이 결정을 나중에 후회할 것만 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You could come with me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You could come with me.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: I promise you, you won't regret it. I don't want to brag, but I'm proficient at just about everything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B2D
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C5"
msgid "I was hoping you'd say that."
msgstr "네가 그렇게 말해 주길 바랐어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Given your scientific expertise, aren't you needed in Dazra?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Given your scientific expertise, aren't you needed in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B18
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C4"
msgid "All my research is now public, and the dangers of the Mourning Device are known."
msgstr "내 연구 자료는 이미 공개됐고 모어닝 장치의 위험성도 알려졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Given your scientific expertise, aren't you needed in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B18
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C3"
msgid "To put it another way, the milk has been spilled. They don't need me to remind them to use a glass."
msgstr "다시 말하자면 이미 우유는 엎질러졌고, 이제 와서 내가 우유컵을 쓰라 말할 필요도 없단 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Given your scientific expertise, aren't you needed in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B18
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C2"
msgid "And a coaster. You really should use both!"
msgstr "그리고 컵 받침까지. 둘 다 꼭 써야 하는 거라고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B24
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C1"
msgid "Thank you! I can't wait to start tinkering with your ship. We'll have to measure the progress in femtometres!"
msgstr "고마워! 얼른 네 우주선부터 손 보고 싶네. 펨토미터 단위로 진행 상황을 측정해야 할 거라고!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Okay, got an assignment! Seems... cozy? Heading there now!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B24
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009C0"
msgid "But first, um... stupid question but, do you happen to know where my assignment is?"
msgstr "하지만 먼저, 음... 바보 같은 질문인데 혹시 내 과제를 어디서 부여 받을 수 있는지 알고 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Okay, but I have a feeling I'm going to regret this.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Okay, but I have a feeling I'm going to regret this.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B1E
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BF"
msgid "The Great Serpent teaches us that no road is a straight one. Your doubts will come to pass once, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서는 우리에게 그 어떤 길도 올곧지 않다 가르치셨어. 그 의심도 언젠가 다하게 될 거야. 확실히."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You've convinced me. You're hired.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Okay, got an assignment! Seems... cozy? Heading there now!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B24
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BE"
msgid "But first, um... stupid question but, do you happen to know where my assignment is?"
msgstr "하지만 먼저, 음... 바보 같은 질문인데 혹시 내 일을 어디에 시킬 건지 알려 줄 수 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I personally prefer to meet new people when they're under duress. &&& Sahima: You may have a point. I do think hostile situations can help you measure a person's grit. |Hopefully I showed I had plenty. &&& Sahima: It's you! Have you changed your mind about bringing me on your crew? I have a lot to offer.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Dazra is my home, yes, but I carry it with me. I couldn't be rid of it if I wanted to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B28
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BD"
msgid "Why envious? Wouldn't you get homesick if you left?"
msgstr "왜 부러운 건데? 여길 떠나면 이곳이 그리워지지 않겠어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have a spot for you right now. Let's talk later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have a spot for you right now. Let's talk later.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Okay, got an assignment! Seems... cozy? Heading there now!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B1B
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BC"
msgid "Okay, but don't be a stranger! I truly believe the Great Serpent brought us together for a reason."
msgstr "알았어, 다만 모르는 척하기 없기야! 난 정말 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 서로 만나게 하신 이유가 있다고 생각해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All my research is now public, and the dangers of the Mourning Device are known.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B19
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BB"
msgid "Given your scientific expertise, aren't you needed in Dazra?"
msgstr "과학적 전문성을 고려하면 너는 다즈라에 남아야 되는 게 아닐까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thank you! I can't wait to start tinkering with your ship. We'll have to measure the progress in femtometres!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B25
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009BA"
msgid "You've convinced me. You're hired."
msgstr "날 설득했군. 고용하도록 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Seems to me you want to brag. &&& Sahima: Okay, maybe I like bragging a little. But it's not a lie, truly! &&& Sahima: The Great Serpent has blessed us both with gifts!|If we work together, I know we can help each other grow it.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Okay, but don't be a stranger! I truly believe the Great Serpent brought us together for a reason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003B1C
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B9"
msgid "I don't have a spot for you right now. Let's talk later."
msgstr "지금은 네가 함께하도록 해 줄 여력이 없어. 나중에 대화하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Sahima: I'm glad we share that in common. You have to believe in something, even if they're wrong, which they are.|And if the science changes, we'll adjust as we go along.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B8"
msgid "Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously."
msgstr "어쨌든, 내가 좀 방어적으로 보였다면 미안해. 날 진지하게 받아 주는 사람들이 거의 없어서 그랬어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I respect you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B7"
msgid "I'm one of the best scientists in the world, but I still have to fight for respect, because I look so young."
msgstr "나는 이 세상에서 제일 뛰어난 과학자 중 하나지만, 너무 젊어 보여서 남들의 존중을 쉽게 받지 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How do you reconcile scientific law with your religious beliefs? &&& Sahima: Hm... I'm not sure I follow. There's nothing to reconcile. Our beliefs don't contradict science.|Traditional scientists may differ, but they have a history of being closed-minded. |It's almost as if the older you get, the more stubborn and rigid your brain becomes. Like bread!
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, that's an even better analogy! Also side note, I love when you quote scripture.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039FD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B5"
msgid "And even the Great Serpent itself sheds its skin and is born anew."
msgstr "심지어 위대한 뱀께서도 허물을 벗고 새로 태어나시니까 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: And even the Great Serpent itself sheds its skin and is born anew.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: And even the Great Serpent itself sheds its skin and is born anew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Anyway, sorry if I seem a little defensive. I'm just used to people not taking me seriously.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039FC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B4"
msgid "Oh, that's an even better analogy! Also side note, I love when you quote scripture."
msgstr "우와, 그 비유가 훨씬 낫네! 그리고 네가 경전을 인용할 때 너무 좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: By knocking with opportunity! Whispers, rumors, and gossip can lead to new adventures.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B3"
msgid "How can the city be my guide?"
msgstr "어떻게 도시가 내 가이드가 될 수 있단 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039EF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B2"
msgid "It's rough and hazardous, like its people."
msgstr "거칠고 위험천만하지. 이곳에 사는 사람들처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039EF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B1"
msgid "But, outside of our culture, it's also shaped the way our technology has grown."
msgstr "하지만 우리의 문화적 관점 외에도, 우리의 기술 발전 방향에 영향을 주었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039EF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009B0"
msgid "The planet is rich with natural resources, and we use them in our grav drive experiments."
msgstr "이 행성은 천연 자원이 풍부해서 우린 중력 구동기 시험 재료로 잘 쓰고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: What does the city of Dazra have to teach me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039EF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009AF"
msgid "None of this is coincidence, of course. The Great Serpent called us here, knowing Va'ruun'kai would provide for the Promised."
msgstr ""
"물론 그 어느 것도 우연이 아니야. 위대한 뱀께서 우릴 이곳에 부르신 건 바룬카이가 약속받은 자들에게 충분할 것임을 아셨던 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's rough and hazardous, like its people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F0
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009AE"
msgid "What about Va'ruun'kai? Any opinions on the planet?"
msgstr "바룬카이는 어때? 행성에 관해 드는 생각이 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can the city be my guide?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How can the city be my guide?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009AD"
msgid "By knocking with opportunity! Whispers, rumors, and gossip can lead to new adventures."
msgstr "바로 여러 기회를 줌으로써 말이지! 속삭임, 소문, 험담을 들으면 새 모험을 맞이할 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How can the city be my guide?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: What does the city of Dazra have to teach me?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010039F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Dazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0009AC"
msgid "You just have to lend your ear to them."
msgstr "다만 네 귀를 쫑긋 기울여 주면 돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0009AB"
msgid "From accursed to Penitent."
msgstr "저주받은 자에서 회개하는 자로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know. I didn't think it through that far.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know. I didn't think it through that far.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: Phew! On that note, I think I need a break from this topic. Epistemological debates are fun, but exhausting.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 010202E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_Religion
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0009AA"
msgid "That's okay! Let's just say your turtle theory is a work in progress, and leave it at that."
msgstr "괜찮아! 네 거북이 이론이 아직 진행 중인 것으로 남겨 두도록 하자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A9"
msgid "I feel the Serpent coiled around us, protecting us from harm."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 우리 주변에 똬리를 트셔서 보호해 주고 있단 것이 느껴져."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A8"
msgid "The accursed doubt the Great Serpent exists, but gods are like breath, unseen and life giving."
msgstr "저주받은 자들은 위대한 뱀이 존재하는 것인지 의심하지만, 신은 숨결과 같아. 보이지 않고 생명을 불어넣지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A7"
msgid "As a scientist, our ways shouldn't be stone-written. Each new tide of knowledge reshapes the rock, like waves against the cliff."
msgstr ""
"과학자로서, 우리의 방식은 돌에 새겨진 듯 불변적이어서는 안 돼. 새 지식의 물결은 절벽에 부딪히는 파도처럼 바위를 깎는 법이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A6"
msgid "I've tried Chunks. It's actually good? I'm a fan."
msgstr "청크를 먹어봤어. 정말 맛있지 않아? 나 완전 팬이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A5"
msgid "This isn't a scientific study by any means, but the Penitent tend to have very punchable faces."
msgstr "과학적 연구 결과는 없지만, 회개자들은 하나같이 주먹을 날리고 싶은 얼굴을 갖고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A4"
msgid "Prayer isn't spoken. It's felt!"
msgstr "기도문은 말하는 게 아니라, 느끼는 것이지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: cSBFBGSDLC001_CREW_Elite_HellosSpecial
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A3"
msgid "If I sing the Serpent's hymns unprompted, forgive me. They're just so catchy!"
msgstr "혹시 갑자기 뱀의 찬송가를 불러도 용서해 줘. 엄청 중독성이 있거든!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A2"
msgid "Praise be."
msgstr "찬양받으소서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A1"
msgid "Need guidance?"
msgstr "인도가 필요해?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0009A0"
msgid "Blessed are those who walk the path of the Promised."
msgstr "약속받은 자의 길을 걷는 모두에게 복이 있나니."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099F"
msgid "Hey! Need anything?"
msgstr "안녕! 필요한 게 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099E"
msgid "Need me somewhere? I got you!"
msgstr "함께 가야 할 곳이 있어? 말만 해!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099D"
msgid "Need my help? I bet you do!"
msgstr "도움이 필요해? 분명 그렇겠지!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099C"
msgid "Good to see you."
msgstr "반가워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099B"
msgid "Hey, Captain."
msgstr "안녕. 선장."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_FollowerHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00099A"
msgid "Any new orders for me?"
msgstr "새로 명령 내릴 거라도?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Sahima_NonFollower_Hellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000999"
msgid "Need a hand with something?"
msgstr "뭔가 도움이 필요해?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000998"
msgid "Salutations, Vindicator."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 옹호자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000997"
msgid "Salutations, Harbinger."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 선구자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000996"
msgid "Salutations, Reverent."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 숭배자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000995"
msgid "Salutations, Diviner."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 예측자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000994"
msgid "Salutations, Armiger."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 복종자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAC
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_TitleHellos
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000993"
msgid "Salutations, Adherent."
msgstr "경의를 표하지. 지지자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01025685
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000992"
msgid "Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live."
msgstr "거기 꼼짝 마. 내뱉을 말을 신중하게 골라라. 네 명줄이 달려 있으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Guard: Hold very still, and choose your words carefully. They will determine how long you live. &&& companion: We are no threat to House Va'ruun. I promise you.
#. ALIAS: Guard
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I found your wayward starstation, the Oracle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ02
#. TOPIC: 01025684
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ02_Stage200_GuardForcegreet
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000991"
msgid "You have no right to be here. You will tell me how you found this place."
msgstr "넌 여기 있을 권리가 없어. 여길 어떻게 찾았는지 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to discuss the ship departures. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: It's a doozy. Notice anything suspicious about any of the ships?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's a basic Class A fighter, which may have been charged with transporting medical supplies that day.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000990"
msgid "The Eulogy I."
msgstr "율로지 I."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Eulogy I.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Eulogy I.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00098F"
msgid "That's a basic Class A fighter, which may have been charged with transporting medical supplies that day."
msgstr "그날 의료 용품을 수송하는 데 사용되었을 가능성이 있는 기본 A급 전투기입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Eulogy I.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Still, I know better than to take anything you say lightly. I'll have my people find the crew manifest for it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00098E"
msgid "It only showed up once on the list, however. I don't think it's connected."
msgstr "하지만 목록에 한 번만 나타났습니다. 관련이 있다고 생각하지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to discuss the ship departures. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: It's a doozy. Notice anything suspicious about any of the ships?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Class B ship. Fairly state of the art, and may be connected to the missing weapons crate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00098D"
msgid "The Hymn II."
msgstr "히임 II."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Hymn II.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The Hymn II.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00098C"
msgid "Class B ship. Fairly state of the art, and may be connected to the missing weapons crate."
msgstr "B급 우주선입니다. 상당히 최신식이고, 누락된 무기 상자와 관련이 있을 수 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The Hymn II.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Still, I know better than to take anything you say lightly. I'll have my people find the crew manifest for it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010263F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00098B"
msgid "Except that doesn't explain all the other supplies that went missing. Unless they used different ships?"
msgstr "하지만 그것만으로는 없어진 다른 물자를 전부 설명할 수 없습니다. 다른 우주선을 사용한 게 아니라면 말이죠."

