#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00096B"
msgid "Sneak in, confront the thief, and sneak out."
msgstr "잠입해서, 도둑과 대면하고, 빠져나오세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sneak in, confront the thief, and sneak out.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sneak in, confront the thief, and sneak out.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Now, since you have what you need, I'm going to turn my attention to other matters.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026039
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_100_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00096A"
msgid "Good plan. It'll mean they'll be plenty of zealots leftover for my team to kill. They just love doing that stuff."
msgstr "좋은 계획입니다. 제 팀이 죽일 광신도가 많이 남게 될 테니까요. 그 친구들은 그런 일을 아주 좋아합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to discuss the names on the employment records. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: There's some familiar ones on there. See anything that stands out?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True, but Carmina Andajar died in the accident. If she were involved, she certainly isn't now.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026038
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000969"
msgid "There's a smuggler assigned to the spaceport."
msgstr "우주항에 배정된 밀수업자가 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's a smuggler assigned to the spaceport.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's a smuggler assigned to the spaceport.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: But I trust your judgment. I'll do a more thorough investigation of their activities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026037
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000968"
msgid "True, but Carmina Andajar died in the accident. If she were involved, she certainly isn't now."
msgstr "맞아요. 하지만 카미나 앤다자는 사고로 죽었습니다. 카미나가 연루되었다 하더라도, 지금은 확실히 아니죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: For the Mourning Device, I presume? Seems unrelated to the investigation though.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026032
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000966"
msgid "But I trust your judgment. I'll do a more thorough investigation of their activities."
msgstr "하지만 당신의 판단을 믿습니다. 그들의 활동에 대해 더 철저히 조사해 보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to discuss the names on the employment records. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: There's some familiar ones on there. See anything that stands out?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Really? I thought one name would stand out above the rest. But maybe I'm reading into things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026034
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000965"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr "별로요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not really.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not really.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: But I trust your judgment. I'll do a more thorough investigation of their activities.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01026033
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000962"
msgid "Really? I thought one name would stand out above the rest. But maybe I'm reading into things."
msgstr "정말요? 저는 한 이름이 다른 이름들보다 눈에 띌 거라고 생각했습니다. 하지만 제가 과대 해석하는 것일 수도 있겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about Tevina Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020607
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000961"
msgid "Do not let her cheery demeanor fool you. She has a reputation around these parts for being a ruthless hunter of heretics."
msgstr "테비나의 쾌활한 태도에 속지 마세요. 이 근처에서 이단자들을 무자비하게 사냥하는 것으로 유명합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: She also has a distinct manner of speech which... well, I will need to verify the contents of the slate you gave me before I say anything more.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020607
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000960"
msgid "If she doesn't know the location of the hideout, at the very least she'll at least have a lead."
msgstr "테비나가 은신처의 위치를 모른다 해도, 적어도 단서는 가지고 있을 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: For now, let me see what I can find out regarding the missing supplies.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102060D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "00095E"
msgid "What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years."
msgstr "어머, 너무 이른가요? 겨우 50년밖에 안 됐는데요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Do not let her cheery demeanor fool you. She has a reputation around these parts for being a ruthless hunter of heretics.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0102060A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00095A"
msgid "What can you tell me about Tevina Veth'aal?"
msgstr "테비나 베타알에 대해 알려주시겠습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Excellent. As for me, I must mourn my cousin's passing. I understand there's a shrine upstairs, although it seems to be occupied at the moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020605
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000957"
msgid "I'll talk to Tevina."
msgstr "테비나와 얘기해 보겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll talk to Tevina.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: When you return meet meet me at the Halls of Obedience, where we first met.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020604
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL00
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000955"
msgid "Excellent. As for me, I must mourn my cousin's passing. I understand there's a shrine upstairs, although it seems to be occupied at the moment."
msgstr "훌륭합니다. 저는, 사촌의 죽음을 애도해야겠습니다. 위층에 성소가 있다고 들었는데, 지금은 누가 쓰고 있는 것 같더군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: First, a slate of recent assignees to the spaceport and supply warehouse. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: And last but not least, the big prize, a Zealot's encrypted slate!|If what I'm told is true, the coordinates for Jandar's Rest should be on it.|It's password protected, but I believe you already have the cipher key. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: I was wondering when you'd grace my office again with your presence.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh, you have fans all over Dazra. Count myself among them.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000952"
msgid "I wasn't aware I had fans."
msgstr "제게 팬이 있는 줄은 몰랐는데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: In fact, I think you and I are going to be fast friends.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000951"
msgid "Oh, you have fans all over Dazra. Count myself among them."
msgstr "오, 다즈라 전역에 당신 팬이 있을걸요. 저도 그중 하나고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who do you think is stealing the supplies?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000950"
msgid "My mind goes immediately to motive. Who would want to aid the Zealots?"
msgstr "바로 동기가 뭔지 생각하게 되네요. 누가 광신도를 돕고 싶어 할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094F"
msgid "I want to be careful, but I will say this. There are members of the noble Houses who have floated the idea of reconciliation in the past."
msgstr "조심스럽긴 합니다만, 이 말씀은 드리겠습니다. 과거에 화해를 제안했던 명문 가문원들이 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094E"
msgid "But to make a suggestion is one thing. Without approval from the Speaker, the act is treason."
msgstr "하지만 제안을 하는 것과, 대변자의 승인 없이 행동하는 것은 별개입니다. 그건 반역입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: First, a slate of recent assignees to the spaceport and supply warehouse. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: And last but not least, the big prize, a Zealot's encrypted slate!|If what I'm told is true, the coordinates for Jandar's Rest should be on it.|It's password protected, but I believe you already have the cipher key. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: I was wondering when you'd grace my office again with your presence.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Really? Well, let me apologize for appearing to be! I can't imagine what I was thinking, letting you slip away.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094D"
msgid "I figured you were busy."
msgstr "바쁘신 줄 알았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I figured you were busy.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I figured you were busy.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: In fact, I think you and I are going to be fast friends.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094C"
msgid "Really? Well, let me apologize for appearing to be! I can't imagine what I was thinking, letting you slip away."
msgstr "정말요? 그렇게 보였다니 사과드리죠! 당신을 놓치다니, 제가 무슨 생각을 한 건지 모르겠군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can we trust House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020601
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094B"
msgid "They are fiercely loyal to House Va'ruun and are in charge of rooting out zealotry in our ranks."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 바룬 가문에 우악스럽게 충성하면서 우리들 안에 있는 광신 행위를 뿌리뽑는 임무를 맡고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020601
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00094A"
msgid "Only one thing troubles me though."
msgstr "하지만 한 가지 문제가 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020601
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000949"
msgid "If a shipment were put on hold and confiscated, it would likely go to them first."
msgstr "만약 선적물이 보류되고 압수된다면, 아마도 먼저 베타알 가문에게 갈 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: First, a slate of recent assignees to the spaceport and supply warehouse. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: And last but not least, the big prize, a Zealot's encrypted slate!|If what I'm told is true, the coordinates for Jandar's Rest should be on it.|It's password protected, but I believe you already have the cipher key. &&& Tevina:  &&& Tevina: I was wondering when you'd grace my office again with your presence.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh yes! You came to the city as a husk and now stand as its savior. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000948"
msgid "So I've made a name for myself?"
msgstr "제가 유명해졌나 보군요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: They are fiercely loyal to House Va'ruun and are in charge of rooting out zealotry in our ranks. 
