#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: With regards to politics, these days I'm mostly an advisor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F1
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00093F"
msgid "What's your role at House Ka'dic?"
msgstr "카딕 가문에서 무슨 일을 하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Vaeric killed / Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: So I've made a name for myself?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: So I've made a name for myself?
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00093E"
msgid "Oh yes! Especially the way you handled Vaeric. I would've done the same, believe me."
msgstr "오, 그럼요! 특히 배릭을 처리한 방식을 보면요. 저라도 그랬을 겁니다. 믿어 의심치 마세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Excellent.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00093C"
msgid "I take it this is about the missing supplies?"
msgstr "누락된 물자에 대한 얘기인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Oh, you have fans all over Dazra. Count myself among them.
