#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00093B"
msgid "In fact, I think you and I are going to be fast friends."
msgstr "사실, 저와 당신은 금방 친구가 될 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, let's.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205F3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00093A"
msgid "But I realize that's not why you're here, hm? Shall we get down to business?"
msgstr "하지만 그 때문에 여기 오신 건 아니겠죠? 흐음? 본론으로 들어갈까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: Oh, you have fans all over Dazra. Count myself among them.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, let's.
