#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000939"
msgid "Ready to get down to business?"
msgstr "본론으로 들어갈 준비가 되셨나요?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: My mind goes immediately to motive. Who would want to aid the Zealots?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205FF
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000934"
msgid "Who do you think is stealing the supplies?"
msgstr "누가 물자를 훔치고 있다고 생각하십니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What's your role at House Ka'dic?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000933"
msgid "With regards to politics, these days I'm mostly an advisor."
msgstr "정치와 관련해서, 요즘은 주로 조언자 역할을 맡고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000932"
msgid "I focus on high level concepts and strategies as opposed to the day to day operations."
msgstr "일상의 단기 운영 계획보다는 고도의 구상과 전략에 집중해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "000931"
msgid "I let my ward, Ochim, handle all of that. He sends me proposals, I weigh in and give approval. I've even made him Captain of my ship, the Cortege."
msgstr ""
"피후견자인 오킴이 모든 걸 처리하게 내버려 두거든. 오킴이 내게 제안서를 보내면, 나는 의견을 제시하고 승인하지. 내 배인 코테지의 "
"선장으로 임명까지 했고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000930"
msgid "I joke that I'm mostly a glorified rubber stamp. But my days working the field are over."
msgstr "나는 농담으로 날 내용을 보지도 않고 도장찍는 녀석이 미화됐다고 말하곤 했지. 하지만 현장에서 뛰던 내 왕년은 끝났어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1C6
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_Yield
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Yield
msgctxt "00092F"
msgid "Victory is yours, heretic! Mercy!"
msgstr "네놈의 승리다, 이단자여! 자비를!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, let's. &&& Tevina: Excellent. &&& Tevina: I take it this is about the missing supplies?|I may have some intel on my computer that could help you with your case.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'd like to know that too. That's why I've had my people track the movements at the spaceport. Still, no smoking gun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E7
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00092C"
msgid "I don't need your intel. I just need to know where Jandar's Rest is."
msgstr "당신 정보는 필요 없습니다. 그냥 잔다르의 안식처가 어디 있는지 알고 싶을 뿐입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yes, let's. &&& Tevina: Excellent. &&& Tevina: I take it this is about the missing supplies?|I may have some intel on my computer that could help you with your case.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then feel free to use my computer. We'll solve this thing together.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E5
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00092B"
msgid "Thanks. Every little piece of evidence you can find will help us solve this case."
msgstr "감사합니다. 당신이 모을 수 있는 모든 작은 증거가 이 사건을 해결하는 데 도움이 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: 
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wasn't aware I had fans.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00092A"
msgid "I was wondering when you'd grace my office again with your presence."
msgstr "언제쯤 다시 제 사무실을 찾아 주실까 궁금했습니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: So you overheard us. Well then, let me answer your question with a question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205E3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000929"
msgid "What was that discussion in the courtyard about?"
msgstr "마당에서 뭐에 대해 언쟁하고 있었나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervous
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Nervous
