msgstr "지금... 지금은 때가 아니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was that discussion in the courtyard about? &&& Mujeen: So you overheard us. Well then, let me answer your question with a question.|Do you think the cycle of violence can be broken? Or are some conflicts absolute?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
