msgid "I don't know the answer to that."
msgstr "그것에 대한 답은 저도 모르겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Thanks. Every little piece of evidence you can find will help us solve this case.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Thanks. Every little piece of evidence you can find will help us solve this case.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
