msgstr "그렇다면 마음대로 제 컴퓨터를 쓰세요. 함께 이 사건을 해결하자고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Impressed / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's possible to break it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's possible to break it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Impressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DC
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000921"
msgid "I wholeheartedly agree. We do not have to forgive, but we can let go."
msgstr "진심으로 동의하네. 우리는 용서할 필요는 없지만, 놓아줄 수는 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was that discussion in the courtyard about? &&& Mujeen: So you overheard us. Well then, let me answer your question with a question.|Do you think the cycle of violence can be broken? Or are some conflicts absolute?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I wholeheartedly agree. We do not have to forgive, but we can let go.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DD
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000920"
msgid "It's possible to break it."
msgstr "폭력의 악순환을 깨는 것도 가능합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Violence begets violence without end.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Violence begets violence without end.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091F"
msgid "You may be right. But what if the origin of the conflict itself no longer exists?"
msgstr "자네 말이 맞을지도 모르지. 하지만 갈등의 근원 자체가 더 이상 존재하지 않는다면 어떻게 될까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Violence begets violence without end.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As long as blood's been shed, it doesn't matter if the reasons are gone. People will continue to fight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205DA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091E"
msgid "I would argue neither side has a reason to continue such a pointless fight."
msgstr "나는 어느 쪽도 그런 무의미한 싸움을 계속할 이유가 없다고 말하고 싶네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was that discussion in the courtyard about? &&& Mujeen: So you overheard us. Well then, let me answer your question with a question.|Do you think the cycle of violence can be broken? Or are some conflicts absolute?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I am merely stating a hypothetical. And I am not saying the sinful should be absolved of their crimes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091D"
msgid "Forgiveness for a sworn enemy is treason."
msgstr "불구대천의 적을 용서하는 건 반역입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Forgiveness for a sworn enemy is treason.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Forgiveness for a sworn enemy is treason.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091C"
msgid "I am merely stating a hypothetical. And I am not saying the sinful should be absolved of their crimes."
msgstr "나는 단지 가정한 걸 말하는 것뿐이네. 그리고 죄인들의 죄를 사면해야 한다고 말하는 게 아니네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Forgiveness for a sworn enemy is treason.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't feel strongly either way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D8
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091B"
msgid "But if the origin of one's conflict no longer exists, what purpose does the cycle of violence serve?"
msgstr "하지만 갈등의 근원 자체가 더 이상 존재하지 않는다면, 폭력의 악순환이 무슨 소용이 있을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know the answer to that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know the answer to that.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Why ask the question? What's this about?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D6
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00091A"
msgid "It's a complicated question. But if the roots of the conflict were to be removed, even the most robust of trees would fall and wither."
msgstr "복잡한 질문이지. 하지만 갈등의 뿌리를 제거한다면, 가장 억센 나무조차 쓰러지고 시들겠지."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Oh I assure you it was one hundred percent personal.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D4
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000919"
msgid "Is it me or did that discussion seem heated?"
msgstr "저만 그렇게 느끼는 건가요? 언쟁이 좀 격렬했던 것 같은데요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: Our agents mostly work in the Settled Systems, but I have contacts in Dazra as well. I can set up a meeting at the Halls of Obedience. &&& Qisrani: I appreciate the support. My mind has been frazzled as of late.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: You're right, and your concern is welcome.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205CE
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000918"
msgid "It's understandable. The accident has affected all of us."
msgstr "이해한다. 그 사고는 우리 모두에게 영향을 미쳤다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: If you feel you're in danger, I can provide a security detail. My people are nothing if not capable. &&& Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. I'll consider it. Was there anything else?
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
