#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "000915"
msgid "Disgusting accursed sloff!"
msgstr "역겹고 저주받은 허물 같으니!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1C3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
