#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1C3
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_Taunt
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Taunt
msgctxt "000912"
msgid "The Great Serpent shall feast upon you!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 너를 포식하실 것이다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: If you feel you're in danger, I can provide a security detail. My people are nothing if not capable.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
