msgid "Thank you, Envoy. I'll consider it. Was there anything else?"
msgstr "감사합니다, 사절님. 고려해 보겠습니다. 다른 용건은 없으십니까?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I appreciate the support. My mind has been frazzled as of late. &&& Mujeen: It's understandable. The accident has affected all of us.
