#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00090A"
msgid "Tevina and I have history. She blames me for derailing her political ambitions."
msgstr "테비나와 나는 과거에 사연이 있네. 테비나는 자기의 정치적 야망을 좌절시켰다고 나를 탓하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000909"
msgid "Without getting too caught in the seaweed, a long time ago, I received some bad intel from a source on a Zealot hideout."
msgstr "지엽적인 내용은 넘어가고 말하자면, 오래전에 광신도 은신처에 관해 안 좋은 정보를 입수했었네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000908"
msgid "Tevina used that intel to launch an attack, and ended up taking out a camp of civilians."
msgstr "테비나는 그 정보를 이용해 공격을 감행했고, 결국 민간인 야영지를 파괴하는 것으로 끝났지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205D3
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Mujeen_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000907"
msgid "The incident was high profile, and the fault was attributed mostly to her."
msgstr "그 사고는 세간의 이목을 끌었고, 실책에 대한 책임은 대부분 테비나가 지게 됐네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: Thank you, Envoy. I'll consider it. Was there anything else? &&& Mujeen: Yes, there was one more thing.  &&& Mujeen: Regarding the missing supplies, I was wondering if I could be of any assistance. &&& Mujeen: Our agents mostly work in the Settled Systems, but I have contacts in Dazra as well. I can set up a meeting at the Halls of Obedience.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: It's understandable. The accident has affected all of us.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205CB
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000906"
msgid "I appreciate the support. My mind has been frazzled as of late."
msgstr "지지해 주시니 감사합니다. 최근에 정신이 없었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Mujeen
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Andreja] This is a personal matter. I'm sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& companion: This is a personal matter. I am sure the Envoy will respect our privacy. &&& Mujeen: Indeed, and your timing is apt. The Cortege has arrived at the spaceport, and I don't like to leave the crew waiting.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Executor.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205CA
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000905"
msgid "Thank you, Envoy."
msgstr "감사합니다. 사절님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I apologize, the Envoy and I were just discussing matters of state.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Thank you for your diligence, Envoy. On that note, I hate to take up any more of your time than I already have. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205C9
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000904"
msgid "In particular, I offered to help find the missing supplies. I have my people looking into the matter as well."
msgstr "특히, 누락된 물자를 찾는 데 도움을 주겠다고 제안했다. 내 밑의 사람들도 그 문제를 조사하고 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Mujeen
