#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000903"
msgid "And I'm sure you're busy with issues regarding your own House."
msgstr "그리고 당신도 당신 가문의 문제로 바쁘실 텐데요."

