#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "000895"
msgid "An accursed is attacking the ship!"
msgstr "저주받은 자가 우주선을 공격하고 있다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToCombat_DefendShip
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "000894"
msgid "We will not allow this ship to be taken!"
msgstr "이 우주선을 빼앗기게 둘 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToCombat_DefendShip
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "000893"
msgid "By the Great Serpent, they're on board!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 이름으로, 저들이 쳐들어왔다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1AE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_NormalToCombat_DefendShip
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: NormalToCombat
msgctxt "000892"
msgid "Jinan's breath, we've been boarded!"
msgstr "지난의 숨결이시여, 적이 쳐들어왔습니다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: If only it were that easy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C9A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000891"
msgid "Don't know if this helps, but when I'm confronted with a problem, I just punch my way through it."
msgstr "도움이 될지는 모르겠지만, 저는 문제에 직면하면 그냥 주먹으로 해결해 버려요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just let me through. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will, as soon as you provide proof of access. We follow proper procedure here. You will need to provide names, slate numbers...
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: *Sigh* You must be the newcomer we've heard so much about. Only an outsider would be so brazen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C95
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000890"
msgid "My name is \"I do what I want.\" My slate number is \"Because I said so.\""
msgstr "제 이름은 '멋대로'고, 제 슬레이트 번호는 '내맘대로'예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: PowerRoomZealotAlias: I seeeee you.
#. ALIAS: PowerRoomZealotAlias
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: PowerRoomZealotAlias: And now you and your friend will die.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01012216
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MS01_Scene_Announcement_060
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088F"
msgid "You cannot escape the Shrouding, Accursed one."
msgstr "장막의 날에서 벗어날 순 없다. 저주받은 자야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I must say I find this highly irregular, but not surprising. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C92
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088E"
msgid "So it does."
msgstr "그렇군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I'm sorry, but this wing of the hospital is under investigation. You'll have to leave.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I will, as soon as you provide proof of access. We follow proper procedure here. You will need to provide names, slate numbers...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088D"
msgid "Just let me through."
msgstr "그냥 통과시켜줘요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: And quickly. You are free to waste your own time, but not ours.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088C"
msgid "Well, if you're not an Executor here, then I would first ask that you state your business."
msgstr "글쎄요, 만약 당신이 이곳 실무관이 아니라면, 먼저 용건을 말씀해 주시길 바랍니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: My name is "I do what I want." My slate number is "Because I said so."
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: My name is "I do what I want." My slate number is "Because I said so."
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C93
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088B"
msgid "*Sigh* You must be the newcomer we've heard so much about. Only an outsider would be so brazen."
msgstr "*한숨* 당신이 소문이 자자한 그 새로 온 사람인가 보군요. 이방인만이 이렇게 뻔뻔하게 굴 수 있을 테니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I'm sorry, but this wing of the hospital is under investigation. You'll have to leave.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, if you're not an Executor here, then I would first ask that you state your business.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00088A"
msgid "I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me."
msgstr "권한은 없어요. 당신이 권한을 주면 좋겠다 생각했거든요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I will not pretend to know the particulars of this case, I will say this. We are House Dul'kehf. We have a reputation.|We are professional. We are exacting. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: We don't make mistakes.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000889"
msgid "Precisely."
msgstr "바로 그겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Qisrani sent me. This slate should provide me access. &&& CommerceOfficial: Ugh. Even with the cataclysm, this is highly irregular. But not surprising.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So it does.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C91
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000888"
msgid "[Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 제게 우카루의 컴퓨터에 접속할 수 있는 권한이 있다고 이 슬레이트에 나와 있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me. &&& CommerceOfficial: Well, if you're not an Executor here, then I would first ask that you state your business. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: And quickly. You are free to waste your own time, but not ours.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ah, so you don't have access. Understood.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C98
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000887"
msgid "I'm not at liberty to say. This is above your clearance level."
msgstr "말할 수 없어요. 당신의 권한 수준 이상의 일이거든요."

#. PROMPT: I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have access. I was hoping you'd give it to me. &&& CommerceOfficial: Well, if you're not an Executor here, then I would first ask that you state your business.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not at liberty to say. This is above your clearance level. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C97
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000886"
msgid "And quickly. You are free to waste your own time, but not ours."
msgstr "그리고 신속하게 처리하십시오. 자기 시간을 낭비하시겠다면 선택은 자유입니다만, 저희의 시간까지 허비되게 해선 안됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When did Ukaru last check in for work? &&& CommerceOfficial: Ukaru hasn't logged into his station for some time. I've had to process several write-ups documenting his absence.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: We've also had to shift resources and people to make up for his absence. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C89
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000885"
msgid "Dereliction of duty, failure to serve -- fireable offenses all around."
msgstr "직무 유기, 업무 실패는 모두 해고 사유에 해당합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficialOther: A very unfortunate choice. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will not pretend to know the particulars of this case, I will say this. We are House Dul'kehf. We have a reputation.|We are professional. We are exacting.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Precisely.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000884"
msgid "We don't make mistakes."
msgstr "저희는 실수하지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just let me through.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just let me through.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My name is "I do what I want." My slate number is "Because I said so."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C90
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000883"
msgid "I will, as soon as you provide proof of access. We follow proper procedure here. You will need to provide names, slate numbers..."
msgstr ""
"접속 권한 증빙 자료를 제시해 주시면, 바로 드리겠습니다. 이곳에서 저희는 적법한 절차를 따릅니다. 이름, 슬레이트 번호를 제공해 주셔야 "
"합니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: It is highly unusual for anyone to display such disobedience, especially now. |Such actions are tantamount to heresy. Loss of employment is the most likely outcome. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A beheading isn't off the table.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C8C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000882"
msgid "It would be done humanely of course."
msgstr "물론 인도적으로 처리할 것입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it unusual for Ukaru to abandon his post? &&& CommerceOfficial: It is highly unusual for anyone to display such disobedience, especially now. |Such actions are tantamount to heresy. Loss of employment is the most likely outcome.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: It would be done humanely of course.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C88
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000881"
msgid "A beheading isn't off the table."
msgstr "참수는 고려 대상에서 제외되지 않았습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Unfortunately, rather than use the proper channels, he chose to start his own investigation. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A very unfortunate choice.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000880"
msgid "I will not pretend to know the particulars of this case, I will say this. We are House Dul'kehf. We have a reputation."
msgstr ""
"이번 일의 세부 사항까지 안다고 말하지는 않겠지만, 이것만은 말씀드리겠습니다. 저희는 둘케프 가문입니다. 저희에겐 지켜야 할 평판이 "
"있습니다."

#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: We don't make mistakes.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C86
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087F"
msgid "We are professional. We are exacting."
msgstr "저희는 전문가입니다. 저희는 정확합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Ukaru hasn't logged into his station for some time. I've had to process several write-ups documenting his absence. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: Dereliction of duty, failure to serve -- fireable offenses all around.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C87
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087E"
msgid "We've also had to shift resources and people to make up for his absence."
msgstr "저희는 또한 자리를 비운 우카루 씨의 업무 공백을 메우기 위해 자원과 인력을 재배치해야 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C87
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087D"
msgid "Suffice to say it has made navigating this current situation more difficult."
msgstr "현재 상황을 헤쳐나가는 것이 더 어려워졌다고 말하는 것으로 충분할 거 같군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did Ukaru give you any details about what he was up to? &&& CommerceOfficial: Unfortunately, rather than use the proper channels, he chose to start his own investigation.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I will not pretend to know the particulars of this case, I will say this. We are House Dul'kehf. We have a reputation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C85
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087C"
msgid "A very unfortunate choice."
msgstr "매우 불행한 선택입니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Unfortunately, rather than use the proper channels, he chose to start his own investigation.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C83
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087B"
msgid "Did Ukaru give you any details about what he was up to?"
msgstr "우카루가 당신에게 뭘 하고 있었는지 세부 사항을 알려준 게 혹시 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. PROMPT: What if I end up needing admin privileges?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if I end up needing admin privileges? &&& CommerceOfficial: Then you are out of luck.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Exactly that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C7F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00087A"
msgid "In a bind, high and dry, up the creek without a paddle."
msgstr "곤란한 상황에서, 막막하게, 곤경에 처하게 될 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& ...  &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.|You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month.|Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you are out of luck.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C7B
