#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000879"
msgid "What if I end up needing admin privileges?"
msgstr "만약 제게 관리자 권한을 줘야 할 필요가 생기게 되면 어떻게 할 건가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& ...  &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.|You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month.|Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I apologize, but you were only given access to view the computer's records.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C79
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000878"
msgid "[Persuade] That's not good enough. I need admin privileges."
msgstr "[설득] 그거만으로는 부족해요. 관리자 권한이 필요해요."

#. PROMPT: What if I end up needing admin privileges?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Then you are out of luck. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: In a bind, high and dry, up the creek without a paddle.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C82
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000877"
msgid "Exactly that."
msgstr "바로 그겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did Ukaru give you any details about what he was up to?
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: A very unfortunate choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C84
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000876"
msgid "Unfortunately, rather than use the proper channels, he chose to start his own investigation."
msgstr "불행히도, 적절한 경로를 통해 진행하는 대신, 우카루 씨는 자신만의 방식대로 조사를 시작하기로 했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What if I end up needing admin privileges?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What if I end up needing admin privileges?
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: In a bind, high and dry, up the creek without a paddle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C7C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000875"
msgid "Then you are out of luck."
msgstr "그러면 운이 없는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I'm sorry, but this wing of the hospital is under investigation. You'll have to leave.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ugh. Even with the cataclysm, this is highly irregular. But not surprising.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C72
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000874"
msgid "[Give Slate] Qisrani sent me. This slate should provide me access."
msgstr "[슬레이트 주기] 키스라니가 저를 보냈어요. 이 슬레이트에 저에게 부여된 권한이 적혀있을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: [Give Slate] Qisrani sent me. This slate should provide me access.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] Qisrani sent me. This slate should provide me access.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Qisrani is obsessed with transparency and often seeks independent help. I find this tendency unwise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C71
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000873"
msgid "Ugh. Even with the cataclysm, this is highly irregular. But not surprising."
msgstr "으. 대재난도 일어났지만, 이건 참으로 이례적인 일입니다. 하지만 놀랍지는 않군요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I suppose given all that's happened, exceptions must be made. |You'll be granted temporary admin privileges to Ukaru's computer. That should be enough for you to do your investigation.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C70
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000872"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I cannot grant you that level of access. You'll have to make do."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 당신에게 그 정도 수준의 접속 권한을 드릴 수는 없습니다. 알아서 하셔야 할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C76
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000871"
msgid "I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer."
msgstr "우카루 씨의 컴퓨터 키카드를 드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C76
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000870"
msgid "You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month."
msgstr "당신은 지난 한 달간의 문서와 통신 내역에 접속할 수 있게 됩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C76
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00086F"
msgid "Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant."
msgstr "그 이상 자료에 접근하려면 관리자 권한이 필요할 겁니다. 저는 그런 권한을 드리지 않을 거고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficialOther: And by unwise, he means a complete disregard for operational security, rules and regulations. &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C75
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00086E"
msgid "A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable."
msgstr "좋은 절충안은 모두를 불행하게 만듭니다. 이번 절충안은 특히 비참했습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Basic access isn't enough. I need admin privileges to Ukaru Dul'kehf's computer.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00086D"
msgid "I apologize, but you were only given access to view the computer's records."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 당신은 컴퓨터 기록을 볼 수 있는 권한만 받았습니다."

#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I suppose given all that's happened, exceptions must be made. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00086C"
msgid "Admin privileges are restricted to House officials only."
msgstr "관리자 권한은 가문의 관료들에게만 주어집니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& CommerceOfficial: So it does. &&& CommerceOfficial: I must say I find this highly irregular, but not surprising.  &&& CommerceOfficial: Qisrani is obsessed with transparency and often seeks independent help. I find this tendency unwise.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficialOther
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C74
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00086B"
msgid "And by unwise, he means a complete disregard for operational security, rules and regulations."
msgstr "그리고 현명하지 못하게도, 우카루 씨가 운영 보안 관련 규칙 및 규정을 완전히 무시하려 한 것으로 보입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A9
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_LostIdle
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostIdle
msgctxt "00086A"
msgid "We can smell the stench of your heresy..."
msgstr "네 이단의 악취가 진동하는구나..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: I apologize, but you were only given access to view the computer's records.|Admin privileges are restricted to House officials only.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000869"
msgid "I suppose given all that's happened, exceptions must be made."
msgstr "이 모든 일이 일어난 걸 고려하면, 예외를 두어야 할 수도 있다는 생각이 드네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Qisrani would have given me approval if she had known it was required. You're wasting both our times if I have to return to her.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010FAE45
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000868"
msgid "You'll be granted temporary admin privileges to Ukaru's computer. That should be enough for you to do your investigation."
msgstr "우카루 씨의 컴퓨터에 대한 임시 관리자 권한을 당신에게 드리겠습니다. 이거면 조사하는 데 충분할 겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: [Give Slate] This slate says I can have access to his computer. &&& ...  &&& CommerceOfficial: Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable. &&& CommerceOfficial: I will give you the keycard to Ukaru's computer.|You will be able to access documents and correspondence for the past month.|Any further access will require admin privileges which I am not willing to grant.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. If there's anything else I can do, let me know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C78
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000867"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I understand.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I understand.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C77
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000866"
msgid "Of course. If there's anything else I can do, let me know."
msgstr "물론입니다. 저에게 부탁할 다른 일이 있다면, 알려주십시오."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I apologize, but you were only given access to view the computer's records.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000865"
msgid "Basic access isn't enough. I need admin privileges to Ukaru Dul'kehf's computer."
msgstr "기본 권한으로는 충분하지 않아요. 우카루 둘케프의 컴퓨터 관리자 권한이 필요해요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: I apologize, but you were only given access to view the computer's records.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_SPCH
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000864"
msgid "Files on Ukaru Dul'kehf's computer have been deleted. I need access."
msgstr "우카루 둘케프의 컴퓨터에 있는 파일들이 삭제됐어요. 접속 권한이 필요해요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Several. The Halls of Healing are extremely busy. We can't keep track every individual that passes through.|In particular, the patients. We had to usher one out of here just now who claimed to have a crippling headache. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: Given the patient himself was a headache, it's likely genetic.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000863"
msgid "Admin privileges would allow you to view the access logs, however, that track the last three users to sign in."
msgstr "관리자 권한을 통해 접속 기록을 볼 수 있지만, 최근에 로그인한 세 명의 사용자만 추적 가능합니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Several. The Halls of Healing are extremely busy. We can't keep track every individual that passes through.|In particular, the patients. We had to usher one out of here just now who claimed to have a crippling headache. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: Given the patient himself was a headache, it's likely genetic.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000862"
msgid "The admin privileges I've granted you will allow you to view the access logs, however, that track the last users to sign in."
msgstr "제가 드린 관리자 권한을 통해 접속 기록을 볼 수 있지만, 최근에 로그인한 사용자들만 추적 가능합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Has anyone else been allowed entry here?
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000861"
msgid "Several. The Halls of Healing are extremely busy. We can't keep track every individual that passes through."
msgstr "여러 명 있습니다. 회복의 전당은 매우 바쁩니다. 여기를 지나다니는 사람을 모두 일일이 추적할 순 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it unusual for Ukaru to abandon his post?
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C69
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000860"
msgid "It is highly unusual for anyone to display such disobedience, especially now."
msgstr "특히 지금 같은 상황에, 누군가가 그런 불복종을 보이다니 참으로 이례적입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: A beheading isn't off the table.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C69
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00085F"
msgid "Such actions are tantamount to heresy. Loss of employment is the most likely outcome."
msgstr "그런 짓은 이단 행위와 같습니다. 일자리를 잃게 될 가능성이 가장 크겠죠."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Several. The Halls of Healing are extremely busy. We can't keep track every individual that passes through.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C6A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL04
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00085E"
msgid "Has anyone else been allowed entry here?"
msgstr "출입 승인을 받은 다른 사람이 있나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: When did Ukaru last check in for work?
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: Dereliction of duty, failure to serve -- fireable offenses all around.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C68
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00085D"
msgid "Ukaru hasn't logged into his station for some time. I've had to process several write-ups documenting his absence."
msgstr ""
"우카루 씨는 한동안 자기 작업용 컴퓨터에 로그인하지 않았습니다. 여러 번 우카루 씨가 자리를 비웠다는 사실을 보고서로 작성해야 했죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "00085C"
msgid "Great Serpent, your will is done."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 당신의 뜻이 이루어졌습니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: It is highly unusual for anyone to display such disobedience, especially now. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C67
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00085B"
msgid "Is it unusual for Ukaru to abandon his post?"
msgstr "우카루가 자기 자리를 비우는 경우가 흔하지 않은가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: [Give Slate] Qisrani sent me. This slate should provide me access.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C66
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00085A"
msgid "I'm sorry, but this wing of the hospital is under investigation. You'll have to leave."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 이 병원 구역은 조사 중입니다. 나가셔야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: CommerceOfficial: Qisrani is obsessed with transparency and often seeks independent help. I find this tendency unwise. &&& CommerceOfficialOther: And by unwise, he means a complete disregard for operational security, rules and regulations.
#. ALIAS: CommerceOfficial
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficialOther: A good compromise leaves everyone unhappy. This one was particularly miserable.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C65
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000859"
msgid "Possibly. And yet despite what I said, and unsaid, she persists in doing so. So we must come to a compromise."
msgstr "가능합니다. 그리고 제가 말했든 말하지 않았든, 키스라니 씨는 계속 그렇게 하시죠. 그래서 우리는 절충안을 도출해야 합니다."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: CommerceOfficial: Ukaru hasn't logged into his station for some time. I've had to process several write-ups documenting his absence.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C64
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_030_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000858"
msgid "When did Ukaru last check in for work?"
msgstr "우카루가 마지막으로 업무 확인을 한 게 언제인가요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of shipments have gone missing?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of shipments have gone missing?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C62
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000857"
msgid "Vital supplies for the city. Which, given the cataclysm, is a wide breadth of things."
msgstr "도시에 필요한 필수 물자에요. 대재난 때문에, 물자의 영향이 매우 크죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of shipments have gone missing?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I can investigate. And if I hurry, I think I can save Ukaru.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C62
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000856"
msgid "Construction materials, medical kits, food... the loss of all this is a great cause for concern, given the state of the city."
msgstr "건설 자재, 의료 키트, 식량... 이런 것들이 모두 사라졌다면 도시 상황을 고려할 때 큰 우려가 일어날 수밖에 없죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Is it possible the supplies were simply lost?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C63
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000855"
msgid "That is what I suggested to Ukaru originally when I asked him to dig further."
msgstr "우카루에게 더 깊이 파헤쳐 보라고 했을 때 그 가능성도 말했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C63
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000854"
msgid "It is not until his disappearance that I have begun to suspect something more sinister."
msgstr "우카루가 사라지고 나서야 뭔가 더 불길한 일이 벌어지고 있는 거 아닌지 의심하게 됐어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C63
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000853"
msgid "But I cannot imagine that anyone with access to said shipments would commit such heresy."
msgstr "하지만 해당 선적물에 접근할 수 있는 사람이 그런 이단 행위를 저지를 거라고는 상상할 수 없군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C63
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000852"
msgid "To forsake one's duty for profit is an affront to House Va'ruun."
msgstr "이익을 위해 자신의 의무를 저버리는 것은 바룬 가문을 모욕하는 짓이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& ...  &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed. &&& Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days. &&& Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Vital supplies for the city. Which, given the cataclysm, is a wide breadth of things.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C60
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000851"
msgid "What kind of shipments have gone missing?"
msgstr "어떤 종류의 선적물이 사라졌습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can you tell me more about Ukaru Dul'kehf?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000850"
msgid "He's a good man. A little awkward, yes, but who isn't."
msgstr "우카루는 좋은 사람이에요. 좀 까다롭긴 하지만, 누구든 안 그럴까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00084F"
msgid "As Executors tend to be, he is also meticulous and detailed."
msgstr "실무관들이 보통 그렇듯이, 우카루는 꼼꼼하고 세심해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00084E"
msgid "Given the incident, a lost shipment here and there is almost a given."
msgstr "사고의 여파를 고려하면, 여기저기서 선적물이 사라지는 건 당연히 벌어질 일이죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A5
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "00084D"
msgid "Nothing there, it seems..."
msgstr "아무것도 없는 것 같군..."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: That is what I suggested to Ukaru originally when I asked him to dig further.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C61
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL07
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00084C"
msgid "Is it possible the supplies were simply lost?"
msgstr "물자가 그냥 분실되었을 가능성도 있습니까?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: He's a good man. A little awkward, yes, but who isn't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL06
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00084B"
msgid "Can you tell me more about Ukaru Dul'kehf?"
msgstr "우카루 둘케프에 대해 더 말씀해 주시겠습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& ...  &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed. &&& Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days. &&& Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Understood. Sadly I can't rely on anyone in the noble Houses to investigate this, so let me know if you change your mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C59
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00084A"
msgid "I don't have time for this right now."
msgstr "지금은 이럴 시간이 없습니다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You mentioned you were dealing with some issues.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It's about the supply shortage. There may be a reason for it, beyond the cataclysm itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000849"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr "그래요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& ...  &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed. &&& Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days. &&& Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The slate Ukaru sent via courier is light on details. But he did say that one of the noble Houses may be involved.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000848"
msgid "Why someone disconnected from the noble Houses?"
msgstr "왜 명문 가문과 관련 없는 사람이어야 합니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C55
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000847"
msgid "The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well..."
msgstr "내용은 암호화되어 있었어요. 우카루는 음모 가능성, 미행당하고 있다는 사실을 언급했죠. 그리고, 음..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealots_AlertToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToCombat
msgctxt "000846"
msgid "You could not evade us!"
msgstr "우릴 피할 순 없었다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have time for this right now.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have time for this right now.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: All right. What would you like to know?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000845"
msgid "Understood. Sadly I can't rely on anyone in the noble Houses to investigate this, so let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "알겠어요. 슬프게도 이 사건을 조사하기 위해 명문 가문의 누구에게도 의지할 수 없으니, 마음이 바뀌면 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Doing so would be treason. &&& Qisrani: Yes. But given the seriousness of the accusation, the proof must be irrefutable. &&& Qisrani: So I told my cousin to return with more evidence, and when I didn't hear back, I assumed that was the end of it. |But this morning I received a slate from a courier. It's from Ukaru. It was worrying to say the least.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yes, he was trying to leave a trail it seems. In case something happened.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C52
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000844"
msgid "Odd that he wouldn't talk to you in person."
msgstr "사촌이 직접 당신을 만나 이야기하지 않다니 이상하군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C58
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000843"
msgid "Ukaru's workstation is likely your best bet. He's been working in the Rehabilitation Unit, on the third floor of the Halls of Healing."
msgstr "우카루의 작업용 컴퓨터를 찾는 게 가장 좋은 방법일 거예요. 우카루는 회복의 전당 3층에 있는 재활 부서에서 일하고 있었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C58
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000842"
msgid "Once you locate him, report back to me. I've got a meeting at House Ka'dic later, but I shouldn't be hard to track down."
msgstr "우카루를 찾으면, 저에게 보고해 주세요. 나중에 카딕 가문 회의에 가봐야 하지만, 저를 찾는 건 어렵지 않을 거예요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C58
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000841"
msgid "If you run into any issues with access, hand this slate to my fellow Executors."
msgstr "들어갈 때 문제가 생기면, 이 슬레이트를 제 동료 실무관들에게 건네주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& ...  &&& companion: A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed. &&& Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days. &&& Qisrani: But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ukaru's workstation is likely your best bet. He's been working in the Rehabilitation Unit, on the third floor of the Halls of Healing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C57
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000840"
msgid "I'll investigate. Just tell me where to start."
msgstr "제가 조사하겠습니다. 어디서부터 시작해야 할지 알려주세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Odd that he wouldn't talk to you in person.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Odd that he wouldn't talk to you in person.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C51
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083F"
msgid "Yes, he was trying to leave a trail it seems. In case something happened."
msgstr "네, 우카루는 뭔가 일이 생길 경우를 대비해서 흔적을 남기려고 했던 것 같아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Explain.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C50
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083E"
msgid "It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me."
msgstr "우카루가 저에게 뭔가 경고하려고 했던 것처럼 느껴졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Doing so would be treason. &&& Qisrani: Yes. But given the seriousness of the accusation, the proof must be irrefutable. &&& Qisrani: So I told my cousin to return with more evidence, and when I didn't hear back, I assumed that was the end of it. |But this morning I received a slate from a courier. It's from Ukaru. It was worrying to say the least.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083D"
msgid "Explain."
msgstr "설명해 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I can investigate. And if I hurry, I think I can save Ukaru.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C56
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083C"
msgid "But if he is in danger, I don't know if it's safe for me to investigate. I need someone disconnected from the noble Houses."
msgstr "하지만 우카루가 위험에 처해 있다면, 제가 조사하는 게 안전할지 모르겠어요. 명문 가문과 관련이 없는 사람이 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: The accident has strained our supply chain on a number of fronts. Envoy Ka'dic argues it's a problem of manpower. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083B"
msgid "What was that conversation about?"
msgstr "뭐에 관해 대화하고 있었습니까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Qisrani, Tevina
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Except we can't build without construction materials and resources.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00083A"
msgid "If we are to stand on equal footing with the outsiders, we must rebuild Dazra to its former glory."
msgstr "우리가 이방인들과 대등하게 맞서려면, 예전의 영광스러웠던 다즈라를 다시 재건해야 한다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Doing so would be treason. &&& Qisrani: Yes. But given the seriousness of the accusation, the proof must be irrefutable. &&& Qisrani: So I told my cousin to return with more evidence, and when I didn't hear back, I assumed that was the end of it. |But this morning I received a slate from a courier. It's from Ukaru. It was worrying to say the least.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Of course. Let me explain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C53
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000839"
msgid "Just get to the point."
msgstr "요점만 말해 주시죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& Qisrani: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me. &&& Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFAndreja
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000838"
msgid "A sudden absence would give credence to the idea he was followed."
msgstr "갑작스럽게 자리를 비우다니. 우카루가 미행당했다는 추측에 신빙성이 생기네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& Qisrani: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me. &&& Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMBarrett
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000837"
msgid "Three days seems like a lot given how uh, passionate people here are about their work."
msgstr "3일은 너무 긴 것 같군. 어, 여기 사람들이 일에 대해 얼마나 열정적인지를 고려하면 말이야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& Qisrani: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me. &&& Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCMSamCoe
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000836"
msgid "I don't know, he sounds unhinged. Are we sure this guy isn't just holed up in his apartment reading about aliens and bat people?"
msgstr ""
"모르겠어. 듣기로는 우카루가 좀 불안정한 거 같은데. 그냥 아파트에 틀어박혀서 외계인이나 박쥐 인간에 대한 책을 읽고 있는 거 아냐?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Explain. &&& Qisrani: It felt like Ukaru was trying to warn me. &&& Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...|I hate to say it, but I'm starting to panic. He hasn't shown up to work in days, and the timing of this all feels... suspicious.
#. ALIAS: companion
#. VOICE TYPE: NPCFSarahMorgan
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: And Ukaru himself was extremely punctual. He would not miss three minutes, let alone three days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000835"
msgid "Regardless of the reason, it sounds like something, or someone might've gotten to him."
msgstr "이유가 무엇이든, 들은 내용만 따지면 뭔가, 혹은 누군가가 우카루에게 접근한 것처럼 들려."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Tevina: How convenient. &&& Mujeen: You're putting the groat before the horns. The issue is not the supplies, it's the workforce! &&& Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen... &&& Qisrani: Careful, Envoy. It means nothing if those who lend a hand are holding a knife.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C4C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000834"
msgid "Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad."
msgstr "게다가 그 인간들은 완전히 허물지게 정신이 나갔죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just get to the point.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just get to the point.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: The contents were cryptic. He mentions a possible conspiracy, and being followed, and, well...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C54
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000833"
msgid "Of course. Let me explain."
msgstr "물론이죠. 설명해 드릴게요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was that conversation about?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What was that conversation about?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C46
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000832"
msgid "The accident has strained our supply chain on a number of fronts. Envoy Ka'dic argues it's a problem of manpower."
msgstr "사고로 인해 여러모로 저희의 공급망에 부담이 커졌어요. 카딕 사절은 그게 인력 문제 때문이라고 주장하고 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was that conversation about?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C46
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000831"
msgid "Warden Veth'aal says it's a problem of resources."
msgstr "베타알 교정관은 자원 문제 때문이라고 말하고 있고요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: reveling in the memory of a victorious battle
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "000830"
msgid "The look in that heretic's eyes... ha!"
msgstr "그 이단자의 눈빛... 하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What was that conversation about?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C46
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00082F"
msgid "I had hoped we would've solved the supply issue by now but... there's been a complication."
msgstr "저는 지금쯤이면 물자 문제를 해결할 수 있을 거라 기대했지만... 문제가 복잡해졌어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concentrating / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why someone disconnected from the noble Houses?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why someone disconnected from the noble Houses?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concentrating
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00082E"
msgid "The slate Ukaru sent via courier is light on details. But he did say that one of the noble Houses may be involved."
msgstr ""
"우카루가 택배로 보낸 슬레이트에는 내용이 자세하게 적혀 있지 않았어요. 하지만 우카루는 명문 가문 중 한 곳이 연관됐을 수도 있다고 "
"말했어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why someone disconnected from the noble Houses?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I can investigate. And if I hurry, I think I can save Ukaru.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C5C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00082D"
msgid "Which if true, would emphasize the need for discretion, and an outside party."
msgstr "만약 사실이라면, 이는 신중하게 다뤄야 할 거고, 외부인의 조력이 필요하겠죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Catches themselves slacking
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "00082C"
msgid "*Yawn* Ah, must stay vigilant. Great Serpent, give me energy."
msgstr "*하품* 아, 방심하면 안 되지. 위대한 뱀이시여, 제게 에너지를 주소서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're right, of course. It's not anyone's problem but my own.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C48
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00082B"
msgid "Not my problem."
msgstr "제 알 바 아니에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: If we are to stand on equal footing with the outsiders, we must rebuild Dazra to its former glory.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: What about this talk of missing supplies? I would think the conversation starts there, hm?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C47
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00082A"
msgid "Except we can't build without construction materials and resources."
msgstr "하지만 건설 자재와 자원이 없으면 건설을 할 수가 없어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I apologize, but with the cataclysm, the investigation has been slow going. &&& Tevina: How convenient. &&& Mujeen: You're putting the groat before the horns. The issue is not the supplies, it's the workforce! &&& Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C43
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000828"
msgid "Careful, Envoy. It means nothing if those who lend a hand are holding a knife."
msgstr "조심하세요. 사절님. 도움의 손길을 내미는 사람들이 다른 손에 칼을 들고 있다면 아무 의미가 없겠죠."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "000827"
msgid "Hmmm... I wonder if there's any Koza left over."
msgstr "흠... 코자가 남았으려나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Forgot the words to a prayer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "000825"
msgid "Oh Great One, you have opened my eyes to -- Ah no, that's not the invocation..."
msgstr "오 위대하신 분이시여, 당신은 제 눈을 뜨게... 아, 아니, 이 기도가 아닌데..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "000824"
msgid "How many accursed have I made dust? Countless... Ha!"
msgstr "내가 가루로 만든 저주받은 자가 몇이더라? 셀 수 없이 많지... 하!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen... &&& ...  &&& Tevina: Not to mention they're completely sloffing mad. &&& Tevina: What, too soon? It's only been about fifty years. &&& Qisrani: For now, let me see what I can find out regarding the missing supplies.|It's possible they were lost in the tragedy along with everything else. But I don't know for sure.|Once that is sorted, we can revisit this debate.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C42
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000823"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Pleading / to Qisrani
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: You're putting the groat before the horns. The issue is not the supplies, it's the workforce!
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Pleading
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Careful, Envoy. It means nothing if those who lend a hand are holding a knife.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C41
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000822"
msgid "This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen..."
msgstr "좀 급진적으로 들릴 수도 있겠지만, 만약 우리가 추방된 마린 가문 녀석들과 다시 힘을 합칠 수 있다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like you're someone important.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like you're someone important.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C40
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000821"
msgid "I'm not someone in power, if that's what you think. Still, my work is important, and allows me to meet all manner of people."
msgstr "제가 당신이 생각하는 것처럼 권력자는 아니에요. 그래도 제 일은 중요하고, 덕분에 온갖 사람들을 만날 수 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like you're someone important.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I overheard your conversation and was curious.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C40
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000820"
msgid "Which is what I assume brings you to me. Do you need assistance?"
msgstr "그래서 당신이 저를 찾아온 거겠죠. 도움이 필요하세요?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "00081F"
msgid "The accursed shall all be made Penitent in the end."
msgstr "저주받은 자들은 결국 모두 회개하게 될 것이다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "00081E"
msgid "All heathens shall be made dust in time..."
msgstr "모든 이교도는 결국 가루가 될 것이다..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1A2
#. INFO GROUP: VaruunZealot_Idle_NotSuspiciousDUPLICATE000
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Idle
msgctxt "00081D"
msgid "His fangs are endless voids..."
msgstr "그분의 송곳니는 끝없는 공허로다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Qisrani, Tevina
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Mujeen: If we are to stand on equal footing with the outsiders, we must rebuild Dazra to its former glory. &&& ...  &&& Tevina: What about this talk of missing supplies? I would think the conversation starts there, hm? &&& Qisrani: I apologize, but with the cataclysm, the investigation has been slow going. &&& Tevina: How convenient.
#. ALIAS: Mujeen
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: This may sound radical, but if we could reunite with some of the exiled from House Ma'leen...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C3E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_010_Start
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00081C"
msgid "You're putting the groat before the horns. The issue is not the supplies, it's the workforce!"
msgstr "그로트 뿔을 꽁무니에 붙이지 말라고. 문제는 물자가 아니다! 일할 사람들이란 말이야!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_TrespassNoVisual
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: TrespassNoVisual
msgctxt "00081B"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "뭐지...?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill. &&& Qisrani: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies... &&& Qisrani: But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself.|My name is Qisrani Dul'kehf. I work as an Executor for House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Likewise, and I'm well aware of who you are. Word of the first convert in generations is on everyone's lips these days.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C3D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00081A"
msgid "I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you."
msgstr "제 이름은 <Alias=Player>인데요. 만나서 반갑습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You look exhausted. Maybe take a day.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You look exhausted. Maybe take a day.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C3B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000819"
msgid "Pray that I could. But right now I need more time, not less."
msgstr "그럴 수 있기를 바라지만, 지금은 시간이 더 필요해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't do pleasantries.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't do pleasantries.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm looking for work.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C3C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000818"
msgid "I see. Then perhaps you can tell me what you're here for? Do you need assistance?"
msgstr "알겠어요. 그럼 혹시 여기 왜 왔는지 말씀해 주시겠어요? 도움이 필요하세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_Trespass_FinalWarning
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Trespass
msgctxt "000817"
msgid "Leave at once, or be made Penitent!"
msgstr "당장 떠나지 않으면 회개하게 만들어주마!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C39
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000816"
msgid "*Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now..."
msgstr "*한숨* 저번 대재난에, 이제는 이런 일까지 벌어지다니. 지금 너무 문제가 많이 일어나고 있어요..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There's never enough time for anything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There's never enough time for anything.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C38
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000815"
msgid "And yet we still try to get it done, in the little window we are given."
msgstr "하지만 그래도 우리는 주어진 촉박한 시간 안에 일을 해내려고 노력하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You look stressed.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You look stressed.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C36
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000814"
msgid "I hoped I had masked it better, but yes. I am."
msgstr "티 나지 않게 했어야 했는데 못했군요. 네. 맞아요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And yet we still try to get it done, in the little window we are given.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C35
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000813"
msgid "There's never enough time for anything."
msgstr "무슨 일을 하든 시간은 항상 촉박하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Not my problem.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Not my problem.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C34
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000812"
msgid "You're right, of course. It's not anyone's problem but my own."
msgstr "물론, 당신 말이 맞아요. 남이 맡을 문제가 아니죠. 제 일이니까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm looking for work.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm looking for work.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It's about the supply shortage. There may be a reason for it, beyond the cataclysm itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C2A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000811"
msgid "Funny you should say that."
msgstr "그런 말을 하다니 재밌네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Worried / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Worried
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C30
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000810"
msgid "I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies..."
msgstr "허둥거린 것처럼 보였다면 죄송해요. 대재난 이후로 상황이 혼란스러웠던 데다, 이제는 물자가 사라졌다는 소식까지..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_Trespass
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Trespass
msgctxt "00080F"
msgid "You must leave at once."
msgstr "당장 떠나야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunZealotFemale03
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVGenericVaruunZealots_NewVoicesOnly
#. TOPIC: 010CE1B0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VaruunZealot_Trespass
#. TYPE: Combat
#. SUBTYPE: Trespass
msgctxt "00080E"
msgid "You are not allowed here. Turn around."
msgstr "여긴 출입 금지 구역이야. 돌아가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill. &&& Qisrani: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies... &&& Qisrani: But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself.|My name is Qisrani Dul'kehf. I work as an Executor for House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm not someone in power, if that's what you think. Still, my work is important, and allows me to meet all manner of people.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C2F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00080D"
msgid "Sounds like you're someone important."
msgstr "당신은 중요한 분인가 보네요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I hoped I had masked it better, but yes. I am.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C2E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00080C"
msgid "You look stressed."
msgstr "스트레스를 받나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like you're someone important. &&& Qisrani: I'm not someone in power, if that's what you think. Still, my work is important, and allows me to meet all manner of people.|Which is what I assume brings you to me. Do you need assistance?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: In that case, maybe you can help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C25
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00080B"
msgid "I overheard your conversation and was curious."
msgstr "옆에서 대화를 듣게 됐는데 무슨 일인지 궁금해서요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Executor? &&& Qisrani: Members of House Dul'kehf who handle trade in and out of Dazra. We are part of the Ministry of Commerce, but our building was lost in the cataclysm.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then consider yourself introduced. Now if you'll excuse me, I have things to attend to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C24
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00080A"
msgid "Nothing. I just wanted to introduce myself."
msgstr "아무것도 아닙니다. 그냥 제 소개를 하고 싶었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill. &&& Qisrani: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike. &&& Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies... &&& Qisrani: But that doesn't excuse my rudeness. Let me at least introduce myself.|My name is Qisrani Dul'kehf. I work as an Executor for House Dul'kehf.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I see. Then perhaps you can tell me what you're here for? Do you need assistance?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C33
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000809"
msgid "I don't do pleasantries."
msgstr "저는 인사치레는 하지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C32
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000808"
msgid "Regardless we have duties we must fulfill."
msgstr "그럼에도 우리는 해야 할 의무가 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is House Ka'dic in charge of?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is House Ka'dic in charge of?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01117898
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000806"
msgid "They mostly deal with matters regarding the Settled Systems."
msgstr "카딕 가문은 주로 개척 성계와 관련된 문제를 처리해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is House Ka'dic in charge of?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I want to return to my earlier questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01117898
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000805"
msgid "Their primary focus is diplomacy, gathering information, and converting unbelievers to the true path."
msgstr "카딕 가문의 주요 임무는 외교, 정보 수집, 불신자들이 진실한 길을 걷도록 개종시키는 것이에요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: "Trouble" only begins to describe it.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000804"
msgid "It's about the supply shortage. There may be a reason for it, beyond the cataclysm itself."
msgstr "물자 부족 관련 문제에요. 어쩌면 대재난 이외의 이유가 있을지도 몰라요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000803"
msgid "A week ago my cousin, Ukaru, came to my office concerned about a series of lost shipments."
msgstr "일주일 전에 제 사촌인 우카루가 일련의 선적물 손실에 대해 걱정하면서 제 사무실에 왔었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Doing so would be treason.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000802"
msgid "He was certain someone was using the tragedy as cover, to steal supplies and route them to our enemies."
msgstr "우카루는 누군가가 비극을 은폐 수단으로 악용해, 물자를 훔쳐서 우리 적들에게 보내고 있다고 확신했어요."

msgctxt "000800"
msgid "\"Trouble\" only begins to describe it."
msgstr "'문제'라는 단어만으로는 설명하기 부족하죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How does Dazra operate?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007FF"
msgid "Before the cataclysm, city operations were comprised of three branches, run by each of the noble Houses. House Ka'dic, Veth'aal, and Dul'kehf."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 이전에는 각 명문 가문이 운영하는 3개 부서가 도시 운영을 맡고 있었어요. 카딕 가문, 베타알 가문, 둘케프 가문이 운영했죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007FE"
msgid "And while the buildings themselves are gone, the staff remains. Collectively we are still trying to serve the needs of Dazra and its citizens."
msgstr "그리고 건물 자체는 사라졌지만, 직원들은 남아 있어요. 우리는 모두 다즈라 시민들의 요구를 충족시키기 위해 노력하고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I want to return to my earlier questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007FD"
msgid "That has become exceedingly difficult in the wake of all that's happened, but we are still duty bound."
msgstr "일어난 일들 때문에 매우 어려워졌지만, 우리는 여전히 의무를 다해야 하고요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Indeed.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007FB"
msgid "You mentioned you were dealing with some issues."
msgstr "문제를 겪고 있다고 말했던 거 같은데요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you. &&& Qisrani: Likewise, and I'm well aware of who you are. Word of the first convert in generations is on everyone's lips these days.|But I am sure you are busy getting adjusted to life here. Is there anything I can help you with?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: "Trouble" only begins to describe it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C2B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007FA"
msgid "No, but maybe I can help you. Seems like you've hit some trouble."
msgstr "아니요. 하지만 제가 도울 수 있을지도 모르죠. 문제가 좀 있나 보군요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Nothing. I just wanted to introduce myself.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Nothing. I just wanted to introduce myself.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: It's about the supply shortage. There may be a reason for it, beyond the cataclysm itself.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C21
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F9"
msgid "Then consider yourself introduced. Now if you'll excuse me, I have things to attend to."
msgstr "그러면 자기소개는 마친 걸로 하죠. 이제 실례할게요. 처리해야 할 일이 있거든요."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: Before the cataclysm, city operations were comprised of three branches, run by each of the noble Houses. House Ka'dic, Veth'aal, and Dul'kehf.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C16
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F8"
msgid "How does Dazra operate?"
msgstr "다즈라는 어떻게 돌아가나요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Regardless we have duties we must fulfill.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C31
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F7"
msgid "I'm well aware. Which is why my door is open to colleagues and strangers alike."
msgstr "잘 알고 있어요. 그래서 동료든 낯선 사람이든 가리지 않고 제 사무실 문을 열어두는 거죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What can you tell me about House Veth'aal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What can you tell me about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111789A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F6"
msgid "They handle all matters concerning the Va'ruun populace."
msgstr "베타알 가문은 바룬 신민과 관련된 문제라면 모든 처리해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What can you tell me about House Veth'aal?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I want to return to my earlier questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111789A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F5"
msgid "They ensured all citizens were productive, fed, and had work, and that said work was in service to House Va'ruun."
msgstr ""
"베타알 가문은 모든 시민이 생산성을 챙기고, 먹을 것을 얻고, 직업을 얻을 수 있도록 관리했죠. 그 일은 바룬 가문을 위해 봉사하는 "
"일이었어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't do pleasantries. &&& Qisrani: I see. Then perhaps you can tell me what you're here for? Do you need assistance?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Funny you should say that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C26
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F4"
msgid "I'm looking for work."
msgstr "일자리를 찾고 있어요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm <Alias=Player>. Nice to meet you.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C22
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F1"
msgid "Likewise, and I'm well aware of who you are. Word of the first convert in generations is on everyone's lips these days."
msgstr ""
"또한, 당신이 누구인지도 잘 알고 있어요. 몇 세대 만에 처음으로 등장한 개종자에 대한 소문이 요즘 모든 신민의 입에 오르내리고 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll try to keep that in mind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007F0"
msgid "You should try working less. It works for rich people."
msgstr "일을 좀 덜 하려고 노력해 보세요. 부자들에게 효과가 있죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is House Dul'kehf's role in government?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What is House Dul'kehf's role in government?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111789C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007EF"
msgid "Executors at House Dul'kehf focus mostly on trade."
msgstr "둘케프 가문의 실무관들은 주로 교역 업무에 집중해요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is House Dul'kehf's role in government?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111789C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007EE"
msgid "While we take pride in being self-sufficient, there are supplies that are necessary from the outside world for Dazra to function."
msgstr "우리는 자급자족하는 것에 자부심을 느끼지만, 다즈라가 기능을 발휘하기 위해서는 외부 세계에서 조달해야 할 물자들이 있지요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What is House Dul'kehf's role in government?
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I want to return to my earlier questions.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 0111789C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_TL02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007ED"
msgid "Commerce agents work with smugglers to organize drop-offs, trade routes, and ensure our efforts remain discreet."
msgstr "상무성 요원들은 밀수업자들과 협력하여 하역 및 교역 통로를 조성하고, 우리가 노력한 결과물이 은밀하게 유지되도록 만들죠."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: *Sigh* First the cataclysm, now this. There's too much going on right now...
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Pray that I could. But right now I need more time, not less.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C18
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007EC"
msgid "You look exhausted. Maybe take a day."
msgstr "지쳐 보이는데요. 하루 쉬는 게 어떨까요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should try working less. It works for rich people.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should try working less. It works for rich people.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Qisrani: I'm sorry if I seem a bit flustered. Things have been chaotic since the cataclysm, and now word of missing supplies...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C19
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007EB"
msgid "I'll try to keep that in mind."
msgstr "명심하도록 노력할게요."

#. PROMPT: I overheard your conversation and was curious.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: In that case, maybe you can help.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C1D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_020_Greeting
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007EA"
msgid "All right. What would you like to know?"
msgstr "좋아요. 뭘 알고 싶으세요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0007E9"
msgid "Would love to chat, but I'm extremely busy at the moment."
msgstr "대화하고 싶지만, 지금은 매우 바쁩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0007E8"
msgid "I'm really sorry, but I've got some business to take care of. Let's talk later?"
msgstr "정말 죄송하지만, 처리해야 할 용무가 있습니다. 나중에 얘기할까요?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Flirting
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Flirting
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0007E7"
msgid "You and me need to chat some time. But not now. Now's bad."
msgstr "당신과 저는 언젠가 대화를 나눠야 합니다. 하지만 지금은 안 됩니다. 지금은 상황이 좋지 않습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205AF
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaBlockers
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: BlockingHello
msgctxt "0007E6"
msgid "Sorry, I gotta run. In case you haven't noticed, there's a lot going on."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 가봐야 합니다. 눈치채셨는지 모르겠지만, 많은 일이 벌어지고 있습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007E5"
msgid "Better make haste. A good lead is like a puff of smoke. Hard to miss, but wait too long, and it's gone."
msgstr "서두르는 게 좋겠습니다. 좋은 단서는 마치 연기 한 모금과 같습니다. 놓치기 어렵지만, 너무 오래 기다리면 사라져 버립니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll go first. Ochim Ka'dic is dead. It seems he was working for the Armiger.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'll go first. Ochim Ka'dic is dead. It seems he was working for the Armiger.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020599
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007E1"
msgid "Really? Interesting. Then again, I suppose it's not exactly a coincidence. Someone wanted him gone, and it's not hard to see who."
msgstr ""
"정말요? 흥미롭군요. 하긴, 그게 우연이 아니라는 건 분명합니다. 누군가 오킴을 제거하길 원했고, 그게 누군지 알아내는 건 어렵지 않을 "
"겁니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'll go first. Ochim Ka'dic is dead. It seems he was working for the Armiger.
#. ALIAS: Tevina
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Tevina: I take it this is about the missing supplies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01020599
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_090_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007E0"
msgid "But I'll let you view the evidence for yourself."
msgstr "하지만 증거를 직접 확인하도록 해드리겠습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007DF"
msgid "Well, you might want to read it first. Just a thought."
msgstr "음, 먼저 읽어보는 게 좋을 것 같습니다. 그냥 제 생각입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010205B1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_TevinaGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007DE"
msgid "But you didn't read it? No rush, of course."
msgstr "하지만 읽지 않으셨군요? 물론 서두를 필요는 없습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Qisrani: He mentioned that to me as well, but we'll need more. Keep digging into it and let me know what else you find.
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Depressed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B07
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007DD"
msgid "*Exhales* I was afraid of that. If only I had preached more caution. But after the accident, things were dire..."
msgstr "*숨 내뱉는 소리* 그럴까 봐 두려웠습니다. 좀 더 신중하라고 말했어야 했는데. 하지만 사고 이후로, 상황이 심각했습니다..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Qisrani
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Mujeen: Hold on... you knew the Executor was investigating the missing supplies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 010B9B07
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Scene_060_Greeting
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: SharedInfo
msgctxt "0007DC"
msgid "Our resources were blocked, we needed those supplies and..."
msgstr "우리의 자원은 차단되었고, 그 물자들이 필요했습니다. 그리고..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_GoodbyeGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007DB"
msgid "Thank you for looking into this for me."
msgstr "이 문제를 조사해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_GoodbyeGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007DA"
msgid "Let me know if you have any further questions."
msgstr "추가 질문이 있으면 알려주세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_GoodbyeGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007D9"
msgid "In Dazra, All Must Serve."
msgstr "다즈라에서는, 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_MinistryOfCommerceGoodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007D8"
msgid "Now to get back to these spreadsheets..."
msgstr "이제 이 스프레드시트로 돌아가야겠군..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_GoodbyeGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007D7"
msgid "Let me know if you have any further questions."
msgstr "추가 질문이 있으면 알려주세요."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C11
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_GoodbyeGroup
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007D6"
msgid "In Dazra, All Must Serve."
msgstr "다즈라에서는, 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Concerned
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_030_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007D5"
msgid "We'll need to rely on others at times, but I'd like to keep this investigation mostly between us."
msgstr "때로는 다른 사람들에게 의지해야 하겠지만, 이 조사는 주로 우리끼리만 진행하고 싶습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFQisraniDulkehf
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_030_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007D4"
msgid "It's possible the vortex issues are to blame here, but something about Ukaru's messages make me think otherwise."
msgstr "볼텍스 문제가 원인일 가능성도 있지만, 우카루의 메시지를 보면 다른 이유가 있는 것 같습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007D2"
msgid "The Halls of Healing are currently the unofficial home of House Dul'kehf."
msgstr "회복의 전당은 현재 둘케프 가문의 비공식 거처입니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007D1"
msgid "If Ukaru has not been eliminated or kidnapped, he will likely be terminated upon his return."
msgstr "우카루가 제거되거나 납치되지 않았다면, 돌아오는 즉시 해고될 가능성이 높습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007D0"
msgid "Access is provided to and by Executors of House Dul'kehf. This unit reminds you to be mindful of your position."
msgstr "접속은 둘케프 가문의 실무관에 의해 제공되고 허용됩니다. 이 기체는 당신의 지위를 명심하라고 상기시킵니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Disgust
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CF"
msgid "This unit has been repurposed from a medical bot to aid in smuggling and trade."
msgstr "이 유닛은 밀수와 교역을 돕기 위해 의료용 봇에서 용도가 변경되었습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CE"
msgid "After the cataclysm, resources have been pulled from other departments to reach specific goals."
msgstr "대재난 이후, 명확하게 목표를 달성하기 위해 다른 부서에서 자원을 끌어왔습니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_VaruunGenericMale01
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CD"
msgid "Trade is vital now more than ever. We need to ensure supplies are being delivered to areas of need."
msgstr "지금은 그 어느 때보다 교역이 중요하죠. 우리는 필요한 곳에 물자가 공급되도록 해야 합니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: RobotModelAGeneric
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 0102FD8A
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_020_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CC"
msgid "Regardless of who survived the incident, the work must go on. All Must Serve."
msgstr "누가 그 사고에서 살아남았든, 일은 계속되어야 합니다. 모두가 섬겨야 한다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_010_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CB"
msgid "Can't talk. Busy."
msgstr "말할 수 없습니다. 바쁩니다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_010_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007CA"
msgid "If you have business, speak to Envoy Ka'dic."
msgstr "용무가 있으시면, 카딕 사절에게 말씀하세요."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001MS01_Stage_010_Group
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C9"
msgid "*Cough*"
msgstr "*기침*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Mujeen
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C8"
msgid "How can I be of assistance?"
msgstr "어떻게 도와드릴까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Mujeen
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C7"
msgid "I am a busy man, but I will try to make time."
msgstr "바쁜 몸이지만, 시간을 내보도록 하겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Mujeen
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C6"
msgid "If you have business with House Ka'dic, speak to Razma."
msgstr "카딕 가문에 용무가 있다면, 라즈마에게 말하도록."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMMujeenKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Mujeen
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C5"
msgid "I spend most of my time working at the Ministry of State."
msgstr "나는 대부분의 시간을 국무성에서 일하며 보낸다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFTevinaVethaal
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01
#. TOPIC: 01011C12
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01026068
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "0007C4"
msgid "So, what do you think?"
msgstr "그래, 당신 생각은 어떻죠?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007C3"
msgid "Harbinger."
msgstr "선구자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007C2"
msgid "Vindicator."
msgstr "옹호자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007C1"
msgid "Diviner."
msgstr "예측자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007C0"
msgid "Reverent."
msgstr "숭배자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007BF"
msgid "Armiger."
msgstr "복종자."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: said with respect / Friendly
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMVorisNerun
#. FACE: Friendly
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_DialogueHVDazra
#. TOPIC: 01033565
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_VorisNerun_Goodbyes
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Goodbye
msgctxt "0007BE"
msgid "Adherent."
msgstr "지지자."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But there's too many crates, and some have been emptied out. I need to override the computer, look at the manifest and ping the tracking device I placed on the crates. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01012B06
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007BD"
msgid "I wonder if I can even hack into the security system and identify their exact locations."
msgstr "보안 시스템을 해킹해서 정확한 위치를 알 수 있을지 궁금하군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My boss has no intention of doing that. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll let them know. And what of this one? He's seen my face.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01012890
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007BC"
msgid "We will need assurances, in person. We will send a message through an encrypted slate. The coordinates to Jandar's Rest will be there."
msgstr "직접 만나 확실히 약속을 받아야겠다. 암호화된 슬레이트를 하나 보내지. 잔다르의 안식처 좌표가 들어 있을 거다."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): No one! My superiors don't even believe there's missing shipments!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01012141
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007BA"
msgid "I'll ask you again. Who else knows?"
msgstr "다시 물어보지. 또 누가 알고 있지?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll ask you again. Who else knows?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And why is that?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0101213F
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B9"
msgid "No one! My superiors don't even believe there's missing shipments!"
msgstr "아무도 몰라요! 제 상사들은 물자가 없어졌다고 믿지도 않는다고요!"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I-I don't know, they were all signed off by someone higher up.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And what of it? If you are using this as a pretense to end our agreement...
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01012140
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B8"
msgid "If they know that much, it's only a matter of time before they find out about my boss."
msgstr "그자들이 그것까지 알고 있다면, 내 상사에 대해 알아내는 건 시간 문제겠군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): And why is that?
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): If they know that much, it's only a matter of time before they find out about my boss.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0101213C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B7"
msgid "I-I don't know, they were all signed off by someone higher up."
msgstr "나, 난 몰라요. 더 윗사람이 승인한 거예요."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): If they know that much, it's only a matter of time before they find out about my boss.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): My boss has no intention of doing that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0101213B
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B6"
msgid "And what of it? If you are using this as a pretense to end our agreement..."
msgstr "그래서? 설마 이를 구실로 우리 거래를 끝내려는 거라면..."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): We will need assurances, in person. We will send a message through an encrypted slate. The coordinates to Jandar's Rest will be there.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMOchimKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Hmph. He's given us everything we need. Turn him to dust.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0101213A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B5"
msgid "I'll let them know. And what of this one? He's seen my face."
msgstr "그렇게 전하지. 이 녀석은 어떻게 할 건가? 내 얼굴을 봤는데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): No one! My superiors don't even believe there's missing shipments!
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I-I don't know, they were all signed off by someone higher up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 0101213D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B4"
msgid "And why is that?"
msgstr "이유는?"

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): This is bad. REAL bad. But it begs the question, who are these for? And who's helping them?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C0C
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B3"
msgid "I've found the shipment! Along with uh... countless others."
msgstr "드디어 선적물을 찾아냈다! 다만, 그외 수많은 다른 것들까지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Rattle*
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Whack*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C0E
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B1"
msgid "Wait. What was that?"
msgstr "잠깐. 방금 뭐지?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I've found the shipment! Along with uh... countless others.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): *Rattle*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C0D
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007B0"
msgid "This is bad. REAL bad. But it begs the question, who are these for? And who's helping them?"
msgstr "정말 위험하다. 엄청 위험하다고. 하지만 도대체 누굴 위해 이렇게 잔뜩 빼돌려 놓은 것이지? 또 누가 이들을 도와주는 것이고?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I'll let them know. And what of this one? He's seen my face.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01012139
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog03
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007AF"
msgid "Hmph. He's given us everything we need. Turn him to dust."
msgstr "흠. 얻을 수 있는 건 다 얻었으니. 제거하도록 하지."

#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Lucky for me, it doesn't seem as if anyone's home. Hello? Hello! Okay, looks clear.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C0A
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007AE"
msgid "So the coordinates on the tracking device brought me to what looks like a supply depot."
msgstr "좌표는 보급고처럼 보이는 곳으로 날 인도했다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): So the coordinates on the tracking device brought me to what looks like a supply depot. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Anyway, the main entrance was locked but I managed to sneak my way into a vent area and into what looks like a security office. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C09
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007AC"
msgid "Lucky for me, it doesn't seem as if anyone's home. Hello? Hello! Okay, looks clear."
msgstr "운 좋게도, 누가 사는 곳처럼 보이진 않는다. 아무도 없나요? 저기요! 아무도 없는 것 같군."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Lucky for me, it doesn't seem as if anyone's home. Hello? Hello! Okay, looks clear.
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): But there's too many crates, and some have been emptied out. I need to override the computer, look at the manifest and ping the tracking device I placed on the crates. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C07
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007AA"
msgid "Anyway, the main entrance was locked but I managed to sneak my way into a vent area and into what looks like a security office."
msgstr "어쨌든, 주 출입구가 잠겨 있어서 점검구로 숨어들어 보안 사무실처럼 보이는 곳으로 들어왔다."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): Anyway, the main entrance was locked but I managed to sneak my way into a vent area and into what looks like a security office. 
#. ALIAS: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note)
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMUkaruDulkehf
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Play Audio At Player(Voice Note): I wonder if I can even hack into the security system and identify their exact locations.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MS01_AudioLogs
#. TOPIC: 01011C06
#. SCENE: SFBGSDLC001MS01_AudioLog01
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0007A9"
msgid "But there's too many crates, and some have been emptied out. I need to override the computer, look at the manifest and ping the tracking device I placed on the crates."
msgstr ""
"상자들이 너무 많고, 몇 개는 이미 비워져 있다. 컴퓨터를 재정의 설정한 다음, 물품 목록을 보고 상자에 붙여 놓은 추적 장치로 "
"찾아봐야겠다."

