#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Neither you nor the Zealots will disrupt our achievement now. The Gate will cycle one more time, shifting the Citadel into the Vortex.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530F
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage921_AnaskoVortexGateConfrontation
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000763"
msgid "Despite your attempts to meddle, you have nonetheless served your part in the Serpent's Plan."
msgstr "네놈은 훼방 놓으려 했겠지만, 넌 위대한 뱀의 계획에서 네가 맡은 역할을 수행한 것에 불과하다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: The Serpent's Crusade is too important to risk. The work must carry on.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: companion: Speaker, you cannot be serious! This cannot be what the Great Serpent has intended for us!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530E
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage920_AnaskoVortexGateTalk
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000762"
msgid "You have served honorably. Your deeds here, and your sacrifice, will be heralded down through the generations."
msgstr "넌 그동안 훌륭하게 섬겨 주었지. 네가 이곳에서 이룬 업적과 희생은 대대로 칭송받을지어다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Come, then, all of you. Ascend the Citadel, or squabble amongst yourselves. I will await you at the Pinnacle.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530D
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000761"
msgid "Zealots. Of course they would attempt to poison this, as they do all things. They will not stop me. The work will be completed - now!"
msgstr ""
"광신도 놈들. 당연히 여길 더럽히려 하겠지. 항상 하는 짓이 그거니까. 놈들은 날 막지 못할 것이다. 과업은 바로 지금 완수되리라!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Shocked
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: You think you can override the will of the Great Serpent?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530C
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage580_DestroyedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000760"
msgid "What have you done? You have killed them all!"
msgstr "이게 무슨 짓이냐? 다 죽여 버렸잖아!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: This is but the first wave. Once we have restored the Citadel, we will have the knowledge and power to send out hundreds, thousands more.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530A
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage570_ActivatedPhantoms
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00075E"
msgid "Excellent. It is done."
msgstr "잘 했다. 끝났구나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: Finally, it is time.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01025308
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage535_AnaskoOutsidePodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00075D"
msgid "Come, see what you have helped to save."
msgstr "이리 와라. 네가 어떤 도움을 준 것인지 보거라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Waste no time - ascend the Citadel! Join me at the Pinnacle! We must defend the Vortex Gate! We cannot fail the Great Serpent now!
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 0102530B
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage570_ActivatedPhantoms02
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00075C"
msgid "Zealots have infiltrated the Citadel. They cannot be allowed to gain control of our work!"
msgstr "광신도가 성채에 침입했구나. 놈들이 우리 과업을 통제하게 둘 수는 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Override, active. Securty lockdown terminated. / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LC06_02_Announcer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001NPCMAnnouncer
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01025306
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage470_ResearchLevelLockdownEnd
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00075B"
msgid "Override *static* lockdown *static*."
msgstr "봉쇄 *잡음* 재정의 설정 *잡음*."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: A security lockdown is in progress. / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: LC06_02_Announcer
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001NPCMAnnouncer
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01025305
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage410_ResearchLevelLockdownStart
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00075A"
msgid "*static* security lockdown *static*."
msgstr "*잡음* 보안 봉쇄 *잡음*."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Relieved / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Relieved
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Anasko: Come, see what you have helped to save.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01025307
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage535_AnaskoOutsidePodRoom
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000759"
msgid "Finally, it is time."
msgstr "마침내, 때가 되었도다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Anasko: You will have no choice but to deal with them.
#. ALIAS: Anasko
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMAnaskoVaruun
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_MQ06
#. TOPIC: 01025304
#. SCENE: SFBGS001_MQ06_Stage310_AnaskoInEntryway
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000758"
msgid "The Reactor Level is below us. Bring the Interlock there. We will need it if we wish to see this through."
msgstr "반응로 층은 아래에 있다. 거기로 제어장치를 가져가거라. 과업을 끝내려면 그 장치가 필요할 게다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7D
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_Smuggler_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000688"
msgid "Ugh... I'm more bruise than man at this point."
msgstr "으윽... 온 몸에 멍 자국이 생긴 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000687"
msgid "Yeah, I'll hold onto it."
msgstr "그래, 갖고 있을게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000686"
msgid "I'll take that for you."
msgstr "내가 들어 주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000685"
msgid "I can take a few things off your hands."
msgstr "자네 물건을 좀 들어 주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000684"
msgid "What do you got for me?"
msgstr "내게 무얼 줄 생각인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000683"
msgid "Yeah, I can lighten your load."
msgstr "그래, 짐을 좀 짊어 주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000682"
msgid "No big deal. I've got space in my bag."
msgstr "문제 없어. 남는 공간이 좀 있으니까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000681"
msgid "You know me, I can make room when there's no room."
msgstr "나 알잖나. 공간이 없어도 억지로 만들 수 있지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000680"
msgid "You can trust me with your things. I'll keep them safe. Mostly."
msgstr "내게 짐을 믿고 맡겨도 좋네. 잘 지켜 줄 테니. 대부분은."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067F"
msgid "I can help carry some carry some stuff."
msgstr "내가 물건을 대신 들어 줄 수 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067E"
msgid "No problem, I got you."
msgstr "문제 없어, 도와주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067D"
msgid "Need something from my pack?"
msgstr "나한테 찾는 물건이 있나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067C"
msgid "Don't worry, I got you."
msgstr "걱정 마, 도와줄게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067B"
msgid "I'll carry what I can."
msgstr "들어 줄 수 있는 건 들어 주지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7C
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Trade
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00067A"
msgid "All right Captain. Let's see what we got stored."
msgstr "좋아, 선장. 무얼 챙겼을지 살펴보자고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000679"
msgid "That's probably for the best. Later."
msgstr "그게 제일 나을지도. 나중에 봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000678"
msgid "Yeah, safer without me at your back."
msgstr "그래, 나 없이 더 안전할 것 같다 이거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000677"
msgid "Probably best you hang around me in small doses."
msgstr "내 옆에 자꾸 들러붙지 않는 게 좋겠는데 말이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000676"
msgid "See ya, Captain."
msgstr "나중에 봐. 선장."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000675"
msgid "Stay safe out there. My job depends on it."
msgstr "조심히 다녀야 해. 내 일자리가 달려 있다고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A78
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_EliteUnassigned
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000674"
msgid "Have fun out there. Don't do anything I wouldn't do."
msgstr "즐거운 시간 보내도록 해. 내가 하지 않을 짓은 하지 말고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000673"
msgid "You're like me. We pick up everything that isn't nailed down."
msgstr "나랑 비슷하네. 땅에 박혀 있지만 않으면 전부 줍고 보지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000672"
msgid "If you need a hand with any of that, let me know."
msgstr "혹시 들어 줄 사람이 필요하면 말만 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000671"
msgid "I've smuggled less for worse pay. I'm all for hoarding everything you can."
msgstr "그것보다 더 하찮은 물건도 취급했었지. 최대한 짐을 챙기도록 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000670"
msgid "One person's junk, am I right?"
msgstr "다 누군가에겐 보물이겠지, 안 그래?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066F"
msgid "You trying out a new workout routine carrying all that? Let me know how that goes."
msgstr "그렇게 물건을 많이 들고서 새 운동 루틴이라도 짠 거야? 효과가 있나 알려 줘."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066E"
msgid "Never can have too much stuff."
msgstr "물건은 아무리 많아도 부족하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066D"
msgid "Careful, you might hurt yourself carrying all that."
msgstr "조심해, 그렇게 물건을 많이 들고 다니다 등 다칠라."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066C"
msgid "Easy Cap. That's a lot you're carrying on your own."
msgstr "진정해. 선장. 너무 짐을 많이 짊어지고 있잖아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066B"
msgid "I got bad knees from carrying too much stuff. You seem to be doing okay though."
msgstr "난 짐을 많이 짊어지고 다녀서 무릎이 안 좋아졌어. 자네는 썩 괜찮나 보군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A7A
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_BecomeOverEncumbered
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00066A"
msgid "That's a lot of stuff you got there. I'm getting tired just watching you."
msgstr "너무 물건을 많이 짊어지고 있어. 옆에서 보기만 해도 지칠 정도야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000669"
msgid "You really like attention, don't you."
msgstr "관심 받길 정말 좋아하는구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000668"
msgid "Hey, that could hurt someone. Make sure it's someone you hate."
msgstr "어이, 그러다 사람 다치겠어. 싸울 사람한테만 쏘도록 해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000667"
msgid "I'm sure the guard won't care you did that."
msgstr "경비대원이 그걸 보고도 분명 가만히 있겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000666"
msgid "Just keep that thing aimed away from me."
msgstr "총구 방향을 나한테 돌리지만 마."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000665"
msgid "At least we know it fires."
msgstr "총이 잘 나가는 건 확실하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000664"
msgid "Like to announce your presence I see."
msgstr "자네가 왔다는 걸 만천하에 알리길 좋아하는군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000663"
msgid "Didn't know this was a shooting range."
msgstr "여기가 사격장인 줄은 몰랐어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000662"
msgid "That's one loose trigger finger."
msgstr "방아쇠 당기는 손가락이 근질한가 봐."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000661"
msgid "Yeah, let 'em know who's boss."
msgstr "그래, 누가 대장인지 보여주라고."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A75
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_Smuggler_DischargeWeapon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000660"
msgid "That's dangerous but hey, I'm not gonna stop you."
msgstr "위험한 짓인데 뭐... 말리진 않겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065F"
msgid "If you hurt your leg just now, I know a guy. They call him \"Dr. Tequila,\" because he'll fix you up in exchange for a bottle."
msgstr "혹시 다리 다치면 말만 해. '데킬라' 선생한테 술병 하나 살 돈만 주면 싹 다 고쳐 줄 테니."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065E"
msgid "You'd be great at running from the cops. They'd never chase you down that drop."
msgstr "경비대로부터 잘 도망치겠는걸. 그렇게 높은 데서 떨어지면 절대 못 쫓아오지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065D"
msgid "Gravity doesn't scare you much, does it."
msgstr "중력이 별로 무섭지 않나 보군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065C"
msgid "I'm not making that jump. Not without a drink first."
msgstr "그렇게 높은 데선 안 뛸 거야. 술이라도 마시지 않는 한."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065B"
msgid "It's not the fall that kills you. It's the decision to follow you."
msgstr "추락으로 죽는 게 아니라, 널 따라하려다가 죽겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A00
#. BRANCH: SFBGSDLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SmugglerBranch
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_JumpFromHeight
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00065A"
msgid "You all right there? I mean like, mentally."
msgstr "괜찮은 거야? 정신적으로 말이야."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I can tell you, but just so you know, talking about this stuff's not really my thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BED
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000659"
msgid "Do you have any friends or family you're close with?"
msgstr "주변에 친한 친구나 가족은 있어?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: You may not believe it, but I had a family of my own once. A wife, and a little one, Tainafi. |When he died, everything fell apart. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01005289
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000658"
msgid "*Exhales*"
msgstr "*숨 내뱉는 소리*"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any friends or family you're close with?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BEB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000657"
msgid "Hmph, guess we're on this again."
msgstr "흥, 또 이 얘기를 하려는군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to. &&& Smuggler: Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread. &&& Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.|We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug.|It's just been ten years since the last one.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, maybe I will. I probably won't, but I definitely should.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BEA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000656"
msgid "Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up."
msgstr "10년은 참 긴 시간이야. 나라면 메시지라도 전해서 그동안 서로 못했던 얘길 할 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to. &&& Smuggler: Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread. &&& Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.|We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug.|It's just been ten years since the last one.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You think so? If they're anything like me, I doubt it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BDC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000655"
msgid "They likely miss you but have trouble communicating it."
msgstr "아마 분명 당신을 그리워하고 있을 거야. 다만 연락을 하고 싶어도 못하고 있는 거겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why don't you talk to your family more?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why don't you talk to your family more?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000654"
msgid "I don't know, the thought never crosses my mind. It's not like I'm dying or anything."
msgstr "잘 모르겠어. 그런 생각은 들지도 않았는데. 내가 막 죽어 가는 것도 아니잖나."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why don't you talk to your family more?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000653"
msgid "Of course when I do die, it'll probably be another twenty years before someone tells them."
msgstr "물론 내가 죽는다 해도, 20년은 지나야 누군가가 내 부고 소식을 가족에게 전하겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's no big deal. There's no need to force a relationship just because you're family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's no big deal. There's no need to force a relationship just because you're family.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BDF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000652"
msgid "My thoughts exactly. We're not going to talk about anything important, so why bother?"
msgstr "내 생각도 그거야. 어차피 서로 중요한 얘기도 안 할 텐데 뭣하러 말을 걸어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's no big deal. There's no need to force a relationship just because you're family.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, I know it doesn't make for good conversation, but it's the truth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BDF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000651"
msgid "I'll see 'em when I see 'em, and get the short version of the last decade or so."
msgstr "볼 때가 되면 볼 거야. 그리고 지난 세월이 어땠는지 짧게 듣고 끝내야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, I know it doesn't make for good conversation, but it's the truth.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BE5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000650"
msgid "Yeah, maybe I will. I probably won't, but I definitely should."
msgstr "그래, 그럴지도. 아마 안 만날 것 같은데, 분명 그래야 하긴 하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They likely miss you but have trouble communicating it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They likely miss you but have trouble communicating it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064F"
msgid "You think so? If they're anything like me, I doubt it."
msgstr "그렇게 생각해? 나 같으면 그럴 리 없을 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They likely miss you but have trouble communicating it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064E"
msgid "It's not that I don't care, but I just don't care enough. I'm too busy trying to work the spacelanes to worry about which cousin has a birthday this week."
msgstr ""
"관심이 없는 게 아니라, 그만큼 관심을 갖지 않아서 그래. 이번 주 생일인 친척들을 챙기는 것보다 우주 항로를 외우는 게 훨씬 더 "
"중요하다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They likely miss you but have trouble communicating it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064D"
msgid "But fine, if it'll make you happy, maybe I'll send a slate, and see what they're all up to."
msgstr "하지만, 좋아. 자네 기분이라도 나아질 수 있다면, 슬레이트를 하나 보내 잘 지내나 물어보겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to. &&& Smuggler: Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread. &&& Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.|We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug.|It's just been ten years since the last one.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't know, the thought never crosses my mind. It's not like I'm dying or anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064C"
msgid "Why don't you talk to your family more?"
msgstr "왜 가족과 대화를 나누려 하지 않는 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to. &&& Smuggler: Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread. &&& Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.|We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug.|It's just been ten years since the last one.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: My thoughts exactly. We're not going to talk about anything important, so why bother?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BE2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064B"
msgid "That's no big deal. There's no need to force a relationship just because you're family."
msgstr "별 것 아니지. 서로 가족이란 이유 때문에 억지로 친히 지낼 필요는 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00064A"
msgid "I once got a job to smuggle a slate into a Freestar prison."
msgstr "자유항성 교도소 내부로 슬레이트를 반입하라는 일을 했었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000649"
msgid "I was gonna put it in a cake before I realized I could just bribe the guard."
msgstr "케이크에 넣으려다가 그냥 경비대원에게 뇌물을 먹이면 된다는 것을 깨달았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000648"
msgid "One time to finesse a guard, I started a rumor my ship was haunted."
msgstr "어느 날 경비원을 속이기 위해 내 배에 귀신이 나온다는 소문을 퍼뜨렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000647"
msgid "He was going to board my ship and search for contraband, but as soon as I told him the name, his face turned ghost white, and he waved me on through."
msgstr ""
"그 사람이 내 배에 올라타서 밀수품을 수색할 예정이었는데, 내가 이름을 말하니까 그 즉시 얼굴이 하얗게 변해서 나보고 가라고 손짓하더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000646"
msgid "I once smuggled a pack of Chunks into Dazra for a Herald at the Halls of Healing."
msgstr "예전에 회복의 전당에 있는 전령을 위해 청크 팩을 밀수하려고 한 적이 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000645"
msgid "I suppose sometimes the best medicine isn't chems or prayer, it's chocolate."
msgstr "역시 가끔 가장 뛰어난 약은 기도나 약물도 아니고 초콜릿인 건가 봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000644"
msgid "I once got offered a mountain of creds to deliver a black box to an unspecified location."
msgstr "언제는 검은 상자 하나를 불특정 위치로 가져다 주면 엄청난 돈을 주겠다는 제안을 받았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000643"
msgid "Client told me not to open the box, but I needed to know if it was a bomb, chems, or worse."
msgstr "고객은 박스를 열지 말랬지만... 폭탄, 마약 아니면 더 끔찍한 것이 있을까 확인해야만 했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000642"
msgid "Turns out it was a plushie. Limited edition Wilby. And I screwed up the job by taking it out of the box."
msgstr "알고 보니 인형이었어. 한정판 윌비. 그리고 그걸 열어 버려서 일을 망치고 말았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000641"
msgid "Back when I started I was a bouncer. Meaning, I couldn't pay docking fees, so I just bounced around from port to port."
msgstr "내가 일을 시작했을 때는 바운서였네. 즉, 도킹 요금도 낼 수 없어서 우주항에서 다른 우주항으로 옮겨 다녔단 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000640"
msgid "But then I meet this guy, Ronaldo. He says I can park at his little outpost for free, provided I smuggle in some specialty items."
msgstr ""
"그러다 로날도라는 남자를 만났어. 내가 특별한 물건을 밀수해 오면 그 친구의 작은 전초기지에 공짜로 지내게 해 줄 수 있다고 말하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063F"
msgid "Now keep in mind this guy looks shady. Real shady. I'm thinking human organs, black market chems, or worse."
msgstr "그 남자가 의심스러워 보였단 걸 명심해 줘. 진짜 기괴했지. 인간 장기, 암시장 마약, 그것보다 더 나쁜 걸 취급할 것처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063E"
msgid "But nope. Turns out he wanted fine art. Guy literally lives on a mining farm and has Renaissance paintings hanging from the bathroom stalls."
msgstr "하지만 알고 보니 미술품을 원했던 것뿐이었어. 말 그대로 광산에 살면서 욕실 칸막이에 르네상스 시대 그림을 걸어 놓았던 것이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063D"
msgid "So there was this one time I was asked to smuggle some stolen ship tech."
msgstr "어느 날, 어떤 도난당한 우주선 기술을 밀수해 달라는 요청을 받았었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063C"
msgid "Now, Dazra typically has their own smugglers, for operational security reasons."
msgstr "자, 다즈라에는 원래 보안 상의 이유로 밀수꾼들이 많아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063B"
msgid "But this guy wanted someone off the books for this. So they came to me."
msgstr "그런데 장부에 등록되지 않은 사람이 필요하다고 나한테 접근한 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00063A"
msgid "And while the pay was good, something about it didn't smell right, so I turned it down. Don't know for sure, but I think the guard was trying to set me up."
msgstr "그리고 급여는 좋았지만 뭔가 이상한 낌새가 느껴져서 거절했어. 확실히는 모르겠지만 경비대원이 날 모함하려 했던 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000639"
msgid "Got a job to deliver some soap once. And of course, I don't get it. Why do you need a smuggler for that?"
msgstr "비누를 배달하라는 일거리가 생겼었지. 당연히 이해가 안 갔고 말이야. 왜 그 일에 밀수꾼이 필요하겠냐고?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_SmugglingStoriesGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000638"
msgid "Well, you know how oils and fats are what you use to make soap?"
msgstr "비누에 기름이나 지방이 재료로 들어간다는 건 알겠지?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BAE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000637"
msgid "None come to mind at the moment. Ask me again later."
msgstr "지금은 딱히 생각이 나는 게 없네. 나중에 다시 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to. &&& Smuggler: Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread. &&& Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.|We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug.|It's just been ten years since the last one.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nope. Weird, I know, but that's just not something we ever did.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BD1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000636"
msgid "Don't you talk to them during the holidays or birthdays?"
msgstr "생일이나 명절 때에 다같이 만나 대화를 하지 않나 보군?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BB0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingStories
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000635"
msgid "Do you have any interesting smuggling stories?"
msgstr "밀수업 하면서 좀 재밌는 얘기는 없어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you talk to them during the holidays or birthdays?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Don't you talk to them during the holidays or birthdays?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BCE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000634"
msgid "Nope. Weird, I know, but that's just not something we ever did."
msgstr "아니. 이상한 건 나도 알지만 우린 한 번도 그러질 않았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you talk to them during the holidays or birthdays?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BCE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000633"
msgid "That's why me getting stuck on Va'ruun'kai wouldn't seem out of the ordinary to anyone."
msgstr "그러니 내가 여기 바룬카이에 짱박혀 있는 것도 딱히 이상한 일은 아니지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Don't you talk to them during the holidays or birthdays?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BCE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000632"
msgid "If I get lost, the only people who are going to file a missing person's report are the goons at the Trade Authority."
msgstr "내가 사라진다 해도, 실종신고를 해 줄 사람들은 무역 연맹에 근무하는 머저리들밖에 더 없을걸."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B9A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000631"
msgid "How did you end up in Dazra?"
msgstr "어쩌다 다즈라로 오게 된 거야?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BA9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000630"
msgid "Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?"
msgstr "좀 사적인 질문 해도 괜찮아?"

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I can tell you, but just so you know, talking about this stuff's not really my thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BED
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00062F"
msgid "Do you have any friends or family you're close with?"
msgstr "주변에 친한 친구나 가족은 있어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Smuggler
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BA7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smugger_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00062E"
msgid "It's your show."
msgstr "신나게 말해보게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Smuggler
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BA7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smugger_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00062D"
msgid "You really do like talking, don't you."
msgstr "정말 수다 떠는걸 좋아하는구먼, 자네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Smuggler
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BA7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smugger_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00062C"
msgid "Already, huh. Not gonna throw around a ball and do some male bonding first? All right, fire away."
msgstr "벌써 말인가? 뭐 공이라도 차면서 친해질 새도 없이? 뭐, 좋으니 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Smuggler
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003BA7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smugger_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00062B"
msgid "Already, huh. Not gonna throw around a ball and do some bonding first? All right, fire away."
