msgid "I told you, I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "말했잖아, 그건 얘기하고 싶지 않다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know how you feel. I've lost someone too. &&& Smuggler: Then you know. I've talked to people who say, "just move on," and they don't get it. &&& Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.|You just learn to live with that hole in your chest. And no offense to my nephew, but he doesn't need a hollow version of me in his life.|Sigh, look, I know I just unloaded a bunch of trauma on you. You don't need that shit. |So let's focus on the positive. I'm glad I reached out to my brother. He'll be a good father to the boy.
