msgid "How did you end up in Dazra?"
msgstr "어쩌다가 다즈라에 오게 됐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sad / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happened with your marriage?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What happened with your marriage?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sad
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
