#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00060F"
msgid "That crumbled after my son passed. I started spending more time away from home, and one day, I just never went back."
msgstr "내 아들이 떠나고 나서 사랑은 팍 식었지. 난 점점 집에 돌아가지 않는 시간이 많아졌고, 어느 날... 영영 안 갔어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What happened with your marriage?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I'm sure he'll be a great father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
