#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00060E"
msgid "Last I heard she married some local guy. Accountant, I think. Good for them."
msgstr "마지막으로 들은 소식은 어떤 동네 사람과 결혼했단 소식이었어. 회계사랬나. 잘된 일이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Damn straight.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
