#. TOPIC: 01003B5A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00060B"
msgid "Still, the guard insists. Says someone in a fancy suit vouched for me, and he's waiting at the Broken Spear."
msgstr "그럼에도 경비원은 완고하더라고. 어떤 정장 차려 입은 사람이 날 보증해 줬고, 브로큰 스피어에서 기다린다면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Disgust
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Disgust
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B5A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00060A"
msgid "Now, I've never worn a suit in my life, and I don't deal with anyone who does.  And I'm willing to bet this guy's \"favor\" comes with his own set of strings."
msgstr ""
"자, 나는 살면서 평생 정장을 입어 본 적 없고, 정장 입은 사람이랑 상대도 하지 않아. 그 남자도 분명 '부탁할 것'이 있어서 찾아온 "
"게 뻔했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Who was the guy in the suit?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Who was the guy in the suit?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Except you probably didn't have a choice.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B4A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000609"
msgid "Best I can tell, a middle man. Maybe he worked for the snakes, but more likely he was just a contact, twice removed."
msgstr "중년 남성으로 보였지. 뱀 작자들의 부하였을 수도 있으나 그냥 연락책이었을 가능성이 더 높아. 두 세대 차이는 나 보이더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Except you probably didn't have a choice.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B4E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000608"
msgid "Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs."
msgstr "바로 그렇지. 나는 그때 보호 관찰이었거든. 그러니 남들보다 두 배는 더 감시를 받았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Except you probably didn't have a choice.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B4E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000607"
msgid "Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk."
msgstr "그때 내가 예전에 알던 친구들이 활동 중이었어도, 누구도 그런 위험을 지고 싶진 않았겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A person's got to have a code. &&& Smuggler: Damn straight. &&& Smuggler: So I'm expecting to do hard labor, strings on my back like a damn puppet for the UC.|But after six months I get out for good behavior. So I tell them they got the wrong guy. My behavior flat out stinks.|Still, the guard insists. Says someone in a fancy suit vouched for me, and he's waiting at the Broken Spear.|Now, I've never worn a suit in my life, and I don't deal with anyone who does.  And I'm willing to bet this guy's "favor" comes with his own set of strings.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah. But turns out, I didn't have a choice. I was on probation, and it'd be a while before I could smuggle things cleanly.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B4D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000606"
msgid "I wouldn't trust a stranger under those circumstances."
msgstr "내가 그런 상황에 처했다면 낯선 사람 얘기는 믿지 않았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I wouldn't trust a stranger under those circumstances.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I wouldn't trust a stranger under those circumstances.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
