#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B4C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000605"
msgid "Yeah. But turns out, I didn't have a choice. I was on probation, and it'd be a while before I could smuggle things cleanly."
msgstr "그래. 하지만 결국, 난 선택의 여지가 없었어. 그때 난 보호 관찰이라, 맘 놓고 밀수업을 하기엔 시간이 더 필요했거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
