#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000603"
msgid "Except you probably didn't have a choice."
msgstr "다만 네게 선택의 여지는 없었을 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B90
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F7"
msgid "How did you get into smuggling?"
msgstr "어쩌다가 밀수꾼이 되었지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B29
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F6"
msgid "But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything."
msgstr "진짜 사연을 듣고 싶다면... 내가 밀수꾼이 된 이유는 이 세상 사는 모든 사기꾼, 게으름뱅이, 용병들의 이유와 똑같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Money isn't everything.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Money isn't everything.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B23
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F4"
msgid "Thanks. Real original for you to say that. You almost moved me to tears."
msgstr "고마워. 그런 말을 하다니 아주 독창적이구만. 감동해서 눈물이 나겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Money isn't everything.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B23
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F3"
msgid "I wasn't aware money isn't everything as I pay for my meals with sunshine and skin flakes."
msgstr "땡볕이나 각질 따위로는 먹을 밥도 못 사는 세상에 돈이 전부가 아니라고 수긍할 것 같아?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Money isn't everything.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: There has to be more to this than just money.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B23
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F2"
msgid "But jokes aside, it's not just about survival. For me, it's lucrative."
msgstr "농담은 차치하고, 그냥 살아남으려는 게 아니야. 내겐 큰 돈을 벌 수 있기 때문이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise. &&& Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words. &&& Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything. &&& Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thanks. Real original for you to say that. You almost moved me to tears.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B26
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F1"
msgid "Money isn't everything."
msgstr "돈이 이 세상의 전부는 아니야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise. &&& Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words. &&& Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything. &&& Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're preaching to the choir there. It's a bit rough going at first, but once you learn all the angles, it's cake.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B20
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005F0"
msgid "Good move. Anyone who says crime doesn't pay is obviously bad at it."
msgstr "좋은 선택이네. 애초에 범죄로 돈을 못 번다는 소리는 그걸 못하는 작자들이나 하는 소리고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Good move. Anyone who says crime doesn't pay is obviously bad at it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Good move. Anyone who says crime doesn't pay is obviously bad at it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B1D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005EF"
msgid "You're preaching to the choir there. It's a bit rough going at first, but once you learn all the angles, it's cake."
msgstr "내 생각과 딱 맞는 말을 하네. 처음에는 잘 안 될 수도 있는데, 여러 면을 전부 익히고 나면 누워서 떡 먹기거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise. &&& Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words. &&& Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything. &&& Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We had enough. You know how smuggling isn't all the way bad, just a little bad?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B1A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005EE"
msgid "Did you not have a lot growing up?"
msgstr "어렸을 때 가족이 좀 가난했었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it. &&& Smuggler: I like to think so. &&& Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.|That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education.|I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed. |I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Like what, working for GalBank? I don't need that kind of respect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B0B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005ED"
msgid "Or you could go to a real school and learn a respectable trade."
msgstr "아니면, 제대로 된 학교에 가서 존경받는 직업을 구할 수도 있었겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it. &&& Smuggler: I like to think so. &&& Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.|That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education.|I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed. |I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Just a master's? Don't sell me short. I've got at least a doctorate.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B05
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005EC"
msgid "You make it sound like you got your master's in smuggling."
msgstr "밀수업에 관련해선 석사 학위라도 딴 사람처럼 말하는 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it. &&& Smuggler: I like to think so. &&& Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.|That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education.|I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed. |I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, there's little things you pick up on just working the daily.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B11
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005EB"
msgid "As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about."
msgstr "나도 화물 운송 사업에 종사했던 적이 있기 때문에, 네가 무슨 얘길 하는지 정확히 알고 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B0E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005EA"
msgid "Yeah, there's little things you pick up on just working the daily."
msgstr "그래, 매일 일하면서 차츰 알게 되는 자잘한 것들이 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Long story short, I eventually saved enough to buy a small freighter, and got in contact with a guy at the Trade Authority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B0E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E9"
msgid "There's a lot of nuance to choosing the right spaceport, knowing who's working the forklifts, and where shipments get routed."
msgstr "딱 알맞는 우주항을 택하는 데에는 노련함이 필요해. 누가 지게차를 모는지, 어디서 선적물을 가로채는지 알아내는 것 말이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Or you could go to a real school and learn a respectable trade.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Or you could go to a real school and learn a respectable trade.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Long story short, I eventually saved enough to buy a small freighter, and got in contact with a guy at the Trade Authority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B08
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E8"
msgid "Like what, working for GalBank? I don't need that kind of respect."
msgstr "그래서, 뭐... 갤뱅크 일자리 같은 거 말야? 난 그런 존중은 필요 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Shocked / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you not have a lot growing up?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you not have a lot growing up?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Shocked
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B17
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E7"
msgid "We had enough. You know how smuggling isn't all the way bad, just a little bad?"
msgstr "우리에게 돈은 충분했어. 밀수업이란 게 완전 나쁜 게 아니라, 조금만 나쁘다는 건 알겠지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did you not have a lot growing up?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: A pretty basic impulse.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B17
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E6"
msgid "Well, maybe if we were poorer, I would've been a pirate or spacer. But I only had to break the law a little to get by."
msgstr "우리 가족이 더 가난했으면 난 아마 해적이나 스페이서가 되었겠지. 하지만 경범죄 정도만 저질러도 충분히 먹고 살았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You make it sound like you got your master's in smuggling.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You make it sound like you got your master's in smuggling.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Long story short, I eventually saved enough to buy a small freighter, and got in contact with a guy at the Trade Authority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B02
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E5"
msgid "Just a master's? Don't sell me short. I've got at least a doctorate."
msgstr "겨우 석사 학위 갖고? 그 정도 쯤이 아니야. 박사 학위 정도는 된다니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: I like to think so.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E4"
msgid "I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot."
msgstr "처음부터 얘기를 시작해야겠군. 내 아버지는 군인이셨어, 가족이 자주 이사를 해야 했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E3"
msgid "That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education."
msgstr "즉 난 우주항에서 많은 시간을 보냈단 뜻이야, 교육도 거기서 받았다 할 수 있을 정도로."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E2"
msgid "I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed."
msgstr "상자들이 어떻게 운송되고, 기록되고, 숨겨지는지도 다 봤고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As someone who also worked in the cargo business, I know exactly what you're talking about.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B14
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E1"
msgid "I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean."
msgstr "어떻게 뇌물을 갖다 바쳐서 원하는 걸 얻을 수 있을지 금방 깨우쳤지. 정확히 무얼 원하는지 말할 필요도 없이."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003ADC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Dismiss
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005E0"
msgid "You can return to your post."
msgstr "원래 자리로 돌아가도 좋아."

