#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's good enough for me. Welcome aboard. &&& Smuggler: That easy, huh. Didn't even have to bribe you or lie about how good-looking you are.|Well then, just tell me where you want me.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Damn, after all that, I still get the boot. On the other hand, I don't really care.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005C1"
msgid "Sorry, I don't have a spot for you at the moment."
msgstr "미안하지만, 지금 당장은 사람을 고용할 여력이 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company. &&& Smuggler: Does this mean you're gonna be surrounded by a bunch of other losers, not just me? I don't know if I like that.|Eh, fine. I don't work well in teams, but at least you aren't the kind with uniforms.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good. I like your hiring style. No interview or background check. That's all bullshit anyway, in case you didn't know.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005C0"
msgid "Welcome aboard."
msgstr "합류하게 된 걸 환영해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BF"
msgid "Well, even before I lost my ship, I've been looking to branch out. Being a smuggler is fine, but there's not a whole lot of job security."
msgstr "음, 사실 난 내 우주선을 잃기 전에 이미 다른 일을 해 볼 생각이었어. 밀수업자 노릇이야 괜찮지만 직업 안정성은 형편 없거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler:  Welcome aboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BE"
msgid "Maybe this is a bad read on my part, but being on your crew seems like a steadier paycheck."
msgstr "잘못 생각한 것일지도 모르지만, 사실 자네의 승무원이 되면 급여를 꾸준히 받을 수 있을 것 같군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BD"
msgid "Well, the pay scales up with the risk. And at some point it's just too much of one to make the other worthwhile."
msgstr "급여도 일이 위험할수록 상승하긴 하는데. 나중엔 돈이 의미가 없을 정도로 너무 위험해지더라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BC"
msgid "Besides money, there's two things I look for in a job. Excitement and complexity. I want neither."
msgstr "돈 말고 내가 일하면서 바라는 건 딱 두 가지야. 즐겁거나 복잡한 건 둘 다 싫어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler:  Welcome aboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BB"
msgid "Give me boring and stupid, and make it pay well. That's the dream."
msgstr "지루하고 바보도 할 수 있는 일을 줘, 게다가 후한 급여까지. 내 꿈이 그거야."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitRepeat
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_RecruitRepeatGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005BA"
msgid "Hopefully somewhere far away from the heat."
msgstr "덥지 않은 곳이면 좋겠는데."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitRepeat
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_RecruitRepeatGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B9"
msgid "Just tell me where."
msgstr "어디로 가야 할지 말해 줘."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitRepeat
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_RecruitRepeatGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B8"
msgid "Where do you need me?"
msgstr "어디로 가면 돼?"

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitRepeat
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_RecruitRepeatGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B7"
msgid "Sure, I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "좋아, 한번 해 보지."

#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's get you assigned somewhere.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003AA4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitRepeat
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_RecruitRepeatGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B6"
msgid "Okay. No promises I won't break something."
msgstr "좋아. 다만 아무것도 고장내진 않을 거라 약속 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, I don't have a spot for you at the moment.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sorry, I don't have a spot for you at the moment.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B5"
msgid "Damn, after all that, I still get the boot. On the other hand, I don't really care."
msgstr "젠장, 그 노력을 했는데 결국 거절당하네. 뭐, 사실 크게 관심은 없지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sorry, I don't have a spot for you at the moment.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Guess I'll be heading out. See you later, Captain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B4"
msgid "Well, let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "음, 생각이 바뀌면 다시 말해 줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure you'll be of much use then. &&& Smuggler: Yeah, well, I might surprise you. You probably have plenty of gunslingers and vaqueros on board already.|Maybe you need someone who uses the only muscle that counts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, even before I lost my ship, I've been looking to branch out. Being a smuggler is fine, but there's not a whole lot of job security. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B3"
msgid "What about your job as a smuggler?"
msgstr "밀수꾼으로서 하던 일은 어떻게 할 셈이지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure you'll be of much use then. &&& Smuggler: Yeah, well, I might surprise you. You probably have plenty of gunslingers and vaqueros on board already.|Maybe you need someone who uses the only muscle that counts.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, even before I lost my ship, I've been looking to branch out. Being a smuggler is fine, but there's not a whole lot of job security. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B2"
msgid "Smuggling didn't pay well?"
msgstr "밀수업이 돈이 되지 않았나 보군?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Good. I like your hiring style. No interview or background check. That's all bullshit anyway, in case you didn't know.|Better you just point me to my station so we can get on with it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Guess we're done talking? 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B1"
msgid "Guess I'll be heading out. See you later, Captain."
msgstr "그럼 이만 갈 때가 됐나 보군. 나중에 봐, 선장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Guess I'll be heading out. See you later, Captain.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005B0"
msgid "Guess we're done talking?"
msgstr "그럼 우리 대화는 끝난 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then we're on the same page. Good.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A9A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AF"
msgid "As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew."
msgstr "마침 나도 새 일손을 찾고 있던 참이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A99
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AE"
msgid "Then we're on the same page. Good."
msgstr "그럼 우리 생각이 같은 거구나. 좋네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, works for me.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A98
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AD"
msgid "Let's talk about this later."
msgstr "이 얘기는 나중에 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew. &&& Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good. &&& Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. |You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun.|And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That easy, huh. Didn't even have to bribe you or lie about how good-looking you are.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A94
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AC"
msgid "That's good enough for me. Welcome aboard."
msgstr "그 정도면 충분해. 우리 팀과 함께하게 된 것을 환영하지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's good enough for me. Welcome aboard.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's good enough for me. Welcome aboard.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A93
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AB"
msgid "That easy, huh. Didn't even have to bribe you or lie about how good-looking you are."
msgstr "이렇게 쉽게? 뇌물을 주거나 자네 외모가 얼마나 뛰어난지 거짓말할 필요도 없었구만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's good enough for me. Welcome aboard.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sorry, I don't have a spot for you at the moment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A93
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005AA"
msgid "Well then, just tell me where you want me."
msgstr "좋아, 그럼 내가 필요할 때 말만 해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your hands work well enough for your age?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Your hands work well enough for your age?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A95
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A9"
msgid "Well, I got arthritis. And they shake from time to time."
msgstr "내가 관절염이 있긴 해. 가끔마다 양손이 떨리기도 하고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your hands work well enough for your age?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A95
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A8"
msgid "Lot of pain from years of lifting stuff, moving crates, that sort of thing."
msgstr "오랜 세월 동안 물건이나 상자를 옮기느라, 꽤 많이 아파."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Your hands work well enough for your age?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A95
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A7"
msgid "Buddy of mine said I've got two left feet. What he forgot to mention is they're attached to my wrists."
msgstr "내 친구가 나한테 왼발만 두 개인 것 같다고 한 적이 있지. 걔가 까먹고 말 안 한 게, 그게 내 양 손목에 달렸단 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's talk about this later.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's talk about this later.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A97
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A6"
msgid "Yeah, works for me."
msgstr "그래, 괜찮아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I got arthritis. And they shake from time to time.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A96
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A5"
msgid "Your hands work well enough for your age?"
msgstr "나이가 좀 있어도 손재주는 여전히 뛰어난 건가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew. &&& Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good. &&& Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. |You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun.|And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Does this mean you're gonna be surrounded by a bunch of other losers, not just me? I don't know if I like that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A92
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A4"
msgid "To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company."
msgstr "사실, 난 그냥 일손을 더하려고 당신을 고용하는 것뿐이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A91
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A3"
msgid "Does this mean you're gonna be surrounded by a bunch of other losers, not just me? I don't know if I like that."
msgstr "그 말은, 자네가 나 말고도 다른 패배자들이랑 함께 지내게 된다는 것 아니야? 썩 맘에 들진 않는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default:  Welcome aboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A91
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A2"
msgid "Eh, fine. I don't work well in teams, but at least you aren't the kind with uniforms."
msgstr "어, 좋아. 나야 팀플레이는 못하지만, 그래도 자네는 제복을 입는 그런 부류는 아니니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I want someone old and lazy on my crew?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why would I want someone old and lazy on my crew?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0005A1"
msgid "Because we know all the shortcuts, and don't start fights we can't win."
msgstr "왜냐면 우리 모두 지름길을 알고, 이길 수 없는 싸움은 걸지도 않으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why would I want someone old and lazy on my crew?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: To be honest, I'm just recruiting you for the added company.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059F"
msgid "And yeah, I've killed people. I don't go around bragging about it though."
msgstr "그리고 맞아, 사람도 죽여 봤어. 딱히 자랑하고 다니진 않지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew. &&& Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good. &&& Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. |You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun.|And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Because we know all the shortcuts, and don't start fights we can't win.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A90
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059E"
msgid "Why would I want someone old and lazy on my crew?"
msgstr "내가 왜 늙고 게으른 사람을 동료로 받아들일 거라 생각하지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059D"
msgid "New Atlantis is busy and noisy, but the good kind of noisy. Cydonia's like that too, but in a different way."
msgstr "뉴아틀란티스는 바쁘고 소음이 심한 곳이지만 좋은 식으로 시끄러워. 시도니아도 그렇지만, 다른 식이고 말야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059C"
msgid "It's a lot easier to pass a contraband check when the guard's working a double shift, the coffee maker is broken because maintenance is overbooked, and traffic control is screaming in his ear."
msgstr ""
"경비대원이 이중 교대로 근무하고, 유지보수가 너무 밀려서 커피 머신이 고장 나 있고, 교통 통제관이 귀에 대고 소리를 지르고 있을 땐 "
"밀수품 검사를 통과하는 것이 훨씬 쉽지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059B"
msgid "That kind of noisy."
msgstr "그런 소음 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems. |Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They're patchwork cities, held together by spit, vacuum tape, and a whole lot of guts.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00059A"
msgid "What do you think of the Freestar Collective?"
msgstr "자유항성 공동체에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems. |Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A89
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000599"
msgid "How do you feel about Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems. |Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: New Atlantis is busy and noisy, but the good kind of noisy. Cydonia's like that too, but in a different way.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000598"
msgid "What do you think about the United Colonies?"
msgstr "식민지 연합에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems. |Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A85
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000597"
msgid "I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr "더 물어보고 싶은 게 있는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A83
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000596"
msgid "As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems."
msgstr "나는 밀수꾼으로서 개척 성계 전역을 여행해 왔지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A83
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000595"
msgid "Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed."
msgstr "내가 그 세력의 장소에 가 본 적은 없지만 말이야. 잠시 멈추고 감상할 겨를이 있어야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A83
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000594"
msgid "Of course. What do you want to know?"
msgstr "물론이지. 뭘 알고 싶었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
