#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000592"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000591"
msgid "Let's hear it."
msgstr "어서 말해봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd like to ask you about something else. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A84
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003E3B
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000590"
msgid "Fine with me."
msgstr "나야 괜찮지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: As a smuggler, I've traveled all over the Settled Systems. |Although I can't say I've really visited any of them. No time to stop and soak the seaweed.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A87
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058F"
msgid "If given the choice, where would you want to live?"
msgstr "혹시 선택권이 주어진다면, 어디에 살고 싶지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058E"
msgid "They're patchwork cities, held together by spit, vacuum tape, and a whole lot of guts."
msgstr "대충 기워진 도시들이라 할 수 있지. 침, 진공 테이프, 그리고 엄청난 배짱으로 유지되고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058D"
msgid "Smuggling wise, the job is less straightforward, so you gotta get creative at times to get things through."
msgstr "밀수 일을 할 땐... 복잡해지는 경향이 있어서, 장애물이 생길 때마다 창의력을 발휘해야 할 필요가 가끔 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058C"
msgid "I once dealt with a spaceport worker in Akila who wouldn't take bribes. Just flat out refused."
msgstr "예전에 아킬라의 어느 우주항 작업자가 뇌물을 거부하더라고. 무슨 수를 써도 안 받아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058B"
msgid "So I bribed a co-worker to tell me about their favorite movie. Man, I watched that Inteceptor crap like twenty times, just for research."
msgstr ""
"그래서 그 사람의 직장 동료에게 뇌물을 먹여 제일 좋아한다는 영화를 알아냈지. 참 나, 어떻게든 친해지려고 그 망할 인터셉터 쓰레기를 "
"스무 번은 봤어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: SinisterSmile / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What do you think of the Freestar Collective?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: SinisterSmile
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: What do you think about the United Colonies?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A8A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_Submaster_DazraLeave
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00058A"
msgid "After that, I never had any problems."
msgstr "그 이후로는 아무 문제도 겪지 않았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any friends or family you're close with? &&& Smuggler: I can tell you, but just so you know, talking about this stuff's not really my thing.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: And yet you asked the question.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A56
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000589"
msgid "I get it. Talking about this stuff isn't really mine either."
msgstr "잘 알겠어. 이런 대화 주제는 나도 딱히 좋아하지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I get it. Talking about this stuff isn't really mine either.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get it. Talking about this stuff isn't really mine either.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A55
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000588"
msgid "And yet you asked the question."
msgstr "그럼에도 자넨 네게 질문을 했군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you have any friends or family you're close with? &&& Smuggler: I can tell you, but just so you know, talking about this stuff's not really my thing.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I rather not talk about that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A53
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000587"
msgid "Relax. I just asked about your family, not your darkest secrets."
msgstr "진정해, 난 그저 가족에 관해 물어본 거야. 가장 소중히 여기는 비밀을 털어놓으란 게 아니라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Relax. I just asked about your family, not your darkest secrets.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Relax. I just asked about your family, not your darkest secrets.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A52
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000586"
msgid "I rather not talk about that."
msgstr "그 얘긴 하고 싶지 않아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise. &&& Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words. &&& Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything. &&& Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What, is that supposed to be an insult? In my business, interesting people tend to get caught.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A47
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000575"
msgid "A pretty basic impulse."
msgstr "꽤 충동적인 이유로군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise. &&& Smuggler: Diet and exercise? Where I'm from, those are curse words. &&& Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything. &&& Smuggler: Money. I did it for the money.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: True. But you can only make the MOST money one way. The way that works best for you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A45
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000574"
msgid "You can make money in a lot of different ways that aren't criminal."
msgstr "굳이 범죄를 저지르지 않는 방식으로도 돈은 충분히 벌 수 있어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A pretty basic impulse.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A pretty basic impulse.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A46
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000573"
msgid "What, is that supposed to be an insult? In my business, interesting people tend to get caught."
msgstr "뭐야, 모욕하려고 한 말이야? 내 업계에서는 보통 흥미로운 사람들이 잡히는데 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew. &&& Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good. &&& Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. |You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun.|And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, well, I might surprise you. You probably have plenty of gunslingers and vaqueros on board already.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000572"
msgid "I'm not sure you'll be of much use then."
msgstr "그럼 당신은 나한테 딱히 도움이 되지 못하겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Hmph. Glad we got that Vaeric business sorted. Whole thing was starting to be a real pain in the ass.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, yeah, I know. You don't have to rub it in though. No one likes a show off.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000571"
msgid "You both were lucky I came along when I did."
msgstr "내가 찾아와서 둘 다 운이 좋은 거라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew. &&& Smuggler: Then we're on the same page. Good. &&& Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. |You ask anyone about Tane Salavea, and they'll tell you he's old and lazy and useless with a gun.|And I'm here to tell ya, they're only half true. I AM old and lazy. But I'm okay with a gun.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Is that sarcasm? I can't tell.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A41
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000570"
msgid "I'm surprised. You carry yourself with such youthful vigor."
msgstr "좀 놀랐어. 젊은 사람처럼 그렇게 뛰어난 체력을 보일 줄이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I couldn't have done it without your help.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A36
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056F"
msgid "So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you."
msgstr "그렇게 나오겠다, 이거지? 칭찬부터 하다니. 음, 딱히 막을 생각은 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, just telling you how it is. I'm a smuggler, not a fighter. Doesn't mean I'm not useful.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056E"
msgid "That's not exactly a ringing endorsement."
msgstr "그런 말을 들으니 썩 달갑지는 않은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You both were lucky I came along when I did.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You both were lucky I came along when I did.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A39
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056D"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, I know. You don't have to rub it in though. No one likes a show off."
msgstr "그래, 그래. 나도 잘 알아. 자랑할 필요는 없잖아. 거들먹거리는 건 아무도 안 좋아해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure you'll be of much use then.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm not sure you'll be of much use then.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056C"
msgid "Yeah, well, I might surprise you. You probably have plenty of gunslingers and vaqueros on board already."
msgstr "그게, 나를 잘 보면 깜짝 놀랄지 몰라. 이미 네게 뛰어난 카우보이나 사수들이 많이 있을지 모르지만..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm not sure you'll be of much use then.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: What about your job as a smuggler?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056B"
msgid "Maybe you need someone who uses the only muscle that counts."
msgstr "지금 네게 근육을 제대로 써 줄 사람이 필요할지도 모르지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler:  Welcome aboard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A38
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00056A"
msgid "Long time no see. You change your mind about the crew thing? Might be a good fit."
msgstr "오랜만이네. 같이 다니는 것에 생각이 바뀌었어? 서로 잘 어울릴지 모르는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm surprised. You carry yourself with such youthful vigor.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm surprised. You carry yourself with such youthful vigor.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confused
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000569"
msgid "Is that sarcasm? I can't tell."
msgstr "혹시 비꼬는 거야? 잘 모르겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm surprised. You carry yourself with such youthful vigor.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Guess I'll be heading out. See you later, Captain.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000568"
msgid "I mean yeah, I don't move much. But I can if I have to. Depends on what's chasing me."
msgstr "음, 그래. 내가 자주 움직이진 않아도, 필요할 때면 움직이거든. 뭐에 쫓기냐에 다르지만."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's not exactly a ringing endorsement.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's not exactly a ringing endorsement.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Oh, and one other thing. I've got a reputation. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A3E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000567"
msgid "Well, just telling you how it is. I'm a smuggler, not a fighter. Doesn't mean I'm not useful."
msgstr "난 그냥 사실대로 말하는 것일 뿐이야. 난 밀수꾼이지 싸움꾼이 아니야. 무쓸모가 아니란 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Hmph. Glad we got that Vaeric business sorted. Whole thing was starting to be a real pain in the ass.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A37
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000566"
msgid "I couldn't have done it without your help."
msgstr "당신의 도움이 없었으면 해내지 못했을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You can make money in a lot of different ways that aren't criminal.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can make money in a lot of different ways that aren't criminal.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's not like smuggling is that hard.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A44
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000565"
msgid "True. But you can only make the MOST money one way. The way that works best for you."
msgstr "그 말은 사실이지만 제대로 돈을 벌려면 방식은 하나뿐이야. 바로 네게 가장 딱 맞는 방식이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: It's not like smuggling is that hard.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It's not like smuggling is that hard.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A2C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000564"
msgid "Nah, I just make it look easy."
msgstr "아냐, 쉬운 것처럼 보이는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Concerned / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, you have enough problems as it is.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, you have enough problems as it is.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Concerned
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A34
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000563"
msgid "Yeah, but there's problems and then there's PROBLEMS. You're the capital kind."
msgstr "그래, 근데 자잘한 문제가 있고 심각한 문제가 있지. 자네가 그런 심각한 문제야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Long time no see. You change your mind about the crew thing? Might be a good fit.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nah, he was just a cargo, right? The way you did him, might as well have been.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A33
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000562"
msgid "Were you and Vaeric close?"
msgstr "혹시 배릭이랑 서로 절친한 사이였나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Long time no see. You change your mind about the crew thing? Might be a good fit.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Well, I was the guy who was going to smuggle him out of Va'ruun'kai.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A31
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000560"
msgid "What would've happened if we didn't get it sorted?"
msgstr "우리가 이 일을 잘 처리하지 못했으면 무슨 일이 생겼을까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would've happened if we didn't get it sorted?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What would've happened if we didn't get it sorted?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A30
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00055D"
msgid "Well, I was the guy who was going to smuggle him out of Va'ruun'kai."
msgstr "음, 사실 배릭을 바룬카이 바깥으로 몰래 빼 줄 사람이 바로 나였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Afraid / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would've happened if we didn't get it sorted?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Afraid
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A30
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00055C"
msgid "But that was before he ran off and Viktor put him on the shit list. And if someone fingered me as his ride out of here, well..."
msgstr "그것도 그 친구가 도망가서 빅토르 양반이 암살 명령을 내리기 전이었지. 혹시 그렇게 돼서 누가 날 지목하기라도 했다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What would've happened if we didn't get it sorted?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I couldn't have done it without your help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A30
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00055B"
msgid "This lumpy old head would be on a pike somewhere, being meat for the crows."
msgstr "이 늙고 통통한 아재의 머리통은 창끝에 꽂혀서 까마귀 밥이나 되었겠지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You can make money in a lot of different ways that aren't criminal. &&& Smuggler: True. But you can only make the MOST money one way. The way that works best for you.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nah, I just make it look easy.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A2D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000558"
msgid "It's not like smuggling is that hard."
msgstr "밀수업이 딱히 어려운 일도 아니고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Trying to play  / Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Were you and Vaeric close?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Were you and Vaeric close?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I couldn't have done it without your help.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A32
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000556"
msgid "Nah, he was just a cargo, right? The way you did him, might as well have been."
msgstr "아니, 그 친구도 화물이었을 뿐이야. 자네가 처리한 방식을 보면, 그런 편이 나았을지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A pretty basic impulse. &&& Smuggler: What, is that supposed to be an insult? In my business, interesting people tend to get caught.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I like to think so.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A2F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000552"
msgid "In other words, you're good at it."
msgstr "다른 말로 표현하면, 솜씨가 있다는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: In other words, you're good at it.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A2E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000550"
msgid "I like to think so."
msgstr "그렇다고 믿고 싶군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Long time no see. You change your mind about the crew thing? Might be a good fit.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, but there's problems and then there's PROBLEMS. You're the capital kind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A35
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00054F"
msgid "Yeah, you have enough problems as it is."
msgstr "흠, 아직 처리해야 할 문제가 많으실 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Meeting up with a mysterious stranger is always a good idea.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Meeting up with a mysterious stranger is always a good idea.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A1E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00054E"
msgid "You know what? I agree. Because my life got way more interesting after."
msgstr "그거 아나? 동의하네. 왜냐하면 그 만남 후 내 삶이 더 흥미로워졌으니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A person's got to have a code. &&& Smuggler: Damn straight. &&& Smuggler: So I'm expecting to do hard labor, strings on my back like a damn puppet for the UC.|But after six months I get out for good behavior. So I tell them they got the wrong guy. My behavior flat out stinks.|Still, the guard insists. Says someone in a fancy suit vouched for me, and he's waiting at the Broken Spear.|Now, I've never worn a suit in my life, and I don't deal with anyone who does.  And I'm willing to bet this guy's "favor" comes with his own set of strings.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You know what? I agree. Because my life got way more interesting after.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A1F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00054A"
msgid "Meeting up with a mysterious stranger is always a good idea."
msgstr "신원 미상의 누군가와 만남. 정말 좋은 아이디어지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You don't have to talk about it if you don't want to.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Look, my family and I aren't close. I'd like to give you a sob story, like we're all alcoholics or something, but the truth is a lot stranger.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A17
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000546"
msgid "Well, it's not that. There just isn't much ground to tread."
msgstr "말하기 싫은 건 아니고, 그냥 딱히 말할 게 별로 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up. &&& Smuggler: Yeah, maybe I will. I probably won't, but I definitely should. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, I know it doesn't make for good conversation, but it's the truth.|If you really want to get me talking, better to ask me about home brewed kombucha or painting miniatures than my family.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It can take anywhere from 1 to 4 weeks. Depends on how long you want that SCOBY to ferment.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A15
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000545"
msgid "Tell me about home brewed kombucha."
msgstr "수제 콤부차에 대해서 좀 알려줘."

