#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00053D"
msgid "We just don't talk. It's not like we hate each other or anything. If I see my brother, I'll be the first to give him a hug."
msgstr "별 이유는 없어. 우리가 뭐 서로 싫은 것도 아니고... 오랜만에 형제라고 만나면, 내가 먼저 안아줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up.
