msgid "It's just been ten years since the last one."
msgstr "마지막으로 연락한 지 벌써 10년이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Just answer the question.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Just answer the question.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
