#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00053B"
msgid "Well then the answer's \"no.\" I don't talk to them."
msgstr "내 대답은 '싫어'야. 그런 태도로는 말 안해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I want to know about painting miniatures.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I want to know about painting miniatures.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
