#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00053A"
msgid "Oh, it's my favorite hobby. It's relaxing as hell."
msgstr "그야말로 최고의 취미지. 망할 긴장이 싹 풀린다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I want to know about painting miniatures.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That sounds foul.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A12
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000539"
msgid "If I got down time in the ship, I'll usually spend it painting those little guys until they're totally custom."
msgstr "보통 우주선에서 짬 나면 미니어처 피규어 몇 개 가져다가 나만의 버전으로 도색하는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're deflecting. I can tell talking about family makes you uncomfortable.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're deflecting. I can tell talking about family makes you uncomfortable.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000538"
msgid "You're really pushing this angle, aren't you."
msgstr "계속 몰아붙일 작정인 거지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're deflecting. I can tell talking about family makes you uncomfortable.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000537"
msgid "It's not that I don't care. It's just I don't care enough to keep in touch."
msgstr "뭐 신경을 전혀 안 쓴다는 게 아니라. 그냥 계속 연락할 정도는 아니라는 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Apologetic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're deflecting. I can tell talking about family makes you uncomfortable.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Apologetic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0F
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000536"
msgid "But fine, if you're gonna keep harassing me about it, then maybe I'll send a slate to my brother, ask him what the family's up to these days."
msgstr "뭐 알겠다고. 자꾸 그것 가지고 잔소리하면 못 견디고 형제에게 슬레이트 하나 보낼지도. 뭐 가족 근황이나 묻고 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: An education like that is way more valuable than going to school.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: An education like that is way more valuable than going to school.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Long story short, I eventually saved enough to buy a small freighter, and got in contact with a guy at the Trade Authority.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0B
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000535"
msgid "That's what I tell people all the time. They should call me doctor for all the years I put in."
msgstr "내가 사람들한테 말하는 게 바로 그거야. 연차로 치면 벌써 박사학위 땄겠다."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ten years is a long time. I'd drop them a message and catch up. &&& Smuggler: Yeah, maybe I will. I probably won't, but I definitely should. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, I know it doesn't make for good conversation, but it's the truth.|If you really want to get me talking, better to ask me about home brewed kombucha or painting miniatures than my family.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You're really pushing this angle, aren't you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A10
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000534"
msgid "You're deflecting. I can tell talking about family makes you uncomfortable."
msgstr "회피하려 하네. 가족 관련한 얘기를 불편해하는 것 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Yeah, there's little things you pick up on just working the daily.|There's a lot of nuance to choosing the right spaceport, knowing who's working the forklifts, and where shipments get routed.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000533"
msgid "Long story short, I eventually saved enough to buy a small freighter, and got in contact with a guy at the Trade Authority."
msgstr "짧게 말해, 모으고 모으다가 결국 작은 화물선 하나 장만했고, 무역 연맹 소속의 어떤 남자랑 연락이 닿았지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000532"
msgid "And here's the kicker. My first job? Smuggling a big old pile of Va'ruun Heretic writings."
msgstr "그리고 짠. 내 첫 의뢰? 낡은 바룬 이단 경전 한가득 밀수하기."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0A
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000531"
msgid "At the time, I thought they were just pamphlets. But hey, maybe they were a sign."
msgstr "그땐 그냥 홍보 전단인가 싶었는데. 흠, 지금 생각해 보니 어떤 신호였을지도."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: As long as you combine it with diet and exercise.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A09
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000530"
msgid "Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure."
msgstr "의사 선생님께서 그러시더라. 밀수가 혈압에 그렇게 좋다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There has to be more to this than just money.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There has to be more to this than just money.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0D
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00052F"
msgid "All right, all right, getting there."
msgstr "그래, 그래, 어차피 다 말해 줄 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it. &&& Smuggler: I like to think so. &&& Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.|That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education.|I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed. |I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's what I tell people all the time. They should call me doctor for all the years I put in.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0C
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "00052E"
msgid "An education like that is way more valuable than going to school."
msgstr "인생은 실전이지. 이런 건 교과서에서 배울 수 없다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You gotta follow the doctor's orders.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You gotta follow the doctor's orders.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A05
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00052D"
msgid "That's what I told Sergeant Yumi, but he didn't buy it."
msgstr "UC에 유미 경사한테도 그 소리 했는데 씨알도 안 먹히더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Money isn't everything. &&& Smuggler: Thanks. Real original for you to say that. You almost moved me to tears.|I wasn't aware money isn't everything as I pay for my meals with sunshine and skin flakes.|But jokes aside, it's not just about survival. For me, it's lucrative.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: All right, all right, getting there.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A0E
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00052C"
msgid "There has to be more to this than just money."
msgstr "단순 돈 때문에만은 아닌 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: There are better ways to manage that.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: There are better ways to manage that.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A01
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00052B"
msgid "So I've heard. Chems always make me dizzy though."
msgstr "더 좋은 약은 널렸는데, 다 내 몸에서 안 받더라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling? &&& Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's what I told Sergeant Yumi, but he didn't buy it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A06
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00052A"
msgid "You gotta follow the doctor's orders."
msgstr "어쩌겠어. 의사 말씀은 잘 들어야지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling? &&& Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Huh, that's a good idea. I wonder if they're taking new patients.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A04
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000529"
msgid "Funny, my doctor advised me to drink."
msgstr "그거 웃기네, 내 주치의는 술을 더 마시라던데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling? &&& Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, it's more like a "you not getting the joke" problem, but I'll let it slide because I like you.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A08
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000528"
msgid "Sounds like a hypotension problem."
msgstr "알겠다. 저혈압 문제가 있으시네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Funny, my doctor advised me to drink.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Funny, my doctor advised me to drink.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A03
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000527"
msgid "Huh, that's a good idea. I wonder if they're taking new patients."
msgstr "허, 그거 좋은 처방인데. 그 의사 어디서 진료 보나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You sure like to whine.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You sure like to whine.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039F9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000526"
msgid "Yeah, and so what if I do? You're still talking to me, aren't you?"
msgstr "그래, 그러면 어쩔래? 그래도 나랑 아직도 얘기하고 있네?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I couldn't have done it without your help. &&& Smuggler: So that's your play, huh, gassing me up. Eh, I don't care enough to stop you. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, seeing as I don't have a ship, I'm kind of out of a job.|So I was thinking, if you're looking for an extra hand, I got two. They both work well enough, for my age anyway.|But fair warning, I can't do all that "moving around and trying new things" stuff that the kids do. |Because fact is, I'm retired. Not from work, but life.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: No, it just means when there's a bench, I park my butt on it. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000525"
msgid "Doesn't retiring from life mean death?"
msgstr "삶에서 은퇴라면 죽음 아닌가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Sounds like a hypotension problem.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Sounds like a hypotension problem.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: But if you want the real story, I became a smuggler for the same reason any hustler, deadbeat, or soldier of fortune does anything.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A07
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000524"
msgid "No, it's more like a \"you not getting the joke\" problem, but I'll let it slide because I like you."
msgstr "하, 저혈압이 아니라 네 농담 이해력이 더 문제 같은데? 그래도 넌 좋은 녀석이니 눈감아줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Doesn't retiring from life mean death?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Doesn't retiring from life mean death?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000523"
msgid "No, it just means when there's a bench, I park my butt on it."
msgstr "그냥 앉을 기회만 있으면 느긋하게 주저앉는다, 그런 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Friendly / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Doesn't retiring from life mean death?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Friendly
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: As it so happens, I'm looking for additional crew.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000522"
msgid "If there's meat on the menu, I'm ordering it. Simple as that."
msgstr "고기가 있으면 먹으면 그만. 묻고 따질 것 없이 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Yep. And yeah, from the start, I had I feeling that's who was gonna be at the end of the rainbow, but none of it's real until the Leprechauns show up at your door.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000521"
msgid "At that point, I realized the whole thing was a test. And now it was time to jump to the homeland for real."
msgstr "그 순간, 이 모든 게 사실 시험이었다는 걸 깨달았지. 이제 바룬 가문의 고향으로 향할 차례였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000520"
msgid "I also knew that if I screwed this up, I'd be a dead man. So pressure was on."
msgstr "그리고 이번 작업 망치면 내 목숨도 끝인 걸 아니까 더 압박감이 심했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Nervously shaking the leg only increases the pressure on the knee rather than alleviate it / Surprised
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Surprised
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00051F"
msgid "I could hear my old man chirping in my head, reminding me to keep from shaking."
msgstr "마치 영감탱이 아빠가 말하는 게 들릴 정도야, 다리 좀 떨지 말라고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: The rest is like that old tale about Jinan and the snake. History.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00051E"
msgid "So I kept still, said nothing, and completed the job. More importantly, I earned their trust."
msgstr "침착하게, 그리고 침묵을 지키면서 결국 임무 완수했지. 핵심은, 내가 바룬 쪽의 신뢰를 얻었다는 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you get into smuggling? &&& Smuggler: Doctor prescribed it for me. Said it'd be good for my blood pressure.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: So I've heard. Chems always make me dizzy though.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A02
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00051A"
msgid "There are better ways to manage that."
msgstr "더 좋은 약은 없었나?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Was your father disappointed you didn't join the military?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Was your father disappointed you didn't join the military?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039ED
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000519"
msgid "Had to be. The military was his life."
msgstr "그랬겠지. 군대는 곧 아버지의 삶 그 자체였어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Long time no see. You change your mind about the crew thing? Might be a good fit.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, and so what if I do? You're still talking to me, aren't you?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039FA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_RecruitScene
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000518"
msgid "You sure like to whine."
msgstr "불평 많은 건 여전하시군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: In other words, you're good at it. &&& Smuggler: I like to think so. &&& Smuggler: I guess I'll start from the beginning. My dad was a military guy, and we moved around a lot.|That meant spending a lot of time at spaceports. That's where I got my education.|I'd watch how crates were moved, logged, and stashed. |I'd see how palms were greased and how to ask for what you want, without saying what you mean.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Had to be. The military was his life.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039EE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_SmugglingOrigin
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000517"
msgid "Was your father disappointed you didn't join the military?"
msgstr "혹시 입대 안 했다고 아버지께서 실망하셨어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Next time we got a moment, I'll show you my collection. Way better use of our time than trying to find old relatives in grainy photos.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A11
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000513"
msgid "Either way, it's a better use of our time than talking about relatives I can't pick out of a two person police lineup."
msgstr "어찌 됐든, 닮은꼴 사이에 서 있으면 알아보지도 못할 친척들 얘기나 하기엔 시간이 아까우니."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family? &&& Smuggler: If that's what you want. &&& Smuggler: Well, after the lecture you gave me I pretty much had to. &&& Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."|Oh and uh, he's having a baby. A son.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'll let him know you said that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039E0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000511"
msgid "Congratulations."
msgstr "축하해!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family? &&& Smuggler: If that's what you want. &&& Smuggler: Well, after the lecture you gave me I pretty much had to. &&& Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."|Oh and uh, he's having a baby. A son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Didn't seem all that relevant.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000510"
msgid "You should have led with the baby part."
msgstr "육아 관련해서는 당신이 도울 수 있었을 텐데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family? &&& Smuggler: If that's what you want. &&& Smuggler: Well, after the lecture you gave me I pretty much had to. &&& Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."|Oh and uh, he's having a baby. A son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good thing you're not the parent here.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00050F"
msgid "Ugh, I hate children."
msgstr "으, 난 애들은 싫어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Congratulations. &&& Smuggler: I'll let him know you said that. &&& Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't do that. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00050E"
msgid "You should meet your nephew."
msgstr "조카 한번 만나봐야겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should meet your nephew.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should meet your nephew.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D8
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00050C"
msgid "I don't do that."
msgstr "그럴 일은 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Congratulations.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Congratulations.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00050A"
msgid "I'll let him know you said that."
msgstr "자네의 그 말 전달해 주겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know how you feel. I've lost someone too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000508"
msgid "Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son."
msgstr "그리고 그날, 난 죽어 묻혔지. 내 심장이랑 아들놈을 함께 묻어버렸어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Ugh, I hate children.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Ugh, I hate children.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000507"
msgid "Good thing you're not the parent here."
msgstr "자네가 진짜 부모가 아니라 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then you know. I've talked to people who say, "just move on," and they don't get it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000504"
msgid "I know how you feel. I've lost someone too."
msgstr "어떤 느낌인지 알겠어. 나도 소중한 누군가를 잃었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Then you know. I've talked to people who say, "just move on," and they don't get it.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000502"
msgid "My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it."
msgstr "우리 아들 죽은 지 30년이 됐어, 근데 현실은? 그걸 어떻게 잊을 수 있겠나. 망할, 잊고 싶지도 않을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000501"
msgid "You just learn to live with that hole in your chest. And no offense to my nephew, but he doesn't need a hollow version of me in his life."
msgstr ""
"상처난 가슴 부여잡고 살아가는 법을 배우는 게 최선이야. 내 조카에겐 안 될 말이지만, 나처럼 텅 빈 인간 곁에 둬봐야 인생에 도움 안 "
"돼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000500"
msgid "Sigh, look, I know I just unloaded a bunch of trauma on you. You don't need that shit."
msgstr "하, 괜히 내 트라우마나 잔뜩 뱉어놓은 거 미안해. 자네가 감당해야 할 부담도 아닌데."

#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I'm sure he'll be a great father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004FF"
msgid "So let's focus on the positive. I'm glad I reached out to my brother. He'll be a good father to the boy."
msgstr "그러니까 긍정적으로 생각하자. 내 형제랑 연락이 닿아서 기뻐. 녀석은 좋은 아버지가 될거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's not your fault. It's nobody's fault. It'd almost make me feel better if it was.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004FE"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "물어봐서 미안."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm sorry.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm sorry.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004FD"
msgid "It's not your fault. It's nobody's fault. It'd almost make me feel better if it was."
msgstr "네 잘못이 아니야. 그 누구의 잘못도 아니야. 차라리 누구 탓이라도 할 수 있었다면..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Depressed
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Depressed
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: *Exhales*
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004FB"
msgid "When he died, everything fell apart."
msgstr "내 아들이 죽었을 때, 내가 알던 모든 게 무너졌어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: At that point, I realized the whole thing was a test. And now it was time to jump to the homeland for real.|I also knew that if I screwed this up, I'd be a dead man. So pressure was on.|I could hear my old man chirping in my head, reminding me to keep from shaking. |So I kept still, said nothing, and completed the job. More importantly, I earned their trust.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039E1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004FA"
msgid "The rest is like that old tale about Jinan and the snake. History."
msgstr "나머지 뭐, 다들 알다시피잖아. 지난이랑 위대한 뱀의 신화처럼."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I know how you feel. I've lost someone too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know how you feel. I've lost someone too.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F8"
msgid "Then you know. I've talked to people who say, \"just move on,\" and they don't get it."
msgstr "그럼 자네도 알겠네. '그냥 잊어버려요'라고 하는 사람들은 얘기 해줘도 이해를 못해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: That's wonderful news.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: That's wonderful news.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C8
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F7"
msgid "Yeah, I'll let him know you said that."
msgstr "그렇지, 네 말도 걔한테 전해줄게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Congratulations. &&& Smuggler: I'll let him know you said that. &&& Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It's complicated.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F6"
msgid "Mess what up? I'm not sure I understand."
msgstr "망치다니? 이해가 안가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You should have led with the baby part.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You should have led with the baby part.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039DD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F5"
msgid "Didn't seem all that relevant."
msgstr "딱히 내가 해줄 수 있는 게 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, you're a bad influence.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, you're a bad influence.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: We don't have to talk about this if you don't want to.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F4"
msgid "That's what I said."
msgstr "나도 알아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: If that's what you want.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F3"
msgid "Well, after the lecture you gave me I pretty much had to."
msgstr "자네가 한 말씀 하고 나니 그럴 수밖에 없었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Tired
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: If that's what you want.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Tired
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F2"
msgid "Yeah, I know you said I didn't have to, but I started feeling guilty."
msgstr "그럴 필요 없다 한거 나도 알아. 근데 죄책감이 좀 느껴져서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is your brother?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: What kind of person is your brother?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F1"
msgid "He's a man of few words and even less emotion."
msgstr "과묵한 거 이상으로 목석같은 사람이지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: What kind of person is your brother?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Anyway, that's about all I have to say on the matter. Let's get back to the grind.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004F0"
msgid "But that was ten years and one child ago. Maybe he's changed. I know I have."
msgstr "그렇지만 벌써 10년하고도 애 한 명 낳기도 전 일이야. 아마 녀석은 이제 변했을 수도. 내가 그랬듯이."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: *Exhales*
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D6
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004EF"
msgid "You asked me before if \"being retired from life\" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right."
msgstr "자네가 물어봤었지. '삶에서 은퇴했다'라는 게 죽었다는 뜻 아니냐고. 사실은, 자네가 맞았어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: *Exhales*
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D6
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004EE"
msgid "When I said I was retired from life, I meant it."
msgstr "내가 전에 삶에서 '은퇴'했다 했을 때, 그건 진심이었어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in Dazra?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Let's hear the whole thing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004ED"
msgid "That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?"
msgstr "말하자면 긴데, 진짜 다 듣고 싶어? 아니면 짧게 끝낼까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't know what to say.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't know what to say.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004EC"
msgid "Yeah, not like you can. It is what it is."
msgstr "무슨 말을 할 수 있겠나. 인생 그런거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: I'm sure he'll be a great father.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039D0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004EB"
msgid "If that's what you want."
msgstr "자네가 원한다면."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in Dazra? &&& Smuggler: That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Good, saves me time and oxygen.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004EA"
msgid "The short version please."
msgstr "짧은 버전으로 부탁할게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Feigning grumpiness but actually doesn't mind telling the story / Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's hear the whole thing.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's hear the whole thing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E9"
msgid "Oh god, seriously? Ugh, fine. I'll start from the beginning."
msgstr "젠장, 진짜로? 알겠네, 처음부터 다 말해주지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's hear the whole thing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E8"
msgid "So I got a reputation in the smuggling business. No muss, no fuss."
msgstr "밀수 업계에서 명성을 좀 쌓았지. 신속 정확."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Let's hear the whole thing.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: A person's got to have a code.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E7"
msgid "But my main rule is, I don't rat out my suppliers. And I got twenty months in a Martian prison eating salted rocks to prove it."
msgstr ""
"공급책에 관해서는 입 꾹 닫기, 그게 내 최고 원칙이지. 그거 증명하려고 화성 교도소에서 12개월 동안 짠맛 나는 돌덩이 먹으면서 버틴 "
"거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The short version please.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The short version please.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E6"
msgid "Good, saves me time and oxygen."
msgstr "좋아. 시간이랑 산소 둘 다 절약되겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The short version please.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E5"
msgid "So a while back I spent some time in the clink, because I refused to snitch on my supplier."
msgstr "좀 예전에 감방 생활을 좀 했었지. 내 공급책에 대해서 아무것도 안 불었거든."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: The short version please.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E4"
msgid "I guess someone liked how I did business, and sent a middle man to offer me a deal."
msgstr "누가 내 이력이 마음에 들었는지, 중개인을 보내서 제안 하나 하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Congratulations. &&& Smuggler: I'll let him know you said that. &&& Smuggler: For my part, I wished him well. He's got a stable life, and doesn't need me messing that up.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's what I said.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E3"
msgid "Yeah, you're a bad influence."
msgstr "잘했어, 네가 딱히 모범적인 사람은 아니잖아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: A person's got to have a code.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: A person's got to have a code.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: So I'm expecting to do hard labor, strings on my back like a damn puppet for the UC.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E2"
msgid "Damn straight."
msgstr "옳은 말씀."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'd be a rat. You have to look out for yourself. The people you're protecting won't.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'd be a rat. You have to look out for yourself. The people you're protecting won't.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: So I'm expecting to do hard labor, strings on my back like a damn puppet for the UC.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E1"
msgid "Then remind me never to tell you any secrets."
msgstr "그럼 자네한테 내 비밀 털어놓는 것도 이게 마지막이겠네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Yeah, I don't care.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Yeah, I don't care.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Angry
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004E0"
msgid "I don't expect you to. But you asked the question, so I'm answering it."
msgstr "자네가 신경 쓸 거라고는 생각 안 했어. 물어보니까 대답한 거지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: How did you end up in a Martian prison?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in a Martian prison?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DF"
msgid "Smuggling organs. And I know what you're thinking, but I'm just the delivery guy."
msgstr "장기 밀매. 그래, 뭔 생각 하는지는 알겠는데, 난 그냥 운송책이었다고."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smirk / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did the guards offer you a deal?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did the guards offer you a deal?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smirk
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DE"
msgid "Sure they did. Freedom, a swanky apartment, and all the steak I could eat."
msgstr "말도 못 하지. 호화로운 아파트랑 먹을 만치 쌓아둔 스테이크, 그리고 자유."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Defiant / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Did the guards offer you a deal?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Defiant
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DD"
msgid "But there's an old saying. You feed birds bread, they forget how to fetch the berry."
msgstr "근데 옛말에 그러잖아. 물고기를 주지 말고 물고기 잡는 법을 가르쳐라."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, not like you can. It is what it is.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DC"
msgid "I don't know what to say."
msgstr "뭐라 해줘야 할지 모르겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Did you ever get in touch with your family? &&& Smuggler: If that's what you want. &&& Smuggler: Well, after the lecture you gave me I pretty much had to. &&& Smuggler: So I sent a slate to my brother, asked him how he was. He told me he was "good."|Oh and uh, he's having a baby. A son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, I'll let him know you said that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C9
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DB"
msgid "That's wonderful news."
msgstr "진짜 좋은 뉴스네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: The short version please. &&& Smuggler: Good, saves me time and oxygen.|So a while back I spent some time in the clink, because I refused to snitch on my supplier.|I guess someone liked how I did business, and sent a middle man to offer me a deal.|They didn't tell me any details about the job, but they paid in advance, and that was good enough for me.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Then remind me never to tell you any secrets.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004DA"
msgid "I'd be a rat. You have to look out for yourself. The people you're protecting won't."
msgstr "나 입 가벼운데 좀 조심하는 게 좋을걸. 자기는 자기 스스로가 지키는 거니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: It'll help if you talk about it. &&& ...  &&& Smuggler: *Exhales* &&& Smuggler: You asked me before if "being retired from life" meant being dead. And the truth is you were right.  &&& Smuggler: Because that's the day I died. I buried my heart with my son.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I don't expect you to. But you asked the question, so I'm answering it.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039CD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004D4"
msgid "Yeah, I don't care."
msgstr "알겠는데, 별로 관심 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he was killed for talking too much. &&& Smuggler: Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.|And the more remote the job, the more slick the operation. Faces I haven't seen, shorter dropoffs, no convos, it's all business.|Then one day, I'm asked to meet with someone who clearly isn't local. 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yep. And yeah, from the start, I had I feeling that's who was gonna be at the end of the rainbow, but none of it's real until the Leprechauns show up at your door.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AF
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004D3"
msgid "They were from House Va'ruun."
msgstr "바룬 가문 쪽 사람이었겠군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs. |Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004D2"
msgid "Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details."
msgstr "어쨌든, 어떤 사내가 작업을 제안하더군. 근데 정작 중요한 건 빼먹으면서."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Serious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004D1"
msgid "He can't tell me what cargo he wants to move. He can't tell me who it's for. Won't even tell me his damn name.  Just wrote some numbers on a napkin and left the bar."
msgstr ""
"어떤 화물인지도 비밀. 누가 수취인인지도 비밀. 망할, 의뢰인인 자기 이름도 비밀이야. 그냥 숫자 몇 개 끄적이더니 술집을 나서더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I would've taken the job too.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AD
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004D0"
msgid "But that napkin told me all I needed to know. The coordinates, and the payment. In advance."
msgstr "하지만 그 냅킨, 내가 필요한 모든 게 적혀있었지. 좌표, 보상금, 선불로 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in Dazra? &&& Smuggler: That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Sure they did. Freedom, a swanky apartment, and all the steak I could eat.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B6
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004CF"
msgid "Did the guards offer you a deal?"
msgstr "경비들이 뭐 제안했어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in Dazra? &&& Smuggler: That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Oh god, seriously? Ugh, fine. I'll start from the beginning. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C0
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004CE"
msgid "Let's hear the whole thing."
msgstr "끝까지 들어볼게."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Smuggler: Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004CD"
msgid "Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller."
msgstr "어쨋든, 의뢰가 쌓일수록 중력 도약도 더 멀리까지 가게 되고, 왕복 팀 규모도 점차 작아지지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Suspicious
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Suspicious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004CC"
msgid "And the more remote the job, the more slick the operation. Faces I haven't seen, shorter dropoffs, no convos, it's all business."
msgstr "작업 위치가 외딴곳이면, 작업 방식도 더 교묘해지지. 생판 모르는 얼굴, 수취 과정도 신속히, 대화도 자제, 철저한 비즈니스지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: They were from House Va'ruun.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AE
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004CB"
msgid "Then one day, I'm asked to meet with someone who clearly isn't local."
msgstr "그러다 어느 날, 여기 출신이 아닌 누군가와 접선하라고 부탁하더군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice. &&& Smuggler: Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs. |Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.|He can't tell me what cargo he wants to move. He can't tell me who it's for. Won't even tell me his damn name.  Just wrote some numbers on a napkin and left the bar.|But that napkin told me all I needed to know. The coordinates, and the payment. In advance.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, I would've preferred that, but I get why they didn't.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A6
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C9"
msgid "Why not just give you the coordinates to Va'ruun'kai?"
msgstr "바룬카이의 좌표를 그냥 주면 되는 거 아닌가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice. &&& Smuggler: Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs. |Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.|He can't tell me what cargo he wants to move. He can't tell me who it's for. Won't even tell me his damn name.  Just wrote some numbers on a napkin and left the bar.|But that napkin told me all I needed to know. The coordinates, and the payment. In advance.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: I know. Not my style to take a leap of faith. But I got bills, and a stomach that needs feeding.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C8"
msgid "You still took a big risk."
msgstr "그렇다 해도 큰 위험 감수를 했는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I know how you feel. I've lost someone too. &&& Smuggler: Then you know. I've talked to people who say, "just move on," and they don't get it. &&& Smuggler: My son died thirty years ago, and the reality is, you never get over it. Hell, you don't WANT to get over it.|You just learn to live with that hole in your chest. And no offense to my nephew, but he doesn't need a hollow version of me in his life.|Sigh, look, I know I just unloaded a bunch of trauma on you. You don't need that shit. |So let's focus on the positive. I'm glad I reached out to my brother. He'll be a good father to the boy.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: He's a man of few words and even less emotion.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039C3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Family
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C7"
msgid "What kind of person is your brother?"
msgstr "그 형제는 어떤 사람인데?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he was killed for talking too much. &&& Smuggler: Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.|And the more remote the job, the more slick the operation. Faces I haven't seen, shorter dropoffs, no convos, it's all business.|Then one day, I'm asked to meet with someone who clearly isn't local. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah, but I wasn't in the club just yet.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A3
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C6"
msgid "I guess they were starting to trust you."
msgstr "그쪽 사람들이 당신을 믿기 시작한 것이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I guess they were starting to trust you.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I guess they were starting to trust you.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: At that point, I realized the whole thing was a test. And now it was time to jump to the homeland for real.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A2
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C5"
msgid "Yeah, but I wasn't in the club just yet."
msgstr "그렇지만 아직 부족했어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You still took a big risk.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You still took a big risk.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C4"
msgid "I know. Not my style to take a leap of faith. But I got bills, and a stomach that needs feeding."
msgstr "알아. 눈 질끈 감고 뛰어드는 게 딱히 내 스타일은 아니지만 집세도 내야하고, 먹고 살 궁리도 해야 하니 말이야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You still took a big risk.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AB
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C3"
msgid "Besides, how bad could the job be? At my age, it takes a lot to surprise me."
msgstr "게다가, 뭐 얼마나 위험하겠어? 내 나이쯤 되면, 별로 놀랄 것도 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Maybe he was killed for talking too much. &&& Smuggler: Maybe? There's no maybes about it. The guy's dead as groat shit. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, every time I do the job, the jumps get more and more remote, and the relay team gets smaller and smaller.|And the more remote the job, the more slick the operation. Faces I haven't seen, shorter dropoffs, no convos, it's all business.|Then one day, I'm asked to meet with someone who clearly isn't local. 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Nah, nothing like that. Just a man from a place off the map.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A1
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C2"
msgid "You're talking about aliens."
msgstr "혹시 외계인을 말하는 거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice. &&& Smuggler: Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs. |Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.|He can't tell me what cargo he wants to move. He can't tell me who it's for. Won't even tell me his damn name.  Just wrote some numbers on a napkin and left the bar.|But that napkin told me all I needed to know. The coordinates, and the payment. In advance.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A8
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C1"
msgid "I would've taken the job too."
msgstr "나라도 그 의뢰를 받았을 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I would've taken the job too.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I would've taken the job too.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: As for the job, it went down like this -- I jump to the location, and there's another guy waiting for me. My job is to pass off the cargo to him.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A7
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004C0"
msgid "Yeah. I normally don't like risky jobs, but hard to say no when you're hungry and tired and got a bad hip."
msgstr "그래. 위험한 의뢰는 딱히 좋아하진 않지만, 배고프고 지치고 역마살이 낀 나에게 선택지는 없었지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: Why not just give you the coordinates to Va'ruun'kai?
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Why not just give you the coordinates to Va'ruun'kai?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A5
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004BF"
msgid "Yeah, I would've preferred that, but I get why they didn't."
msgstr "나도 그랬으면 좋았겠지만, 그쪽 입장도 이해가 가."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Let's hear the whole thing. &&& Smuggler: Oh god, seriously? Ugh, fine. I'll start from the beginning. |So I got a reputation in the smuggling business. No muss, no fuss.|But my main rule is, I don't rat out my suppliers. And I got twenty months in a Martian prison eating salted rocks to prove it.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Damn straight.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039BC
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004BE"
msgid "A person's got to have a code."
msgstr "소신을 지킨 것이군."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: They were from House Va'ruun.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: They were from House Va'ruun.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: At that point, I realized the whole thing was a test. And now it was time to jump to the homeland for real.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A4
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004BD"
msgid "Yep. And yeah, from the start, I had I feeling that's who was gonna be at the end of the rainbow, but none of it's real until the Leprechauns show up at your door."
msgstr ""
"그렇지. 처음부터 바룬 녀석들이 내가 찾는, 이번 여정의 목표라는 걸 알았지. 하지만 그게 환상인지 실체인지는 만져보기 전까지는 모르는 "
"거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: How did you end up in Dazra? &&& Smuggler: That's a long story. You sure you want to hear it? Or are you cool with the short version?
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Smuggling organs. And I know what you're thinking, but I'm just the delivery guy. 
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039B8
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004BC"
msgid "How did you end up in a Martian prison?"
msgstr "어쩌다 화성 교도소에 갇히게 된거야?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Except you probably didn't have a choice. &&& Smuggler: Correctamundo. I was on probation, and that means twice the checks and pat downs. |Even if my old contacts were still around, no one would want to take the risk. &&& Smuggler: Anyway, guy offers me a job, but he's real light on the details.|He can't tell me what cargo he wants to move. He can't tell me who it's for. Won't even tell me his damn name.  Just wrote some numbers on a napkin and left the bar.|But that napkin told me all I needed to know. The coordinates, and the payment. In advance.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Not a lot, but enough.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039AA
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_HowDazra
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0004BB"
msgid "Must've been a lot of creds."
msgstr "크레딧 좀 꽤 벌었겠는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Sarcastic / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: You're talking about aliens.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: You're talking about aliens.
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Sarcastic
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Smuggler: At that point, I realized the whole thing was a test. And now it was time to jump to the homeland for real.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 010039A0
