#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000435"
msgid "What's the gravity here, like a million? Two?"
msgstr "중력 수준은 어떤데, 백만? 이백만?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000434"
msgid "I go where you go."
msgstr "함께 가겠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000433"
msgid "I'm not much of a fighter, but I can hold your things real good."
msgstr "내가 뛰어난 투사는 아니지만 물건은 제대로 들어 줄 수 있지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000432"
msgid "So what's next on the menu?"
msgstr "그래, 이젠 뭘 할 생각이지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000431"
msgid "What's the plan?"
msgstr "계획은 뭐지?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Question
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Question
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000430"
msgid "Need something, boss?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거라도, 대장?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042F"
msgid "So you're still not sick of me. You should be."
msgstr "아직 내가 질리지 않았나 보군. 그래야겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042E"
msgid "My back hurts. So does everything attached to it."
msgstr "등이 쑤시네. 그 주변 부위도 마찬가지로 말이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042D"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042C"
msgid "Another break would be nice."
msgstr "잠시 좀 쉬면 좋겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_Hired_Following
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042B"
msgid "You got that look in your eye."
msgstr "그 눈빛이 감도는구만그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Irritated
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Irritated
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "00042A"
msgid "By now you're probably tired of seeing this face. Me too."
msgstr "아마 지금쯤이면 이 얼굴 보기 지겹겠지. 나도 그래."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000429"
msgid "We should booby-trap the cargo on your ship. I don't trust any of your crew not to steal it."
msgstr "네 우주선의 화물에다가 부비트랩을 설치해야 돼. 네 승무원이 손대지 않을 거라 장담할 수 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Smug
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Smug
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000428"
msgid "What's the one phrase you say the most? Mine's \"I'm sorry officer, I don't know how that got there.\""
msgstr "자네가 가장 자주하는 말은 뭐지? 나는 '죄송합니다. 경관님. 저게 왜 여기 있는지 모르겠네요'야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Stern
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Stern
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000427"
msgid "Working for you beats trying to evade the scans, no lie."
msgstr "스캔을 피하며 다니는 것보다 널 위해 일하는 게 훨씬 낫군, 확실히."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000426"
msgid "Look who it is."
msgstr "이게 누구신가."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000425"
msgid "What's on the docket?"
msgstr "오늘 일정으로는 뭐가 있지?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000424"
msgid "Do you need me somewhere?"
msgstr "혹시 내 도움이 필요한가?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000423"
msgid "Another day, another injury."
msgstr "아무리 힘들어도, 오늘도 힘내야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000422"
msgid "We shipping out today?"
msgstr "오늘 우리 이제 떠나는가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000421"
msgid "Yo, Captain."
msgstr "어이, 선장."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
msgctxt "000420"
msgid "My hip is killing me. I'm a corpse in waiting."
msgstr "엉덩이가 아파 죽겠군. 기다리다가 시체가 되겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCMTaneSalavea
#. FACE: Serious
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003A58
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_Smuggler_NotFollowing
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: Hello
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "00041F"
msgid "You still working?"
msgstr "아직인가?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00041E"
msgid "By the Serpent's Grace!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 은총이시여!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00041D"
msgid "The Great Serpent has honored you with many a gift."
msgstr "위대한 뱀께서 네게 참 많은 재능을 내려 주셨구나."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00041C"
msgid "The power you wield is the will of Jinan."
msgstr "네가 쓰는 그 파워는 바로 지난 님의 의지시지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00041B"
msgid "The unbelievers will surely believe now."
msgstr "불신자들은 이제 확실히 믿기 시작하겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00041A"
msgid "You are truly one of the Promised, Captain."
msgstr "정말 선장은 선택받은 자 중 하나야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000419"
msgid "I would love to learn the science behind your powers."
msgstr "네 파워가 어떤 과학적 방식으로 작동하는 건지 알아보고 싶네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000418"
msgid "By the light of Jinan, wonders never cease."
msgstr "지난의 빛이여, 몇 번을 봐도 놀라워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD2
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_StarbornPower
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000417"
msgid "I still have so much to learn about our galaxy, your powers included."
msgstr "난 아직도 이 은하수에서 배울 게 많구나, 네 그 파워까지 포함해서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD1
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000416"
msgid "Serpent bless you for the aid."
msgstr "날 도와준 너를 위대한 뱀께서 축복하시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD1
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000415"
msgid "By Jinan's word! You are a herald in the flesh!"
msgstr "지난이시여! 넌 이 땅에 강림한 전령이구나!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD1
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000414"
msgid "I feel ready to explore again."
msgstr "다시 탐험할 준비가 됐어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD1
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000413"
msgid "Serpent's grace! I feel much better!"
msgstr "위대한 뱀의 은총이시여! 훨씬 나아졌어!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: InPain
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: InPain
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AD1
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_HealCompanion
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000412"
msgid "The Serpent teaches us to endure the pain... but ugh... it's proving quite the task."
msgstr "뱀께서는 우리에게 고통을 인내하라 가르치시지만... 어휴... 너무 힘든데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000411"
msgid "Mars' atmosphere is almost entirely made of CO2. Fun!"
msgstr "화성의 대기는 거의 대부분이 이산화탄소야. 흥미롭지!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000410"
msgid "Mars is so barren. I prefer planets that have biodiversity, interesting specimens, or just appeal to my feral nature."
msgstr "화성은 참 척박해. 난 생물이 다양하고 흥미로운 종이 많은 행성이나, 야생을 좋아하는 내 성격에 맞는 곳을 바라는데 말이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040F"
msgid "Cydonia reminds me of Dazra somewhat. It's very no nonsense, very blue collar."
msgstr "시도니아를 보면 다즈라가 언뜻 떠올라. 허튼 생각은 통하지도 않고, 육체 노동을 중시하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040E"
msgid "I want to bring home a Martian rock as a souvenir. Do you think we can find one shaped like a snake?"
msgstr "기념품으로 화성의 돌을 가져가고 싶어. 뱀처럼 생긴 것을 찾을 수 있을 것 같아?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040D"
msgid "From my notes I've read Mars has an abudant supply of silicon dioxide -- great for making glass."
msgstr "내가 읽어 본 것에 의하면 화성에는 이산화규소가 많다고 했어. 유리의 재료로 쓰기 좋지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: That inhale is like she's smelling something on the air. Mars is iron-rich, it might have a distinct scent. 
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040C"
msgid "I'm not sure how it's scientifically possible but this planet smells like red."
msgstr "과학적으로 가능한 것인지 모르겠는데 이 행성은 마치 붉은 냄새가 나는 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040B"
msgid "The surface gravity on Mars is less than most inhabited planets. A person weighing 100 pounds on Old Earth would weigh 38 pounds on Mars."
msgstr ""
"화성의 지표면 중력은 대부분의 개척 행성보다 훨씬 낮아. 만약 옛 지구에서 몸무게가 45kg인 사람이 화성에 오면 17kg이 된다고 하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00040A"
msgid "This is a mining town, correct? I bet everyone here has huge biceps."
msgstr "여긴 광업 도시 맞지? 분명 이곳 사람들은 근육도 엄청 튼튼할 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000409"
msgid "I like Mars. It's small and cute, but has a lot of spunk."
msgstr "난 화성이 좋아. 작고 귀엽지만 활기가 넘치지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Cydonia
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000408"
msgid "Whenever I land on other planets, I do a gravity calculation to check how high I can jump. Mars is 1.58 meters!"
msgstr "나는 다른 행성에 착륙할 때마다 얼마나 높게 뛰어오를 수 있는지 중력 계산을 하곤 해. 화성은 1.58미터야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000407"
msgid "This city is what you call... rustic? I think that's the word. Rustic."
msgstr "이 도시는 뭐랄까... 소박하다고 해야 하나? 그거 같아, 소박한 곳이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000406"
msgid "There are elements of Akila that remind me of Dazra. Rough, unforgiving, but also, unfazed."
msgstr "아킬라의 여러 모습을 살펴보면 다즈라가 떠올라. 거칠고, 매섭지만, 침착하지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000405"
msgid "I like the adventure of eating space food but it will be good to have a hot meal."
msgstr "우주 보존 음식을 먹는 모험도 좋지만, 뜨거운 음식을 먹는 것도 좋겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000404"
msgid "I bet the people here are exactly the kind of folksy people you hear about in the tales."
msgstr "이곳에 사는 사람들이야말로 동화에 나오는 친근한 마을 사람들과 제일 똑같겠지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000403"
msgid "I wonder if the walls could be replaced by some kind of sonic repellant."
msgstr "이곳의 방벽을 음파를 이용한 유해 동물 구제책으로 대체할 수 있지 않을까?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000402"
msgid "The city almost fits right into the natural landscape. Like an anthill, only with people!"
msgstr "이 도시는 주변 경관과 거의 딱 들어 맞네. 마치 사람들이 사는 개미탑 같아!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000401"
msgid "Do we hitch our ship to the Hitching Post?"
msgstr "우리 우주선은 히칭 포스트라는 곳에 맡겨야 하나?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000400"
msgid "I bet a city like this has so many guns, you can find ammo in the trash! Not that I would dig through any."
msgstr "이런 도시에는 총이 참 많을 거야, 쓰레기통에는 총알도 많겠지! 내가 뒤질 거라는 건 아니지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003FF"
msgid "Akila is not the sprawling capital of the Freestar Collective I was expecting. It's much more... quaint? I like it though."
msgstr "아킬라는 내가 생각한 자유항성 공동체의 난잡한 수도 같은 곳이 아니네. 더... 예스러운데? 그래도 맘에 들어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Arrival_City_Akila
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "0003FE"
msgid "Can we stop by the museum? I want to do all the touristy things."
msgstr "박물관에 들를 순 없을까? 여기 전부 관광해 보고 싶군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003FD"
msgid "The oceans here must be teeming with exotic species."
msgstr "바다에 분명 이국적인 종들이 가득할 거야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003FC"
msgid "I bet the fashion here has the Serpent's eye. Our lives may not be perfect, but in Neon our outfits can be!"
msgstr "이곳의 패션은 위대한 뱀의 눈동자와 같은 게 분명해. 우리의 삶은 완벽하지 않을지언정 네온의 최신 의상은 가능하겠지!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Awed
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Awed
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003FB"
msgid "The towers here are as tall as the Serpent's fangs! And just as bright!"
msgstr "여기 건물은 위대한 뱀의 송곳니 만큼이나 크고... 눈도 부셔!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003FA"
msgid "I've heard rumors that Neon is dangerous. May Jinan's gaze protect us here."
msgstr "네온은 위험하다는 소문을 들었는데... 지난의 시선이 우릴 보호해 주시길."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F9"
msgid "I've never tried Aurora. Being a scientist, I know enough about chems to know they are bad news."
msgstr "오로라는 해본 적 없어. 과학자라면 마약이 얼마나 나쁜지 정도는 알아야지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F8"
msgid "Godless civilizations like Neon would do well to turn to scripture. We should bring it to them!"
msgstr "불신자가 가득한 네온 같은 곳이야 말로 뱀의 경전이 필요해. 그분의 말씀을 전파해야겠어!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F7"
msgid "It's all so opulent. Almost makes you forget this is a glorified fishing platform."
msgstr "화려하긴 화려하네. 고작 어획 시설을 꾸며놓은 것 치고는."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F6"
msgid "I can't believe cities like this exist -- on the razor's edge, always in danger of being cut open."
msgstr "이런 도시가 존재한다니 믿을 수 없는데. 칼날 끝에서 위태롭게 버티는 느낌이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F5"
msgid "Neon is actually very tiny! All of this culture and society, on a little fishing rig."
msgstr "네온 실제로 보니까 진짜 작다! 낚싯대처럼 작은 곳에 옹기종기 모인 공동체라니..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_Arrival_City_Neon
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F4"
msgid "I do not know if Neon is for people like me, but I am still glad to have seen it."
msgstr "나 같은 사람이 네온에 어울리는지 모르겠지만 그래도 한번 봐서 다행이야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F3"
msgid "What a sprawling city! I want to go shopping for clothes so I can blend in better."
msgstr "도시 뻗어져 있는 것 좀 봐! 여기 패션 따라가려면 옷부터 사야겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F2"
msgid "There was once an Embassy here for House Va'ruun, but with Dazra in isolation, it no longer serves any practical purpose."
msgstr "바로 여기에 바룬 가문 대사관도 있었지. 근데 다즈라가 고립되고 나서 그 의미가 사라졌어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F1"
msgid "The Scaled Citadel was just as majestic as any building here. I wish you could've seen it."
msgstr "비늘 성채도 여기 있는 빌딩만큼이나 화려했어. 네가 볼 수만 있었다면..."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003F0"
msgid "This city is so clean! I wonder what kind of systems they use for that."
msgstr "도시 완전 깨끗하다! 이렇게 유지하려고 어떤 시스템을 구축했을까 궁금해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003EF"
msgid "I bet there are so many diverse food choices here. We should try them all."
msgstr "여기 음식 종류 엄청 많겠지. 다 먹어보고 싶다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003EE"
msgid "Is religious freedom a thing here? I hope no one thinks of me or my beliefs as strange."
msgstr "여긴 종교의 자유를 보장한다고? 사람들이 내 종교 보고 이상하다고 생각 안 하면 좋겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003ED"
msgid "The skyline here is quite the sight. It reminds me of all we've lost in Dazra."
msgstr "도시 풍경 끝내준다. 다즈라도 한때 번성했었지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003EC"
msgid "A city like this is meant to be explored. But it'd take a lifetime to see it all."
msgstr "이런 도시는 구석구석 탐험해야 제맛이지. 근데 다 보려면 평생은 걸리겠다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003EB"
msgid "If you're from New Atlantis, do you refer to yourself as an Atlantian? I want to get the terms right."
msgstr "뉴 아틀란티스 출신들은 자기네들을 뭐라 불러? 아틀란티안? 나중에 실수 안 하게."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_City_NewAtlantis
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003EA"
msgid "There are so many people here, leading such busy lives. I hope they take time to appreciate the moment."
msgstr "여긴 사람도 많고, 다들 바쁘게 사네. 다들 가끔은 여유를 가지면 좋겠다."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E9"
msgid "We're going to need our suits here. Scans would never lie."
msgstr "스캔은 항상 옳다. 우주복 필요해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E8"
msgid "I always feel like my suit could fit a little more snug than it does. I guess this would be a good time to test that."
msgstr "우주복이 좀 더 꽉 맞았으면 좋겠어서 손 좀 봤는데, 이참에 한번 테스트해볼까."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E7"
msgid "Based on the scans, looks like it's time to suit up!"
msgstr "스캔 결과, 우주복 껴입을 시간이야!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E6"
msgid "Atmospheric scans say we'll need our suits."
msgstr "대기 스캔 결과 우리 우주복이 필요해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E5"
msgid "I'd be impressed if any creatures can survive in this atmosphere."
msgstr "이런 대기에서 생존할 수 있는 생명체가 과연 있을지 모르겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E4"
msgid "The biome here is inhospitable to humans. Better make sure our suits are free of leaks."
msgstr "여기 환경에서 사람이 살 순 없겠네. 새는 곳은 없는지 우주복 점검부터 하자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E3"
msgid "I inspected the suits earlier for leaks. Looks like it was right on time!"
msgstr "좀 전에 우주복에 어디 구멍난 곳 없나 점검했거든. 타이밍 좋았네!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E2"
msgid "We're definitely going to need our spacesuits on this expedition."
msgstr "여기 탐험하려면 우주복 먼저 입어야겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E1"
msgid "The air here is not meant to be inhaled."
msgstr "이런 대기에서는 호흡할 수 없겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_SuitsRequired
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003E0"
msgid "We should don our spacesuits before embarking any further."
msgstr "더 멀리 나가기 전에 우리 우주복 먼저 입자."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DF"
msgid "This biome scans as hospitable. It could definitely support life."
msgstr "환경 스캔 결과 거주 적합함. 생명체가 살기 좋아 보여."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DE"
msgid "According to my findings, the environment here is well suited for habitation."
msgstr "내가 살펴본바, 여기 환경은 거주용으로도 적합해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DD"
msgid "I bet there's a lot of interesting flora and fauna here."
msgstr "여기 흥미로운 동식물이 잔뜩 있을 것 같아."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DC"
msgid "Organic materials will be abundant in a biome like this."
msgstr "이런 환경에는 유기물 자원도 풍부할거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DB"
msgid "The ecosystem here would be quite interesting to study, if we had the time."
msgstr "시간 난다면 여기 생태계를 연구하는 것도 재밌겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003DA"
msgid "I wonder if any of the plants here have curative properties."
msgstr "여기 식물한테 치유력이 있을까 궁금해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D9"
msgid "Do you think we'll run into other people here? What fascinating lives they must lead!"
msgstr "여기 다른 사람이랑 마주칠 수도 있을까? 이런 행성에서의 삶이란!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D8"
msgid "I hope the local creatures are friendly. Maybe they'll let us pet them!"
msgstr "여기 토착 생물들은 온순했으면 좋겠다. 쓰다듬어도 될지도 몰라!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D7"
msgid "I wonder what kind of unique fauna roam this place."
msgstr "여기 토착 동물은 어떤게 있나 궁금하군."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Living
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D6"
msgid "This looks like a rich ecosystem... lots of scary predators, lots of cute prey!"
msgstr "여기 생태계는 풍성해보여... 무시무시한 포식자도, 귀여운 사냥감도!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D5"
msgid "No signs of life here. But maybe plenty of minerals."
msgstr "삶의 흔적 없음. 대신 광물 자원은 많을 수도."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D4"
msgid "Biomes like this are so barren... but oddly, peaceful."
msgstr "여기 생태계는 씨가 말랐네... 그치만 이상하게 평화로워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D3"
msgid "The biome shows no signs of activity, but there may be lots of minerals and wonders to find under the surface."
msgstr "활동 중인 생물군 없음. 그렇지만 매장된 광물 자원은 풍부할지도 모르겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D2"
msgid "I wager there are tons of mineral deposits to scan for here."
msgstr "스캔해 보면 광물 매장량이 꽤 된다에 한 표."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D1"
msgid "No signs of life to speak of. But that doesn't mean it's not worth exploring."
msgstr "살아있는 게 없네. 그렇다고 탐험할 가치가 없는 건 아니지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003D0"
msgid "Creatures would be hard pressed to adapt to such a harsh environment."
msgstr "생명체는 이런 혹독한 환경에 적응하기 어렵겠는데."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CF"
msgid "No flora, no fauna. It's very lacking in color."
msgstr "식물군도 없고, 동물군도 없고. 우중충하네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CE"
msgid "I wonder if this place was ever hospitable. Not all barren planets started out as such."
msgstr "옛날에 여기서 살 수 있었나 궁금하네. 메마른 행성이 다 원래부터 그랬던 건 아니거든."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CD"
msgid "I prefer planets with bustling biomes. But there are still things we can learn from places like this."
msgstr "물론 살아 숨쉬는 행성이 더 좋기는 하지만 이런 곳에서도 배울 점은 많지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACF
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_Biome_Dead
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CC"
msgid "I may grab a few rock samples while we're here."
msgstr "여기 온 김에 암석 샘플 좀 수집해야겠네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CB"
msgid "I'm getting warnings on the scanner."
msgstr "스캐너에 경고 신호가 잡히고 있어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003CA"
msgid "Serpent protect us. There are hazards here."
msgstr "위대한 뱀이시여, 우릴 이 위험으로부터 보호하소서."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C9"
msgid "The warnings on the scans are starting to worry me."
msgstr "환경 스캔 결과가 정말 우려스럽네."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C8"
msgid "This is a dangerous area. Lots of hazards."
msgstr "여기 위험한데. 환경이 심각해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C7"
msgid "Staying here risks injury to us both."
msgstr "여기서 이러다가 우리 다 부상당하겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C6"
msgid "The Serpent's protection wanes here."
msgstr "뱀께서도 여기선 우릴 지켜주시지 못할 거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C5"
msgid "This area is not safe to tread. We should exercise caution."
msgstr "환경이 너무 험난해. 조심해야겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C4"
msgid "There are too many hazards to explore this area safely."
msgstr "환경이 너무 위험해서 탐사가 힘들겠어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C3"
msgid "Much like Jinan's teachings, hazard warnings should not be ignored."
msgstr "지난의 가르침도 그렇고 환경 위험 경고도 무시해선 안돼."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003ACD
#. BRANCH: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadiicNewBranch0
#. INFO GROUP: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic_EnvironmentalHazardWarn
#. TYPE: PlayerDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "0003C2"
msgid "There are hazards among us more harmful than your courage."
msgstr "네 배짱 하나로 이겨내기엔 여기 엄청 험난한데."

#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
