#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000395"
msgid "Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?"
msgstr "혹시 개인적인 것 좀 물어봐도 돼?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000394"
msgid "Not at all. Ask away."
msgstr "괜찮아. 질문해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Surprised / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Surprised
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000393"
msgid "Of course. Let's talk."
msgstr "물론이지. 물어봐."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Sahima
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions?
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?
