#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_MasterTopLevelGroup
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000391"
msgid "I'm game, Captain."
msgstr "물론이지, 선장님."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC1
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000390"
msgid "Can I ask you about Dazra?"
msgstr "다즈라에 관해 질문해도 돼?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BC5
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00038F"
msgid "You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?"
msgstr "네 컴플렉스 잠깐 언급했잖아. 이제 좀 진정이 됐어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Sahima: 
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: So I was thinking about what you said -- how I don't have to be perfect.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
