#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00038E"
msgid "You mentioned dealing with feelings of insecurity. Have you had time to digest our earlier talk?"
msgstr "네 컴플렉스 잠깐 언급했잖아. 이제 좀 진정이 됐어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Do you mind if I ask you some personal questions? &&& Smuggler: 
#. ALIAS: Smuggler
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_TaneSalavea
#. TOPIC: 01003B86
#. SCENE: DLC001_CREW_EliteCrew_Smuggler_MasterTopLevel
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00038D"
msgid "I don't have any more questions right now."
msgstr "지금은 딱히 질문 없어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Thinking / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I doubt that. I've barely paid you any mind.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I doubt that. I've barely paid you any mind.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Thinking
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB4
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00038C"
msgid "That's not a bad thing. Sometimes good leadership is trusting your crew to do what's required."
msgstr "그건 그것대로 괜찮아. 좋은 리더는 자기 팀원이 알아서 잘 할거라 믿는 것도 중요하니까."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get that. &&& Sahima: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth. &&& Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.|I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love.|One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn.|At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone. &&& Sahima: But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: Thanks. Being part of a team that supports each other is so refreshing.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB7
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000389"
msgid "I'm glad you feel that way."
msgstr "그렇게 느끼다니 다행이네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Amused / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I'm glad you feel that way.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I'm glad you feel that way.
#. ALIAS: Player Default
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Amused
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's a credit to you as a leader, Captain. So I guess I want to say, good job! And thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB6
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000388"
msgid "Thanks. Being part of a team that supports each other is so refreshing."
msgstr "고마워. 다들 서로 격려하는 팀에 있다는 느낌이 너무 신선하네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get that. &&& Sahima: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth. &&& Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.|I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love.|One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn.|At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone. &&& Sahima: But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: That's not a bad thing. Sometimes good leadership is trusting your crew to do what's required.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB5
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000385"
msgid "I doubt that. I've barely paid you any mind."
msgstr "그럴 리가 있나. 너한테 그렇게 신경도 못 썼는데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BBA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003DA4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000384"
msgid "Let me know if that changes."
msgstr "뭐 물어볼 게 생기면 말해."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BBA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003DA4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000383"
msgid "It was nice talking with you."
msgstr "이야기 즐거웠어."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BBA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003DA4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000382"
msgid "Have a good one."
msgstr "좋아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I don't have any more questions right now. 
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BBA
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_MasterTopLevel
#. INFO GROUP: FormID 01003DA4
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000381"
msgid "Do you need something else?"
msgstr "뭐 필요한 거라도?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I get that. &&& Sahima: Yeah, it might sound pathetic or sad, but it's the truth. &&& Sahima: So for as long as I can remember, I've felt loneliest around other people.|I guess it's because they reminded me of all the things I'd never have. Family, friends, love.|One day, when I was wandering the markets, I found Silver in a trash can, discarded and worn.|At the time, I just wanted a friend. But she was also a reminder of how the world saw me -- and that I'd always be alone. &&& Sahima: But for some reason, I haven't felt that way in a while. And I think it's because I joined your crew.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Player Default: It really is. I feel more at home in your crew than I ever did at House Ka'dic.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB3
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000380"
msgid "I appreciate you saying that. I like to think of this crew as a family."
msgstr "그렇게 말해주니 고마워. 우리 승무원들은 나한테 가족같은 존재야."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Grateful / to Player Default
#. PROMPT: I appreciate you saying that. I like to think of this crew as a family.
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: I appreciate you saying that. I like to think of this crew as a family.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Grateful
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Sahima: And it's a credit to you as a leader, Captain. So I guess I want to say, good job! And thanks.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003BB2
#. SCENE: CREW_EliteCrew_Sahima_TopLevel_TimeLocked_Future
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00037F"
msgid "It really is. I feel more at home in your crew than I ever did at House Ka'dic."
msgstr "진심이 느껴져. 카딕 가문에 있을 때보다 지금 네 팀에 있는 게 훨씬 더 집 같아."

#. SCRIPT NOTES:  / to Player Default
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Player Default: Can I ask you about Dazra? &&& Sahima: It's only a remnant of what it once was. The Scaled Citadel, missing from the horizon, is a constant reminder of that. &&& Sahima: And yet, I still feel Dazra offers much to a visitor like yourself. &&& Sahima: To me, cities are like people. They have personalities, moods, and stories.|Some days, you want a teacher. Others, you need a guide.|And some days, you seek neither. You just need a friend.
#. ALIAS: Sahima
#. VOICE TYPE: PlayerVoiceMale01
