#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0002B0"
msgid "They're back! We won't let them slip away again!"
msgstr "놈들이 돌아왔어! 이번엔 도망가게 두어선 안 돼!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0002AF"
msgid "You won't get away this time!"
msgstr "이번엔 도망치지 못할걸!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0002AE"
msgid "You can't escape the eye of the Serpent!"
msgstr "뱀의 시야에서 벗어날 순 없다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0002AD"
msgid "You're mine now!"
msgstr "잡았다!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Angry
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Angry
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB7
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_CREW_Sahima_LostToCombat
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: LostToCombat
msgctxt "0002AC"
msgid "There's no hiding from the Serpent's wrath!"
msgstr "뱀께서 노하시니, 숨을 곳은 없다!"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002AB"
msgid "All the accursed will be made to dust."
msgstr "다른 저주받은 자들도 모두 흙으로 돌아갈거야."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002AA"
msgid "I'm glad you were on my side back there."
msgstr "아까 내 뒤 봐줘서 고마워."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A9"
msgid "Heralds blessed us in this fight."
msgstr "전령께서 이번 전투를 축복해 주셨어."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A8"
msgid "I felt the hymns flow through me in that battle."
msgstr "전투의 순간, 성스러운 찬가가 나를 감쌌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A7"
msgid "All are dust in the end. Pray for their peace."
msgstr "모두 먼지로 돌아가기 마련. 명복을 빌지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A6"
msgid "That was pretty easy. But we make it look that way."
msgstr "이번엔 꽤 쉬웠네. 우리가 쉬워 보이게 만든 거지."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A5"
msgid "I am glad we are safe, but I wonder sometimes about the emotional cost. Do you think fighting so much makes us bad people?"
msgstr ""
"우리가 무사해서 다행이긴 한데, 가끔은 감정적인 대가가 궁금해진단 말이야. 이렇게 싸움을 많이 하고 다니는 게 우릴 나쁜 사람으로 만드는 "
"걸까?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A4"
msgid "The heart plays a song with every battle. Put your hand on your chest and listen!"
msgstr "매번 싸울 때 마다 심장이 노래를 부른다니까. 가슴에 손을 얹고 들어봐!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Confident
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Confident
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB4
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_MS01_Sahima_CombatToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: CombatToNormal
msgctxt "0002A3"
msgid "This never gets old. My heart is stomping!"
msgstr "이건 질리지를 않는다니까. 심장이 막 뛰는데!"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "0002A2"
msgid "Maybe I'm hearing things. Jinan, lend me your ear."
msgstr "환청이라도 들리는 건가. 지난, 네 귀 좀 빌려줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "0002A1"
msgid "Is there nothing there? I thought I heard a noise."
msgstr "저기에 아무것도 없는 거야? 뭔가 소리를 들은 것 같은데."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "0002A0"
msgid "Whatever it was, it must've run off."
msgstr "그게 뭐였든 간에, 도망쳐 버린 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "00029F"
msgid "It seems we are alone."
msgstr "우리 둘만 남은 것 같네."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Puzzled
#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Puzzled
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AB1
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_CREW_AlertToNormal
#. TYPE: Detection
#. SUBTYPE: AlertToNormal
msgctxt "00029E"
msgid "Hmmm... I guess we're alone?"
msgstr "흠... 우리 둘만 남은 것 같네?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_WaitingForPlayerInput
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "00029D"
msgid "Gathering your thoughts?"
msgstr "생각중이야?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_WaitingForPlayerInput
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "00029C"
msgid "Sorry, I'm not a mind-reader. Although I did prototype a device once."
msgstr "미안, 내가 독심술사는 아니라서. 그런 걸 한번 만들려고 해본 적은 있지만."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_WaitingForPlayerInput
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "00029B"
msgid "Caught in a thought? Take your time, it's not a race."
msgstr "생각에 사로잡힌거야? 빨리 해야 하는 거 아니니까 안심해."

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_WaitingForPlayerInput
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "00029A"
msgid "Are you still there?"
msgstr "아직도 거기 있어?"

#. VOICE TYPE: SFBGS001_NPCFSahimaKadic
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001_CREW_EliteCrew_SahimaKadic
#. TOPIC: 01003AAE
#. INFO GROUP: SFBGS001_CREW_Sahima_WaitingForPlayerInput
#. TYPE: Miscellaneous
#. SUBTYPE: WaitingForPlayerInput
msgctxt "000299"
msgid "Has your power disconnected?"
msgstr "동력이 끊어졌어?"

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: Buddy I know works at a starstation. Found this place in the shipping logs.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC010_EavesdropScene_Bridge
#. TOPIC: 0100DFD6
#. SCENE: EavesdropTemplateSceneCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "000290"
msgid "How'd you even find this place? Ninety percent of the facility is underground..."
msgstr "이 장소를 어떻게 찾았어? 시설의 90%가 지하에 있는데..."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to SceneTrigger
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: How'd you even find this place? Ninety percent of the facility is underground...
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor01: Remind me what I'm looking for again?
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC010_EavesdropScene_Bridge
#. TOPIC: 0100DFD5
#. SCENE: EavesdropTemplateSceneCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00028F"
msgid "Buddy I know works at a starstation. Found this place in the shipping logs."
msgstr "우주정거장에서 일하는 친구가 있어. 선적 기록에서 이곳을 발견했지."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to Actor02
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor01: How'd you even find this place? Ninety percent of the facility is underground... &&& Actor02: Buddy I know works at a starstation. Found this place in the shipping logs.
#. ALIAS: Actor01
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. DIALOGUE AFTER: Actor02: We want some uncontaminated samples of whatever you can find in the lab. And don't touch the canisters, hyper freeze will kill us both.
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC010_EavesdropScene_Bridge
#. TOPIC: 0100DFD4
#. SCENE: EavesdropTemplateSceneCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00028E"
msgid "Remind me what I'm looking for again?"
msgstr "내가 뭘 찾아야 하는지 다시 말해줘."

#. SCRIPT NOTES: Neutral / to SceneTrigger
#. DIALOGUE BEFORE: Actor02: Buddy I know works at a starstation. Found this place in the shipping logs. &&& Actor01: Remind me what I'm looking for again?
#. ALIAS: Actor02
#. VOICE TYPE: VaruunZealotMale01
#. FACE: Neutral
#. QUEST: SFBGS001LC010_EavesdropScene_Bridge
#. TOPIC: 0100DFD3
#. SCENE: EavesdropTemplateSceneCOPY0001
#. TYPE: SceneDialogue
#. SUBTYPE: Custom
msgctxt "00028D"
msgid "We want some uncontaminated samples of whatever you can find in the lab. And don't touch the canisters, hyper freeze will kill us both."
msgstr "실험실에서 오염되지 않은 샘플을 찾아. 그리고 용기는 만지지 마. 초저온 냉각이 우리 둘 다 죽일 거야."

